amily:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ভাউচার ডিসকাউন্ট কোড শুধুমাত্র একবার প্রয়োগযোগ্য।</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">অর্ডারের মূল্য ভাউচারের মূল্যের চেয়ে কম হলেও অবশিষ্ট অর্থ ফেরত দেওয়া হবে না বা পরবর্তী কেনাকাটার জন্য ব্যবহার করা যাবে না</span></p></li></ul>', 'shahinbazar refund policy', 'HavingMart is a trusted importer of 100% authentic skincare, hair care, and cosmetics from Korea, USA, Canada, Europe & India. Buy original beauty products online in Bangladesh at competitive prices.', 'HavingMart, authentic beauty products Bangladesh, original skincare Bangladesh, imported cosmetics Bangladesh, Korean skincare Bangladesh, USA beauty products Bangladesh, wholesale cosmetics Bangladesh, trusted beauty shop Dhaka', NULL, '2020-11-04 10:14:41', '2026-02-14 21:59:59'),
(3, 'return_policy_page', 'Return Policy', 'return-policy', '<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.44;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(52, 58, 64); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b>Returns Policy</b></span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thank you for shopping at havingmart.com.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">1.A Return Period</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">A user may return any product at the time of delivery. Returns or refunds are available within the first 5 days of purchase. After 5 days, no returns, refunds, or partial exchanges will be accepted.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">1.B Prerequisites</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:none;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Item must be unused and in the same condition as received.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:none;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Item must be in original packaging.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:none;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">A purchase receipt or invoice is required to complete your return.</span></p></li></ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.44;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.5pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">পণ্যফেরত নীতিমালা (Returns Policy)</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">havingmart.com এ কেনাকাটার জন্য আপনাকে ধন্যবাদ।</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">১.এ ফেরতের সময়কাল</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ব্যবহারকারী ডেলিভারির সময় যেকোনো পণ্য ফেরত দিতে পারবেন। ক্রয়ের প্রথম ৫ দিনের মধ্যে পণ্যফেরত বা মূল্য ফেরত (refund) পাওয়া যাবে। ৫ দিন অতিক্রম করলে কোনো ফেরত, মূল্য ফেরত বা আংশিক এক্সচেঞ্জ দেওয়া হবে না।</span></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-be671400-7fff-3536-7888-56682be9c72a\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">১.বি অপরিহার্য শর্তাবলী</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">১. আপনার আইটেমটি অবশ্যই অব্যবহৃত এবং ডেলিভারির সময় প্রাপ্ত অবস্থার মতো থাকতে হবে।</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">২. আইটেমটি মূল প্যাকেজিংয়ে থাকতে হবে।</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">৩. রিটার্ন সম্পূর্ণ করতে, একটি ক্রয়রসিদ বা ইনভয়েস থাকতে হবে।</span></p>', 'shahinbazar.com Return Policy', 'HavingMart is a trusted importer of 100% authentic skincare, hair care, and cosmetics from Korea, USA, Canada, Europe & India. Buy original beauty products online in Bangladesh at competitive prices.', 'HavingMart, authentic beauty products Bangladesh, original skincare Bangladesh, imported cosmetics Bangladesh, Korean skincare Bangladesh, USA beauty products Bangladesh, wholesale cosmetics Bangladesh, trusted beauty shop Dhaka', NULL, '2020-11-04 10:14:41', '2026-02-14 22:01:02');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `type`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `keywords`, `meta_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(4, 'support_policy_page', 'Tentative Delivery time', 'tentative-delivery-time', '<h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.44;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b>Delivery Time</b></span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Inside Dhaka Metro: Your order will be delivered within just 1 hour to 72 hours.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Outside Dhaka Metro: Reliable delivery guaranteed within 2 to 5 days.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.44;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.499999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ডেলিভারি সময়কাল</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ঢাকা মেট্রোর ভিতরে: মাত্র ১ ঘন্টা থেকে ৭২ ঘন্টার মধ্যে আপনার পণ্য পৌঁছে যাবে।</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ঢাকা মেট্রোর বাইরে: ২ থেকে ৫ দিনের মধ্যে নির্ভরযোগ্য ডেলিভারি নিশ্চিত।</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.44;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.499999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Note</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Supply times may be affected due to national emergencies, severe weather conditions, or transportation strikes.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.44;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.499999999999998pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#343a40;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">বিঃদ্রঃ</span></h3><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-bbf22a33-7fff-3e06-9212-00957a734638\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">জাতীয় জরুরি অবস্থা, মারাত্মক খারাপ আবহাওয়া বা পরিবহন ধর্মঘটের কারণে ডেলিভারি সময় পরিবর্তিত হতে পারে।</span></p>', 'Support Policy', 'HavingMart is a trusted importer of 100% authentic skincare, hair care, and cosmetics from Korea, USA, Canada, Europe & India. Buy original beauty products online in Bangladesh at competitive prices.', 'HavingMart, authentic beauty products Bangladesh, original skincare Bangladesh, imported cosmetics Bangladesh, Korean skincare Bangladesh, USA beauty products Bangladesh, wholesale cosmetics Bangladesh, trusted beauty shop Dhaka', NULL, '2020-11-04 10:14:59', '2026-02-14 22:01:55');
