t-size: 13.3333px;\">.com</span> offers certain essential products to its members without adding any profit margin. This ensures affordable access to necessary goods.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">How does <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">havingmart</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">.com</span> sustain its operations?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Since <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">havingmart</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">.com</span> does not earn profit from product sales, the primary source of revenue is the membership or subscription fees.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Note: A minimal margin may be applied depending on the type of product to cover packaging costs, potential product damages, or expired items.</span></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.44;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#343a40;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">৯. বিনা লাভে পণ্য বিতরণ</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">havingmart</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.com</span> কেন বিনা লাভে পণ্য সরবরাহ করে?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">মূল্য ওঠানামা এবং বাজারে অস্থিরতার সময় গ্রাহকদের সহায়তা করার জন্য, Dazlea তার সদস্যদের জন্য কিছু গুরুত্বপূর্ণ পণ্য বিনা লাভে সরবরাহ করে। এর মাধ্যমে প্রয়োজনীয় পণ্য সহজলভ্য করা যায়।</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">havingmart</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.com</span> কীভাবে তার কার্যক্রম বজায় রাখে?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212529;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">havingmart</span><span style=\"font-size: 13.3333px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.com</span> পণ্য বিক্রয় থেকে কোনো লাভ অর্জন না করার কারণে, প্রধান আয় আসে সদস্যপদ বা সাবস্ক্রিপশন ফি থেকে।</span></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-e68610c1-7fff-5975-8e09-c8036f963620\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">বিঃদ্রঃ: প্যাকেজিং খরচ, সম্ভাব্য পণ্য ক্ষতি, বা মেয়াদোত্তীর্ণ পণ্য কভার করার জন্য পণ্যের ধরন অনুসারে সামান্য মার্জিন প্রযোজ্য হতে পারে।</span></p>', 'Term havingmart.com Terms & Conditions | User Agreement and Website Policies in BangladeshTerm ConditionsConditions', 'HavingMart is a trusted importer of 100% authentic skincare, hair care, and cosmetics from Korea, USA, Canada, Europe & India. Buy original beauty products online in Bangladesh at competitive prices.', 'HavingMart, authentic beauty products Bangladesh, original skincare Bangladesh, imported cosmetics Bangladesh, Korean skincare Bangladesh, USA beauty products Bangladesh, wholesale cosmetics Bangladesh, trusted beauty shop Dhaka', NULL, '2020-11-04 10:15:29', '2026-02-14 22:04:21');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `type`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `keywords`, `meta_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(6, 'privacy_policy_page', 'Privacy Policy', 'privacy-policy', '<h3 data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"143\">Privacy Policy Summary</h3><p data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"383\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">HavingMart respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. We collect only the information necessary to process orders, deliver products, manage payments, improve our services, and provide customer support.</p><p data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"632\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">Your personal data may include contact details, delivery address, and payment information. We do not sell your data and only share it with trusted third parties such as delivery partners and payment processors when required to fulfill your orders.</p><p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"824\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">We use cookies and analytics tools (such as Google Analytics and Meta/Facebook) to improve website functionality and measure performance. You can manage cookie settings through your browser.</p><p data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"995\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">You have full control over your data, including the right to access, update, correct, or delete your information, and to opt out of marketing communications at any time.</p><p data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1076\" style=\"font-size: medium;\">For any privacy-related requests, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1075\"><a data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1073\" class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\">info@havingmart.com<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-rtl-flip=\"\" class=\"block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]\"><use href=\"/cdn/assets/sprites-core-gvfid0kn.svg#304883\" fill=\"currentColor\"></use></svg></span></a></strong>.</p>', 'Privacy Policy', 'HavingMart is a trusted importer of 100% authentic skincare, hair care, and cosmetics from Korea, USA, Canada, Europe & India. Buy original beauty products online in Bangladesh at competitive prices.', 'HavingMart, authentic beauty products Bangladesh, original skincare Bangladesh, imported cosmetics Bangladesh, Korean skincare Bangladesh, USA beauty products Bangladesh, wholesale cosmetics Bangladesh, trusted beauty shop Dhaka', NULL, '2020-11-04 10:15:55', '2026-02-14 22:10:36');
