(1, 'Spa Secrets Clay & Gel Face Mask Set for Smooth and Refine Skin Texture (Deep Sea Minerals 60ml, Clay 60ml)', '1', 0, 3, 1, '1', '1', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Healthy, radiant skin can now be achieved in just 15 minutes! This duo set face mask contains everything you need to deep cleanse you skin and remove impurities. Use the Clay mask two or three times a week to hep rebalance skin health and the Dead Sea Minerals Gel face mask once a week to help replace your skin\'s elasticity, leaving you looking and feeling good. The included silicone brush allows easy mess-free application.', 956.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Set', 0.00, 1, NULL, 494.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Spa Secrets Clay & Gel Face Mask Set for Smooth and Refine Skin Texture (Deep Sea Minerals 60ml, Clay 60ml)Price in BD', 'Spa Secrets Clay & Gel Face Mask Set for Smooth and Refine Skin Texture (Deep Sea Minerals 60ml, Clay 60ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'spa-secrets-clay-gel-face-mask-set-for-smooth-and-refine-skin-texture-deep-sea-minerals-60ml-clay-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(2, 'Some By Mi Retinol Intense Trial Kit (Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream 10ml + Retinol Intense Reactivating Serum 10ml)', '1', 0, 3, 2, '2', '2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With the Some By Mi Retinol Intense Trial Kit you will discover the power of retinol and its many benefits! What you can expect is improved skin texture, skin renewal, hydration and reduced aging. Who wouldn\'t want that?!\nRetinol, also called vitamin A, is known for improving skin texture. Retinol is known to improve skin texture. Fine lines and wrinkles are reduced by stimulating skin cell renewal. It makes the skin smoother and gives a healthy glow. This trial set is perfect to discover the powers of retinol!\nThis set:\nSOME BY MI Retinol Intense Advanced Tripe Action Eye Cream is a nighttime eye cream formulated to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles while firming and brightening your most fragile skin. This intense brightening eye cream contains Niacinamide, Retinol and Tranexamic Acid to visibly brighten dark eye circles and support natural collagen.\nThis serum is infused with retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to boost skin elasticity and reduce signs of aging. It’s created with patented elastic-liposome technology to deliver active ingredients deep into skin. The gentle formula gives a non-sticky, moisturizing finish without any irritation. Recommended for sensitive skin.\nRetinol Intense Reactivating Serum Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream\nAll skin types\nMade in Korea', 1155.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'Box', 0.00, 1, NULL, 845.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some By Mi Retinol Intense Trial Kit (Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream 10ml + Retinol Intense Reactivating Serum 10ml)Price in BD', 'Some By Mi Retinol Intense Trial Kit (Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream 10ml + Retinol Intense Reactivating Serum 10ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-retinol-intense-trial-kit-retinol-intense-advanced-triple-action-eye-cream-10ml-retinol-intense-reactivating-serum-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-15 06:02:00'),
(3, 'Some By Mi AHA.BHA.PHA 30 Days Miracle AC SOS Kit Edition - Miracle Acne Clear Foam + Miracle Toner + Miracle Serum + Miracle Cream', '1', 0, 3, 2, '3', '3', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Acne Clear Foam 30ml + Toner 30ml + Serum 10ml + Cream 20g [AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Acne Clear Foam]Â A low pH cleansing foamÂ thatÂ controls excessive sebum and removes impurities. Contains SOME BY MI\'s exclusive ingredient TRUECICA (160,200 ppm) to soothe acne. [AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner] Low pH 5.5 toner with AHA/BHA/PHA and tea tree water extract prevents trouble and keeps skin healthy.Â Free of 20Â artificial ingredients. Dermatologically tested for sensitive skin. [AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Serum] AHA/BHA/PHA and tea tree water extract gently exfoliates and removes skin impurity and normalize skin turn-over period A double-layer of plant-based oils to lock in moisture to keep the skin hydrated and balanced. [AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Cream] This miracle cream removes dead skin cells and sebum as well as keeps your skin hydrated.Â High-Asiatic-content (700,000ppm) and high-enriched 4 kinds of cica extract(Asiatic acid, Madecassic acid, Asiaticocaid, Madecassoside) repairs damaged skin and strengthens the skin barrier. Size:Â Foam 30ml / Toner 30ml / Serum 10ml / Cream 20g', 1753.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'box', 0.00, 1, NULL, 807.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some By Mi AHA.BHA.PHA 30 Days Miracle AC SOS Kit Edition - Miracle Acne Clear Foam + Miracle Toner + Miracle Serum + Miracle CreamPrice in BD', 'Some By Mi AHA.BHA.PHA 30 Days Miracle AC SOS Kit Edition - Miracle Acne Clear Foam + Miracle Toner + Miracle Serum + Miracle Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-ahabhapha-30-days-miracle-ac-sos-kit-edition-miracle-acne-clear-foam-miracle-toner-miracle-serum-miracle-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-15 06:01:59'),
(4, 'Mamaearth Ubtan Facial Kit With Turmeric & Saffron (6 -Step Facial Kit)', '1', 0, 3, 3, '4', '4', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Want salon-like facial glow at home? You’re in for a surprise! With Mamaearth Ubtan Facial Kit, revive your skin’s natural glow in 6 easy steps & just 30 minutes! Crafted with the natural goodness of Turmeric and Saffron, this facial kit comes with a Cleansing Milk for deep cleansing, a Face Scrub to exfoliate dead skin cells, a Soothing Gel that hydrates your skin, a Massage Cream to improve blood circulation, and a Face Mask to brighten your skin. Finally end your relaxing facial at home with the Ubtan Glow Cream to lock in all that moisture and give you brighter, smoother, and rejuvenated skin. It has all you need for that effortlessly radiant skin. The best part is that all the products are Made Safe Certified which means no toxins or harmful chemicals, just the goodness of nature.Features :\nHow to Use:\nIngredients:\nCleansing Milk: Aqua, Sodium Cocoamphoacetate, Disodium Cocoamphodiacetate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glyceryl Mono Stearate, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Glycerin, Decyl Glucoside, Stearic Acid, Turmeric Extract, Shea Butter, Coconut Oil, Hydroxy Ethyl Urea, Decyl Oleate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Saffron Extract, Beeswax, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Butylene Glycol, Sodium Methyl Cocoyl Taurate, Sodium Gluconate, IFRA Certified Allergen Free Fragrance, Xanthan Gum & Sodium EDTA.Face Scrub: Aqua, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl Monostearate, Beeswax, Walnut Beads, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Glycerin, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Caprylic/Capric Triglycerides, Sodium Stearoyl Lactylate, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Sweet Almond Oil, Turmeric Root Oil, Sodium Benzoate, Phenoxyethanol, IFRA Certified Allergen Free Fragrance, Titanium Dioxide, Apricot Oil, Potassium Sorbate, Liquorice Extract, Saffron Extract, Zinc Oxide, Jojoba Oil, Avocado Oil, Vitamin E, Disodium EDTA & Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate.Soothing Gel: Aqua, Glycerin, Sorbitol, Sodium PCA, Carbomer, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Turmeric Extract, Aloe Vera Extract, Saffron Extract, Tartrazine Yellow Colour (CI 19140), Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Benzoate, Allantoin, Disodium EDTA, Polysorbate 20, IFRA Certified Allergen Free Fragrance & Menthol.Massage Cream :Aqua, Ethyl Olivate, Olive Oil Methyl Ester, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Glycerin, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl Stearate, Ceteareth-20, Isopropyl Myristate, Beeswax, Phenoxyethanol, Turmeric Extract, Tartrazine Yellow Colour (CI 19140), Sodium Benzoate, Honey Extract, Saffron Extract, IFRA Certified Allergen Free Fragrance & Disodium EDTA.Face Mask: Aqua, Kaolin, Emulsifying Wax, Bentonite, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Glycerin, Glycolic Acid,Magnesium Aluminium Silicate, Propylene Glycol Dibenzoate, Olive Oil, Kokum Butter, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Olive Oil PEG-7 Esters, Titanium Dioxide, Magnesium Carbonate,Ethylhexylglycerin, Phenoxyethanol, Apricot Oil, Sodium PCA, Turmeric Powder, Xanthan Gum, Niacinamide, Potassium Sorbate, Imid Urea, Sodium Benzoate, Saffron Extract, Chamomile Extract, Mulberry Extract, D-Panthenol, Licorice Extract, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, IFRA Certified Allergen Free Fragrance, Aloe Vera Powder, Carrot Seed Oil, Orange Oil, Ylang-Ylang Oil & Patchouli Oil.Glow Cream: Aqua, Kaolin, Emulsifying Wax, Bentonite, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Glycerin, Glycolic Acid, Magnesium Aluminium Silicate, Propylene Glycol Dibenzoate, Olive Oil, Kokum Butter, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Olive Oil PEG-7 Esters, Titanium Dioxide, Magnesium Carbonate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Phenoxyethanol, Apricot Oil, Sodium PCA, Turmeric Powder, Xanthan Gum, Niacinamide, Potassium Sorbate, Imid Urea, Sodium Benzoate, Saffron Extract, Chamomile Extract, Mulberry Extract, D-Panthenol, Licorice Extract, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydroci