(9, 'FaceFacts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Soothe & Protect Gift Set (Sheet Mask, Gel Cream, Eye Cream & Serum Cream)', '1', 0, 3, 7, '9', '9', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The FaceFacts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Gift Set offers a comprehensive skincare solution designed to soothe, hydrate, and strengthen your skin\'s natural barrier. It features a powerful blend of 5 ceramides, hydrating hyaluronic acid, and soothing oats, along with nourishing Vitamin E. This set is ideal for sensitive, dry, and reactive skin, helping to prevent moisture loss while calming irritation and enhancing skin resilience.\nFaceFacts Ceramide Moisturising Gel CreamA lightweight gel-cream moisturizer formulated with 5 ceramides, hyaluronic acid, Vitamin E, and oats. It deeply hydrates and strengthens the skin barrier, soothing sensitive skin without leaving a greasy residue. Dermatologically tested, fragrance-free, and vegan-friendly.\nKey Ingredients:Aqua, Glycerin, Ceramide NP, Ceramide NS, Ceramide NG, Ceramide AS, Ceramide EOP, Ceramide AP, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopherol, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Extract.\n\nFaceFacts Ceramide Replenishing Eye CreamA nourishing eye cream designed to hydrate and strengthen the delicate skin around the eyes. Contains 5 ceramides, hyaluronic acid, soothing oats, glycerin, and Vitamin E. Helps smooth under-eye area, supports the skin barrier, and reduces dryness. Vegan-friendly and fragrance-free.\n\nFaceFacts Ceramide Repairing Serum CreamA very light, fast-absorbing serum cream ideal for dry and sensitive skin. Formulated with 5 ceramides, hyaluronic acid, oats, glycerin, and Vitamin E, this serum supports skin barrier repair, deep hydration, and improved texture. Dermatologist tested, fragrance-free, and suitable for all skin types.\n\nFaceFacts Ceramide Soothing Sheet MaskThese sheet masks soothe dry and sensitive skin, reinforce the skin\'s natural barrier, and provide lasting hydration through ceramides, hyaluronic acid, and oats. Fragrance-free, vegan-friendly, and biodegradable for an eco-conscious skincare routine.\nFor best results, incorporate the products into your daily skincare routine—apply the gel cream and eye cream after cleansing and toning, use the serum for targeted repair, and treat your skin with the soothing sheet masks as needed.\n\nFaceFacts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Gift Set provides all-around care to restore, protect, and enhance skin health, leaving a calm, hydrated, and resilient complexion.Country of Origin: PRC', 1850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 650.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'FaceFacts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Soothe & Protect Gift Set (Sheet Mask, Gel Cream, Eye Cream & Serum Cream)Price in BD', 'FaceFacts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Soothe & Protect Gift Set (Sheet Mask, Gel Cream, Eye Cream & Serum Cream) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'facefacts-ceramide-skin-barrier-complex-soothe-protect-gift-set-sheet-mask-gel-cream-eye-cream-serum-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
