(11, 'Laikou Milk Skincare 5 Pcs Set (Cleanser + Eye Cream + Mosturizing Cream + Brightening Cream + Sunscreen)', '1', 0, 3, 8, '11', '11', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Milk Skin Care Sets - 5pcs\nEmbrace the nourishing power of milk with our Milk Skincare Set -a 5-piece collection designed to nourish and soften your skin. Each product is meticulously manufactured by milk ingredients, delivering a pampering experience for your skin. It can deeply hydrate skin, improve elasticity, even skin tone, provide daytime protection and restore your skin’s natural radiance. Pamper yourself with this luxurious milk skincare set and enjoy the transformative glow.\nStep 1: Take an appropriate amount of the cleanser on the palm, foam it with water and gently massage the wet face and neck for one minute, then wash with water.\nStep 2: After cleansing, apply the cream evenly on the whole face and neck. Massage your skin gently until it is absorbed.\nStep 3: Apply the eye cream on eye areas and rotate the rolling head. Then massage your skin gently in circle motions for about 5 times to let it be absorbed.\nStep 4: After skin care, apply proper amount of the sunscreen onto face, neck, arm and leg evenly before make up or going outside, massage gently until it is absorbed.', 1598.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Set', 0.00, 1, NULL, 652.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Milk Skincare 5 Pcs Set (Cleanser + Eye Cream + Mosturizing Cream + Brightening Cream + Sunscreen)Price in BD', 'Laikou Milk Skincare 5 Pcs Set (Cleanser + Eye Cream + Mosturizing Cream + Brightening Cream + Sunscreen) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-milk-skincare-5-pcs-set-cleanser-eye-cream-mosturizing-cream-brightening-cream-sunscreen', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
