(18, 'HEVEBLUE Salmon Caring Centella Special Travel Kit Bag – 4pcs Skincare Set', '1', 0, 3, 13, '18', '18', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The HEVEBLUE Salmon Caring Centella Special Travel Kit is a complete soothing and hydrating skincare routine in a compact travel-friendly bag. Each product is enriched with Salmon Egg Extract, Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, PDRN, and Avocado Peptide, delivering deep nourishment while supporting the skin barrier. Ideal for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nThis set includes a Bubble Cleanser, Toner, Ampoule, and Cream, each formulated to calm irritation, balance moisture, and maintain healthy, glowing skin.\nSalmon Caring Centella Bubble Cleanser – 30ml\nSalmon Caring Centella Toner – 25ml\nSalmon Caring Centella Ampoule – 13ml\nSalmon Caring Centella Cream – 20ml\nGently cleanses without stripping the skin\nSoothes irritation with Centella Asiatica Leaf Water\nHydrates with Broccoli Water, Purslane, and Avocado Peptide\nSoft, fine bubbles leave a refreshing, non-irritating finish\nSuitable for all skin types\npH 5.5 formula balances skin’s oil-water level\nCentella and PDRN help soothe sensitive skin\nHouttuynia Cordata and Salmon Egg Extract purify and revitalize\nLightweight watery texture absorbs instantly\nSuitable for all skin types\nCalms redness and irritation with Salmon extracts and PDRN\nDeep hydration from Hyaluronic Acid, Purslane and Avocado Peptide\nNon-sticky, refreshing texture\nSuitable for all skin types\nLocks in hydration for long-lasting moisture\nCentella, PDRN and Salmon Egg Extract soothe and repair\nSunflower Seed Oil, Panthenol and Hyaluronic Acid strengthen skin barrier\nSmooth cream texture absorbs well\nSuitable for all skin types\nCentella Asiatica Leaf Water\nSalmon Egg Extract (1,500 ppm)\nSodium DNA / PDRN\nHouttuynia Cordata Water\nAvocado Fruit Extract / Peptide\nBroccoli Water\nPortulaca Oleracea Extract\nHyaluronic Acid Complex\nSunflower Seed Oil\nPanthenol\nMadecassoside', 1980.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1310.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'HEVEBLUE Salmon Caring Centella Special Travel Kit Bag – 4pcs Skincare SetPrice in BD', 'HEVEBLUE Salmon Caring Centella Special Travel Kit Bag – 4pcs Skincare Set Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heveblue-salmon-caring-centella-special-travel-kit-bag-4pcs-skincare-set', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(19, 'Spa Secrets Gold Gel Face Mask Set for Smooth and Refine Skin Texture', '1', 0, 3, 1, '19', '19', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Spa secret Gold Gel 140ml face mask cleanses skin whilst gently removing impurities and dead skin cells. The mask helps to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and makes your skin more elastic.', 955.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Set', 0.00, 1, NULL, 495.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Spa Secrets Gold Gel Face Mask Set for Smooth and Refine Skin TexturePrice in BD', 'Spa Secrets Gold Gel Face Mask Set for Smooth and Refine Skin Texture Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'spa-secrets-gold-gel-face-mask-set-for-smooth-and-refine-skin-texture', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(20, 'Organikaon Winter Special Combo (Kumkumadi Oil 30ml, Triple Anti Oxident Vitamin C Serum 30ml, Saffron Goat Milk Soap 100g, Lip Balm 10gm &  Lip Scrub 10gm)', '1', 0, 3, 14, '20', '20', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Organikaon Winter Special Combo\nA complete winter skincare set designed to nourish, brighten, and protect your skin and lips during harsh, cold months. This combo combines potent natural oils, vitamins, and herbal extracts to deeply hydrate, rejuvenate, and enhance skin radiance. Ideal for gifting or daily self-care, it ensures your skin and lips stay soft, glowing, and healthy throughout the season.\nWhat it includes:• Kumkumadi Oil 30ml• Triple Antioxidant Vitamin C Serum 30ml• Saffron Goat Milk Soap 100g• Lip Balm 10g• Lip Scrub 10g\nDetails of Each Product:\n1. Kumkumadi Oil 30ml\nOrganikaon’s Kumkumadi Oil is a luxurious facial oil blending ancient Ayurvedic wisdom with modern skincare. It contains saffron pollen, sandalwood, rose petals, and a mix of 62 herbs, fruits, and vegetables to rejuvenate skin, reduce dark spots, and improve texture. Ideal for nightly use, it deeply moisturizes, smoothens patchiness, and promotes a radiant, youthful glow.\nBenefits:• Brightens naturally for a radiant glow• Improves skin texture and complexion• Reduces dark circles and puffiness• Evens out skin tone and decreases pigmentation• Helps prevent fine lines and early signs of aging• Reduces blemishes and acne marks• Strengthens and nourishes skin• Deep moisturizer and natural skin cleanser• Reduces unevenness of lips\nIngredients:Saffron Pollen, Sandalwood, Rose Petals, Papaya, Sacred Lotus, Red Raspberry, Carrot, Potato, Cucumber, Hibiscus, Almond, Manjusha, Wild Turmeric, Peppermint Extracts & 62 Herbs, Nutritional Fruits & Vegetables\nUsage:Cleanse your face, apply a few drops of oil, and massage gently. Best used at night; if using during the day, leave for 25–30 minutes and apply sunscreen afterward. Not recommended for acne-prone skin.\n\n2. Triple Antioxidant Vitamin C Serum 30ml\nA potent serum formulated with three forms of antioxidants: Vitamin C (Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate), Vitamin E (Tocopherol), and Ferulic Acid. Infused with multi-molecular Hyaluronic Acid, Green Tea, Licorice Root, Lemongrass, and Rose Extracts, it hydrates, firms, reduces fine lines, and improves skin tone.\nBenefits:• Brightens and evens out skin tone• Reduces fine lines and pigmentation• Provides antioxidant protection• Deeply hydrates and improves elasticity• Soothes sensitive and red skin\nIngredients:Water (Aqua), Tetrahexyldecyl Ascorbate (Vitamin C), Glycerine, Sodium Hyaluronate (HMW, LMW), Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Extract, Cymbopogon Citratus (Lemongrass) Extract, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Extract, Rose Extract, Alpha Arbutin, Sodium PCA, Amino Acids, Betaine, Xanthan Gum, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Ferulic Acid, Sodium Phytate\nUsage:Apply 2–3 drops on cleansed face and neck. Pat gently until fully absorbed. Use daily in AM or PM and follow with moisturizer and sunscreen.\n\n3. Saffron Goat Milk Soap 100g\nA gentle, halal moisturizing soap enriched with saffron pollen and goat milk. Its antioxidant-rich formula moisturizes, exfoliates lightly, and brightens skin for a soft, luminous glow. Suitable for face and body.\nBenefits:• Maintains skin pH balance• Moisturizes and softens skin• Reduces signs of aging• Prevents pigmentation and suntan• Enhances natural skin tone and glow• Provides long-lasting hydration\nIngredients:Saffron, Goat’s Milk, Aloe Vera Gel, Glycerin, Saffron Oil, Olive Oil, Coconut Oil, Castor Oil, Essential Oils, Honey, Himalayan Pink Salt, Aqua, Lye\nUsage:Wet skin with lukewarm water, lather soap, massage gently, rinse thoroughly, and pat dry. Can be used daily on face and body.\n\n4. Exfoliating Lip Scrub 10g\nA natural lip exfoliator that gently removes dead skin and locks in moisture. Enriched with olive oil, aloe vera, argan oil, beetroot extract, and lemon essential oil, it leaves lips soft, smooth, and naturally radiant.\nBenefits:• Removes dead skin cells• Hydrates and nourishes lips• Prepares lips for lipstick or balm• Improves texture and appearance\nUsage:Apply a small amount to lips, massage gently, and rinse. Use 2–3 times weekly for best results.\n\n5. Lip Balm 10g\nA nourishing lip balm formulated with shea butter, olive oil, argan oil, cocoa butter, aloe vera, orange extract, and lemon essential oil. Protects lips from dryness, chapping, and environmental stress.\nBenefits:• Deeply hydrates and softens lips• Soothes irritation• Prevents chapping and cracking• Brightens lips naturally\nUsage:Apply on clean lips as needed throughout the day for soft, smooth, and protected lips.', 2450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1050.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Organikaon Winter Special Combo (Kumkumadi Oil 30ml, Triple Anti Oxident Vitamin C Serum 30ml, Saffron Goat Milk Soap 100g, Lip Balm 10gm &  Lip Scrub 10gm)Price in BD', 'Organikaon Winter Special Combo (Kumkumadi Oil 30ml, Triple Anti Oxident Vitamin C Serum 30ml, Saffron Goat Milk Soap 100g, Lip Balm 10gm &  Lip Scrub 10gm) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'organikaon-winter-special-combo-kumkumadi-oil-30ml-triple-anti-oxident-vitamin-c-serum-30ml-saffron-goat-milk-soap-100g-lip-balm-10gm-lip-scrub-10gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(21, 'Mamaearth Rice Facial Kit With Rice Water & Niacinamide for Glass Skin - 60gm', '1', 0, 3, 3, '21', '21', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Achieve salon-like, glass-like glowing skin in the comfort of your home with Mamaearth\'s Rice Facial Kit. This 6-step facial kit is enriched with the natural goodness of Rice Water and Niacinamide, designed to brighten, hydrate, and improve your skin\'s texture, giving you a luminous complexion.\nRice Water: Known for its brightening properties, Rice Water helps in reducing dark spots and pigmentation, leaving the skin with a radiant glow.\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): This powerful antioxidant improves skin texture, minimizes pores, and evens out skin tone, resulting in smoother and clearer skin.\nInstant Glow: Experience a visible radiance and glass-like glow after just one use.\nImproves Skin Texture: Regular use helps in refining skin texture, making it smoother and more even-toned.\nReduces Dark Spots: The combined action of Rice Water and Niacinamide helps in fading dark spots and pigmentation.\nHydrates Skin: Keeps the skin moisturized and nourished, preventing dryness and dullness.\nMade Safe Certified: Free from harmful chemicals, ensuring safety for all skin types.\nCleanse: Start with the Rice Cleansing Milk to remove impurities and makeup.\nExfoliate: Apply the Rice Face Scrub to gently exfoliate dead skin cells.\nHydrate: Use the Rice Soothing Gel to hydrate and calm the skin.\nMassage: Apply the Rice Massage Cream to massage the face in upward strokes.\nMask: Apply the Rice Face Mask evenly and leave it on for 10-15 minutes.\nMoisturize: Finish with the Rice Glow Cream to lock in moisture and enhance the glow.\nMade Safe Certified: Ensures the product is free from harmful chemicals, making it safe for regular use.\nCruelty-Free: Committed to ethical practices, Mamaearth does not test on animals.\nEco-Friendly Packaging: The brand uses recyclable materials, contributing to environmental sustainability.\nDermatologically Tested: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.', 973.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 417.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Rice Facial Kit With Rice Water & Niacinamide for Glass Skin - 60gmPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Rice Facial Kit With Rice Water & Niacinamide for Glass Skin - 60gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-rice-facial-kit-with-rice-water-niacinamide-for-glass-skin-60gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(22, 'SkinO Glow Your Skin Strawberry Scented Shower Gel 220ml  with SkinO Ultimate Glow Vitamin E Body Lotion 220ml Combo', '1', 0, 3, 15, '22', '22', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This skincare combo from skinO is designed to elevate your daily body care routine with gentle cleansing and deep hydration. The Glow Your Skin Rose Scented Shower Gel offers a refreshing cleanse with a delicate floral aroma, while the Soft Care Vitamin E Body Lotion replenishes moisture and leaves the skin feeling smooth and supple. Ideal for all skin types, this duo is perfect for those seeking a balance of freshness and nourishment.\nKey Features\nUsage\nWhy Choose This Product\n', 510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SkinO Glow Your Skin Strawberry Scented Shower Gel 220ml  with SkinO Ultimate Glow Vitamin E Body Lotion 220ml ComboPrice in BD', 'SkinO Glow Your Skin Strawberry Scented Shower Gel 220ml  with SkinO Ultimate Glow Vitamin E Body Lotion 220ml Combo Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-glow-your-skin-strawberry-scented-shower-gel-220ml-with-skino-ultimate-glow-vitamin-e-body-lotion-220ml-combo', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
