(34, 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Skin Care Set Blossom Beauty (Cleanser 50g, Toner 100ml, Serum 17ml, Eye Cream 15g, Essence Cream 25g & Sunscreen 30g)', '1', 0, 3, 8, '34', '34', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Indulge in the delicate and rejuvenating power of cherry blossoms with the LAIKOU Japan Sakura Skin Care Set. This luxurious, 6-piece collection is designed to enhance your skin\'s natural radiance while providing deep nourishment and protection. Infused with the delicate essence of Sakura (cherry blossoms), each product in this set helps to hydrate, brighten, and smooth your skin, giving you a soft, glowing complexion.\n1. Cleanser (50g) – A gentle yet effective foaming cleanser that removes impurities, dirt, and makeup while preserving your skin\'s natural moisture balance. The Sakura extract helps to soothe and refresh the skin, leaving it clean and hydrated.\n2. Toner (100ml) – This refreshing toner balances your skin’s pH levels, tightens pores, and preps your face for the next steps in your skincare routine. It’s enriched with Sakura extract, providing a calming and hydrating effect that revitalizes the skin.\n3. Serum (17ml) – A lightweight yet potent serum that penetrates deeply to target skin imperfections, fine lines, and dullness. It helps to brighten and smooth the skin, delivering an even and luminous complexion with the nourishing benefits of Sakura.\n4. Eye Cream (15g) – Specially formulated to combat puffiness and dark circles, this soothing eye cream hydrates and firms the delicate skin around your eyes, leaving it refreshed and rejuvenated.\n5. Essence Cream (25g) – A rich, silky cream that deeply nourishes and hydrates your skin, locking in moisture for a plump and radiant look. The Sakura essence helps to restore the skin\'s natural glow and improve elasticity for a youthful appearance.\n6. Sunscreen (30g) – Protect your skin from harmful UV rays with this lightweight, non-greasy sunscreen. Its broad-spectrum SPF helps shield your skin from sun damage while keeping it hydrated and protected all day long.\nWhether you’re looking to refresh your skincare routine or treat yourself to a complete regimen, the LAIKOU Japan Sakura Skin Care Set is your perfect solution. Treat your skin to the gentle, restorative benefits of Sakura and enjoy smoother, brighter, and healthier-looking skin every day.', 1091.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Set', 0.00, 1, NULL, 559.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Skin Care Set Blossom Beauty (Cleanser 50g, Toner 100ml, Serum 17ml, Eye Cream 15g, Essence Cream 25g & Sunscreen 30g)Price in BD', 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Skin Care Set Blossom Beauty (Cleanser 50g, Toner 100ml, Serum 17ml, Eye Cream 15g, Essence Cream 25g & Sunscreen 30g) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-skin-care-set-blossom-beauty-cleanser-50g-toner-100ml-serum-17ml-eye-cream-15g-essence-cream-25g-sunscreen-30g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(35, 'Lotus Professional 6 Sessions Instafair Melanin Control & Skin Lightening Kit for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 3, 20, '35', '35', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Enhance your skin complexion effectively and get a fairer and brighter face by using this instafair melanin control and skin lightening from Lotus Professional. This kit effectively brings in skin lightening that lightens skin tone and evens skin complexion effectively. Make your skin brighter and fairer by making use of this instafair skin lightening kit that has combined effects of controlling melanin in your skin. This instafair kit comprises of instafair mulberry whitening masque, skin whitening pill mask along with skin whitening concentrate. The mulberry masque is enriched with extracts of mulberry, rice bran, cucumber, orange peel, almond oil and lettuce. All the ingredients of the masque play a significant role in rejuvenating your skin by effectively controlling and preventing skin darkening. The skin whitening complex contains extracts of avocado, lavender, milk enzymes and grape seed which makes your skin fairer by delivering a high amount of actives.\nEnhance your skin complexion effectively and get a fairer and brighter face\nThe skin whitening complex contains extracts of avocado, lavender, milk enzymes and grape seed which makes your skin fairer by delivering a high amount of actives\nThe mulberry masque is enriched with extracts of mulberry, rice bran, cucumber, orange peel, almond oil and lettuce. All the ingredients of the masque play a significant role in rejuvenating your skin by effectively controlling and preventing skin darkening\nKit Content:\n1 x Instafair Skin Whitening Complex(5ml)1 x Instafair Mulberry Whitening Masque(60gm)6 x Instafair Skin Whitening Concentrate(5ml)6 x Pill Masks\nProduct Benefit:\nWhitening, Hydrating, Lightening, Radiant Skin, Soothing, Anti-ageing, Brightening & Freshning\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter the basic CETOM (Cleanse-Exfoliate-Tone-Moisturise) with HYDRAVITALS or PURAVITALS (depending upon the skin type)Induction of INSTAFAIR Skin Whitening Complex with the help of ultrasonic.Massage with HYDRAVITALS jojoba stimulating massage cream or puravitals\nCinnamon Energising Massage Gel.Apply Instafair Skin Mulberry whitening masque.\nSteps to Use The Pill Mask:Step 1 : Take about 100 ml water in a tumbler. Drop one pill mask in water.Step 2 : Pill mask will open up. Drain out the water taking care that opened pill mask remains in the tumbler.Step 3 : Break the neck of one ampoule and empty the \'Concentrate\' over the pill mask, taking care that whole of pill mask is drenched in \'Concentrate\'.Step 4 : Spread the pill mask (drenched in Concentrate over the face). After 10-15 minutes remove the pill mask.\nMade in India', 3799.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 5801.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lotus Professional 6 Sessions Instafair Melanin Control & Skin Lightening Kit for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Lotus Professional 6 Sessions Instafair Melanin Control & Skin Lightening Kit for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lotus-professional-6-sessions-instafair-melanin-control-skin-lightening-kit-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
