(37, 'Some By Mi AHA.BHA.PHA 30 Days Miracle Starter Kit - Miracle Cleansing Bar(30g) + Miracle Toner (30ml) + Miracle Serum (10ml) + Miracle Cream (20g)', '1', 0, 3, 2, '37', '37', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'STEP 1: Wash your face with warm water and the Some By Mi Cleansing Bar.\nSTEP 2: Soak a cotton pad with the Some By Mi Toner and gently apply to your skin. Gently tap your skin to help with absorption.\nSTEP 3: Apply an appropriate amount of the Some By Mi Serum to your entire face.\nSTEP 4: Gently apply the Some By Mi Cream with your fingertips.\nCaution\n▪For external use only  ▪Avoid contact with eyes  ▪Do not apply to broken or inflamed skin  ▪Keep out of reach of children  ▪Use with care for easily irritated skin, testing on small areas recommended  ▪Discontinue use if signs of irritation appear  ▪Store in cool and dry places, away from direct sunlight\n', 1650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 950.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some By Mi AHA.BHA.PHA 30 Days Miracle Starter Kit - Miracle Cleansing Bar(30g) + Miracle Toner (30ml) + Miracle Serum (10ml) + Miracle Cream (20g)Price in BD', 'Some By Mi AHA.BHA.PHA 30 Days Miracle Starter Kit - Miracle Cleansing Bar(30g) + Miracle Toner (30ml) + Miracle Serum (10ml) + Miracle Cream (20g) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-ahabhapha-30-days-miracle-starter-kit-miracle-cleansing-bar30g-miracle-toner-30ml-miracle-serum-10ml-miracle-cream-20g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
