(39, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Facial Kit – With Vitamin C & Turmeric, 6-Step Facial Kit', '1', 0, 3, 3, '39', '39', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A complete Vitamin C facial kit designed to cleanse, exfoliate, nourish, and enhance natural skin radiance.\nVitamin C Cleansing Milk – 10 ml\nVitamin C Face Scrub – 10 g\nVitamin C Soothing Gel – 10 ml\nVitamin C Massage Cream – 10 g\nVitamin C Face Mask – 10 g\nVitamin C Glow Cream – 10 g\nStep 1: Vitamin C Cleansing MilkApply evenly on face and neck. Gently wipe with cotton and rinse with water.\nStep 2: Vitamin C Face ScrubMassage gently for 2–3 minutes. Rinse off and pat dry.\nStep 3: Vitamin C Soothing GelMassage for 1–2 minutes until completely absorbed.\nStep 4: Vitamin C Massage CreamMassage in upward circular motion for 5–10 minutes. Gently wipe off with a wet cloth.\nStep 5: Vitamin C Face MaskApply a generous layer and leave for 15 minutes. Wash off with water.\nStep 6: Vitamin C Glow CreamTake a small amount and gently massage all over face and neck.\nBrightens dull and tired skin\nDeep cleansing and exfoliation\nHydrates and soothes the skin\nEnhances natural glow\nSuitable for all skin types', 693.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 297.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Facial Kit – With Vitamin C & Turmeric, 6-Step Facial KitPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Facial Kit – With Vitamin C & Turmeric, 6-Step Facial Kit Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-vitamin-c-facial-kit-with-vitamin-c-turmeric-6-step-facial-kit', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-15 05:50:05'),
