nene, LinaloolMADE IN KOREA', 1573.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1177.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some By Mi Super Matcha Pore Care Starter Kit (Cleansing Gel 42ml + Clay Mask 42g + Pore Tightening Toner 30ml + Pore Tightening Serum 10ml)Price in BD', 'Some By Mi Super Matcha Pore Care Starter Kit (Cleansing Gel 42ml + Clay Mask 42g + Pore Tightening Toner 30ml + Pore Tightening Serum 10ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-super-matcha-pore-care-starter-kit-cleansing-gel-42ml-clay-mask-42g-pore-tightening-toner-30ml-pore-tightening-serum-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(41, 'Laikou Pro Niacinamide Brightening Skincare Set-4 Pieces (Cleanser, Toner, Serum, cream)', '1', 0, 3, 8, '41', '41', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Pro Niacinamide Skincare Set Brightening – 4pcs\nNet:Laikou Pro Niacinamide Serum – 17mlLaikou Pro Niacinamide Cream – 30gLaikou Pro Niacinamide Toner – 50mlLaikou Pro Niacinamide Cleanser – 50g\nFeatures: High concentration / high purity Niacinamide / Brightening/moisturizing / Delay skin aging\nEffects:LAIKOU PRO NIACINAMIDE SKINCARE SET features high concentration and high purity niacinamide, which can accelerate the metabolism of melanocytes, reduce pigment deposition, brighten skin tone, and delay skin aging.\nHow to use:Step 1 : Take an appropriate amount of the cleanser on the palm, foam it with water and gently massage the wet face and neck for one minute, then wash with water.Step 2 : Take a few drops of the toner on the plam, apply evenly on the whole face and pat gently until it is absorbed.Step 3 : After cleansing, apply the serum evenly on the whole face and neck. Massage your skin gently until it is absorbed.Step 4 : After cleansing, apply the cream evenly on the whole face and massage your skin gently until it is absorbed.\nCautions:1.Sensitive skin should be tested behind the ear before using. Stop using it if irritation sense appears.2.Keep it in a cool place and out of reach of children.', 1204.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 496.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Pro Niacinamide Brightening Skincare Set-4 Pieces (Cleanser, Toner, Serum, cream)Price in BD', 'Laikou Pro Niacinamide Brightening Skincare Set-4 Pieces (Cleanser, Toner, Serum, cream) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-pro-niacinamide-brightening-skincare-set-4-pieces-cleanser-toner-serum-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-15 06:01:48'),
(42, 'Dermamate Face Wash for Acne Prone Skin 100ml with Dermamate Face Gel for Acne Prone Skin 50ml Combo', '1', 0, 3, 22, '42', '42', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Dermamate Face Wash (100ml) and Face Gel (50ml) combo is designed for acne-prone skin, offering a complete cleansing and treatment routine that targets breakouts, excess oil, and inflammation.\nProduct Overview\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHow to Use\n\nThis combo is ideal for individuals dealing with oily, acne-prone skin and looking for a simple, effective routine.\n', 855.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 95.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermamate Face Wash for Acne Prone Skin 100ml with Dermamate Face Gel for Acne Prone Skin 50ml ComboPrice in BD', 'Dermamate Face Wash for Acne Prone Skin 100ml with Dermamate Face Gel for Acne Prone Skin 50ml Combo Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermamate-face-wash-for-acne-prone-skin-100ml-with-dermamate-face-gel-for-acne-prone-skin-50ml-combo', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(43, 'LAIKOU Bye Bye Acne Australia Tea Tree Skin Care Set (Cleanser, Toner, Serum, Gel & Cream)', '1', 0, 3, 8, '43', '43', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LAIKOU Australia Tea Tree Acne 5pcs Skincare Set Purify Pores Oil-Water Balance Repair Acne Skin Bye Bye Acne Set\nLaikou Tea Tree Bye Bye Acne Skincare Set – 5pcs\nTea Tree Set:\n☑Cleanser 50g☑Toner 100ml☑Serum 17ml☑Face Cream 25g☑Gel 15g\nEffects:\n☑Repairing ☑Soothing ☑Oil Control ☑Lighten Acne\nAfter using:\n☒Coarse pores ☒Acne Marks ☒Oily Skin\nSkincare Routine:\n1. Cleanser: Clean your face first\n2. Toner : Take a few drops of the toner on the palm or cotton pad, apply evenly on the whole face and pat gently.\n3. Serum: Take 2-4 drops of serum, then apply evenly on the face.\n4. Cream: Apply the cream evenly and massage your skin gently until it is absorbed.\n5. Gel: After daily skin care, apply the gel evenly on the acne areas.\n\n\n', 1215.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Combo', 0.00, 1, NULL, 435.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Bye Bye Acne Australia Tea Tree Skin Care Set (Cleanser, Toner, Serum, Gel & Cream)Price in BD', 'LAIKOU Bye Bye Acne Australia Tea Tree Skin Care Set (Cleanser, Toner, Serum, Gel & Cream) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-bye-bye-acne-australia-tea-tree-skin-care-set-cleanser-toner-serum-gel-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(44, 'Boots The Glow Peach Collection Set – (Peach Sugar Scrub 50ml , Peach Jelly Moisturiser 50ml , Peach Serum 28ml)', '1', 0, 3, 11, '44', '44', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Get instantly fresh, smooth, and glow-ready skin with the Boots The Glow Peach Collection Set—a complete peach-scented skincare trio that helps exfoliate, hydrate, and boost a healthy-looking glow. Infused with peach extract, each product is designed to leave skin looking cleaner, softer, and naturally radiant with easy daily use.\nGlow Peach Sugar Scrub – 50ml\nGlow Peach Jelly Moisturiser – 50ml\nGlow Peach Serum – 28ml\nA gentle exfoliating scrub that helps remove dirt, impurities, and dull-looking build-up for radiant, healthy-looking skin.\nHow to use: Use once or twice a week. Massage gently onto skin, then rinse off.\nIngredients:Aqua (Water), Glycerin, Polysorbate 20, Phenoxyethanol, Dipropylene Glycol, Parfum (Fragrance), Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) (…), Chlorphenesin, Butylene Glycol, Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Linalool, CI 14700 (Red 4).(Some words were unclear in your text, but I kept the list as close as possible.)\nA lightweight jelly moisturiser that helps relieve the look of dryness and leaves skin with a healthy-looking natural glow. Includes Niacinamide and Panthenol for added skin comfort and moisture support.\nHow to use: Apply as your daily moisturiser morning and night. Pat onto skin until absorbed.\nIngredients:Aqua (Water), Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Niacinamide, PEG-240/HDI Copolymer Bis-Decyltetradeceth-20 Ether, Panthenol, PPG-26-Buteth-26, Phenoxyethanol, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Hydroxyacetophenone, Trehalose, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Dipropylene Glycol, Prunus Persica (Peach) (… ) Extract, Chlorphenesin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Parfum (Fragrance), Disodium EDTA, Sodium Hydroxide, Linalool, Hexyl Cinnamal, Geraniol, Tocopherol, Potassium Laurate, Limonene, Denatonium Benzoate, CI 14700 (Red 4), CI 19140 (Yellow 5).(A couple of extract/resin words were unclear in your text.)\nA lightweight serum that boosts hydration and supports the skin’s natural healthy-looking glow. Great as a prep step before moisturiser, with peach extract and glow-supporting ingredients.\nHow to use: Apply 2–3 drops onto clean, toned skin before moisturiser (morning and/or night).\nIngredients (as provided, some parts unclear):Aqua (Water), Glycerin, (… gum), Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract, Phenoxyethanol, (… ), Parfum (Fragrance), Sodium (… ), Chlorphenesin, Ethylhexylglycerin, (… ), Disodium EDTA, Linalool, Tocopheryl Acetate, CI 14700 (Red 4), CI 19140 (Yellow 5).Note: Your serum ingredient line is partially cut/garbled. If you paste it again (or send a clearer photo), I can rewrite the full INCI perfectly.', 2200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'Set', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1590.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots The Glow Peach Collection Set – (Peach Sugar Scrub 50ml , Peach Jelly Moisturiser 50ml , Peach Serum 28ml)Price in BD', 'Boots The Glow Peach Collection Set – (Peach Sugar Scrub 50ml , Peach Jelly Moisturiser 50ml , Peach Serum 28ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-the-glow-peach-collection-set-peach-sugar-scrub-50ml-peach-jelly-moisturiser-50ml-peach-serum-28ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-15 05:50:01'),
(45, 'COSPROF Acne Care 3-in-1 Combo – Acne Serum 30ml, Face Cleanser 200ml & Mineral Sunscreen Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 3, 23, '45', '45', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COSPROF Acne Care 3-in-1 Combo একটি সম্পূর্ণ স্কিন কেয়ার সল্যুশন, যা তৈলাক্ত ও ব্রণ-প্রবণ ত্বকের জন্য বিশেষভাবে তৈরি। এই কম্বোতে আছে:\nAcne Serum 30ml (Niacinamide 5% + Salicylic Acid 1%) – ব্রণ কমাতে, দাগ হ্রাস করতে এবং ত্বককে উজ্জ্বল ও হাইড্রেটেড রাখে।\nFace Cleanser 200ml (Salicylic Acid 0.5%) – স্কিনকে ডিপ ক্লিন করে, অতিরিক্ত তেল নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে এবং ব্ল্যাকহেড ও হোয়াইটহেড দূর করতে সহায়ক।\nMineral Sunscreen Cream 50ml (SPF 50 PA++) – UVA ও UVB রশ্মি থেকে স্কিনকে সুরক্ষা প্রদান করে, ত্বককে ময়েশ্চারাইজ করে এবং হালকা ওল ফ্রি ফর্মুলার কারণে কোন হোয়াইট কাস্ট দেয় না।\nনিয়মিত ব্যবহারে এই কম্বো ত্বককে ব্রাইট, সফট এবং হাইড্রেটেড রাখে, একই সঙ্গে ব্রণজনিত দাগ ও হাইপারপিগমেন্টেশন কমাতে সহায়তা করে।\nব্রণ দ্রুত শুকাতে এবং পুনরায় ব্রণ হওয়ার প্রবণতা হ্রাস করে\nডার্ক স্পট ও ব্রণজনিত দাগ হ্রাস করে\nত্বককে উজ্জ্বল ও হাইড্রেটেড রাখে\nঅতিরিক্ত তেল নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে এবং ব্ল্যাকহেড/হোয়াইটহেড দূর করে\nসূর্য থেকে স্কিনকে সুরক্ষা প্রদান করে (SPF 50 PA++)\nস্কিনকে সফট, মসৃণ ও প্রাকৃতিক উজ্জ্বল রাখে\nসকল স্কিন টাইপের জন্য নিরাপদ\nNo Harmful Chemicals, BCSIR Lab Tested\nAcne Serum: Niacinamide 5%, Salicylic Acid 1%, Green Tea Extract, Aloe Vera, Licorice, Pomegranate\nFace Cleanser: Salicylic Acid 0.5%, Green Tea Extract, Glycerin, Polyquaternium-7\nMineral Sunscreen: Zinc Oxide, Hyaluronic Acid, Shea Butter, Vitamin E, Lavender Essential Oil\nFace Cleanser: মুখ পরিষ্কার করতে ব্যবহার করুন, ১–২ মিনিট হালকা ম্যাসাজ করুন, তারপর পানি দিয়ে ধুয়ে ফেলুন।\nAcne Serum: পরিষ্কার মুখে ২–৩ ফোঁটা সিরাম নিন, মুখ ও ঘাড়ে সমানভাবে ম্যাসাজ করুন। সকালে বা রাতে ব্যবহার করুন।\nMineral Sunscreen Cream: রোদে বের হওয়ার ৫ মিনিট আগে মুখ ও ঘাড়ে প্রয়োগ করুন। প্রয়োজনে চার থেকে পাঁচ ঘণ্টা পর পুনরায় ব্যবহার করুন।\nPack Size: Acne Serum 30ml, Face Cleanser 200ml, Mineral Sunscreen Cream 50ml\nSkin Type: All Skin Types (especially Oily & Acne-Prone)\npH: 4–6\nMade in: Bangladesh\nশিশুদের নাগালের বাইরে রাখুন\nচোখে লাগলে সঙ্গে সঙ্গে পানি দিয়ে ধুয়ে ফেলুন\nশুধুমাত্র বাহ্যিক ব্যবহারের জন্য\nসরাসরি সূর্যালোক ও অতিরিক্ত তাপ থেকে দূরে রাখুন\nThe COSPROF Acne Care 3-in-1 Combo is a complete skincare solution specially designed for oily and acne-prone skin. This combo includes:\nAcne Serum (30ml) – Niacinamide 5% + Salicylic Acid 1%: Helps reduce acne, fade dark spots, and keeps the skin bright, hydrated, and smooth.\nFace Cleanser (200ml) – Salicylic Acid 0.5%: Deeply cleanses the skin, controls excess oil, and helps remove blackheads and whiteheads.\nMineral Sunscreen Cream (50ml) – SPF 50 PA++: Protects the skin from UVA and UVB rays, moisturizes, and features a lightweight, oil-free formula that does not leave a white cast.\nWith regular use, this combo keeps skin bright, soft, and hydrated, while helping reduce acne scars and hyperpigmentation.\nSpeeds up acne healing and reduces recurrence\nReduces dark spots and acne-related marks\nKeeps skin bright, hydrated, and healthy\nControls excess oil and removes blackheads/whiteheads\nProvides sun protection (SPF 50 PA++)\nLeaves skin soft, smooth, and naturally radiant\nSafe for all skin types\nNo harmful chemicals – BCSIR Lab Tested\nAcne Serum: Niacinamide 5%, Salicylic Acid 1%, Green Tea Extract, Aloe Vera, Licorice, Pomegranate\nFace Cleanser: Salicylic Acid 0.5%, Green Tea Extract, Glycerin, Polyquaternium-7\nMineral Sunscreen Cream: Zinc Oxide, Hyaluronic Acid, Shea Butter, Vitamin E, Lavender Essential Oil\nFace Cleanser:\nApply to wet face, gently massage for 1–2 minutes, then rinse thoroughly with water.\nAcne Serum:\nTake 2–3 drops on a clean face and neck.\nMassage evenly.\nCan be used morning and/or night.\nMineral Sunscreen Cream:\nApply to face and neck 5 minutes before sun exposure.\nReapply every 4–5 hours if necessary.\nPack Size: Acne Serum 30ml + Face Cleanser 200ml + Mineral Sunscreen Cream 50ml\nSkin Type: All Skin Types (especially oily and acne-prone)\npH: 4–6\nMade in: Bangladesh\nKeep out of reach of children\nIn case of contact with eyes, rinse immediately with water\nFor external use only\nStore away from direct sunlight and excessive heat', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'Combo', 0.00, 1, NULL, 201.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSPROF Acne Care 3-in-1 Combo – Acne Serum 30ml, Face Cleanser 200ml & Mineral Sunscreen Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'COSPROF Acne Care 3-in-1 Combo – Acne Serum 30ml, Face Cleanser 200ml & Mineral Sunscreen Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosprof-acne-care-3-in-1-combo-acne-serum-30ml-face-cleanser-200ml-mineral-sunscreen-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-15 05:50:02'),
