(47, 'Boots Ingredients Renewal Set – Oat Cleansing Balm 50ml + Salicylic Acid Cleanser 150ml + Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30ml + AHA BHA Serum 28ml', '1', 0, 3, 11, '47', '47', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Build a simple, effective skincare routine with the Boots Ingredients Renewal Set—a 4-step collection designed to cleanse, hydrate, refine pores, and gently renew skin texture. This set combines an ultra-gentle Oat Cleansing Balm for removing daily build-up, a Salicylic Acid Cleanser to help decongest pores, a hydrating Hyaluronic Acid Serum for plumper-looking skin, and an exfoliating AHA/BHA Serum to support smoother, brighter-looking results over time.\nIdeal for anyone looking to refresh dull skin, manage congestion, and maintain balanced hydration—especially when used consistently with sunscreen.\nHyaluronic Acid Serum – 30ml (hydration + plump look)\nOat Cleansing Balm – 150ml (gentle cleanse + makeup/SPF removal)\nSalicylic Acid Cleanser – 50ml (pore-clearing cleanser)\nAHA BHA Serum – 28ml (skin-renewing exfoliation)\nHelps remove impurities and daily build-up (balm cleanser)\nSupports clearer-looking pores and reduced congestion (salicylic cleanser)\nBoosts hydration for softer, smoother-feeling skin (hyaluronic serum)\nHelps improve rough texture and dullness (AHA/BHA serum)\nA complete routine for renewal + balance + glow\nSalicylic Acid Cleanser (or use a gentler cleanser if your skin is dry/sensitive)\nHyaluronic Acid Serum\nMoisturiser\nSunscreen (essential)\nOat Cleansing Balm (first cleanse)\nSalicylic Acid Cleanser (second cleanse, optional based on skin tolerance)\nHyaluronic Acid Serum\nAHA BHA Serum (use 2–3 nights a week at first, then increase only if skin tolerates)\nMoisturiser\nTip: On nights you use AHA/BHA, keep the rest of the routine simple and avoid other strong exfoliants.\nIngredients: Aqua (Water), Glycerin, Propanediol, Betaine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Chlorphenesin, Carbomer, Allantoin, Methylparaben, Xanthan Gum, Disodium EDTA, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Sodium Hydroxide, Tocopheryl Acetate.\nIngredients: Paraffinum Liquidum (Mineral Oil), Cera Microcristallina (Microcrystalline Wax), Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Hydrogenated Styrene/Isoprene Copolymer, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Polyethylene, Trihydroxystearin, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Flour, Paraffin, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Oil, BHT, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate.\nIngredients: Aqua (Water), Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Decyl Glucoside, Glycerin, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Salicylic Acid, PEG-120 Methyl Glucose Dioleate, Cocamide MEA, Sodium Chloride, PEG-150 Distearate, Sodium Hydroxide, Allantoin, Sodium Benzoate, Phenoxyethanol, Citric Acid, Tetrasodium EDTA, Zinc PCA.\nIngredients: Aqua (Water), Propanediol, Betaine, Glycolic Acid, Sodium Hydroxide, Salicylic Acid, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Benzoate, Hydroxyethylpiperazine Ethane Sulfonic Acid, Disodium EDTA.\nKeep out of reach of children. If product gets into eyes, rinse well with water immediately.\nStore in a cool, dry place. Avoid direct sunlight.\nSunburn Alert (Salicylic Acid Cleanser & AHA/BHA Serum): Contains AHA/BHA which may increase sun sensitivity. Use sunscreen, wear protective clothing, and limit sun exposure during use and for one week after stopping.\nAHA/BHA Serum: Do not apply to irritated or broken skin. If uncomfortable, remove and rinse thoroughly. Use only as directed. If irritation persists, discontinue and consult a physician. Contact with skin should be limited in frequency/duration. This is not a food. Colour may vary. Can be diluted with other treatments until skin builds tolerance.', 2585.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Set', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1205.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Ingredients Renewal Set – Oat Cleansing Balm 50ml + Salicylic Acid Cleanser 150ml + Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30ml + AHA BHA Serum 28mlPrice in BD', 'Boots Ingredients Renewal Set – Oat Cleansing Balm 50ml + Salicylic Acid Cleanser 150ml + Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30ml + AHA BHA Serum 28ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-ingredients-renewal-set-oat-cleansing-balm-50ml-salicylic-acid-cleanser-150ml-hyaluronic-acid-serum-30ml-aha-bha-serum-28ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
(48, 'Simple SkinKind Collection Booster Serum Gift Set (3% Hyaluronic Acid+B5, 10% VitaminC+E+F & 10% Vitamin B3 Niacinamide)', '1', 0, 3, 24, '48', '48', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Give her the gift of a supercharged skin care routine with the Simple Skin Kind Booster Serum Gift Set, featuring three skin-friendly gifts for her from our Skin Kind range for instant, visible results. Our booster serums are designed to hydrate, brighten, and protect her skin, and this gift set features a pink travel beauty bag so she can keep all her beauty products together. Simple Booster Serum 3% Hyaluronic Acid 30 ml is our hydrating, power-plumping miracle for youthful-looking skin, powered by high-performance ingredients, with deep hydration to supercharge your skin care routine in the morning and evening. Simple Booster Serum 10% Vitamins C+E+F 30 ml is naturally brilliant at brightening your complexion, reducing fine lines, and protecting against environmental aggressors like pollution and blue light, leaving you with youthful, glowing skin throughout the day. Simple Booster Serum 10% Niacinamide 30 ml contains niacinamide (vitamin B3) and B5 to hydrate, smooth, and help strengthen and protect your skin barrier while you sleep. You\'ll be left with an even skin tone and texture. Packaged in a small travel beauty bag, perfect for storing skin care products, this Simple gift set is the perfect present for anyone who enjoys a little pampering. Like all our products, these Simple Christmas gifts for her are infused with skin-loving ingredients and contain no artificial perfume or colour and no harsh chemicals that can upset the skin. Show just how much you care by treating her to a daily skin care boost to supercharge her beauty routine.\n\nEach Gift Set Includes:\n\nFeatures:\n\nHow to Use:\n\nIngredients:\nSafety Warnings: For external use only.\n\nMade in Hungary', 2870.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1770.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple SkinKind Collection Booster Serum Gift Set (3% Hyaluronic Acid+B5, 10% VitaminC+E+F & 10% Vitamin B3 Niacinamide)Price in BD', 'Simple SkinKind Collection Booster Serum Gift Set (3% Hyaluronic Acid+B5, 10% VitaminC+E+F & 10% Vitamin B3 Niacinamide) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-skinkind-collection-booster-serum-gift-set-3-hyaluronic-acidb5-10-vitamincef-10-vitamin-b3-niacinamide', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:21:59', '2026-02-11 06:21:59'),
