(53, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Skin Care 3 Pcs Set Pretty Girl (Serum+Eye Cream+Essence Cream)', '1', 0, 3, 8, '53', '53', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Skincare Set – 3pcs\nLaikou japan sakura skincare set serum moisturizing cream eye cream brightening anti-wrinkle oil control skincare set – 3 in 1\nSpecifications:Brand: LaikouSkin type: all skin types\nType:1 x japan sakura serum 17ml1 x japan sakura eye cream 15g1 x japan sakura essence cream 25g\nFeatures:1. Sakura serum contains sakura extract, which is known for its moisturizing, anti-aging, brightening and anti-inflammatory functions.2. Intensely rehydrate, restore skin’s glow and smoothen skin3. For dull skin, it can brighten the skin tone4. Suitable for all skin types and sensitive skin5. Sakura extract is with excellent moisturizing and whitening effect and more than 80% of the ingredients are natural, which is safe for skin6. Repairing the dry lines due to lacking of moisture.7. Restoring the skin elasticity, leaving skin smooth\nHow to use:1. After facial cleansing, apply a few drops of the serum on the palm, spread evenly on the face, and neck and massage until absorption.2. Apply an appropriate amount of the cream onto the face or neck3. Apply the eye cream on the eye contour and massage the skin until it is completely absorbed.', 446.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'Set', 0.00, 1, NULL, 204.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Skin Care 3 Pcs Set Pretty Girl (Serum+Eye Cream+Essence Cream)Price in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Skin Care 3 Pcs Set Pretty Girl (Serum+Eye Cream+Essence Cream) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-skin-care-3-pcs-set-pretty-girl-serumeye-creamessence-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-15 05:49:57'),
