(56, 'Skin\'O Keratin Smooth Repair Shampoo 220ml  with SkinO Lavender Shower Gel 220ml Combo', '1', 0, 3, 15, '56', '56', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This nourishing hair and body care combo from Skin\'O is designed to deliver smooth, manageable hair and refreshed, soothed skin. The Keratin Smooth Repair Shampoo helps restore damaged strands and reduce frizz, while the Lavender Shower Gel gently cleanses and calms the skin with its aromatic formula. Ideal for daily use, this duo offers a complete self-care experience for all hair and skin types.\nKey Features\nUsage\nWhy Choose This Product\n', 510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin\'O Keratin Smooth Repair Shampoo 220ml  with SkinO Lavender Shower Gel 220ml ComboPrice in BD', 'Skin\'O Keratin Smooth Repair Shampoo 220ml  with SkinO Lavender Shower Gel 220ml Combo Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-keratin-smooth-repair-shampoo-220ml-with-skino-lavender-shower-gel-220ml-combo', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-15 05:49:52'),
