(60, 'GM TRUM Anti Acne Serum 15gm', '1', 0, 6, 27, '60', '60', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purified Water, 2-Propanol, Propylene Glycol, Glycerol, Salicylic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Triethanolamine, Tea Tree (Melaleuca Alternifolia) Leaf Extract, Camellia (Thea) Sinensis Leaf Extract, Neem Leaf Extract, Niacinamide, Resorcinol, Sebacic Acid, Ethyl Hexyl Glycerin, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Pyrrolidone Carboxylic Acid, Polyquaternium-10, Perfume.\nReduces acne breakouts\nFades acne scars and dark spots\nPurifies and minimizes pores\nRepairs skin and boosts renewal process\nEvens out overall skin tone\nCalms redness and flare-ups\nUse a very small amount on targeted areas only.Take one drop and press it onto the acne-affected spot.Dab lightly to help it absorb.Repeat for each acne mark or scar.Do not apply all over the face.Use twice daily under moisturizer.\nPatch test recommended before first use\nNatural ingredients may cause allergic reactions\nDiscontinue use if redness or irritation occurs\nDo not use on inflamed or broken skin\nAvoid contact with eyes\nKeep away from children\nStore in a cool, dark place', 1747.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 18.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'GM TRUM Anti Acne Serum 15gmPrice in BD', 'GM TRUM Anti Acne Serum 15gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gm-trum-anti-acne-serum-15gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(61, 'Fenyi Vitamin C Whitening Serum', '1', 0, 7, 28, '61', '61', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fenyi Vitamin C Whitening Serum – 17ml\nBrand: Fenyi\nShelf life: 5 years\nSuitable: All skin types\nNet weight: 17ml\nBrighten skin tone/ Moisturizing /Reduce acne marks\nThe selected “” T+X”” formula for Fenyi Vitamin C Whitening Serum contains Citrus Tangerina (Tangerine) Extract, Niacinamide and Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, which can brighten the dull skin, reduce acne marks and blemishes, making your skin soft and bright. With Sodium Hyaluronate and Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, it can nourish skin deeply and restore skin elasticity.\nA strong formula of “”T+X”” , double care for your skin, gentle and natural\ningredient:CITRUS TANGERINA (TANGERINE) EXTRACT: Contain Vitamin C to inhibit tyrosinase activity and brighten skin tone\nNIACINAMIDE: Prevent the appearance of melanin and promote the skin metabolism\nDIPOTASSIUM GLYCYRRHIZATE: Soothe the skin, reduce inflammation and make your skin bright\nSODIUM HYALURONATE: Nourish the skin and retain the moisture\nUsage:\nAfter cleansing,take a few drops of the serum on the palm and apply evenly on the whole face,avoiding the eye areas. Massage your skin gently until it is absorbed.', 220.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fenyi Vitamin C Whitening SerumPrice in BD', 'Fenyi Vitamin C Whitening Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fenyi-vitamin-c-whitening-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(62, 'Sadoer AHA + BHA Repair Salicylic Acid Serum for Acne Skin Repair 30ml', '1', 0, 8, 29, '62', '62', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Sadoer AHA + BHA Repair Salicylic Acid Serum is formulated to address acne-prone skin by combining Alpha Hydroxy Acids (AHAs) and Beta Hydroxy Acids (BHAs) to exfoliate, unclog pores, and promote skin rejuvenation.\n\nKey Benefits:\nExfoliation: AHAs, such as malic acid, gently exfoliate the skin\'s surface, removing dead skin cells and promoting a brighter complexion.\nDeep Cleansing: BHAs, particularly salicylic acid, penetrate deep into the pores to dissolve excess oil and debris, helping to prevent acne formation.\nSkin Repair: The serum aids in repairing damaged skin, reducing the appearance of acne scars, and improving overall skin texture.\n\nKey Ingredients:\nMalic Acid (AHA): An alpha hydroxy acid that exfoliates the skin\'s surface, promoting cell turnover and a brighter complexion.\nSalicylic Acid (BHA): A beta hydroxy acid that penetrates pores to exfoliate from within, effectively treating and preventing acne.\nSophora Root Extract: Known for its anti-inflammatory properties, it helps soothe irritated skin.\nPEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil: Acts as an emulsifier and moisturizer, helping to soften and hydrate the skin.\n\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Start with a clean face, ensuring all makeup and impurities are removed.\nApply: Dispense a few drops of the serum onto your fingertips.\nMassage: Gently massage the serum into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use the serum twice daily, in the morning and evening, for optimal results.\n\nPrecautions:\nPerform a patch test before first use to check for any adverse reactions.\nAvoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation develops, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.', 237.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 213.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sadoer AHA + BHA Repair Salicylic Acid Serum for Acne Skin Repair 30mlPrice in BD', 'Sadoer AHA + BHA Repair Salicylic Acid Serum for Acne Skin Repair 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sadoer-aha-bha-repair-salicylic-acid-serum-for-acne-skin-repair-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
