(64, 'Skin\'O Advanced Brightening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 15, '64', '64', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin’O Advanced Brightening SerumBenefitsSkin\'O Advanced Brightening Serum offers a multitude of benefits for your skin. Firstly, it effectively brightens dull skin, unveiling a radiant and luminous complexion that reflects a healthy glow. Secondly, it tackles skin discoloration, ensuring an even tone and diminishing the appearance of unwanted pigmentation. Additionally, the serums potent formula targets dark spots and acne marks, providing a visibly clearer and smoother skin texture. Moreover, it actively works to reduce age spots, freckles, and melasma, combating signs of aging and hyperpigmentation. With regular use, this serum revitalizes your skin, leaving it looking more youthful, vibrant, and beautifully.\nHow to use:Apply a few drops of serum to your face in the morning and night before using any heavier cream. Gently tap it into the skin for better absorption.\n\nIngredientsAqua, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Carbomer, Hyaluronic Acid, Glycerine, Niacinamide, Alpha Arbutin, Propylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, PEG- 40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Fragrance Oil', 393.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 97.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin\'O Advanced Brightening Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Skin\'O Advanced Brightening Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-advanced-brightening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(65, 'Cosrx Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence 100ml', '1', 0, 8, 31, '65', '65', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosrx Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence 100ml, Korea\nCosrx Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence is a lightweight Korean skincare essence that delivers deep hydration while repairing and soothing the skin. Available at Arogga Bangladesh at the best price, this authentic essence is perfect for enhancing skin texture, reducing redness, and restoring a natural glow.\n\nKey Features:\n96% Snail Secretion Filtrate: Provides intense hydration and skin repair.\nLightweight Essence: Absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky feel.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Works for normal, oily, and sensitive skin.\nBoosts Skin Elasticity: Helps improve firmness and smoothness.\nCompatible with Serums: Works well with Vitamin C or Retinol products.\n\nBenefits:\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes the skin.\nReduces redness and improves uneven skin tone.\nRepairs damaged skin and supports natural healing.\nSoftens the appearance of fine lines.\nEnhances skin radiance and natural glow.\n\nUsage: After cleansing and toning, apply an adequate amount to face and neck. Gently pat until fully absorbed. Can be used morning and evening.\n\nIngredients: Snail Secretion Filtrate, Betaine, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Ethyl Hexanediol, Carbomer, Panthenol, Arginine\n\nCountry of Origin: Korea', 1265.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1485.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence 100mlPrice in BD', 'Cosrx Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-advanced-snail-96-mucin-power-essence-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
