(74, 'OSUFI Collagen Moisturizing Brightening Firming Essence Toner 300ml', '1', 0, 10, 35, '74', '74', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OSUFI Collagen Moisturizing Brightening Firming Essence Toner 300ml is a multifunctional skincare toner formulated to enhance hydration, brightness, and skin firmness. Enriched with collagen and other nourishing ingredients, it is designed to boost skin elasticity and provide a smooth, refreshed look.\nAfter cleansing, apply the toner to the face with a cotton pad or hands, gently patting for full absorption.', 737.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 313.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'OSUFI Collagen Moisturizing Brightening Firming Essence Toner 300mlPrice in BD', 'OSUFI Collagen Moisturizing Brightening Firming Essence Toner 300ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'osufi-collagen-moisturizing-brightening-firming-essence-toner-300ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(75, 'Cos De BAHA HB Hydroquinone Brightening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 36, '75', '75', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COS DE BAHA Hydroquinone Brightening works for dark spot corrector remover, melasma & hyperpigmentation treatment. It’s a combination of 2% Hydroquinone + Arbutin + Niacinamide 4%. Find authentic Cos De Baha Hydroquinone Brightening serum at reasonable price in Bangladesh from us.\nHydroquinone is a skin-lightening agent. It bleaches the skin, which can be helpful when treating different forms of hyperpigmentation.\nHistorically, there’s been some back-and-forth on the safety of hydroquinone. In 1982, the U.S. Food and Drug Administration recognized the ingredient as safe and effectiveTrusted Source.\nSeveral years later, concerns about safety prompted retailers to pull hydroquinone from the market. The FDA went on to discover that many of the products in question contained contaminants like mercury. They established that these contaminants were behind reports of adverse effects.\nSince then, the FDA has confirmed that hydroquinone can be safely sold over the counter (OTC) in 2 percent concentrations. which Cos De BAHA has prepared for a long time. Now, check for yourself the effects of improving the texture of your skin.\nHow can Hydroquinone make your skin healthy?\nHydroquinone bleaches your skin by decreasing the number of melanocytes present. Melanocytes make melanin, which is what produces your skin tone.\nIn cases of hyperpigmentation, more melanin is present due to an increase in melanocyte production. By controlling these melanocytes, your skin will become more evenly toned over time.\nIt takes about four weeks on average for the ingredient to take effect. It may take several months of consistent use before you see full results.\n', 1099.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 351.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA HB Hydroquinone Brightening Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA HB Hydroquinone Brightening Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-hb-hydroquinone-brightening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
