(79, 'Melao 2% Alpha Arbutin Whitening Serum', '1', 0, 7, 30, '79', '79', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Melao Whitening Serum Alpha Arbutin plus Kojic Acid 30ml\nMelao Whitening Serum Alpha Arbutin plus Kojic Acid for ‘glowing,’/’healthy ‘skin: achieve the ‘ideal complexion. This formula is intended to fight against melasma and all kinds of results in renewed, glowing, and young skin.\nMelao Whitening Serum combines the best of two brightening ingredients: Alpha Arbutin and Kojic Acid, two extensively used ingredients that have proven their efficiency in diminishing melanin production in the skin. The part ingredient exfoliants blend with ractopamine to gradually eradicate dark patches and hyper-pigmenting.\n\nThis serum is not only for brightening purposes alone or for other similar functionality alone. It also has Hyaluronic Acid, which is another host of moisturizers that has the potential to fill up the skin and make it look smoother. Moreover, an enhanced level of antioxidants reverses some elements of skin aging, like lines and crow’s feet.\n\nThe packaging of Melao Whitening Serum does not harm even sensitive skin. A significant advantage of this product is that it is very light and non-oily, which is very important for me, as most collagen products I have tried in the past are very oily and will leave a residue on the hands and clothes.\n\nOur dermatologist recommended skin lightening or skin brightening treatment, which can make your skin look fair and even textured cost-effectively. Melao Whitening Serum is a home care product that can be used easily and without strain. It is best used after washing the face by spreading a dime-sized amount of the lotion on the problematic areas twice a day, waiting for it to dry before putting on other creams, ointments or makeup.', 381.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 169.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao 2% Alpha Arbutin Whitening SerumPrice in BD', 'Melao 2% Alpha Arbutin Whitening Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-2-alpha-arbutin-whitening-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(80, 'The Ordinary Niacinamide 10%+Zinc1% 60ml', '1', 0, 11, 25, '80', '80', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A high‑strength vitamin and mineral formula designed to target blemishes, regulate excess oil, and visibly refine skin texture. This supersized 60ml edition delivers the same cult‑favorite formula with double the value, making it ideal for daily use in any skincare routine.\n\nKey Features\n\nFull Ingredient ListAqua (Water), Niacinamide, Pentylene Glycol, Zinc PCA, Dimethyl Isosorbide, Tamarindus Indica Seed Gum, Xanthan Gum, Isoceteth‑20, Ethoxydiglycol, Phenoxyethanol, Chlorphenesin.\n\nBenefits', 2150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Niacinamide 10%+Zinc1% 60mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Niacinamide 10%+Zinc1% 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-niacinamide-10zinc1-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(81, 'Garnier Bright Complete 30x Vitamin C+ Booster Serum (Made in India)', '1', 0, 7, 37, '81', '81', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Made in India\nReveal glowing skin in just 3 days!\nGarnier Bright Complete 30x Vitamin C+ Booster Serum is Garnier’s most concentrated brightening formula yet. Infused with 30 times more Vitamin C than their day cream, along with pure lemon extracts, this lightweight, non-oily serum penetrates deeply to reduce dark spots and boost radiance.\nFades dark spots in as little as 3 days (clinically tested)\nBrightens dull skin and enhances natural glow\nNon-oily, fast-absorbing texture\nGentle formula suitable for all skin types\nMade with natural lemon extracts and 30x Vitamin C\nCleanse your face with a gentle face wash.\nApply 3–4 drops of serum to face and neck.\nGently tap and spread evenly.\nUse twice daily for best results.\nFollow with a moisturizer and sunscreen during the day.\nNet Volume: 15 ml\nSkin Type: All skin types\nManufactured in: India\nAchieve visibly brighter and smoother skin—naturally. Garnier Vitamin C+ Booster Serum is your everyday solution for a clear, radiant look.', 620.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Bright Complete 30x Vitamin C+ Booster Serum (Made in India)Price in BD', 'Garnier Bright Complete 30x Vitamin C+ Booster Serum (Made in India) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-bright-complete-30x-vitamin-c-booster-serum-made-in-india', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(82, 'Minimalist Alpha Arbutin 02% Face Serum for Reduces Pigmentation & Spots for All Skin Types 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 32, '82', '82', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reduces Dark Spots, Marks & Evens Skin Tone:\nAn anti-pigmentation daily serum with high purity Alpha Arbutin along with Butylresorcinol for dramatically reducing dark spots and blemishes for brighter, even-looking skin.\n\n\nHow to Use:\nApply after cleansing & toning. Apply 2-3 drops. With gentle circular motion, spread it all over your face. Use sunscreen during the day for best results.\nWhen to use: AM & PM. Everyday', 1299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 241.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist Alpha Arbutin 02% Face Serum for Reduces Pigmentation & Spots for All Skin Types 30mlPrice in BD', 'Minimalist Alpha Arbutin 02% Face Serum for Reduces Pigmentation & Spots for All Skin Types 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-alpha-arbutin-02-face-serum-for-reduces-pigmentation-spots-for-all-skin-types-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(83, 'The Ordinary AHA 30% + BHA 2% Peeling Solution 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 25, '83', '83', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AHA 30% + BHA 2% Peeling Solution exfoliates multiple layers of the skin for a brighter, more even appearance. With the help of alpha-hydroxy acids (AHA), beta-hydroxy acids (BHA), and a studied Tasmanian pepperberry derivative, which reduces irritation that can be associated with acid use, this at-home peel helps even skin texture, clear pore congestion, and improve uneven pigmentation. The formula is further supported with a crosspolymer form of hyaluronic acid for comfort, pro-vitamin B5 for hydration, and black carrot for added protection.Note: This formula contains an extremely high concentration of free acids. We recommend use only if you are an experienced user of acid exfoliation and your skin is not sensitive.The pH of this formula is approximately 3.6. Glycolic Acid, the primary AHA used in the formula, has a pKa of 3.6 and pKa is the most important aspect to consider in formulating with acids. pKa implies acid availability. When pKa is close to pH, there is an ideal balance between salt and acidity, maximizing the effectiveness of the acid and reducing skin discomfort.\nWhat it is: An exfoliating solution to help fight visible blemishes and improve the look of skin texture and radiance.Skin Type: Normal, Combination, and OilySkincare Concerns: Dullness, Uneven Texture, and Acne/BlemishesFormulation: LiquidHighlighted Ingredients:- Glycolic Acid: Exfoliates the outer layers of skin.- Lactic Acid: Exfoliates the outer layers of skin.- Salicylic Acid: Exfoliates inside the pores to reduce congestion.Ingredient Callouts: Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.What Else You Need to Know: This 10-minute exfoliating facial uses a combined 30 percent AHA (alpha hydroxy acid) and two percent BHA (beta hydroxy acid) to diminish the look of blemishes. It smooths the look of skin texture for a more radiant look.\nIngredients:\n-Glycolic Acid: Exfoliates the outer layers of skin.-Lactic Acid: Exfoliates the outer layers of skin.-Salicylic Acid: Exfoliates inside the pores to reduce congestion.Glycolic Acid, Aqua (Water), Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water, Sodium Hydroxide, Daucus Carota Sativa Extract, Propanediol, Cocamidopropyl Dimethylamine, Salicylic Acid, Potassium Citrate, Lactic Acid, Tartaric Acid, Citric Acid, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Tasmannia Lanceolata Fruit/Leaf Extract, Glycerin, Pentylene Glycol, Xanthan gum, Polysorbate 20, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Ethylhexylglycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol.\nHow to use:\nSuggested Usage:-Apply to a clean, dry face.-Leave on for 10 minutes, then rinse with lukewarm water.-Use ideally in the PM, no more frequently than twice per week.Precautions:-Do not use on wet skin.-Do not leave on for longer than 10 minutes.-If persistent irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician.\nDirections:\nDo not use withCopper PeptidesDirect AcidsDirect Vitamin CEUKNiacinamide PowderPeptidesRetinoids\nMade in CanadaDetails:\n\n', 1950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary AHA 30% + BHA 2% Peeling Solution 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary AHA 30% + BHA 2% Peeling Solution 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-aha-30-bha-2-peeling-solution-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(84, 'Beauty of Joseon Revive Eye Serum: Ginseng + Retinal 10ml', '1', 0, 13, 34, '84', '84', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Improve wrinkles around the sensitive eye area with this nourishing eye serum. It’s formulated with retinol liposome to enhance skin elasticity and ginseng root extract to boost hydration. Non-sticky formula glides on smoothly and is absorbed quickly into skin.\nBenefits:\nInfused with 10% Ginseng Root Extract and 2% Retinal Liposome to improves wrinkles over sensitive eye area .Rich Saponins in Ginseng delivers rich moisture deep into skin and keeps skin fully hydrated all day long.Vitamin A in Retinal promotes rapid absorption of active ingredients for excellent elasticity care.Nourishing texture gives smooth application and leaves a non-sticky silky finish.\nHow to use:\nDispense a proper amount onto finger, apply and gently tap around the eye area for further absorption.\nIngredient:\nWater, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Pentaerythrityl Tetraethylhexanoate, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol Dicaprylate/Dicaprate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Sorbitan Olivate, Cetearyl Olivate, Butylene Glycol, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Tromethamine, Carbomer, Glyceryl Stearate, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Adenosine, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Extract, Dextrin, Cholesterol, Polyglyceryl-10 Oleate, Disodum EDTA, Retinal, Brassica Campestris (Rapeseed) Sterols, Phytosteryl/Behenyl/Octyldodecyl Lauroyl Glutamate, Silica, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopherol, Aluminum/Magnesium Hydroxide Stearate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-t-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Ceramide NP, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5', 499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 371.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty of Joseon Revive Eye Serum: Ginseng + Retinal 10mlPrice in BD', 'Beauty of Joseon Revive Eye Serum: Ginseng + Retinal 10ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-of-joseon-revive-eye-serum-ginseng-retinal-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(85, 'Farm Stay Collagen & Hyaluronic Acid All in One Ampoule', '1', 0, 7, 38, '85', '85', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nBenefits:\nImprove the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles with this ampoule.• Formulated with marine collagen• Helps skin attract moisture• Brightens skin• Improves skin elasticity\n\n\n\n\n\n8.46 fl oz. of generous amount provides abundant hydration for all needed areas such as your face, neck, and body. It also has Vitamin Scrubs which pops as appllied, to nourish the skin.\nMarine Collagen extracted from fish scale has the most similar structure to that of human skin, allowing it to be absorbed deep in the skin effectively. This ampoule consists of 2500mg of Marine Collagen to firm your skin to be elastic.\nHyaluronic Acid known for its instant hydration and improvement in reducing fine wrinkles, also soothes redness and irritation caused on the skin.', 1461.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 389.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Farm Stay Collagen & Hyaluronic Acid All in One AmpoulePrice in BD', 'Farm Stay Collagen & Hyaluronic Acid All in One Ampoule Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'farm-stay-collagen-hyaluronic-acid-all-in-one-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(86, 'Laikou Switzerland Niacinamide serum', '1', 0, 9, 8, '86', '86', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Switzerland Nicotinamide Serum is Moisturizing, Shrinking Pores, Firming Skin Anti-Drying Face Serum Whitening Face Cream Anti-Aging. After facial cleansing, apply a few drops of the serum on the palm, spread evenly on the the face, neck and massage until absorption.\nFeatures:\nHow to use: After facial cleansing, apply a few drops of the serum on the palm, spread evenly on the the face, neck and massage until absorption.', 167.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 183.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Switzerland Niacinamide serumPrice in BD', 'Laikou Switzerland Niacinamide serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-switzerland-niacinamide-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(87, 'Cos De BAHA VA Serum with Vitamin C 15% and Ascorbic Acid', '1', 0, 7, 36, '87', '87', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vitamin C is touted as one of the best anti-aging ingredients on the market — and the key to maintaining a smooth, even, and glowy complexion. Vitamin C has an excellent safety profile. Most people can use topical vitamin C for an extended period of time without experiencing any adverse reactions.\nProduct Features:\nIt is an effective treatment for the following issues:\nVitamin C Ascorbic can cause side effects, including:\nIf you experience any of these side effects, stop using Vitamin C and see a doctor.To prevent these symptoms, please use only a small amount after the patch test.\nCountry of Origin: Korea\nSpecification:\n\n', 1175.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 425.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA VA Serum with Vitamin C 15% and Ascorbic AcidPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA VA Serum with Vitamin C 15% and Ascorbic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-va-serum-with-vitamin-c-15-and-ascorbic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(88, 'Melao B3 5% Niacinamide Serum', '1', 0, 12, 30, '88', '88', NULL, NULL, NULL, '100% natural skin care anti-aging repairs skin reduces wrinkles niacinamide serum moisturizer vitamin b3 serum revitalize your skin! Niacinamide, also known as vitamin b3, offers your complexion an incredible range of benefits. To maximize results, we paired it with other powerful ingredients your skin will love. Along with aloe, it improves elasticity by nourishing barrier function and restoring youthful vibrancy!\nKey Features:\n1. Melao niacinamide serum2. Vitamin b3 5%3. Improves skin’s elasticity4. Revives skin tone and texture5. Helps erase discoloration6. Country origin: made in china\nIngredients:\nWater, glycerol, propylene glycol, butylene glycol, allantoin, diazolidinyl urea, methylparaben, sodium hyaluronate, disodium edta, niacinamide, mentha arvensis extract, pelargonium graveolens flower/leaf/stem extract, portulaca oleracea flower/leaf/stem extract, chrysanthellum indicum extract, aloe yohjyu matsu ekisu, 3-o-ethyl ascorbic acid.\nCautions:\nDiscontinue use if redness or irritation occurs. Do not ingest. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep away from children\nDirections:\n1. Ensure skin is clean and dry2. Apply toner and let dry3. Apply the serum on the face and dab around the eye area. Let dry4. Set with your favorite moisturizer\n\n\nMade in PRC', 414.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 136.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao B3 5% Niacinamide SerumPrice in BD', 'Melao B3 5% Niacinamide Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-b3-5-niacinamide-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(89, 'Cos De BAHA AN Serum with Arbutin Niacinamide', '1', 0, 7, 36, '89', '89', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MEDICAL RESEARCH HAS PROVEN that arbutin is very effective in treating pigmentations, age spots and it can also inhibit the negative effects of UV-radiation thanks to its sun protection properties.Arbutin evens out skin tone and is also effective in treating acne scars.\nArbutin can also be combined with other skincare ingredients to maximize its efficacy, for example, with an alpha-hydroxy acid (AHA) to exfoliate skin and facilitate its absorption of arbutin. When paired with Vitamin C, arbutin imparts even skin tone with improved radiance.\nGenerally - After cleansing and toning your face. Apply 1~2 drops of serum at night and day. Do not wash or wipe after applying the serum. After applying this serum, we recommend using a skin moisturizer. Massage a small amount of cleanser to wet skin, avoiding eye area.\nSensitive - Is your skin sensitive? Please mix with other Pure Serum. If your skin has fully adapted to the ingredients, you can expect faster results with only the product in question. Or use our 5% niacinamide toner first.\nexpiration date display\nThe expiration date is displayed on a sticker or on the bottom of the product.\nEXP. year. month. day.\nIngredients:\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Propanediol, Arbutin, Niacinamide, Glycerine, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Allantoin,*Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, *Momordica Charantia Fruit Extract,*Sambucus Nigra Flower Extract,*Leontopodium Alpinum Extract\nCountry of Origin: Korea', 1099.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 351.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA AN Serum with Arbutin NiacinamidePrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA AN Serum with Arbutin Niacinamide Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-an-serum-with-arbutin-niacinamide', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(90, 'The Derma Co 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum for Active Acne', '1', 0, 6, 33, '90', '90', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Type: For all skin types\nAnyone with oily and acne-prone skin, blackheads, whiteheads, acne marks, and open pores\n1. Apply on your face and neck in the morning and evening after cleansing and before moisturizin\n2. Always follow it up with a broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day to avoid sun damage\nThe Derma Co. take skincare seriously. To us, solving problems remains the primary goal. We want to ensure each one of you that our products are dermatologist-approved and highly effective.\nMade in India\nSteps for Patch Testing\nIngredients:\nAqua, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Extract, Salicylic Acid, Ethoxydiglycol, Glycerin, Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Extract, Citric Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Metabisulfite, Sodium Hydroxide & Disodium EDTA.\n', 990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum for Active AcnePrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum for Active Acne Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-2-salicylic-acid-face-serum-for-active-acne', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(91, 'Skin\'O Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 15, '91', '91', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin’O Acne + Spot Treatment SerumBenefitsskin&#39;O Acne + Spot Treatment Serum delivers multiple benefits for visibly clearer and smoother skin.Formulated to effectively reduce acne and fade stubborn spots, it unveils a smoother skin texture.Additionally, the serum regulates oil production, promoting a healthy, naturally radiant glow. Experiencethe transformative effects of reduced blemishes and fine lines, revealing visibly smoother and morerejuvenated skin.How to useUse a small amount of serum on your face both in the morning and at night before applying any thickercreams. Gently pat it into your skin to enhance absorption.IngredientsAqua, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Niacinamide, Carboner, Glycerine, Hyaluronic Acid, Salicylic Acid,Propylene Glycol, phenoxyethanol', 393.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 97.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin\'O Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Skin\'O Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-acne-spot-treatment-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(92, 'Laikou France 24k Gold snail serum', '1', 0, 12, 8, '92', '92', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Introducing 24K Gold Snail Serum Essence!\nUnlock the secrets to radiant and youthful skin with our extraordinary 24K Gold Snail Serum. Crafted with precision and care, this serum is a luxurious blend of potent ingredients, carefully selected to bring out the best in your skin.\n? Rediscover Your Glow ?Experience the magic of 24K gold combined with the powerful benefits of snail secretion filtrate. This winning combination brings you the ultimate solution to your skincare concerns. Our serum works wonders in reducing rough pores, banishing dullness, and revitalizing dry and sagging skin. Embrace a radiant complexion that exudes youthfulness and confidence.\n? Deep Moisturization, Lasting Rejuvenation ?Indulge your skin with the purest form of nourishment. Enriched with hyaluronic acid, our serum deeply moisturizes every layer of your skin, leaving it plump, supple, and incredibly hydrated. With each use, it rejuvenates your skin from within, revealing a natural and vibrant glow.\n? The Power of Nature ?We believe in the power of nature to nurture your skin. Our serum incorporates ginseng radix et rhizoma rubra extract, renowned for its exceptional skin-enhancing properties. Experience the touch of nature as it works harmoniously with the other ingredients, revealing a revitalized and youthful you.\n? Suitable for All Skin Types ?Embrace the versatility of LAIKOU France 24K Gold Snail Serum Essence. Whether you have dry, oily, or sensitive skin, our serum is your answer to achieving a complexion that feels and looks flawless. Trust in our carefully curated formula, suitable for all skin types.\n?️ Timeless Beauty, Timeless Shelf Life ?️We believe in offering products that stand the test of time. With a shelf life of 3 years, you can embrace your skincare routine with confidence, knowing that our serum is here to accompany you on your journey to timeless beauty.\n? Caution: Your Skin Deserves the Best ?We care about your safety. Before using the product, we recommend testing it behind your ear if you have sensitive skin. Experience the magic of LAIKOU France 24K Gold Snail Serum Essence with peace of mind.\nUnlock the golden secrets to radiant skin. Order your LAIKOU 24K Gold Snail Serum Essence now and embrace a complexion that’s as precious as gold. Say hello to timeless beauty.', 280.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 71.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou France 24k Gold snail serumPrice in BD', 'Laikou France 24k Gold snail serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-france-24k-gold-snail-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(93, 'Gluta-C Facial Night Serum', '1', 0, 7, 39, '93', '93', NULL, NULL, NULL, '“Using Gluta-C’s whitening facial serum has made me regain my confidence!” “After spending years trying to erase the dark spots on my skin using various products, I finally found the holy grail that saved my complexion. Now, I am no longer shy to take selfies and share them on my newsfeed.”\nMichelle Santos\n\n5/5\nIf you are looking for a whitening facial night serum that will help you get rid of dark spots and intensely whiten your skin, look no further than Gluta-C’s Intense Whitening Facial Night Serum. This product is a hydrating, water-based serum that contains Glutathione and Vitamin C, two powerful antioxidants, and Arbutin.\nUsing this product regularly after a long day will help you enjoy various benefits. One of the most important advantages that you can enjoy once you start using Gluta-C’s Intense Whitening Facial Night Serum is a reduction in dark spots caused by aging and sun damage. This night serum for the face is also effective in preventing new spots from forming and protecting your skin from photo-aging.\n“After spending years trying to erase the dark spots on my skin using various products, I finally found the holy grail that saved my complexion. Now, I am no longer shy to take selfies and share them on my newsfeed.”\nPatricia San Miguel\n\n5/5\nHere at Gluta-C, we aim to provide you with a complexion that is beautiful and healthy inside and out. We accomplish this through our high-quality products, including our whitening facial night serum for the face. This hydrating, water-based serum can provide you with a healthier, smoother, and fairer complexion by:\nReversing the damage done by pollution, aging and the sun\nReducing the appearance of dark spots, fine lines and wrinkles\nPreventing new dark spots from forming\nProtecting your skin against photoaging\nMinimizing your pores\nKeeping your skin hydrated\nMaking your skin softer, plumper and brighter\nApplying an overnight serum for your face regularly can help you achieve the radiant and youthful glow that you have always wanted. Serums often contain a high concentration of ingredients that can whiten your skin or repair the damage caused by aging.\nOnce you start using the Gluta-C Intense Whitening Facial Night Serum, you will be able to enjoy both benefits without buying additional, expensive serums. You also do not have to worry about wasting any drop because this product is a hydrating, water-based serum that will easily be absorbed by your skin as you sleep.\nGluta-C Intense Whitening Facial Night Serum is infused with Glutathione and Vitamin C. These two powerful antioxidants can provide you with a brighter-looking and fairer complexion while also keeping your skin healthy.\nOne of the greatest benefits our whitening facial night serum provides is its anti-aging properties. This overnight serum for the face contains Vitamin B9 and Alpha-Lipoic Acid, which work together to promote collagen production in your skin. These components also help minimize your pores and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nThis product is also infused with Vitamins A and E together with sunflower, soybean, grapeseed, and olive natural oils that combine to provide you with the glass skin you want to achieve. They accomplish this by making your skin softer, plumper, and brighter.\nFor only 230 pesos, you can enjoy all the whitening and anti-aging benefits that the Gluta-C Intense Whitening Facial Night Serum offers. Make the switch today and start your journey to having a bright and youthful complexion.\nAchieving a brighter, more radiant skin tone has never been easier with Gluta-C’s Intense Whitening Facial Night Serum. This product does not only help you get rid of the dark spots that ruin your complexion, but it also makes your skin healthier, providing you with a glow that comes from the inside. So, what are you waiting for? Grab one now today and see how it improves your skin tone firsthand.\nShop Now', 1803.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 77.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gluta-C Facial Night SerumPrice in BD', 'Gluta-C Facial Night Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gluta-c-facial-night-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(94, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Serum', '1', 0, 11, 8, '94', '94', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Sakura Serum is suitable for all skin types. This Sakura Serum has potent bioactive compounds with beneficial effects on the skin, including anti-glycation, stimulation of fibroblast collagen production, moisturizing, whitening and other beautifying and anti-aging benefits.\nCherry blossoms are known as Sakura flowers in Japan and are considered a highly revered cultural symbol that reflects beauty.\nSakura extract reinforces moisturisation at its optimal level and provides necessary comfort. It preserves the essence of youth and acts as a shield against pollution and external aggressions. “Anti-glycation” is an important approach in preventing aging while promoting healthy, youthful skin.\nThe serum contains multiple plant essences for your skin care:', 172.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 178.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura SerumPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(95, 'The Derma Co 10% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 33, '95', '95', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MINIMIZES OPEN PORES:The combination of 5% Niacinamide and 10% Vitamin C accelerates cell regeneration and boosts collagen, thereby helping the skin to shed dead cell build-up from the surface and allowing new and healthy skin layers to take their place. This skin regeneration process also pushes out debris clogged inside pores, ensuring no room for any bacterial infection like acne while also making them less visible and more normal-sized. You and your skin can now confidently go #FilterFree\n\n1. Apply 3-5 drops of serum on the entire face and neck (twice a day) in an upward circular motion 2. Massage gently until the serum gets absorbed 3. During the day, follow it up with a broad-spectrum sunscreen\n\nPurified water, Propanediol, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Niacinamide, Diethylene Glycol Monoethyl Ether, Sodium Hyaluronate, HydroxyethylCellulose, Ferulic Acid, Sodium Gluconate, Ethylhexylglycerin,Phenoxyethanol\n\n\n\n\n3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid is the most potent form of Vitamin C, equipped with immense brightening effects. It helps treat pigmentation and evens the skin tone. 10% Vitamin C is highly effective in putting an end to melanin biosynthesis, neutralizing free radicals, and preventing inflammatory processes. It also provides visible anti-aging benefits, brightens skin, and helps protect against oxidative stress.\nAn active form of Vitamin B3, Niacinamide is the gold-standard ingredient that actively works towards reducing acne marks & scars. It strengthens the skin’s barrier function that helps limit damage from free radicals and thus, helps you achieve #FilterFreeSkin. In short, Niacinamide is just what your skin needs to be healthy and clear.\nA plant-based antioxidant, ferulic acid neutralizes free radicals, enhances antioxidant benefits and the stability of Vitamin C. It boosts the effects of Vitamin C & Hyaluronic Acid while protecting the overall skin integrity. It slows and ultimately stops the development of spots, wrinkles, and fine lines.\nHyaluronic Acid provides long-lasting hydration to improve the skin texture by preventing premature moisture and ceramide loss, thereby keeping skin supple & hydrated. It is an excellent skincare active that reduces the visibility of fine lines, retains moisture in the skin, and increases skin cell turnover - creating a ‘plump’ effect.\n\n\n\nSay hello to the World’s 1st Face Serum with 10% Vitamin C, 5% Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid, and Ferulic Acid all-in-one. Vitamin C is formulated to make skin glow by correcting photodamage and enhancing collagen production for improving texture- fine lines and wrinkles with its potent brightening and antioxidant effects. The addition of niacinamide helps control oil and prevents UV-induced pigmentation, while Hyaluronic Acid boosts hydration and normalizes skin pH. This 10% Vitamin C concentration is perfect for first-time users who would like to start with a smaller percentage and those who have sensitive skin. This is a super serum for addressing multiple skin issues at the same time!\nThe combination of 5% Niacinamide and 10% Vitamin C accelerates cell regeneration and boosts collagen, thereby helping the skin to shed dead cell build-up from the surface and allowing new and healthy skin layers to take their place. This skin regeneration process also pushes out debris clogged inside pores, ensuring no room for any bacterial infection like acne while also making them less visible and more normal-sized. You and your skin can now confidently go #FilterFree with real & visible results in just 3-6 weeks!\nVitamin C is the most potent form of 3-O Ethyl Ascorbic Acid and the one that’s not only safe to use but also penetrates the skin from within to lighten the skin tone, giving it a more even-toned and healthy look. Ferulic Acid in the 10% Vitamin C Face Serum boosts Vitamin C’s antioxidant effects and helps protect overall skin integrity by reducing the development of fine lines, spots, and wrinkles. With this, you know you’ve made the right choice as it\'s going to be there for your skin through thick and thin!\n\n\n\nSuitable for all skin types, this face serum is for anyone with dull, damaged, and dehydrated skin.\nFree from mineral oil, dye, parabens, and sulfates, this face serum has a safe & effective formulation that offers a visible difference in 3-8 weeks.\nAll The Derma Co. products go through strict testing to ensure they are absolutely safe for use.', 1299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 231.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 10% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 10% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-10-vitamin-c-face-serum-for-skin-radiance-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(96, 'Minimalist Vitamin C 10% Face Serum for All Skin Types 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 32, '96', '96', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For Brighter, Glowing & Healthy Looking Skin\nA glow-boosting daily serum packaged with the goodness of Vitamin C & Polyhydroxy Acid (PHA) that brightens and tones sun damaged and dull skin with dark spots.\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning your face, take 2-3 drops of Vitamin C serum on your fingertips with the dropper. Apply it on the face by gently tapping it on the skin. With a circular motion, evenly spread the serum and allow your skin to absorb it.\nWhen to use: AM & PM. Everyday.', 1499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 301.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist Vitamin C 10% Face Serum for All Skin Types 30mlPrice in BD', 'Minimalist Vitamin C 10% Face Serum for All Skin Types 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-vitamin-c-10-face-serum-for-all-skin-types-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(97, 'Garnier Vitamin C Serum Cream SPF40 45g', '1', 0, 6, 37, '97', '97', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier Vitamin C Serum Cream SPF40 is a multi-action skincare solution that combines brightening, hydration, and sun protection in one convenient product. Available in a 45g jar, this serum cream is enriched with Vitamin C, known for its powerful antioxidant and brightening properties, which helps to reduce dark spots, even skin tone, and enhance overall radiance.\nThe SPF40 provides strong protection against harmful UVA and UVB rays, preventing sun damage and further darkening of spots, making it ideal for daytime use. This cream also offers lightweight hydration, keeping skin smooth and soft without a greasy feel. With regular use, it promotes a visibly brighter, clearer, and more youthful complexion.\nPerfect for daily use, Garnier Vitamin C Serum Cream SPF40 is suitable for all skin types, especially for those seeking protection against sun exposure while achieving a radiant glow. Apply it in the morning as the last step of your skincare routine to enjoy brightened, protected, and revitalized skin throughout the day.', 480.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Vitamin C Serum Cream SPF40 45gPrice in BD', 'Garnier Vitamin C Serum Cream SPF40 45g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-vitamin-c-serum-cream-spf40-45g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(98, 'The Derma Co 2% Kojic Acid Face Serum for Dark Spots & Pigmentation 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 33, '98', '98', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kojic acid serum has become a popular choice for those seeking to address hyperpigmentation and achieve a brighter, more even skin tone. Here are the key benefits of The Derma Co 2% Kojic Acid Face Serum for Dark Spots & Pigmentation:\n\nFree from mineral oil, dye, parabens, and sulfates, this serum for pigmentation and dark spots is a safe & effective formulation that offers visible difference in 3-6 weeks.; WHO IS IT SUITABLE FOR: Suitable for all skin types, this serum is for anyone looking for a solution for dark spots, skin discoloration, sun damage and pigmentation.\n\nSkin Type: All skin types\nMade in India\n\n\n\n\nKojic Acid has anti-aging effects, lightens dark spots, treats melasma, and decreases the appearance of scars. It minimizes the recurrence of discoloration and stubborn brown patches. With continued use, it treats hyperpigmentation.\nAlpha Arbutin works wonders towards fading effects of hyperpigmentation like age spots, acne marks, and melasma. It also prevents recurrence of skin discoloration even after a sunburn, by blocking tyrosine (a non-essential amino acid that binds with tyrosinase to produce more melanin). Alpha Arbutin is also very gentle and safe for all skin types!\n\n\n\nIt’s time to treat pigmentation and make way for clear skin with 2% Kojic Acid Face Serum. Kojic Acid is derived from fermented rice & certain type of mushrooms. This protective antioxidant brightens skin & neutralizes the damage caused due to pollution, UV rays, smoke, and toxic chemical elements. The best part is that it penetrates quickly through the skin to reduce hyperpigmentation. It evens the skin tone and minimizes the recurrence of discoloration for healthy and clear skin.\nGo #FilterFree with 2% Kojic Acid Serum loaded with 1% Alpha Arbutin and that efficiently helps in fading dark spots with every application. The magic of 1% Alpha Arbutin works towards controlling the production of Melanin (a pigment that creates skin color). The lesser Melanin produced by your skin, the lesser dark spots you have, thus giving an even complexion. This advanced formulation stands as the ultimate solution for minimizing dark spots and pigmentation. It repairs past signs of damage and gives you crystal clear skin with continued use.\nThe power-packed combination of 2% Kojic Acid and 1% Alpha Arbutin work together to act quicker on absorbing well into the skin. Enriched with antioxidants from Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract - derived to fight towards free radical damage, this serum works well to keep your skin smooth, improve skin discoloration, and thus, making the skin look brighter, clearer, and healthier. Say hello! It’s your skin’s BFF.\n\n\n\nSuitable for all skin types, this face serum is for anyone with dark spots, skin discoloration, scars, and pigmentation.\nFree from mineral oil, dye, parabens, and sulfates, this serum for pigmentation has a safe & effective formulation that offers a visible difference in 3-6 weeks.\nAll The Derma Co. products go through strict testing to ensure they are absolutely safe for use.', 990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 2% Kojic Acid Face Serum for Dark Spots & Pigmentation 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 2% Kojic Acid Face Serum for Dark Spots & Pigmentation 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-2-kojic-acid-face-serum-for-dark-spots-pigmentation-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(99, 'Laikou Korea Hyaluronic Acid Serum', '1', 0, 5, 8, '99', '99', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Awaken Your Skin with Hyaluronic Acid Serum!\nDive into Deep Hydration! Our Hyaluronic Acid Serum Essence, a powerful elixir, unleashes the ultimate moisturizing magic on your skin. Say goodbye to dryness, dullness, and signs of aging with this transformational formula. ? It expertly penetrates your skin barriers, strengthening the skin base, and repairing damages. Embrace the beauty of rejuvenation!\nThe Beauty of Natural Ingredients: Crafted with love, our serum combines the power of Hyaluronic Acid and Tremella Fuciformis Extract, delivering a soothing and nourishing experience.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Designed for everyone, regardless of skin type, this little bottle holds the key to radiant, supple, and youthful skin.\nHyaluronic acid serum contains high purity repair essence.It has best moisturizing ability, penetrate into your skin barriers,strengthen skin base and gently nourish,repair damaged skin,deal with dry,dull,aging and other problems,to moisture and rejuvenate the skin.', 240.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Korea Hyaluronic Acid SerumPrice in BD', 'Laikou Korea Hyaluronic Acid Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-korea-hyaluronic-acid-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(100, 'Sebonia Serum 20ml', '1', 0, 9, 40, '100', '100', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\n\"Directions For Use: Apply 3-4 drops of the Sebonia Serum on clean and dry face Massage gently in a circular motion till the serum gets absorbed into the skin For best results, use twice daily in the morning and at night. During the day, follow up with sunscreen \"\n\nSebonia Serum is an all-rounder serum that helps to fade away blemishes, refine pores and give an even skin tone.It is formulated with clinically proven and patented ingredients like Niacinamide and Zinc.Maintains the skin barrier and gives protection from indoor-outdoor pollution and UV damage', 1035.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1035.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sebonia Serum 20mlPrice in BD', 'Sebonia Serum 20ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sebonia-serum-20ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(101, 'Minimalist Vitamin C + E + Ferulic 16% Face Serum', '1', 0, 7, 32, '101', '101', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Minimalist Vitamin C + E + Ferulic 16% Face Serum:\nThis vitamin C, E, and ferulic acid serum with 16% concentration is a professional-grade daily serum for brightening and improving your skin health. Stabilised with ethyl ascorbic acid (EAA) and two potent antioxidants (vitamin E & ferulic acid), this formula delivers 15% EAA and 1% antioxidant blend, providing 86% pure vitamin C content. The addition of Fullerenes (C60), a powerful new generation antioxidant, provides long-lasting and stable anti-oxidative benefits that are several times more potent than vitamin C. This potent combination not only brightens the skin, but also reduces redness and skin damage for overall skin health.\nBrightens & protects skin:\nA skin-brightening daily serum with stable Vitamin C at 15% and antioxidants (Vitamin E & Ferulic Acid) at 1% combined.\n\nWhat Makes It Potent?\nMade with stabilized Vitamin C derivative \"Ethyl Ascorbic Acid\" (EAA) that has 86% pure Vitamin C content. This serum delivers EAA in high concentration of 15%1% blend of 2 potent antioxidants - Vitamin E & Ferulic Acid. Together they not only stabilize the formula, but also improve efficacy of Vitamin CContains Fullerenes (C60), a new generation antioxidant (the scientists who discovered Fullerenes were awarded Nobel Prize). It is several times more potent than Vitamin C and has strong, long lasting and stable anti-oxidative activityThe combination of actives not only brighten the skin, but also scavenge free radicals to reduce redness, skin damage and make skin healthy overall\nIdeal For:\nSkin type: All skin types\nConcerns: Spots, Uneven Tone & Dull Skin\nSuitable for: 18+ years of age\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning your face, take 2-3 drops of Vitamin C serum on your fingertips with the dropper. Apply it on the face by gently tapping it on the skin. With a circular motion, evenly spread the serum and allow your skin to absorb it.\nWhen to use: AM & PM Everyday\n\n\n', 1299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '20ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 371.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist Vitamin C + E + Ferulic 16% Face SerumPrice in BD', 'Minimalist Vitamin C + E + Ferulic 16% Face Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-vitamin-c-e-ferulic-16-face-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
