(103, 'APLB Tranexamic Acid 34.8% Niacinamide Ampoule Serum', '1', 0, 6, 4, '103', '103', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The APLB Tranexamic Acid 34.8% Niacinamide Ampoule Serum is a highly effective serum formulated to target hyperpigmentation, uneven skin tone, and dullness while improving skin texture and overall health. It’s an excellent choice for those seeking brighter, clearer, and more even-toned skin.\nTranexamic Acid (34.8%):\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3):\nHyaluronic Acid:\nCentella Asiatica Extract:\nThe serum features a lightweight, non-sticky texture that absorbs quickly into the skin, making it suitable for all skin types, including oily and sensitive skin.\nAPLB is known for its high-quality formulations, blending cutting-edge science with skin-loving ingredients to create solutions that deliver visible results while being gentle on the skin.\nThis serum offers a powerful combination of Tranexamic Acid and Niacinamide to address stubborn pigmentation, uneven skin tone, and dullness while providing hydration and soothing benefits. It’s a versatile and effective addition to any skincare routine aiming for brighter, healthier skin.\nMade in Korea', 850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '40ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 650.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Tranexamic Acid 34.8% Niacinamide Ampoule SerumPrice in BD', 'APLB Tranexamic Acid 34.8% Niacinamide Ampoule Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-tranexamic-acid-348-niacinamide-ampoule-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
