(106, 'The Ordinary Salicylic Acid 2% Solution for Blemish Prone Skin 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 25, '106', '106', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Ordinary is an evolving collection of treatments offering familiar, effective clinical technologies positioned to raise pricing and communication integrity in skincare. The brand was created to celebrate integrity in its most humble and true form. Its offering is pioneering, not in the familiar technologies it uses, but in its honesty and integrity. The Ordinary is born to disallow commodity to be disguised as ingenuity. The Ordinary is \"\"Clinical formulations with integrity\".\nA gentler solution for blemish-prone skin and uneven texture. gentler solution for blemish-prone skin and uneven texture.The Ordinary Salicylic Acid 2% Anhydrous Solution is a water-free product formulated to effectively decongest the skin. and impart a superficial exfoliating effect. This will result in a visible reduction of apparent pore size and textural irregularities. with improved skin tone homogeneity and clarity over time.\n', 1680.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 770.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Salicylic Acid 2% Solution for Blemish Prone Skin 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Salicylic Acid 2% Solution for Blemish Prone Skin 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-salicylic-acid-2-solution-for-blemish-prone-skin-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(107, 'Himalaya Dark Spot Clearing Turmeric Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 10, '107', '107', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Visibly reduces dark spots in just seven days. Using the Ayurvedic Svarasa cold-pressed extraction method, Himalaya Dark Spot Clearing Turmeric Face Serum is packed with potent Turmeric extract. The serum also contains Niacinamide and Glycolic acid, making it an effective blend of ancient wisdom and modern science.\nIngredients:\nTurmeric, Licorice, Niacinamide\nAdditional information\n- Non-staining.- Free from mineral oil, Parabens, Phthalates, and Silicones.- Free from SLS/SLES.- Dermatologically tested.- For external use only.- Store in a cool and dry place, away from direct heat and sunlight.Directions for Use:- Apply 3 to 5 drops of Himalaya Dark Spot Clearing Turmeric Face Serum and massage gently until the serum gets absorbed. Use once daily at night on a cleansed face.- For best results, use along with the Himalaya Dark Spot Clearing Turmeric range of products.Recommended Daily Skincare Regimen:1. Cleanse with Dark Spot Clearing Turmeric Facewash2. Nourish with Dark Spot Clearing turmeric Face Serum3. Moisturizer with dark Spot Clearing Turmeric Face CreamCaution: New users are recommended to apply the product to small areas during the first three days. If no discomfort occurs, apply on cleansed face at night. Slight burning, irritation is common with products containing glycolic acid (AHA). If dryness or peeling of skin occurs, reduce the application to every other day. Use only as directed, and avoid contact with eyes. If irritation persists, discontinue use and consult your physician. It is recommended that prior to exposure to the sun, users cover areas where AHAs have been applied with sunscreen. Contact of the product with the skin must be of limited frequency or duration.\nMade in India', 350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Himalaya Dark Spot Clearing Turmeric Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Himalaya Dark Spot Clearing Turmeric Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'himalaya-dark-spot-clearing-turmeric-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(108, 'Simple 10% Vitamin B3 Niacinamide Booster Serum for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 14, 24, '108', '108', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Features:\nThe strengthening kind! Niacinamide is a powerhouse skin care ingredient that frees your skin from signs of damage, strengthens your skin barrier and protects even sensitive skin from future threats.\nShake, drop and dab your way to stronger, healthier-looking skin. 10% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) and B5 deeply hydrates and softens even dry skin, making it smoother and more even-looking.\nA multi-action sensitive skin care hero. Along with moisturizing dry skin and regulating sebum, this booster protects from dryness, improves elasticity and texture and reduces pore size and wrinkles.\nA non-greasy, non-sticky serum emulsion = amazing skin care for even sensitive skin! It contains 88% naturally derived ingredients to deeply hydrate, protect and calm redness and irritation.\nOur kind to skin promise. This product is PETA vegan approved and contains no harsh chemicals, no alcohol, no mineral oils, no artificial colour or perfume – The best skincare for sensitive skin.\nContains superpowered ingredients, kind to even sensitive skin. This serum can do it all, from improving skin texture and elasticity to strengthening your skin barrier and relieving dry skin.\nCountry of Origin: Hungary', 801.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 199.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple 10% Vitamin B3 Niacinamide Booster Serum for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Simple 10% Vitamin B3 Niacinamide Booster Serum for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-10-vitamin-b3-niacinamide-booster-serum-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(109, 'LAIKOU Australia Tea Tree Anti Acne Serum 17ml', '1', 0, 6, 8, '109', '109', NULL, NULL, NULL, '• Reduces acne, blackheads & whiteheads• Replenishes moisture deeply and oil control• Restores skin’s natural moisture• Rich in Australian tea tree active ingredients• It can effectively      remove acne and pimples, shrink pores and repair the damaged rough skin.• It can soothe acne skin, redness and repair the damaged skin\n• Reduces acne, blackheads & whiteheads\n• Replenishes moisture deeply and oil control\n• Restores skin’s natural moisture\n• Rich in Australian tea tree active ingredients\n• It can effectively remove acne and pimples, shrink pores and repair the damaged rough skin.\n• It can soothe acne skin, redness and repair the damaged skin\n\n\n1. Before using it on the face, take 2~3 days to test oil on inner arm or behind the ear using a cotton swap.2. If there is no irregular symptom, use small amount on the face.\nAs the final skincare step, soak cotton swab with oil and apply it on the problematic spot.* Notice | Apply this oil on trouble spots and it may give cool and sharp sensation to the skin. Do not apply all over the face unlike other moisture-purpose oil.\n1. Maximize soothing care if mixed slightly with other Cream.2. Mix with mist or foundation to better control oil on the skin.\n', 154.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 196.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Australia Tea Tree Anti Acne Serum 17mlPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU Australia Tea Tree Anti Acne Serum 17ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-australia-tea-tree-anti-acne-serum-17ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(110, 'The Ordinary Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 30ml', '1', 0, 5, 25, '110', '110', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nSearching for \"hyaluronic acid serum the ordinary\" or \"the ordinary hyaluronic acid serum\" in Bangladesh? The Ordinary\'s Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 serum is a popular choice for its powerful hydrating and plumping properties. Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 is a water-based formula combining low-, medium- and high-molecular-weight hyaluronic acid molecules and a next-generation HA crosspolymer to support hydration to multiple layers of your skin. It also targets the appearance of wrinkles and textural irregularities. Plus, it uses pro-vitamin B5 to enhance hydration at the outer layers, resulting in smoother, plumper skin.\n\nHyaluronic Acid is found in the skin naturally but its natural function within the skin is not hydration. Many products have used HA to claim hydration benefits, but HA is too large of a molecule to penetrate the skin and instead sits on the surface and can draw moisture out of the skin making the surface feel soft and hydrated temporarily, while making you feel like you need more HA after the product is rinsed. This formula uses three forms of HA with varying molecular weights, as well as an HA crosspolymer, to offer multi-depth hydration and visible plumping without drawing water out of the skin solely to improve temporary surface hydration.\n\n\nThis innovative formula combines different-sized hyaluronic acid (HA) molecules to deliver hydration to various layers of your skin.  Unlike some HA products, this addresses concerns about hyaluronic acid on skin by ensuring deeper delivery that lasts. The molecular size of HA determines its depth of delivery in the skin. This formulation combines low-, medium- and high-molecular weight HA, as well as a next-generation HA crosspolymer at a combined concentration of 2% for multi-depth hydration in a water-based formula. This system is supported with the addition of Vitamin B5 which also enhances surface hydration.\n\n\nHyaluronic acid (HA) is naturally found in your skin, but some misconceptions surround its effectiveness. While traditional HA can attract moisture, it may not penetrate deeply enough. The Ordinary\'s advanced formula with multi-sized HA molecules ensures deeper delivery for lasting hydration, without the risk of drawing moisture out.\n\n\n\n\nPatch testing prior to use is advised. Keep out of reach of children.\n\n\nAqua (Water), Sodium Hyaluronate, Pentylene Glycol, Propanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Panthenol, Ahnfeltia Concinna Extract, Glycerin, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Citric Acid, Isoceteth-20, Ethoxydiglycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hexylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol.\n\n\nAll Skin Types\n\nA hydrator that smooths and plumps with hyaluronic acid.  Upgrade your skincare routine with The Ordinary\'s Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 serum! This powerful hydrator targets dryness and offers a range of benefits you\'ll love, making it a perfect choice for anyone searching for \"hyaluronic acid serum the ordinary\" or \"the ordinary hyaluronic acid serum\" in Bangladesh.\n', 1800.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-hyaluronic-acid-2-b5-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
(111, 'The Derma Co Pore Minimizing Face Serum with 4% Niacinamide, 5% PHA and p-REFINYL', '1', 0, 11, 33, '111', '111', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Power over pores! Minimize open pores, Control excess oil and unclog pores effortlessly with the Pore Minimizing Face Serum. Formulated with 4% Niacinamide and p-REFINYL®, this fragrance-free serum reduces the appearance of dilated pores and stimulates collagen synthesis. That’s not all! Packed with a gentle exfoliant - 5% PHA, the Pore Minimizing Face Serum accelerates cellular turnover and prevents slackening of pores when used regularly. Still thinking? Kickstart your journey to radiant skin with this pore-fectionist by your side! Dermatologically tested, the Derma Pore Minimizing Face Serum is safe for all skin types including sensitive skin.Benefits:\nKey Ingredients:\nUsage Direction:\nSuitable for: Oily Skin with Open & Clogged Pores? This Face Serum is just for you! Yay! The Pore Minimizing Face Serum is all skin-friendlyCountry of Origin: India', 1020.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 380.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co Pore Minimizing Face Serum with 4% Niacinamide, 5% PHA and p-REFINYLPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co Pore Minimizing Face Serum with 4% Niacinamide, 5% PHA and p-REFINYL Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-pore-minimizing-face-serum-with-4-niacinamide-5-pha-and-p-refinyl', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
