(117, 'Cos De BAHA AC Azelaic Acid Hinokitiol Clear Skin Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 36, '117', '117', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cos De Baha Acne Treatment Serum Azelaic acid 5%, Niacinamide 10%, Salicylic Acid, Retinol, Tea Tree – anti-acne serum, the effectiveness of the serum is due to the action of a balanced complex of powerful anti-inflammatory components. The serum has a strong tea tree fragrance. pH of the agent: 6.0 ~ 6.3. Recommended for problematic, combination, oily skin.\nMain active ingredients:\n– Niacinamide (10%) is a regenerating component that acts on the skin in several directions simultaneously. Visibly tightens enlarged pores, evens skin tone, smoothes wrinkles and visibly improves the condition of the upper layer of the skin. Use a broad-spectrum sunscreen with an SPF of 30 or higher during the day.\n– Azelaic acid (5%) is a pharmaceutical ingredient used to treat acne. Azelaic acid has been shown to inhibit the growth of bacteria that play a key role in the development of acne. After a few weeks of regular use of azelaic acid products, the number of bacteria on the skin is significantly reduced. The component is effective for long-term use and is not addictive.\n– Salicylic acid (1%) – has a disinfectant and anti-inflammatory effect, destroying bacteria that cause inflammation within the comedone, suppresses the production of sebum secretion and sebaceous glands, reducing skin oiliness, softens and exfoliates the horny layer of the skin, softens and dissolves plugs in the follicles.\n– Hinokithiol is a natural monoterpenoid with a pronounced antimicrobial effect.\n– Tea tree oil is a bactericidal, fungicidal, anti-inflammatory and healing agent.\n– Retinol – accelerates cell regeneration processes in the epidermis, gives a lifting effect, increases the elasticity and firmness of tissues, combats dryness and flaking, has a slight brightening effect.\nBenefits:\n– deep moisturizing\n– anti-inflammatory and disinfectant effect\n– antioxidant effect\n– cell regeneration\n– healing and restoration\n– elasticity and firmness\n– brightening and whitening\n– treatment\nHow to use:\nIn your evening routine, apply to pre-moisturized skin with toner using patting or massaging motions. Wait 10-15 minutes, then apply cream.\nIt is recommended to test 48 hours before use.', 1149.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 531.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA AC Azelaic Acid Hinokitiol Clear Skin Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA AC Azelaic Acid Hinokitiol Clear Skin Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-ac-azelaic-acid-hinokitiol-clear-skin-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
