(121, 'Iunik Tea Tree Relief Serum', '1', 0, 6, 17, '121', '121', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Added niacinamide and adenosine help improve the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines, while a patented formula containing 6,000ppm of nutrient-dense sprouts (pak choi, broccoli, sprout wheat, clover, white radish and cabbage) delivers vital nutrients, minerals and enzymes to protect the skin from external stressors.\nGreat for sensitive, acne-prone or oily skin. Cruelty-free. Vegan. No artificial scents or dyes.\nAfter applying your toner, use one drop of iUNIK Tea Tree Relief Serum and spread all over the face. Pat lightly to aid absorption.\nIngredients:   Niacinamide, Tea Tree Extract 67%, 6 Patented Fresh Buds - Sprout Vegetables, Centella Asiatica Extract 19.5%, Beta GlucanNiacinamide, Tea Tree Extract 67%, 6 Patented Fresh Buds - Sprout Vegetables, Centella Asiatica Extract 19.5%, Beta Glucan\nMade in Korea', 1375.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 425.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Iunik Tea Tree Relief SerumPrice in BD', 'Iunik Tea Tree Relief Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'iunik-tea-tree-relief-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:00', '2026-02-11 06:22:00'),
