(124, 'Buy 1 Dermamate Face Serum with Salicylic Acid 30ml Get 1 Dermamate Acne Face Wash 100ml Free', '1', 0, 6, 22, '124', '124', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Achieve clear, glowing skin with this limited-time deal: Buy 1 Dermamate Face Serum with Salicylic Acid (30ml) and receive a Dermamate Acne Face Wash (100ml) for free!\nDermamate Face Serum is a powerful acne treatment serum that helps to treat active acne, acne breakouts, minimize pores, clear blemishes, reduce redness, and improve the overall appearance of acne-prone skin. It contains a blend of effective ingredients including Salicylic acid, Azadirachta indica Extract, Camellia Sinensis extract and Mentha piperita extract which control oil productions along with helps the skin look more radiant and youthful.\nBenefits:\nIngradients:\nAqua, Salicylic acid, Glycyrrhiza glabra Extract, Azadirachta indica Extract, Cucumis sativus Extract, Propylene glycol, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Camellia Sinensis extract, Mentha piperita Extract, Calendula Officinalis extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Glycerine, Panthanol, Disodium EDTA, Hydrogenated Xanthan Gum, Hydrogenated Lecithin & Sclerotium Gum, Phenoxyethanol, and Ethylhexylglycerin.\nHow To Use:\nCautions:\nStorage Conditions:\nDermamate Acne Face Wash enriched with salicylic acid that helps to eliminate the acne breakout and prevent future breakouts. It leaves skin feeling residue-free with a reduction of excessive sebum production. This face wash helps to control excess oil and acne-causing bacteria and leaves skin feeling fresh and clean.\n\nMade in Bangladesh', 877.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 273.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Buy 1 Dermamate Face Serum with Salicylic Acid 30ml Get 1 Dermamate Acne Face Wash 100ml FreePrice in BD', 'Buy 1 Dermamate Face Serum with Salicylic Acid 30ml Get 1 Dermamate Acne Face Wash 100ml Free Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'buy-1-dermamate-face-serum-with-salicylic-acid-30ml-get-1-dermamate-acne-face-wash-100ml-free', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(125, 'The Derma Plus 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum for Oily & Acne Prone Skin 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 52, '125', '125', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Derma Plus 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum is a nightly, oil‑control and acne‑fighting treatment formulated specifically for oily and acne‑prone skin.\n2% salicylic acid (BHA) penetrates into pores, dissolves excess oil and debris, and helps clear blackheads, whiteheads, and active pimples.\nZinc PCA and tea tree leaf oil (0.5%) help reduce acne‑causing bacteria, control sebum, and calm inflamed breakouts.\nNiacinamide, sodium hyaluronate (hyaluronic), glycerin, panthenol (vitamin B5), and allantoin soothe, hydrate, and improve overall skin texture while minimizing irritation from the acid.\nFights acne‑causing bacteria and helps shrink active pimples.\nUnclogs and tightens the look of pores, preventing future breakouts.\nControls excess oil production and shine.\nReduces redness and post‑acne blemishes over time.\nSmooths rough, bumpy texture without heavy, greasy feel.\nFragrance‑free, essential‑oil‑free, and non‑comedogenic, so it is less likely to clog pores.\nCleanse (and optionally tone) your face in the evening.\nApply 2–3 drops to dry skin, avoiding eye and lip areas.\nGently massage until absorbed, then follow with a light, non‑comedogenic moisturizer.\nDo not layer in the same routine with other strong exfoliants (AHAs, scrubs, retinoids for beginners).\nIn the morning, always use a broad‑spectrum sunscreen, as exfoliating acids can make skin more sensitive to the sun.\nBest suited for oily, combination, and acne‑prone skin; dry or very sensitive skin should start slowly (2–3 nights per week).\nDo a patch test first (behind ear or along jawline) for 24 hours before applying to full face.\nIf you notice excessive dryness, peeling, or burning, reduce frequency or stop use and switch to a barrier‑repair moisturizer for a few days.', 675.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.0