(127, 'COSPROF Anti-Acne Serum 30ml – Niacinamide 5% + Salicylic Acid 1% for Acne-Prone Oily Skin', '1', 0, 6, 23, '127', '127', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COSPROF Anti-Acne Serum একটি উচ্চ কার্যকরী সিরাম, যা তৈলাক্ত ও ব্রণ-প্রবণ ত্বকের জন্য বিশেষভাবে তৈরি। এতে থাকা Niacinamide 5% এবং Salicylic Acid 1% ত্বকের অতিরিক্ত তেল নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে, ব্রণ কমায় এবং নতুন ব্রণ হওয়ার প্রবণতা হ্রাস করে। পাশাপাশি এটি স্কিনকে রাখে ময়েশ্চারাইজড, সফট ও উজ্জ্বল, ব্ল্যাকহেড ও হোয়াইটহেড দূর করতে সহায়তা করে।\nসিরামটি প্রাকৃতিক এক্সট্র্যাক্টস যেমন Pomegranate, Aloe Vera, Licorice, Green Tea, Tea Tree এবং Chamomile এর সমন্বয়ে তৈরি, যা স্কিনকে শান্ত ও হেলদি রাখে।\nব্রণ দ্রুত শুকাতে ও কমাতে সহায়ক\nভবিষ্যতে ব্রণ হওয়ার প্রবণতা হ্রাস করে\nব্রণের দাগ হালকা করে স্কিনকে ব্রাইট ও হেলদি রাখে\nঅতিরিক্ত তেল নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে এবং ব্ল্যাকহেড/হোয়াইটহেড দূর করে\nস্কিনকে ময়েশ্চারাইজ ও সফট রাখে\nত্বককে প্রাকৃতিক উজ্জ্বলতা প্রদান করে\nSuitable for Oily & Acne-Prone Skin\nNo Harmful Chemicals\nMade in Bangladesh\nAqua (DM Water), Gluconate, Green Tea Extracts, Glycerin, Niacinamide 5%, Salicylic Acid 1%, Hyaluronic Acid Solution, Pomegranate Extract, Aloe Vera Extract, Licorice Extract, Tea Tree Extract, Chamomile Extract, Polyquaternium-7, Euxyl 510, Lavender Essential Oil, Fragrance\nপ্রথমে মুখ পরিষ্কার করুন ফেস ওয়াশ ব্যবহার করে\nপাঁচ মিনিট পর ২–৩ ফোঁটা সিরাম নিন\nমুখে সমানভাবে ম্যাসাজ করুন\nদিনে একবার বা প্রয়োজনে দুইবার ব্যবহার করুন\nনিয়মিত ব্যবহারে সর্বোত্তম ফলাফল পাওয়া যায়\nPack Size: 30 ml\nSkin Type: Oily & Acne-Prone\npH: 4–5\nCertification: Imported & Selective Ingredients with FDA & ISO Certified\nCountry of Origin: Bangladesh\nশিশুদের নাগালের বাইরে রাখুন\nসরাসরি সূর্যালোক ও অতিরিক্ত তাপ থেকে দূরে রাখুন\nশুধুমাত্র বাহ্যিক ব্যবহারের জন্য\nচোখে লাগলে সঙ্গে সঙ্গে পর্যাপ্ত পানি দিয়ে ধুয়ে ফেলুন', 396.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 54.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSPROF Anti-Acne Serum 30ml – Niacinamide 5% + Salicylic Acid 1% for Acne-Prone Oily SkinPrice in BD', 'COSPROF Anti-Acne Serum 30ml – Niacinamide 5% + Salicylic Acid 1% for Acne-Prone Oily Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosprof-anti-acne-serum-30ml-niacinamide-5-salicylic-acid-1-for-acne-prone-oily-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(128, 'Laxzin Salicylic Acid 02% with Niacinamide Face Serum', '1', 0, 6, 54, '128', '128', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laxzin Salicylic Acid 2% + Niacinamide Face Serum (30ml)\nTransform your skincare routine with the Laxzin Salicylic Acid 2% + Niacinamide Face Serum. This powerful yet gentle formula is designed to target acne, improve skin texture, and enhance overall skin clarity while being suitable for all skin types.\nAcne Treatment:\nImproves Skin Texture:\nGentle Exfoliation:\nSay goodbye to blemishes and hello to a smoother, more radiant complexion with Laxzin Salicylic Acid 2% + Niacinamide Face Serum.', 660.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laxzin Salicylic Acid 02% with Niacinamide Face SerumPrice in BD', 'Laxzin Salicylic Acid 02% with Niacinamide Face Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laxzin-salicylic-acid-02-with-niacinamide-face-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(129, 'Dr. Rashel Vitamin C Brightening & Anti-Aging Face Serum with Hyaluronic Acid', '1', 0, 6, 55, '129', '129', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Features:\n\nBenefits:  It\'s light and highly effective. It will help fade sun spots & discoloration, refine skin texture, reduce wrinkle formation, and minimize existing wrinkles. It also has a high concentrated base of pure vegan hyaluronic acid to plump skin cells and protect and restore. Contains collagen ingredient brightens and smooths skin for a more radiant and youthful complexion Powerful antioxidants neutralize free radicals to prevent and reverse sun damage and fade sun spots and discoloration.\n\nDirections : Apply a small amount of eye treatment with fingertip along the orbital bone and under eye area. Pat gently without pulling the skin', 480.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 170.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr. Rashel Vitamin C Brightening & Anti-Aging Face Serum with Hyaluronic AcidPrice in BD', 'Dr. Rashel Vitamin C Brightening & Anti-Aging Face Serum with Hyaluronic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-rashel-vitamin-c-brightening-anti-aging-face-serum-with-hyaluronic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(130, 'NEOGEN Dermalogy A-Clear Soothing Pink Eraser 15ml', '1', 0, 6, 56, '130', '130', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NEOGEN Dermalogy A-Clear Soothing Pink Eraser is a dual-phase acne treatment formulated to target blemishes overnight. With a blend of calming and purifying ingredients, this product is ideal for acne-prone and sensitive skin. Its compact 15ml size makes it perfect for both daily skincare routines and emergency spot care on the go.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage InstructionsDo not shake the bottle. Dip a clean cotton swab into the pink sediment at the bottom and apply directly to blemishes. Leave on overnight and rinse off in the morning. Use once daily as needed. Avoid applying to broken skin or using near the eyes.\n\nKey ingredients:\n\nMade In Korea', 1363.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 387.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'NEOGEN Dermalogy A-Clear Soothing Pink Eraser 15mlPrice in BD', 'NEOGEN Dermalogy A-Clear Soothing Pink Eraser 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neogen-dermalogy-a-clear-soothing-pink-eraser-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(131, 'SKYA Accutane Anti-Acne Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 57, '131', '131', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tagline: Targeted Correction for Stubborn Acne. Clinical Strength, Skin-Loving Care.\nA potent, clarifying serum designed to target acne at its root. This concentrated formula works to unclog pores, reduce redness, and minimize the appearance of existing blemishes while preventing new ones from forming. Achieve a smoother, more even complexion with this advanced daily treatment.\nUnveil a Clearer Complexion with Precision Power\nIntroducing the SKYA Accutane Anti-Acne Serum – a high-performance, targeted treatment engineered for those who demand serious results in their fight against acne. This isn\'t just a surface-level solution; it\'s a deeply penetrating serum that works within the pores to disrupt the acne cycle, from prevention to restoration.\nInspired by dermatological efficacy, this potent 30ml formula combines multi-action agents to exfoliate, calm, and refine. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing texture delivers active ingredients directly to the source of breakouts without over-drying, making it the perfect core treatment for a resilient, clear complexion.\nKey Benefits & Features:\n🎯 Multi-Action Formula: Features a powerful blend of Salicylic Acid (BHA) to dive deep into pores and dissolve oil, dirt, and dead skin cells, preventing them from becoming acne.\n🔥 Reduces Redness & Inflammation: Infused with soothing agents like Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) to calm irritated skin, reduce the appearance of redness, and minimize the swelling of active pimples.\n✨ Fights Acne-Causing Bacteria: Creates an environment that helps eliminate the bacteria responsible for breakouts, promoting a cleaner, healthier-looking complexion.\n📉 Regulates Sebum Production: Helps balance oil production, reducing shine and minimizing the likelihood of future pore clogging throughout the day.\n🧼 Non-Comedogenic & Lightweight: Specifically formulated to not clog pores. Its silky, water-based serum texture absorbs quickly with no sticky residue, layering perfectly under moisturizer and sunscreen.\n❤️ Skin Barrier Support: Enriched with ingredients to help support the skin\'s natural barrier, mitigating potential dryness associated with acne treatments.\nWho Is It For?\nThe SKYA Accutane Serum is ideal for:\nThose with oily, combination, and acne-prone skin.\nAnyone struggling with persistent blackheads, whiteheads, and inflammatory acne (papules and pustules).\nIndividuals looking to add a targeted, treatment-grade product to their skincare routine.\nNote: While effective for many, those with highly sensitive skin should patch test first.\nHow To Use:\nCleanse: Start with a clean, dry face. Use the SKYA Accutane Anti-Acne Bar for a synergistic cleansing effect.\nApply: Dispense a small amount (2-3 drops) of serum onto your fingertips.\nTarget: Gently smooth and press the serum onto affected areas or your entire T-zone. Avoid the immediate eye area.\nLayer: Allow the serum to fully absorb for 60 seconds.\nFollow Up: Always apply a fragrance-free moisturizer to hydrate and sunscreen (SPF 30+) in the morning to protect your skin, as acne treatments can increase sun sensitivity.\nFrequency: Begin by using every other day, gradually increasing to once or twice daily as your skin tolerates.', 1605.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 85.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKYA Accutane Anti-Acne Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'SKYA Accutane Anti-Acne Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skya-accutane-anti-acne-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(132, 'Derma Acne Lucid Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 49, '132', '132', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Derma Acne Lucid Serum (30ml)\nDerma Acne Lucid Serum is a targeted skincare solution formulated to combat acne, reduce inflammation, and promote clearer, healthier-looking skin. This 30ml serum is enriched with active ingredients like salicylic acid, tea tree oil, and niacinamide, known for their acne-fighting and anti-inflammatory properties. The lightweight, fast-absorbing formula penetrates deep into the pores to help control excess oil production, reduce redness, and prevent future breakouts without drying out the skin. Gentle and suitable for sensitive, acne-prone skin, this serum is free from parabens, sulfates, and artificial fragrances, making it an ideal choice for daily use to support a balanced, blemish-free complexion.', 2000.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Derma Acne Lucid Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Derma Acne Lucid Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'derma-acne-lucid-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
