(134, 'Sam Acne Aid Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 59, '134', '134', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sam Acne Aid Serum is a targeted treatment solution specially formulated for oily and acne-prone skin. Meticulously created with a synergistic blend of Benzoic Acid, Salicylic Acid, and Niacinamide, this advanced serum works at multiple levels to combat acne, control excess oil, and improve overall skin clarity.\nDesigned to address the root causes of breakouts, Sam Acne Aid Serum helps eliminate acne-causing bacteria, unclog pores, and reduce inflammation while supporting the skin’s natural barrier. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing formula penetrates deeply into the skin without leaving a greasy residue, making it ideal for daily use.\nIn addition to acne-fighting actives, the serum is enriched with skin-soothing and antioxidant ingredients such as Aloe Vera Extract, Neem Extract, Tea Extract, Vitamin E, and Ferulic Acid, which help calm irritation, reduce redness, and protect the skin from environmental stressors. With consistent use, skin appears clearer, smoother, and more balanced, with reduced blemishes and minimized pores.\nSam Acne Aid Serum is suitable for individuals struggling with frequent breakouts, excess oil, clogged pores, and post-acne marks, helping restore confidence through visibly healthier skin.\nSuitable for oily and acne-prone skin.\nHelps combat acne and reduce blemishes\nControls excess oil and minimizes shine\nUnclogs pores and prevents future breakouts\nReduces redness, inflammation, and irritation\nLightweight, non-greasy, fast-absorbing formula\nPromotes a clearer, smoother, and more even-toned complexion\nBenzoic Acid\nActs as an antibacterial agent to fight acne-causing bacteria\nHelps reduce redness and inflammation\nRegulates excess oil to prevent future breakouts\nSalicylic Acid\nPenetrates deep into pores to dissolve excess oil and dead skin cells\nExfoliates gently to improve skin texture\nHelps reduce acne scars and blemishes\nNiacinamide\nMinimizes the appearance of pores\nRegulates oil production and reduces shine\nStrengthens the skin barrier and soothes irritated skin\nAqua, Benzoic Acid, Salicylic Acid, Niacinamide, Propylene Glycol, Vitamin E, Ferulic Acid, Collagen, Phenoxyethanol, Glycerin, Neem Extract, Aloe Vera Extract, Tea Extract.\nCleanse your face thoroughly and pat dry.\nApply 2–3 drops of Sam Acne Aid Serum to the face.\nGently massage into the skin using upward, circular motions, focusing on acne-prone areas.\nFollow with a moisturizer if desired.\nFor best results, use twice daily—morning and evening.\nFor external use only. Perform a patch test before first use. Avoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water. Keep out of reach of children. If irritation or rash develops, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.', 1199.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1199.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sam Acne Aid Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Sam Acne Aid Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sam-acne-aid-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01');
