(135, 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Serum Gel 45gm', '1', 0, 6, 37, '135', '135', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Serum Gel is a lightweight, hydrating serum designed to brighten and refresh the skin. Available in a 45g jar, this serum gel is enriched with Vitamin C, a powerful antioxidant that helps to fade dark spots, even out skin tone, and enhance natural radiance. The gel formula absorbs quickly, delivering intense hydration without leaving a greasy residue, making it perfect for all skin types, especially oily and combination skin.\nInfused with the brightening benefits of Vitamin C, this serum gel works to improve dullness, reduce pigmentation, and give the skin a fresh, glowing appearance. Its unique gel texture provides a cool, soothing effect, making it ideal for daily use in both morning and evening routines.\nFor best results, apply Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Serum Gel to cleansed skin and follow with moisturizer or sunscreen during the day. Regular use will help achieve a brighter, clearer, and more revitalized complexion.', 418.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 22.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Serum Gel 45gmPrice in BD', 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Serum Gel 45gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-bright-complete-vitamin-c-serum-gel-45gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(136, 'The Dermalix Salicylic Acid 2% + Niacinamide 2% Acne Treatment Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 60, '136', '136', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Dermalix Salicylic Acid 2% + Niacinamide 2% Acne Treatment Serum is a multitasking formulation that treats acne, unclogs pores, and prevents skin damage. The combination of 2% Salicylic Acid with 2% Niacinamide exfoliates the pores walls to prevent the appearance of whiteheads and blackheads. With no more sebum in the pores, it eventually stops the formation of acne. When your pimples say hi, give them the best farewell with this super acne treatment serum! Bring on the best of the filter-free YOU with your spotless, unique & youthful skin. Barcode 8801030802235\nAfter cleansing and toning your face, apply a few drops of Dermalix Acne Treatment Serum evenly across your face and neck. Gently massage it into the skin until fully absorbed. Start by using it once daily at night, and if well tolerated, you may increase usage to twice daily (morning and evening). Always follow with a moisturizer to help maintain skin hydration and, if using during the day, apply sunscreen for optimal protection.\nFor External use only. Avoid contact with the eyes. Do not use it on wounded skin. Discontinue use if signs of irritation or rash occur. Keep out of reach of children. In case of accidental ingestion, seek medical help.', 585.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 305.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Dermalix Salicylic Acid 2% + Niacinamide 2% Acne Treatment Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Dermalix Salicylic Acid 2% + Niacinamide 2% Acne Treatment Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-dermalix-salicylic-acid-2-niacinamide-2-acne-treatment-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
