(138, 'La Roche Posay Pure Niacinamide 10 Serum', '1', 0, 6, 62, '138', '138', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This anti-aging niacinamide serum clarifies skin discoloration and rebalances the look of uneven skin tone with visible results starting in one week. This formula, with 10% Niacinamide, visibly reduces discoloration, post-acne marks (also called post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation), and even stubborn dark spots to reveal a brighter, more even complexion.​ Skin Concern:\nBenefits:\nSkin Type:All skin types. Country of Origin: France.', 3630.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche Posay Pure Niacinamide 10 SerumPrice in BD', 'La Roche Posay Pure Niacinamide 10 Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-pure-niacinamide-10-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(139, 'Melao 4% Nicotinamide Serum', '1', 0, 6, 30, '139', '139', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Melao 4% Nicotinamide Serum is a skin-brightening and pore-refining solution formulated to address multiple skin concerns. Enriched with 4% nicotinamide (niacinamide), this serum works to minimize the appearance of pores, reduce dark spots, and enhance overall skin texture. It is gentle enough for daily use and suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nReveal a brighter, smoother, and healthier complexion with the Melao 4% Nicotinamide Serum—an essential step in your skincare routine for radiant and balanced skin.', 348.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 202.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao 4% Nicotinamide SerumPrice in BD', 'Melao 4% Nicotinamide Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-4-nicotinamide-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(140, 'Cetaphil Acne Gentle Clear Repairing Post-Acne Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 63, '140', '140', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This serum is specifically designed as a follow-up treatment for skin experiencing or recovering from acne. Its primary focus is not on actively stopping new pimples (though it helps), but on repairing the visible marks and discoloration left behind (post-acne hyperpigmentation) and strengthening the skin barrier that is often compromised by both acne and harsh acne treatments.\nTargets Post-Acne Marks: The core purpose is to visibly reduce the appearance of dark spots, red marks, and discoloration resulting from past acne breakouts.\nStrengthens the Skin Barrier: Formulated with Ceramides and Hydrating Glycerin, it helps restore the skin\'s natural protective barrier. This is crucial for acne-prone skin, which is often sensitized by treatments like benzoyl peroxide or salicylic acid.\nPrevents Clogged Pores: It is non-comedogenic (won\'t clog pores) and oil-free, making it safe for acne-prone skin.\nGentle Formula: Like all Cetaphil products, it is:\nFragrance-Free\nHypoallergenic\nNon-Irritating\nImproves Skin Texture: By promoting healthy cell turnover and providing hydration, it helps smooth the skin\'s texture over time.\nPurpose: To repair the look of post-acne marks and support skin barrier recovery.\nIdeal User: Someone with active acne (using other treatments) or, more commonly, someone with fading acne marks and a compromised, sensitive skin barrier.\nApplication Steps:\nClean: Start with a clean, dry face. Use a gentle cleanser like one from the Cetaphil Gentle Clear range.\nLayer: Apply a small amount (typically 2-3 drops for the entire face) after cleansing and toning, but before your moisturizer and sunscreen.\nTarget: Gently smooth and press the serum onto the entire face, paying extra attention to areas with post-acne marks.\nFollow Up: Always follow with a moisturizer to lock in hydration and, crucially, apply a broad-spectrum sunscreen every morning. Sun exposure can darken post-acne marks, making them harder to fade.\nFrequency: Can be used both morning and night. If you have very sensitive skin, you may want to start with nightly application to see how your skin responds.\nThis serum uses a blend of effective and gentle ingredients:\n2% Licorice Root Extract: The star ingredient for brightening. It is a natural, gentle compound that helps inhibit the enzyme responsible for producing melanin (pigment), which causes dark spots. It also has anti-inflammatory properties to soothe redness from past breakouts.\n0.5% Salicylic Acid: A beta-hydroxy acid (BHA) that exfoliates inside the pore. At this low concentration, it works to gently exfoliate the skin\'s surface, prevent pore clogging, and improve skin texture without being overly drying or irritating.\nGlycerin: A powerful humectant that draws moisture into the skin, providing essential hydration to repair the barrier and keep the skin plump and healthy.\nCeramide Precursor: Cetaphil uses Hydroxypropyl Bislactam Dimethicone, a ingredient that helps the skin produce its own ceramides. Ceramides are the essential \"glue\" that holds skin cells together, reinforcing the skin\'s barrier to prevent moisture loss and protect against irritants.\nFor External Use Only: Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nSun Sensitivity: Salicylic Acid can increase sun sensitivity. It is absolutely essential to use a daily broad-spectrum sunscreen (SPF 30 or higher) while using this product and for a week after discontinuing use.\nPatch Test Recommended: Always perform a patch test on a small area of your skin (like the jawline or inner arm) for a few days before applying it to your entire face to check for any adverse reaction.\nPotential Initial Tingling: A slight, temporary tingling sensation upon application can be normal, especially when first starting, due to the salicylic acid. However, if you experience significant stinging, redness, or irritation, discontinue use.\nConsult a Dermatologist: If you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or under a dermatologist\'s care for a severe skin condition, consult your doctor before using this product.\nIndividuals with acne-prone skin struggling with red or brown post-acne marks.\nAnyone with a compromised skin barrier due to previous acne treatments.\nThose looking for a gentle, hydrating alternative to harsh brightening serums containing high-strength acids or vitamin C.', 3450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 250.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Acne Gentle Clear Repairing Post-Acne Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Acne Gentle Clear Repairing Post-Acne Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-acne-gentle-clear-repairing-post-acne-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
