(144, 'Claree Acne Control & Acne Scar Removal Serum – With Niacinamide & Salicylic Acid, 30 ml', '1', 0, 6, 67, '144', '144', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Claree Acne Control & Acne Scar Removal Serum is a targeted skincare solution designed to help reduce acne, pimples, blackheads, and visible acne scars while improving overall skin texture. The advanced formula combines exfoliating acids, soothing botanical extracts, and skin-balancing actives to promote clearer, healthier-looking skin.\nFormulated with 10% Gluconolactone (PHA), this serum gently removes dead skin cells while being mild on sensitive and acne-prone skin. Salicylic Acid and Capryloyl Salicylic Acid help unclog pores, control excess oil, and reduce breakouts, while Niacinamide supports skin barrier repair, evens skin tone, and minimizes the appearance of marks and scars. Zinc PCA and Tea Tree Oil provide oil-control and antibacterial benefits, helping prevent future acne.\nKey Benefits:\nHelps control acne, pimples, and blackheads\nSupports reduction of acne scars and marks\nGently exfoliates to remove dead skin cells\nBalances oil production and refines pores\nImproves overall skin clarity and texture\nSuitable for all skin types\nHow to Use:Apply an even layer of the serum over clean, dry face. Use daily, morning and night, for effective skin conditioning.\nIngredients:Water, Gluconolactone, Methylpropanediol, Propanediol, Glycerin, Sodium Hydroxide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Butylene Glycol, Erythritol, Salicylic Acid, Xylitol, Diphenyl Dimethicone, Disodium EDTA, Xanthan Gum, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sorbitan Isostearate, t-Butyl Alcohol, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Kummerowia Striata Extract, Cinchona Pubescens Bark Extract, Leptospermum Scoparium Leaf Extract, Capryloyl Salicylic Acid, Zinc PCA, Tocopherol.\nCaution:\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nDo not apply on open wounds or broken skin\nKeep out of reach of children\nAvoid direct exposure to sunlight during use', 1786.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 94.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Claree Acne Control & Acne Scar Removal Serum – With Niacinamide & Salicylic Acid, 30 mlPrice in BD', 'Claree Acne Control & Acne Scar Removal Serum – With Niacinamide & Salicylic Acid, 30 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'claree-acne-control-acne-scar-removal-serum-with-niacinamide-salicylic-acid-30-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(145, 'Caplino Niacinamide 10% Serum Reduces Acne, Refines Pores & Boost Skin Elaticity', '1', 0, 6, 68, '145', '145', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Effects:Caplino Niacinamide Serum, Niacinamide reduces inflammation, which relieves the redness associated with inflammatory skin disorders such as eczema, acne, pores, and others. With nano clear and transparent package technology, the brightening ingredients can be released to the bottom of the skin. It is not only gentle and easy to absorb but also can give full play to the high efficiency of the nutrients.Just like the natural brightening reduces the look of pores & reinforces elasticity naturally.\n\n\nCaplino Niacinamide Serum Key Benefits:\n\n\nSafety and Quality:\nWe prioritize the quality and safety of your skin, ensuring our serum is formulated with natural ingredients and free from harmful additives.\n\n\nIngredients:Aqua, niacinamide 5%, butylene glycol, trehalose, corn gluten amino acids, beta-glucan, morus alba root extract, codium tomentosum extract, portulaca oleracea extract, laminaria saccharina extract, zinc pca, sodium hyaluronate, hydrogenated lecithin, xanthan gum, allantoxin, disodium edta, phenoxyethanol, ethylhexylglycerin.\n\n\nHow to use Caplino Niacinamide Serum:After cleansing your face take 3-5 drops in the palm of your hand and apply it to your hand and apply it to your face with your fingertips. Massage gently until absorption.We recommend applying the serum twice a day and night.\n\nStorage: keep it a cool and dry place, out of direct sunlight\n\nCautions: for sensitive skin, it is recommended to conduct an allergy test on the back of the ear before using the product.\n\n\nSpecifications: 1fl.Oz / 30ml\nFormulated by Italy\nMade in P.R.C', 630.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 320.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Caplino Niacinamide 10% Serum Reduces Acne, Refines Pores & Boost Skin ElaticityPrice in BD', 'Caplino Niacinamide 10% Serum Reduces Acne, Refines Pores & Boost Skin Elaticity Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'caplino-niacinamide-10-serum-reduces-acne-refines-pores-boost-skin-elaticity', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
