(149, 'Acne Seed Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 71, '149', '149', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Advanced Skin Solution for Acne, Pimples & Rosacea\nAcne Seed Serum is a gentle yet powerful solution formulated to combat acne, reduce pimples, and relieve rosacea-related irritation. Enriched with Tea Tree Oil, Tranexamic Acid, Zinc PCA, and other proven actives, this lightweight serum targets blemishes at the source, soothes inflamed skin, and supports faster healing.\nWith natural Salicylic Acid, Niacinamide, and calming botanicals like Chamomile and Aloe Vera Extract, it helps control excess oil, reduce redness, and restore clarity—leaving your skin feeling fresh, smooth, and balanced.\nReduces acne breakouts, pimples & blemishes\nSoothes redness, inflammation & rosacea symptoms\nRegulates sebum production to prevent clogged pores\nPromotes skin healing and barrier repair\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, and non-comedogenic\nTea Tree Oil – Natural antibacterial to fight acne-causing bacteria\nTranexamic Acid – Calms inflammation and reduces pigmentation\nZinc PCA – Controls oil and soothes irritated skin\nSalicylic Acid (from natural sources) – Gently exfoliates and unclogs pores\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3) – Reduces redness and strengthens the skin barrier\nChamomile Extract – Anti-inflammatory and calming\nHyaluronic Acid – Hydrates without clogging pores\nAloe Vera Extract – Soothes and cools sensitive skin\nCleanse your face thoroughly. Apply 2–3 drops of serum to the face and neck. Gently massage in a circular motion until fully absorbed. Use twice daily for best results.', 1575.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 175.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Acne Seed Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Acne Seed Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acne-seed-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(150, 'The Derma Co 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum for Active Acne', '1', 0, 6, 33, '150', '150', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Country of Origin India\nAqua, Salicylic Acid, Ethoxydiglycol, Glycerin, Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Extract, Citric Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Fragrance, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Metabisulfite, Sodium Hydroxide, Disodium EDTA\nApply on your face and neck in the morning and evening after cleansing and before moisturizing. Always follow it up with a broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day to avoid sun damage\n', 599.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 81.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum for Active AcnePrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 2% Salicylic Acid Face Serum for Active Acne Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-2-salicylic-acid-face-serum-for-active-acne', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(151, 'White Seed Whitening Serum – 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 71, '151', '151', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Radiant Skin Starts Here\nUnveil your skin’s natural glow with the White Seed Whitening Serum, a luxurious blend of advanced brightening and hydrating ingredients. Enriched with White Seed Extract, Vitamin C, and Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), this lightweight serum targets dullness, dark spots, and uneven skin tone while enhancing skin texture and elasticity.\nFormulated with skin-loving actives like L-Glutathione, Hyaluronic Acid, and botanical extracts such as Aloe Vera, Green Tea, and Seed Extracts, it delivers deep hydration and antioxidant protection for visibly healthier, smoother, and brighter skin.\nBrightens skin tone naturally\nReduces dark spots, pigmentation & uneven skin tone\nImproves skin elasticity & smoothness\nProvides intense hydration and a radiant glow\nLightweight, non-greasy, and fast-absorbing formula\nWhite Seed Extract – Helps brighten and even out complexion\nL-Glutathione & Vitamin C – Powerful antioxidants that reduce pigmentation\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3) – Improves skin texture and tone\nHyaluronic Acid – Deeply hydrates and plumps skin\nAloe Vera, Green Tea & Seed Extracts – Soothe, nourish, and protect\nCleanse your face thoroughly and pat dry.\nApply 2–3 drops of the serum to your face and neck.\nGently massage in upward circular motions until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, morning and evening, for best results.\nFollow with a moisturizer and sunscreen during the day.', 1662.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 88.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'White Seed Whitening Serum – 30mlPrice in BD', 'White Seed Whitening Serum – 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'white-seed-whitening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(152, 'Lumi Clear Glow Acne Control Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 72, '152', '152', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lumi Clear Glow Acne Control Serum 30mlA targeted acne-control serum formulated with natural antibacterial and anti-inflammatory plant extracts. Lumi Clear Glow helps reduce active acne, calm irritation, and support clearer, healthier-looking skin with consistent use.\n\nKey Features• Concentrated formula designed for direct spot application• Packed with natural essential oils and botanical extracts• Helps reduce acne-causing bacteria• Supports faster healing of active breakouts• Helps soothe redness and irritation\n\nBenefits• Targets acne at the source: Tea Tree Oil, Thymus Extract, and Cinnamaldehyde work together to fight acne-causing bacteria and reduce breakouts.• Reduces inflammation: Botanical root extracts help calm swelling and redness, promoting smoother skin.• Promotes skin recovery: Nourishing plant oils support healing and prevent further irritation.• Controls excess oil: Helps balance the skin and minimize new acne formation.\n\nUsageApply the serum directly to acne-affected areas using the dropper. You may also apply with fingertips. Leave it on for at least 3 hours or longer. Recommended to use twice daily—morning and evening.\n\nIngredientsCinnamaldehyde, Thymus Extract Oil, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Rosmarinus Extract, Syzygium Aromaticum Extract, Gentiana Scabra Root Extract, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Syzygium Aromaticum, Ricinus Communis.\nCountry of OriginBangladesh', 975.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 325.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lumi Clear Glow Acne Control Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Lumi Clear Glow Acne Control Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lumi-clear-glow-acne-control-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
