(154, 'Cos De BAHA S2 Salicylic Acid BHA 2% Liquid', '1', 0, 6, 36, '154', '154', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cos De BAHA S2 Salicylic Acid BHA 2% Liquid is a gentle yet effective exfoliating toner formulated to treat acne, blackheads, and clogged pores while improving skin texture. It is ideal for oily, combination, and sensitive skin types.\nKey Ingredients:\nBetaine Salicylate (4%): A gentler alternative to salicylic acid that offers effective exfoliation with less irritation. Helps unclog pores and reduce breakouts.\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): Brightens the complexion, helps fade dark spots, and supports the skin barrier.\nAloe Vera Extract: Soothes and hydrates the skin, reducing redness and inflammation.\nGreen Tea, Lavender, and Rose Extracts: Provide antioxidant protection and calming benefits.\n1,2-Hexanediol and Propanediol: Help retain moisture and improve product absorption.\nBenefits:\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells and promotes a clearer complexion.\nHelps control excess sebum and reduce the occurrence of acne and blackheads.\nMinimizes the appearance of enlarged pores.\nCalms irritated skin and supports overall skin health.\nFree From: Parabens, sulfates, artificial colorants, and synthetic fragrances.Made in Korea', 1290.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 610.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA S2 Salicylic Acid BHA 2% LiquidPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA S2 Salicylic Acid BHA 2% Liquid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-s2-salicylic-acid-bha-2-liquid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(155, 'Claris Men Intense Purifying Face Wash 100gm', '1', 0, 6, 61, '155', '155', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brand: Clariss\nType: Face Wash\nSize: 100 ml\nGender: Men\nOrigin: Thailand\nIntense Whitening: Aims to brighten the skin tone.\nNano Boosting Beads: Enhance cleansing and exfoliation.\nOil Defense: Helps control excess oil production.\nDeep Cleansing: Removes dirt and impurities effectively.\nMinimizes Clogged Pores: Reduces the risk of acne and blackheads\nThe face wash contains:\nWater\nLauryl Glucoside\nMinerals\nTetra Sodium EDTA\nAcrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Cross Polymer\nSodium Laureth Sulfate\nCocamidopropyl Betaine\nDisodium Cocamphodiacetate\nGlycerin\nMethylchloroisothiazolinone\nMethylisothiazolinone\nTriethanolamine\nCitric Acid\nFragrance (Parfum)\nColorants\n', 559.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 21.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Claris Men Intense Purifying Face Wash 100gmPrice in BD', 'Claris Men Intense Purifying Face Wash 100gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'claris-men-intense-purifying-face-wash-100gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(156, 'Earth Beauty & You Cica Care Barrier Repair Acne Treatment Serum – Anti-Acne, Hydrating & Skin Brightening (30ml)', '1', 0, 6, 73, '156', '156', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Say goodbye to breakouts and hello to clear, radiant skin with Earth Beauty & You Cica Care Barrier Repair Acne Treatment Serum — a lightweight, fast-absorbing serum specially formulated for acne-prone and sensitive skin.\nPowered by Centella Asiatica (Cica), this serum soothes irritation, reduces redness, and supports skin healing. The exfoliating power of Salicylic Acid helps unclog pores, eliminate blackheads, and control excess oil, while Sodium PCA and Hyaluronic Acid deliver deep hydration and strengthen the skin’s natural moisture barrier.\nEnriched with Niacinamide, it brightens dull skin, minimizes pores, and balances sebum production for a smoother, healthier, and more even complexion. With regular use, this serum helps prevent future breakouts, fades acne marks, and restores the skin’s natural glow.\nKey Benefits:\n🌿 Anti-Acne Formula: Targets breakouts, blackheads, and clogged pores.\n💧 Deep Hydration: With Sodium PCA & Hyaluronic Acid for long-lasting moisture.\n🌸 Soothing & Healing: Cica calms redness and supports barrier repair.\n✨ Brightening Effect: Niacinamide improves tone, texture, and radiance.\n🧴 Lightweight Texture: Absorbs quickly without stickiness or irritation.\nHow to Use:After cleansing and toning, apply 2–3 drops of serum to your face or affected areas. Gently massage until fully absorbed. Use twice daily for best results.\nKey Ingredients:Centella Asiatica (Cica), Salicylic Acid, Sodium PCA, Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide.\nSuitable For: Oily, acne-prone, and sensitive skin.', 445.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Earth Beauty & You Cica Care Barrier Repair Acne Treatment Serum – Anti-Acne, Hydrating & Skin Brightening (30ml)Price in BD', 'Earth Beauty & You Cica Care Barrier Repair Acne Treatment Serum – Anti-Acne, Hydrating & Skin Brightening (30ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'earth-beauty-you-cica-care-barrier-repair-acne-treatment-serum-anti-acne-hydrating-skin-brightening-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
