(159, 'Cos De BAHA AZ Azelaic Acid 10 Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 6, 36, '159', '159', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Has anyone not thought about how to get rid of acne before? Seeing red, swollen skin and rough skin can only make you feel stuffy. The fact that people of all ages can get acne used to bother many people. Many people still say that they\'ve tried everything good for acne, but it hasn\'t worked. In solving red and sore skin acne, Azelaic Acid is a new emerging solution. In the past, no one really knew about it, but now everyone wants to try it out at least once. We\'d like to help you solve your skin problems through Serum with Azelaic Acid, which Cos De BAHA has prepared for a long time. Now, check for yourself the effects of improving the texture of your skin.\nIngredients\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Propylene Glycol, Azelaic Acid (10%), Polysorbate 20, 1,2-Hexanediol, Propanediol, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Sodium Hyaluronate,*Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract,*Momordica Charantia Fruit Extract, *Sambucus Nigra Flower Extract,*Leontopodium Alpinum Extract.\nPlease note the following when using your Azelaic Acid product:\nDo you see white crystals in the product? Don\'t worry because it\'s a normal product! Soak it in warm water for 15 minutes. It is a crystal of active ingredient caused by low winter temperature. If you are using the product for the first time, soak it in warm water for 10 minutes. Please store at room temperature. Please feel free to contact me if you have any questions or feel strange.\nThank you for your understanding of our commitment to using only non-hazardous ingredients.\n\nUsage Directions for Cos De BAHA Azelaic Acid 10% Serum:\nNote: Always conduct a patch test before full application to check for any skin sensitivity.\n\nSafety Information\nThe product contains a high content of Azelaic Acid. We have experienced \"Allergic reaction\" and \"face burning\" in users with sensitive skin. Please test under the chin before use.\nDo white crystals occur?\nMade in Korea', 1058.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 570.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA AZ Azelaic Acid 10 Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA AZ Azelaic Acid 10 Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-az-azelaic-acid-10-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
