(161, 'C Acnes Cica + 2% Salicylic Acid Serum 30ml (Acne & Oil Control)', '1', 0, 6, 77, '161', '161', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fight breakouts and control shine with C Acnes Cica + 2% Salicylic Acid Serum—a targeted formula designed for active acne, blackheads/whiteheads, and excess oil. Powered by 2% Salicylic Acid (BHA) for gentle exfoliation and pore-clearing action, plus soothing Cica (Centella Asiatica) to help calm redness and inflammation, this serum supports smoother, clearer, more even-looking skin with regular use.\nActive acne\nRedness & inflammation\nExcess oil / oily skin\nBlackheads & whiteheads\nAnti-acne & oil control\nBlackhead treatment & pore clearing\nExfoliating & smoothing\nAnti-inflammatory, redness removal\nDark spot correction & even toning\nHelps boost glow\nHypoallergenic (as stated)\nHelps fade hyperpigmentation for a more even-toned look\nHelps treat dullness & dark spots for visibly glowing skin\nHelps boost collagen for firmer-looking skin\nCica Water, Glycerine, Ethoxydiglycol, Propanediol, 1,3-Butylene Glycol, Salicylic Acid, Sodium Hydroxide, Ethylhexylglycerin & Phenoxyethanol, Niacinamide, Zinc PCA, Xanthan Gum, Pear Juice Ferment Filtrate & Botanical Extract Complex, Hydroxyethyl Cellulose, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Sodium Gluconate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Opuntia Ficus-Indica (Prickly Pear) Stem Extract, Laminaria Digitata Extract, Cetyl-PG Hydroxyethyl Palmitamide, Ceramide Mix, Centella Asiatica (Cica) Extract, Witch Hazel Extract, Mugwort Extract.\nApply a few drops to clean, dry skin (focus on acne-prone areas). Start 2–3 times a week, then increase as tolerated. Use moisturizer after. Use sunscreen in the daytime.', 1398.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 152.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'C Acnes Cica + 2% Salicylic Acid Serum 30ml (Acne & Oil Control)Price in BD', 'C Acnes Cica + 2% Salicylic Acid Serum 30ml (Acne & Oil Control) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'c-acnes-cica-2-salicylic-acid-serum-30ml-acne-oil-control', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
