(164, 'Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid 2% Serum 30 ml', '1', 0, 6, 78, '164', '164', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid 2% Acne Control Serum features gentle formula penetrates deep into pores to control excess oil, dead skin cells, and reduces acne, making it suitable for even sensitive skin. Achieve clearer, more radiant skin with our innovative solution.\nIngredients: Aqua, Alpha Arbutin, Niacinamide, Salicylic Acid, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Hyaluronic Acid, Triethanolamine, Preservative ,Tocopheryl Acetate, Flavor.\nUses: Cleanse your face thoroughly. Apply 3-4 drops of serum to your face and neck using a dabbing motion. Before first use, it is highly recommended to do a patch test on a small area of skin to check for any reactions.\n', 517.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 58.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid 2% Serum 30 mlPrice in BD', 'Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid 2% Serum 30 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nature-beauty-salicylic-acid-2-serum-30-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(165, 'Caplino Niacinamide 5% Serum 30ml and Laikou Niacinamide Whitening Cream 100g', '1', 0, 6, 68, '165', '165', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Caplino Niacinamide 5% Serum 30ml\nEffects:\nCaplino Niacinamide Serum Key Benefits:\nIngredients:\nHow to use Caplino Niacinamide Serum:\nStorage:\nCautions:\n\nLaikou Niacinamide Whitening Cream 100g\n\nFeatures:\nContaining a High Concentration of Niacinamide, Α-arbutin and 3-o-ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Laikou Niacinamide Whitening Cream Can Penetrate Into the Skin Layer Deeply, Inhibit Melanin, and Fade Dark Spots. With the Ingredient of Sodium Hyaluronate, It’s Easy to Be Absorbed, and Prolonged Use Can Make Your Skin Bright and Translucent.\nEffects : Lighten Spots/brighten Skin Tone/moisturizing\nIngredients :\nAqua, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Dimethicone, Propylene Glycol Dicaprylate/dicaprate, Isononyl Isononanoate, Cyclopentasiloxane, Ci 77891, Phenyl Trimethicone, Sodium Polyacrylate, Sodium Acrylate/sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Ethylhexyl Stearate, Isohexadecane, Trideceth-6, Polysorbate 80, Aluminum Hydroxide, Sorbitan Oleate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane， Etc.\nUsage:\nAfter Cleaning the Skin, Take the Appropriate Amount of Niacinamide Whitening Cream, and Gently Massage the Skin Until It is Absorbed.', 1050.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 635.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Caplino Niacinamide 5% Serum 30ml and Laikou Niacinamide Whitening Cream 100gPrice in BD', 'Caplino Niacinamide 5% Serum 30ml and Laikou Niacinamide Whitening Cream 100g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'caplino-niacinamide-5-serum-30ml-and-laikou-niacinamide-whitening-cream-100g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(166, 'Maxi-Peel Vitamin Exfoliate Solution Step. 2, 60 ml', '1', 0, 15, 79, '166', '166', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Maxi-Peel Vitamin Exfoliate Solution No. 2 is a micro-exfoliating vitamin solution specially formulated to help remove dead skin cells and prevent mild skin concerns such as pimples, blackheads, and whiteheads. Its advanced formula contains skin-friendly vitamins and hydroxides that provide effective exfoliation without visible peeling, redness, or irritation.\nDesigned for regular skincare routines, this exfoliating solution helps promote smoother, clearer, and healthier-looking skin while maintaining comfort and balance. It is ideal for those seeking gentle exfoliation with visible results.\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells\nHelps prevent pimples, blackheads, and whiteheads\nContains skin vitamins for nourishment\nMicro-exfoliating formula without harsh peeling\nMinimal redness and irritation\nBrand: Maxi-Peel\nProduct Type: Vitamin Exfoliate Solution\nVariant: No. 2\nNet Content: 60 ml\nWhile we work to ensure that product information is correct, manufacturers may occasionally update their ingredient lists. Actual product packaging and materials may contain more or different information than what is shown here. We recommend that you do not rely solely on the information presented and always read labels, warnings, and directions before using the product. For additional information, please contact the manufacturer.', 1615.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 85.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Maxi-Peel Vitamin Exfoliate Solution Step. 2, 60 mlPrice in BD', 'Maxi-Peel Vitamin Exfoliate Solution Step. 2, 60 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'maxi-peel-vitamin-exfoliate-solution-step-2-60-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(167, 'Deconstruct 10%  Vitamin C & Ferulic Acid Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 15, 80, '167', '167', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Deconstruct 10% Non-Irritating Vitamin C Face Serum For Glowing Skin|10% Vitamin C + 0.5% Ferulic Acid|Water Based Serum|Highly Stable Vitamin C Face Serum For Women And Men|Beginner Friendly|30 Ml\nThe peculiar combination of Vitamin C and Ferulic acid function well together towards limiting the expression of tyrosinase which will provide the brightening effect. This Vitamin C serum for face is specifically designed for all skin types, including oily, dry, combination and sensitive skin. Ferulic acid and Vitamin C serum for face contains anti-inflammatory properties which clear pigmentation and PIH and are also essential for collagen biosynthesis.\nVitamin C Serum:', 1690.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 610.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Deconstruct 10%  Vitamin C & Ferulic Acid Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Deconstruct 10%  Vitamin C & Ferulic Acid Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'deconstruct-10-vitamin-c-ferulic-acid-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
