(173, 'Organikaon Triple Antioxidant Vitamin C Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 15, 14, '173', '173', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Organikaon Triple Antioxidant Vitamin C Serum is a premium skincare solution designed to brighten, hydrate, and protect the skin. Formulated with a stable and effective form of Vitamin C, this serum is enriched with triple antioxidant power to combat signs of aging and environmental stress. Made in Bangladesh, it reflects Organikaon’s commitment to natural, chemical-free beauty products.\nKey Features\nUsageApply a few drops of the serum to clean, dry skin, preferably after toner and before moisturizer. Gently massage into the face and neck until fully absorbed. Use once or twice daily for best results. Always follow with sunscreen during daytime use to protect the skin.\nWhy Choose This Product\nBenefits\nCautions\n', 1015.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 435.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Organikaon Triple Antioxidant Vitamin C Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Organikaon Triple Antioxidant Vitamin C Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'organikaon-triple-antioxidant-vitamin-c-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(174, 'Yuderma VIT C Serum 40ml', '1', 0, 15, 50, '174', '174', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yuderma VIT C Serum (40ml) is a potent antioxidant-rich skincare product designed to brighten the skin, improve texture, and reduce signs of aging. Formulated with Vitamin C, it works to enhance skin radiance, reduce dark spots, and promote collagen production, resulting in firmer, smoother, and more youthful-looking skin.\nThis serum is ideal for those looking to achieve brighter, more even-toned, and youthful skin through the benefits of Vitamin C.', 2075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Yuderma VIT C Serum 40mlPrice in BD', 'Yuderma VIT C Serum 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yuderma-vit-c-serum-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(175, 'Purito Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 8, 83, '175', '175', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purito Seoul Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Serum is a lightweight, fast-absorbing formula that delivers deep hydration and barrier repair. With a high concentration of panthenol (Vitamin B5), combined with Damyang bamboo extract and ectoin, this serum provides lasting moisture, calms irritation, and enhances skin’s natural defenses. Its silky, non-sticky texture makes it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin, and layers seamlessly under moisturizers or makeup for a radiant, plump complexion.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage Instructions\n\nIngredients\nWater, Panthenol, Glycerin, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Butylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Squalane, Bambusa Vulgaris Extract, Ectoin, Allantoin, Carbomer, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Cetearyl Olivate, Tromethamine, Sorbitan Olivate, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Sorbitan Isostearate, Polyglyceryl-10 Stearate.\n\nBenefits', 1575.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 457.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Purito Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-mighty-bamboo-panthenol-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(176, 'COSRX AHA BHA Vitamin C Booster Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 8, 31, '176', '176', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Cosrx Refresh AHA-BHA Vitamin C Booster Serum is a multi-functional serum that is designed to brighten, exfoliate, and hydrate the skin. This serum contains a blend of powerful ingredients that work together to improve the overall texture and appearance of the skin.The serum is formulated with a combination of AHAs (Alpha Hydroxy Acids), BHAs (Beta Hydroxy Acids), and Vitamin C, which help to exfoliate dead skin cells, unclog pores, and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. These ingredients also work to brighten the complexion, even out skin tone, and improve overall skin texture.The serum also contains a blend of hydrating ingredients, including Panthenol (Provitamin B5) and Sodium Hyaluronate, which help to hydrate and soothe the skin. Additionally, this serum contains natural plant extracts, including Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract (Green Tea Extract) and Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Extract, which provide antioxidant and anti-inflammatory benefits to the skin.\nKey Benefits:\nKey Ingredients:\nHow to use:\n\nIt\'s recommended to Start by using the serum once a day, preferably in the evening. You can gradually increase the frequency to twice a day as your skin adjusts.', 1710.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 490.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSRX AHA BHA Vitamin C Booster Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'COSRX AHA BHA Vitamin C Booster Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-aha-bha-vitamin-c-booster-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(177, 'No7 Defence+ 3% Ceramide Complex Strengthening Serum', '1', 0, 8, 84, '177', '177', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brand: No7\nMade In: Thailand\nSkin Type : All type skin\nSize : 25ml\n\nPowered by 3% Ceramide Complex, 1% Centella Extract Blend and Pollution Shield Technology. This serum instantly hydrates and soothes skin while protecting it from environmental factors like pollutants and blue light exposure. This fast absorbing serum, helps recover the skin moisture barrier and reduces the appearance of redness, leaving the skin feeling deeply nourished and healthier looking in 7 days.How to useApply 3-4 drops to a cleansed face using your fingertips while avoiding eye and lip area. Use twice a day, during the day and at night.Hazards and cautionsAvoid contact with the eyes rinse well with water immediately. If this becomes uncomfortable or irritation occurs, wash off your skin thoroughly and discontinue use. IngredientsAqua (Water), Butylene glycol, Propanediol, Isododecane, Dimethicone, Polyacrylamide, Propylene glycol, Phenoxyethanol, C13-14 isoparaffin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium lauroyl lactylate, Chlorphenesin, Divinyldimethicone/dimethicone crosspolymer, Laureth-7, Dimethicone/vinyl dimethicone crosspolymer, Dipropylene glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol^, Ceramide NP, Caesalpinia spinosa fruit extract^, Xanthan gum, Sodium metabisulfite, Benzotriazolyl dodecyl p-cresol, Parfum (Fragrance), Phytosphingosine, Ceramide AP, Cholesterol.\n\nHow to use:\nApply 3-4 drops to a cleansed face using your fingertips while avoiding eye and lip area. Use twice a day, during the day and at night.\n\nIngredients:\nAqua (Water), Butylene glycol, Propanediol, Isododecane, Dimethicone, Polyacrylamide, Propylene glycol, Phenoxyethanol, C13-14 isoparaffin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium lauroyl lactylate, Chlorphenesin, Divinyldimethicone/dimethicone crosspolymer, Laureth-7, Dimethicone/vinyl dimethicone crosspolymer.etc.\n', 1243.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 517.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'No7 Defence+ 3% Ceramide Complex Strengthening SerumPrice in BD', 'No7 Defence+ 3% Ceramide Complex Strengthening Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'no7-defence-3-ceramide-complex-strengthening-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(178, 'LANBENA Herbal Skin Care Serum', '1', 0, 8, 85, '178', '178', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Plant extract formulated to smoothe,soften, & improve the appearanceof scars associated with skintrauma, surgery, wounds, andburns. fade scar melanin, remover stretch marks, pockmark repair.\nIngredients:\nWater, Hyaluronic Acid, Butylene, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, Saccharomyces Lysate Extract, Nonapeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5, L-Carnosine, Tripeptide-3, Copper Tripeptide-1, Nicotinamide, Portulaca, Oleracea, Lavandula Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract\n\nSkin Types: Suitable for various skin types\n1.The product should be applied to a healed skin surface.\n2.People with sensitive skin are recommended to use the product only after a sensitivity test at the back of the ears without any adverse reactions.\n3.If such abnormalities as rash, swelling, itching and allergy occur in use or after use, please immediately stop using the product and consult a doctor.\n\nMade in PRC', 359.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 291.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LANBENA Herbal Skin Care SerumPrice in BD', 'LANBENA Herbal Skin Care Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lanbena-herbal-skin-care-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(179, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Serum – Hyaluronic Acid & Centella Asiatica, 30ml', '1', 0, 8, 86, '179', '179', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Enhance your skincare routine with the Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Serum, infused with Hyaluronic Acid and Centella Asiatica. This lightweight, fast-absorbing serum brightens skin tone, reduces the appearance of pores, calms inflammation, and hydrates deeply, leaving your skin smooth, radiant, and refreshed. Perfect for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nNiacinamide (10%) – Brightens complexion, reduces dark spots, and balances oil production\nHyaluronic Acid – Provides deep hydration and maintains moisture for plump, healthy-looking skin\nCentella Asiatica – Soothes and repairs skin, calming redness and irritation\nSkin Texture & Tone – Improves smoothness, refines pores, and restores radiance\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, dispense 1–2 pumps into your palm.\nGently pat onto face and neck until fully absorbed.\nFollow with your moisturizer.\nUse morning and night for best results.\nApply sunscreen during the day for added protection.\nSuitable For:\nAll skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin\nIdeal for brightening, hydration, and calming', 1883.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 807.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Serum – Hyaluronic Acid & Centella Asiatica, 30mlPrice in BD', 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Serum – Hyaluronic Acid & Centella Asiatica, 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'absolute-new-york-niacinamide-10-face-serum-hyaluronic-acid-centella-asiatica-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(180, 'Beaute Melasma-x 24 Gold EGF Repair Ampoule 30ml', '1', 0, 8, 87, '180', '180', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Unleash the power of luxurious skincare with the Beaute Melasma-X 24 Gold EGF Repair Ampoule, a high-performance treatment designed to rejuvenate and repair your skin. Infused with 24K gold particles, Epidermal Growth Factor (EGF), and premium natural extracts, this ampoule targets stubborn skin concerns like melasma, pigmentation, and dullness, while promoting a youthful, radiant complexion.\nFor best results, use every evening as part of your nighttime skincare routine. Regular use for at least one month will reveal noticeable improvements in skin clarity, brightness, and texture.\nThis ampoule is ideal for individuals experiencing melasma, pigmentation, or signs of aging, as well as anyone looking to achieve a radiant, rejuvenated complexion.\nTransform your skin with the perfect blend of science and luxury. With its potent formula and premium ingredients, this ampoule delivers visible results, helping you achieve the flawless, glowing skin you\'ve always dreamed of.Country of Origin: Korea', 790.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 840.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beaute Melasma-x 24 Gold EGF Repair Ampoule 30mlPrice in BD', 'Beaute Melasma-x 24 Gold EGF Repair Ampoule 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beaute-melasma-x-24-gold-egf-repair-ampoule-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(181, 'Boots Ingredients Lactic Acid Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 8, 11, '181', '181', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots Ingredients Lactic Acid Serum 30mlA gentle exfoliating serum formulated with naturally derived lactic acid to help remove dead skin cells, revealing smoother and brighter skin. This lightweight serum improves skin texture while promoting a more radiant complexion.\n\nKey Features\n\nBenefits\n\nBenefits of Key Ingredients\n\nHow to UseApply to face and neck in the evening. Gently massage until fully absorbed. Avoid contact with eyes. Use sunscreen and limit sun exposure during use and for a week after discontinuation. Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n\nFull IngredientsAqua (Water), Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Lactic Acid, Betaine, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Hydroxide, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Sodium Benzoate, Hydroxyethylpiperazine Ethane Sulfonic Acid, Stephania Tetrandra Root Extract, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Nitrate\n\nCountry of Origin: PRC', 1210.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 40.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Ingredients Lactic Acid Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Boots Ingredients Lactic Acid Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-ingredients-lactic-acid-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(182, 'Abib Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum 50ml', '1', 0, 8, 88, '182', '182', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Abib Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum 50ml\nSoothe, repair, and hydrate your skin with the Abib Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum — the ultimate solution for irritated, acne-prone, or sensitive skin. This calming serum combines Heartleaf Extract and Centella Asiatica (TECA) to reduce redness, calm inflammation, and strengthen the skin barrier, while niacinamide, glycerin, panthenol, and allantoin provide hydration, brightening, and healing benefits. Dermatologically tested, it’s gentle enough for daily use yet powerful enough to target irritation, acne, and uneven skin tone.\n\nKey Details:\n\nBenefits:\n\nWho is it for:Ideal for men and women with sensitive, irritated, acne-prone, or dehydrated skin seeking a gentle yet effective calming serum.\nUsage Direction:\n\nIngredients:Water, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Propanediol, Dipropylene Glycol, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Betaine, Diethoxyethyl Succinate, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Isononyl Isononanoate, Chondrus Crispus Extract, Panthenol, Glucose, Chlorella Vulgaris Extract, Saccharum Officinarum (Sugarcane) Extract, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Carbomer, Fructose, Fructooligosaccharides, Tromethamine, Pentylene Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Xanthan Gum, Castor Oil/IPDI Copolymer, Madecassoside, Succinic Acid, Allantoin, Sodium Phytate, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Biosaccharide Gum-1, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Coccinia Indica Fruit Extract, Arginine, Beta-Glucan, Amber Powder, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract, Amodimethicone, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Moringa Oleifera Seed Oil, Tocopherol, Ectoin, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract, 4-Terpineol, Sorbitol.\nCountry: South Korea', 3085.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -3085.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Abib Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum 50mlPrice in BD', 'Abib Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'abib-heartleaf-teca-capsule-serum-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(183, 'Cetaphil Ceramide Serum with Ceramide,Cica and Allantoin for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 8, 63, '183', '183', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For all skin types\nApply an even layer to the whole face daily after cleansing, and before applying moisturizer. Can be used twice daily even on the most sensitive skin. Use this product in combination with Cetaphil cleansers and moisturizers for a full skincare regimen.\nEffectively restore and repair your skin\'s moisture barrier with the lightweight, Ceramide Serum, designed for even the most sensitive skin. It\'s formulated with Ceramides to help restore the skin\'s natural moisture barrier, plus CICA to help defend against surface free radicals, and Allantoin to help soothe sensitive skin and defend against dryness. This gentle formula is clinically proven to lock in moisture for 48 hour hydration and significantly repair the skin’s moisture barrier in just 1 week. Get visibly more even skin tone in just 3 days with this non-greasy serum, which also defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity - dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness and a weakened skin barrier.\nParaben free\nFragrance free\nHypoallergenic\nNon-comedogenic\nDermatologist tested', 2860.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1340.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Ceramide Serum with Ceramide,Cica and Allantoin for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Ceramide Serum with Ceramide,Cica and Allantoin for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-ceramide-serum-with-ceramidecica-and-allantoin-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(184, 'Minimalist Multi Peptides 10% Face Serum for All Skin Type', '1', 0, 8, 32, '184', '184', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A rejuvenating, collagen boosting serum boosted with peptides that restore youthfulness, resulting in younger, firmer-looking skin. It\'s a 10% multi-peptide face serum with 7% matrixyl , Oligopeptides & Polypeptides that repairs & smoothens wrinkles for every skin type.\nFeatures:\nIdeal For:\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning your face, take 2-3 drops of the serum on your fingertips with the dropper. Apply it on the face by gently tapping it on the skin. Do not layer immediately before/after antioxidants like Retinol, or Vitamin C.\nWhen to use: PM. Everyday.\nMade in INDIA\n', 1380.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 420.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist Multi Peptides 10% Face Serum for All Skin TypePrice in BD', 'Minimalist Multi Peptides 10% Face Serum for All Skin Type Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-multi-peptides-10-face-serum-for-all-skin-type', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(185, 'Neogen Dermalogy CICA Repair Snail Essence 100ml', '1', 0, 8, 56, '185', '185', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neogen’s Dermalogy Cica Repair Snail Essence contains a whopping 96% snail mucin to help revitalize dull, or irritated skin. Formulated to aid in skin regeneration and promote elasticity, the Cica complex included in the formula contains centella asiatica extract, asiaticoside, madecassic acid, asiatic acid, and madecassoside - all of which work together to help soothe sensitive or troubled skin.  Additionally, hyaluronic acid helps to maintain and increase hydration, while 10 types of youthberry & plant collagen help promote the appearance of elasticity, hydration and firmness. pH of 6.5 ~ 1.0. Formulated without artificial fragrances or colors, parabens, alcohol, and mineral oils. Snail mucin is extracted in a harmless manner that does not injure the snails.\n\nContains 96% of Snail mucin extract, which is known for snail\'s recovery!-96% of snail mucin extreacted ftom snail mucus raised in a harmless and clean environment. It is effective for skin regeneration and elasticity care.\nAdded hyaluronic acid, antioxidants, and plant collagen to boost moisture & elasticity care!- Hyaluronic acid, which maintains hydration, and 10 types of youthberry & plant collagen that are effective in elasticity, meet to create a synergy effect, helping to maintain hydration and firmness.\nAC-CICA PURE COMPLEX soothes & relieves scars!- The Cica complex Cenella asiatica extract, asiaticoside, madecassic acid, asiatic acid, madecassoside) helps soothe sensitive troubled skin.\n\nIngredients:\nSnail Secretion Filtrate(96%), Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Centella Asiatica Extract, Vaccinium Macrocarpon (Cranberry) Fruit Extract, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Fruit Extract, Vaccinium Angustifolium (Blueberry) Fruit Extract, Cornus Officinalis Fruit Extract, Euterpe Oleracea Fruit Extract, Sambucus Nigra Fruit Extract, Schizandra Chinensis Fruit Extract, Panax Ginseng Berry Extract, Vaccinium Myrtillus Fruit Extract, Epilobium Fleischeri Extract, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract, Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract\n\nHow to Use:\nDispense a dime-sized amount of product into hands and gently press into skin until fully absorbed. Suitable for daily use, morning and night.\n\nMade in Korea', 1408.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 592.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neogen Dermalogy CICA Repair Snail Essence 100mlPrice in BD', 'Neogen Dermalogy CICA Repair Snail Essence 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neogen-dermalogy-cica-repair-snail-essence-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(186, 'Beauty Formulas Repairing Ceramides Restore + Revive Serum', '1', 0, 8, 89, '186', '186', NULL, NULL, NULL, '​The Beauty Formulas Repairing Ceramides Restore + Revive Serum is a UK-made facial serum designed to moisturize and repair the skin. It is suitable for all skin types and is part of Beauty Formulas\' ceramide-focused skincare line.​\nCeramide-Enriched Formula: Helps reinforce the skin\'s protective barrier, enhancing resilience and moisture retention.​\nMoisturizing and Repairing: Aims to restore the skin\'s natural barrier, promoting a healthier complexion.​\nUniversal Use: Designed for daily application, suitable for both morning and evening routines.​\nAffordable Skincare: Offers quality skincare benefits at a budget-friendly price point.​\nVolume: 30 ml​\nSkin Type: All skin types​\nMade In: Great Britain', 470.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 280.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty Formulas Repairing Ceramides Restore + Revive SerumPrice in BD', 'Beauty Formulas Repairing Ceramides Restore + Revive Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-formulas-repairing-ceramides-restore-revive-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(187, 'Cos De BAHA L3 Serum with Level 3 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 1.0%', '1', 0, 8, 36, '187', '187', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This L3 Bakuchiol & Retinol Serum helps renew and rejuvenate the skin, and improve aging, hyperpigmentation, and acne flare-ups.Enriched with Bakuchiol to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles and restore skin firmness.Infused with Lavender Extract to lessen acne and even skin tone.Suitable for all skin types.\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Propanediol, Glycerin, Isononyl Isononanoate, Dimethicone, Niacinamide, Bakuchiol,Cetearyl Alcohol, Retinol, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Panthenol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Allantoin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Water, Butylene Glycol,*Artemisia Vulgaris Extract,*Melissa Officinalis Leaf Extract,*Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Flower Extract,*Rosa Damascena Extract,*Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Xanthan Gum, Adenosine, Caprylyl Glycol, Polysorbate 20, Tromethamine, Carbomer, Disodium EDTA, Tropolone *Mark : N.O.I.P 72%\nHow to Use:\nApply a moderate amount and gently tap for better absorption.\nDisclaimer: As changes to the product packaging, information, and/or formulation may occur without notice, Chuusi.ca cannot guarantee the information and/or images on this website to be accurate, complete, and/or updated. While we do our best to keep our website updated, the actual product may vary. Prices are subject to change. We cannot accomodate price adjustments on previous orders.\nMade in Korea\n', 1105.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1095.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA L3 Serum with Level 3 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 1.0%Price in BD', 'Cos De BAHA L3 Serum with Level 3 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 1.0% Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-l3-serum-with-level-3-bakuchiol-2-and-retinol-10', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-