(188, 'Laikou Japan Yuzu Skin Refining Serum 17ml', '1', 0, 8, 8, '188', '188', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Japan Yuzu Skin Refining Serum, a 17ml essence, aims to brighten, firm, and refine the skin, targeting pores and blemishes. It contains Yuzu extract, Niacinamide, and Sodium Hyaluronate, among other ingredients. The serum is designed to even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and promote a healthy, radiant complexion.', 199.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 151.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Yuzu Skin Refining Serum 17mlPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Yuzu Skin Refining Serum 17ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-yuzu-skin-refining-serum-17ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
