(190, 'Cos De BAHA SH Snail Mucin HA Serum', '1', 0, 8, 36, '190', '190', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ingredients:\nSnail Secretion Filtrate (83%), Propanediol, Glycerin, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Panthenol, Betaine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Beta Glucan,*Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Allantoin, Adenosine,*Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Leaf Extract, *Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Extract, *Eucalyptus Globulus (Eucalyptus) Leaf Extract,*Thymus Vulgaris (Thyme) Extract, *Aspalathus Linearis (Rooibos) Extract, Sodium Polyacrylate *Mark: Organic Ingredients.\nCountry of Origin: Korea\nWhen you use it for the first time:\nIMPORTANT - This is a concentrated and powerful serum. As with any skincare product, we suggest doing a Patch Test on a small area of skin on your neck to make sure the formula is a good fit for you. Once you determine there is no problem with the patch test you should (1) Wash your face and then dry (2) Apply a small amount to your entire face, neck and decollete, (3) allow to dry (4) Follow with a moisturizer.\nWarnings:\nUse daily after cleansing and before applying moisturizer & makeup. Moisten a cotton ball or pad and apply to the face and neck. For best results, use in the morning and at night for soft, smooth, and beautiful skin.\n\n\n\n', 1399.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 601.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA SH Snail Mucin HA SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA SH Snail Mucin HA Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-sh-snail-mucin-ha-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
(191, 'The Ordinary Lactic Acid 5% + HA 30ml', '1', 0, 8, 25, '191', '191', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lactic Acid 5% + HA is a mild alpha hydroxy acid solution that offers gentle yet effective exfoliation targeted at the skin’s surface. It is supported with purified Tasmanian pepperberry extract , which has been shown to reduce irritation and sensitivity that can be associated with acid use. This water-based serum is ideal for dry and sensitive skin. This pH of this formula is approximately 3.8. Lactic Acid has a pKa of 3.8 and pKa is the most important aspect to consider in formulating with acids. pKa implies acid availability. When pKa is close to pH, there is an ideal balance between salt and acidity, maximizing effectiveness of the acid and reducing irritation\n', 1480.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1190.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Lactic Acid 5% + HA 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Lactic Acid 5% + HA 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-lactic-acid-5-ha-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:01', '2026-02-11 06:22:01'),
