(194, 'Some by Mi Beta Panthenol Repair Serum', '1', 0, 8, 2, '194', '194', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SOME BY MI Beta Panthenol Repair Serum is a powerhouse serum designed to fortify your skin\'s resilience for the long haul, leaving it immediately soothed and hydrated. Infused with SOME BY MI\'s patented Beta-Panthenol™, a harmonious blend of D-panthenol and beta-sitosterol, this serum excels in balancing the skin\'s pH levels and strengthening its barriers.\nRecommended for: Dry skin type.\nHow to use:\nApply onto clean skin, and gently pat into the skin until fully absorbed.\nIngredients:\nPurified Water, 2, 3-Butanediol, Panthenol, Dipropylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-6 Stearate, Betaine, Octyldodecanol, Glycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Candida Bombicola / Glucose / Methyl Rape Cidate Fermented Product, Beta-Sitosterol, Squalane, Vinyl Dimethicone, Polyglyceryl-6 Behenate, Jojoba Ester, Glyceryl Stearate, Stearyl Alcohol, Cetyl Alcohol, Carbomer, Tocopherol, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Phytosterol, Meadowfoam Seed Oil, Sunflower Seed Wax, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Canola Oil, Tromethamine, Argan Kernel Oil, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-10 Stearate, Sodium Surfactin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Sorbitan Olivate, Adenosine, Cetearyl Olivate, Citric Acid, Musa Sapientum Fruit Extract, Rosa Damask Rose Water, Sodium Phytate, Pyrus Communis Fruit Extract, Prunus Domestica Extract, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Cucumis Melo Fruit Extract, Polyglycerin-3, Beta-Glucan, Hedera Helix Leaf/Stem Extract, Cetearyl Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Propanediol, Ceramide NP, Ceramide NS, Phytosphingosine, Cholesterol, Lactococcus fermentation lysate, Ceramide AS, Ceramide AP, Bifida fermentation lysate, Lactobacillus fermentation lysate, Ceramide EOP', 1965.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1135.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some by Mi Beta Panthenol Repair SerumPrice in BD', 'Some by Mi Beta Panthenol Rep