(197, 'Dot and Key Watermelon 10% glycolic gentle exfoliating Face Serum', '1', 0, 16, 91, '197', '197', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot and Key Watermelon 10% glycolic gentle exfoliating Face Serum\n- Daily use gentle exfoliating face serum for visibly smooth & luminous skin.- Unclog pores with 10% Glycolic to exfoliate dead skin cells for a smoother skin texture.- Antioxidant-rich Watermelon controls excess oil for better skin clarity.- Infused with Kojic Acid to combat discolouration for clearer skin.- Lightweight & non-sticky, it works best for normal, oily & combination skin\nSafety Information:Please read the ingredient label carefully before using, to check for specific allergy concerns. Always patch-test before using. Keep out of reach of children.\nIngredients:Watermelon Water, Glycolic, Ethoxydiglycol, Propanediol, 1,3-Butylene Glycol, Benzyl Alcohol (and) Ethylhexylglycerin (and) Tocopherol, Citrullus Lanatus (Watermelon) Fruit Extract, Rubus Chamaemorus (Cloudberry) Fruit Oil, Xanthan gum, Gluconolactone, Kojic, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Sodium Gluconate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Polyglumatic, D-Panthenol, Laminaria Digitata Extract (and) Cetyl-PG Hydroxyethyl Palmitamide (and) Ceramide mix.\nHow to use:- Apply 3-4 drops of Glycolic serum on cleansed skin -Pat gently until completely absorbed -Follow up with a moisturiser -Use for PM routine only -Follow it up with a sunscreen the next day *Start by using 2-3 times a   week for sensitive skin & slowly build to a nightly use over time\n\n', 1000.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Watermelon 10% glycolic gentle exfoliating Face SerumPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Watermelon 10% glycolic gentle exfoliating Face Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-watermelon-10-glycolic-gentle-exfoliating-face-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(198, 'Purito Centella Unscented Serum', '1', 0, 16, 83, '198', '198', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Centella Unscented Serum is formulated not only to calm but also to help strengthen, protect, and hydrate the skin barrier. Part of the Centella Unscented line, this lightweight, gel-type serum is formulated with no essential oils or artificial fragrances. The non-sticky serum contains 49% Centella Asiatica Extract to soothe the skin through its active compounds, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, and Madecassic Acid.\nSkin Types: Dry, CombinationSkin Concerns: Dryness, Compromised Skin Barrier\n\nMain Ingredients:- Centella Asiatica ExtractKnown by many names, including Tiger Grass, Centella Asiatica Extract helps nourish skin and soothe irritation. The fan favorite is also known to help reduce redness.- Ceramide NPKeeping skin hydrated by sealing in moisture, Ceramide NP helps improve the look and feel of dry skin.Synergy Ingredients:- PanthenolThe gentle ingredient is known to be a superstar when it comes to hydration. It helps to strengthen the skin barrier and protect it from external stressors.- PeptidesThe four types of Palmitoyl Peptides featured in the formula are known for their well-aging properties. They help enhance skin elasticity and firmness, improving fine lines. Moisturizing properties also help to keep the skin smooth and supple.\n\nFREE OF LIST– Artificial-fragrance-free– Essential-oil-free– Ethanol-free– Paraben-free\n\nHow To Use\nAfter cleanser and toner, apply an appropriate amount over the face and neck. Pat lightly into the skin for maximum absorption.\n\nMade In Korea', 835.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 125.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Centella Unscented SerumPrice in BD', 'Purito Centella Unscented Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-centella-unscented-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02'