(201, 'W. Skin Laboratory Cica Centella Calming Ampoule Serum', '1', 0, 16, 92, '201', '201', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Soothe and Strengthen Sensitive Skin\nCalm irritated skin with W. Skin Laboratory Cica Centella Calming Ampoule Serum, a concentrated formula enriched with Centella Asiatica extract to provide intense hydration, reduce redness, and support skin\'s natural healing process.\nKey Benefits:\nHow to Use:After cleansing and toning, apply a few drops of the serum to your face and gently pat to enhance absorption. Use morning and night for best results.\nRestore balance and comfort to your skin with W. Skin Laboratory Cica Centella Calming Ampoule Serum, and enjoy a calmer, healthier complexion every day.\nMade in Korea', 770.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 530.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'W. Skin Laboratory Cica Centella Calming Ampoule SerumPrice in BD', 'W. Skin Laboratory Cica Centella Calming Ampoule Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'w-skin-laboratory-cica-centella-calming-ampoule-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(202, 'Jumiso Snail Mucin 95 + Peptide Essence', '1', 0, 16, 93, '202', '202', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A rich face essence that moisturizes and nourishes skin while providing anti-aging benefits, containing 95% Snail Mucin that moisturizes and refreshes skin.\nJUMISO Snail Mucin 95 + Peptide Facial Essence is infused with snail mucin and peptides to increase the skin’s elasticity. It also features panthenol and allantoin to calm and soothe the skin. This nourishing essence deeply hydrates the skin as it offers anti-aging benefits for plump and firmer complexion.\nSize: 5ml\nHow to use:After toner, apply the essence onto your face and around the eyes. Gently tap your whole face with your fingertips to allow the essence to fully absorb onto your skin.\nIngredients:Snail Secretion Filtrate, Betaine, Butylene Glycol, Ethyl Hexanediol, Allantoin, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Carbomer, Water, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Panthenol, Adenosine, Arginine, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7', 286.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 289.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Jumiso Snail Mucin 95 + Peptide EssencePrice in BD', 'Jumiso Snail Mucin 95 + Peptide Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'jumiso-snail-mucin-95-peptide-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(203, 'Wow Skin Science Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 16, 81, '203', '203', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hydrating Serum To Restore Tired, Aging Skin Deliver deep hydration to your dry, patchy skin with WOW Skin Science Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum. It helps to moisturize and revive tired skin and boost the skin renewal process. It helps to make skin luminous and supple. The serum offers the replenishing benefits of hyaluronic acid. Lack of moisture can aggravate signs of aging like dryness, wrinkles, spots, and blotchy complexion. Our Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum might help elevate those problems.\n', 1147.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 52.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Wow Skin Science Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Wow Skin Science Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'wow-skin-science-hyaluronic-acid-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02');
