(204, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Tea Trica Relief Ampoule 30ml', '1', 0, 16, 16, '204', '204', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tea-Trica Relief Ampoule (30ml) is a non-comedogenic serum formulated to soothe and treat acne-prone skin. It combines the calming properties of Centella Asiatica with the purifying effects of tea tree extract to provide relief from inflammation and irritation.\nKey Features:\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Known for its soothing and healing properties, it aids in collagen synthesis and skin regeneration\nTea Tree Leaf Water: Effectively addresses skin troubles and soothes irritated skin\nPine Tree Complex: A blend of cypress water, king pine leaf extract, and tea tree leaf water that treats inflammation and calms the skin.\n\nBenefits:\nSoothes Irritated Skin: Provides instant relief to inflamed and sensitive areas.\nControls Sebum Production: Helps regulate excess oil, reducing the likelihood of breakouts.\nMinimizes Pores: Assists in tightening pores for a smoother complexion.\nHow to Use:\nAfter Cleansing and Toning: Apply a drop or two to the skin, focusing on inflamed or irritated areas.\nGently Pat: Use your fingertips to promote absorption.\nUse Twice Daily: Incorporate into your morning and evening skincare routine.\nSuitable For:\nAcne-prone and oily skin types.\nIndividuals seeking relief from skin inflammation and irritation.\nMade in Korea', 799.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 501.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Tea Trica Relief Ampoule 30mlPrice in BD', 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Tea Trica Relief Ampoule 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-tea-trica-relief-ampoule-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
