(207, 'Heimish 30% AHA BHA Peeling Serum', '1', 0, 16, 95, '207', '207', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revolutionize your skincare routine with Heimish\'s RX AHA BHA PEELING SERUM! Specifically formulated for acne-prone skin, this serum exfoliates dead skin cells, evens out tone, and enhances the effectiveness of your other products. See the difference for yourself today!\nExperience the power of Heimish RX AHA BHA PEELING SERUM 35ml, a wash-off type serum that combines AHA for surface exfoliation and BHA for clearing pore congestion. With a high concentration of free acids, this formula is perfect for experienced users looking for targeted exfoliation. Try it now for a radiant, smooth complexion!\nUnlock brighter, smoother, and more radiant skin with Heimish\'s RX AHA BHA PEELING SERUM! Say goodbye to dullness, uneven texture, dryness, and makeup flare-ups as it reveals a refreshed complexion. Experience improved skin texture, evened tone, and enhanced luminosity with just one peel.\nThis gentle serum exfoliates accumulated keratinized cells, instantly smoothing and evening skin tone. Its formula rich in free acids, AHAs and BHAs, helps eliminate impurities and reduce pore congestion, leaving skin smoother, brighter and more even-toned. Suitable for experienced acid exfoliating users.\nKey Ingredients:\nSkin benefits:\nSuitable for skin types:\nHow to use:\nApply a suitable amount all over the face, avoiding the eye area. Leave for 10 minutes maximum, then rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. Use 1-2 times a week, ideally in the evening on clean, dry skin.Country of Origin: Korea', 1499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 901.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish 30% AHA BHA Peeling SerumPrice in BD', 'Heimish 30% AHA BHA Peeling Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-30-aha-bha-peeling-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(208, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Serum', '1', 0, 16, 96, '208', '208', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Serum is a powerful skincare solution designed to revitalize, hydrate, and restore your skin’s natural glow. Infused with PDRN (Polydeoxyribonucleotide), this serum promotes skin regeneration, helping to repair damaged skin and improve elasticity for a youthful, radiant complexion.\nFormulated with peptides, it enhances collagen production, reducing fine lines and wrinkles while strengthening the skin barrier. The addition of hyaluronic acid delivers deep hydration, leaving skin plump, smooth, and refreshed. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing texture ensures a non-sticky finish, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nThe serum’s pink hue comes from botanical extracts that brighten dull skin and even out skin tone. With consistent use, this dermatologically-tested formula helps achieve firmer, healthier skin with improved texture and resilience.\nIdeal for daily skincare routines, the Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Serum is perfect for those looking to restore skin vitality, enhance hydration, and combat signs of aging effectively.', 2156.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 994.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide SerumPrice in BD', 'Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-pdrn-pink-peptide-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(209, 'Minimalist Niacinamide 05% Face Serum with Bifida Ferment, Oat Extract & Hyaluronic Acid for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 16, 32, '209', '209', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A nourishing and hydrating day serum that repairs and soothes sensitive skin. Ideal for those with dry and sensitive skin and for those who find 10% niacinamide a little too strong.\nHow to use: Morning and night, after cleansing and moisturizing with hyaluronic acid. Apply 2-3 drops. Apply to entire face using gentle circular motions. Although this is a lightweight formula that absorbs quickly, it is advisable to wait 1-2 minutes before applying other serums or moisturizers. Always apply serum from the lightest consistency (e.g. niacinamide) to the thickest/heaviest. Apply a broad spectrum sunscreen SPF 30 or higher to your skin, followed by moisturizer.\nMinimalist , a leading science-based skincare brand committed to “effectiveness and transparency in cosmetics.” The brand remains true to its vision of delivering high-performance, solution-based, and efficacy-driven products.\n\nIngredients:\nAqua, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Extract, Niacinamide, Dimethyl Isosorbide, Propanediol, Ethoxydiglycol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Pullulan, Xanthan Gum, Sclerotium Gum, Lecithin\nThe ingredients listed correspond to the current state of production. New scientific findings are regularly incorporated into the formulations, which means that the formulations may change accordingly. Therefore, the ingredients listed on the product or on the packaging are decisive.\n\nMade in India', 1425.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 165.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist Niacinamide 05% Face Serum with Bifida Ferment, Oat Extract & Hyaluronic Acid for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Minimalist Niacinamide 05% Face Serum with Bifida Ferment, Oat Extract & Hyaluronic Acid for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-niacinamide-05-face-serum-with-bifida-ferment-oat-extract-hyaluronic-acid-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(210, 'Laxzin Vitamin - C 10% With Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum', '1', 0, 7, 54, '210', '210', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laxzin Vitamin C 10% with Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum – Brighten, Hydrate, and Rejuvenate Your Skin\nTransform your skincare routine with Laxzin Vitamin C 10% with Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum, a powerful combination designed to revitalize tired, dull skin while providing deep hydration and anti-aging benefits. This premium serum combines the brightening power of Vitamin C with the moisture-locking properties of Hyaluronic Acid, helping you achieve a radiant, youthful complexion.\nWhy Choose Laxzin Vitamin C 10% Face Serum?\nPowerful 10% Vitamin C Formula: Vitamin C is a potent antioxidant known for fighting free radicals, reducing fine lines, and protecting the skin’s collagen. Regular use helps to even skin tone, fade dark spots, and restore your natural glow.\nDeep Hydration with Hyaluronic Acid: Hyaluronic Acid penetrates deep into the skin to provide long-lasting hydration. It keeps your skin plump, smooth, and soft, reducing dryness and improving elasticity.\nBrightening & Radiance Boost: This serum helps diminish dullness and enhances skin brightness, giving you a naturally luminous complexion.\nAnti-Aging Benefits: Reduces the appearance of wrinkles, fine lines, and age spots while supporting skin regeneration.\nLightweight & Fast Absorbing: The non-greasy formula is quickly absorbed into the skin, making it ideal for daily use under makeup or alone.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle enough for sensitive skin yet effective for normal, dry, oily, and combination skin types.\nHow to Use Laxzin Vitamin C Serum:\nStart with a clean face. Wash using a gentle cleanser and pat dry.\nApply 2–3 drops of the serum onto slightly damp skin.\nGently massage the serum into your face and neck until fully absorbed.\nFollow with your favorite moisturizer to lock in hydration.\nFor best results, use daily in the morning and evening.\nBenefits You’ll Love:\nBrighter, more even skin tone\nReduced appearance of dark spots and pigmentation\nPlump, hydrated, and youthful-looking skin\nSofter, smoother texture\nProtection against environmental stressors and free radicals\nPerfect For:Anyone looking to fight signs of aging, hydrate dry skin, reduce dark spots, or achieve a radiant, healthy glow. This serum is a must-have in every skincare routine.\nElevate your skincare regimen with Laxzin Vitamin C 10% with Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum – the perfect solution for brighter, younger, and healthier-looking skin.', 660.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laxzin Vitamin - C 10% With Hyaluronic Acid Face SerumPrice in BD', 'Laxzin Vitamin - C 10% With Hyaluronic Acid Face Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laxzin-vitamin-c-10-with-hyaluronic-acid-face-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(211, 'Laikou California Vitamin C Serum for Whitening Anti Oxidant to Remove Spots', '1', 0, 7, 8, '211', '211', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nOur LAIKOU California Vitamin C Serum has function to clear, detoxify the face skin. Effectively ades fine lines, reduces spots and many more! This is not the same vitamin C serum ours has more active ingredients.\nSkin benefits of vitamin C:\nA few clinical studies have demonstrated that vitamin C can improve wrinkles.\nSodium hyaluronate:\nIs a humectant, which means that it attracts moisture. People can use it topically in creams and serums to hydrate the skin.\nDirections:\nClean your face, apply proper amount of this product evenly on the face, message gently till it is fully absorbed.', 205.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 145.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou California Vitamin C Serum for Whitening Anti Oxidant to Remove SpotsPrice in BD', 'Laikou California Vitamin C Serum for Whitening Anti Oxidant to Remove Spots Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-california-vitamin-c-serum-for-whitening-anti-oxidant-to-remove-spots', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(212, 'The Derma Co 10% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance 10ml', '1', 0, 7, 33, '212', '212', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\n\n1. Apply 3-5 drops of serum on the entire face and neck (twice a day) in an upward circular motion 2. Massage gently until the serum gets absorbed 3. During the day, follow it up with a broad-spectrum sunscreen\n\n\nPurified water, Propanediol, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Niacinamide, Diethylene Glycol Monoethyl Ether, Sodium Hyaluronate, HydroxyethylCellulose, Ferulic Acid, Sodium Gluconate, Ethylhexylglycerin,Phenoxyethanol\n\n\n\n\n3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid is the most potent form of Vitamin C, equipped with immense brightening effects. It helps treat pigmentation and evens the skin tone. 10% Vitamin C is highly effective in putting an end to melanin biosynthesis, neutralizing free radicals, and preventing inflammatory processes. It also provides visible anti-aging benefits, brightens skin, and helps protect against oxidative stress.\nAn active form of Vitamin B3, Niacinamide is the gold-standard ingredient that actively works towards reducing acne marks & scars. It strengthens the skin’s barrier function that helps limit damage from free radicals and thus, helps you achieve #FilterFreeSkin. In short, Niacinamide is just what your skin needs to be healthy and clear.\nA plant-based antioxidant, ferulic acid neutralizes free radicals, enhances antioxidant benefits and the stability of Vitamin C. It boosts the effects of Vitamin C & Hyaluronic Acid while protecting the overall skin integrity. It slows and ultimately stops the development of spots, wrinkles, and fine lines.\nHyaluronic Acid provides long-lasting hydration to improve the skin texture by preventing premature moisture and ceramide loss, thereby keeping skin supple & hydrated. It is an excellent skincare active that reduces the visibility of fine lines, retains moisture in the skin, and increases skin cell turnover - creating a ‘plump’ effect.\n\n\n\nSay hello to the World’s 1st Face Serum with 10% Vitamin C, 5% Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid, and Ferulic Acid all-in-one. Vitamin C is formulated to make skin glow by correcting photodamage and enhancing collagen production for improving texture- fine lines and wrinkles with its potent brightening and antioxidant effects. The addition of niacinamide helps control oil and prevents UV-induced pigmentation, while Hyaluronic Acid boosts hydration and normalizes skin pH. This 10% Vitamin C concentration is perfect for first-time users who would like to start with a smaller percentage and those who have sensitive skin. This is a super serum for addressing multiple skin issues at the same time!\nThe combination of 5% Niacinamide and 10% Vitamin C accelerates cell regeneration and boosts collagen, thereby helping the skin to shed dead cell build-up from the surface and allowing new and healthy skin layers to take their place. This skin regeneration process also pushes out debris clogged inside pores, ensuring no room for any bacterial infection like acne while also making them less visible and more normal-sized. You and your skin can now confidently go #FilterFree with real & visible results in just 3-6 weeks!\nVitamin C is the most potent form of 3-O Ethyl Ascorbic Acid and the one that’s not only safe to use but also penetrates the skin from within to lighten the skin tone, giving it a more even-toned and healthy look. Ferulic Acid in the 10% Vitamin C Face Serum boosts Vitamin C’s antioxidant effects and helps protect overall skin integrity by reducing the development of fine lines, spots, and wrinkles. With this, you know you’ve made the right choice as it\'s going to be there for your skin through thick and thin!\n\n\n\nSuitable for all skin types, this face serum is for anyone with dull, damaged, and dehydrated skin.\nFree from mineral oil, dye, parabens, and sulfates, this face serum has a safe & effective formulation that offers a visible difference in 3-8 weeks.\nAll The Derma Co. products go through strict testing to ensure they are absolutely safe for use.', 790.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 80.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 10% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance 10mlPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 10% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance 10ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-10-vitamin-c-face-serum-for-skin-radiance-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
