(214, 'Caplino Vitamin C Serum 30ml and Breylee Vitamin C Face Cream 40g', '1', 0, 7, 68, '214', '214', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Caplino Vitamin C Serum 30ml\nThe antioxidant effect of vc can effectively relieve skin aging, desalt the sports on the face, improve the problem of rough and dark skin, and can scavenge free radicals. Vc has a powerful whitening effect. It can effectively inhibit the formation of melanin, shrink pores, inhibit sebum secretion, and promote collagen production. At the same time, it also has the effect of preventing and improving skin aging, which can improve dull skin and make the skin more fair, so as to achieve the effect of whitening and skin care and keep the skin white and tender.\n\nIngredients:\nAqua, butylene glycol, trehalose, corn gluten amino acids, beta-glucan, magnesium ascorbyl phosphate ( vitamin c ), morus alba root extract, portulaca oleracea extract, leontopodium alpinum extract, creatine, polyglutamic acid, sodium hyaluronate, xanthan gum. Cruelty-free, vegan.\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing your face take 3-5 drops in the palm of your hand and apply it to your hand and apply it to your face with your fingertips. Massage gently until absorption.We recommend applying the serum twice a day and night.\nStorage: keep it a cool and dry place, out of direct sunlight\nCautions: For sensitive skin, it is recommended to conduct an allergy test on the back of the ear before using the product.\n\nThis cream is a great addition to a skincare routine for anyone looking to brighten their complexion and combat early signs of aging.\n', 880.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 695.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Caplino Vitamin C Serum 30ml and Breylee Vitamin C Face Cream 40gPrice in BD', 'Caplino Vitamin C Serum 30ml and Breylee Vitamin C Face Cream 40g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'caplino-vitamin-c-serum-30ml-and-breylee-vitamin-c-face-cream-40g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(215, 'APLB PDRN 49.1% VItamin C Ampoule Serum', '1', 0, 7, 4, '215', '215', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The APLB PDRN 49.1% Vitamin C Ampoule Serum (40ml) is a potent skincare product designed to enhance skin elasticity, revitalize dullness, tighten pores, balance oil and moisture levels, and soothe sensitive skin. It contains 49.1% PDRN (Polydeoxyribonucleotide), Vitamin C, Niacinamide, and Centella Asiatica, which work together to provide deep hydration and rejuvenation for dry skin.\n\n\nKey Benefits:\nDeep Hydration: The serum replenishes moisture, addressing dryness and promoting a supple complexion.\nSkin Revitalization: Vitamin C and Niacinamide work synergistically to brighten the skin, reducing dullness and enhancing radiance.\nPore Tightening: Regular use helps to tighten pores, contributing to a smoother skin texture.\nOil-Water Balance: The formulation aids in maintaining the skin\'s natural oil and water balance, preventing excessive oiliness or dryness.\nSoothing Effect: Centella Asiatica extract soothes sensitive skin, reducing redness and irritation.\n\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Start with a clean face, ensuring all makeup and impurities are removed.\nApply: Dispense an appropriate amount of the serum onto your fingertips.\nMassage: Gently massage the serum into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use the serum twice daily, in the morning and evening, for optimal results.\nPrecautions:\nPerform a patch test before first use to check for any adverse reactions.\nAvoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation develops, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.', 850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB PDRN 49.1% VItamin C Ampoule SerumPrice in BD', 'APLB PDRN 49.1% VItamin C Ampoule Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-pdrn-491-vitamin-c-ampoule-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0,