(220, 'Yuderma Malarid De-Pigmentation Serum 40ml', '1', 0, 7, 50, '220', '220', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yuderma Malarid De-Pigmentation Serum (40ml) is a specialized skincare product designed to reduce hyperpigmentation, dark spots, and uneven skin tone. Formulated with active ingredients that target melanin production, this serum works to brighten the skin and restore a more even complexion.\nThis serum is ideal for those looking to address pigmentation issues and enhance their skin\'s brightness while maintaining hydration.', 2075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Yuderma Malarid De-Pigmentation Serum 40mlPrice in BD', 'Yuderma Malarid De-Pigmentation Serum 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yuderma-malarid-de-pigmentation-serum-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(221, 'Sadoer Snail Vitamin C Moisturizing Essence Serum 15ml', '1', 0, 7, 29, '221', '221', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Sadoer Snail Vitamin C Moisturizing Essence Serum (15ml) is formulated to hydrate and revitalize the skin, combining the regenerative properties of snail secretion filtrate with the brightening effects of Vitamin C.\n\nKey Benefits:\nDeep Hydration: Provides essential moisture to the skin, improving texture and elasticity.\nSkin Regeneration: Snail secretion filtrate supports skin repair and regeneration, promoting a smoother complexion.\nBrightening: Vitamin C helps to lighten dark spots and even out skin tone, enhancing overall radiance.\n\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Begin with a clean face, ensuring all makeup and impurities are removed.\nApply: Dispense a few drops of the serum onto your fingertips.\nMassage: Gently massage the serum into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use the serum twice daily, in the morning and evening, for optimal results.\n\nPrecautions:\nPerform a patch test before first use to check for any adverse reactions.\nAvoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation develops, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.', 185.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 165.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sadoer Snail Vitamin C Moisturizing Essence Serum 15mlPrice in BD', 'Sadoer Snail Vitamin C Moisturizing Essence Serum 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sadoer-snail-vitamin-c-moisturizing-essence-serum-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(222, 'Lilac Vitamin C 10% Facial Serum', '1', 0, 7, 98, '222', '222', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lilac Vitamin C Serum is prepared to provide your skin with the best protection from environmental stressors. This lilac serum is enriched with Vitamin C and Hyaluronic Acid. Vit-C & HA individually are two of the key skin-repairing ingredients. But when partnered together, they create the most powerful skincare product that helps you get visibly bright, hydrated, and younger-looking skin.\n\n', 783.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 167.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lilac Vitamin C 10% Facial SerumPrice in BD', 'Lilac Vitamin C 10% Facial Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lilac-vitamin-c-10-facial-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(223, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Serum with Niacinamide, Vitamin C % Hyaluronic Acid 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 8, '223', '223', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Serum is a lightweight, fast-absorbing essence formulated to target dullness, uneven tone, and dehydration. Enriched with sakura extract and boosted by niacinamide, vitamin C, and hyaluronic acid, this serum delivers a powerful blend of antioxidants and moisture to rejuvenate the skin. Suitable for all skin types, it’s ideal for daily use to maintain a radiant and healthy complexion.\n\nKey Features\n\nHow to Use\n\nWhy Choose This Product\nThis serum combines traditional Japanese cherry blossom extract with clinically proven skincare actives, making it a versatile solution for multiple skin concerns. Whether you\'re looking to brighten dull skin, reduce pigmentation, or boost hydration, Laikou Sakura Serum offers a balanced approach with visible benefits over time.\n\nBenefits', 320.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 230.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Serum with Niacinamide, Vitamin C % Hyaluronic Acid 30mlPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Serum with Niacinamide, Vitamin C % Hyaluronic Acid 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-serum-with-niacinamide-vitamin-c-hyaluronic-acid-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(224, 'Cos De BAHA VM Vitamin C MSM Serum', '1', 0, 7, 36, '224', '224', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Cos De BAHA VM Vitamin C MSM Serum (30ml) is a Korean skincare product designed to target signs of aging, improve skin tone, and enhance hydration. Here\'s a comprehensive overview:​\nBrightens and Evens Skin Tone: Contains Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate (a stable form of Vitamin C) to reduce dark spots and promote a radiant complexion.​\nEnhances Skin Elasticity: MSM (Dimethyl Sulfone), known as \"Nature\'s Beauty Mineral,\" supports collagen production, improving skin firmness and reducing fine lines.​\nDeep Hydration: Enriched with Botanical Hyaluronic Acid and Vitamin E, it provides lasting moisture and antioxidant protection.\nSoothes and Calms: Aloe Vera Leaf Extract and Allantoin help soothe irritated skin, making it suitable for sensitive skin types.\nAddresses Skin Concerns: Formulated to assist with conditions like acne, eczema, and rosacea, promoting clearer and healthier skin.​\nSodium Ascorbyl Phosphate: A stable Vitamin C derivative that brightens and protects the skin.​\nMSM (Dimethyl Sulfone): Supports collagen synthesis and has anti-inflammatory properties.​\nBotanical Hyaluronic Acid: Provides deep hydration and plumps the skin.​\nVitamin E (Tocopheryl Acetate): An antioxidant that protects against environmental stressors.​\nFerulic Acid: Enhances the stability and efficacy of Vitamins C and E.​\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract: Soothes and moisturizes the skin.​\nAdditional Extracts: Includes Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea), Sambucus Nigra (Elderflower), Momordica Charantia (Bitter Melon), and Leontopodium Alpinum (Edelweiss) for added antioxidant benefits.​\nCleanse: Start with a clean face.​\nApply: Dispense 2-3 drops of the serum onto your fingertips.​\nMassage: Gently massage into the face and neck until fully absorbed.​\nMoisturize: Follow with your regular moisturizer.\nSun Protection: If used in the morning, apply sunscreen as the final step.​', 1040.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 460.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA VM Vitamin C MSM SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA VM Vitamin C MSM Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-vm-vitamin-c-msm-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(225, 'Babe Multi Renewal Night Peeling Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 99, '225', '225', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Babe Healthy Aging Multi Renewal Night Peeling Serum prevents and corrects wrinkles, repairing the damage caused by the exposome, evening out the complexion and giving the skin a more youthful appearance.\nCharacteristics:\nDirections for use:\nApply 1-2 times a week until the skin gets used to it, daily use according to skin tolerance. Apply 3-4 drops at night to clean, dry skin of the face, neck and décolleté, massaging until absorbed.', 3797.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 103.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Babe Multi Renewal Night Peeling Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Babe Multi Renewal Night Peeling Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'babe-multi-renewal-night-peeling-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
