(231, 'Plum 10% Niacinamide Face Serum with Rice Water', '1', 0, 7, 101, '231', '231', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skin with Plum 10% Niacinamide Face Serum, a powerhouse formula designed to target blemishes and enhance skin clarity. Infused with the goodness of rice water, it hydrates while brightening your complexion, leaving it smooth and radiant. Niacinamide works to control excess oil, minimizing the appearance of pores and acne marks. Lightweight and quick-absorbing, this serum seamlessly fits into your daily routine. Reveal a balanced, glowing complexion with this gentle yet effective solution!Benefits:\nIngredients:Aqua, Niacinamide, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Isodecyl Neopentanoate, Squalane, Sorbitol, Pentylene Glycol, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake), Butylene Glycol, Rosa Damascena (Rose) Flower Water, Caffeine, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Glycerin, Acrylates Copolymer, VP/Polycarbamyl Polyglycol Ester, Hydrolyzed Sesame Protein PG-Propyl Methylsilanediol, Benzyl Alcohol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexyl Olivate, Sodium Acrylates Copolymer, Polyglyceryl-4 Olivate, Cyclodextrin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Gluconate', 1470.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 630.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Plum 10% Niacinamide Face Serum with Rice WaterPrice in BD', 'Plum 10% Niacinamide Face Serum with Rice Water Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'plum-10-niacinamide-face-serum-with-rice-water', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02');
