(232, 'Celimax The Vita A Retinol Shot Tightening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 102, '232', '232', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Celimax The Vita A Retinol Shot Tightening Serum is a potent anti-aging serum formulated with 0.1% pure retinol and a 9-peptide complex to address signs of aging such as wrinkles, fine lines, and loss of skin elasticity. Enhanced with A-Shot™ technology, this serum delivers active ingredients deep into the skin, promoting smoother, firmer, and more youthful-looking skin.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\n0.1% Pure Retinol: A potent form of Vitamin A that accelerates cell turnover, reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and improves skin texture.\n9-Peptide Complex: A blend of peptides that work synergistically to enhance skin elasticity, support collagen production, and promote a firmer, more lifted appearance.\nA-Shot™ Technology: Utilizes micro-particle delivery to enhance the absorption of active ingredients, ensuring deeper penetration and minimizing irritation.\n1% Panthenol (Vitamin B5): Provides deep hydration, soothes the skin, and supports the skin barrier.\nAntioxidants (Vitamin E & Carrot Root Extract): Protect the skin from environmental stressors and free radicals, promoting a healthy and radiant complexion.\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply a small amount of the serum to the face and neck.\nGently massage into the skin until fully absorbed.\nUse in the evening, 2–3 times a week, gradually increasing frequency as tolerated.\nAlways follow with a broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day.\nWhy You\'ll Love It:\nClinically proven to improve the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines.\nEnhances skin density for a firmer, more youthful look.\nSuitable for most skin types, including those concerned with signs of aging.\nDermatologist-tested and free from parabens and sulfates.\nIngredients: Water, Methylpropanediol, Glycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Panthenol, Polypropylsilsesquioxane, C14-22 Alcohols, Glyceryl Stearates, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Hydrolyzed Sponge, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tocopherol, Retinol (0.1%), Allantoin, Arginine, Undecane, Xanthan Gum, Ethylhexylglycerin, C12-20 Alkyl Glucoside, Lauryl Glucoside, Polyglyceryl-6 Laurate, Adenosine, Tridecane, Disodium EDTA, Daucus Carota Sativa (Carrot) Root Extract, Myristyl Glucoside, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Pvm/Ma Copolymer, Butylene Glycol, Beta-Carotene, Glucose, Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Nonapeptide-1, Hexapeptide-9, Dipeptide-2, Copper Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-5, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4.Made in Korea | Celimax US', 1485.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 865.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Celimax The Vita A Retinol Shot Tightening Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Celimax The Vita A Retinol Shot Tightening Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'celimax-the-vita-a-retinol-shot-tightening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(233, 'Melao Glutathione Whitening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 30, '233', '233', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reveal a brighter, more radiant complexion with Melao Glutathione Whitening Serum. Powered by Glutathione, a potent antioxidant known for its skin-brightening properties, this serum helps to even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of dark spots, and improve overall skin clarity.\nInfused with hydrating and nourishing ingredients, it supports skin renewal while protecting against environmental stressors, leaving your skin smooth, luminous, and visibly healthier.\nKey Benefits:\nBrightens dull and uneven skin tone\nHelps fade dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and discoloration\nBoosts antioxidant protection for healthier skin\nPromotes a clear, luminous complexion\nHydrates and nourishes for smoother texture\nSuitable for: All skin types\nUsage: After cleansing and toning, apply a few drops to the face and gently pat until fully absorbed. Use daily, morning and night, for best results. Always follow with sunscreen during the day.', 400.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao Glutathione Whitening Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Melao Glutathione Whitening Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-glutathione-whitening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(234, 'Novawhite-C Serum', '1', 0, 7, 50, '234', '234', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Novawhite C - Vitamin C Serum | Highly Absorbing Vitamin C, WithVitamin E, Hyaluronic Acid, Argireline Peptides, Niacinamide &Aloevera | 30ml (30 ml). Anti-aging and brightening formula. Washface and neck with mild cleanser/ facewash and pat dry. Dispensea pea-sized amount of the serum on to your palm. Apply on faceand neck in upward circular movements. Go from inside of yourface towards the hairline and from neck to jaw and upwards. Dothis for a minute to allow the serum to get absorbed into theskin. Use this twice daily.', 1677.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Novawhite-C SerumPrice in BD', 'Novawhite-C Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'novawhite-c-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(235, 'Precious Skin Thailand Miracle Anti-Melasma & Brightening Facial Serum for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 7, 103, '235', '235', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This Miracle Anti-Melasma Serum comes with natural ingredients that make it safe for all skin types. It can prevent hyperpigmentation, dark spots, and melasma. It deeply clears and moisturizes your skin. The nourishing serum gives you a glossy and bright skin tone. It gives you radiant skin by reducing melasma. It incredibly eliminates freckles and makes your skin shiny and consistent. This serum quickly absorbs the skin to nourish and moisturize the skin intensely.', 638.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 487.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Precious Skin Thailand Miracle Anti-Melasma & Brightening Facial Serum for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Precious Skin Thailand Miracle Anti-Melasma & Brightening Facial Serum for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'precious-skin-thailand-miracle-anti-melasma-brightening-facial-serum-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(236, 'The Derma Co 20% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance', '1', 0, 7, 33, '236', '236', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1485.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 515.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 20% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin RadiancePrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 20% Vitamin C Face Serum for Skin Radiance Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-20-vitamin-c-face-serum-for-skin-radiance', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(237, 'Cosrx Advanced Snail Radiance Dual Essence', '1', 0, 7, 31, '237', '237', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'High-efficacy snail essence mixes with the radiance essence upon pumping to create a combination of plumping and brightening care.\nBenefits:\n• Plumps• Brightens• Hydrates• Non-sticky, Refreshing Finish\nTargets:\n• Dry & rough skin• Dull & tired skin• Multiple skin concerns• Sensitive skin in need of effective skincare\nIngredients:\n• 74.3% Triple Snail Complex  :A complex that combines the existing hydrating and plumping effects of snail secretion filtrate and fortifies it with the anti-aging, pore contracting benefits of Black Snails and the anti-bacterial, antioxidant and UV protection effects of Gold Snails and more\n• 5% niacinamide :brightening the skin for simultaneous plumping & radiance care, strengthening skin\'s barrier\n• Glutathione :Improving skin tone and skin complexion\nSnail Secretion Filtrate, Butylene Glycol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Betaine, Panthenol, Water, Glycerin, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Allantoin, Carbomer, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Sodium Polyacrylate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Inulin Lauryl Carbamate, Arginine, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Surfactin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glutathione\nHo to use:\nPump an appropriate amount, mix the two essences, and apply gently on the face. Gently tap it into skin for better absorption.\nProduct Details:', 2496.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1204.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Advanced Snail Radiance Dual EssencePrice in BD', 'Cosrx Advanced Snail Radiance Dual Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-advanced-snail-radiance-dual-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(238, 'Mamaearth Rice Water Dewy Active Serum for Glass Skin 50ml', '1', 0, 7, 3, '238', '238', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'GIVES GLASS SKIN GLOW: Glass skin glow incoming! With the natural goodness of 98%* Pure Rice Water, this serum brightens the skin, resulting in glass-like glowing skin.\nHYDRATES & LEAVES DEWY FINISH: Dive straight into dewy hydration. Rice Water Dewy Active Serum with Rice Water & Hyaluronic Acid intensely hydrates your skin & lends a natural dewy finish.\nREDUCES AGE SPOTS & EVENS SKIN TONE: Powered with 10% Niacinamide, the Rice Water Dewy Active Serum targets age spots and pigmentation, resulting in even-toned skin.\nMADE SAFE CERTIFIED: Ditch the toxins! Rice Water Dewy Active Serum is infused with natural goodness & is Made Safe Certified, making it suitable for all skin types.', 660.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Rice Water Dewy Active Serum for Glass Skin 50mlPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Rice Water Dewy Active Serum for Glass Skin 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-rice-water-dewy-active-serum-for-glass-skin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(239, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care BioBright Skin Lightening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 104, '239', '239', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care BioBright Skin Lightening Serum (30ml)\nDescription:Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care BioBright Skin Lightening Serum is a powerful, yet gentle, organic serum designed to brighten the skin, reduce hyperpigmentation, and promote an even skin tone. Formulated with natural and medical-grade ingredients, this serum targets dark spots, sun damage, and uneven skin tone while hydrating and nourishing the skin. It is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin, and is free from harmful chemicals, parabens, and synthetic fragrances.\nKey Benefits:\nSkin Brightening: Reduces the appearance of dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone for a radiant complexion.\nHydration: Provides deep moisture to keep the skin soft, smooth, and supple.\nAntioxidant Protection: Protects the skin from free radicals and environmental stressors.\nOrganic Ingredients: Made with natural, organic components that are gentle yet effective.\nLightweight Formula: Absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy residue.\nIdeal For:\nIndividuals looking to brighten their skin and reduce dark spots or hyperpigmentation.\nThose seeking a natural solution for achieving a more even skin tone.\nAnyone wanting a lightweight, hydrating serum that works for all skin types.\nHow to Use:Apply a few drops of the BioBright Skin Lightening Serum to clean, dry skin in the morning and/or evening. Gently massage into the face and neck using upward circular motions until fully absorbed. Follow with your favorite moisturizer. For best results, use daily as part of your skincare routine.\nVolume: 30ml\nCertifications:\nOrganic\nDermatologically Tested\nFree from Parabens, Sulfates, and Synthetic Fragrances\nIngredients:A blend of organic and skin-brightening ingredients such as:\nVitamin C\nLicorice Root Extract\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3)\nHyaluronic Acid\nAloe Vera\nWhy Choose Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care?Biomd is committed to providing high-quality, organic skincare solutions that are both effective and safe. Their products are carefully formulated to ensure your skin receives the best natural ingredients for optimal health and radiance.\nPerfect for those who prioritize clean beauty and want to achieve a brighter, more even skin tone naturally.', 2578.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 47.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care BioBright Skin Lightening Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care BioBright Skin Lightening Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biomd-organic-medical-skin-care-biobright-skin-lightening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(240, 'Kozicare Skin Lightening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 105, '240', '240', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Advanced Skin Brightening & Anti-Pigmentation Care\nKozicare Skin Lightening Serum is an advanced formulation designed to deeply penetrate the skin to effectively reduce dark spots, scars, hyperpigmentation, and discoloration, while enhancing overall brightness and tone. Enriched with powerful Kojic Acid and Glutathione, this serum helps in whitening, smoothing fine lines, and improving skin clarity and texture.\nLightens dark spots, acne scars, and pigmentation\nEvens out skin tone and improves complexion brightness\nHelps reduce the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines\nPromotes smoother, healthier-looking skin\nFormulated with premium, skin-safe ingredients, Kozicare Serum is non-irritating and free from harsh chemicals—making it suitable for daily use on all skin types, including sensitive skin.No known side effects.\nFace – can be applied generously on all areas of the face\nIdeal for individuals seeking even skin tone, glow, and blemish reduction\nApply a few drops of Kozicare Skin Lightening Serum to clean, dry skin. Massage gently in upward motions until fully absorbed. Use morning and night for best results. Follow with a moisturizer or sunscreen as needed.', 748.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 102.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Kozicare Skin Lightening Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Kozicare Skin Lightening Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'kozicare-skin-lightening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(241, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Booster Serum', '1', 0, 7, 11, '241', '241', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Details:\nBoots Vitamin C Brightening Booster Serum\nBoost the skin to look clear, soft, smooth, pores look smaller. Reveals brighter, brighter skinFace and neck care products\nBooster serum, vegan formula, absorbs quickly, nourishes deep into the skin layer with vitamin C and YUZU orange extract.\nSuitable for all skin types\n\nHow to use:Apply serum over face and neck after cleansing, morning and night. for better results\n\nWarning:1. Do not use on irritated or wounded skin. Discontinue use if rash occurs.2. Be careful not to get into your eyes. If the product gets into your eyes Should be rinsed with clean water immediately.3. Do not eat Keep out of reach of children.4. Keep away from heat and sunlight.\n\nIngredients:Aqua (Water), Glycerin, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Propylene Glycol, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Ascorbyl Tetraisopalmitate, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Benzoate, Xanthan Gum, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Neopentyl Glycol. Diheptanoate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Butylene Glycol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Parfum (Fragrance), Dipropylene Glycol, Limonene, Citrus Junos (Yuzu) Fruit Extract, CI 15985 (Yellow 6), CI 19140 (Yellow 5), CI 42090 ( Blue 1).', 950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Booster SerumPrice in BD', 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Booster Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-vitamin-c-brightening-booster-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(242, 'Medicube Glutathione Glow Serum 30g', '1', 0, 7, 96, '242', '242', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fade blemishes, spots, and pigmentation while filling your skin with radiance. This serum is designed to visibly lift crow\'s feet, smile lines, and forehead wrinkles, leaving your skin looking voluminous and youthful.\nFormulated with Active Glow-zom Technology with Glutathione (50,000ppm), Niacinamide, Adenosine, Patented Skin-like Collagen, and Bifida Fermentation Lysate. This potent combination enhances the skin\'s natural glow, addressing blemishes, spots, and pigmentation.\nSuitable for all skin types.\nMade in Korea\nHow to use:\nApply appropriate amount gently along skin texture after washing your face and pat lightly for absorption.\nIngredients:\nWater, Glycerin, PEG-8, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, Methylpropanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Betaine, Glycereth-26,m Bis-PEG-18 Methyl Ether Dimethyl Silane, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Methyl Gluceth-20, Panthenol, Squalane, Glucosylrutin, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Carbomer, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Tromethamine, Xanthan Gum, Propanediol, Flavor, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glutathione(500ppm), Adenosine, Ceramide NP, Sodium Phytate, Benzyl Glycol, Hydrolyzed Glycosaminoglycans, Sodium Hyaluronate, Dextrin, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Extract, Beta-Glucan, Cyanocobalamin, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Tocopherol, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Soluble Collagen, Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate.\nDisclaimer: Ingredients and packaging are subject to change at Manufacturer\'s discretion. For the most complete and up-to-date list of ingredients and packaging, please refer to the actual product.', 1518.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 932.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube Glutathione Glow Serum 30gPrice in BD', 'Medicube Glutathione Glow Serum 30g P