(244, 'Bionnex Whitening Night Repair Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 7, 107, '244', '244', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Transform your skin overnight with Arogga!\nThe Bionnex Whitening Night Repair Serum is a powerful skincare solution designed to rejuvenate and brighten your skin while you sleep. Enriched with advanced whitening and repairing ingredients, this serum helps to reduce dark spots, even out skin tone, and promote a radiant complexion. Perfect for all skin types, it’s your go-to product for achieving flawless, glowing skin.\nWhitening Action:\nReduces the appearance of dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone.\nPromotes a brighter, more radiant complexion.\nNight Repair Formula:\nWorks overnight to repair and rejuvenate your skin, enhancing its natural glow.\nHydrating and Nourishing:\nInfused with moisturizing ingredients to keep your skin hydrated and supple.\nLightweight and Fast-Absorbing:\nThe serum is lightweight and absorbs quickly, leaving no greasy residue.\nSuitable for All Skin Types:\nGentle enough for daily use and effective for sensitive skin.\nAnti-Aging Benefits:\nHelps to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, promoting youthful-looking skin.\nCleanse your face thoroughly before application.\nApply a small amount of serum to your face and neck, gently massaging it into the skin.\nUse every night as part of your skincare routine.\nFollow up with a moisturizer for best results.\nBrightens Skin: Reduces dark spots and evens out skin tone.\nRepairs and Rejuvenates: Works overnight to repair damaged skin.\nHydrates: Keeps your skin moisturized and supple.\nAnti-Aging: Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nLightweight: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue.\nAdvanced Formula: Combines whitening and repairing ingredients for maximum effectiveness.\nOvernight Results: Works while you sleep to rejuvenate your skin.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle and effective for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nVisible Results: Promotes a brighter, more even complexion with regular use.\n1 x Bionnex Whitening Night Repair Serum 30ml\nThe Bionnex Whitening Night Repair Serum is your ultimate solution for achieving a radiant, even-toned complexion. Whether you\'re targeting dark spots, uneven skin tone, or signs of aging, this serum delivers visible results with regular use.\nOrder now from Arogga and wake up to glowing skin every morning! ✨\n🔗 Order Now: https://www.arogga.com', 3446.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 4.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionnex Whitening Night Repair Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Bionnex Whitening Night Repair Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionnex-whitening-night-repair-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(245, 'Purito Pure Vitamin C Serum 60ml', '1', 0, 7, 83, '245', '245', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purito Pure Vitamin C Serum 60ml (Korea)\nPurito Pure Vitamin C Serum is a gentle yet effective brightening serum formulated with 5% Ascorbic Acid to help improve uneven skin tone, dullness, and early signs of aging. Designed for all skin types, this lightweight serum helps reduce the appearance of sun damage and hyperpigmentation while enhancing skin radiance and firmness. Reformulated with stabilizing natural agents and packed in a dark brown bottle, it ensures better protection against oxidation for optimal efficacy.\n\nWhat is it:A daily-use vitamin C serum that brightens complexion, boosts skin vitality, and supports healthier-looking skin with improved tone and texture.\n\nKey Features:\nContains 5% pure Ascorbic Acid for visible brightening\nHelps reduce hyperpigmentation and sun damage\nImproved formula with enhanced stability against oxidation\nDark brown bottle protects serum from sunlight\nSuitable for all skin types\n\nBenefits:\nBrightens dull skin and evens skin tone\nHelps fade dark spots and discoloration\nImproves skin firmness and overall radiance\nSupports healthier, smoother-looking skin\nEnhances glow without heaviness\n\nUsage:After cleansing, apply 1–2 pumps onto clean hands. Gently spread over face and neck and pat for better absorption. For sensitive skin, start with a smaller amount and gradually increase usage. Follow with moisturizer and apply sunscreen during daytime use. Avoid using together with AHA, BHA, or Retinol.\n\nIngredients:Sodium Hyaluronate Liquid (84%), Ascorbic Acid (10%), 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Arginine, Human Oligopeptide-1, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Nelumbium Speciosum Flower Extract, Magnolia Liliflora Bud Extract, Lilium Tigrinum Extract, Paeonia Albiflora Root Extract, Tuber Magnatum Extract, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract, Red Ginseng Extract, Sodium Polyacrylate, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA\n\nSize: 60mlSkin Type: All Skin TypesCountry of Origin: KoreaPackagings can be a little different due to editions.', 1699.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 801.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Pure Vitamin C Serum 60mlPrice in BD', 'Purito Pure Vitamin C Serum 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-pure-vitamin-c-serum-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(246, 'Grace Day Miracle Snail All in One Ampoule', '1', 0, 12, 108, '246', '246', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Serum with snail mucin for the skin of the face & neck contains a unique complex of natural ingredients that help restore skin hydration and elasticity.\nSnail mucin stimulates skin cell regeneration, improves its structure and reduces signs of aging. Pearl extract is rich in amino acids and microelements that nourish and strengthen the skin.\nNiacinamide protects the skin from the effects of free radicals, prevents the appearance of wrinkles, and also reduces the depth of existing ones.\nSuitable for skin with age-related changes.\nDirections for use : apply the serum to previously cleansed, toned skin. Allow to absorb. If necessary, cover with cream, emulsion or night mask.', 950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 825.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Grace Day Miracle Snail All in One AmpoulePrice in BD', 'Grace Day Miracle Snail All in One Ampoule Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'grace-day-miracle-snail-all-in-one-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(247, 'Kissera 24k Gold Lifting Essence Prestige Edition', '1', 0, 12, 109, '247', '247', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kissera 24k Gold Lifting Essence Prestige Edition\n-Contains various moisturizing ingredients to moisturize dry skin,-Allowing you to feel pure skin itself.-This essence is an essence that contains adenosine to help-Improve wrinkles on skin that has become dry due to the external-Environment, and gold ingredients soothe skin tired from harmful-Environments and help purify the skin.\nHow to use\nAfter cleansing the skin, take an appropriate amount and lightly spread it along the skin texture from the center of the face outwards.\n', 1080.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 920.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Kissera 24k Gold Lifting Essence Prestige EditionPrice in BD', 'Kissera 24k Gold Lifting Essence Prestige Edition Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'kissera-24k-gold-lifting-essence-prestige-edition', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(248, 'Caplino 1% Retinol Serum Fine Lines Faded, Spots Gone & Youth Retored', '1', 0, 12, 68, '248', '248', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Caplino 1% Retinol Serum is a dermatologically tested, high-performance formula designed to fade fine lines, reduce dark spots, and restore youthful skin. Powered by Retinol (1%) and Niacinamide (3%), this serum boosts collagen production, accelerates cell turnover, and refines skin texture for a radiant and even complexion.\n✔ 1% Retinol – Stimulates collagen production and reduces signs of aging.✔ 3% Niacinamide – Minimizes pores and evens out skin tone.✔ Hyaluronic Acid & Squalane – Deep hydration for smooth and plump skin.✔ Fades Wrinkles & Fine Lines – Promotes firmer, youthful-looking skin.✔ Brightens & Repairs – Reduces dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and blemishes.✔ Non-Greasy & Fast Absorbing – Lightweight formula perfect for daily use.✔ Suitable for All Skin Types – Especially beneficial for acne-prone & aging skin.✔ Vegan, Cruelty-Free & Fragrance-Free\n🔹 After cleansing, take 3-5 drops in your palm.🔹 Apply to your face using fingertips and massage gently until absorbed.🔹 Use twice a day (morning & night) for best results.🔹 Apply sunscreen in the morning for enhanced protection.\nVegan & Cruelty-Free | Dermatologically Tested | Paraben-Free | Fragrance-Free\n⚠ Patch test before use.⚠ Avoid direct contact with eyes.⚠ If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.\nAqua (Water), Retinol (1%), Squalane, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, Niacinamide (3%), Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Di-C12-13 Alkyl Malate, Panthenol (Vitamin B5), Allantoin, Hyaluronic Acid (Sodium Hyaluronate), Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Vegan, Cruelty-Free, Fragrance-Free.', 665.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 285.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Caplino 1% Retinol Serum Fine Lines Faded, Spots Gone & Youth RetoredPrice in BD', 'Caplino 1% Retinol Serum Fine Lines Faded, Spots Gone & Youth Retored Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'caplino-1-retinol-serum-fine-lines-faded-spots-gone-youth-retored', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(249, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift 0.3% Pure Retinol Night Serum', '1', 0, 12, 110, '249', '249', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nFor external use only.\n\n\n909141 51 - INGREDIENTS: AQUA / WATER • GLYCERIN • ALCOHOL DENAT. • ISONONYL ISONONANOATE • PENTYLENE GLYCOL • DICAPRYLYL ETHER • GLYCINE SOJA OIL / SOYBEAN OIL • PROPYLENE GLYCOL • PEG-6 CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC GLYCERIDES • CITRIC ACID • PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE • SODIUM HYALURONATE • TRISODIUM ETHYLENEDIAMINE DISUCCINATE • RETINOL • DICAPRYLYL CARBONATE • AMMONIUM POLYACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE • BUTYLENE GLYCOL • CAPRYLYL GLYCOL • GLYCERYL ISOSTEARATE • PPG-6-DECYLTETRADECETH-30 • TOCOPHEROL • XANTHAN GUM • BENZYL ALCOHOL • CITRONELLOL • ISOEUGENOL • LIMONENE • LINALOOL • PHENOXYETHANOL • PARFUM / FRAGRANCE. (F.I.L. B264237/1).\nBecause You\'re Worth it.\nPure Retinol Night Serum is a powerful solution to visibly reduce the appearance of even deep wrinkles. Our highest concentration of pure Retinol, delivers 3X more pure Retinol to the skin. So effective, 70% of women saw a reduction in the appearance of deep wrinkles*. This anti-wrinkle serum contains a naturally sourced trio of caring ingredients for maximum efficacy with exceptional comfort. *Legal super: 80 Pure Retinol Night Serum users agree.', 4930.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1370.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift 0.3% Pure Retinol Night SerumPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift 0.3% Pure Retinol Night Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-03-pure-retinol-night-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
