(251, 'Boots Vitamin C Advanced Plus Anti-Wrinkle Booster Serum', '1', 0, 12, 11, '251', '251', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots Vitamin C Advanced Plus Anti-Wrinkle Booster Serum\nWe\'ve lovingly formulated Boots vitamin C ADVANCED PLUS anti-wrinkle boosterserum with 15% pure Vitamin C* and 2x Hyaluronic Acid\" enriched with anti-oxidantsto help promote radiant skin and effectively reduce the appearance of wrinkles andsigns of aging effectively. Wrinkles look less visible and skin? appears to be visiblyglowing. Paraben-free. Suitable of all skin types.\nHere\'s how to use: Perform a patch test before use, apply a small quantity of producton the cleaned skin on the upper forearm, test for 24 hours prior to use. If you developany irritation during or after the test, r?nse off and do not use the product. After cleansing,apply 3-4 drops with your finger tips onto your face.Use once per day (AM or PM) avoiding eye and lip area.For best results, we recommend following with Bootsvitamin C ADVANCED PLUS serum and day or night cream.\nWARNINGS: May cause a tingling sensation. Do not apply to irritated or brokenskin.Avoid contact with the eyes. If product gets into the eyes rinse well with waterimmediately. If this becomes uncomfortable or irritation occurs, wash your skinthoroughly and discontinue to use. Patch test for 24 hours prior to use. Do not usethe product if any irritation is observed during or after the test.This is not a food.Keep out of reach of children.\nPRECAUTIONS: Keep product in cool dry place and avoid direct sunlight.', 1010.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 940.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Vitamin C Advanced Plus Anti-Wrinkle Booster SerumPrice in BD', 'Boots Vitamin C Advanced Plus Anti-Wrinkle Booster Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-vitamin-c-advanced-plus-anti-wrinkle-booster-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-