(253, 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Serum with Retinol Liposome 2% + Black Ginseng', '1', 0, 12, 113, '253', '253', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The anti-aging serum is enriched with 2% retinal liposome to combat wrinkles and pigmentation, as well as 58% black ginseng extract for antioxidant, anti-inflammatory and collagen-boosting properties. Perfect for mature skin, this serum helps reduce signs of aging and improve skin elasticity.\nUsage:\nIngredients:Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Water, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Caprylic/ Capric Triglyceride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, Methyl Gluceth-20, Polyglyce- ryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Sorbitan Stearate, Ammonium Acryloyl- dimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Betaine, Tocopherol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Helian- thus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Cholesterol, Polyglyceryl-10 Oleate, Brassica Campestris (Rapeseed) Sterols, Phytosteryl/Behenyl/Octyldodecyl Lauroyl Glutamate, Retinal, Silica, Aluminum/Magnesium Hydroxide Stearate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhy- drocinnamate, Arctium Lappa Root Extract, Cnidium Officinale Root Extract, Dioscorea Japonica Root Extract, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Rehmannia Chinensis Root Extract, 3-0-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Bakuchiol, SH-Oligopep- tide-1, SH-Oligopeptide-2, SH-Polypeptide-1\nMade in Korea', 1599.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 701.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Serum with Retinol Liposome 2% + Black GinsengPrice in BD', 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Serum with Retinol Liposome 2% + Black Ginseng Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'k-secret-seoul-1988-serum-with-retinol-liposome-2-black-ginseng', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(254, 'Loreal Paris Age Perfect Dark Spot Corrector Serum with Peony Native Cells and Niacinamide For Mature Skin', '1', 0, 12, 110, '254', '254', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Loreal Paris Age Perfect Dark Spot Corrector Serum with Peony Native Cells and Niacinamide For Mature Skin\nDiscover the secret to radiant, spot-free skin with the revolutionary Age Perfect Fast Action Anti-Spot Corrector Serum.\nPowered by the fusion of two powerful ingredients: Native peony cells and niacinamide, this advanced serum from L\'Oréal Paris has been designed specifically for mature skin and can be applied to the face, neck and hands.\nBenefits:\nProven to be 39%* effective in reducing age spots, this serum offers fast action that will transform the appearance of your skin.\nNative peony cells, known for their ability to brighten and revitalize skin, are combined with niacinamide, renowned for their ability to combat dark spots, creating a unique, pearlescent formula for your skin.\n*Clinical analysis of persistent dark spots - 48 women.\n', 2964.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2236.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Age Perfect Dark Spot Corrector Serum with Peony Native Cells and Niacinamide For Mature SkinPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Age Perfect Dark Spot Corrector Serum with Peony Native Cells and Niacinamide For Mature Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-age-perfect-dark-spot-corrector-serum-with-peony-native-cells-and-niacinamide-for-mature-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
