(258, 'Fixderma Anti Ageing Face Serum with Hyaluronic Acid Serum & Pro Retinol', '1', 0, 12, 116, '258', '258', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Why is it Different?Our anti-aging serum is formulated with scientifically proven ingredients that help to reduce the signs of aging. The serum contains powerful antioxidants which protect the skin from damage caused by free radicals. It also includes hyaluronic acid, and pro retinol which hydrates and firms the skin, reduces signs of aging, improves skin texture, and increases elasticity. Additionally, it contains peptides, which can help to stimulate collagen production, a protein that provides structure and firmness to the skin. Recommended and tested by dermatologists, this Anti-Ageing Face Serum is clinically proven to reduce aging signs.\nBacked by ScienceFixderma’s Anti-Ageing Face Serum has undergone rigorous testing to ensure its efficacy and safety. Typically, this involves conducting clinical trials or studies on the product\'s ingredients to determine their effectiveness in addressing specific skin concerns, such as reducing fine lines and wrinkles or improving skin texture and tone. The formulation has been carefully researched and tested to ensure it is safe to use on the skin and on all skin types.\nWe have used high-quality ingredients such as hyaluronic acid, peptides, and pro-retinol, that have been shown to improve skin health and appearance. These ingredients work together to hydrate the skin, boost collagen production, and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles and are known to be safe for topical use and have been tested for any potential adverse reactions. These active ingredients are effective in reducing the signs of aging on the skin.\nThe ingredients have been carefully selected based on their ability to promote collagen production, reduce fine lines and wrinkles, and improve skin texture and tone. Our serum has undergone rigorous clinical testing to demonstrate its effectiveness in reducing the signs of aging on the skin. These clinical trials have been conducted using objective measures, such as skin elasticity and wrinkle depth, to provide scientific evidence of the serum\'s efficacy.\nDirections for Use-Apply 2-3 drops of serum evenly on clean skin with fingertips and let it sink into the skin.-For best results use twice daily on the affected skin area.-Always follow with an SPF in the daytime.\nIngredientsAqua, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Propanediole, Water (Aqua) & Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 & Caprylyl Glycol, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Glyceryl Stearate Citrate, Phenoxyethanol & Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydrolysed Hyaluronic Acid, Cyamopsis Tetragonoloba (Guar) Gum, Bisabolol, Xathan Gum, Retinol & Polysorbate 20, Fragrance.\nHyaluronic Acid: Hyaluronic Acid is an agent which keeps collagen synthesis up. It also retains skin moisture. As body collagen declines the appearance of wrinkles and discoloration become more visible. It binds tremendous amounts of moisture to the skin, granting elasticity and suppleness.\nHyaluronic Acid is one of the Natural Moisturizing Factors (NMF) of the skin, which binds moisture to the skin & boosts elasticity & hydration of the skin. It is known to hold water molecules 1000 times its weight, which makes the skin look more supple, plump, and wrinkle-free.\nPro-Retinol:  Pro-retinol, also known as retinyl palmitate, is a form of vitamin A that is commonly found in anti-aging skincare products. It is a powerful antioxidant that can help to reduce the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and other signs of aging by promoting cell turnover and collagen production. It is also known for its ability to improve skin texture and tone, making it a popular ingredient in many anti-aging products.\nAdditionally, pro-retinol products should always be used in conjunction with broad-spectrum sunscreen to prevent sun damage and further signs of aging.\nPeptides: Peptides are short chains of amino acids that play a crucial role in many biological processes, including skin health. They have the ability to stimulate collagen production, which helps to improve skin firmness and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. They can also aid in skin hydration and improve skin elasticity, resulting in a more youthful and radiant complexion. Additionally, some peptides have antioxidant properties that can help protect the skin from environmental stressors and free radical damage. Overall, peptides are a valuable ingredient and can provide numerous benefits for maintaining healthy, youthful-looking skin.', 1352.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 698.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fixderma Anti Ageing Face Serum with Hyaluronic Acid Serum & Pro RetinolPrice in BD', 'Fixderma Anti Ageing Face Serum with Hyaluronic Acid Serum & Pro Retinol Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fixderma-anti-ageing-face-serum-with-hyaluronic-acid-serum-pro-retinol', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(259, 'W. Skin Laboratory Peptide Energy Ampoule Serum', '1', 0, 12, 92, '259', '259', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'W. Skin Laboratory Peptide Energy Ampoule Serum\nRevitalize and Rejuvenate Your Skin\nInfuse your skin with youthful energy using W. Skin Laboratory Peptide Energy Ampoule Serum. Packed with powerful peptides, this serum promotes elasticity, smooths fine lines, and restores your skin’s natural glow.\nKey Benefits:\nHow to Use:\nMade in Korea', 1250.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1050.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'W. Skin Laboratory Peptide Energy Ampoule SerumPrice in BD', 'W. Skin Laboratory Peptide Energy Ampoule Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'w-skin-laboratory-peptide-energy-ampoule-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02'),
(260, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury Gold Anti-Wrinkle Ampoule 100ml', '1', 0, 12, 114, '260', '260', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury Gold Anti-Wrinkle Ampoule (100ml) is a premium skincare product designed to target signs of aging, such as wrinkles and fine lines. The ampoule combines the benefits of collagen and gold to provide intense hydration, improve skin elasticity, and give the skin a luxurious glow.\nCleanse Your Face:\nApply Toner:\nDispense the Ampoule:\nApply the Ampoule:\nFollow with Moisturizer:\nUse Twice Daily:\nLayering (Optional):\nAnti-Aging Properties:\nLuxurious Glow:\nDeep Hydration:\nImproved Skin Texture:\nBrightening Effect:\nNourishment and Repair:\n3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury Gold Anti-Wrinkle Ampoule (100ml) is a luxurious, anti-aging skincare product that targets wrinkles, improves skin elasticity, and enhances skin radiance. Its key ingredients, collagen, and gold, work together to provide deep hydration, a youthful glow, and overall skin rejuvenation. Suitable for all genders, this ampoule is an excellent addition to any skincare routine for those looking to address signs of aging and achieve a more radiant complexion.', 1125.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury Gold Anti-Wrinkle Ampoule 100mlPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury Gold Anti-Wrinkle Ampoule 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-collagen-and-luxury-gold-anti-wrinkle-ampoule-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:02');
