(265, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Age Reversal Face Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 119, '265', '265', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Age Reversal Face Serum is a high-performance anti-aging solution formulated with 1.5% Rovisome Retinol. This patented ingredient encapsulates retinol in liposomes, ensuring deeper penetration and better absorption into the skin. Designed to rejuvenate and restore youthful radiance, this serum targets visible signs of aging while maintaining hydration.\n\n\nKey Features\n\n\nUsage\nApply 3 to 5 drops on clean, dry face and neck, avoiding the eye area. Allow the serum to absorb before applying moisturizer. Use at night only. Always apply sunscreen during the day to protect skin from UV damage.\n\nWhy Choose This Product\nUnlike standard retinol serums, The Remedist Age Reversal Serum uses advanced liposomal technology to deliver retinol more effectively into the skin. This ensures maximum anti-aging benefits with reduced irritation, making it suitable for those seeking visible improvements in skin tone, texture, and elasticity.\n\n\nBenefits', 2300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 190.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Age Reversal Face Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Age Reversal Face Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-remedist-by-dr-rhazes-age-reversal-face-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:02', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(266, 'Some By MI Retinol Intense Reactivating Serum with 0.1% Retinol 1 ppm Retinal & 5000 ppm Bakuchiol', '1', 0, 12, 2, '266', '266', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'RETINOL SERUM : The Retinol Serum offers a safe and powerful skin improvement effect with its Re-active technology that is gentle on sensitive skin that has been sensitized by frequent damage. This facial serum contains Retinol 0.1%, Retinal 1ppm, and Bakuchiol 5,000ppm, which promote the synthesis of collagen and elastin in the skin. This daily serum also includes Panthenol, Beta-glucan, Ceramides, and Trucica to help with damaged skin recovery and strengthen the skin barrier\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS : Bakuchiol is a plant-derived ingredient that has been found to have similar benefits to retinol without the potential for irritation or sensitivity. It is known to improve skin texture and pigmentation. And Retinol is a form of Vitamin A that helps to increase cell turnover, stimulate collagen production, and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\n\nRETINOL LINE : Re-Activate is the main concept of the Retinol line, which aims to reactivate and boost the skin\'s vitality. The Retinol line is effective in improving four fast aging signals, slowing down the aging process, and boosting the skin barrier\'s regeneration speed, resulting in a revitalized and rejuvenated skin\n\nMade in Korea', 1999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 901.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some By MI Retinol Intense Reactivating Serum with 0.1% Retinol 1 ppm Retinal & 5000 ppm BakuchiolPrice in BD', 'Some By MI Retinol Intense Reactivating Serum with 0.1% Retinol 1 ppm Retinal & 5000 ppm Bakuchiol Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-retinol-intense-reactivating-serum-with-01-retinol-1-ppm-retinal-5000-ppm-bakuchiol', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(267, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Laser Tri- Peptides Age - Correcting Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 110, '267', '267', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Revitalift Laser Tri-Peptides Age-Correcting Serum by L’Oréal Paris is a 3-in-1 age-defying treatment designed to visibly reduce wrinkles, firm the skin, and brighten complexion. Powered by Tri-Peptides (Matrixyl™ 3000, Argireline™ Amplified Peptide, and Carnosine), combined with Vitamin C and Hyaluronic Acid, this serum delivers immediate hydration and long-term anti-aging results. Its milky, lightweight texture absorbs quickly, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage Instructions\n\nKey Ingredients\n(Ingredients may vary; always check product packaging for the most up-to-date list.)\n\nBenefits', 3348.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 972.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Laser Tri- Peptides Age - Correcting Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Laser Tri- Peptides Age - Correcting Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-laser-tri-peptides-age-correcting-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(268, 'Heimish Marine Care Retinol for Face Serum', '1', 0, 12, 95, '268', '268', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nAnti-wrinkle + Elasticity Care\nHydrating & Soothing\nNo stickiness, pulling or greasiness!\n\nBrightening + Natural Radiant\n\nWHO IS THIS FOR?\n\nBenefits:\n\nHow to use:\n\n\nIngredients:\nWater, Undaria Pinnatifida Extract, Hizikia Fusiforme Extract, Laminaria Japonica Extract, Ecklonia Cava Extract, Hydrogenated Lecithin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycerin, Propanediol, Niacinamide, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Butylene Glycol, Caprylic/capric Triglyceride, Cholesterol, Retinol, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Brassica Campestris (Rapeseed) Sterols, Phytosteryl/Behenyl/Octyldodecyl Lauroyl Glutamate, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Chitosan, Aluminum/Magnesium Hydroxide Stearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Tris(Tetramethylhydroxypiperidinol) Citrate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Biosaccharide Gum-1, Ethylhexylglycerin, Polyglyceryl-3 Distearate, Glyceryl Stearate Citrate, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, 1.2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Glycol Stearate SE, Cetearyl Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Phenyl Trimethicone, Sorbitan Stearate, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene Simethicone, Panthenol, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Sorbitan Isostearate, Polvsorbate 60, Coptis Japonica Extract, Hydroxyacetophenone, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Fragrance, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Extract, Dextrin, Gelidium Cartilagineum Extract, Chlorella Minutissima Extract, Plankton Extract, Sargassum Fulvellum Extract, Hydrolyzed Sponge, Spirulina Platensis Extract.\n\n\nMade in Korea', 2332.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1628.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish Marine Care Retinol for Face SerumPrice in BD', 'Heimish Marine Care Retinol for Face Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-marine-care-retinol-for-face-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(269, 'No7 Protect & Perfect Intense Advanced Serum For Sensitive Skin by The Boots', '1', 0, 12, 84, '269', '269', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\n\nNo7 Serums are designed to be used underneath your moisturiser to help penetrate deeper into the skinSTEP 1: Use morning and evening as part of your daily skincare routineSTEP 2: Cleanse skin thoroughlySTEP 3: Smooth Protect & Perfect Intense ADVANCED Serum onto your face and neckSTEP 4: Follow with Protect & Perfect Intense ADVANCED Eye creamSTEP 5: Apply Protect & Perfect Intense ADVANCED Day or Night cream\n\nAvoid contact with eyes. If product gets into the eyes rinse well with water immediately.\nDimethicone, Aqua (Water), Dimethicone crosspolymer, Butylene glycol, Glycerin, Alcohol denat., Sodium ascorbyl phosphate, PEG/PPG-18/18 dimethicone, Magnesium sulfate, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 dimethicone, Polyglyceryl-4 isostearate, Hexyl laurate, Phenoxyethanol, Retinyl palmitate, Hydrolyzed rice protein, Propylene glycol, Tocopheryl acetate, Sorbitan laurate, Salicylic acid, Methylparaben, Carbomer, Medicago sativa (Alfalfa) extract, Ethylparaben, Polysorbate 20, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Acetyl dipeptide-1 cetyl ester, Panax ginseng root extract, Morus alba leaf extract, Sodium benzoate, Tocopherol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Palmitoyl tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl tetrapeptide-7.\n', 1215.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 945.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'No7 Protect & Perfect Intense Advanced Serum For Sensitive Skin by The BootsPrice in BD', 'No7 Protect & Perfect Intense Advanced Serum For Sensitive Skin by The Boots Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'no7-protect-perfect-intense-advanced-serum-for-sensitive-skin-by-the-boots', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(270, 'INNISFREE RETINOL CICA REPAIR AMPOULE', '1', 0, 12, 120, '270', '270', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dull skin with blemish scars.Pores enlarged by blackheads.Flakiness induced by external causes e.g., fine dust!\nRETINOL CICA REPAIR AMPOULE is for,\nDryness, redness (temporary redness induced by external irritation), sensitivity,enlarged pores and a bumpy skin texture.\nAll aboutTrouble\nPowerful all-in-one solution suitable even for sensitive skin that helps address the various stages of dealing with skin troubles\nFrom soothing acne to relieving post-acne scars without causing skin irritation.\nSudden sensitivity and patchiness.\nEarly skin troubles\nRough and bumpy skin texture.\nMid-phase skin troubles.\nBumpy and dark.\nSkin blemish scars.\n\nSkin sebum 24.3% decrease.\nBlackhead/whitehead 23.6% decrease.', 2805.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1275.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'INNISFREE RETINOL CICA REPAIR AMPOULEPrice in BD', 'INNISFREE RETINOL CICA REPAIR AMPOULE Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innisfree-retinol-cica-repair-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(271, 'Celimax The Vita A Retinal Shot Tightening Booster 15ml', '1', 0, 12, 102, '271', '271', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Celimax The Vita A Retinal Shot Tightening Booster is a concentrated anti-aging serum from Korea, formulated with stabilized retinal to visibly improve skin firmness, smooth out fine lines, and enhance elasticity. Designed for nighttime use, especially in humid and sun-exposed climates like Bangladesh, it delivers targeted skin renewal with minimal irritation. The inclusion of niacinamide and panthenol ensures a balanced approach to rejuvenation and barrier support.\n\nKey FeaturesThis serum contains retinal, a potent form of Vitamin A known for its ability to accelerate skin cell turnover and reduce signs of aging with less sensitivity than traditional retinol. Niacinamide helps brighten the complexion and reinforce the skin barrier, while panthenol provides hydration and soothes irritation. Ceramide NP strengthens the skin’s protective layer and locks in moisture, and allantoin offers gentle care for reactive or aging skin.\n\nUsageApply a small amount—roughly the size of a pea—to freshly cleansed and toned skin in the evening. Focus application on areas showing fine lines or reduced elasticity. Follow with a moisturizer to seal in hydration. Begin by using the product two to three times per week, gradually increasing frequency as your skin builds tolerance. Daily use of sunscreen is essential when incorporating retinal into your routine.\n\nWhy Choose This ProductCelimax is known for its science-driven formulations that balance efficacy with skin sensitivity. This booster offers a high-performance alternative to retinol with reduced risk of irritation, making it suitable for users seeking visible anti-aging results without compromising skin comfort. Its lightweight texture and barrier-supporting ingredients make it a smart choice for climates prone to heat, humidity, and sun exposure.\n\nBenefits\n\nCautions\n\nSuitable Skin TypesThis product is recommended for aging, sagging, dull, uneven, normal, combination, and post-acne skin. It is not advised for hypersensitive or fungal acne-prone skin without prior patch testing.', 1745.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 314.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Celimax The Vita A Retinal Shot Tightening Booster 15mlPrice in BD', 'Celimax The Vita A Retinal Shot Tightening Booster 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'celimax-the-vita-a-retinal-shot-tightening-booster-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(272, 'Melao Peptide Complex Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 30, '272', '272', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Melao Peptide Complex Serum 30ml\nRevitalize and restore your skin with Melao Peptide Complex Serum, a powerful anti-aging formula infused with Peptides, Vitamin E, and Hyaluronic Acid. Designed to target the visible signs of aging, this lightweight serum stimulates natural collagen production, smooths fine lines, and deeply hydrates to give your skin a plump, youthful glow.\nFormulated with botanical extracts like Aloe Vera, Hydrangea Leaf, and Mentha Arvensis, it also helps soothe and balance the skin while supporting its natural healing process.\nProduct Features:\nKey Ingredients:\nUsage Direction:\nWash and pat skin dry. Apply toner as needed. Apply a small amount to entire face and neck area. Allow to dry. Can be used daily (both morning and night) as well as under makeup. Follow with a moisturizer.\nCaution:\nSuitable for all skin types, this serum can be used daily to maintain youthful, well-hydrated, and healthy-looking skin.Made in PRC', 450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao Peptide Complex Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Melao Peptide Complex Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-peptide-complex-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(273, 'Cosrx The Niacinamide 15 Serum with Acetyl Glucosamine + Zinc PCA', '1', 0, 12, 31, '273', '273', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Highly concentrated serum that combines the maximum concentration of niacinamide with optimal ratios of synergistic ingredients for total acne control.\n*Non-comedogenic tested -doesn\'t clog the pores.\nProduct Details:\nSuitable for acne prone skin use (Non-comedogenic)- 45.27% improvement of activated sebaceous glands- 48.07% improvement of oil synthesis amount- 42.72% improvement of number of blackheads- 50% improvement of number of whiteheads- 15.50% improvement of (hidden melasma and blemishes)- 19.47% improvement of pigmentation (visible melasma and blemishes)- 2.59% improvement of triple-complexion skin tone (brightness)- 24.89% improvement of triple-complexion skin tone (redness)- 11.73% improvement of triple-complexion skin tone (yellowness)*Based on clinical trials of 20 subjects.\nIngredients:\nNiacinamide, N-Acetylglucosamine(NAG), Zinc PCA, Allantoin, Water, Pentylene Glycol, Niacinamide(15%), Butylene Glycol, Acetyl Glucosamine, 1,2-Hexanediol, Zinc PCA, Trehalose, Xanthan Gum, Pullulan, Allantoin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Phytate, Citric Acid, Tocopherol\n\n\n\nImproves and refines the appearance of enlarged pores, extra sebum, and uneven skin tone with a highly concentrated formula of 15% Niacinamide and natural skin-stabilizing ingredients. Enhance your complexion and soothe irritated skin.\nThis light texture serum is designed to address clogged pores, redness, and dryness. A blend of Niacinamide and Zinc PCA instantly improves texture and radiance by reducing excess oil and minimizing pore sizes.\nThe serum effectively tightens the look of sagging pores and smoothens the skin\'s texture. Niacinamide is a form of Vitamin B3 that helps normalize the pore\'s function and improve stretched skin texture for a youthful-looking, radiant complexion.', 1870.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 