(283, 'Gongskin Vitamin Blemish Cream 100ml – Whitening & Wrinkle Improvement Cream', '1', 0, 12, 123, '283', '283', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gongskin Vitamin Blemish Cream 100ml – Whitening & Freckle Care, Wrinkle Improvement\nDescription:Gongskin Vitamin Blemish Cream is a whitening functional cosmetic designed to reduce freckles, brighten the skin, and improve the appearance of wrinkles. Enriched with niacinamide, marine extracts, and tocopherol, this cream nourishes and hydrates while helping to maintain a radiant, even-toned complexion.\nKey Benefits:\nBrightens skin and reduces freckles\nHelps improve fine lines and wrinkles\nHydrates and nourishes with marine and plant extracts\nSuitable for daily use after serum application\nHow to Use:After applying serum, take an appropriate amount and spread evenly on the skin. Pat gently until fully absorbed.\nVolume: 100ml / 3.38 fl.oz\nKey Ingredients:Niacinamide, Water, Glycerin, Cetearyl Alcohol, Mineral Oil, Stearic Acid, Tocopherol, Wakame Extract, Scutellaria Root Extract, Kelp Extract, Fusiforme Extract, Schisandra Chinensis Extract, Chlorella Vulgaris Extract, Laver Extract, Hydrolyzed Seaweed Extract, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol\nPrecautions:\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nAvoid application on wounds or sensitive areas\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight\nCountry of Origin: Made in Korea', 930.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 410.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gongskin Vitamin Blemish Cream 100ml – Whitening & Wrinkle Improvement CreamPrice in BD', 'Gongskin Vitamin Blemish Cream 100ml – Whitening & Wrinkle Improvement Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gongskin-vitamin-blemish-cream-100ml-whitening-wrinkle-improvement-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(284, 'APLB Liposome Retinol LX 27.6% Serum 40ml', '1', 0, 12, 4, '284', '284', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'APLB Liposome Retinol LX 27.6% Serum (40ml):\nKey Features\nHow to UseDispense a moderate amount onto clean skin and gently pat for better absorption. Recommended for nighttime use due to retinol content.', 850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Liposome Retinol LX 27.6% Serum 40mlPrice in BD', 'APLB Liposome Retinol LX 27.6% Serum 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-liposome-retinol-lx-276-serum-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(285, 'Aveeno Calm + Restore Fragrance Free Age Renewal Serum for Sensitive Skin', '1', 0, 12, 124, '285', '285', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Visibly improve the look of fine lines and wrinkles with fragrance free Aveeno® Calm + Restore® Age Renewal Serum. Proven gentle and safe when tested on sensitive skin, the nourishing anti-wrinkle serum contains cranberry extract, a gentle, plant-based retinol alternative with antioxidant-rich peptides clinically proven to reduce visible signs of aging without redness or sensitivity.\nImproves look of fine lines & wrinkles\nSmoother, healthier-looking skin in 1 week\nWith Vitamin B3, oat & cranberry extract\nGood for: Anti-Aging, Sensitive skin\nTexture: Light serumKey Features:\nAlcohol-free, Dyes, Fragrance, Parabens, Phthalates, Non-Comedogenic\nMorning and evening, gently massage a dime size amount onto a dry, clean face before moisturizing. Gentle enough for daily use.', 3185.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1565.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aveeno Calm + Restore Fragrance Free Age Renewal Serum for Sensitive SkinPrice in BD', 'Aveeno Calm + Restore Fragrance Free Age Renewal Serum for Sensitive Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aveeno-calm-restore-fragrance-free-age-renewal-serum-for-sensitive-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(286, 'Loreal Paris Age Perfect Cell Renewal Midnight Face Serum With Antioxidants 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 110, '286', '286', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The L\'Oréal Paris Age Perfect Cell Renewal Midnight Face Serum is a luxurious nighttime treatment designed specifically for mature skin. Infused with antioxidants, this serum works to revitalize and renew the skin\'s appearance while you sleep. It helps to restore a youthful glow and improves skin texture, making it a valuable addition to your nighttime skincare routine.\nThe L\'Oréal Paris Age Perfect Cell Renewal Midnight Face Serum is a great option for those looking to rejuvenate their skin overnight. With its blend of powerful antioxidants and hydrating ingredients, this serum helps restore youthful vitality, making it a perfect addition to your anti-aging skincare regimen.\nMade in France', 3150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Age Perfect Cell Renewal Midnight Face Serum With Antioxidants 30mlPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Age Perfect Cell Renewal Midnight Face Serum With Antioxidants 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-age-perfect-cell-renewal-midnight-face-serum-with-antioxidants-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(287, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Anti Wrinkle Ampoule', '1', 0, 12, 114, '287', '287', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hydrolyzed Collagen helps skin moisturizing & Vitalizing skin\'s balance to add on the comfort to the skin.\n- Paraben Free,\n- Mineral Oil Free\n- Benzophenone Free\n- Benzylalcoho Free\n- Petrolatum Free\n- Imidazolidinyl Urea Free\n- Gold ingredients 500PPM\n\nOur formula combines the power of hydrolyzed collagen and gold ingredients to provide a luxurious and effective skincare experience.\nHydrolyzed collagen, known for its exceptional hydrating properties, deeply nourishes and moisturizes the skin. It works by replenishing the skin\'s natural moisture barrier, resulting in a visibly plump and radiant complexion. Say goodbye to dryness and hello to a revitalized, supple skin texture.\nOur moisturizing and vitalizing formula provides a comprehensive solution to your skin\'s needs. Experience the transformative effects as your skin is enveloped in lasting hydration, revealing a more youthful and radiant appearance. Pamper yourself with our cutting-edge skincare product and indulge in the ultimate comfort and luxury your skin deserves.\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, trim the skin with toner, take an appropriate amount and spread it evenly over the face.', 1020.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 480.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Anti Wrinkle AmpoulePrice in BD', '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Anti Wrinkle Ampoule Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-collagen-and-luxury-24k-gold-anti-wrinkle-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(288, 'ANJO Professional 24K Gold Heritage Ampoule 90ml – Premium Gold Anti-Wrinkle & Whitening Serum', '1', 0, 12, 125, '288', '288', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reveal radiant, youthful-looking skin with ANJO Professional 24K Gold Heritage Ampoule (90ml)—a luxurious facial ampoule enriched with 99.9% pure gold (250ppm), inspired by the ancient beauty rituals of legendary icons such as Yang Guifei and Cleopatra. This premium ampoule delivers deep hydration, glow, and skin vitality for a smooth, luminous complexion.\nFormulated with the patented Eternal-P™ Plant Protein Complex (including hydrolyzed pea protein, shea butter, and ceramides), along with grape callus culture extract and vitamin beads, it helps strengthen skin, improve elasticity, and provide rich, long-lasting moisture. Its dense yet comfortable texture absorbs well, leaving skin nourished and revitalized.\nThis is a dual-functional cosmetic that helps with wrinkle improvement and skin brightening, powered by Adenosine and Niacinamide.\nDual functional ampoule: wrinkle improvement + brightening\nContains 99.9% pure gold (250ppm) for radiant skin\nPatented Eternal-P™ complex for firm, healthy-looking skin\nEnriched with vitamin beads and grape callus culture extract\nDelivers intensive moisture and skin vitality\nRich, concentrated texture with a luxurious feel\nAfter cleansing, apply an appropriate amount evenly over the face. Gently press with your palms to help absorption.\nHelps improve the appearance of wrinkles\nHelps enhance skin brightness and tone(Active ingredients: Adenosine, Niacinamide)\nWater (Aqua), Dipropylene Glycol, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Lactose, PEG-60 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Cellulose, Hydrogenated Castor Oil Dimer Dilinoleate, Arginine, Carbomer, Butylene Glycol, Allantoin, Panthenol, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Adenosine, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Gold (250ppm), Sodium Hyaluronate, Disodium EDTA, Hydroxypropyl Methylcellulose, Jojoba Esters, Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Tocopheryl Acetate, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Xanthan Gum, Grape Callus Culture Extract (30ppm), Pentylene Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydrolyzed Pea Protein, Lecithin, Olive Oil, Squalane, Ceramide NP, Green Tea Extract, Aloe Vera Leaf Extract, Mushroom Extracts, Fragrance, Colorants (CI 19140, CI 15985).\nProduct: ANJO Professional 24K Gold Heritage Ampoule\nVolume: 90ml\nFunction: Wrinkle Improvement & Brightening\nOrigin: Made in Korea', 2640.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ANJO Professional 24K Gold Heritage Ampoule 90ml – Premium Gold Anti-Wrinkle & Whitening SerumPrice in BD', 'ANJO Professional 24K Gold Heritage Ampoule 90ml – Premium Gold Anti-Wrinkle & Whitening Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anjo-professional-24k-gold-heritage-ampoule-90ml-premium-gold-anti-wrinkle-whitening-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(289, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Revitalizing Comfort Anti Wrinkle Gold Essence', '1', 0, 12, 114, '289', '289', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury Revitalizing Comfort 24K Gold Essence is a luxurious anti-aging serum that gives you smooth, baby-soft skin. Made with pure gold and collagen, it quickly moisturizes dehydrated skin and improves elasticity to ward off wrinkles. The lightweight formula never feels heavy or greasy, too, so you can easily layer moisture on drier patches. The result? A younger, brighter, and bouncier complexion. It’s enhanced with soothing Centella Asiatica, which facilitates healing for dry and broken skin. With anti-inflammatory properties, it’s also an effective ingredient against acne.\nGood For:\nBenefits:\nHow to Use:STEP 1: Dispense 2-3 pumps of product.STEP 2: Evenly spread over the entire face and pat until fully absorbed.', 1499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 701.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Revitalizing Comfort Anti Wrinkle Gold EssencePrice in BD', '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Revitalizing Comfort Anti Wrinkle Gold Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-collagen-and-luxury-24k-gold-revitalizing-comfort-anti-wrinkle-gold-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03');
