(290, 'The Derma Co. 0.3% Retinol Face Serum For Spotless Skin', '1', 0, 12, 33, '290', '290', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize and renew your skin with The Derma Co. 0.3% Retinol Face Serum, a potent formula designed to reduce dark spots, fine lines, and uneven skin texture. Infused with 0.3% Retinol, this anti-aging serum promotes cell turnover, diminishes the appearance of dark spots, and smooths fine lines, revealing a more youthful, radiant complexion. With the added benefits of Vitamin C and Hyaluronic Acid, it also hydrates and brightens the skin, making it smoother, firmer, and spotless over time.\nKey Features:\n0.3% Retinol: Stimulates collagen production, promotes cell renewal, and reduces the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and dark spots for a youthful glow.Vitamin C: Brightens skin tone, fades pigmentation, and enhances skin radiance, leaving the complexion more even and luminous.Hyaluronic Acid: Deeply hydrates and plumps the skin, locking in moisture to improve skin elasticity and smoothness.Anti-Aging Benefits: Reduces signs of aging like fine lines, wrinkles, and pigmentation while improving skin texture and firmness.Lightweight & Fast-Absorbing: A non-greasy formula that quickly absorbs into the skin, making it ideal for use under makeup or as part of your nighttime skincare routine.\nBenefits:\nReduces dark spots, fine lines, and signs of aging.Promotes cell turnover for a smooth, spotless complexion.Hydrates and plumps the skin, enhancing firmness and texture.Brightens skin tone, giving a radiant, even glow.Suitable for all skin types, especially those with mature or uneven skin.Achieve radiant, youthful, and spotless skin with The Derma Co. 0.3% Retinol Face Serum, your solution for smoother, firmer, and rejuvenated skin.', 1365.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 735.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co. 0.3% Retinol Face Serum For Spotless SkinPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co. 0.3% Retinol Face Serum For Spotless Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-03-retinol-face-serum-for-spotless-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(291, 'Dot and Key Pomegranate Miracle Collagen Boost Retinol Youth Serum', '1', 0, 12, 91, '291', '291', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Pomegranate Miracle Collagen Boost Retinol Youth Serum\nDot & Key Pomegranate Miracle Collagen Boost Retinol Youth Serum is designed to visibly reduce fine lines, wrinkles, and signs of aging. Powered by 0.9% Retinol and antioxidant-rich Pomegranate Extract, it boosts natural collagen production and promotes smoother, firmer, and more youthful-looking skin. This gentle yet effective formula improves skin texture and elasticity while minimizing early signs of aging. It also deeply hydrates the skin, delivering a healthy, radiant glow without irritation. Lightweight and quick-absorbing, this serum is suitable for all skin types and fits seamlessly into any nighttime skincare routine.\n\nBenefits:\n\nHero Ingredients:\n\nIngredients:Water, C13-15 Alkane, Isononyl Isononanoate, Glycerin, Propanediol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Retinol, Punica Granatum (Pomegranate) Fruit Extract, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), and other supportive ingredients for skin nourishment.\n\nUsage:\n\nMade in India', 875.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Pomegranate Miracle Collagen Boost Retinol Youth SerumPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Pomegranate Miracle Collagen Boost Retinol Youth Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-pomegranate-miracle-collagen-boost-retinol-youth-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(292, 'Cos De BAHA AL A- Arbutin 5% Licorice Serum', '1', 0, 12, 36, '292', '292', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brightening and Even Skin Tone: Contains 5% Alpha-Arbutin, a potent yet gentle skin-brightening agent that helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and hyperpigmentation.​\nSoothing and Anti-Inflammatory: Infused with Spanish Licorice Root Extract, known for its anti-inflammatory properties, which can help calm irritated skin and reduce redness.​\nHydration and Skin Barrier Support: Includes Hyaluronic Acid and Panthenol to provide deep hydration and support the skin\'s natural barrier.​\nAdditional Skin Benefits: Features ingredients like Bisabolol and Centella Asiatica Extract to further soothe the skin and promote healing.​\nAlpha-Arbutin (5%): A derivative of hydroquinone that inhibits melanin production, leading to a brighter complexion.​\nLicorice Root Extract: Contains glabridin, which helps to lighten pigmentation and has anti-inflammatory effects.​\nHyaluronic Acid: A powerful humectant that attracts moisture to the skin, keeping it hydrated and plump.​\nPanthenol (Vitamin B5): Helps to moisturize, soothe, and heal the skin.​\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Known for its healing properties, it aids in skin regeneration and reduces inflammation.​\nCleanse: Start with a clean face.​\nApply: Dispense a few drops of the serum onto your fingertips.​\nMassage: Gently apply to the face and neck, focusing on areas with dark spots or uneven tone.​\nFollow-Up: Allow the serum to absorb fully before applying moisturizer.​\nSun Protection: Use sunscreen during the day to protect the skin and enhance results', 1150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 400.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA AL A- Arbutin 5% Licorice SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA AL A- Arbutin 5% Licorice Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-al-a-arbutin-5-licorice-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(293, 'Cos De BAHA P Peptide M.A  Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 36, '293', '293', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Type\nNormal\nProduct Benefits\nMoisturize\nUse for\nFace\nScent\nUnscented\n\nCountry of Origin: Korea\nAbout this item:\nOUR PEPTIDES SERUM BOASTS NIACINAMIDE AND HYALURONIC ACID to smooth away wrinkles and improve elasticity for a stunningly youthful glow. In addition to being an anti-aging skincare must-have ingredient and skin plumper Peptides are touted as natural healing agents! Our proprietary peptide complex which the skin’s natural production of collagen reducing the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines & leading.\nOUR POTENT MATRIXYL 3000 SIGNALS YOUR SKIN TO INCREASE collagen production for firmer more youthful looking skin. Promotes smooth younger-looking skin with Matrixyl synthe’7 and 1. Argireline helps relax facial muscles and discourages formation of new lines. Let this nutrient rich serum nourish your skin from inside out so your skin can feel vibrant hydrated and healthy looking.\nCREATES SMOOTHER AND TIGHTER SKIN with our powerful ARGIRELINE peptide also known as the natural treatment. Our fragrance-free moisture rich (non-greasy)serum with collagen and elastin plumps and renews skin leaving it smooth and more elastic.\nPOTENT PEPTIDES FORMULATED IN THE POPULAR HYALURONIC ACID Base to Offer the Best Absorption and Results. Unlike Creams and Oil Based Peptide Solutions That Simply Sit on Top of Skin. It’s natural and organic. Our bottle is not a glass bottle but a professional cosmetic bottle. It will be delivered to you more safely.\nTHE BEST KOREAN SKIN CARE AT THE LOWEST PRICE - You will be hard-set to find the high quality ingredients in our products for even close to our price. We believe fantastic skin-care should be available to anyone, and it is our mission to ensure that you get both top-notch quality products, but also the best customer care available. Contact us anytime through Amazon for assistance.\n\nProduct Description:\n\nM.A Peptide Serum\nAnti-aging products are no longer only for specific age groups. Now it\'s safe to say that the products that have the effect of improving wrinkles are all used by peoplewho want to take care of their skin before it gets wrinkled, as well as those who are wondering how to manage the wrinkles that they already have. If you\'re looking for a more satisfying, safe-use anti-aging serum, Cos De BAHA\'s M.A.Peptide serum will be the answer. Using only proven safety materials, this serum allows the benefits of the Matrixyl 3000 and Argyline to be revealed in your life. If you\'re thinking about what kind of serum to use now, meet Cos De BAHA so your skin can have a healthier day right now.\nGenuine Peptide Matrixyl 3000 + Argireline Peptide Complex\nThe combination of the Matrixyl 3000 and Argireline greatly helps to keep your skin healthier and moisturized. Along with the Matrixyl 3000, Argireline, which helps improve wrinkles on the skin, has also recently returned to the spotlight. Argireline allows you to manage wrinkles on your skin in a safer way. It relieves the skin of tension and prevents wrinkles that can occur in a tense state.\nEffects of the product\nTied To Skin Elasticity\nIntensive Hydration\nFINE LINES\nIt is based on raw materials to improve skin problems, but our products are not medicines.\nIngredients:\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract (hydration/skin-soothing), Propanediol (hydration), Glycerin (hydration/skin replenishing), Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1 (Matrixyl 3000/Anti Wrinkles), Palmitoyl Tetrap eptide-7 (Matrixyl 3000/Anti Wrinkles), Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 (Argireline/Anti Wrinkles), Niacinamide (vitamin B3, skin-restoring ), 1,2-Hexanediol(Prevent oxidation), Sodium Hyaluronate (hydration/skin replenishing), Beta-Glucan (skin-soothing), Adenosine (skin-restoring), Butylene Glycol (hydrating), Allantoin (skin-soothing), *Rosa Damascena Extract *Lavandula Angustifolia Flower Extract *Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract *Melissa Officinalis Leaf Extract *Artemisia Vulgaris Extract. (*Mark: Organic Ingredients. Organic: 78%)\nWhen you use it for the first time:\nIMPORTANT - This is a concentrated and powerful serum. As with any skincare product, we suggest doing a Patch Test on a small area of skin on your neck to make sure the formula is a good fit for you. Once you determine there is no problem with the patch test you should (1) Wash your face and then dry (2) Apply a small amount to your entire face, neck and decollete, (3) allow to dry (4) Follow with a moisturizer.\nDirections:\nUse daily after cleansing and before applying moisturizer & makeup. Moisten a cotton ball or pad and apply to face and neck. For best results, use in the morning and at night for soft, smooth and beautiful skin. Do not overcoat thickly.', 900.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 699.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA P Peptide M.A  Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA P Peptide M.A  Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-p-peptide-ma-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(294, 'Medicube Deep Vita A Retinol Serum', '1', 0, 12, 96, '294', '294', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Medicube Deep Vita A Retinol Serum\nRevitalize your skin with Medicube Deep Vita A Retinol Serum, a powerful anti-aging solution designed to smooth fine lines, improve skin texture, and enhance radiance. Infused with 0.3% pure retinol, this serum stimulates collagen production, promoting a youthful glow while targeting wrinkles and uneven skin tone. The formula is enriched with Vitamin A derivatives and nourishing ingredients to gently refine pores and boost skin elasticity without irritation.\nKey Benefits:✔ Anti-Aging Power – Visibly reduces fine lines and wrinkles✔ Smoother Skin – Refines texture and minimizes pores✔ Brightening Effect – Enhances radiance and evens skin tone✔ Gentle Yet Effective – Hydrating formula to prevent dryness and irritation✔ Dermatologist-Tested – Safe for sensitive skin with gradual adaptation\nDirections for Use:\nUnlock youthful, radiant skin with Medicube Deep Vita A Retinol Serum!', 1870.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1805.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube Deep Vita A Retinol SerumPrice in BD', 'Medicube Deep Vita A Retinol Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-deep-vita-a-retinol-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(295, 'The Ordinary Retinol 1% in Squalane 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 25, '295', '295', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Ordinary Retinol 1% in Squalane is a powerful anti-aging serum that targets visible signs of aging such as fine lines, wrinkles, and uneven skin texture. Formulated with 1% pure retinol in a lightweight squalane base, this product provides potent anti-aging benefits while minimizing irritation that retinol products can cause.\nRetinol (1%):\nSqualane:\nFrequency: Apply in the evening as part of your nighttime skincare routine. Start by using it 2-3 times a week and gradually increase frequency as your skin builds tolerance to retinol.\nApplication:\nSun Protection: Always use sunscreen during the day when using retinol products, as retinol can increase skin sensitivity to the sun.\nThis product is a great option for anyone looking to introduce a powerful, results-driven retinol into their skincare routine, with the added benefit of squalane to hydrate and protect the skin.\n\nMade in Canada', 1760.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Retinol 1% in Squalane 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Retinol 1% in Squalane 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-retinol-1-in-squalane-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(296, 'Cos De BAHA L1 serum with Level 1 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 0.15%', '1', 0, 12, 36, '296', '296', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Type\nNormal\nProduct Benefits\nMoisturize\nScent\nAloe\nBrand\nCos De BAHA\nItem Form\nSerum\nAbout this item:\nEVENS SKIN TONE : Bakuchiol deeply penetrates the skin to help lessen the appearance of dark spots or areas of hyperpigmentation.\nBAKUCHIOL HAS RETINOL SIMILAR PROPERTIES but is gentler on skin, so the idea is you get the perks (smoother, brighter skin) without the pitfalls (redness, irritation).\nREDUCES THE APPEARANCE OF FINE LINES : Like retinol, bakuchiol tells your cells to regenerate and make collagen, \"plumping\" your skin and reducing the look of lines and wrinkles. Try Bakuchiol, Retinol’s Gentle, Plant-Based for Fresh, Healthy Skin.\nDOESN\'T CAUSE DRYNESS OR IRRITATION : Bakuchiol is generally less irritating, and may carry a lower risk of side effects like redness or flaking, a more recent study suggests.\nHELPS SOOTHE AND HEAL SKIN : By promoting cell turnover and healthy cell regeneration, bakuchiol may help soothe and heal your skin from the inside out.', 1305.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 594.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA L1 serum with Level 1 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 0.15%Price in BD', 'Cos De BAHA L1 serum with Level 1 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 0.15% Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-l1-serum-with-level-1-bakuchiol-2-and-retinol-015', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(297, 'Anua Retinol 0.3% + Niacin Renewing Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 12, 21, '297', '297', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anua Retinol 0.3% + Niacin Renewing Serum\nDescriptionElevate your skincare routine with anua\'s Nano Retinol 0.3% Niacin Renewing Serum, specifically formulated to improve pigmentation, elasticity, pores, and texture. This serum blends nano Retinol with Niacinamide for improved anti-aging and skin-brightening benefits. Its advanced formula uses liposome technology to encapsulate the active ingredients, ensuring efficient delivery and absorption into the skin. Perfect for those aiming for a firmer, clearer complexion, this serum deeply hydrates, leaving your skin rejuvenated and bright.\nThis serum combines advanced skincare technology to target signs of aging, improve skin texture, and enhance overall radiance. It is formulated to be gentle yet effective, making it suitable for various skin types.\nBenefits:Retinol helps in the regeneration of skin cells, fights wrinkles, stimulates the synthesis of collagen, which is important for maintaining healthy and young-looking skin.Reduces fine wrinkles - vitamin A, cleans pores and normalizes the activity of the sebaceous glands, thus acting effectively against acne.Niacinamide naturally renews the skin and gives an anti-wrinkle effect. Thanks to its effects, it ensures the unification of skin tone, reduces pores, treats small acne scars. It combats dark pigment spots, stimulates sebum production and reduces redness and irritation. Its properties promote collagen production and protect the skin from UV rays. It is a versatile ingredient that is suitable for all skin types. It moisturises the skin while keeping it matte. Suitable for all skin types.Enriched with 8 kinds of Peptide to amplify the moisturizing effect and further diminish wrinkles, while minimizing the appearance of pores and firming up saggy skin.Blended with a moisturizing and soothing formula, incorporating ingredients such as Tea Tree Leaf Oil, Carapa Guianensis Seed Oil and Ceramide.Skin irritation test completed, suitable for sensitive skin.\nHow to use:1. During your evening skincare routine, apply less than half of the amount you normally used for serum on skin.2. When used in the morning, apply sufficient sunscreen afterwards.3. For the first two weeks of usage, use it once every two days to allow your skin to gradually get used to it.\n\nIngredients: Water, Glycereth-26, Niacinamide (5%), Malus Domestica Fruit Extract, Glycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Castanea Crenata (Chestnut) Shell Extract, Glyceryl Citrate/Lactate/Linoleate/Oleate, Diospyros Kaki Leaf Extract, Coptis Japonica Root Extract, Potentilla Anserina Extract, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Extract, Cynara Scolymus (Artichoke) Leaf Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Extract, Ficus Carica (Fig) Fruit Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Artemisia Capillaris Flower Extract, Arnica Montana Flower Extract, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Flower Extract, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower/Leaf Extract, Borago Officinalis Extract, Centaurea Cyanus Flower Extract, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Water, Centaurea Cyanus Flower Water, Sodium Hyaluronate, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Carapa Guianensis Seed Oil, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Oil, Tocopherol, Propanediol, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Methylpropanediol, Butylene Glycol, Polysorbate 20, Retinol (0.11%), Ceramide NP, Pentylene Glycol, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Polyquaternium-51, Beta-Glucan, Squalane, Panthenol, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, BHT, Oleic Acid, Dipropylene Glycol, BHA, Allantoin, Maltodextrin, Saccharide Hydrolysate, Sorbitan Laurate, Glyceryl Stearate, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Octyldodecanol, Phytosterols, Madecassoside, Ceramide AS, Ceramide AP, Capryloyl Salicylic Acid, Cholesterol, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Acetyl Dipeptide-1 Cetyl Ester, Ceramide NS, Ceramide NG, Caprylyl Glycol, Guaiazulene, Sucrose Distearate, Nonapeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Hydroxypropyl Cyclodextrin, Hexapeptide-9, Ceramide EOP', 2475.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1375.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Retinol 0.3% + Niacin Renewing Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Anua Retinol 0.3% + Niacin Renewing Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-retinol-03-niacin-renewing-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(298, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Triple Power Age- Defying Serum', '1', 0, 12, 110, '298', '298', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Aging skin requires more intensive action to help restore its youthful look. With age, wrinkles become more permanent, skin loses its resilience and the face, neck and jawline begin to sag.\nThis luxurious, lightweight facial serum helps transform the look of aging skin by working both on skin\'s surface and penetrating skin\'s surface by combining Hyaluronic Acid, a proven wrinkle-fighter, with Pro-Xylane, an exclusive anti-aging super ingredient developed by L\'Oreal Paris Laboratories.\nBenefits:\nIngredients:\nInstructions:For best results, smooth Revitalift® Triple Power Concentrated Serum Treatment over face, neck, and jawline every morning and night before applying Revitalift Triple Power Deep-Acting Moisturizer.\nMade in USA', 2990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2510.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Triple Power Age- Defying SerumPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Triple Power Age- Defying Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-triple-power-age-defying-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(299, 'Mistine Gold Prestige Serum  30ml', '1', 0, 12, 126, '299', '299', NULL, NULL, NULL, '98% Pure Rice Water: Known for its skin-brightening properties, rice water helps in hydrating the skin and enhancing its natural glow.​\n10% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3): This potent ingredient aids in reducing dark spots, minimizing pores, and evening out skin tone, contributing to a clearer complexion.​\nHyaluronic Acid: A powerful humectant that attracts moisture, keeping the skin plump, hydrated, and reducing the appearance of fine lines.​\nZinc PCA: Helps in controlling excess oil production and supports the skin\'s natural barrier, making it suitable for various skin types.​\nThese ingredients work synergistically to provide deep hydration, reduce pigmentation, and impart a dewy finish to the skin.​\nCleanse: Start with a clean face, ensuring all makeup and impurities are removed.​\nApply Serum: Take 2–3 pumps of the serum and apply evenly on the face and neck.​\nMassage: Gently pat and massage the serum into the skin until fully absorbed.​\nFollow-Up: For best results, follow up with a moisturizer to lock in hydration.', 752.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 198.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mistine Gold Prestige Serum  30mlPrice in BD', 'Mistine Gold Prestige Serum  30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mistine-gold-prestige-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
