(303, 'I\'m From Ginseng Serum', '1', 0, 14, 129, '303', '303', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I\'m From Ginseng Serum is infused with 7.98% six-year-old red ginseng sap. This power ingredient enhances blood circulation and rejuvenates dry and tired skin. Its antioxidant properties help purify skin and protect from future damage. It adheres to skin and improves elasticity, reducing fine lines and wrinkles.\nHyaluronic acid helps retain moisture for more deeply hydrated skin and an added plumping effect. Adenosine energizes the skin’s surface, helping to smooth out skin over time. The result is glowing, bouncy skin and a more youthful complexion.\n\nFeatures:\n\nAfter cleansing, prep the skin with toner. Dispense serum and pat into face. Once fully absorbed, follow up with a moisturizer to lock in.\n\nMade in Korea\n', 2057.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1568.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'I\'m From Ginseng SerumPrice in BD', 'I\'m From Ginseng Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'im-from-ginseng-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(304, 'Babe 15% Vitamin C Antiox  Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 99, '304', '304', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten, protect, and rejuvenate your skin with this powerful multi-antioxidant formula. Featuring stabilized 15% Vitamin C for a luminous, even complexion, it combines Carnosine, Encapsulated Ferulic Acid, and Hyaluronic Acid to fight oxidative stress, pollution, and blue-light damage while delivering deep hydration. The lightweight, fast-absorbing serum helps defend cellular DNA, improve firmness, and reduce visible signs of photo-aging for a radiant, youthful glow.\nKey Benefits\n15% stabilized Vitamin C for brighter, more even skin tone\nPotent antioxidant blend to protect against free radicals and environmental stressors\nHyaluronic Acid for lasting hydration and plumpness\nSupports collagen synthesis and fights fine lines\nHow to UseApply 3–4 drops morning or evening to clean, dry skin on the face, neck, and décolleté. Gently massage until fully absorbed, then follow with moisturizer and SPF in the daytime.\nDermatologically & Ophthalmologically Tested – Suitable for all skin types.', 3610.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 190.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Babe 15% Vitamin C Antiox  Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Babe 15% Vitamin C Antiox  Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'babe-15-vitamin-c-antiox-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
