(307, 'Cos De BAHA L2 Serum with Level 2 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 0.5% 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 36, '307', '307', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anti-Aging: The synergy of Retinol and Bakuchiol promotes collagen production, helping to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.​\nEven Skin Tone: Niacinamide and Bakuchiol work together to diminish hyperpigmentation and dark spots, leading to a more uniform complexion.​\nAcne Reduction: Retinol aids in unclogging pores and reducing acne flare-ups, while Bakuchiol offers anti-inflammatory properties to soothe the skin.​\nHydration & Soothing: Ingredients like Aloe Vera, Panthenol, and Sodium Hyaluronate provide hydration and calm the skin, enhancing overall skin health.​\nRetinol (0.5%): A derivative of Vitamin A, known for its ability to accelerate cell turnover and stimulate collagen production.​\nBakuchiol (2%): A plant-derived compound that mimics the effects of retinol, offering anti-aging benefits with reduced risk of irritation.​\nNiacinamide: Also known as Vitamin B3, it helps to improve skin elasticity, enhance the barrier function, even out skin tone, and diminish dullness.​\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract: Provides soothing and anti-inflammatory properties, aiding in skin healing.​\nPanthenol: Also known as Provitamin B5, it moisturizes and improves skin elasticity.​\nSodium Hyaluronate: A form of hyaluronic acid that helps retain moisture, keeping the skin hydrated and plump.​\nCleanse: Begin with a clean face, ensuring all makeup and impurities are removed.​\nApply Serum: Dispense a small amount of the serum onto your fingertips.​\nMassage: Gently apply to the face and neck, focusing on areas of concern.​\nMoisturize: Follow with your regular moisturizer to lock in hydration.​\nSun Protection: In the morning, apply a broad-spectrum sunscreen as the final step in your skincare routine.', 1353.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 197.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA L2 Serum with Level 2 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 0.5% 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA L2 Serum with Level 2 Bakuchiol 2% and Retinol 0.5% 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-l2-serum-with-level-2-bakuchiol-2-and-retinol-05-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(308, 'Melasma seed Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 71, '308', '308', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Advanced Skin Solution for Melasma, Chloasma & Hyperpigmentation – Brightening Formula\"\nMelasma Seed Serum is a powerful skin treatment specially formulated to reduce melasma, chloasma, hyperpigmentation, and dark spots. Enriched with a potent blend of natural seed extracts and clinically proven brightening agents, it works deep within the skin to fade discoloration, even out skin tone, and restore a healthy, radiant glow.\nWith ingredients like Tranexamic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Niacinamide, and Kojic Acid, this serum targets pigmentation at the root. Calming extracts of Licorice Root, Mulberry, and Aloe Vera help soothe inflammation, while Hyaluronic Acid delivers intense hydration to keep skin plump and nourished.\nReduces melasma, chloasma, and dark spots\nBrightens skin and evens out overall complexion\nSoothes irritated skin and calms inflammation\nProvides deep hydration and improves skin texture\nTranexamic Acid – Targets stubborn pigmentation and melasma\nAlpha Arbutin – Gently lightens dark spots and evens skin tone\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3) – Reduces redness, strengthens skin barrier\nKojic Acid – Brightens dull skin and prevents future pigmentation\nHyaluronic Acid – Locks in moisture for plump, hydrated skin\nLicorice Root & Mulberry Extracts – Natural anti-inflammatory agents\nAloe Vera Extract – Soothes and nourishes irritated skin\nCleanse your face thoroughly and pat dry.\nApply 2–3 drops of the serum to your face and neck.\nGently massage in circular, upward motions until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, morning and night, for best results.\nFollow with a moisturizer and sunscreen during the day.', 1575.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 175.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melasma seed Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Melasma seed Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melasma-seed-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(309, 'Bioaqua Anti Wrinkle R Retinol Serum with Hyaluronic Acid 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 69, '309', '309', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BIOAQUA Facial Retinol Serum 30ml\nAnti-Wrinkle Tender Skin 8.5% Retinol 5% Hyaluronic Acid Moisturizing Essence\nBrand: BIOAQUA\nNet Weight: 30ml\nSkin Type: All Types of Skin\nAnti-Wrinkle Tender Skin 8.5% Retinol 5% Hyaluronic Acid Moisturizing Essence\nActivate Skin Cells Facial Serums for Glowing Skin can make your skin cells more activated because it contains effective active ingredients. At the same time, it can help firm and plump skin.\nEven Skin Tone Rejuvenating and improving skin elasticity, the Face Serums can help restore an even and clear skin texture, leaving skin looking more energized.\nEffective Hydrating Serums for Skin Care, with many moisturizing ingredients, not only replenish skin with moisture but also helps nourish the skin.\nApply Easily Clean your face and apply a few drops of the Facial Serums. It absorbs fast as you massage your skin. This helps you get better results when you use it morning and night.\nMultiple Applications Suitable for most skin types like dry skin, oily skin, or combination skin, the moisturizing Serums for Face help repair the facial skin.\nSkin Firming Because of the active ingredients in Facial Serums for Glowing Skin, they can make your skin cells more active, and help to firm and plump your skin.\nMADE IN CHINA', 338.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 212.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Anti Wrinkle R Retinol Serum with Hyaluronic Acid 30mlPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Anti Wrinkle R Retinol Serum with Hyaluronic Acid 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-anti-wrinkle-r-retinol-serum-with-hyaluronic-acid-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
