(311, 'Cos De BAHA A5 Azelaic Acid 5 Serum', '1', 0, 14, 36, '311', '311', NULL, NULL, NULL, '✔ We develop products around ingredients that have been verified in multiple papers.✔ We use beneficial raw materials to ensure our products offer the highest effects. We do not use any harmful or suspected harmful ingredients.✔ We conduct countless types of research and experiments with active ingredients until we get the best effects.✔ We want to remove all unnecessary costs in the production and distribution process so we can sell our products at a reasonable price.✔ We offer a variety of solutions for many different skin types.\nCos De BAHA strives to provide the most effective and safe solutions for the skin and will continue to maintain those values in the future.', 1015.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 485.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA A5 Azelaic Acid 5 SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA A5 Azelaic Acid 5 Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-a5-azelaic-acid-5-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(312, 'Cos De BAHA GN Galactomyces 94 Serum', '1', 0, 14, 36, '312', '312', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brightens and Evens Skin Tone: Contains 94% Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, known for its ability to improve skin radiance and texture.​\nReduces Hyperpigmentation: Infused with 2% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), which helps diminish dark spots and uneven skin tone.\nHydrates and Plumps: Includes Sodium Hyaluronate and Glycerin to provide deep hydration, leaving the skin plump and supple.\nMinimizes Pores and Controls Oil: Helps in reducing the appearance of enlarged pores and balances sebum production.​\nAnti-Aging Properties: Regular use can lead to a reduction in fine lines and wrinkles, promoting a youthful complexion.​\nGalactomyces Ferment Filtrate (94%): A yeast-derived ingredient rich in vitamins and amino acids, promoting skin vitality.​\nNiacinamide (2%): A form of Vitamin B3 that brightens skin and improves elasticity.​\nSodium Hyaluronate: A form of Hyaluronic Acid that deeply hydrates and retains moisture.​\nGlycerin: A humectant that attracts moisture to the skin, keeping it hydrated.​\n1,2-Hexanediol: A solvent and emollient that enhances the serum\'s texture and stability.​\nCleanse: Start with a clean face.​\nTone: Apply your regular toner to prepare the skin.​\nApply Serum: Dispense 1-2 drops of the serum onto your fingertips.​\nMassage: Gently massage into the face and neck until fully absorbed.​\nMoisturize: Follow with your regular moisturizer.​\nSun Protection: If used in the morning, apply sunscreen as the final step.', 785.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 765.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA GN Galactomyces 94 SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA GN Galactomyces 94 Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-gn-galactomyces-94-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(313, 'Wow Skin Science Retinol Face Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 81, '313', '313', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin rejuvenating serum for aging, dull, and acne-prone skin Repair and revive your aging and acne-prone skin with WOW Skin Science Retinol Face Serum. The serum helps to hydrate, minimize fine lines, clear up acne flare-ups, reduce pore size, smoothen acne scars, clarify skin tone, refine skin texture, even out complexion, and boost radiance. It controls excess sebum on the skin and improves the skin renewal process. It helps to minimize acne scars and pits, giving skin a smooth texture.\nWHY YOU WOULD LOVE THIS FACE SERUM\nBrightening and smoothing serum to enhance skin textureHelp revive your dull, acne-prone aging skin with WOW Skin Science Retinol C Face Serum. Infused with potent retinol and other natural actives this serum helps to fade dark spots, fight signs of aging brought on by free radicals, brighten and nourish the skin. How to use:\n', 1147.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 52.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Wow Skin Science Retinol Face Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Wow Skin Science Retinol Face Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'wow-skin-science-retinol-face-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(314, 'Dr. Althea Natural Radiance Essence', '1', 0, 14, 131, '314', '314', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Natural Radiance Essence is an essence that brightens dull skin and helps it return to its original state. It effectively helps give you clear and glowy skin. It contains 85% of Kakadu plum extract along with soothing ingredients so that it is safe to be used on sensitive skin too. It is also free from 20 toxic ingredients and can be recycled. For better use, it is recommended to be used with our other essences as well.', 1320.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 930.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr. Althea Natural Radiance EssencePrice in BD', 'Dr. Althea Natural Radiance Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-althea-natural-radiance-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(315, 'Cosmed Intensive Anti-Aging BTX Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 132, '315', '315', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Clean and safe apothecary formulas from Anatolia\nA deeply moisturizing and protecting serum designed to support the well-aging process. Enriched with advanced actives such as Hyaluronic Acid, Bakuchiol, and Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, this serum helps reduce the appearance of fine lines, improves elasticity, and restores a youthful glow.\nSmooths fine lines and wrinkles\nHydrates and plumps skin with Hyaluronic Acid\nBoosts firmness and elasticity\nPlant-based Bakuchiol delivers retinol-like anti-aging benefits without irritation\nDermatologically tested and suitable for daily use\nCrocus Chrysanthus (Golden Crocus) – The signature ingredient of Cosmed formulas, symbolizing renewal and resilience. Known for its ability to revitalize and protect the skin.\nBakuchiol – A natural, gentle alternative to retinol, promoting smoother and younger-looking skin.\nAcetyl Hexapeptide-8 (BTX Peptide) – Helps relax micro-tensions and reduce wrinkle depth for a smoother complexion.\nApply to cleansed face and neck.\nMassage gently in circular motions, avoiding the eye area.\nUse morning and night for best results.\nDo not rinse.\nFor external use only.\nPerform a patch test before use.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs and consult your doctor.\nAvoid eye contact. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nWe don’t create products we wouldn’t use ourselves.\nEvery Cosmed product is crafted with innovative, high-quality ingredients.\nCommitment to clean, pure, eco-friendly, and sustainable formulations.\nAQUA, GLYCERIN, PANTHENOL, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, HYALURONIC ACID, SODIUM HYALURONATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, PARFUM, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, POTASSIUM HYDROXIDE, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, ZANTEDESCHIA ELLIOTTIANA FLOWER EXTRACT, BAKUCHIOL, ACTINIDIA POLYGAMA FRUIT EXTRACT, ACETYL HEXAPEPTIDE-8, CROCUS CHRYSANTHUS BULB EXTRACT.', 2403.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 127.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmed Intensive Anti-Aging BTX Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmed Intensive Anti-Aging BTX Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmed-intensive-anti-aging-btx-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(316, 'Cos De BAHA NN NMN 10 EGF FGF Peptide Serum', '1', 0, 14, 36, '316', '316', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anti-Aging & Skin Renewal: Contains 10% Nicotinamide Mononucleotide (NMN) and Resveratrol, which are known to promote cellular rejuvenation and combat signs of aging.​\nEnhanced Skin Repair: Includes Epidermal Growth Factor (EGF) and Fibroblast Growth Factor (FGF) to stimulate collagen production and improve skin elasticity.​\nDeep Hydration: Formulated with Sodium Hyaluronate and Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid to provide lasting moisture and plump the skin.​\nSoothing & Calming: Enriched with Panthenol, Madecassoside, and Allantoin to soothe irritated skin and strengthen the skin barrier.​\nAntioxidant Protection: Resveratrol offers antioxidant benefits, protecting the skin from environmental stressors.\nNicotinamide Mononucleotide (NMN): A derivative of Vitamin B3 that supports cellular energy production and skin vitality.​\nResveratrol: A powerful antioxidant that helps protect the skin from oxidative damage.​\nEGF & FGF: Growth factors that aid in skin regeneration and collagen synthesis.​\nSodium Hyaluronate & Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid: Provide deep hydration and improve skin elasticity.​\nPanthenol & Madecassoside: Known for their soothing and healing properties, beneficial for sensitive skin.​\nCleanse: Start with a clean face.​\nApply Serum: Dispense a few drops of the serum onto your fingertips.​\nMassage: Gently apply to the face and neck, focusing on areas with fine lines or dryness.​\nFollow-Up: Allow the serum to absorb fully before applying moisturizer.​\nSun Protection: Use sunscreen during the day to protect the skin and enhance results.', 1400.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA NN NMN 10 EGF FGF Peptide SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA NN NMN 10 EGF FGF Peptide Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-nn-nmn-10-egf-fgf-peptide-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(317, 'Yuderma Malarid-TRX Serum 40ml', '1', 0, 14, 50, '317', '317', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yuderma Malarid-TRX Serum (30ml) is an advanced skincare product designed to target hyperpigmentation, dark spots, and uneven skin tone. The serum is formulated with Tranexamic Acid (TRX), known for its ability to reduce pigmentation and improve skin clarity. It is ideal for individuals dealing with melasma, sunspots, and other forms of skin discoloration.\nThis serum is an excellent choice for anyone looking to address pigmentation concerns and achieve brighter, more even-toned skin.', 2075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Yuderma Malarid-TRX Serum 40mlPrice in BD', 'Yuderma Malarid-TRX Serum 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yuderma-malarid-trx-serum-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03');
