(318, 'BIO Mela B3 Pore Minimizing Serum with Niacinamide 10% 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 133, '318', '318', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BIO Mela B3 Pore Minimizing Serum is a multi-action skincare serum designed to minimise the appearance of enlarged pores, correct dark spots, and reduce skin pigmentation while improving overall skin texture. Its advanced formula combines AHAs, BHA, Niacinamide 10%, Urea, Hyaluronic Acid, and Panthenol to refine pores, balance oil, and hydrate the skin for a smoother, more even-toned complexion.\nThe blend of AHAs (Glycolic Acid, Lactic Acid, and Tartaric Acid) gently exfoliates the skin’s surface to remove dead cells that can clog pores and make them appear larger. Salix Alba (Willow Bark) Extract, a natural source of BHA (salicylic acid), helps unclog pores and refine skin texture. Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) helps regulate excess oil production, preventing clogged and enlarged pores, while also supporting brighter, more even-looking skin.\nUrea acts as a gentle exfoliant and humectant, softening and smoothing the skin. Hyaluronic Acid delivers intense hydration to plump the skin and reduce the appearance of pores, and Panthenol (Provitamin B5) helps soothe, calm redness, and support skin repair.\nKey Benefits\nMinimises the appearance of enlarged pores\nHelps correct dark spots & uneven pigmentation\nGently exfoliates to refine skin texture\nRegulates oil and reduces pore congestion\nHydrates, soothes, and supports healthier-looking skin\nSuitable for daily use\nHow to UseAfter cleansing, apply a thin layer to the targeted area and gently massage until absorbed. Suitable for daily use.\nIngredientsAqua, Niacinamide, Salix Alba Extract, Fructose, Lactic Acid, Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Glutamate, Glycolic Acid, Sodium PCA, Sodium Hyaluronate, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Hydrogenated Starch Hydrolysate, Polyglycerin-6, Hydrogenated Polysorbate 20, Sodium Hydroxide, Lysine, Glucose, Ethylhexylglycerin, Citric Acid, Hydrolyzed Wheat Protein, Tartaric Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Urea, Potassium Hydroxide, Malic Acid, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate.\nPack Size: 30ml (1 fl oz)\n(Pore Minimizing • Dark Spot Corrector • Skin Tone Evenser)', 2158.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 92.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BIO Mela B3 Pore Minimizing Serum with Niacinamide 10% 30mlPrice in BD', 'BIO Mela B3 Pore Minimizing Serum with Niacinamide 10% 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bio-mela-b3-pore-minimizing-serum-with-niacinamide-10-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
