(320, 'Angelina Hyaluronic Booster 60g', '1', 0, 14, 134, '320', '320', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brand: AngelinaWeight: 60mlProduct Type: Hyaluronic BoosterCountry of Origine: Bangladesh* Shake bottle well.*Apply once or twice a day onto cleansed, damp face and neck before or together with your moisturiser.', 153.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 7.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Angelina Hyaluronic Booster 60gPrice in BD', 'Angelina Hyaluronic Booster 60g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'angelina-hyaluronic-booster-60g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(321, 'I\'m From Rice Serum', '1', 0, 14, 129, '321', '321', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The formula consists of 73% rice embryo extract, which conditions, moisturizes, and soothes the skin. Niacinamide with adenosine brightens, evens out the skin tone, and delays the aging process, while alpha-glucan supports the functioning of the epidermal hydro-lipid barrier. All of this is complemented by nourishing and moisturizing ingredients such as hyaluronic acid and squalane, making the skin elastic, smooth, and velvety-soft. Facial serum recommended for all skin types, including sensitive skin. The product is suitable for vegans.\nKey Ingredients:\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, prep the skin with the toner. Dispense an appropriate amount at the essence stage and apply it over your face evenly. Finish with the rice cream once it’s fully absorbed.\n\nIngredients:\nAspergillus/Rice Germ Ferment Extract Filtrate, Propanediol, Glycerin, Methylpropanediol, Cyclopentasiloxane, Niacinamide, Caprylyl Methicone, Water (Aqua), Cyclohexasiloxane, 1,2-Hexanediol, Squalane, Betaine, C12-14 Pareth-12, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Vp Copolymer, Panthenol, C30-45 Alkyl Cetearyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Allantoin, Tranexamic Acid, Xanthan Gum, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Adenosine, Disodium Edta, Pentylene Glycol, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Alpha-Glucan Oligosaccharide, Sodium Hyaluronate, Madecassoside, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Hydroxypropyl Cyclodextrin, Glutathione.\n\nMade in Korea', 1925.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1375.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'I\'m From Rice SerumPrice in BD', 'I\'m From Rice Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'im-from-rice-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(322, 'APLB 42.2% Kojic Acid Vitamin C Ampoule Serum 40ml', '1', 0, 14, 4, '322', '322', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten, hydrate, and revitalize your skin with this advanced ampoule serum formulated with 42.2% Kojic Vita Cen™, a patented blend of kojic acid, vitamin C, and centella asiatica. This powerhouse formula helps improve skin elasticity, tighten pores, and balance oil and moisture for a clearer and more radiant complexion. Enriched with hyaluronic acid, beta-glucan, and squalane, it deeply hydrates while reinforcing the skin barrier. The fragrance-free, patent-based formula is gentle and suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nBenefits:\nKey Ingredients:\nFull Ingredients:Water, Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, Butylene Glycol, Propanediol, Glycerin, Diethoxyethyl Succinate, Kojic Acid, Ascorbic Acid, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Squalane, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Beta-Glucan, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extract, Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Dipropylene Glycol, Sodium Citrate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Cellulose Gum, Disodium EDTA, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Citric Acid, Xanthan Gum, Inulin, Cellulose, Glucose, Fructose, Panthenol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyacetophenone, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, 1,2-Hexanediol.\nHow to Use:Apply a moderate amount onto the face and gently dab for better absorption.\nCountry of Origin: Korea', 790.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 460.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB 42.2% Kojic Acid Vitamin C Ampoule Serum 40mlPrice in BD', 'APLB 42.2% Kojic Acid Vitamin C Ampoule Serum 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-422-kojic-acid-vitamin-c-ampoule-serum-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now