(324, 'Axis- Y The Difference Blemish Treatment Light Gel', '1', 0, 14, 12, '324', '324', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The spot treatment of your dreams! Formulated especially for acne-prone skin, this blemish treatment contains AHAs, BHAs and 2% Niacinamide that provides effective relief from breakouts and blemishes whilst maintaining oil balance. The clear gel contains visible Ceramide Capsules that help restore and promote a healthy skin barrier. Suitable for those.\nFormulated for acne-prone, oily and sensitive skin, Spot The Difference Blemish Treatment provides effective relief from breakouts and blemishes. This light gel is also infused with hydrating Ceramide capsules to help restore the skin barrier.Daily life stress along with environmental stressors like air pollution, overly humid or dry environments, and more harm our skin’s barrier function. This makes skin problems, especially acne, more common and more difficult to recover from. Inspired by these concerns from our community, and after careful formulation and countless testing, we’ve been able to create a product focusing on a “spot treatment” for affected areas.\nBenefits:\n\nIngredients:\nWater, Glycerin, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycereth-26, Niacinamide, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Althaea Rosea Flower Extract, Laminaria Japonica Extract, Eclipta Prostrata Leaf Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Ficus Carica (Fig) Fruit Extract, Ulmus Davidiana Root Extract, Amaranthus Caudatus Seed Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Monarda Didyma Leaf Extract, Hydrangea Macrophylla Leaf Extract, Mentha Aquatica Extract, Sasa Quelpaertensis Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Eclipta Prostrata Extract, Cinnamomum Camphora (Camphor) Leaf Extract, Cryptomeria Japonica Leaf Extract, Pinus Pinaster Bark/Bud Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Chamaecyparis Obtusa Water, Trehalose, Octyldodeceth-16, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tromethamine, C12-14 Pareth-12, Butylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Disodium Edta, Ceramide Np, Fructooligosaccharides, Beta-Glucan, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, 4-Terpineol, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Rhizome/Root, Moringa Oleifera Seed Oil, Glycolic Acid, Salicylic Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin\n', 1100.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 450.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Axis- Y The Difference Blemish Treatment Light GelPrice in BD', 'Axis- Y The Difference Blemish Treatment Light Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'axis-y-the-difference-blemish-treatment-light-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(325, 'APLB Collagen EGF Peptide 27.2% Mist Essence', '1', 0, 14, 4, '325', '325', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The APLB Collagen EGF Peptide 27.2% Mist Essence is a revitalizing skincare product formulated to improve skin elasticity, hydrate, and support skin regeneration. This mist essence delivers a potent combination of collagen, peptides, and epidermal growth factors (EGF) in an easy-to-use mist format, offering significant benefits for maintaining youthful, firm, and radiant skin.\nCollagen (27.2%):\nEGF (Epidermal Growth Factor):\nPeptides:\nHyaluronic Acid:\nAloe Vera Extract:\nAnti-Aging:\nReduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles by promoting collagen synthesis and enhancing skin elasticity.Supports skin regeneration, helping to maintain a youthful complexion.\nHydration and Moisture: The mist provides a boost of moisture, leaving the skin feeling refreshed, hydrated, and smooth.\nSkin Firming: Helps improve skin tone and texture by increasing collagen production, which firms and tightens the skin.\nBrightening: Regular use can help brighten dull skin, providing a more radiant and even complexion.\nConvenience: The mist format allows for quick and easy application, making it ideal for on-the-go use. It provides an instant refreshing burst whenever needed.\nThe APLB Collagen EGF Peptide Mist Essence has a lightweight, non-sticky formula that is quickly absorbed, making it suitable for all skin types. It’s a convenient option for anyone looking to instantly hydrate, firm, and rejuvenate their skin throughout the day.\nThis mist essence is an excellent option for those looking to improve skin elasticity, combat signs of aging, and maintain hydrated, firm, and glowing skin. With a high concentration of collagen, peptides, and EGF, it provides powerful skin regeneration and repair benefits while being easy to apply and refresh your skin throughout the day.\nMade in Korea', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '105ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 751.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Collagen EGF Peptide 27.2% Mist EssencePrice in BD', 'APLB Collagen EGF Peptide 27.2% Mist Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-collagen-egf-peptide-272-mist-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
