(332, 'Bionnex Vitamin C 15% + Ferulic Acid 0.5% + Arbutin + Burdock Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 107, '332', '332', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Illuminate your skin with Arogga!\nThe Bionnex Vitamin C 15% + Ferulic Acid 0.5% + Arbutin + Burdock Serum is a potent skincare solution designed to brighten, rejuvenate, and protect your skin. Enriched with 15% Vitamin C, Ferulic Acid, Arbutin, and Burdock Extract, this serum helps to reduce dark spots, even out skin tone, and promote a radiant, youthful complexion. Perfect for all skin types, it’s your go-to product for achieving glowing, healthy skin.\n15% Vitamin C:\nBrightens the skin, reduces dark spots, and promotes an even skin tone.\nBoosts collagen production, improving skin elasticity and reducing fine lines.\nFerulic Acid 0.5%:\nEnhances the stability and effectiveness of Vitamin C.\nProvides antioxidant protection against environmental damage.\nArbutin:\nReduces hyperpigmentation and dark spots, promoting a brighter complexion.\nBurdock Extract:\nRich in antioxidants, it helps to detoxify and soothe the skin.\nLightweight and Fast-Absorbing:\nThe serum is lightweight and absorbs quickly, leaving no greasy residue.\nSuitable for All Skin Types:\nGentle enough for daily use and effective for sensitive skin.\nCleanse your face thoroughly before application.\nApply a small amount of serum to your face and neck, gently massaging it into the skin.\nUse every morning and night as part of your skincare routine.\nFollow up with a moisturizer and sunscreen during the day for best results.\nBrightens Skin: Reduces dark spots and evens out skin tone.\nAnti-Aging: Boosts collagen production, reducing fine lines and wrinkles.\nAntioxidant Protection: Shields the skin from environmental damage.\nHydrates: Keeps your skin moisturized and supple.\nLightweight: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue.\nPowerful Formula: Combines Vitamin C, Ferulic Acid, Arbutin, and Burdock Extract for maximum effectiveness.\nVisible Results: Promotes a brighter, more even complexion with regular use.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle and effective for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nAnti-Aging Benefits: Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\n1 x Bionnex Vitamin C 15% + Ferulic Acid 0.5% + Arbutin + Burdock Serum 30ml\nThe Bionnex Vitamin C 15% + Ferulic Acid 0.5% + Arbutin + Burdock Serum is your ultimate solution for achieving a radiant, even-toned complexion. Whether you\'re targeting dark spots, uneven skin tone, or signs of aging, this serum delivers visible results with regular use.\nOrder now from Arogga and wake up to glowing skin every morning! ✨\n🔗 Order Now: https://www.arogga.com', 3446.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 4.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionnex Vitamin C 15% + Ferulic Acid 0.5% + Arbutin + Burdock Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Bionnex Vitamin C 15% + Ferulic Acid 0.5% + Arbutin + Burdock Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionnex-vitamin-c-15-ferulic-acid-05-arbutin-burdock-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(333, 'Mary & May 6 Peptide Complex Serum', '1', 0, 14, 121, '333', '333', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A serum with 6 types of peptides that work together in synergy to stimulate skin regeneration and refine visible wrinkles, preventing advanced signs of aging.Helps restore firm skin and hydrates the skin.Formulated with EWG verified organic quality ingredients.Free from animal testing and 7 harmful ingredients: parabens, artificial fragrances and colors, alcohol, mineral oil, surfactants and allergens.Light, fast-absorbing texture that leaves the skin without feeling greasy.\nKEY INGREDIENTS: 6 PEPTIDES: Featuring a potent blend of six peptides, each selected for their unique ability to synergize and enhance skin elasticity and firmness. This serum delivers visible results by reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, promoting a smoother, more youthful complexion.\nHOW TO USE FOR BEST RESULTS: Apply a small amount to your face and neck after cleansing and toning. Gently massage in upward motions until fully absorbed. Use morning and night for optimal firming and anti-aging effects. Pair with a moisturizer to lock in hydration and further enhance skin\'s elasticity.Made in Korea', 1265.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 935.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mary & May 6 Peptide Complex SerumPrice in BD', 'Mary & May 6 Peptide Complex Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mary-may-6-peptide-complex-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(334, 'Constanta Melasma Face Serum 30ml (CT-194)', '1', 0, 14, 137, '334', '334', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tranexamic Acid • Kojic Acid • Alpha ArbutinBrightening • Anti-Melasma • Hyperpigmentation Care\nConstanta Melasma Face Serum is a high-performance brightening and anti-pigmentation treatment specially formulated for individuals experiencing melasma, freckles, and hyperpigmentation. This concentrated serum combines clinically recognized skin-brightening actives to visibly reduce discoloration, fade dark spots, and even out skin tone.\nThe formulation features Tranexamic Acid, a well-known melasma-correcting agent that helps reduce dark patches and prevent the recurrence of pigmentation. It is further enhanced with Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin, two powerful brightening ingredients that work synergistically to lighten persistent dark spots and improve overall complexion clarity.\nTo support skin comfort and hydration, the serum also contains Hyaluronic Acid and Centella Asiatica Extract, which help soothe, moisturize, and strengthen the skin barrier, leaving the skin soft, balanced, and luminous.\nHelps reduce melasma, freckles, and hyperpigmentation\nFades dark spots and discoloration\nBrightens and evens skin tone\nContains Tranexamic Acid for targeted melasma treatment\nKojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin enhance complexion clarity\nHyaluronic Acid provides deep hydration\nCentella Asiatica Extract soothes and supports skin recovery\nSuitable for regular daily use\nApply a small amount of Constanta Melasma Face Serum to clean, dry skin.Gently massage onto the face, focusing on areas with pigmentation.Use regularly for best results.Follow with moisturizer and sun protection during the day.\nFull ingredient list was not provided in your text. You may add it later if needed.\n(If you supply the ingredient panel, I will integrate it into this section just like the previous Constanta descriptions.)\nTargeted melasma-correcting serum\nAdvanced brightening blend with triple-action ingredients\nHydrating and soothing botanical support\nHelps restore a clearer, brighter, more even complexion\nManufactured under license of Constanta Germany', 2084.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 96.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Constanta Melasma Face Serum 30ml (CT-194)Price in BD', 'Constanta Melasma Face Serum 30ml (CT-194) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'constanta-melasma-face-serum-30ml-ct-194', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:03', '2026-02-11 06:22:03'),
(335, 'Yuderma HA Prime 5D Hyaluronic Concentrate Serum 40ml', '1', 0, 14, 50, '335', '335', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yuderma HA Prime 5D Hyaluronic Concentrate Serum is a potent hydrating formula designed to provide deep, multi-layer hydration to the skin. It utilizes a unique blend of five different types of hyaluronic acid, each with varying molecular weights, to penetrate different skin layers effectively.\n\nKey Benefits:\nDeep Hydration: The combination of five hyaluronic acid types ensures comprehensive hydration, leaving the skin plump and moisturized.\nReduction of Fine Lines and Wrinkles: Regular use helps diminish the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles by enhancing skin elasticity and firmness.\nImproved Skin Texture: The serum promotes a smoother and more youthful complexion by improving overall skin texture.\nUsage Instructions:\nCleanse your face thoroughly and pat dry.\nDispense a small amount of the serum onto your fingertips.\nApply to the face and neck, gently massaging in upward, circular motions until fully absorbed.\nFor optimal results, use twice daily, in the morning and evening.\nThe serum is lightweight, fast-absorbing, and suitable for all skin types, making it an excellent addition to any skincare routine aiming for long-lasting hydration and a radiant glow', 2075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Yuderma HA Prime 5D Hyaluronic Concentrate Serum 40mlPrice in BD', 'Yuderma HA Prime 5D Hyaluronic Concentrate Serum 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yuderma-ha-prime-5d-hyaluronic-concentrate-serum-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(336, 'Sam Moist Moisturizing Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 59, '336', '336', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience deep, lasting hydration with Sam Moist Moisturizing Serum, a carefully formulated skincare essential designed to restore moisture, strengthen the skin barrier, and soothe dryness and sensitivity. Powered by a skin-loving blend of Ceramide, Hyaluronic Acid, and Allantoin, this lightweight serum delivers intense hydration while maintaining a healthy, balanced complexion.\nSpecially created for all skin types, the serum is particularly beneficial for dry, sensitive, and dehydrated skin. Its fast-absorbing, non-greasy texture penetrates deeply into the skin, providing long-lasting comfort without feeling heavy or sticky. With regular use, skin feels softer, smoother, and visibly more plump and resilient.\nAt the heart of this formula is Ceramide, an essential component that helps reinforce the skin’s natural protective barrier. By preventing moisture loss and shielding the skin from environmental stressors, ceramides play a vital role in maintaining healthy, hydrated skin. Complementing this is Hyaluronic Acid, a powerful humectant known for its ability to attract and retain moisture, helping the skin stay hydrated, supple, and youthful-looking throughout the day. Allantoin adds a soothing touch, calming irritation, supporting skin repair, and enhancing overall skin comfort.\nIdeal for daily use, Sam Moist Moisturizing Serum works to restore the skin’s moisture balance, improve texture, and reduce the appearance of dryness and fine lines caused by dehydration. Whether used alone or layered under a moisturizer, it seamlessly fits into any skincare routine and helps maintain a fresh, healthy glow.\nSuitable for all skin types, especially dry, sensitive, or dehydrated skin.\nProvides deep and long-lasting hydration\nStrengthens and repairs the skin’s natural moisture barrier\nSoothes dryness, irritation, and sensitivity\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, and non-greasy formula\nHelps maintain soft, smooth, and plump-looking skin\nCeramide\nStrengthens the skin barrier\nPrevents moisture loss\nProtects against environmental aggressors\nHyaluronic Acid\nAttracts and locks in moisture\nHelps reduce dryness and the appearance of fine lines\nPromotes plump, smooth, and youthful-looking skin\nAllantoin\nCalms and soothes irritated skin\nSupports skin healing and regeneration\nEnhances softness and comfort\nCleanse your face and gently pat dry.\nApply 2–3 drops of Sam Moist Moisturizing Serum to the face.\nMassage gently using upward, circular motions until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, morning and night, for best results.\nFollow with a moisturizer and apply sunscreen during the day.\nFor external use only. Perform a patch test before first use. Avoid direct contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist. Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.', 885.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 314.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sam Moist Moisturizing Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Sam Moist Moisturizing Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sam-moist-moisturizing-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
