(338, 'Mela-A Face Serum 50ml – Anti-Melasma & Anti-Dark Spot', '1', 0, 14, 138, '338', '338', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mela-A Intensive Depigmenting Face Serum by Avien Laboratories is a night treatment serum formulated to effectively reduce melasma, dark spots, and hyperpigmentation. Steroid-free and enriched with advanced peptides and brightening agents, it helps restore a more even and radiant skin tone.\nIndications:\nMelasma\nLentigo\nPost-inflammatory hyperpigmentation (PIH)\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nAcetyl Hexapeptide-8 & Nano Peptide-1 – Reduces pigmentation and supports skin regeneration\nNiacinamide – Evens skin tone and reduces dark spots\nPotassium Azeloyl Diglycinate – Brightening and anti-inflammatory properties\nBisabolol & Phytic Acid – Soothes skin and reduces irritation\nTocopheryl Acetate & Squalene – Antioxidant and moisturizing support\nBeta Sitosterol – Skin barrier protection\nLecithin, Lyso-Lecithin & Lactobacillus Ferment – Enhances skin texture and absorption\nDirections for Use:\nApply daily at night on affected areas.\nGently massage until fully absorbed.\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only\nAvoid direct contact with eyes; rinse thoroughly if contact occurs.\nBenefits:\nEffectively reduces melasma and dark spots\nPromotes even skin tone and radiance\nSteroid-free and safe for nightly use\nLightweight and fast-absorbing formula', 1339.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 61.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mela-A Face Serum 50ml – Anti-Melasma & Anti-Dark SpotPrice in BD', 'Mela-A Face Serum 50ml – Anti-Melasma & Anti-Dark Spot Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mela-a-face-serum-50ml-anti-melasma-anti-dark-spot', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(339, 'Melao Tea Tree Clear Skin Super Serum', '1', 0, 14, 30, '339', '339', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Melao Tea Tree Clear Skin Serum combines the power of Vitamin C, Retinol, Vitamin B3, Hyaluronic Acid, Salicylic Acid, MSM & Tea Tree Essential Oil to deliver a synergistic formula that targets Acne & Blemishes, Acne Scars & Dark Spots, Uneven Tone, Dull & Dry Skin Tone for Fresher, Clearer Skin that Glows. It effectively reduces fine lines, prevents wrinkles, improves loose skin, lifts and moisturises the skin and slows down aging.\nIngredients:\nOrganic deionized herbal infusion, organic aloe, vitamin c (sodium ascorbyl phosphate), MSM (methylsulfonylmethane), botanical hyaluronic acid, niacinamide (vitamin b3), retinol, olive oil squalene, salicylic acid, organic rosehip seed oil, carbomer, (2s)-2-amino-5-guanidinopentanoic acid, tea tree essential oil, lavender essential oil, ylang ylang essential oil, wildcrafted dandelion, organic gotu kola, wild geranium, wildcrafted horsetail, phenoxyethanol, ethyl hexyl glycerin.', 374.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 176.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao Tea Tree Clear Skin Super SerumPrice in BD', 'Melao Tea Tree Clear Skin Super Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-tea-tree-clear-skin-super-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(340, 'Vaseline Dry Serum GlutaGlow Ampoule Deodorant Ultra Bright with 3% Niacinamide + Licorice 45ml', '1', 0, 14, 139, '340', '340', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vaseline Dry Serum GlutaGlow Ampoule Deodorant Ultra Bright  The first deo serum from Vaseline clinically proven to restore underarm skin 20 layers deep, giving you whiter underarms instantlyPlucking and shaving your underarms causes damage deep beneath the skins surface, causing skin darkening to form.\nKey Fetures:\nIngredients:\nWater, Aluminum Chlorohydrate, Glyceryl Stearate, Glycerin, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Stearyl Alcohol, Niacinamide, Steareth-20, Perfume, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cyclopentasiloxane, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Titanium Dioxide, Steareth-2, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Petrolatum, Collagen Amino Acids, Glutathione\nUsage:\nFor External use only on underarm area Directions for use: (1) Squeeze the tube until a pea-sized amount comes out of the dome (2) Apply dome directly to underarms (3) Spread the product evenly on the underarm everyday\n', 594.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 356.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Dry Serum GlutaGlow Ampoule Deodorant Ultra Bright with 3% Niacinamide + Licorice 45mlPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Dry Serum GlutaGlow Ampoule Deodorant Ultra Bright with 3% Niacinamide + Licorice 45ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vaseline-dry-serum-glutaglow-ampoule-deodorant-ultra-bright-with-3-niacinamide-licorice-45ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
