(342, 'Ralycos Cutinail Serum 5ml', '1', 0, 14, 140, '342', '342', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nourish. Strengthen. Protect.\nCUTINAIL Serum is a powerful blend of Defensil Vitamin E and a rich mix of natural oils formulated to strengthen nails and cuticles while promoting overall nail health. It enhances moisture retention, reduces yellowing, discoloration, and peeling around the cuticle area. With regular use, it helps protect against infections caused by cuticle damage.\nStrengthens weak or damaged nails and cuticles\nDeeply nourishes and hydrates\nReduces yellowing and discoloration\nHelps prevent peeling and cracking\nActs as a protective barrier against infection\nCaprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Linum Usitatissimum (Flax) Seed Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Glycerin, Aqua (Water), Sucrose Laurate, Sucrose Stearate, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Isopropyl Myristate, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Octyldodecanol, Echium Plantagineum Seed Oil, Cardiospermum Halicacabum Flower/Leaf Extract, Fragrance, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Extract, Polysorbate-20, Raphanus Sativus (Radish) Seed Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), Santalum Austrocaledonicum (Sandalwood) Wood Oil, Butylated Hydroxytoluene.\nWash hands and feet thoroughly.\nAfter drying, apply the serum directly onto the cuticle area.\nAllow the serum to absorb naturally.\nFor best results, use twice daily.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nDiscontinue use if irritation or rash occurs.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nFor external use only.\nStore in a cool, dry place below 30°C.\nDo not freeze.\nNet Volume: 5 ml (When Packed)Manufactured in India by:SPARROW LIFE - CARE (P) LIMITEDE-1190, Phase IV, RIICO Industrial Area, Bhiwadi-301019, Rajasthan.📧 customercare@ralycos.com📞 +91-73039 38499', 1187.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 63.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Ralycos Cutinail Serum 5mlPrice in BD', 'Ralycos Cutinail Serum 5ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ralycos-cutinail-serum-5ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(343, 'APLB Retinol 19.4%  Vitamin C Vitamin E Mist Essence', '1', 0, 14, 4, '343', '343', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The APLB Retinol 19.4% Vitamin C Vitamin E Mist Essence is a versatile skincare product designed to deliver powerful anti-aging, brightening, and hydrating benefits in a convenient mist form. It is ideal for enhancing your skincare routine or providing a refreshing boost throughout the day.\nRetinol (19.4%):\nVitamin C:\nVitamin E:\nNiacinamide:\nHyaluronic Acid:\nAloe Vera Extract:\nThis mist essence is non-sticky and absorbs quickly, making it perfect for all skin types. Its compact bottle is easy to carry, allowing you to hydrate and refresh your skin on the go.\nThis mist essence combines the potency of retinol, vitamins, and hydrating agents in a user-friendly format. Whether you’re targeting signs of aging, uneven skin tone, or simply looking to maintain hydrated, radiant skin, this product offers a refreshing and effective solution.\nMade in Korea', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '105ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 751.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Retinol 19.4%  Vitamin C Vitamin E Mist EssencePrice in BD', 'APLB Retinol 19.4%  Vitamin C Vitamin E Mist Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-retinol-194-vitamin-c-vitamin-e-mist-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
