(345, 'Cos De BAHA NN NMN 10 EGF FGF Peptide Serum', '1', 0, 14, 36, '345', '345', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anti-Aging & Skin Renewal: Contains 10% Nicotinamide Mononucleotide (NMN) and Resveratrol, which are known to promote cellular rejuvenation and combat signs of aging.​\nEnhanced Skin Repair: Includes Epidermal Growth Factor (EGF) and Fibroblast Growth Factor (FGF) to stimulate collagen production and improve skin elasticity.​\nDeep Hydration: Formulated with Sodium Hyaluronate and Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid to provide lasting moisture and plump the skin.​\nSoothing & Calming: Enriched with Panthenol, Madecassoside, and Allantoin to soothe irritated skin and strengthen the skin barrier.​\nAntioxidant Protection: Resveratrol offers antioxidant benefits, protecting the skin from environmental stressors.\nNicotinamide Mononucleotide (NMN): A derivative of Vitamin B3 that supports cellular energy production and skin vitality.​\nResveratrol: A powerful antioxidant that helps protect the skin from oxidative damage.​\nEGF & FGF: Growth factors that aid in skin regeneration and collagen synthesis.​\nSodium Hyaluronate & Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid: Provide deep hydration and improve skin elasticity.​\nPanthenol & Madecassoside: Known for their soothing and healing properties, beneficial for sensitive skin.​\nCleanse: Start with a clean face.​\nApply Serum: Dispense a few drops of the serum onto your fingertips.​\nMassage: Gently apply to the face and neck, focusing on areas with fine lines or dryness.​\nFollow-Up: Allow the serum to absorb fully before applying moisturizer.​\nSun Protection: Use sunscreen during the day to protect the skin and enhance results.', 1190.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 910.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA NN NMN 10 EGF FGF Peptide SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA NN NMN 10 EGF FGF Peptide Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-nn-nmn-10-egf-fgf-peptide-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(346, 'Neofollics Anti Grey Hair Serum 90ml', '1', 0, 14, 141, '346', '346', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Introducing our scientifically approved Anti Grey Hair Serum, a potent solution that combats premature greying with exceptional efficacy. Our serum is a powerful leave-in treatment that targets melanin grey hair production, preventing and reversing the signs of grey hair. Enriched with antioxidants, it effectively reduces oxidative stress within the hair bulb, revitalizing your locks from within. By stimulating melanin production in greying hair, our serum helps restore natural pigmentation, which makes your own hair colour dominate again. Suitable for both men and women, this serum nourishes and hydrates your scalp and hair with its rich vitamin-infused formula.\nAt Neofollics we always work from scientific insights and developments. This makes our products of high quality and clinically proven effective at inhibiting grey hair. We love to share you more of the experiences of our customers.\nThe picture is from the clinical trial of patented Greyverse™, a key ingredient in Neofollics Anti Grey serum. It is clinically proven to prevent and reduce grey hair. The man used the lotion containing Greyverse™ for 3 months.\nThis picture if from the clinical trial of Darkenyl™, a key ingredient in Neofollics Anti Grey serum. It is clinically proven to significantly reduce the grey hair. The man used the hair lotion containing Darkenyl™ for four months.\nThe image was captured following four months of hair lotion treatment containing Darkenyl™, as part of a clinical trial conducted by Darkenyl™.\nThe outcome of a man enrolled in the result guarantee program and undergoing the Anti Grey Treatment (Anti Grey Serum + Tablets) for a duration of 6 months has proven highly satisfactory. The customer expresses great contentment with the results and intends to continue using the anti-grey treatment.\n', 4269.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 181.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neofollics Anti Grey Hair Serum 90mlPrice in BD', 'Neofollics Anti Grey Hair Serum 90ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neofollics-anti-grey-hair-serum-90ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
