(353, 'Sam Retino + Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 14, 59, '353', '353', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sam Retino+ Serum is an advanced anti-aging treatment expertly formulated to target fine lines, wrinkles, uneven texture, and early signs of aging. Powered by a potent yet balanced combination of Retinol, Niacinamide, and Collagen, this serum works deep within the skin to promote renewal, improve elasticity, and restore a youthful, radiant appearance.\nDesigned for all skin types—especially those concerned with visible signs of aging—Sam Retino+ Serum helps stimulate collagen production and accelerate cell turnover, revealing smoother, firmer, and healthier-looking skin over time. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing formula delivers powerful results without feeling heavy or greasy, making it ideal for nighttime skincare routines.\nRetinol, the gold-standard ingredient in anti-aging care, works to minimize the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and pigmentation while refining skin texture. Niacinamide supports the skin barrier, reduces the appearance of pores, and calms irritation, helping the skin stay balanced and resilient. Collagen further enhances skin firmness and hydration, giving the complexion a plump, revitalized look. Added antioxidants such as Vitamin E and Ferulic Acid, along with soothing botanical extracts like Aloe Vera and Tea Extract, help protect the skin from environmental stressors and maintain overall skin comfort.\nWith consistent use, Sam Retino+ Serum helps visibly improve skin tone, texture, and firmness, leaving the skin looking smoother, refreshed, and more youthful.\nSuitable for all skin types, especially those concerned with signs of aging.\nTargets fine lines, wrinkles, and premature aging\nBoosts collagen production to improve elasticity and firmness\nPromotes skin renewal and smoother texture\nFast-absorbing, lightweight, non-greasy formula\nEnhances skin radiance and overall skin health\nRetinol\nStimulates collagen production to reduce fine lines and wrinkles\nPromotes cell turnover for smoother, youthful-looking skin\nImproves skin tone and texture while minimizing pigmentation\nNiacinamide\nStrengthens the skin barrier and protects against environmental damage\nMinimizes the appearance of pores and regulates oil production\nSoothes redness and irritation\nCollagen\nSupports skin structure and elasticity\nHydrates and plumps the skin\nHelps maintain a firm, youthful complexion\nAqua, Retinol, Niacinamide, Collagen, Vitamin E, Propylene Glycol, Ferulic Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Glycerin, Tea Tree Extract, Aloe Vera Extract, Tea Extract.\nCleanse your face and gently pat dry.\nApply 2–3 drops of Sam Retino+ Serum evenly over the face.\nMassage gently until fully absorbed.\nFollow with a moisturizer if desired.\nUse at night only.\nApply sunscreen during the daytime, as retinol can increase skin sensitivity to sunlight.\nFor external use only. Perform a patch test before first use. Avoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water. Keep out of reach of children. If irritation or rash occurs, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist. Always use sunscreen during the day while using retinol-based products.', 1199.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1199.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sam Retino + Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Sam Retino + Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sam-retino-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(354, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule', '1', 0, 14, 16, '354', '354', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella-Asiatica 100 Ampoule is made from 100% Centella Asiatica extract which is safe for sensitive skin and makes skin brighter and younger. The Centella Asiatica extract consists of 30% Asiaticoside which can balance oil levels in the skin, 30% Asiatic Acid which can increase the skin’s protective layer and can function as an antioxidant, and 40% Madecassic Acid which can repair problematic skin. Has a formula that quickly absorbs and moisturizes the skin. Suitable for all skin types, this ampoule repairs damaged skin while regulating its moisture and oil balance. Main ingredient cenetella asiatica extracts strengthen the skin’s barrier for healthier looking skin.\nIngredients: Centella Asiatica Extract 100% • Water • Glycerin • Butylene Glycol • 1,2 – Hexanediol • Phenoxyethanol • Cellulose Gum\nHow to Use:\n1. Apply after cleansing and toning\n2. Apply a few drops evenly throughout skin and seal in with moisturiser while still slightly damp for extra hydration', 462.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 318.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella AmpoulePrice in BD', 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(355, 'Bionnex Anti-Hair Loss Serum Concentrate 12*10ml', '1', 0, 14, 107, '355', '355', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your hair with Arogga!\nThe Bionnex Anti-Hair Loss Serum Concentrate is a powerful, targeted solution designed to combat hair loss and promote healthier, stronger hair growth. Packed with nourishing ingredients, this serum concentrate helps to reduce hair fall, strengthen hair follicles, and improve scalp health. Each pack contains 12 x 10ml vials, making it convenient for regular use and ensuring you get the most out of this effective treatment.\nReduces Hair Loss:\nTargets the root cause of hair fall, helping to reduce shedding and breakage.\nStrengthens Hair Follicles:\nNourishes and strengthens hair follicles, promoting healthier hair growth.\nImproves Scalp Health:\nEnhances blood circulation to the scalp, creating a healthy environment for hair growth.\nLightweight and Non-Greasy:\nAbsorbs quickly into the scalp without leaving a greasy residue.\nConvenient Vial Format:\nEach pack contains 12 x 10ml vials for easy and precise application.\nSuitable for All Hair Types:\nGentle and effective for both men and women.\nCleanse your scalp and hair thoroughly.\nOpen one 10ml vial and apply the serum directly to the scalp.\nGently massage the serum into the scalp using circular motions.\nUse 2-3 times per week or as directed by a healthcare professional.\nDo not rinse off after application.\nReduces Hair Fall: Helps to minimize hair shedding and breakage.\nPromotes Hair Growth: Strengthens hair follicles for thicker, healthier hair.\nImproves Scalp Health: Enhances blood circulation and nourishes the scalp.\nNon-Greasy: Absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky residue.\nConvenient: Easy-to-use vials for precise application.\nEffective Formula: Targets the root cause of hair loss for visible results.\nNourishing Ingredients: Promotes healthier and stronger hair growth.\nConvenient Packaging: 12 x 10ml vials for regular use.\nSuitable for All Hair Types: Safe and effective for both men and women.\n12 x Bionnex Anti-Hair Loss Serum Concentrate 10ml vials\nThe Bionnex Anti-Hair Loss Serum Concentrate is your ultimate solution for combating hair loss and achieving thicker, healthier hair. Whether you\'re dealing with excessive shedding or looking to improve scalp health, this serum delivers visible results with regular use.\nOrder now from Arogga and take the first step towards revitalizing your hair! 💇‍♂️💇‍♀️\n🔗 Order Now: https://www.arogga.com', 4746.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 84.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionnex Anti-Hair Loss Serum Concentrate 12*10mlPrice in BD', 'Bionnex Anti-Hair Loss Serum Concentrate 12*10ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionnex-anti-hair-loss-serum-concentrate-1210ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
