(358, 'Chemist At Play 10% Vitamin C Brightening Face Serum – 30ml ,With 2% Glucosamine & Ceramides for Radiant Skin', '1', 0, 14, 145, '358', '358', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:The Chemist At Play 10% Vitamin C Brightening Face Serum is a lightweight, fast-absorbing serum designed to brighten, even skin tone, and enhance radiance. Infused with 10% Vitamin C (3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid), 2% Glucosamine, and Ceramides, it helps reduce dullness, promote collagen synthesis, and strengthen the skin barrier, leaving your skin smooth, hydrated, and visibly luminous.\nKey Benefits:\nBrightens and evens out skin tone\nReduces dullness and promotes natural radiance\nStrengthens the skin barrier with Ceramides\nHydrates and plumps skin with Sodium Hyaluronate\nGentle formula with Allantoin for soothing care\nKey Ingredients:\n3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid (Vitamin C) – Potent antioxidant for brightening\nAcetyl Glucosamine (2%) – Supports skin renewal and reduces pigmentation\nCeramides (Rice & Konjac Ceramides) – Reinforce the skin barrier and retain moisture\nSodium Hyaluronate – Deep hydration and plumping\nAllantoin & Lactic Acid – Soothes and gently exfoliates\nHow to Use:\nApply 2–3 drops onto clean, dry face.\nGently massage and pat until fully absorbed.\nFollow with moisturizer and sunscreen during the day.\nUse daily for best results.\nCaution:\nFor external use only.\nPatch test recommended before first use.\nDiscontinue if irritation or redness occurs.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStorage Instructions:\nStore in a cool, dry place below 30°C, away from sunlight.\nAvoid leaving the bottle open for long periods.\nDo not freeze.\nColor and fragrance may naturally vary over time without affecting efficacy.\nNet Content: 30 ml | 1.01 fl oz', 1295.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 555.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Chemist At Play 10% Vitamin C Brightening Face Serum – 30ml ,With 2% Glucosamine & Ceramides for Radiant SkinPrice in BD', 'Chemist At Play 10% Vitamin C Brightening Face Serum – 30ml ,With 2% Glucosamine & Ceramides for Radiant Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'chemist-at-play-10-vitamin-c-brightening-face-serum-30ml-with-2-glucosamine-ceramides-for-radiant-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
