(367, 'Mixdair Retinol Anti-Wrinkle Eye Serum 30gm', '1', 0, 13, 147, '367', '367', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 & RetinolNet Content: — 30gm\nProduct Description:MIXDAIR Anti-Wrinkle Eye Essence is formulated with Retinol, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, and small-molecule polypeptides to deliver powerful anti-aging care for the delicate eye area. This lightweight, nourishing essence provides triple-action benefits: moisturizing, hydrating, and locking in moisture—leaving the skin around your eyes refreshed, radiant, and visibly smoother.\nThe fast-absorbing formula gently penetrates the delicate eye contour, helping to reduce the appearance of fine lines, dryness, and dullness. With regular use, it helps improve skin elasticity and brightness for a more youthful, plump, and revitalized look.\nSmoothes fine lines and crow’s feet\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes delicate eye skin\nImproves elasticity and firmness\nBrightens and refreshes tired-looking eyes\nLightweight, non-greasy texture\nSuitable for daily use\nAfter cleansing, apply an appropriate amount of the essence around the eye area. Gently massage with fingertips until fully absorbed.\nRetinol – Fights signs of aging and promotes cell turnover\nAcetyl Hexapeptide-8 – A peptide known for reducing expression lines\nPalmitoyl Tripeptide-5 – Enhances collagen production\nHyaluronic Acid – Provides intense hydration\nPortulaca Oleracea Extract – Soothes and calms skin\nCentella Asiatica Glycoside – Helps repair and protect skin\nVitamin E (Tocopherol) – An antioxidant that protects and nourishes\nHydrolyzed Wheat Protein & Collagen – Boosts firmness and smoothness\nAllantoin – Calms and softens skin\nStore in a cool, dry place. Avoid direct sunlight.\nNot recommended for children under 3 years old.\nIn case of accidental contact with eyes, rinse immediately with clean water.\nIf irritation or discomfort occurs, discontinue use and consult a physician if needed.', 396.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 