(369, 'La Roche Posay Pigmentclar Eye Cream For Dark Circles (15ml)', '1', 0, 13, 62, '369', '369', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten and refresh tired-looking eyes with La Roche-Posay Pigmentclar Eye Cream, a targeted under-eye treatment designed to visibly improve the look of dark circles, uneven tone, and dullness around the delicate eye area. Its smooth, comfortable texture hydrates while helping the under-eye look more even, rested, and radiant—perfect for daily use in both morning and night routines.\nThis formula combines powerful tone-improving and energizing ingredients. Niacinamide helps support the skin barrier and improve the appearance of uneven tone, while Phenylethyl Resorcinol and Ascorbyl Glucoside (Vitamin C derivative) work to enhance brightness and promote a more luminous look over time. Caffeine helps reduce the appearance of puffiness and fatigue, and light-reflecting mineral pigments help the eye area appear instantly more awake and fresh.\nGentle yet effective, it’s ideal for anyone dealing with persistent under-eye darkness and a tired appearance—especially those who want a daily eye cream that hydrates, smooths, and boosts radiance without feeling heavy.\nHelps visibly reduce the appearance of dark circles\nBrightens and improves the look of uneven under-eye tone\nHelps under-eyes look more rested and fresh\nSupports hydration and smoothness for the delicate eye area\nLight-reflecting pigments help provide an instant brightening effect\nSuitable for daily use\nApply a small amount to the under-eye area morning and/or night. Gently tap with your ring finger until absorbed. Avoid direct contact with eyes.\n15ml\nAqua/Water/Eau, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Dimethicone, Niacinamide, Isopropyl Palmitate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Ammonium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, CI 77891/Titanium Dioxide, CI 77491/Iron Oxides, Mica, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Hydrolyzed Rice Protein, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Lauroyl Glutamate, Stearic Acid, Phenylethyl Resorcinol, Phenoxyethanol, Caffeine, PEG/PPG/Polybutylene Glycol-8/5/3 Glycerin, PEG-100 Stearate, Magnesium Chloride, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Palmitic Acid, Poloxamer 338, Silica, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Dimethiconol, Pentylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Ginkgo Biloba Leaf Extract, Tin Oxide, Isopropyl Titanium Triisostearate, Caprylyl Glycol, Myristic Acid, Ferulic Acid, Disodium EDTA, Lysine, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Citric Acid, Aluminum Hydroxide, Alumina, Glyceryl Stearate.\nIf you want, I can also make a short bullet version for marketplaces (Daraz/Amazon) with 5 highlights + how to use + key ingredients.', 2999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 291.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche Posay Pigmentclar Eye Cream For Dark Circles (15ml)Price in BD', 'La Roche Posay Pigmentclar Eye Cream For Dark Circles (15ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-pigmentclar-eye-cream-for-dark-circles-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
