(371, 'Cetaphil Deep Hydration Refreshing Eye Serum 15ml', '1', 0, 13, 63, '371', '371', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This product is a specialized eye treatment designed to deliver intense hydration and refresh the delicate eye area. Unlike traditional, heavier eye creams, it has a lightweight, serum-like texture that targets dehydration, which is a primary cause of fine lines and tired-looking skin around the eyes.\nIntense Hydration: The core function is to provide deep and long-lasting moisture to the under-eye area, which is prone to dryness due to a lack of oil glands.\nRefreshing & Depuffing: Formulated with Hyaluronic Acid and Cucumber Extract, it has a cooling effect that helps to soothe the eye area and reduce the appearance of puffiness.\nBrightening Effect: Hydration alone can make the skin appear more plump and radiant, which helps diminish the look of dark circles caused by shadowing from dehydration or thin skin.\nLightweight Texture: As a \"serum,\" it is fast-absorbing and non-greasy, making it an excellent base under makeup or under a richer eye cream for added benefits.\nStrengthens the Skin Barrier: It contains Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) and Licorice Extract to help improve the skin\'s barrier function, calm irritation, and even out skin tone.\nFormulated for Delicate Skin: It is:\nFragrance-Free\nHypoallergenic\nNon-Comedogenic (will not clog pores)\nDermatologist Tested\nPurpose: To hydrate, refresh, and brighten the under-eye area.\nIdeal For: Daily use, morning and/or night, for anyone showing signs of dehydration (fine lines, dullness) or puffiness around the eyes.\nApplication Steps:\nClean: Start with a clean face.\nDispense: Use a very small amount. A drop about half the size of a grain of rice is often sufficient for both eyes.\nApply: Gently dot the serum around the orbital bone (the bone that encircles your eye socket), avoiding the immediate lash line to prevent irritation.\nPat: Using your ring finger (which applies the least pressure), gently pat and tap the serum into the skin until absorbed. Do not rub or tug.\nLayer: Follow with your regular moisturizer and, in the morning, always apply sunscreen.\nFrequency: Can be used both AM and PM. The morning application is great for depuffing and prepping for makeup, while the evening application allows for deep hydration overnight.\nThe formula is built around powerful hydrators and soothing agents:\nHyaluronic Acid: A superstar humectant that can hold up to 1000 times its weight in water. It draws moisture into the skin to instantly plump and smooth the appearance of fine lines caused by dehydration.\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): Helps to strengthen the delicate skin barrier, reduce water loss, and can have a mild brightening effect on discoloration.\nCucumber Fruit Extract: Known for its soothing, cooling, and anti-inflammatory properties, which help to reduce the look of puffiness and refresh tired eyes.\nLicorice Root Extract: A natural skin-brightening ingredient that can help even out skin tone, potentially reducing the appearance of dark circles.\nFor External Use Only: Take extreme care to avoid direct contact with eyes. If product gets into eyes, rinse immediately with plenty of water.\nGentle Application: The skin around the eyes is extremely thin and delicate. Always pat the product on gently; pulling or stretching the skin can cause damage over time.\nDiscontinue Use if Irritation Occurs: If you experience redness, stinging, or itching, stop using the product.\nPatch Test: If you have highly sensitive skin or known allergies, test the product on your inner arm first.\nIndividuals with dehydrated skin around the eyes, showing fine lines.\nAnyone looking for a lightweight, fast-absorbing eye product, especially for daytime use or under makeup.\nPeople who struggle with puffiness or tired-looking eyes in the morning.\nThose with sensitive skin who need a fragrance-free, gentle formula.\nThe Cetaphil Deep Hydration Refreshing Eye Serum is an excellent choice for targeting dehydration and puffiness in the delicate eye area. Its strength is its lightweight, hydrating formula that provides an immediate refreshed feeling and works to smooth the appearance of fine lines caused by dryness. It is a perfect gentle, entry-level eye treatment or a hydrating base for those who already use a richer eye cream.', 2350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Deep Hydration Refreshing Eye Serum 15mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Deep Hydration Refreshing Eye Serum 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-deep-hydration-refreshing-eye-serum-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(372, 'The Ordinary Multi Peptide Eye Serum', '1', 0, 13, 25, '372', '372', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Multi-Peptide Eye Serum is a water-based formula designed to target the appearance of common signs of aging around the eye area. This serum utilizes multiple peptide technologies to help reduce the appearance of crow’s feet and under eye wrinkles, eye bags, puffiness, and dark circles, leaving the eye area looking brighter, smoother and less puffy.The peptide technologies found within this eye serum formula include Palmitoyl Tripeptide-38. This formula also contains a combination of niacinamide and fraxinus excelsior bark extract, as well as propyl gallate, gallyl glucoside, and epigallocatechin gallatyl glucoside.Note: This formula comes at a higher price point than many of our other products due to the high concentration of actives required to address multiple eye area concerns at once. However, a little does go a long way. If you are looking to target puffiness and dark circles specifically, you may wish to explore our Caffeine Solution.\nKey ingredients\nThis formula contains Matrixyl™ synthe\'6™, RetinoPeptide 189, SYN™-AKE, CYTOBIOL™ LUMIN-EYE, UNISOOTH EG-28, and Eyeseryl™ peptide.All trademarks belong to their respective owners. Matrixyl™ synthe\'6™ is a trademark of Sederma Inc., RetinoPeptide 189 is the property of SYMRISE AG, SYN™ is a trademark of DSM, CYTOBIOL™ LUMIN-EYE is a trademark of Gattefosse SAS, UNISOOTH EG-28 is a trademark of Givaudan, and Eyeseryl™ is a trademark of Lipotec S.A.U. Neither DECIEM nor The Ordinary is affiliated with the trademark owners.\nUse after cleansing, before water-based serums, anhydrous serums, oils, suspensions or creams.', 3900.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Multi Peptide Eye SerumPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Multi Peptide Eye Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-multi-peptide-eye-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(373, '3W Clinic Collagen Retinol Ball Whitening and Anti Wrinkle Eye Serum', '1', 0, 13, 114, '373', '373', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3w Clinic Collagen Retinol Eye Ball Serum This is an all-in-one serum that can moisturize and whiten skin while smoothing out wrinkles. Due to the fact that the serum is enriched with various vitamins, collagen and retinol, it effectively nourishes the skin, and no matter how sensitive it is, the serum does not cause irritation on it. Collagen slows down the aging process by improving skin tone and smoothing out wrinkles. In addition, collagen restores the protective and regenerative properties of the epidermis, which is especially important for the eye area. Retinol also improves the texture, tone and relief of the skin. And due to the fact that the composition contains collagen, the effect of rejuvenation is enhanced several times. Moreover, retinoids help retain moisture in the cells, as well as remove age spots. Ball massagers relieve stress from the skin and smooth wrinkles around the eyes. They also improve blood circulation and help the serum to be absorbed.\nContains hydrolyzed collagen and retinol, a pure vitamin A ingredient, to provide nutrition and elasticity to the skin.The cooling massage effect of the rolling massage balls on the dull and saggy skin around the eyes enhances the skin absorption of the serum, and refines the skin texture to make the skin around the eyes smooth and lively.The three balls work effectively to control wrinkles and smooth skin around the eyes.\n\nAt the last stage of skin care, after applying an appropriate amount of this product, massage it with a massage ball to let it absorb into the skin.\n\nPurified water, glycerin, butylene glycol, niacinamide, carbomer, mineral oil, cetyl alcohol, stearyl alcohol, myristyl alcohol, lauryl alcohol, glyceryl stearate, glyceryl stearate lactate, PEG- 100 Stearate, Beeswax, Polybate 20, Dimethicone, Triethanolamine, Hydrolyzed Collagen (1,000ppm), Adenosine, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Methyl Methacrylate Crosspolymer, Retinol ( 1,000 ppb), Hydrogenated Lecithin, Cholesterol, BHT, Tocopheryl Acetate, Mung Bean Seed Extract, BHA, Oat Flour Extract, Peppermint Leaf Extract, Matricaria Flower Extract, Rosemary Leaf Extract, Fragrance, Benzyl Alcohol, Sheet Ral, Geraniol, Farnesol, Linalool, Citronellol, Hexylcinnamal, Limonene, Phenoxyethanol.', 455.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 195.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Collagen Retinol Ball Whitening and Anti Wrinkle Eye SerumPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Collagen Retinol Ball Whitening and Anti Wrinkle Eye Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-collagen-retinol-ball-whitening-and-anti-wrinkle-eye-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(374, 'Buy 1 Monica Intensive Placenta Eye Seum 15ml Get 02pcs Sini Care Intensive Recovery Placenta Sheet Mask Free Save 1116tk', '1', 0, 13, 149, '374', '374', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sini Care Monica Intensive Placenta Eye Serum helps you to restore your skin confidence with moisture and vitality. Placenta penetrates deep into the dermis to treat signs of aging and fortifies the skin’s natural moisture barrier. Natural oils provide maximum moisture retention capacity for healthy, soft and smooth result.\nSinicare Monica Intensive Placenta Eye Serum helps you to restore your skin confidence with moisture and vitality.\nSinicare Monica Intensive Placenta Eye Serum helps you to restore your skin confidence with moisture and vitality. Placenta penetrates deep into the dermis to treat signs of aging and fortifies the skin’s natural moisture barrier. Natural oils provide maximum moisture retention capacity for healthy, soft and smooth result.DirectionsGently roll Monica Intensive Placenta Eye Serum under the eye from the inner corner to the outer corner, one to two times.Use finger to smooth in any excess with your fingertips.\n– Aids in skin regeneration– By improving moisture level of the skin– Effectively helps to reduce the effects of aging\nCountry of Origin: Australia.', 1200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Buy 1 Monica Intensive Placenta Eye Seum 15ml Get 02pcs Sini Care Intensive Recovery Placenta Sheet Mask Free Save 1116tkPrice in BD', 'Buy 1 Monica Intensive Placenta Eye Seum 15ml Get 02pcs Sini Care Intensive Recovery Placenta Sheet Mask Free Save 1116tk Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'buy-1-monica-intensive-placenta-eye-seum-15ml-get-02pcs-sini-care-intensive-recovery-placenta-sheet-mask-free-save-1116tk', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
