(376, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Eye Serum', '1', 0, 13, 8, '376', '376', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Eye Serum Improve eye skin, remove the puffiness and dark circles, eye contour to improve the prevention of fine wrinkles, creating bright eyes for bags under eyes anti age.\nEffect:Improve eye skin, remove the puffiness and dark circles, eye contour to improve the prevention of fine wrinkles, creating bright eyes for bags under eyes anti age.\nUsage: After cleaning the eye skin, sliding from the inside to the outside.\nIngredients: Prunus Lannesiana, Flower Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Ascorbic Acid, Tremella Fuciformis Polysaccharide, Niacinamide\n\nMade in PRC', 183.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 167.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Eye SerumPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Eye Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-eye-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(377, 'Cetaphil Hydrating Eye Gel Cream With Hyaluronic Acid - 14ml', '1', 0, 13, 63, '377', '377', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refresh tired-looking eyes with Cetaphil Hydrating Eye Gel-Cream, a lightweight yet deeply moisturizing formula that delivers up to 24-hour hydration. Its unique gel-cream texture absorbs quickly like a gel while nourishing like a cream, helping the delicate under-eye area feel smooth, comfortable, and replenished.\nEnriched with Hyaluronic Acid (Sodium Hyaluronate) to attract and retain moisture, this eye gel-cream supports the skin’s natural moisture barrier for a softer, plumper appearance. The formula also features Niacinamide and Vitamin E along with botanical extracts to help condition and soothe the under-eye area—perfect for daily use, morning and night.\nKey Benefits\nProvides continuous 24-hour hydration\nFast-absorbing gel-cream texture; non-greasy feel\nFormulated with Hyaluronic Acid to lock in moisture\nHelps smooth and refresh the under-eye area\nSuitable for daily use\nHow to UseApply a pearl-sized amount around the eye area and gently smooth until fully absorbed. Use morning and night.\nSize: 14mlProduct Type: Hydrating Eye Gel-CreamBrand: Cetaphil®', 1899.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 601.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Hydrating Eye Gel Cream With Hyaluronic Acid - 14mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Hydrating Eye Gel Cream With Hyaluronic Acid - 14ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-hydrating-eye-gel-cream-with-hyaluronic-acid-14ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(378, 'Primaderm  Radiant Acid Peel 10ml', '1', 0, 9, 57, '378', '378', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Localized anti-blemish peeling\nIntensive corrector for localized hyperpigmentation formulated with hydroxy acids (glycolic and salicylic acid) and pigmentation regulators (tranexamic acid and azeoglycine) for a progressive reduction of all types of spots.', 2950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2950.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Primaderm  Radiant Acid Peel 10mlPrice in BD', 'Primaderm  Radiant Acid Peel 10ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'primaderm-radiant-acid-peel-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(379, 'The Ordinary Salicylic Acid 2% Solution for Acne Prone Skin', '1', 0, 9, 25, '379', '379', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'From the skincare experts at The Ordinary, comes the hero ingredient Salicylic Acid 2% Solution. A lightweight serum suitable for all skin types, especially those with blemish-prone complexions.\nSinking readily into the skin, the formula seeks to buff away dead skin cells that often cause congested pores. With continued use, the serum helps to support a balanced, even-looking skin tone.\n\nSunburn Alert: This product contains a beta hydroxy acid (BHA) that may increase your skin\'s sensitivity to the sun and particularly the possibility of sunburn. Use a sunscreen, wear protective clothing, and limit sun exposure while using this product and for a week afterwards.\n\n\nAqua (Water), Saccharide Isomerate, Cocamidopropyl Dimethylamine, Salicylic Acid, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Polysorbate 20, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Sodium Hydroxide, Phenoxyethanol, Chlorphenesin.\n\nMade in Canada', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 925.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Salicylic Acid 2% Solution for Acne Prone SkinPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Salicylic Acid 2% Solution for Acne Prone Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-salicylic-acid-2-solution-for-acne-prone-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(380, 'Cosmed Body Elixir After Epilation Serum 100ml', '1', 0, 9, 132, '380', '380', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmed Body Elixir After Epilation Serum 100mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmed Body Elixir After Epilation Serum 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmed-body-elixir-after-epilation-serum-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(381, 'Babe Vitamin C+ Ampoule 10\'s Pack', '1', 0, 9, 99, '381', '381', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Babe Vitamin C+ Ampoule light fluid texture suits all skin types, including sensitive skin, and can, in essence, return to dull and tired skin an even.\nBabe Vitamin C+ Ampoule are perfect to hydrate and illuminate the skin lending it a radiant and rejuvenated look. With Glycerin and Natural Moisturizing Factors, these ampoules can deeply hydrate the skin not only restoring it to proper moisture levels but also preventing skin dehydration. With Licorice Root they help inhibit the melanin production leading to a brighter and luminous complexion.\nHow to use\n', 3212.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Box', 0.00, 1, NULL, 88.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Babe Vitamin C+ Ampoule 10\'s PackPrice in BD', 'Babe Vitamin C+ Ampoule 10\'s Pack Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'babe-vitamin-c-ampoule-10s-pack', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04');
