(382, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule 30ml', '1', 0, 9, 16, '382', '382', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule is a brightening and anti-wrinkle functional cosmetic formulated to restore, strengthen, and soothe damaged or sensitive skin. Infused with fermented Centella Asiatica from Madagascar, skin-repairing probiotics, and barrier-strengthening ceramides, this intensive ampoule boosts elasticity while helping the skin feel firm, balanced, and rejuvenated.\nDermatologically tested with a Skin Irritation Test Completed, this ampoule is gentle, deeply hydrating, and suitable for all skin types—including sensitive skin.\nImproves Skin Elasticity with fermented Centella and ceramides\nStrengthens Skin Barrier with ProBio-Cica complex & probiotics\nBrightens Dull Skin with Niacinamide\nAnti-Wrinkle Care powered by Adenosine\nDeep Soothing & Repair from Centella actives (Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside & Asiatic Acid)\nHydrates & Softens with Panthenol, Allantoin & Sodium Hyaluronate\nLightweight, Fast-Absorbing Texture\nDermatologically Tested – Skin Irritation Test Completed\nWater, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Propanediol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Dipropylene Glycol, Centella Asiatica Extract (7,308 ppm), Polyglyceryl-3 Distearate, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, C14-22 Alcohols, Arginine, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Betaine, Allantoin, Panthenol, Hydroxystearic Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Glyceryl Stearate Citrate, Adenosine, C12-20 Alkyl Glucoside, Sodium Polyacrylate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Xanthan Gum, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Sodium Phytate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Stearic Acid, Ceramide NP, Sorbitan Isostearate, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Lactobacillus Ferment (20 ppm), Polyglyceryl-10 Myristate, Madecassic Acid (16 ppm), Asiaticoside (16 ppm), Phytosphingosine, Asiatic Acid (8 ppm), Sucrose Distearate, Polyglutamic Acid, Lauric Acid, Phytosterols.\nDrop an appropriate amount onto clean skin after toner.\nSpread evenly across the face.\nGently pat to promote absorption.\nFollow with moisturizer.\nSuitable for AM & PM use.\nFor external use only.\nStop using if irritation or redness occurs.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nBrand: SKIN1004\nProduct Name: Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule\nFunction: Brightening & Anti-Wrinkle\nCategory: Functional Cosmetic\nSkin Type: Sensitive, Dry, Irritated, All Skin Types\nSize: 30ml\nMade in: Korea', 840.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 359.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule 30mlPrice in BD', 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-probio-cica-intensive-ampoule-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
