(384, 'Singuladerm Corrective Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 9, 144, '384', '384', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Serum formulated with a growth factor, Reneseed™ and a biotechnological extract, Equioseb™, to normalise the skin\'s sebum according to its needs and reduce pore size while treating existing imperfections and preventing the formation of post-inflammatory blemishes. Indicated for all types of imperfections including those caused by hormonal or adult acne.\n', 3412.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 238.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Singuladerm Corrective Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Singuladerm Corrective Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'singuladerm-corrective-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(385, 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Plus Niacinamide Serum with Hyaluronic Acid & 10% Niacinamide', '1', 0, 9, 151, '385', '385', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hydrate and treat skin with Hydro Boost+ Niacinamide Serum. This powerful, multi-action hydrating serum exfoliates to reduce the look of dark marks and refine the look of pores, leaving skin with a clearer-looking complexion. Plus, it helps strengthen skin\'s moisture barrier while visibly improving dull, uneven skin tone.Reveal your clear, healthy glow with 10% niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid and glycerin. Gentle on skin and suitable for all skin types and tones, including acne prone and sensitive skin.\n\nHow to Use:\nSTEP 1\nApply a pearl-sized amount twice a day to cleansed face and neck, avoiding contact with the eyes.\nSTEP 2\nAllow serum to fully absorb into skin.\nSTEP 3\nFollow with moisturizer as needed.\n\nWhen your complexion needs results, reach for the powerful yet gentle Hydro Boost+ line – targeted treatments with powerful dermatologist-recommended ingredients to unleash visibly clear, hydrated-looking and glowing skin.*', 3153.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1472.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Plus Niacinamide Serum with Hyaluronic Acid & 10% NiacinamidePrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Plus Niacinamide Serum with Hyaluronic Acid & 10% Niacinamide Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-hydro-boost-plus-niacinamide-serum-with-hyaluronic-acid-10-niacinamide', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(386, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule', '1', 0, 9, 16, '386', '386', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'WHAT IT IS:\nThe highly concentrated ampoule, which has the nutritional and efficacy of fermented Centella, takes care of the skin healthily with quick sedation on the irritated skin.\nAN ALL-IN-ONE AMPOULE: An all-rounder product to help with the replenishment, soothing, softening and rejuvenation of the skin.\nSOOTHING AMPOULE WITH CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT : Using undamaged & high-quality extracts from Centella Asiatica harvested in Madagascar, this serum offers intense hydration and balances sebum levels, reducing acne, dry patches, skin irritation and prevents signs of aging.\nMAIN EFFECTS : Soothes blemishes and reduces excess oil production, diminishes the appearance of dark spots and hyperpigmentation, provides deep hydration, and strengthens the skin barrier.\nHYDRATION LIKE NO OTHER: Thanks to its innovative formulation and its high pure extract concentration, this ampoule seeps deep into the skin, leaving it supple all day long. You will feel the difference from other products that often leave the skin dry after 1 hour.\nHOW TO USE: After cleansing, put an appropriate amount on a cotton pad or hands. Gently apply in the direction of your skin texture and let it absorb.', 2000.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive AmpoulePrice in BD', 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-probio-cica-intensive-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(387, 'Singuladerm Radiant Dual Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 9, 144, '387', '387', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Intensive dual action serum that combines state-of-the-art depigmenting active ingredients such as Stellight™ , a state-of-the-art peptide that acts on 5 levels of melanogenesis, together with tranexamic acid, niacinamide and azeoglycine. Its anti-aging action is provided by the AntioxFerulic Complex , an anti-radical complex and MARSturizer™ , which will restore the skin’s uniformity and luminosity.\n', 3950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -3950.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Singuladerm Radiant Dual Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Singuladerm Radiant Dual Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'singuladerm-radiant-dual-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
