(389, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Ingrow Gone Ingrown Hair Removal 90ml', '1', 0, 9, 104, '389', '389', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BioMD Ingrow Gone is a medical-grade skin care solution specially formulated to remove and prevent ingrown hairs while soothing irritated skin. Waxing, shaving, and other hair removal methods can cause hairs to grow sideways under the skin, leading to bumps, redness, and razor burn. Ingrow Gone helps address these concerns effectively and gently.\nThis advanced formula works with a three-fold action to eliminate existing ingrown hairs, prevent their recurrence, and reduce razor burns and bumps. Its exfoliating and skin-renewing ingredients help clear blocked pores, allowing trapped hairs to grow out naturally while improving overall skin texture.\nRemoves existing ingrown hairs\nHelps prevent recurring ingrown hair growth\nReduces razor burns, bumps, and irritation\nTo remove ingrown hairs:Apply the lotion morning and evening to a cotton pad and gently rub onto the affected areas.\nTo prevent ingrown hairs:Apply to the hair before hair removal. After hair removal, apply twice a week to the affected areas.\nSalicylic Acid: Helps exfoliate the skin and unclog pores\nGlycolic, Lactic, Malic & Citric Acids: Promote gentle chemical exfoliation and skin renewal\nGlycerin, Sodium PCA & Sodium Lactate: Help maintain skin hydration and balance\nAlcohol Denat., Aqua, Salicylic Acid, Glycerin, Sodium Lactate, Sodium PCA, Sodium Glycolate, Sodium Citrate, Sodium Malate, Lactic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Malic Acid, Citric Acid\nMedical personal care product\nSuitable for use after shaving or waxing\nHelps improve skin smoothness and clarity\n90 ml', 1496.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 79.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Ingrow Gone Ingrown Hair Removal 90mlPrice in BD', 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Ingrow Gone Ingrown Hair Removal 90ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biomd-organic-medical-skin-care-ingrow-gone-ingrown-hair-removal-90ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(390, 'Buy 1 Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid Serum 30ml Get 1 Free', '1', 0, 9, 78, '390', '390', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy 1 Get 1 Free – Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid 2% Serum (30ml)\nLimited-Time Offer: Purchase one bottle and receive another absolutely free! Perfect for acne-prone skin and anyone looking to refine their complexion.\nKey Benefits\nThis serum is expertly formulated to target breakouts, excess oil, and uneven texture:\nHow to Use', 575.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -575.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Buy 1 Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid Serum 30ml Get 1 FreePrice in BD', 'Buy 1 Nature Beauty Salicylic Acid Serum 30ml Get 1 Free Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'buy-1-nature-beauty-salicylic-acid-serum-30ml-get-1-free', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
