(392, 'Dermo Phisiologique Seno 3D Siero Volumizzante Volumizing Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 10, 152, '392', '392', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Volumizing & Firming Breast Serum | Hormone-Free | Dermatologically Tested\nDermophisiologique Seno 3D is a high-performance volumizing serum specifically formulated to enhance the appearance of the bust. With its lightweight, emulsion-based texture and high concentration of botanical actives, this serum helps increase breast volume and firmness—without the use of hormones or invasive procedures. Ideal for women experiencing loss of volume due to aging, weight changes, or post-pregnancy.\nNatural volume enhancement with 3D Filler-Complex (from brown algae) that stimulates lipid synthesis in breast tissue.\nLifting & firming action with Hyaluronic Acid and Vitamin B5 for improved skin elasticity and hydration.\nVisible results: Up to 1 cm increase in breast circumference in 8 weeks; ½ cm lift in 4 weeks; potential gain of one cup size with continued use.\nLeaves skin hydrated, smooth, and plump with enhanced contour and tone.\nApply twice daily (morning and evening) to the breasts and décolleté. Massage in gentle upward strokes from the base of the breast toward the center. For enhanced results, apply before using the Seno 3D Firming Cream from the same line.\nFree from hormones, parabens, silicones, and mineral oils\nDermocompatible, gentle on sensitive skin', 3695.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 975.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermo Phisiologique Seno 3D Siero Volumizzante Volumizing Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Dermo Phisiologique Seno 3D Siero Volumizzante Volumizing Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermo-phisiologique-seno-3d-siero-volumizzante-volumizing-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(393, 'Cerave SA Smoothing Cream for Dry, Rough, Bumpy Skin', '1', 0, 10, 153, '393', '393', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Restore dry, uncomfortable skin with CeraVe Moisturising Cream, a rich and nurturing moisturiser that delivers a surge of much-needed hydration to dry and sensitive skin. Cocooning yet non-greasy, the moisturising cream contains three essential Ceramides and Hyaluronic Acid that work in synergy to moisture and protect skin’s natural barrier. Locking in moisture for all-day hydration, it utilises MVE Delivery Technology, which ensures controlled release of ingredients for 24 hour hydration. Gentle on skin, it leaves itchy, uncomfortable patches feeling soft and replenished. Developed by dermatologists.\nSuitable for dry to very dry skin.', 3280.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 660.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave SA Smoothing Cream for Dry, Rough, Bumpy SkinPrice in BD', 'Cerave SA Smoothing Cream for Dry, Rough, Bumpy Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-sa-smoothing-cream-for-dry-rough-bumpy-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(394, 'Iunik Beta - Glucan Power Moisture Serum 15ml', '1', 0, 10, 17, '394', '394', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Iunik Beta Glucan Power Moisture Serum is a Korean skincare solution formulated to deliver intensive hydration while reinforcing the skin’s natural barrier. With 98% Beta-Glucan as its core ingredient, this serum offers superior moisture retention compared to hyaluronic acid. It is particularly well-suited for sensitive, dehydrated, or post-acne skin, especially in climates like Bangladesh where heat and humidity can compromise skin health.\n\nKey FeaturesThis serum is powered by a high concentration of Beta-Glucan, known for its ability to hydrate deeply and strengthen the skin’s protective layer. Centella Asiatica extract helps calm inflammation and supports skin recovery. Aloe Vera provides a cooling effect to soothe irritation, while Mushroom Extract delivers antioxidant benefits and promotes regeneration. Panthenol enhances moisture levels and reduces sensitivity, making the formula gentle yet effective.\n\nUsageApply two to three drops to clean, toned skin in the morning and evening. Pat gently into the face and neck until fully absorbed. Follow with a moisturizer to lock in hydration and apply sunscreen during the day to protect the skin from environmental damage.\n\nWhy Choose This ProductIunik’s Beta Glucan serum is designed for those seeking a lightweight yet powerful hydration booster that supports barrier repair and skin resilience. Its minimalist, fragrance-free formula is ideal for layering and compatible with most skincare routines. The serum’s calming and restorative properties make it a reliable choice for individuals dealing with sensitivity, dryness, or post-acne concerns.\n\nBenefits\n\nCautions\n\nSuitable Skin TypesThis serum is recommended for sensitive, dry, dehydrated, post-acne, normal, and combination skin. It is not advised for fungal acne-prone skin without prior patch testing.', 431.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Iunik Beta - Glucan Power Moisture Serum 15mlPrice in BD', 'Iunik Beta - Glucan Power Moisture Serum 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'iunik-beta-glucan-power-moisture-serum-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(395, 'Primaderm XPERT Expression Serum Sublime 50ml', '1', 0, 10, 57, '395', '395', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Description\nWith a light and fresh texture, the exclusive concentrated formula of this serum prevents and visibly reduces the appearance of wrinkles and expression lines, helping to combat premature skin aging on a daily basis.The inclusion of multifunctional peptides of the latest generation in the new formulation reinforces cellular protection mechanisms and promotes their repair against environmental damage and daily stress.RESULT: younger, smoother, softer, luminous and protected skin.\nDermatologically tested.', 4850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -4850.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Primaderm XPERT Expression Serum Sublime 50mlPrice in BD', 'Primaderm XPERT Expression Serum Sublime 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'primaderm-xpert-expression-serum-sublime-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
