(397, 'Fade Out Collagen Boost Pro Collagen Lift & Firm Concentrated Whitening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 10, 154, '397', '397', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fade Out Collagen Boost Pro Collagen Lift & Firm Concentrated Whitening Serum 30ml\nBoost skin elasticity and strength with our Collagen Boost Concentrated Brightening Serum, formulated with plumping Pro-Collagen plant peptides and hero ingredient, Niacinamide. Designed for daily use and to enhance the rest of your Collagen Boost regime, this regime booster is proven to soften and smooth skin, whilst addressing loss of volume and radiance. Key Benefits:• A multi-tasking, daily-use treatment serum formulated to restore skin\'s strength and suppleness, whilst enhancing radiance and tightening pores.• Addresses common signs of ageing including loss of volume, dull skin tone and age spots• Light, fragrance-free formula texture allows for rapid absorption of key active ingredients.How To: After cleansing using the Collagen Boost Facial Wash, dispense 3-4 drops onto fresh skin, paying attention to problem areas. Follow with the Collagen Boost Day or Night cream. Suitable for morning and evening application.', 912.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 228.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fade Out Collagen Boost Pro Collagen Lift & Firm Concentrated Whitening Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Fade Out Collagen Boost Pro Collagen Lift & Firm Concentrated Whitening Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fade-out-collagen-boost-pro-collagen-lift-firm-concentrated-whitening-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
