(401, 'Sadoer HA Delicate Moisturizing Essence Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 10, 29, '401', '401', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Benefits:\nDeep Hydration: Formulated with hyaluronic acid, this serum delivers intense moisture to the skin, helping to maintain optimal hydration levels.\nSkin Revitalization: Regular use can enhance skin elasticity and firmness, reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nNourishing Formula: Enriched with nourishing ingredients, it supports overall skin health, leaving the skin feeling smooth and supple.\n\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Begin with a clean face, ensuring all makeup and impurities are removed.\nApply: Dispense a few drops of the serum onto your fingertips.\nMassage: Gently massage the serum into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use the serum twice daily, in the morning and evening, for optimal results.\n\nPrecautions:\nPerform a patch test before first use to check for any adverse reactions.\nAvoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation develops, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.', 211.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 239.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sadoer HA Delicate Moisturizing Essence Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Sadoer HA Delicate Moisturizing Essence Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sadoer-ha-delicate-moisturizing-essence-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(402, 'Sadoer Arbutin Rejuvenation Essence Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 10, 29, '402', '402', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Sadoer Arbutin Rejuvenation Essence Serum (30ml) is formulated to brighten the skin, reduce dark spots, and promote a more even complexion. It combines the skin-lightening properties of arbutin with moisturizing agents to enhance skin elasticity and smoothness.\n\nKey Benefits:\nSkin Brightening: Arbutin helps to lighten dark spots and hyperpigmentation, leading to a more uniform skin tone.\nMoisturization: The serum provides hydration, improving skin elasticity and texture.\nAnti-Aging: Regular use can reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, contributing to a youthful look.\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Begin with a clean face, removing all makeup and impurities.\nApply: Dispense a few drops of the serum onto your fingertips.\nMassage: Gently massage the serum into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use the serum twice daily, in the morning and evening, for optimal results.\n\nIngredients:\nThe serum contains key ingredients such as arbutin, known for its skin-brightening effects, and moisturizing agents that enhance skin elasticity and smoothness.\n\nPrecautions:\nPerform a patch test before first use to check for any adverse reactions.\nAvoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation develops, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.', 241.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 209.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sadoer Arbutin Rejuvenation Essence Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Sadoer Arbutin Rejuvenation Essence Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sadoer-arbutin-rejuvenation-essence-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(403, 'Cerave Skin Renewing Retinol Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 10, 153, '403', '403', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Retinol is an essential ingredient in any anti-aging skincare routine. A retinol serum is an effective product for improving the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, skin texture, and radiance. When looking for a face serum to add to your skincare routine, look for ingredients like ceramides that help restore and protect your skin barrier. It may take some time for your skin to adapt to retinol, so plan to slowly work your way up to daily use to avoid skin irritation. To help your skin look and feel its best, look for a face serum formulated with hydrating and calming ingredients like hyaluronic acid and niacinamide.CeraVe Skin Renewing Retinol Serum is a gentle, yet effective daily retinol serum that provides your skin with a variety of anti-aging benefits. Our retinol face serum is formulated with ingredients like hyaluronic acid for extra hydration, niacinamide to soothe, and three essential ceramides that work together to lock in moisture and help restore your skin’s protective barrier. It’s also formulated with MVE Technology that encapsulates ceramides to ensure efficient delivery within your skin’s barrier and slow release over time, supporting your protective skin barrier long after you’ve finished applying.\n\n\n\nAqua/water/eau, Glycerin, Caprylic/capric Triglyceride, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Hydrogenated Palm Glycerides, Polysorbate 20, Peg-40 Stearate, Cyclopentasiloxane, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Potassium Phosphate, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Carbomer, Niacinamide, Isoceteth-10, Dimethicone/vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Triethanolamine, Cetearyl Alcohol, Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Cichorium Intybus Root Extract / Chicory Root Extract, Lecithin, Retinol, Silica, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Cholesterol, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopherol, Alcohol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Citric Acid, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Pentylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Phytosphingosine, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter / Shea Butter, Ethylhexylglycerin', 2995.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1005.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Skin Renewing Retinol Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Skin Renewing Retinol Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-skin-renewing-retinol-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(404, 'HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Tightening Podo Ampoule 52ml – Refines Pores & Controls Oil', '1', 0, 10, 13, '404', '404', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Overview:The HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Tightening Podo Ampoule is a pore-refining, oil-controlling ampoule formulated with Grape Water, Red Bean Extract, Lotus Pore Complex, and peptides to visibly tighten pores, improve skin elasticity, and promote a smoother, more even complexion. This lightweight, fast-absorbing ampoule also helps maintain skin hydration while enhancing density and texture, making it ideal for oily or combination skin prone to enlarged pores. Dermatologically tested for sensitive skin, it provides effective care without irritation.\nKey Features:\nGrape Water 490,190ppm: Soothes, hydrates, and supports skin resilience.\nRed Bean & Coix Lacryma-Jobi Seed Extracts (1,000ppm each): Help refine pores and balance oil production.\nLotus Pore 10,000ppm & Peptides: Improve pore elasticity, tighten skin, and enhance texture.\nPanthenol & Plant Extracts: Hydrate, calm, and protect skin.\nDermatologically Tested: Gentle formula for sensitive skin.\nBenefits:\nRefines and tightens enlarged pores\nControls excess sebum and reduces shine\nImproves skin elasticity and density\nSmoothens texture for a polished complexion\nPrepares skin for better absorption of serums and moisturizers\nDirections for Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning, take an appropriate amount onto your palms.\nApply evenly to the face and gently pat until fully absorbed.\nUse morning and evening for optimal results.\nKey Ingredients:\nVitis Vinifera (Grape) Fruit Water (490,190ppm): Hydrating and soothing\nLotus Pore Complex (10,000ppm) & Peptides: Improve pore elasticity and tighten skin\nCoix Lacryma-Jobi Seed & Phaseolus Angularis Seed Extracts (1,000ppm each): Balance oil and refine pores\nHyaluronic Acid & Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid: Deep hydration\nPanthenol, Gardenia, Viola Tricolor, Cocoa, and Sunflower Seed Oil Extracts: Nourish and protect skin\nCaution:For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Discontinue use if irritation occurs and consult a doctor if necessary. Keep out of reach of children.\nNet Volume: 52mlMade in Korea', 1599.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 691.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Tightening Podo Ampoule 52ml – Refines Pores & Controls OilPrice in BD', 'HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Tightening Podo Ampoule 52ml – Refines Pores & Controls Oil Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heveblue-pot-pore-tightening-podo-ampoule-52ml-refines-pores-controls-oil', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(405, 'APLB Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 37.4% Ampoule Serum', '1', 0, 10, 4, '405', '405', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Serum replenishes skin with moisture while delivering soothing care. B5 panthenol in the mix strengthens the skin’s natural barrier for enhanced resilience against environmental stressors. Hypoallergenic formula is free of mineral oil, paraben, artificial fragrance and artificial pigment.\n\nUsing this product after applying toner in the morning, evening, and after washing by applying an appropriate amount evenly over your face letting it absorb.\n\nWater, Centella Asiatica Extract (36.9%), Butylene Glycol, Propanediol, Glycerin, Diethoxyethyl Succinate, Panthenol (5,000ppm), Sodium Hyaluronate (8,000ppb), Ceramide NP (5,000ppb), Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Octyldodecanol, Dipropylene Glycol, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Beta-Glucan, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extract, Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Phytosteryl/Octyldodecyl Lauroyl Glutamate, Sodium Citrate, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Squalane, Disodium EDTA, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Citric Acid, Xanthan Gum, Inulin, Cellulose, Glucose, Fructose, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Styrene/Acrylates Copolymer, Coccinia Indica Fruit Extract, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyacetophenone, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Allantoin, Cellulose Gum\n\nBrand : APLB\nCapacity : 40ml\nTarget Area : Face\nSkin Type : All Skin Types\nCountry of origin : South Korea', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 451.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 37.4% Ampoule SerumPrice in BD', 'APLB Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 37.4% Ampoule Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-hyaluronic-acid-ceramide-ha-b5-374-ampoule-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(406, 'HEVEBLUE Centella & Salmon Caring Ampoule 30ml – Hydration & Skin Barrier Boost', '1', 0, 10, 13, '406', '406', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Overview:The HEVEBLUE Centella & Salmon Caring Ampoule is a highly concentrated, soothing, and hydrating ampoule designed to calm stressed skin, strengthen the skin barrier, and boost moisture levels. Infused with Salmon-PDRN, Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, Madecassoside, and hyaluronic acid, this ampoule helps reduce irritation, enhance skin resilience, and leave your complexion plump and revitalized. Suitable for sensitive and easily irritated skin, it has been dermatologically tested and proven for skin-soothing effects.\nKey Features:\nSalmon-PDRN 10,000ppm: Supports skin regeneration and barrier repair.\nCentella Asiatica Leaf Water 847,474ppm & Madecassoside: Soothes irritation, redness, and inflammation.\nHyaluronic Acid & Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid: Deep hydration to restore moisture balance.\nPatent Ingredient EFFIPULPO & Plant Extracts: Protects skin from environmental stressors while calming sensitivity.\nDermatologically Tested: Gentle formula suitable for sensitive skin.\nBenefits:\nProvides intensive hydration and nourishment\nStrengthens skin barrier and resilience\nSoothes redness, irritation, and stress-exposed skin\nHelps improve skin elasticity and overall texture\nPrepares skin for better absorption of serums and moisturizers\nDirections for Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning, dispense an appropriate amount onto your palms.\nApply evenly to the face and gently pat until fully absorbed.\nUse morning and evening for optimal results.\nKey Ingredients:\nCentella Asiatica Leaf Water (847,474ppm): Calms and soothes sensitive skin\nSalmon Egg Extract (1,500ppm) & Sodium DNA: Revitalize skin and support barrier repair\nMadecassoside: Reduces irritation and promotes healing\nHyaluronic Acid & Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid: Intense hydration\nPlant Extracts (Avocado, Cocoa, Quinoa, Portulaca Oleracea, Wheat Protein): Nourish and protect skin\nCaution:For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. Discontinue use if irritation occurs and consult a doctor if necessary.\nNet Volume: 30mlMade in Korea', 1670.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 720.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'HEVEBLUE Centella & Salmon Caring Ampoule 30ml – Hydration & Skin Barrier BoostPrice in BD', 'HEVEBLUE Centella & Salmon Caring Ampoule 30ml – Hydration & Skin Barrier Boost Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heveblue-centella-salmon-caring-ampoule-30ml-hydration-skin-barrier-boost', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(407, 'Loreal Paris Innovation Revitalift 1.5% Hyaluronic Acid Replumping  Serum', '1', 0, 10, 110, '407', '407', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'L\'Oréal Skincare Laboratories developed 1.5% Hyaluronic Acid Replumping Serum with our highest concentration of hyaluronic acid to replump and intensely hydrate from within, for youthful radiant skin.\nA scientifically formulated blend of 3 types of Hyaluronic Acid. A gold standard skincare which helps to enhance skin’s own moisture retention.\nMacro HA holds multiple times its weight in water and locks moisture in skin. Micro HA comprehensively rehydrate various skin layers to smooth skin surface.\n50x^ smaller than standard HA for deep skin penetration and known to have 13x^^ longer lasting power. Instantly hydrates and replumps fine lines.\nVisible Results: In 1 hour: Skin is replumped and firmed**, After 4 weeks: Reduces fine lines by -60%*. Day after day: Skin regains its bounce and looks youthfully radiant. Usage: Use daily before your moisturizer. Layers well under makeup. *Representation of expert scoring based on Clinical Study for 4 weeks. Results may vary.\n*Based on clinical study on 83 women in 4 weeks. **Instrumental test ^vs Standard HA (1000KDa)^* vs Micro HA (20KDa) *Partial illustration of global score fine line improvement. ˅1.5% represents Sodium Hyaluronate and Sodium Acelylated Hyaluronate\nTested by Dermatologists on Asian Skin\nUsage\nUse daily before your moisturizer. Layers well under makeup.\nIngredients:\nAQUA / WATER, GLYCERIN, HYDROXYETHYLPIPERAZINE ETHANE SULFONIC ACID, SODIUM HYALURONATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, PEG-60 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, CHLORPHENESIN, HYDROXYPROPYL GUAR, SODIUM ACETYLATED HYALURONATE, XANTHAN GUM, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, SECALE CEREALE SEED EXTRACT / RYE SEED EXTRACT, DIPEPTIDE DIAMINOBUTYROYL BENZYLAMIDE DIACETATE. (F.I.L. B242774/1).', 1645.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 755.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Innovation Revitalift 1.5% Hyaluronic Acid Replumping  SerumPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Innovation Revitalift 1.5% Hyaluronic Acid Replumping  Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-innovation-revitalift-15-hyaluronic-acid-replumping-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:04', '2026-02-11 06:22:04'),
(408, 'HaruHaru Wonder Black Rice Night Knight Retinol Serum 20ml – Made in Korea', '1', 0, 10, 155, '408', '408', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'HaruHaru Wonder Black Rice Night Knight Retinol Serum is a gentle yet effective anti-aging night treatment designed to improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Formulated with 0.08% Retinol, Black Rice Extract, Bakuchiol, and Panax Ginseng, this serum helps boost skin elasticity, smooth texture, and promote a more youthful glow.\nHelps reduce the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines\nPromotes firmer, smoother, youthful-looking skin\nGentle formula with Retinol + Bakuchiol\nEnriched with Black Rice Extract (2,000ppm) for antioxidant protection\nStrengthens the skin barrier with Ceramide NP\nVegan, PETA Approved, cruelty-free\nLightweight texture that absorbs easily\nSuitable for nighttime skincare routine\nApply after toner in your nighttime routine.\nTake an appropriate amount and spread evenly from the inner to outer areas of the face.\nGently pat to enhance absorption.\nUse sunscreen the following morning.\nFor external use only.\nDo not apply on damaged or broken skin.\nStop use and consult a doctor if irritation or rash occurs.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStore away from direct sunlight.\nWater, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Glycerin, Sunflower Seed Oil, 1,2-Hexanediol, Bakuchiol, C14-22 Alcohol, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, C12-20 Alkyl Glucoside, Black Rice Extract (2,000ppm), Arginine, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Bamboo Shoot Bark Extract (1,000ppm), Disodium EDTA, Retinol (0.08%), Aspergillus Ferment, Ethylhexylglycerin, Polyglyceryl-10 Stearate, Xanthan Gum, Adenosine, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Glyceryl Stearate, Polyglyceryl-2 Stearate, Ceramide NP, Dipropylene Glycol, Stearyl Alcohol, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Glucose, Hydroxyacetophenone, Butylene Glycol, Caprylyl Glycol, Cyclodextrin.\nBrand: HaruHaru Wonder\nType: Anti-Wrinkle Retinol Serum\nVolume: 20ml\nCountry of Origin: Korea\nVegan & PETA Approved: Yes\nSkin Concern: Wrinkles, fine lines, texture', 1430.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 990.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'HaruHaru Wonder Black Rice Night Knight Retinol Serum 20ml – Made in KoreaPrice in BD', 'HaruHaru Wonder Black Rice Night Knight Retinol Serum 20ml – Made in Korea Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'haruharu-wonder-black-rice-night-knight-retinol-serum-20ml-made-in-korea', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
