(410, 'HEVEBLUE Black Yuja Bean Skin Booster Serum 42ml', '1', 0, 10, 13, '410', '410', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A deeply hydrating, oil-free serum designed to protect and nourish the skin. Formulated with Yuja (Citrus Junos) Water, Black Soybean Water, Mung Bean Water, and HEVEBLUE’s patented Blue Omija Bio-Pump complex, this serum delivers intense moisture while preventing makeup from flaking and supporting sensitive skin.\nHydration: Improves deep skin moisturization\nMakeup Protection: Prevents makeup from caking or flaking\nSensitive Skin Tested: Dermatologically tested\nAdditional Ingredients: Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Methyl Gluceth-20, Betaine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Carbomer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tromethamine, Sodium Polyacrylate, and more.\nAfter cleansing, take an appropriate amount of serum.\nApply evenly to the face.\nPat gently until fully absorbed.\nUse morning and night for best results.\nFor external use only. Avoid eye contact.\nIf product gets into eyes, rinse immediately with running water.\nKeep out of reach of children. If ingested, seek medical help immediately.\nDiscontinue use and consult a doctor if irritation occurs.\nAvoid using on wounded or broken skin.\nStore away from direct sunlight.\nDistributor (Korea): Cosmerito Korea Co., Ltd., BF HS Tower, 703, Seolleung-ro, Gangnam-gu, Seoul, Republic of Korea\nMade in Korea', 1530.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 660.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'HEVEBLUE Black Yuja Bean Skin Booster Serum 42mlPrice in BD', 'HEVEBLUE Black Yuja Bean Skin Booster Serum 42ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heveblue-black-yuja-bean-skin-booster-serum-42ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(411, 'Coxir Vita C Toning Serum', '1', 0, 5, 156, '411', '411', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vita C Bright Serum is a highly effective brightening serum designed to revitalize and illuminate your skin. Enriched with a powerful blend of vitamins and antioxidants, this lightweight, fast-absorbing serum helps promote a radiant and even complexion while nourishing the skin from within.\n50ml\nPerfect for individuals looking to brighten dull skin, reduce uneven tone, and nourish dry, normal, or sensitive skin types.\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.\nTransform your skincare routine with Vita C Bright Serum 50ml and reveal your naturally radiant, healthy-looking skin!', 1461.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 889.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Coxir Vita C Toning SerumPrice in BD', 'Coxir Vita C Toning Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'coxir-vita-c-toning-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05');
