(412, 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Unscented Centella Serum', '1', 0, 5, 83, '412', '412', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This serum rejuvenates the skin by strengthening its barrier. It contains essential Centella ingredients to restore a damaged skin barrier and soothe irritated skin. The Centella Asiatica Extract and Panthenol help calm the irritated skin preventing further inflammation. If your skin is stressed using too many products with various ingredients that do not fit your skin, give your face a break and help it restore by using the Centella Unscented Serum.\n\nBenefits:\nUsage: After cleansing and toning, as a treatment, Pump 1-2 times and spread over your entire face and neck, and gently patting to help absorption.\nIngredients:\nCentella Asiatica Extract(49%) (strengthens skin barrier), Water, Glycerin (humectants), Dipropylene Glycol (humectants), Niacinamide (strengthens skin barrier), Butylene Glycol (humectants), 1,2-Hexanediol (stabilizers), Glycereth-26 (humectants), Ceramide NP (strengthens skin barrier), Sodium Hyaluronate (natural moisturizing factor/ humectants), Asiaticoside (strengthens skin barrier), Asiatic Acid (strengthens skin barrier), Madecassic Acid (strengthens skin barrier), Palmitoyl Hexapeptide-12 (improves elasticity), Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1 (improves elasticity), Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7 (improves elasticity), Palmitoyl Dipeptide-10 (improves elasticity), Carbomer (viscosity increasing agents), Arginine (pH adjusters), Sclerotium Gum (viscosity increasing agents), Hydrolyzed Jojoba Esters (skin-conditioning agents), Caprylyl Glycol (emollient), Polyglyceryl-10 Myristate (solubilizers), Panthenol (strengthens skin barrier), Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate (solubilizers), Hydrogenated Lecithin (stabilizers), Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract (soothes skin), Pancratium Maritimum Extract (skin-conditioning agent), Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate (stabilizers), Disodium EDTA (chelating agent), Adenosine (improves wrinkles)\nMade in Korea', 2111.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1189.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Unscented Centella SerumPrice in BD', 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Unscented Centella Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-seoul-wonder-releaf-unscented-centella-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(413, 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Hyaluronic Acid Serum', '1', 0, 5, 151, '413', '413', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Treat your skin to weightless hydration for 24 hours with Neutrogena Hydro Boost Hyaluronic Acid Serum. Formulated with Neutrogena’s 17% Hydration Complex, this face serum contains hyaluronic acid, glycerin, and vitamin B5 to deeply quench dry skin. This hydrating serum is hypoallergenic, noncomedogenic, mineral oil-free, fragrance-free, and paraben-free.\nNeutrogena Hydro Boost Hyaluronic Acid Serum smoothens the look of skin and weightlessly hydrates skin for a full 24 hoursFormulated with Neutrogena’s 17% Hydration Complex, and contains both macro and micro hyaluronic acid to absorb and hold water to the skinAlso made with Glycerin to penetrates 9 layers deep into skin while vitamin B5 & trehalose attract and lock in moisture', 2816.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 704.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Hyaluronic Acid SerumPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Hyaluronic Acid Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-hydro-boost-hyaluronic-acid-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(414, 'Dermashare Medi Propolis Vitamin E  Ampoule', '1', 0, 5, 157, '414', '414', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dermashare Medi Propolis Vitamin E Ampoule is a skincare treatment designed to nourish and rejuvenate the skin. This ampoule combines the power of propolis and Vitamin E, two potent ingredients known for their healing and antioxidant properties.\nPropolis is a natural resin produced by bees, renowned for its soothing, anti-inflammatory, and antimicrobial properties. It helps to repair and protect the skin, making it ideal for those with sensitive or irritated skin.\nVitamin E is a powerful antioxidant that helps to protect the skin from free radical damage, supports skin barrier function, and improves hydration, making the skin look healthy and radiant.\nThis ampoule is typically used as part of a skincare routine to improve skin texture, reduce redness, and promote a glowing complexion. It can be applied directly to the skin after cleansing, providing a boost of hydration and nourishment. Perfect for dry, dull, or sensitive skin, the Dermashare Medi Propolis Vitamin E Ampoule helps to restore balance and vitality to the skin.\nMade in Korea', 930.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 820.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermashare Medi Propolis Vitamin E  AmpoulePrice in BD', 'Dermashare Medi Propolis Vitamin E  Ampoule Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermashare-medi-propolis-vitamin-e-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(415, 'Cos De Baha G Glycolic Acid 10 AHA Serum', '1', 0, 5, 36, '415', '415', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PRODUCTS BENEFITS\nSPECIFICATION\nWARNING: This product contains Glycolic Acid. Because sensitivity to Glycolic Acid varies substantially from person to person, we STRONGLY RECOMMEND to always test the product on a small area before using it. In order to test, apply a small quantity of product on a very limited, dime-sized area behind the ear or under the chin, and wait for 2 to 3 minutes. ALWAYS read and follow the instructions available online as specified on the product label BEFORE using the product.\nINGREDIENTS :\n*Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Ext, Glycolic Acid, Propanediol, Arginine, 1,2-Hexanediol, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Sodium Hydroxide, *Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, *Momordica Charantia Fruit Extract,*Sambucus Nigra Flower Extract,*Leontopodium Alpinum Extract.\nTEST Usage:\nPlease note that all serums can sometimes create irritations for people with very sensitive skin or uncommon allergies. Always test the product on a small area before using it, ideally behind an ear or under the chin. Allow 24 hours to measure skin sensitivity to the product.', 968.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 532.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De Baha G Glycolic Acid 10 AHA SerumPrice in BD', 'Cos De Baha G Glycolic Acid 10 AHA Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-g-glycolic-acid-10-aha-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(416, 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Essence : Snail Mucin 97% + Rice 100ml', '1', 0, 5, 113, '416', '416', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This serum is composed of 97% snail mucin, a popular Korean skin care ingredient known for its moisturizing and healing properties. Additionally formulated with rice ingredients including rice extract, rice water and rice ferment filtrate, which brighten, smooth and hydrate skin.\nIngredients:\nSnail Secretion Filtrate (970,0 00ppm), Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethyl Hexanediol, Allantoin, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Carbomer, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Panthenol, Water, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Seed Extract (130ppm), Arginine, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Seed Water(30ppm), Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake)(30ppm)\nHow to Use:\n1. After cleansing and toning, apply a moderate amount of the essence on entire face and neck.2. Gently pat until fully absorbed into the skin.\nMade in Korea', 1699.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 401.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Essence : Snail Mucin 97% + Rice 100mlPrice in BD', 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Essence : Snail Mucin 97% + Rice 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'k-secret-seoul-1988-essence-snail-mucin-97-rice-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(417, 'Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Unscented Serum 15ml', '1', 0, 5, 83, '417', '417', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gentle Barrier Care for Sensitive & Acne-Prone Skin\n\nPurito Wonder Releaf Centella Unscented Serum is a minimalistic, fragrance-free serum specially formulated for sensitive, irritated, and breakout-prone skin. Powered by 49% Centella Asiatica Extract, this soothing serum calms redness, strengthens the skin barrier, and restores healthy moisture balance without causing irritation.\nEnriched with Niacinamide, Ceramide NP, peptides, and hyaluronic acid, it helps improve skin tone, reinforce the skin’s natural defense, and keep skin hydrated, resilient, and visibly calm.\nVegan, cruelty-free, and free from essential oils—perfect for even the most reactive skin types.\nSoothes Redness & Irritation: High-strength Centella Asiatica calms inflamed and stressed skin\nStrengthens Skin Barrier: Ceramide NP and peptides help repair and protect the moisture barrier\nBrightens & Evens Skin Tone: Niacinamide reduces dullness and uneven tone\nDeep Hydration: Sodium Hyaluronate and Panthenol provide long-lasting moisture\nSafe for Sensitive Skin: Fragrance-free, essential oil-free formula\nMinimal ingredients, maximum skin comfort\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, non-sticky texture\nIdeal for acne-prone, sensitive, and compromised skin\nVegan & cruelty-free\nNo fragrance, no essential oils, no harsh irritants\nCentella Asiatica Extract (49%) – Soothes, repairs, and calms irritation\nNiacinamide – Brightens skin and improves texture\nCeramide NP – Strengthens skin barrier and prevents moisture loss\nPeptides Complex – Enhances skin resilience and elasticity\nSodium Hyaluronate & Panthenol – Deep hydration and skin comfort\n✔ Sensitive skin✔ Acne-prone skin✔ Redness-prone & irritated skin✔ All skin types needing barrier repair\nCleanse and tone your face\nApply 1–2 pumps of serum evenly on the face\nGently pat until absorbed\nFollow with moisturizer\nFor daytime use, finish with sunscreen\nBrand: Purito (Korea)\nProduct Type: Unscented Facial Serum\nSize: 15ml\nFormulation: Fragrance-Free\nVegan & Cruelty-Free: Yes\nDaily calming care, post-acne recovery, compromised skin barrier, and anyone looking for a gentle yet effective Centella serum.', 675.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Unscented Serum 15mlPrice in BD', 'Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Unscented Serum 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-wonder-releaf-centella-unscented-serum-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(418, 'Buy 1 Sinicare Placenta Gold Serum 50ml Get 02pcs Sini Care Intensive Recovery Placenta Sheet Mask Free Save 1116tk', '1', 0, 5, 158, '418', '418', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Placenta Gold Serum is an anti-ageing face serum which contains a rich blend of active ingredients. Placenta, Gold, EGF, Peptide and Collagen helps restore skin texture and elasticity and brings youthfulness to your skin, while placenta extract smoothest skin tone and provides long- lasting hydration to tired complexion.\nSinicare Nanosome Gold Serum contains active natural ingredients. This serum has dual functions in both enhancing skin hydration and cell renewal. The miniscule golden flakes, allows for instant brightening of the skin.\nDirections:After cleansing, drying and preparing the facial area, apply and massage a small but sufficient amount of product on the surface of the facial area until satisfied.\n– Aids in skin regeneration– By improving moisture level of the skin– Effectively helps to reduce the effects of aging\n', 3600.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 900.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Buy 1 Sinicare Placenta Gold Serum 50ml Get 02pcs Sini Care Intensive Recovery Placenta Sheet Mask Free Save 1116tkPrice in BD', 'Buy 1 Sinicare Placenta Gold Serum 50ml Get 02pcs Sini Care Intensive Recovery Placenta Sheet Mask Free Save 1116tk Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'buy-1-sinicare-placenta-gold-serum-50ml-get-02pcs-sini-care-intensive-recovery-placenta-sheet-mask-free-save-1116tk', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(419, 'Mild & Mind Ginseng Radish Cream 20gm', '1', 0, 5, 159, '419', '419', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 843.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 7.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mild & Mind Ginseng Radish Cream 20gmPrice in BD', 'Mild & Mind Ginseng Radish Cream 20gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mild-mind-ginseng-radish-cream-20gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(420, 'COSRX Galactomyces 95 Tone Balancing Essence', '1', 0, 5, 31, '420', '420', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Multi - acting enhancer for dull, rough skin!\nWhat it is: Formulated with 95% Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, this essence helps nourish and hydrate the skin, and over time making it appears more radiant and clear.\n\n\nWHY IT\'S SPECIAL:\n\n\nHow to use:\n\n\n\nGalactomyces ferment filtrate is the key ingredient that illuminates tired and dull-looking skin while delivering hydration.\nA water-like, lightweight essence absorbs quickly into the skin, leaving it well-hydrated without feeling greasy.\nThis powerful essence is formulated with 95% Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate and niacinamide to enhance skin radiance and even out rough skin.', 1628.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 872.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSRX Galactomyces 95 Tone Balancing EssencePrice in BD', 'COSRX Galactomyces 95 Tone Balancing Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-galactomyces-95-tone-balancing-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(421, 'Simple 3% Hyaluronic Acid + B5 Booster Serum for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 5, 24, '421', '421', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hyaluronic acid is our hydrating, power-plumping miracle for youthful-looking skin. Safe for every skin type, Simple 3% Hyaluronic Acid + B5* Booster Serum is powered by high-performance, 95% naturally derived ingredients to supercharge your skin care routine for instant, visible results. This hydrating serum is a real multitasker; along with locking moisture into dry skin, improving skin texture and reducing fine lines, it also relieves irritation, making it the perfect partner to calm dry or sensitive skin. Packed with 3% active ingredients, it contains 0.5% hyaluronic acid, 0.5% PENTAVITIN and 2.5% provitamin B5 – the dream team for soft, plump skin. Like all Simple products, this face serum is dermatologically tested and non-comedogenic, contains no harsh chemicals and is free from alcohol, mineral oils, artificial colours and perfume. This Simple product is also PETA-Approved Vegan – we don’t test on animals anywhere in the world. Shake, drop, dab – it’s that simple. After using a cleanser, apply our non-sticky, non-greasy serum alone or mix a few drops into your favourite face moisturiser for a super-quick hydration boost. Oh, and it’s fab under makeup too. Try cocktailing it with Simple Vitamin C + E + F* Booster Serum in the morning (along with a broad-spectrum SPF 30) and 10% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) in the evening – it goes well with both, but make sure you use them at different times (niacinamide and vitamin C get on better when used separately). The best part? Real people love it. 81% agreed their skin felt instantly soft, 80% said it looked healthy and 3 out of 4 agreed it felt instantly hydrated. The stats don’t lie, so try it yourself – we’d love to know what you think of our products, so leave us a review. *percent value represents cumulative concentration in the formula **within the stratum corneum\nIngredients:\nProvitamin b5, Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide, Vitamin C, Aqua, Panthenol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Propanediol, Niacinamide, Coco-Caprylate, Polyglyceryl-6 Distearate, Tapioca Starch, Cetearyl Alcohol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Dicaprylyl Ether, Caprylyl Glycol, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Sclerotium Gum, Saccharide Isomerate, Phenoxyethanol, Citric Acid, Pantolactone, Polyglyceryl-10 Stearate, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Citrate, Tocopherol.\nHow to use:\nAvoid contact with eyes. For external use only.', 1199.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 651.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple 3% Hyaluronic Acid + B5 Booster Serum for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Simple 3% Hyaluronic Acid + B5 Booster Serum for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-3-hyaluronic-acid-b5-booster-serum-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(422, 'Aveeno Calm+ Restore Triple Oat Serum for Sensitive Skin', '1', 0, 5, 124, '422', '422', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Overview:\nInstantly soothe skin and fortify its moisture barrier with this hydrating face serum. Formulated with nourishing triple oat complex and calming feverfew, the facial serum is ideal for sensitive skin.\nFace serum for irritated, dry, sensitive skin\nInstantly smooths and fortifies skin\nContains nourishing oat and calming feverfew\nGood for:\nSensitive skin\nProduct Benefits:\nHydrating,Hypoallergenic,Moisturizing,Non-comedogenic,Nourishing,Smoothening,Softening,Soothing,StrengtheningHydrating,Hypoallergenic,Moisturizing,Non-comedogenic,Nourishing,Smoothening,Softening,Soothing,Strengthening\nHow to use:\nPump once before use to clear dropper. Apply 3-4 drops onto hand. Massage gently onto face.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 2523.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 677.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aveeno Calm+ Restore Triple Oat Serum for Sensitive SkinPrice in BD', 'Aveeno Calm+ Restore Triple Oat Serum for Sensitive Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aveeno-calm-restore-triple-oat-serum-for-sensitive-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(423, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Intensive Serum Foundation with SPF50+ PA++++', '1', 0, 5, 114, '423', '423', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Features:\nHow to use\nTake an appropriate amount of the main product and spread it evenly on the skin.\n\nIngredients\nPurified water, cyclopentasiloxane, glycerin, titanium dioxide, cetyl ethylhexanoate, butylene glycol, cyclohexasiloxane, caprylic/capric triglyceride, cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, dimethicone, sorbitan sesquioleate, sodium chloride, ozokerite, triethylhexanoin, isododecane, iron oxide yellow, dimethicone/vinyl dimethicone crosspolymer, magnesium aluminum silicate, Polyglyceryl-4 isostearate, polyglyceryl-3 polyricinoleate, phenoxyethanol, fragrance, talc, chlorphenesin, red iron oxide, distear dimonium hectorite, aluminum hydroxide, triethane Toxycaprylylsilane, betaine, iron black oxide, disodium EDTA, allantoin, polyglyceryl-3 ricinoleate, propylene carbonate, limonene, 1,2-hexanediol, citronellol, benzylbenzo. Acetate, geraniol, linalool, alpha-isomethyl ionone, hydrolyzed collagen (20 ppm), pentaerythrityl tetra-di-t-butylhydroxyhydrocinnamate, sodium hyaluronate, beta- Glucan, vegetable amino acid (1 ppm), gold (0.1 ppm), proline (0.1 ppm), hydroxyproline (0.1 ppm).', 841.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 424.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Intensive Serum Foundation with SPF50+ PA++++Price in BD', '3W Clinic Collagen and Luxury 24K Gold Intensive Serum Foundation with SPF50+ PA++++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-collagen-and-luxury-24k-gold-intensive-serum-foundation-with-spf50-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(424, 'Round Lab Birch Juice Moisturizing Serum', '1', 0, 5, 160, '424', '424', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'HOW IT WORKS\nAfter tidying skin with toner, take a sufficient amount of serum and gentle apply across skin for full absorption.\nAbout Birch TreesBirch Trees are refreshingly tall, snow white, and has been nicknamed “the queen of the forest” due to their romantic images of unspoiled mountain streams and wintry nights. Their white skin, which can be preserved for over a thousand years, sheds into more than ten thinner layers that can be repurposed as “paper” in the old ages. Its roots, sap, and even the mushrooms living off these trees were commonly used for medical purposes.\nIn the spring, before the leaves have sprouted, Birch tree sap is harvested with a small hole, bleeding its “white sap” that has a slightly sweet flavor and is rich with NMF (Natural Moisturizing Factor, a cocktail of ingredients that the skin naturally creates to keep the stratum corneum hydrated. These include Amino Acids, Lactic Acid, Pyrrolidone Carboxylic Acid (PCA), and Hyaluronic Acid).\nFeels likeSlightly viscous, watery and lightweightSmells likeUnscentedGood ForSensitive + All Skin Types\nBenefits on our skin\nMoisturize our skin\nPrevent sun pigmentation\nEncourage growth of new collagen\nStrengthen hair\nReduce inflammation\nClear and brighten skin\nAntioxidant properties\nPrevent hair loss\nPurify and hydrate skin\nEnergize skin\nEliminate toxins\n\n', 1760.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Round Lab Birch Juice Moisturizing SerumPrice in BD', 'Round Lab Birch Juice Moisturizing Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'round-lab-birch-juice-moisturizing-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(425, 'Heimish RX 2% Hyaluronic Acid Hydrating serum', '1', 0, 5, 95, '425', '425', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hydration support serum infused with 8 forms of Hyaluronic Acid which work different layers of skin’s surface and deliver instant, long-lasting hydration.Formulated with 2% Hyaluronic Acid. Hyaluronic acid captures surrounding moisture 1,000 times more than of its own weight. Powered by 2% of Hyaluronic Acid powder, it provides immediate hydration while improving skin’s water-retention abilities, promoting long- lasting hydration. Also infused with 1% Panthenol.This lightweight, non-sticky formula provides plumping hydration for softer, smoother, healthy-looking skin. It visibly improves skin’s moisture barrier and effectively delivers benefit of active ingredients. Dermatologist tested.Experience the ultimate hydration with our serum containing 2% hyaluronic acid. This powerful ingredient can hold 1000 times its weight in moisture, providing instant hydration and improving the skin\'s ability to retain water. Get long-lasting hydration with our serum infused with 2% hyaluronic acid powder.\nSuitable for all skin types.\nHow to use:\nTake an appropriate amount of cream in the morning and night, gently apply all over your face.\nIngredients:\nWater, Propanediol, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate (20,000ppm), Panthenol, Glycereth-25 PCA Isostearate, Betaine, Disodium EDTA, Ectoin, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Potassium Hyaluronate, Fragrance.\nDisclaimer: Ingredients and packaging are subject to change at Manufacturer’s discretion. For the most complete and up-to-date list of ingredients and packaging, please refer to the actual product.\nMade in Korea', 2420.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1830.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 