(433, 'YC X3 Hyaluronic Acid Advanced Facial Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 5, 76, '433', '433', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'YC X3 Hyaluronic Acid Advanced Facial Serum 30mlYC X3 Hyaluronic Acid Advanced Facial Serum is a hydrating, skin-revitalising formula powered by multi-weight hyaluronic acid, Vitamin C, niacinamide, antioxidants, and skin-brightening actives. Designed to deeply replenish moisture, improve firmness, and enhance radiance, it promotes a youthful, glowing, and healthy-looking complexion.\n\nKey Features• Deep, long-lasting hydration with multi-type hyaluronic acids• Brightens and evens skin tone• Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and dullness• Enhances firmness, elasticity, and skin smoothness• Antioxidant protection for youthful radiance• Lightweight and fast-absorbing texture• Suitable for all skin types\n\nBenefits• Hydrates and plumps the skin for a smoother, supple feel• Improves skin clarity and overall brightness• Supports collagen for firmer, youthful-looking skin• Reduces dryness, dehydration lines, and fatigue• Helps fade dark spots and enhances glow• Calms and revitalises tired skin\n\nUsageApply a small amount to clean face. Gently massage until fully absorbed. Use twice daily—morning and night—for best results.\n\nIngredientsAqua, Glycerin, Polysorbate 20, Polysorbate 60, Xanthan Gum, Phenoxyethanol, Parfum, Ethylhexylglycerin, Amodimethicone, Citric Acid, Cetrimonium Chloride, Trideceth-12, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Alpha-Arbutin, Glutathione, Niacinamide, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Benzoate, Musa Sapientum Leaf Extract, Maltodextrin, Propylene Glycol, Caffeine, Carnitine, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Paullinia Cupana Seed Extract, Kojic Dipalmitate, Melaleuca Alternifolia Leaf Oil, Butylene Glycol, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Pentylene Glycol, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Calcium Pantetheine Sulfonate, Cysteic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate.', 585.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 