(434, 'Boots Aqua Hydrating Booster Serum', '1', 0, 5, 11, '434', '434', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots Aqua Hydrating Water Essence MOISTURISATION FOR UP TO 72 HRS* FOR A HEALTHY AND DEWY GLOW This skincare has proven, lightweight and fast absorobed, with the powered of Hyaluron’ and Glyceryl Glucoside plus CICA extract, to help moisturisation for up to 72 hrs with an instant 100% boost in skin hydration*. For a healthy and dewy glow. Suitable for all skin types\nTips:\n\nINGREDIENTS:\nAqua (Water), Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Polysorbate 20, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Chlorphenesin, Alpha-Glucan Oligosaccharide, Glyceryl Glucoside, Sodium Hyaluronate, Xanthan Gum, Parfum (Fragrance), Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Erythritol, Dipropylene Glycol, Citric Acid, Centella Asiatica Extract, Hexyl Cinnama\n\nWarnings:\n1. Do not apply to irritated or broken skin; discontinue use if rash develops.\n2. Avoid contact with eyes. If product gets into the eyes rinse well with water immediately.\n3. This is not a food. Keep out of reach of children.\n\nMade in Thailand', 1137.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 688.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Aqua Hydrating Booster SerumPrice in BD', 'Boots Aqua Hydrating Booster Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-aqua-hydrating-booster-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(435, 'Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 02% Face Serum', '1', 0, 5, 32, '435', '435', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Intense, Multi-Level Hydration without the Oily Feel\nA hydrating booster with 4 different types of Hyaluronic Acid Molecules along with super hydrator Polyglutamic Acid (PGA). Provides multi-level hydration throughout the day.\nIdeal For:\nSkin type: Dry/Normal, Sensitive, Oily/Combination, Acne-Prone\nConcerns: Dry, Dehydrated & Skin Tightness\nSuitable for: 16+ years of age\nConsumer Studies:\nHyaluronic Acid & Polyglutamic Acid are potent hydrators & we got the product\'s efficacy evaluated through a consumer study.\n93% subjects noticed less dryness & hydrated skin in 4 weeks\n90% subjects said skin stayed hydrated throughout the day\n97% subjects felt skin felt soft & plump immediately upon application\nHow to Use:\nTake a pea-sized amount on your fingertips, and apply on the face and neck. For best results, follow it with a moisturiser to lock in the hydration within the skin.\nWhen to use: AM & PM. Everyday', 1365.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 735.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 02% Face SerumPrice in BD', 'Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 02% Face Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-hyaluronic-pga-02-face-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(436, 'Melao Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 5, 30, '436', '436', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our Hyaluronic Acid Serum is made with Certified Organic ingredients (72%) and is 100% Vegan for the highest potency. Paraben, Alcohol, and Fragrance Free. Delivers immideate nourishemnt and moisture that makes your skin glowing and more radiant. Helps to minimize the fine lines, wrinkles, dark circles and puffiness under the eyes.\nIngredients: Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Mentha Arvensis Leaf Extract, Hydrangea Macrophylla Leaf Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Chrysanthellum Indicum Extract, Sophora Angustifolia Root Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Euglena Gracilis Polysaccharide, Hydroxyac-etophenone, 1,2-hexanediol, Carnosine, Disodium Edta\nDirections: For best results use morning and night. Apply 3-5 drops to your fingertips and gently pat and massage onto your face, neck and and desired areas and let it dry. Follow with any one of our moisturizing oils.\nFor external use only.\nDiscontinue use if redness or irritation occurs. Avoid direct contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dark place.\nMade in PRC', 350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Melao Hyaluronic Acid Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-hyaluronic-acid-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(437, 'Cosmed Brightening Vitamin C Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 5, 132, '437', '437', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Clean and safe apothecary formulas from Anatolia\nA potent antioxidant-rich serum formulated with Vitamin C (Ascorbyl Tetraisopalmitate) and natural botanical extracts to reveal a brighter, more even skin tone. This lightweight serum helps protect against oxidative stress, fade dark spots, and restore natural radiance—suitable for all skin types and all seasons.\nBrightens dull, tired-looking skin\nHelps reduce the appearance of dark spots & hyperpigmentation\nProvides antioxidant protection against free radicals\nSupports a smoother, more even complexion\nGentle and dermatologically tested formula\nVitamin C (Ascorbyl Tetraisopalmitate) – A stable, oil-soluble form of Vitamin C that boosts radiance, fades discoloration, and stimulates collagen.\nMorus Alba (Mulberry) Root Extract – Naturally brightens skin and helps reduce uneven tone.\nCitrus Limon Peel Oil – Refreshes and energizes skin with a natural glow.\nBisabolol – Calms and soothes skin, reducing irritation.\nCrocus Chrysanthus Extract – Cosmed’s signature ingredient, symbolizing resilience and renewal, supporting skin vitality.\nApply to cleansed face and neck.\nMassage gently in circular motions, avoiding the eye area.\nUse morning and night for optimal results.\nDo not rinse.\nFor external use only.\nPerform a patch test before use.\nDiscontinue if irritation occurs and consult your doctor.\nAvoid eye contact. If contact occurs, rinse with water.\nWe don’t produce a product we wouldn’t use ourselves.\nFormulated with innovative, effective, and skin-friendly ingredients.\nPure, clean, eco-friendly, and sustainable approach.\nDIBUTYL ADIPATE, ADANSONIA DIGITATA OIL, ASCORBYL TETRAISOPALMITATE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, MORUS ALBA ROOT EXTRACT, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, CITRUS LIMON PEEL OIL, PHENYLETHYL RESORCINOL, BISABOLOL, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, BUTYL METHOXYDIBENZOYLMETHANE, AQUA, CROCUS CHRYSANTHUS BULB EXTRACT.', 2403.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 127.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmed Brightening Vitamin C Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmed Brightening Vitamin C Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmed-brightening-vitamin-c-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(438, 'Cetaphil 48hr Deep Hydration Activation Serum', '1', 0, 5, 63, '438', '438', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Cetaphil Deep Hydration 48 Hour Activation Serum is a lightweight, fast-absorbing serum designed to provide intense hydration for up to 48 hours, enhancing the overall quality of sensitive skin. Formulated with a blend of hyaluronic acid, sunflower seed oil, vitamin B5, and antioxidant-rich vitamin E, it works to rehydrate and restore the skin\'s appearance.\n\nKey Features:\nHydroSensitiv™ Complex: Incorporates soothing blue daisy to deepen dynamic hydration and alleviate skin sensitivity.\nDeep Hydration: Delivers moisture to the skin, maintaining hydration for 48 hours.\nNutrient-Rich Formula: Contains hyaluronic acid, sunflower seed oil, vitamin B5, and vitamin E to rehydrate and revitalize the skin\'s appearance.\nGentle on Sensitive Skin: Clinically tested to be gentle, hypoallergenic, and non-comedogenic, ensuring it won\'t clog pores or irritate sensitive skin.\nHow to Use:\nApplication: After cleansing, apply a small amount of the serum to your face and neck.\nFrequency: Use both morning and night for optimal hydration.', 1920.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1579.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil 48hr Deep Hydration Activation SerumPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil 48hr Deep Hydration Activation Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-48hr-deep-hydration-activation-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(439, 'Mamaearth Beetroot Hydraful Essence Serum 50ml', '1', 0, 5, 3, '439', '439', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mamaearth Beetroot Hydraful Essence Serum – 50ml\nMamaearth Beetroot Hydraful Essence Serum is a lightweight, hydrating serum infused with the goodness of beetroot extract, hyaluronic acid, and aloe vera to deeply nourish and revitalize your skin. This serum helps in locking in moisture, enhancing skin elasticity, and providing a radiant glow. The non-greasy formula absorbs quickly, leaving your skin soft, plump, and refreshed.\n✔ Deep Hydration – Hyaluronic acid and beetroot extract provide intense moisture✔ Glowing Skin – Brightens and revitalizes dull skin for a fresh, radiant look✔ Lightweight & Non-Greasy – Quickly absorbs into the skin without a sticky feel✔ Made Safe Certified – Free from parabens, sulfates, silicones, and harmful chemicals✔ Suitable for All Skin Types – Dermatologically tested and gentle on sensitive skin', 765.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 285.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Beetroot Hydraful Essence Serum 50mlPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Beetroot Hydraful Essence Serum 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-beetroot-hydraful-essence-serum-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
