(443, 'Beauty Formulas Moisture Serum with 1% Hyaluronic Acid', '1', 0, 5, 89, '443', '443', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Beauty Formulas Moisture Serum is a lightweight and hydrating formula infused with 1% Hyaluronic Acid. This serum is designed to provide intense hydration and moisture to the skin, making it an ideal addition to your daily skincare routine. Hyaluronic acid is known for its ability to retain moisture, helping to plump and rejuvenate the skin, leaving it feeling soft and supple.\nIntense Hydration: The 1% Hyaluronic Acid helps attract and retain moisture, ensuring the skin stays hydrated throughout the day.Plumps and Smooths: Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, promoting a plump and youthful complexion.Lightweight Texture: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, making it suitable for all skin types.Enhances Skin Barrier: Supports the skin’s natural barrier, helping to protect against environmental stressors.Improves Skin Texture: Regular use can lead to smoother, softer skin with a more even tone.Suitable for All Skin Types: Gentle enough for sensitive skin and suitable for daily use.\n\n\n\nIdeal For:\nAll Skin Types: Suitable for dry, oily, combination, and sensitive skin types.Dehydrated Skin: Particularly beneficial for those with dry or dehydrated skin needing extra moisture.Anti-Aging Routine: Can be incorporated into anti-aging skincare regimens to help improve skin texture and appearance.Sensitive and Normal Skin Types: Gentle enough for daily use on various skin types.Dull Skin: Revitalizes and improves skin texture, giving a dewy, fresh look.\nThe Beauty Formulas Moisture Serum with 1% Hyaluronic Acid is an essential product for anyone looking to boost hydration, improve skin texture, and achieve a more youthful glow.\n\nMade in UK', 499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 201.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty Formulas Moisture Serum with 1% Hyaluronic AcidPrice in BD', 'Beauty Formulas Moisture Serum with 1% Hyaluronic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-formulas-moisture-serum-with-1-hyaluronic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(444, 'Dot & Key Water Drench Hydrating Hyaluronic Serum Concentrate', '1', 0, 5, 91, '444', '444', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Water Drench Hydrating Hyaluronic Serum Concentrate\nQuench your skin’s thirst with Dot & Key Water Drench Hydrating Hyaluronic Serum Concentrate, a powerhouse formula designed to deeply hydrate, restore plumpness, and strengthen the skin barrier. Infused with Hyaluronic Acid, Vitamin C, and Vitamin E, this lightweight serum locks in moisture while fighting free radicals and daily environmental stressors for a radiant, healthy glow.\n✔ Deep Hydration & Plump Skin – Hyaluronic Acid intensely moisturizes and locks in hydration 💧✔ Skin Barrier Repair – Strengthens and protects against moisture loss and environmental damage 🛡️✔ Brightens & Revives – Vitamin C boosts collagen and enhances skin radiance 🌟✔ Soothes & Calms Sensitivity – Bulgarian Rose and Acai Berry heal and nourish for a soft, dewy finish 🌹✔ Clean & Gentle Formula – Free from harmful chemicals, making it safe for all skin types 🌍\nGet dewy, youthful, and glowing skin with this ultra-hydrating serum—your skin’s daily drink of water! 💖', 1075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 475.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot & Key Water Drench Hydrating Hyaluronic Serum ConcentratePrice in BD', 'Dot & Key Water Drench Hydrating Hyaluronic Serum Concentrate Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-key-water-drench-hydrating-hyaluronic-serum-concentrate', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(445, 'Guerniss Hydrating N90 Essence Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 5, 162, '445', '445', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Guerniss Moisturizing and Hydrating Essence is an extra ordinary Hyaluronic Acid serum to keep your everyday beauty care product list. Your body naturally produces hyaluronic acid that is a sugar molecule and found at a large scale in your skin, eyes, joints and connective tissues. Its amounts decrease with exposure to UV rays of sun, tobacco smoke, environmental contaminants and the natural process of ageing. The salient features and benefits of HA includes reducing visibility of fine line and wrinkles holding moisture to the skin, stimulating skin cell regeneration, lessening pigmentation issue, making texture smoother, tightening saggy skin, increasing resilience, enhancing lipid barrier, decreasing dermatitis, healing wounds and filling all skin layer with revitalising and boosting hydration as the most important activity. There is no known side effect issue we have found. Hyaluronic acid serum is suitable for all skin types but it’s especially helpful for dry skin.This Product is Dermatologically Tested.\nUsage: Cleanse your face with a simple cleanser. Then apply a couple of drops of our serum on your wet or damp face or skin followed by a moisturiser and sunscreen especially during the day time.You can use Hyaluronic Acid serum and vitamin C together for optimum result if vitamin c suits you well.\nIngredients: Water/Aqua, Sodium, Tea Tree Oil, Ascorbyl Phosphate Xanthan Gum, Haematococcus Pluvialis Extract, Sodium Hyaluranate, Hamamelis Virgimiena (Witch Hazel) Water, Glycerin Tocopherol Rosacanimna Fruit Extract Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract Chamomilla Recutita (Mareicaray Leaf Extract), Lecithin, Sucrose Stearate Polly Glyceryl Laurate, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA Sodium Benzoate, Pclassium Sorbate.\nMade in Hongkong', 1323.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 567.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Guerniss Hydrating N90 Essence Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Guerniss Hydrating N90 Essence Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guerniss-hydrating-n90-essence-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
(446, 'Numbuzin No. 5+ Vitamin Concentrated Serum', '1', 0, 5, 94, '446', '446', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Numbuzin No.5 Vitamin Concentrated Serum helps diminish the appearance of acne scars and brightens skin tone with antioxidants, glutathione and Niacinamide.\nThe lightweight serum absorbs quickly into the skin and leaves it supple and glowing. Suitable for all skin types.\nHow to use:\nUse this serum after cleansing and toning. Apply an adequate amount to the skin and gently pat it to allow absorption. Apply an additional drop to any areas of concern.\nIngredients:\nVaccinium Vitis-Idaea Fruit Extract, Butylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Panthenol, Tranexamic Acid, Water, 1,2-Hexanediol, Neopentyl Glycol Dicaprate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Sorbitol, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Chondrus Crispus Extract, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Saccharum Officinarum (Sugarcane) Extract, Alpha-Arbutin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Tremella Fuciformis (Mushroom) Extract, Pentylene Glycol, Glycerin, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Bisabolol, Tromethamine, Ethylhexylglycerin, Adenosine, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Allantoin, Glutathione, Ceramide NP, Beta-Glucan, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Tocopherol, Ascorbic Acid, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Tocopheryl Acetate, Hydroxypropyl Cyclodextrin, Ubiquinone, Thioctic Acid, Potassium Hydroxide, Behenyl Alcohol, Carbomer, Xanthan Gum, Disodium EDTA\nCaution\nMade in Korea', 1950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 650.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Numbuzin No. 5+ Vitamin Concentrated SerumPrice in BD', 'Numbuzin No. 5+ Vitamin Concentrated Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'numbuzin-no-5-vitamin-concentrated-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22: