(472, 'The Derma Plus 10 % Niacinamide +1% Zinc Face Serum for All Skin Types 30ml', '1', 0, 11, 52, '472', '472', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Derma Plus 10% Niacinamide + 1% Zinc Face Serum (30ml) targets acne, oiliness, and uneven tone for all skin types with a lightweight, non-comedogenic formula.\nHigh-potency niacinamide minimizes pores, regulates sebum, and brightens while zinc reduces inflammation and fights blemishes. Strengthens skin barrier for smoother texture and faded acne scars.\nNiacinamide (10%): Evens tone, controls oil, boosts ceramides.\nZinc (1%): Antibacterial, calms redness, balances oil.\nHyaluronic acid hydrates; fragrance-free and essential oil-free.\nCleanse, tone, apply 2-3 drops AM/PM. Follow with moisturizer/sunscreen. Patch test first; results visible in 2-4 weeks.\nPerfect for oily/combination/acne-prone skin; gentle enough for sensitive types without clogging pores.', 700.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, -700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Plus 10 % Niacinamide +1% Zinc Face Serum for All Skin Types 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Derma Plus 10 % Niacinamide +1% Zinc Face Serum for All Skin Types 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-plus-10-niacinamide-1-zinc-face-serum-for-all-skin-types-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:05'),
