(477, 'Phytotree Phyto Solution 9 Niacin Ampoule 30 ml', '1', 0, 11, 168, '477', '477', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Phytotree Phyto Solution 9 Niacin Ampoule is a lightweight, water-like facial ampoule formulated to help improve the look of dull, uneven skin tone while supporting anti-wrinkle care. This dual-functional formula is powered by 5% Niacinamide for brightening and vitality, plus Adenosine to help improve the appearance of fine lines. With hydrating and soothing ingredients, it absorbs comfortably and helps skin look brighter, smoother, and healthier-looking with consistent use.\nBrightening & Tone Care: Helps reduce the appearance of dullness and uneven tone for a clearer, more radiant look.\nWrinkle Appearance Support: Contains Adenosine to help improve the look of fine lines and wrinkles.\nHydration Boost: Delivers moisture for a plumper, healthier-looking finish.\nLightweight Texture: Water-like consistency layers easily under moisturizer and makeup.\nSoothing Support: Includes skin-comforting ingredients to help calm the feel of sensitive-looking skin.\nNiacinamide (5%) – Helps brighten and improve the appearance of uneven tone.\nAdenosine – Helps support wrinkle-care and smoother-looking skin.\nSodium Hyaluronate – Hydration support\nGlycerin, Propanediol, Butylene Glycol – Moisture-attracting humectants\nPanthenol – Helps support skin comfort\nCentella Asiatica Extract & Madecassoside – Soothing care\nHydrolyzed Collagen – Skin-conditioning support\nRosa Centifolia Flower Water – Refreshing skin feel\nAfter cleansing, apply toner.\nDispense an appropriate amount of ampoule.\nSpread evenly over the face and gently pat for absorption.\nFollow with moisturizer.Use morning and evening.\nProduct Type: Facial ampoule / serum\nSize: 30 ml / 1.01 fl.oz.\nSkin Concerns: Dullness, uneven tone, dehydration, fine lines\nTexture: Water-like, fast-absorbing\nWater, Rosa Centifolia Flower Water, Sodium Hyaluronate, Glycerin, Propanediol, Niacinamide (5%), 1,2-Hexanediol, Butylene Glycol, Panthenol, Centella Asiatica Extract, Caprylyl Glycol, Carbomer, Arginine, Xanthan Gum, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Trehalose, Illicium Verum (Anise) Fruit Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Madecassoside, DNA.\nFor external use only. Discontinue use and consult a professional if redness, swelling, itching, or irritation occurs during or after use (including after sun exposure). Avoid using on broken or damaged skin. Store away from direct sunlight and keep out of reach of children.', 1290.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 560.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Phytotree Phyto Solution 9 Niacin Ampoule 30 mlPrice in BD', 'Phytotree Phyto Solution 9 Niacin Ampoule 30 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'phytotree-phyto-solution-9-niacin-ampoule-30-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:05', '2026-02-11 06:22:06'),
(478, 'AXIS - Y Calamine Pore Control Capsule Serum', '1', 0, 11, 12, '478', '478', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience smooth , radiant skin with AXIS-Y Calamine Pore Control Capsule Serum! This innovative serum is your solution to improve the appearance of enlarged pores and achieve better textured skin .\nFormulated with Calamine , this serum works against inflammation and helps eliminate acne irritation by purifying pores. It also includes Tannin Complex to control excess sebum and minimize pores , thus maintaining healthy skin.\nThe serum capsules are enriched with two plant-derived complexes (Centella Asiatica, Artemisia, Broccoli, Pineapple, Blue Iris and Witch Hazel) that contain soothing , antioxidant and pore - tightening ingredients , reducing their appearance and giving a firmer and more radiant look.\nIdeal for all skin types , especially oily and acne-prone skin , this serum provides effective hydration and improves the skin\'s water-oil balance .\n\nContent: 50ml\n\nHow to use: Apply 2-3 drops to forehead and cheeks and spread over entire face. We recommend gently patting with your fingertips to help it absorb better.\nIngredients: Water, Butylene Glycol, Dipropylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Calamine, Bromelain, Iris Versicolor Extract, Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Extract, Sucrose, Mannitol, Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Hydroxypropyl Methylcellulose, Centella Asiatica Extract, Artemisia Capillaris Extract, Brassica Oleracea Italica (Broccoli) Extract, Diospyros Kaki Leaf Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Fruit Extract, Zanthoxylum Piperitum Fruit Extract, Castanea Crenata (Chestnut) Shell Extract, Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Flower Extract , Coffea Arabica (Coffee) Seed Extract, Polygonum Cuspidatum Root Extract, Dextrin, Palmitic Acid, Allantoin, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Xanthan Gum, Carbomer, C12-16 Alcohols, Sorbitan Isostearate, Disodium EDTA, Tromethamine, Ethylhexylglycerin, Gardenia Florida Fruit Extract, Tocopherol.', 1846.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 954.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'AXIS - Y Calamine Pore Control Capsule SerumPrice in BD', 'AXIS - Y Calamine Pore Control Capsule Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'axis-y-calamine-pore-control-capsule-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:06', '2026-02-11 06:22:06'),
