(482, 'Lumi Lupix Pore Minimizing Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 11, 72, '482', '482', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lumi Lupix Pore Minimizing Serum 30ml is a lightweight, targeted skincare solution designed to refine skin texture, reduce the appearance of pores, and promote a smoother, more radiant complexion. Ideal for oily and combination skin types, this serum helps balance sebum production while delivering hydration and clarity.\n\nKey Features:\n\nUsage:Apply 2–3 drops of the serum to cleansed and toned skin, focusing on areas with enlarged pores or excess oil. Gently pat until fully absorbed. Use twice daily, morning and evening, before moisturizer.\n\nIngredients:\nRetinol, Niacinamide, Licorice extract, Alpha arbutin, Xanthan gum. Aloe vera juice, Pentylene glycol, Aqua(water), Citric acid.\n\nWhy Choose This Product:Lumi Lupix Pore Minimizing Serum combines science-backed ingredients with a gentle formulation to deliver visible results without irritation. Its non-greasy texture makes it ideal for layering under makeup or sunscreen, making it a seamless addition to any skincare routine.\n\nBenefits:\n\nPatch test before use', 975.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 325.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lumi Lupix Pore Minimizing Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Lumi Lupix Pore Minimizing Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lumi-lupix-pore-minimizing-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:06', '2026-02-11 06:22:06'),
(483, 'Guerniss Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 11, 162, '483', '483', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% Serum is a combination of concentration of niacinamide and  zinc. These two ingredient together can work great to repair your skin barrier and overall skin health.\nWhat is niacinamide?It is a form of vitamin B which is an essential nutrient for our skin. It is also known as nicotinamide. Niacinamide can help to build proteins in the skin and also lock in moisture to prevent damage.\nThe benefits of Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% Serum :\nWhat is Zinc?It is an essential mineral for our body, it is also great for our skin. Zinc is commonly known for healing wounds and also for its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties. The 1% zinc in the serum also enhances repair function of skin and also reduces redness and inflammation.\nCautions: If you notice any redness, burn or any side effects do not continue the product Do not use this with topically applied Vitamin C. Use these two components in alternate time.This Serum is gentle for everyday use and also has no proven side effects. It is also Vegan, dermatologically tested and cruelty free.How to use:\nIngredients:Water;Aqua, Sodium, Ascorby Phosphate Xanthan Gum, Haematococcus Plvialis Extract Sodium Hyaluronate, Hamamelis Virginiana(Witch Hazel), Water Glycerin, Tocopherol Niacinamide 10 Zinc 1% High Strength Vitamin and MIneral Blemish Formula Niacinamide 10%, Zinc 1% Ultra Vitamin E Formula, Mineral Controlled Imperfections.Made in Hongkong', 1330.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 560.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Guerniss Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Guerniss Niacinamide 10% + Zinc 1% Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guerniss-niacinamide-10-zinc-1-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:06', '2026-02-11 06:22:06'