(487, 'Jumiso Niacinamide 10 Pore Minimizing Serum for Sensitive Skin 40ml', '1', 0, 11, 93, '487', '487', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jumiso Niacinamide 10 Serum is a potent, fast-absorbing skincare solution designed to visibly brighten skin, minimize pores, and reduce dark spots. Formulated with 10% Niacinamide, Glutathione, and Tranexamic Acid, it helps smooth rough texture, control excess sebum, and promote a clearer, more even complexion. Lightweight and suitable for sensitive skin, this serum strengthens the skin barrier while delivering noticeable results.\nPore Minimizing: Reduces the appearance of enlarged pores for a smoother texture.\nBrightens Skin Tone: 10% Niacinamide helps fade dark spots and uneven skin.\nHyperpigmentation Care: Glutathione + Tranexamic Acid target dark spots and discoloration.\nCalms & Strengthens: Triple Centella Complex reduces redness and supports skin barrier health.\nFast-Absorbing & Lightweight: Non-greasy formula perfect for layering in daily routines.\n27.7% reduction in hyperpigmentation within 2 weeks.\n20% reduction in visible redness within 2 weeks.\nApply an appropriate amount onto clean, dry skin.\nGently tap or massage into the face until fully absorbed.\nUse daily, morning and evening, before moisturizer or sunscreen.\nFor external use only.\nAvoid application on broken or wounded skin.\nDiscontinue use and consult a doctor if redness, itching, or irritation occurs.\nKeep out of reach of infants and store away from direct sunlight.\nVolume: 40ml\nSkin Type: Sensitive and all skin types\nTexture: Lightweight, fast-absorbing serum\nFree From: Harsh chemicals and unnecessary irritants', 2330.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Ampule', 0.00, 1, NULL, 120.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Jumiso Niacinamide 10 Pore Minimizing Serum for Sensitive Skin 40mlPrice in BD', 'Jumiso Niacinamide 10 Pore Minimizing Serum for Sensitive Skin 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL,