(488, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule', '1', 0, 11, 16, '488', '488', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule is a lightweight, non-sticky serum designed to minimize pores, enhance skin elasticity, and provide hydration. Perfect for oily, combination, and sensitive skin types, this ampoule is your go-to solution for a refreshed and balanced complexion.\nKey Ingredients:\nBenefits:\nHow to Use: After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount of the ampoule to your face. Gently pat it in to promote absorption. Use it both morning and night for optimal results.\nThis ampoule is free from artificial fragrances, vegan, and cruelty-free, ensuring a safe and ethical choice for your skincare routine. With regular use, it helps achieve a refined, hydrated, and healthy-looking complexion.Made in Korea', 1815.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 985.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh AmpoulePrice in BD', 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-poremizing-fresh-ampoule', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 06:22:06', '2026-02-11 06:22:06'),
(489, 'Isme Centella Stretch Mark Repair Cream – 100g For Prevent & Reduce Stretch Mark', '1', 0, 18, 169, '489', '489', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Isme Centella Stretch Mark Repair Cream is a nourishing and rejuvenating cream formulated to prevent, reduce, and repair stretch marks and scars. Enriched with Centella Asiatica Extract, it promotes collagen and elastin production, enhancing skin elasticity and supporting the natural repair process of skin cells. The cream also contains B-Glucan, which helps protect against wrinkles and cellular damage, and Vitamins B3, C, and E, which hydrate and smooth the skin, promoting a firmer, radiant, and natural-looking complexion.\nKey Benefits:\nHelps prevent and reduce the appearance of stretch marks and scars\nEnhances skin elasticity and firmness by stimulating collagen and elastin production\nPromotes skin cell regeneration for smoother, rejuvenated skin\nProtects against wrinkles and skin deterioration with B-Glucan\nHydrates and nourishes skin with Vitamins B3, C, and E\nLeaves skin soft, smooth, and naturally radiant\nHow to Use:\nApply the cream to the stretch mark area.\nMassage gently for 3–5 minutes until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, morning and evening, preferably after bathing.\nFor best results, use consistently.\nIngredients:Deionized Water, Stearic Acid, Hydrolyzed Cat Protein, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Oleate, Glyceryl Stearate, Isopropyl Myristate, Glycerin, Cyclopentasiloxane, Cyclotetrasiloxane, Fragrance, Spirulina Platensis Extract, Soy Isoflavones, Caffeine, Polysorbate, Phenoxyethanol, Beta Glucan, Betaine, Nicotinamide (Vitamin B3), Tetrasodium EDTA, Centella Asiatica Extract, and other skin-nourishing components.\nNet Weight: 100g\nThis cream is ideal for anyone looking for a gentle, effective solution to improve skin elasticity, prevent stretch marks, and promote smooth, healthy, and radiant skin.', 836.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 214.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Isme Centella Stretch Mark Repair Cream – 100g For Prevent & Reduce Stretch MarkPrice in BD', 'Isme Centella Stretch Mark Repair Cream – 100g For Prevent & Reduce Stretch Mark Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isme-centella-stretch-mark-repair-cream-100g-for-prevent-reduce-stretch-mark', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
