(491, 'TouchSoft Stretch Mark & Scar Reduction Lotion – 100ml with Geranium & Rosemary', '1', 0, 18, 171, '491', '491', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:TouchSoft Stretch Mark Lotion is a herbal Ayurvedic preparation designed to reduce stretch marks, scars, and even out skin discoloration. Enriched with natural botanicals like Geranium, Rosemary, Neem, Manjishtha, and Tulsi, it nourishes and hydrates the skin while minimizing the appearance of stretch marks, especially during pregnancy. This herbal lotion is gentle, effective, and suitable for long-term use.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces stretch marks and scars naturally\nEvens out skin tone and discoloration\nHerbal formulation with Geranium, Rosemary, Neem, Manjishtha, Tulsi, Yashtimadhu, and Daruharidra\nRich in Til Taila (Sesame oil) for excellent spreadability and hydration\nSafe for external use during pregnancy\nComposition (per 100ml):\nPatol Patra (Trichosanthes dioica) Leaf: 2.29% w/v\nNeem (Azadirachta indica) Leaf: 2.29% w/v\nManjishtha (Rubia cordifolia) Stem: 2.29% w/v\nTulsi (Ocimum sanctum) Whole Plant: 2.29% w/v\nDaruharidra (Berberis aristata) Stem/Root: 2.29% w/v\nYashtimadhu (Glycyrrhiza glabra) Root: 2.29% w/v\nTil Taila (Sesamum indicum) Oil Base: 16% w/v\nOther ingredients q.s.\nIndications:\nPrevention or minimization of stretch marks due to pregnancy\nMode of Application:\nApply liberally over the stomach, abdomen, and flanks\nTwice daily, from the 4th month of pregnancy until delivery\nRub gently until fully absorbed\nPrecautions & Storage:\nFor external use only\nStore in a cool, dry place\nNot a cosmetic or toiletry; this is an Ayurvedic medicine\nNet Contents: 100ml', 1315.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 70.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'TouchSoft Stretch Mark & Scar Reduction Lotion – 100ml with Geranium & RosemaryPrice in BD', 'TouchSoft Stretch Mark & Scar Reduction Lotion – 100ml with Geranium & Rosemary Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'touchsoft-stretch-mark-scar-reduction-lotion-100ml-with-geranium-rosemary', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(492, 'Aichun Beauty Anti Stretch Mark Cream 60gm Intensive Skin Treatment for Improvement & Elimination', '1', 0, 18, 172, '492', '492', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Intensive Skin Treatment for Improvement & Elimination\nSay goodbye to unwanted stretch marks with Aichun Beauty’s Anti Stretch Mark Cream, expertly formulated to reduce the appearance of stretch marks and restore your skin’s elasticity and smoothness. This intensive treatment is ideal for use on the abdomen, thighs, hips, and other areas prone to stretching due to pregnancy, weight changes, or growth.\nVisibly reduces stretch marks with regular use\nDeeply moisturizes and nourishes dry, tight skin\nImproves skin tone and elasticity\nHelps repair damaged skin tissues\nLightweight, non-greasy, and fast-absorbing formula\nAll skin types\nPregnant and postpartum women\nMen & women with stretch marks due to weight gain or loss\nApply a generous amount on clean, dry skin and gently massage until fully absorbed. Use twice daily for best results.\n✅ Dermatologist-tested✅ Gentle and safe for daily use', 396.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 54.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aichun Beauty Anti Stretch Mark Cream 60gm Intensive Skin Treatment for Improvement & EliminationPrice in BD', 'Aichun Beauty Anti Stretch Mark Cream 60gm Intensive Skin Treatment for Improvement & Elimination Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aichun-beauty-anti-stretch-mark-cream-60gm-intensive-skin-treatment-for-improvement-elimination', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(493, 'Constanta Stretch Mark Cream 100ml (CT-196)', '1', 0, 18, 137, '493', '493', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Enriched with Centella Asiatica Extract & Vitamin EGentle & Mild Formula\nConstanta Stretch Mark Cream is a specially formulated treatment designed to prevent and minimize stretch marks while supporting the skin’s natural elasticity and smoothness. Its nourishing formula helps improve suppleness, encourages natural cell renewal, and provides deep moisturization to soothe sensitive or stressed skin.\nIdeal for skin affected by pregnancy, rapid weight changes, growth spurts, or aging, this cream works to reduce the appearance of existing stretch marks while preventing the formation of new ones. With consistent use, the skin becomes firmer, smoother, and more resilient.\nHelps prevent the formation of new stretch marks\nSupports skin elasticity and suppleness\nEncourages natural cell renewal\nSmooths and softens skin texture\nProvides deep moisturization to soothe sensitive areas\nIdeal for pregnancy, weight fluctuation, and rapid growth\nGentle and mild formula suitable for daily use\nApply Constanta Stretch Mark Cream directly to areas with stretch marks.Gently massage in a circular motion until fully absorbed.Use regularly for best results.\nAqua, Paraffinum Liquidum (Mineral Oil), Glyceryl Stearate, Glycerin, PEG-100 Stearate, Cetyl Alcohol, Phenoxyethanol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Dimethicone, Fragrance, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, Xanthan Gum, Allantoin, Butylated Hydroxytoluene, Disodium EDTA, Niacinamide, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Propylene Glycol, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract, Butylene Glycol, Centella Asiatica Extract, Cholesterol, Stearic Acid, Ceramide NP, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Lactic Acid, Oleic Acid, Polygonum Cuspidatum Root Extract, Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract, Phytosphingosine, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Glycyrrhiza Glabra Root Extract, Caprylyl Glycol, Chamomilla Recutita Flower Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis Leaf Extract, Caprylhydroxamic Acid, Glucose, Sodium Hyaluronate, Chondrus Crispus Extract, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Hyaluronic Acid, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Potassium Hyaluronate.\nPrevents and minimizes stretch marks\nDeeply nourishing and hydrating\nSupports firmness and elasticity\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\nManufactured under license of Constanta Germany', 1899.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 81.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Constanta Stretch Mark Cream 100ml (CT-196)Price in BD', 'Constanta Stretch Mark Cream 100ml (CT-196) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'constanta-stretch-mark-cream-100ml-ct-196', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(494, 'Dilastin Strech Mark Gel 60gm', '1', 0, 18, 173, '494', '494', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For Stretch Marks, Scars & Skin Rejuvenation\nDescription (English):Dilastin Gel is an advanced herbal formulation specially designed to reduce stretch marks, dissolve deep scar tissues, and lighten dark spots. Enriched with the power of Nicotinamide, Vitamin B3, and Onion Extract (Allium Cepa), it helps improve overall skin texture, offers anti-aging benefits, and deeply moisturizes the skin.\nReduces appearance of stretch marks\nBreaks down deep scar tissues\nFades dark spots & discoloration\nOffers anti-aging skin benefits\nMoisturizes and softens skin\nIngredients (Per gram):\nNicotinamide – 5%\nVitamin B3 – 4%\nOnion Extract (Allium Cepa) – 10%\nUsage:Apply gently on the affected area 2-3 times daily.Use for 8 weeks on new scars and 3-6 months on older scars or as directed by a physician.\nCaution:For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Do not apply on broken or open skin.\n📚 Reference: USP DSC & PDR for Herbal Medicines🔖 Mfg. Lic. No.: HBL-022🔖 DAR No.: 022-82-94🏭 Manufactured by: Alien Pharma (Herbal)\nস্ট্রেচ মার্ক, দাগ ও ত্বকের উজ্জ্বলতায় কার্যকর হার্বাল সমাধান\nবর্ণনা (বাংলা):ডাইলাস্টিন জেল একটি প্রাকৃতিক হার্বাল ফর্মুলা, যা স্ট্রেচ মার্ক কমায়, গভীর স্কার টিসু গলিয়ে দেয়, কালো দাগ হালকা করে, এবং ত্বকে ময়েশ্চারাইজিং ও এন্টি এজিং প্রভাব প্রদান করে। এতে রয়েছে নিকোটিনামাইড, ভিটামিন বি৩ এবং অলিয়াম সেপা (অনিয়ন এক্সট্রাক্ট) যা ত্বককে করে আরও স্বাস্থ্যজ্জ্বল ও নমনীয়।\nস্ট্রেচ মার্ক ও দাগ হ্রাস করে\nগভীর স্কার টিসু ভেঙে দেয়\nকালচে দাগ ও স্পট দূর করে\nত্বকের বয়সজনিত প্রভাব রোধ করে\nত্বকে ময়েশ্চারাইজিং দেয় ও কোমল করে\nউপাদান (প্রতি গ্রামে):\nনিকোটিনামাইড – ৫%\nভিটামিন বি৩ – ৪%\nঅনিয়ন এক্সট্রাক্ট – ১০%\nব্যবহারবিধি:প্রতিদিন ২-৩ বার দাগের উপর আলতোভাবে ব্যবহার করুন।নতুন দাগের ক্ষেত্রে ৮ সপ্তাহ এবং পুরাতন দাগে ৩-৬ মাস ব্যবহার করুন অথবা চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ অনুযায়ী প্রয়োগ করুন।\nসতর্কতা:শুধুমাত্র বাহ্যিক ব্যবহারের জন্য। চোখে লাগানো থেকে বিরত থাকুন। ক্ষত স্থানে ব্যবহার করবেন না।\n📚 সূত্র: USP DSC ও হার্বাল মেডিসিনের পিডিআর🔖 লাইসেন্স নম্বর: HBL-022🔖 রেজি নম্বর: 022-82-94🏭 প্রস্তুতকারক: এলিয়েন ফার্মা (হার্বাল)', 551.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dilastin Strech Mark Gel 60gmPrice in BD', 'Dilastin Strech Mark Gel 60gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dilastin-strech-mark-gel-60gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(495, 'Creme 21 Germany Skin Care Glycerin', '1', 0, 19, 174, '495', '495', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Creme 21 Germany Skin Care Glycerin is a premium skincare product crafted by the esteemed German brand Creme 21. Unlike traditional creams, this product harnesses the power of glycerin to deeply hydrate and rejuvenate the skin. Glycerin, a natural humectant, attracts moisture to the skin, helping to maintain its hydration levels and promote a smooth, radiant complexion.\nThis innovative skincare solution is formulated to deliver intense hydration without the heaviness or greasiness commonly associated with creams. Its lightweight consistency makes it ideal for use on all skin types, providing instant relief for dry, dehydrated skin.\nCreme 21 Germany Skin Care Glycerin works by forming a protective barrier on the skin\'s surface, locking in moisture and shielding against external aggressors such as pollution and harsh weather conditions. With regular use, it helps to improve the skin\'s elasticity, texture, and overall appearance.\nExperience the refreshing and revitalizing effects of Creme 21 Germany Skin Care Glycerin and treat your skin to the nourishment it deserves. Made with the highest quality ingredients and backed by the expertise of German skincare craftsmanship, this product embodies excellence in skincare innovation.\nMade in UAE', 872.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 443.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Creme 21 Germany Skin Care GlycerinPrice in BD', 'Creme 21 Germany Skin Care Glycerin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'creme-21-germany-skin-care-glycerin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
