(503, 'Palmer\'s Coconut Hydrate Facial Oil for Radiant, Hydrated Skin with Vitamin E', '1', 0, 19, 179, '503', '503', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boost Hydration and Glow with Palmer\'s® Coconut Oil Formula™ Facial Oil, crafted with antioxidant-rich Extra Virgin Coconut Oil + 9 other skin nourishing oils for radiant, healthy-looking skin. Helps maintain skin\'s optimal moisture level so skin is replenished and balanced with a dewy, youthful appearance.\nDERMATOLOGIST APPROVED\nNON-COMEDOGENIC\nSuitable for Vegans\nKey Ingredients:\nCoconut Oil (Cocos Nucifera)*: Sustainably harvested, raw coconut is rich in natural lipids and proteins for superior hydration and maintaining a healthy glow.\nFAIR TRADE COCONUT OIL\nETHICALLY AND SUSTAINABLY SOURCED OILS\n*Certified Organic Extra Virgin Fair Trade Coconut Oil', 890.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1035.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Palmer\'s Coconut Hydrate Facial Oil for Radiant, Hydrated Skin with Vitamin EPrice in BD', 'Palmer\'s Coconut Hydrate Facial Oil for Radiant, Hydrated Skin with Vitamin E Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'palmers-coconut-hydrate-facial-oil-for-radiant-hydrated-skin-with-vitamin-e', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(504, 'W7-Prime Magic Universal Face Primer', '1', 0, 19, 180, '504', '504', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Your Skin’s Perfect Canvas\n✔ Blurs Imperfections – Minimizes pores & fine lines instantly✔ 24H Makeup Lock – Extends foundation wear without fading✔ Weightless Finish – Silicone-free, breathable formula✔ Universal Adaption – Self-adjusting tone suits all complexions\nLight-Diffusing Spheres: Creates soft-focus effect (no white cast)\nHyaluronic Acid: Boosts hydration by 200% (in 1 hour*)\nVitamin E: Protects against pollution-induced oxidation\nPrep: Apply after moisturizer, before foundation\nApplication:\nUse pea-sized amount\nPress (don’t rub) onto T-zone & cheeks\nPro Tip: Reapply on eyelids to prevent eyeshadow creasing\nFree From:✖ Parabens | ✖ Mineral Oil | ✖ Synthetic Fragrance\nVegan & Cruelty-FreeApproved by PETA\n30ml pump bottle (TSA-approved)\nHygienic airtight packaging\nPerfect For:\nOily skin seeking shine control\nMature skin wanting smoothing\nBridal makeup longevity', 667.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 53.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'W7-Prime Magic Universal Face PrimerPrice in BD', 'W7-Prime Magic Universal Face Primer Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'w7-prime-magic-universal-face-primer', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
