(507, 'SOFTRAS Hypoallergenic Hydrating Moisturizer Lotion with Aloe Vera & Ceramides (100ml)', '1', 0, 19, 70, '507', '507', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With Aloe Vera & Ceramides | All Skin Types | 100ml\nSOFTRAS Hydrating Moisturizer Lotion is a rich, nourishing lotion that deeply hydrates the skin while strengthening the skin barrier. Enriched with Aloe Vera and Ceramides, it replenishes moisture, soothes irritation, and keeps your skin soft, smooth, and healthy-looking.\nThis hypoallergenic, non-greasy lotion is suitable for all skin types, non-comedogenic, and paraben-free.\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes the skin\nStrengthens skin barrier with Ceramides\nHypoallergenic and non-greasy\nNon-comedogenic and paraben-free\nSuitable for all skin types\nPurified Water, 1-2-20 Propanediol, Ketoconazole, Biotin, ZPTO, Piroctone Olamine, Butylene Glycol, PPG-26-Buteth-26, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Apigenin, Oleanolic Acid, Climbazole, Polyquaternium-10, D-Panthenol, Sodium Lauryl Sulfosuccinate, Decyl Glucoside, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Coco Diethanolamide, Cocomonoethanolamide, Collagen, Caffeine, Polysorbate, Hydrolyzed Soy Protein, Arachidyl Alcohol, Terpineol, Thymol, Tea Tree Oil, Undecylenic Acid, Glycerin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Phenoxyethanol, Dimethicone, Cetearyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Acrylates Copolymer, Guar Hydroxypropyl-trimonium Chloride, Triticum Vulgare (Wheat Germ Oil), Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Oil, Alpha Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), Disodium Edetate, Perfume.\nApply a small amount to clean skin and massage gently until absorbed. Use daily for best results.\nStore at a temperature not exceeding 25°C.Keep away from direct sunlight and do not freeze.\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse immediately with water. Keep out of reach of children.', 1596.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 84.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SOFTRAS Hypoallergenic Hydrating Moisturizer Lotion with Aloe Vera & Ceramides (100ml)Price in BD', 'SOFTRAS Hypoallergenic Hydrating Moisturizer Lotion with Aloe Vera & Ceramides (100ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'softras-hypoallergenic-hydrating-moisturizer-lotion-with-aloe-vera-ceramides-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(508, 'The Ordinary 100% Organic Cold-Pressed Rose Hip Seed Oil 30ml', '1', 0, 19, 25, '508', '508', NULL, NULL, NULL, '100% Organic Cold-Pressed Rosehip Seed Oil naturally hydrates skin to help address signs of aging by brightening and balancing uneven skin tone, supporting skin elasticity, and promoting supple, more radiant-looking skin. It’s made of 100% organic rosehip seed oil that is cold-pressed to retain its potency and is gentle enough for daily use.Rose Hip Seed Oil is completely unrefined and imparts a natural scent partly due to its high omega fatty acid content. This scent is not an indication of rancidity.\nWhat it is: A daily support formula with 100 percent high-purity, sustainably sourced, organic, cold-pressed rose hip seed oil.Skin Type: Normal, Dry, Combination, and OilySkincare Concerns: Dryness and DullnessHighlighted Ingredients:- Rosa Canina Seed Oil: Targets visible signs of photo aging and supports healthy, hydrated skin.Ingredient Callouts: Free of parabens, formaldehydes, mineral oil, oxybenzone, coal tar, and sulfates SLS & SLES. It is also vegan, gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.What Else You Need to Know: Rose Hip Seed Oil is completely unrefined and imparts a natural scent, partly due to its high omega fatty acid content. This scent is not an indication of rancidity. Rose Hip Seed Oil that does not have a scent is refined and offers reduced benefits. It comes in UV-protective packaging.\nKey Ingredients:\nRosa Canina Seed Oil.\nSuggested Usage:-Apply to the face once a day, ideally at bedtime after application of water-based treatments.\nWhen to use: Use in PM\nHow to use:', 1500.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 340.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary 100% Organic Cold-Pressed Rose Hip Seed Oil 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary 100% Organic Cold-Pressed Rose Hip Seed Oil 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-100-organic-cold-pressed-rose-hip-seed-oil-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
