(522, 'Balance Active Formula Rose Nourishing Oil with Rosehip Oil 30ml (Nourish & Illuminate)', '1', 0, 19, 189, '522', '522', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Balance Rose Nourishing Oil is a gentle, fast-absorbing face oil infused with Rosehip Oil to deeply moisturise and instantly brighten dull skin. This luxurious blend of youth-boosting oils helps leave skin feeling smooth, comfortable, and healthy-looking. Dermatologically tested and suitable for sensitive skin, it’s ideal for daily use on the face and neck for a naturally radiant complexion.\nNourishes & illuminates for instant radiance\nDeeply moisturises and softens dry, tired-looking skin\nFast-absorbing and lightweight, non-heavy feel\nGentle formulation suitable for sensitive skin\nHelps improve smoothness with continued use\nDermatologically tested\nLeaves skin looking instantly radiant*\nSkin feels smoother after 2 weeks use*\n93% agree skin feels instantly nourished**Independent study on 58 people for 2 weeks.\nMorning and night, apply a few drops and gently smooth over face and neck.\nPrunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Rosa Canina Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Punica Granatum Seed Oil, Parfum (Fragrance), Tocopherol, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, Citronellol, Geraniol, Benzyl Benzoate, Geranyl Acetate.\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse immediately with clean warm water. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.\nSize: 30ml / 1 fl.oz\nMade in England', 1155.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 744.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Balance Active Formula Rose Nourishing Oil with Rosehip Oil 30ml (Nourish & Illuminate)Price in BD', 'Balance Active Formula Rose Nourishing Oil with Rosehip Oil 30ml (Nourish & Illuminate) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'balance-active-formula-rose-nourishing-oil-with-rosehip-oil-30ml-nourish-illuminate', 0.0