(523, 'Dr Rashel Vitamin C Turmeric Face Oil', '1', 0, 19, 55, '523', '523', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Benefits : Absorbing rapidly into skin, the face oil works to brighten and hydrate the look of skin to recharge your natural radiance. Promoting a healthy looking luster, it contains golden turmeric extract and oil soluble from of vitamin c for its antioxidant-rich composition, calming properties and ability to improve the look of skin evenness. Delivers instant glow and antioxidant protection. It also helps to reduce the appearance of fine lines, dark spots\nUse For : Face Oil\nFeature : Antioxidant - Hydrating - Brighten Skin Tone - Dark Spots - Dullness - Uneven Texture - Dryness\nSkin Type : Suitable for all skin types\nIngredients : Ethylhexyl palmitate, c13-14 isoparaffin, canola oil, isopropyl myristate, c13-16 isoparaffin, prunus amygdalus dulcis (sweet almond) oil, fragrance, tocopheryl acetate, arnebia euchroma extract, caprylic/capric triglyceride, disostearyl malate, olea europaea (olive) fruit oil, candida bombicola/glucose/methyl rapeseedate ferment, oryza sativa (rice) germ oil, curcuma longa (turmeric) root extract, bisabolol, tocopherol, carthamus tinctorius (safflower) seed oil, ascorbyl tetraisopalmitate, tbhq, ci 47000\nHow To Use : After cleansing, put 1-2 drops on the palm, rub your hands together until the palms are slightly warm, lift up and massage according to the skin texture until absorbed', 663.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 312.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr Rashel Vitamin C Turmeric Face OilPrice in BD', 'Dr Rashel Vitamin C Turmeric Face Oil Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-rashel-vitamin-c-turmeric-face-oil', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(524, 'Skin Secrets Glycerin 125ml', '1', 0, 19, 190, '524', '524', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Secrets Glycerin - 125ml\nSkin Secrets Glycerin is a versatile and highly effective moisturizer known for its ability to retain moisture, providing long-lasting hydration for skin that feels soft, smooth, and refreshed. Glycerin is a natural humectant, meaning it attracts moisture from the environment and locks it into the skin, helping to keep it well-hydrated throughout the day. This product is suitable for use on the face, hands, and body, making it a must-have for dry skin care routines, especially during colder months.\nKey Features:\n\nHow to Use:\n\n\nIdeal For:\nSkin Secrets Glycerin (125ml) is an essential moisturizer that provides deep hydration and keeps skin soft, smooth, and protected from dryness. With its non-greasy formula and gentle properties, this glycerin is suitable for all skin types and versatile for face, body, and hands. Whether used on its own or as part of a DIY skincare routine, it’s an excellent choice for maintaining soft, hydrated skin.', 120.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '125ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Secrets Glycerin 125mlPrice in BD', 'Skin Secrets Glycerin 125ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-secrets-glycerin-125ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
