(526, 'Guerniss Remedies N80 Tea Tree Oil 30ml', '1', 0, 19, 162, '526', '526', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tea Tree Oil Serum is a Multipurpose serum that works for both face and body. It has the goodness of tea tree oil that is not only an incredible ingredient for your face but also for your scalp.\nTea tree oil is an essential oil. The other name of this oil is melaleuca oil. It comes from steaming the leaves of the Australian tea tree. Tea tree oil is also believed to be antibacterial and antifungal when applied topically.\nTea tree oil helps in promoting healthy skin by soothing and healing a wide range of skin problems including acne, rashes, eczema, itchiness and inflammation. It is a wound healer for skin. Besides tea tree oil helps to heal wounds that are caused by bacteria.\nThere is some research that shows that this ingredient also plays a role in treating Psoriasis.\nApplying tea tree oil on your scalp can help prevent buildup of chemicals and dead skin. It promotes healthy hair. It helps to treat dandruff, dry and flaky scalp. It has antioxidant and antimicrobial properties that prevents scalp irritation and soothes the scalp.\nBesides, tea tree oil can fight the flake-forming yeast and reduce the itchiness associated with dandruff.\nThis product can be a game changer for you if you are suffering from both acne and dandruff. Tea tree oil serum can also reduce your cost of purchasing two separate products for skin and hair.\nOur serum can control excess sebum on your scalp and face. It also calms down your scalp irritation and acne inflammation.\nHow to Use:Guerniss Tea Tree Oil Serum can be used after washing the face properly. If you usually use a toner, then apply that at first. Let your skin dry. Then take a small amount of the serum. Apply onto the entire face and neck. Allow drying. This can be used daily and under make-up as well.\nMade in Hong Kong', 1613.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 277.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Guerniss Remedies N80 Tea Tree Oil 30mlPrice in BD', 'Guerniss Remedies N80 Tea Tree Oil 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guerniss-remedies-n80-tea-tree-oil-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(527, 'Keo Karpin Olivoyl Moisturizing Body Oil 200ml', '1', 0, 19, 178, '527', '527', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Keo Karpin Olivoyl Moisturizing Body Oil (200ml) is a nourishing and lightweight body oil enriched with the goodness of olive oil and other natural ingredients. Designed to deeply moisturize and rejuvenate the skin, it helps combat dryness, leaving your skin soft, smooth, and glowing.\nOlive Oil Enriched Formula:\nLightweight and Non-Greasy:\nDeep Hydration:\nGentle and Natural:\nConvenient Size:', 370.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Keo Karpin Olivoyl Moisturizing Body Oil 200mlPrice in BD', 'Keo Karpin Olivoyl Moisturizing Body Oil 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'keo-karpin-olivoyl-moisturizing-body-oil-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(528, 'The Body Shop Tea Tree Oil for Blemished Skin', '1', 0, 19, 191, '528', '528', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'We don\'t believe in flawless skin & blemishes are a totally normal part of life. But we get it, there are times you\'d like to have a little control over it. Which is where our Tea Tree range comes in. And this Tea Tree Oil is going to be your new best friend.\nThis nifty little oil might be small but it sure is powerful. Super lightweight and non-greasy, it feels almost invisible on the skin, so it\'s perfect to use as a purifying pick-me-up throughout the day. In fact, it helps to reduce the appearance of blemishes after just one use.\nIt\'s enriched with Community Fair Trade tea tree oil, one of nature\'s most powerfully purifying ingredients. We source ours from expert farmers in Kenya, who use small scale production, hand-harvesting and absolutely no pesticides to ensure its powers are at their peak.\nAnd, even better news, the gloriously green packaging is now recyclable*.\n\n\nTea tree oil is the holy grail for oily and blemished skin, thanks to its naturally purifying talents.\nAqua/Water/Eau, Alcohol Denat., Polysorbate 60, Melaleuca Alternifolia Leaf Oil/Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Limonene, Calophyllum Inophyllum Seed Oil, Linalool, t-Butyl Alcohol, Citral, Citronellol, Leptospermum Petersonii Oil, Denatonium Benzoate, Tocopherol.\n', 1600.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 400.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Body Shop Tea Tree Oil for Blemished SkinPrice in BD', 'The Body Shop Tea Tree Oil for Blemished Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-body-shop-tea-tree-oil-for-blemished-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(529, 'Heimish RX Retinol Bakuchiol 1% Booster Face Oil', '1', 0, 19, 95, '529', '529', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Heimish RX Retinol Bakuchiol 1% Booster Face Oil is a luxurious skincare product formulated to address fine lines, uneven skin texture, and dullness. Combining the powerful anti-aging benefits of Retinol with the gentleness of Bakuchiol, it ensures effectiveness while being skin-friendly, even for sensitive skin types.\nDual Action Formula:\nNourishing Oils:\nAnti-Aging and Brightening:\nGentle and Suitable for Sensitive Skin:\nLightweight Texture:\nEvening Use Only:\nFollow with Moisturizer:\nSun Protection:\nStart Slowly:\nHeimish RX Retinol Bakuchiol 1% Booster Face Oil is perfect for anyone seeking youthful, radiant skin with a gentle yet powerful approach to anti-aging.Made in Korea', 1485.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '35ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1215.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish RX Retinol Bakuchiol 1% Booster Face OilPrice in BD', 'Heimish RX Retinol Bakuchiol 1% Booster Face Oil Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-rx-retinol-bakuchiol-1-booster-face-oil', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
