(535, 'Dr Rashel Rosehip Squalane Face Oil', '1', 0, 19, 55, '535', '535', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience Radiant Skin with Dr. Rashel Rosehip Oil Squalane Face OilIndulge in a skincare revolution with Dr. Rashel Rosehip Oil Squalane Face Oil, a meticulously crafted formula aimed at revitalizing your skin from within.\nDeep Nourishment and RejuvenationEnriched with the goodness of squalane and rosehip oil, this face oil penetrates deeply into your skin, providing intense hydration and nourishment. Say goodbye to dryness and hello to a supple, refreshed complexion as this lightweight blend works its magic.\nMoisturizes and BrightensExperience the dual benefits of moisture and radiance as this potent blend infuses your skin with essential nutrients. Its hydrating properties help restore your skin’s natural balance, while its brightening effects leave you with a youthful, luminous glow.\nRestores Firmness without Clogging PoresUnlike heavy creams that can weigh your skin down, Dr. Rashel Rosehip Oil Squalane Face Oil offers a non-comedogenic solution for firm, plump skin. Its lightweight texture ensures that your pores remain unclogged, allowing your skin to breathe freely.\nSuitable for All Skin TypesWhether you have dry, oily, or sensitive skin, this versatile face oil is designed to cater to your unique needs. Its gentle yet effective formula ensures compatibility with all skin types, making it a must-have addition to your daily skincare routine.\nSoft, Glowing, Renewed SkinExperience the ultimate skincare transformation as Dr. Rashel Rosehip Oil Squalane Face Oil leaves your skin feeling irresistibly soft, visibly glowing, and renewed. Say hello to a complexion that exudes radiance and vitality with every application.', 663.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 237.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr Rashel Rosehip Squalane Face OilPrice in BD', 'Dr Rashel Rosehip Squalane Face Oil Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-rashel-rosehip-squalane-face-oil', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(536, 'Skino Hydration Boost Gel Moisturizer 70ml', '1', 0, 20, 15, '536', '536', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'skino Hydration Boost Gel Moisturizer is enriched with Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol, and Vitamin E to provide deep, long-lasting hydration. This lightweight formula absorbs quickly, soothing irritation and improving skin texture. It strengthens the skin barrier, leaving your skin soft, smooth, and glowing while delivering intense moisture without a greasy feel.\nThis Fast-absorbing. Non-greasy Formula Leaves Your Skin Feeling Soft, Refreshed, And Glowing With A Natural Radiance.\n\nBenefits:\nImproves Skin Texture\nSoothes Irritation\nStrengthens Skin Barrier\nProvides Intense Hydration\n\nHow to use:Apply evenly to cleansed face and neck in the morning and evening. Massage gently until fully absorbed.\nCaution: For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Do not use it on wounded skin. Discontinue use if signs of irritation or rash occur. Keep out of reach of children.\n\nStorage: Store in a cool and dry place.', 390.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, -390.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skino Hydration Boost Gel Moisturizer 70mlPrice in BD', 'Skino Hydration Boost Gel Moisturizer 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-hydration-boost-gel-moisturizer-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(537, 'Lakme Skin Perfect Collection Peach Milk Vitamin E Cream Moisturiser', '1', 0, 20, 192, '537', '537', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lakme Skin Perfect Collection Peach Milk Vitamin E Cream Moisturiser 25g:\n\nThe Lakmé Skin Perfect Collection Peach Milk Vit E Crème Moisture-Riser 24H Moisture Lock Non Sticky (25g) is a nourishing moisturizer designed to keep your skin hydrated and glowing for a full day. Here’s a detailed explanation:\nPeach Milk Extract: Enriched with peach milk extract, which deeply nourishes the skin without making it oily.\nVitamin E: Contains Vitamin E, known for its antioxidant properties that help to protect and repair the skin.\n24-Hour Moisture Lock: Keeps your skin hydrated for up to 24 hours.\nNon-Sticky Formula: Lightweight and non-sticky, ensuring comfort throughout the day.\nRich Cream Texture: Provides a rich, creamy texture that feels luxurious on the skin.\nDeep Hydration: Offers long-lasting hydration to keep your skin soft and smooth.\nEnhances Radiance: Boosts skin radiance, giving it a healthy, glowing look.\nNon-Greasy Finish: Leaves a non-greasy finish, ensuring comfort throughout the day.\nImproves Skin Texture: Nourishing ingredients improve overall skin texture, making it smoother and more even.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Ideal for daily use on all skin types, including dry and oily skin.', 155.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lakme Skin Perfect Collection Peach Milk Vitamin E Cream MoisturiserPrice in BD', 'Lakme Skin Perfect Collection Peach Milk Vitamin E Cream Moisturiser Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lakme-skin-perfect-collection-peach-milk-vitamin-e-cream-moisturiser', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22');
