(538, 'O Vera Lotion', '1', 0, 20, 27, '538', '538', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Composition:\nAloe Vera Extract – 10.00% w/v\nLight Liquid Paraffin – 7.00% w/v\nWhite Soft Paraffin – 3.00% w/v\nMoisturising base q.s.\nContains Dimethicone and Purified Lanolin\nO Vera Lotion is a rich, creamy moisturising formula that combines the natural goodness of Aloe Vera with skin-nourishing paraffins and protective agents. It absorbs easily into the skin, relieves dryness, and deeply nourishes to leave your skin soft, smooth, and glowing.\nThis lotion is ideal for daily use, especially after bathing, to maintain healthy, hydrated skin. Its lightweight, non-greasy texture ensures quick absorption while providing long-lasting comfort. Suitable for all skin types.\nDeep Moisturisation: Hydrates and soothes dry, flaky skin\nSoft & Smooth Skin: Leaves skin supple, nourished, and silky\nProtective Care: Dimethicone and lanolin create a barrier to retain moisture\nDaily Skin Care: Keeps skin healthy, refreshed, and glowing\nQuick Absorption: Non-sticky, easily absorbed formula\nApply generously to clean skin and massage gently until fully absorbed. Use daily, preferably after bath, for best results.\nFor external use only\nNot for oral consumption\nStore in a cool, dry place away from sunlight\nKeep out of reach of children\nAloe Vera Moisturising Lotion – Ultra Comforting. Relieves Skin Dryness. For Smooth & Glowing Skin.', 1128.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 47.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'O Vera LotionPrice in BD', 'O Vera Lotion Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'o-vera-lotion', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(539, 'Pond\'s Hydra Miracle Super Light Gel with Hyaluronic Acid 25ml', '1', 0, 20, 193, '539', '539', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pond\'s Hydra Miracle Super Light Gel with Hyaluronic Acid 💧✨\nGet 24-hour intense hydration with Pond’s Hydra Miracle Super Light Gel – the perfect moisturizer for all skin types and seasons! Infused with Hyaluronic Acid, Vitamin E, and Glycerin, this lightweight gel absorbs faster than regular creams, leaving your skin soft, smooth, and water-fresh without any sticky residue.\n✔ 24-Hour Hydration – Keeps skin moisturized all day long 💦✔ Ultra-Lightweight & Fast-Absorbing – No stickiness, perfect for all seasons ☀️❄️✔ Infused with Hyaluronic Acid – Boosts skin’s moisture retention for a plump, fresh look ✨✔ Vitamin E & Glycerin – Nourish and protect skin for long-lasting softness 🌿✔ Non-Oily Formula – Keeps excess oil and shine under control for a fresh feel 🛡️\nWith Pond’s Super Light Gel, experience the ultimate hydration and glow all year round!', 175.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 55.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Hydra Miracle Super Light Gel with Hyaluronic Acid 25mlPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s Hydra Miracle Super Light Gel with Hyaluronic Acid 25ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-hydra-miracle-super-light-gel-with-hyaluronic-acid-25ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
