(550, 'Dermawin Actvera Lotion – 100gm', '1', 0, 20, 197, '550', '550', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dermawin Actvera Lotion is a non-greasy, oil-free, and non-comedogenic body lotion designed to keep your skin soft, supple, and healthy. Enriched with Aloe Vera Extract and Vitamin E Acetate, it provides long-lasting hydration, retains moisture, and helps maintain your skin’s natural freshness throughout the day.\nAloe Vera Extract (2% w/v): Soothes and nourishes skin, promoting softness and hydration.\nVitamin E Acetate (0.5% w/v): Protects skin from damage and supports healthy texture.\nCetyl Alcohol & Cetostearyl Alcohol (2% w/v each): Smoothens and stabilizes the lotion, giving a rich feel.\nGlycerin (2% w/v): Acts as a humectant to lock in moisture.\nKeeps skin hydrated and fresh all day.\nNon-greasy and lightweight, suitable for daily use.\nOil-free and non-comedogenic, safe for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\nEnhances skin texture and promotes overall skin health.\nApply after washing or bathing.\nGently massage the lotion on the face and body.\nCan be used as directed by a dermatologist.\nStore below 30°C and protect from direct sunlight.\nDo not freeze.\nSlight color changes may occur over time, but product quality remains intact within shelf-life.\n100g', 795.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -795.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermawin Actvera Lotion – 100gmPrice in BD', 'Dermawin Actvera Lotion – 100gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermawin-actvera-lotion-100gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
