(553, 'Cosrx Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream', '1', 0, 20, 31, '553', '553', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Intensely hydrating cream boosts moisture content in your skin and seals it inside, protecting your skin from further loss of hydration. Without feeling oily or heavy, this intensively hydrating cream makes the skin feel soft like clouds and provides long-lasting moisture.\nBenefits:\n• Nourishing moisturizer\n• Create Plump & Youthful\nTargets:\n• Dry & Dehydrated skin• Worried about fine wrinkles• Doesn\'t like oily or heavy\nIngredients:\n• 57.8% Hippophae Rhamnoides Water :Nourishing moisturizer & Vitality\n• 3,000ppm Sodium hyaluronate(hyaluronic acid) :Helps reduce the appearance of fine wrinkles by filling in the skin\nHippophae Rhamnoides Water, Ethyl Hexanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Betaine, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Sodium Hyaluronate, Arginine, Panthenol, Dimethicone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Carbomer, Allantoin, Xanthan Gum\nHow to use:\nAfter Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence, gently apply a proper amount of the cream to face. Tap the area where the cream was applied gently in order for it to be absorbed along the skin texture.\nAbout this item:\nRecharge and Lock in Moisture: COSRX Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream is designed to deliver moisture deep into your skin. Locking the moisture into your skin, the cream provides long-lasting nourishment and hydration.\nThirst-Quenching: Your parched skin will thank this ultimate thirst quencher which has an intense moisturizing quality. None-oily yet greatly hydrating, it will leave your skin smooth and supple.\nKey Ingredients: Hyaluronic Acid, found naturally on our skin, helps your cells to retain moisture. With additional antioxidizing benefits, it is safe for all skin types.\nPlump and Dreamy Radiance: This cream is the key to plumping out the fine lines and delivering the glow. Grasp on to your bright youthful skin texture while hydrating from its roots.\nCOSRX Standards: Clean Beauty - All COSRX products are formulated with skin-friendly ingredients that alleviate irritated skin. Hypoallergenic, Dermatologist tested, Animal Testing-FREE, Parabens-FREE, Sulfates-FREE, Phthalates-FREE\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFound naturally on the surface of our skin, Hyaluronic Acid aims to deliver rich and long-lasting hydration to your skin. Locking in water and penetrating deep inside, it is a game-changing intensive cream.\nThis thick cream is meant to be used in little amounts for effective absorption and perfect nourishment! Just a little bit will give you the expected result, unlike other creams that leave you dry and underwhelmed even after slathering it on.\nPlumping up your fine lines while delivering intense moisturization, COSRX Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream is formulated to bring back your skin to where it came from. Safe for all skin types. Sensitive, dry, and acne-prone.\n\n', 1850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 850.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Hyaluronic Acid Intensive CreamPrice in BD', 'Cosrx Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-hyaluronic-acid-intensive-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
(554, 'Dot and Key Watermelon Superglow Matte Moisturizer', '1', 0, 20, 91, '554', '554', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Watermelon Superglow Matte Moisturizer is a lightweight, gel-based moisturizer designed to hydrate the skin while providing a fresh, matte finish. Infused with the goodness of watermelon extract, it helps cool, hydrate, and soothe the skin, making it ideal for oily, combination, and acne-prone skin types. Its non-greasy, oil-free formula makes it a great daily moisturizer for those who want hydration without added shine.\nMorning Routine:\nEvening/Night Routine:\nHot or Humid Weather:\nAfter Sun Exposure:\nBy using this product regularly, you can maintain hydrated, balanced, and shine-free skin throughout the day.\nThe Dot & Key Watermelon Fresh Matte Moisturizer is a great solution for anyone looking for lightweight hydration with a cooling effect and a shine-free, matte finish. It’s ideal for daily use, especially for those with oily or combination skin.\nMade in India', 359.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 91.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Watermelon Superglow Matte MoisturizerPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Watermelon Superglow Matte Moisturizer Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-watermelon-superglow-matte-moisturizer', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:22', '2026-02-11 08:14:22'),
