(556, 'Laikou Vitamin C Face Cream', '1', 0, 20, 8, '556', '556', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Vitamin C Face Cream is a revitalizing skincare product designed to brighten, hydrate, and rejuvenate your complexion. Infused with potent Vitamin C, this cream helps to diminish dark spots, even out skin tone, and protect against environmental damage. Its lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs quickly into the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and radiant.\nKey Features & Benefits:\nBrightening Effect: Vitamin C is a powerful antioxidant that helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and pigmentation, promoting a brighter and more even skin tone.\nAnti-Aging Properties: The cream aids in reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, giving your skin a youthful and revitalized look.\nDeep Hydration: Enriched with hyaluronic acid and other moisturizing ingredients, this cream provides intense hydration, leaving your skin supple and plump throughout the day.\nProtection Against Environmental Stressors: The antioxidant properties of Vitamin C help protect the skin from environmental stressors, such as pollution and UV rays, reducing the risk of premature aging.\nLightweight and Non-Greasy: The formula is designed to absorb quickly without leaving a greasy residue, making it ideal for daily use and suitable for all skin types.\nImproves Skin Texture: Regular use of this cream can help refine skin texture, making it smoother and more even.', 538.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 202.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Vitamin C Face CreamPrice in BD', 'Laikou Vitamin C Face Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-vitamin-c-face-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
