(563, 'NIVEA All Purpose Creme for Face & Body 30ml', '1', 0, 20, 196, '563', '563', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Everyone’s skin needs a little extra care, and NIVEA Creme Body, Face and Hand Moisturizing Cream provides that and more. Enriched with Provitamin B5, this rich, creamy formula intensively moisturizes and nourishes the skin from feeling dry. This NIVEA Creme made in Germany is dermatologically tested, gentle enough for everyday application, and great for use on all skin types. This multi-use body moisturizer can be used as a hand creme, foot creme or face moisturizer. For a little extra care, apply this NIVEA moisturizer cream to the roughest areas, such as knees, feet and elbows. Try this NIVEA cream as a makeup remover, face mask or massage cream to take your skin care routine to the next level. NIVEA is proud to be one of the leading companies in the field of skin care products, with more than 130 years of expertise. A daily dry skin moisturizer is a key part of a skincare routine, and NIVEA Creme is a perfect addition to a daily skincare regimen. To use, smooth NIVEA Creme over your body and apply daily for the best results.\n\n', 175.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'NIVEA All Purpose Creme for Face & Body 30mlPrice in BD', 'NIVEA All Purpose Creme for Face & Body 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nivea-all-purpose-creme-for-face-body-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
