(568, 'Cerave Moisturising Cream for Dry to Very Dry Skin 177ml', '1', 0, 20, 153, '568', '568', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Type: Dry to Very Dry\nProduct Claims: Fragrance-free, Paraben-free, Hypoallergenic, Oil-free, Non-comedogenic, Sulfate-free, Alcohol-free, Silicone-free, EU Allergen-free\nIngredients:Aqua/Water, Glycerin, Cetearyl Alcohol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Cetyl Alcohol, Ceteareth-20, Petrolatum, Dimethicone,Phenoxyethanol,Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Potassium Phosphate,Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Disodium Edta,Dipotassium Phosphate, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Phytosphingosine, Cholesterol,Xanthan Gum, Carbomer, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopherol,Ceramide Eop.(Code F.I.L. D213768/1)', 1845.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 555.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Moisturising Cream for Dry to Very Dry Skin 177mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Moisturising Cream for Dry to Very Dry Skin 177ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-moisturising-cream-for-dry-to-very-dry-skin-177ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(569, 'LAIKOU Milk Moisturizing Cream', '1', 0, 20, 8, '569', '569', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Features:1.Reduce expression wrinkles on the face and replenish nutrients to skin2.Increase the elasticity and tightness of the skin, quickly brighten the skin tone. 3.Soften skin and enhance skin firmness, leaving it smooth and elastic.\nUsage:1:Clean the face2:Take proper amount of cream3:Apply evenly to the face, gently message until to be absorbed,or drop a little serum into the cream , then mix then and massage the skin\nBeauty tips:1.It can brighten skin and can be used as tone up cream as it can brighten skin instantly2.Contain milk extract, pearl powder and niacinamide to even skin tone\nType: 1. Milk Brightening Cream: for normal or combination skin, texture is refreshing and thin2. Milk Nourishing Cream: for dry and rough skin mostly, texture a bit thicker that compare with brightening type\n', 432.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 118.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Milk Moisturizing CreamPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU Milk Moisturizing Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-milk-moisturizing-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(570, 'Laxzin Pure Glycerin Original Gel 165ml', '1', 0, 20, 54, '570', '570', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laxzin Pure Glycerin features a deep hydration formula that attracts essential moisture from the surrounding water vapor up to 5 layers deep into the skin. It helps maintain proper moisture balance, leaving your skin soft, smooth, and radiant.\nUse a mixture of 60% glycerin and 40% water each time for best results.\nApply Laxzin Glycerin generously all over the body, focusing on dry areas like hands, feet, elbows, knees, and soles after bathing for maximum protection.\nAvoid applying on sensitive areas of the body.\nGlycerin\nProduct of Malaysia\nBeauty World Brand Ltd., KAH-200/C, Hazi Solim Uddin Lane, Middle Badda, Dhaka', 148.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 27.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laxzin Pure Glycerin Original Gel 165mlPrice in BD', 'Laxzin Pure Glycerin Original Gel 165ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laxzin-pure-glycerin-original-gel-165ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(571, 'Neutrogena Clear and Radiant Oil Free Moisturiser with Pink Grapefruit Fragrance for Dry Skin 50ml', '1', 0, 20, 151, '571', '571', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Formulated for skin with imperfections, Neutrogena® Clear & Radiant Oil-Free Moisturiser gives 24-hour hydration without clogging pores. Developed with dermatologists, the refreshing, light formula has a pink grapefruit fragrance and helps to keep skin clear and radiant.\nIntensely hydrates without clogging* For a clearer radiant complexion\nWith pink grapefruit fragrance\nOil-free\nFor dry skin\nSkin with imperfections\nWhat it Does:Neutrogena® Clear & Radiant Moisturiser is an uplifting daily moisturiser containing pink grapefruit fragrance that hydrates without clogging for 24-hour hydration and a clearer radiant complexion.\n\nHow to Use:\nApply over face and neck morning and evening.\nAvoid contact with eyes. In case of contact with eyes, rinse thoroughly.\nMade in France', 620.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 280.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Clear and Radiant Oil Free Moisturiser with Pink Grapefruit Fragrance for Dry Skin 50mlPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Clear and Radiant Oil Free Moisturiser with Pink Grapefruit Fragrance for Dry Skin 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-clear-and-radiant-oil-free-moisturiser-with-pink-grapefruit-fragrance-for-dry-skin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
