(581, 'Cerave Daily Moisturizing Lotion for Normal to Dry Skin 87ml', '1', 0, 20, 153, '581', '581', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nCeraVe Daily Moisturizing Lotion is specially formulated for normal to dry skin types, offering a lightweight and non-greasy moisturizing solution. It is designed to provide 24-hour hydration thanks to its essential ingredients such as hyaluronic acid and three essential ceramides. This lotion helps to restore and maintain the skin’s natural protective barrier.\n\nFinding the right products for your skincare routine should come down to a few easy steps. Besides cleansing and sun protection, a daily moisturizer is essential. We recommend looking for ingredients like hyaluronic acid and ceramides to help restore and maintain the skin’s protective barrier.\n\nCeraVe Daily Moisturizing Lotion is a lightweight, oil-free moisturizer that helps hydrate the skin and restore its natural barrier. Formulated with 3 essential ceramides that work together to lock in skin moisture and help restore your skin’s protective barrier. MVE technology encapsulates ceramides to ensure efficient delivery within the skin’s barrier and slow release over time. Supporting your protective skin barrier, long after you’ve finished applying. Our daily moisturizer leaves the skin feeling comfortable and is gentle on the skin as it provides 24-hour hydration.\n\nHow to use:\n\nIngredients:\nAqua / Water / Eau, Glycerin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cetyl Alcohol, Potassium Phosphate, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Carbomer, Dimethicone, Ceteareth-20, Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Methylparaben, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Cholesterol, Disodium Edta, Dipotassium Phosphate, Propylparaben, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Phytosphingosine, Xanthan Gum, Polysorbate 20, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate\n#1 Dermatologist Recommended Skincare Brand\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe has a complete line of skincare to cleanse and moisturize skin. CeraVe contains the three essential ceramides (called 1, 3, and 6-II) skin needs. Delivered through a controlled-release technology, this formula with ceramides helps rebuild the skin\'s protective barrier and locks in moisture all day.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Daily Moisturizing Lotion has a unique, lightweight formula that provides 24-hour hydration and helps restore the protective skin barrier with three essential ceramides (1,3,6-II). The formula also contains hyaluronic acid to help retain the skin’s natural moisture.\n\n\n\n\nApply liberally as often as needed, or as directed by a physician.\nOur MultiVesicular Emulsion (MVE) ensures moisturizing ingredients are delivered to the skin slowly over time, lasting long after you apply it.\nHelps retain skin\'s natural moisture.\nNon-comedogenic, won\'t clog pores.\n\n\n\n\nAll CeraVe products contain the vital ceramides skin needs to help restore and maintain its natural protective barrier.\nCeramides are an essential part of the skin\'s natural barrier. They hydrate all day to help restore the protective skin barrier.\nCeraVe is the #1 Dermatologist Recommended Skincare brand.\nThe National Eczema Association Seal of Acceptance only accepts products that have satisfied the criteria for use for those with eczema or sensitive skin conditions.', 1145.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 355.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Daily Moisturizing Lotion for Normal to Dry Skin 87mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Daily Moisturizing Lotion for Normal to Dry Skin 87ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-daily-moisturizing-lotion-for-normal-to-dry-skin-87ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(582, 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream for Dry to Very Dry Skin 453g', '1', 0, 20, 63, '582', '582', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rich, non-greasy cream is formulated with a blend of key ingredients: hydrating glycerin, panthenol (vitamin B5) to hydrate, soothe and preserve the skin barrier, and niacinamide (vitamin B3) to help smooth skin’s texture and retain skin’s moisture barrier. This extra strength cream binds water to the skin to deeply replenish the skin\'s moisture and protect skin from dryness for 48 hours. This formula is clinically proven to nourish skin in 1 day and completely restore the skin\'s moisture barrier in 1 week. This daily use cream defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity and is clinically proven to be gentle on even the most sensitive skin.\n\nSkin type:  Dry to Very Dry Skin\nRich cream is clinically proven to hydrate for 48 hours and fully restores skin\'s moisture barrier.\nRich cream nourishes skin in 1 day and completely restore the skin\'s moisture barrier in 1 week. Ideal for daily use on face or body.\n\nIngredients:\nWater, Glycerin, Petrolatum, Dicaprylyl Ether, Dimethicone, Glyceryl Stearate, Cetyl Alcohol, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Peg-30 Stearate, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate, Pantolactone, Dimethiconol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Carbomer, Propylene Glycol, Disodium Edta, Benzyl Alcohol, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hydroxide, Citric Acid\n.', 3652.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1448.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream for Dry to Very Dry Skin 453gPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream for Dry to Very Dry Skin 453g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-moisturizing-cream-for-dry-to-very-dry-skin-453g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(583, 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Moisturising Cream 100ml', '1', 0, 20, 11, '583', '583', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots Essentials Cucumber Moisturising Cream is enriched with soothing cucumber and vitamins, it is suitable for day or night use and contains antioxidants to help protect the skin from environmental damage.\nWe\'ve formulated our vegan skin care range enriched with cooling cucumber and vitamins to gently care for your skin. Our moisturising cream with added antioxidants is perfect for you to use both day and night. Leaving you with hydrated, nourished and beautifully soft skin.\nAqua (Water), Paraffinum liquidum (Mineral oil), Cetearyl alcohol, Glycerin, Glyceryl stearate, PEG-100 stearate, Dimethicone, Phenoxyethanol, Methylparaben, Carbomer, Ethylparaben, Tocopheryl acetate, Propylene glycol, Dipropylene glycol, Potassium hydroxide, Retinyl palmitate, Tetrasodium EDTA, Parfum (Fragrance), Hexyl cinnamal, Sorbitol, Hydroxycitronellal, Citronellol, Cucumis sativus (Cucumber) fruit extract, Denatonium benzoate, Tocopherol, Benzoic acid, CI 19140 (Yellow 5), CI 42090 (Blue 1).\nInstructions:Follow the skin care 5-Step Regimen\nStep 1: Cleanse – Wash your face with a gentle Cleanser/Facewash accordingly to your skin type.\nStep 2: Tone- Toner helps to calmed and balanced skin pH after cleansing.\nStep 3: Treat – Serum/Facial Oil/Essence contain useful nutrients — for your skin.\nStep 4: Moisturize – Boots Essentials Cucumber Moisturising CreamSmooth over your face and neck after cleansing for extra soft skin in the morning and at night.\nStep 5: Sun Care – Apply Sunscreen to protect skin from UV Ray (Day time only)', 630.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 320.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Moisturising Cream 100mlPrice in BD', 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Moisturising Cream 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-everyday-cucumber-moisturising-cream-1