(585, 'Cerave Moisturizing Cream for Normal to Dry Skin 453g', '1', 0, 20, 153, '585', '585', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CeraVe Moisturising Cream for Normal to Dry Skin 453g (Country of Origin: USA)\nCeraVe Moisturising Cream provides 24-hour hydration for normal to dry skin through three essential ceramides and hyaluronic acid. This dermatologist-developed, fragrance-free formula features patented MVE Technology for continuous moisturizing ingredient release, restoring and protecting the skin barrier on both face and body.\nContains Ceramide NP, AP, EOP to rebuild skin\'s protective barrier\nHyaluronic acid retains skin\'s natural moisture levels\nMVE Delivery Technology provides sustained 24-hour hydration\nNon-comedogenic formula prevents pore clogging\n453g tub offers economical family-sized supply\nEliminates dryness, flakiness, and tightness\nStrengthens compromised skin barrier function\nSuitable for eczema-prone, sensitive skin conditions\nFast-absorbing, non-greasy despite rich texture\nMaintains hydration through humid Bangladesh climate\nScoop appropriate amount using clean spatula\nApply to slightly damp skin for optimal absorption\nUse twice daily (morning/evening) or as needed\nGentle massage until fully absorbed\nExternal use only; avoid direct eye contact\nDermatologically tested, accepted by National Eczema Association\nSafe for pregnancy/nursing (consult physician)\nSuitable for children and sensitive skin\nNon-irritating fragrance-free formula\nPatch test recommended for new users\nToo heavy for face? Absorbs completely without residue\nOily skin compatible? Non-comedogenic, controls dehydration\nEczema/psoriasis safe? Specifically formulated for barrier repair\nHot/humid climate? Controls oil production from dehydration\nSunscreen compatible? Excellent base under SPF products\nMedical-grade ceramide restoration beyond cosmetic hydration\nPatented MVE Technology ensures all-day performance\nDeveloped with dermatologists, clinically proven efficacy\nFamily-sized 453g tub economical for face+body use\nAddresses Bangladesh winter dryness and summer dehydration', 3300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1900.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Moisturizing Cream for Normal to Dry Skin 453gPrice in BD', 'Cerave Moisturizing Cream for Normal to Dry Skin 453g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-moisturizing-cream-for-normal-to-dry-skin-453g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
