(590, 'AR Vitamin e Moisturizing Cream Enriched with Sunflower Oil 200g', '1', 0, 20, 206, '590', '590', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'AR Vitamin E Moisturizing Cream Enriched with Sunflower Oil 200gA deeply nourishing moisturizing cream enriched with Vitamin E and Sunflower Oil. Designed to restore and maintain the skin’s natural moisture, it protects against dryness, improves texture, and leaves skin soft, smooth, and supple.\n\nBenefits• Provides long-lasting hydration and softness• Vitamin E helps protect skin from free radical damage• Sunflower oil nourishes and restores skin’s natural barrier• Smooths and improves skin texture• Suitable for all skin types, including dry and sensitive skin• Helps prevent dryness, roughness, and irritation\n\nHow to UseApply a sufficient amount to clean skin. Massage gently until fully absorbed. Can be used daily on face and body as needed.\n\nKey Ingredients• Vitamin E – antioxidant, protects and nourishes skin• Sunflower Oil – restores moisture, softens, and smooths skin• Additional moisturizing agents for enhanced hydration\nAR Vitamin E Moisturizing Cream combines the antioxidant benefits of Vitamin E with the hydrating properties of Sunflower Oil to provide complete skin care. Its rich, creamy texture absorbs easily, leaving skin healthy, radiant, and well-protected from environmental stressors. Ideal for daily use to maintain soft, supple, and nourished skin.', 645.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 105.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'AR Vitamin e Moisturizing Cream Enriched with Sunflower Oil 200gPrice in BD', 'AR Vitamin e Moisturizing Cream Enriched with Sunflower Oil 200g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ar-vitamin-e-moisturizing-cream-enriched-with-sunflower-oil-200g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(591, 'Earth Beauty and You Moisturizer for Normal and Dry Skin- 50ml', '1', 0, 20, 73, '591', '591', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Earth Beauty and You Moisturizer is the perfect daily skincare solution for normal to dry skin. Specially formulated with hydrating and soothing ingredients, this moisturizer keeps your skin soft, smooth, and refreshed throughout the day.\nInfused with aloe vera, shea butter, and essential vitamins (like Vitamin E), along with natural plant extracts to promote hydration and protect your skin’s natural barrier.\nCompact 50ml tube, convenient for travel and easy to use.\nEmbrace the beauty of well-moisturized skin with Earth Beauty and You Moisturizer – your essential companion for soft, glowing skin.', 347.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Earth Beauty and You Moisturizer for Normal and Dry Skin- 50mlPrice in BD', 'Earth Beauty and You Moisturizer for Normal and Dry Skin- 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'earth-beauty-and-you-moisturizer-for-normal-and-dry-skin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(592, 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Lotion for Normal to Combination, Sensitive Skin 25ml', '1', 0, 20, 63, '592', '592', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Lotion for Normal to Combination, Sensitive Skin 25ml\nBuy Cetaphil Moisturising Lotion, a dermatologist-tested lightweight formula enriched with niacinamide, panthenol, and glycerin. Clinically proven to hydrate sensitive skin for 48 hours and restore its natural moisture barrier. Buy now for healthier skin.\n\n\nCetaphil Moisturising Lotion provides long-lasting hydration and soothes the skin. It has been formulated with a powerful blend of various ingredients to boost hydration and rejuvenate the skin. This moisturiser is for daily use and all skin types. Lightweight lotion is clinically proven to instantly soothe and provide lasting 48-hour hydration.\nThe lightweight and fast-absorbing lotion is specially formulated with a new and improved formula containing a dermatologist-backed blend of niacinamide, panthenol, and hydrating glycerin to improve the resilience of sensitive skin. Enriched with avocado oil, this daily use lotion is clinically proven to instantly soothe sensitive skin and hydrate skin for 48 hours. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity, including a weakened skin barrier, irritation, roughness, tightness and dryness.\nWater, Glycerin, Isopropyl Palmitate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Ceteareth-20, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Tocopheryl Acetate, Dimethicone, Persea Gratissima (Avocado Oil), Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Pantolactone, Glyceryl Stearate, Sodium Bicarbonate, Benzyl Alcohol, Citric Acid.\n\nHow to Use:\n\n\nUsers frequently praise its gentle formulation and effectiveness in providing hydration without causing breakouts. However, some individuals with oily skin have noted that it can feel slightly greasy, suggesting it may be more suitable for those with normal to dry skin types. Buy Cetaphil Moisturising Lotion now from Arogga beauty shop at the lowest price in Bangladesh.\nIf you\'re looking for more intensive hydration, explore the Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream, perfect for very dry or sensitive skin. Alternatively, for those with oily skin, the Cetaphil Moisturizer for Oily Skin is an ideal choice, offering hydration without greasiness or clogging pores.\n', 280.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '25ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 120.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Lotion for Normal to Combination, Sensitive Skin 25mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Lotion for Normal to Combination, Sensitive Skin 25ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-moisturizing-lotion-for-normal-to-combination-sensitive-skin-25ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
