(610, 'Medis-SLC Lotion', '1', 0, 21, 50, '610', '610', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bionova\'s MEDIS SLC is a skin lightening complex with arbutin,kojic acid, glycolic acid, licorice and octyl methoxycinnamate askey ingredients. MEDIS-SLC is a scientifically formulated skincare formula with arbutin, kojic acid, glycolic acid, licoriceand octyl methoxycinnamate as key ingredients. Arbutin is aneffective skin-lightening agent that works by blocking thetyrosinase activity and preventing melanin synthesis. Kojic acidhas antifungal, antibacterial, anti-inflammatory, antioxidant andphotoprotective activities. It prevents the formation of acne,addresses the existing acne, suppresses the melanin synthesis andlastly protects your skin against UVB damage. Glycolic acid ispowerful, yet, gentle exfoliator with deep-penetratingproperties. It removes the dead skin and unclogs the pores thatare accumulated with dead skin, bacterial cells and other harmfulchemicals. Licorice possesses anti-aging and skin-lighteningproperties. Glabridin, one of the active ingredients present inlicorice, reduces pigmentation and prevents under-eye darkcircles. Licochalone, another active ingredient, balances the oilcontent.', 1099.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 51.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medis-SLC LotionPrice in BD', 'Medis-SLC Lotion Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medis-slc-lotion', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23');
