(611, 'Constanta Collagen Plus Q10 30ml CT-156', '1', 0, 21, 137, '611', '611', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With Vitamins A, C & E – Tightening & Moisturizing FormulaGentle & Mild\nConstanta Collagen Plus Q10 is a revitalizing facial treatment serum formulated with Micro Collagen, Coenzyme Q10, and a potent blend of Vitamins A, C, and E. This advanced skincare formula helps restore skin firmness, improve elasticity, brighten the complexion, and deliver long-lasting hydration.\nEnriched with Dansonyl LS 9168, extracted from the Tree of Life, the serum provides an immediate tightening effect and up to 72 hours of deep moisturization. With continuous use, the skin becomes smoother, softer, and more radiant, with improved tone and texture.\nContains Micro Collagen for enhanced moisturization and nourishment\nQ10 helps energize skin cells and reduce visible signs of aging\nVitamins A, C, and E provide antioxidant protection and help brighten the skin\nDansonyl LS 9168 delivers immediate tightening and long-lasting hydration\nHelps soften, smooth, and revitalize the skin\nImproves firmness and overall skin tone\nEnhances skin clarity and natural glow\nGentle and mild formula suitable for daily use\nApply Constanta Collagen Plus Q10 evenly onto the face and neck.For best results, use regularly and in combination with other Constanta skincare products.\nAqua, Methoxy PEG-22-Dodecyl Glycol Copolymer, Mineral Oil, Titanium Dioxide, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Sodium Chloride, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance, Chlorphenesin, Silica, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Collagen, Ubiquinone (Q10), Retinol, Ascorbic Acid, Tocopheryl Acetate, Saccharide Isomerate.\nTightening and 72-hour moisturizing effect\nAnti-aging and antioxidant-rich formula\nEnhances firmness, clarity, and smoothness\nSupports brighter, healthier-looking skin\nManufactured under license of Constanta Germany', 2180.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2180.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Constanta Collagen Plus Q10 30ml CT-156Price in BD', 'Constanta Collagen Plus Q10 30ml CT-156 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'constanta-collagen-plus-q10-30ml-ct-156', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
