(619, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Face Serum - 30ml', '1', 0, 21, 3, '619', '619', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This Glow Face Serum helps restore your skin’s natural radiance and brightness. Formulated with over 50 times more Vitamin C compared to Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Face Cream, this powerful serum delivers visible glow-enhancing benefits for both men and women.\nEnriched with Turmeric, Niacinamide, and Tangerine, it works to reduce dullness, improve uneven skin tone, and reveal brighter, healthier-looking skin from within. The lightweight, fragrance-free formula absorbs instantly without leaving any greasy residue, making it especially suitable for oily and combination skin.\nFree from harsh chemicals, this serum combines the goodness of natural ingredients to nourish and protect your skin. Its gentle yet effective formulation makes it ideal for all skin types, helping enhance facial glow, improve texture, and promote a fresh, radiant complexion with regular use.', 680.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 120.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Face Serum - 30mlPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Face Serum - 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-vitamin-c-daily-glow-face-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
