(623, 'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 21, 12, '623', '623', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A glow-boosting moisturizer for calm, hydrated, and visibly even skin.\nMore than a moisturizer — the Dark Spot Correcting Glow Cream is the final step in your glow ritual, designed to visibly brighten, deeply hydrate, and strengthen your skin barrier. Powered by 2% Alpha-Arbutin, 5% Niacinamide, and Ceramide NP, this cream helps reduce the appearance of uneven tone while locking in moisture for a dewy, healthy-looking glow.\nIts unique gel-to-water texture melts effortlessly into the skin, delivering refreshing hydration without stickiness. Calming botanicals like Centella Asiatica and Heartleaf help create a skin-loving experience that soothes as it nourishes. Whether you’re layering it into your full routine or using it solo, the Glow Cream is your go-to for barrier care, moisture, and a radiant finish — all in one. The Glow Cream goes beyond hydration. Its unique gel-to-water texture glides on effortlessly, providing deep, non-sticky moisture that instantly revitalizes your skin. Powered by Ceramide NP, it fortifies your skin barrier, defending against daily stressors and breakouts. Soothing Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract (CICA) and Houttuynia Cordata extracts ensure even the most sensitive skin feels calm and nourished.What truly distinguishes this cream is its potent brightening blend: 2% Alpha-Arbutin, 5% Niacinamide, and a water-soluble Vitamin C derivative. Together, they target the root cause of dark spots - melanin - revealing a clearer, more radiant complexion. Enhanced with a patented plant-based brightening ingredient, this cream delivers that coveted glow.\nKey Benefits:\n✔ Visibly improves skin tone and overall radiance✔ Deep hydration with a non-sticky, water-light texture✔ Supports the skin barrier and reduces moisture loss✔ Formulated for daily use on all skin types✔ Vegan, cruelty-free, fragrance-free\nClinically Proven Results:\nIngredients:\nTargets hyperpigmentation, supports collagen synthesis, and reduces fine lines without irritation.\nKnown for its brightening properties, helps reduce spots for a clearer complexion.\nFights free radicals, keeping skin youthful and healthy.\nRich in Madecassic Acid, effective in skin regeneration and soothing irritated skin.\nKnown for its skin-soothing properties, soothes and balances irritated skin.\nConditions and hydrates the skin while providing wrinkle care and protection from external irritants.\nA potent brightening duo that inhibits excess melanin production, promoting a more even, radiant skin tone.\nA patented Korean plant complex rich in isoflavones, derived from six types of beans and other plant-based ingredients. This advanced formula, enhanced with ultrasound and fermentation technology, delivers superior moisturizing and brightening effects.\n\nHow To Use:\nMade in Korea', 1650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'axis-y-dark-spot-correcting-glow-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(624, 'Lotus Herbals PAPAYABLEM Papaya-N-Saffron Anti-Blemish Crème 50gm', '1', 0, 21, 20, '624', '624', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nLotus Herbals Papayablem Papaya-n-Saffron Anti-Blemish Cream unique blend of papaya, saffron, almond and apricot not only clears blemishes, spots and scars from the face, but also makes the complexion fair and imparts a smooth and spotless glow to the face. Suitable for all skin types.\n\nCleanse face. Apply in dots. Gently massage in upward direction. Can be used at any time of the day. For best results use before going to bed at night.\n\nAlmond Oil- Excellent emollent & skin nourishing properties. Natural source of Vitamin E. Apricot Kernel Oil- Good moisturizing, softening & skin absorbing properties. Rich in skin conditioning Vitamin E. Clove Oil- Antiseptic & anti-acne. Papaya Extract- Natural astringent, anti-blemish. Contains natural exfoliating enzyme called papaine hence exfoliates & makes skin more radiant. Saffron Extract-Natural antioxidant & rejuvenates skin. Lemon Peel Extract- Natural source of Vitamin C. Act as antioxidant & anti-blemish.\n\nmade in India', 981.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 109.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lotus Herbals PAPAYABLEM Papaya-N-Saffron Anti-Blemish Crème 50gmPrice in BD', 'Lotus Herbals PAPAYABLEM Papaya-N-Saffron Anti-Blemish Crème 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lotus-herbals-papayablem-papaya-n-saffron-anti-blemish-creme-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(625, 'Dermamate Melasma Solution Spot Gel 50ml', '1', 0, 21, 213, '625', '625', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Dermamate Melasma Solution Spot Gel is a topical treatment designed to address the appearance of melasma and hyperpigmentation. Here is a detailed description of its features and benefits:\nBrand: Dermamate\nProduct Name: Melasma Solution Spot Gel\nThis gel is a comprehensive solution designed to address and improve the appearance of melasma, offering both treatment and preventive benefits to maintain a clear and even skin tone.', 499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 51.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermamate Melasma Solution Spot Gel 50mlPrice in BD', 'Dermamate Melasma Solution Spot Gel 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermamate-melasma-solution-spot-gel-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:23', '2026-02-11 08:14:23'),
(626, 'Rajkonna Light Moisturizer With Rice Water And Licorice Extract 50gm', '1', 0, 21, 214, '626', '626', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Discover the secret to hydrated, radiant skin with Rajkonna Light Moisturizer, enriched with the goodness of rice water and licorice extract. This lightweight, fast-absorbing moisturizer is designed to nourish and brighten your skin, leaving it feeling soft, smooth, and rejuvenated.\nKey Features:\nHydration and Nourishment: Formulated with rice water, a traditional beauty secret known for its moisturizing and nourishing properties, this moisturizer replenishes your skin\'s hydration levels, leaving it feeling dewy and supple.\nBrightening Effect: Infused with licorice extract, a natural skin brightener, this moisturizer helps to even out skin tone and reduce the appearance of dark spots and hyperpigmentation, revealing a more radiant and luminous complexion.\nLightweight Formula: Say goodbye to heavy, greasy moisturizers. The lightweight texture of this moisturizer absorbs quickly into the skin, providing instant hydration without clogging pores or leaving a sticky residue.\nOil Control: Formulated with ingredients that help regulate oil production, this moisturizer is perfect for oily and combination skin types. It helps to mattify the skin and control shine, leaving your complexion looking fresh and balanced.\nAntioxidant Protection: Rich in antioxidants, including vitamins and minerals, this moisturizer helps protect your skin from environmental stressors, such as pollution and UV damage, helping to prevent premature aging and maintain youthful-looking skin.\nSuitable for Daily Use: Gentle enough for daily use, this moisturizer is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Use it morning and night to keep your skin hydrated and glowing all day long.\nDirections for Use:', 243.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 52.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL