(630, 'Garnier Sakura Glow Ceramide Serum Cream with SPF 30/PA+++', '1', 0, 21, 37, '630', '630', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier Sakura Glow Hyaluron Serum Cream SPF30 PA+++ is a 50ml combines the benefits of a serum and a cream with sun protection. This multi-tasking product contains hyaluronic acid, which provides intense hydration to the skin, and sakura extract, which helps to brighten the complexion. The formula also contains SPF30 PA+++, which helps to protect the skin from the damaging effects of UV radiation. The texture is lightweight and absorbs quickly into the skin, leaving a non-greasy and non-sticky finish. It can be used as a day cream or as a makeup base. This product is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.', 1168.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 482.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Sakura Glow Ceramide Serum Cream with SPF 30/PA+++Price in BD', 'Garnier Sakura Glow Ceramide Serum Cream with SPF 30/PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-sakura-glow-ceramide-serum-cream-with-spf-30pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(631, 'Zafran Skin Therapy Cream with Advanced Skin Repair Formula', '1', 0, 21, 215, '631', '631', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Most of the fast working beauty creams available in the market are made of harmful toxic chemicals, which are bound to harm both your skin and health.\nAccording to experts, creams or lotions which are mixed with harmful ingredients do not provide any long lasting protection or beauty to the skin, rather they can be seriously damage.\nMany times, the use of these whitening creams or lotions causes dark spots or pimples on the healthy part of the skin, the skin becomes thinner and reddish, the UV protection ability of the skin decreases, so even if you go out in the light, the skin feels pale, and the skin becomes black lighter than before under the influence of a little UV. Even using these harmful chemicals can cause skin cancer.\nAccording to psychologists, when an effort to enhance one’s beauty results in a loss of beauty, it affects them psychologically. Then anger and frustration developed in her/him. It also has a negative effect on his confidence.\nIn fact, our skin has special cells called melanocytes, which produce a pigment called melanin. This melanin is again of three types, among which eumelanin (Eumelanin) controls the color of our skin. If eumelanin increases in the skin, the color of the skin becomes dark or black, and if eumelanin decreases, the color will become white.\nSo “Zafran” brand has brought “Zafran Face Skin Therapy” to safely reduce skin eumelanin to make skin fair and radiant. These therapies do not white shed the outer layer of your skin like normal creams or lotions. They reduce the skin’s eumelanin and flush out the dead skin cells that accumulate deep in the skin and help in the continuous regeneration of healthy new cells.\nZafran Skin Therapies are formulated with the world’s safest and most effective whitening agent alpha erbutin, glutathione and a unique combination of many vitamins, so these skin therapies are the most reliable skin products in the market that work on the smallest skin cells without harming your skin. Can give flawless, fair, bright, fresh attractive beautiful skin.\n\nDirections For Use:\nEvery day after sunset, wash your face well and apply the cream on your full face. Then before going to sleep, wash your face again and apply the cream again. Wash your face in the morning and use sunscreen regularly throughout the day. Remember, when you use a night cream it is very important to use sunscreen during the day.\n\nMade in Pakistan', 300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 178.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Zafran Skin Therapy Cream with Advanced Skin Repair FormulaPrice in BD', 'Zafran Skin Therapy Cream with Advanced Skin Repair Formula Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'zafran-skin-therapy-cream-with-advanced-skin-repair-formula', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(632, 'Zoya Mango Fairness Bleach 25gm', '1', 0, 21, 182, '632', '632', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Zoya Mango Fairness Bleach – 25gm\nExperience the goodness of mango with Zoya Mango Fairness Bleach, designed to brighten your complexion and give your skin a soft, radiant glow. Enriched with natural mango extracts, this gentle formula lightens facial hair, reduces dullness, and enhances your overall skin tone.\nInstantly brightens and freshens the skin\nLightens facial hair for a natural, fairer appearance\nEnriched with nourishing mango extracts\nReduces dullness and evens out skin tone\nGentle and suitable for all skin types\nFruit-based fairness bleach\nSmooth, easy-to-apply cream texture\nFast and effective results\nConvenient 25gm pack ideal for quick beauty care\nDermatologically tested formula\nMix the bleach cream and activator powder in the correct ratio\nApply evenly on cleansed skin, avoiding eyes and eyebrows\nLeave on for 10–15 minutes, depending on skin sensitivity\nRinse off with lukewarm water and pat dry\nUse every 2–3 weeks for best results\nPerform a patch test 24 hours before use\nAvoid contact with eyes\nDo not apply on irritated or inflamed skin\nDiscontinue use if irritation persists\nজয়া ম্যাঙ্গো ফেয়ারনেস ব্লিচ – ২৫ গ্রাম\nজয়া ম্যাঙ্গো ফেয়ারনেস ব্লিচে রয়েছে প্রাকৃতিক আমের নির্যাস, যা ত্বককে উজ্জ্বল, মসৃণ ও প্রাণবন্ত করে। এটি মুখের লোম হালকা করে স্বাভাবিক ফেয়ার লুক প্রদান করে এবং ত্বকের মলিনতা দূর করতে সাহায্য করে।\nত্বক তাৎক্ষণিকভাবে উজ্জ্বল ও ফ্রেশ দেখায়\nমুখের লোম হালকা করে স্বাভাবিক ফেয়ার লুক দেয়\nপ্রাকৃতিক আমের নির্যাসে সমৃদ্ধ\nমলিনতা কমায় ও ত্বকের টোন সমান করে\nসব ধরনের ত্বকের জন্য উপযোগী\nফল নির্ভর ফেয়ারনেস ব্লিচ\nমসৃণ ও সহজে ব্যবহারযোগ্য টেক্সচার\nদ্রুত ও কার্যকর ফলাফল\n২৫ গ্রাম প্যাক—দ্রুত বিউটি কেয়ারের জন্য উপযোগী\nডার্মাটোলজিক্যালি টেস্টেড\nব্লিচ ক্রিম ও অ্যাক্টিভেটর পাউডার সঠিক অনুপাতে মেশান\nচোখ ও ভ্রু এড়িয়ে সমানভাবে লাগান\nত্বকের সংবেদনশীলতা অনুযায়ী ১০–১৫ মিনিট রাখুন\nকুসুম গরম পানি দিয়ে ধুয়ে নিন\nপ্রতি ২–৩ সপ্তাহে একবার ব্যবহার করলে ভালো