(639, 'Avien Faironomics Plus Skin Lightening Gel 50ml', '1', 0, 21, 138, '639', '639', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Avien Faironomics Plus Skin Lightening Gel is a highly effective advanced formulation designed to brighten skin tone and improve overall skin clarity. Its powerful blend of scientifically proven ingredients works synergistically to help reduce dark spots, uneven skin tone, and all types of hyperpigmentation, leaving the skin looking brighter, smoother, and more radiant.\nEnriched with Glutathione, Mequinol, Tranexamic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Kojic Acid Dipalmitate, Sepiwhite™ MSH, Pine Bark Extract, and Collagen Peptide, this gel targets excess melanin production, gently exfoliates the skin, and supports skin renewal. The lightweight gel texture absorbs quickly, making it suitable for daily use on the face and affected areas.\nIndications\nBrightening dull and uneven skin tone\nReducing dark spots, melasma, and hyperpigmentation\nKey Benefits\nHelps lighten and even out skin tone\nSupports clearer, brighter-looking skin\nImproves skin texture and radiance\nSuitable for targeted areas or full-face application\nIngredientsGlutathione, Mequinol, Tranexamic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Kojic Acid Dipalmitate, Pine Bark Extract, Sepiwhite™ MSH, Collagen Peptide.\nDirection for UseApply twice daily (morning and evening) on clean skin over the affected area or entire face.During morning use, apply SunOnomics SPF 50 sunscreen 30 minutes after applying Faironomics Plus Gel.\nব্যবহারবিধিঃআক্রান্ত স্থানে বা সম্পূর্ণ মুখে দিনে দুইবার সকাল ও রাতে ব্যবহার করুন। সকালে ব্যবহারের ৩০ মিনিট পর সানওনোমিকস এসপিএফ ৫০ সানস্ক্রিন ব্যবহার করুন।\nPrecautionsFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nPack Size: 50ml', 1425.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Avien Faironomics Plus Skin Lightening Gel 50mlPrice in BD', 'Avien Faironomics Plus Skin Lightening Gel 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'avien-faironomics-plus-skin-lightening-gel-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(640, 'CARE:NEL Derma Alpha Arbutin Glutathione Whitening Cream 45ml', '1', 0, 21, 216, '640', '640', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CARENEL Derma Alpha Arbutin Glutathione (গ্লুটাথিওন ক্রিম) Whitening Cream is a premium skin care solution formulated in Korea to tackle hyperpigmentation and uneven skin tone. This cream leverages the power of alpha arbutin and glutathione, potent ingredients known for their ability to inhibit melanin production. Perfect for daily application, it promises a brighter, more even complexion with regular use.\nTargets Hyperpigmentation: Aims to reduce dark spots, blemishes, and uneven skin tone.\nHydration Boost: The formula may also improve hydration (check the ingredients for hyaluronic acid).\nLightweight Comfort: The texture of this cream is lightweight and absorbs quickly, providing a comfortable, non-greasy feel. This feature ensures that you can use the product without any discomfort, making you feel at ease with its application.\nAlways follow the instructions on the product label.  Also, see the Drug Facts panel(s) on the package.\nPurified Water, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Alpha-Arbutin (2%), Niacinamide (2%), Cetearyl Alcohol, Cetearyl Oliveate, Titanium Dioxide , glutathione (0.15%), hydrolyzed collagen extract, sorbitan olivate, ammonium polyacryloyldimethyltaurate, vinyl dimethicone, glyceryl stearate, polymethylsilsesquioxane, isononylisono Nanoate, t-butyl alcohol, polyhydroxystearic acid, triethoxycaprylylsilane, aluminum hydroxide, ethoxydiglycol, butylene glycol, octyldodecanol, ethylhexylglycerin, Asiaticoside, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Asiatic Acid, Madecassic Acid, Glycolipid, C12-13 Phares-9, Kudzu Root Extract, Giant Pine Leaf Extract, Elm Root Extract, Evening Primrose Extract, Fragrance, Hexylcinnamal , linalool, limonene.\nDesigned for topical use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Consult a dermatologist if irritation occurs.\n', 1290.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 510.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'CARE:NEL Derma Alpha Arbutin Glutathione Whitening Cream 45mlPrice in BD', 'CARE:NEL Derma Alpha Arbutin Glutathione Whitening Cream 45ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'carenel-derma-alpha-arbutin-glutathione-whitening-cream-45ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
