(642, 'Groome Skin Regenerist Brightening & Moisturizing Cream 50gm', '1', 0, 21, 44, '642', '642', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Groome Skin Regenerist Brightening & Moisturizing Cream 50gm\nThe Groome Skin Regenerist Brightening & Moisturizing Cream is designed to enhance skin brightness and provide deep moisturization. Formulated with a blend of wheat germ oil and ginseng, this cream helps to hydrate and rejuvenate the skin. Wheat germ oil is rich in vitamins A, B, D, E, and essential fatty acids, contributing to its nourishing and anti-aging properties. Ginseng is known for its ability to boost skin radiance and improve overall skin tone.\nThis cream is suitable for daily use and aims to make the skin appear more youthful and radiant. It is available in a 50g package and is recommended for those looking to improve skin texture and brightness while keeping their skin well-moisturized​\n', 937.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 253.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Groome Skin Regenerist Brightening & Moisturizing Cream 50gmPrice in BD', 'Groome Skin Regenerist Brightening & Moisturizing Cream 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'groome-skin-regenerist-brightening-moisturizing-cream-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
