(646, 'Medwise Mela Anti-Melasma Cream 20g', '1', 0, 21, 217, '646', '646', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Overview:Medwise Mela Anti-Melasma Cream is a specialized skin care formulation designed to reduce melasma, dark spots, freckles, and uneven skin tone. Enriched with potent active ingredients like Tranexamic Acid, Arbutin, and Niacinamide, this cream works to brighten skin, inhibit melanin formation, and promote a more even, radiant complexion. The inclusion of squalene and a vitamin complex helps nourish and protect the skin while improving moisture retention.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces melasma and hyperpigmentation\nBrightens dull and uneven skin\nHelps prevent the formation of dark spots\nHydrates and nourishes the skin\nSupports a healthier, radiant complexion\nActive Ingredients:\nTranexamic Acid – 5%: Helps reduce pigmentation and melasma\nArbutin – 5%: Brightens skin and inhibits melanin formation\nNiacinamide – 5%: Evens skin tone and improves skin barrier\nSqualene – 2%: Moisturizes and nourishes skin\nVitamin Complex – 1%: Provides antioxidant and skin-repairing benefits\nOther Ingredients:Aqua, Stearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Monostearate, Glycerin, Cetyl Alcohol, Light Liquid Paraffin, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Carbomer, Methyl Paraben, Propyl Paraben, Retinol Palmitate, Triethanolamine, Disodium EDTA, Butylated Hydroxy Toluene, Perfume\nDirections for Use:Apply a thin layer of Mela Cream to clean face and neck in a gentle circular motion twice daily – morning and evening.\nPrecautions:\nAvoid direct contact with eyes.\nIn case of irritation, rinse thoroughly with water.\nStore in a cool, dry place and keep out of reach of children.', 940.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medwise Mela Anti-Melasma Cream 20gPrice in BD', 'Medwise Mela Anti-Melasma Cream 20g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medwise-mela-anti-melasma-cream-20g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(647, 'Dabo 3 In 1 Collagen Lifting Cream', '1', 0, 21, 207, '647', '647', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The cream base for makeup has high penetrating power and a powerful rejuvenating effect. It acts on the skin in several directions at once: nourishes, moisturizes, smoothes wrinkles, increases skin elasticity, evens out its texture, and also helps lighten pigmentation. It has a light texture that instantly penetrates the basal layer of the dermis and activates tissue regeneration processes. The active composition of the product effectively smoothes wrinkles, evens out tone, and provides radiance to the skin. The basis of the product is hydrolyzed collagen, which replenishes the deficiency of its own collagen, helping to tighten the contours of the face and make the oval clearer. The complex of plant extracts has a moisturizing, anti-inflammatory and antibacterial effect. The light powdery pigment in the composition makes the skin radiant, evens out the tone and prepares it for applying basic makeup.\n\nKey Features:\n\nUse last, after all procedures. Apply a small amount of cream, spreading evenly over the entire face. Ideal as a face primer or makeup base.\n\nWater, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Propanediol, Niacinamide, Cyclopentasiloxane, Titanium Dioxide, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polysorbate 80, Glyceryl Caprylate, Isohexadecane, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Dimethiconol, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer , Hydrogenated Olive Oil Unsaponifiables, Cyclohexasiloxane, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Sorbitan Oleate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Adenosine, Sorbitan Isostearate, Polysorbate 60, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Ethylhexylglycerin, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Acet yl Hexapeptide-8, Palmitoyl Tripeptide- 1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Disodium EDTA, Chlorphenesin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Phenoxyethanol, CI 77491, Fragrance\n\nMade in Korea', 990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 510.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo 3 In 1 Collagen Lifting CreamPrice in BD', 'Dabo 3 In 1 Collagen Lifting Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-3-in-1-collagen-lifting-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
