(650, 'Bioaqua Pink Cherry Cream', '1', 0, 21, 69, '650', '650', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Delicate pink temptation: 1. Gentle on the skin, give the skin attentive care. 2. Supplements the skin with essential moisture giving it softness and hydration. 3. Improves skin tone and moisturizes it. Cherry blossom is a natural beauty skin care flower. Flowers of cherries are rich in peptides and vitamins. They gently nourish the skin, giving it a matte glow. Make yourself more beautiful. Give your body the charming color. Pink seductive. Rosy charm. Pink temptation. Method of use: A matte finish lip color. Apply on the lips evenly, making lips pink and wet. Pink nipple areola. Gently massage into the skin until fully absorbed. Pink skin. Apply on the inner part of the thigh, allows to wear a bikini more confidently.', 230.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 120.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Pink Cherry CreamPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Pink Cherry Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-pink-cherry-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(651, 'Dermamate Night Care Face Cream 25g', '1', 0, 21, 22, '651', '651', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dermamate Night Care Face Cream is a targeted skincare solution designed to reduce melasma, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone. Formulated for nighttime use, it works while you sleep to restore clarity, hydration, and smoothness to your skin. This cream is enriched with a blend of active brightening agents and antioxidants that support skin renewal and moisture retention.\nKey Features\nUsage Instructions\nWhy Choose This ProductDermamate Night Care Face Cream is trusted for its effective blend of skin-brightening and hydrating ingredients. It targets stubborn dark spots and melasma without harsh chemicals, making it suitable for long-term use. Its lightweight texture and fast absorption make it ideal for layering with other skincare products.\nBenefits\nCautions', 495.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 55.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermamate Night Care Face Cream 25gPrice in BD', 'Dermamate Night Care Face Cream 25g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermamate-night-care-face-cream-25g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(652, 'Kozicare Skin Lightening Cream 15gm', '1', 0, 21, 105, '652', '652', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kozicare Skin Lightening Cream 15gm\nKozicare Skin Lightening Cream is formulated to brighten, even out skin tone, and restore your skin’s natural radiance. Enriched with Kojic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, and herbal extracts, it targets dark spots, pigmentation, and dullness while providing deep hydration and improving overall skin texture. Suitable for daily use, this cream helps achieve visibly fairer, smoother, and glowing skin.\nBenefits:• Brightens & Evens Skin Tone: Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin reduce dark spots, pigmentation, and melanin production.• Rich Herbal Nourishment: Mulberry and Liquorice extracts restore radiance and fight dullness.• UV Protection: Helps shield skin from harmful UVA/UVB rays and prevents further darkening.• Deep Moisturization: Glycerin, Glutathione, and Light Liquid Paraffin keep skin soft, smooth, and hydrated.• Soothes & Improves Texture: Niacinamide and Allantoin reduce redness and refine skin texture.\nIngredients: Demineral Water, Light Liquid Paraffin, White Soft Paraffin, Mulberry Extract, Cetomacrogol 1000, Cetyl Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Isopropyl Myristate, Fragrance, Kojic Acid, Glycerin, Glutathione, Propylene Glycol, Alpha Arbutin, Liquorice Extract, Niacinamide, Cyclomethicone, Phenoxyethanol, Allantoin\nHow to Use: Apply twice daily (morning and night) on cleansed skin. Gently massage until fully absorbed.\nCaution: For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children.\nSize: 15gmSkin Type: All skin types, ideal for dull or pigmented skin.', 405.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 45.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Kozicare Skin Lightening Cream 15gmPrice in BD', 'Kozicare Skin Lightening Cream 15gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'kozicare-skin-lightening-cream-15gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(653, 'Glow and Lovely Cream Ayurvedic Care 50g', '1', 0, 21, 198, '653', '653', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With Glow & Lovely Ayurvedic Care+ (formerly known as Fair & Lovely Ayurvedic care), get a natural glow instantly. Infused with 16 expert ayurvedic ingredients like Kesar, Chandan, Manjistha, this cream gives you a natural glow every day. The 16 expert ingredients are known to give the following benefits: 1. Ingredients like Manjistha, Kesar and Lotus helps clear marks and improve glow, 2. Lodhra, Khas and Neelotpal calms and soothes skin, 3. Milk, Chandan and Wheatgerm oil clears uneven skin tone. Glow & lovely Ayurvedic Care+ cream is not just a cream, it’s your ayurvedic glow expert that gives your skin a natural glow. Best effects obtained on regular usage. Suitable for all skin types but not advised for application on broken or inflamed skin. Just dot the cream over face and neck and massage in. Use twice daily. For best results wash face with Glow & Lovely Ayurvedic Care Facewash and then follow with Glow & Lovely Ayurvedic Care+ Face Cream. Filled with rejuvenating and skin glow actives, it is a powerhouse of natural antioxidants that gives you a clear skin and glowing skin. The natural agents calm and soothes your skin. Available in a 25g and 50g packs, so you can use at home as well as carry along for a natural glow on-the-go. So, with Glow & Lovely Ayurvedic Care. Face Cream get your Natural Glow right away.', 177.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 18.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Glow and Lovely Cream Ayurvedic Care 50gPrice in BD', 'Glow and Lovely Cream Ayurvedic Care 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'glow-and-lovely-cream-ayurvedic-care-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(654, 'Kozimax Cream', '1', 0, 21, 40, '654', '654', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Kozimax Skin Lightening Cream is widely used to treat hyperpigmentation, dark spots, and uneven skin tone. It contains active ingredients like Kojic Acid, Vitamin C, Glabridin, and Arbutin, which work together to reduce melanin production and lighten the skin. It is suitable for individuals looking to address issues like sunburn, acne marks, and dark elbows or knees.\n\nIn Bangladesh, the price for Kozimax Cream (15 gm) typically ranges around ৳1035. However, the price may vary depending on discount, location, and retailers.\n\nTo use, apply the cream twice daily after washing and drying the affected areas. It’s important to follow up with sunscreen to protect the skin from further damage​.', 1035.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1035.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Kozimax CreamPrice in BD', 'Kozimax Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'kozimax-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(655, 'Fiorae Pomegranate HYA & Arbutin Booster Whitening Cream for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 21, 219, '655', '655', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience the naturally youth and whitening skin enriched with natural extract from pomegranate. The antioxidants and vitamins in pomegranate extract protect against hyperpigmentation, dark spots, wrinkles, and fine lines. It is also packed with rich hya arbutin, naturally extracted from bearberry and cowberry that reduces the occurrence of melasma, and freckles, improves skin hydration, strengthens skin elasticity and luminous glowing skin\nANTIOXIDANT POWER OF POMEGRANATE & HYA ARBUTIN\nThe power of pomegranate extract, hyaluronic acid, and alpha arbutin\nPOMEGRANATE SEED OIL (PUNICA ACID)\nDeeply hydrating and locking moisture into dry skin.\nThe pomegranate seed oil has anti-inflammatory properties and slows down cell degeneration by replenishing and retaining moisture in the skin.\nPOMEGRANATE PEEL EXTRACT (ELLAGIC ACID) & VITAMIN C\nProvides natural UV protection which will reduce melasma and hyperpigmentation.\nEncourage the maintenance of the skin\'s elasticity. Diminishing fine lines and wrinkles.\nEllagic acid and vitamin C from pomegranate peel\n• Reduces the problem of dull skin, freckles, and dark spots caused by UV rays.\n• Stimulates collagen production and delays the appearance of wrinkles.\n\nMade in Thailand', 693.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 557.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fiorae Pomegranate HYA & Arbutin Booster Whitening Cream for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Fiorae Pomegranate HYA & Arbutin Booster Whitening Cream for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fiorae-pomegranate-hya-arbutin-booster-whitening-cream-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(656, 'Inthyglow Cream 20gm', '1', 0, 21, 220, '656', '656', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'INTHYGLOW Cream\nGlutathione, Kojic Acid, Arbutin, Licorise Extract,\nVitamin-C\nSkin Glowing Lighining & Whitening Cream', 1445.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 145.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Inthyglow Cream 20gmPrice in BD', 'Inthyglow Cream 20gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'inthyglow-cream-20gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
