(659, 'Lotus WhiteGlow Vitamin-C Radiance Creme SPF 20 PA+++', '1', 0, 21, 20, '659', '659', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A lightweight ultra-hydrating Vitamin C Radiance Creme that comes with the goodness of SPF 20. This luxurious creme is carefully crafted to restore the skin’s natural radiance & protect it from the harmful sun rays. The magical Yuzu Lemon Extracts visibly reduce dark spots & pigmentation, while the Kakadu Plum, which has 100X more Vitamin C than an orange, delivers the skin with unparalleled radiance.\nThe Lotus vitamin c moisturizer for face is stacked with SPF 20, which is enough coverage for people to get protection from the harsh sun rays during the daytime. This vitamin c face cream assists with lightening and brightening the skin composition. The vitamin c face lotion reestablishes brilliance to your tired, dull skin as it contains the miracle nutrient Vitamin C, which helps fix skin harm caused by natural aggressors. It is the best moisturizer to use after face serum. Kakadu Plum & Yuzu lemon are rich sources of vitamin c that illuminate the skin. All in all, this vitamin c face cream works wonders for all skin types.\nExplore the best vitamin c cream for face & get your hands on this miracle product by Lotus Herbals.', 570.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 10.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lotus WhiteGlow Vitamin-C Radiance Creme SPF 20 PA+++Price in BD', 'Lotus WhiteGlow Vitamin-C Radiance Creme SPF 20 PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lotus-whiteglow-vitamin-c-radiance-creme-spf-20-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
