(663, 'The Body Shop Edelweiss Smoothing Day Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 191, '663', '663', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Start your morning with our new Edelweiss Smoothing Day Cream: Made with 96% ingredients of natural origin, it only takes a tiny dollop to smooth the appearance of fine lines and leave skin plumped with 48hr moisture – just ask the 113 women who tried (and loved!) our new cream in an independent user trial.* Lightweight with an air-whipped texture, this non-sticky, fast-absorbing daily cream loves even sensitive skin, helps signs of fatigue appear reduced and it leaves skin looking more luminous with a fresh-faced glow. But here’s the best bit, we’ve now enriched every jar with double the concentration of edelweiss, which is naturally (and rather uniquely) strengthened with leontopodic acid known for its antioxidant properties. In fact, the tiny edelweiss plant is so resilient and powerful that its extract has 43% more antioxidant power than retinol.** Pretty extraordinary, right? Our vegan cream is boosted with hyaluronic acid, too, just for good measure. It helps retain moisture and maintains the skin’s natural moisture barrier. There’s one more surprise – our recyclable*** jar is now made with recycled glass too. *Skin that looks plump with moisture, with a smooth surface. Skin looks re-energised and refreshed. **Retinol expressed as Retinol acetate. The radical protection factor (RPF) was measured in vitro by electron spin resonance.', 3410.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1090.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Body Shop Edelweiss Smoothing Day Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'The Body Shop Edelweiss Smoothing Day Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-body-shop-edelweiss-smoothing-day-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
