(665, 'No7 Men Soothing Moisturiser SPF-15 – 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 84, '665', '665', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Keep your skin healthy, hydrated, and protected with No7 Men Soothing Moisturiser SPF-15, specially formulated for men. This lightweight moisturizer soothes, nourishes, and protects the skin from daily sun exposure while maintaining a smooth, comfortable feel.\nKey Benefits:\nHydrates & soothes dry, irritated skin\nProvides SPF-15 protection against harmful UV rays\nLightweight, non-greasy formula perfect for daily use\nNurtures skin with Panthenol, Aloe Vera, Shea Butter, and Ginseng Extract\nDirections for Use:Use every morning. Pump a small amount into your palm, rub hands together, and apply evenly on face and neck. Avoid direct contact with eyes; rinse immediately if contact occurs.\nKey Ingredients:Water (Aqua), Glycerin, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Octocrylene, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Dimethicone, Panthenol, Shea Butter (Butyrospermum Parkii), Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice Powder, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Morus Alba Leaf Extract, Ascorbyl Glucoside, and other skin-nurturing ingredients.\nNote: This moisturizer is designed for everyday skin protection and is not intended for sunbathing.', 2420.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1180.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'No7 Men Soothing Moisturiser SPF-15 – 50mlPrice in BD', 'No7 Men Soothing Moisturiser SPF-15 – 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'no7-men-soothing-moisturiser-spf-15-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(666, 'Loreal Paris Fragrance Free Collagen Daily Moisturiser', '1', 0, 22, 151, '666', '666', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Loreal Paris Fragrance Free Collagen Daily Moisturiser:\nLoreal Paris Collagen Moisture Filler Fragrance Free is a daily face moisturizer that provides a daily dose of intense hydration, helping to fill in lines and wrinkles and restore moisture for smoother, plumper skin\nAfter one week of using this Collagen face moisturizer, skin appeared smoother in 86 percent of women\nAfter 4 weeks of use, Collagen face moisturizer fills in wrinkles, and leaves skin looking younger in 72 percent of women\nCollagen face moisturizer is lightweight, non-greasy, Dermatologist tested for safety and non-comedogenic\nApply moisturizer every day and night on the face – melting texture absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy or sticky film\nInstructions:\nSmooth over face every morning and evening after serum or treatment.\nLoreal Paris Collagen Moisture Filler Facial Day Cream Fragrance-Free is an excellent product for older adults who need more collagen in their skincare routine. This product is very effective in replacing depleted collagen, and its results are immediately visible. Although it might be a bit on the greasy side, this product is fabulous and works great for winter and summer alike. It is a top-quality collagen product and is perfect for those who are looking to soften their face and smooth their wrinkles. This product is highly recommended and has great reviews from customers who have used it.\nMade in USA', 2335.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1390.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Fragrance Free Collagen Daily MoisturiserPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Fragrance Free Collagen Daily Moisturiser Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-fragrance-free-collagen-daily-moisturiser', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(667, 'Fade Out Advanced Whitening Day Cream with Niacinamide & Mulberry SPF20 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 154, '667', '667', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fade Out’s Advanced Even Skin Tone Day cream contains active ingredients to brighten and even skin tone, whilst improving skin hydration levels to reveal a more radiant and luminous complexion in just 28 days.Every day, your skin is exposed to environmental factors, UV radiation and the inevitable, ageing of our skin, all of which can result in dull, uneven skin tone and pigmentation (dark spots or patches on your skin).Fade Out uses the power of effective ingredients including Niacinamide, Lactic Acid and natural extracts of Licorice and Mulberry to help reduce the appearance of dark spots, to gently remove dull, dead skin cells, and help retain moisture to keep your skin hydrated, resulting in a more radiant, luminous and even skin tone. With SPF20 and UVA/UVB filters, Fade Out provides SPF protection against the harmful effects of the sun\nMADE IN U.KNET WEIGHT - 50ml\nCountry of Origin: UK', 986.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 89.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fade Out Advanced Whitening Day Cream with Niacinamide & Mulberry SPF20 50mlPrice in BD', 'Fade Out Advanced Whitening Day Cream with Niacinamide & Mulberry SPF20 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fade-out-advanced-whitening-day-cream-with-niacinamide-mulberry-spf20-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
