(675, 'Fade Out Pure Glow Whitening Day Cream with Vitamin C, Pink Pomelo & Niacinamide 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 154, '675', '675', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Enriched with high-quality ingredients it will brighten and hydrate your skin easily. The easily absorbed cream leaves the skin feeling smooth, glowing, and refreshed. It has vitamins E & C which are extremely skin-friendly. These vitamins help to even pigmentation and protect skin from damage or pollutants. The cream has Pin k pomelo as one of the key ingredients that nourishes the skin from the deep and retains skin moisture. Using the cream properly will increase skin tone and keep it hydrated all day. It also works as a natural exfoliation.\n\nCountry of Origin: UK', 1074.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fade Out Pure Glow Whitening Day Cream with Vitamin C, Pink Pomelo & Niacinamide 50mlPrice in BD', 'Fade Out Pure Glow Whitening Day Cream with Vitamin C, Pink Pomelo & Niacinamide 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fade-out-pure-glow-whitening-day-cream-with-vitamin-c-pink-pomelo-niacinamide-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(676, 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 30', '1', 0, 22, 153, '676', '676', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Protect your skin with CeraVe Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 30, a lightweight and silky face cream that defends the complexion against the damage caused by UV rays. Helping to strengthen and restore the natural skin barrier to prevent moisture loss, the lotion uses three naturally occurring ceramides and Hyaluronic Acid to soothe any sensitivity and leave skin calm, comfortable and ultra-healthy. Suitable for normal to dry skin types. Fragrance-free. Non-comedogenic.\nProduct Details:\nA lightweight, moisturising face lotion with broad spectrum SPF30, for all-day hydration for normal to dry skin. Specifically formulated to moisturise sensitive skin that is normal to dry and exposed to UV rays. Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Sunscreen provides protection against UVA and UVB rays while the formula hydrates, while helping maintain and protect the skin barrier of the face. Spreads easily and dries with a clear finish.\nWith 3 naturally occurring ceramides and Hyaluronic Acid which are essential in supporting the skin barrier and retaining moisture. Utilises patented MVE® delivery technology to help replenish ceramides and deliver controlled, long lasting hydration.\nIngredients:\nAqua/Water, Homosalate, Glycerin, Octocrylene, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Niacinamide, Silica, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Dimethicone, Cetearyl Alcohol, Peg-100 Stearate, Glyceryl Stearate, Phenoxyethanol, Stearic Acid, Behentromonium Methosulfate, Capryl Glycol, Palmitic Acid, Ammonium Polycryloyldimethyl Tuarate, Xanthan Gum, Disodium Edta, Tocopherol, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Myristic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Phytosphingosine, Cholesterol, Cerbomer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Ceramide Eop\nHow to use:\nHazards and Cautions:Keep out of the sight and reach of chidren.\nMade in France', 1753.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 697.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 30Price in BD', 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 30 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-am-facial-moisturising-lotion-spf-30', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
