(678, 'Olay Natural Aura Day SPF 15 Cream 50gm', '1', 0, 22, 58, '678', '678', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Olay Natural White reveals your all-in-one fairness! Powered with its triple nutrient system - vitamins B3, pro B5 &E, it has the combined effect of a fairness cream, spot remover and moisturizer. It lightens skin tone, reduces the appearance of dark spots, evens skin tone, hydrates and protects skin from harmful UV rays.Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse eyes thoroughly with water', 786.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 204.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Natural Aura Day SPF 15 Cream 50gmPrice in BD', 'Olay Natural Aura Day SPF 15 Cream 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-natural-aura-day-spf-15-cream-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(679, 'Dr. Clinic Facial Day Cream with Vegan Hyaluronic Acid and Vitamin C for Blemished Skin 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 225, '679', '679', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This day cream is rich in antioxidants, vitamins and minerals that work together to hydrate and nourish the skin, leaving it feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed. Vitamin C, also known as ascorbic acid, helps to brighten the skin and reduce the appearance of dark spots, discoloration and hyperpigmentation. It also helps to boost collagen production, which can reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nAqua, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Trideceth-10, Bis-Phenylpropyl Dimethicone, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, Parfum, Sodium Hyaluronate, Alcohol, Hydrogenated Phosphatidylcholine, Cholesterol, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Benzoate, Citronellol, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Hexyl Cinnamal, Isoeugenol, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, D-Limonene, Linalool.', 1080.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 120.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr. Clinic Facial Day Cream with Vegan Hyaluronic Acid and Vitamin C for Blemished Skin 50mlPrice in BD', 'Dr. Clinic Facial Day Cream with Vegan Hyaluronic Acid and Vitamin C for Blemished Skin 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-clinic-facial-day-cream-with-vegan-hyaluronic-acid-and-vitamin-c-for-blemished-skin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
