(681, 'Cetaphil Bright Healthy Radiance Day Protection Cream SPF 15', '1', 0, 22, 63, '681', '681', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A moisturising cream that helps brighten and even skin tone, without irritating or weakening the skin barrier. Day after day, this hydrating face cream works to enhance evenness of complexion, protecting sensitive skin against the damaging effects of the sun to help prevent dark spots. Skin is visbility more even and dark spots reduced in just 4 weeks*.\nAqua, Homosalate, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Niacinamide, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glycerin, Isoamyl P-Methoxycinnamate, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Octocrylene, Dipropylene Glycol, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Acrylates/ C10-30 Alkyl Acrylatecrosspolymer, Anhydroxylitol, Caprylyl Glycol, Disodium Edta, Ethylhexylgiycerin, Glyceryl Stearate, Hydrolyzed Cicer Seed Extract, Pancratium Maritimum Extract, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Rhododendron Chrysanthum Leaf Extract, Sodium Hydroxide, Tricholoma Matsutake Extract, Xylitol, Xylitylglucoside FIL1714.V00\nThe Healthy Radiance range with GentleBright Technology and moisturising ingredients is designed to respect even the most sensitive skin as it works to help decrease the appearance of dark spots and restore even, luminous skin. The natural extract of white Sea Daffodil, proven to reduce the intensity and colour of dark spots, acts in perfect combination with brightening Niacinamide to even out skin tone. This gentle, yet highly effective blend of brightening, soothing and moisturising ingredients protects even the most sensitive skin against dryness as it enhances skin\'s natural, healthy radiance. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness and a weakened skin barrier.\n', 2200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 800.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Bright Healthy Radiance Day Protection Cream SPF 15Price in BD', 'Cetaphil Bright Healthy Radiance Day Protection Cream SPF 15 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-bright-healthy-radiance-day-protection-cream-spf-15', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(682, 'Jvelyn Cicathenol 61 One Day Cream', '1', 0, 22, 111, '682', '682', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jvelyn Cicathenol 61 One Day Cream 🌿✨\nA deeply hydrating and soothing cream formulated with Centella Asiatica Extracted Water and Panthenol to restore and protect your skin.\n✔ Intense Hydration – Panthenol enhances skin moisture levels for long-lasting hydration.✔ Soothing & Calming – Centella Asiatica Extract helps calm irritated skin and promotes healing.✔ Luminous Glow – Provides a healthy, radiant complexion by maintaining skin moisture.✔ Purified Water-Free Formula – Uses Centella Asiatica Extracted Water instead of purified water for extra nourishment.✔ Gentle & Nourishing – Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n1️⃣ After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount to the face.2️⃣ Gently massage into the skin until fully absorbed.3️⃣ Use daily, morning and night, for hydrated, glowing skin.\n💖 Give your skin the soothing care it deserves!', 990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 810.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Jvelyn Cicathenol 61 One Day CreamPrice in BD', 'Jvelyn Cicathenol 61 One Day Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'jvelyn-cicathenol-61-one-day-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(683, 'Loreal Paris Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming SPF 30 Hydrating Day Cream for Age 40+ 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 110, '683', '683', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pro-Retinol - Elasti-Peptides - Age 40+ Firming Protection\n\nLoreal Paris Revitalift Multi-Lift SPF 30 Day Cream targets wrinkles and sagging skin for women over 40 with Pro-Retinol and Elasti-Peptides in a hydrating formula. This 50ml day cream smooths crow\'s feet by 20%, firms skin, and provides broad-spectrum UV protection for daily anti-aging defense.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 1651.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 184.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming SPF 30 Hydrating Day Cream for Age 40+ 50mlPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming SPF 30 Hydrating Day Cream for Age 40+ 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-anti-wrinkle-extra-firming-spf-30-hydrating-day-cream-for-age-40-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24');
