(684, 'Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Day Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 226, '684', '684', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Day Cream SPF 20 is a budget-friendly skincare product designed to address signs of aging while providing sun protection. Formulated with Coenzyme Q10 (CoQ10), Vitamin E, and SPF 20, this day cream aims to rejuvenate the skin, reduce the appearance of fine lines, and protect against harmful UV rays.\nCoenzyme Q10 (Ubiquinone): An antioxidant that helps neutralize free radicals, potentially reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nVitamin E (Tocopheryl Acetate): An antioxidant that helps protect the skin from environmental stressors and supports skin health.\nAscorbyl Tetraisopalmitate: A stable form of Vitamin C that provides antioxidant benefits and may help brighten the skin.\nAloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Leaf Juice: Soothes and hydrates the skin, providing a calming effect.\nGlycerin: A humectant that draws moisture into the skin, keeping it hydrated.\nSodium Hyaluronate: A form of hyaluronic acid that attracts moisture to the skin, keeping it plump and hydrated.\nPanthenol (Provitamin B5): Known for its moisturizing and soothing properties, it helps maintain skin hydration.\nOctocrylene & Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane: Sunscreen agents that help protect the skin from harmful UV rays.\nCyclopentasiloxane & Cyclohexasiloxane: Silicones that provide a smooth application and help the product spread evenly on the skin.\nSimmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil: A natural oil that moisturizes and nourishes the skin.\nAlgin: A natural polymer that helps to stabilize the formulation and improve texture.\nCarica Papaya (Papaya) Fruit Extract: Contains enzymes that may help exfoliate the skin, promoting a smoother appearance.\nDisodium Adenosine Triphosphate: A compound that may help improve the skin\'s energy metabolism.\nGlyceryl Stearate, Glyceryl Oleate, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Lecithin: Emulsifiers that help blend the cream\'s ingredients together, ensuring a smooth texture.\nPropylene Glycol: A humectant that helps retain moisture in the skin.\nPhenoxyethanol, Benzoic Acid, Dehydroacetic Acid: Preservatives that prevent microbial growth and extend the shelf life of the cream.\nFragrance: Adds a pleasant scent to the product.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Dermatologically tested to be compatible with various skin types.\nFragrance-Free: Designed to minimize the risk of skin irritation.\nNon-Greasy Formula: Absorbs quickly into the skin, leaving a smooth finish.\nAffordable: Provides anti-aging and sun protection benefits at a budget-friendly price point.\nCleanse: Wash your face with a gentle cleanser to remove impurities.\nApply: Dispense a small amount of the day cream onto your fingertips.\nMassage: Gently massage the cream into your face and neck in upward motions.\nReapply: For prolonged sun exposure, reapply every two hours or after swimming or sweating.', 1200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 180.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Day Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Day Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lacura-q10-anti-wrinkle-day-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(685, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift  Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Day Cream', '1', 0, 22, 110, '685', '685', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Want glowing skin with wrinkles reduced? Revitalift is formulated with pro retinol, to reduce the appearance of wrinkles and help skin achieve a healthy looking glow.Advanced Pro-Retinol .Powerful dermatologist-inspired anti-wrinkle ingredient. Helps smooth skin\'s surface.\n\nHow To Use:Apply every morning on a perfectly cleansed face and neck using circular motions for better absorption. Avoid eye area.\nPlease be aware that ingredient lists for the products of our brand are updated regularly. Please refer to the ingredient list on your product package for the most up to date list of ingredients to ensure it is suitable to your personal use.AQUA / WATER • DIMETHICONE • GLYCERIN • OCTYLDODECANOL • STEARIC ACID • ISOHEXADECANE • PALMITIC ACID • PEG-100 STEARATE • GLYCERYL STEARATE • ELAEIS GUINEENSIS OIL / PALM OIL • CETYL ALCOHOL • TIN OXIDE • PEG-20 STEARATE • CI 77891 / TITANIUM DIOXIDE • CERA ALBA / BEESWAX • POTASSIUM CETYL PHOSPHATE • MICA • POTASSIUM SORBATE • GERANIOL • LINALOOL • SORBITAN OLEATE • GLYCINE SOJA PROTEIN / SOYBEAN PROTEIN • ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE • MYRISTIC ACID • RETINYL PALMITATE • SODIUM HYDROXIDE • SODIUM COCOYL GLUTAMATE • SODIUM BENZOATE • SALICYLOYL PHYTOSPHINGOSINE • PHENOXYETHANOL • POLOXAMER 338 • DISODIUM EDTA • TOCOPHEROL • LIMONENE • HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE • SHOREA ROBUSTA SEED BUTTER • HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN • CAPRYLYL GLYCOL • CAPRYLOYL SALICYLIC ACID • CITRONELLOL • CITRIC ACID • PENTYLENE GLYCOL • ACETYL TRIFLUOROMETHYLPHENYL VALYLGLYCINE • PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE • FAEX EXTRACT / YEAST EXTRACT • BUTYROSPERMUM\n\nMade In Germany', 1705.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1395.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift  Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Day CreamPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift  Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Day Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-multi-lift-anti-wrinkle-extra-firming-hydrating-day-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(686, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift  Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Day SPF35 PA** Cream', '1', 0, 22, 110, '686', '686', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Want glowing skin with wrinkles reduced? Revitalift is formulated with pro retinol, to reduce the appearance of wrinkles and help skin achieve a healthy looking glow.Advanced Pro-Retinol .Powerful dermatologist-inspired anti-wrinkle ingredient. Helps smooth skin\'s surface.\n\nHow To Use:Apply every morning on a perfectly cleansed face and neck using circular motions for better absorption. Avoid eye area', 1300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift  Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Day SPF35 PA** CreamPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift  Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Day SPF35 PA** Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-multi-lift-anti-wrinkle-extra-firming-hydrating-day-spf35-pa-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(687, 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion with Sunscreen SPF 30', '1', 0, 22, 153, '687', '687', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Provides Broad Spectrum SPF 30 sunscreen with InVisibleZinc Technology.MVE Technology: This patented delivery system continually releases moisturizing ingredients for all day hydration.Ceramides: Help restore and maintain the skin’s natural barrier.Hyaluronic acid: Helps retain the skin’s natural moisture.Niacinamide: Helps calm the skin.Non-comedogenic, allergy tested, oil-free and fragrance-free.\nBenefits:\nIngredients:\nActive Ingredients: Homosalate (10%), Meradimate (5%), Octinoxate (5%), Octocrylene (2%),  Zinc Oxide  (6.3%).\nInactive Ingredients: Water, Niacinamide, Glycerin, Cetearyl Alcohol, Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Dimethicone, Bht, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Carbomer, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Methylparaben, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Cholesterol, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Disodium Edta, Propylparaben, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Phytosphingosine, Xanthan Gum.\nHow To Use:\nSun protection measures: spending time in the sun increases your risk of skin cancer and early skin aging. To decrease this risk regularly use a sunscreen with a broad spectrum spf value of 15 or higher and other sun protection measures including:\n\n\n\n\nCeraVe AM Facial Moisturizing Lotion with Sunscreen provides all day hydration and broad spectrum SPF 30 sunscreen protection from UVA and UVB rays. UVA rays cause aging. UVB rays cause burning.\nWhen layering products like serums or eye creams, apply a thin layer & allow product to be absorbed fully before applying CeraVe AM Facial Moisturizing Lotion with Sunscreen.\nUnlock the pump for first time use by twisting it to the left and pressing down several times until the product comes out.\nApply liberally 15 minutes before sun exposure.\nAll CeraVe products are developed with dermatologists.\nAM Facial Moisturizing Lotion with Sunscreen is formulated without fragrance and oil and is non-comedogenic and allergy tested. Suitable for all skin types.\nRecommended by Skin Cancer Foundation as an effective, broad-spectrum sunscreen.\nFormulated with Hyaluronic Acid to help retain skin’s natural moisture, Niacinamide to help calm the skin, and 3 Essential Ceramides to help restore & maintain the skin’s natural moisture barrier.', 1740.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 860.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion with Sunscreen SPF 30Price in BD', 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion with Sunscreen SPF 30 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-am-facial-moisturising-lotion-with-sunscreen-spf-30', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
