(689, 'Cetaphil Healthy Radiance Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Whipped Day Cream', '1', 0, 22, 63, '689', '689', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CETAPHIL Healthy Radiance Renewing Cream is specifically designed for sensitive skin to reduce the appearance of dark spots. The unique, lightweight, souffle like texture melts into skin to instantly hydrate for smoother, more radiant skin. Specifically formulated with our GentleBright complex, powered with 2% niacinamide & nourishing antioxidants, to reduce the appearance of dark spots for a more even, radiant complexion. Plus bakuchiol, a plant-derived retinol alternative that\'s ideal for sensitive skin. This gentle renewing cream has a lightweight souffle like texture & non-greasy formula, & is hypoallergenic & non-comedogenic, so it won\'t irritate the skin or clog the pores. It is also fragrance free, oil free & paraben free, dermatologist tested & ophthalmologist tested to be suitable for sensitive skin & safe for use around the eyes. CETAPHIL skincare products defend against 5 signs of skin sensitivity - dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness & a weakened skin barrier. Tackle sensitive skin by improving the quality of your skin with the help of CETAPHI. Formulated with sensitive skin science, this lightweight, whipped moisturizer contains our GentleBright Complex with 2% niacinamide & nourishing antioxidants to reduce the appearance of dark spots plus SPF 30 to protect against sun\'s damaging UVA & UVB rays & prevent new dark spots from forming, promoting a more even skin tone. Infused with Mica for instantly more radiant & smoother-looking skin. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness & a weakened skin barrier.\nSkin type: For dull or uneven, sensitive skin\nLightweight, whipped texture moisturizer with SPF 30 is specifically designed for sensitive skin to reduce the appearance of dark spots & prevent new ones from forming by protecting against sun damage, promoting a more even skin tone. Formulated with infused Mica to reveal instantly more luminous skin.\nAvobenzone 3%, Homosalate 12.5%, Octisalate 5%, Octocrylene 8%\nInactive ingredients:\nWater, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Butylene Glycol, Isododecane, Sorbitol, Silica, Styrene/Acrylates Copolymer, Cetearyl Alcohol, Niacinamide, Glycerin, Phenoxyethanol, Dimethicone, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Ceteareth-20, Phenylethyl Resorcinol, Carbomer, Fatty Acid Ethyoxylate, Sorbitan Stearate, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Ethylhexylglycerin, Titanium Dioxide, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Hydroxide, Tin Oxide.\nSmooth evenly over face & neck as a last step every morning. Apply liberally on the face 15 minutes before sun exposure. Use a water-resistant sunscreen if swimming or sweating. Reapply at least every 2 hours.\nCountry of Origin: USA\n', 2860.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1220.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Healthy Radiance Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Whipped Day CreamPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Healthy Radiance Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Whipped Day Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-healthy-radiance-broad-spectrum-spf-30-whipped-day-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
