(692, 'Fade Out Anti Wrinkle Whitening Day Cream with Hyaluronic Acid & Niacinamide SPF25 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 154, '692', '692', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our super-hydrating formula contains Hyalusphere™ (a smaller molecular derivative of Hyaluronic Acid) which plumps the skin from within, helping blur static and dynamic wrinkles, whilst Niacinamide helps fade areas of persistent pigmentation. Naturally occurring AHA’s deliver a mild exfoliating action to help minimize the appearance of pigmentation and fine lines helping to achieve a radiant and age-defying complexion.Skin type: Suitable for all skin types and tonesConcern: Particularly suitable for premature aging concerns including fine lines, loss of radiance and uneven skin tone, caused by the build- up of melanin from sun damage, hormonal pigmentation and natural aging.Good to KnowActive ingredients that brighten the complexion and tackle uneven skin toneHelps blur static and dynamic wrinklesRich formula that provides intense hydrationHow to UseAfter cleansing and optional use of serum, apply evenly over face, paying attention to areas of pigmentation concern. Can additionally be used on the neck and décolletage.Key IngredientsHYALUSPHERE 2.0%A moisture-binding humectant that plumps out fine lines and revitalizes skin’s outer surface layers so they look softer, smoother and hydrated. Features a lower molecular weight than Hyaluronic Acid, so is more easily absorbed.LACTIC ACID 1.7%Naturally occurring AHA that speeds up cell turnover to improve skin texture and fade hyperpigmentation Extract, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Linalool, Limonene, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Coumarin, Geraniol.NIACINAMIDE 2.2% (VITAMIN B3)A superlative skin improver that reduces inflammation and environmental stresses, whilst tackling pigmentation and minimizing pores.CLERILYS W ® 1%An active blend of White Mulberry, Hibiscus and Cucumber that limits pigment storage, inhibits melanin production and increases exfoliationDetailed Ingredient