(696, 'Olay Natural Aura SPF 15 Glowing Radiance Day Cream with Mulberry Extract', '1', 0, 22, 58, '696', '696', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'International bestseller Skincare Brand Olay has engineered a range of products that promises the perfect skin for all ages and across skin types. This cream reveals skin’s natural and healthy fairness with the triple nutrient system in only 14 days. It Nourishes skin to lightens and brighten the skin tone. Experience the even skin tone and reduced appearance of dark spots. Visible Skin Results from Day 1. Get your Skin Hydrated, smooth & plump. Start with the youthful glow for your skin, now with the Olay Range. Natural Aura SPF 15 Glowing Radiance Day Cream with Mulberry Extract nourishes and helps protect your skin with added fairness benefits. Your skin is vulnerable to the sun’s UV rays and signs of skin darkening during the day, Olay Glowing Fairness cream helps prevent skin tanning and gives you soft, glowing and brighter looking skin. It is powered with a Tri-Vitamin boost of B3, Pro-B5 and E and SPF 24/PA++, which works on skin renewal and gives anti-oxidant protection for natural glowing fairness and much more healthier skin.\nSafety Information:As with all facial skin care products, avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse eyes thoroughly with water. If eye and skin irritation develops, discontinue use. Keep out of reach of children.\nIngredients:Water, Glycerin, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Niacinamide, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Dimethicone, Isopropyl Isostearate, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Octocrylene, Phenylbenzimidazole Sulfonic Acid, Polyethylene, Triethanolamine, Isohexadecane, Stearyl Alcohol, Benzyl Alcohol, Panthenol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Cetyl Alcohol, Titanium Dioxide, Behenyl Alcohol, Sucrose Polycottonseedate, Dimethiconol, Carbomer, Ethylparaben, Polysorbate 60, Fragrance, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cetearyl Glucoside, Methylparaben, PEG-100 Stearate, Propylparaben, Disodium EDTA, Silica, Stearic Acid, Linalool, Hydroxyisohexyl 3-cyclohexene Carboxaldehyde, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Butylene Glycol, Benzyl Salicylate, Citronellol, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Isoeugenol, Milk Lipids, Morus Alba Root Extract, Coix Lacryma-Jobi Ma-Yuen Seed Extract, Ceramide 3, Phytosphingosine, CI 19140\nDirections:Apply liberally to cleansed face and neck twice a day.', 594.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 296.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Natural Aura SPF 15 Glowing Radiance Day Cream with Mulberry ExtractPrice in BD', 'Olay Natural Aura SPF 15 Glowing Radiance Day Cream with Mulberry Extract Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-natural-aura-spf-15-glowing-radiance-day-cream-with-mulberry-extract', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:24'),
(697, 'Fadeout Advanced Brightening Day Cream SPF 20 Niacinamide & Mulberry 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 154, '697', '697', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten your complexion and tackle persistent pigmentation with Fadeout Advanced Brightening Day Cream SPF 20. Designed for daily use, this lightweight cream combines SPF protection, niacinamide, naturally occurring AHAs, and Clerilys W, a new-generation blend of white mulberry, hibiscus, and cucumber extracts. Together, these ingredients help fade hyperpigmentation, improve skin texture, and boost radiance.\nThe fast-absorbing formula also hydrates, nourishes, and protects the skin while promoting a clearer, more even-toned complexion. Suitable for all skin types and tones, it addresses post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation, sun spots, and hormonal pigmentation.\nBrightens and evens skin tone with Niacinamide 2.2% (Vitamin B3)\nGentle exfoliation with Lactic Acid 3.3% to improve skin texture and fade dark spots\nLimits pigment storage and inhibits melanin production with Clerilys W 1%\nProvides SPF 20 protection to prevent further pigmentation\nFast-absorbing, hydrating, and nourishing formula\nCruelty-free and vegan\nBlurring\nBrightening\nHydrating\nProtecting\nVegan\nCruelty-free\nSuitable for all skin types and tones\nTargets persistent pigmentation, including post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation, sun spots (solar lentigines), and hormonal pigmentation\nAfter cleansing and optional serum application, apply evenly over the face.\nFocus on areas with pigmentation concerns.\nCan also be used on hands, neck, shoulders, and décolletage.\nUse daily for best results.\nNiacinamide 2.2% (Vitamin B3): Reduces inflammation, minimizes pores, and brightens skin\nVitamin E: Antioxidant protection and skin soothing\nLactic Acid 3.3%: Gently exfoliates and stimulates cell renewal\nClerilys W 1%: Limits pigment storage, inhibits melanin production, and enhances exfoliation\nSodium Lactate 6.1%: Superior humectant to retain moisture and prevent dryne