(698, 'Pond\'s Bright Miracle Niasorcinol Ultimate Clarity Day Cream with SPF15 PA++', '1', 0, 22, 193, '698', '698', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Pond\'S Bright Miracle Ultimate Clarity Day Cream SPF15 PA++ Niasorcinol\nFADES SPOTS AND POST ACNE MARKS FROM 7 DAYS\nIntroducing NIASORCINOLTM, inspired by Nobel Prize winning scientific research on SKIN REPAIR.  The golden ratio combination of\nNiacinamide  Brightening ingredient for Micro Repair. Fade dark spots and post-acne marks.\nE-Resorcinol  500X brightening power\nVitamin C  Visibly evens out skintone and discolouration for glowing complexion\n\nHOW TO USE:Dispense pea sized amount onto hand. Slowly massage cream onto cleansed face & neck\nORDER OF USE: 1. Cleanser 2. Day Serum 3. Day Cream 4. SPF TIME OF USE  Day. Apply every morning onto face and neck. Fades Dark Spots. Get radiant, stronger skin - Ultimately Clearer Skin from 7 days\nBenefits:\nBrightening Reduces Dark Spots Acne.\nGender:Unisex\nType of Hair / Skin:\nNormalSize and Volumn:45g.\n\nWarnings:1. Stop using in case of skin irritation and contact Unilever Careline. Do not use on damaged skin.2. Avoid contact with eyes. In case of contact with eyes, rinse thoroughly with water.3. Do not stay too long in the sun even while using a sunscreen product.4. Store away from sunlight and heatTIME OF USE  Day. Apply every morning onto face and neck.', 858.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 392.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Bright Miracle Niasorcinol Ultimate Clarity Day Cream with SPF15 PA++Price in BD', 'Pond\'s Bright Miracle Niasorcinol Ultimate Clarity Day Cream with SPF15 PA++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-bright-miracle-niasorcinol-ultimate-clarity-day-cream-with-spf15-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:24', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(699, 'Olay Total Effects 7 In One Normal Day Cream SPF 15 50g', '1', 0, 22, 58, '699', '699', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'International bestseller Skincare Brand Olay has engineered a range of products that promises the perfect skin for all ages and across skin types. 7 benefits in one that keeps your skin youthful and at its radiant best with a fragrance free formula. Olay Total Effects delivers optimal hydration to nourish skin and visibly fight the 7 signs of aging (Smoothes Evens Tone Brightens Refines Pores Reduces Age Spots Restores Firmness Moisturises). Vitamin B5 is an anti-inflammatory and skin conditioner boosts collagen and treats acne. Vitamin B3 renews your cell and holds skin moisture. Anti-oxidants Vitamin C Vitamin E and Green Tea clears skin prevents aging and protects from harmful radicals of the environment. Visible Skin Results from Day 1. Start with the youthful glow for your skin now with Total Effects Range. Skin Type: Normal Skin Oily Skin Dry Skin Combination Skin Daily all-in-one face moisturizer for Women with SPF 15 that even complexion. Fights 7 signs of aging for younger-looking skin Revives skin by reducing the appearance of fine lines & wrinkles age spots uneven tone uneven texture dryness dullness and the appearance of pores Powerful Ingredients: Pro Vitamin B5 Vitamin C&E Green Tea Extract Vitamin B3 Daily moisturizer Visible Results Day 1: Instantly improves hydration and with continued use builds skin to its strongest state to best combat everyday stress', 1252.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 348.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Total Effects 7 In One Normal Day Cream SPF 15 50gPrice in BD', 'Olay Total Effects 7 In One Normal Day Cream SPF 15 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-total-effects-7-in-one-normal-day-cream-spf-15-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(700, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Day Cream with Vitamin C & Hyaluronic Acid 30g', '1', 0, 22, 8, '700', '700', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Unlock the secret to a bright, balanced complexion with the LAIKOU Japan Sakura Day Cream. Infused with the delicate essence of cherry blossoms and a powerful blend of skincare actives, this day cream provides all-day hydration while working to enhance your skin’s natural radiance.\nThis luxurious formula is packed with nourishing and brightening components:\nApply a pea-sized amount to your face and neck every morning after cleansing and toning. Gently massage into the skin until fully absorbed.', 300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 250.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Day Cream with Vitamin C & Hyaluronic Acid 30gPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Day Cream with Vitamin C & Hyaluronic Acid 30g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-day-cream-with-vitamin-c-hyaluronic-acid-30g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(701, 'Cetaphil Daily Defence Moisturiser SPF50+ for Sensitive Skin 50ml', '1', 0, 22, 63, '701', '701', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cetaphil Daily Defence Moisturiser SPF50+ for Sensitive Skin\nClinically proven to hydrate and nourish skin while providing SPF 50 protection against sun damage without leaving a heavy residue. Ideal for sensitive, dry to normal skin. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness and a weakened skin barrier.\nSkin type: For dry to normal, sensitive skin\nClinically proven to hydrate skin while SPF 50 helps to defend against damaging sun rays.\nFormulated with micronized titanium dioxide, which absorbs quickly and leaves no filmy, white residueNourishes to retain skin\'s vital moisture throughout the day Dermatologist tested and clinically proven to be gentle on sensitive skin\nHow to use:\nApply liberally 15 minutes before sun exposure. Use a water resistant sunscreen if swimming or sweating. Reapply at least every 2 hours. Children under 6 months: ask a doctor.\nIngredients:\nActive ingredients :Octinoxate 7.5%, Octisalate 5%, Octocrylene 7%, Oxybenzone 6%, Titanium Dioxide 5.7%\nInactive ingredients :Water, Propylene Glycol, Glycerin, Dimethicone, VP/Eicosene Copolymer, Cyclomethicone, Stearic Acid, Dimethiconol, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Aluminum Hydroxide, Disodium EDTA, Tocopherol, Triethanolamine, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylparaben, Chlorphenesin, Cetyl Alcohol, Carbomer, Methylparaben, Xanthan Gum\nApply daily to freshly cleansed skin on the face and neck. Re-apply where necessary to maintain protection.\n\n*Package May Vary', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1275.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Daily Defence Moisturiser SPF50+ for Sensitive Skin 50mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Daily Defence Moisturiser SPF50+ for Sensitive Skin 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-daily-defence-moisturiser-spf50-for-sensitive-skin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(702, 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 30 with Sunscreen for Normal to Dry Skin 89ml', '1', 0, 22, 153, '702', '702', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Developed with dermatologists, CeraVe AM Facial Moisturizing Lotion with Sunscreen moisturizes throughout the day and helps to restore the protective skin barrier. This sunscreen lotion is Formulated with broad spectrum SPF 30 sunscreen for daily UV protection, protecting your skin from damaging UVA and UVB rays. This non-comedogenic moisturizer with SPF 30 spreads easily without leaving a chalky residue.', 2103.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '89ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1097.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 30 with Sunscreen for Normal to Dry Skin 89mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave AM Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 30 with Sunscreen for Normal to Dry Skin 89ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-am-facial-moisturising-lotion-spf-30-with-sunscreen-for-normal-to-dry-skin-89ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
