(704, 'Creme 21 Intensive Care & Protection Ultra Dry Skin with Vitamin E – 250 ml', '1', 0, 22, 174, '704', '704', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Creme 21 Intensive Care & Protection is specially formulated to provide intensive hydration and long-lasting protection for ultra-dry skin. Enriched with Vitamin E and Almond Oil, this rich cream deeply nourishes and helps restore the skin\'s natural moisture balance. Its non-greasy, fast-absorbing formula leaves the skin feeling soft, smooth, and protected throughout the day.\nDeep Moisturization: Provides intensive hydration to ultra-dry skin.\nVitamin E Enriched: Helps nourish and protect the skin.\nAlmond Oil Infused: Supports skin\'s natural moisture balance.\nNon-Greasy Formula: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue.\nSoft & Smooth Skin: Leaves skin feeling nourished and comfortable.\nVitamin E: Nourishes and protects the skin.\nAlmond Oil: Supports skin\'s natural moisture balance.\nHydrating Agents: Provide long-lasting moisture to dry skin.\nApply generously to clean, dry skin.\nMassage gently until fully absorbed.\nUse daily or as needed for soft, smooth, and protected skin.\nSize: 250 mL\nForm: Rich moisturizing cream\nSkin Type: Ultra-dry skin\nFinish: Soft, smooth, and hydrated skin\nEnriched with Vitamin E & Almond Oil | Intensive Care | Non-Greasy Formula', 825.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Creme 21 Intensive Care & Protection Ultra Dry Skin with Vitamin E – 250 mlPrice in BD', 'Creme 21 Intensive Care & Protection Ultra Dry Skin with Vitamin E – 250 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'creme-21-intensive-care-protection-ultra-dry-skin-with-vitamin-e-250-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(705, 'Olay Natural Aura All in One Radiance Night Cream with Mulberry Extract', '1', 0, 22, 58, '705', '705', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Feature:\n\nIngredients:\nWater, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Isohexadecane, Butylene Glycol, Dimethicone, Isopropyl Isostearate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Panthenol, Morus Alba Root Extract, Milk Lipids, Zizyphus Jujuba Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract, Crataegus Cuneata Fruit Extract, Citrus Grandis (Grapefruit) Fruit Extract, Lilium Candidum Bulb Extract, Citrus Aurantifolia Juice, Phytosphingosine, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Fruit Extract, Ceramide NP, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Juice, Dimethiconol, Sorbitan Stearate, Sucrose cocoate, Stearic Acid, Palmitic acid, Cetyl alcohol,Stearyl alcohol, Disodium EDTA, Carbomer, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Sodium hydroxide, PEG-100 Stearate, Ammonium polyacrylate, Titanium dioxide, Benzyl Alcohol, Ethylparaben, Propylparaben,Methylparaben, Parfum, Linalool, Citronellol, Benzyl Salicylate, Alpha-iso methyl Ionone, CI 19140, CI 16035\n\nUsage:\nApply night cream to clean, dry skin before bedtime, focusing on your face and neck. Gently massage in circular motions until fully absorbed for optimal overnight nourishment.\n\n', 583.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 307.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Natural Aura All in One Radiance Night Cream with Mulberry ExtractPrice in BD', 'Olay Natural Aura All in One Radiance Night Cream with Mulberry Extract Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-natural-aura-all-in-one-radiance-night-cream-with-mulberry-extract', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(706, 'Siodil Brightening Gel 40ml', '1', 0, 23, 75, '706', '706', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Siodil Brightening Gel is the lightest gel ever created to get brighter and glowing skin. It is rich in skin vitamins and active ingredients like Kojic Acid, Vitamin C, and Niacinamide. Its fast-absorbing gel formula helps to reduce dark spots and provides antioxidant benefits. The advanced formula enhances skin complexion, reduces pores, and leaves your skin glowing and youthful.', 2079.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 211.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Siodil Brightening Gel 40mlPrice in BD', 'Siodil Brightening Gel 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'siodil-brightening-gel-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(707, 'Mamaearth Beetroot Facial Kit – With Beetroot & Hyaluronic Acid | Hydrate & Achieve a Natural Pink Glow', '1', 0, 23, 3, '707', '707', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pamper your skin with the Mamaearth Beetroot Facial Kit, a complete 6-step skincare solution infused with Beetroot Extract and Hyaluronic Acid. This all-in-one kit cleanses, exfoliates, soothes, and hydrates, leaving your skin with a radiant natural pink glow. Suitable for all skin types, it’s perfect for those looking to refresh and rejuvenate their complexion at home.\nBeetroot Cleansing Milk (10 ml): Gently cleanses face & neck, removing dirt and impurities.\nBeetroot Face Scrub (10 g): Exfoliates dead skin cells and smoothens texture.\nBeetroot Soothing Gel (10 ml): Calms and hydrates skin instantly.\nBeetroot Massage Cream (10 g): Massages away stress and improves blood circulation.\nBeetroot Face Pack (10 g): Deep cleanses and brightens skin for a natural glow.\nBeetroot Glow Serum Gel (10 g): Locks in hydration and enhances radiance.\nHydrates & Moisturizes: Hyaluronic Acid ensures skin stays plump and soft\nBrightens & Revitalizes: Beetroot extract imparts a natural pink glow\nGentle & Safe: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\nAll-in-One Kit: Complete facial care at home without any hassle\nFollow the 6-step routine in sequence: Cleansing → Scrub → Soothing Gel → Massage Cream → Face Pack → Glow Serum Gel\nMassage products gently as instructed for maximum absorption\nRinse thoroughly where required\nStore in a cool, dry place; avoid direct sunlight\nPatch test recommended before first use\nBeetroot Extract: Brightens skin and restores natural glow\nHyaluronic Acid: Provides deep hydration and plumps skin\nNiacinamide: Improves skin tone and strengthens skin barrier\nKaolin Clay & Aloe Vera: Detoxifies, soothes, and nourishes skin\nQuantity: 6-step kit (10 ml/g per product)\nSkin Type: All skin types\nCategory: Skincare → Facial Kit\nCaution: For external use only', 780.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 340.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Beetroot Facial Kit – With Beetroot & Hyaluronic Acid | Hydrate & Achieve a Natural Pink GlowPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Beetroot Facial Kit – With Beetroot & Hyaluronic Acid | Hydrate & Achieve a Natural Pink Glow Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-beetroot-facial-kit-with-beetroot-hyaluronic-acid-hydrate-achieve-a-natural-pink-glow', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(708, 'Natura Expert Care Body Lotion 200ml', '1', 0, 23, 229, '708', '708', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Natura Expert Care Body Lotion is a rich, skin-softening moisturizer formulated to repair, hydrate, and protect dry or rough skin. Enriched with Shea Butter, Cocoa Butter, and Coconut Milk, it penetrates deeply to restore moisture and improve skin texture. Its non-greasy, fast-absorbing formula makes it ideal for daily use, leaving your skin feeling smooth, supple, and radiant.\nKey Features\nBenefits\nUsage Instructions\nWhy Choose Natura Expert Care Body Lotion?\n\n', 215.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 65.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Natura Expert Care Body Lotion 200mlPrice in BD', 'Natura Expert Care Body Lotion 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'natura-expert-care-body-lotion-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(709, 'Laikou Japan Sakura After Sun Gel 50g', '1', 0, 23, 8, '709', '709', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Soothe and revive your skin after sun exposure with Laikou Japan Sakura After Sun Gel. Enriched with nourishing Sakura extract, Shea Butter, and 96% Aloe Vera Gel, this lightweight gel delivers intense hydration while calming and cooling sun-stressed skin. Its fast-absorbing formula helps restore moisture balance, ease discomfort from sunburn, and leave your skin feeling soft, refreshed, and rejuvenated.\nKey Benefits:\nUsage:Cleanse your skin and gently pat dry. Apply a generous amount of gel to the affected area. Spread evenly and allow it to absorb naturally—no need to rub in. Ideal for use after sun exposure or anytime your skin needs a soothing touch.', 299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 251.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura After Sun Gel 50gPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura After Sun Gel 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-after-sun-gel-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25');
