(711, 'Neutrogena Clear & Defend 2-in-1, 1% Salicylic Acid Wash-Mask 150ml', '1', 0, 23, 151, '711', '711', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neutrogena Clear & Defend 2-in-1 Wash-Mask is a dual-action facial cleanser that helps fight acne while keeping skin clear and smooth. Formulated with 1% Salicylic Acid, it penetrates pores to target impurities, reduce breakouts, and unclog pores. Its wash-to-mask formula allows you to use it as a daily cleanser or leave it on as a mask for intense acne-fighting treatment. Suitable for oily and acne-prone skin, it leaves your face feeling refreshed, balanced, and clear.\nDual Action: Works as a daily wash or a deep-cleansing mask.\nFights Acne & Breakouts: 1% Salicylic Acid penetrates pores to reduce blemishes.\nUnclogs Pores: Removes excess oil, dirt, and impurities effectively.\nSmooth & Clear Skin: Helps prevent future breakouts while refining skin texture.\nGentle Yet Effective: Dermatologist-tested formula for oily and acne-prone skin.\nKey Ingredients:Water, Glycerin, Salicylic Acid 1%, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Acrylates Copolymer, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance\nIngredient Highlights:\nSalicylic Acid (1%): Penetrates pores to fight acne, reduce blackheads, and prevent breakouts.\nGlycerin: Hydrates skin to prevent over-drying.\nGentle Cleansers: Effectively remove excess oil and impurities without harsh irritation.\nAs a Daily Wash:\nApply to wet face.\nMassage gently and rinse thoroughly.\nAs a Mask:\nApply a thin layer to clean, dry skin.\nLeave on for 3–5 minutes.\nRinse thoroughly.\nUse 2–3 times a week or as needed.\nSize: 150 mL\nForm: 2-in-1 wash and mask\nSkin Type: Oily, acne-prone, and blemish-prone skin\nFinish: Refreshed, clear, and balanced skin\nDermatologist Tested | Non-Comedogenic | Gentle yet Effective', 1155.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 705.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neu