(716, 'Pond\'s Clarant B3 Dark Spot Correcting Cream 200g – For Balanced to Oily Skin /Para piel equilibrada a seca', '1', 0, 23, 193, '716', '716', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reduces Dark Spots: Helps diminish the appearance of dark spots and discoloration.\nEvens Skin Tone: Improves overall skin tone and radiance.\nHydrates Skin: Provides essential moisture without clogging pores.\nSuitable for Normal to Oily Skin: Tailored for individuals with normal to oily skin types.\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\nApply the cream evenly to your face.\nMassage gently until fully absorbed.\nUse daily for best results.\nActive & Key Ingredients: Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), R-Phosphate, Pyridoxine HCl.Other Ingredients: Water, Stearic Acid, Isopropyl Myristate, Glycerin, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Triethanolamine, Cetyl Alcohol, Detox Methane, Phenoxyethanol, Carbomer, Methylparaben, Sodium PCA, Hydroxystearic Acid, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Limonene, Linalool, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).\nThe cream contains:\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): Known for its brightening and anti-inflammatory properties.\nGlycerin: A humectant that draws moisture into the skin.\nPalmitic Acid & Stearic Acid: Fatty acids that help in emulsifying and moisturizing the skin.\nCyclopentasiloxane & Cetyl Alcohol: Emollients that provide a smooth application.\nSodium Ascorbyl Phosphate: A stable form of Vitamin C with antioxidant properties.\nEthylhexyl Methoxycinnamate & Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane: Sunscreen agents that protect the skin from UV damage.\nThis formulation is designed to be non-comedogenic, meaning it won\'t clog pores, making it suitable for daily use on normal to oily skin types.', 2200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Clarant B3 Dark Spot Correcting Cream 200g – For Balanced to Oily Skin /Para piel equilibrada a secaPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s