(731, 'Dabo 24hr Waterful Aqua Cream', '1', 0, 23, 207, '731', '731', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dabo Waterful Aqua Cream is a lightweight moisturizer that is designed to provide long-lasting hydration to the skin. The cream contains a blend of hydrating ingredients such as hyaluronic acid, aloe vera leaf extract, and centella asiatica extract, which work together to replenish the skin\'s moisture levels and leave it feeling soft and supple.The cream has a refreshing, gel-like texture that absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy or sticky residue. It provides a burst of hydration that helps to plump and smooth the skin, while also improving its elasticity and firmness.In addition to its hydrating benefits, Dabo Waterful Aqua Cream also contains niacinamide, which helps to brighten the skin and reduce the appearance of dark spots and hyperpigmentation. It also contains adenosine, which has anti-aging benefits and helps to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.Overall, Dabo Waterful Aqua Cream is a lightweight, hydrating moisturizer that provides anti-aging benefits and helps to brighten and nourish the skin. It is suitable for all skin types, but is particularly beneficial for those with dry or dehydrated skin.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nKey Ingredient:\n\nHow to use:\nThe lightweight texture of the cream makes it ideal for daily use. It can be used alone or as a part of your skincare routine, depending on your preference. It is suitable for all skin types.\n\nMade in Korea', 1099.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 476.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo 24hr Waterful Aqua CreamPrice in BD', 'Dabo 24hr Waterful Aqua Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-24hr-waterful-aqua-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(732, 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Gel Cream for Extra  Dry Skin', '1', 0, 23, 151, '732', '732', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lightweight and fragrance-free, Neutrogena® Hydro Boost Gel-Cream Extra-Dry is formulated with a Unique Liquid Crystal Gel Matrix that absorbs quickly like a gel, while boosting hydration.\nInstantly quench dry skin for a healthy-looking glow day after day. This award-winning formula with Hyaluronic Acid absorbs quickly like a gel but has the lasting, intense moisturizing power of a cream.\nSTEP 1\nApply evenly to face and neck after cleansing.\nSTEP 2\nWear it alone or under makeup as a moisturizer.\n', 2229.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 651.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Gel Cream for Extra  Dry SkinPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Hydro Boost Gel Cream for Extra  Dry Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-hydro-boost-gel-cream-for-extra-dry-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(733, 'Pond\'s Clarant B3 Dark Spot Correcting Cream 200g – For Balanced to Oily Skin / Para piel equilibrada a grasa', '1', 0, 23, 193, '733', '733', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pond’s Clarant B3 Dark Spot Correcting Cream is a dermatologist-tested moisturizer specially formulated for balanced to oily skin. Enriched with Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), this cream works to reduce dark spots, even out skin tone, and restore natural radiance. Its lightweight, non-greasy formula is designed to hydrate without clogging pores, making it ideal for daily use.\nReduces Dark Spots: Visibly diminishes dark spots and discoloration.\nEvens Skin Tone: Promotes a brighter, more uniform complexion.\nHydrating & Lightweight: Nourishes the skin without leaving it oily or heavy.\nNon-Comedogenic: Won’t clog pores, keeping skin clear and refreshed.\nDermatologist-Tested: Safe for regular use on balanced to oily skin.\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\nApply the cream evenly to the face and neck every morning and evening.\nMassage gently until fully absorbed.\nAvoid contact with eyes and eyelids. Rinse immediately with water if contact occurs.\nDiscontinue use and consult a doctor if irritation develops.\nWater, Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Stearic Acid, Isopropyl Myristate, Glycerin, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Triethanolamine, Cetyl Alcohol, Phenoxyethanol, Carbomer, Methylparaben, Sodium PCA, Hydroxystearic Acid, Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), R-Phosphate, Pyridoxine HCl, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Limonene, Linalool, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).\nStore in a cool, dry place.\nFor external use only.\nKeep out of reach of children.', 2310.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 990.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Clarant B3 Dark Spot Correcting Cream 200g – For Balanced to Oily Skin / Para piel equilibrada a grasaPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s Clarant B3 Dark Spot Correcting Cream 200g – For Balanced to Oily Skin / Para piel equilibrada a grasa Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-clarant-b3-dark-spot-correcting-cream-200g-for-balanced-to-oily-skin-para-piel-equilibrada-a-grasa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(734, 'Cetaphil Daily Oil Free Facial Moisturizer with Sunscreen SPF 35 for Combination, Sensitive Skin', '1', 0, 23, 63, '734', '734', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This lightweight oil-free moisturizer hydrates and strengthens the skin barrier while providing broad spectrum UVA/UVB defense against sunburn. Formulated with edelweiss flower and vitamins E, B3 and B5 to strengthen the skin barrier and prevent surface free radical damage. This oil free moisturizer hydrates for 24 hours while leaving the skin with a matte finish. Ideal for sensitive, combination skin. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness and a weakened skin barrier.\nProVitamin B5, Edelweiss Flower Extract, Avobenzone, Homosalate, Octisalate, Octocrylene, Glycerin, Niacinamide\nApply liberally 15 minutes before sun exposure. Use a water resistant sunscreen if swimming or sweating. Reapply at least every 2 hours. Children under 6 months of age: Ask a doctor. Sun Protection Measures. Spending time in the sun increases your risk of skin cancer and early skin aging. To decrease this risk, regularly use a sunscreen with aBroad Spectrum SPF value of 15 or higher and other sun protection measures including: Limit time in the sun, especially from 10 am -2 pm. Wear long-sleeved shirts, pants, hats, and sunglasses\nPrecautions: For external use only. Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product keep out of eyes. Rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if rash occurs. Keep out of reach of children. If swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away.\n\nIngredients:\nActive Ingredients: Avobenzone 2.8%, Homosalate 9.5%, Octisalate 4.8%, Octocrylene 7.0%.\nInactive Ingredients: Water, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycole, Panthenol (Vitamin B5), Ethylhexyl Methoxycrylene, Isopropyl Palmitate, Silica, Niacinamide, Cetearyl Olivate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Sorbitan Olivate, Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E Acetate), Caprylyl Glycol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Palmitic Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Leontopodium Alpinum (Edelweiss) Extract, Stearic Acid, 1,2-Hexanediol, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Lees Extract, Propanediol, Sodium Hydroxide, Adenosine, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Citric Acid, Myristic Acid, Buddleja Davidii (Summer Lilac) Leaf Extract, Thymus Vulgaris (Thyme) Leaf Extract, Tocopherol(Vitamin E).', 2399.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1451.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Daily Oil Free Facial Moisturizer with Sunscreen SPF 35 for Combination, Sensitive SkinPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Daily Oil Free Facial Moisturizer with Sunscreen SPF 35 for Combination, Sensitive Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-daily-oil-free-facial-moisturizer-with-sunscreen-spf-35-for-combination-sensitive-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
