(742, 'Dr. Rashel Rose Oil Nutritious Vitality Glow Essence Gel Cream', '1', 0, 23, 233, '742', '742', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Face gel cream contains pure natural rose water and rose oil, gently cares for the skin, makes the skin moisturized and radiant. Suitable for the treatment of stressed, irritated, dull and aging skin. Stabilizes cell walls, strengthens the skin and tones it. Enriched with a variety of...\nBenefits : Face gel cream contains pure natural rose water and rose oil, gently cares for the skin, makes the skin moisturized and radiant. Suitable for the treatment of stressed, irritated, dull and aging skin. Stabilizes cell walls, strengthens the skin and tones it. Enriched with a variety of vitamins, the skin gradually becomes natural, fair and translucent, the cream gel prevents aging and gives the skin a soft and refreshed look. Deep moisturizing, tender and smooth skin, brighten skin tone.\nUse For : Face, Neck Gel Cream\nFeature : Anti-Puffiness - Anti-Wrinkle - Dark Circles - Moisturizer - Nourishing - Anti-Aging - Dullness\nSkin Type : Suitable for all skin types and most sensitive skin\nIngredients : Aqua, glycerin, niacinamide, betaine, propylene glycol, hydrolyzed collagen, rosa damascena flower water, arbutin, panthenol, sodium hyaluronate, allantoin, hydroxyethylcellulose, carbomer, sodium hydroxide, methylparaben, 1,2-hexanediol, hydroxyacetophenone, disodium edta, hydroxypropyl methylcellulose, pelvetia canalliculate extract, zea mays (corn) starch, titanium dioxide, 2-bromo-2-nitropropane-1,3-diol, peg-40 hydrogenated castor oil, rosa rugosa flower oil, ci 12490, ci 11680, ci 17200\nHow To Use : Apply a small amount to a thoroughly clean face and neck. Message into skin using gentle upward and outward strokes. Use in the morning as a moisturizer makeup base and at nigh as a nourishing night cream\n\nMade in P.R.C', 638.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 612.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '