(743, 'The Derma Co Oil Free Daily Face Moisturizer for Non Greasy & Hydrated Skin', '1', 0, 23, 33, '743', '743', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Derma Co Oil-Free Daily Face Moisturizer is designed for individuals with oily, acne-prone, or combination skin who want effective hydration without a greasy feel. This lightweight, non-comedogenic moisturizer hydrates the skin while controlling excess oil, leaving the skin feeling fresh and matte. It helps maintain a balanced moisture level, preventing dryness while keeping the skin non-greasy throughout the day.\nHyaluronic Acid:\nCeramides:\nNiacinamide:\nAloe Vera Extract:\nGlycerin:\nThis moisturizer is a great solution for individuals looking to balance hydration and oil control, keeping the skin soft, smooth, and matte throughout the day.\nMade in India', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '100g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 186.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co Oil Free Daily Face Moisturizer for Non Greasy & Hydrated SkinPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co Oil Free Daily Face Moisturizer for Non Greasy & Hydrated Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-oil-free-daily-face-moisturizer-for-non-greasy-hydrated-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
