(745, 'Eucerin Face Immersive Hydration Gel Cream for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 23, 234, '745', '745', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Eucerin Face Immersive Hydration Gel Cream hydrates throughout the skin’s surface layers for up to 72 hours with an ultra-lightweight formula. Enriched with Multi-weight Hyaluronic Acid, the clinically proven moisturizing cream formula combines two sizes of hyaluronic acid. With macro-sized molecules, this hydrating face moisturizer intensively hydrates the skin’s surface, while with 40x smaller* micro molecules, it hydrates throughout the skin\'s upper surface layers, helping to improve the look of fine lines and wrinkles. To support the skin’s smooth, hydrated appearance, this daily moisturizer cream is further enriched with an Antioxidant Complex, helping to defend against damaging free radicals. Eucerin Face Immersive Hydration Gel Cream increases moisture significantly for skin that looks fresh and healthy and feels more resilient. The non comedogenic moisturizer is formulated for all skin types, even sensitive skin, and has a skin-friendly fragrance, free of common fragrance allergens. Use this gel cream with the Eucerin Face Immersive Hydration Collection. Eucerin is a dermatologist-recommended skincare brand that is based on an uncompromising approach to science, with skin care products formulated to restore and sustain healthy-looking skin. *40x smaller than macro hyaluronic acid molecules also in the formula', 2670.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2430.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Eucerin Face Immersive Hydration Gel Cream for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Eucerin Face Immersive Hydration Gel Cream for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'eucerin-face-immersive-hydration-gel-cream-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(746, 'I\'m from Vitamin Tree Water Gel', '1', 0, 23, 129, '746', '746', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I’m From Vitamin Tree Water Gel is a lightweight, hydrating gel moisturizer formulated with vitamins and natural plant extracts to provide intensive hydration, calm sensitive skin, and maintain a balanced, non-greasy finish. It\'s especially suitable for oily and combination skin types due to its gel-like consistency, which absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy residue.\nLightweight Hydration:\nSoothes and Calms:\nRich in Antioxidants:\nOil-Control Properties:\nReduces the Appearance of Fine Lines:\nVitamin Tree (Sea Buckthorn) Leaf Extract:\nNiacinamide:\nHyaluronic Acid:\nButylene Glycol and Glycerin:\nThis water gel is designed to provide a light, soothing hydration boost while supporting a healthy skin barrier and a radiant complexion.\nMade in Korea', 2365.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '75g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1785.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'I\'m from Vitamin Tree Water GelPrice in BD', 'I\'m from Vitamin Tree Water Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'im-from-vitamin-tree-water-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25');
