(748, 'Derma V10 Aloe Vera Gel 75ml – Soothing ,Cooling,Moisturising For All Skin Types', '1', 0, 23, 223, '748', '748', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Soothe, hydrate, and refresh your skin with Derma VIO Aloe Vera Gel, a lightweight, non-sticky formula that absorbs quickly for instant cooling relief. Perfect for dry, rough, or sun-exposed skin, it leaves your skin soft, moisturised, and comfortable anytime you need it.\nHydrates & Moisturises: Aloe Vera from organic origin nourishes and softens skin.\nSoothes & Cools: Provides instant relief to sun-exposed or irritated skin.\nVersatile Use: Suitable for face and body, for daily hydration or after-sun care.\nApply liberally to clean skin on the face and body as often as needed. For external use only.\nAqua, Glycerin, Alcohol Denat, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Triethanolamine, Benzophenone-4, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Hexylglycerin, Parfum, Limonene, CI 47005, CI 61570.\nAvoid contact with eyes. If the product enters eyes, rinse thoroughly with water immediately.\nIn case of irritation, discontinue use.\nKeep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place.\nGentle enough for everyday use, Derma VIO Aloe Vera Gel is your go-to for soft, hydrated, and soothed skin.', 455.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 195.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Derma V10 Aloe Vera Gel 75ml – Soothing ,Cooling,Moisturising For All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Derma V10 Aloe Vera Gel 75ml – Soothing ,Cooling,Moisturising For All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'derma-v10-aloe-vera-gel-75ml-soothing-coolingmoisturising-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(749, 'Skin Cafe Pure & Natural Aloe Vera Gel 98% 240ml', '1', 0, 23, 224, '749', '749', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Cafe Pure & Natural 98% Aloe Vera Gel- this soothing gel is enriched with 98% natural aloe vera free from paraben, mineral oil, and artificial color.\n\n\nStops hair loss and helps hair growth\nThis aloe vera gel works well to stop hair loss and promote hair growth.\nNourishes the skin and protects skin from sunburn\nSkin Cafe 98% Pure & Natural Aloe Vera Gel nourishes your skin and protects your skin from sunburn.\n\n\nAloe Vera: The hydrating power of aloe vera, coupled with its soothing nature and antibacterial properties, can help calm the irritation, reduce scalp itchiness, and protect any open wounds from worsening.', 412.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 88.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe Pure & Natural Aloe Vera Gel 98% 240mlPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe Pure & Natural Aloe Vera Gel 98% 240ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-pure-natural-aloe-vera-gel-98-240ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
