(752, 'Reihaku Hatomugi UV Milky Gel SPF50+ PA++++ Pump 250ml', '1', 0, 23, 235, '752', '752', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reihaku Hatomugi UV Milky Gel SPF50+ PA++++ Pump 250ml\nProtect your skin from harmful UV rays while keeping it moisturized, bright, and blemish-free with the Reihaku Hatomugi UV Milky Gel SPF50+ PA++++. This high-protection sunscreen gel combines broad-spectrum SPF50+ PA++++ defense with the nourishing benefits of coix seed extract, squalane, and hyaluronic acid to maintain skin hydration, prevent pigmentation, and reduce the appearance of blemishes and pimples. Its lightweight, non-sticky milky texture makes it ideal for daily use and suitable for all skin types.\n\nKey Details:\n\nBenefits:\n\nWho is it for:Perfect for anyone seeking high-protection, moisturizing sunscreen that also improves skin brightness and helps prevent blemishes.\nUsage Direction:\nKey Ingredients:Water, Ethanol, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, BG, DPG, Dimethicone, Steareth-6, Octocrylene, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Carbomer, (Acrylates/Acrylic Acid Ester (C10-30)) Crosspolymer, Mineral Oil, Coix Seed Extract, Squalane, Sodium Hyaluronate, Xanthan Gum, EDTA-4Na, Sodium Hydroxide, TEA, BHT, Phenoxyethanol, Methylparaben, Fragrance\nCountry: Japan', 1945.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 255.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Reihaku Hatomugi UV Milky Gel SPF50+ PA++++ Pump 250mlPrice in BD', 'Reihaku Hatomugi UV Milky Gel SPF50+ PA++++ Pump 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'reihaku-hatomugi-uv-milky-gel-spf50-pa-pump-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(753, 'Dr Meinaier Moisturising Snail Aloe Vera Gel 99% 250ml', '1', 0, 23, 236, '753', '753', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dr Meinaier Moisturising Snail & Aloe Vera Gel 99% 250ml (Bangladesh)Dr Meinaier Moisturising Snail & Aloe Vera Gel is a high‑concentration hydrating gel formulated with 99% pure snail secretion filtrate and aloe vera to deeply nourish, soothe, and repair skin. This lightweight, non‑sticky gel provides intense moisture, supports skin renewal, and helps calm acne‑prone or sun‑stressed skin. Available at Arogga Bangladesh with guaranteed authenticity and the best price.\n\nKey Features:• 99% Snail & Aloe Vera Gel: High content for deep hydration and repair• Lightweight & Fast Absorbing: Non‑greasy texture ideal for daily use• Multi‑Purpose Gel: Hydrates, nourishes, and calms skin• Soothing Formula: Helps soothe irritation from sun exposure or breakouts• Large 250ml Size: Great for face and body use\n\nBenefits:• Provides deep and long‑lasting moisture• Helps repair skin and improve texture• Supports acne‑prone skin gently• Helps calm and soothe sun‑stressed skin• Leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and radiant\n\nIngredients:Snail Secretion Filtrate, Aloe Vera Extract, and other hydrating agents\n\nUsage Direction:After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to face or body. Gently massage until fully absorbed. Use daily, morning and night, or as needed for extra hydration or soothing care.', 1090.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '250ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr Meinaier Moisturising Snail Aloe Vera Gel 99% 250mlPrice in BD', 'Dr Meinaier Moisturising Snail Aloe Vera Gel 99% 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-meinaier-moisturising-snail-aloe-vera-gel-99-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(754, 'Medicube Collagen Jelly Cream', '1', 0, 23, 96, '754', '754', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Medicube Collagen Jelly Cream – Deep Hydration & Firming Care\nMedicube Collagen Jelly Cream is a revolutionary skincare solution designed to deeply hydrate, firm, and revitalize your skin. Infused with highly concentrated collagen peptides, this luxurious jelly-textured cream absorbs effortlessly, delivering intense moisture and improving skin elasticity. Get the best price from Arogga.\nEnriched with multi-peptide complexes, it works to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles while enhancing skin resilience. The unique jelly formula creates a refreshing, non-sticky finish, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nThis dermatologist-tested cream strengthens the skin barrier, locking in moisture for a plump, youthful glow. Regular use helps restore skin firmness, providing a lifting effect for a smoother complexion.\nPerfect for daily skincare routines, Medicube Collagen Jelly Cream is your go-to solution for hydrated, firmer, and more youthful-looking skin.\nDirection:\nApply an even layer to clean skin and gently pat for better absorption. Use morning and night for optimal results.\nExperience the power of collagen with Medicube Collagen Jelly Cream!', 2778.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '110ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 422.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube Collagen Jelly CreamPrice in BD', 'Medicube Collagen Jelly Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-collagen-jelly-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
