(756, 'Soap and Glory In the Bright of Day Vitamin C Gel Cream', '1', 0, 23, 164, '756', '756', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'To glow or not to glow, that is the question. But it’s a silly one. Of course, it’s to glow.  It’s not like us to be dramatic (ok, maybe it is) but it’s time to banish bored, lacklustre skin with our new, glorious In The Bright Of Day Vitamin C Gel Cream – a lightweight, hybrid gel cream that delivers marvellous moisture and a boost of brightness.  It’s jam-packed full of glow-getting goodies – such as vitamin C – for a complexion that looks ravishingly radiant, re-energised and down-right glorious.\nThis product is vegan.\n\nHow to Use:\nFor that little radiance pick-me-up, apply evenly to your face and neck every morning. Gently massage upwards in a circular motion – and voilà – you’re ready to glow!\n\nCautions & Warnings:\nTHIS IS NOT A FOOD. Keep out of the reach of children. Avoid contact with eyes. If product gets into the eyes rinse well with water immediately. Store in a cool, dry place. Avoid direct sunlight. Colour may vary due to natural ingredients\n\nIngredients:\nAqua (Water), Glycerin, Caprylic/capric triglyceride, Cetearyl alcohol,  Butyrospermum parkii (Shea) butter, Dimethicone, Polyacrylamide, Phenoxyethanol, Steareth-2, Steareth-21, C13-14 isoparaffin, Chlorphenesin, Ascorbyl tetraisopalmitate, Laureth-7, 3-O-Ethyl ascorbic acid, BHT, Sodium citrate, Limonene, Dipropylene glycol, Citric acid, Propylene glycol, Alcohol denat., Parfum (Fragrance), Benzotriazolyl dodecyl p-cresol, Linalool, Glycine soja (Soybean) oil, Lecithin, Alcohol, Tris(Tetramethylhydroxypiperidinol) citrate, Caprylyl glycol, Xanthan gum, Potassium sorbate, Ubiquinone, Carrageenan, CI 14700 (Red 4), CI 15985 (Yellow 6), CI 19140 (Yellow 5).\n\nMade in Thailand', 1515.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 885.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Soap and Glory In the Bright of Day Vitamin C Gel CreamPrice in BD', 'Soap and Glory In the Bright of Day Vitamin C Gel Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'soap-and-glory-in-the-bright-of-day-vitamin-c-gel-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(757, 'Sam Moist Restorative Moisturizing Body Lotion 500ml', '1', 0, 23, 59, '757', '757', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SAM Moist Restorative Moisturizing Body Lotion is a nourishing and hydrating body lotion specially formulated to restore, soothe, and protect dry, sensitive, or irritated skin. Enriched with Lactic Acid, Calamine, and Ceramides, this gentle, non-greasy lotion helps lock in moisture, improve skin texture, and relieve itchiness and discomfort. With up to 24 hours of hydration, it leaves your skin feeling soft, smooth, and resilient.\nSensitive skin\nNormal to dry skin\nDull or scaly skin\nLactic Acid\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells\nPromotes skin renewal for a smoother, healthier texture\nCalamine\nSoothes and calms irritated or itchy skin\nReduces discomfort caused by dryness, sun exposure, or environmental stressors\nCeramides\nStrengthen and restore the skin’s natural moisture barrier\nHelps lock in hydration for long-lasting softness and protection\nOther Hydrating Ingredients\nHyaluronic Acid and Propylene Glycol attract and retain moisture\nPetrolatum and Cetearyl Alcohol provide a protective, emollient layer\nApply SAM Moist Lotion generously to face, hands, feet, or body as needed.\nUse after bathing, showering, swimming, or sun exposure.\nReapply before exposure to wind, cold, or dry environments for optimal hydration and protection.\nFor external use only\nAvoid contact with eyes; rinse immediately if contact occurs\nKeep out of reach of children\nNet Volume: 500ml', 2065.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 734.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sam Moist Restorative Moisturizing Body Lotion 500mlPrice in BD', 'Sam Moist Restorative Moisturizing Body Lotion 500ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sam-moist-restorative-moisturizing-body-lotion-500ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
(758, 'Dot and Key 72hr Hydrating Gel Moisturizer with Probiotics', '1', 0, 23, 91, '758', '758', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key\'s 72HR Hydrating Gel Moisturizer is a lightweight, oil-free formula designed to provide intense hydration and restore balance to your skin. Infused with hyaluronic acid, probiotics, and Japanese rice water, this gel moisturizer delivers up to 72 hours of continuous hydration, leaving your skin plump, healthy, and glowing.\nDetails:\n\nHero Ingredients:\nFull Ingredients:Aqua, Cyclopentasiloxane, Cyclopentasiloxane (and) Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Glycerine, Xylitylglucoside (and) Anhydroxylitol (and) Xylitol, Divinyldimethicone/Dimethicone Copolymer (and) C12-13 Pareth-23 (and) C12-13 Pareth-3, Polyacrylamide (and) C13-14 Isoparaffin (and) Laureth-7, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Trideceth-10, Dimethylsilanol Hyaluronate, Silanetriol (and) Hyaluronic Acid, Caprylyl Methicone (and) PEG-12 Dimethicone/PPG-20 Crosspolymer, Methylsilanol Mannuronate, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Saccharide Isomerate (and) Citric Acid (and) Sodium Citrate, Laminaria Digitata Extract (and) Hydrogenated Lecithin (and) Cetyl-PG Hydroxyethyl Palmitamide (and) Ceramide 1, 2,3,4,6II (and) Cholesterol (and) 1,2-hexanediol, Disodium EDTA, Aqua (and) Glycerin (and) Trehalose (and) Urea (and) Serine (and) Pentylene Glycol (and) Glyceryl Polyacrylate (and) Algin (and) Caprylyl Glycol (and) Sodium Hyaluronate (and) Pullulan (and) Disodium Phosphate (and) Potassium Phosphate, Sodium Hydroxide, Lactococcus Ferment Lysate, Saccharomyces/Xylinum/Black Tea Ferment, Avena Sativa Kernel (Oat) Extract, Aqua (and) Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract (and) Saccharomyces ferment lysate filtrate (and) Citric acid (and) Sodium Benzoate (and) Potassium sorbate, Glycerin (and) Aqua (and) Vaccinium Angustifolium (Blueberry) Fruit Extract, Phenoxyethanol (and) Ethylhexylglycerin, Fragrance, CI 42090.\nBenefits:\nUsage:\nMade in India', 935.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 215.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key 72hr Hydrating Gel Moisturizer with ProbioticsPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key 72hr Hydrating Gel Moisturizer with Probiotics Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-72hr-hydrating-gel-moisturizer-with-probiotics', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:25', '2026-02-11 08:14:25'),
