(765, 'Minimalist 10% Vitamin B5 Lightweight & Oil Free Face Moisturizer for Oily & Combination Skin', '1', 0, 23, 32, '765', '765', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For Oily & Combination Skin – Hydrate, Repair & Refresh Without the Grease\nDiscover the perfect balance of deep hydration and a feather-light finish with Minimalist 10% Vitamin B5 Moisturizer. Specially designed for oily and combination skin, this oil-free daily moisturizer quenches thirsty skin, repairs its natural barrier, and controls excess shine—without clogging pores or leaving a heavy feel.\nPowered by 10% Vitamin B5 (Panthenol), it soothes irritation, strengthens skin resilience, and prevents water loss for long-lasting comfort. A trio of essential minerals—Zinc, Copper, and Magnesium—works as a potent antioxidant shield, protecting against environmental stress and promoting clear, balanced skin. Hyaluronic Acid and Betaine deliver multi-depth hydration, leaving your skin plump, smooth, and refreshed all day.\nUse after cleansing, toning and applying all serums. Take sufficient quantity of product and massage into face and neck until it is fully absorbed.When to use: When to use: AM & PM. Everyday.\nWater (Aqua), Panthenol, Cyclopentasiloxane, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Glycerin, Xylitylglucoside, Anhydroxylitol, Xylitol, PEG/PPG-18/18 Dimethicone, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Magnesium Aspartate, Zinc Gluconate, Copper Gluconate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Betaine, Phenoxyethanol, Pentylene Glycol, Allantoin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Carbomer, Magnesium Sulfate Heptahydrate, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer.\nCountry of Origin: India', 960.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 210.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist 10% Vitamin B5 Lightweight & Oil Free Face Moisturizer for Oily & Combination SkinPrice in BD', 'Minimalist 10% Vitamin B5 Lightweight & Oil Free Face Moisturizer for Oily & Combination Sk