(777, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Night Cream', '1', 0, 24, 110, '777', '777', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skin with L\'Oréal Paris® Revitalift Hydrating Night Cream. This powerful formula contains Advanced Pro-Retino and Fibrelastyl to fight signs of aging, improve skin elasticity, and promote a more youthful, firm, and smooth complexion. With regular use, Revitalift Night Cream helps to stimulate skin cell regeneration for a more youthful and wrinkle-free appearance.\n\nApply every evening on a perfectly cleansed face and neck using circular motions.\nPlease be aware that ingredient lists for the products of our brand are updated regularly. Please refer to the ingredient list on your product package for the most up to date list of ingredients to ensure it is suitable to your personal use.782389 14 - Ingredients: Aqua / Water, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Cetyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Peg-40 Stearate, Prunus Armeniaca Kernel Oil / Apricot Kernel Oil, Horea Robusta Butter / Shorea Robusta Seed Butter, Paraffinum Liquidum / Mineral Oil, Paraffin, Zea Mays Extract / Corn Kernel Extract, Stearic Acid, Stearyl Alcohol, Cera Microcristallina / Microcrystalline Wax, Sorbitan Tristearate, Glycine Soja Protein / Soybean Protein, Triethanolamine, Isohexadecane, Salicyloyl Phytosphingosine, Myristyl Alcohol, Palmitic Acid, Phenethyl Alcohol, Hydrolyzed Soy Protein, Caprylyl Glycol, Acetyl Trifluoromethylphenyl Valylglycine, Faex Extract / Yeast Extract, Polysorbate 80, Acrylamide/Sodium Acryloyldimethyltaurate Copolymer, Retinyl Palmitate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate, Phenoxyethanol, Linalool, Geraniol, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Amyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Citral, Citronellol, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Hexyl Cinnamal, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Benzoate, Benzyl Cinnamate, Benzyl Salicylate, Parfum / Fragrance. (F.I.L. B174075/1).\n\nMade In Germany', 2094.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 994.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Night CreamPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Multi Lift Anti-Wrinkle + Extra Firming Hydrating Night Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-multi-lift-anti-wrinkle-extra-firming-hydrating-night-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(778, 'Loreal Paris Innovation Glycolic Bright Glowing Night Cream', '1', 0, 24, 110, '778', '778', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Get glowing skin, while you get your beauty sleep, with the L\'Oréal Paris Glycolic Bright Glowing Night Cream. This skin brightening night cream is enriched with glycolic acid and vitamin E. The formulation of the cream has encapsulated beads, which help fight dullness and give you visibly brighter and glowing skin.\nThe L\'Oréal Glycolic Bright night cream gives you nourished and glowing skin. It effectively repairs the skin barrier and reduces the appearance of hyperpigmentation, making it one of the best night creams for dark spots. Powered with glycolic acid, this AHA penetrates deep into the skin to brighten it from the inside. Glycolic acid also accelerates skin renewal and removes melanin to reveal even-toned skin. It also has vitamin E that has antioxidant properties to repair your skin and reduce dullness. This night cream for glowing skin will leave you with well-hydrated and brighter face.\n\nBenefits:\nDeeply nourishes the skin overnight.Glycolic acid brightens skin and reduces dark spots.Enriched with vitamin E that repairs the skin.\n\nHow to Use:\nGently massage some night cream on your face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\n\nMade in Indonesia', 1499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 501.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Innovation Glycolic Bright Glowing Night CreamPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Innovation Glycolic Bright Glowing Night Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-innovation-glycolic-bright-glowing-night-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26');
