(779, 'Olay Anti Wrinkle Firm & Lift Night Cream for Normal / Dry Skin', '1', 0, 24, 58, '779', '779', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Olay Anti-Wrinkle Firm & Lift Night Cream helps to visibly reduce fine lines and wrinkles and fights the visible signs of ageing.\nIt provides you with all-night moisture to help boost skin firmness, for skin that appears renewed and re-energised with improved radiance, for noticeable results week by week. Designed with SKIN RENEWAL COMPLEX, including Vitamin B3, it activates surface cell renewal to improve skin\'s smoothness. The formula is designed to help skin recover from moisture loss during the day, with a rich and nourishing feel.\nBenefits:\nHelps to visibly reduce fine lines and wrinkles\nFights against the visible signs of ageing\nAll-night moisture to help boost skin firmness\nSkin appears renewed and re-energised with improved radiance\nDesigned with SKIN RENEWAL COMPLEX, including Vitamin B3\nRich and nourishing formula\nFormulated to help skin recover from moisture loss during the day\nActivates surface cell renewal to improve skin\'s smoothness\nAqua, Glycerin, Isohexadecane, Niacinamide, Dimethicone, Isopropyl Isostearate, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Stearyl Alcohol, Panthenol, Dimethiconol, Caprylyl Glycol, Polysorbate 60, Cetearyl Glucoside, Cetearyl Alcohol, Sorbitan Isostearate, Stearic Acid, Palmitic Acid, Cetyl Alcohol, Behenyl Alcohol, Arachidyl Alcohol, Disodium EDTA, PEG-100 Stearate, 1.2-Hexanediol, Phenoxyethanol, Parfum, Hexyl Cinnamal, Linalool, Hydroxycitronellal, Limonene, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Citronellol, Geraniol, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Benzoate\nUsage: Use in the evening. Smooth evenly over cleansed face.', 1031.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 468.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Anti Wrinkle Firm & Lift Night Cream for Normal / Dry SkinPrice in BD', 'Olay Anti Wrinkle Firm & Lift Night Cream for Normal / Dry Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-anti-wrinkle-firm-lift-night-cream-for-normal-dry-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(780, 'Himalaya Revitalizing Night Cream 50g', '1', 0, 24, 10, '780', '780', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Himalaya\'s Revitalizing Night Cream is a luxurious cream that works overnight with the natural renewal cycle of your skin. The cream provides three essential benefits so that you wake up to soft, supple and rejuvenated skin.\n\nFeatures:\n\n\nWater, caprylic/capric triglyceride, isopropyl myristate, glyceryl stearate SE, ricinus communis (castor) seed oil, hydrogenated castor oil, phenoxyethanol, ethylhexylglycerin, cetearyl alcohol, cetyl alcohol, sorbitan stearate, sucrose cocoate, glycerin, sodium cetearyl sulfate, fragrance, lilium candidum bulb extract, dimethicone, sodium benzoate, carbomer, pyrus malus (apple) fruit extract, triticum vulgare (wheat) germ oil, tocopheryl acetate, citrus grandis (grapefruit) fruit extract, citrus limon (lemon) fruit extract, solanum lycopersicum (tomato) fruit/leaf/stem extract, vaccinium myrtillus fruit/leaf extract, disodium edta, sodium hydroxide.\nFree from: Alcohol and parabens.\n\nCountry of Origin: India', 550.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Himalaya Revitalizing Night Cream 50gPrice in BD', 'Himalaya Revitalizing Night Cream 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'himalaya-revitalizing-night-cream-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(781, 'Olay Retinol 24 Night Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 24, 58, '781', '781', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 2745.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1255.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Retinol 24 Night Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Olay Retinol 24 Night Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-retinol-24-night-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(782, 'Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Night Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 24, 226, '782', '782', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Night Cream is an affordable skincare product designed to address signs of aging, such as fine lines and wrinkles. Formulated with Coenzyme Q10 (CoQ10), Retinol, and Vitamin E, this night cream aims to rejuvenate the skin overnight, leaving it feeling soft and appearing more youthful.\nCoenzyme Q10 (Ubiquinone): An antioxidant that helps neutralize free radicals, potentially reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nRetinol: A form of Vitamin A that promotes skin cell turnover, aiding in the reduction of fine lines and improving skin texture.\nVitamin E (Tocopheryl Acetate): An antioxidant that helps protect the skin from environmental stressors and supports skin health.\nPanthenol (Provitamin B5): Moisturizes and soothes the skin, maintaining hydration.\nGlycerin: A humectant that draws moisture into the skin, keeping it hydrated.\nSodium Hyaluronate: A form of hyaluronic acid that attracts moisture to the skin.\nDimethicone: Forms a barrier on the skin to prevent moisture loss.\nCetearyl Alcohol & Cetearyl Glucoside: Emulsifiers that help blend the cream\'s ingredients together for a smooth texture.\nCaprylic/Capric Triglyceride: Softens and smooths the skin.\nDicaprylyl Carbonate: Provides a silky feel and enhances spreadability.\nEthylhexyl Stearate: Imparts a smooth, non-greasy feel.\nPhospholipids: Maintain the skin\'s natural barrier and improve hydration.\nGlyceryl Stearate & Glyceryl Stearate Citrate: Stabilize the cream\'s formulation.\nRetinyl Palmitate: Supports skin health and appearance.\nChondrus Crispus (Carrageenan) Extract: Thickening agent to stabilize texture.\nGlycine Soja (Soybean) Oil & Germ Extract: Provide moisturizing and antioxidant benefits.\nPersea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil Unsaponifiables: Moisturizing properties.\nCarthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Seed Oil: Softens and smooths the skin.\nLinoleic Acid & Linolenic Acid: Support the skin\'s barrier and hydration.\nLecithin: Maintains the skin barrier and improves hydration.\nGlyceryl Oleate: Emulsifier to blend ingredients together.\nCitric Acid: pH adjuster.\nPreservatives (Phenoxyethanol, Benzoic Acid, Dehydroacetic Acid): Prevent microbial growth and extend shelf life.\nSuitable for all skin types; dermatologically tested.\nFragrance-free to minimize irritation risk.\nNon-greasy formula that absorbs quickly.\nAffordable anti-aging solution.\nCleanse: Wash your face with a gentle cleanser.\nApply: Dispense a small amount onto your fingertips.\nMassage: Gently massage the cream into your face and neck in upward motions.\nLeave On: Allow the cream to absorb fully overnight.', 1200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 180.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Night Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Lacura Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Night Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lacura-q10-anti-wrinkle-night-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(783, 'Cetaphil Healthy Radiance Brightening Night Comfort Cream', '1', 0, 24, 63, '783', '783', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cetaphil Healthy Radiance Brightening Night Comfort Cream\nCetaphil Healthy Radiance Brightening Night Comfort Cream is a dermatologist-developed night cream designed to visibly reduce dark spots, even skin tone, and restore a radiant complexion while respecting sensitive skin. Powered by Gentle Bright Technology, it combines Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Hyaluronic Acid, and Natural Sea Daffodil Extract to hydrate, brighten, and rejuvenate skin overnight. The hypoallergenic, fragrance-free, and non-greasy formula comforts dry and sensitive skin, helping you wake up with luminous, even-toned skin every morning.\n\nBenefits:• Reduces Dark Spots & Evens Skin Tone – Niacinamide and Sea Daffodil Extract visibly correct dark spots and balance skin tone in 4 weeks.• Radiant, Glowing Skin – Enhances skin luminosity while you sleep, revealing brighter skin in the morning.• Deep Hydration – Hyaluronic Acid and other moisturizers provide all-night hydration and comfort.• Gentle on Sensitive Skin – Dermatologist-developed, hypoallergenic, fragrance-free, and non-greasy.• Strengthens Skin Barrier – Gradually improves skin texture, reduces dryness, tightness, and irritation.\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply a small amount to face and neck in an upward circular motion.\nFocus on areas with dark spots or uneven tone, such as the brow and jawline.\nUse nightly for best results. Combine with a brightening day cream for optimal day-to-night care.\n\nKey Ingredients:Aqua, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, Hydrogenated Polydecene, 1,2-Hexanediol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cetearyl Olivate, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Sorbitan Olivate, Beeswax, Vinyl Dimethicone, Anhydroxylitol, Citric Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glyceryl Stearate, Hyaluronic Acid, Hydrolyzed Cicer Seed Extract, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Pancratium Maritimum Extract (Sea Daffodil), Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopherol, Tricholoma Matsutake Extract.\n\nCountry of Origin: Korea\nThis night cream is ideal for anyone seeking brightened, hydrated, and even-toned skin while maintaining gentle care for sensitive skin.', 2175.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1175.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Healthy Radiance Brightening Night Comfort CreamPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Healthy Radiance Brightening Night Comfort Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-healthy-radiance-brightening-night-comfort-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(784, 'Lotus Herbals YouthRx Anti Ageing Nourishing Night Cream', '1', 0, 24, 20, '784', '784', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Lotus Herbals YouthRX Anti-Ageing Nourishing Night Cream is a testament to a revolutionary development in ‘Green Science’. It comes with the Gineplex Youth Compound derived from potent natural ingredients and is clinically proven to accelerate the process of skin lifting, firming and protective skin action.\nIn addition, the Nourishing Night Creme hydrates your skin throughout the night so that you wake up to optimally hydrated and dewy skin. The Night Cream is infused with Natural ingredients like Ginger & Ginseng that help prevent free radical damage & slow skin ageing.\nHow to use:', 1250.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1250.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lotus Herbals YouthRx Anti Ageing Nourishing Night CreamPrice in BD', 'Lotus Herbals YouthRx Anti Ageing Nourishing Night Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lotus-herbals-youthrx-anti-ageing-nourishing-night-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(785, 'Skin Cafe Night Repairing Cream With Collagen 50g', '1', 0, 24, 224, '785', '785', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Cafe Night Repairing Cream is a collagen-enriched night treatment designed to rejuvenate and restore your skin while you sleep. Formulated with a blend of nourishing ingredients, this cream targets signs of aging, uneven skin tone, and dehydration, promoting a smoother, firmer, and more radiant complexion by morning.\nKey Features\nBenefits\nUsage Instructions\nKey Ingredients\nStorage and Caution', 386.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 104.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe Night Repairing Cream With Collagen 50gPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe Night Repairing Cream With Collagen 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-night-repairing-cream-with-collagen-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(786, 'Melao Organic Shea Butter & Retinol Night Cream Moisturizer - 50ml', '1', 0, 24, 30, '786', '786', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Melao Organic Shea Butter & Retinol Night Cream Moisturizer – 50ml\nWake up to refreshed, youthful skin with Melao Organic Shea Butter & Retinol Night Cream—a powerful yet gentle anti-aging moisturizer designed to work its magic while you sleep.\n🌙 Deep Repair & HydrationInfused with Shea Butter and 5 major skin-rejuvenating ingredients, this night cream moisturizes, nourishes, and repairs damaged tissue, restoring your skin to a healthy, radiant state.\n✨ Anti-Aging & Wrinkle ReductionFormulated with Retinol and Carnosine, this cream helps to:✔ Smooth fine lines & wrinkles✔ Boost collagen production✔ Regenerate skin cells✔ Strengthen the skin’s protective barrier\n🌿 Nourishing & Restorative Formula💧 Shea Butter – Deeply hydrates and soothes💧 Retinol – Supports skin renewal and reduces signs of aging💧 Carnosine – Protects against environmental damage and promotes skin elasticity💧 Essential Nutrients – Help to rebuild and reinforce the skin’s barrier function\n🌟 Wake Up to Glowing, Rejuvenated Skin!This luxurious night cream delivers intense hydration and nourishment so you wake up with moisturized, refreshed, and glowing skin every morning.\n💡 How to Use:Apply a small amount to clean skin before bedtime. Massage gently until fully absorbed.\nLet Melao Organic Shea Butter & Retinol Night Cream transform your nighttime skincare routine—because your skin deserves the best while you rest! ✨', 743.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 307.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao Organic Shea Butter & Retinol Night Cream Moisturizer - 50mlPrice in BD', 'Melao Organic Shea Butter & Retinol Night Cream Moisturizer - 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-organic-shea-butter-retinol-night-cream-moisturizer-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(787, 'Dr. Rashel White Skin Fade Spots Night Cream With Arbutin Niacinamide 50gm', '1', 0, 24, 233, '787', '787', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brand: Dr. Rashel\nProduct Name: White Skin Fade Spots Night Cream\nSize: 50 g\nType: Night cream\nPurpose: Targets dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone during the night.\nSkin Type: Suitable for all skin types.\nArbutin: A skin-brightening agent that inhibits melanin production, helping to reduce dark spots and even out skin tone.\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): Known for its anti-inflammatory properties, niacinamide helps to improve skin elasticity, enhance the skin barrier function, even out skin tone, and diminish dullness.\nGlycerin: A humectant that draws moisture into the skin, keeping it hydrated and soft.\nSodium Hyaluronate: A form of hyaluronic acid that penetrates the skin more effectively, providing deep hydration and plumping the skin.\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Known for its healing properties, it soothes and repairs the skin, promoting collagen production.\nLicorice Root Extract: Offers skin-brightening benefits and helps to reduce pigmentation.\nShea Butter: An emollient that moisturizes and nourishes the skin, leaving it soft and smooth.\nAllantoin: Soothes and protects the skin, promoting wound healing.\nPanthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5): Moisturizes, softens, and heals the skin.\nTocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E): An antioxidant that helps to protect the skin from damage by free radicals.\nChamomile Extract: Soothes and calms the skin, reducing redness and irritation.\nRosemary Extract: Offers antioxidant properties and helps to tone and tighten the skin.\nXanthan Gum: A natural thickening agent that stabilizes the formula.\nEthylhexylglycerin: A skin-conditioning agent and preservative.\nPhenoxyethanol: A preservative that prevents microbial growth.\nBrightens Skin: Regular use can lead to a more radiant and even skin tone.\nReduces Dark Spots: Targets hyperpigmentation and dark spots, helping to fade them over time.\nHydrates Skin: Provides deep moisture, keeping the skin soft and supple.\nSoothes and Repairs: Ingredients like Centella Asiatica and Chamomile Extract help to calm and repair the skin.\nImproves Skin Texture: Enhances the overall texture of the skin, making it smoother and more refined.\nCleanse: Wash your face with a gentle cleanser to remove impurities.\nApply: Take a small amount of the night cream and apply it evenly to your face and neck.\nMassage: Gently massage in upward circular motions until fully absorbed.\nLeave Overnight: Allow the cream to work overnight.\nUse Regularly: For best results, use every night before bedtime.\nPatch Test: Always perform a patch test before using any new skincare product to ensure you don\'t have an allergic reaction.\nSun Protection: While this is a night cream, it\'s essential to use sunscreen during the day, as some ingredients can make the skin more sensitive to sunlight.\nConsistency: Results may vary, and consistent use over several weeks is often necessary to see noticeable improvements.', 552.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 98.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr. Rashel White Skin Fade Spots Night Cream With Arbutin Niacinamide 50gmPrice in BD', 'Dr. Rashel White Skin Fade Spots Night Cream With Arbutin Niacinamide 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-rashel-white-skin-fade-spots-night-cream-with-arbutin-niacinamide-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
