(789, 'Chane Arbutin Whitening and Anti Melasma Night Cream (20 gm)', '1', 0, 24, 241, '789', '789', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Repairing • Brightening • Overnight Skin RenewalProduct of Thailand\nChane Arbutin Whitening & Anti-Melasma Night Cream is an intensive overnight repairing formula designed to target melasma, freckles, dark spots, blemishes, and dull skin. Powered by Alpha Arbutin, Tranexamic Acid, Vitamin C, Collagen, and Hyaluronic Acid, this night cream works while you sleep to restore skin clarity, hydration, and youthful radiance.\nWith regular use, skin appears brighter, smoother, firmer, and more even-toned.\nReduces melasma, freckles, dark spots, and pigmentation\nHelps inhibit melanin production for brighter skin\nDeeply hydrates and locks in moisture overnight\nRepairs dull, damaged, and uneven skin tone\nBoosts collagen and improves skin elasticity\nSmooths fine lines and wrinkles\nSoothes irritated skin and reduces redness\nLeaves skin soft, plump, radiant, and youthful\nAlpha Arbutin – Helps inhibit melanin production, fades dark spots, and brightens skin tone\nTranexamic Acid (TXA) – Targets stubborn melasma and pigmentation effectively\nVitamin C (Ascorbic Acid) – Antioxidant that boosts collagen and improves radiance\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3) – Strengthens skin barrier, balances oil, and improves texture\nCollagen – Enhances skin firmness and elasticity\nHyaluronic Acid – Deep hydration without greasiness, keeps skin plump\nAloe Vera Extract – Calms, soothes, and repairs sun-damaged skin\nVitamin E – Protects skin from free radicals and premature aging\nApply a small amount evenly to the face and neck every night after cleansing.Gently massage until fully absorbed.Use consistently for best results.\nWater, Disodium EDTA, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Cetyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-75 Stearate, Ceteth-20, Steareth-20, PEG-100, Glyceryl Stearate SE, Isopropyl Myristate, Dimethicone, Cyclopentasiloxane,