(796, 'Boots Tea Tree & Witch Hazel Overnight Sleep Mask, Night Care 70mL', '1', 0, 24, 11, '796', '796', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product DescriptionLet this overnight sleep mask work while you rest. Infused with calming witch hazel and purifying tea tree oil, this Boots formulation is designed for overnight use to help restore balance to oily or combination skin. As you sleep, the mask gels into your skin to provide hydration, clarify, and soothe, leaving your skin looking refreshed, clear, and nourished by morning.\nKey Features & Benefits\nTea Tree + Witch Hazel Synergy: Tea tree oil is known for its antimicrobial properties, while witch hazel helps soothe and tone the skin.\nOvernight Treatment: Works while you sleep—no rinsing needed until morning.\nRebalances Oily/Combination Skin: Helps regulate excess oil production with continued use.\nBoosts Hydration: Supports moisture retention so skin doesn’t feel tight.\nSkin Looks Balanced & Rested: Leaves skin with a more even, calm appearance.\nHow to Use\nCleanse the skin thoroughly before application.\nSmooth a thin layer of the mask across the face (avoiding eye area) using clean fingers or a spatula.\nMassage in gently until absorbed.\nLeave overnight.\nRinse off in the morning as part of your regular routine.\nFor best results, use at least twice a week (or more often if your skin tolerates it).\nCautions & Notes\nAvoid contact with eyes. If the product enters the eyes, rinse immediately with plenty of water.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nPerform a patch test first, especially if you have sensitive skin or are new to tea tree oil.\nTypical IngredientsHere are some of the main ingredients included in the Boots 50 mL version (likely similar in 70 mL version):\nAqua (Water)\nPropylene Glycol\nCetyl Alcohol, Dimethicone\nC12‑15 Alkyl Benzoate\nGlycerin\nPolysorbate 60, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG‑100 Stearate\nHamamelis virginiana (Witch Hazel) Water\nMelaleuca alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil\nNiacinamide\nSodium Hyaluronate\nOther supporting ingredients (carbomer, phenoxyethanol, parfum, etc.)', 1122.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 843.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Tea Tree & Witch Hazel Overnight Sleep Mask, Night Care 70mLPrice in BD', 'Boots Tea Tree & Witch Hazel Overnight Sleep Mask, Night Care 70mL Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-tea-tree-witch-hazel-overnight-sleep-mask-night-care-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
