(798, 'Olay Total Effects 7 in One Night Moisturiser with Vitamin C & B3 37ml', '1', 0, 24, 58, '798', '798', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Olay Total Effects Night Firming Cream is formulated with a vitamin-rich complex designed to fight seven visible signs of aging in one easy step. Infused with VitaNiacin Complex—combining vitamins B3, C, and E—this night cream works overnight to replenish moisture, restore firmness, and smooth fine lines and wrinkles.\nDeeply hydrates skin, preventing dryness while boosting suppleness.\nVisibly firms and tightens skin texture for a youthful look.\nSmooths fine lines and wrinkles, minimizing their appearance.\nEvens out skin tone for a radiant and balanced complexion.\nReduces the look of pores, refining skin surface.\nBrightens skin, enhancing natural glow.\nHelps fade dark spots, promoting clarity and luminosity.\nRich yet fast-absorbing formula that nourishes skin throughout the night.\nSupports the skin’s natural self-renewal process with gentle exfoliation.\nDesigned to be applied after cleansing as skin loses more moisture overnight.\nClinically tested for safety and effectiveness.\nSuitable for daily use to reveal firmer, healthier skin each morning.\nKey ingredients include Aqua, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Dimethicone, Panthenol, Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate (Vitamin C), various moisturizers, and skin conditioners.\nAfter cleansing your face and neck, apply a smooth, even layer of Olay Total Effects Night Moisturiser. Use nightly allowing the formula to work while you sleep. For best results, pair with Olay Total Effects Day Moisturiser with SPF.\nExperience an all-in-one anti-aging solution with Olay Total Effects 7 in One Night Moisturiser, designed to rejuvenate your skin overnight and help you wake up to a visibly firmer, radiant complexion.', 1475.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 525.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Total Effects 7 in One Night Moisturiser with Vitamin C & B3 37mlPrice in BD', 'Olay Total Effects 7 in One Night Moisturiser with Vitamin C & B3 37ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-total-effects-7-in-one-night-moisturiser-with-vitamin-c-b3-37ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(799, 'Fade Out Collagen Boost Whitening Night Cream with Pro-Collagen & Niacinamide 50ml', '1', 0, 24, 154, '799', '799', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Formulated to brighten skin tone and address pigmentation, our peptide-rich cream helps stimulate the skin’s own collagen production to plump and firm the skin.Our boosting formula features Pro-Coll-One+®, a plant-based peptide, that helps increase collagen synthesis whilst plumping and hydrating the skin. Naturally occurring AHA’s deliver a mild exfoliating action to help minimize the appearance of pigmentation and fine lines, whilst Antioxidants including Rosehip Seed Oil (a source of Vitamin A), Sacha Inchi Oil (Omega 3) and Sodium Lactate work with the skin’s overnight renewal process to replenish, revitalize and restore an even skin tone.\nSkin Concern:Particularly suitable for premature aging concerns including skin laxity, uneven skin tone, fine lines, and reduced radiance.Result:A Peptide-rich formula with added fatty acids to increase collagen synthesis and nourish at nightImproved elasticity, structural support and plumpnessReduces pigmentation and fine linesHow to UseUse as part of an evening routine after cleansing and optional use of serums. Apply a thin, even layer over the face, paying attention to areas of pigmentation concern. Can additionally be used on the neck and décolletage.Key Ingredients:PRO COL 1+ 2.0%Formulated from soya, these plant-based peptides help increase collagen synthesis to improve skin laxity and firmness.NIACINAMIDE 5.0% (VITAMIN B3)A superlative skin improver that reduces inflammation and environmental stresses, whilst tackling pigmentation and minimizing pores.LACTIC ACID 2.8%Naturally occurring AHA that speeds up cell turnover, as well stimulating cell renewal to improve skin texture and fade hyperpigmentation.ROSEHIP SEED OIL 0.3%Rich in essential fatty acids, this natural oil helps to protect, hydrate and nourish the skin, whilst restoring natural suppleness and elasticity for a smoother complexion.Detailed Ingredients:\nAqua, Octocrylene, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Sodium Lactate, Butyl methoxydibenzoylmethane, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Niacinamide, Glycerin, Stearyl Alcohol, Lactic Acid, Hexylene Glycol, Titanium Dioxide (Nano), Dimethicone, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Ceteareth-20, Phenoxyethanol, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Sucrose Palmitate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Parfum, Sodium Saccharin, Silica, VP/Eicosene Copolymer, Glyceryl Linoleate, Disodium EDTA, Panthenol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Potassium Sorbate, Citric Acid, BHT, Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract, Morus Alba Bark Extract, Cucumis Sativus Seed Extract, Sodium Benzoate, Hexyl Cinnamal, Linalool, Citronellol, Limonene, Eugenol.\nCountry of Origin: UK', 1068.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 62.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fade Out Collagen Boost Whitening Night Cream with Pro-Collagen & Niacinamide 50mlPrice in BD', 'Fade Out Collagen Boost Whitening Night Cream with Pro-Collagen & Niacinamide 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fade-out-collagen-boost-whitening-night-cream-with-pro-collagen-niacinamide-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
