(801, 'Dot and Key Retinol + Ceramide Night Repair Cream', '1', 0, 24, 91, '801', '801', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reduces Fine Lines and Wrinkles: Retinol in our night cream has been clinically proven to effectively smooth fine lines and wrinkles. It not only reduces the appearance of aging signs but also boosts collagen production and enhances skin elasticity for visibly firmer and youthful-looking skin.Boosts Collagen and Firms Skin: Infused with Ceramide, our night cream locks in moisture, prevents further dryness and improves the skin barrier. Your skin appears supple and plump over time. Enjoy the added benefits of improved skin firmness and resilience.Youthful & Radiant Skin: Enriched with the antioxidant-rich superfruit Pomegranate, our night cream give your skin a youthful radiance. Being a potent ingredient it helps combat free radicals and promotes glowing and radiant skin.Clean Formulations, Cleaner Ingredients: Our ingredients are derived naturally and we ensure that our products are Sulphate Free, Mineral-Oil Free, Essential Oil Free, Paraben Free, Cruelty-Free,GMO-Free.', 450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 60.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Retinol + Ceramide Night Repair CreamPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Retinol + Ceramide Night Repair Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-retinol-ceramide-night-repair-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
