(803, 'Cerave PM Facial Moisturising Lotion for Normal to Dry Skin 52ml', '1', 0, 24, 153, '803', '803', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PM Facial Moisturizing LotionLightweight, Oil-Free Night Cream Oil Free\nNight cream with niacinamide\nYour skin needs moisture around the clock, but it may need other things too—like soothing. With a night cream containing niacinamide, which can help calm the skin while you sleep, plus hyaluronic acid and ceramides, you can help your skin hold on to moisture and restore the skin\'s barrier all while you sleep. We recommend a non-comedogenic nighttime moisturizer like CeraVe PM Facial Moisturizing Lotion, which is formulated with all three of these ingredients and won’t clog pores or cause acne flare-ups.\nCreated with dermatologists, CeraVe PM Facial Moisturizer features three essential ceramides, hyaluronic acid and niacinamide in an oil-free, non-comedogenic formula that can hydrate and calm the skin while helping to restore the skin’s natural barrier. This rich, yet lightweight night cream uses our patented MVE Delivery Technology to deliver a steady stream of much-needed moisture throughout the night. Suitable for normal to dry skin.\nIngredients:Aqua / Water / Eau, Glycerin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Niacinamide, Cetearyl Alcohol, Potassium Phosphate, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Carbomer, Dimethicone, Ceteareth-20, Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Cholesterol, Phenoxyethanol, Disodium Edta, Dipotassium Phosphate, Caprylyl Glycol, Phytosphingosine, Xanthan Gum, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Ethylhexylglycerin\nProduct Benefits:\nHow to use:\nProduct Details:', 1829.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 801.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave PM Facial Moisturising Lotion for Normal to Dry Skin 52mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave PM Facial Moisturising Lotion for Normal to Dry Skin 52ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-pm-facial-moisturising-lotion-for-normal-to-dry-skin-52ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(804, 'Bio Balance Facial Whitening Night Cream 55ml', '1', 0, 24, 42, '804', '804', NULL, NULL, NULL, '55mlDERMATOLOGICALLY TESTED\nOvernight whitening\nWhitens and deeply detoxifies skin overnight\n​\nThis antioxidant, anti-pollution night-time whitening reduces age spots, sun spots, or any kind of skin discolorations for an overall fairer and whiter complexion.\n\nAntioxidant & Anti-pollution Inositol and Five-Plant Extracts deeply detoxify the skin and accelerate the night-time cell regeneration process for a radiant and even complexion upon waking.\n​\nWhitens\n​\nNiacinamide by inhibiting the transfer of the melanosomes to the surrounding keratinocytes up to 68% helps to reduce the dark spots and skin discolorations.\n\nVitamin C (Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate) acts on the melanin formation process to prevent hyperpigmentation and senile keratosis.\n\nLicorice root extract is able to inhibit tyrosinase act by modifying the action site of the enzyme, thus reducing its activity.\n​\nRejuvenates\n​\nFive-Plant Extracts: Bilberries, sugar cane, sugar maple, lemon, and orange extract, rich in alpha hydroxy acids (AHA’s), accelerate the skin’s natural renewal process to get rid of dead skin cells that dull the complexion.\n\nAntioxidant\n​\nInositol deeply detoxifies the skin, increases its density, and helps reduce the harmful effects of UV rays and daytime oxidative stress factors.\n​\nVitamin E is an important antioxidant that protects the skin from various harmful effects of the sun by acting as a free-radical scavenger.\n​\nSoothes\n​\nAllantoin increases cell renewal reduces skin irritations transepidermal water loss (TEWL).\n​\nMoisturizes\n​\nPanthenol quickly and deeply moisturizes skin and has a significant effect on skin barrier function by decreasing TEWL values.​\nDirections\n​\nAfter cleansing, gently massage evenly all over your face and neck. Regular application is recommended to naturally fade away the appearance of dark spots and to obtain an even complexion. For best results, use in combination with Bio Balance Discoloration Free Lumiskin 4% Super Serum and Bio Balance Facial Whitening Cream SPF 30.\n\nAlways apply sunscreen on the skin when it is exposed to the sun to prevent further darkening of existing spots and to lessen the probability of having discolorations in the future. Re-apply it every two hours.\n\nSuitable for all skin types including dry, dehydrated, and oily skin due to its lightweight fast-absorbing texture.\n\n\nPharmacist Insight\nPharmacist Kenan ALPAY\n\n\nRegardless of what caused uneven skin tone, the slightest bit of sun exposure can trigger the skin to start melanin production. That’s why protecting the skin from the sun is a determinative factor to see quick results.\n\nThe cause of the discoloration should be stopped if it is possible. Bio Balance Facial Whitening Night cream should be used regularly.​\n\nUsing sunscreen on the area during and after treatment is a must to suppress the pigment from coming back out. During the daytime use Sunspot Even Tone Aqua Fusion SPF 50+ or Sun Protection Facial Cream SPF 50+ and re-apply it often if the affected area is going to be exposed to UV rays for a long time or after towel-drying, swimming, or extensive perspiration.', 1890.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bio Balance Facial Whitening Night Cream 55mlPrice in BD', 'Bio Balance Facial Whitening Night Cream 55ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bio-balance-facial-whitening-night-cream-55ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(805, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Night Cream with Gotu Kola for Skin Illumination', '1', 0, 24, 3, '805', '805', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Crafted with the natural goodness of Vitamin C and Gotu Kola, Mamaearth Vitamin C Night Cream is lightweight, reduces spots, and helps replenish lost radiance. Mamaearth Vitamin C Night Cream helps enhance the skin barrier and gives firm and healthy skin. The night cream will work while you sleep, keeping your skin moisturized throughout the night and helping you regain your natural youthful glow. And because of our no toxins, no harmful chemicals philosophy, you won’t find any silicones, parabens, mineral oils, or dyes in our Vitamin C Night Cream.Benefits:\nUsage Direction:Cleanse your face with a gentle cleanser. Pat dry. Apply a small amount of night cream to your face and neck, gently massaging in upward circular motions. Let the cream absorb fully before going to bed. Use every night for optimal results.Country of Origin: India', 711.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 79.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Night Cream with Gotu Kola for Skin IlluminationPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Night Cream with Gotu Kola for Skin Illumination Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-vitamin-c-night-cream-with-gotu-kola-for-skin-illumination', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(806, 'Laikou Fade Spots Night Cream for Whitening, Lighten Spots & Nourishing', '1', 0, 24, 8, '806', '806', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Effects: whitening/lighten spots/nourishingMain ingredients: niacinamide, glycyrrhiza glabra extract, hyaluronic acid, shea butter, trehalose and panthenol\nFeatures\n\nHow to useAfter cleansing, apply the cream evenly on the whole face and massage your skin gently until it is absorbed.\n\nMade in PRC', 559.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 91.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Fade Spots Night Cream for Whitening, Lighten Spots & NourishingPrice in BD', 'Laikou Fade Spots Night Cream for Whitening, Lighten Spots & Nourishing Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-fade-spots-night-cream-for-whitening-lighten-spots-nourishing', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
