(809, 'Derma-Night Cream Retinol Repair Night Cream 50gm', '1', 0, 24, 49, '809', '809', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Derma-Night Cream Retinol Repair Night Cream (50g)\nDerma-Night Cream Retinol Repair Night Cream is a potent, overnight skin-repairing cream enriched with retinol to target signs of aging, improve skin texture, and promote a radiant complexion. This 50g cream combines retinol with hydrating ingredients like hyaluronic acid and nourishing oils to minimize the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and uneven skin tone while you sleep. Its gentle, yet effective formula enhances cell turnover, supports collagen production, and refines pores, making it suitable for all skin types, including mature skin. Designed for nightly use, this cream is free from parabens and synthetic fragrances, providing a rejuvenating, smoothing effect for refreshed, youthful-looking skin by morning.', 1800.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1800.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Derma-Night Cream Retinol Repair Night Cream 50gmPrice in BD', 'Derma-Night Cream Retinol Repair Night Cream 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'derma-night-cream-retinol-repair-night-cream-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
