(811, 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Yoghurt Cream Night 40gm', '1', 0, 24, 37, '811', '811', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nGarnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Yoghurt Night Cream nourishes your skin overnight, giving you a brighter complexion by morning. This cream leverages the skin-brightening properties of Vitamin C and the smoothing and hydrating effects of yoghurt. Suitable for all skin types, it works overnight to reduce dark spots and revive your skin’s natural glow.\n\nGarnier is known for its innovative and accessible skincare solutions tailored to meet a variety of skin needs and concerns. With its focus on Vitamin C and a gentle formula, Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Cream can be a valuable addition to your skincare routine for a brighter, more radiant you. Let\'s explore how Garnier creams can brighten, hydrate, and protect your skin for a healthy, glowing look.\n\nNourish your skin while you are asleep with the Garnier Skin Naturals Bright Complete Vitamin C Yoghurt Night Cream. The lightweight cream for bright and glowing skin quickly gets absorbed into your skin without making it too sticky and helps with skin brightening.\n\nThis Garnier Skin Naturals cream is enriched with the goodness of VITAMIN C, LEMON ESSENCE, YOGHURT BIFIDUS and WHITESPEED SERUM which helps reduce dark spots and brighten your skin.\nWith the Vitamin C cream, you can notice visible fading of your dark spots after the first night of application. The Vitamin C face cream also helps you exfoliate dead cells and keep tanning at bay. The night cream is dermatologically tested, making it a safe and suitable night cream for bright skin in the morning. How to use: After cleansing your face and neck at night, apply 3-4 drops of the Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Serum. Follow that with a small dollop of the Garnier Bright Complete Night Cream. Gently massage the cream all across your face in an upwards motion.\n\nFor a bonus, you could also massage your face for 60 seconds, to ensure the cream has completely sunk in. Avoid the delicate eye area while applying the night cream. For best results, use with the Garnier Bright Complete Facewash and Garnier Bright Complete Serum Cream during the day.', 440.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -440.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Yoghurt Cream Night 40gmPrice in BD', 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Yoghurt Cream Night 40gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-bright-complete-vitamin-c-yoghurt-cream-night-40gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(812, 'Olay Total Effect Night Cream 50gm', '1', 0, 24, 58, '812', '812', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Olay Total Effects Night Firming Cream, infused with a proven vitamin-rich complex, Fights 7 signs of Aging in 1 formula: Replenishes moisture, Restores firmness, Visibly smoothes fine lines and wrinkles, Smoothes and evens skin texture, Instantly evens skin tone appearance, Enhances brightness and Instantly reduces the look of dark spots. This rich night cream provides nourishing miniaturization through the night for Firmer, younger-looking skin in the morning.', 1411.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 64.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Total Effect Night Cream 50gmPrice in BD', 'Olay Total Effect Night Cream 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-total-effect-night-cream-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
