(814, 'P Aura Night Whitening Cream 10g', '1', 0, 24, 246, '814', '814', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'P Aura Night Whitening Cream is a herbal-based skincare solution designed to rejuvenate and brighten facial skin overnight. Enriched with natural extracts of turmeric and cucumber, this cream nourishes the skin while addressing common concerns such as clogged pores, redness, acne, and blemishes. Its gentle formula is suitable for all skin types, making it an ideal addition to your nightly skincare routine.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage Instructions\n\nIngredients\n\nBenefits', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '10g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'P Aura Night Whitening Cream 10gPrice in BD', 'P Aura Night Whitening Cream 10g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'p-aura-night-whitening-cream-10g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(815, 'Boots Ingredients Retinol Night Moisturiser 30ml', '1', 0, 24, 11, '815', '815', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots Ingredients Retinol Night Moisturiser 30ml is formulated with retinol and retinyl palmitate to support skin renewal and enhance firmness. Ideal for nighttime use, this lightweight moisturiser helps smooth fine lines and improve overall skin tone. It’s part of the Boots Ingredients range, known for simple, effective formulations without unnecessary additives.\n\nKey Features:\n\nUsage:Apply a small amount to clean, dry skin in the evening. Gently massage into the face and neck, avoiding the eye area. Use sunscreen during the day when using retinol products. Start with 2–3 times per week and gradually increase frequency as tolerated.\n\nWhy Choose This Product:Boots Ingredients Retinol Night Moisturiser offers a straightforward, effective formula for those seeking visible improvements in skin texture and tone. With no added fragrance or essential oils, it’s ideal for sensitive skin and those new to retinol. Its affordable price point makes it accessible without compromising on quality.\n\nBenefits:', 1210.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 40.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Ingredients Retinol Night Moisturiser 30mlPrice in BD', 'Boots Ingredients Retinol Night Moisturiser 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-ingredients-retinol-night-moisturiser-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(816, 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Night Sleeping Mask Cream 40gm', '1', 0, 24, 37, '816', '816', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'গার্নিয়ার লাইট কমপ্লিট ইয়োগার্ট নাইট ক্রিম\nDiscover Garnier Light Complete Yoghurt Night Cream 40gm in Bangladesh at Arogga. Buy now to reduce dark spots and enhance skin radiance with natural fruit extracts.\nGarnier Light Complete Yoghurt Night Cream is designed to revitalize your skin overnight. Enriched with natural fruit extracts, this cream targets dark spots and uneven skin tone, promoting a clearer complexion. It offers deep hydration and a lemon-like fragrance, making it a delightful part of your nightly skincare routine. The components are completely herbal and natural, comprising of fruit extracts which exhibit a lemon like aroma. The cream also helps you to moisturize your skin and add a visible glow and freshness.\nApply the cream on clean skin before bed. Consistent use over 28 days leads to optimal results, with some improvements visible from the next morning.\nSuitable for all skin types. Test on a small area if you have sensitive skin. Discontinue use if irritation occurs.', 428.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 22.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Night Sleeping Mask Cream 40gmPrice in BD', 'Garnier Bright Complete Vitamin C Night Sleeping Mask Cream 40gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-bright-complete-vitamin-c-night-sleeping-mask-cream-40gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
