(819, 'Palmer\'s Skin Success Anti-Dark Spot Fade Night Cream with Vitamin E', '1', 0, 24, 179, '819', '819', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Wake to a youthful glow! Infused with natural skin brighteners Vitamin C, Japanese Songyi Mushroom Extract and anti-aging powerhouse Retinol, Palmer’s Skin Success Anti-Dark Spot™ Night Fade Cream enhances skin’s radience and helps minimize the apperance of fine lines and wrinkles. Contains soothing essential lavender oil for a relaxing nights rest. A tone correcting fade cream that deeply hydrates skin and effectively lightens the appearance of dark spots and discoloration. With continued use, you will awake to a more luminous and evenly-toned complexion. Uniquely formulated with calming lavender and intensive moisturizers to replenish and rehydrate skin while you sleep. Formulated with a powerful pigment-perfecting blend of ingredients: 5% Niacinamide, Retinol, Songyi Mushroom, Vitamin C, and Vitamin E.', 1600.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 400.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Palmer\'s Skin Success Anti-Dark Spot Fade Night Cream with Vitamin EPrice in BD', 'Palmer\'s Skin Success Anti-Dark Spot Fade Night Cream with Vitamin E Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'palmers-skin-success-anti-dark-spot-fade-night-cream-with-vitamin-e', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(820, 'Cetaphil Redness Relieving Night Moisturiser 50ml', '1', 0, 24, 63, '820', '820', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A nourishing moisturiser that provides continuous hydration to improve skin\'s texture and visibly reduce the appearance of redness due to dryness. Specially formulated with Allantoin, Licorice Extract and Caffeine to soothe redness, it is ideal for redness prone, sensitive skin. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness and a weakened skin barrier.\nKeep your skin hydrated overnight while strengthening the skin barrier with Cetaphil PRO Redness Prone Skin Moisturising Night Cream, suitable for sensitive skin prone to redness and rosacea.\nThis comforting night cream is formulated with Allantoin, Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Panthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5) and Vitamin E, designed to provide 24 hour moisturisation while helping to improve skin texture and the appearance of dryness. It reduces visible redness and discomfort, including stinging, leaving skin feeling calm and soothed for night time.\n', 2544.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1531.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Redness Relieving Night Moisturiser 50mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Redness Relieving Night Moisturiser 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-redness-relieving-night-moisturiser-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(821, 'Medipeel Collagen Super 10 Sleeping Cream 70ml', '1', 0, 24, 247, '821', '821', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The MEDI-PEEL Collagen Super 10 Sleeping Cream is a luxurious overnight treatment designed to rejuvenate and hydrate the skin. Enriched with a potent blend of ingredients, it aims to restore skin elasticity, reduce the appearance of fine lines, and promote a youthful complexion.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nUsage:At the last step of skin care, take an appropriate amount and spread evenly over the face except around the eyes and mouth for absorption.After going to bed, wash your face lightly the next morning.\nFull Ingredients:Purified water, glycerin, niacinamide, dimethicone, butylene glycol, oat flour extract, PEG-240/HDI Copolymer Bis-decyltetradeces-20 ether, dimethicone/vinyldimethicone crosspolymer, Hydroxyacetophenone, PEG-60 hydrogenated castor oil, glyceryl stearate, PEG-10 dimethicone, PEG-100 stearate, carbomer, arginine, garlic extract, walnut extract, hydrolyzed Decollagen, sweet almond oil, tomato fruit/leaf/stem extract, spinach extract, squalane, wine extract, low sweet blueberry extract, propanediol, ethylhexyl glycerin, allantoin, trehalose, adenosine, disodium iditi A, Sodium Hyaluronate, Jojoba Seed Oil, Argan Kernel Oil, Green Tea Extract, Ceramide 3, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Aloe Vera Leaf Extract, Dipropylene Glycol, Glyceres-20, Bioflavonoids, Pig-10 Lepe Seed Sterol, 1,2-hexanediol, Olive Tree Leaf Extract, Spanish Licorice Root Extract, Western Dandelion Leaf Extract, White Willow Bark Extract, Oregano Leaf Extract, Broccoli Extract, Cypress Leaf Extract, broiler bark extract, lactobacillus/soybean fermentation extract, golden extract, purslane extract, rock stone flower root extract, damask rose flower extract, palisade flower extract, chopidae fruit extract, usnia extract, copper tripeptide-1, acetyl Hexapeptide-8, oligopeptide-29, oligopeptide-32, palmitoylpentapeptide-4, fragrance, limonene, alpha-isomethylionone, linalul\nMade in Ko