(822, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Moisturizing Night Cream for Anti-Wrinkles + Firmness', '1', 0, 24, 110, '822', '822', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elevate your nighttime skincare routine with L\'Oréal Paris Revitalift Moisturizing Night Cream. This advanced night cream is specifically formulated to target signs of aging while you sleep, working to reduce the appearance of wrinkles and enhance skin firmness. Enriched with powerful anti-aging ingredients, it delivers intense hydration and rejuvenation, leaving your skin looking refreshed, smooth, and more youthful by morning.\nKey Features:\nBenefits:\nHow to Use:\nTransform your nightly skincare regimen with L\'Oréal Paris Revitalift Moisturizing Night Cream, and wake up to visibly firmer, smoother, and more youthful-looking skin.\n\nMade in Indonesia', 1300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Moisturizing Night Cream for Anti-Wrinkles + FirmnessPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Moisturizing Night Cream for Anti-Wrinkles + Firmness Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-moisturizing-night-cream-for-anti-wrinkles-firmness', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
