(824, 'Pond\'s Age Miracle Night Cream (Made in Thailand)', '1', 0, 24, 193, '824', '824', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The product reduces wrinkles, blur, crow’s feet and dullness. With Retinol C Complex technology that helps collagen under the skin to be reborn, strong, so it has powerful performance. Can reduce wrinkles non-stop throughout the day to make the skin tight, clear, bouncing, young face until people say hello.\nPonds claims that its Age Miracle Night Cream offers the following features and benefits. Let’s take a look.\nWater, Dimethicone crosspolymer/ Cyclopentasiloxane, Ethylhexyl methoxycinnamate, Glycerin, Caprylyl Methicone, PEG-10 Dimethicone/ Disteardimonium hectorite/ Cyclopentasiloxane, Isomerized Linoleic Acid, Caprylic/ Capric Triglycerides, Zinc Oxide/ Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Fragrance, Tetradibutyl Pentaerithrityl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Stearic acid, cholesterol, Mica/ Titanium Dioxide, Tocopheryl Acetate, Bisabolol, BHT, DMDM Hydantoin/ Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Linoleic acid, Borago officinalis Seed Oil, Disodium EDTA, Retinyl Palmitate, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Butylene Glycol/ Carbomer/ Polysorbate 20/ Palmitoyl Oligopeptide/ Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Coriandrum sativum seed oil.\nThe ingredients that make this night cream potent include glycerin, niacinamide, dimethicone, retinyl palmitate, and AHAs. Just a heads up – what turned me off is the fact that it contains parfum and other dicey ingredients that may irritate the skin.\nThe formula of this cream is milky white in color, and it has the consistency similar to that of whipped cream. It feels lightweight and non-sticky, so you don’t have to worry about this cream making your skin greasy. It spreads easily and also gets absorbed into the skin without any difficulties.\nIt has a mild floral scent that bothers me because I prefer fragrance-free skin care products especially when it’s to do with my night cream. The fact that it contains parfum is a huge letdown.\nI applied this regularly every night for about a month, and I must say, my skin felt a whole lot softer, brighter, and more rejuvenated in the mornings. I have combination skin, and it seemed to work well on my skin type. I could see a subtle difference in my dark spots, and I believe the Niacinamide (which is a form of Vitamin B3) is responsible for their reduced appearance. It also provides the right amount of hydration and moisture so you can use it even if you have really oily skin.\nThe bottom line? I’m not quite sure if the Ponds Age Miracle fully works when it comes to fine lines and wrinkles because I don’t have any yet, but it surely does rejuvenate my skin, giving it a healthy glow each morning. It does contain some impressive ingredients but also some very unnecessary elements that can cause irritation to sensitive skin.', 1150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 520.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Age Miracle Night Cream (Made in Thailand)Price in BD', 'Pond\'s Age Miracle Night Cream (Made in Thailand) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-age-miracle-night-cream-made-in-thailand', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(825, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Anti Wrinkle and Firming Night Moisturizer', '1', 0, 24, 110, '825', '825', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Anti Wrinkle and Firming Night Moisturizer\nWith age, the natural lifters thLoreal Paris Revitalift Anti Wrinkle and Firming Night Moisturizerat are present in the skin and responsible for its firmness and youthful appearance begin to break down. As a result, skin looks and feels less firm and wrinkles are more visible.\nFormulated with wrinkle-fighting Pro-Retinol, RevitaliftAnti-Wrinkle + Firming Night Cream Face Moisturizer advanced formula firms skin and minimizes the look of wrinkles for smoother, younger-looking skin. Night cream is non-greasy, non-comedogenic and suitable for all skin types.\nHow to Use: every night, smooth gently onto face and neck until thoroughly absorbed. Use alone or layer as needed.', 1496.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1004.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Anti Wrinkle and Firming Night MoisturizerPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Anti Wrinkle and Firming Night Moisturizer Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-anti-wrinkle-and-firming-night-moisturizer', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(826, 'Cosmo Advanced Night Repairing Face Cream with Hyaluronic Acid & Retinol Complex 250ml', '1', 0, 24, 248, '826', '826', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosmo Advanced Night Repairing Face Cream with Hyaluronic Acid & Retinol Complex 250mlA nourishing night cream designed to repair and rejuvenate skin while you sleep. Formulated with hyaluronic acid, retinol complex, and natural moisturizers, it helps restore skin’s moisture balance, reduce fine lines, and promote a smoother, firmer, and more radiant complexion.\n\nKey Features\n\nBenefits\n\nBenefits of Key Ingredients\n\nHow to UseApply to clean face and neck before bedtime. Gently massage in upward circular motions until fully absorbed. Use nightly for best results.\n\nIngredientsAqua (Water), Glycerin, Isopropyl Myristate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Cetyl Stearate, Isostearyl Isostearate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Extract, Glyceryl Monostearate, Cetyl Esters, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Butter, Stearic Acid, PEG-100 Stearate, Paraffinum Liquidum, Panthenol, Methyl Gluceth-20, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Niacinamide, Hydrolyzed Silk, Ceteth-10 Phosphate, Hyaluronic Acid, Retinol Complex, Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate, Disodium EDTA, Seaweed Extract, Allantoin, Carbomer, Glycol Distearate, Hydroxycitronellal\n\nCountry of Origin: UAE', 902.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 486.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmo Advanced Night Repairing Face Cream with Hyaluronic Acid & Retinol Complex 250mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmo Advanced Night Repairing Face Cream with Hyaluronic Acid & Retinol Complex 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-advanced-night-repairing-face-cream-with-hyaluronic-acid-retinol-complex-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy N