(830, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Light Gel Cream', '1', 0, 8, 16, '830', '830', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Light Gel Cream (75ml) is a lightweight gel moisturizer designed to provide instant cooling and deep hydration, leaving the skin smooth with a dewy finish.\nKey Features:\nPore Care: Formulated with Himalayan pink salt to remove impurities and prevent pore enlargement.\nSoothing Ingredients: Contains cypress tree extract and witch hazel to calm sensitive skin.\nBrightening Effect: Enriched with niacinamide to help brighten skin tone.\nHydration: Aloe vera leaf extract provides deep hydration.\nBenefits:\nCalms Sensitive Skin: Ideal for soothing irritated skin.\nLightweight Texture: Gel-like consistency ensures quick absorption without clogging pores.\nNon-Sticky Finish: Leaves the skin feeling refreshed and non-greasy.\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Start with a clean face.\nApply: Take an appropriate amount and gently massage into the skin.\nAbsorb: Allow the cream to fully absorb before applying other skincare products or makeup.\nMade in Korea', 1419.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '75ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1031.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Light Gel CreamPrice in BD', 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Light Gel Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-poremizing-light-gel-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(831, 'Vaseline Intensive Care Advanced Repair Unscented Body Lotion - 200ml', '1', 0, 8, 139, '831', '831', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vaseline Intensive Care Advanced Repair Unscented Lotion is specifically designed to provide fast and effective relief for dry, rough, and irritated skin. This rich, fragrance-free body lotion combines healing micro-droplets of Vaseline Jelly with high levels of moisturising glycerine to deliver intense hydration. Clinically proven to deeply moisturise and heal very dry skin in just five days, it is also suitable for sensitive skin and proudly carries the National Eczema Seal of Acceptance.\nThe unique formula works by penetrating deeply into the skin\'s surface, forming a protective barrier that locks in moisture and accelerates the skin’s natural recovery process. Enriched with glycerine and dimethicone, the lotion draws moisture into the skin, restoring hydration and relieving dryness and itchiness. With Vaseline Intensive Care Advanced Repair, you can achieve soft, healthy-looking skin that feels nourished and protected.\nKey Features:\nAlways read labels, directions and warnings before purchase or use of product. Patch / strand test is advised before use to avoid any chance of an allergic reaction, hypersensitivity or skin irritation. See more details in tabs below.\n\nSuitable For:This product is ideal for Normal Skin, Dry Skin.How to Use:Apply to clean, dry skin daily or as needed. Massage gently until fully absorbed, focusing on dry or rough areas for best results.Warnings:- For external use only.- Avoid contact with eyes.- Do not ingest.- Keep out of reach of children.Allergy Advice:A patch test is advised before use to avoid any chance of an allergic reaction, hypersensitivity or skin irritation. Apply one or two rows of the product on finger and allow it to dry and then wash. After 24 hours, this product can be used safely now, if no reddening, burning itching or swelling is seen in and around the test area.', 645.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 355.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Intensive Care Advanced Repair Unscented Body Lotion - 200mlPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Intensive Care Advanced Repair Unscented Body Lotion - 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vaseline-intensive-care-advanced-repair-unscented-body-lotion-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(832, 'Neogen Dermalogy CICA Repair Snail Cream 50g', '1', 0, 8, 56, '832', '832', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neogen Dermalogy CICA Repair Snail Cream is a Korean skincare product formulated to address irritated, sensitive, or damaged skin. It blends the regenerative properties of snail mucin with the calming effects of Centella Asiatica (Cica) to deliver deep hydration and visible skin repair. Ideal for those dealing with redness, acne scars, or dullness, this cream helps restore a youthful, healthy glow.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage InstructionsAfter cleansing and applying toner or essence, dispense an appropriate amount of cream and gently press into the skin until fully absorbed. Use twice daily—morning and night—for best results. Follow with sunscreen during the day.\n\nSnail Secretion Filtrate (88%), Centella Asiatica Extract, Asiaticoside, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Fruit Extract, Propyl Gallate, Madecassoside, Niacinamide, Adenosine\nSnail Mucin: A powerhouse ingredient that promotes skin regeneration, hydrates, and enhances elasticity.\nCentella Asiatica (Cica) Extract: Soothes inflammation, reduces redness, and supports healing.\nPanthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5): Strengthens the skin barrier and keeps skin moisturized.\nAllantoin: Calms and softens the skin while promoting healing.\nNiacinamide: Brightens skin tone and reduces the appearance of dark spots.\n\nMade In Korea', 1290.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 710.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neogen Dermalogy CICA Repair Snail Cream 50gPrice in BD', 'Neogen Dermalogy CICA Repair Snail Cream 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neogen-dermalogy-cica-repair-snail-cream-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(833, 'Cos De BAHA DC Facial Drying Cream 45ml-For Face Sebum Control Oily Skin', '1', 0, 8, 36, '833', '833', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Cos De BAHA DC Drying Cream is specially formulated for oily and combination skin types, particularly those struggling with excess sebum. This lightweight cream helps balance oil production while keeping the skin hydrated and smooth. It strengthens the skin barrier, improves overall texture, and promotes a fresh, matte finish without dryness.\nKey Benefits:\nControls excess oil and sebum production\nHydrates without making the skin greasy\nStrengthens the skin barrier and improves resilience\nHelps brighten and even out skin tone\nLeaves a soft, smooth, and non-sticky finish\nAlcohol-free, silicone-free, vegan-friendly, and free from harmful ingredients\nKey Ingredients:\nNiacinamide (4–5%) – Strengthens the skin barrier, reduces oiliness, improves brightness, and soothes inflammation.\nHydrogenated Lecithin – Deeply moisturizes and locks in hydration, creating a protective barrier against dryness.\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract – Soothes and hydrates the skin, reducing irritation.\nCaffeine – Helps energize the skin and reduce puffiness.\nAllantoin – Calms and protects the skin while promoting smoothness.\nBotanical Extracts – Includes Camellia Sinensis Leaf, Momordica Charantia Fruit, Sambucus Nigra Flower, and Leontopodium Alpinum Extracts for antioxidant and soothing benefits.\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount evenly over the face.\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, in the morning and at night.\nFor best results, apply on prepped skin after toner or essence.\nTips:\nSuitable for oily and combination skin.\nAlways perform a patch test before first use, especially for sensitive skin.\nApply sunscreen during the day, as this cream does not replace sun protection.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\nFull Ingredient List:Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Propanediol, Niacinamide, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Isononyl Isononanoate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Allantoin, Caffeine, Carbomer, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Tromethamine, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Momordica Charantia Fruit Extract, Sambucus Nigra Flower Extract, Leontopodium Alpinum Extract.', 1012.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 778.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA DC Facial Drying Cream 45ml-For Face Sebum Control Oily SkinPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA DC Facial Drying Cream 45ml-For Face Sebum Control Oily Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-dc-facial-drying-cream-45ml-for-face-sebum-control-oily-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
