(837, 'Cos De BAHA CG Centella Gel Cream', '1', 0, 8, 36, '837', '837', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The main active constituents of Centella Asiatica are saponins known as asiaticosides, which have soothing and healing properties. Centella Asiatica is ideal for sensitive skin which is red, inflamed, irritated or itchy. It helps reduce the visible signs of skin sensitivity such as itching and burning significantly.\nBenefits:\nHow to use:\nDirections:\nUse daily after cleansing and before applying moisturizer & makeup. Moisten a cotton ball or pad and apply to face and neck. For best results, use in the morning and at night for soft, smooth and beautiful skin.\nIngredients:\nCentella Asiatica Extract (83%), Glycerin, Isononyl Isononanoate, Propanediol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, *Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Panthenol, Caffeine, Allantoin, Sodium Hyaluronate, *Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, *Momordica Charantia Fruit Extract, *Sambucus Nigra Flower Extract, *Leontopodium Alpinum Extract, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP CopolymerAcrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tocopheryl Acetate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Tromethamine.\nMade in Korea', 1053.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 347.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA CG Centella Gel CreamPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA CG Centella Gel Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-cg-centella-gel-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
(838, 'Cosrx Advanced Snail 92 All in One Cream 50g', '1', 0, 8, 31, '838', '838', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosrx Snail 92 All in One Cream repairs and soothes irritated, sensitized skin after breakouts. A rich gel-type cream absorbs instantly into the skin with a full of nourishment while leaving your skin feeling fresh and comfortable.\n\nProduct Benefits:\n• Nourishes & plumps• Anti-aging• Repairs damaged skin• Long lasting hydration\n• Red, irritated skin• Dull & rough skin• Dark spots & scars• Dehydrated skin\n• 92% Snail Mucin :Infused with 92% of snail mucin, this cream glides onto the skin and builds a moisture barrier to plump, hydrate and soothe skin.\n• 1,000 ppm sodium hyaluronate :plumping and soothing care, infuses hydration\nSnail Secretion Filtrate, Betaine, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Carbomer, Arginine, Dimethicone, Sodium Polyacrylate, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Stearic acid, Allantoin, Panthenol, Xanthan Gum, Ethyl Hexanediol, Adenosine\n\nHow to use:\nGently apply a proper amount of the cream on face, avoiding the eye and mouth area, after cleansing and toning. Tap the area where the cream was applied gently in order for it to be absorbed along the skin texture.\nAbout this item:\nLong-lasting Hydration: Infused with 92% of snail mucin (also called Snail Secretion Filtrate), this cream builds a moisture barrier to plump, hydrate, and soothes skin. This everyday multi-solution cream glides onto the skin and revives skin radiance.\nSupercharged Repairing Moisturizer: A light-weight, gel-type cream repairs and soothes irritated, sensitized skin after breakouts like rosacea. This cream moisturizer is powered by snail mucin, hyaluronic acid, and betaine to strengthen the skin barrier by replenishing moisture.\nKey Ingredient: Snail Secretion Filtrate contains \"Mucin\"- an EFFECTIVE ingredient for enhanced moisturization. It instantly soothes damaged skin and delivers moisture deep into your skin. Perfect for dehydrated and damaged skin.\nNO Snails are Harmed: Snail Mucin is obtained in a safe and environmentally friendly way in a favorite environment of snails and then processed as a cosmetic material. 100% Natural, Hypoallergenic, Dermatologist-tested.\nCOSRX Standards: All COSRX products are formulated with skin-friendly ingredients that alleviate irritated skin. Hypoallergenic, Dermatologist tested, Animal Testing-FREE, Parabens-FREE, Sulfates-FREE, Phthalates-FREE', 970.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 480.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Advanced Snail 92 All in One Cream 50gPrice in BD', 'Cosrx Advanced Snail 92 All in One Cream 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-advanced-snail-92-all-in-one-cream-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:26', '2026-02-11 08:14:26'),
