(842, 'Some By Mi Super Matcha Pore Clean Clay Mask 100g – Pore Tightening & Oil Control Mask', '1', 0, 8, 2, '842', '842', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Detoxify and refine your skin with the Some By Mi Super Matcha Pore Clean Clay Mask, formulated with 12% Kaolin, Bentonite, and Matcha (Camellia Sinensis) extracts. This powerful clay mask absorbs excess oil, unclogs pores, and removes impurities while calming and soothing the skin with natural botanicals like Centella Asiatica, Tea Tree, and Houttuynia Cordata extracts. Perfect for oily and combination skin types, it leaves your complexion clean, smooth, and refreshed.\n✨ Key Benefits:\nPore Tightening: Deeply cleanses pores and removes blackheads\nOil Control: Reduces excess sebum and shine\nSoothing & Calming: Botanical extracts reduce irritation and redness\nBrightening & Smoothening: Improves skin texture for a refreshed complexion\nGentle Yet Effective: Suitable for regular use without over-drying\nHow to Use:\nApply an even layer to cleansed face, avoiding eye and lip areas.\nLeave on for 10–15 minutes until fully dry.\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water and follow with toner or moisturizer.\nKey Ingredients:\nKaolin & Bentonite Clay – Absorbs oil and impurities\nCamellia Sinensis (Matcha) Leaf Extract – Antioxidant-rich, soothes & protects\nCentella Asiatica & Tea Tree – Calms irritation, reduces redness\nHouttuynia Cordata & Willow Bark Extracts – Purifying and anti-inflammatory\nCapryloyl Salicylic Acid – Helps exfoliate and unclog pores\n✅ Ideal for oily, combination, and acne-prone skin seeking clean, smooth, and balanced skin.', 1452.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 198.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some By Mi Super Matcha Pore Clean Clay Mask 100g – Pore Tightening & Oil Control MaskPrice in BD', 'Some By Mi Super Matcha Pore Clean Clay Mask 100g – Pore Tightening & Oil Control Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-super-matcha-pore-clean-clay-mask-100g-pore-tightening-oil-control-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(843, 'Cerave SA Smoothing Cream for Dry, Rough, Bumpy Skin 177ml', '1', 0, 8, 153, '843', '843', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rough, bumpy skin has uneven texture and feels coarse to the touch. Common on the legs and backs of the arms, rough skin can be the result of dryness or a buildup of dead skin cells. A bar-based salicylic acid cleanser that provides both chemical and physical exfoliation along with barrier-reinforcing ingredients like ceramides can be a beneficial cleansing option for rough and bumpy skin.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe SA Cleanser Bar for Rough & Bumpy Skin features dual action exfoliation in convenient bar form. This gentle, soap-free bar provides chemical exfoliation with salicylic acid and physical exfoliation with spherical jojoba beads to gently sweep away dead skin cells and improve the look and feel of rough, bumpy skin. Formulated to deeply cleanse and thoroughly remove dirt and oil, it also softens and smoothes skin without disrupting the skin’s protective barrier or leaving it feeling tight or dry.\n\nImmediately after use:\n\nAfter 4 weeks of use:\n*In a blind consumer use test\n\nBenefits:\n\nHow to Use:', 1950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1275.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave SA Smoothing Cream for Dry, Rough, Bumpy Skin 177mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave SA Smoothing Cream for Dry, Rough, Bumpy Skin 177ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-sa-smoothing-cream-for-dry-rough-bumpy-skin-177ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(844, 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer pH 5.5 15g', '1', 0, 8, 91, '844', '844', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer is a daily face cream with pH 5.5 that intensely hydrates dry skin, strengthens the barrier function, balances microbiome, and smoothens rough texture. Infused with ceramides (1,2,3,4,6), hyaluronic acid, Japanese rice water, olive/jojoba oils, and probiotics, this lightweight cream from India plumps, repairs, and protects sensitive/compromised skin for healthy, glowing results.\nApply pea-sized amount to cleansed face/neck. Massage upward until absorbed. Use AM/PM daily.\nPatch test first. For external use; avoid eyes. Keep from children. Read label for allergies.', 250.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer pH 5.5 15gPrice in BD', 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer pH 5.5 15g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-key-ceramides-hyaluronic-barrier-repair-moisturizer-ph-55-15g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(845, 'VITILSI Gel 15g – Regulation of Depigmentation', '1', 0, 8, 39, '845', '845', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'VITILSI Gel (15g / 0.5oz) is a lightweight skincare gel formulated to support the regulation of depigmentation and help improve the appearance of uneven-looking skin tone. Its hydrating gel base absorbs easily and is designed for targeted application on areas where skin tone may look irregular, helping keep the skin moisturized and comfortable with regular use.\nThe formula includes Glycerin, a well-known humectant that helps attract and retain moisture, supporting smoother and softer-feeling skin. It also contains botanical extracts such as Coleus forskohlii root extract and Cassia alata leaf extract, selected for skin-conditioning support and to help maintain a healthy-looking complexion. The gel texture spreads evenly, making it convenient for daily skincare routines.\nGel format for easy, targeted application\nSupports regulation of depigmentation and uneven tone care\nHydrating formula with Glycerin\nWith botanical extracts for skin-conditioning support\nCompact 15g tube—easy to carry and use\nAqua (Water), Glycerin, Coleus forskohlii Root Extract, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Ethoxydiglycol, Cassia alata Leaf Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hydroxide, Xanthan Gum, Citric Acid, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate.\nNet Weight: 15g (0.5 oz)\nMade in France by ALPOL COSMÉTIQUE for LSI SILDERMA\nImported & Distributed by: Consorcio Dermatológico de México SA de CV, Isaac Garza Poniente No. 16, Col. Centro, Monterrey, N.L. C.P. 64000, Mexico (as printed on pack)\nMedStyle (as printed on pack)\nApply a small amount to clean, dry skin and massage gently until absorbed.\nAvoid contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a healthcare professional.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.', 1607.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 73.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'VITILSI Gel 15g – Regulation of DepigmentationPrice in BD', 'VITILSI Gel 15g – Regulation of Depigmentation Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vitilsi-gel-15g-regulation-of-depigmentation', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(846, 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Cream : Snail Mucin 93% + Rice 100ml', '1', 0, 8, 113, '846', '846', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'K-Secret Seoul 1988 Snail Mucin Cream 93% with Rice is designed to address concerns such as dull skin, dryness, troubled skin, and uneven texture. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin, this cream offers deep hydration, moisture, skin repair, trouble care, and soothing benefits. With 93% snail mucin filtrate, it provides intense hydration, preventing dryness and promoting long-lasting moisture. The cream helps calm irritated and sensitive skin, reducing redness, while ingredients like Ectoin and Panthenol work to strengthen the skin barrier and enhance healing. It also promotes collagen production, improving skin texture, elasticity, and firmness, resulting in smoother, softer skin. The rice blend further boosts skin texture, brightens the complexion, and nourishes the skin, making it a perfect addition to any anti-aging skincare routine.\nIngredients:\nSnail Secretion Filtrate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Dimethicone, Water, Cetearyl Olivate, Carbomer, Arginine, Benzyl Glycol, Sorbitan Olivate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Water, Allantoin, Sodium Polyacrylate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA, Butylene Glycol, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake), Panthenol, Ectoin, Sodium Hyaluronate\nHow to Use:\nApply a moderate amount to the skin evenly as the last step of your skincare routine and gently pat it for better absorption.\nMade in korea', 1658.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 742.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Cream : Snail Mucin 93% + Rice 100mlPrice in BD', 'K Secret Seoul 1988 Cream : Snail Mucin 93% + Rice 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'k-secret-seoul-1988-cream-snail-mucin-93-rice-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
