(848, 'Daboo 3X Vitamin Aux Super Calming Radiance Cream – 100ml', '1', 0, 8, 207, '848', '848', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Daboo 3X Vitamin Aux Super Calming Radiance Cream is a deeply nourishing and soothing facial cream designed to calm irritated skin while enhancing radiance and moisture retention. Enriched with Niacinamide, Panthenol, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid (Vitamin C derivative), Sodium Hyaluronate, and botanical extracts like Dandelion Leaf and Sea Buckthorn (Hippophae Rhamnoides) Extract, this cream works to strengthen the skin barrier, reduce redness, and improve overall skin texture. With continuous use, it helps achieve a more even, radiant, and healthy-looking complexion.\nKey Benefits:\nSoothes and calms sensitive or irritated skin\nProvides deep hydration and moisture retention\nBrightens skin tone and reduces dullness\nStrengthens skin barrier and supports elasticity\nReduces fine lines and promotes smooth, radiant skin\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\nHow to Use:\nTake an appropriate amount of cream and apply evenly onto the face.\nGently pat for absorption until fully absorbed.\nUse daily, morning and evening, as part of your skincare routine.\nCaution:\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes; rinse immediately if contact occurs.\nDiscontinue use if irritation, redness, or rash appears.\nAvoid using on broken or damaged skin.\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight.\nIngredients:Water, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Vinyl Dimethicone, Cetearyl Alcohol, Niacinamide (20,000 ppm), Glyceryl Stearate, Polyglyceryl-2 Stearate, Phenyl Trimethicone, Behenyl Alcohol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Cyclohexasiloxane, Stearyl Alcohol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycereth-26, Hydroxyacetophenone, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Dimethiconol, Panthenol (2,000 ppm), 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid (500 ppm), Xanthan Gum, Adenosine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Disodium EDTA, Capryloyl Salicylic Acid, Lactobacillus Ferment Lysate (10 ppm), Taraxacum Officinale (Dandelion) Leaf Extract, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate (1 ppm), Ethylhexylglycerin, Potassium Hyaluronate, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Hyaluronic Acid, Hippophae Rhamnoides Extract (0.05 ppm), Pentylene Glycol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Fragrance.\nNet Weight: 100 ml\nThis cream is ideal for anyone looking for a soothing, hydrating, and brightening solution that improves skin texture and radiance while calming sensitive skin.', 1240.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 310.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Daboo 3X Vitamin Aux Super Calming Radiance Cream – 100mlPrice in BD', 'Daboo 3X Vitamin Aux Super Calming Radiance Cream – 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'daboo-3x-vitamin-aux-super-calming-radiance-cream-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
