Experience smoother, brighter, and healthier skin with DABO’s advanced Korean skincare innovation!', 650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo All In One Black Snail Repair Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Dabo All In One Black Snail Repair Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-all-in-one-black-snail-repair-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(851, 'Anua Birch Moisture Boosting Pad 160ml', '1', 0, 8, 21, '851', '851', NULL, NULL, NULL, '– A subacidic moisture pad formulated with 70,000ppm Japanese White Birch Water that helps maintain the pH balance of the skin and prevent the skin from moisture loss.– Features Panthenol and 10 types of Hyaluronic Acids that deeply moisturize the skin and help form a skin protection barrier.– Consists of ABC Complex(Allantoin, Betaine, Cucumber Fruit Extract) that helps soothe sensitive skin and maintain oil-moisture balance of the skin.– Free from artificial colorant, fragrances and 20 types of harmful ingredients.\nAfter cleansing, take a pad and gently wipe the face avoiding the lip and eye areas.\n\nEnriched with Japanese white birch water, panthenol and ten hyaluronic acids, these subacidic moisture pads deliver deep moisture into skin, maintain pH balance and create a skin protection barrier. ABC complex comprising of allantoin, betaine and cucumber extract soothes sensitive skin and maintains oil-moisture balance.\nA subacidic moisture pad formulated with 70,000ppm Japanese White Birch Water that helps maintain the pH balance of the skin and prevent the skin from moisture loss.\nFeatures Panthenol and 10 types of Hyaluronic Acids that deeply moisturize the skin and help form a skin protection barrier.', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1050.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Birch Moisture Boosting Pad 160mlPrice in BD', 'Anua Birch Moisture Boosting Pad 160ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-birch-moisture-boosting-pad-160ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(852, 'Avène Cicalfate+ Repairing Protective Cream for Sensitive, Irritated Skin', '1', 0, 8, 218, '852', '852', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'New and improved formula to help repair damaged, dry, cracked, and non-oozing skin in 48 hours*.Skin is immediately soothed after the first application,and the cutaneous barrier is restored.Anti-bacterial agents. Fragrance-free, paraben-free.*In-vitro study. **% of satisfaction – In use tolerance under dermatological, gynaecological and paediatric control on 83 subjects – Product applied twice daily for 21 days.Benefits:Repairing, protective and very well tolerated, Cicalfate+ Restorative Protection Cream is a multipurpose cream for the whole family\'s skin irritation needs. Even greater efficacy, immediately soothing thanks to its unique active ingredients combination: -Innovative postbiotic repairing ingredient C+ Restore, derived from probiotic Avène Thermal Spring Water. Inspired by fundamental research of the microbiome and skin healing and resulting from the ongoing research programs of Avène Dermatological Laboratories, this patented postbiotic ingredient supports the microbiome to assist with repair. -The combination of Copper Sulfate and Zinc Sulfate helps limit the risk of bacterial proliferation. -Very rich in Avène Thermal Spring Water to soothe and soften the skin. Ingredients:AVENE THERMAL SPRING WATER (AVENE AQUA). CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE. MINERAL OIL (PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM). GLYCERIN. HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE OIL. ZINC OXIDE. PROPYLENE GLYCOL. POLYGLYCERYL-2 SESQUIISOSTEARATE. PEG-22/DODECYL GLYCOL COPOLYMER. ALUMINUM STEARATE. AQUAPHILUS DOLOMIAE FERMENT FILTRATE. ARGININE. BEESWAX (CERA ALBA). COPPER SULFATE. MAGNESIUM STEARATE. MAGNESIUM SULFATE. MICROCRYSTALLINE WAX (CERA MICROCRISTALLINA). TROMETHAMINE. ZINC SULFATE.', 3025.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2175.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Avène Cicalfate+ Repairing Protective Cream for Sensitive, Irritated SkinPrice in BD', 'Avène Cicalfate+ Repairing Protective Cream for Sensitive, Irritated Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'avene-cicalfate-repairing-protective-cream-for-sensitive-irritated-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
