(854, 'Loreal Paris Collagen Daily Moisturizer Filler', '1', 0, 8, 110, '854', '854', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Transform your skincare routine with L\'Oréal Paris Collagen Daily Moisturizer Filler, an anti-aging powerhouse designed to plump, hydrate, and smooth your skin. Enriched with pure collagen, this lightweight yet deeply nourishing moisturizer works to visibly reduce fine lines and wrinkles, restoring a youthful bounce to your complexion. The non-greasy formula absorbs effortlessly, delivering 24-hour hydration while enhancing skin elasticity and firmness. Perfect for daily use, this moisturizer leaves your skin feeling soft, supple, and rejuvenated with every application. Unlock a radiant, age-defying glow with L\'Oréal’s trusted expertise in skincare innovation.\nBenefits:\nUsage:\nMade in USA', 1890.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1710.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Collagen Daily Moisturizer FillerPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Collagen Daily Moisturizer Filler Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-collagen-daily-moisturizer-filler', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(855, 'Purito Seoul Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream 15ml', '1', 0, 8, 83, '855', '855', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purito Seoul Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream is a deeply hydrating and soothing moisturizer designed to calm irritated skin and strengthen the skin’s moisture barrier. Infused with bamboo extract and panthenol (pro-vitamin B5), this cream provides intense hydration while promoting skin repair. Bamboo extract is known for its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties, while panthenol locks in moisture and supports skin regeneration, making this cream ideal for sensitive and dry skin.Features:\nIngredients:\nMighty Bamboo Extract, originating from the pristine nature of Damyang, contains a variety of amino acids and minerals that mirror the body’s own moisture to keep the skin healthy. Bamboo Extract protects the skin against external elements and reinforces the skin barrier, making it stronger than before.\nA high concentration of Panthenol, which converts to vitamin B5 when absorbed into the skin, helps to strengthen the skin barrier by improving water retention and hydration.\nInhibits skin moisture loss and is quickly absorbs to increase moisturizing power.※ The above description is limited to raw material characteristics\nWater, Panthenol (10%), Squalane, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Bambusa Vulgaris Extract (3,497 ppm), Hydrolyzed Jojoba Esters, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Hydroxyacetophenone, Tromethamine, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Xanthan Gum, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Hyaluronate, Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Madecassic Acid, Copper Tripeptide-1\nUsage Direction:\nFor Additional Care Moisture Layer: Before bed, apply 2-3 times more than your usual amount to the face in two separate layers. Allow the first layer to absorb fully. Then, apply the second layer to create a moisturize seal to help your skin feel hydrated and strong.\n\nFaq:\nNot only have we upgraded the packaging and product name for a renewed and enhanced experience, but we’ve also increased the product volume from 80 mL to 100 mL! The new cream also now includes Bamboo Extract to strengthen the skin barrier and lock in moisture.\nMighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream contains 10% of high-concentration Panthenol to deliver more intensive skin barrier strengthening results.\nMighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream is a perfect hydrating moisturizer to use after applying products with potent active ingredients, such as vitamin C, retinol, or AHA/BHA.However, we recommend conducting a patch test when introducing new products into your skincare routine.\nCountry of Origin: Korea', 612.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 68.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Seoul Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream 15mlPrice in BD', 'Purito Seoul Mighty Bamboo Panthenol Cream 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-seoul-mighty-bamboo-panthenol-cream-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
