(863, 'Face Facts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Gel Moisturiser 50ml', '1', 0, 8, 7, '863', '863', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Face Facts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Gel Moisturiser is a lightweight, fast-absorbing gel cream designed to strengthen and protect the skin barrier. Infused with ceramides, hyaluronic acid, and glycerin, this vegan-friendly moisturiser helps lock in hydration, soothe dryness, and improve overall skin resilience. Suitable for all skin types, it delivers long-lasting moisture without heaviness, leaving skin soft, supple, and refreshed.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\n\nHow to Use\n\n', 499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 251.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Face Facts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Gel Moisturiser 50mlPrice in BD', 'Face Facts Ceramide Skin Barrier Complex Gel Moisturiser 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'face-facts-ceramide-skin-barrier-complex-gel-moisturiser-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(864, 'Avène Cicalfate+ Restorative Protective Cream 40ml – Skin Barrier Repair in 48H for  Dry Skin', '1', 0, 8, 218, '864', '864', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Avène Cicalfate+ Restorative Protective Cream is a multi-purpose repairing cream suitable for babies, children, and adults. Enriched with Copper and Zinc Complex and Avène Thermal Spring Water, it helps accelerate the skin’s natural repair process, soothes irritation, and protects against external aggressors.\nThe creamy, fragrance-free texture forms a protective barrier on the skin, promoting high-quality epidermal restoration within 48 hours. Clinically tested on sensitive and fragile skin, it provides comfort, purity, and hydration without clogging pores.\nKey Benefits:\nRepairs and restores the skin barrier in 48 hours\nSoothes irritation and redness on face, body, and external intimate areas\nPurifies with Copper & Zinc to protect against bacteria\nSuitable for infants, children, and adults\nNon-comedogenic & fragrance-free\nHow to Use:Apply twice daily to clean, dry skin. Gently massage until fully absorbed. Safe for everyday use on sensitive and irritated skin.', 2100.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Avène Cicalfate+ Restorative Protective Cream 40ml – Skin Barrier Repair in 48H for  Dry SkinPrice in BD', 'Avène Cicalfate+ Restorative Protective Cream 40ml – Skin Barrier Repair in 48H for  Dry Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'avene-cicalfate-restorative-protective-cream-40ml-skin-barrier-repair-in-48h-for-dry-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(865, 'Babe Pediatric Emollient Cream 200ml', '1', 0, 26, 99, '865', '865', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nFor the prevention and care of dry and atopic skin.\nActive Ingredients: SWEET ALMOND 4.00 % · BLACKCURRANT 2.00 % · KOKUM BUTTER 2.00 % · VITAMIN F 1.00 % · VITAMIN E 0.25 %\nBabies and children\n\nBabé pediatric emollient cream 200 ml is an intensive nourishment for the dry and atopic skin of babies and children. 2 in 1 (nutrition and regenerating). It is preservative-free (paraben-free), alcohol-free, colourant-free, mineral oil-free, phthalate-free and has an allergen-free fragance. Main benefits: Regenerates cases of localised dryness; deeply moisturises (restores moisture levels); repairs, protects and provides immediate comfort thanks to its content in essential fatty acids, Omega 3 and 6. Rapidly absorbed emollient texture. Formula tested under strict paediatric and dermatological control. Excellent cosmeticity. Easy, comfortable opening of the products for adults, while safe for children.\nFor the prevention and care of dry and atopic skin.\nActive Ingredients: SWEET ALMOND 4.00 % · BLACKCURRANT 2.00 % · KOKUM BUTTER 2.00 % · VITAMIN F 1.00 % · VITAMIN E 0.25 %\nBabies and children\n1 x Pediatric Emollient cream', 3358.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 92.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Babe Pediatric Emollient Cream 200mlPrice in BD', 'Babe Pediatric Emollient Cream 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'babe-pediatric-emollient-cream-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(866, 'Etude Soonjung 2x Barrier Intensive Cream', '1', 0, 26, 253, '866', '866', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SoonJung 2x Barrier Intensive Cream 60ml\nMoisturizing cream to strengthen skin\'s moisture barrier.\n- Panthensoside Contained to Calm SkinPanthenol(Strengthens skin barrier and soothes dry skin) +Madecassoside(Soothes irritated skin and protects skin from external stimuli) *Ingredient-specific efficacy\n- pH Balanced FormulapH Balanced formula for healthier and more hydrated skin\n- 10 Ingredient CalloutsClean ingredients free of 10 additives (Free of animal-derived ingredients, mineral oil, silicone oil, polyacrylamide, imidazolidinyl urea, triethanolamine, fragrance, PEG, synthetic pigment, paraben)\nIngredients    WATER / AQUA / EAU, PROPANEDIOL, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAETHYLHEXANOATE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, POLYGLYCERYL-3 METHYLGLUCOSE DISTEARATE, HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE OIL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, PANTHENOL, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, CARBOMER, XANTHAN GUM, GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE, TROMETHAMINE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, DISODIUM EDTA, MADECASSOSIDE, LECITHIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, TOCOPHEROL, CAMELLIA SINENSIS LEAF EXTRACT\n\n\n', 1692.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '60ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1133.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Etude Soonjung 2x Barrier Intensive CreamPrice in BD', 'Etude Soonjung 2x Barrier Intensive Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'etude-soonjung-2x-barrier-intensive-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(867, 'The Derma Co Snail Peptide 96 Hydrating Serum with Snail Mucin & Peptide Complex for Smooth & Moisturized Skin', '1', 0, 26, 33, '867', '867', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Derma Co Snail Peptide 96 Hydrating Serum is formulated with snail mucin and a peptide complex to deliver intense hydration and repair for smooth, plump, and moisturized skin. This lightweight serum helps to restore the skin’s natural moisture barrier, reduce fine lines, and improve skin elasticity. It is ideal for those looking for a powerful hydrating and anti-aging serum that helps improve overall skin texture and appearance.\nThis serum is a powerful addition to any skincare routine aimed at improving hydration, anti-aging, and overall skin texture.\nMade in India', 799.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 301.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co Snail Peptide 96 Hydrating Serum with Snail Mucin & Peptide Complex for Smooth & Moisturized SkinPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co Snail Peptide 96 Hydrating Serum with Snail Mucin & Peptide Complex for Smooth & Moisturized Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-snail-peptide-96-hydrating-serum-with-snail-mucin-peptide-complex-for-smooth-moisturized-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
