(869, 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer  120ml pH 5.5', '1', 0, 26, 91, '869', '869', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer (pH 5.5) is a lightweight yet intensely hydrating daily moisturizer designed to repair, strengthen, and protect the skin barrier while delivering long-lasting moisture—without feeling greasy or sticky. Powered by Ceramides + Cholesterol + barrier-supporting lipids, it helps reinforce the skin’s natural protective layer, making skin look healthier, smoother, and more resilient over time.\nFormulated with Hyaluronic Acid (Sodium Hyaluronate) and Polyglutamic Acid, it locks in moisture and supports a plump, hydrated look for hours. Skin-loving extras like Blueberry extract, Rice extract, Probiotics/Ferments (Saccharomyces ferment lysate filtrate, Lactobacillus) help nourish the skin and support overall skin comfort—making it a great everyday “skin bodyguard” for barrier repair and hydration.\nBacked by clinical claims, this moisturizer is clinically tested and derma approved, with results including:\n93.76% increase in skin moisturization instantly\n100% saw improved skin barrier in 4 weeks\nProvides up to 120 hours of moisturization\nSignificantly improves skin texture in 2 weeks\nSkin Type\nSuitable for most skin types, especially dry, dehydrated, or barrier-compromised skin\nNot suitable for very oily/oily acne-prone skin (as stated on pack)\nNon-comedogenic\nFormulated Without\nFragrance\nSynthetic dyes\nPhthalates\nMineral oils\nEssential oils\nHow to UseDot the moisturizer on a clean face and neck. Massage gently in an upward motion until fully absorbed. Use twice daily for best results. Follow with SPF in the daytime.\nCautionRead the ingredient label carefully for allergy concerns. Patch test before use. Avoid contact with eyes.\nIngredients (Full List)Aqua, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Glyceryl Stearate (and) PEG-100 Stearate, Cetyl Alcohol, Cetearyl Olivate (and) Sorbitan Olivate, Cyclopentasiloxane, Cyclopentasiloxane (and) Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Sodium Polyacrylate (and) Dicaprylyl Carbonate (and) Polyglyceryl-3 Caprate, Dimethicone, C14-22 Alcohols (and) C12-20 Alkyl Glucoside, Xylitylglucoside (and) Anhydroxylitol (and) Xylitol, Stearic Acid, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Laminaria Digitata Extract (and) Hydrogenated Lecithin (and) Cetyl-PG Hydroxyethyl Palmitamide (and) Ceramide 1, 2, 3, 4, 6 II (and) Cholesterol (and) 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Glycerin (and) Aqua (and) Vaccinium Angustifolium (Blueberry) Fruit Extract, Aqua (and) Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract (and) Saccharomyces Ferment Lysate Filtrate (and) Citric Acid (and) Sodium Benzoate (and) Potassium Sorbate, Polyglutamic Acid, Lactobacillus (and) Maltodextrin, Tocopheryl Acetate, Xanthan Gum, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Hydroxide, BHT, Phenoxyethanol (and) Ethylhexylglycerin.\nStorageFor external use only. Store in a cool & dry place. Made in India.', 895.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 205.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer  120ml pH 5.5Price in BD', 'Dot & Key Ceramides & Hyaluronic Barrier Repair Moisturizer  120ml pH 5.5 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-key-ceramides-hyaluronic-barrier-repair-moisturizer-120ml-ph-55', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
