(871, 'Nella Honey 1 Snail Ultra Moisture Cream 100g', '1', 0, 26, 254, '871', '871', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Nella Honey 1 Snail Ultra Moisture Cream 100g is a Korean skincare product featuring snail mucin and honey extracts for intense hydration and skin repair. It is known for its ability to moisturize, help with fine lines, and improve skin elasticity without feeling sticky.\nKey features and benefits\nContains Aloe Vera Leaf Extract, Hyaluronic Acid and Shea Butter to improve the skin dryness.\nIngridients\nWater, Butylene Glycol, Cetyl Ethylhexanote, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Cetearyl Alcohol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter), Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Snail Secretion Filtrate, Citrus Paradisi (Grapefruit) Fruit Extract, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Ceteareth-20, Glyceryl Stearate, Stearic Acid, Dimethicone, Cety PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Betaine, Trehalose, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Adenosine, Honey Extract, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Polyacrylate-13, Polyisobutene, Polysorbate 20, Sorbitan Isostearate, Sodium Polyacrylate, Trisodium EDTA, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin\nHow to use:Apply a proper amount on the face or dry skin area evenly.', 1045.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 455.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nella Honey 1 Snail Ultra Moisture Cream 100gPrice in BD', 'Nella Honey 1 Snail Ultra Moisture Cream 100g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nella-honey-1-snail-ultra-moisture-cream-100g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27');
