(872, 'Laxzin Anti-Malasma Cica Cream', '1', 0, 26, 54, '872', '872', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laxzin Anti-Melasma Cica Cream\nAchieve brighter, more even-toned skin with Laxzin Anti-Melasma Cica Cream, expertly formulated to target melasma, dark spots, and skin irritation. Packed with powerful active ingredients like 5% Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica, and Tranexamic Acid, this dermatologist-tested cream works to calm, nourish, and enhance your skin’s radiance while being gentle enough for all skin types.\nMelasma Reduction:\nSoothing Properties:\nRadiance Enhancement:\nPotent Active Ingredients:\nDermatologist-Tested: Proven gentle and effective for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nLightweight & Non-Greasy: Absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a sticky residue.\nReclaim your skin’s natural glow and clarity with Laxzin Anti-Melasma Cica Cream, the perfect addition to your daily skincare routine.', 484.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 66.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laxzin Anti-Malasma Cica CreamPrice in BD', 'Laxzin Anti-Malasma Cica Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laxzin-anti-malasma-cica-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(873, 'Guerniss Vitamin C Collagen Gel Lotion 120ml', '1', 0, 26, 162, '873', '873', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Guerniss Vitamin C Collagen gel is a moisturiser which combines the goodness of Vitamin C and Collagen. That primarily means it has both brightening and anti-aging benefits. Vitamin C is a water soluble vitamin that has brightening benefits. Although we’re probably getting vitamin C in our diet, we cannot get the most benefit of the vitamin out of this for our skin. Using topical products such as Vitamin C Collagen gel is the most direct way to reap these benefits. Vitamin C in a moisturiser which-\nIf you want to have radiant and healthy looking skin incorporating a vitamin C based moisturiser into your skin care routine. We can find vitamin C in a variety of skin care products but it’s particularly effective when it is incorporated in the moisturiser.\nCollagen is a type of protein. It is a considerable component of your bones, skin, muscles, tendons, and even blood vessels. Though our body naturally produces collagen it diminishes with age. And our skin needs collagen boost from outer sources. For example diet, medicines and skin care products.\nWhen a skin care product incorporates collagen into it, applying it will give you a boost of collagen. And will help fill in fine lines and wrinkles. It plumps the skin and makes the signs of ageing less visible.\nTopical collagen for example Vitamin C Collagen gel can be used across all skin types, including those who have super oily and sensitive skin. We can commonly use it alongside other active ingredients to improve the tolerability of the active ingredients.\nUsage:Wash the face with a cleanser or face wash which suits you best. Then take as much as you need. Apply gently on your face. Use twice in a day.\nIngredients: Water, Glycerol, Propylene Glycol, 1, 3- Propanediol, Polydimethylsiloxane, Sodium Hyaluronate, Gentian (Gentiana Scabra) Extract, Allantoin, Edta Disodium, Fructooligosaccharide, Hydroxybenzamide, Methyl Isothiazolinone, Vitamin C, Centella Asiatica (Centella Asiatica) Extract, Polygonum Cuspidatum (Polygonum Cuspidatum) Root Extract, Yellow, Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract, Tea (Camellia Sinensis), Liquorice (Glycyrrhiza Uralensis) Root Extract, Chamomile (Chrysanthellum Indicum) Extract, Rosemary (Rosmarinus Officinalis) Leaf Extract.\n\nMade in Hongkong', 1455.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 435.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Guerniss Vitamin C Collagen Gel Lotion 120mlPrice in BD', 'Guerniss Vitamin C Collagen Gel Lotion 120ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guerniss-vitamin-c-collagen-gel-lotion-120ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(874, 'ZQ-II Skin Barrier Repairing Gel 50gm', '1', 0, 26, 39, '874', '874', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Name: ZQ-II Skin Barrier Repairing Gel\nSize: 50gm\nType: Lightweight gel for skin barrier restoration\nKey Features:\nStrengthens compromised skin barriers\nSoothes irritation and redness\nHydrates without greasiness\nIdeal for post-procedure/sensitive skin\n(Note: Likely contains ceramides, panthenol, and other barrier-supporting ingredients based on the name.)\n(Actual ingredients may vary - check product label for confirmation.)\nRestores lipid barrier → Prevents moisture loss\nProtects against irritants → Reduces sensitivity\nHeals damaged skin → Accelerates repair\nAnti-inflammatory → Calms redness\nSoothes irritation → Ideal for eczema/rosacea\nStimulates collagen → Strengthens skin\nDeep hydration → Plumps fine lines\nWeightless moisture → No sticky residue\nGentle exfoliation → Removes dead skin cells\nEnhances healing → Post-laser/peel recovery\nBoosts immunity → Protects against pollution\nReduces TEWL → Improves hydration retention\n✔ Repairs damaged barriers (e.g., from over-exfoliation)✔ Reduces trans-epidermal water loss (TEWL)✔ Calms post-procedure skin (laser, microneedling)✔ Non-comedogenic & fragrance-free✔ Prevents recurring irritation\nCleanse skin with lukewarm water\nApply pea-sized amount to face/neck\nPat gently until absorbed (no rubbing)\nUse AM/PM after toners, before creams\nFor intensive repair: Layer under moisturizer\nPro Tip: Keep refrigerated for extra soothing effect!\nSensitive/Reactive Skin → Rosacea, eczema\nPost-Procedure Care → Laser, chemical peels\nOver-Exfoliated Skin → \"Barrier disaster\" recovery\nDry/Dehydrated Skin → Lightweight hydration\nTube: Airless pump (hygienic, preserves actives)\nColor: Medical blue/white (clinical trust)\nLabel Highlights:\n\"Clinically Proven Repair\"\n\"72-Hour Hydration Lock\"\nHypoallergenic badge\nPatch test if extremely sensitive\nAvoid if allergic to centella asiatica\nSun protection essential (barrier is vulnerable)\n💡 Dermatologist Tip: Pair with a ceramide moisturizer for \"sandwich method\" barrier repair.', 1510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 80.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ZQ-II Skin Barrier Repairing Gel 50gmPrice in BD', 'ZQ-II Skin Barrier Repairing Gel 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'zq-ii-skin-barrier-repairing-gel-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
