(877, 'Axis-Y Panthenol 10 Skin Smoothing Shield Cream', '1', 0, 26, 12, '877', '877', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The AXIS-Y Panthenol 10 Skin Smoothing Shield Cream is a vegan moisturizer designed to enhance the skin\'s moisture barrier and provide deep hydration. Enriched with 10% Panthenol (Provitamin B5) and TECA (a purified extract of Centella Asiatica), this cream soothes, hydrates, and strengthens the skin, making it suitable for sensitive and irritated skin types.\nKey Features:\n10% Panthenol (Provitamin B5): Enhances moisture retention and strengthens the skin barrier, promoting skin regeneration.\nTECA (Centella Asiatica Extract): Soothes and calms irritated skin, providing anti-inflammatory benefits.\nVegan and Cruelty-Free: Formulated without animal-derived ingredients and not tested on animals.\nClinically Proven: Shown to improve the skin moisture barrier by 61% within 5 minutes of application.\nBenefits:\nDeep Hydration: Provides immediate and long-lasting moisture to the skin.\nStrengthens Skin Barrier: Improves the skin\'s natural defense against environmental stressors.\nSoothes Irritation: Reduces redness and calms sensitive skin.\nLightweight Texture: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, suitable for daily use.\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount of cream evenly to the skin.\nGently pat the cream into the skin for better absorption.\nFor enhanced soothing and improved skin barrier, apply a generous layer to targeted areas as a sleeping pack.\nIngredients:\nXylitol: Improves moisture retention and delivers rapid hydration to the skin.\nErythritol: Provides moisturizing benefits and strengthens moisture retention.\nArginine: Prevents dryness through moisture-holding properties.\nVitamin E: A natural antioxidant that forms a protective barrier against damaging UV rays to help maintain healthy skin.\nBeta-Sitosterol: A type of pro-vitamin D that helps strengthen the skin barrier.\nTaurine: Improves skin barrier