(880, 'BIODERMA Atoderm Intensive Baume – Ultra-Soothing Anti-Itch Balm for Irritated Skin 500ml', '1', 0, 26, 200, '880', '880', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bioderma Atoderm Intensive Baume – Ultra-Soothing Anti-Itch Balm for Irritated Skin (500 ml)\nOverview:Bioderma Atoderm Intensive Baume is a deeply nourishing, ultra-soothing balm specially formulated for very dry, irritated, and atopic-prone skin. Its advanced dermatological care restores comfort, relieves itching, and helps rebuild the skin barrier. Suitable for the face and body, and safe for babies, children, and adults.\nKey Technologies & Active Ingredients:\nSkin Barrier Therapy™ (Patented): Inspired by NAOS’s Ecobiology approach, this unique technology helps prevent the adhesion of bacteria (notably Staphylococcus aureus) that can aggravate skin dryness and irritation.\nLipigenium™ Complex: Composed of biomimetic lipids, it restores and reinforces the natural skin barrier, providing long-lasting protection and hydration.\nPEA (Anti-Pruritus Active): Helps soothe discomfort and reduce itching, providing instant relief.\nProven Efficacy:\nStrengthens the skin’s barrier function.\nReduces the urge to scratch.\nSoothes sensations of irritation and tightness.\nTexture & Characteristics:\nRich, creamy, and non-sticky formula.\nQuickly absorbed, allowing immediate dressing after application.\nFragrance-free, paraben-free, and dermatologically tested.\nIdeal for sensitive, irritated, and atopic skin types.\nHow to Use:\nApply once or twice daily to clean, dry skin.\nCan be used alone or alongside dermocorticoid treatments.\nSuitable for face and body use.\nFor infants, children, and adults.\nDo not apply to oozing or open skin.\nSafety Note:If skin irritation persists, consult a healthcare professional. Store in a cool, dry place away from sunlight.\nBrand Philosophy – NAOS France:Guided by Ecobiology, Bioderma believes in supporting the skin’s natural biology rather than over-treating it.\nVocation: “To love, understand, and care for living things.”\nEcobiology: Combines ecosystem biology with responsibility toward individual skin health.\nMade in France | Dermatologically Tested | Authenticity Guaranteed by NAOS', 3040.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1160.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BIODERMA Atoderm Intensive Baume – Ultra-Soothing Anti-Itch Balm for Irritated Skin 500mlPrice in BD', 'BIODERMA Atoderm Intensive Baume – Ultra-Soothing Anti-Itch Balm for Irritated Skin 500ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-atoderm-intensive-baume-ultra-soothing-anti-itch-balm-for-irritated-skin-500ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
