(891, 'Minimalist Ceramides 0.3% + Madecassoside Moisturizer for All Skin Types 50g', '1', 0, 26, 32, '891', '891', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Minimalist Ceramides 0.3% + Madecassoside Moisturizer for All Skin Types – 50gStrengthens, Restores & Protects the Skin Barrier\nA breakthrough everyday moisturizer designed to repair, hydrate, and soothe your skin. Formulated with 5 essential Ceramides at a high concentration of 0.3%—far higher than most products on the market—this lightweight, fast-absorbing gel cream helps restore your skin’s natural barrier, prevent water loss, and keep skin comfortably hydrated all day.\nAfter cleansing, toning, and applying serums, take a pea-sized amount and gently massage into your face until fully absorbed.When to use: AM & PM, daily.\nKey Actives:\nComplete List:Aqua, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Extract, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Glycerin, Glyceryl Glucoside, Butylene Glycol, Trehalose, Saccharide Isomerate, Ursolic Acid, Aminobutyric Acid, Pentylene Glycol, Allantoin, Cholesterol, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Madecassoside, Polyacrylate-13, Polyisobutene, Polysorbate 20, Glyceryl Stearate, Sucrose Distearate, Propylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Ceramide NP, Ceramide EOP, Ceramide NS, Ceramide AS, Ceramide AP, Triethanolamine, Ethylhexylglycerin, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Carbomer, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate.\nFragrance-Free • Essential Oil-Free • Non-Comedogenic\nCountry of Origin: India', 1460.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 290.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist Ceramides 0.3% + Madecassoside Moisturizer for All Skin Types 50gPrice in BD', 'Minimalist Ceramides 0.3% + Madecassoside Moisturizer for All Skin Types 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-ceramides-03-madecassoside-moisturizer-for-all-skin-types-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(892, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream', '1', 0, 26, 16, '892', '892', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream (75ml) is a lightweight, non-sticky gel cream formulated to soothe and hydrate the skin. It is particularly beneficial for sensitive skin types.\nKey Features:\nSoothing and Calming: Enriched with 72% Centella Asiatica extract sourced from Madagascar, this cream effectively calms skin irritation and redness.\nHydration: Contains Trehalose and Sodium Hyaluronate, which provide deep hydration, leaving the skin moisturized without a greasy residue.\nSkin Barrier Repair: Formulated with Ceramide NP and Cholesterol, it helps strengthen and repair the skin\'s natural barrier, enhancing overall skin health.\nBenefits:\nCalms Sensitive Skin: Ideal for those with sensitive or irritated skin, offering immediate relief and comfort.\nLightweight Texture: The gel-like consistency ensures quick absorption, making it suitable for daily use without clogging pores.\nNon-Sticky Finish: Leaves the skin feeling refreshed and non-greasy, suitable for various climates and skin types.\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Start with a clean face.\nApply: Take an appropriate amount of the cream and gently massage it into the skin.\nAbsorb: Allow the cream to fully absorb before applying other skincare products or makeup.\nMade in Korea', 1908.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '75ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 923.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Soothing CreamPrice in BD', 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-soothing-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(893, 'Vaseline Lotion Deep Restore 200ml', '1', 0, 26, 139, '893', '893', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Healing micro-droplets of VaselineÂ® Jelly combined with a fast-absorbing non-greasy moisturizing formula, the result is a lotion that moisturizes to heal very dry skin, leaving it looking and feeling healthier. We believe healthy skin starts with deep-restoring moisture. Our Intensive Care Deep Restore Lotion is infused with multi-layer moisture and nutrients which penetrate the skin deep down* absorbing quickly to leave your skin feeling healthy, soft, and smooth.', 255.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 45.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Lotion Deep Restore 200mlPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Lotion Deep Restore 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vaseline-lotion-deep-restore-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(894, 'Iunik Beta - Glucan Daily Moisture Cream 15ml', '1', 0, 26, 17, '894', '894', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Iunik Beta Glucan Daily Moisture Cream is a lightweight Korean moisturizer formulated to deliver deep hydration while reinforcing the skin’s natural barrier. Designed for sensitive and redness-prone skin, it combines soothing botanical extracts with advanced hydration technology. Its gentle formula is particularly suitable for use in humid, pollution-heavy environments like Bangladesh, where skin is often exposed to environmental stressors.\nKey FeaturesThis cream contains 3000mg of Beta-Glucan, a powerful humectant that hydrates more effectively than hyaluronic acid and helps strengthen the skin’s protective layer. Centella Asiatica extract calms inflammation and promotes healing, while Aloe Vera provides a cooling effect to reduce irritation. The Red Fruit Complex offers antioxidant protection and enhances skin radiance, and Panthenol helps moisturize and reduce sensitivity.\n\nUsageApply a small amount to clean, toned skin in the morning and evening. Gently massage into the face and neck until fully absorbed. For daytime use, follow with sunscreen to protect the skin from UV damage and maintain barrier integrity.\n\nWhy Choose This ProductIunik’s Beta Glucan Moisture Cream is ideal for those seeking a non-greasy, fast-absorbing moisturizer that delivers lasting hydration without clogging pores. Its formulation is free from harsh additives and designed to support skin recovery, making it a reliable choice for individuals dealing with dryness, sensitivity, or post-acne concerns.\n\nBenefits\n\nCautions\n\nSuitable Skin TypesThis product is recommended for sensitive, dry, dehydrated, post-acne, normal, and combination skin. It is not advised for fungal acne-prone skin without prior patch testing.', 431.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Iunik Beta - Glucan Daily Moisture Cream 15mlPrice in BD', 'Iunik Beta - Glucan Daily Moisture Cream 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'iunik-beta-glucan-daily-moisture-cream-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(895, 'Eucerin Advanced Repair Cream for Very Dry Skin 226g', '1', 0, 26, 234, '895', '895', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Eucerin Advanced Repair Hand Cream is a unique formula specifically made for hands, helps repair dry skin, and provides the moisture skin craves. Frequent washing and external factors like the environment can strip hands of vital elements needed to keep hands soft, smooth, and hydrated. Advanced Repair Hand Cream’s formula combines Ceramide-3 and Natural Moisturizing Factors. Ceramides help to strengthen the skin’s moisture barrier to lock in moisture. Natural Moisturizing Factors, amino acids that are naturally found in the skin, boost moisture and prevent dryness from reoccurring. This hand lotion leaves hands noticeably softer and smoother after just one application.\n\nBenefits:\n\nHow to Use:', 2299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1201.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Eucerin Advanced Repair Cream for Very Dry Skin 226gPrice in BD', 'Eucerin Advanced Repair Cream for Very Dry Skin 226g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'eucerin-advanced-repair-cream-for-very-dry-skin-226g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
