(897, 'Nature Skin Advanced Snail 4 In One Repairing Cream 102ml', '1', 0, 26, 255, '897', '897', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nature Skin Advanced Snail 4 in One Repairing Cream is a multifunctional skincare product designed to repair, moisturize, whiten, and provide anti-wrinkle benefits. Packaged in a 102ml container, this cream utilizes the regenerative properties of snail mucin to enhance skin health and appearance.\nKey Features:\nSkin Repairing: Snail mucin aids in skin healing and regeneration, helping to repair damaged tissues and improve skin texture.\nMoisturizing: The cream provides deep hydration, promoting suppleness and maintaining the skin\'s moisture balance.\nWhitening: Regular use can help lighten skin tone and reduce the appearance of pigmentation, leading to a more even complexion.\nAnti-Wrinkle: The formulation has anti-aging properties that help diminish fine lines and wrinkles, enhancing skin\'s radiance.\nUsage Instructions:\nApply an appropriate amount of the cream to cleansed face and neck. Gently massage in circular motions until fully absorbed. Use regularly for optimal results.\nAdditional Information:\nIncorporate Nature Skin Advanced Snail 4 in One Repairing Cream into your daily skincare routine to experience its comprehensive benefits.', 891.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 308.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nature Skin Advanced Snail 4 In One Repairing Cream 102mlPrice in BD', 'Nature Skin Advanced Snail 4 In One Repairing Cream 102ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nature-skin-advanced-snail-4-in-one-repairing-cream-102ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(898, 'Isntree Onion Newpair Gel Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 26, 238, '898', '898', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A spot care cream that helps treat blemishes and spots at one time.Enriched with 71% Muan Red Onion Extract to tackle blemishes.Formulated with NoSCalm Complex (sodium heparin, allantoin, panthenol and Heartleaf Houttuynia) to soothe sensitive, irritated skin.Contains Tranexamic Acid and Vitamin C derivatives to even skin tone and tackle pigmentation.\nOnion Newpair Gel Cream, an advanced moisturiser that revives the rosy glow of the skin by acting on protecting the skin barrier and brightening skin tone.Inspired by nature and powered by science, allow the powerfully healing effect of Onion to calm and soothe redness and irritation with instant attention whilst plumping out wrinkles and fine lines. The gel-like texture absorbs quickly upon application to a polished and non-greasy finish.Tailor-made to lock in moisture together with Allantoin, Heartleaf and Panthenol, otherwise known as Vitamin B5, skin is left looking healthier, fresher and deeply nourished.Vitamin C, Tranexamic acid and Vitamin B3 disrupt pigmentary pathways inhibiting further pigment deposition whilst simultaneously encouraging melanin breakdown. Enjoy smoother, brighter and more radiantly luminescent skin with luxurious ease.Free from artificial fragrances, essential oils, mineral oils and alcohol to suit all skin types, even the most sensitive of skin.\nHow To Use:\nAt the last step of skin care, take an appropriate amount, gently spread over the entire face and absorb.', 1420.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1480.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Isntree Onion Newpair Gel Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Isntree Onion Newpair Gel Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isntree-onion-newpair-gel-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(899, 'NEOGEN Dermalogy Black Energy Cream', '1', 0, 26, 56, '899', '899', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stress-Free Clean Beauty\nNo skin worries! Formulated with the concept to care for skin vitality without irritation to the skin.\nContains naturally-derived black complex ingredients\nIt helps to strengthen the skin barrier by delivering rich nutrients with natural-derived black complex ingredients that help soothe and revitalize the skin.\nPersonalized care for various skin problems with 119 natural ingredients\nIt contains 119 kinds of natural ingredients to give moisture + elasticity + soothing + nutrition all at once to help the skin feel soft and moisturized.\nCan be used as a sleeping mask the night before an important event\nDeep absorption of benefits by providing moisture and nutrients to the skin during sleep with a thick gel texture full of nutrients and moisture.\nIngredients:\n\n\n\n\nOryza Sativa (Rice) Extract Sesamum Indicum Seed Extract Glycine Max (Soybean) Seed Extract Coffea Arabica (Coffee) Seed Extract Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Extract\nPropolis Extract Pearl Extract Nelumbium Speciosum Flower Extract Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract Melissa Officinalis Leaf Extract\nCentella Asiatica Extract Aloe Vera Leaf Extract Green Tea Extract Opuntia Ficus-Indica Extract\n3 Types of Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide NP Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Fruit Extract Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract\n\nMade in South Korea', 2312.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1108.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'NEOGEN Dermalogy Black Energy CreamPrice in BD', 'NEOGEN Dermalogy Black Energy Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neogen-dermalogy-black-energy-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(900, 'LAIKOU French Snail Essence Cream with Hyaluronic Acid', '1', 0, 26, 8, '900', '900', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Snail mucus extract has excellent skin care effects, which can improve fragile and damaged skin, rapidly restore health of skin, reproduce brilliance of skin.\nAdd moisture to nourish the skin, moisturize rough skin especially in dry weather, help keep your skin smooth and tender.\nImproves unhealthy, uneven complexion, promoting rapid skin regeneration with Snail extract serum.\nPromotes collagen synthesis, provides revitalizing nutrients .\nPromote skin regeneration and protect skin. Suitable for adults in any occasion, you can smear it before makeup.\n\nClean your face first\nApply appropriate amount of the facial cream evenly onto the face\nMassage it gently to help absorption\n\n\nMade in PRC', 308.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 242.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU French Snail Essence Cream with Hyaluronic AcidPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU French Snail Essence Cream with Hyaluronic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-french-snail-essence-cream-with-hyaluronic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(901, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream 30ml', '1', 0, 26, 16, '901', '901', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Centella Soothing CreamHoney-like gel cream that runs smoothly on the skin and absorbs quickly into the skin without stickiness, leaving it smooth and moisturized.\nWhat It Is:A non sticky soothing gel with Centella, Trehalose, and Ceramide NP moisturizes the skin and repairs the skin barrier.Product Benefits:Calming, HydratingSkin Type:Normal, SensitiveKey Ingredients:Centella Asiatica Extract, Trehalose, Sodium Hyaluronate, Ceramide NP, Cholesterol\nWater, Glycerin, Propanediol, Dipropylene Glycol, Cyclopentasiloxane, Centella Asiatica Extract, 1,2-Hexanediol, Cyclohexasiloxane, T\nCentella Soothing Cream- An instant cooling effect reliefs skin redness- Powerful soothing care quickly calms sensitive skin and strengthens the skin barrier- Contains 3 essential components to firm skin: Ceramide, Cholesterol, and Fatty acids- Balances damaged skin with the closest pH level of healthy skin- Contains highly purified Centella asiatica from Madagascar- Non-sticky and lightweight moisturizing gel texture that runs smoothly on the skin\nApply appropriate amount on face and pat gently with both palms for absorption. Use it as last step of skincare routine.', 702.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 78.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream 30mlPrice in BD', 'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-soothing-cream-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(902, 'W. Skin Laboratory Collagen Glutathione Cream', '1', 0, 26, 92, '902', '902', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten, Firm, and Revitalize Your Skin\nElevate your skincare routine with W. Skin Laboratory Collagen Glutathione Cream, a powerful blend of collagen and glutathione designed to improve skin elasticity, brighten your complexion, and provide deep nourishment.\nKey Benefits:\nHow to Use:\nMade in Korea', 1704.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1796.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'W. Skin Laboratory Collagen Glutathione CreamPrice in BD', 'W. Skin Laboratory Collagen Glutathione Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'w-skin-laboratory-collagen-glutathione-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27');
