(903, 'La Roche Posay Cicaplast Baume B5+  Soothing Repairing Balm', '1', 0, 26, 62, '903', '903', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'La Roche-Posay\'s Cicaplast Baume B5+ is a skin barrier repair specifically formulated for damaged, uncomfortable & irritated skin. Use balm for face and/or body on a wide range of common skin irritations including nappy rashes, heating sensations, post peeling & laser. Suitable for the whole family from adults to babies from 3 months. Also suitable skincare for cancer patients undergoing treatment.\nHelps accelerates the natural skin recovery process whilst respecting the skin microbiome and reducing feelings of discomfort. The balm texture acts as a barrier cream, leaving an invisible protective layer on the skin, also making it ideal as an everyday nappy change balm.Rough, cracked skinDry skin irritations on face and bodyChapped, chafed skinDiaper rashSensitive skin\nApply cream as needed to clean, dry skin. Use to nourish and soothe dry skin irritations. Can be applied to body, face, and lips. Avoid eye area.', 2950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 950.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche Posay Cicaplast Baume B5+  Soothing Repairing BalmPrice in BD', 'La Roche Posay Cicaplast Baume B5+  Soothing Repairing Balm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-cicaplast-baume-b5-soothing-repairing-balm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
(904, 'Uni Hydra Cream', '1', 0, 26, 176, '904', '904', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Uni Hydra Cream is a nourishing, non-greasy moisturizer specially formulated to hydrate, soothe, and repair dry or sensitive skin. Enriched with natural extracts, ceramides, and essential hydrators, this cream delivers long-lasting softness and skin barrier support for a healthier, glowing complexion.\nDeep Hydration: Glycerin, Xylitol & Caprylic Triglyceride help lock in moisture.\nSkin Barrier Repair: Ceramide 3 and Glycyrrhetinic Acid support skin regeneration.\nAntioxidant Protection: Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E) and Ginkgo Biloba protect from environmental stressors.\nSoothing Action: Allantoin and Laminaria Extract help calm irritated skin.\nNon-Greasy Texture: Lightweight, fast-absorbing formula suitable for all skin types.\nTake a suitable amount of cream in your palm.\nRub hands together to warm it slightly.\nGently massage onto cleansed skin in small circular motions.\nUse twice daily or as recommended by your skincare routine.\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nPerform a patch test if prone to allergies.\nStore in a cool, dry place.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nIdeal for daily moisturizing. Gentle enough for sensitive skin.Net Weight: (40gm)**Made for everyday skincare comfort._', 1757.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 93.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Uni Hydra CreamPrice in BD', 'Uni Hydra Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'uni-hydra-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
