(908, 'Cos De BAHA AZ20 Azelaic Acid MSM Cica Facial Cream', '1', 0, 26, 36, '908', '908', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience powerful skin renewal with the Cos De BAHA AZ20 Facial Cream, a high-performance formula crafted to combat acne, dullness, and uneven texture. Infused with 20% azelaic acid, this potent cream helps clarify skin tone, reduce blemishes, and soothe inflammation—making it an ideal choice for acne-prone and sensitive skin types.\nHigh-Potency Azelaic Acid (20%)Helps unclog pores, fade hyperpigmentation, and visibly improve skin clarity by targeting acne-causing bacteria and reducing redness.\nMSM (Methylsulfonylmethane)Known for its skin-healing benefits, MSM supports collagen production and helps soothe irritated skin for a calmer, healthier appearance.\nCica Complex (Centella Asiatica Extract + Madecassoside)Promotes skin repair and provides anti-inflammatory benefits, making it perfect for calming redness and supporting a healthy skin barrier.\nHydrating & Barrier-Supportive IngredientsEnriched with panthenol, ceramide NP, and hyaluronic acid, this cream deeply hydrates while strengthening the skin\'s natural defenses.\nAntioxidant ProtectionVitamin E helps neutralize free radicals and supports overall skin resilience.\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply a small amount evenly across the face.\nUse 2–3 times per week to allow your skin to adjust, especially if you\'re new to high-strength actives.\nFollow with a moisturizer and apply sunscreen during the day to protect against UV sensitivity.\nMade in Korea', 1499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 551.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA AZ20 Azelaic Acid MSM Cica Facial CreamPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA AZ20 Azelaic Acid MSM Cica Facial Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-az20-azelaic-acid-msm-cica-facial-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:2