(909, 'Dr. Reju-All Advanced LC-Ceramide Barrier Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 26, 256, '909', '909', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Strengthen • Soothe • Protect • Hydrate\nGive your skin the barrier support it deserves with Dr. Reju-All Advanced LC-Ceramide Barrier Cream, a dermatologist-formulated moisturizer designed to repair, strengthen, and deeply hydrate compromised skin. Enriched with Ceramide NP, nourishing lipids, soothing actives, and advanced hydrating complexes, this cream restores the skin’s natural defense for a visibly healthier, calmer, and smoother complexion.\nPerfect for dry, sensitive, irritated, or barrier-damaged skin, this cream works as the final step in your routine to lock in hydration and shield your skin from environmental stressors.\nCeramide NP + Phytosterols strengthen the skin barrier and prevent moisture loss\nSqualane, Shea Butter & Meadowfoam Seed Oil deliver rich, nourishing hydration\nNiacinamide + Panthenol brighten, calm, and improve overall skin texture\nMadecassoside + Allantoin soothe irritation, redness, and sensitivity\nHydrolyzed Collagen Extract helps keep skin soft, plump, and elastic\nBiosaccharide Gum-1 provides long-lasting moisture protection\nLuxurious, silky texture that absorbs without heaviness\n✔ Rebuilds and strengthens the skin’s natural barrier✔ Deep and long-lasting hydration for dry, tight, or flaky skin✔ Calms irritation & redness, ideal for sensitive or post-treatment skin✔ Helps improve skin tone, texture & elasticity✔ Locks in all previous skincare steps, making it perfect as the final step✔ Supports anti-aging thanks to Adenosine and moisture-rich actives\nUse at the end of your skincare routine to seal in hydration.Apply an appropriate amount and gently massage onto the entire face until absorbed.Use morning and night for best results.\nRead all instructions before use\nDo not apply on broken or eczema-affected skin\nDiscontinue use if irritation, swelling, or redness occurs\nAvoid contact with eyes\nKeep out of reach 