(910, 'Keloplast Scars SPF 50+', '1', 0, 26, 74, '910', '910', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalizing cream with patch effect is excellent for recovery from superficial burns, redness, irritation and as a post-procedure treatment. The dotted tip spreads the product economically and evenly for a spot application.\nMAIN PROPERTIES OF THE INGREDIENTS\n5% filmogenic polysaccharide\n- Patch effect / anti-pollution\nCombination of 100% mineral UV filters:\n18% titanium dioxide + 2% zinc oxide\n– High degree of photoprotection SPF 50+: UVB (61.7) / UVA (22.6)\nPrevention of hyperpigmentation (PVGP)\n2% Tartar extract\nRestructuring: stimulates cellular regeneration\n2% Cocoa Butter + 3% Glycerin\n– Soothes, softens, moisturizes and improves skin elasticity\nApply 1-2 times a day in a thick layer to the affected areas without getting wet (face and body).\nTo reduce the risk of post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation, extend application time by 1 month after healing.\nWhen in full sun, renew every two hours.\n\n0% PARABENS • PERFUME FREE\nTESTED UNDER DERMATOLOGICAL CONTROL\nCOMPOSITION:AQUA (WATER), TITANIUM DIOXIDE [NANO] ], STEARIC ACID, ALCOHOL, POLYMETHYL METHACRYLATE, POLYGLYCERYL-4 ISOSTEARATE, CETYL PEG/PPG-10/1 DIMETHICONE, HEXYL LAURATE, CHLORPHENESIN, SODIUM CHLORIDE, O-CYMEN-5-OL, PHENOXYETHANOL, BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-4, ONOPORDUM ACANTHIUM FLOWER/LEAF/STEM EXTRACT, TOCOPHEROL, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRA-DI-T-BUTYL HYDROXYHYDROCINNAMATE', 2205.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 245.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Keloplast Scars SPF 50+Price in BD', 'Keloplast Scars SPF 50+ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'keloplast-scars-spf-50', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
