(912, 'BioMD Organic Aqua Purify Hyalu B5 24H Cleansing & Moisturising Face Cream – 50ml', '1', 0, 10, 104, '912', '912', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BioMD Organic Aqua Purify Hyalu B5 24H Face Cream is a multi-action detoxifying and moisturizing cream designed to provide all-day hydration while protecting the skin from environmental stressors. Its advanced formula helps cleanse, nourish, and restore the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and radiant throughout the day and night.\nThis innovative face cream is enriched with Purisoft®, a clinically tested detoxifying ingredient derived from moringa seed extract. Purisoft® helps protect the skin from pollution, environmental aggressors, and free radicals while detoxifying and purifying the skin at a cellular level.\nThe formula combines a rich blend of Shea Butter, Argan Oil, Avocado Oil, Cotton Seed Oil, Aloe Vera, and Rosehip Oil, delivering deep and long-lasting hydration. These natural oils help strengthen the skin barrier, improve elasticity, and maintain optimal moisture balance. Rosehip Oil supports skin regeneration, helps regulate sebum production, and gently exfoliates dead skin cells, improving overall skin texture and tone.\nDesigned for daily use, this 24-hour moisturizing cream supports the skin’s natural recovery process, making it appear healthier, younger, and more luminous. Its antioxidant properties help defend against oxidative stress caused by pollution, stress, and harsh environmental conditions.\nProvides 24-hour hydration and nourishment\nDetoxifies and protects skin from pollution and free radicals\nImproves skin softness, smoothness, and radiance\nSupports natural skin regeneration\nHelps balance oil and moisture levels\nSuitable for day and night use\nApply to clean face twice daily, morning and evening. Gently massage until fully absorbed.\nAqua, Glycerin, Gossypium Herbaceum (Cotton) Seed Oil, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter), Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dicaprylyl Ether, Cetearyl Glucoside, Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil, Rosa Canina (Rosehip) Fruit Oil, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Xanthan Gum, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Benzyl Alcohol, Dehydroacetic Acid, Moringa Pterygosperma Seed Extract, Citric Acid.', 2042.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 108.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BioMD Organic Aqua Purify Hyalu B5 24H Cleansing & Moisturising Face Cream – 50mlPrice in BD', 'BioMD Organic Aqua Purify Hyalu B5 24H Cleansing & Moisturising Face Cream – 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biomd-organic-aqua-purify-hyalu-b5-24h-cleansing-moisturising-face-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:27', '2026-02-11 08:14:27'),
