(918, 'GuanJing Beauty Kojic Acid Face Cream Deep Nourishment Brightening Anti-Wrinkle Firming 50g', '1', 0, 10, 259, '918', '918', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elevate your skincare routine with GuanJing Beauty Kojic Acid Face Cream, a multi-functional formula designed to brighten, nourish, and firm the skin. Infused with kojic acid and powerful natural extracts, this cream targets dark spots, fine lines, and loss of elasticity, leaving your skin smooth, radiant, and youthful.\nBrightening & Even Skin Tone – Kojic acid helps reduce pigmentation and promotes a naturally radiant complexion.\nDeep Nourishment – Rich moisturizing ingredients penetrate deeply to restore softness and hydration.\nAnti-Wrinkle & Firming – Supports elasticity, reduces fine lines, and improves overall skin firmness.\nSkin Repair & Protection – Strengthens the skin barrier and promotes healthy skin renewal.\nGentle & Daily Use – Lightweight, non-greasy texture suitable for all skin types.\nApply a small amount to cleansed face and neck. Massage gently until fully absorbed. Use twice daily, morning and evening, for best results.\nBrand: Guanjing Beauty\nProduct Type: Face Cream\nActive Ingredient: Kojic Acid\nWeight: 50g\nTarget Benefits: Brightening, Deep Nourishment, Anti-Wrinkle, Firming, Skin Repair', 441.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 49.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'GuanJing Beauty Kojic Acid Face Cream Deep Nourishment Brightening Anti-Wrinkle Firming 50gPrice in BD', 'GuanJing Beauty Kojic Acid Face Cream Deep Nourishment Brightening Anti-Wrinkle Firming 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guanjing-beauty-kojic-acid-face-cream-deep-nourishment-brightening-anti-wrinkle-firming-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
