(920, 'Yuderma Yulift Cream 100ml', '1', 0, 10, 50, '920', '920', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yuderma Yulift Cream (100ml) is an advanced anti-aging skincare product designed to improve skin firmness, elasticity, and overall texture. Formulated with active lifting agents and moisturizing components, the cream helps combat signs of aging, such as sagging skin, fine lines, and wrinkles.\nYuderma Yulift Cream is ideal for individuals looking for an effective anti-aging solution that improves skin texture and elasticity while keeping it hydrated and smooth.', 1848.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 42.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Yuderma Yulift Cream 100mlPrice in BD', 'Yuderma Yulift Cream 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yuderma-yulift-cream-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
