(923, 'Simple Water Boost Quench Gel Cream', '1', 0, 10, 24, '923', '923', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Simple Water Boost Skin Quench Sleeping Cream transforms dull and tired skin, replenishing dehydrated skin while you sleep! It works naturally with skin, for instant and continuous hydration throughout the day.\nThis silky, lightweight moisturiser is made with a plant extract and skin-essential minerals. With regular use, it boosts skins natural hydration process, for health-looking skin.\nSpecially formulated for dehydrated, dry skin, Simple Water Boost Skin Quench Sleeping Cream contains no harsh chemicals, artificial colours or dyes, or perfume, making it perfectly suitable for even sensitive skin.\nAs part of your skincare routine try our new Simple Water Boost skincare range, dedicated to reversing the 5 early symptoms of dehydration: dryness, roughness, feelings of tightness, dullness and dry dehydration lines; to leave skin revitalized, supple and dewy fresh.\nAt night, after cleansing with a Simple Water Boost cleanser, we recommend applying Simple Water Boost Hydrating Booster all over your face to instantly moisturize your skin and help it stay hydrated for longer. Finish your hydration skincare routine with our Simple Skin Quench Sleeping Cream.', 985.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 515.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple Water Boost Quench Gel CreamPrice in BD', 'Simple Water Boost Quench Gel Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-water-boost-quench-gel-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(924, 'Jergens Oil-Infused Skin Firming Moisturiser 496ml', '1', 0, 10, 260, '924', '924', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jergens Oil-Infused Skin Firming Moisturiser is a dermatologist-tested body lotion designed to hydrate and firm the skin. Formulated with collagen and elastin, it aims to improve skin elasticity and provide a smoother, more toned appearance. The lotion is infused with a nourishing oil blend, delivering long-lasting moisture and a light, fresh scent.\nCollagen and Elastin: Vital proteins that help improve skin\'s elasticity and firmness.\nHydralucence™ Blend: A unique blend that enhances skin tone and luminosity.\nGlycerin: A humectant that draws moisture into the skin, keeping it hydrated.\nDimethicone: A silicone that provides a smooth application and helps retain moisture.\nCaffeine: Known for its antioxidant properties, it may help reduce puffiness.\nTocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E): An antioxidant that helps protect and nourish the skin.\nFragrance: Provides a light, fresh scent to the lotion.\nImproves Skin Firmness: Regular use can help enhance skin elasticity and firmness.\nHydrates and Nourishes: Provides deep moisture, leaving the skin feeling soft and smooth.\nEnhances Skin Tone: The Hydralucence™ blend helps improve skin tone and luminosity.\nSuitable for Dry Skin: Formulated to relieve dryness and replenish moisture.\nApplication: Apply generously to clean, dry skin.\nFrequency: Use daily for optimal results.\nStorage: Keep the bottle tightly closed and store in a cool, dry place.\nAllergic Reactions: If you have sensitive skin or allergies, perform a patch test before full application.\nEye Contact: Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nDisposal: Discard after 12 months of opening.', 2200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 450.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Jergens Oil-Infused Skin Firming Moisturiser 496mlPrice in BD', 'Jergens Oil-Infused Skin Firming Moisturiser 496ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'jergens-oil-infused-skin-firming-moisturiser-496ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(925, 'Kitao Organic Matcha & Chia Facial Cream', '1', 0, 10, 261, '925', '925', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This facial cream uses antioxidant-rich superfoods such as ECOCERT-certified organic matcha directly from Kyoto, Japan to hydrate, replenish skin, and keep moisture locked in all day long. If you’re tired of moisturizing creams that leave your skin feeling greasy or sticky, then this is the perfect facial cream for you. Our formula firms, moisturizes and revitalizes skin all without leaving behind a sticky residue. The quinoa and açai in this formula also help minimize free radical damage and even out skin complexion. Trust us, your skin will thank you for finding a facial cream that works all day to keep your face hydrated and healthy!', 1599.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1276.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Kitao Organic Matcha & Chia Facial CreamPrice in BD', 'Kitao Organic Matcha & Chia Facial Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'kitao-organic-matcha-chia-facial-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(926, 'Quiyum Collagen Hydrating Moisturizer Cream', '1', 0, 10, 5, '926', '926', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Achieve firmer, more radiant skin with Quiyum Collagen Hydrating Moisturizer Cream. Enriched with collagen, this luxurious cream works to restore elasticity and provide intense hydration for a youthful glow. Its lightweight formula absorbs quickly, leaving your skin feeling soft, smooth, and revitalized.\nRevitalize your skin with Quiyum Collagen Hydrating Moisturizer Cream—a perfect blend of hydration and firming care for a youthful complexion!Country of Origin: PRC', 305.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 145.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Quiyum Collagen Hydrating Moisturizer CreamPrice in BD', 'Quiyum Collagen Hydrating Moisturizer Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'quiyum-collagen-hydrating-moisturizer-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(927, 'Neogen Dermalogy Collagen Lifting Cream 70ml', '1', 0, 10, 56, '927', '927', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neogen Dermalogy Collagen Lifting Cream\'s collagen extracts lift the skin texture naturally and help absorb nutrients, providing glossy and dense elasticity. It contains collagen, which is essential for making the skin firm and elastic, regains the elasticity and gloss of the skin and strains the surface of the skin to maintain a tight, raised faceStrengthens the natural skin barrier, tight and complete healthy looking skinIt contains ingredients that strengthen the skin barrier such as panthenol, adenosine, and ceramide to firmly stack the skin structure to restore the disordered skin condition.\nFeatures:\nKey Ingredients:\nIt helps restore skin condition and boosts skin texture closely to improve skin elasticity\nwrinkle-enhancing ingredientsSafe and effective wrinkle improvement Functional ingredients help improve stretched skin wrinkles\nwrinkle-enhancing ingredientsSafe and effective wrinkle improvement Functional ingredients help improve stretched skin wrinkles\nHelps regenerate the skin and strengthens the barrierCeramide protects the skin from damage such as external harmful factors and uv and helps keep it healthy.\nUsage:\nAfter apply the appropriate amount of skin care and apply smoothly on the last stage, and put it smoothly on face and neck.', 1892.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1108.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neogen Dermalogy Collagen Lifting Cream 70mlPrice in BD', 'Neogen Dermalogy Collagen Lifting Cream 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neogen-dermalogy-collagen-lifting-cream-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(928, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Body Firmer Body Lotion 150ml', '1', 0, 10, 104, '928', '928', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Body Firmer Body Lotion (150ml)\nDescription:Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Body Firmer Body Lotion is a premium, organic skincare product designed to nourish, hydrate, and firm the skin. Formulated with natural and medical-grade ingredients, this lotion helps improve skin elasticity, reduce the appearance of cellulite, and promote a smoother, more toned complexion. It is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin, and is free from harmful chemicals, parabens, and synthetic fragrances.\nKey Benefits:\nSkin Firming: Enhances skin elasticity and firmness, reducing sagging and promoting a more youthful appearance.\nHydration: Deeply moisturizes the skin, leaving it soft, supple, and revitalized.\nCellulite Reduction: Helps minimize the appearance of cellulite for smoother-looking skin.\nOrganic Ingredients: Made with natural, organic components that are gentle yet effective.\nNon-Greasy Formula: Absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky residue.\nIdeal For:\nIndividuals looking to improve skin firmness and elasticity.\nThose seeking a natural, organic solution for cellulite reduction.\nAnyone wanting deep hydration and nourishment for their skin.\nHow to Use:Apply the Body Firmer Lotion generously to clean, dry skin, focusing on areas that need firming or hydration. Massage in circular motions until fully absorbed. For best results, use daily, preferably after a shower or bath.\nVolume: 150ml\nCertifications:\nOrganic\nDermatologically Tested\nFree from Parabens, Sulfates, and Synthetic Fragrances\nIngredients:A blend of organic oils, plant extracts, and medical-grade components such as:\nAloe Vera\nShea Butter\nJojoba Oil\nVitamin E\nNatural Collagen Boosters\nWhy Choose Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care?Biomd is committed to providing high-quality, organic skincare solutions that are both effective and safe. Their products are crafted with care, ensuring that your skin receives the best natural ingredients for optimal health and beauty.\nPerfect for those who prioritize clean beauty and want to achieve firmer, smoother, and more radiant skin naturally.', 1850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 40.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Body Firmer Body Lotion 150mlPrice in BD', 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Body Firmer Body Lotion 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biomd-organic-medical-skin-care-body-firmer-body-lotion-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
