(930, 'Medicube PDRN Booster Gel with 7 Types of Peptide 300ml', '1', 0, 28, 96, '930', '930', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Medicube AGE-R PDRN Booster Gel is a high-performance Korean skincare essential formulated to hydrate, firm, and rejuvenate your skin. Powered by Salmon PDRN and a complex of 7 peptides, this lightweight gel penetrates deep into the skin to support elasticity, calm irritation, and enhance the skin’s natural glow. Designed to address early signs of aging, it delivers intensive nourishment and helps restore the skin’s moisture barrier—perfect for daily use in any advanced skincare routine.', 2565.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 285.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube PDRN Booster Gel with 7 Types of Peptide 300mlPrice in BD', 'Medicube PDRN Booster Gel with 7 Types of Peptide 300ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-pdrn-booster-gel-with-7-types-of-peptide-300ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(931, 'Sadoer Pomegranate Sooting Gel 99% 300g', '1', 0, 28, 29, '931', '931', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Deep Hydration - Post-Sun Repair - Multi-Use Moisturizer\nSADOER Pomegranate Soothing Gel harnesses 99% pure pomegranate extract in a lightweight 300g formula for instant skin hydration and calming care. This fast-absorbing, non-sticky gel nourishes face and body while repairing sun-exposed skin, delivering supple texture and healthy glow through antioxidant-rich pomegranate essence.\n\n99% Pomegranate Fruit Extract provides potent antioxidant protection\nHyaluronic Acid and Hydrolyzed Collagen enhance deep moisture retention\nCentella Asiatica and Aloe Vera soothe irritation and redness\nNiacinamide brightens tone and strengthens skin barrier\nMulti-functional for face, body, and hair application\n\nLocks in moisture for long-lasting softness and plumpness\nCalms and repairs skin after sun exposure or irritation\nReduces redness and inflammation with natural botanicals\nImproves skin elasticity through collagen stimulation\nEvens complexion with gentle brightening action\n\nAfter cleansing, apply generous layer to face and body\nGently massage until fully absorbed for maximum efficacy\nUse morning and evening or as post-sun soothing treatment\nLayer with other products or use alone for lightweight hydration\nSafe for sensitive skin with patch test recommendation\n\nPatch test behind ear before full facial use\nDiscontinue if irritation or discomfort occurs\nAvoid direct eye contact; rinse if contact happens\nNot recommended for children under 3 years\nStore in cool, ventilated place away from sunlight\n\nKeep below 25°C in dry environment\nTightly seal after each use\nUse within 12 months of opening\n\nFace and body safe? Yes, multi-use formula for complete coverage.\nHeavy or sticky? Lightweight gel absorbs without residue.\nPost-sun essential? Perfect for calming and repairing sun-stressed skin.\nDaily use appropriate? Ideal morning and evening hydration.\n\nHigh-potency 99% pomegranate concentration maximizes benefits\nMulti-tasking formula replaces multiple skincare products\nClean absorption suitable under makeup or sunscreen\nComprehensive soothing and hydration for all skin types', 450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '300g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 400.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sadoer Pomegranate Sooting Gel 99% 300gPrice in BD', 'Sadoer Pomegranate Sooting Gel 99% 300g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sadoer-pomegranate-sooting-gel-99-300g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(932, 'Dabo Watermelon Pure Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 207, '932', '932', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Benefits:\nDeep Hydration: Watermelon extract, rich in vitamins A and C, delivers intense moisture, leaving the skin refreshed and supple.\nSoothing and Calming: The gel provides a cooling effect, alleviating irritation, redness, and sunburn, making it ideal for sensitive skin.\nLightweight and Non-Greasy: Its quick-absorbing formula ensures no sticky residue, making it suitable for daily use on both face and body.\nHow to Use:\nCleansing: Start with clean, dry skin.\nApplication: Apply a generous amount to desired areas, such as the face, neck, arms, or legs.\nAbsorption: Gently massage until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use as needed, especially after sun exposure or when skin feels dry or irritated.\nIngredients:\nWatermelon Extract: Provides hydration and essential nutrients.\nAloe Vera: Soothes and calms the skin.\nNiacinamide: Brightens skin tone and improves texture.\nAdditional Components: Water, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Betaine, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Phenoxyethanol, Allantoin, Polysorbate 80, Fragrance.', 899.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 411.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo Watermelon Pure Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'Dabo Watermelon Pure Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-watermelon-pure-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
