(935, 'Fixderma FCL AHA Lightening Gel 30ml', '1', 0, 28, 116, '935', '935', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fixderma Lightening Gel supports healthy cell renewal while exfoliating away dry, dead, complexion-dulling cells. It is a lightweight gel, helps to improve severe to a moderate acne condition. It should be applied as a thin layer on clean face.\nHow to use', 2510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 135.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fixderma FCL AHA Lightening Gel 30mlPrice in BD', 'Fixderma FCL AHA Lightening Gel 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fixderma-fcl-aha-lightening-gel-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(936, 'MISSHA Premium Cica Aloe Soothing Gel with Cica & Aloe – 300ml(Maid In Korea)', '1', 0, 28, 262, '936', '936', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Soothe, hydrate, and refresh your skin anytime with MISSHA Premium Cica Aloe Soothing Gel. This lightweight, fast-absorbing gel is dermatologically tested and formulated with Aloe Vera Leaf Extract and Centella Asiatica (Cica) Extract to help calm irritated or sensitive-feeling skin without any sticky finish. Perfect for daily moisturizing and after-sun care, it leaves skin feeling cool, soft, and comfortably hydrated.\nUse it on the face, neck, arms, legs, or any dry area whenever your skin needs an instant boost of moisture. Its refreshing gel texture makes it ideal for hot weather, post-shower hydration, or anytime skin feels tight and dry.\nSoothing + cooling hydration for dry or irritated skin\nNon-sticky, lightweight gel texture\nDermatologically tested (skin irritation test completed)\nHelps calm skin with Aloe + Cica (Centella Asiatica)\nMulti-use: suitable for face & body\nLarge 300ml jar—great value for daily use\nAloe Vera Leaf Extract (4,750 ppm) – refreshing moisture & soothing care\nCentella Asiatica Extract (Cica) (0.6 ppm) – calming support\nHyaluronic Acid complex (Sodium Hyaluronate + Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid and more) – helps retain moisture\nAllantoin, Beta-Glucan, Betaine – comfort and hydration support\nApply to face, neck, arms, legs, or any dry area whenever needed. Gently spread and let it absorb.\nProduct Type: Soothing Gel (Face & Body)\nNet Volume: 300ml\nMade in: Korea\nPAO (After Opening): 12M (use within 12 months after opening)\nStop use if irritation or rash occurs. Do not use on broken skin. Keep out of reach of children. Store away from direct sunlight.', 1210.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 589.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'MISSHA Premium Cica Aloe Soothing Gel with Cica & Aloe – 300ml(Maid In Korea)Price in BD', 'MISSHA Premium Cica Aloe Soothing Gel with Cica & Aloe – 300ml(Maid In Korea) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'missha-premium-cica-aloe-soothing-gel-with-cica-aloe-300mlmaid-in-korea', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(937, 'Skin Doctor Honey & Orange Soothing Gel 300ml', '1', 0, 28, 263, '937', '937', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skin naturally with Skin Doctor Honey & Orange Soothing Gel, a dual-action formula enriched with honey and orange extracts that hydrate, brighten, and soothe your skin. Suitable for both face and body, this refreshing gel helps maintain your skin’s natural moisture balance while improving texture and radiance — perfect for use in any season.\nHoney extract acts as a natural humectant, locking in moisture and preventing dryness.\nHelps to soothe skin inflammation and irritation, keeping your skin calm and soft.\nIdeal for dry or dehydrated skin, providing long-lasting hydration.\nOrange fruit extract is rich in vitamin C, which helps reduce dark spots and uneven skin tone.\nPromotes a radiant, youthful glow by improving dull, tired-looking skin.\nHelps to strengthen the skin barrier and protect against environmental stress.\nAbsorbs quickly without leaving any greasy residue.\nPerfect to wear under makeup or as a daily moisturizer.\nProvides a cooling, soothing sensation — great for use after sun exposure.\n\nBecause it offers natural hydration, brightening, and soothing care — all in one lightweight formula. Give your skin the nourishment it deserves and enjoy healthy, radiant skin year-round.', 900.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 210.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Doctor Honey & Orange Soothing Gel 300mlPrice in BD', 'Skin Doctor Honey & Orange Soothing Gel 300ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-doctor-honey-orange-soothing-gel-300ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
