(940, 'Bionike Triderm Baby Soothing Cream', '1', 0, 28, 237, '940', '940', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bionike Triderm Baby Soothing Cream Soft oily cream Due to the high percentage of zinc oxide, it performs an effective soothing and protective action against all forms of skin irritation. Specifically formulated for the most sensitive skin, such as baby and baby, protects against redness and cracking.\nHow to use', 1743.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 37.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionike Triderm Baby Soothing CreamPrice in BD', 'Bionike Triderm Baby Soothing Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionike-triderm-baby-soothing-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(941, 'Nature Beauty Milk Moisture Soothing Gel 130ml', '1', 0, 28, 78, '941', '941', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nature Beauty 99% Pure Milk Moisture Gel- formulated with pure milk extract providing long-lasting moisture, making it perfect for all skin types. Consist of vitamins and proteins, it helps to improve skin texture and elasticity, promoting a glowing and youthful appearance.\nIngredients: Aqua, Carbopol, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Aloe Vera Extract, Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Triethanolamine, Color, Milk Protein.\nUses: Cleanse your face thoroughly. Take an appropriate amount of gel on your fingers or a spatula and gently massage it onto your face and neck in circular motions. It can be used along with a regular moisturizer. Before first use, it is highly recommended to do a patch test on a small area of skin to check for any reactions.\n', 225.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '130ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nature Beauty Milk Moisture Soothing Gel 130mlPrice in BD', 'Nature Beauty Milk Moisture Soothing Gel 130ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nature-beauty-milk-moisture-soothing-gel-130ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(942, 'Beaute Melasma Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 87, '942', '942', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Beaute Melasma-X Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel is a skincare product designed to brighten and soothe the skin, particularly for those with hyperpigmentation and melasma concerns. It comes in a 50g tub.The key ingredient in this gel is Moringa extract, which is known for its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties that help protect and soothe the skin. Moringa extract is also believed to help reduce the appearance of dark spots and hyperpigmentation.The gel is also formulated with other natural ingredients such as aloe vera, which helps soothe and hydrate the skin, and niacinamide, which can help even out skin tone and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. It also contains vitamin C, which can help brighten and protect the skin from free radical damage.The cooling agents in the gel provide a refreshing and calming sensation on the skin, while the lightweight and non-sticky texture make it suitable for daily use. This product is suitable for all skin types.\nKey Ingredients:\nHow to use:\n\nIt is recommended to perform a patch test before using the product to ensure that you are not allergic to any of the ingredients. Avoid contact with the eyes, and if the product gets into your eyes, rinse them thoroughly with water.\nCountry of Origin: Korea', 745.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 305.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beaute Melasma Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'Beaute Melasma Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beaute-melasma-moringa-brightening-cool-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(943, 'Simi Emi Coenzyme Q10 Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 264, '943', '943', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The blending of Coenzyme Q10, herbal extracts help to metabolize skin cells and get rid of dead skin cells to produce healthy skin.In addition, these ingredients work to reinforce the skin’s barrier.\nUsage:\nWash your hand use the fingertips to apply a small amount of coenzyme Q10 on your face.Message the full face for a minute. Rinse with cool water and dry the face with soft cloths, Follow with toner for smoothing your skin tone. Follow with lotion or sunblock or cream for additional beautification.\nIngredients:\nWater, Ubiquinone(Coenzyme Q10), Triethanolamine, Carbomer, Butylene Glycol, PEG-60 Hydrogenated Castor Oil,1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Hydroxyethylcellulose,Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Fragrance, DisodiumEDTA, Glycerin, Illicium Verum (Anise) Fruit Extract, Niacinamide, Ethylhexylglycerin,Lecithin, Ceramide NP', 799.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 301.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simi Emi Coenzyme Q10 Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'Simi Emi Coenzyme Q10 Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simi-emi-coenzyme-q10-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(944, 'ZQ-II Aqp Free Soothing Anti-Itch Body Lotion 150gm', '1', 0, 28, 39, '944', '944', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Description:The ZQ-II AQP Free Soothing Anti-Itch Body Lotion is a specialized skincare solution designed to alleviate dryness and itching. Its unique AQP-Free formula, enriched with botanical extracts like aloe vera, orchid, goji berry, and string tree leaf, helps balance and restore the skin\'s moisture content. This lotion not only soothes and calms irritated skin but also strengthens the natural skin barrier, leaving the skin soft, smooth, and nourished.\nKey Features:\nAQP-Free Formula: Targets dryness and itching without disrupting the skin\'s natural moisture channels.\nBotanical Extracts: Contains aloe vera, orchid, goji berry, and string tree leaf extract for enhanced soothing and moisturizing effects.\nIntensive Moisturization: Provides deep hydration, making the skin feel soft and silky smooth.\nSkin Barrier Support: Strengthens the skin\'s natural defenses against environmental stressors.\nVegan-Friendly: Formulated without animal-derived ingredients.\nUsage Instructions:Apply the lotion generously to clean, dry skin. Massage gently until fully absorbed. Use regularly for optimal results.\nProduct Details:\nSize: 150g', 1512.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 168.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ZQ-II Aqp Free Soothing Anti-Itch Body Lotion 150gmPrice in BD', 'ZQ-II Aqp Free Soothing Anti-Itch Body Lotion 150gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'zq-ii-aqp-free-soothing-anti-itch-body-lotion-150gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(945, 'HG. Zrly 99% Moisturising Repair Aloe Vera Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 265, '945', '945', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'HG. Zrly 99% Moisturising Repair Aloe Vera Soothing Gel – 300ml\nSoothe, hydrate, and heal your skin with the refreshing power of HG. Zrly 99% Aloe Vera Soothing Gel. Infused with 99% pure aloe vera extract, this multi-purpose gel delivers intense moisture and instant relief for dry, sunburned, irritated, or sensitive skin.\nLightweight and fast-absorbing, the gel glides on smoothly without leaving a sticky residue. It’s perfect for daily use on the face, body, and even hair. Whether used as a moisturizer, after-sun treatment, or a calming mask, it helps repair the skin barrier while leaving your skin feeling soft, supple, and rejuvenated.\nKey Benefits:\nContains 99% pure aloe vera for deep hydration and skin repair\nCalms sunburn, redness, and irritation instantly\nLightweight, non-sticky formula suitable for all skin types\nMulti-functional: use as a moisturizer, aftershave, hair treatment, or soothing mask\nFree from parabens, sulfates, and artificial colors\nIdeal For:All skin types, especially sensitive, dry, or sun-exposed skin.', 732.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 368.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'HG. Zrly 99% Moisturising Repair Aloe Vera Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'HG. Zrly 99% Moisturising Repair Aloe Vera Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'hg-zrly-99-moisturising-repair-aloe-vera-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(946, 'Bcare Milk Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 249, '946', '946', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1. The skin will GLASS SKIN.2. Moisturizes the skin.3. Eliminates the impression of age.4. Tightens the skin.5. Brightens the skin, without any side effects6. Increases skin radiance.7. Minimizes pores.8. Works to remove sunburn naturally.9. Makes skin glow naturally.10. Removes excess oil from the skin11. Removes dark skin.12. Cleans the skin from the inside due to which there is less chance of acne.13. Will remove dark spots under the eyes.14. Smoothens the skin.', 327.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 23.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bcare Milk Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'Bcare Milk Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bcare-milk-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(947, 'Lavino Aloe Vera 99% Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 205, '947', '947', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lavino Aloe Vera Gel is a versatile soothing gel enriched with vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants that moisturize and heal skin and hair. Moisturizes and heals dry skin, Soothes Sunburn, Promotes hair growth, Makes hair soft & silky.\nFor skin:\nFor hair:\nKey Ingredients:Aloe Vera(Aloe Barbadensis): The scientific name of Aloe vera is Aloe barbadensis miller. It is a short-stemmed shrub that stores water in its leaves. Aloe vera has been used for centuries for a variety of purposes and is best known for its soothing effects on sunburns. However, it also has many other potential benefits for the skin, such as fading dark spots and stretch marks, managing acne, and slowing the signs of aging. Ingredients:Aqua, Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Leaf Extract, Xylitol, Propylene Glycol, Carbomer, Dipropylene Glycol, 1,3-Propanediol, PEG-40 Hydroginated Castor Oil, Trideceth-9, Phenoxyethanol, Triethanolamine, Allantoin, Disodium EDTA, Parfum.Usag Direction:Apply an adequate amount of aloe vera gel on the face in a circular motion and gently massage the scalp. For use on hair, leave for 30 minutes to 1 hour and wash off. Also, use a generous amount of aloe vera gel in various face and hair masks. Before use, a patch is recommended.\nWho can use Lavino Aloe Vera Soothing Gel?Both men and women above 15+ years can use this product.Country of Origin: Bangldesh', 374.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 101.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lavino Aloe Vera 99% Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'Lavino Aloe Vera 99% Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lavino-aloe-vera-99-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(948, 'MARS All Oil Blotter Gel Compact for Poreless Effect (5gm)', '1', 0, 28, 266, '948', '948', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Get an instant shine-free, smooth-looking finish with MARS All Oil Blotter Gel Compact. Made for everyone, this lightweight gel compact absorbs excess oil instantly, helps mattify and control shine, and blurs the look of pores for a clean, poreless-effect makeup base. Perfect for quick touch-ups throughout the day—especially for oily or combination skin.\nAbsorbs oil instantly\nMattifies & controls shine\nBlurs pores for a smoother-looking finish\nLightweight gel compact texture\nIdeal for daily use & on-the-go touch-ups\nNet Weight: 5g\nGently dab onto oily areas (T-zone, forehead, nose, chin) using clean fingers or a sponge. Reapply as needed for shine control.\nPolymethylsilsesquioxane, Dimethicone, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Vinyl Dimethicone/Methicone Silsesquioxane Crosspolymer, Phenoxyethanol, Tridecyl Trimellitate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil.May Contain (+/-): Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850)\nMfd By/For: Zebra Brands Ltd., No.5, 17/F, Strand 50, 50 Bonham Strand, Sheung Wan, Hong Kong', 770.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 520.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'MARS All Oil Blotter Gel Compact for Poreless Effect (5gm)Price in BD', 'MARS All Oil Blotter Gel Compact for Poreless Effect (5gm) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mars-all-oil-blotter-gel-compact-for-poreless-effect-5gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(949, 'Gongskin Aloe Niacinamide Soothing Gel – Hydrating & Refreshing Skin Gel', '1', 0, 28, 123, '949', '949', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Gongskin Aloe Niacinamide Soothing Gel combines the hydrating power of aloe vera with the brightening and soothing benefits of niacinamide. This lightweight gel provides long-lasting moisture, leaving the skin soft, supple, and refreshed without any sticky residue. Ideal for dry or irritated skin, it can be used on both face and body.\nKey Benefits:\nDeeply hydrates and soothes dry skin\nContains niacinamide for brightening and calming\nLightweight, non-sticky texture\nSuitable for daily use on face and body\nHow to Use:Take an appropriate amount and gently apply to dry areas. Pat until fully absorbed.\nKey Ingredients:Niacinamide (1000ppm), Aloe Vera Leaf Extract (100ppm), Sodium Hyaluronate, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol\nPrecautions:\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nAvoid application on wounds or sensitive areas\nKeep out of reach of children\nVolume: Not specified (can add if known)', 930.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 410.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gongskin Aloe Niacinamide Soothing Gel – Hydrating & Refreshing Skin GelPrice in BD', 'Gongskin Aloe Niacinamide Soothing Gel – Hydrating & Refreshing Skin Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gongskin-aloe-niacinamide-soothing-gel-hydrating-refreshing-skin-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(950, '3W Clinic Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 114, '950', '950', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel is a skincare product that comes in a 160g tub. The gel is designed to provide a refreshing and hydrating sensation to the skin, while also brightening and soothing it.The key ingredient in this gel is Moringa extract, which is derived from the Moringa oleifera plant. This extract is known for its anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties, which can help to soothe and protect the skin.Other ingredients in the gel include aloe vera, which is also known for its soothing properties, and niacinamide, which can help to brighten the skin and even out skin tone. The gel is also formulated with cooling agents that provide a refreshing sensation on the skin.\n\n\nKey Ingredients:\n\nHow to use:\n\nMade in Korea', 730.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing GelPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-moringa-brightening-cool-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
