(954, 'Dabo Avocado Vital Rich Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 207, '954', '954', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Benefits:\nDeep Hydration: Enriched with avocado extract, known for its rich vitamins and fatty acids, this gel delivers intense moisture, leaving the skin soft and supple.\nSoothing Properties: The gel helps eliminate sunburn and reduce redness, calming irritated skin and alleviating small rashes.\nSkin Brightening: Regular use can lead to a lighter complexion, as the gel works to fade dark spots and even out skin tone.\nAnti-Aging Effects: By promoting skin regeneration, the gel reduces the impression of age, contributing to a more youthful appearance.\n\nHow to Use:\nCleansing: Begin with a clean face and body, ensuring all impurities are removed.\nApplication: Apply an appropriate amount of the gel to the desired areas, such as the face, neck, arms, or legs.\nAbsorption: Gently massage the gel into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use as needed, especially after sun exposure or when the skin feels dry or irritated.\nIngredients:\nKey Components:\nFull Ingredient List:', 989.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 321.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo Avocado Vital Rich Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'Dabo Avocado Vital Rich Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-avocado-vital-rich-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
