(957, 'MAYA True Herbs Aloe Vera Gel - 250ml', '1', 0, 28, 187, '957', '957', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Name: MAYA Aloe Vera Gel\nMAYA Aloe Vera Gel, sourced from the lush and nutrient-rich fields of North Bengal, is a product of nature\'s finest care and innovation. Meticulously extracted from handpicked aloe vera plants, it guarantees the purest, most consistent quality. With 99% pure aloe vera gel, it serves as a multipurpose gel for skin and hair care, offering instant relief, nourishment, and hydration.\n\nKey benefits of MAYA Aloe Vera Gel:\nSkin Benefits:\nMoisturizes & Hydrates: MAYA Aloe Vera Gel provides deep hydration, helping to keep your skin soft and refreshed.Soothes & Calms: It gently soothes sunburn and heat irritation, offering an immediate cooling relief.Minimizes Inflammation: Reduces skin irritation due to allergens and minimizes post-cooking inflammation on skin.Soothes sensitive skin: Instantly calms sensitive skin due to its natural cooling properties.\nHair Benefits:\nHair Shaping: Use MAYA Aloe Vera Gel as a natural alternative to harsh chemical hair gels, providing smooth, flexible hold while styling and shaping your hair with no side effects.Moisturizes & Conditions: It nourishes the hair, providing a natural shine, frizz control and softness.Healthy Scalp: Aloe Vera’s antifungal properties support a healthier scalp by reducing dandruff and itchiness.Ideal for hair packs: Combine with coconut oil, honey, methi and other natural ingredients to amplify the deep nourishing effects.Net Quantity: 250 ml\n\nUsage directions:\nMassage an appropriate amount of MAYA Aloe Vera Gel onto clean, dry skin. Use this natural gel for immediate soothing effect and relief from irritation, especially after cooking or sun exposure. Use the gel every morning and night to keep your skin refreshed and hydrated. Apply into clean hair for added shine and moisture. Ideal to blend with natural ingredients for creating hair packs.', 268.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '250ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 57.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'MAYA True Herbs Aloe Vera Gel - 250mlPrice in BD', 'MAYA True Herbs Aloe Vera Gel - 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'maya-true-herbs-aloe-vera-gel-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(958, 'Chamomile Essence Soothing 200ml', '1', 0, 28, 269, '958', '958', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chamomile Essence Soothing 200ml – Ultimate Skin Calming Solution\nA luxurious, alcohol-free facial essence infused with pure chamomile extract to instantly calm irritated skin, reduce redness, and restore your natural glow. Perfect for sensitive, dry, or stressed skin.\n✔ Deeply Hydrates – Locks in moisture for 24-hour suppleness✔ Reduces Redness & Irritation – Soothes sunburn, rosacea, and reactive skin✔ Anti-Inflammatory – Calms acne, eczema, and post-treatment sensitivity✔ Brightens Dull Skin – Evens tone and enhances radiance✔ Prepares Skin – Perfect pre-serum step for better product absorption\n• German Chamomile Extract – Rich in azulene and bisabolol for intense soothing• Hyaluronic Acid – Boosts hydration and plumps fine lines• Aloe Vera Juice – Cools and repairs damaged skin• Panthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5) – Strengthens skin barrier• Allantoin – Promotes gentle healing\n1️⃣ Cleanse skin thoroughly.2️⃣ Apply 3-5 drops to palms or cotton pad.3️⃣ Gently press onto face/neck (avoid rubbing).4️⃣ Follow with serum/moisturizer.✨ Use AM/PM or as a calming mask when skin feels stressed.\n✅ 100% Vegan & Cruelty-Free✅ No Alcohol/Parabens/Sulfates✅ Dermatologist-Tested✅ Safe for All Skin Types (Even ultra-sensitive skin)\n1 x Chamomile Essence Soothing (200ml glass bottle with dropper)\n💡 Pro Tip: Keep in fridge for extra cooling relief on puffy mornings!\n✖ Artificial Fragrance✖ Harsh Preservatives✖ Mineral Oil', 616.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 534.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Chamomile Essence Soothing 200mlPrice in BD', 'Chamomile Essence Soothing 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'chamomile-essence-soothing-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
