(965, 'Dr. C. Tuna Aloe Vera Gel 100ml', '1', 0, 28, 272, '965', '965', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Dr. C. Tuna Aloe Vera Gel (100ml) is a skincare product designed to provide deep hydration and soothe the skin. Enriched with a high concentration of Aloe Vera, it forms a protective layer, promoting a natural glow and relaxation.\n\nKey Features:\nHigh Aloe Vera Concentration: Contains 93% concentrated Aloe Vera, known for its moisturizing and soothing properties.\nEnriched with Grape Seed Extract: This antioxidant-rich ingredient enhances skin health and provides additional nourishment.\nFast-Absorbing Formula: The gel absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a sticky residue, ensuring comfort and ease of use.\nBenefits:\nDeep Hydration: Provides intense moisture, making it suitable for dry and sensitive skin areas.\nSoothing Effect: Calms irritated skin, which is beneficial after sun exposure or shaving.\nProtective Layer: Forms a barrier that helps retain moisture and shields the skin from environmental factors.\nHow to Use:\nApplication: Apply an appropriate amount to clean skin, focusing on dry or sensitive areas.\nFrequency: Use as often as necessary to maintain hydration and comfort.\nCaution: Avoid applying to broken skin.\nIngredients:\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice: Provides hydration and has anti-inflammatory properties.\nGrape Seed Extract: Rich in antioxidants, it helps protect the skin from damage and supports overall skin health.\nCarbomer: Used as a thickening agent to give the gel its consistency.\nEthylhexylglycerin and Phenoxyethanol: Serve as preservatives to maintain the product\'s shelf life.\nMade in Turkey', 858.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 342.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr. C. Tuna Aloe Vera Gel 100mlPrice in BD', 'Dr. C. Tuna Aloe Vera Gel 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-c-tuna-aloe-vera-gel-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(966, 'Lavino Tomato 99% Hydrating & Glowing Soothing Gel 250ml', '1', 0, 28, 205, '966', '966', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lavino Tomato 99% Soothing Gel is a lightweight, multi-purpose skincare solution enriched with 99% pure tomato extract. Designed to hydrate, brighten, and calm the skin, this gel delivers essential nutrients and antioxidants like lycopene and vitamin C to promote a healthy, radiant complexion. Its non-sticky formula absorbs quickly, making it ideal for daily use on the face, body, and even hair.\nKey Features\nBenefits\nUsage Instructions\nRecommended For\nCountry of Origin\n\n', 374.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 101.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lavino Tomato 99% Hydrating & Glowing Soothing Gel 250mlPrice in BD', 'Lavino Tomato 99% Hydrating & Glowing Soothing Gel 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lavino-tomato-99-hydrating-glowing-soothing-gel-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(967, 'Nature Beauty Aloe Vera Moisture Soothing Gel 130ml', '1', 0, 28, 78, '967', '967', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nature Beauty 99% Pure Aloe Vera Moisture Soothing Gel is a light-textured, refreshing gel that helps to hydrate, calm, and nourish your skin and hair. Derived from the finest aloe vera plants, this gel is packed with natural nutrients and antioxidants that provide intense moisture while promoting skin healing.\nIngredients: Aqua, Aloe Vera Extract, Carbopol, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Alpha Arbutin, Triethanolamine, Flavor.\nUses: Cleanse your face thoroughly. Take an appropriate amount of gel on your fingers or a spatula and gently massage it onto your face and neck in circular motions. It can be used along with a regular moisturizer. Before first use, it is highly recommended to do a patch test on a small area of skin to check for any reactions.\n', 225.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '130ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nature Beauty Aloe Vera Moisture Soothing Gel 130mlPrice in BD', 'Nature Beauty Aloe Vera Moisture Soothing Gel 130ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nature-beauty-aloe-vera-moisture-soothing-gel-130ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28');
