(968, 'Laxzin Aloe Vera Soothing Gel 300ml', '1', 0, 28, 54, '968', '968', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laxzin Aloe Vera Soothing Gel 300ml\n\nLaxzin Aloe Vera Soothing Gel is supposed to be a part of your skincare routine. It contains a light formula with a refreshing, cooling sensation. Manufactured from aloe vera, it is well known for its soothing properties. It helps soothe and hydrate your skin. You can use it for sunburns and dryness or as a moisturizer in your daily routine. This product will definitely enhance your skincare collection.\n\nFeatures and Benefits:\n\nHelps with Skin Irritation: Laxzin Aloe Vera Gel soothes skin irritations. The product can be used in cases of cuts or minor burns. The aloe vera in it soothes the skin. It reduces discomfort and helps the skin to heal faster. It is great for sensitive skin.\n\nDeeply moisturizes the skin: It is quickly absorbed into the skin and does not leave any greasy feeling after use. It leaves your skin soft and smooth for hours. It also locks hydration and prevents dryness. Perfect for everyday use.\n\nSun damage protection: If one has been in the sun, then Laxzin Aloe Vera Gel is a great product to be used. It soothes your skin after exposure to the sun. This reduces redness and irritation caused by the sun. Aloe vera protects your skin from harmful UV rays.\n\nLightweight and Non-Greasy: This soothing gel is lightweight and non-greasy. It does not leave any sticky residue on your skin. It feels comfortable and fresh after application. You can apply it anytime without worrying about feeling oily.\n\nLaxzin Aloe Vera Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh\nLaxzin Aloe Vera Soothing Gel is available at the best price in Bangladesh on your own Rokomari.com. Grab it now from us!', 539.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 60.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laxzin Aloe Vera Soothing Gel 300mlPrice in BD', 'Laxzin Aloe Vera Soothing Gel 300ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laxzin-aloe-vera-soothing-gel-300ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(969, 'Paxmoly 99% Deep Marine Collagen Soothing Gel', '1', 0, 28, 82, '969', '969', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pax Moly 99% Deep Marine Collagen Soothing Gel made with Collagen and natural ingredients, Botanical made, Soothing after suntan / Body & face moisturizer. You can use this gel in 10 ways. Such as Facial toner/lotion/moisturizer, Anti-aging gel, Make-up base, After the shave, Body gel after bathing, Hair Treatment, Nail care, Facial pack, Wrinkle care, Aromatic massage. But we just suggest you, you can use this product just body and face for better result.\nUsage:\nFollow the skin care 5-Step Regimen\nStep 1: Cleanse – Wash your face with a gentle Cleanser accordingly to your skin type.\nStep 2: Tone- Toner helps to calmed and balanced skin pH after cleansing.\nStep 3: Treat – Serum contain useful nutrients — for your skin.\nStep 4: Moisturize – Paxmoly 99% Deep Marine Collagen Soothing GelApply as needed to face. Massage gently for the gel to be absorbed in the skin.\nStep 5: Sun Care – Apply Sunscreen to protect skin from UV Ray (Day time only)\n\nIngredients:\nDisodium EDTA, Ficus Carica (Fig) Fruit Extract, Water, Carbomer, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Alcohol, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, PEG-60 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Triethanolamine, Fragrance, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract', 970.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 280.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Paxmoly 99% Deep Marine Collagen Soothing GelPrice in BD', 'Paxmoly 99% Deep Marine Collagen Soothing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'paxmoly-99-deep-marine-collagen-soothing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
