(974, 'Siodil Acqua De Rose Gel 40gm', '1', 0, 28, 75, '974', '974', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Siodil Acqua De Rose Gel (40gm) is a premium skincare product infused with the natural goodness of rose extracts. This soothing gel is designed to hydrate, refresh, and rejuvenate your skin, making it soft, smooth, and radiant. Suitable for all skin types, it provides a gentle and luxurious experience for everyday skincare.\nRose Extracts for Nourishment:\nLightweight Gel Formula:\nDeep Hydration:\nSoothing Properties:\nMulti-Purpose Use:', 826.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 64.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Siodil Acqua De Rose Gel 40gmPrice in BD', 'Siodil Acqua De Rose Gel 40gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'siodil-acqua-de-rose-gel-40gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
(975, 'Nature Republic Soothing & Moisture Aloe Vera 92% Soothing Gel 300ml', '1', 0, 28, 273, '975', '975', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Introducing the Soothing & Moisture Aloe Vera 92% Soothing Gel from NATURE REPUBLIC—our all-time bestseller adored globally for its superior quality. Proudly crafted with 92% California-grown aloe leaves extract, this Korean skincare treasure offers unparalleled hydration, boasting a nutrient concentration four times greater than water. Certified by CCOF for its safety, this soothing gel is a testament to our commitment to environmentally conscious practices; it\'s 100% vegan as certified by the French vegan institute, Eve Vegan, and is free from sulfates, silicones, and parabens. Not just for your face, this versatile gel can be applied to any part of the body that needs a moisture boost, used on damaged hair, or even as a soothing treatment for swollen eyes, dry lips, and nails. It\'s also an excellent post-shave remedy. Available in multi-pack discounts, it makes an ideal gift to show your loved ones how much you care—just store it in the refrigerator for a refreshing treat that’s ready whenever you need it.\n\n\n\n\n\nSoothing & Moisture Aloe Vera 92% gel instantly hydrates the skin and leaves a crisp, cooled skin.\nTo relieve dyhydrated & tired skin, cool aloe gel before usage for even better cooling exprerience.\nTry using Nature Republic aloe vera gel as a hair essence to soothe dry hair and instantly relieve visible dehydration.', 1050.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 210.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nature Republic Soothing & Moisture Aloe Vera 92% Soothing Gel 300mlPrice in BD', 'Nature Republic Soothing & Moisture Aloe Vera 92% Soothing Gel 300ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nature-republic-soothing-moisture-aloe-vera-92-soothing-gel-300ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-