(978, 'Freyias Aloe Vera Gel 200ml', '1', 0, 28, 268, '978', '978', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description: Freyia\'s Aloe Vera Gel is likely formulated to provide soothing and hydrating benefits for the skin. Aloe vera is well-known for its calming and moisturizing properties, making it a popular ingredient in skincare products.\nKey Features:\nUsage: Apply a small amount of the gel to clean, dry skin. Massage gently until absorbed. Use as needed, especially after sun exposure, or to soothe irritated or dry skin.\nBenefits:\nNote: Always perform a patch test before using any new skincare product, especially if you have sensitive skin or known allergies. Aloe vera gel is generally well-tolerated, but it\'s best to test on a small area first to ensure there are no adverse reactions.', 254.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 31.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Freyias Aloe Vera Gel 200mlPrice in BD', 'Freyias Aloe Vera Gel 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'freyias-aloe-vera-gel-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
