(980, 'Absolute New York Poppy & Ivy Beauty Aloe Gel – All Skin Types, 200ml', '1', 0, 28, 86, '980', '980', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Experience the soothing power of nature with Absolute New York Poppy & Ivy Beauty Aloe Gel, specially formulated to hydrate, refresh, and calm your skin. Infused with pure aloe vera extract, this lightweight gel absorbs quickly to deliver deep hydration without any sticky residue. Suitable for all skin types, it helps restore moisture balance, soothe irritation, and promote smooth, healthy-looking skin.\nKey Benefits:\n🌿 Aloe Vera Extract: Calms and hydrates dry or irritated skin\n💧 Lightweight Formula: Absorbs fast without greasiness\n☀️ Multi-Purpose Use: Perfect for face, body, and hair\n🌸 Soothing Care: Ideal after sun exposure, shaving, or waxing\n🧴 Daily Moisturizer: Keeps skin soft, supple, and refreshed\nHow to Use:\nApply generously on clean, dry skin.\nGently massage until fully absorbed.\nUse daily or as needed for instant hydration and soothing relief.\nSuitable For:All skin types – including sensitive and dry skin\nNet Weight: 200mlMade by: Absolute New York', 1078.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 572.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Absolute New York Poppy & Ivy Beauty Aloe Gel – All Skin Types, 200mlPrice in BD', 'Absolute New York Poppy & Ivy Beauty Aloe Gel – All Skin Types, 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'absolute-new-york-poppy-ivy-beauty-aloe-gel-all-skin-types-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:28', '2026-02-11 08:14:28'),
