(986, 'Dot and Key Watermelon Fresh Spotlight Strobe Cream Natural Glam for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 29, 91, '986', '986', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Give your skin a remix of makeup & skincare with this illuminating strobe cream. Punched with juicy Watermelon, Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid, say hello to instantly dewy, lumionous skin. Plus, it gives your skin a megadose of moisturization while boosting skin radiance over time.\nBenefits:-Dewy, glowing skDewy, glowing skin instantly in instantly-Works as a moisturizer & highlighter-Boost skin radiance-For all skin tones-Blends easily & seamlessly\nIngredientsAqua, Dimethicone, Butylene glycol, Phenyl Trimethicone, Synthetic Fluorphlogopite (and) TiO2 (CI 77891) (and) Tin Oxide (CI 77861), Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer (and) Isohexadecane (and) Polysorbate 60, Cyclopentasiloxane (and) Cetearyl Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Cetyl Alcohol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Ceteareth 20 , Citrullus Lanatus (Watermelon) Fruit Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Niacinamide, Panthenol, Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate, Hydrogenated Castor oil, Glyceryl Stearate (and) PEG-100 Stearate, Talc (and) Titanium Dioxide (and) Cyclopentasiloxane (and) Dimethicone, Glycol Distearate, Glyceryl Stearate, Xanthan gum, Disodium EDTA, BHT, Phenoxyethanol (and) Ethylhexylglycerin, Fragrance\n\nDirections\n- Dot the cream on a clean face\n- Dab gently for seamless blending\n- Follow up with SPF during daytime\n\nPro Tip : Use it as a liquid highlighter or mix it with your foundation or liquid blush for that extra sheen.', 759.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 101.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Watermelon Fresh Spotlight Strobe Cream Natural Glam for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Watermelon Fresh Spotlight Strobe Cream Natural Glam for All Skin Types Price in Ba