(988, 'KA White Spot Cream Dark Spot Professional 45g – Brightening Spot Corrector', '1', 0, 29, 277, '988', '988', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'KA White Spot Cream Dark Spot Professional 45g – Brightening Spot Corrector\nTarget uneven skin tone and dark spots with KA White Spot Cream. Formulated with Tetrahydrocurcum, Vitamin B3, Vitamin E, and Titanium Dioxide, this cream works to lighten dark spots, reduce pigmentation, and brighten skin. Its gentle, effective formula helps even out skin tone while providing antioxidant protection and maintaining skin’s natural barrier. Suitable for all skin types, it can be used on the face and body to achieve a brighter, more radiant complexion.\nReduces Dark Spots: Tetrahydrocurcum and Vitamin B3 help fade pigmentation.\nBrightens Skin: Promotes an even and radiant skin tone.\nAntioxidant Protection: Vitamin E protects skin from free radicals.\nSun Protection Aid: Titanium Dioxide provides mild protection against UV rays.\nGentle & Effective: Suitable for all skin types and daily use.\nTetrahydrocurcum: Helps lighten dark spots and pigmentation.\nVitamin B3 (Niacinamide): Reduces discoloration and promotes even skin tone.\nVitamin E: Protects against oxidative stress and nourishes skin.\nTitanium Dioxide: Provides mild UV protection and enhances skin radiance.\nApply a thin layer to affected areas twice daily.\nMassage gently until fully absorbed.\nUse consistently for best results.\nFollow with sunscreen during daytime for additional protection.\nSize: 45gm\nForm: Spot cream\nSkin Type: All skin types, especially those with pigmentation or dark spots\nFinish: Brightened, even-toned, and protected skin\nSpot Treatment | Brightening | Antioxidant Protection | Gentle Formula', 1633.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 47.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'KA White Spot Cream Dark Spot Professional 45g – Brightening Spot CorrectorPrice in BD', 'KA White Spot 