(991, 'Vaseline Intensive Care Essential Healing Lotion 400ml', '1', 0, 29, 139, '991', '991', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vaseline Essential Healing Lotion is clinically proven to deeply moisturize and restore dry skin from the very first application. Enriched with pure oat extract and micro-droplets of Vaseline Jelly, this fast-absorbing, non-greasy lotion works to heal dry, rough skin and keep it soft, smooth, and visibly healthy. It locks in moisture to help replenish the skin’s natural barrier, providing continuous hydration for up to 3 weeks with regular use.\nThe lightweight formula absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky residue, making it perfect for everyday use on hands and body. Ideal for normal to dry skin types, it helps soothe rough patches, prevent dryness, and deliver lasting nourishment even in harsh weather conditions.\nKey Benefits:\nHow to Use:Apply daily all over the body, focusing on dry areas such as elbows, knees, and heels. For best results, use after a shower to seal in moisture.\nIngredients:Aqua, Glycerin, Stearic Acid, Palmitic Acid, Isopropyl Myristate, Paraffinum Liquidum, Petrolatum, Avena Sativa Straw Extract, Dimethicone, Dihydroxypropyltrimonium Chloride, Hydroxyethyl Urea, Propylene Glycol, Lactic Acid, Glyceryl Stearate, Glycol Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Cetyl Alcohol, Stearamide AMP, Sodium Hydroxide, Tapioca Starch, Magnesium Aluminum Silicate, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Xanthan Gum, Disodium EDTA, Parfum, Methylparaben, Phenoxyethanol, Propylparaben, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Amyl Cinnamal, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Citronellol, Coumarin, Hexyl Cinnamal, Geraniol, Benzyl Alcohol, Limonene, Linalool.', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 746.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Intensive Care Essential Healing Lotion 400mlPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Intensive Care Essential Healing Lotion 400ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, N