(1003, 'NanoMed Finale Stretch Mark Cream  50gm', '1', 0, 29, 217, '1003', '1003', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Overview:Finale Stretch Mark Cream by NanoMed is specially formulated to help improve, reduce, and prevent stretch marks, particularly those caused by pregnancy, rapid growth spurts, weight fluctuations, or weight lifting. Enriched with potent natural extracts and moisturizing agents, this cream works to restore skin elasticity, tone, and firmness while reducing the appearance of existing stretch marks.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces the appearance of stretch mark ridges and discoloration\nPrevents new stretch marks from forming\nImproves skin elasticity and firmness\nMoisturizes and nourishes the skin\nNon-greasy formula with nanomolecules for better penetration\nHow It Works:With continuous use over 4–6 weeks, Finale Stretch Mark Cream helps fade redness and whiteness of stretch marks, smoothes out ridges, strengthens surrounding skin, and keeps the skin supple to prevent future stretch marks. This cream is particularly effective for post-pregnancy stretch marks, supporting skin recovery and elasticity after childbirth.\nDirections for Use:Apply generously to affected areas after a bath or shower. Massage gently in a circular, upward motion 1–2 times daily. For best results, start using early in pregnancy, before stretch marks appear, and continue applying for at least two months after childbirth.\nKey Ingredients:\nAqua\nShea Butter\nCaprylic/Capric Acid Triglyceride\nMethylsilanol Mannuronate\nCentella Asiatica Leaf Extract\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract\nRice Extract & Rice Bran Oil\nJojoba Oil\nVitamin E Acetate\nSodium Hyaluronate\nAllantoin\nSericin\nOther skin-nourishing and moisturizing agents\nSuitable For:Pregnant and post-pregnancy women, individuals experiencing rapid weight gain or loss, adolescents undergoing growth spurts, or anyone wanting to improve skin elasticity and reduce stretch marks.\nNanoMed Finale Stretch Mark Cream offers a professional, dermatologically inspired solution to restore smooth, supple, and radiant skin while minimizing the appearance of stretch marks, especially those from pregnancy.', 2915.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2915.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'NanoMed Finale Stretch Mark Cream  50gmPrice in BD', 'NanoMed Finale Stretch Mark Cream  50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nanomed-finale-stretch-mark-cream-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
(1004, 'NanoMed Finale Footsoft Cream 30gm', '1', 0, 29, 217, '1004', '1004', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NanoMed Finale Footsoft Cream – 30gm\nNanoMed Finale Footsoft Cream is specially formulated to help repair cracked heels and deeply moisturize dry feet. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing texture delivers hydration without leaving a greasy residue, helping to restore smooth and soft skin. Clinically proven, noticeable improvement can be seen within just three days of regular use.\nKey Benefits:\nRepairs and softens cracked heels\nProvides deep moisturization\nProtects skin and prevents water loss\nPromotes gentle skin renewal\nDirections for Use:Apply the cream to clean, dry heels 1–2 times daily, or more as needed. Do not wash off. For best results, use regularly to maintain soft, healthy feet.\nIngredients:Water, Urea, Propylene Glycol, Squalane, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Stearic Acid, Behenyl Alcohol, Lactic Acid, Sodium PCA, Glyceryl Stearate, Cetyl Alcohol, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Glyceryl Linoleate, Salicylic Acid, Dimethicone, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, DL-Alpha-Tocopheryl Acetate, Xanthan Gum, Sorbitol, Glycerine, Allantoin, Fragrance, Lecithin, Disodium EDTA, Glyceryl Linolenate, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Retinyl Palmitate, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate.\nNet Weight: 30 gmStorage: Store in a cool, dry place. Keep out of reach of children.', 1180.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1180.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'NanoMed Finale Footsoft Cream 30gmPrice in BD', 'NanoMed Finale Footsoft Cream 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nanomed-finale-footsoft-cream-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
(1005, 'Monisoft Lotion', '1', 0, 29, 26, '1005', '1005', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Moisoft lotion has been specially formulated to moisturize, nourish and soften dry, itchy & irritating skin. Moisoft is distinctively enriched with natural humectants like Aloe Vera to provide optimum hydration. Pentavitin in Moisoft works like moisture magnet that binds to keratin in the skin to keep the moisture balance.', 1444.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 76.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Monisoft LotionPrice in BD', 'Monisoft Lotion Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'monisoft-lotion', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
