(1007, 'Pond\'s Flawless Radiance SPF 15 Mattifying Day Cream (Made in Thailand)', '1', 0, 29, 193, '1007', '1007', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'New POND\'S Flawless Radiance Derma+ Mattifying Day Cream SPF 15 is inspired by derma treatments, to achieve event-toned pore-less, luminous skin. The Mattifying Day Cream corrects skin imperfection while giving an instant matte finish. POND\'S first day cream designed with highest sun protection of SPF 15 PA+++ to shield skin from UV/ sun-damage. Clinically proven to achieve even-toned skin tighten pores and luminous skin, in 7 days. Best suited for Normal to Oily skin. Intense Pulsed Light.\nIngredients:Aqua, Stearic Acid, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Laureth-23, Octocrylene, Cetearyl Alcohol, Niacinamide, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Dimethicone, Glycerin, Titanium Dioxide, Potassium Hydroxide, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Parfum, Phenoxyethanol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Hexylresorcinol, Methylparaben, Allantoin, Acrylates Copolymer, Acrylates/Steareth-20 Methacrylate Copolymer, Propylparaben, Hydroxystearic Acid, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Metabisulfite, Aluminum Hydroxide, Sodium Bisulfite, Pyridoxine HCl, Palmitic Acid, Arachidic Acid, Isopropyl Titanium Triisostearate, Triethoxysilylethyl Polydimethylsiloxyethyl Dimethicone, CI 77491, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Acetate, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Salicylate, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Citronellol, Geraniol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Linalool, Linalyl Acetate.Made in Thailand', 923.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 352.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Flawless Radiance SPF 15 Mattifying Day Cream (Made in Thailand)Price in BD', 'Pond\'s Flawless Radiance SPF 15 Mattifying Day Cream (Made in Thailand) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-flawless-radiance-spf-15-mattifying-day-cream-made-in-thailand', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '20