(1010, 'DXN Aloe.V Hand & Body Lotion 250ml', '1', 0, 29, 281, '1010', '1010', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Hydrating Care with Natural Aloe Vera Extract\nDXN Aloe.V Hand & Body Lotion is a non-greasy, deeply moisturizing lotion enriched with natural Aloe Vera extract. Specially formulated to soothe dry and chapped skin, it forms a dual protective layer that helps nourish and shield the skin from moisture loss. Leaves your skin feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed all day long.\nEnriched with Aloe Vera for natural hydration\nForms 2 protective layers to lock in moisture\nLightweight and non-greasy formula\nIdeal for dry, rough, or irritated skin\nLeaves skin soft, smooth, and healthy-looking\nGently massage into the skin after bathing. Apply generously on areas that need extra care.\nAqua, Macadamia ternifolia Seed Oil, Cetearyl Olivate (and) Sorbitan Olivate, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Aminomethyl Propanol, Aloe Barbadensis Extract, Fragrance, Triethylene Glycol, Retinyl Palmitate.Suitable for daily use on all skin types.', 1395.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 155.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'DXN Aloe.V Hand & Body Lotion 250mlPrice in BD', 'DXN Aloe.V Hand & Body Lotion 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dxn-aloev-hand-body-lotion-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
