(1022, 'Belo Moisturizing Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 29, 217, '1022', '1022', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Belo Moisturizing Lotion is an all-purpose lotion designed to nourish, hydrate, and protect the skin, leaving it soft, silky, and smooth. Enriched with Olive Oil, Aloe Vera, Coconut Oil, and Vitamin E, it helps maintain the skin’s pH balance and improves its moisture retention capacity. Suitable for daily use, it can be applied alone or under makeup for a refreshed, healthy glow.\nOlive Oil – Moisturizes and nourishes the skin.\nAloe Vera – Soothes and hydrates, promoting skin health.\nCoconut Oil – Softens and protects against dryness.\nVitamin E – Provides antioxidant benefits and supports skin repair.\nParaffin Oil, Glycerin, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG 100 Stearate, Stearic Acid, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Phenoxyethanol, Methyl Paraben, Propyl Paraben, Triethanolamine, Disodium EDTA, Fragrance, Aqua.\nApply all over the face and neck.\nUse daily, alone or under makeup.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nIn case of irritation, flush thoroughly with water.\nStore below 30°C. Do not freeze.\nKeep away from direct sunlight and out of reach of children.\nMaintains skin moisture and hydration.\nPromotes soft, smooth, and silky skin.\nSuitable for daily use, under makeup or alone.', 1163.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 62.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Belo Moisturizing Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Belo Moisturizing Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'belo-moisturizing-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
(1023, 'Emotopic-E  Everyday Bath Emulsion 200ml', '1', 0, 29, 274, '1023', '1023', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our Clinically and Dermatologically Tested European formula is now available in the United States!✦How to Care for Dry and Dermatitis-Prone Skin✦Individuals with dry and atopic skin are advised to limit baths (particularly in chlorinated water), use soft towels, avoid woolen garments (tiny wool fibers cause continuous mechanical irritation to the skin), and, if necessary, use air humidifiers. Moisturizing products like our Pharmaceris Lipid Replenishing Cream, which reconstitute the levels of micro-flora and are free of any irritating components (such as fragrance additives) are essential. Apply the cream onto cleansed and dry skin a few times daily on areas requiring intensive care during periods of severe skin dryness and associated additional symptoms (i.e. itching, irritation and burning).✦Ingredients✦➤Hemp oil➤Canola oil➤Sodium hyaluronate➤Omega acids 3, 6 & 9➤For a complete list of ingredients, please see product photos✦Safety✦➤ Free of colorants, preservative, parabens, and fragrances➤ Formula developed and tested in dermatological and clinical trials under the supervision of a team of dermatologists➤ Highly toleratedTo guarantee quality, our product is made in smaller quantities, therefore supplies may be limited. Order now and let us show you why our tested European formula is the best choice! --- 100% Satisfaction GuaranteedMade in Poland', 2555.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 135.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Emotopic-E  Everyday Bath Emulsion 200mlPrice in BD', 'Emotopic-E  Everyday Bath Emulsion 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'emotopic-e-everyday-bath-emulsion-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
(1024, 'ACM Viticolor Gel Correcteur De Teint 50ml', '1', 0, 29, 284, '1024', '1024', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Long-Lasting Camouflage for Depigmented Skin (3 to 5 Days)\nViticolor Gel is a corrective gel designed to camouflage depigmented patches caused by vitiligo or other pigmentation disorders. It offers immediate and durable skin coloration that lasts between 3 to 5 days, helping to visibly even out skin tone and boost confidence.\nInstant colouring agents provide immediate coverage of depigmented areas\nPigmentation agents (DHA and Erythrulose) develop a natural-looking, longer-lasting tint over several hours\nSuitable for use on face and body\nCan be used alongside standard vitiligo treatments, including phototherapy\nApplied easily with a brush applicator for precise coverage\nImproves the quality of life and self-esteem of people living with vitiligo\nApply the gel with the included brush directly to depigmented areas\nAllow several hours for full colour development\nColour lasts for 3 to 5 days before needing reapplication\nSuitable for all skin types\nDesigned specifically to camouflage vitiligo and other depigmentation\nTube with brush applicator', 2686.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 114.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ACM Viticolor Gel Correcteur De Teint 50mlPrice in BD', 'ACM Viticolor Gel Correcteur De Teint 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acm-viticolor-gel-correcteur-de-teint-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
