(1027, 'ACM Sensitelial Emollient Care 200ml', '1', 0, 29, 284, '1027', '1027', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Daily Moisturising and Soothing Care for Dry to Atopic Skin\nACM Sensitelial Emollient Care is specially formulated to nourish, soothe, and protect dry, sensitive, and atopic skin. Enriched with hydrating and lipid-replenishing agents, it helps restore the skin barrier, reduce itching, and prevent further dryness or irritation. Suitable for both children and adults, including infants.\n🌿 Deeply moisturises and softens dry to very dry skin\n🧴 Restores the skin barrier and reduces transepidermal water loss\n🌾 Soothes itching and irritation associated with atopic or sensitive skin\n✔️ Lightweight, non-greasy texture\n👶 Suitable for infants, children, and adults\n🧪 Hypoallergenic, fragrance-free, and dermatologically tested\nGlycerin – Deep hydration\nShea Butter – Lipid replenishment\nAllantoin – Soothing and anti-irritant\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3) – Strengthens skin barrier function\nApply once or twice daily to clean, dry skin, especially after bathing or showering. Suitable for face and body.\nDry, very dry, sensitive, or atopic skin\n200ml tube\n', 1439.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 61.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ACM Sensitelial Emollient Care 200mlPrice in BD', 'ACM Sensitelial Emollient Care 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acm-sensitelial-emollient-care-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
