(1041, 'Mom Care Cream 100gm', '1', 0, 30, 150, '1041', '1041', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Stretch Mark Remover – For Pregnancy, Weight Gain & Bodybuilders\nFunction:Mom Care Cream is specially formulated to reduce and prevent stretch marks caused by pregnancy, weight gain, or intense workouts. Enriched with skin-nourishing ingredients, it enhances elasticity, fades discoloration, and restores smooth, healthy skin.\nKey Benefits:\nHelps reduce the appearance of stretch marks\nSafe for use during and after pregnancy\nEffective for stretch marks due to weight gain or bodybuilding\nDeeply hydrates and softens the skin\nBoosts collagen production and skin renewal\nIngredients:Aqua (Water), Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Glycerin, Mineral Oil, Dimethicone, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate & PEG-100 Stearate, Cetearyl Glucoside, Propylene Glycol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter) Oil, Palmitoyl Hexapeptide-12, Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), Collagen, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, Polyacrylamide, C13-14 Isoparaffin, Laureth-7, Disodium EDTA, BHT, Fragrance (Parfum), Methylisothiazolinone, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Glycolic Acid, Dmuze Essential Oils.\nHow to Use:Apply twice daily (morning and evening) on the affected areas. Massage gently in circular motions until fully absorbed. Use consistently for best results.\nCaution:For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. In case of irritation, discontinue use and consult a physician.', 931.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 49.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mom Care Cream 100gmPrice in BD', 'Mom Care Cream 100gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mom-care-cream-100gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
