(1047, 'Bionnex Ultra Moisturizing Face Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 30, 107, '1047', '1047', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nourish and hydrate your skin with Arogga!\nThe Bionnex Ultra Moisturizing Face Cream is a luxurious, deeply hydrating cream designed to provide intense moisture and nourishment to your skin. Enriched with skin-loving ingredients, this face cream helps to restore your skin\'s natural moisture barrier, leaving it soft, smooth, and radiant. Perfect for all skin types, it’s your go-to product for achieving a healthy, glowing complexion.\nIntense Hydration:\nProvides deep, long-lasting moisture to dry and dehydrated skin.\nRestores the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\nNourishing Formula:\nEnriched with vitamins and essential nutrients to nourish and rejuvenate the skin.\nLightweight and Non-Greasy:\nAbsorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy residue.\nSuitable for All Skin Types:\nGentle enough for daily use and effective for sensitive skin.\nSoothing and Calming:\nHelps to soothe irritated skin and reduce dryness.\nAnti-Aging Benefits:\nHelps to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, promoting youthful-looking skin.\nCleanse your face thoroughly before application.\nApply a small amount of the cream to your face and neck, gently massaging it into the skin.\nUse every morning and night as part of your skincare routine.\nFor optimal results, follow up with sunscreen during the day.\nDeep Hydration: Keeps your skin moisturized and supple.\nNourishes: Provides essential nutrients to rejuvenate the skin.\nNon-Greasy: Absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky feel.\nSoothes: Calms and soothes irritated or dry skin.\nAnti-Aging: Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nIntense Moisturization: Provides deep hydration for dry and dehydrated skin.\nLightweight Formula: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle and effective for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nNourishing Ingredients: Enriched with vitamins and essential nutrients for healthy skin.\n1 x Bionnex Ultra Moisturizing Face Cream 50ml\nThe Bionnex Ultra Moisturizing Face Cream is your ultimate solution for achieving soft, smooth, and hydrated skin. Whether you\'re targeting dry patches or looking for an all-over moisturizer, this face cream delivers intense hydration and nourishment.\nOrder now from Arogga and indulge your skin with the care it deserves! ✨\n🔗 Order Now: https://www.arogga.com', 1839.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionnex Ultra Moisturizing Face Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Bionnex Ultra Moisturizing Face Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionnex-ultra-moisturizing-face-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
(1048, 'Tranacix Cream 30gm', '1', 0, 30, 39, '1048', '1048', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'TRANEXAMIC ACID FORMULA,\nA REVOLUTIONARY SOLUTION\nFOR SKIN TONE IMPERFECTIONS\nMADE IN FRANCE\n3% Tranexamic Acid Cream, a revolutionary formula for skin tone imperfections.\nActive ingredients\n\nTranexamic Acid is used for a long time as a\ntraditional hemostatic medicine.\nIndications\n\nTranexamic Acid is known as an oral medicine for\ntreating melasma. Its rare but severe side effects\nwhen taken orally, such as pulmonary embolism, deep-vein thrombosis, myocardial or cerebrovascular infarction, make risky its systemic use in dermatology.\nProperties\n\nPlasmin, a kind of protease in the blood serum,\nfunctions to enhance the intracellular release of\narachidonic acid, a precursor of prostanoid, and also\nto elevate alpha-melanocyte stimulating hormone\nprocessed from pro-opiomelanocortin.\nBoth arachidonic acid and alpha-melanocyte stimulating hormone can activate melanin synthesis by melanocytes. Therefore, the anti-plasmin activity of tranexamic acid is thought to play a role in its topical effectiveness for treating melasma.\nDirections for use\n\nOn the perfectly clean skin apply TRANACIX Cream twice a day, in the morning and at nigth, on the\nconsidered areas. Slightly massage in order to make its absorption easier. Once perfectly absorbed, make up is possible.\nTargets\n\nDermatology | Aesthetic Medicine\nOrigin\n\nMade in France.', 2197.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 93.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Tranacix Cream 30gmPrice in BD', 'Tranacix Cream 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'tranacix-cream-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
