(1051, 'Activ\'M Gel 20gm', '1', 0, 30, 289, '1051', '1051', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Activ’M Gel © is a silicone gel with matte effect and no oily residue, composed of new generation of silicones. Activ’M Gel © has been developed for treating inflammatory, keloid and hypertrophic scars and improving their aesthetic aspect.\nActiv’M Gel © is mainly used on face and bending zone area, body joints … where a silicone dressing is not easy to place. After application Activ’M Gel © forms a protective and invisible film on the skin with an immediate silky touch.\nThe medical silicon reacts actively by maintaining the hydration of the skin and decreasing the capillary activity. So, only a reduced amount of collagen is produced, in result, less risk of hypertrophy. The scar is softened and flattened with the treatment.', 2446.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 129.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Activ\'M Gel 20gmPrice in BD', 'Activ\'M Gel 20gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'activm-gel-20gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
