(1054, 'Oestrogel', '1', 0, 30, 136, '1054', '1054', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Oestrogel is a transdermal estrogen gel containing 17-β-Estradiol, which is chemically identical to the natural estrogen produced by the human ovaries. It is a bioidentical estrogen derived from a plant source and formulated as a transparent, colorless, fragrance-free gel for application on the skin.\nBecause Oestrogel is applied through the skin (percutaneous route), it allows estradiol to be absorbed directly into the bloodstream, bypassing first-pass metabolism in the liver. This makes it especially suitable for patients who cannot tolerate or should not take oral estrogen therapy.\nOestrogel is supplied in a tube containing 80 g of gel, delivering 60 mg of 17-β-estradiol, and is approved by the U.S. FDA for use in hormone replacement therapy.\nOestrogel is used in Hormone Replacement Therapy (HRT) for the treatment and prevention of conditions caused by estrogen deficiency, including:\nRelief of moderate to severe menopausal symptoms (hot flashes, night sweats, vaginal dryness)\nPrevention of osteoporosis in postmenopausal women\nHypogonadism (low estrogen levels)\nAtrophic vaginitis\nSupport for overall hormonal balance in estrogen-deficient states\nOestrogel helps restore estrogen levels, improving quality of life, bone health, and reproductive system function in women who have low estrogen.', 2176.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 104.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'OestrogelPrice in BD', 'Oestrogel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'oestrogel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:29', '2026-02-11 08:14:29'),
