(1056, 'MelLock Plus AHA + BHA + Vitamin C Peel Gel (HQ 4%, Glycolic 7%, Lactic 5%) 15ml', '1', 0, 30, 136, '1056', '1056', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MelLock Plus AHA + BHA + Vitamin C Peel Gel 15ml MelLock Plus AHA + BHA + Vitamin C Peel Gel is a professional-strength depigmenting and resurfacing gel designed to help improve dark spots, uneven skin tone, and dull skin by optimizing cell renewal through multi-action exfoliation. This leave-on “sleep n peel” formula combines Hydroquinone (HQ 4%) with brightening and exfoliating actives to help inhibit excess melanin formation and reveal a clearer, more youthful-looking complexion.\nPowered with a high-performance blend of AHA acids (Glycolic 7%, Lactic 5% and other botanically-derived acids) plus BHA (Salicylic Acid) and Vitamin C, it helps clear away dead skin cells, smooth rough texture, and support brighter-looking skin. Hyaluronic Acid (Sodium Hyaluronate) helps hydrate and soften the skin to reduce dryness often associated with peeling products.\nKey Benefits\nHelps reduce the appearance of hyperpigmentation & dark spots\nSupports brighter, more even-looking skin tone\nExfoliates to improve texture, dullness, and fine lines\nMulti-acid blend (AHA/BHA) promotes skin renewal\nHydrating support with Hyaluronic Acid\nHow to UseApply on a clean face and neck every night (or as directed by your doctor). Allow the product to fully absorb. Use a broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day.\nPrecautionsFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes and broken/irritated skin. Mild tingling, dryness, or peeling may occur. Stop use and consult a physician if severe irritation develops. Always use sunscreen while using this product.\nNet Content: 15ml (0.6 fl oz)', 2724.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 116.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'MelLock Plus AHA + BHA + Vitamin C Peel Gel (HQ 4%, Glycolic 7%, Lactic 5%) 15mlPrice in BD', 'MelLock Plus AHA + BHA + Vitamin C Peel Gel (HQ 4%, Glycolic 7%, Lactic 5%) 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mellock-plus-aha-bha-vitamin-c-peel-gel-hq-4-glycolic-7-lactic-5-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
