(1060, 'My Bain Fair Gel Skin Lightening, Dark Spot & Age Spot Removing Gel 40gm', '1', 0, 30, 290, '1060', '1060', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'My Bain Fair Gel Skin Lightening, Dark Spot & Age Spot Removing Gel 40gm\nMy Bain Fair Gel is a targeted skin-brightening gel formulated to help improve uneven skin tone, dark spots, and age spots. Its advanced blend of brightening and exfoliating ingredients works to reduce the appearance of hyperpigmentation and enhance overall skin radiance with regular use.\nPowered with Glutathione, Mequinol, Tranexamic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Kojic Acid Dipalmitate, and Pine Bark Extract, the gel helps support a clearer and brighter-looking complexion. Glycolic Acid gently exfoliates dead skin cells to promote smoother texture and a more even tone. The lightweight gel base absorbs quickly and is suitable for application on targeted affected areas.\nKey IngredientsGlutathione, Mequinol, Tranexamic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Pine Bark Extract, Kojic Acid Dipalmitate, Gel base q.s.\nHow to UseWash/clean your face thoroughly and pat dry. Apply My Bain Fair Gel to the affected areas and massage gently. Use twice daily (morning and night). For best results, continue use for a minimum of 3 months. Visible results may be noticeable within 4–6 weeks.\nPrecautions\nFor external use only\nAvoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly\nKeep out of reach of children\nDo not use if the seal is broken\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight\nNet Weight: 40gm', 1439.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 61.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'My Bain Fair Gel Skin Lightening, Dark Spot & Age Spot Removing Gel 40gmPrice in BD', 'My Bain Fair Gel Skin Lightening, Dark Spot & Age Spot Removing Gel 40gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'my-bain-fair-gel-skin-lightening-dark-spot-age-spot-removing-gel-40gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1061, 'Novacalamine Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 30, 50, '1061', '1061', NULL, NULL, NULL, '• Minor skin rashes • Skin irritation • Can be used by adults and children\nNovacalamine Calamine lotion contains: Calamine-15%, Bentonite-5%, Zinc Oxide-3%, Aloe Vera -10%, Light Liquid Parafin-10% & Rose Extract-1%\nNOVACALAMINE lotion gives a cooling and soothing effect on the skin especially when your skin is irritated. Soothes the irritation of the most common skin rashes. Absorbs quickly and leaves a fresh and natural feel. Calamine lotion has been used to relieve itchiness and discomfort caused by chicken pox, minor skin rashes, insect bites, measles, eczema, sunburn, poison ivy and other minor skin conditions.\nCalamine lotion absorbs excess oil which helps you keep away problems like pimples, acne, dark spots, blackheads, whiteheads and patchy skin.\nDirections to use: Wash the skin surface thoroughly and pat dry before application. Take a generous quantity of this lotion and gently apply over the affected area when you need. Do not apply more than 3 to 4 times a day.\nStop using calamine lotion if your skin condition gets worse or if it does not improve within 7 days or irritation and rashes develops. Check with your doctor immediately.\nSuitable for : Adults and children.\nBefore you use this calamine lotion\nDo not use:If you are allergic to any of the ingredientsIf you are having an x-ray (because it may affect the results)\nYou can use this product if you are pregnant or breastfeeding', 1099.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 51.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Novacalamine Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Novacalamine Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'novacalamine-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
