(1064, 'Fixderma Cleovora Cream 60gm', '1', 0, 30, 116, '1064', '1064', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fixderma Cleovora Cream 60gm\nFixderma Cleovera Cream is a dermatologically formulated protective cream designed to replenish, soothe, and restore sensitive or damaged skin. Enriched with a potent blend of Aloe Vera, Vitamin A, Vitamin E, and RetiStar (liposomal retinol), this cream delivers deep hydration and healing benefits. Whether you\'re recovering from a chemical peel, post-surgery, or simply battling dryness and irritation, Cleovera Cream offers a calming touch with a smooth, non-greasy finish.\nKey Features\n\nBenefits\nUsage Instructions\nWhy Choose Fixderma Cleovera Cream?\n', 1300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 80.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fixderma Cleovora Cream 60gmPrice in BD', 'Fixderma Cleovora Cream 60gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fixderma-cleovora-cream-60gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1065, 'Bioderma Atoderm Baume Levres Very Dry Lips Ultra-Nourishing Lip Balm 15ml', '1', 0, 30, 227, '1065', '1065', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ultra-Nourishing Lip Balm for Very Dry Lips | 15ml**\nDaily Care for Very Dry LipsBioderma Atoderm Baume Levres is a nourishing, moisturizing, and comforting lip balm designed for very dry lips. Its rich, emollient formula restores softness and provides long-lasting comfort.\nKey Benefits:\nDeeply nourishes and moisturizes: Keeps lips hydrated throughout the day.\nRestores softness and suppleness: Enriched with nourishing ingredients to maintain smooth, healthy lips.\nEasy application: The convenient applicator tip ensures effortless, precise use.\nHigh tolerance: Dermatologically tested; suitable for sensitive lips.\nFragrance-free: Ideal for those with sensitive skin or fragrance sensitivities.\nResults:Lips feel nourished, comfortable, and regain natural suppleness.\nUsage Instructions:Apply directly to the lips as often as needed. If dryness persists, consult a healthcare professional.\nBrand Philosophy:Bioderma is founded on Ecobiology, the core of the NAOS approach, which respects the skin’s ecosystem and preserves its health sustainably.\nDistributor: NAOS USA Inc., Wilmington DE 19808-1609, USAManufacturer: NAOS, Ecobiology Company – France, 13290 Aix-en-ProvenceBD Distributor: Unihealth LtdBSTI ApprovedStandard: BDS', 1530.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 170.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Atoderm Baume Levres Very Dry Lips Ultra-Nourishing Lip Balm 15mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Atoderm Baume Levres Very Dry Lips Ultra-Nourishing Lip Balm 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-atoderm-baume-levres-very-dry-lips-ultra-nourishing-lip-balm-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1066, 'Bellycon Cream 30gm', '1', 0, 30, 291, '1066', '1066', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bellycon Cream is a specialized skincare product available in a 30g tube, formulated to address concerns related to skin tone, texture, and hydration. It is designed to be gentle on the skin while effectively moisturizing and nourishing, making it suitable for daily use.\nThis cream typically includes ingredients known for their hydrating and brightening properties, helping to promote a smoother and more even complexion. It may also work to reduce the appearance of dark spots, blemishes, or uneven skin tone with regular application, leaving the skin looking healthier and more radiant.\nIdeal for use on areas that require extra care, Bellycon Cream can be applied to the face or specific spots on the body that need a hydration boost. Its convenient 30g packaging makes it travel-friendly and easy to incorporate into your daily skincare routine. For optimal results, use Bellycon Cream as directed, and enjoy a refreshed, rejuvenated skin texture.', 990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bellycon Cream 30gmPrice in BD', 'Bellycon Cream 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bellycon-cream-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
