(1069, 'Bioderma Atoderm Creme Ultra-Nourishing Moisturising Cream 200ml', '1', 0, 30, 227, '1069', '1069', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'All BIODERMA products are formulated according to the ecobiology principles, which is at the heart of NAOS approach, to respect the skin\'s ecosystem and preserve its health in a lasting way.\nThe Skin Protect Complex™ contains vitamin PP and a combination of two sugars that contributes to recreate a healthy-looking skin barrier and helps maintain the skin\'s water reserves, thus making the skin comfortable again:\n- Vitamin PP, helps improve the skin barrier, which enhances the skin\'s suppleness and restores its comfort durably.\n- The combination of sugars optimises the skin\'s water reserves and facilitates the hydric flow. This provides hydration for 24 hours*; to support this action, it targets the synthesis of hyaluronic acid, a highly hygroscopic molecule.\n- The presence of glycerine contributes to lock in moisture inside the skin.\n- The D.A.F™ patented natural complex contributes to increase the skin’s tolerance threshold.\nOnce or twice a day - 7 days a week\nApply to healthy skin. If skin dryness persists, consult a healthcare professional.', 2565.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 135.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Atoderm Creme Ultra-Nourishing Moisturising Cream 200mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Atoderm Creme Ultra-Nourishing Moisturising Cream 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-atoderm-creme-ultra-nourishing-moisturising-cream-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1070, 'A Bonne Yogurt Milk Whitening Underarm Cream Bring Back Your Baby Skin 30gm', '1', 0, 30, 293, '1070', '1070', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product DescriptionA Bonne Whitening Underarm & Dark Shadow Cream is a gentle and effective solution for dark underarms. Made from natural ingredients, this cream brightens and whitens the skin with Glutathione and Yogurt, while Wasabi Extract provides deodorizing properties for long-lasting freshness. It is hypoallergenic, suitable for sensitive skin, and free from Hydroquinone and Paraben. With regular use, it helps remove dead skin cells and restores the skin’s natural smoothness and glow.\nDirection for Use:After showering, towel dry and apply A Bonne Whitening Underarm Cream onto the underarm area.', 484.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 66.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'A Bonne Yogurt Milk Whitening Underarm Cream Bring Back Your Baby Skin 30gmPrice in BD', 'A Bonne Yogurt Milk Whitening Underarm Cream Bring Back Your Baby Skin 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'a-bonne-yogurt-milk-whitening-underarm-cream-bring-back-your-baby-skin-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
