(1072, 'JA Derma Care Jabit Lotion 50ml', '1', 0, 30, 294, '1072', '1072', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For the Treatment of Scabies & Lice InfestationFOR EXTERNAL USE ONLY\nJA Derma Care Jabit Lotion is a fast-acting medicated lotion specially formulated to treat scabies and lice infestations. Combining the proven insecticidal power of Permethrin 5% with the antiseptic and soothing benefits of Cetrimide 0.1%, this lotion not only eliminates mites and lice but also helps prevent secondary infections caused by scratching.\nEnriched with Peppermint Oil and Neem Oil, it delivers a cooling, calming effect and supports healthy skin recovery.\nKills mites & lice effectively at the root level\nSoothes irritated skin and prevents infection\nRapid relief from itching and discomfort\nQuick-absorbing formula for scalp and skin\nEffective in just 1–2 applications\nPermethrin – 5.0% w/v (Insecticidal agent)\nCetrimide – 0.1% w/v (Antiseptic)\nPeppermint Oil – 2.0% w/w (Cooling, soothing)\nNeem Oil – 2.0% w/w (Natural antimicrobial)\nLotion base – q.s.\nWash affected area (hair or skin) with mild soap or shampoo.\nShake the bottle well before use.\nCover face and eyes with a towel if applying to scalp.\nApply lotion evenly to the affected area (skin or scalp).\nLeave on for the recommended duration (as directed by a physician).\nRinse off thoroughly with clean water.\nRepeat if necessary after 7 days or as advised.\nFor external use only\nAvoid contact with eyes, mouth, and open wounds\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from sunlight\nJA Jabit Lotion offers a trusted, dual-action formula that fights infestation and restores comfort—so you can enjoy itch-free, healthy skin and scalp once again.', 742.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 83.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'JA Derma Care Jabit Lotion 50mlPrice in BD', 'JA Derma Care Jabit Lotion 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NU