(1077, 'Oilatum Junior Cream 150ml', '1', 0, 30, 136, '1077', '1077', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nFor external use only.\n\n\nLight Liquid Paraffin White Soft Paraffin PEG Monosterate Cetostearyl Alcohol Glycerol Potassium Sorbate Benzyl Alcohol Citric Acid Monohydrate Povidone K29/32 Purified Water\n\n\nUse as required, especially after washing. Apply with clean hands to affected areas and rub in well. For best results use with Oilatum Junior Bath Formula. FOR EXTERNAL USE ONLY.\n\n\nAs we operate a large high street store, some items may be shop soiled. But all items will be brand new, just the outer packaging may not on some occasions be 100% perfect. Grab a Bargain!\n\nSoothes away the discomfort of children\'s and babies\' itchy dry skin conditions.Rehydrates and protects.Suitable for eczema.For best results use with Oilatum Junior Bath Formula.Oilatum Junior Cream has been specially developed for children\'s and babies\' itchy dry skin conditions. Based on the tried and trusted Oilatum Junior Bath formulation, Oilatum Junior Cream is effective, yet gentle, on sensitive skin.Oilatum Junior Cream soothes, softens and rehydrates and is suitable for use on eczema. It leaves a protective emollient barrier on the skin that helps to prevent further drying.FRAGRANCE FREE.\nLight Liquid Paraffin White Soft Paraffin PEG Monosterate Cetostearyl Alcohol Glycerol Potassium Sorbate Benzyl Alcohol Citric Acid Monohydrate Povidone K29/32 Purified Water\nUse as required, especially after washing. Apply with clean hands to affected areas and rub in well. For best results use with Oilatum Junior Bath Formula. FOR EXTERNAL USE ONLY.\nFor external use only.\nAs we operate a large high street store, some items may be shop soiled. But all items will be brand new, just the outer packaging may not on some occasions be 100% perfect. Grab a Bargain!\nGlaxosmithkline Consumer Healthcare', 1900.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, N