(1078, 'Derma Radiant Face Cream 50gm', '1', 0, 30, 295, '1078', '1078', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Derma Radiant Face Cream is a daily-use brightening cream formulated to support clearer, smoother, and more radiant-looking skin. With a powerful blend of skin-brightening and exfoliating ingredients such as L-Glutathione, Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Kojic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Bearberry, and Liquorice Extract, it helps improve dullness, uneven tone, and dark spots for a healthier glow.\nThe formula also includes gentle exfoliating acids like Glycolic Acid and Lactic Acid to help remove dead skin cells and reveal fresher skin. Allantoin, Glycerin, Sodium PCA, and Vitamin E help soothe and hydrate, keeping the skin soft and comfortable. It is suitable for all skin types and is Paraben Free and Sulfate Free—making it a good option for regular skincare routines.\nKey Benefits\nHelps brighten skin and improve uneven tone\nSupports reduction of dullness and dark spots\nGently exfoliates for smoother skin texture\nHydrates and soothes for soft, healthy-looking skin\nSuitable for all skin types\nParaben Free & Sulfate Free\nIngredientsL-Glutathione, Sodium Hydroxide, Benzoic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Lactic Acid, Allantoin, Vitamin C, Vitamin E, Niacinamide, Bearberry Extract, Liquorice Extract, Kojic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Peony Extract, Baicalensis Root Extract, BHT, BHA, Cetyl Alcohol, Cetomacrogol-1000, Stearic Acid, Glycerin, Sodium PCA, Tagocare 165, Isopropyl Myristate, Phenoxyethanol, Disodium EDTA, Perfume, DM Water.\nDirections for UseCleanse your face thoroughly. Take a small amount and apply over face and neck. Massage gently with soft strokes—from center to outward on the face and upward to jawline on the neck. Finish by lightly patting the skin. Use twice daily for best results.\nPack Size: 50gm', 1282.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 68.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Derma Radiant Face Cream 50gmPrice in BD', 'Derma Radiant Face Cream 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'derma-radiant-face-cream-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
