(1080, 'Sodermix Cream 30gm', '1', 0, 30, 39, '1080', '1080', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product DescriptionSodermix Cream 30g is a moisturizing skincare cream made in France by ALPOL COSMÉTIQUE. Designed for external use only, it helps hydrate and soften the skin with a nourishing blend of emollients and skin-conditioning ingredients, including Avocado Oil, Tomato Fruit Extract, and Vitamin E (Tocopherol). Its creamy texture supports daily skin comfort by helping reduce dryness and leaving the skin feeling smooth.\nIndication\nHelps moisturize the skin(Please refer to the leaflet inside the box for full instructions and precautions.)\nHow to UseApply a small amount to clean, dry skin and gently massage until absorbed. Use as directed in the enclosed leaflet.\nKey Ingredients (INCI)Aqua (Water), Propylene Glycol Dipelargonate, Propylene Glycol, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl Stearate, Paraffinum Liquidum (Mineral Oil), Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Maltodextrin, PEG-75 Stearate, Cetyl Palmitate, Petrolatum, Methylparaben, Sorbic Acid, Magnesium Aluminum Silicate, Xanthan Gum, Cellulose Gum, Triethanolamine, Solanum Lycopersicum (Tomato) Fruit Extract, Superoxide Dismutase, Caprylyl Glycol, Phenylpropanol, Propanediol, Tocopherol.\nPrecautions\nFor external use only\nRead the leaflet inside for detailed precautions and directions\nAvoid contact with eyes\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight\nOriginMade in France by ALPOL COSMÉTIQUE.', 2356.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 124.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sodermix Cream 30gmPrice in BD', 'Sodermix Cream 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sodermix-cream-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1081, 'Glyco 6 Cream 30g', '1', 0, 30, 296, '1081', '1081', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nGlyco 6 Cream is a highly effective skincare solution known for its potent 6% glycolic acid formulation. This cream is designed to tackle a variety of skin concerns, including acne, hyperpigmentation, melasma, and photoaging. It offers ultra-hydrating benefits while being non-irritating, making it suitable for different skin types, including sensitive skin. With its skin-renewing properties, Glyco 6 Cream increases skin cell turnover, thereby reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n\n\n\nGlyco 6 Cream works by increasing the turnover rate of epithelial cells, the cells that line the surface of the skin. This process encourages skin peeling and the treatment of comedones (small bumps caused by acne). The cream’s action also involves killing bacteria, reducing inflammation, and unplugging blocked pores. When applied, Glyco 6 Cream decomposes to release oxygen, which acts as a bactericidal agent against Propionibacterium acnes, the bacteria responsible for acne.\n\n\nGlyco 6 Cream is primarily used to treat:\n\n\n\nGlyco 6 Cream is for external use only. To use it effectively, follow these steps:\n\nDo not use Glyco 6 Cream if you are allergic to any of its ingredients. Let your doctor know if you have contact dermatitis, liver, kidney, gastrointestinal, or heart diseases. Please inform your doctor if you are using any other medications, including vitamins, before starting Glyco 6 Cream. Glyco 6 Cream can make the skin more sensitive to the sunlight; hence always use sunscreen and protective clothing before you step outdoors. It is recommended to avoid tanning booths and sunlamps. Do not apply Glyco 6 Cream on irritated and sunburned skin. Care should be taken while using Glyco 6 Cream on sensitive areas, such as the neck. Let your doctor know if you are pregnant, planning to conceive, or are a breastfeeding mother.\n\nStore Glyco 6 Cream in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Ensure that the lid is tightly closed after each use to maintain the cream’s efficacy.  If you do not notice any improvement after 4-6 weeks of using Glyco 6 Cream, consult your dermatologist for further advice.\n\n', 544.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 155.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Glyco 6 Cream 30gPrice in BD', 'Glyco 6 Cream 30g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'glyco-6-cream-30g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
