(1085, 'ACM Vitix Gel Regulateur 20ml', '1', 0, 30, 284, '1085', '1085', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Supportive Treatment for Repigmentation of Vitiligo-Affected Skin\nVitix Gel is a specially formulated dermatological gel designed to assist in the repigmentation of depigmented skin caused by vitiligo. It works by restoring the balance of free radicals in the skin and supporting melanocyte function through its patented plant-based antioxidant complex.\nHelps repigment vitiliginous (depigmented) skin\nSuitable as a supportive treatment in combination with phototherapy (UVB) or heliotherapy (sunlight)\nRecommended as part of a long-term care routine for vitiligo\nVitix Gel contains a vegetable active ingredient with powerful antioxidant properties, designed to rebalance oxidative stress in the skin\'s epidermal cells (melanocytes and keratinocytes), which plays a critical role in the pathogenesis of vitiligo.\nApply twice daily to affected areas\nUse for at least 3 to 6 months\nRecommended to be combined with phototherapy (UVB) or natural sun exposure for enhanced results\nA comparative study has shown that Vitix Gel, when combined with selective UVB phototherapy, is more effective than phototherapy alone in promoting repigmentation in vitiligo vulgaris.\nPatented plant-based complex with superoxide dismutase (SOD) and catalase-like antioxidant activity\nTube – 20ml', 2686.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 114.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ACM Vitix Gel Regulateur 20mlPrice in BD', 'ACM Vitix Gel Regulateur 20ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acm-vitix-gel-regulateur-20ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1086, 'SepiVit Cream 20ml', '1', 0, 30, 136, '1086', '1086', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SepiVit Cream is a dermatological skincare product formulated to help lighten skin tone and reduce hyperpigmentation. It features an HQ-free (hydroquinone-free) skin-lightening complex, making it suitable for long-term use under medical guidance.\nKey Features:\nHelps reduce dark spots, melasma, freckles, and uneven skin tone\nHydroquinone-free formulation\nEnriched with SepiWhite™, Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin, Glycolic Acid, and Kojic Acid Dipalmitate\nPromotes brighter, clearer, and more even-looking skin\nDesigned for dermatological use\nSuitable for most skin types\nHow it works:The multi-action formula targets excess melanin production, gently exfoliates the skin, and supports skin renewal for a more radiant complexion.\nUsage:Apply a thin layer to the affected area once daily or as directed by a physician. Use sunscreen during the day for best results.\nPack Size: 20 ml', 1205.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 45.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SepiVit Cream 20mlPrice in BD', 'SepiVit Cream 20ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sepivit-cream-20ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1087, 'Eucerin Redness Relief Overnight Cream for Sensitive & Redness-Prone Skin', '1', 0, 31, 234, '1087', '1087', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Info:Eucerin Redness Relief Night Creme is a soothing, hydrating formula that helps reduce redness for sensitive and redness-prone skin at night. The hydrating formula contains Licochalcone, a skin soothing extract of licorice root. Redness Relief Night Cream is gentle and formulated without fragrances or dyes to minimize the risk of irritation. Also use Eucerin’s Redness Relief Day Lotion Broad Spectrum SPF 15 and Redness Relief Cleansing Gel to compliment Redness Relief Night Cream and help improve the condition of sensitive and redness-prone skin.\nAbout this item:\nReduce redness for sensitive and redness-prone skin at night\nSoothing, hydrating formula\nEnriched with Licochalcone, a skin soothing extract of licorice root\nGentle for sensitive skin\nFragrance-Free, Dye Free and Noncomedogenic\nIngredints:\nWater, Glycerin, Panthenol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Octyldodecanol, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Dimethicone, Squalene, Tapioca Starch, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate Citrate, Myristyl Myristate, Butylene Glycol, Benzyl Alcohol, Glycyrrhiza Inflata Root Extract, Carbomer, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium HydroxideThe ingredients in our brand products are updated regularly. For this reason, occasionally there may be discrepancies between the ingredients on our website and on our product packaging. We therefore recommend that you always pay attention to the information on our product packaging and check the ingredients listed there.\nHow to use:\nGently smooth over face every evening after cleansing.\nWarnings:\nKeep out of reach of children. For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Discontinue use if irritation occurs.\nCountry of Origin: Poland\n\n\n\n', 1755.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1365.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate',