(1089, 'Plum Green Tea Mattifying Face Moisturizer with Glycolic Acid for Oil Control & Glow – 50 ml', '1', 0, 31, 101, '1089', '1089', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BECAUSE MATTE MATTERS!Silicone-free, matte-finish moisturizer with handpicked, non-comedogenic ingredients. Gives a daily pleasant after-feel, a non-shiny finish, and helps combat acne.\nHOW TO USETake a sufficient amount and apply evenly after cleansing and toning. Follow with sunscreen during the day. Don’t forget your neck! Suitable for day & night use.Tip: Always patch test new products before regular use.\nGOOD FORCombination, oily, and acne-prone skin.\nMADE GOOD WITHKey Ingredients: Aqua, Glycerin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Stearic Acid, PEG-400, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glycolic Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Leaf Extract, Triethanolamine, Fragrance, CI 19140, CI 42090\nFree From: Parabens, phthalates, other harmful chemicals, and animal-derived ingredients.\nPLUM SPEAKGreen tea extracts and glycolic acid keep your skin healthy and help prevent oxidative stress that can trigger acne.', 960.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 420.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Plum Green Tea Mattifying Face Moisturizer with Glycolic Acid for Oil Control & Glow – 50 mlPrice in BD', 'Plum Green Tea Mattifying Face Moisturizer with Glycolic Acid for Oil Control & Glow – 50 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'plum-green-tea-mattifying-face-moisturizer-with-glycolic-acid-for-oil-control-glow-50-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
