(1092, 'Cerave Psoriasis Moisturising Cream with 2% Salycylic Acid', '1', 0, 31, 153, '1092', '1092', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Psoriasis moisturizer with salicylic acid\nDealing with psoriasis can be challenging, but there are ways to help relieve symptoms and help prevent them from recurring. One key to keeping your psoriasis at bay is using a moisturizing psoriasis treatment that gently exfoliates and hydrates your skin—like CeraVe Psoriasis Moisturizing Cream—to help comfort your skin.\nCeraVe Psoriasis Moisturizing Cream is formulated with 2% salicylic acid to help relieve scaling, redness, and dry, flaky skin, lactic acid for gentle exfoliation, niacinamide to help calm skin, and three essential ceramides to help maintain the skin’s barrier. Our psoriasis cream was developed with dermatologists to help provide smoother skin, and is formulated with our MVE Technology to continually release moisturizing ingredients all day. Use this psoriasis cream daily to help skin itching, scaling, redness, flaking, and irritation associated with psoriasis, as well as to help prevent the reoccurrence of psoriasis symptoms.\nACTIVE INGREDIENT: SALICYLIC ACID 2%\nINACTIVE INGREDIENTS: WATER, UREA, GLYCERYL STEARATE SE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, GLYCERIN, NIACINAMIDE, CETYL ALCOHOL, PEG-100 STEARATE, LIMNANTHES ALBA (MEADOWFOAM) SEED OIL, LAURETH-9, GOSSYPIUM HERBACEUM (COTTON) SEED OIL, BEHENTRIMONIUM METHOSULFATE, C12-13 ALKYL LACTATE, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, DIMETHICONE, CERAMIDE NP, CERAMIDE AP, CERAMIDE EOP, CARBOMER, GLYCERYL STEARATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SODIUM LAUROYL LACTYLATE, CHOLESTEROL, TASMANNIA LANCEOLATA FRUIT/LEAF EXTRACT, PHENOXYETHANOL, DISODIUM EDTA, TOCOPHEROL, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, HYDROGENATED OLIVE OIL, HYDROLYZED HYALURONIC ACID, CITRIC ACID, PHYTOSPHINGOSINE, XANTHAN GUM, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN\nBenefits:\nCountry of Origin: USA\nHow to use:\n\nDeveloped with dermatologists*, CeraVe has a complete line of therapeutic skincare to cleanse and moisturize skin. CeraVe contains the three essential ceramides (called 1, 3, and 6-II) skin needs. Delivered through a controlled-release technology, this formula with ceramides helps rebuild the skin\'s protective barrier and locks in moisture all day.\n*Confirmed by CeraVe 2019\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Psoriasis Skin Therapy Moisturizing Cream was designed to relieve the symptoms of psoriasis and moisturize dry skin. Removes scales and dead skin and helps restore essential moisture. Helps prevent recurrence of the symptoms of psoriasis.\n\n\n\n\nApply to affected area 1 to 4 times daily, or as directed by a doctor.\nRelives skin itching, scaling, redness, flaking and irritation associated with psoriasis.\nHelps calm skin.\nOur MultiVesicular Emulsion (MVE) ensures moisturizing ingredients are delivered to the skin slowly over time, lasting long after you apply it.\n\n\n\n\nAll CeraVe products contain the vital ceramides skin needs to help restore and maintain its natural protective barrier.\nCeramides are an essential part of the skin\'s natural barrier. They hydrate all day to help restore the protective skin barrier.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Psoriasis Skin Therapy Cleanser gently cleanses psoriatic skin while repairing skin\'s natural protective barrier with 3 essential ceramides.\n*Confirmed by CeraVe 2019\nStep 1: Cleanse with CeraVe Psoriasis Cleanser.\nStep 2: Apply CeraVe Psoriasis Moisturizing Cream.', 3630.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2385.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Psoriasis Moisturising Cream with 2% Salycylic AcidPrice in BD', 'Cerave Psoriasis Moisturising Cream with 2% Salycylic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-psoriasis-moisturising-cream-with-2-salycylic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1093, 'Gacotouch Glycerine 60gm', '1', 0, 31, 298, '1093', '1093', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gacotouch Glycerine - 60gm is a versatile product known for its moisturizing properties. Glycerine is a humectant, which means it attracts moisture from the air into the skin, making it an excellent ingredient for hydration.\nApply a small amount directly to the skin or mix it with your favorite lotion or cream for an added moisture boost. It can also be used in DIY beauty recipes, like face masks and hair treatments.', 49.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 16.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gacotouch Glycerine 60gmPrice in BD', 'Gacotouch Glycerine 60gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gacotouch-glycerine-60gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
