(1095, 'APLB 30.9% Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 Facial Cream', '1', 0, 31, 4, '1095', '1095', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lock in long-lasting moisture with APLB Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 Facial Cream, a deeply hydrating and skin-repairing moisturizer formulated with 30.9% Hyaluronic HA B5 Cen™, a blend of Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide, and Centella Asiatica Extract. This antioxidant-rich formula brightens, soothes irritation, and strengthens the skin barrier, leaving your complexion plump, smooth, and radiant.\nIntense Hydration & Moisture Lock – 30.9% Hyaluronic HA B5 Cen™ provides multi-layer hydrationStrengthens Skin Barrier & Protects – Ceramide & Centella Asiatica help restore and maintain skin resilienceSoothes & Calms Sensitivity – Centella Extract helps reduce redness and irritation for a balanced complexionBrightens & Revitalizes – Antioxidant-rich formula improves skin tone and radianceLightweight Yet Nourishing – Absorbs quickly for deep hydration without greasiness\n\nHow to Use:', 950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB 30.9% Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 Facial CreamPrice in BD', 'APLB 30.9% Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 Facial Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-309-hyaluronic-acid-ceramide-ha-b5-facial-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30');
