(1096, 'Biumark H2O Moisturising Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 136, '1096', '1096', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize and protect your skin every day with Biumark H2O Moisturising Lotion—a gentle yet powerful moisturiser made for dry to normal and sensitive skin. Its advanced hydrating formula helps restore lost moisture, soothe dryness, and leave your skin feeling soft, smooth, and comfortably nourished. With regular use, it supports a healthier-looking, more even-toned complexion and a naturally youthful glow.\nDeep Hydration & Skin ComfortEnriched with Sodium PCA and Glycerine, this lotion helps replenish moisture and reduce dryness and roughness for long-lasting comfort.\nNourishing & Skin-Soothing IngredientsPowered with Vitamin E, Omega 6, 3, 9, and Curcumin, it helps soothe stressed skin and supports the skin’s natural barrier—ideal for daily hydration.\nSqualene-Infused for a Healthy GlowSqualene helps soften and smooth the skin while supporting a fresh, hydrated look that feels light and breathable.\nFast-Absorbing, Non-Sticky FinishThe lightweight texture absorbs quickly and leaves no greasy residue, making it perfect for everyday use—morning or night.\nSuitable for Dry to Normal, Sensitive Skin\nHypoallergenic & Non-Comedogenic (won’t clog pores)\nHelps with dryness, roughness, and dehydration\nLeaves skin soft, smooth, and refreshed\nDermatological skincare for daily use\nApply a sufficient amount to clean, dry skin and gently massage until fully absorbed. Use daily, especially after bathing or whenever skin feels dry.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Keep out of reach of children.', 1290.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 10.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biumark H2O Moisturising Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Biumark H2O Moisturising Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biumark-h2o-moisturising-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1097, 'Luli-NS Anti Fungal Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 127, '1097', '1097', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Triple Action Formula for Tough Fungal Infections\nDescription:Luli-NS Anti Fungal Lotion is a powerful topical treatment designed to combat persistent fungal skin infections. It combines the antifungal strength of Luliconazole (1%) and Terbinafine Hydrochloride (1%) with Salicylic Acid (6%), which aids in exfoliating dead skin cells, enhancing penetration, and promoting faster healing.\nThis triple-action formula is ideal for treating conditions such as tinea corporis (ringworm), tinea cruris (jock itch), tinea pedis (athlete\'s foot), and other dermatophytic infections.\nLuliconazole 1% w/v – Broad-spectrum antifungal\nTerbinafine Hydrochloride 1% w/v – Fungicidal agent effective against dermatophytes\nSalicylic Acid 6% – Keratolytic, exfoliates and enhances absorption\nLotion Base – Q.S (Gentle, non-greasy formulation)\nUse as directed by a physician. Apply a thin layer to the affected area and surrounding skin, once or twice daily.\nFor external use only\nAvoid contact with eyes\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore below 30°C\nDo not freeze\nProtect from direct sunlight', 1605.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 85.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Luli-NS Anti Fungal Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Luli-NS Anti Fungal Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'luli-ns-anti-fungal-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1098, 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream for Very Dry to Dry, Sensitive Skin', '1', 0, 31, 63, '1098', '1098', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Care for your dry to very dry skin with CETAPHIL® Moisturizing Cream, a non-greasy, moisture rich cream for the whole body. Enriched with sweet almond oil and vitamin E, it immediately comforts and instantly hydrates dry, sensitive skin. Formulated with a new blend of key ingredients: hydrating glycerin, panthenol (vitamin B5) to hydrate, soothe and preserve the skin barrier, and niacinamide (vitamin B3) to help smooth skin\'s texture and retain skin\'s moisture barrier. For long lasting hydration, this extra strength moisturizer binds water to the skin to deeply replenish the skin\'s moisture and prevent moisture loss, hydrating and soothing skin\'s dryness for 48 hours and completely restoring the skin\'s moisture barrier in one week. Ideal for very dry areas of skin on the hands, feet, elbows and knees, leaving your skin feeling soft, smooth and nourished. This fragrance free, paraben free, and sulfate free formula won\'t clog pores and is clinically tested for even the most gentle skin. Effectively defends against five signs of skin sensitivity.', 1736.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 619.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream for Very Dry to Dry, Sensitive SkinPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream for Very Dry to Dry, Sensitive Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-moisturizing-cream-for-very-dry-to-dry-sensitive-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
