(1100, 'Tru Peel Gel Exfoliating Peeling Gel 30gm', '1', 0, 31, 186, '1100', '1100', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tru Peel Gel – Exfoliating Peeling Gel (30gm)\nKey Benefits\nSkin Texture & Tone – Improves smoothness and promotes a more even complexion.\nGentle Exfoliation – Removes dead skin cells to reveal fresh, radiant skin.\nFine Lines & Wrinkles – Reduces the appearance of lines, boosts collagen production, and enhances skin elasticity.\nAcne & Scarring – Helps clear breakouts and minimize acne scars.\nHyperpigmentation – Lightens dark spots, reduces melasma, and brightens overall skin tone.\nAdditional Benefits – Minimizes pore size, increases hydration, and calms inflammation.\nKey Ingredients\nGlycolic Acid – Gently exfoliates for a smoother, brighter look.\nVitamin B5 & Glycerin – Locks in moisture, keeping skin hydrated and nourished.\nResveratrol – A powerful antioxidant that reduces oxidative stress, improves elasticity, and smooths fine lines over time.\nLicorice Extract – Brightens complexion, fades dark spots, and soothes inflammation.\nOther Active Ingredients – Green tea, aloe vera, vitamin E, beet root extract, amino acids, and plant extracts for skin nourishment and repair.\nFree From\nAlcohol\nOil\nSilicone\nGluten\n100% Vegan & Cruelty-Free\nHow to Use\nAfter cleansing, apply to face, neck, and décolletage using a cotton pad.\nLet it absorb; do not rinse.\nFollow with serum or moisturizer.\nUse morning or evening.\nAlways apply sunscreen in the morning.\nSafety Advice\nPerform a patch test before use.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStore at room temperature.\nAvoid use on broken skin.\nIf irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a doctor.\nAvoid contact with eyes.', 1719.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 91.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Tru Peel Gel Exfoliating Peeling Gel 30gmPrice in BD', 'Tru Peel Gel Exfoliating Peeling Gel 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'tru-peel-gel-exfoliating-peeling-gel-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1101, 'Aveeno Calm + Restore Oat Gel Moisturiser for Sensitive Skin 50ml', '1', 0, 31, 124, '1101', '1101', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Aveeno Calm + Restore Oat Gel Facial Moisturizer for Sensitive Skin, Fast-Absorbing, Soothing Lightweight Gel Cream with Prebiotic Oat & Feverfew, Fragrance-Free & Hypoallergenic\nHydrate your sensitive, irritated, dry skin with Aveeno Calm + Restore Oat Gel Facial Moisturizer. Tested to be gentle on sensitive skin, the gentle oat gel moisturizer instantly soothes & replenishes skin moisture barrier. Aveeno Calm + Restore designed for sensitive skin with prebiotic oat, goes beyond soothing to strengthen skin\'s moisture barrier. The lightweight hydrating gel cream continues to moisturize for 24 hours so even sensitive skin feels comfortable all day. The hypoallergenic cream with prebiotic oat helps soothe dryness & nourishes skin\'s natural moisture barrier while feverfew calms & 97% noted skin feels less irritated, more tolerant & comfortable all day. The fast-absorbing, non-comedogenic formula is free of fragrances, parabens, alcohol, dyes & phthalates & leaves skin feeling soft & supple. This soothing moisturizer is gentle & effective.\nSoothe & hydrate irritated, dry, sensitive skin with this gel moisturizer. This fast-absorbing, lightweight gel face cream with nourishing prebiotic oat & calming feverfew moisturizes skin for 24 hours.\nHydrating gel moisturizer for sensitive skin\nLightweight cream provides 24-hour moisture\nMade with soothing prebiotic oat & feverfew\nGood for: Sensitive skin\nTexture: Lightweight gel\n', 2200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aveeno Calm + Restore Oat Gel Moisturiser for Sensitive Skin 50mlPrice in BD', 'Aveeno Calm + Restore Oat Gel Moisturiser for Sensitive Skin 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aveeno-calm-restore-oat-gel-moisturiser-for-sensitive-skin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1102, 'Cetaphil Daily Hydrating Lotion – Oil-Free, 24H Moisture with Hyaluronic Acid – 88ml', '1', 0, 31, 63, '1102', '1102', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cetaphil® Daily Hydrating Lotion is a dermatologist-recommended, ultra-lightweight, oil-free moisturizer specifically designed to deliver intense, long-lasting hydration for up to 24 hours. Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid, a powerful moisture-binding agent naturally found in the skin, this gentle yet effective formula helps attract and retain moisture, leaving your skin feeling soft, smooth, and comfortably hydrated.\nIdeal for combination, dry to oily, and sensitive skin types, this fast-absorbing lotion works to restore the skin’s natural moisture barrier without clogging pores or leaving a greasy residue. With regular use, skin feels balanced, refreshed, and visibly healthier.\nProvides 24-hour hydration for visibly smoother, softer skin\nOil-free, non-comedogenic formula – won\'t clog pores\nContains Hyaluronic Acid to lock in moisture and support hydration\nHelps reinforce the skin’s natural protective barrier\nFast-absorbing, ultra-lightweight texture\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\nClinically proven to help defend against the 5 signs of skin sensitivity:\nDryness\nIrritation\nRoughness\nTightness\nWeakened skin barrier\nApply evenly to the face and neck after cleansing. Use morning and evening or as needed. Gently massage into the skin until fully absorbed.\nDaily facial hydration\nSensitive, combination, oily, or dry skin\nUse under makeup or sunscreen\nLightweight hydration without heaviness or shine\nHyaluronic Acid – Enhances hydration by attracting and retaining moisture in the skin\nWater, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Hydroxyethyl Urea, Cyclopentasiloxane, Glycerin, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Hydroxide, Homarine HCl, Sodium PCA, Cetyl Alcohol, Caprylyl Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Erythritol.\n88 mL / 3 fl oz', 2450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1050.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Daily Hydrating Lotion – Oil-Free, 24H Moisture with Hyaluronic Acid – 88mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Daily Hydrating Lotion – Oil-Free, 24H Moisture with Hyaluronic Acid – 88ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-daily-hydrating-lotion-oil-free-24h-moisture-with-hyaluronic-acid-88ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
