(1106, 'Cerave Diabetics Dry Skin Relief Moisturizing Cream', '1', 0, 31, 153, '1106', '1106', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Details:\n\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe has a complete line of therapeutic skincare to cleanse & moisturize skin. CeraVe contains the 3 ceramides (called 1, 3, & 6-II) healthy skin needs. Delivered through a patented, controlled-release technology, this formula with ceramides helps restore the skin\'s protective barrier & lock in moisture.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Diabetics\' Dry Skin Relief Moisturizing Cream moisturizes and helps soothe diabetics\' dry skin at application. This formula, with Billbery and Urea, helps attract and retain moisture for all day hydration. Also formulated with three essential ceramides to help restore and maintain your skin\'s natural protective barrier.\n\n\n\n\nAll CeraVe products contain the essential ceramides healthy skin needs to help restore and maintain its natural protective barrier.\nSource of antioxidants.\nHelps attract and retain moisture.\nFree of Parabens and Fragrance to avoid skin irritation.\n*Please refer to ingredient list\n\n\n\n\nApply liberally as often as needed, or as directed by a physician.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, its unique formula - with 3 essential ceramides - goes beyond moisturizing to soothe dry skin and helps restore and maintain your skin\'s natural protective barrier.\nCeramides are an essential part of the skin\'s natural barrier. They help skin to seal in moisture and seal out impurities.\nControlled release for long-lasting hydration.', 2100.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Diabetics Dry Skin Relief Moisturizing CreamPrice in BD', 'Cerave Diabetics Dry Skin Relief Moisturizing Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-diabetics-dry-skin-relief-moisturizing-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1107, 'La Roche-Posay Toleriane Double Repair Face Moisturizer – 48H Hydration with Ceramide-3 & Niacinamide – 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 62, '1107', '1107', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'La Roche-Posay Toleriane Double Repair Face Moisturizer is a dermatologist-tested, oil-free daily moisturizer formulated for sensitive skin. It delivers dual-action care by replenishing moisture for up to 48 hours and helping to restore the skin’s natural protective barrier.\nEnriched with La Roche-Posay Prebiotic Thermal Water, Ceramide-3, Niacinamide, and Glycerin, the formula supports the skin’s microbiome and barrier function, reducing visible signs of sensitivity such as dryness, tightness, redness, and roughness.\nProvides 48-hour hydration with a lightweight, fast-absorbing texture\nHelps restore and maintain the skin’s natural moisture barrier\nSupports the skin’s microbiome with prebiotic thermal water\nSoothes and improves the appearance of sensitive skin\nSafe for all skin types, including sensitive\nLa Roche-Posay Prebiotic Thermal Water – Soothes and strengthens the skin\nCeramide-3 – Helps rebuild the skin barrier\nNiacinamide – Calms visible redness and improves skin tone\nGlycerin – Attracts and retains moisture\nSqualane – Provides lightweight hydration\nImmediately restores the feeling of skin comfort\nReplenishes moisture for up to 48 hours\nHelps restore the skin barrier within 1 hour\nApply to the face and neck morning and/or evening after cleansing. Massage gently until fully absorbed.\nOil-free\nFragrance-free\nNon-comedogenic\nParaben-free\nAllergy tested\nSuitable for sensitive skin\n100 ml / 1.35 fl ozMade in France\nAqua/Water/Eau, Glycerin, Squalane, Dimethicone, Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, Niacinamide, Ammonium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Myristyl Myristate, Stearic Acid, Ceramide NP, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Glyceryl Stearate SE, Sodium Hydroxide, Myristic Acid, Palmitic Acid, Capryloyl Glycine, Caprylyl Glycol, Xanthan Gum', 3690.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0