(1108, 'Aveeno Eczema Therapy Daily Moisturizing Cream for Eczema-Prone Skin 141g', '1', 0, 31, 124, '1108', '1108', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Aveeno Eczema Therapy Daily Moisturizing Cream is a dermatologist-recommended, clinically proven formula designed to soothe and protect dry, itchy, and eczema-prone skin. Developed with leading dermatologists, this breakthrough cream helps relieve key eczema symptoms—itchiness, redness, irritation, and dryness—while restoring the skin’s natural protective barrier.\nThis gentle, nourishing formula features colloidal oatmeal and ceramides, essential lipids naturally found in the skin. Together, they strengthen the skin barrier, enhance moisture retention, and support long-term skin health.\nRecognized for its effectiveness, this eczema cream has received the National Eczema Association Seal of Approval. It is steroid-free, fragrance-free, allergy-tested, and safe for daily use on both adults and children—even babies.\nAveeno blends the goodness of nature with the power of science to keep skin healthy, balanced, and protected—making it a trusted choice for families and dermatologists worldwide.', 1950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aveeno Eczema Therapy Daily Moisturizing Cream for Eczema-Prone Skin 141gPrice in BD', 'Aveeno Eczema Therapy Daily Moisturizing Cream for Eczema-Prone Skin 141g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aveeno-eczema-therapy-daily-moisturizing-cream-for-eczema-prone-skin-141g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
