(1111, 'Cetaphil Moisturising Cream for Dry To Normal, Sensitive Skin 80gm', '1', 0, 31, 63, '1111', '1111', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A rich, fragrance-free moisturiser that delivers intense hydration and replenishes even the driest skin into soft, smooth and healthy skin.\nIngredients:\npurified water, polylycerylmethacrylate and propylene glyceryl stearate, light liquid paraffin, dicaprylyl ether, peg-5,glycery stearate, glycerine, dimethicone and dimethiconal,cetyl alcohol, refined almond oil, benzyl alcohol, tocopheryl acetate, acrylates/c10-30 alkyl acrylate, disodium edetate, sodium hydroxide, all-rac-alpha tocopherol\nApply liberally as often as needed or as recommended by physician\nCetaphil Moisturizing Cream is a rich, fragrance-free moisturizer that delivers intense hydration and replenishes sensitive, dry skin. It’s clinically proven to provide immediate and long-lasting relief. This nongreasy formula absorbs quickly and goes to work right away, helping to leave dry skin soft and smooth to the touch\n\n\n\n\nThis moisturizing cream is specially formulated to treat the dryness, flakiness, and scaly skin associated with a variety of skin conditions. Clinically tested in patients with eczema, it is effective and nonirritating to sensitive skin.\nCetaphil Moisturizing Cream has a fast-absorbing formula that absorbs quickly into skin to protect and enhance skin\'s natural barrier. Daily use of the cream helps skin return to its normal, healthy appearance and comfort level.\nThis moisturizing cream provides long-lasting moisture for extended relief of dry skin. It contains highly-effective yet gentle ingredients that are clinically proven to bind water to the skin to help prevent moisture loss. This results in long-term relief for even severely dry skin.\nLike all Cetaphil moisturizers, Cetaphil Moisturizing Cream was developed with dermatologists and is mild and nonirritating for sensitive skin. It has a hypoallergenic, non-comedogenic formula and is free of fragrance, parabens, lanolin, and other potentially irritating ingredients.\n', 1149.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 401.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Moisturising Cream for Dry To Normal, Sensitive Skin 80gmPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Moisturising Cream for Dry To Normal, Sensitive Skin 80gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-moisturising-cream-for-dry-to-normal-sensitive-skin-80gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1112, 'Bioderma Atoderm Intensive Baume 200ml', '1', 0, 31, 227, '1112', '1112', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The intensely anti-itching and repairing treatment. Ultra-soothing, ultra-nourishing.\nOnce or twice a day daily, on previously cleansed skin. The 3-6-9 method is a new method for systematizing the application of emollient. It has been developed to indicate the correct dose of Atoderm Intensive balm to apply, as well as to create a routine for daily application and lasting results.\n3 doses for a BABY: 1 dose for the face, neck and chest, 1 dose for both arms and back, 1 dose for both legs.\n6 doses for a CHILD: 1 dose for the face and neck, 1 dose for the chest, 1 dose for the back, 1 dose for both arms, 1 dose for each leg (x2).\n9 doses for an ADULT: 1 dose for the face and neck, 1 dose for the chest, 1 dose for the back, 1 dose for each arm (x2), 2 doses for each leg (x2).\nAQUA/WATER/EAU, GLYCERIN, PARAFFINUM LIQUIDUM/MINERAL OIL/HUILE MINERAL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, BEHENYL ALCOHOL, SUCROSE STEARATE, CANOLA/ CANOLA OIL/HUILE DE RAPEZ, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMERPENTYLENE GLYCOL, BETA -SITOSTEROL, XYLITOL, ZINC GLUCONATE, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, PALMITAMIDE MEA, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, SODIUM CITRATE, MANNITOL, RHAMNOSE, SODIUM LAUROYL LACTYLATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, POLYSORBATE 60, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, TOCOPHERATE , PHYTOSPHINGOSINE, CERAMIDE NP, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, CERAMIDE AP, CHOLESTEROL, CARBOMER, XANTHAN GUM, FRUCTOOLIGOSACCHARIDES, CAPRYLIC/ CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, LAMINARIA OCHROLEUCA EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, CERAMIDE EOP. [BI 669]\nThe ingredients listed here are those contained in the latest formulation of this product. As a time lag may exist between its production and its distribution on the market, we invite you to consult the list of ingredients on the packaging of your product.', 4221.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1