(1114, 'Lexikin Lotion', '1', 0, 31, 128, '1114', '1114', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lexikin Lotion is a therapeutic skin moisturizer formulated with White Soft Paraffin, Light Liquid Paraffin, and Aloe Vera. This soothing emollient forms a protective layer on the skin surface, reducing moisture loss and promoting hydration. Enriched with natural Aloe Vera, it helps soothe irritation and support skin repair.\nLight Liquid Paraffin – 10.2%\nWhite Soft Paraffin – 13.2%\nAloe Vera Extract – 10.0%\nGlycerin Lotion Base – q.s.\nEczema\nDermatitis\nChapped or cracked skin\nVery dry or flaky skin\nApply Lexikin Lotion generously to the affected area 2 to 3 times daily or as needed. For chronic skin conditions such as eczema, continued use even after improvement can help prevent flare-ups. Reapply frequently, especially after washing.\n✔ Deep, long-lasting moisturization✔ Helps restore and protect the skin barrier✔ Soothes dry, itchy, or irritated skin✔ Paraben-free & Alcohol-free✔ Suitable for daily use✔ Non-greasy & fast absorbing\nFor external use only.Store in a cool, dry place.Keep out of reach of children.', 1187.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 63.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lexikin LotionPrice in BD', 'Lexikin Lotion Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lexikin-lotion', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1115, 'Constanta Tea Tree Nourishing Oil For Nail And Skin 35ml (CT199)', '1', 0, 31, 137, '1115', '1115', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Constanta Tea Tree Nourishing Oil is a purifying and revitalizing treatment specially formulated for the skin, body, and nails. Infused with Tea Tree Oil, known for its cleansing, antibacterial, and antimicrobial properties, this nourishing oil helps refresh the skin while supporting a healthier appearance. It works to combat bacteria that may compromise skin and nail health, leaving the applied areas smooth, revitalized, and protected.\nContains Tea Tree Oil, known for antibacterial and purifying properties.\nHelps reduce inflammation, redness, irritation, and acne.\nSupports healthy-looking nails and cuticles.\nHelps control dandruff and scalp irritation caused by bacteria.\nProvides nourishment to dry or rough areas of the skin.\nLightweight, fast-absorbing formula suitable for daily use.\nHelps refresh, smooth, and revitalize skin and nails.\nApply one or two drops of the oil onto a cotton pad or cotton bud.Gently apply to the affected area as required.Suitable for nails, cuticles, and targeted skin application.\nMineral Oil, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Argania Spinosa Kernel Oil, Ascorbyl Tetraisopalmitate, Oryza Sativa Bran Oil, Ricinus Communis Seed Oil, Salvia Hispanica Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil, Tocopheryl Acetate.\nPurifying and antibacterial\nCalms skin irritation\nNourishes nails and cuticles\nSupports healthy scalp and skin\nSuitable for regular use', 1596.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 84.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Constanta Tea Tree Nourishing Oil For Nail And Skin 35ml (CT199)Price in BD', 'Constanta Tea Tree Nourishing Oil For Nail And Skin 35ml (CT199) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'constanta-tea-tree-nourishing-oil-for-nail-and-skin-35ml-ct199', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy 