(1119, 'Garnier Men Acno Fight Pimple Clearing Brightening Moisturiser 45gm', '1', 0, 31, 37, '1119', '1119', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier Men Acno Fight Pimple Clearing Brightening Moisturiser is a specially formulated skincare product designed to target acne and pimples while providing a brightening effect for men’s skin. Packaged in a 45g tube, this moisturizer combines the benefits of pimple-fighting ingredients with brightening agents to help clear breakouts, control excess oil, and reduce the appearance of dark spots.\nThe lightweight formula absorbs quickly, leaving a non-greasy, matte finish, which is ideal for oily and acne-prone skin. It contains active ingredients that work to unclog pores, prevent future breakouts, and soothe irritated skin, while brightening the complexion and evening out skin tone. With regular use, it helps achieve a smoother, clearer, and healthier-looking complexion.\nGarnier Men Acno Fight Pimple Clearing Brightening Moisturiser is perfect for daily use, offering both hydration and oil control. Apply after cleansing in the morning and evening for best results, allowing your skin to stay clear, fresh, and radiant all day.', 410.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Men Acno Fight Pimple Clearing Brightening Moisturiser 45gmPrice in BD', 'Garnier Men Acno Fight Pimple Clearing Brightening Moisturiser 45gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-men-acno-fight-pimple-clearing-brightening-moisturiser-45gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1120, 'APLB 34.3% Zinc Niacinamide Facial Cream', '1', 0, 31, 4, '1120', '1120', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The APLB Zinc Niacinamide Facial Cream is a lightweight, hydrating moisturizer designed to calm and balance the skin. Formulated with zinc and niacinamide, it helps to regulate sebum production, reduce redness, and minimize the appearance of pores. Ideal for oily and acne-prone skin and promotes a clearer, smoother complexion. Its non-greasy formula absorbs quickly, providing long-lasting hydration.\n\nHow to Use:Apply an appropriate amount to cleansed (and toned) skinPat into the skin until fully absorbedUse in the morning and at night', 792.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 458.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB 34.3% Zinc Niacinamide Facial CreamPrice in BD', 'APLB 34.3% Zinc Niacinamide Facial Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-343-zinc-niacinamide-facial-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1121, 'Cerave Moisturizing Lotion for Dry to Very Dry Skin 88ml (Made in France)', '1', 0, 31, 153, '1121', '1121', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CeraVe Moisturizing Lotion is a dermatologist-developed, fragrance-free lotion designed specifically for dry to very dry skin. Enriched with 3 essential ceramides, it helps restore and maintain the skin’s natural protective barrier while providing long-lasting hydration. Gentle enough for face and body, this lotion is suitable for both adults and children, making it perfect for daily skincare routines.\nMoisturizes and nourishes dry and very dry skin\nRestores the skin barrier with 3 essential ceramides\nFragrance-free – ideal for sensitive skin\nNon-comedogenic – won’t clog pores\nHypoallergenic – formulated to minimize risk of allergies\nSuitable for face and body, adults and children\nGentle, fast-absorbing formula for daily use\nApply liberally as often as needed.\nSuitable for all ages, including children.\nCan be used on face and body.\nCeramide NP, Ceramide AP, Ceramide EOP – restore and protect skin barrier\nGlycerin – retains moisture and softens skin\nAdditional emollients – provide long-lasting hydration\nVolume: 88ml (3 fl. oz)\nMade in France', 1040.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 450.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Moisturizing Lotion for Dry to Very Dry Skin 88ml (Made in France)Price in BD', 'Cerave Moisturizing Lotion for Dry to Very Dry Skin 88ml (Made in France) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-moisturizing-lotion-for-dry-to-very-dry-skin-88ml-made-in-france', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1122, 'APLB AHA BHA PHA 26.0% Centella Facial Cream', '1', 0, 31, 4, '1122', '1122', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Centella Asiatica Extract (25.8%): Known for its soothing and healing properties, it helps calm irritated skin and supports skin barrier repair.​\nAHA, BHA, and PHA (100ppm each): These chemical exfoliants work together to remove dead skin cells, unclog pores, and promote smoother skin texture.​\nTea Tree Leaf Extract (2,000ppm): Offers antibacterial and anti-inflammatory benefits, aiding in acne prevention and skin purification.​\nTurmeric Root Extract: Provides antioxidant and anti-inflammatory effects, contributing to a brighter complexion.​\nHydrating Agents: Ingredients like Sodium Hyaluronate, Panthenol, and Beta-Glucan help maintain skin moisture and elasticity.​\nSize: Typically available in a 50ml tube.​\nTexture: Lightweight and fast-absorbing, suitable for layering in skincare routines.​\nSkin Types: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin.​\nFree From: Artificial fragrances, colorants, and other potential irritants, making it gentle on the skin.​\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount of the cream to your face.​\nGently massage until fully absorbed.​\nUse twice daily, in the morning and evening, for optimal results.', 950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB AHA BHA PHA 26.0% Centella Facial CreamPrice in BD', 'APLB AHA BHA PHA 26.0% Centella Facial Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-aha-bha-pha-260-centella-facial-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1123, 'Xerosoft Lotion 180ml', '1', 0, 31, 299, '1123', '1123', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Xerosoft Lotion is an emollient moisturizer used for the treatment of dry skin (শুষ্ক ত্বক). It helps soften and protect the skin by forming a barrier that reduces moisture loss—especially when the skin’s natural oil (sebum) level is low and the skin becomes rough, tight, or flaky.\nActive Ingredients (per gram)\nSoft Paraffin BP 80 mg\nLiquid Paraffin BP 30 mg\nIndication\nRecommended for the treatment and management of dry skin.\nHow to Use\nApply to the affected area as needed, depending on the skin’s condition.\nWorks best when applied after cleansing/bathing, when skin tends to lose moisture.\nStorage & Safety\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from light.\nKeep below 25°C.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nFor external use only.', 315.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 35.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Xerosoft Lotion 180mlPrice in BD', 'Xerosoft Lotion 180ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'xerosoft-lotion-180ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1124, 'Garnier Men Turbo Bright Anti-Pollution Brightening Moisturiser 40gm', '1', 0, 31, 37, '1124', '1124', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier Men Turbo Bright Anti-Pollution Brightening Moisturiser is a lightweight daily moisturizer formulated to combat pollution’s effects while brightening and hydrating the skin. Available in a 40g tube, this moisturizer is infused with Vitamin C and other brightening ingredients to help reduce dullness, dark spots, and uneven skin tone, leaving the skin looking fresh and radiant.\nThis moisturizer provides a shield against environmental aggressors, reducing damage caused by pollution and helping to prevent further dullness. The non-greasy formula absorbs quickly, making it ideal for men with oily or combination skin. It delivers lasting hydration while giving an instant brightness boost, leaving skin smooth, soft, and shine-free throughout the day.\nSuitable for daily use, Garnier Men Turbo Bright Anti-Pollution Brightening Moisturiser is perfect for anyone exposed to urban environments, as it not only brightens but also protects. Apply it after cleansing in the morning to achieve a brighter, healthier-looking complexion and protect against daily environmental stressors', 351.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 39.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Men Turbo Bright Anti-Pollution Brightening Moisturiser 40gmPrice in BD', 'Garnier Men Turbo Bright Anti-Pollution Brightening Moisturiser 40gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-men-turbo-bright-anti-pollution-brightening-moisturiser-40gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:30', '2026-02-11 08:14:30'),
(1125, 'Salcura Bioskin Zeoderm Skin Repair Moisturiser Face & Body Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 301, '1125', '1125', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Salcura Bioskin Zeoderm Skin Repair Moisturiser – Face & Body Lotion (100ml)\nDescription:A natural skin repair moisturiser formulated to protect, soothe, and nourish dry, itchy, and atopic skin.Suitable for skin that may be prone to eczema, dermatitis, and psoriasis.\nDirections for Use:Apply liberally to the skin and repeat as often as required.We recommend 3–4 times daily until dryness improves.For best results, use in conjunction with Bioskin Dermalotion Intensive.\nProduct Selection Guide:\nBioskin Dermalotion Intensive (Body): Use as a daily source of moisture and vital nutrients.\nBioskin Dermaserum (Face): Use as an intense daily facial moisturiser.\nBioskin Zeoderm Skin Repair Moisturiser (Face & Body): Apply over Derma-products for additional repair and protection to the most affected areas.\nFree From:SLS/SLES, parabens, lanolin, synthetic fragrance, microplastics, formaldehyde, nanoparticles, triclosan, methylisothiazolinone (MI), and methylchloroisothiazolinone (MCI).\nCertifications:Cruelty-free and vegan-friendly. Dermatologically tested.\nIngredients:Aqua, Glycerin, Urea, Linum Usitatissimum (Flax) Seed Oil, Cetearyl Alcohol, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Zeolite, Cetearyl Glucoside, Borago Officinalis Leaf Extract, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Cetearyl Sulfate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Citronellol, Geraniol, Phenethyl Alcohol, Cymbopogon Martini Oil, Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil, Pelargonium Graveolens (Geranium) Oil, Linalool, Rosa Damascena Flower Water.\nManufacturer:Salcura Ltd, London, UKTel: +44 (0)20 8979 3502Email: info@salcura.co.ukWebsite: www.salcuraskincare.com', 1107.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 83.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Salcura Bioskin Zeoderm Skin Repair Moisturiser Face & Body Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Salcura Bioskin Zeoderm Skin Repair Moisturiser Face & Body Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'salcura-bioskin-zeoderm-skin-repair-moisturiser-face-body-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31');
