(1126, 'Aestura Atobarrier 365 Cream for Dry & Sensitive Skin 10ml', '1', 0, 31, 300, '1126', '1126', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'High-density ceramide capsule cream , 120 Hours Moisturization, Strengthening Skin Barrier for Dry and Sensitive Skin\nThrough 40 years of dedicated research on sensitive skin, AESTURA has launched the 2nd generation evolved moisturizer, ATOBARRIER365 Cream. The concentrated, long-chain and high-density ceramide capsules help repair your compromised skin barrier.\nINGREDIENTS\nWATER / AQUA / EAU, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, GLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL DICAPRYLATE/ DICAPRATE, CETYL ETHYLHEXANOATE, SQUALANE, PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRAISOSTEARATE, DICAPRYLYL CARBONATE, BEHENYL ALCOHOL, DIMETHICONE, HYDROXYPROPYL BISPALMITAMIDE MEA, STEARIC ACID, BETAINE, MANNITOL, C14-22 ALCOHOLS, PALMITIC ACID, HYDROXYPROPYL BISLAURAMIDE MEA, ARACHIDYL ALCOHOL, CHOLESTEROL, POLYACRYLATE-13, C12-20 ALKYL GLUCOSIDE, ALLANTOIN, ARACHIDYL GLUCOSIDE, NIACINAMIDE, CERAMIDE NP, GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, HYDROGENATED POLYISOBUTENE, CARBOMER, TROMETHAMINE, DIMETHICONOL, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, HYDROGENATED LECITHIN, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, ACRYLATES / AMMONIUM METHACRYLATE COPOLYMER, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, SILICA, PHYTOSPHINGOSINE, SPHINGOLIPIDS, ARACHIDIC ACID, TOCOPHEROL, OLEIC ACID\n\nFREE of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance.', 350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aestura Atobarrier 365 Cream for Dry & Sensitive Skin 10mlPrice in BD', 'Aestura Atobarrier 365 Cream for Dry & Sensitive Skin 10ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aestura-atobarrier-365-cream-for-dry-sensitive-skin-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1127, 'Neova Moisturizing Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 302, '1127', '1127', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neova Moisturizing Lotion (100ml) is a high-quality skincare product designed to provide deep hydration and nourishment to your skin. Here\'s a detailed overview of its features and benefits:\nIntense Hydration:\nLightweight Formula:\nSkin-Nourishing Ingredients:\nSuitable for All Skin Types:\nCompact 100ml Size:\nDermatologist-Recommended:\nNeova Moisturizing Lotion (100ml) is perfect for anyone looking to achieve smooth, hydrated, and healthy-looking skin with a trusted skincare solution.', 1510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 340.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neova Moisturizing Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Neova Moisturizing Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neova-moisturizing-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1128, 'Babé Depigment+ Lotion Glow-150ml – Illuminates, Renews & Evens Skin Tone 150ml', '1', 0, 31, 99, '1128', '1128', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'DescriptionBabé Depigment+ Lotion Glow is a gentle renewing lotion designed to illuminate the complexion, even out skin tone, and provide a fresh, revitalized appearance. With a lightweight and refreshing texture, it absorbs easily and can be applied directly using the palms of your hands. Perfect for daily day and night use, it preps the skin after cleansing and enhances the performance of the rest of the Depigment+ routine.\nFormulated with Stable Vitamin C, Gluconolactone (PHA), and Niacinamide, the lotion boosts radiance, improves clarity, strengthens the skin barrier, and provides mild exfoliation. It also delivers lasting hydration through Hyaluronic Acid, while its pre- and postbiotic complex helps support a balanced and healthy skin microbiome.\nIlluminates and renews the skin\nEvens and unifies skin tone\nProvides immediate radiance\nLeaves skin smoother, softer, and more even\nHelps prevent the formation of dark spots(protection against blue light & pollution)\nAll skin types, including sensitive\nIdeal for those dealing with pigmentation, dullness, uneven tone, or dark spots\nStable Vitamin C (2%) – Brightens and evens skin tone\nGluconolactone (5%) – Gently renews and smooths the skin\nNiacinamide (3%) – Evens tone and strengthens the skin barrier\nD-Panthenol (2%) – Soothes and protects\nHyaluronic Acid (0.1%) – Provides lasting hydration\nPre- & Postbiotics (0.1%) – Support a balanced skin microbiome\nAQUA, GLUCONOLACTONE, NIACINAMIDE, PROPANEDIOL, ASCORBYL GLUCOSIDE, PANTHENOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BIS-PEG-12 DIMETHICONE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT, AVENA SATIVA KERNEL EXTRACT, LACTOBACILLUS FERMENT, PHYTIC ACID, GLYCERIN, ISOPENTYLDIOL, POLYSORBATE 20, SODIUM METABISULFITE, PANTOLACTONE, PARFUM, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE*Always refer to the product packaging for the most updated ingredient list.\nUse morning and evening on clean, dry skin.\nPour into the palm of your hand.\nSmooth and press gently onto the face until fully absorbed.\nFollow with Intensive Serum and Control Fluid for enhanced depigmentation results.', 3650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Babé Depigment+ Lotion Glow-150ml – Illuminates, Renews & Evens Skin Tone 150mlPrice in BD', 'Babé Depigment+ Lotion Glow-150ml – Illuminates, Renews & Evens Skin Tone 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'babe-depigment-lotion-glow-150ml-illuminates-renews-evens-skin-tone-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1129, 'Mum CL Calamine Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 285, '1129', '1129', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mum CL Calamine Lotion is a soothing and protective skincare lotion specially formulated to provide relief from itching, irritation, and discomfort caused by various skin conditions. Enriched with Calamine, Zinc Oxide, Aloe Vera Extract, Bentonite, Glycerin, and Vitamin E, it helps calm irritated skin, absorb excess moisture, and protect the skin barrier—making it suitable for all skin types.\nThis lotion works as an effective itch-relief solution, skin protectant, and drying agent, helping to soothe conditions such as rashes, prickly heat, minor skin irritation, insect bites, and allergic reactions. Aloe Vera and Glycerin help moisturize and soothe the skin, while Vitamin E supports skin nourishment and repair.\nKey Benefits\nProvides effective itch relief and soothing comfort\nActs as a skin protectant and drying agent\nHelps calm irritated, itchy, and inflamed skin\nAbsorbs excess oil and moisture\nSuitable for all skin types\nKey Ingredients\nCalamine 15%\nZinc Oxide 5%\nBentonite 3%\nGlycerin 5%\nAloe Vera Extract 5%\nVitamin E (Tocopheryl Acetate) 0.5%\nIngredients (INCI)Purified Water, Calamine, Paraffinum Liquidum (Light Liquid Paraffin), Glycerin, Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Extract, Zinc Oxide, Bentonite, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Cera Alba (Beeswax), Cetearyl Alcohol & Ceteareth-20, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Isopropyl Myristate, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter), Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), Sodium PCA, Ethylene Glycol Monostearate, Phenoxyethanol, Carbomer, Polyquaternium-10, Triethanolamine, Disodium EDTA, Perfume.\nDirections for UseShake well before use. Apply gently to the affected area to soothe and protect dry, itchy skin, or use as directed by a dermatologist.\nFor external use only.Pack Size: 100ml', 1092.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 58.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mum CL Calamine Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Mum CL Calamine Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mum-cl-calamine-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1130, 'La Roche-Posay Toleriane Double Repair Matte Face Moisturizer 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 62, '1130', '1130', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Oil-Free, Lightweight Moisturizer for Oily & Acne-Prone Skin\nExperience balanced hydration without the shine. The Toleriane Double Repair Matte Moisturizer from La Roche-Posay is specially formulated for oily and combination skin. Infused with prebiotic thermal water, ceramide-3, niacinamide, and perlite, this gel-textured face moisturizer provides all-day hydration while visibly refining pores and improving overall skin texture.\n✅ All-day hydration with a matte finish – no greasy residue\n✅ Strengthens the skin barrier in just 1 hour\n✅ Visibly minimizes pores\n✅ Improves skin texture and reduces the appearance of fine lines\n✅ Lightweight, fast-absorbing formula\n✅ Oil-free, non-comedogenic, and suitable for sensitive skin\nLa Roche-Posay Prebiotic Thermal Water: Soothes and protects with a high concentration of selenium and essential minerals.\nCeramide-3 (NP): Reinforces the skin’s moisture barrier to lock in hydration.\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): Calms irritation and helps fade discoloration.\nPerlite & Silica: Absorb excess oil for a shine-free, soft-focus effect.\nApply morning and/or evening to the face and neck after cleansing. Use as the final step in your skincare routine or before applying makeup.\nAqua / Water, Glycerin, Silica, Betaine, Niacinamide, Cetearyl Isononanoate, Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, Ceramide NP, Carbomer, Glyceryl Stearate Citrate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Hydroxide, Perlite, Hydroxyacetophenone, Caprylyl Glycol, Xanthan Gum.Ingredients may change at manufacturer’s discretion. Always check product packaging for latest information.\nMade in France | Dermatologist-Tested | Paraben-Free | Fragrance-Free | Oil-Free', 3680.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 920.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche-Posay Toleriane Double Repair Matte Face Moisturizer 100mlPrice in BD', 'La Roche-Posay Toleriane Double Repair Matte Face Moisturizer 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-toleriane-double-repair-matte-face-moisturizer-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1131, 'Aveeno Tone + Texture Daily Renewing Body Lotion With Prebiotic Oat & PHA 532ml', '1', 0, 31, 124, '1131', '1131', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reveal smoother, more radiant skin every day with Aveeno Tone + Texture Daily Renewing Body Lotion. This gentle yet effective lotion is formulated with a unique blend of prebiotic oat and PHA (polyhydroxy acid) to help visibly improve skin tone and texture. Designed to gently exfoliate and nourish, it works to even out roughness and reduce dullness while supporting your skin’s natural moisture barrier.\nThe prebiotic oat ingredient helps maintain a healthy skin microbiome, promoting balanced and resilient skin. Meanwhile, the gentle exfoliating action of PHA helps remove dead skin cells, revealing fresher, softer skin underneath without irritation—perfect for sensitive skin types.\nLightweight and fast-absorbing, this lotion delivers lasting hydration and leaves your skin feeling smooth, healthy, and comfortable throughout the day. Ideal for daily use on the body, it’s free from parabens, phthalates, and dyes, making it a trusted choice for sensitive skin.\nVisibly improves skin tone and texture with gentle exfoliation\nContains prebiotic oat to support a healthy skin microbiome\nPHA gently renews skin by removing dead skin cells without irritation\nProvides long-lasting hydration and softness\nLightweight, non-greasy formula that absorbs quickly\nSuitable for sensitive skin\nFree from parabens, phthalates, and dyes\nDermatologist recommended\nLarge 532ml bottle for daily use\nApply generously all over the body daily. Massage into clean skin until fully absorbed. For best results, use consistently as part of your skincare routine.', 3045.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1305.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aveeno Tone + Texture Daily Renewing Body Lotion With Prebiotic Oat & PHA 532mlPrice in BD', 'Aveeno Tone + Texture Daily Renewing Body Lotion With Prebiotic Oat & PHA 532ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aveeno-tone-texture-daily-renewing-body-lotion-with-prebiotic-oat-pha-532ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1132, 'Cosmed Anti-Redness Repair Cream 40ml', '1', 0, 31, 132, '1132', '1132', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Clean and safe apothecary formulas from Anatolia\nA repairing and moisturizing cream specially formulated for sensitive and redness-prone skin. Enriched with natural extracts and the powerful Crocus Chrysanthus, it soothes irritation, strengthens the skin barrier, and restores comfort.\nReduces redness and irritation\nProvides deep hydration and nourishment\nStrengthens sensitive skin barrier\nGentle, dermatologically tested formula\nClean, safe, and eco-conscious production\nCrocus Chrysanthus (Golden Crocus) – A delicate yet resilient flower from Anatolia, symbolizing renewal and survival. Known for its soothing and skin-repairing properties, it lies at the heart of all Cosmed formulas.\nApply to cleansed face and neck.\nMassage gently in circular motions, avoiding the eye area.\nUse morning and night for best results.\nDo not rinse.\nFor external use only.\nTest on a small patch of skin before full application.\nIf irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult your doctor.\nAvoid eye contact. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water.\nWe don’t produce a product we wouldn’t use ourselves.\nCommitted to pure, clean, eco-friendly, and sustainable formulations.\nBlending Anatolia’s endemic plants with innovative science for healthier skin.\nAQUA, HEPTYL UNDECYLENATE, CYCLOPENTASILOXANE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CETEARYL OLIVATE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, PEG-100 STEARATE, OLUS OIL, SORBITAN OLIVATE, PANTHENYL TRIACETATE, DIMETHICONE, CAMELLIA SINENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PANTHENOL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, SODIUM POLYACRYLATE, AESCULUS HIPPOCASTANUM SEED EXTRACT, RUSCUS ACULEATUS ROOT EXTRACT, CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT, PORPHYRIDIUM CRUENTUM CULTURE EXTRACT, NARINGENIN, TROXERUTIN, VITIS VINIFERA LEAF EXTRACT, HEDERA HELIX EXTRACT, POLYGONUM FAGOPYRUM LEAF EXTRACT, BISABOLOL, XANTHAN GUM, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, ACACIA SENEGAL GUM, SODIUM BENZOATE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CROCUS CHRYSANTHUS BULB EXTRACT.', 2075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmed Anti-Redness Repair Cream 40mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmed Anti-Redness Repair Cream 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmed-anti-redness-repair-cream-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1133, 'Vanicream Daily Facial Moisturizer 89ml – Hydrating & Gentle Formula with Hyaluronic Acid & Ceramides for Sensitive Skin, Fragrance-Free', '1', 0, 31, 303, '1133', '1133', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Vanicream Daily Facial Moisturizer is specially formulated for sensitive skin and for those who wish to avoid common chemical irritants often found in regular skincare products. This lightweight yet nourishing moisturizer delivers long-lasting hydration without clogging pores, making it ideal for daily use, day or night.\nEnriched with Hyaluronic Acid, it helps attract and retain moisture, leaving skin soft, smooth, and refreshed. Ceramides help strengthen the skin barrier to lock in hydration and protect against environmental stressors. Non-comedogenic and fragrance-free, it’s suitable for all skin types, including the most sensitive.\nKey Benefits:\nProvides gentle, effective moisturization for sensitive skin\nHydrates and locks in moisture with Hyaluronic Acid\nSupports skin barrier health with Ceramides\nLightweight, non-greasy, and non-comedogenic\nFree from fragrance, dyes, parabens, and other common irritants\nDirections for Use:Apply as needed to the face and neck, day or night, or as directed by a physician.\nIngredients:Water, Squalane, Glycerin, Pentylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-2 Stearate, Glyceryl Stearate, Stearyl Alcohol, Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide EOP, Ceramide NG, Ceramide NP, Ceramide AS, Ceramide AP, Carnosine, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Phytosterols, Caprylyl Glycol, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-11, 1,2-Hexanediol\nFor External Use Only. Store at room temperature.\nOfficial Vanicream – Trusted skincare for sensitive, delicate skin.', 2590.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vanicream Daily Facial Moisturizer 89ml – Hydrating & Gentle Formula with Hyaluronic Acid & Ceramides for Sensitive Skin, Fragrance-FreePrice in BD', 'Vanicream Daily Facial Moisturizer 89ml – Hydrating & Gentle Formula with Hyaluronic Acid & Ceramides for Sensitive Skin, Fragrance-Free Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vanicream-daily-facial-moisturizer-89ml-hydrating-gentle-formula-with-hyaluronic-acid-ceramides-for-sensitive-skin-fragrance-free', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1134, 'Cosmed Atopia Intensive Moisturizing Cream 200ml', '1', 0, 31, 132, '1134', '1134', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Clean and safe apothecary formulas from Anatolia\nCosmed Intensive Moisturizing Cream is specially formulated for dry and atopy-prone skin, providing long-lasting hydration and soothing care. Enriched with Crocus Chrysanthus extract, the mysterious flower of Anatolia, this cream restores skin softness while protecting the natural barrier. Its dermatologically tested formula is safe for babies, children, and adults, making it a versatile daily moisturizer for the whole family.\nProvides intensive hydration for dry to very dry skin.\nStrengthens skin barrier with ceramides and natural plant oils.\nSoothes irritation and reduces discomfort of atopy-prone skin.\nSafe for sensitive skin – suitable for babies and children.\nLightweight, non-greasy texture for everyday use.\nApply to previously cleansed face and body using gentle circular motions. Massage until fully absorbed. Avoid the eye area. Do not rinse.\nFor external use only.\nTest on a small patch of skin before use.\nIf irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a doctor.\nAvoid eye contact; rinse with water if contact occurs.\nAt COSMED, we produce only what we can safely use ourselves. Inspired by the endemic plants of Turkey, every formula is designed to be pure, clean, environmentally friendly, and sustainable.\n🌸 Crocus Chrysanthus Extract – A delicate yet resilient flower that symbolizes renewal, used as a signature ingredient in COSMED formulations for its soothing and skin-nourishing properties.\nAQUA, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, GLYCERIN, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CYCLOPENTASILOXANE, PLUKENETIA VOLUBILIS SEED OIL, STEARYL ALCOHOL, HEPTYL UNDECYLENATE, BIS-DIGLYCERYL POLYACYLADIPATE-2, NIACINAMIDE, OLIVE GLYCERIDES, CYCLOHEXASILOXANE, SODIUM POLYACRYLATE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, POLYGLYCERYL-5 OLEATE, CERAMIDE 3, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CAPRYLHYDROXAMIC ACID, PARFUM, ZINC PCA, XANTHAN GUM, 