(1139, 'Bioderma Pigmentbio Foaming Cream Brightening Cleanser 200ml', '1', 0, 31, 227, '1139', '1139', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bioderma Pigmentbio Foaming Cream is a brightening cleanser that helps to fade dark spots and gently cleanse the skin. 100% of the users state that they notice their spots fade over a period of 4 weeks and that the complexion is evened out. This cleanser combines the power of a double method exfoliation in order to remove the pigmented cells faster, with ingredients that help to reduce the pigment synthesis directly on the skin. Therefore, this cleanser is able to both prevent and reduce the pigmentation.\nApply Bioderma Pigmentbio Foaming Cream onto wet skin and follow by lathering and rinsing with lukewarm water. Alternatively, you can apply a thick layer for 5 minutes and then rinse thoroughly.', 2850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Pigmentbio Foaming Cream Brightening Cleanser 200mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Pigmentbio Foaming Cream Brightening Cleanser 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-pigmentbio-foaming-cream-brightening-cleanser-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
