(1141, 'Plum Green Tea Oil-Free Moisturizer – 50ml | With Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid for Hydrated, Matte Skin', '1', 0, 31, 101, '1141', '1141', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:The Plum Green Tea Oil-Free Moisturizer is a lightweight, non-comedogenic gel cream specially formulated for all skin types, particularly oily and acne-prone skin. Infused with Niacinamide, Green Tea Extract, Kakadu Plum, and Hyaluronic Acid, it provides deep hydration while controlling excess oil and preventing breakouts. This moisturizer leaves the skin feeling matte, fresh, and balanced, without clogging pores or causing shine.\nKey Benefits:\nHydrates and nourishes skin without oiliness\nControls acne and reduces breakouts\nMinimizes pores and refines skin texture\nLightweight, non-greasy, and fast-absorbing\nSuitable for daily use on face and neck\nGood For:All skin types, especially oily and acne-prone skin\nKey Ingredients:Aqua, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Betaine, Isodecyl Neopentanoate, Niacinamide, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Extract, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Leaf Extract, Terminalia Ferdinandiana (Kakadu Plum) Fruit Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Benzyl Alcohol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Caprylyl Glycol, Glycerin, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Squalane, Cyclodextrin, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Sorbitol, Sodium Gluconate.\nMade Good Without:Parabens, phthalates, harmful chemicals, and animal-derived ingredients\nHow to Use:Take an adequate amount and apply evenly after cleansing and toning. Follow up with sunscreen during the day. Apply also on the neck area. Use morning and night.\nThis moisturizer is perfect for hydrated, matte, and healthy-looking skin while keeping oiliness and breakouts under control.', 1050.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 450.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Plum Green Tea Oil-Free Moisturizer – 50ml | With Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid for Hydrated, Matte SkinPrice in BD', 'Plum Green Tea Oil-Free Moisturizer – 50ml | With Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid for Hydrated, Matte Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'plum-green-tea-oil-free-moisturizer-50ml-with-niacinamide-hyaluronic-acid-for-hydrated-matte-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
