(1143, 'SKYA Urea 10% Intensive Care Lotion 200ml', '1', 0, 31, 57, '1143', '1143', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Skya Accurex U-10 Urea Intensive Care Lotion is a 200ml Urea lotion which is suitable, especially for all dry and flaky skin types. It is a dermatologically tested lotion that is free from paraben and cruelty. It has a composition of Urea, Glycerin, Soy Oil, vitamin-E acetate, and Shea Butter, thus, helping in preventing wrinkles, and fine lines, and protecting the skin from harmful UV rays and skin irritation. For naturally hydrated, younger-looking, and healthy skin, Skya’s Accurex Urea Intensive Care Lotion is perfect for toning your skin. It repairs the skin and removes dead skin cells to give you wrinkle-free, healthy, and moisturised skin.', 1650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1650.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKYA Urea 10% Intensive Care Lotion 200mlPrice in BD', 'SKYA Urea 10% Intensive Care Lotion 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skya-urea-10-intensive-care-lotion-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1144, 'Aveeno Calm+ Restore Redness Relief Moisturizimg Cream for Sensitive Skin with Ceramide & Vitamin B5', '1', 0, 31, 124, '1144', '1144', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Overview:\n\nInstantly hydrate skin & visibly soothe facial redness. This redness relief face moisturizer formulated with Vitamin B5 & ceramide features a calming feverfew & nourishing oat formula to calm dry skin.\nSensitive, Irritated dry skin\nIngredients:\nWater, Glycerin, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Dimethicone, Arachidyl Alcohol, Cetyl Alcohol, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Flour, Phenyl Trimethicone, Cetearyl Glucoside, Behenyl Alcohol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Phenoxyethanol, Panthenol, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylene/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Polyacrylamide, Arachidyl Glucoside, C13-14 Isoparaffin, Chrysanthemum Parthenium (Feverfew) Flower/Leaf/Stem Juice, Chlorphenesin, Disodium EDTA, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Laureth-7, Ceramide NP\nAbout this Item:\n1.7-ounces of Aveeno Calm + Restore Redness Relief Moisturizing Facial Cream for sensitive skin with calming feverfew and oat instantly calms and soothes the appearance of redness on the face\nThe daily moisturizing facial cream for sensitive skin features a calming Feverfew and nourishing Oat formula to soothe and calm irritated, dry skin while reducing the look of redness\nFormulated with Ceramide and Vitamin B5, this Calm + Restore Redness Relief moisturizing cream helps restore the skin\'s moisture barrier while visibly reducing the appearance of redness and irritated, dry skin\nDermatologist tested and tested on sensitive skin, this hypoallergenic moisturizing cream is non-comedogenic, gentle enough for everyday use and formulated to be free of fragrances, parabens and phthalates\nFrom a dermatologist-recommended brand for over 70 years, Aveeno Calm + Restore Redness Relief Moisturizing Face Cream calms and soothes the appearance of redness, making it the perfect addition to any daily skincare routine\nHow to use:\nSmooth cream over entire cleansed face. Gentle enough for everyday use.\nWarnings:\nIf product goes into eyes, rinse thoroughly with water.', 2942.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1758.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aveeno Calm+ Restore Redness Relief Moisturizimg Cream for Sensitive Skin with Ceramide & Vitamin B5Price in BD', 'Aveeno Calm+ Restore Redness Relief Moisturizimg Cream for Sensitive Skin with Ceramide & Vitamin B5 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aveeno-calm-restore-redness-relief-moisturizimg-cream-for-sensitive-skin-with-ceramide-vitamin-b5', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1145, 'Transrepair SL Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 283, '1145', '1145', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For Scalp Psoriasis, Seborrhea, Eczema & Skin Itching Relief\nSalicylic Acid IP – 3% w/v\nCoal Tar BP – 1% w/v\nLotion Base – q.s.\nTransrepair SL Lotion is a medicated topical formulation specially designed to soothe and manage chronic skin conditions such as psoriasis, seborrheic dermatitis, eczema, and ringworm. Its combination of Salicylic Acid and Coal Tar works effectively to reduce scaling, thickening, and hardening of the skin, while also relieving itching and irritation.\nIdeal for use on the scalp and other affected skin areas, this lotion helps restore skin comfort and promotes healthier skin texture.\nHelps reduce scaling and flaking in psoriasis\nSoothes itchy, inflamed skin\nActs as an antiseptic and exfoliant\nSoftens thickened, hardened skin\nEspecially effective for scalp psoriasis\nApply to the affected area and rub gently to produce lather\nLeave on for 3–5 minutes, then rinse thoroughly\nUse as directed by a physician\nAvoid contact with eyes\nFor external use only\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight\nKeep out of reach of children', 765.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 85.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Transrepair SL Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Transrepair SL Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'transrepair-sl-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1146, 'APLB 37.1% Kojic Acid Vitamin C Facial Cream', '1', 0, 31, 4, '1146', '1146', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten, Hydrate & Revitalize – This luxurious facial cream combines 37.1% Kojic Acid and Vitamin C to reduce dark spots, enhance skin radiance, and provide powerful anti-aging benefits for a smooth, even-toned complexion.\nKey Benefits:Brightens & Evens Skin Tone – Kojic Acid helps fade hyperpigmentation and dark spots.Powerful Antioxidant Protection – Vitamin C fights free radicals and supports collagen production.Hydrates & Nourishes – Keeps skin supple and deeply moisturized.Reduces Fine Lines & Wrinkles – Improves skin elasticity and firmness.Gentle, Non-Greasy Formula – Absorbs quickly, making it perfect for daily use.\nHow to Use:After cleansing and toning, apply a generous amount to the face and neck.Gently massage in upward motions until fully absorbed.Use morning and night for best results. Follow with sunscreen in the daytime.\nWhy Choose APLB Kojic Acid Vitamin C Facial Cream?High concentration of Kojic Acid & Vitamin C for visible brightening.Lightweight yet deeply hydrating for all skin types.Free from artificial fragrances and harsh irritants—safe for daily use.', 950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB 37.1% Kojic Acid Vitamin C Facial CreamPrice in BD', 'APLB 37.1% Kojic Acid Vitamin C Facial Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-371-kojic-acid-vitamin-c-facial-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
