(1148, 'Vital Moist Lotion 150ml', '1', 0, 31, 305, '1148', '1148', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Overview:Vital Moist Lotion is a lightweight, deeply hydrating skincare solution designed to nourish and protect your skin. Formulated with moisturizing agents and soothing ingredients, it restores skin balance, improves elasticity, and helps strengthen the skin barrier for long-lasting hydration.\nKey Features:\nUses & Benefits:\nBest For:Ideal for anyone looking for lightweight yet powerful hydration, especially those with dry or sensitive skin.', 1045.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 55.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vital Moist Lotion 150mlPrice in BD', 'Vital Moist Lotion 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vital-moist-lotion-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1149, 'Nemus PMT Permethrin 5% Lotion – 50ml', '1', 0, 31, 282, '1149', '1149', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Permethrin B.P. – 5.0% w/v\nLotion base – q.s.\nApproved colour used\nUse only as directed by a registered medical practitioner.\nAvoid use during pregnancy and lactation unless advised by a physician.\nNot recommended for children under 2 months of age.\nAvoid contact with eyes and mouth.\nNot for oral use.\nKeep out of reach of children.', 617.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 33.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nemus PMT Permethrin 5% Lotion – 50mlPrice in BD', 'Nemus PMT Permethrin 5% Lotion – 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nemus-pmt-permethrin-5-lotion-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1150, 'La Roche- Posay Lipikar AP+M Triple Repair Moisturizing Cream Body & Face For Dry Skin 75ml', '1', 0, 31, 62, '1150', '1150', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Soothe, nourish, and protect extra-dry sensitive skin with La Roche-Posay Lipikar AP+M Triple Repair Moisturizing Cream—a dermatologist-tested, lipid-replenishing moisturizer made for the whole family. Specially formulated for babies, children, and adults, this rich yet fast-absorbing cream is suitable for both face and body, helping skin feel comfortable, soft, and deeply hydrated.\nPowered by advanced prebiotic skincare technology (AP+M), this moisturizer is designed to support and rebalance the skin’s microbiome—an important protective ecosystem on the skin’s surface. When skin becomes very dry, it can feel rough, tight, itchy, and more reactive. Lipikar AP+M helps relieve these symptoms by replenishing essential lipids and strengthening the skin barrier, delivering up to 48-hour hydration with a non-greasy, non-sticky finish.\nEnriched with La Roche-Posay Prebiotic Thermal Water, Shea Butter, Ceramide, and Niacinamide, it helps restore the protective barrier, soothe discomfort, and visibly improve dryness over time. It’s also fragrance-free, paraben-free, mineral oil-free, non-comedogenic, and allergy-tested, making it a dependable choice for sensitive skin types.\nTriple repair care: nourishes, soothes, and strengthens the skin barrier\nHelps rebalance the skin microbiome with AP+M technology\nProvides up to 48-hour hydration\nHelps reduce dryness, roughness, and tight-feeling skin\nSuitable for babies, children & adults\nGentle formula with fast absorption and non-greasy feel\nExtra-dry, sensitive skin (Face & Body)\nApply morning and evening on clean, dry skin. Smooth gently over face and/or body.Note: Keep out of reach of children. Avoid use on broken skin. If undergoing medical treatment, consult a healthcare professional as needed.\nSafe for sensitive skin\nFragrance-free\nParaben-free\nMineral oil-free\nNon-comedogenic\nAllergy-tested\nSuitable for patients undergoing chemotherapy and radiation (as stated on pack)\nAqua/Water/Eau, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Niacinamide, Brassica Campestris (Rapeseed) Seed Oil, Glyceryl Stearate, Papanax Japonicus Root Extract, Ceramide AP, Ammonium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, PEG-100 Stearate, Caprylyl Glycol, Coco-Betaine, Disodium EDTA, Maltodextrin, Xanthan Gum (and other supporting ingredients as listed on the pa', 2320.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche- Posay Lipikar AP+M Triple Repair Moisturizing Cream Body & Face For Dry Skin 75mlPrice in BD', 'La Roche- Posay Lipikar AP+M Triple Repair Moisturizing Cream Body & Face For Dry Skin 75ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-lipikar-apm-triple-repair-moisturizing-cream-body-face-for-dry-skin-75ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1151, 'Salcura Bioskin Junior Daily Nourishing Lotion 100ml', '1', 0, 31, 301, '1151', '1151', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Salcura Bioskin Junior Daily Nourishing Lotion 100ml\nDaily Nourishing LotionAn effective daily therapy designed to soothe and hydrate dry, itchy, and atopic skin.Suitable for skin prone to eczema, dermatitis, and psoriasis.\nDirections for Use:\nApply liberally to the skin.\nRepeat as often as required.\nRecommended 3–4 times daily until skin dryness improves.\nProduct Benefits:\nDaily hydration and nourishment for dry & itchy skin\nSoothes irritation and restores comfort\nWhen skin is very dry or irritable, use alongside Bioskin Junior Outbreak Rescue Cream for better results\nNourish & Moisturise – provides essential moisture and vital nutrients\nRepair & Restore – supports skin’s natural barrier function\nFree From:\nSLS / SLES\nParabens\nLanolin\nSynthetic Fragrance\nMicroplastics\nFormaldehyde\nNanoparticles\nTriclosan\nMethylisothiazolinone (MI)\nMethylchloroisothiazolinone (MCI)\nCruelty-Free & Vegan-Friendly\nKey Ingredients:Aqua, Glycerin, Sunflower Seed Oil, Glyceryl Oleate, Wheat Germ Oil, Sea Buckthorn Kernel Extract, Olive Fruit Oil, Safflower Seed Oil, Lavender Oil, Rosemary Leaf Oil, Urea, Vitamin E, Aloe Vera Leaf Juice Powder, Beta-Carotene, and other skin-friendly natural emollients.\nStorage:Keep in a cool, dry place. Protect from direct sunlight.\nManufactured by:Salcura Ltd., SW15 2TN, London, UKSpectrumlaan 31, 2665 NM, Bleiswijk, NetherlandsWebsite: www.salcuraskincare.com', 1176.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 89.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Salcura Bioskin Junior Daily Nourishing Lotion 100mlPrice in BD', 'Salcura Bioskin Junior Daily Nourishing Lotion 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'salcura-bioskin-junior-daily-nourishing-lotion-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 08:14:31', '2026-02-11 08:14:31'),
(1152, '3W Clinic Intensive Aloe Sunblock Cream with SPF50+ PA+++ 70ml', '1', 0, 32, 114, '1152', '1152', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Benefits:\nSoothes sensitive skin by:Replenishing insufficient moisture in the skin.Non-greasy sunscreen.Natural skin expression (also used as a makeup base).SPF50+/PA+++\nHow to Use:\nAfter completing the skin care, apply an appropriate amount to your hands. Apply evenly to skin exposed to UV rays.\nIngredients:\nPurified water, cetyl alcohol, mineral oil, glycerin, palmitic acid, glyceryl stearate SE, Glyceryl stearate, stearic acid, titanium dioxide, stearyl alcohol, polysorbate 60, sorbitan stearate, cyclopentasiloxane, carbomer, triethanolamine, myristyl alcohol, dimethicone/vinyldime Ticon crosspolymer, lauryl alcohol, aluminum hydroxide, disodium EDTA, myristic acid, aloe vera leaf juice powder (10ppm), aloe vera leaf water (8.8ppm), butylene glycol, 1,2-hexane Diol, phenoxyethanol, methyl paraben, methyl paraben, bu Tilparaben, propylparaben, fragrance.\nSize: 70ml\nAdditional Info:\nApproved by Ministry of HealthMade in Korea', 460.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 210.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Intensive Aloe Sunblock Cream with SPF50+ PA+++ 70mlPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Intensive Aloe Sunblock Cream with SPF50+ PA+++ 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-intensive-aloe-sunblock-cream-with-spf50-pa-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:22', '2026-02-11 13:41:22'),
(1153, '3W Clinic Intensive UV Sunblock Cream with SPF50+ PA+++ 70ml', '1', 0, 32, 114, '1153', '1153', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic Intensive UV Sunblock Cream is a high-performance sunscreen designed to protect the skin against harmful UVA and UVB rays. With SPF50+ PA+++, it offers broad-spectrum defense while delivering hydration, soothing care, and a brightening effect. Enriched with aloe vera extract, hydrolyzed collagen, and red ginseng, this sunblock not only shields the skin but also nourishes and maintains a healthy complexion.\n\nKey Features\n\nBenefits\n\nHow to Use\n\nIngredients', 480.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 170.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Intensive UV Sunblock Cream with SPF50+ PA+++ 70mlPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Intensive UV Sunblock Cream with SPF50+ PA+++ 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-intensive-uv-sunblock-cream-with-spf50-pa-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:22', '2026-02-11 13:41:22');
