(1154, 'Dot and Key Watermelon Cooling Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ with Hyaluronic Acid', '1', 0, 32, 91, '1154', '1154', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Watermelon Cooling Sunscreen offers high-performance protection with an instantly refreshing feel. Infused with Watermelon Extract and Hyaluronic Acid, this lightweight, gel-cream sunscreen hydrates, soothes, and revitalizes the skin without any greasiness or white cast. Formulated with powerful UV filters, it shields skin from UVA, UVB, blue light, IR, and HEV rays, while promoting better Vitamin D absorption. Enriched with Beet Root Extract, it also targets dullness, uneven skin tone, and improves skin texture, delivering a smooth, luminous, and fresh finish every day. Free from parabens, cruelty, color, and fragrance, this non-sticky sunscreen is suitable for all skin types and works perfectly under makeup.\n\nBenefits:\n\nHero Ingredients:\n\nIngredients:Aqua, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Benzophenone-3, Phospholipids, 1,3 Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Starch, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Titanium Dioxide, Silica, Dimethicone, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Isopropyl Myristate, Citrullus Lanatus (Watermelon) Fruit Extract, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Sorbitan Stearate, Sucrose Cocoate, Sodium Lactate, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Betaine, Fructooligosaccharides, Beta Vulgaris (Beet) Root Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Menthyl Lactate, Oxothiazolidine, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Gluconate, Sodium Hyaluronate.\n\nUsage:\nMade in India', 885.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 185.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Watermelon Cooling Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ with Hyaluronic AcidPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Watermelon Cooling Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ with Hyaluronic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-watermelon-cooling-sunscreen-spf-50-pa-with-hyaluronic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:22', '2026-02-11 13:41:22'),
(1155, 'Freyia\'s Sunscreen SPF PA 50 ++ For Oily Skin 50ml', '1', 0, 32, 268, '1155', '1155', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Freyia’s Sunscreen SPF 50 PA++ is a Broad spectrum and super lightweight formula that protects your skin from harmful UVA & UVB rays of the sun. The skin quickly absorbs this sunscreen, and its double-layer UV-blocking system provides long-lasting protection against sunburn. It is a water-resistant and non-greasy formula that it suitable for oily skin types.\nBenefits:\nIngredients: Aqua, Di sodium EDTA, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Benzophenone-3, Phospholipids & 1,3-Butylene Glycol, Butyrospermum parkii (Shea Butter), Ceto Stearyl Alcohol, Titanium dioxide, Zinc Oxide, Cetearyl Alcohol, Ceteareth-20, Glycerine, Caprylic capric triglyceride, Glycerol monostearate, Butylated hydroxytoluene, Stearic acid, Sodium hyaluronate, Alpha Tocopheryl acetate, Isopropyl myristate, Olea europaea oil, Aloe barbadensis Extract, Anhydroxylitol, C13-15 Alkane, Prunus dulcis seed oil (Almond oil), Allantoin, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, and Fragrance oil.\nHow to use: Dispense a small amount to one palm and rub your hands together. Apply liberally on your face, neck, and other exposed areas on your body 15 minutes before going outdoors. It should spread easily without leaving a greasy residue or feel. It works effectively when applied. For best results, keep applying every 2 hours for better protection from UV rays.\nCautions: For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes; If contact occurs rinse thoroughly with water. Don’t apply in bruised, cut or damaged skin. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any irritation, rinse well with clean water, discontinue usage and consult with a doctor.\nStorage Conditions: Avoid direct sunlight. Store in a cool and dry place. Do not freeze.', 550.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, 