(1156, 'Revive Daily Moisturizer Sunscreen SPF 50+ Cream - 50g', '1', 0, 32, 203, '1156', '1156', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A lightweight yet powerful sunscreen moisturizer, Revive Daily Moisturizing Sunscreen with SPF 50+ provides superior protection against harmful UVA and UVB rays, shielding your skin from sunburn and long-term damage. Its advanced formula not only defends against environmental stressors but also deeply nourishes the skin, keeping it smooth, soft, and hydrated throughout the day. Designed for everyday use, it blends effortlessly into the skin without leaving a greasy or sticky residue, making it the perfect companion for all-day sun protection and skin care.', 577.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 123.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Revive Daily Moisturizer Sunscreen SPF 50+ Cream - 50gPrice in BD', 'Revive Daily Moisturizer Sunscreen SPF 50+ Cream - 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'revive-daily-moisturizer-sunscreen-spf-50-cream-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:22', '2026-02-11 13:41:22'),
