(1167, 'The Derma Co 1% Hyaluronic Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ for Normal to Oily Skin  - 50g', '1', 0, 32, 33, '1167', '1167', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nThe skincare industry has witnessed a surge in demand for multifunctional products that provide comprehensive protection. The Derma Co Hyaluronic Acid Sunscreen Aqua Gel meets these needs with its unique formulation. This sunscreen promises broad-spectrum protection, hydration, and an anti-aging effect, making it a must-have for anyone serious about maintaining healthy skin.\n\nWhen it comes to skincare, finding the perfect sunscreen can be a game-changer. The Derma Co Hyaluronic Acid Sunscreen Aqua Ultra Light Gel offers a powerful solution that not only protects your skin from the sun but also hydrates and rejuvenates it. With the increasing awareness of the harmful effects of UV rays and blue light, this product stands out as an essential part of any skincare routine.\n\nBuy The Derma Co 1% Hyaluronic Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ Aqua Gel in Bangladesh from Arogga, your trusted online store. Buy this hydrating and protective sunscreen at the lowest cost for healthier skin.\n\n\n\n\nThis rich, hydrating cleanser has a lotion-like consistency. It gently cleanses and removes dirt and oil without leaving skin feeling tight or dry.\nWet skin with lukewarm water. Massage Hydrating Cleanser into skin in a gentle, circular motion. Rinse.\nSuitable for use on the face, body, even hands.\nAll CeraVe products are developed with dermatologists.\nHydrating Facial Cleanser is formulated without fragrance & paraben and is non-comedogenic & accepted by the National Eczema Association. It is suitable for normal to dry skin types.\nCeramides are naturally found in your skin and play a vital role in helping your skin protect you. They help fill in the gaps between your skin cells so your skin can seal in moisture and impurities.\nHyaluronic Acid helps retain the skin\'s natural moisture.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAll ingredients:\n\nWater, Glycerin, Myristic Acid, Stearic Acid, Potassium Hydroxide, Lauric Acid, Butylene Glycol, Glycol Distearate, Polysorbate 80, Sodium Methyl Cocoyl Taurate, Salicylic Acid, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, PEG-60 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Fragrance, Sodium Chloride, Melaleuca Alternigolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Water, Saccharomyces Ferment, Cryptomeria Japonica Leaf Extract, Nelumbo Nucifera Leaf Extract, Pinus Palustris Leaf Extract, Ulmus Davidiana Root Extract, Oenothera Biennis (Evening Primrose) Flower Extract, Pueraria Lobata Root Extract,1,2-Hexanediol, Ethyl Hexanediol, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA.\n\nAvoid contact with eyes. In case of any irritation, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.\n\n\nBroad Spectrum Protection (PA++++)\n\nOne of the standout features of this sunscreen is its PA++++ rating, indicating superior protection against UVA rays. UVA rays penetrate deeper into the skin, causing long-term damage such as wrinkles, fine lines, and even skin cancer. The inclusion of SPF 50 further ensures that your skin is safeguarded against harmful UVB rays, which cause sunburn and immediate damage.\n\nProtection Against Blue Light\n\nIn today\'s digital age, our exposure to blue light from electronic devices is unprecedented. Blue light can penetrate the skin more deeply than UV rays, leading to premature aging and other skin issues. The Derma Co Hyaluronic Acid Sunscreen Aqua Gel is formulated with ingredients that shield your skin from blue light, making it a comprehensive protective solution.\n\nHydrating and Anti-Aging Benefits\n\nHyaluronic Acid is a key ingredient known for its ability to retain moisture, keeping your skin hydrated and plump. This sunscreen contains a 1% concentration of Hyaluronic Acid, ensuring your skin stays moisturized throughout the day. Additionally, Vitamin E is included for its antioxidant properties, which help combat the signs of aging and protect the skin from environmental stressors.\n\nNon-Greasy and Fragrance-Free\n\nMany people shy away from using sunscreen due to its greasy texture and overwhelming scent. However, the Derma Co Hyaluronic Acid Sunscreen Aqua Gel addresses these concerns with its non-greasy, fragrance-free formulation. The lightweight gel absorbs quickly into the skin, leaving no residue or sticky feeling.\n\nSafe and Effective Formulation\n\nSafety is paramount when it comes to skincare products. This sunscreen is free from toxins and fragrance, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Users can expect to see visible differences within 3-6 weeks of consistent use, including reduced fine lines, improved skin texture, and a more even skin tone.\n\nWho Can Benefit from This Sunscreen?\n\nThis product is ideal for anyone seeking a non-greasy, fragrance-free sunscreen that offers broad-spectrum protection. It is particularly beneficial for individuals with normal, oily, acne-prone, or blemish-prone skin. Whether you spend a lot of time outdoors or are frequently exposed to screens, this sunscreen provides the necessary protection and care.\n\n\nThe Science Behind SPF and PA Ratings\n\nSPF (Sun Protection Factor) and PA (Protection Grade of UVA) ratings are critical indicators of a sunscreen\'s effectiveness. SPF measures protection against UVB rays, which cause sunburn, while the PA rating assesses protection against UVA rays, responsible for aging and long-term damage. The higher the ratings, the more comprehensive the protection.\n\nHyaluronic Acid: The Hydration Powerhouse\n\nHyaluronic Acid is celebrated in the skincare community for its remarkable ability to retain moisture. It can hold up to 1,000 times its weight in water, making it an essential ingredient for maintaining skin hydration. By incorporating Hyaluronic Acid, this sunscreen not only protects your skin but also ensures it stays hydrated and supple.\n\nVitamin E: The Antioxidant Shield\n\nVitamin E is a potent antioxidant that helps neutralize free radicals, which are harmful molecules that can damage your skin cells. By including Vitamin E in its formulation, the Derma Co Hyaluronic Acid Sunscreen provides an added layer of defense against environmental stressors, promoting healthier, younger-looking skin.\n\nThe Role of Blue Light in Skin Damage\n\nBlue light, also known as high-energy visible (HEV) light, is emitted by digital screens, LED lights, and even the sun. Prolonged exposure to blue light can lead to skin damage, including hyperpigmentation, inflammation, and premature aging. This sunscreen\'s ability to protect against blue light makes it particularly relevant in our tech-driven world.\n\n\nApplication Tips for Optimal Results\n\nFor best results, apply the sunscreen generously on your face and neck 15-30 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply every two hours, especially if you are swimming or sweating. Ensure you cover all exposed areas, and don\'t forget often-missed spots like the ears and the back of the neck.\n\nIncorporating Sunscreen into Your Daily Routine\n\nSunscreen should be a staple in your daily skincare routine, regardless of the weather or your activities. Incorporate it after your moisturizer and before your makeup. Consistent use is key to reaping the full benefits of sun protection and maintaining healthy skin.\n\nUser Experiences and Feedback\n\nMany users have praised the Derma Co Hyaluronic Acid Sunscreen for its lightweight feel and non-greasy texture. Positive feedback highlights its quick absorption and the added benefit of skin hydration. Users have also noted visible improvements in their skin\'s texture and reduction in fine lines and wrinkles.\n\nVisible Results Over Time\n\nWith regular use, individuals can expect to see significant improvements in their skin\'s health and appearance. The combination of Hyaluronic Acid and Vitamin E works synergistically to enhance skin hydration, reduce signs of aging, and provide robust protection against UV and blue light damage.\n\nIn Bangladesh, the derma sunscreen price is competitive, making it accessible for daily use. The sunscreen with hyaluronic acid not only protects your skin from UVA and UVB rays but also helps maintain the skin\'s natural moisture balance. Developed with dermatologists, this product contains three essential ceramides to restore the skin\'s protective barrier. It is fragrance-free, non-comedogenic, and non-drying, making it suitable for normal to dry skin.\n\nTo purchase The Derma Co 1% Hyaluronic Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ Aqua Gel at the best price in Bangladesh, visit Arogga\'s online store. This hyaluronic acid sunscreen offers comprehensive protection and hydration, ensuring healthier skin every day.\n', 1050.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 229.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 1% Hyaluronic Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ for Normal to Oily Skin  - 50gPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 1% Hyaluronic Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ for Normal to Oily Skin  - 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-1-hyaluronic-sunscreen-spf50-pa-for-normal-to-oily-skin-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1168, 'Bioderma Photoderm Aquafluide Sun Active Defense SPF 50+ UVA UVB 40ml', '1', 0, 32, 227, '1168', '1168', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bioderma Photoderm Max Aquafluid SPF 50+ is a moisturizing and mattifying sun fluid with very high UVA/UVB protection. The ultra-light, refreshing and invisible texture moisturizes and leaves no-sticky feeling, with a dry touch finish for a matted finish. To avoid negative effects from the sun and not to overload the skin with filters, Bioderma SUN ACTIVE DEFENSE developed a high-tech sunscreen that is reinforced against UVA rays. It combines UV filters and a patented biological protection that improves the skin’s ability to defend itself to allow long-lasting care', 2723.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 27.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Photoderm Aquafluide Sun Active Defense SPF 50+ UVA UVB 40mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Photoderm Aquafluide Sun Active Defense SPF 50+ UVA UVB 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-photoderm-aquafluide-sun-active-defense-spf-50-uva-uvb-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1169, 'Freyia\'s Sunscreen SPF PA 50++ For Dry Skin 50ml', '1', 0, 32, 268, '1169', '1169', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Freyia’s Sunscreen SPF 50 PA++ is a Broad spectrum and super lightweight formula that protects your skin from harmful UVA & UVB rays of the sun. The skin quickly absorbs this sunscreen, and its double-layer UV-blocking system provides long-lasting protection against sunburn. It is a water-resistant and non-greasy formula that it suitable for oily skin types.\nBenefits:\nIngredients: Aqua, Di sodium EDTA, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Benzophenone-3, Phospholipids & 1,3-Butylene Glycol, Butyrospermum parkii (Shea Butter), Ceto Stearyl Alcohol, Titanium dioxide, Zinc Oxide, Cetearyl Alcohol, Ceteareth-20, Glycerine, Caprylic capric triglyceride, Glycerol monostearate, Butylated hydroxytoluene, Stearic acid, Sodium hyaluronate, Alpha Tocopheryl acetate, Isopropyl myristate, Olea europaea oil, Aloe barbadensis Extract, Anhydroxylitol, C13-15 Alkane, Prunus dulcis seed oil (Almond oil), Allantoin, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, and Fragrance oil.\nHow to use: Dispense a small amount to one palm and rub your hands together. Apply liberally on your face, neck, and other exposed areas on your body 15 minutes before going outdoors. It should spread easily without leaving a greasy residue or feel. It works effectively when applied. For best results, keep applying every 2 hours for better protection from UV rays.\nCautions: For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes; If contact occurs rinse thoroughly with water. Don’t apply in bruised, cut or damaged skin. Keep out of reach of children. In case of any irritation, rinse well with clean water, discontinue usage and consult with a doctor.\nStorage Conditions: Avoid direct sunlight. Store in a cool and dry place. Do not freeze.', 315.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 35.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NUL