(1171, 'Muuchstac Ocean Moisturizer & Sunscreen SPF 18+ – 45ml, Lightweight Hydrating Face Cream for Men, Non-Greasy Daily Moisturizer with Sun Protection', '1', 0, 32, 306, '1171', '1171', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Muuchstac Ocean Moisturizer & Sunscreen is a dual-action skincare solution designed specifically for men. This lightweight, non-sticky formula combines the goodness of Turmeric and Aloe Vera Beads to deeply moisturize your skin while providing effective sun protection.\n✅ SPF 18+ ProtectionGuards your skin from harmful UVA/UVB rays for up to 2 hours under the sun.\n✅ Infused with Natural Ingredients\nTurmeric: Known for its natural antiseptic and brightening properties.\nAloe Vera Beads: Soothes and hydrates irritated or dry skin.\n✅ Non-Sticky & Water-ResistantDesigned for daily wear, it gives a matte finish and stays effective even with sweat or moisture.\n✅ Paraben-FreeGentle and safe for all skin types — even sensitive skin.\nDaily sun protection\nPreventing sunburn, dark spots & skin damage\nLightweight hydration without greasy residue', 495.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 55.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Muuchstac Ocean Moisturizer & Sunscreen SPF 18+ – 45ml, Lightweight Hydrating Face Cream for Men, Non-Greasy Daily Moisturizer with Sun ProtectionPrice in BD', 'Muuchstac Ocean Moisturizer & Sunscreen SPF 18+ – 45ml, Lightweight Hydrating Face Cream for Men, Non-Greasy Daily Moisturizer with Sun Protection Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'muuchstac-ocean-moisturizer-sunscreen-spf-18-45ml-lightweight-hydrating-face-cream-for-men-non-greasy-daily-moisturizer-with-sun-protection', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1172, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Watery Sunscreen SPF 50PA+++', '1', 0, 32, 8, '1172', '1172', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Benefits\nSPF50 PA+++ broad UV protection\nHelps prevent sunburn and UV damage\nSupports a brighter, more even-looking complexion\nLightweight, non-greasy feel\nHelps hydrate and nourish sun-exposed skin\nIngredientsWater (Aqua), Propylene Glycol, Titanium Dioxide, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Mineral Oil, Isohexadecane, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Octocrylene, Magnesium Sulfate, Cyclopentasiloxane, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Benzophenone-3, Silica, Alumina, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, BHT, Magnesium Stearate, Mica, PEG-30 Dipolyhydroxystearate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Maltodextrin, Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Lees Extract, Prunus Lannesiana Flower Extract, Ascorbic Acid, Calendula Officinalis Flower Extract, Hydroxyacetophenone, Hydrolyzed Rice Protein, Propylparaben, Methylparaben, Diazolidinyl Urea, Fragrance (Parfum), Iron Oxides (CI 77491).\nHow to UseApply a generous amount evenly to the face, neck, arms, and legs before makeup or sun exposure. Gently massage until fully absorbed.', 299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 251.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Watery Sunscreen SPF 50PA+++Price in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Watery Sunscreen SPF 50PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-watery-sunscreen-spf-50pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1173, 'Dot & Key Watermelon Cooling Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ with Hyaluronic Acid 80g', '1', 0, 32, 91, '1173', '1173', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Features:\n\nHow to Use:', 1150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot & Key Watermelon Cooling Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ with Hyaluronic Acid 80gPrice in BD', 'Dot & Key Watermelon Cooling Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ with Hyaluronic Acid 80g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-key-watermelon-cooling-sunscreen-spf-50-pa-with-hyaluronic-acid-80g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1174, 'ACM Sebionex Gel Solaire Mattifying Sunscreen Gel 40ml', '1', 0, 32, 284, '1174', '1174', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mattifying Sunscreen Gel – 40ml\nA lightweight, mattifying sunscreen gel designed for oily and acne-prone skin. Provides broad-spectrum sun protection while controlling shine and excess sebum throughout the day.\nKey Features:\nHigh UVA/UVB protection\nOil-free, non-greasy gel texture\nControls shine and mattifies skin\nSuitable for combination to oily, acne-prone skin types\nWater-resistant formula\nUsage: Apply evenly before sun exposure. Reapply regularly for continued protection.', 1439.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 61.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ACM Sebionex Gel Solaire Mattifying Sunscreen Gel 40mlPrice in BD', 'ACM Sebionex Gel Solaire Mattifying Sunscreen Gel 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acm-sebionex-gel-solaire-mattifying-sunscreen-gel-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1175, 'Primaderm XpertSun Urban SPF50+ 50ml', '1', 0, 32, 57, '1175', '1175', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sun protection and anti-pollution for daily use. With a fluid and silky texture, it protects and prevents your skin from the harmful effects caused by UVA and UVB rays (SPF 50+). It also reverses the negative consequences of pollution on the skin.\nClinical studies\n21% brightness in just 28 days*\n69% more antioxidant activity in as little as 5 days**\n*In vivo test performed on volunteers applying 2% cream Neøclair Pro™, twice a day for 28 days. **Ex-vivo test with Neøclair Pro™ 2%, hemoxygenase levels.\n1. Shake vigorously before use.\n2. Apply generously to dry skin on the face, neck and neckline half an hour before sun exposure.\n3. Reapply every two hours especially after bathing or drying off.', 2850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2850.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Primaderm XpertSun Urban SPF50+ 50mlPrice in BD', 'Primaderm XpertSun Urban SPF50+ 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'primaderm-xpertsun-urban-spf50-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1176, 'Bioderma Photoderm AKN Mat Sun Active Defense SPF 30 UVB (UVA) Acne-Prone Skin 40ml', '1', 0, 32, 227, '1176', '1176', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For Acne-Prone, Combination to Oily Skin\nBioderma Photoderm AKN Mat SPF 30 is a high-protection sunscreen specially formulated for acne-prone, combination to oily skin. It provides broad-spectrum UVA/UVB protection while helping to control excess oil, reduce shine, and prevent new imperfections.\nPowered by SUN ACTIVE DEFENSE™, Bioderma’s patented sun protection technology, it combines advanced UV filters with biological protection to strengthen the skin’s natural self-defense mechanisms and preserve long-term skin health under sun exposure.\nHigh UVA/UVB protection (SPF 30)\nMattifies skin throughout the day\nHelps prevent pimples and blackheads\nImproves skin texture and smoothness\nInvisible finish with no white cast\nNon-greasy, non-sticky, and non-drying\nExcellent makeup base\nVery good skin and eye tolerance\nPhotostable formula\nFLUIDACTIV™ Technology: Regulates sebum quality and helps limit the formation of new blemishes\nSUN ACTIVE DEFENSE™ (Patented): Reinforced UVA protection combined with biological skin defense for long-lasting sun care\nLightweight, fluid, imperceptible texture\nLeaves skin feeling comfortable and fresh\nInvisible matte finish suitable for daily wear\nUse daily, alone or after a moisturising/mattifying skincare product\nApply evenly and generously to the face and neck before sun exposure\nReapply after sweating, swimming, or towel drying to maintain protection\nAvoid contact with fabrics\nAcne-prone skin\nCombination to oily skin\nAdults and adolescents\nApply only on healthy skin\n⚠️ Overexposure to the sun is harmful to health, even when using sun protection.\nBSTI Approved | BDS-1382', 2850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Photoderm AKN Mat Sun Active Defense SPF 30 UVB (UVA) Acne-Prone Skin 40mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Photoderm AKN Mat Sun Active Defense SPF 30 UVB (UVA) Acne-Prone Skin 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-photoderm-akn-mat-sun-active-defense-spf-30-uvb-uva-acne-prone-skin-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1177, 'Christian Dean Secret Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++ 70ml', '1', 0, 32, 307, '1177', '1177', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Christian Dean Secret Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++, Korea\nChristian Dean Secret Tone-Up Sun Cream is a high-protection sun cream that brightens and evens out skin tone while safeguarding your skin from harmful UV rays. Available at Arogga Bangladesh at the best price, it ensures authenticity and reliable skincare results.\n\nKey Features:\nSPF50+ PA+++: Provides strong protection against UVA & UVB rays.\nTone-Up Effect: Slightly pink cream enhances natural skin tone.\nMoisturizing: Deeply hydrates for soft, supple skin.\nMakeup Base Friendly: Smooth texture improves skin for makeup application.\n12 Plant Extracts & Antioxidants: Nourishes and protects the skin.\n\nBenefits:\nBrightens skin instantly for a radiant look.\nHydrates deeply with hyaluronic acid & galactomyces.\nProtects skin from sun damage and external aggressors.\nImproves skin texture and keeps makeup fresh all day.\nSoothes and nourishes skin with glutathione & vitamin C.\n\nUsage: Apply evenly on face and exposed areas as the last step of your skincare routine before sun exposure. Can be used daily.\n\nIngredients: Purified water, titanium dioxide, Cyclopentasiloxane, cyclohexasiloxane, Ethylhexyl methoxycinnamate, zinc oxide, propylene glycol, beeswax, cetyl PG/PPG-10/1 dimethicone, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Sodium Chloride, Cetylethylhexanoate, Butylmethoxydibenzoylmethane, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sorbitan Stearate, Glutathione, Ethyl Ascorbyl ether, Licorice Root Extract, Sorghum Root Extract, Green Tea Extract, Angelica Root Extract, Peony Root Extract, Daffodil Fruit Extract, Tangerine Peel Extract, Safflower Flower Extract, Golden Extract, Copper Bamboo Root Extract, White Willow Bark Extract, European Chestnut Bark Extract, Galactomyces Fermentation Filtrate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Disodium EDTA, Yellow Iron Oxide, Red Iron Oxide, Fragrance.\n\nCountry of Origin: Korea', 430.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 220.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Christian Dean Secret Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++ 70mlPrice in BD', 'Christian Dean Secret Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++ 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'christian-dean-secret-tone-up-sun-cream-spf-50-pa-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1178, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Gentle Sunscreen SPF 50+ 50g', '1', 0, 32, 119, '1178', '1178', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Gentle Sunscreen SPF 50+ is a dermatologist-tested, mineral-based sunscreen designed to provide superior protection against harmful sun exposure. With its water-resistant and oil-free formulation, this sunscreen ensures a smooth, non-greasy finish, making it suitable for daily use by individuals of all genders and skin types.\n\n\nKey Features\n\n\nUsage\nApply generously to cleansed skin 15–20 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply every 2 hours, or immediately after swimming, sweating, or towel drying, to maintain optimal protection. Suitable for daily use on face and body.\n\nWhy Choose This Product\nUnlike chemical sunscreens, The Remedist Gentle Sunscreen relies on mineral filters for safe and effective sun defense. Its gentle yet powerful formula is ideal for sensitive skin, offering hydration while protecting against sunburn, premature aging, and long-term UV damage.\n\n\nBenefits\n\n\nCautions\n', 1960.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 30.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Gentle Sunscreen SPF 50+ 50gPrice in BD', 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Gentle Sunscreen SPF 50+ 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-remedist-by-dr-rhazes-gentle-sunscreen-spf-50-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1179, 'COSRX Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++', '1', 0, 32, 31, '1179', '1179', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Formulated with Aloe Arborescens Leaf Extract, the daily soothing sunblock is so lightweight that is feels like a moisturizer, and it does not leave any white cast. Designed to be travel friendly, you can easily carry COSRX Aloe Soothing Sun Cream anywhere and layer on sun protection anytime. Hydrating, Moisturizing, Nourishing, Nourishment, Smoothening & UV Protection\nBenefits:\n• Block UV rays • Soothes & moisturizes skin • Lightweight texture\nTargets:\n• Doesn\'t want a white cast• Enjoy outdoor activities often• Dehydrated skin\nIngredients:\nAloe Complex 55,000ppm, Water, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Cyclopentasiloxane, Phenylbenzimidazole Sulfonic Acid, Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Isoamyl P-Methoxycinnamate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Alcohol, Dimethicone, Butylene Glycol, Glyceryl Stearate, Titanium Dioxide, C14-22 Alcohols, Polymethyl Methacrylate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Peg-100 Stearate, Triethanolamine, Silica, Sodium Hydroxide, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, C12-20 Alkyl Glucoside, Aluminum Hydroxide, Stearic Acid, Fragrance, Caprylyl Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Aloe Arborescens Leaf Extract, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Carbomer, Xanthan Gum, Limonene, Tocopheryl Acetate, Disodium Edta, Hexyl Cinnamal, Linalool, Benzyl Salicylate, Geraniol, Benzyl Alcohol, Citronellol, Benzyl Benzoate, Citral\nHow to use:\nApply a generous amount on over face 30 minutes before sun exposure.Reapply throughout the day as needed, especially during prolonged sun exposure.\nProduct Features:\nMade in Korea', 1095.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 505.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSRX Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++Price in BD', 'COSRX Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-aloe-soothing-sun-cream-spf-50-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1180, 'Beauty of Joseon Matte Sun Stick : Mugwort + Camelia SPF 50+ PA++++', '1', 0, 32, 34, '1180', '1180', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Matte Sun Stick was developed with Ramón @glowbyramon, an influencer and cosmetic chemist, as the director. It was created after an extensive collaboration by meticulously going through all the processes that fall under BOJ\'s brand philosophy of Modern Hanbang skin care.\nWhile most sun sticks are tailored for outdoor pursuits, we\'ve designed ours to be just as beneficial in our everyday urban environments. Regular sunscreen reapplication every 2-3 hours is crucial for optimal SPF and PA protection, but it\'s often challenging. Therefore, we\'ve engineered a sun stick with a matte formula that applies smoothly, without becoming clumpy or greasy, even when reapplied over makeup.Our sun stick utilizes a sebum-control silica powder to regulate oil production, ensuring an adherence boost and a smooth, matte finish. Plus, it\'s packed with artemisia capillaris and green tea extracts, contributing to a smooth skin texture while preserving its hydration.\nNon-greasy matte sun stickIt is a matte sun stick without any of the oily or sticky feelings. It is hygienic as you don’t need to apply it with your hands, and it is compact, enabling convenient use anytime, anywhere.Porous sebum-control silica powderSebum-control silica powder regulates sebum on the skin, giving a smooth and soft-rolling feeling without greasiness.\nHow to Use:\nApply to areas that need sun protection, such as the face and body.Reapply every 2-3 hours.*If you extend the sun stick too far, dust may stick to it or it may break, so it is recommended to only extend it as much as needed.*Due to its solid formula, excessive pressure may cause the product to separate from the container or break. Apply with a gentle rolling motion.*Due to the nature of the stick formula, where physical pressure is needed, makeup may be removed when putting the product over makeup.\nMade in Korea', 1550.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Stick', 0.00, 1, NULL, 600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty of Joseon Matte Sun Stick : Mugwort + Camelia SPF 50+ PA++++Price in BD', 'Beauty of Joseon Matte Sun Stick : Mugwort + Camelia SPF 50+ PA++++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-of-joseon-matte-sun-stick-mugwort-camelia-spf-50-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23');
