(1181, '3W Clinic Multi Protection UV Sun Block SPF 50+ PA+++ 70ml', '1', 0, 32, 114, '1181', '1181', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic - sunscreen cream Multi Protection UV Sun Block SPF 50+ PA+++ with collagen. This cream provides reliable protection for the skin during sun exposure; the collagen in the composition increases its firmness and elasticity. Comfort and reliable skin protection during sun exposure is provided by intensive sunscreen from 3W Clinic. The cream protects the skin from UVA and UVB rays, thanks to a combination of active ingredients that prevent sunburn and inflammation, provide protection against free radicals and slow down the aging process. The fairly dense texture of the cream spreads well over the skin, is quickly absorbed without leaving a greasy sheen or stickiness, does not weigh down the skin and does not provoke inflammation. In addition to its effective sunscreen effect, the cream has excellent skin care properties. The product contains hydrolyzed collagen (increasing firmness and elasticity, smoothing wrinkles), allantoin (restoration, regeneration) and other components beneficial for the skin. Thanks to this composition, the cream has a deep moisturizing, nourishing, softening and soothing effect. It has antioxidant properties and provides antioxidant protection.\n\nApplication: apply the cream in a thin, even layer to the skin of the face, neck, and 20 minutes before going out into the sun.', 490.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Multi Protection UV Sun Block SPF 50+ PA+++ 70mlPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Multi Protection UV Sun Block SPF 50+ PA+++ 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-multi-protection-uv-sun-block-spf-50-pa-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1182, 'Jigott Whitening UV Sun Block SPF50+/PA+++', '1', 0, 32, 211, '1182', '1182', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Features:\n\nIngredients:\nWater, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), 1,3-Butylene Glycol, 4-Methylbenzylidene Camphor, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Beeswax, Cetearyl Alcohol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glyceryl Stearate, Dimethicone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Arbutin, Adenosine, Tocopheryl Acetate, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Xanthan Gum, Aloe Barbadensis (Aloe Vera) Leaf Extract, Morus Alba Bark Extract, Disodium EDTA, Methyl Hydroxyethylcellulose, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Fragrance', 635.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 240.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Jigott Whitening UV Sun Block SPF50+/PA+++Price in BD', 'Jigott Whitening UV Sun Block SPF50+/PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'jigott-whitening-uv-sun-block-spf50pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1183, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++', '1', 0, 32, 8, '1183', '1183', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Containing Prunus Lannesiana Flower Extract, Laikou Japan Sakura Face Sunscreen can brighten skin tone and tighten skin. It has long-lasting UV protection and can effectively prevent sunburn. With smooth and lotion texture, it’s non-greasy and can quickly form a protective film on the surface of the skin. With the ingredients of Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Rice Protein and Centella Asiatica Extract, it can relieve skin from the moisture loss by sun exposure, making your skin smooth and bright.\nMain ingredients:\nHow to Use: Apply proper amount of the sunscreen onto face, neck, arm and leg evenly before make up or going outside, massage gently until it is absorbed.', 218.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 132.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++Price in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-sunscreen-spf-50-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
