(1186, 'Neutrogena Ultra Sheer Dry Touch Sunblock with SPF 50+ PA ++++ 80g', '1', 0, 32, 151, '1186', '1186', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Give your skin a boost of protection with Neutrogena® Ultra Sheer Dry Touch Sunblock SPF 50+ PA++++. Formulated with Advanced Helioplex™ XP Technology and an ultralight texture. This neutrogena sunblock offers powerful protection against 5 signs of sun damage and harmful UVA/UVB rays, leaving no white cast. This neutrogena sunscreen is the ideal choice for powerful sun protection with a comfortable, lightweight feel - especially if you have oily or acne-prone skin.\n\nKey Benefits:\n\nHow to Use:\nStep 1: Apply liberally on face and body 15-30 min before sun exposure.\n', 1195.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 405.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Ultra Sheer Dry Touch Sunblock with SPF 50+ PA ++++ 80gPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Ultra Sheer Dry Touch Sunblock with SPF 50+ PA ++++ 80g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-ultra-sheer-dry-touch-sunblock-with-spf-50-pa-80g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
