(1189, 'Missha All Around Safe Block Water Proof Sun Milk SPF50+ PA++++ 70ml', '1', 0, 32, 262, '1189', '1189', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience superior sun protection with Missha All Around Safe Block Water Proof Sun Milk SPF50+ PA++++. This advanced waterproof sunscreen offers an ultra-lightweight, velvety finish that resists sweat, water, and sebum, ensuring your skin stays protected even during outdoor activities, beach days, and intense sports. The innovative formula absorbs quickly without leaving a white cast or greasiness, making it perfect for all skin types.\n\n\n\nWhy Choose This Product?\n\nQ: Is this sunscreen waterproof and sweatproof?A: Yes, Missha Water Proof Sun Milk is formulated to resist water, sweat, and sebum for long-lasting protection during outdoor activities.​\nQ: Will it leave a white cast?A: No, the lightweight, fluid formula blends smoothly and does not leave a white cast, making it suitable for all skin tones.​\nQ: Can oily or acne-prone skin use this?A: Yes, it contains eucalyptus extract to regulate oil and feels matte and non-greasy on oily or acne-prone skin.​\nQ: Does it contain alcohol or fragrance?A: Yes, it contains both alcohol and a noticeable floral fragrance. Those with sensitive skin or who prefer fragrance-free should patch test first.​\nQ: Is it suitable for use under makeup?A: Yes, it applies evenly and does not pill, making it a good base for makeup.​\nQ: How often should I reapply?A: Reapply every 2 hours or after swimming, sweating, or towel-drying.​\nQ: Is it hydrating for dry skin?A: It may feel drying for very dry or dehydrated skin types, especially due to its alcohol content. Layering with a moisturizer underneath is recommended.\nChoose Missha All Around Safe Block Water Proof Sun Milk SPF50+ PA++++ for all-day, beach-ready sun protection and comfort that never quits, even under the hottest conditions.\nOrder Missha Safe Block Sun Milk 70ml today for premium Korean sun care that keeps skin truly safe and beautifully matte.', 1298.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 402.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Missha All Around Safe Block Water Proof Sun Milk SPF50+ PA++++ 70mlPrice in BD', 'Missha All Around Safe Block Water Proof Sun Milk SPF50+ PA++++ 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'missha-all-around-safe-block-water-proof-sun-milk-spf50-pa-70ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
