(1193, 'Missha All Around Safe Block Soft Finish Sun Milk SPF50+ PA+++ 70ml', '1', 0, 32, 262, '1193', '1193', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A lightweight, high‑performance sunscreen designed to protect your skin from intense UV exposure while delivering a soft, matte, and smooth finish. Formulated with Missha’s advanced UV-blocking technology, this sun milk is ideal for hot, humid climates and daily wear.\n\nKey Features\n\nWhy You’ll Love It\n\nFull Ingredient List\nWater, Cyclopentasiloxane, Zinc Oxide, Silica, Lauryl PEG‑10 Tris(Trimethylsiloxy)silylethyl Dimethicone, Butylene Glycol, Dipropylene Glycol, Isopropyl Palmitate, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Caprylyl Methicone, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Alcohol Denat., C12‑15 Alkyl Benzoate, Quaternium‑18 Bentonite, Helichrysum Arenarium Extract, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Bis‑Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine, Dimethicone, Magnesium Sulfate, Stearic Acid, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Aluminum Hydroxide, Acrylates/Dimethicone Copolymer, Hydrogen Dimethicone, Glycerin, Fragrance, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Disodium EDTA, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Potassium Sorbate, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Lecithin, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Isostearic Acid, Polyglyceryl‑3 Polyricinoleate, CI 77492, CI 77491, Limonia Acidissima Extract, Rosa Davurica Bud Extract, Psidium Guajava Leaf Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Abronia Villosa Leaf Extract, Cinchona Succirubra Bark Extract, Rhodiola Rosea Root Extract, VP/Hexadecene Copolymer.\n\nHow to Use', 1299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 551.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Missha All Around Safe Block Soft Finish Sun Milk SPF50+ PA+++ 70mlPrice in BD', 'Missha All Around Safe Block Soft Finish Sun Milk SPF50+ PA+++ 70ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'missha-all-around-safe-block-soft-finish-sun-m