(1195, 'GM SLX 50+ Aqua Lotion', '1', 0, 32, 27, '1195', '1195', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'DESCRIPTION\nUltra sun-SLX Aqua Lotion\nUltra sun-SLX Aqua Lotion is a sunscreen lotion that will protect your skin from the harmful rays of the sun. Sunscreens provide either a chemical or a physical barrier to sunlight. These agents help to prevent sunburn, premature aging, photosensitivity reactions and reduce incidences of skin cancer. Ultra sun-SLX Aqua Lotion contains a mixture of physical and chemical sunscreen agents to give you optimum protection from sun rays.\nAdults and children above 6 months of age should apply the lotion liberally and evenly to exposed areas of the skin before sun exposure. If required reapply the product liberally every 1 to 2 hours for adequate protection or as directed by the physician. There is no recommended dosage for children below 6 months of age except under the supervision of the doctor.\nAvobenzone U.S.P. 2.0% w/v\nOctinoxate U.S.P. 7.5% w/v\nOxybenzone U.S.P. 3.0% w/v\nOctocrylene U.S.P. 3.0% w/v\nZinc Oxide I.P. 2.0% w/v\nOxybenzone is a benzophenone which effectively absorb light throughout the UVB range (290-320) and also absorb some UVA Iight with wavelengths of 320 to 360 and some UVC light from 250 to 290 nm.\nAvobenzone is a substituted dibenzoylmethane which absorb UVA 320 to 400. It is generally used in combination with other agents which have a UVB absorption.\nOctinoxate is a substituted cinnamate which effectively absorb light throughout the UVB range (290-320).\nOclocrylene is the substituted cinnamate with actions similar to that of Octinoxate.\n& Physical sunscreens reflect or scatter light in both the visible and UV spectrum (290 to 700 nm), preventing penetration of the skin. Ultrasun-SLX Aqua Lotion contains zinc oxide as the physical sunscreen agent\nThe formulation found to be safe. Most common side effect is dryness. Rarely some patient show acne, burning, itching or stinging of skin, early appearance of redness or swelling of the skin, late appearance of rash with or without weeping blisters that become crusted, especially in sun exposed areas and may extend to unexposed areas of skin, pain in hairy areas, pus in hair follicles. The aforesaid side effects may disappears as body adjusts to the product', 1226.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 44.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'GM SLX 50+ Aqua LotionPrice in BD', 'GM SLX 50+ Aqua Lotion Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gm-slx-50-aqua-lotion', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1196, 'Missha All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+ PA++++ 50ml', '1', 0, 32, 262, '1196', '1196', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Missha All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+/PA++++ is an advanced sunscreen designed to provide robust protection against harmful UV rays while maintaining a soft and lightweight feel on the skin. The updated Missha All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun formula delivers more hydration than before. This product is particularly noted for its refreshing texture that does not leave a white cast, making it a suitable choice for everyday use.\nMissha All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+/PA++++ with water gel base to help make skin moisturized and stay cool. This lightweight, non-greasy daily sunscreen provides very effective protection against harmful UVA and UVB rays.  The New Double Layer UV Blocking System provides long-lasting and impenetrable UV protection.\nThe new version of Missha All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun is more hydration-oriented, as in addition to hyaluronic acid, glycerin, and beta-glucan have been added to provide better protection against dehydration and oxidative damage from solar radiation; in addition to vitamin E (tocopherol) with antioxidant and protective properties.\nBuy MISSHA All  Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+/PA++++ 50ml tubein Bangladesh from Arogga. Shop this lightweight, high-protection sunscreen for a seamless finish.', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 551.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Missha All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+ PA++++ 50mlPrice in BD', 'Missha All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+ PA++++ 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'missha-all-around-safe-block-aqua-sun-gel-spf50-pa-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
