(1200, 'Rohto Skin Aqua Super Moisture UV Gel SPF50+ PA++++ 110gm', '1', 0, 32, 308, '1200', '1200', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rohto Skin Aqua Super Moisture Gel is a Japanese sunscreen that has a unique texture allowing it to spread across the skin effortlessly. In addition to its buttery texture, it also does not leave any kind of white cast on the skin. The unique formula of this Japanese sunscreen gel contains three different types of intensely moisturizing hyaluronic acid, so you can hydrate your skin even while blocking UV rays in the hot summer sun. The sunscreen is also super waterproof too, meaning that it will melt away with water or sweat. Not to worry though, it can easily be removed with cleansing oil or face wash.\nKey Features:\n\n\nMade in Japan', 1888.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 212.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Rohto Skin Aqua Super Moisture UV Gel SPF50+ PA++++ 110gmPrice in BD', 'Rohto Skin Aqua Super Moisture UV Gel SPF50+ PA++++ 110gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'rohto-skin-aqua-super-moisture-uv-gel-spf50-pa-110gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1201, 'Zafran Brightening Sunscreen with SPF 50+ PA+++', '1', 0, 32, 215, '1201', '1201', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Zafran Brightening Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA+++ (30g)\nProvides broad-spectrum UVA/UVB protection along with Blue Light defense, ensuring all-around skin safety. This advanced formula not only shields against sun damage but also moisturizes, brightens, and soothes the skin. Infused with key ingredients like Zinc Oxide, Titanium Dioxide, and Arbutin, it helps maintain a radiant and nourished complexion. Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, it should be reapplied every 2–3 hours for optimal protection. Keep your skin safe, healthy, and glowing with Zafran Brightening Sunscreen.', 160.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Zafran Brightening Sunscreen with SPF 50+ PA+++Price in BD', 'Zafran Brightening Sunscreen with SPF 50+ PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'zafran-brightening-sunscreen-with-spf-50-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1202, 'Valencia Gio Nature Plus Sun Block Collagen Water Resistant Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++', '1', 0, 32, 309, '1202', '1202', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience the ultimate sun protection with Valencia Gio Nature Plus Sunblock. This collagen-infused sun cream offers complete defense against harmful UVA/UVB rays while boasting a smooth texture that glides effortlessly onto your skin. Designed for comfort, it leaves your skin feeling clean and dry without any greasiness or white cast, making it perfect for everyday use. Water-resistant and enriched with collagen, this sun cream not only shields your skin but also nurtures it, ensuring a healthy and radiant complexion.\n\n\n\nMade in KOREA', 475.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 205.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Valencia Gio Nature Plus Sun Block Collagen Water Resistant Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++Price in BD', 'Valencia Gio Nature Plus Sun Block Collagen Water Resistant Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'valencia-gio-nature-plus-sun-block-collagen-water-resistant-sun-cream-spf-50-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1203, 'KEYA SETH Umbrella Sunscreen Powder SPF50 PA+++ for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 32, 310, '1203', '1203', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'KEYA SETH Umbrella Sunscreen Powder SPF50 PA+++ for All Skin Types:\n\nEnjoy All-Round Sun Protection as you step outside with Sunscreen Powder SPF 50 that contains PA+++ and offers Broad-Spectrum Sun Protection against the harmful UV rays. It maintains a Smooth Appearance for your skin without dryness for Long Hours.\nTinosorb M & S\nBeing Photostable Compounds, they enhance the Sunscreen’s effectiveness, resulting in Broad-\nSpectrum UV Protection for skin.\nMicronized Zinc Oxide\nIt absorbs the carcinogenic UV rays while combating premature ageing.\nSandalwood Oil\nSoothes skin irritations while protecting from sunburns & sun allergies.\nSPF 50: Defence Against Pigment Darkening\nTanning can not only speed up the visible signs of ageing but can also lead to skin cancer. The Sunscreen Powder shields your skin from both — UVA & UVB rays of the sun. It also contains PA+++ that offers Protection from UV rays, minimizing Pigment Darkening.\n\n\nMade in India', 620.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 280.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'KEYA SETH Umbrella Sunscreen Powder SPF50 PA+++ for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'KEYA SETH Umbrella Sunscreen Powder SPF50 PA+++ for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'keya-seth-umbrella-sunscreen-powder-spf50-pa-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1204, 'Missha Cotton Sun All Around Safe Block SPF50+ PA++++', '1', 0, 32, 262, '1204', '1204', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MISSHA All Around Safe Block Cotton Sun is a mattifying sunscreen with Cotton Fitting System that helps absorb excess oil and reduce shine/oiliness, leaving the skin with a matte and non-sticky finish!\nMISSHA All Around Safe Block Cotton Sun with UV protection SPF50+ PA++++ is a physical sunscreen that uses mineral UV filters Zinc Oxide (100%) and Titanium Oxide. It has a mattifying effect that keeps sebum production in check during the day, making it perfect for oily skin types!\nAmong other ingredients, this best-selling sunscreen from Missha contains tea tree leaf extract with healing and anti-inflammatory properties and panthenol for soothing the skin. This sunscreen is ideal for acne-prone, oily skin!\nThis sunscreen has a waterproof, sweat and sebum-resistant formula. It gives the skin a natural tone-up effect that evens out the complexion and is also ideal as a primer or makeup base.\n\nMade in Korea', 875.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 575.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Missha Cotton Sun All Around Safe Block SPF50+ PA++++Price in BD', 'Missha Cotton Sun All Around Safe Block SPF50+ PA++++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'missha-cotton-sun-all-around-safe-block-spf50-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1205, 'Innsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen 50ml', '1', 0, 32, 6, '1205', '1205', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'innsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen 50m\nInnsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen is a powerful blend of sun protection and hydration. With the added benefits of hyaluronic acid, it keeps your skin safe from the sun while keeping it moisturized and healthy.Country : BangladeshCategory :Skin Care Sunscreen\nHow to use: At the end of your skincare routine, take an appropriate amount of sunscreen and apply it evenly over your face and body until absorbed. Wait 15 to 30 minutes after applying before sun exposure. Reapply as needed for extended sun exposure.\nIngredients: Aqua, Stearic Acid, Cetereath-25, Isopropyl Myristate, Titanium Dioxide, Cetostearyl Alcohol, Cetereath-20, BHT, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Carbomer, Hyaluronic Acid, Tocopheryl Acetate, Glycerine, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Octocrylene, Butyl Methyoxydibenzoyl Methane, Triclosan, Cyclopentasiloxane, DMDM Hydantoin, Fragrance.\nCaution:\n1. For External use only.\n2. Avoid contact with eyes.\n3. Do not use it on wounded skin\n4. Discontinue use if signs of irritation or rash occur.\n5. Keep out of reach of children.\n6. In case of accidental ingestion, seek medical help.\nDo\'s:-Apply Generously: Ensure you use a sufficient amount to cover all exposed areas of your skin, including your face and body.-Apply Before Sun Exposure: Apply the sunscreen 15-30 minutes before going out into the sun for optimal protection.-Reapply Regularly: Reapply every 2 hours or after swimming, sweating, or towel drying to maintain effective sun protection.-Patch Test First: Conduct a patch test on a small area of your skin before full application to check for any adverse reactions.-Store Properly: Keep the sunscreen in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight to maintain its effectiveness.\nDon\'ts:-Avoid Contact with Eyes: Keep the sunscreen out of your eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.-Don’t Use on Broken Skin: Avoid applying the sunscreen to any areas of broken or irritated skin.-Don’t Skip Application: Even on cloudy days or indoors, UV rays can still impact your skin if you\'re near windows.-Avoid Excessive Sun Exposure: Even with sunscreen, limit your time in direct sunlight, particularly during peak hours.Don’t Use if Irritated: If you experience any signs of irritation, redness, or rash, stop using the product and consult a healthcare professional.', 683.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 7.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen 50mlPrice in BD', 'Innsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innsaei-hyaluronic-sunscreen-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
