(1211, 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Lip Mask', '1', 0, 33, 8, '1211', '1211', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Indulge in overnight lip rejuvenation with the Laikou Japan Sakura Sleeping Lip Mask, an intensely hydrating and nourishing treatment that transforms chapped, dry lips into a supple, smooth pout. Infused with the delicate fragrance of cherry blossoms and a blend of natural extracts, this lip mask works its magic while you sleep, leaving your lips feeling soft, moisturized, and irresistibly kissable\nPrunus Lannesiana Flower Extract: This botanical extract, derived from the cherry blossom tree, is renowned for its ability to soothe and hydrate dry, chapped lips.\nShea Butter: A rich source of fatty acids and vitamins, shea butter nourishes and softens lips, leaving them feeling supple and protected.\nVitamin E: A powerful antioxidant, vitamin E helps to combat free radical damage and promote cell regeneration, keeping lips looking youthful and radiant.\nDeeply Hydrating: Replenishes lost moisture and prevents dryness, leaving lips feeling soft and supple.\nExfoliating Action: Gently removes dead skin cells, revealing a smoother, plumper lip surface.\nLine-Reducing Formula: Helps to minimize the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, restoring a youthful appearance to lips.\nSakura Aroma: Infused with a delicate cherry blossom fragrance for a soothing and sensorial experience.\nApply a generous layer of the lip mask to clean, dry lips before bedtime.\nMassage gently into lips, allowing the mask to absorb fully.\nLeave on overnight and wake up to lips that are soft, hydrated, and visibly revitalized', 190.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Mask', 0.00, 1, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Lip MaskPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Lip Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-lip-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026