(1218, 'Dot and Key Barrier Repair Hydrating Tinted Lip Balm SPF 50 PA+++ Cherry Crimson', '1', 0, 33, 91, '1218', '1218', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Barrier Repair Hydrating Tinted Lip Balm SPF 50 offers a perfect blend of color, moisture, and sun protection. Infused with nourishing ingredients like Vitamin C and E, it hydrates and repairs the delicate skin of your lips while providing broad-spectrum SPF 50 protection. This lightweight formula glides smoothly, leaving your lips with a subtle tint and a soft, supple feel, making it ideal for everyday wear.\n\nProduct Details:\n\nHero Ingredients:\nFull Ingredients List:\nHydrogenated Polyisobutene, Petrolatum, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Synthetic Wax, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Tri-isostearoyl Polyglyceryl-3 Dimer Dilinoleate, Propylene Glycol, Microcrystalline Wax, Ozokerite, Paraffin Wax, Propylene Glycol Dibenzoate, Shea Butter, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Synthetic Beeswax, Polyethylene, Octyl Methoxycinnamate, Mica, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tocopheryl Acetate, Avocado Oil, Butylated Hydroxytoluene, Flavor, Glycerin/Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride/Water/Hydrogenated Lecithin / Phytosteryl Octyldodecyl Lauroyl Glutamate / Ceramide NP/ Sodium Hyaluronate Natural, CI 19140:1, CI 45410:2, CI 15880:1, CI 77891.\n\nProduct Benefits:\n\nHow to Use:\n\nFaq:', 418.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '4.5g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 152.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Barrier Repair Hydrating Tinted Lip Balm SPF 50 PA+++ Cherry CrimsonPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Barrier Repair Hydrating Tinted Lip Balm SPF 50 PA+++ Cherry Crimson Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-barrier-repair-hydrating-tinted-lip-balm-spf-50-pa-cherry-crimson', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1219, 'Liptok Lip Balm - Apple 4.8g', '1', 0, 33, 313, '1219', '1219', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Liptok Lip Balm – Love at First Swipe!Meet Liptok, your lips’ new best friend!Infused with Vitamins, natural oils, and butter-based hydration, Liptok Lip Balm keeps your lips soft, smooth, and kissably fresh all day long. Whether your lips are dry, chapped, or just need a little glow, Liptok brings instant comfort and shine with every swipe.\nAvailable in four fun flavors — 🍋 Lemon, 🍏 Apple, 🍦 Vanilla, and 🍫 Chocolate — each swipe adds a playful touch to your mood and a burst of hydration to your lips.\nKey Benefits:', 47.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 3.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Liptok Lip Balm - Apple 4.8gPrice in BD', 'Liptok Lip Balm - Apple 4.8g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'liptok-lip-balm-apple-48g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1220, 'Zafran Lightening Lip Balm', '1', 0, 33, 215, '1220', '1220', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Zafran Lightening Lip Balm (20g)\nExperience the nourishing power of saffron with Zafran Lightening Lip Balm. Specially formulated to brighten and even out lip tone, this luxurious balm deeply hydrates and softens lips, leaving them smooth and supple. Enriched with natural ingredients, including saffron extract, essential oils, and moisturizing butters, it helps reduce pigmentation, dryness, and dark spots caused by sun exposure or dehydration.\nKey Benefits:✔ Lightens and evens out lip pigmentation✔ Deeply hydrates and nourishes lips✔ Softens and smooths dry, chapped lips✔ Infused with saffron for a natural glow✔ Suitable for daily use', 191.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 79.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Zafran Lightening Lip BalmPrice in BD', 'Zafran Lightening Lip Balm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'zafran-lightening-lip-balm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
