(1222, 'Labello Classic Care Lip Balm for 12h Moisture', '1', 0, 33, 315, '1222', '1222', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Want to give your lips intense hydration that lasts up to 24 hours? Rely on the power of nourishing natural oils and shea butter. Included in the Labello Classic Care lip balm is a formula that protects your lips from drying out in all kinds of weather. Say goodbye forever to chapped, dry, rough skin and welcome lips that are nourished, soft and silky.\nCharacteristics:\nprovides lips with hydration that lasts up to 24 hours, intensively taking care of themprotects lips from drying out in all weather conditionsreduces chapping, fights dry and rough skinleaves the lips soft and silky smoothsuitable for all skin typesdermatologically tested and approved\nIngredients:\navocado and jojoba oils, shea butter - intensively care for lips, keep them hydrated and protect them from drying outthe composition is 96% of natural originmineral oil free\nHow to apply:Apply Labello Classic Care lip balm whenever needed on both upper and lower lips. Use several times a day, and apply a thicker layer at night for intense regeneration overnight.', 209.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '5.5ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 141.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Labello Classic Care Lip Balm for 12h MoisturePrice in BD', 'Labello Classic Care Lip Balm for 12h Moisture Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'labello-classic-care-lip-balm-for-12h-moisture', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1223, 'Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Petroleum Jelly 50ml', '1', 0, 33, 139, '1223', '1223', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Petroleum Jelly - 50ml\nVaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Petroleum Jelly is designed to deeply moisturize and condition the skin, especially for those with dry or sensitive skin. Enriched with pure cocoa butter, this petroleum jelly provides a smooth, radiant glow while restoring moisture and enhancing skin softness.\n\nKey Ingredients:\n\nBenefits:\n\nHow to Use:\n\nIdeal For:\nThe 50ml Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Petroleum Jelly is a compact, travel-friendly moisturizer enriched with cocoa butter. It provides lasting hydration, promotes a radiant glow, and keeps skin protected, making it essential for everyday skin care.\nMade in South Africa', 240.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Petroleum Jelly 50mlPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Petroleum Jelly 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vaseline-blueseal-cocoa-butter-rich-conditioning-petroleum-jelly-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1224, 'Vaseline Blueseal Nourishing Skin Jelly with Vitamin E 100ml', '1', 0, 33, 139, '1224', '1224', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vaseline Blueseal Nourishing Skin Jelly with Vitamin E is a trusted skincare essential designed to protect against dry skin and signs of aging. Its fast-absorbing, non-greasy formula combines the moisturizing benefits of Vaseline Petroleum Jelly with the antioxidant power of Vitamin E to keep your skin smooth, nourished, and elastic.\nIdeal for individuals with dry, rough, or aging skin who want an effective yet gentle moisturizer. Suitable for all skin types and ages, including sensitive skin.\n\n\nChoose Vaseline Blueseal Nourishing Skin Jelly with Vitamin E 100ml for a trusted, effective skincare solution that restores moisture, protects skin, and keeps you feeling confidently radiant every day.', 340.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Blueseal Nourishing Skin Jelly with Vitamin E 100mlPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Blueseal Nourishing Skin Jelly with Vitamin E 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vaseline-blueseal-nourishing-skin-jelly-with-vitamin-e-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
