(1226, 'Meril Petroleum Jelly Lemon Fresh 15ml', '1', 0, 33, 177, '1226', '1226', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin protects yourself from all the odds. How to protect your skin? Skin is one of the most delicate organs of the body which faces several adversities such as dryness, roughness etc. A little care can make your skin healthy, shiny and beautiful even in the wintry bite of the season. Meril Petroleum Jelly is the pioneer in providing the complete solution for protection against the cold in winter. Meril Petroleum Jelly prevents skin contraction and relieves dryness. You can directly apply on your skin, hand, elbow, lips, feet, ankle and other parts of the body without any hesitation. Meril Petroleum Jelly is not only an ordinary petroleum jelly but a value-added petroleum jelly with Vitamin C and Lemon Extract enriched. The presence of Vitamin C and Lemon Extract moisturizes the skin making it soft. It also provides protection to minor burns and chapping as Vitamin C and Lemon have natural power for prevention. Enriched with Vitamin C and lemon extract, the jelly provides a protective layer against cold. So make Meril petroleum jelly your all-time companion and enjoy 100% protection; Protection is always better than Healing.\nPetroletum, LLP, with Lemon Extract and Vitamin C\nTake a small amount of Meril petroleum jelly and use it on your lips and hand or other part of your dry skin. Can also be used in small scars and burned skin.', 24.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Meril Petroleum Jelly Lemon Fresh 15mlPrice in BD', 'Meril Petroleum Jelly Lemon Fresh 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'meril-petroleum-jelly-lemon-fresh-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1227, 'Nicor Lip Balm 8gm', '1', 0, 33, 316, '1227', '1227', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nicor Lip Balm is designed to provide deep hydration and nourishment to the lips, helping to prevent dryness and chapping. Formulated with natural ingredients, it offers long-lasting moisture and protection. The balm is available in various flavors, including peach and avocado, each providing a subtle hint of color for a natural glow. It\'s suitable for daily use and can be worn alone or as a base for lipstick. Additionally, Nicor offers a two-in-one anti-wrinkle moisturizing balm that replenishes lips and minimizes fine lines.\nKey Features:\nDeep Moisturization: Provides long-lasting hydration to keep lips soft and supple.\nNatural Ingredients: Formulated with nourishing extracts to protect and care for your lips.\nSubtle Tint: Offers a light touch of color, enhancing the natural beauty of your lips.\nVersatile Use: Can be used alone for a natural look or as a base under lipstick.\nUsage Instructions:\nApply a small amount of Nicor Lip Balm to clean, dry lips.\nReapply as needed throughout the day, especially in dry or cold conditions.\nFor an intensive overnight treatment, apply a generous layer before bedtime.\nIncorporating Nicor Lip Balm into your daily skincare routine can help maintain healthy, hydrated lips with a natural, polished appearance.', 99.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 101.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nicor Lip Balm 8gmPrice in BD', 'Nicor Lip Balm 8gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nicor-lip-balm-8gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
(1228, 'Meril Lipgel 10gm', '1', 0, 33, 177, '1228', '1228', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Origin: Bangladesh\nManufacturer: square toiletries ltd.\nMeril Lip Gel provides the ultimate relief to dry lips. Aloe Vera in the gel provides a therapeutic effect and helps to relieve skin dryness. It is available with citrus flavor and provides nourishment to the lips while it protects the very delicate lips skin. Meril Lip Gel promises to bring back everyone\'s smile in the winter.\nIngredients\nMineral Oil, White Petroleum Jelly, Aloe vera Gel, Food Grade Citrus Flavour', 35.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 5.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Meril Lipgel 10gmPrice in BD', 'Meril Lipgel 10gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'meril-lipgel-10gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:23', '2026-02-11 13:41:23'),
