(1239, 'Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Jelly 100ml', '1', 0, 33, 139, '1239', '1239', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'When skin is healthy, light reflects off the rich color below the surface, enabling it to literally glow. But when skin is dry, its surface becomes uneven and rough, leaving it looking dull. Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Petroleum Jelly works naturally with your skin to keep it visibly healthy and glowing all day. Helps heal dry skin and keeps skin moisturized and glowing throughout the day. The formula contains cocoa butter, is gentle on the skin, hypoallergenic, and non-comedogenic which means that it does not clog the pores.\n\nHow to Use:\nScoop fingertips through jelly and spread across especially dry areas on skin until absorbed. Excellent for cuts, burns, or problem areas like hands, feet, elbows, and heels. Repeat as needed throughout day.\n\nInredients:\nPetrolatum, Parfum, Theobroma cacao, Benzyl Alcohol, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Coumarin, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene.\n\nCautionsFor external uses only. Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\n\nMade in South Africa', 320.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Jelly 100mlPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Blueseal Cocoa Butter Rich Conditioning Jelly 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vaseline-blueseal-cocoa-butter-rich-conditioning-jelly-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
