(1255, 'Vaseline Blueseal Light Hydrating Jelly with Aloe Fresh', '1', 0, 33, 139, '1255', '1255', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vaseline®Aloe Petroleum Jelly is a healing moisturizer with a fast-absorbing formula and the goodness of Aloe Vera. Vaseline®is the world\'s best-known hypoallergenic and non-comedogenic white petroleum jelly for gentle skin care. A light hydrating petroleum jelly that absorbs fast with a non-greasy feel makes skin soft, smooth and healthy.\nAloe Vera, drawn from nature, is known to calm and soothe dry or irritated skin with long-lasting effect that keeps your skin feeling fresh and hydrated all day long. It is also incredibly gentle on your skin, hypoallergenic and non-comedogenic combined with micro droplets of Vaseline Petroleum Jelly.\nIt doesn\'t block your pores, but does create a shield that protects skin and speeds up healing. Vaseline is well-known for protecting dry, cracked skin and helping with healing of minor cuts, scrapes, and burns.\nThis incredible formula is triple-purified to be 100% pure, keep your skin in perfect shape which locks in moisture and speeds up your skin\'s natural recovery process.\nAloe vera extracts is an emollient that is a great source of natural antioxidants and moisturizing properties. It adds a protective hydrating layer to skin, and provides long-lasting moisturization. Petroleum Jelly and aloe vera are said to have healing properties and a powerful antioxidant that can protect your lips and skin. Aloe extracts help you get smooth and glowing skin. Thus, this jelly with fresh aloe vera extracts will not only keep your skin nourished and moisturized but also make them soft and supple.\nHow To Use:\nApply this jelly on your clean and damp skin.\nTake a require amount of this jelly and rub a thin layer on any area that might get exposed to the air.\nIngredients:\nPetrolatum, Parfum, Aloe barbadensis, Cucumis Sativus Oil, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Salicylate, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Hexyl Cinnamal.\nMade in UK', 340.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vaseline Blueseal Light Hydrating Jelly with Aloe FreshPrice in BD', 'Vaseline Blueseal Light Hydrating Jelly with Aloe Fresh Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vaseline-blueseal-light-hydrating-jelly-with-aloe-fresh', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
(1256, 'Laikou Hydrating Lip Mask', '1', 0, 33, 8, '1256', '1256', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LAIKOU JAPAN SAKURA HYDRATING LIP MASK can deeply nourish and relieve dry lips, soften dead skin cells on lips, lighten lip lines, brighten lip tone and make lips soft and elastic. It contains Rich in Prunus Speciosa Flower Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Honey Extract, Tocopherol and other herbal extracts.\nHow does it work?\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, apply the lip mask on lip areas for 15-20 minutes, then peel it off.', 33.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Mask', 0.00, 1, NULL, 13.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Hydrating Lip MaskPrice in BD', 'Laikou Hydrating Lip Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-hydrating-lip-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
