(1264, 'Maybelline New York Baby Lips Color Lip Balm Berry Crush SPF 11', '1', 0, 33, 312, '1264', '1264', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Maybelline Baby Lips Lip Balm is the ideal lip care solution that provides 8-hour hydration and is nourishing for baby soft lips. Apply your lip colour by starting in the centre of your upper lip. Work from the centre to the outer edges of your lip, following the contours of your mouth. Then glide across the entire bottom lip. It is the perfect conditioning care for lips that feel baby soft and look healthier.It is infused with translucent colour and shine. The formula contains Vitamin E and coconut oil which helps to shed dryness for smooth, supple and all day moisturised lips.\nKey Benefits:\nstep 1. Apply lip balm in the center of your upper lip and follow the contours of your mouth.\nStep 2. Glide the lip balm across the entire bottom lip. Step 3. Lip balm can be worn alone or under lipstick or lip gloss.\nMade in India\n', 335.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Stick', 0.00, 1, NULL, 65.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Maybelline New York Baby Lips Color Lip Balm Berry Crush SPF 11Price in BD', 'Maybelline New York Baby Lips Color Lip Balm Berry Crush SPF 11 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'maybelline-new-york-baby-lips-color-lip-balm-berry-crush-spf-11', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
