(1273, 'Aichun Beauty Sexy Pink Lips Areolas And Private Parts Keep Pink And Tender 30gm', '1', 0, 33, 172, '1273', '1273', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purpose – These products claim to lighten, brighten, or maintain a pinkish tone in intimate areas. They often contain ingredients like niacinamide, arbutin, vitamin C, or botanical extracts.\nSafety Concerns – Always check the ingredients list for potential irritants (e.g., hydroquinone, steroids, or strong bleaching agents), as sensitive skin in these areas can react badly.\nEffectiveness – Results vary; some users may see mild brightening, while others may not notice significant changes.\nAlternatives – Natural options like gentle exfoliation, moisturizing, and sun protection can help maintain healthy skin tone.\nPatch Test first to avoid allergic reactions.\nResearch Reviews to see real user experiences.\nConsult a Dermatologist if you have concerns about pigmentation.', 280.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 220.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Aichun Beauty Sexy Pink Lips Areolas And Private Parts Keep Pink And Tender 30gmPrice in BD', 'Aichun Beauty Sexy Pink Lips Areolas And Private Parts Keep Pink And Tender 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aichun-beauty-sexy-pink-lips-areolas-and-private-parts-keep-pink-and-tender-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
