(1283, 'Arbutin-DS Anti-Melasma Serum 30ml (With Vitamin C & Kojic Acid)', '1', 0, 35, 217, '1283', '1283', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Arbutin-DS Anti-Melasma Serum is a specialized skincare serum designed to reduce melasma, freckles, dark spots, and uneven skin tone. Enriched with Vitamin C and Kojic Acid, it gently exfoliates dead skin cells, brightens the complexion, and promotes healthy, radiant skin naturally without causing irritation.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces hyperpigmentation, melasma, and dark spots\nBrightens and evens skin tone\nMoisturizes and nourishes the skin\nMinimizes pore appearance\nProtects against sun damage\nReduces fine lines and wrinkles\nDirections for Use:Apply 2–4 drops on clean, dry skin of the face and neck every evening or as needed. Gently pat around the eye area.\nCaution:\nAvoid direct contact with eyes. Rinse immediately with water if contact occurs.\nFor external use only.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat. Maximum storage temperature should not exceed 40°C.\nIngredients:Deionized Water, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Alpha Arbutin, Alpinia Katsumadai Seed Extract, Benzyl Alcohol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tocopherol, Polysorbate 20, Fragrance, Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Kojic Acid.', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Arbutin-DS Anti-Melasma Serum 30ml (With Vitamin C & Kojic Acid)Price in BD', 'Arbutin-DS Anti-Melasma Serum 30ml (With Vitamin C & Kojic Acid) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'arbutin-ds-anti-melasma-serum-30ml-with-vitamin-c-kojic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
(1284, 'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum 5ml', '1', 0, 35, 12, '1284', '1284', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Introducing the AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum Mini 5ml – a compact, travel-friendly solution designed to brighten your complexion and reduce the appearance of dark spots.\nThe AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum Mini is a lightweight serum formulated to address dark spots and uneven skin tone. With 5% Niacinamide, it effectively brightens the skin, while plant-derived Squalane ensures deep hydration.\n\nNatural extracts from Calendula, Papaya, and Sea Buckthorn provide additional nourishment, leaving your skin radiant and healthy. The compact 5ml size makes it an excellent choice for travel or for those new to the product.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAXIS-Y is a skincare brand dedicated to creating products that cater to individual skin concerns. With a focus on natural ingredients and innovative formulations, AXIS-Y aims to provide effective and gentle skincare solutions for all.\nElevate your skincare routine with the AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum Mini 5ml and experience a brighter, more even complexion.\n\n\n\n\nProvides effective relief from breakouts.\nStrengthens the skin\'s natural barrier.\nImproves the appearance of enlarged pores.', 199.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 251.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum 5mlPrice in BD', 'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum 5ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'axis-y-dark-spot-correcting-glow-serum-5ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
