(1286, 'Earth Beauty & You Cica Care Barrier Repair Gel – Anti-Acne Derma Solution 50ml', '1', 0, 35, 323, '1286', '1286', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Restore, soothe, and hydrate your skin with the Cica Care Barrier Repair Gel, a derma solution designed for sensitive and acne-prone skin. This lightweight gel-cream works to repair the skin’s natural moisture barrier, calm irritation, and promote a smoother, healthier complexion.\nSoothes Irritation: Calms redness and discomfort caused by acne or sensitive skin.\nDeep Hydration: Hyaluronic Acid locks in moisture for soft, plump skin.\nBarrier Repair: Restores and strengthens the skin’s natural protective barrier.\nAnti-Acne Action: Salicylic Acid gently exfoliates, preventing clogged pores.\nSkin Brightening: Niacinamide improves texture and promotes a radiant complexion.\nAnti-Inflammatory: D-Panthenol reduces inflammation and promotes healing.\nApply an appropriate amount to the face and neck.\nGently massage in upward circular motions until fully absorbed.\nUse morning and evening as part of your skincare routine.\nFor best results, follow with sunscreen during the day.\nCentella Asiatica: Soothes and supports skin repair\nNiacinamide: Brightens and improves skin texture\nHyaluronic Acid: Deeply hydrates and plumps skin\nSalicylic Acid: Exfoliates and helps prevent breakouts\nD-Panthenol: Reduces inflammation and supports skin healing\nOther Ingredients: Aqua, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Polyacrylate, Dimethicone, Cyclopentasiloxane, Trideceth-6, BHT, Ceteareth-25, Cetyl Alcohol, Stearic Acid, Polysorbate-80, Isopropyl Myristate, Glycerine, DMDM Hydantoin, Fragrance Oil.\nEarth Beauty & You Cica Care Barrier Repair Gel is your go-to solution for hydrated, calm, and healthy-looking skin, suitable for sensitive, acne-prone, and irritated skin types.', 470.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NUL