(1288, 'Cornex Acne Clearing & Whitening Gel 10g', '1', 0, 35, 217, '1288', '1288', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cornex Acne Clearing & Whitening Gel is a high-tech formula designed to fight acne, reduce dark spots, and brighten your skin. Enriched with pure Pomegranate Extract and Vitamin B3, it helps prevent inflamed acne, control bacterial growth, and promote a clearer, healthier complexion. With regular use, it reduces pimples, prevents scars, and enhances skin brightness.\nClears acne and reduces inflammation caused by pimples.\nBrightens skin naturally with Vitamin B3.\nPrevents dark spots and scars, promoting a smooth complexion.\nAnti-inflammatory properties from Pomegranate Extract break the bacterial cycle causing acne.\nWash your face thoroughly before application.\nApply the gel on pimples every morning and night.\nUse consistently, visible improvement may be seen within 3 days.\nDo not squeeze pimples to avoid scarring.\nCabopol 934, Triethanolamine, Pomegranate Extract, Hexamidine Dihydrochloride, Vitamin B3, Deionised Water.\n10g', 1300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cornex Acne Clearing & Whitening Gel 10gPrice in BD', 'Cornex Acne Clearing & Whitening Gel 10g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cornex-acne-clearing-whitening-gel-10g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
