(1292, 'Sebamed Clear Face Care Gel – Hydrating & Soothing Gel for Impure and Oily Skin, pH 5.5, with Hyaluron & Aloe (50ml)', '1', 0, 35, 325, '1292', '1292', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sebamed Clear Face Care Gel – Hydrating & Soothing Gel for Impure and Oily Skin, pH 5.5, with Hyaluron & Aloe\nSebamed Clear Face Care Gel is a lightweight, fast-absorbing gel designed specifically for impure, oily, and acne-prone skin. Its clinically tested pH of 5.5 supports the skin’s natural acid mantle, helping maintain a healthy, balanced complexion while preventing excess oil buildup and breakouts.\nThe gel’s moisturizing complex with Hyaluron and Aloe Barbadensis deeply hydrates the skin without leaving a greasy residue, while the Allantoin and Panthenol formula soothes irritation, calms redness, and leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and supple. Its light texture ensures quick absorption and a fresh, matte finish.\nSebamed Clear Face Care Gel is part of the Sebamed Clear Face skin care system, which includes cleansing, deep cleansing, and care steps to maintain smooth and even skin. Regular use helps reduce impurities, maintain hydration, and support a healthy, clear complexion.\nHydrates and nourishes impure, oily, and acne-prone skin\nSoothes irritation and redness with Allantoin and Panthenol\nFast-absorbing, non-greasy formula for a fresh, matte finish\nClinically tested pH 5.5 to maintain healthy skin barrier\nHelps keep skin smooth, soft, and balanced\nCompatible with the full Sebamed Clear Face system (Cleansing Bar, Cleansing Foam, Facial Toner, and Care Gel)\nCleanse the face, neck, and neckline thoroughly.\nApply the gel every morning and evening.\nMassage gently into the skin until fully absorbed.\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice – Hydrates and calms the skin\nSodium Hyaluronate (Hyaluron) – Provides deep moisturization\nAllantoin – Soothes and protects irritated skin\nPanthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5) – Improves skin softness and suppleness\nImpure, oily, and acne-prone skin\n50ml / 1.69 fl. oz.', 1299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 591.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sebamed Clear Face Care Gel – Hydrating & Soothing Gel for Impure and Oily Skin, pH 5.5, with Hyaluron & Aloe (50ml)Price in BD', 'Sebamed Clear Face Care Gel – Hydrating & Soothing Gel for Impure and Oily Skin, pH 5.5, with Hyaluron & Aloe (50ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sebamed-clear-face-care-gel-hydrating-soothing-gel-for-impure-and-oily-skin-ph-55-with-hyaluron-aloe-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24');
