(1293, 'Perfect Skin Lady Melasma Breakdown Serum 40ml', '1', 0, 35, 240, '1293', '1293', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Advanced Melasma, Freckle & Dark Spot Correcting Serum\nPerfect Skin Lady Melasma Breakdown Serum is a powerful skin-correcting formula designed to break down stubborn melasma, freckles, dark spots, and hormonal pigmentation. Enriched with hydrating, nourishing, and collagen-boosting ingredients, this serum helps restore clear, smooth, and radiant skin with regular use.\nBreaks down melasma, freckles, and dark spots\nHelps reduce hormonal pigmentation and redness\nDeeply hydrates and moisturizes the skin\nStimulates new skin cell regeneration\nBoosts collagen production for firmer skin\nHelps repair sun damage and uneven skin tone\nSmooths fine lines and wrinkles\nFights free radicals and slows signs of aging\nLeaves skin brighter, smoother, and naturally radiant\nVisible improvement may be seen within 2 weeks with consistent use.\nThe serum penetrates deep into the skin to help break down excess pigment at the source, gently exfoliate dead skin cells, and promote healthy new skin growth—resulting in a clearer, more even complexion.\nApply an appropriate amount of serum evenly to the face and neck.Use regularly morning and night for best results.\nGlycerin, Butylene Glycol, PEG-20, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Mannitol, Vitamin C, Acetyl Heptapeptide, Hydrolyzed Elastin, Soluble Collagen, Sodium Hyaluronate, Algin, Alcohol, Moth Bean Extract, Mangosteen Peel Extract, Collagen, Vitamin E, Aloe Vera, Palmitoyl Lauric Acid, Allantoin, Xanthan Gum, Glycoside, Aloe Vera Extract, 24K Gold, Vitamin B3 (Niacinamide)\nFor external use only\nAvoid contact with eyes\nIf irritation occurs, rinse thoroughly with water and discontinue use\nKeep out of reach of children', 484.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 266.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Perfect Skin Lady Melasma Breakdown Serum 40mlPrice in BD', 'Perfect Skin Lady Melasma Breakdown Serum 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'perfect-skin-lady-melasma-breakdown-serum-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
(1294, 'CISDERMA Akcis Salicylic Acid Acne Removing Essence Gel – 20 ml', '1', 0, 35, 39, '1294', '1294', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CISDERMA Akcis Acne Gel is a targeted acne treatment formulated with Salicylic Acid, Clindamycin, and Niacinamide to combat blemishes, unclog pores, and reduce inflammation. Designed for oily and acne-prone skin, this essence gel helps prevent new breakouts, soothe redness, and improve overall skin texture while maintaining the skin’s moisture balance. Dermatologically tested, it is suitable for regular topical use under professional guidance.\nTreats Acne: Reduces both inflammatory and non-inflammatory acne effectively\nAntibacterial Action: Clindamycin inhibits acne-causing bacteria for clearer skin\nReduces Inflammation: Niacinamide calms redness and swelling associated with pimples\nUnclogs Pores: Helps regulate sebum production to prevent blackheads and whiteheads\nImproves Skin Appearance: Promotes a smoother, clearer, and healthier complexion\nSalicylic Acid: Gently exfoliates and unclogs pores\nClindamycin Phosphate 1%: Antibiotic that targets acne-causing bacteria\nNicotinamide (Niacinamide) 4%: Anti-inflammatory agent that soothes irritated skin\nGel Base: Propylene Glycol, Carbomer – ensures smooth application and absorption\nClean & Dry: Wash the affected area thoroughly and pat dry\nApply: Spread a thin, even layer over the acne-prone areas\nFrequency: Use once or twice daily (morning/evening) as directed by a physician\nPrecautions: Avoid eyes, nose, mouth, and broken or sunburned skin\nDuration: Results may take 6–8 weeks for full effect\nHygiene: Wash hands before and after application\nTemporary redness, stinging, or burning at the application site\nDryness, peeling, or mild flaking of skin\nMild itchiness or temporary increase in oiliness\nPerform a patch test before first use if you have sensitive skin\n20 ml / 0.67 fl. oz', 836.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 44.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'CISDERMA Akcis Salicylic Acid Acne Removing Essence Gel – 20 mlPrice in BD', 'CISDERMA Akcis Salicylic Acid Acne Removing Essence Gel – 20 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cisderma-akcis-salicylic-acid-acne-removing-essence-gel-20-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
(1295, 'Provamed Scar Zone Ultra', '1', 0, 35, 79, '1295', '1295', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Provamed Scar Zone 10 gm Ultra Treatment Improve Overall Scar Cream Restore Skin\nHow does Provamed scar Zone Ultra work ?\nProvamed scar Zone Ultra- The unique scar cream, is advance scar solution with 5 Dimensions Bioactive,a perfect natural blended, provides 5 properties to improve the overall appearance of scars resulting from injury,burns, cuts, scrapes,and more.\nSCARZONE ULTRA is proven to soften, smoothen, diminish the scar’s appearance and restore skinto a more natural texture and color.\nActive ingredients:1. Allium Cepa 15% :- Promote skin regeneration2. Vitamin B Complex:- Improve wound healing3. Phytelene Complex:- Anti inflammation4. Vitamin E:- Moisturize and Soften scars5. Niacinamide:- Fade color of scar', 1200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Provamed Scar Zone UltraPrice in BD', 'Provamed Scar Zone Ultra Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'provamed-scar-zone-ultra', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
(1296, 'Dot and Key Cica + 10% Niacinamide Spot Reduction Face Serum with Alpha Arbutin', '1', 0, 35, 91, '1296', '1296', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dot & Key Cica + 10% Niacinamide Spot Reduction Face Serum with Alpha Arbutin (30ml) is a targeted treatment designed to address dark spots, acne scars, and uneven skin tone. This serum combines powerful brightening and soothing ingredients like Niacinamide, Alpha Arbutin, and Cica (Centella Asiatica) to promote a clearer, more even complexion and calm inflamed or acne-prone skin.\nReduces Dark Spots and Hyperpigmentation:\nEvens Skin Tone:\nSoothes and Calms Irritated Skin:\nStrengthens Skin Barrier:\nControls Excess Oil:\nCleanse:\nApply Serum:\nFollow with Moisturizer:\nFrequency:\n10% Niacinamide: Brightens, reduces blemishes, improves skin tone, and supports a stronger skin barrier.Alpha Arbutin: Inhibits melanin synthesis, targeting pigmentation and dark spots for a more uniform complexion.Cica (Centella Asiatica): Calms and soothes inflamed skin, aiding in skin repair and reducing redness.Hyaluronic Acid: Provides lightweight hydration, keeping skin plump and moisturized.Antioxidants: Protect skin from environmental stressors, keeping it fresh and healthy.\nDot & Key Cica + 10% Niacinamide Spot Reduction Serum is ideal for anyone looking to reduce dark spots, improve skin clarity, and maintain a calm, even complexion. Suitable for all skin types, especially those with combination or acne-prone skin.\n\nMade in India', 1210.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot and Key Cica + 10% Niacinamide Spot Reduction Face Serum with Alpha ArbutinPrice in BD', 'Dot and Key Cica + 10% Niacinamide Spot Reduction Face Serum with Alpha Arbutin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-and-key-cica-10-niacinamide-spot-reduction-face-serum-with-alpha-arbutin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2