(1301, 'Isme Acne Spots Cream – 10g With Aloe Vera, Tea Tree Oil & Vitamin B6', '1', 0, 35, 169, '1301', '1301', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Isme Acne Spots Cream is a targeted treatment cream designed to help reduce acne and blemishes while keeping skin hydrated. Formulated with Tea Tree Oil, Aloe Vera, and Vitamin B6, it works to control excess oil, reduce clogged pores, and inhibit bacterial growth that causes acne. The inclusion of Beta Hydroxy Acid (BHA) helps to exfoliate the skin gently, promoting clearer, smoother skin. Regular use helps to prevent new breakouts and supports faster healing of existing spots.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces acne and blemishes\nControls excess oil and sebum production\nInhibits growth of acne-causing bacteria\nGentle exfoliation with Beta Hydroxy Acid (BHA)\nHydrates and soothes skin with Aloe Vera\nPromotes faster healing of inflamed spots\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, apply a small amount directly to acne-affected areas.\nGently massage until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, morning and evening.\nIngredients:Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Tea Tree Oil, Vitamin B6 (Pyridoxine), Beta Hydroxy Acid (BHA), and other skin-conditioning agents.\nCaution:\nFor external use only.\nAvoid use on children under 3 years old.\nDiscontinue if irritation occurs.\nNet Weight: 10g', 441.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 49.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Isme Acne Spots Cream – 10g With Aloe Vera, Tea Tree Oil & Vitamin B6Price in BD', 'Isme Acne Spots Cream – 10g With Aloe Vera, Tea Tree Oil & Vitamin B6 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isme-acne-spots-cream-10g-with-aloe-vera-tea-tree-oil-vitamin-b6', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
(1302, 'La Roche-Posay Effaclar Adapalene Gel 0.1% Acne Treatment (Topical Retinoid) 45g', '1', 0, 35, 62, '1302', '1302', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Topical retinoid (Adapalene 0.1%) acne treatment\nHelps treat acne and support clearer-looking skin\nOnce-daily use (easy routine)\nSuitable for age 12 years and older\nHelps prevent future breakouts with consistent use\nBrand: La Roche-Posay\nRange: Effaclar\nProduct Type: Acne Treatment Gel / Topical Retinoid\nActive Ingredient: Adapalene USP 0.1%\nNet Weight: 45g\nAge Range: 12+ years\nActive ingredient\nAdapalene USP 0.1% (retinoid)\nPurpose\nAcne treatment\nUses\nFor the treatment of acne\nWarnings\nFor external use only\nDo not use on damaged skin (cuts, abrasions, eczema, sunburn)\nDo not use if allergic to adapalene or any ingredients\nIf pregnant or breastfeeding: ask a doctor before use\nWhen using this product\nLimit sun exposure (including tanning beds) and use sunscreen outdoors\nDo not wax hair in areas where product is applied\nAcne may appear to worsen in early weeks (normal)\nIrritation (redness, itching, dryness, burning) is more likely in the first weeks or when combining acne meds\nAvoid contact with eyes, lips, mouth; rinse with water if contact occurs\nWash hands after use\nStop use and ask a doctor if\nYou become pregnant or plan pregnancy while using\nSigns of allergic reaction occur (itching, rash, hives, swelling, shortness of breath)\nIrritation becomes severe\nNo improvement after 3 months of once-daily use\nKeep out of reach of children. If swallowed, get medical help or contact Poison Control.\nDirections (12 years and older)\nUse once daily\nClean skin gently and pat dry\nApply a thin layer over the entire affected area (e.g., whole face if acne is on face)\nDo not use more than once a day\nInactive ingredientsCarbomer homopolymer, edetate disodium, phenoxyethanol, poloxamer 182, propylene glycol, purified water, sodium hydroxide.\nStorageStore at room temperature 68°F–77°F (20°C–25°C). Protect from freezing.', 3135.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1255.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche-Posay Effaclar Adapalene Gel 0.1% Acne Treatment (Topical Retinoid) 45gPrice in BD', 'La Roche-Posay Effaclar Adapalene Gel 0.1% Acne Treatment (Topical Retinoid) 45g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-effaclar-adapalene-gel-01-acne-treatment-topical-retinoid-45g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
(1303, 'Biogel Acne Gel 30gm', '1', 0, 35, 327, '1303', '1303', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nBiogel Acne Gel is a powerful, natural solution designed to treat acne and pimples effectively. Enriched with neem and tea tree oil, this 30gm gel provides a natural antifungal shield, helping to clear your skin from impurities and protect it from germs. Biogel Acne Gel not only treats existing acne but also prevents future breakouts, ensuring clear and healthy skin.\n\n\n\n\n\nBiogel Acne Gel is indicated for the treatment of acne, pimples, and blackheads. It is suitable for individuals looking to control sebum production and maintain clear, healthy skin.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBiogel Acne Gel is your go-to natural solution for treating acne and pimples. Formulated with neem and tea tree oil, it offers a natural and effective way to maintain clear and healthy skin. The gel is easy to use and provides visible results with regular application.\nExperience the natural goodness of Biogel Acne Gel. Order your 30gm tube today from Arogga and enjoy clear, radiant skin with the power of neem and tea tree oil.', 935.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 22.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biogel Acne Gel 30gmPrice in BD', 'Biogel Acne Gel 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biogel-acne-gel-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:24', '2026-02-11 13:41:24'),
