(1313, 'CISDERMA Melacis De-Pigment Whitening Face Cream – 20 g', '1', 0, 35, 39, '1313', '1313', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CISDERMA Melacis Whitening Face Cream is a targeted pigmentation correction treatment designed to brighten the complexion, reduce dark spots, and even out skin tone. Enriched with active ingredients like Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, Alpha Arbutin, Kojic Acid, Hyaluronic Acid, and Centella Asiatica Extract, this cream helps diminish melasma, post-acne marks, freckles, and other discolorations while nourishing and hydrating the skin for a healthier, radiant appearance.\nDermatologically tested and formulated to be gentle on all skin types, Melacis helps you achieve a brighter, more even complexion safely and effectively.\nReduces Pigmentation: Targets melasma, dark spots, freckles, and post-acne marks\nBrightens & Evens Skin Tone: Controls melanin production for a radiant, uniform complexion\nHydrates & Nourishes: Provides up to 24-hour moisture, leaving skin soft, plump, and healthy\nSkin Repair & Protection: Supports skin restoration and defends against environmental aggressors\nGentle & Dermatologically Tested: Suitable for all skin types\nAlpha Arbutin: Inhibits pigment formation to fade dark patches\nTranexamic Acid: Helps reduce melanin overproduction and prevents hyperpigmentation\nNiacinamide: Brightens skin and strengthens the barrier\nKojic Acid: Natural melanin inhibitor for spot correction\nHyaluronic Acid: Deeply hydrates and plumps the skin\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Soothes, repairs, and protects the skin\nCleanse: Wash your face with a gentle cleanser\nApply: Take a small amount and apply evenly to face and neck\nMassage: Gently massage in circular motions until fully absorbed\nFrequency: Recommended for nighttime use\nSun Protection: Always use a broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day to prevent pigmentation from worsening\nMild stinging, irritation, or redness may occur in sensitive skin\nRare allergic reactions may include itching or rash; discontinue use if severe\nPerform a patch test before regular use\nSafe for all skin types when used as directed\n20 g / 0.70 fl. oz', 1026.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 54.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'CISDERMA Melacis De-Pigment Whitening Face Cream – 20 gPrice in BD', 'CISDERMA Melacis De-Pigment Whitening Face Cream – 20 g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cisderma-melacis-de-pigment-whitening-face-cream-20-g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
