(1316, 'Rem Scar Gel 15gm', '1', 0, 35, 40, '1316', '1316', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'RemScar Gel Stick is clinically proven to treat & reduce scarring from acne, burns, surgery, stretch marks & make for a smoother appearance. You can use the convenient Scar Stick to treat new & old scars, and accelerate the healing process for new wounds to prevent scarring. Remescar releases a transparent, thin and discrete silicone film and creates as such a protective barrier for the healing of scars, while maintaining the skin’s moisture balance..', 1380.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1380.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Rem Scar Gel 15gmPrice in BD', 'Rem Scar Gel 15gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'rem-scar-gel-15gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1317, 'Pansly Acne & Dark Spot Corrector Cream 30ml', '1', 0, 35, 330, '1317', '1317', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pansly Acne & Dark Spot Corrector Cream is formulated to address acne scars and hyperpigmentation, promoting a clearer and more even skin tone. This 30ml cream is suitable for all skin types and can be applied to both the face and body.\nKey Features:\nAcne Scar Reduction: Targets and diminishes the appearance of acne scars.\nDark Spot Correction: Helps lighten hyperpigmentation and dark spots.\nEven Skin Tone: Promotes a more uniform complexion.\nHydrating Formula: Moisturizes the skin, preventing dryness.\nUsage Instructions:\nCleanse the skin thoroughly before application.\nApply a small amount of the cream to the affected areas.\nGently massage until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, morning and evening, for optimal results.\nPrecautions:\nPerform a patch test before first use to check for any allergic reactions.\nAvoid contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.\nIncorporating Pansly Acne & Dark Spot Corrector Cream into your daily skincare routine may help achieve a clearer and more even complexion.', 926.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 574.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pansly Acne & Dark Spot Corrector Cream 30mlPrice in BD', 'Pansly Acne & Dark Spot Corrector Cream 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'pansly-acne-dark-spot-corrector-cream-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1318, 'GLP Acne Cross Gel 20gm', '1', 0, 35, 46, '1318', '1318', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'GLP Acne Cross Gel is an advanced anti-acne and anti-bacterial formulation designed to effectively target acne, pimples, and acne-causing bacteria. Powered by a potent blend of Glycolic Acid, Niacinamide, Zinc PCA, and natural botanical extracts, this gel works deep within the skin to unclog pores, control excess oil, and reduce inflammation.\nIts lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs quickly into the skin, helping to soothe irritation, minimize redness, and prevent future breakouts. With regular use, GLP Acne Cross Gel improves skin texture, reduces acne marks, and promotes clearer, healthier-looking skin.\nGlycolic Acid (15%) – Gently exfoliates dead skin cells, unclogs pores, and reduces acne formation\nZinc PCA (1%) – Controls excess sebum and inhibits acne-causing bacteria\nNiacinamide (2%) – Reduces redness, balances oil production, and strengthens the skin barrier\nPine Bark Extract (0.6%) – Rich in antioxidants, helps protect and calm the skin\nAzadirachta (Neem) Leaf Extract (1%) – Natural antibacterial agent that helps prevent breakouts\nWillow Bark Extract (0.5%) – Helps clear pores and reduce inflammation\nTea Tree Oil (0.5%) – Known for its antimicrobial and acne-fighting properties\nAllantoin (0.8%) – Soothes irritation and promotes skin healing\nAqua, D-Panthenol, Acrylate Polymer, Glycerine, Propylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hydroxide, Fragrance\nEffectively reduces acne and pimples\nFights acne-causing bacteria\nControls excess oil and shine\nUnclogs pores and prevents blackheads\nReduces redness, swelling, and irritation\nHelps prevent future breakouts\nTake a pea-sized amount of gel on your fingertip\nApply directly to the affected areas\nGently massage until absorbed\nUse twice daily for best results\nAcne-prone and oily skin\nTeenagers and adults\nPimples, whiteheads, and blackheads\nAvoid contact with eyes\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nPerform a patch test before first use\nKeep out of reach of children\nFor external use only\nGLP Acne Cross Gel 20 gm is a powerful yet gentle acne treatment that helps restore clear, smooth, and healthy skin with consistent use.', 820.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 79.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'GLP Acne Cross Gel 20gmPrice in BD', 'GLP Acne Cross Gel 20gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'glp-acne-cross-gel-20gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
