(1323, 'Fiorae Dark Spot & Anti-Melasma Whitening Cream X8 (20g)', '1', 0, 35, 240, '1323', '1323', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Target Stubborn Discolorations and Reveal a Radiant, Even-Toned Glow!\nIntroducing Fiorae Dark Spot & Anti-Melasma Whitening Cream X8, your professional-grade solution for achieving a flawless, luminous complexion. This powerful, concentrated cream is specifically engineered to target and visibly reduce the appearance of hyperpigmentation, including stubborn dark spots, melasma, age spots, and post-acne marks.\nOur advanced \"X8\" formula works deep within the skin\'s surface to inhibit melanin overproduction, the primary cause of uneven skin tone. Whether your concerns are sun damage, hormonal changes, or skin aging, this cream helps restore your skin\'s natural brightness and uniformity.\nKey Benefits & Features:\n🎯 Fades Dark Spots & Melasma: Experience a significant reduction in the appearance of hyperpigmentation, including challenging melasma patches, for a more even skin tone.\n✨ Brightens & Illuminates: Active ingredients work to gently lift existing discoloration, revealing a naturally brighter, more radiant complexion.\n🤲 Evens Skin Tone: Achieve a smooth, uniform look by diminishing uneven pigmentation and reducing the contrast of dark spots against your natural skin.\n⚡ Powerful X8 Complex: This concentrated formula packs a potent punch, delivering visible results where you need them most.\n🧴 Concentrated & Targeted: The 20g size is perfect for focused application on problem areas, making it a long-lasting and effective treatment.\nIdeal For:\nIndividuals struggling with dark spots, age spots, or sun spots.\nThose looking for a solution to manage melasma and hormonal pigmentation.\nAnyone seeking to brighten their complexion and achieve a more even, radiant skin tone.\nHow To Use:\nCleanse and tone your face thoroughly.\nApply a small amount of Fiorae Whitening Cream directly to dark spots and areas of hyperpigmentation.\nGently massage into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFor best results, use daily as part of your morning and/or evening skincare routine. Always follow with a broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day, as sun exposure can worsen dark spots.\nNet Weight: 20g', 1092.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 58.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fiorae Dark Spot & Anti-Melasma Whitening Cream X8 (20g)Price in BD', 'Fiorae Dark Spot & Anti-Melasma Whitening Cream X8 (20g) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fiorae-dark-spot-anti-melasma-whitening-cream-x8-20g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
