(1325, 'The Derma Plus Dark Spot Correcting Glow Face Serum for All Skin Types 30ml', '1', 0, 35, 52, '1325', '1325', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Derma Plus Dark Spot Correcting Glow Face Serum (30ml) targets stubborn hyperpigmentation and dullness for radiant, even-toned skin across all types.\nNiacinamide and alpha arbutin inhibit melanin production to fade dark spots; tranexamic acid blocks pigment transfer while glutathione recycles melanin for brightness. Licorice root, stable vitamin C (magnesium ascorbyl phosphate), and papaya extract soothe and even complexion.\nSqualane locks in moisture, hyaluronic acid plumps, and panthenol repairs barrier. Sea buckthorn, rice bran, and calendula provide antioxidants without irritation.\nAfter cleansing/toning, apply 2-3 drops to face/neck AM/PM. Follow with moisturizer; always use SPF daytime. Fragrance-free, non-comedogenic—patch test first.\nVisible fading in 4-6 weeks with consistent use; gentle for daily application on sensitive skin.', 765.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 85.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Plus Dark Spot Correcting Glow Face Serum for All Skin Types 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Derma Plus Dark Spot Correcting Glow Face Serum for All Skin Types 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-plus-dark-spot-correcting-glow-face-serum-for-all-skin-types-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25');
