(1326, 'Heimish RX Multi Vitamin Dark Spot Cream', '1', 0, 35, 95, '1326', '1326', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Heimish RX Multi Vitamin Dark Spot Cream (50ml) is a lightweight, non-sticky cream formulated to target hyperpigmentation, including freckles and dark spots, aiming to provide a more even and radiant complexion.\n\nKey Ingredients:\nNiacinamide (5%): Known for its brightening properties, it helps to even out skin tone and reduce the appearance of dark spots.\nKakadu Plum Extract: Rich in Vitamin C (100 times more than oranges), it offers antioxidant benefits and enhances skin radiance.\n3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid: A stable Vitamin C derivative that provides antioxidant protection and promotes a glowing complexion.\nBenefits:\nReduces Pigmentation & Dark Spots: Clinically tested to show significant reduction in pigmentation (-76.2%) and dark spots (-61.9%) within 7 days.\nHydrates & Brightens: Locks in moisture while improving skin tone, leaving the skin radiant and even-toned.\nFast-Absorbing Formula: Lightweight and non-sticky, making it suitable for daily use and ideal for layering under makeup.\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing and toning, apply a small amount of the cream to your face in the morning and at night.\nGently massage until fully absorbed.\nFor enhanced results, consider pairing with the RX Vitamin Glow Serum.\nMade in Korea', 1925.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish RX Multi Vitamin Dark Spot CreamPrice in BD', 'Heimish RX Multi Vitamin Dark Spot Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-rx-multi-vitamin-dark-spot-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
