(1336, 'Kim Whitening Pearl And Snowlotus Cream 20g', '1', 0, 35, 331, '1336', '1336', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pearl Extract: Known for its skin-brightening properties, it helps reduce dark spots and promotes a radiant complexion.\nSnow Lotus: A rare herb believed to have anti-aging and skin-soothing effects.\nVitamin E: An antioxidant that moisturizes and protects the skin from environmental damage.\nLatinal: Enhances skin texture and provides deep hydration.\nAHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid): Exfoliates dead skin cells, revealing fresher, brighter skin underneath.\nBrightens Skin Tone: Regular use can lead to a fairer and more even skin tone.\nReduces Dark Spots and Blemishes: Helps in fading age spots, pimples, and freckles.\nAnti-Aging Effects: Minimizes the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines.\nMoisturizes and Softens: Keeps the skin hydrated and smooth.\nTightens Pores: Improves skin texture by tightening enlarged pores.\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\nApply a small amount of the cream to your face and neck.\nGently massage until fully absorbed.\nUse daily, preferably at night before bedtime.', 288.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 32.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Kim Whitening Pearl And Snowlotus Cream 20gPrice in BD', 'Kim Whitening Pearl And Snowlotus Cream 20g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'kim-whitening-pearl-and-snowlotus-cream-20g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1337, '3W Clinic Lab AHA-BHA-PHA Revital Real Spot Cream', '1', 0, 35, 114, '1337', '1337', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic Lab AHA-BHA-PHA Revital Real Spot Cream\nThe 3W Clinic Lab AHA-BHA-PHA Revital Real Spot Cream is a multi-action treatment designed to target blemishes and improve skin texture. Formulated with a blend of alpha hydroxy acids (AHA), beta hydroxy acids (BHA), and polyhydroxy acids (PHA), this cream gently exfoliates the skin, helping to unclog pores and reduce the appearance of acne and dark spots.\nIts lightweight texture absorbs quickly, delivering deep hydration while promoting a brighter, more even skin tone. Enriched with soothing ingredients, this spot cream also calms irritation and redness, making it suitable for sensitive skin. With regular use, you\'ll notice a revitalized complexion and clearer, healthier skin. Perfect for those seeking an effective solution for stubborn spots and uneven texture!', 857.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 368.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Lab AHA-BHA-PHA Revital Real Spot CreamPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Lab AHA-BHA-PHA Revital Real Spot Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-lab-aha-bha-pha-revital-real-spot-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
