(1339, 'Sky Pearl & Collagen Pure Natural Cream – 20g | Brightening & Anti-Aging Face Cream', '1', 0, 35, 321, '1339', '1339', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience the perfect balance of radiance and nourishment with Sky Pearl & Collagen Pure Natural Cream. This premium skincare formula combines the brightening power of Pearl Extract with the firming benefits of Collagen, designed to rejuvenate, hydrate, and restore your skin’s youthful glow.\nLightweight yet deeply moisturizing, it helps improve skin elasticity, reduce dark spots, smooth fine lines, and enhance overall brightness—making it ideal for everyday skincare.\nBrightens dull and uneven skin tone\nReduces dark spots, blemishes & freckles\nImproves skin elasticity & firmness with collagen\nMinimizes the look of fine lines & wrinkles\nNourishes and hydrates for soft, smooth skin\nGentle formula suitable for all skin types', 275.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sky Pearl & Collagen Pure Natural Cream – 20g | Brightening & Anti-Aging Face CreamPrice in BD', 'Sky Pearl & Collagen Pure Natural Cream – 20g | Brightening & Anti-Aging Face Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sky-pearl-collagen-pure-natural-cream-20g-brightening-anti-aging-face-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1340, 'Isme Acne Spots Cream with Aloe Vera, Tea Tree & Vitamin B6', '1', 0, 35, 169, '1340', '1340', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The medical anti-acne cream ISME Acne Spots quickly removes pimples in a short time, prevents the development of only pimples that appear, dries quickly and heals areas of inflammation on the skin. When applied to a pimple, it removes inflammation and prevents the development of a pimple. Therapeutic point cream has antiseptic and bactericidal properties.\nIngredients:\nWater, Cetearyl alcohol, Butylene glycol, Ceteareth-20, Melaleuca altemifolia (Tea tree) oil, Diisopropyl dimer dilinoleate, PEG-100 stearate, Clyceryl stearate, Carbomer, Triclosan, Methylparaben, Parfurn, Ethylparabent, non-active, Parburn, Ethylparaben, in-the-one, in-the-year, in-the-one, in-the-day, in-the-day, Mflparaben, Parfurn, Ethylparaben, in-the-day, Carbomer, Triclosan, Methylparaben, Parfurn, Ethylparaben, non-essential Pyridoxine HCL, Aloe barbadensis (Aloe vera) leaf juice, DMDM Hydrotoin, Diazolidinyl urea, Disodium EDTA.\n\nAloe Barbadensis (Aloe-Vera, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice) - often referred to as “The Miracle of the Plant” or “Natural Doctor”, harbors many amazing qualities. Aloe juice extract opens and cleanses the pores, moisturizes and tightens the skin, as it is able to easily and deeply penetrate the skin, restore metabolism, stimulate cell regeneration, and also remove inflammation and irritation.\n\nTea tree oil (Melaleuca Altemifolia) - eliminates pustular and acne, irritation, swelling, itching, eliminates bacterial, viral and parasitic dermatitis, eczema. Eliminates cosmetic skin imperfections (warts, corns, acne), and also promotes the healing of any wound and parasitic lesions on the skin. Tea tree oil is one of the best broad-spectrum antifungal drugs.\n\nVitamin B6 (Pyridoxine Hcl) is a strong antioxidant. Vitamin B6 plays a vital role in the reproduction of all cells in the body. He is involved in the synthesis of amino acids - the building blocks for the formation of proteins and certain hormones. It plays an important role in the synthesis of hemoglobin, serotonin, aminobutyric acid. Vitamin is necessary for normal functioning of the central and peripheral nervous system. With its deficiency there are convulsions, polyneuritis, dermatitis. Appointed to treat skin diseases.\n\nTriclosan is a known broad-spectrum antibacterial agent, has anti-inflammatory properties, acts on gram-positive and gram-negative flora, as well as fungal microorganisms.\n\nThe main properties of the cream ISME Acne Spots:\n\nMode of application:\nApply cream spot on acne or pimple on cleansed skin 2 times a day, morning and evening. Does not require rinsing.\n\n\nMade in Thailand', 415.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 185.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Isme Acne Spots Cream with Aloe Vera, Tea Tree & Vitamin B6Price in BD', 'Isme Acne Spots Cream with Aloe Vera, Tea Tree & Vitamin B6 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isme-acne-spots-cream-with-aloe-vera-tea-tree-vitamin-b6', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1341, 'G-Acne Gel for Acne Prone Skin 30g', '1', 0, 35, 27, '1341', '1341', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Advanced Gel for Acne-Prone Skin\nG-Acne Anti-Acne Gel is a targeted treatment for acne-prone skin, enriched with natural extracts, Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), and Zinc PCA. This advanced gel works to control excess oil, reduce inflammation, and prevent acne, while soothing and moisturizing the skin. Its antimicrobial and antioxidant-rich formula helps relieve burning, redness, and itching caused by acne, promoting a healthier, clearer complexion without over-drying the skin.\nControls excess oil production and reduces shine\nReduces acne inflammation and prevents breakouts\nFights acne-induced hyperpigmentation\nSoothes burning, itching, and irritation\nMoisturizes skin while treating acne\nProvides antimicrobial, anti-inflammatory, and antioxidant protection\nAzadirachta Leaf Extract – antimicrobial and soothing\nWillow Bark Extract – natural exfoliant, reduces inflammation\nPine Bark Extract – antioxidant and skin-protective\nTea Tree Oil – antibacterial and anti-acne\nZinc PCA – controls sebum production and acne\nAllantoin & Aloe Vera Extract – soothing and moisturizing\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3) – reduces hyperpigmentation and inflammation\nEmbelica Officinalis & Basil Leaf Extracts – antioxidant and astringent properties\nD.M. Aqua, Carbomer, Methyl Paraben Sodium, Propyl Paraben Sodium, Phenoxyethanol, Colour Helindone Pink CN (73360), Perfume\nApply a small amount to clean, dry affected areas\nMassage gently until fully absorbed\nUse twice daily for best results\nIndia\nG-Acne Anti-Acne Gel – Controls Oil, Reduces Acne, Soothes & Protects Skin.', 1247.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 53.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'G-Acne Gel for Acne Prone Skin 30gPrice in BD', 'G-Acne Gel for Acne Prone Skin 30g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'g-acne-gel-for-acne-prone-skin-30g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
