(1343, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Dark Spot Corrector Cream with Niacinamide and Vitamin C', '1', 0, 35, 8, '1343', '1343', NULL, NULL, NULL, '​Laikou Japan Sakura Dark Spot Corrector Cream is a skincare product formulated to address hyperpigmentation, uneven skin tone, and dryness. Enriched with ingredients like niacinamide, vitamin C, and sakura (cherry blossom) extract, it aims to brighten the complexion and provide hydration.​\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): Helps even out skin tone, reduce the appearance of dark spots, and enhance the skin\'s barrier function.​\nVitamin C (Ascorbic Acid): Known for its antioxidant properties, it aids in brightening the skin and diminishing hyperpigmentation.​\nSakura (Prunus Lannesiana Flower Extract): Offers anti-inflammatory benefits and contributes to skin brightness.​\nShea Butter (Butyrospermum Parkii): Provides deep moisturization, leaving the skin soft and supple.​\nSodium Hyaluronate: A form of hyaluronic acid that helps retain skin moisture, promoting hydration.​\nSize: 50g\nUsage: Suitable for both day and night application.​\nSkin Type: Formulated for all skin types.​\nShelf Life: Approximately 3 years.\nCleanse: Start with a clean face\nApply: Take an appropriate amount of the cream and apply it evenly to the face and neck.​\nMassage: Gently massage until fully absorbed.​\nRoutine: Use consistently in the morning and evening for optimal results', 517.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 533.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Dark Spot Corrector Cream with Niacinamide and Vitamin CPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Dark Spot Corrector Cream with Niacinamide and Vitamin C Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-dark-spot-corrector-cream-with-niacinamide-and-vitamin-c', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
