(1346, 'GLP Acne Cross Face Wash 50gm', '1', 0, 36, 46, '1346', '1346', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'GLP Acne Cross Face Wash is a gentle yet effective anti-acne and anti-bacterial cleanser specially formulated for acne-prone skin. It provides deep cleansing by removing excess oil, dirt, and impurities while helping to prevent breakouts and control acne-causing bacteria.\nEnriched with Glycolic Acid, Salicylic Acid, and Zinc Gluconate, this face wash exfoliates dead skin cells, unclogs pores, and regulates excess sebum production without over-drying the skin. With regular use, it helps improve skin texture, reduce acne, and maintain a clear, healthy complexion.\nGlycolic Acid (1%) – An AHA exfoliant that gently removes dead skin cells and smoothens skin texture\nSalicylic Acid (1.8%) – A BHA exfoliant that penetrates pores to unclog them and reduce acne imperfections\nZinc Gluconate (3%) – Helps regulate sebum production and reduces inflammation\nAqua, Sodium Lauryl Ether Sulphate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Triethanolamine, Carbomer, Phenoxyethanol, Disodium EDTA, Fragrance\nDeep cleanses acne-prone skin\nHelps reduce pimples and breakouts\nUnclogs pores and removes dead skin cells\nControls excess oil and shine\nSoothes inflammation and redness\nSuitable for daily use\nWet your face and neck with warm water\nTake a required amount of face wash on your palms\nGently massage onto face and neck using fingertips\nRinse thoroughly with warm water\nPat dry with a clean towel\nUse twice daily for best results\nAcne-prone skin\nOily and combination skin\nTeenagers and adults\nAvoid contact with eyes\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nFor external use only\nKeep out of reach of children', 1234.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 65.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'GLP Acne Cross Face Wash 50gmPrice in BD', 'GLP Acne Cross Face Wash 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'glp-acne-cross-face-wash-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1347, 'Clinsol Gel (Clindamycin Phosphate & Nicotinamide) 15gm', '1', 0, 36, 332, '1347', '1347', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Clinsol Gel is a topical anti-acne medication that combines Clindamycin Phosphate (an antibiotic) with Nicotinamide (Niacinamide) to help treat acne and pimple breakouts. It works by reducing acne-causing bacteria, calming redness, and controlling inflammation for clearer-looking skin.\nKey Benefits\nHelps treat acne (pimples), blackheads, and inflamed breakouts\nReduces acne-causing bacteria on the skin\nHelps soothe redness, swelling, and irritation\nSupports healthier, clearer skin with regular use\nHow It Works\nClindamycin Phosphate: fights bacteria that contribute to acne.\nNicotinamide: helps reduce inflammation and supports skin barrier health.\nHow to UseClean and dry the affected area, then apply a thin layer once or twice daily or as directed by a doctor. Avoid contact with eyes, mouth, and broken skin. Use sunscreen during daytime.\nPrecautionsFor external use only. Mild dryness or irritation may occur. Stop use and consult a doctor if severe irritation, allergic reaction, or persistent diarrhea occurs. Use during pregnancy/breastfeeding only with medical advice.\nPack Size: 15 gm', 159.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 21.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Clinsol Gel (Clindamycin Phosphate & Nicotinamide) 15gmPrice in BD', 'Clinsol Gel (Clindamycin Phosphate & Nicotinamide) 15gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'clinsol-gel-clindamycin-phosphate-nicotinamide-15gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1348, 'Ralycos Pimcure Gel 20gm (For Oily & Acne-Prone Skin)', '1', 0, 36, 142, '1348', '1348', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ralycos Pimcure Gel is a targeted anti-acne treatment gel specially formulated for oily and acne-prone skin. It helps control acne formation by reducing excess oil secretion, keeping pores clean, and minimizing breakouts. The lightweight gel texture absorbs quickly without clogging pores, making it suitable for daily use.\nEnriched with natural antibacterial and soothing ingredients such as Neem Oil, Tea Tree Oil, Kiwi Extract, Salicylic Acid, Zinc PCA, and Niacinamide, Pimcure Gel helps fight acne-causing bacteria, unclog pores, and calm inflamed skin. Aloe Barbadensis helps keep the skin hydrated, soft, and supple while reducing irritation associated with acne. Added Allantoin and Vitamin E support skin healing and comfort.\nKey Benefits\nHelps control acne, pimples, and breakouts\nReduces excess oil and keeps pores clean\nAntibacterial action to fight acne-causing microbes\nSoothes irritation and redness\nLightweight, non-greasy gel for daily use\nIngredientsAqua, Isopropyl Myristate, Propylene Glycol, Propanediol, C14-22 Alcohols, C12-20 Alkyl Glucoside, Cetearyl Alcohol, Dimethicone, Actinidia Chinensis (Kiwi) Seed Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Salicylic Acid, Capryloyl Glycine, Sarcosine, Cinnamomum Zeylanicum Bark Extract, Niacinamide, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Polysorbate 20, Triethanolamine, Melia Azadirachta (Neem) Seed Oil, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Liquorice) Root Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Arctium Lappa Root Extract, Xanthan Gum, Fragrance, Zinc PCA, Disodium EDTA, Menthol, Allantoin, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil.\nDirections for UseApply a generous amount to the affected area twice daily after cleansing the face.\nFor external use only.Pack Size: 20gm', 1487.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 63.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Ralycos Pimcure Gel 20gm (For Oily & Acne-Prone Skin)Price in BD', 'Ralycos Pimcure Gel 20gm (For Oily & Acne-Prone Skin) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ralycos-pimcure-gel-20gm-for-oily-acne-prone-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
