(1357, 'Bioderma Sebium Global Acne-Prone Skin 30ml', '1', 0, 36, 200, '1357', '1357', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Intensive Care for Acne-Prone Skin | Targets Pimples, Marks & Excess Oil\nBioderma Sébium Global is a dermatologist-recommended treatment cream specifically formulated for acne-prone, oily skin. This intensive formula acts directly on the causes of acne — regulating sebum production, unclogging pores, and reducing inflammation to clear up existing blemishes and prevent future breakouts.\nIt mimics the skin\'s natural function using the Seborestore Technology™, combining bakuchiol and the patented Fluidactiv™ complex to restore healthy sebum quality and prevent clogged pores.\n🔹 Reduces inflammatory acne lesions (pimples, blackheads, whiteheads)\n🔹 Prevents and fades acne scars and dark spots\n🔹 Regulates excess oil production\n🔹 Refines skin texture and tightens pores\n🔹 Light, fast-absorbing cream – non-comedogenic\nOily and acne-prone skin\nTeenagers and adults experiencing breakouts\nUse alone or under makeup\nApply once or twice a day to cleansed skin, preferably with Sébium Gel Moussant. Avoid contact with eyes. For best results, use consistently.\n*Studies show significant improvement in acne and oiliness with daily use.\n🛒 Now available at Arogga – your trusted source for dermatological skincare in Bangladesh.', 2110.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Sebium Global Acne-Prone Skin 30mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Sebium Global Acne-Prone Skin 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-sebium-global-acne-prone-skin-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
