(1360, 'R-E New Acne Lotion 40ml', '1', 0, 36, 278, '1360', '1360', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'R-E New Acne Lotion 40ml is a targeted treatment for acne-prone skin, especially effective for pustular acne, cystic acne, folliculitis, and other bacterial skin infections. Enriched with antibacterial and soothing ingredients, it helps reduce inflammation, prevent breakouts, and promote clear, healthy skin.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nTea Tree Oil (5%) – Natural antibacterial and anti-inflammatory agent\nClindamycin HCL (10mg) – Antibiotic for acne-causing bacteria\nMetronidazole Liniment (8mg) – Reduces bacterial growth and inflammation\nAllantoin (1%) – Soothes and heals irritated skin\nWitch Hazel (1%) – Controls excess oil and tightens pores\nZinc PCA (1%) – Regulates sebum production and reduces acne\nNiacinamide (2%) – Improves skin barrier, reduces redness and pigmentation\nVitamin B3 – Supports skin health and repair\nIndications:\nAcne (pustular and cystic)\nFolliculitis\nTympanitis & Nasosinusitis-related skin issues\nOther bacterial skin infections\nDirections for Use:\nApply a thin layer to affected areas once or twice daily or as directed by a physician.\nAvoid contact with eyes and mucous membranes.\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only\nKeep out of reach of children\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nBenefits:\nReduces acne breakouts and inflammation\nClears bacterial infections on the skin\nControls excess oil and improves skin texture\nSoothes and repairs irritated skin', 1187.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 63.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'R-E New Acne Lotion 40mlPrice in BD', 'R-E New Acne Lotion 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'r-e-new-acne-lotion-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1361, 'Alite Anti-Acne Face Wash with Charcoal 70gm – Detox & Reveal Clear, Healthy Skin', '1', 0, 36, 332, '1361', '1361', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Detox • Cleanse • Reveal Acne-Free, Healthy Skin\nDetoxify and refresh your skin with Alite Anti-Acne Face Wash with Charcoal. Formulated with activated charcoal to draw out dirt, oil, and impurities, this face wash helps fight acne, prevent breakouts, and leave your skin feeling clear, healthy, and revitalized.\nKey Benefits:\nDeep Detox: Activated charcoal removes toxins, pollutants, and excess oil\nFights Acne: Targets acne-causing bacteria and reduces pimples\nPrevents Breakouts: Regular use keeps skin clear and blemish-free\nSoothes & Refreshes: Gentle formula maintains natural moisture balance\nDaily Use Friendly: Soap-free, lightweight formula suitable for all skin types\nHow to Use:\nWet your face with water.\nApply a small amount of face wash and massage in circular motions.\nRinse thoroughly.\nUse twice daily, morning and night, for best results.\nKey Ingredients:Activated Charcoal, Purified Water, Aloe Vera Extract, Glycerin, Sodium Lauryl Ether Sulfate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Acrylates Copolymer, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Citric Acid, Fragrance, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin.', 308.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 82.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Alite Anti-Acne Face Wash with Charcoal 70gm – Detox & Reveal Clear, Healthy SkinPrice in BD', 'Alite Anti-Acne Face Wash with Charcoal 70gm – Detox & Reveal Clear, Healthy Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'alite-anti-acne-face-wash-with-charcoal-70gm-detox-reveal-clear-healthy-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1362, 'Laikou Sakura Pimple Patch Day & Night for All Skin Types - 24 Patches', '1', 0, 36, 8, '1362', '1362', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LAIKOU JAPAN SAKURA PIMPLE PATCH 24 PATCHES For All Skin Types Absorb Excess Oils Repair Acne\n\nKey Ingredients:\n\nFeatures: ✔ Non-drying – Keeps skin hydrated while treating breakouts. ✔ Day & Night Use – Works around the clock for fast recovery. ✔ For All Skin Types – Even sensitive skin can use it safely!\n\nCute & Discreet Designs:  Bear |  Star |  Flower |  Heart |  Butterfly |  Cloud (Blends naturally with skin, perfect for daily wear!)\n\nHow It Works: These ultra-thin patches absorb excess oil, cover blemishes, and create a smoother-looking complexion—all while protecting skin from bacteria and picking.\n\nPerfect for: ✔ Active acne | ✔ Post-pimple marks | ✔ Preventing touch-induced irritation\nLet your skin heal beautifully—with a touch of cherry blossom charm!\n\nHow to use\nStep 1. Wash your face and let your skin dry completely.\nStep 2. Peel off the patch and place it directly on the blemish.\nStep 3. Leave it on for 6-8 hours or overnight, then remove it gently. Apply a new one if needed.\n\nCautions\nFor external use only. Keep out of reach of children. Do not swallow. Do not use it on broken skin. Avoid contact with eyes. Discontinue use if signs of irritation or rash occur. Store in a cool and dry place.\n', 150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'patch', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Sakura Pimple Patch Day & Night for All Skin Types - 24 PatchesPrice in BD', 'Laikou Sakura Pimple Patch Day & Night for All Skin Types - 24 Patches Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-sakura-pimple-patch-day-night-for-all-skin-types-24-patches', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25');
