(1363, 'Vin21 + 4 Zinc Anti Acne Cream', '1', 0, 36, 335, '1363', '1363', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fast Acne Relief: Reduces inflammation and redness associated with acne.\n4 Zinc Compounds: Effectively controls excess oil, minimizes clogged pores, and prevents acne-causing bacteria.\nSoothing and Calming: Relieves irritation and soothes sensitive skin.\nLightweight Texture: Non-greasy formula that absorbs quickly without leaving a residue.\nPrevents Future Breakouts: Strengthens the skin barrier to reduce the recurrence of acne.', 440.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 310.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vin21 + 4 Zinc Anti Acne CreamPrice in BD', 'Vin21 + 4 Zinc Anti Acne Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vin21-4-zinc-anti-acne-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1364, 'Lanbena Acne Pimple Patch Daily Use - 25 Patches', '1', 0, 36, 85, '1364', '1364', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lanbena Acne Pimple Patch is made with non-toxic and completely natural ingredients that cause no harmful side effects on your skin post usage. It can be used as daily patches or during nighttime as well. The Lanbena Acne Pimple Patches come in various sizes to deal with different sizes of acne healing. It is effective in getting your face back to its natural and healthy state by effectively dealing with acne and pimples. It’s designed to be ultra-thin and has an invisible design with a strong adhesive that prevents it from falling off.\n', 200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 70.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lanbena Acne Pimple Patch Daily Use - 25 PatchesPrice in BD', 'Lanbena Acne Pimple Patch Daily Use - 25 Patches Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lanbena-acne-pimple-patch-daily-use-25-patches', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1365, 'Cerave Acne Foaming Cream Wash 10% Benzoyl Peroxide for Acne Treatment (Made in USA)  150ml', '1', 0, 36, 153, '1365', '1365', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A gentle yet effective acne wash is the first step in caring for acne-prone skin. And when choosing an acne cleanser, it’s essential to look for acne-fighting ingredients recommended by dermatologists, such as benzoyl peroxide. A benzoyl peroxide cleanser can be effective for the treatment and management of acne because of this ingredient’s ability to help clear acne pimples, whiteheads, and blackheads from the skin’s surface. Using a benzoyl peroxide face wash or body wash can also help prevent new acne from forming and allow the skin to heal.\nCeraVe is the #1 dermatologist-recommended acne brand,* and CeraVe Acne Foaming Cream Wash is our first-ever acne treatment product developed with the highest concentration of benzoyl peroxide available without a prescription. This clinically-tested 10% benzoyl peroxide acne wash with maximum OTC strength offers multiple benefits for acne-prone skin. Developed with dermatologists, CeraVe Acne Foaming Cream Wash is formulated to clear, treat, and help prevent acne pimples and blackheads on the face and body.\nOur benzoyl peroxide wash features a lightly-foaming, creamy texture that treats face and body acne without dryness or flaking. With a patent pending formula that combines benzoyl peroxide, hyaluronic acid, niacinamide, and three essential ceramides, this acne wash effectively cleanses, without disrupting the skin’s protective barrier. Skin is left feeling comfortable and smooth, and looking clarified with continuous use.\nKey Features & Benefits:\nACTIVE INGREDIENT: BENZOYL PEROXIDE 10%\nINACTIVE INGREDIENTS: WATER, GLYCERIN, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, COCAMIDOPROPYL HYDROXYSULTAINE, SODIUM C14-16 OLEFIN SULFONATE, POTASSIUM HYDROXIDE, CERAMIDE NP, CERAMIDE AP, CERAMIDE EOP, CARBOMER, NIACINAMIDE, GLYCOLIC ACID, TRIDECETH-6, TRIETHYL CITRATE, SODIUM CITRATE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SODIUM LAUROYL LACTYLATE, CHOLESTEROL, PROPANEDIOL, TETRASODIUM EDTA, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, DIETHYLHEXYL SODIUM SULFOSUCCINATE, PHYTOSPHINGOSINE, XANTHAN GUM, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, BENZOIC ACID, PEG-30 DIPOLYHYDROXYSTEARATE.', 2300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1500.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Acne Foaming Cream Wash 10% Benzoyl Peroxide for Acne Treatment (Made in USA)  150mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Acne Foaming Cream Wash 10% Benzoyl Peroxide for Acne Treatment (Made in USA)  150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-acne-foaming-cream-wash-10-benzoyl-peroxide-for-acne-treatment-made-in-usa-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
