(1367, 'MH Fresh N Fair Anti-Acne Gel 30gm', '1', 0, 36, 53, '1367', '1367', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Net Weight: 30 gm (When Packed)Neutral Code: PB/Cosmetics/103-Cos-Pb\nDM Aqua\nSalicylic Acid (2%) – Unclogs pores and treats active acne\nGlycolic Acid (1%) – Gently exfoliates and smoothens skin texture\nGlutathione (2%) – Brightens and helps reduce dark spots\nNiacinamide (2%) – Controls oil and evens out skin tone\nRetinol (0.5%) – Improves skin renewal and reduces acne scars\nZinc PCA – Balances sebum production\nArbutin – Lightens pigmentation\nDisodium EDTA – Stabilizes formula and enhances effectiveness\nFragrance\nGel Base (q.s.)\nControls excess oil and sebum\nFights blemishes and prevents breakouts\nRefines skin texture\nProvides a matte finish\nSpecially formulated for oily and acne-prone skin\nLightweight, oil-free gel\nWash your face and acne-affected areas (neck, chest, back, etc.) with a mild cleanser or face wash\nPat dry with a clean towel\nApply a sufficient amount of Fresh N Fair Anti Acne Gel evenly over the entire face and acne-prone areas\nGently rub in circular motions for better absorption\nFor day use, follow up with a broad-spectrum sunscreen of at least SPF-30\nStore below 25°C\nKeep away from direct sunlight\nDo not freeze\nKeep out of reach of children\nClose the tube tightly after use\nUse within 60 days of opening\nNot recommended during pregnancy, lactation, or for children under 3 years\nDiscontinue use if irritation or rash occurs', 1035.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 55.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'MH Fresh N Fair Anti-Acne Gel 30gmPrice in BD', 'MH Fresh N Fair Anti-Acne Gel 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mh-fresh-n-fair-anti-acne-gel-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1368, 'Laoshiya Acne Scar Gel Cream - 35ml', '1', 0, 36, 336, '1368', '1368', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reduce the look of post-acne marks and uneven tone with Laoshiya Acne Scar Gel Cream, a lightweight gel-cream designed to help improve the appearance of acne scars, dark spots, and hyperpigmentation. With regular use, it helps support the skin’s natural healing and remodeling process—leaving skin feeling softer, smoother, and more even-looking over time.\nThis scar-care formula is enriched with skin-conditioning ingredients such as Aloe Vera, Oat Beta-Glucan, Sodium Hyaluronate, and Trehalose to help hydrate and comfort skin, along with Dipotassium Glycyrrhizinate (Licorice derivative) to support soothing care. Its gel texture absorbs easily and is suitable for targeted use on problem areas.\nHelps reduce the appearance of acne scars and post-acne marks\nHelps fade the look of hyperpigmentation and dark spots\nSupports skin’s natural healing process for a more even tone\nLeaves skin feeling softer and smoother\nLightweight gel-cream texture for easy daily use\nAfter cleansing, apply to acne scars, dark spots, hyperpigmentation, or other marked areas 1–2 times daily (or as needed). For best results, use continuously.\nGlycerin, Nicotine, Poly Methyl Glycerol, Xanthan Gum, Aloe Vera, Menthol, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizinate, Oat Beta-Glucan, Sodium Hyaluronate, Trehalose, Hydrogenated Starch Hydrolyzate, Oligopeptide-1, Methyl Hydroxypropionate, Flavor Butyl Carbamate, Propylene Glycol, Dimethylol Imidazolidinyl Urea, Tea Extract.\nSize: 35ml', 522.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 28.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laoshiya Acne Scar Gel Cream - 35mlPrice in BD', 'Laoshiya Acne Scar Gel Cream - 35ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laoshiya-acne-scar-gel-cream-35ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
