(1372, 'Maya All Natural Spanish Rosehip Seed Oil 30ml', '1', 0, 36, 187, '1372', '1372', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Spanish Rosehip Seed Oil, derived from the seeds of wild rose bushes native to Spain, is acherished beauty secret treasured for its exceptional qualities. MAYA All Natural SpanishRosehip Seed Oil is 100% Cold-Pressed, Virgin &amp; Organic, meticulously processed to maintainits purity and potency. This premium fixed oil is free from water, silicone, gluten, and artificialfragrance. It is also enriched with vitamins, antioxidants, and essential fatty acids. Each drop ofMAYA Rosehip Seed oil is a signature of authenticity and purity which epitomizes nature’sexcellence.\nSome of the key benefits of MAYA All Natural Spanish Rosehip Seed Oil are:* Reduces Acne Spots, Scars, Stretch Marks, and Wrinkles.* Balances uneven skin tone.* Provides deep hydration to the skin and naturally brightens skin complexion.* Helps in the treatment of Melasma and Hyperpigmentation.* Works as a natural makeup remover.* Protects from sun damage and reduces inflammation.* Useful for regenerating and revitalizing skin.* Improves skin elasticity and promotes supple, radiant-looking skin.Embrace MAYA All Natural Spanish Rosehip Seed Oil’s lasting benefits as a daily essential forskin and hair that radiate health and vitality.', 650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Maya All Natural Spanish Rosehip Seed Oil 30mlPrice in BD', 'Maya All Natural Spanish Rosehip Seed Oil 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'maya-all-natural-spanish-rosehip-seed-oil-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1373, 'Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Cream - 20g', '1', 0, 36, 69, '1373', '1373', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Cream – 20g\nBIOAQUA Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Cream Moisturizing Lighten Acne Marks Repairing Shrinking Pores Acne Cream 20g\nProduct Efficacy:Specially Designed To Remove Acne, Nourish And Repair Rough Acne Muscles,Remove Skin Blackheads And Acne, Fine Pores, Tender Skin, Make Skin Even, Tender And Smooth.\nHow to use:After cleansing, take an appropriate amount of this product and apply it evenly on the face, massage gently until absorbed.\nRemarks:-As everyones skin type is different, it is recommended testing it at skin behind your ear-If irritation, skin hurts, injury or skin rashes develop, please do not use it and consult doctor.-Stop using it immediately and seek help from a dermatologist in case of any allergic reactions.-If the product accidentally splashes into eyes, rinse your eyes immediately.', 160.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '20g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 190.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Cream - 20gPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Cream - 20g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-salicylic-acid-acne-removal-cream-20g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1374, 'Cerave Acne Control Gel 2% Salicylic Acid Acne Treatment with AHA & BHA', '1', 0, 36, 153, '1374', '1374', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Target acne and achieve clearer, healthier skin with CeraVe Acne Control Gel, a powerful yet gentle treatment designed to refine pores, smooth texture, and prevent breakouts. Formulated with dermatologist-recommended ingredients, this lightweight gel combines 2% Salicylic Acid, AHA, and BHA to effectively treat acne and promote radiant skin.\nAll skin types, especially oily and acne-prone skin.\nTake control of your acne with CeraVe Acne Control Gel, the ultimate solution for smooth, blemish-free skin.', 2747.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 803.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Acne Control Gel 2% Salicylic Acid Acne Treatment with AHA & BHAPrice in BD', 'Cerave Acne Control Gel 2% Salicylic Acid Acne Treatment with AHA & BHA Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-acne-control-gel-2-salicylic-acid-acne-treatment-with-aha-bha', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
(1375, 'Medisalic Ointment 20gm', '1', 0, 36, 337, '1375', '1375', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Topical steroids control the biosynthesis of potent mediators of inflammation such as prostaglandins and leukotrienes by inhibiting the release of their common precursor, arachidonic acid. Corticosteroids are also thought to act by the induction of phospholipase A2 inhibitory proteins. Topical salicylic acid has keratolytic properties as well as bacteriostatic and fungicidal actions.', 168.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 22.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medisalic Ointment 20gmPrice in BD', 'Medisalic Ointment 20gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medisalic-ointment-20gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:25'),
