(1379, 'Cerave Blemish Control Gel with AHA & BHA', '1', 0, 36, 153, '1379', '1379', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Developed with Dermatologists, CeraVe Blemish Control Gel is a lightweight, hydrating full-face AHA/BHA gel that helps target blemishes and helps prevent future breakouts, while minimising the appearance of pores without over-drying the skin. Formulated with 3 essential ceramides to help support the skin moisture barrier and niacinamide to help comfort skin. Recommended for use once per day in the evening, this salicylic acid enriched gel formula with a effective blend of AHA and BHA is oil-free and free of drying alcohol, leaving skin looking more radiant, smooth and visibly clearer after 3 days.\n\nKey Benefits:\nAHA/BHA Exfoliant for Face: Formulated as a salicylic acid enriched gel for blackheads, the beta-hydroxy acid (BHA) works to help target blemishes and help prevent future breakouts, and alpha hydroxy acids (AHA), a blend of Lactic and Glycolic Acids, help smooth and soften skin.Pore Minimiser: Helps to minimise the appearance of pores & visibly reduce blackheads. Also formulated with Niacinamide, this gel for acne-prone skin works to comfort the skin, while Hyaluronic Acid helps to support the skin moisture barrier.Denatured Alcohol-Free: Gentle, paraben-free, and fragrance-free skin care to avoid potential irritation on sensitive skin. Formulated without drying alcohols like denatured alcohol, which can cause over dryness.3 Essential Ceramides: Found naturally in the skin and make up 50% of the lipids in the skin moisture barrier. All CeraVe products are formulated with three essential ceramides.\n\nType of Skin:\nThe CeraVe Blemish Control Gel is formulated for oily skin prone to mild acne. Target blemishes and visibly reduce the appearance of pores and blackheads for efficacious results.\n\nAreas of Concern:\nThis CeraVe salicylic acidenriched gel for blackheads targets and visibly improves the appearance of pores and blemishes for smoother and clearer-looking skin.\n\nKey Ingredients:\n\nHow to Use:\nThis effective AHA/BHA gel for acne-prone skin can be used morning and/or night.1.Cleanse the skin thoroughly before applying with the CeraVe Blemish Control Gel.2.Cover the entire face with a thin layer of the gel one to three times daily, avoiding the eye area and lips.3.Sun sensitivity can increase while using this product. Please apply CeraVe AM Facial Moisturising Lotion with SPF 15 and your preferred broad-spectrum SPF 50 sun protection during the day on top of the CeraVe Blemish Control Salicylic Acid Gel.\n\nResults\nMore luminous, smoother and noticeably cleaner skin after 3 days of use.\n\nAfter cleansing the skin with CeraVe Blemish Control Cleanser, apply a thin layer of CeraVe Blemish Control Gel in the evening, all over the face, with gentle circular movements. Avoid the eye contour. This product may increase sun sensitivity, so it is recommended to apply CeraVe Moisturizing Facial Lotion with SPF25 during the day.', 1645.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1455.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Blemish Control Gel with AHA & BHAPrice in BD', 'Cerave Blemish Control Gel with AHA & BHA Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-blemish-control-gel-with-aha-bha', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:25', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1380, 'Neutrogena On-The-Spot Acne Treatment', '1', 0, 36, 151, '1380', '1380', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Some acne spot treatments contain high doses of the acne medication Benzoyl Peroxide, which can irritate skin. It can also cause redness and dryness, which can make acne worse. Our formula contains just 2.5% Benzoyl Peroxide, yet is clinically proven to be so effective that skin starts getting clearer on day 1 – all without over-drying, stinging or burning skin.\nThis fast acting acne spot treatment is so lightweight that it quickly absorbs into skin. And it goes deep down to the pores to kill acne bacteria that cause pimples and helps to prevent new ones from forming.', 1899.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 841.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena On-The-Spot Acne TreatmentPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena On-The-Spot Acne Treatment Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-on-the-spot-acne-treatment', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
