(1382, 'DryNil Hydra 100gm', '1', 0, 36, 138, '1382', '1382', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'DryNil Hydra Cream (100gm)\nProduct Description:Dry Nil Hydra Cream is specially formulated to provide intense hydration and care for dry and sensitive skin. Its unique blend of moisturizing agents works to restore skin\'s natural moisture barrier, leaving it soft, smooth, and nourished. Perfect for daily use, it soothes dryness and prevents further irritation, making it ideal for individuals with extremely dry or sensitive skin.', 1140.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 60.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'DryNil Hydra 100gmPrice in BD', 'DryNil Hydra 100gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'drynil-hydra-100gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1383, 'Cosrx Acne Pimple Master Patch 24\'s Pack', '1', 0, 36, 31, '1383', '1383', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosrx Acne Pimple Master Patch 24\'s Pack\nCosrx Acne Pimple Master Patch is a hydrocolloid patch designed to protect and heal acne-prone areas while maintaining the skin’s natural humidity. Each patch acts as a barrier against bacteria, accelerates healing, and helps flatten pimples overnight without causing dryness or irritation. The pack includes 24 patches in three sizes (S, M, L) to cover multiple spots effectively.\n\nBenefits:• Absorbs & Extracts Impurities – Hydrocolloid material draws out pus and debris from pimples.• Faster Healing – Creates a moist environment that promotes quicker recovery of acne.• Prevents Scarring – Protects the area from picking, squeezing, and bacterial infection.• Hygienic & Easy to Use – Sterilized packaging and resealable pouch ensure safe application.• Long-Lasting Adhesion – Stays on through washing or showering for continuous treatment.\n\nHow to Use:\nCleanse and dry the area around the blemish.\nSelect a patch slightly larger than the pimple.\nApply the patch directly to the spot and leave overnight or until it turns white.\n\nIngredients: Cellulose Gum, Styrene Isoprene Styrene Block Copolymer, Polyisobutylene, Petroleum Resin, Polyurethane Film, Liquid Paraffin, Tetrakis Methane\n\nQuantity: 24 patches (S:10, M:5, L:9)Country of Origin: Korea\nThis patch is perfect for anyone looking for a pain-free, hygienic, and fast solution to acne without causing scarring or dryness.', 299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pc', 0.00, 1, NULL, 221.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Acne Pimple Master Patch 24\'s PackPrice in BD', 'Cosrx Acne Pimple Master Patch 24\'s Pack Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-acne-pimple-master-patch-24s-pack', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
