(1385, 'DIFFERIN Adapalene 0.1% Acne Treatment Gel 45g', '1', 0, 36, 242, '1385', '1385', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'DIFFERIN® Adapalene Gel 0.1% is a dermatologist-developed, FDA-approved topical retinoid designed for the effective treatment of acne. Previously available only by prescription, this once-daily gel works deep within the skin to help clear existing acne and prevent new breakouts.\nFormulated with adapalene 0.1%, a clinically proven retinoid, DIFFERIN® targets the root causes of acne by regulating skin cell turnover and reducing inflammation. With consistent use, visible improvement may be seen in as little as a few weeks, with optimal results typically achieved within 3 months.\nThe oil-free, fragrance-free formula is suitable for daily use and is designed to be gentle yet effective. It comes in a convenient easy-pump packaging for controlled, hygienic dispensing.\nKey Features:\nActive Ingredient: Adapalene 0.1% (Retinoid)\nAcne treatment for adults and children 12 years and older\nOnce-daily use\nOil-free and fragrance-free\nDermatologist developed and tested\nFDA approved\nEasy-pump packaging for convenient application\nUsage:Apply a thin layer once daily to clean, dry skin over the entire affected area, as directed. Avoid contact with eyes, lips, and mouth.\nManufactured in Canada', 4620.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1980.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'DIFFERIN Adapalene 0.1% Acne Treatment Gel 45gPrice in BD', 'DIFFERIN Adapalene 0.1% Acne Treatment Gel 45g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'differin-adapalene-01-acne-treatment-gel-45g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
