(1387, 'Panoxyl Acne Treatment Bar 10% Benzoyl Peroxide for Face & Body 113g', '1', 0, 36, 326, '1387', '1387', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The PanOxyl Acne Treatment Bar is a powerful, soap-free cleansing bar formulated with 10% benzoyl peroxide—the highest over-the-counter concentration available without a prescription. Designed for both face and body, it effectively targets acne-causing bacteria, unclogs pores, and helps prevent new breakouts.\nKey Features:\nMaximum Strength Formula: Contains 10% benzoyl peroxide to treat tough acne.\nDual Use: Suitable for use on the face, chest, and back.\nSoap-Free & pH-Balanced: Gentle on the skin while providing deep cleansing.\nVegan & Free from Fragrances and Dyes: Ideal for sensitive skin types.\nUsage Instructions:\nWet the affected area with lukewarm water.\nLather the bar in your hands and apply the foam to the skin.\nLeave the foam on the skin for 1–2 minutes.\nRinse thoroughly and pat dry.\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nIf irritation or excessive dryness occurs, reduce application frequency.', 1575.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 675.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Panoxyl Acne Treatment Bar 10% Benzoyl Peroxide for Face & Body 113gPrice in BD', 'Panoxyl Acne Treatment Bar 10% Benzoyl Peroxide for Face & Body 113g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'panoxyl-acne-treatment-bar-10-benzoyl-peroxide-for-face-body-113g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1388, 'Glyco-12 Cream 30gm', '1', 0, 36, 296, '1388', '1388', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nGlyco 6 Cream is a highly effective skincare solution known for its potent 6% glycolic acid formulation. This cream is designed to tackle a variety of skin concerns, including acne, hyperpigmentation, melasma, and photoaging. It offers ultra-hydrating benefits while being non-irritating, making it suitable for different skin types, including sensitive skin. With its skin-renewing properties, Glyco 6 Cream increases skin cell turnover, thereby reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\n\n\n\n\nGlyco 6 Cream works by increasing the turnover rate of epithelial cells, the cells that line the surface of the skin. This process encourages skin peeling and the treatment of comedones (small bumps caused by acne). The cream’s action also involves killing bacteria, reducing inflammation, and unplugging blocked pores. When applied, Glyco 6 Cream decomposes to release oxygen, which acts as a bactericidal agent against Propionibacterium acnes, the bacteria responsible for acne.\n\n\nGlyco 6 Cream is primarily used to treat:\n\n\n\nGlyco 6 Cream is for external use only. To use it effectively, follow these steps:\n\nDo not use Glyco 6 Cream if you are allergic to any of its ingredients. Let your doctor know if you have contact dermatitis, liver, kidney, gastrointestinal, or heart diseases. Please inform your doctor if you are using any other medications, including vitamins, before starting Glyco 6 Cream. Glyco 6 Cream can make the skin more sensitive to the sunlight; hence always use sunscreen and protective clothing before you step outdoors. It is recommended to avoid tanning booths and sunlamps. Do not apply Glyco 6 Cream on irritated and sunburned skin. Care should be taken while using Glyco 6 Cream on sensitive areas, such as the neck. Let your doctor know if you are pregnant, planning to conceive, or are a breastfeeding mother.\n\nStorage InstructionsStore Glyco 6 Cream in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Ensure that the lid is tightly closed after each use to maintain the cream’s efficacy.  If you do not notice any improvement after 4-6 weeks of using Glyco 6 Cream, consult your dermatologist for further advice.', 863.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 87.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Glyco-12 Cream 30gmPrice in BD', 'Glyco-12 Cream 30gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'glyco-12-cream-30gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1389, 'Cdzole Lotion 50ml', '1', 0, 36, 278, '1389', '1389', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OverviewCdzole Lotion is a topical antifungal formulation combining luliconazole and salicylic acid—a potent duo designed to eliminate fungal infections while enhancing skin healing.\nBroad‑Spectrum Antifungal Action: Luliconazole targets fungal cell production, disrupting ergosterol synthesis to effectively eliminate pathogens such as those responsible for ringworm, athlete\'s foot, and jock itch.\nKeratolytic Support: Salicylic acid acts as an exfoliant, softening and removing dead skin cells to accelerate product absorption and relieve scaling and thickened skin.Dual Action for Faster Relief: Together, these ingredients reduce itching, redness, and irritation while promoting faster recovery.\nClean and dry the affected area thoroughly.\nApply a thin layer of Cdzole Lotion once or twice daily, or as advised by your healthcare provider.\nWash your hands before and after application unless your hands are being treated.\nAvoid contact with eyes, nose, mouth, or other mucous membranes—rinse immediately if contact occurs.\nExternal Use Only. For topical application; not for internal use.\nAllergy Warning. Do not use if you have known sensitivities to luliconazole, salicylic acid, or any lotion components.\nConsult Before Use. Particularly important for pregnant or breastfeeding individuals, and children—use only under medical advice.\nMild skin reactions such as redness, swelling, irritation, or burning sensation may occur where applied. These effects are usually temporary. If they persist or worsen, stop use and consult a healthcare professional.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nEnsure the container cap is tightly closed after each use.', 1045.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 5.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cdzole Lotion 50mlPrice in BD', 'Cdzole Lotion 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cdzole-lotion-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
