(1391, 'Bioderma Sebium Kerato+ Anti Blemish High Tolerance Gel-Cream for Acne-Prone Skin 30ml', '1', 0, 36, 227, '1391', '1391', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For Acne-Prone Skin | Clinically Proven Formula\nBioderma Sébium Kerato+ is an advanced anti-blemish gel-cream specially formulated for acne-prone skin. Developed through Bioderma’s dermatological research, it features an innovative duo of keratolytic active ingredients that effectively target pimples and blackheads while maintaining high skin tolerance and comfort.\nIts unique combination of salicylic acid and malic acid ester helps unclog pores, accelerate epidermal renewal, and reduce the risk of post-acne marks. Enriched with the patented FLUIDACTIV™ technology, it biologically normalizes sebum quality to help prevent the formation of new imperfections.\nRapidly reduces pimples and blackheads\nHelps prevent post-acne marks\nImproves skin texture and clarity\nMattifies skin while providing 8-hour hydration\nNon-greasy, non-sticky texture\nHigh tolerance formula suitable for sensitive, acne-prone skin\nExcellent makeup base\nKeratolytic Duo (Salicylic Acid + Malic Acid Ester): Unclogs pores and promotes skin renewal\nFLUIDACTIV™ Patent: Regulates sebum quality to prevent new blemishes\nDAF™ (Dermatological Advanced Formulation): Enhances skin tolerance and comfort\nImmediately hydrates and mattifies the skin\nDay after day, blemishes and marks are visibly reduced\nSkin becomes clearer, smoother, and more even-looking\nLong-lasting improvement with regular use\nApply morning and/or evening to cleansed, dry skin\nUse on the entire face or only on problem areas\nCan be used at the first signs of spot formation\nSuitable for adults and adolescents\nIn case of sun exposure, apply an appropriate sunscreen\nTexture: Lightweight gel-cream | Non-comedogenicSkin Type: Acne-prone skinBSTI Approved', 2850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 