(1392, 'VALCO ACNE CLEAR (Facial Foam) 50gm', '1', 0, 36, 324, '1392', '1392', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Effectively combat acne and maintain clear, healthy skin with VALCO ACNE CLEAR Facial Foam. Specially formulated for acne-prone skin, this gentle cleansing foam removes excess oil, dirt, and impurities while targeting pimples and preventing future breakouts. Enriched with antioxidants, vitamin E, alpha arbutin, and fruit extracts, it also helps brighten skin and reduce inflammation, leaving your face feeling clean, refreshed, and smooth.\nFights Acne & Pimples: Benzoyl peroxide, triclosan, and triclocarban target bacteria and prevent breakouts.\nDeep Cleansing: Removes dirt, oil, and impurities effectively.\nSoothes & Brightens Skin: Alpha arbutin, vitamin E, ascorbic acid, and fruit extracts nourish and protect the skin.\nBalances Oil & Hydrates: Glycerin and fatty acids help maintain skin moisture.\nDaily Use: Gentle enough for morning and evening cleansing.\nWater: Base for cleansing foam.\nBenzoyl Peroxide: Active anti-acne agent that kills acne-causing bacteria.\nStearic Acid, Palmitic Acid, Lauric Acid, Capric Acid: Fatty acids that cleanse and maintain skin texture.\nGlycerin: Moisturizes and prevents dryness.\nPotassium Hydroxide, Sodium Laureth Sulfate: Cleansing and lathering agents.\nAscorbic Acid (Vitamin C), Vitamin E: Antioxidants that protect and brighten skin.\nAlpha Arbutin: Reduces pigmentation and evens skin tone.\nTriclosan & Triclocarban: Antibacterial agents to prevent acne.\nChromium Oxide & Fruit Extracts: Provide mild soothing, protection, and nourishment.\nWet face with water.\nApply a small amount of foam and massage gently over the face.\nRinse thoroughly with water.\nUse morning and evening for optimal results.\nSize: 50 g\nForm: Facial cleansing foam\nSkin Type: Acne-prone or oily skin\nFinish: Clean, balanced, refreshed, and healthy-looking skin\nKey Features: Anti-acne, antibacterial, oil-balancing, antioxidant-rich, gentle daily cleansin