(1393, 'Acne Rid Sensitive Foaming Gel 150ml', '1', 0, 36, 74, '1393', '1393', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purifying cleansing gel for combination/oily sensitive skin prone to acne (Inflammatory Acne)\nApply morning and evening all over face and neck. Massage gently then rinse. It Can be used on localized areas of the body (chest and back)', 1425.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Acne Rid Sensitive Foaming Gel 150mlPrice in BD', 'Acne Rid Sensitive Foaming Gel 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acne-rid-sensitive-foaming-gel-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1394, 'Salcura Anitac Acne Clearing Lotion 60ml', '1', 0, 36, 340, '1394', '1394', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Totally free from:\nSteroids\nHormones\nCortisones\nPeroxides\nParabens\nAntibiotics\nNot tested on animals\nWho can use this product?\nSuitable for adults and children over 3 years.\nVegan and vegetarian-friendly.\nFree from gluten, nuts, soya, and dairy.\nSafe for use during pregnancy and breastfeeding.\nActive Ingredient:\nSalicylic Acid 0.5% – Acne Treatment\nPurpose:\nFor the treatment of acne\nHelps clear acne blemishes, pimples, blackheads, and whiteheads\nFor external use only.\nSkin irritation and dryness are more likely if used with another topical acne medication at the same time. If irritation occurs, use only one product.\nNot for use on children under 3 years old.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nIf swallowed, seek medical help or contact a Poison Control Center immediately.\nCleanse skin thoroughly before applying.\nApply a thin layer to the affected area 1–2 times daily.\nTo reduce dryness, start with one application every other day, then increase as needed.\nIf excessive dryness or peeling occurs, reduce usage to once every few days.\nSensitivity Test for New Users:\nApply to one or two small affected areas during the first 3 days.\nIf no discomfort occurs, continue as directed above.\nPurified Water (Aqua), Alcohol Denat, Vegetable Glycerin, Sunflower Seed Oil, Glyceryl Cocoate, Hydrogenated Coconut Oil, Safflower Seed Oil, Sodium Cetearyl Sulfate, Cetearyl Glucoside, Cetearyl Alcohol, Grape Seed Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Salicylic Acid, Sea Buckthorn Kernel Extract, Rosemary Leaf Extract, Propylene Glycol, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Trideceth-9, Sandalwood Oil, Tea Tree Leaf Oil, Ceteareth-25, Orange Peel Oil, Dead Sea Salt, Eucalyptus Leaf Oil, Manuka Oil, Lavender Oil, Olive Fruit Oil, Sweet Almond Oil, Peppermint Oil, Aloe Vera Leaf Juice Powder, Bitter Orange Flower Oil, Limonene, Linalool, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Benzoate.\nPure & Natural – Suitable for all skin types, contains no hydrogen peroxide or harmful artificial ingredients.\nFast-Absorbing Lotion – Penetrates the skin quickly for effective results.\nMulti-Action Anti-Bacterial Formula – Targets acne and blemishes for maximum results.\nManufactured in the UK', 1320.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Salcura Anitac Acne Clearing Lotion 60mlPrice in BD', 'Salcura Anitac Acne Clearing Lotion 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'salcura-anitac-acne-clearing-lotion-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26');
