(1402, 'Sam Acne Aid Bar 100g', '1', 0, 36, 59, '1402', '1402', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SAM Acne Aid Bar is a meticulously handcrafted acne cleanser designed to promote clearer and more vibrant skin. With its precision-crafted Tri Active Formula, the bar combines Tea Tree Oil, Salicylic Acid, and Niacinamide to target acne holistically—controlling oil, exfoliating pores, and soothing inflamed skin. Proudly made in Bangladesh, this anti-acne bar is ideal for oily and acne-prone skin.\nAqua, Stearic Acid, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Lye, Clove Bud Oil, Myristic Acid, Propylene Glycol, Tea Tree Oil, Green Tea Extract, Strawberry Extract, Salicylic Acid, Niacinamide.', 599.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bar', 0.00, 1, NULL, -599.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sam Acne Aid Bar 100gPrice in BD', 'Sam Acne Aid Bar 100g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sam-acne-aid-bar-100g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
