(1409, 'Bioderma Pigmentbio C-Concentrate 15ml', '1', 0, 38, 200, '1409', '1409', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bioderma Pigmentbio C Concentrate pigment corrective care acts on the formation of brown spots. It reduces inflammation linked to hyperpigmentation and improves cell renewal in the epidermis. Your complexion is luminous and even.\n\nUsage tipsDuring your first use, press hard on the cap to release the vitamin C. Then unscrew it and check if the vitamin C powder has been released. All you have to do is screw on the dropper and shake for a few seconds.\nOn cleansed face, apply every night for a month, five drops of product on your face and neck, taking care to avoid the eye area. It is normal to feel tingling sensations linked to the action of the treatment, they will disappear very quickly. If these sensations persist, stop using them and consult a dermatologist. Prolonged exposure to the sun during the treatment is not recommended.\n\nCompositionINCI Formula: Aqua / Water / Eau, Propanediol, Glycolic Acid, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Propylheptyl Caprylate, Sodium Hydroxide, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Niacinamide, Salicylic Acid, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate / Vp Copolymer, Sorbitan Sesquiolate Glycol, Pentylene , Sodium Citrate, Lysine, Azelaic Acid, Mannitol, Xylitol, Sodium Metabisulfite, Andrographis Paniculata Leaf Extract, Rhamnose, Saccharide Isomerate, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Tocopherol, Fructooligosaccharides, Caprylic / Capric Triglyceride, Triglyceride Fragrance, )\n\nScented formulaNon-comedogenic\n\nNote:To maintain good results all year long, renew the 1 month cure every 3 months', 4275.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 225.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Pigmentbio C-Concentrate 15mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Pigmentbio C-Concentrate 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-pigmentbio-c-concentrate-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0,