(1415, 'CISDERMA Reticis Skin Renewing Retinol Cream with Hyaluronic Acid – 50 g', '1', 0, 38, 39, '1415', '1415', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CISDERMA Reticis Skin Renewing Cream is an advanced anti-aging treatment designed to rejuvenate the skin through a powerful blend of retinol, vitamins, growth factors, and hyaluronic acid. Formulated to support skin renewal, hydration, and radiance, it targets fine lines, wrinkles, dark spots, and uneven texture while helping to strengthen the skin’s protective barrier.\nThis cream combines Retinol (Vitamin A), Vitamin C, Vitamin K1, plant-derived TGF-β2 growth factors, and a ceramide complex to deliver multi-dimensional anti-aging benefits for a smoother, firmer, and brighter complexion.\nAnti-Aging: Reduces the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and age spots\nSkin Renewal: Accelerates cell turnover and collagen production for smoother, firmer skin\nRestores Radiance: Brightens uneven skin tone and diminishes discoloration, including dark circles\nBarrier Support: Strengthens the skin’s hydrolipid barrier to improve hydration and prevent moisture loss\nDeep Hydration: Hyaluronic acid and ceramides lock in moisture for a plump, soft texture\nRetinol (Vitamin A): Microencapsulated for stability and enhanced penetration; promotes cell turnover and collagen synthesis\nVitamin C: Brightens skin and provides antioxidant protection\nVitamin K1: Helps reduce dark circles and visible veins\nPlant TGF-β2 Growth Factor: Supports skin regeneration, firming, and smoothing\nCeramide Complex: Restores the skin’s protective barrier and counteracts aging\nHyaluronic Acid: Provides lasting hydration and plumps the skin\nCleanse: Wash your face with a mild cleanser and pat dry. Wait 20–30 minutes before application to minimize irritation.\nApply: Smooth a thin, pea-sized layer evenly over the face and neck, avoiding eyes, nostrils, and mouth.\nFrequency: Start every third night and gradually increase to nightly use as your skin builds tolerance.\nSun Protection: Apply broad-spectrum SPF 30+ every morning; retinol increases sun sensitivity.\nInitial redness, mild burning, stinging, or warmth\nTemporary acne flare (“retinoid purge”) in the first 4–6 weeks\nDryness or peeling as skin adjusts to accelerated cell turnover\nIncreased photosensitivity\nNote: Discontinue use and consult a healthcare professional if severe irritation, blistering, or swelling occurs. Not recommended during pregnancy or breastfeeding.\n50 g / 1.76 fl. oz', 1501.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 79.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'CISDERMA Reticis Skin Renewing Retinol Cream with Hyaluronic Acid – 50 gPrice in BD', 'CISDERMA Reticis Skin Renewing Retinol Cream with Hyaluronic Acid – 50 g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cisderma-reticis-skin-renewing-retinol-cream-with-hyaluronic-acid-50-g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1416, 'Vin21 + Collagen Anti Melasma Care Cream 15ml', '1', 0, 38, 335, '1416', '1416', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vin21 Anti Melasma Cream is designed to reduce melasma, hyperpigmentation, and dark spots, while also helping to fade acne scars, freckles, and blemishes. Its lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs quickly into the skin, leaving it feeling fresh and smooth. This cream promotes a more youthful, radiant appearance and helps maintain balanced moisture levels for a softer, silkier complexion. This cream offers a promising option if you’re seeking a solution to diminish melasma and enhance your overall skin tone. However, consult your doctor before starting any new skincare regimen, especially if you’re pregnant or breastfeeding.', 440.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 260.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vin21 + Collagen Anti Melasma Care Cream 15mlPrice in BD', 'Vin21 + Collagen Anti Melasma Care Cream 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vin21-collagen-anti-melasma-care-cream-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1417, 'Cerave Resurfacing Retinol Serum for Skin Barrier & Skin Smoothness 30ml', '1', 0, 38, 153, '1417', '1417', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Acne marks & uneven skin tone can be constant reminders of breakouts, even after your acne is under control. An effective way to reduce the appearance of acne marks (also called post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation) & visible pores is by using a gentle, yet effective resurfacing serum that works to refine your skin without compromising its protective barrier.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Resurfacing Retinol Serum helps smooth your skin\'s texture by reducing the appearance of post-acne marks, minimizing the look of pores & improving your skin’s surface. Our formula contains encapsulated retinol to help resurface your skin, plus licorice root extract to help brighten your skin’s appearance. In addition, it\'s formulated with 3 essential ceramides that work together to lock in skins moisture & help restore your skin’s protective barrier, along with soothing niacinamide. MVE technology encapsulates ceramides to ensure efficient delivery within the skin’s barrier & slow release over time. Supporting your protective skin barrier, long after you’ve finish applying. Lightweight & fast-absorbing, our resurfacing serum helps restore your even skin tone & promote a healthy-looking complexion.', 3030.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 870.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Resurfacing Retinol Serum for Skin Barrier & Skin Smoothness 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Resurfacing Retinol Serum for Skin Barrier & Skin Smoothness 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-resurfacing-retinol-serum-for-skin-barrier-skin-smoothness-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1418, 'Bioderminy Cellular Plus+ 1% Retinol Serum 30ml – Vitamin A & E Enriched', '1', 0, 38, 343, '1418', '1418', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bioderminy Cellular Plus+ Retinol Serum is a powerful anti-aging treatment designed to target fine lines, wrinkles, dark spots, and dull, uneven skin. With 1% Retinol and enriched with Vitamins A and E, this serum works to refresh, renew, and rejuvenate the skin, promoting a smoother, firmer, and more radiant complexion.\nThis fast-absorbing formula exfoliates the top layer of the skin, improving texture and promoting cell renewal while supporting collagen production. Regular use helps reduce the appearance of age spots and lines, giving skin a youthful, revitalized look. Suitable for daily use on all skin types.\nReduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\nHelps fade dark spots and hyperpigmentation\nImproves skin texture and firmness\nPromotes collagen production for youthful, plump skin\nVitamin A & E enriched for antioxidant protection and skin repair\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, and dermatologically tested\nApply 2–3 drops to the face and neck every morning and evening.\nGently massage the serum into the skin until fully absorbed.\nAvoid direct contact with eyes; rinse thoroughly if contact occurs.\nDiscontinue use if redness or irritation occurs.\nFor external use only\nAvoid eye contact\nKeep out of reach of children\nAqua, Glycerin, Glycereth-26, Phenethyl Alcohol, PEG-7 Olivate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Triethanolamine, Carbomer, Citric Acid, Tocopheryl Acetate, Honey, Disodium EDTA, Cetearyl Alcohol, Polysorbate 20, Retinol, Polysorbate 80, BHT, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin\nNet Weight: 30ml / 1 fl. oz.\n1% Retinol with Vitamins A & E\nDermatologically tested and suitable for all skin types', 2840.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderminy Cellular Plus+ 1% Retinol Serum 30ml – Vitamin A & E E