(1419, 'Neutrogena Rapid Wrinkle Repair Retinol Serum', '1', 0, 38, 151, '1419', '1419', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BENEFITS\nNow you can get smoother skin and visible results in just one week with our award-winning Rapid Wrinkle Repair® Anti-Wrinkle Serum. By combining Retinol SA, Glucose Complex and Hyaluronic Acid, our lightweight serum moisturizes and renews the look of skin throughout the day, helping diminish the look of fine lines, wrinkles and age spots.\n\nThe Neutrogena® approach to aging skin is simple: We’re not anti-aging, we’re anti-wrinkles™. We\'re about celebrating the beauty of aging with healthy, hydrated, even-looking skin.Visibly younger looking skin in just 1 week\n\nINGREDIENTS\nWater, Dimethicone, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Vp Copolymer, Trisiloxane, Nylon-12, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Glycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Polyacrylamide, Xanthan Gum, Fragrance, C13-14 Isoparaffin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Lactate, Hydrolyzed Myrtus Communis Leaf Extract, Sodium Hydroxide, Bht, Disodium Edta, Polysorbate 20, Laureth-7, Retinol, Sodium Pca, Sorbitol, Proline, Hinokitiol, Mica, Titanium Dioxide.\n\nHOW TO USE\n\nMade in France', 2739.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 701.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Rapid Wrinkle Repair Retinol SerumPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Rapid Wrinkle Repair Retinol Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-rapid-wrinkle-repair-retinol-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1420, 'Cos De Baha RS Retinol 2.5 Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 38, 36, '1420', '1420', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Features:\nCountry of Origin: Korea\nSpecification:\nIngredients:\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract(hydration/skin replenishing/Vegetable), (hydration, Non GMO Corn),Retinol(skin-restoring, anti-wrinkles), Sodium Hyaluronate(hydration/skin replenishing), niacinamide(vitamin B3, skin-restoring ), 1,2-Hexanediol(Prevent oxidation), Polysorbate 20(texture enhancer), Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E), *Rosa Damascena Ext,*Lavandula Angustifolia Flower Ext,*Camellia Sinensis Leaf Ext,*Melissa Officinalis Leaf Ext,*Artemisia Vulgaris Ext, Disodium EDTA *Mark: Organic Ingredients. Organic 50%\nWarnings:\nPlease note that all serums can sometimes create irritations for people with very sensitive skin or uncommon allergies. Always test the product on a small area before using it, ideally behind an ear or under the chin. Allow 24 hours to measure skin sensitivity to the product.', 1095.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 305.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De Baha RS Retinol 2.5 Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Cos De Baha RS Retinol 2.5 Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-rs-retinol-25-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1421, 'Neutrogena Rapid Tone Repair Retinol With Vitamin C Dark Spot Corrector', '1', 0, 38, 151, '1421', '1421', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Use this targeted dark spot corrector face serum to help fight stubborn dark spots. Formulated with retinol and vitamin C, this dark spot corrector improves the look of dark spots and skin discoloration, revealing noticeably more even, younger-looking skin in just one week.\n-#1 retinol brand used most by dermatologists.\n-Helps improve the look of dark spots and skin discoloration.\n-Clinically proven results you can see over time.\n-Formulated without mineral oil and dyes.\n-Neutrogena® is a retinol leader, with more than 20 retinol patents and 100 clinical retinol studies.\n*Used by dermatologists for themselves.\nDirections:Step 1\nApply daily to cleansed face and neck.\nStep 2\nMassage a pearl-sized amount in even strokes until fully absorbed, paying close attention to uneven skin tone and dark spots.\n', 3300.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '29ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Rapid Tone Repair Retinol With Vitamin C Dark Spot CorrectorPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Rapid Tone Repair Retinol With Vitamin C Dark Spot Corrector Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-rapid-tone-repair-retinol-with-vitamin-c-dark-spot-corrector', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
