(1423, 'Bionike Defence B-Lucent Drop-On Focus', '1', 0, 38, 237, '1423', '1423', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BioNike Defence B-Lucent Drop On Focus Treatment that targets localised dark spots (sun spots, age spots, dark spots left over by other conditions, such as acne). The handy dropper allows to precisely dose the product to effectively target the single dark spot. Has a gel texture that dries up quickly upon application. AHAs and PHAs work together to effectively exfoliate skinand speed up cell turnover.\nHow to use', 2110.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionike Defence B-Lucent Drop-On FocusPrice in BD', 'Bionike Defence B-Lucent Drop-On Focus Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionike-defence-b-lucent-drop-on-focus', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1424, 'Cos De Baha RS Retinol 2.5 Serum 60ml', '1', 0, 38, 36, '1424', '1424', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skin with Cos De Baha RS Retinol 2.5 Serum, a potent anti-aging treatment formulated to reduce fine lines, wrinkles, and improve skin texture. Infused with 2.5% Retinol, this serum accelerates skin renewal, brightens dull skin, and promotes firmer, smoother, and more youthful-looking skin. Ideal for evening use, it prepares your skin for a rejuvenated complexion.\n✨ Key Benefits:\nReduces fine lines, wrinkles & signs of aging\nPromotes skin renewal & improves texture\nBrightens dull skin & evens out tone\nLightweight, fast-absorbing serum\nSuitable for daily night-time use\nHow to Use:After cleansing, apply 2–3 drops to the face, avoiding the eye area. Follow with moisturizer. Start with 2–3 times per week and gradually increase frequency as tolerated.\nKey Ingredients:\nRetinol 2.5% – Stimulates collagen, smooths fine lines, accelerates skin renewal\nHydrating Agents – Maintain moisture and prevent dryness\nSoothing Botanical Extracts – Reduce irritation and calm skin', 1399.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 191.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De Baha RS Retinol 2.5 Serum 60mlPrice in BD', 'Cos De Baha RS Retinol 2.5 Serum 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-rs-retinol-25-serum-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1425, 'The Ordinary Retinol 0.2% in Squalane 30ml', '1', 0, 38, 25, '1425', '1425', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This water-free solution contains 0.2% pure Retinol, an ingredient that can reduce the appearances of fine lines, of photo damage & of general skin aging. Highly-Stable, Water-Free Solution of 0.2% Pure Retinol. This water-free solution contains 0.2% pure Retinol, an ingredient that can reduce the appearances of fine lines, of photo damage & of general skin aging.\nProduct Features:\nBenefits:\nAlpha Arbutin in this serum is a skin lightening agent that is very gentle on your skin.Removes skin spots & dullness.Removes hyper-pigmentation & discoloration.Brings back your normal skin tone & it has hyaluronic acid which keeps your skin hydrated & supple. It is very lightweight & will blend into your skin very quickly.\nTypes of Skin:All skin type\nHow to Use:\nApply a few drops of Ordinary Alpha Arbutin 2%+HA before your daily moisturizer.\nDo not use withCopper PeptidesDirect AcidsDirect Vitamin CRetinoids\nIngredients:\nSqualane, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Retinol, Solanum Lycopersicum (Tomato) Fruit Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Hydroxymethoxyphenyl Decanone, BHT.\nMade in Canada', 2299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 301.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Retinol 0.2% in Squalane 30mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Retinol 0.2% in Squalane 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-retinol-02-in-squalane-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1426, 'Renewcell Retinol 2%+ Argireline 40ml', '1', 0, 38, 50, '1426', '1426', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Renewcell Retinol 2% + Argireline is a multi-action serum designed to combat signs of aging, brighten the skin, provide hydration, and offer soothing effects through its anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties. The formulation aims to diminish fine lines, wrinkles, age spots, and pigmentation, while improving skin texture and tone. It is hypoallergenic and non-comedogenic, making it suitable for various skin types.', 2075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Renewcell Retinol 2%+ Argireline 40mlPrice in BD', 'Renewcell Retinol 2%+ Argireline 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'renewcell-retinol-2-argireline-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1427, 'Purito Seoul Timeless Retinol Spot Cream', '1', 0, 38, 83, '1427', '1427', NULL, NULL, NULL, '💪🏻 Powerful Wrinkle Reduction – A gentle yet highly effective wrinkle-fighting spot cream with a smooth, creamy texture, perfect for first-time retinol users.\n🌺 Korean Hydrangea Synergy – Infused with Korean Hydrangea Extract, which works in harmony with retinol to enhance skin elasticity and diminish fine lines.\n✔️ Suitable for All Skin Types – Dermatologist-tested and hypoallergenic, this formula is designed to be non-irritating and safe for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n🧪 0.1% Pure Retinol – Formulated with a precise 0.1% retinol concentration, offering maximum safe effectiveness in reducing wrinkles, improving elasticity, and lifting sagging skin.\n🎯 4-in-1 Multi-Purpose Spot Cream – A versatile skincare essential that targets wrinkles, enhances skin firmness, refines pores, and delivers deep hydration for smooth, youthful-looking skin.\nAchieve a visibly firmer, smoother, and radiant complexion with PURITO 0.1% Retinol Wrinkle Spot Cream – the perfect introduction to retinol skincare! 💖', 1726.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 874.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Seoul Timeless Retinol Spot CreamPrice in BD', 'Purito Seoul Timeless Retinol Spot Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-seoul-timeless-retinol-spot-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1428, 'La Roche Posay Retinol B3 Serum', '1', 0, 38, 62, '1428', '1428', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This anti-aging pure retinol face and neck serum leave skin feeling smoother, hydrated, and renewed. As a result, the look of lines, wrinkles, and premature sun damage is reduced. This retinol serum combines concentrated pure retinol and vitamin B3 for optimal effectiveness while also being suitable for sensitive skin.\nAs a precautionary measure, avoid using products containing retinol during pregnancy and while breastfeeding.\nAvoid eye area.\nAQUA /WATER / EAU • GLYCERIN • CYCLOHEXASILOXANE • ALCOHOL DENAT. • PENTYLENE GLYCOL • NIACINAMIDE • DIMETHICONE • GLYCINE SOJA OIL / SOYBEAN OIL • PPG-6-DECYLTETRADECETH-30 • SODIUM HYALURONATE • RETINOL • ADENOSINE • AMMONIUMPOLYACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE • CAPRYLYL GLYCOL • CITRIC ACID • TRISODIUM ETHYLENEDIAMINE DISUCCINATE • XANTHAN GUM • POLYSILICONE-11 • RETINYL PALMITATE • TOCOPHEROL • PHENOXYETHANOL • PARFUM/ FRAGRANCE', 4085.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1415.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche Posay Retinol B3 SerumPrice in BD', 'La Roche Posay Retinol B3 Serum Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-retinol-b3-serum', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26');
