(1430, 'Lacura Q10 Renew Anti-Wrinkle Multi-Intensive Serum + Hyaluronic Acid (50 ml)', '1', 0, 39, 226, '1430', '1430', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Lacura Q10 Renew Anti-Wrinkle Multi-Intensive Serum is a high-performance skincare solution designed to combat the visible signs of aging. Enriched with Coenzyme Q10, Hyaluronic Acid, and Retinol, this serum works synergistically to hydrate, smooth, and rejuvenate the skin.\nKey Features:\nCoenzyme Q10 (CoQ10): An antioxidant that helps protect skin cells from oxidative stress, promoting a more youthful appearance.\nHyaluronic Acid: Deeply hydrates the skin, plumping and reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nRetinol: Stimulates collagen production, enhancing skin elasticity and firmness.\nLightweight Texture: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, suitable for daily use.\nHow to Use:\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\nApply a small amount of serum to the face and neck.\nGently massage in upward motions until fully absorbed.\nUse in the evening for optimal results.\nIngredients: Aqua, Glycerin, Cyclopentasiloxane, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Cetearyl Isononanoate, Macadamia Integrifolia Seed Oil, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Pentylene Glycol, C12-25 Alkyl Benzoate, Panthenol, Sorbitol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Lactate, Urea, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Avena Strigosa Seed Extract, Cyclohexasiloxane, Lactic Acid, Lecithin, Allantoin, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Serine, Tocopherol, Propanediol, Dimethylmethoxy Chromanol, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Chloride, Ubiquinone, Hydrogenated Palm Glycerides Citrate, Alcohol Denat, Parfum, Amyl Cinnamal, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Benzoate, Benzyl Salicylate, Citronellol, Eugenol, Geraniol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Linalool, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Caprylyl Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Benzoic Acid, Dehydroacetic Acid, Potassium Sorbate, Citric Acid.\nWhy Choose Lacura Q10 Renew Serum?\nAnti-Aging Benefits: Combats fine lines and wrinkles, promoting a youthful complexion.\nHydration: Provides deep moisture, leaving skin soft and supple.\nAffordable Luxury: Offers high-quality skincare at a budget-friendly price point.\nTrusted Brand: Developed by Lacura, known for effective and accessible skincare solutions.\nNote: For best results, incorporate this serum into your evening skincare routine. Always perform a patch test before full application to ensure compatibility with your skin.', 1330.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 570.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lacura Q10 Renew Anti-Wrinkle Multi-Intensive Serum + Hyaluronic Acid (50 ml)Price in BD', 'Lacura Q10 Renew Anti-Wrinkle Multi-Intensive Serum + Hyaluronic Acid (50 ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lacura-q10-renew-anti-wrinkle-multi-intensive-serum-hyaluronic-acid-50-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
