(1433, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Cream – Hyaluronic Acid & Vitamin A, 60g', '1', 0, 39, 86, '1433', '1433', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Revitalize your skin with the Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Cream, enriched with Hyaluronic Acid and Vitamin A. This lightweight yet nourishing cream helps brighten skin tone, reduce fine lines, improve elasticity, and deeply hydrate, leaving your skin smooth, radiant, and healthy-looking. Ideal for daily use on all skin types.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nNiacinamide (10%) – Brightens complexion, minimizes pores, and evens skin tone\nHyaluronic Acid – Provides intense hydration and locks in moisture for plump skin\nVitamin A – Supports skin renewal, reduces fine lines, and promotes elasticity\nSkin Texture & Tone – Improves smoothness and gives a healthy, radiant glow\nHow to Use:\nApply a small amount of cream on cleansed face and neck.\nGently massage in upward circular motions until fully absorbed.\nUse morning and night for optimal results.\nFollow with sunscreen during the day.\nSuitable For:\nAll skin types, including sensitive skin\nIdeal for brightening, anti-aging, and hydration', 1883.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 807.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Cream – Hyaluronic Acid & Vitamin A, 60gPrice in BD', 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Face Cream – Hyaluronic Acid & Vitamin A, 60g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'absolute-new-york-niacinamide-10-face-cream-hyaluronic-acid-vitamin-a-60g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
