(1435, 'Guerniss Retinol Vitamin E Brightening & Anti Aging Night Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 39, 162, '1435', '1435', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This overnight retinol & vitamin E cream brightens skin, fights wrinkles, and pampers with a vegan formula free of parabens, sulfates, phthalates, and mineral oil.\nRetinol Vitamin E Brightening & Anti-Aging Night Cream is a skincare product designed for nighttime usage. It contains ingredients such as Vitamin E, Retinol, etc. These are known for their beneficial skin effects.\nAs the name suggests, it’s an anti-aging and brightening cream. It will enhance your skin’s looks, removing dullness and pigmentation issues. Whereas retinol and vitamin E are good for their anti-aging properties. They will remove fine lines, and wrinkles and make your skin look younger.\nAnd lastly, as a night cream, its designed to be used during nighttime. So it doesn’t have properties like UV protection or effects that will make you look more extravagant.\nWant to keep your youthful appearance forever? Try Gureniss Retinol Vitamin E Brightening & Anti-Aging Night Cream. Our latest product containing vitamin E and retinol will brighten your skin during nighttime and also enhance your skin repair properties to give you a more younger and vibrant look.\nWith our Retinol Vitamin E Brightening & Anti-Aging Night Cream, say goodbye to a dull face. Our product is designed with two powerhouses of ingredients to rejuvenate your skin.\nThe benefits of our product are its brightening, anti-aging, hydration, and skin renewal. It contains such formulas that will brighten your skin even during the night and make you look more bold. And with its anti-aging properties, you will forever be able to keep your youthful appearance and show it off.\nHydration is also an important factor for skin care. With our anti-aging night cream, you will not only get the aforementioned benefits but also be able to nourish and hydrate your skin. And lastly, with its skin-renewable properties, it will help to enhance your skin’s natural regeneration even faster.\n\nMade in Hong Kong', 1795.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 305.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Guerniss Retinol Vitamin E Brightening & Anti Aging Night Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Guerniss Retinol Vitamin E Brightening & Anti Aging Night Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guerniss-retinol-vitamin-e-brightening-anti-aging-night-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1436, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Energising Red Day Cream for All Skin Tones', '1', 0, 39, 110, '1436', '1436', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The L\'Oréal Paris Revitalift Energising Red Day Cream is an anti-fatigue moisturizer designed to revitalize and illuminate the skin, suitable for all skin tones. Enriched with Advanced Pro-Retinol and Red Ginseng, this cream aims to reduce the appearance of wrinkles, firm the skin, and restore a healthy glow.\n\n\nKey Ingredients:\nAdvanced Pro-Retinol: A potent anti-wrinkle ingredient that helps smooth the skin\'s surface and reduce the appearance of fine lines.\nRed Ginseng: Known for its stimulating properties, it helps boost skin vitality and combat signs of fatigue.\n\nBenefits:\nInstant Radiance: The cream contains red pigments that immediately enhance skin radiance, providing a natural, healthy glow.\nAnti-Aging: Regular use helps reduce wrinkles and fine lines, promoting a more youthful appearance.\nFirming Effect: Improves skin elasticity, resulting in firmer and more toned skin.\n\nHow to Use:\nApplication: Apply daily in the morning on a thoroughly cleansed face and neck.\nMethod: Gently massage the cream in circular motions for better absorption.\nIncorporating this cream into your daily skincare routine can help rejuvenate your skin, providing both immediate radiance and long-term anti-aging benefits.', 2120.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1765.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Energising Red Day Cream for All Skin TonesPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Revitalift Energising Red Day Cream for All Skin Tones Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-revitalift-energising-red-day-cream-for-all-skin-tones', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1437, 'In Your Heart Collagen Lifting Ampoule 50ml – Anti-Aging Korean Serum with Hydrolyzed Collagen, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Adenosine & Hyaluronic Acid for Firming, Hydrating & Youthful Skin', '1', 0, 39, 252, '1437', '1437', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The In Your Heart Collagen Lifting Ampoule is a highly concentrated anti-aging serum designed to firm, hydrate, and rejuvenate your skin. This lightweight ampoule delivers potent active ingredients deep into the skin to improve elasticity, reduce the appearance of fine lines, and leave your complexion radiant and youthful.\nKey Ingredients:\nHydrolyzed Collagen (0.098%) – supports skin elasticity and firmness.\nAcetyl Hexapeptide-8 – helps minimize the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nAdenosine – promotes skin regeneration and improves texture.\nHyaluronic Acid & Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid – deeply hydrates, locks in moisture, and plumps the skin.\nGalactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Niacinamide, Panthenol, Shea Butter, Evening Primrose Extract, Aloe Ferment – provide nourishment, brightening, and soothing effects.\nHow to Use:Take an appropriate amount and apply gently to the skin. Lightly tap for better absorption. Use daily as part of your skincare routine after cleansing and toning, before moisturizing.\nCaution:\nDiscontinue use and consult a specialist if you experience redness, swelling, or itching.\nAvoid use on wounded areas.\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight.\nNet Volume: 50ml / 1.69 fl. oz.\nManufacturer & Seller:\nResponsible Seller: In Your Heart Corp., Smart Square, A-812, 27 Songdo Mirae-ro 11beon-gil, Yeonsu-gu, Incheon, South Korea\nManufacturer: Whitecos Pharm Co., Ltd., 194 Seonggeo-gil, Seonggeo-eup, Seobuk-gu, Cheonan-si, Chungcheongnam-do, Republic of Korea\nThis ampoule is perfect for anyone seeking a Korean anti-aging serum that provides firming, deep hydration, and youthful skin in a concentrated formula.', 2511.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 279.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'In Your Heart Collagen Lifting Ampoule 50ml – Anti-Aging Korean Serum with Hydrolyzed Collagen, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Adenosine & Hyaluronic Acid for Firming, Hydrating & Youthful SkinPrice in BD', 'In Your Heart Collagen Lifting Ampoule 50ml – Anti-Aging Korean Serum with Hydrolyzed Collagen, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Adenosine & Hyaluronic Acid for Firming, Hydrating & Youthful Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'in-your-heart-collagen-lifting-ampoule-50ml-anti-aging-korean-serum-with-hydrolyzed-collagen-acetyl-hexapeptide-8-adenosine-hyaluronic-acid-for-firming-hydrating-youthful-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
