(1440, 'Rene Gel 20gm (Clindamycin & Benzoyl Peroxide)', '1', 0, 39, 345, '1440', '1440', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anti-Acne Combination Gel\nRene Gel is a combination acne treatment containing Clindamycin Phosphate 1.2% w/w and Hydrous Benzoyl Peroxide 5% w/w. This dual-action formula targets acne at multiple levels—reducing bacterial growth, preventing new breakouts, and helping clear existing pimples, blackheads, and whiteheads. The gel base provides smooth application and efficient penetration into the skin.\nHelps treat mild to moderate acne\nReduces acne-causing bacteria (Cutibacterium acnes)\nHelps dry excess oil and unclog pores\nPrevents formation of new pimples\nReduces inflammation and redness\nCombination therapy for faster, effective results\nClindamycin PhosphateEquivalent to Clindamycin — 1.2% w/w\nHydrous Benzoyl PeroxideEquivalent to Benzoyl Peroxide — 5.0% w/w\nGel Base: q.s.\nUse as directed by the physician.\nApply a thin layer to the affected area once or twice daily on clean, dry skin.\nAvoid contact with eyes, mouth, and mucous membranes.\nWash hands after application.\nStore below 25°C\nDo not freeze\nProtect from light and moisture\nFor external use only\nStop use if severe irritation occurs\nKeep out of reach of children', 905.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 60.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Rene Gel 20gm (Clindamycin & Benzoyl Peroxide)Price in BD', 'Rene Gel 20gm (Clindamycin & Benzoyl Peroxide) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'rene-gel-20gm-clindamycin-benzoyl-peroxide', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
