(1450, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Forget Your Age Anti-Wrinkle Skin Cell Rejuvenator Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 39, 104, '1450', '1450', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Forget Your Age Anti-Wrinkle Skin Cell Rejuvenator Cream (50ml)\nDescription:Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Forget Your Age Anti-Wrinkle Skin Cell Rejuvenator Cream is a luxurious, organic anti-aging cream designed to reduce the appearance of wrinkles, fine lines, and other signs of aging. Formulated with potent natural and medical-grade ingredients, this cream works to rejuvenate skin cells, boost collagen production, and restore a youthful, radiant complexion. It is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin, and is free from harmful chemicals, parabens, and synthetic fragrances.\nKey Benefits:\nAnti-Wrinkle: Visibly reduces the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines for smoother, younger-looking skin.\nSkin Rejuvenation: Stimulates skin cell renewal and boosts collagen production to restore elasticity and firmness.\nDeep Hydration: Provides intense moisture to keep the skin soft, supple, and nourished.\nOrganic Ingredients: Made with natural, organic components that are gentle yet effective.\nNon-Greasy Formula: Absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a heavy or sticky residue.\nIdeal For:\nIndividuals seeking to reduce visible signs of aging, such as wrinkles and fine lines.\nThose looking to rejuvenate their skin and restore a youthful glow.\nAnyone wanting a deeply hydrating, anti-aging cream that works for all skin types.\nHow to Use:Apply a small amount of the Forget Your Age Cream to clean, dry skin in the morning and/or evening. Gently massage into the face and neck using upward circular motions until fully absorbed. For best results, use daily as part of your skincare routine.\nVolume: 50ml\nCertifications:\nOrganic\nDermatologically Tested\nFree from Parabens, Sulfates, and Synthetic Fragrances\nIngredients:A blend of organic and anti-aging ingredients such as:\nHyaluronic Acid\nPlant Stem Cells\nVitamin C and E\nPeptides\nAloe Vera\nWhy Choose Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care?Biomd is committed to providing high-quality, organic skincare solutions that are both effective and safe. Their products are carefully formulated to ensure your skin receives the best natural ingredients for optimal health and radiance.\nPerfect for those who prioritize clean beauty and want to achieve a smoother, firmer, and more youthful complexion naturally.', 3146.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 4.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Forget Your Age Anti-Wrinkle Skin Cell Rejuvenator Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Forget Your Age Anti-Wrinkle Skin Cell Rejuvenator Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biomd-organic-medical-skin-care-forget-your-age-anti-wrinkle-skin-cell-rejuvenator-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
(1451, 'The Derma Co 1% Kojic + Arbutin night Repair Gel 50g', '1', 0, 39, 33, '1451', '1451', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Derma Co 1% Kojic + Arbutin Night Repair Gel (50g)\nThe Derma Co 1% Kojic + Arbutin Night Repair Gel is a powerful yet gentle formula designed to fade pigmentation, dark spots, melasma, and acne marks while promoting an even skin tone. Enriched with Alpha Arbutin and Kojic Acid, this lightweight gel deeply nourishes the skin, providing soothing and anti-aging benefits for a brighter complexion.\nWake up to brighter, clearer, and healthier-looking skin with The Derma Co 1% Kojic + Arbutin Night Repair Gel.', 1450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 1% Kojic + Arbutin night Repair Gel 50gPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 1% Kojic + Arbutin night Repair Gel 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-1-kojic-arbutin-night-repair-gel-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
