(1454, 'Eucerin Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Daily Face Cream with Coenzyme Q10 + Biotin, Non-Comedogenic 48gm', '1', 0, 39, 234, '1454', '1454', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reduces Fine Lines & Wrinkles: Clinically proven to diminish the look of fine lines and wrinkles in as little as 5 weeks with twice-daily use.\nAntioxidant Protection: Contains Coenzyme Q10, Vitamin E, and Beta-Carotene to protect skin from free radicals and environmental stressors.\nHydration & Moisture: Formulated with Glycerin and Shea Butter to hydrate and maintain skin\'s moisture balance.\nSuitable for Sensitive Skin: Free from fragrance, alcohol, and dyes; non-comedogenic and gentle on the skin.\nActive Ingredients: Coenzyme Q10, Biotin\nAntioxidants: Vitamin E, Beta-Carotene\nHydrators: Glycerin, Shea Butter\nPreservatives: Phenoxyethanol, 1,2-Hexanediol\nApply a small amount to clean face and neck.\nMassage gently in upward circular motions.\nUse twice daily, in the morning and evening.\nSize: 48g (1.7 oz)\nPackaging: Jar container\nSkin Type: Suitable for all skin types, especially sensitive skin', 2660.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1140.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Eucerin Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Daily Face Cream with Coenzyme Q10 + Biotin, Non-Comedogenic 48gmPrice in BD', 'Eucerin Q10 Anti-Wrinkle Daily Face Cream with Coenzyme Q10 + Biotin, Non-Comedogenic 48gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'eucerin-q10-anti-wrinkle-daily-face-cream-with-coenzyme-q10-biotin-non-comedogenic-48gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:26', '2026-02-11 13:41:26'),
