(1456, 'Nineless B-Boost 10% Niacinamide Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 39, 47, '1456', '1456', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elevate your skincare routine with Nineless B-Boost 10% Niacinamide Serum (30 ml) — a high-performance, multi-benefit serum crafted to target uneven skin tone, excess oil, and texture concerns. The concentrated 10% niacinamide (vitamin B3) base works in harmony with brighteners, humectants, and skin-strengthening agents to give you visibly radiant, smoother, healthier skin.\nBalancing and Pore Minimizing: Helps regulate sebum production and reduce the appearance of enlarged pores, resulting in a refined, smoother complexion\nBrightening & Even Skin Tone: Contains ingredients like tranexamic acid and ascorbyl glucoside that help fade dark spots, reduce pigmentation, and brighten dull or uneven skin.\nDeep Hydration & Barrier Support: With humectants like glycerin, panthenol (pro-vitamin B5), sodium hyaluronate, and soothing extracts, this serum nourishes and strengthens the skin barrier to help retain moisture and resist irritation.\nAntioxidant Protection & Skin Repair: Ingredients such as glutathione, ascorbyl glucoside, and botanical extracts provide antioxidant benefits, fighting environmental stress and aiding in skin restoration.\nLightweight & Fast-Absorbing: Designed to absorb quickly without heavy residue or greasy feel — ideal for layering under moisturizer or SPF. Suitable for all skin types, even sensitive or oily skin\nCleanse your face thoroughly and apply toner if part of your routine.\nApply 2-3 drops of Nineless B-Boost Serum to face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\nGently press or pat until fully absorbed.\nFollow with moisturizer. In the morning, always finish with a broad-spectrum sunscreen to protect results.\nFrequency: Use once or twice daily, depending on your skin’s tolerance. If you’re new to active serums or niacinamide, start with once daily (evening) and gradually increase.\nIdeal for:\nOily / Combination skin\nSkin with enlarged pores\nSkin with uneven tone, hyperpigmentation or dark spots\nSensitive skin (though patch test recommended, especially if new to active ingredients)\nWith a well-balanced formulation combining skin brighteners, humectants, and barrier support, this serum does more than just one thing — it delivers multiple improvements with consistent use. Whether you want radiant skin, minimized pores, or a more even complexion, this serum is designed to help you get there.', 1365.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 585.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nineless B-Boost 10% Niacinamide Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Nineless B-Boost 10% Niacinamide Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nineless-b-boost-10-niacinamide-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1457, 'Constanta Snail Cream White 50gm (CT-173)', '1', 0, 39, 137, '1457', '1457', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brightening • Hydrating • Regenerating\nConstanta Snail Cream White is a premium brightening and anti-aging cream formulated under the quality standards of Constanta Germany. Enriched with snail secretion filtrate, natural plant extracts, and advanced skin-restoring actives, this cream helps to hydrate, lighten, and improve overall skin texture. With regular use, skin becomes visibly brighter, firmer, smoother, and more youthful.\nBrightens and evens skin tone\nContains snail secretion filtrate to support skin regeneration\nProvides deep hydration for soft, smooth, and refreshed skin\nImproves elasticity and reduces dullness\nIncludes soothing plant extracts such as Centella Asiatica, Aloe Vera, Cucumber, and Houttuynia Cordata\nHelps soften fine lines and supports firmer-looking skin\nLightweight and non-sticky, suitable for daily use\nApply gently to a thoroughly cleansed face and neck.Use every morning and evening for best results.\nPurified Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Cyclopentasiloxane, Niacinamide, Titanium Dioxide, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Macadamia Integrifolia Seed Oil, Isohexadecane, Aluminum Hydroxide, Dimethiconol, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Dimethyl Sulfone, Centella Asiatica Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Polysorbate 80, Fragrance, Panthenol, Allantoin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Illicium Verum (Anise) Fruit Extract, Adenosine, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA, Saccharide Isomerate, Lactic Acid, Snail Secretion Filtrate.\nLightens and brightens the complexion\nKeeps skin smooth, soft, and refreshed\nHelps repair damaged skin\nEnhances firmness and overall skin appearance', 2564.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 116.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Constanta Snail Cream White 50gm (CT-173)Price in BD', 'Constanta Snail Cream White 50gm (CT-173) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'constanta-snail-cream-white-50gm-ct-173', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
