(1459, 'Garnier Wrinkle Lift Anti-Ageing Cream 40gm', '1', 0, 39, 37, '1459', '1459', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier Wrinkle Lift Anti-Ageing Cream - 40g\nThe Garnier Wrinkle Lift Anti-Ageing Cream is a specially formulated skincare product designed to reduce the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines while firming and lifting the skin. Enriched with Pro-Retinol and Ginger Extract, this cream helps to visibly smooth wrinkles, restore skin elasticity, and provide a more youthful, radiant complexion.\n✔ Reduces Wrinkles and Fine Lines – Pro-Retinol helps to visibly smooth out wrinkles and fine lines for a more youthful appearance.✔ Firms and Lifts Skin – Improves skin elasticity and firmness, providing a lifting effect.✔ Hydrates and Nourishes – Deeply moisturizes the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and supple.✔ Brightens Skin Tone – Helps to even out skin tone and restore a radiant glow.✔ Suitable for Daily Use – Lightweight, non-greasy formula that absorbs quickly into the skin.\nCleanse your face thoroughly before application.\nTake a small amount of the cream and gently massage it onto your face and neck using upward strokes.\nUse morning and evening for best results.\nFor optimal anti-ageing benefits, follow with sunscreen during the day.\nPro-Retinol – A derivative of Vitamin A that helps to reduce the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines.\nGinger Extract – Known for its antioxidant properties, it helps to firm and lift the skin.\nHydrating Agents – Provide deep moisture to keep the skin soft and supple.\n✔ Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.✔ Ideal for those looking to reduce the signs of ageing, such as wrinkles, fine lines, and loss of firmness.\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.\nKeep the lid tightly closed when not in use.\nThis cream combines the powerful anti-ageing benefits of Pro-Retinol with the firming properties of Ginger Extract to deliver visible results. It’s perfect for anyone looking to achieve a more youthful, radiant complexion.\nAdd the Garnier Wrinkle Lift Anti-Ageing Cream to your skincare routine for firmer, smoother, and younger-looking skin! 🌟✨🧴', 590.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, -590.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Wrinkle Lift Anti-Ageing Cream 40gmPrice in BD', 'Garnier Wrinkle Lift Anti-Ageing Cream 40gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-wrinkle-lift-anti-ageing-cream-40gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
