(1462, 'Gomela Cream 15gm', '1', 0, 39, 350, '1462', '1462', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brand Name: GOMELA\nPack Size: 15 g\nPack Type: Tube\nUsage/Application: Clinical\nPrescription/Non-Prescription: Non-prescription\nProduct Type: Finished Product\nCountry of Origin: India\nGomela Cream is specially formulated for the treatment and prevention of moderate-to-severe melasma (dark or discoloured patches on the skin). It is also effective in treating senile lentigines (age spots, dark spots on the face).\nFormulated in compliance with international medical standards, Gomela Cream is highly effective in Severe / Localized Dermatosis and Melasma.\nHelps reduce melasma and dark patches\nTreats age spots (senile lentigines)\nEffective on localized dermatosis\nEasy-to-apply cream formulation\nKnown for quick and visible results\nPack: 15g Tube\nBulk orders available on request\nReasonably priced', 99.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 31.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gomela Cream 15gmPrice in BD', 'Gomela Cream 15gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gomela-cream-15gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27');
