(1463, 'Isme Whitening Malesma Cream – 10g Brightening with Bearberry Extract & Vitamin C', '1', 0, 39, 169, '1463', '1463', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Isme Whitening Melasma Cream is a brightening facial cream specifically formulated to reduce the appearance of melasma, dark spots, and uneven skin tone. Enriched with Bearberry Extract, Vitamin C, and Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), it helps slow melanin production, fade dark spots, and enhance skin radiance. The cream also contains natural moisturizers to maintain skin elasticity, hydration, and smoothness, leaving the skin soft, supple, and naturally luminous.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces the appearance of melasma and dark spots\nBrightens and evens out skin tone\nSlows melanin production with Bearberry Extract\nNourishes and moisturizes skin for improved elasticity\nSmooths and softens the skin for a radiant look\nSuitable for daily use\nHow to Use:\nApply a thin layer of cream over affected areas of the face.\nUse morning and night for best results.\nConsistent use helps maintain a brighter and more even complexion.\nIngredients:Bearberry Extract, Vitamin C, Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Tranexamic Acid, natural moisturizers, and other skin-conditioning agents.\nNet Weight: 10gUsage Note: Designed for reducing melasma caused by sun exposure. Avoid if any irritation occurs.\nThis cream is ideal for anyone looking to brighten the skin, reduce dark spots, and improve overall skin radiance while keeping it soft and hydrated.', 441.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 49.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Isme Whitening Malesma Cream – 10g Brightening with Bearberry Extract & Vitamin CPrice in BD', 'Isme Whitening Malesma Cream – 10g Brightening with Bearberry Extract & Vitamin C Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isme-whitening-malesma-cream-10g-brightening-with-bearberry-extract-vitamin-c', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now',