(1468, 'Lotus Herbals YouthRx Anti Ageing Transforming Cream SPF 25 PA+++', '1', 0, 39, 20, '1468', '1468', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Lotus Herbals YouthRX Anti-Ageing Transforming Gel Cream with SPF 25 is a testament to a revolutionary development in ‘Green Science’ specially curated to cater to the needs of combination to oily skin type. It comes with the Gineplex Youth Compound derived from potent natural ingredients and is clinically proven to accelerate the process of skin lifting & firming.\nIt is enriched with SPF 25 PA+++ for protection against sun damage that causes skin ageing. In addition, it reduces the appearance of fine lines & wrinkles. The Gel Cream is infused with Natural ingredients like Ginger & Ginseng that help prevent free radical damage & slow skin ageing process.\nHow to use:', 1110.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 40.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Lotus Herbals YouthRx Anti Ageing Transforming Cream SPF 25 PA+++Price in BD', 'Lotus Herbals YouthRx Anti Ageing Transforming Cream SPF 25 PA+++ Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lotus-herbals-youthrx-anti-ageing-transforming-cream-spf-25-pa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1469, 'Biotopix Cream', '1', 0, 39, 351, '1469', '1469', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\n\nHands not only are susceptible to the first signs of aging, but very often age even faster than the face. There is very little fat on the backs of the hands, so when even a small amount of collagen or elastin fibers begins to break down – which is part of the normal aging process – it’s going to have a noticeable impact on hands.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream is an original formula combining a tightening effect, a collagen accelerator, a potent moisturizer and a strongwhitening activity. This gentle cream also contains high UV-protection.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream reduces and changes the type and aspect of wrinkles that add years to the skin appearance. Biotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream contains a natural blend created from extracts of Kiwi and Sophora in a vegetable origin butylene glycol which are effective to fight age spots as well as hyperpigmentation. It will also help preserve the skin moisture content by protecting hyaluronic acid in the skin tissue.\nApply at will on the hands and rub in gently.\nTube of 50 g.\nMade in France.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream was tested on B16 melanocytes in vitro at several concentrations. Its efficacy was compared to an existing version made with petrochemical origin butylene glycol. Melanin synthesis inhibition is dose-dependent.Biotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream used at 1% inhibits more than 100% of melanin synthesis induced by NDP-MSH.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream not only inhibits melanin synthesis induced by NDP-MSH, but also reduces the basal melanin content. When the cytotoxic activity of Biotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream was compared to Kojic acid, a positive whitening reference, it showed a far greater safety than Kojic acid in cell culture. The safety of melanocytes is improved. No associated cytotoxicity is noticed.Biotopix Specific Hand Anti-aging Cream allows to obtain a clear whitening of dark spots without harming the cells.\n', 2680.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2680.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biotopix CreamPrice in BD', 'Biotopix Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biotopix-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1470, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Neck Cream – Hyaluronic Acid, AHA & BHA, 55g', '1', 0, 39, 86, '1470', '1470', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Revitalize and firm your neck area with the Absolute New York 10% Niacinamide Neck Cream. Enriched with Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Hyaluronic Acid, AHA, and BHA, this cream helps brighten skin tone, reduce fine lines, improve elasticity, and clarify skin texture. Specifically formulated for the delicate neck area, it keeps your skin smooth, hydrated, and youthful-looking.\nKey Benefits:\nNiacinamide (10%) – Brightens, evens skin tone, and improves elasticity\nHyaluronic Acid – Deeply hydrates and plumps the skin\nAHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid) – Gently exfoliates to reveal smoother, radiant skin\nBHA (Beta Hydroxy Acid) – Penetrates pores to remove excess oil and impurities\nSkin Texture & Tone – Reduces the appearance of fine lines and dullness\nHow to Use:\nCleanse the neck area thoroughly.\nApply a small amount of cream to the neck and décolletage.\nMassage gently in upward motions until fully absorbed.\nUse daily, preferably at night, for best results.\nSuitable For:\nAll skin types\nIdeal for those targeting aging, uneven tone, and sagging skin in the neck area\n\nPackaging: 55g jar for easy and hygienic application', 1925.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '55gm', 0.00, 1, NULL, 825.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Neck Cream – Hyaluronic Acid, AHA & BHA, 55gPrice in BD', 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Neck Cream – Hyaluronic Acid, AHA & BHA, 55g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'absolute-new-york-niacinamide-10-neck-cream-hyaluronic-acid-aha-bha-55g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1471, 'L’Oreal Paris Men Expert Power Age Hyaluronic Anti-Aging Serum 30ml – Intensely Firms Skin & Visibly Reduces Wrinkles', '1', 0, 39, 110, '1471', '1471', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'L’Oréal Paris Men Expert Power Age Serum is specially formulated for men’s skin to intensely firm, hydrate, and visibly reduce wrinkles. Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid and Bifida Ferment Lysate, it strengthens the skin barrier, boosts hydration, and fights signs of aging for a refreshed, youthful look.\nKey Benefits:\nVisibly reduces fine lines & deep wrinkles\nProvides 24H intense hydration with Hyaluronic Acid\nFirms and revitalizes tired, aging skin\nLightweight, fast-absorbing texture for daily use\nDermatologically tested for men’s skin\nHow to Use:Apply daily on cleansed face and neck before your moisturizer. For best results, complete your routine with cleanser, serum, moisturizer, and eye care.\nIngredients:Aqua/Water, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Glycerin, Alcohol Denat., Dimethicone, Hydroxyethylpiperazine Ethane Sulfonic Acid, Mentha Piperita Extract (Peppermint), Adenosine, Faex Extract (Yeast), Hydroxyacetophenone, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Hydroxide, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Tocopherol, Octyldodecanol, Acetic Acid, Ammonium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Caprylyl Glycol, Lactic Acid, PEG-20 Methyl Glucose Sesquistearate, Pentylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Citral, Citronellol, Coumarin, Limonene, Linalool, Sodium Benzoate, Parfum/Fragrance.', 2530.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 970.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'L’Oreal Paris Men Expert Power Age Hyaluronic Anti-Aging Serum 30ml – Intensely Firms Skin & Visibly Reduces WrinklesPrice in BD', 'L’Oreal Paris Men Expert Power Age Hyaluronic Anti-Aging Serum 30ml – Intensely Firms Skin & Visibly Reduces Wrinkles Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-men-expert-power-age-hyaluronic-anti-aging-serum-30ml-inte