(1473, 'Loreal Paris Wrinkle Expert 35+ Collagen Anti-Wrinkle Hydrating Day Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 39, 110, '1473', '1473', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The L\'Oréal Paris Wrinkle Expert 35+ Collagen Anti-Wrinkle Hydrating Day Cream 50ml (Made in Germany) is specifically formulated to address the early signs of aging for individuals aged 35 and above. Enriched with collagen, it aims to reduce wrinkles, improve skin firmness, and provide lasting hydration.\n\nReduces Wrinkles: Regular use visibly diminishes the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, resulting in smoother skin.\nImproves Firmness: The collagen-enriched formula enhances skin elasticity, making it appear firmer and more youthful.\n24-Hour Hydration: Provides intense moisture that lasts throughout the day, leaving skin feeling nourished and comfortable.\n\n\n', 930.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 720.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Loreal Paris Wrinkle Expert 35+ Collagen Anti-Wrinkle Hydrating Day Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Loreal Paris Wrinkle Expert 35+ Collagen Anti-Wrinkle Hydrating Day Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-wrinkle-expert-35-collagen-anti-wrinkle-hydrating-day-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1474, 'KA Expert Anti Melasma Serum 15gm', '1', 0, 39, 217, '1474', '1474', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'KA Expert Anti-Melasma Serum is a lightweight yet intensive serum designed to reduce melasma, freckles, sun spots, and dull skin. Enriched with 100% natural Alpha Arbutin extract from Bearberry and boosted with INNO MelanoOff™, it helps brighten the skin and diminish pigmentation gently without thinning the skin.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces melasma, freckles, and sun spots\nBrightens and evens skin tone\nGentle on delicate and sensitive skin\nProvides hydration and restores skin’s moisture balance\nImproves skin radiance and texture\nFree from hydroquinone\nActive Ingredients:\nAlpha Arbutin (from Bearberry)\nINNO MelanoOff™\nOrganic Aloe Vera (moisturizes and nourishes skin)\nNatural Peplida & Centella Asiatica Extract (supports skin repair and regeneration)\nOther Ingredients:Aqua, Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid-Diethylhexyl Carbonate, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, Methyl Methacrylate Crosspolymer, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizinate, Phenoxyethanol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter), Allantoin, Disodium EDTA, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Plantago Aquatica Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Citric Acid, Maltodextrin, and other skin-friendly excipients.\nDirections for Use:Apply 2–3 drops on clean, dry skin of the face and neck every evening. Gently pat until absorbed. Use consistently for visible results within 7 days.\nCaution:\nFor external use only\nAvoid direct contact with eyes\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'KA Expert Anti Melasma Serum 15gmPrice in BD', 'KA Expert Anti Melasma Serum 15gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ka-expert-anti-melasma-serum-15gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1475, 'Laikou Avocado African Anti Wrinkle Cream', '1', 0, 39, 8, '1475', '1475', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Avocado extract is a powerful antioxidant vitamin c, it is not only effective to brighten the skin, but also helps to protect the skin and reduce fine lines. After cleansing the skin in the morning and evening. Apply a proper amount of the cream to the face and gently massage until absorbed.\nExperience the ultimate skincare luxury with LAIKOU African Avocado Anti-Wrinkle Cream. Formulated with the richness of African avocado, this cream nourishes and revitalizes your skin, targeting wrinkles and fine lines for a smoother, youthful appearance. Packed with natural ingredients, this cream harnesses the power of nature to hydrate, plump, and restore your skin’s elasticity. Elevate your skincare routine with LAIKOU’s innovative solution and embrace a radiant, age-defying complexion. Unlock the secret to timeless beauty today!', 320.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 230.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Avocado African Anti Wrinkle CreamPrice in BD', 'Laikou Avocado African Anti Wrinkle Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-avocado-african-anti-wrinkle-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1476, 'Osufi Whitening Freckle Lady Cream 50gm', '1', 0, 39, 35, '1476', '1476', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Osufi Whitening Freckle Lady Cream is a skincare product designed to brighten the complexion and reduce the appearance of freckles and dark spots. The 50g cream aims to even out skin tone while providing moisturizing and nourishing benefits.\nKey Features:\nWhitening and Freckle Removal: Formulated to lighten freckles and dark spots, promoting a more uniform skin tone.\nMoisturizing and Nourishing: Provides hydration and essential nutrients to the skin, enhancing its overall health and appearance.\nSuitable for Various Skin Types: Designed to be effective for different skin types, catering to a broad range of users.\nUsage Instructions:\nCleanse your face thoroughly before application.\nApply a small amount of the cream to the affected areas or the entire face, as desired.\nGently massage the cream into the skin using circular motions until fully absorbed.\nFor optimal results, use the cream consistently as part of your daily skincare routine.\nPrecautions:\nPerform a patch test before first use to check for any allergic reactions.\nAvoid contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.\nIncorporating Osufi Whitening Freckle Lady Cream into your skincare regimen may help achieve a brighter and more even complexion by addressing freckles and dark spots while keeping the skin moisturized and nourished.', 638.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 562.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Osufi Whitening Freckle Lady Cream 50gmPrice in BD', 'Osufi Whitening Freckle Lady Cream 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'osufi-whitening-freckle-lady-cream-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1477, 'DR. RASHEL Vitamin C Brightening & Anti-Aging (DAY CREAM)', '1', 0, 39, 233, '1477', '1477', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'DR. RASHEL Vitamin C Brightening & Anti-Aging Day Cream is a skincare product designed to target hyperpigmentation, dullness, and signs of aging while providing hydration and protection during the day. Here’s a detailed breakdown of its features, benefits, and key ingredients:\nBrightening Effect\nContains Vitamin C (likely in the form of Ascorbic Acid or a derivative like Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate), which helps reduce dark spots, even out skin tone, and boost radiance by inhibiting melanin production.\nAnti-Aging Properties\nFights fine lines, wrinkles, and loss of elasticity with antioxidants that protect against free radical damage (e.g., pollution, UV exposure).\nHydration & Nourishment\nTypically includes moisturizing agents like hyaluronic acid, glycerin, or plant oils to keep skin plump and smooth.\nDaytime Protection\nMay contain SPF (check label) or antioxidants to shield skin from environmental stressors. If no SPF, always layer sunscreen over it.\nLightweight Texture\nDesigned for daytime use under makeup, often non-greasy and fast-absorbing.\nVitamin C (Brightening, collagen-boosting)\nNiacinamide (Reduces redness, improves barrier function)\nHyaluronic Acid (Hydration)\nPlant Extracts (Aloe, green tea for soothing/antioxidants)\nPeptides (Anti-aging support)\nApply after cleansing and toning in the AM.\nFollow with sunscreen (if the cream lacks SPF).\nUse consistently for best results (4–6 weeks for visible brightening).\nThose with dull, uneven skin tone.\nPeople targeting early signs of aging.\nNormal to dry skin types (check if it’s oil-free for oily skin).\nVitamin C Sensitivity: Some forms (like L-ascorbic acid) can irritate sensitive skin. Patch test first.\nSun Protection: If no SPF, always pair with a broad-spectrum sunscreen to prevent UV-induced pigmentation.\nFor optimal results, pair with a Vitamin C serum at night or other actives like retinol (if tolerated). Always check the ingredient list for personal allergens (e.g., fragrance, essential oils).\nWould you like help finding alternatives or a nighttime routine to complement this?', 484.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 66.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'DR. RASHEL Vitamin C Brightening & Anti-Aging (DAY CREAM)Price in BD', 'DR. RASHEL Vitamin C Brightening & Anti-Aging (DAY CREAM) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-rashel-vitamin-c-brightening-anti-aging-day-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1478, 'OSUFI Black Bandage Anti-wrinkle Essence Cream Moisturizing Hydrate Brighten Lighten Fine Lines Firm Ant Aging Skin Care 50gm', '1', 0, 39, 35, '1478', '1478', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OSUFI Black Bandage Anti-wrinkle Essence Cream (50gm) is a specialized skincare product formulated to address signs of aging, providing hydration and nourishment while targeting fine lines and wrinkles. This essence cream aims to deliver comprehensive anti-aging benefits, making it suitable for a variety of skin types.\nOSUFI Black Bandage Anti-wrinkle Essence Cream is perfect for individuals seeking an effective solution for aging skin, aiming to hydrate, brighten, and firm the skin while reducing the visible signs of aging. For more detailed information, consider visiting the product page on the official website or trusted beauty retailers.', 748.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 102.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'OSUFI Black Bandage Anti-wrinkle Essence Cream Moisturizing Hydrate Brighten Lighten Fine Lines Firm Ant Aging Skin Care 50gmPrice in BD', 'OSUFI Black Bandage Anti-wrinkle Essence Cream Moisturizing Hydrate Brighten Lighten Fine Lines Firm Ant Aging Skin Care 50gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'osufi-black-bandage-anti-wrinkle-essence-cream-moisturizing-hydrate-brighten-lighten-fine-lines-firm-ant-aging-skin-care-50gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1479, 'Vitasoft-E Cream', '1', 0, 39, 50, '1479', '1479', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vitamin E oil is not same as vitamin E supplements, some users simply pop open vitamin E capsules and put the contents on their skin. Which may not be safe or right to do. You can apply Vitamin E on your skin or or swallow it as a capsule. Both have different benefits. Vitamin E oil is a powerful fat-soluble antioxidant that can rejuvenate your skin and overall health. It encompasses a group of eight compounds that include both tocopherols and tocotrienols. Vitamin E oil in its purest form is extremely versatile. Vitamin E oil is also an ingredient in many skincare products. The biggest risk involved in using Vitamin E capsules for skin care is, difference in the concentration. The 2 different brands of vitamin E capsules might have radically different concentrations and produce different effects in the same person. The Vitamin E in capsules are formulated for your intake and not for your skin application. The manufacturers may add other filler materials to preserve the capsules or as carrier oils. Hence, it is advised to use exclusive Vitamin E skin care product like Vitasoft, that has Natural Vitamin E oil and specifically formulated for benefits of skin. Vitasoft Natural Vitamin E cream has skin rejuvenating and intense moisturizing properties. Vitamin E that is present in this cream is sourced from oil seeds and is 100% natural. With natural vitamin E as the key ingredient, this cream blocks the free radical activity and protects the skin against acne breakouts. Bionova Natural Vitamin E cream protects the skin against photobiological damages such as sunburns, dark spots and skin sagging.', 1505.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 80.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Vitasoft-E CreamPrice in BD', 'Vitasoft-E Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vitasoft-e-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1480, 'Angel Melasma Cream – 12g (Made in Thailand)', '1', 0, 39, 240, '1480', '1480', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Overview:Angel Melasma Cream is a specialized skincare solution designed to reduce melasma, dark spots, freckles, age spots, and hyperpigmentation. Formulated in Thailand, this unisex cream nourishes and hydrates the skin while working to lighten discolored patches for a brighter, even-toned complexion. Results can be seen in as little as 2 weeks with consistent use.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces melasma, dark spots, and age spots\nFades freckles and hyperpigmentation\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes the skin\nSuitable for all skin types, for both men and women\nPromotes a brighter, even-toned complexion\nShows visible results in 2 weeks\nSpecifications:\nCondition: Brand new\nNet Weight: 12g\nFormulation: Cream\nGender: Unisex\nSkin Type: All skin types\nFeatures: Contains vitamins\nConcerns: Melasma\nCountry of Manufacture: Thailand\nPackage Includes: 1 x Angel Melasma Cream\nHow Angel Melasma Cream Works:Melasma is caused by excess melanin production, often triggered by sun exposure, hormonal changes, or genetics. Angel Melasma Cream works to:\nInhibit melanin production to lighten dark spots\nPromote gentle skin exfoliation to remove pigmented cells\nProtect the skin from further darkening\nCommon Active Ingredients:\nHydroquinone: Reduces melanin production\nKojic Acid: Brightens skin and fades dark spots\nVitamin C: Antioxidant that reduces hyperpigmentation\nNiacinamide (Vitamin B3): Reduces dark spots and strengthens the skin barrier\nAzelaic Acid: Treats pigmentation and soothes inflammation\nRetinoids (Retinol/Tretinoin): Promote skin cell turnover\nArbutin: Natural skin-lightening agent\nSPF (Sunscreen): Protects against UV-induced melasma\nHow to Use:\nCleanse your face thoroughly\nApply a thin layer of cream to affected areas, once or twice daily\nAlways use sunscreen (SPF 30+) during the day\nAvoid harsh scrubbing or exfoliation\nPrecautions & Side Effects:\nMay cause redness, irritation, or peeling (especially with retinoids)\nIncreases sensitivity to sunlight\nAllergic reactions possible in some individuals\nPerform a patch test before first use\nBest Practices for Optimal Results:\nUse consistently every day\nProtect your skin from sun exposure\nConsider combining with other treatments (e.g., SPF + retinol)\nConsult a dermatologist if melasma persists or worsens', 682.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 368.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Angel Melasma Cream – 12g (Made in Thailand)Price in BD', 'Angel Melasma Cream – 12g (Made in Thailand) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'angel-melasma-cream-12g-made-in-thailand', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1481, 'Pond\'s Rejuveness Anti‑Wrinkle Cream 200 gm', '1', 0, 39, 193, '1481', '1481', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reduces Fine Lines & Wrinkles: Formulated with Alpha Hydroxy Acids (AHAs) to gently exfoliate dull surface skin cells, revealing smoother skin.\nEnhances Skin Elasticity: Infused with collagen, a protein known to increase skin strength and elasticity.\nDeep Moisture: Contains Vitamin E, an antioxidant that helps moisturize and maintain the healthy appearance of skin.\nNon-Comedogenic: Won’t clog pores, making it suitable for daily use.\nActive Ingredients: Lactic Acid (AHA)Key Components: Collagen, Vitamin EAdditional Ingredients: Water, Glycerin, Cetyl Alcohol, Isopropyl Palmitate, Steareth-21, Dimethicone, Mineral Oil, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Stearyl Dimethicone, Steareth-2, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Isohexadecane, Polysorbate 60, Magnesium Aluminum Silicate, Stearic Acid, Borago Officinalis Seed Oil, Fragrance, Methylparaben, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Titanium Dioxide, Xanthan Gum, Dimethiconol, Disodium EDTA, Benzophenone-3, Propylparaben.\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\nApply the cream evenly to your face and neck every morning and evening.\nMassage gently until fully absorbed.\nAvoid contact with eyes and eyelids. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nIf irritation develops, discontinue use and consult a doctor.\nKeep out of reach of children.', 2240.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 960.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Rejuveness Anti‑Wrinkle Cream 200 gmPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s Rejuveness Anti‑Wrinkle Cream 200 gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-rejuveness-antiwrinkle-cream-200-gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
