(1486, 'Swiss Beauty Hydra Alovera Eye Serum Patch 60pcs', '1', 0, 39, 318, '1486', '1486', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Swiss Beauty Hydra Aloe Vera Eye Serum Patch 60pcsSwiss Beauty Hydra Aloe Vera Eye Serum Patch 60pcs is a hydrating under-eye care solution designed to refresh tired-looking eyes and improve overall under-eye appearance. Enriched with Aloe Vera, these cooling eye patches help soothe the delicate skin while providing moisture and comfort. 100% authentic and available at the best price from Arogga Bangladesh, this product is suitable for daily skincare routines and for anyone looking for reliable under eye patches with a calming effect.\nKey Features• Aloe Vera–enriched formula helps hydrate and nourish the delicate under-eye area• Cooling eye serum patch texture provides a soothing and relaxing feel on application• Helps reduce the visible appearance of dark circles with regular use• Lightweight patches help minimize the look of puffiness and tired eyes• Comes with a spatula for hygienic, easy, and mess-free application\nUsage Direction• Cleanse and dry your face thoroughly• Use the spatula to gently place one patch under each eye• Leave on for 15–20 minutes• Remove the patches and gently pat the remaining serum into the skin• Continue with your regular skincare routine\nWhy This Color/Shade Is for YouThese transparent eye serum patches suit all skin tones and fit seamlessly into both morning and evening skincare routines. They are ideal for people experiencing dull or tired under-eye appearance due to long screen time, stress, or lack of sleep, and help create a smooth, refreshed base before makeup application.\nFAQIs this eye patch suitable for all skin types?Yes, it is formulated to be gentle and suitable for all skin types.Can I use these patches every day?Yes, they can be used regularly as part of your skincare routine.Do these patches help with puffiness?They help reduce the visible appearance of under-eye puffiness with consistent use.Can I apply makeup after using the eye patches?Yes, wait until the serum is fully absorbed before applying makeup.Is this product authentic on Arogga Bangladesh?Yes, Arogga Bangladesh ensures 100% authentic products for customers.', 599.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '60pc', 0.00, 1, NULL, 201.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Swiss Beauty Hydra Alovera Eye Serum Patch 60pcsPrice in BD', 'Swiss Beauty Hydra Alovera Eye Serum Patch 60pcs Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'swiss-beauty-hydra-alovera-eye-serum-patch-60pcs', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1487, 'Melao Miracle Retinol Moisturizer with 2.5% Active Retinol, Vitamin E & Carnosine 50ml', '1', 0, 39, 30, '1487', '1487', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Retinol is the 1 dermatologist-recommended skin care ingredient today. Active Retinol is in a very high concentration of Retinol. This retinol cream gives you the younger-looking and healthier-looking skin around your face and eye area. Proven results: Increase cell turnover, stimulate collagen and elastin production, fade hyperpigmentation, and help skin stay hydrated and glowing without irritation. Moreover, retinol can treat and prevent everything from stubborn cystic acne and eczema to sun-induced wrinkles and dark spots. DIRECTIONS: Apply it all over your face, neck, and decolette. It can be morning and night. Apply after washing, toning and then a serum. This cream works very well with Vitamin C serum. CAUTION: For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse well with water. Keep out of children.\n', 800.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 250.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao Miracle Retinol Moisturizer with 2.5% Active Retinol, Vitamin E & Carnosine 50mlPrice in BD', 'Melao Miracle Retinol Moisturizer with 2.5% Active Retinol, Vitamin E & Carnosine 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-miracle-retinol-moisturizer-with-25-active-retinol-vitamin-e-carnosine-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1488, 'Neutrogena Rapid Wrinkle Repair Retinol Moisturizer Sunscreen Broad Spectrum SPF 30 29ml', '1', 0, 39, 151, '1488', '1488', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Neutrogena Rapid Wrinkle Repair® Daily Retinol Moisturizer with SPF 30 is a powerful anti-aging cream designed to visibly reduce fine lines, wrinkles, and signs of sun damage—while providing essential sun protection.\nThis dermatologist-recommended formula combines pure Retinol SA, hydrating Hyaluronic Acid, and Broad Spectrum SPF 30 to fight signs of aging and help rejuvenate skin from within.\nVisibly reduces fine lines, forehead wrinkles, and crow’s feet\nProvides daily UVA/UVB protection with SPF 30\nHydrates skin and improves tone and texture\nTargets dullness, dark spots, and uneven skin tone\nFast-absorbing, non-greasy, and suitable for daily use\n100% of women showed noticeable improvements in just 1 week\nDermatologist-tested, free from parabens, mineral oil, and dyes\nFrom the #1 Retinol brand most used by dermatologists', 2915.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 85.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Rapid Wrinkle Repair Retinol Moisturizer Sunscreen Broad Spectrum SPF 30 29mlPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Rapid Wrinkle Repair Retinol Moisturizer Sunscreen Broad Spectrum SPF 30 29ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-rapid-wrinkle-repair-retinol-moisturizer-sunscreen-broad-spectrum-spf-30-29ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1489, 'Biotopix Cream', '1', 0, 39, 351, '1489', '1489', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\n\nHands not only are susceptible to the first signs of aging, but very often age even faster than the face. There is very little fat on the backs of the hands, so when even a small amount of collagen or elastin fibers begins to break down – which is part of the normal aging process – it’s going to have a noticeable impact on hands.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream is an original formula combining a tightening effect, a collagen accelerator, a potent moisturizer and a strongwhitening activity. This gentle cream also contains high UV-protection.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream reduces and changes the type and aspect of wrinkles that add years to the skin appearance. Biotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream contains a natural blend created from extracts of Kiwi and Sophora in a vegetable origin butylene glycol which are effective to fight age spots as well as hyperpigmentation. It will also help preserve the skin moisture content by protecting hyaluronic acid in the skin tissue.\nApply at will on the hands and rub in gently.\nTube of 50 g.\nMade in France.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream was tested on B16 melanocytes in vitro at several concentrations. Its efficacy was compared to an existing version made with petrochemical origin butylene glycol. Melanin synthesis inhibition is dose-dependent.Biotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream used at 1% inhibits more than 100% of melanin synthesis induced by NDP-MSH.\nBiotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream not only inhibits melanin synthesis induced by NDP-MSH, but also reduces the basal melanin content. When the cytotoxic activity of Biotopix Specific Hands Anti-aging Cream was compared to Kojic acid, a positive whitening reference, it showed a far greater safety than Kojic acid in cell culture. The safety of melanocytes is improved. No associated cytotoxicity is noticed.Biotopix Specific Hand Anti-aging Cream allows to obtain a clear whitening of dark spots without harming the cells.\n', 2680.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2680.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biotopix CreamPrice in BD', 'Biotopix Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biotopix-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27');
