(1490, 'Cosmed Complete Benefit Spot Control Gel 15ml', '1', 0, 39, 132, '1490', '1490', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Overview:Cosmed Complete Spot Control Gel is a targeted skincare solution designed for oily, combination, and acne-prone skin. This lightweight, leave-on gel helps control acne formation, reduce blemishes, and improve overall skin texture. Dermatologically tested and alcohol-free, it is suitable for both men and women.\nKey Benefits:\nAcne Treatment: Targets active pimples, blackheads, and whiteheads while reducing inflammation and redness.\nSpot Correction: Fades post-acne marks and prevents new dark spots.\nSebum Control: Regulates excess oil production, especially in the T-zone, minimizing shine and clogged pores.\nSkin Texture Improvement: Promotes smoother, healthier-looking skin by supporting renewal and preventing rough patches.\nPreventive Care: Contains antimicrobial agents like Tea Tree Oil to keep pores clean and reduce future breakouts.\nKey Ingredients:\nTea Tree Oil: Antiseptic properties help prevent acne-causing factors.\nCrocus Chrysanthus Extract: Stimulates collagen and elastin for skin renewal.\nGinkgo Biloba Extract: Protects against environmental stressors with antioxidant effects.\nAC.NET™ Complex: Controls sebum production and combats acne-related issues.\nSuitable For:\nOily and combination skin\nAcne-prone individuals\nLocalized breakouts or recurring blemishes\nTeens and adults\nHow to Use:After cleansing, apply a small amount directly to affected areas. Leave on; do not rinse. Use consistently for best results.\nSize: 15ml', 1150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmed Complete Benefit Spot Control Gel 15mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmed Complete Benefit Spot Control Gel 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmed-complete-benefit-spot-control-gel-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1491, 'Biogeniq Professional Care Vitamin C Facial Serum 30ml – Anti-Dark Tone & Anti-Aging for Smooth Skin Texture', '1', 0, 39, 348, '1491', '1491', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elevate your skincare routine with the Biogeniq Professional Care Vitamin C Facial Serum, specially formulated to combat dark spots, uneven skin tone, and signs of aging. Enriched with potent Vitamin C, this serum brightens the complexion while improving skin texture, leaving the skin smooth, radiant, and youthful.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces the appearance of pigmentation and dark spots for a more even skin tone.\nHelps diminish fine lines and wrinkles, promoting firmer and more resilient skin.\nSmooths rough patches and enhances overall skin softness.\nRestores natural glow and vitality.\nLightweight, fast-absorbing formula suitable for daily use.\nUsage:Apply a few drops onto cleansed face and neck in the morning and/or evening. Gently massage until fully absorbed. For best results, follow with a moisturizer and sunscreen during the day.\nKey Ingredients:\nVitamin C: Brightens and protects against environmental damage.\nActive Skin-Improving Agents: Enhance firmness and texture.\nSuitable For:All skin types, especially those looking to target dark spots, dullness, and early signs of aging.\nPackaging:30ml bottle with dropper for precise application.', 2691.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 299.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biogeniq Professional Care Vitamin C Facial Serum 30ml – Anti-Dark Tone & Anti-Aging for Smooth Skin TexturePrice in BD', 'Biogeniq Professional Care Vitamin C Facial Serum 30ml – Anti-Dark Tone & Anti-Aging for Smooth Skin Texture Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biogeniq-professional-care-vitamin-c-facial-serum-30ml-anti-dark-tone-anti-aging-for-smooth-skin-texture', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1492, 'Pond\'s Essential Care Nourishing Anti Wrinkle S Cream with White Tea & Oat Oil for Dry Skin', '1', 0, 39, 193, '1492', '1492', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pond\'s Essential Care Nourishing Anti-Wrinkle Cream is an anti-aging facial cream that is especially suitable for dry skin. Its formula contains:\nBenefits:\nHow to use:Apply evenly morning/evening to clean, dry skin on the face and neck. To improve absorption, it can be accompanied by a light massage.\nCountry of Origin: Valencia', 710.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 340.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Essential Care Nourishing Anti Wrinkle S Cream with White Tea & Oat Oil for Dry SkinPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s Essential Care Nourishing Anti Wrinkle S Cream with White Tea & Oat Oil for Dry Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-essential-care-nourishing-anti-wrinkle-s-cream-with-white-tea-oat-oil-for-dry-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1493, 'Biogeniq Professional Care Multi-Action Firming & Anti-Aging Day Cream 50ml – Skincare forYouthful Skin', '1', 0, 39, 348, '1493', '1493', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skin every morning with the Biogeniq Professional Care Multi-Action Firming & Anti-Aging Day Cream. This advanced formula is designed to combat signs of aging, improve skin elasticity, and provide lasting hydration, helping you achieve a firmer, smoother, and more youthful complexion.\nKey Benefits:\nFirming Action: Enhances skin elasticity and reduces the appearance of sagging.\nAnti-Aging: Helps minimize fine lines and wrinkles for a rejuvenated look.\nDeep Hydration: Provides long-lasting moisture to keep skin soft and supple throughout the day.\nSkin Protection: Creates a protective barrier against environmental stressors.\nDaily Use Formula: Lightweight, non-greasy, and fast-absorbing, ideal for all skin types.\nUsage:Apply evenly to cleansed face and neck each morning. Gently massage until fully absorbed. For best results, use alongside a sunscreen for added protection against UV damage.\nKey Ingredients:\nActive Firming Agents: Promote elasticity and support skin structure.\nHydrating Complex: Ensures lasting moisture and smooth texture.\nAnti-Aging Components: Help reduce the visible signs of aging over time.\nSuitable For:All skin types, especially those seeking to combat early signs of aging, sagging skin, and dryness.\nPackaging:50ml cream in a convenient jar or tube for daily application.', 2691.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 299.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biogeniq Professional Care Multi-Action Firming & Anti-Aging Day Cream 50ml – Skincare forYouthful SkinPrice in BD', 'Biogeniq Professional Care Multi-Action Firming & Anti-Aging Day Cream 50ml – Skincare forYouthful Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biogeniq-professional-care-multi-action-firming-anti-aging-day-cream-50ml-skincare-foryouthful-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1494, 'Quiyum Retinol Smooth Wrinkle Moisturizer', '1', 0, 39, 5, '1494', '1494', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Quiyum Retinol Moisturizer Smooth Wrinkle Cream – 30g\nNet: 30gShelf life: 5 YearsMain ingredients: Retinol, Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid\nFunctions1. Remove wrinkleRetinol has the effect of regulating the metabolism of the epidermis and stratum corneum, which can effectively reduce fine lines and wrinkles.\n2. Tighten poresRetinol can repair damaged skin, smooth rough skin, and reduce skin dullness.\n3. NourishingIt can tighten and moisturize skin so as to make your skin smooth and bright.\nHow to useAfter cleansing, apply the cream evenly on the whole face and massage your skin gently until it is absorbed.It’s advised to use it during night time and prepare to guard against expose to the sun.', 378.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 272.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Quiyum Retinol Smooth Wrinkle MoisturizerPrice in BD', 'Quiyum Retinol Smooth Wrinkle Moisturizer Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'quiyum-retinol-smooth-wrinkle-moisturizer', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1495, 'Primaderm XPERT Collageneur Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 39, 144, '1495', '1495', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Description\nIntensive firming cream indicated to visibly reduce the signs of aging and restore firmness with collagen synthesis. Through its concentrated formula based on biotechnological assets of marine origin; Sirtalice and Seadermium, Epitensive as a growth factor together with Neoclair Pro, a powerful biomimetic peptide inspired by the antioxidant benefits of green tea, we manage to prevent and restore the lack of firmness and elasticity while reducing wrinkles and redefining the facial oval.\nDermatologically tested.\n1.Apply morning and night on clean skin of the face, neck and neckline.\n2.Perform a gentle massage until completely absorbed.\n', 5350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -5350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Primaderm XPERT Collageneur Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Primaderm XPERT Collageneur Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'primaderm-xpert-collageneur-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1496, 'Revuele Smoothing & protecting Rentinol Anti Age Moisturizer SPF 30', '1', 0, 39, 146, '1496', '1496', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'REVUELE RETINOL MOISTURIZER SPF 30 is a light yet very potent anti-age face cream that helps to restore loss of hydration and elasticity and to protect skin throughout the day. Designed with high content of Collagen-boosting Retinol and sun protective factor, it works to minimize the visibility of wrinkles, as well as to firm and strengthen the skin texture. The cream also helps prevent the appearance of sunspots. It actively promotes smoother, brighter, younger-looking skin.\nDirections: Apply in the morning onto clean and dry skin of the face and neck, avoiding the eye area. Gently massage until fully absorbed.\nCaution: Individual intolerance to any of the ingredients is possible. Before the first use, perform a sensitivity test. Do not use on damaged or irritated skin! If irritation or excessive redness occurs, cease using the product! Avoid contact with the eyes. In case the product gets into the eyes, rinse immediately with plenty of water.', 550.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 415.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Revuele Smoothing & protecting Rentinol Anti Age Moisturizer SPF 30Price in BD', 'Revuele Smoothing & protecting Rentinol Anti Age Moisturizer SPF 30 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'revuele-smoothing-protecting-rentinol-anti-age-moisturizer-spf-30', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1497, 'I’m From Ginseng Mask 120g', '1', 0, 39, 129, '1497', '1497', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience the rejuvenating power of 6-year-old red ginseng with the I’m From Ginseng Mask. This premium wash-off mask is formulated with 3.97% concentrated red ginseng extract from Geumsan County, Korea, known for its anti-aging and skin-firming benefits. It detoxifies pores, nourishes the skin with antioxidants, restores elasticity, and leaves your complexion smooth, supple, and radiant.\nTip: Mask consistency may vary with room temperature; soften with slightly damp fingertips if too thick.\nGlycerin, Red Ginseng Extract, Panax Ginseng Seed Oil, Licorice Root Extract, Paeonia Albiflora Root Extract, Angelica Gigas Root Extract, Rheum Palmatum Root Extract, Angelica Pubescens Root Extract, Schizonepeta Tenuifolia Extract, Phellodendron Amurense Bark Extract, Malt Extract, Hyaluronic Acid, Boswellia Serrata Resin Extract, Water, and other skin-friendly compounds.\nProperties: Anti-aging, anti-wrinkle, smoothing, nourishing, and antioxidant-rich.\n\nMade In Korea', 3479.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, -3479.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'I’m From Ginseng Mask 120gPrice in BD', 'I’m From Ginseng Mask 120g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'im-from-ginseng-mask-120g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
