(1499, 'Collagen & Luxury Gold Revitalizing Comfort Gold Essence Anti-Wrinkle', '1', 0, 40, 353, '1499', '1499', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1. Energetic energy is soft and moisturizes the skin texture. 2. The active ingredient penetrates the skin to promote collagen production. 3. Wrinkle improvement vital improvements and other various aging symptoms improved. 4. It is thin and refreshing like my skin due to thin soft texture and moisture. 5. Fill up the lack of collagen in your skin, making a firm elastic skin. 6. Moisturizes and protects skin from roughness and dryness. 7. It is deeply absorbed into the skin, making skin rejuvenate from the base firmly. 8. Contains abundance of vitamins preventing oxidative stress and improves to clear and fresh skin. 9. Use 7 ingredients (triethanolamine, mineral oil, paraben, benzophenone, benzyl alcohol, imidazolidinyl urea, petrolatum) to block and protect skin.', 1595.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 255.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Collagen & Luxury Gold Revitalizing Comfort Gold Essence Anti-WrinklePrice in BD', 'Collagen & Luxury Gold Revitalizing Comfort Gold Essence Anti-Wrinkle Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'collagen-luxury-gold-revitalizing-comfort-gold-essence-anti-wrinkle', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1500, 'Caplino Lavender Essential Oil 10ml', '1', 0, 40, 68, '1500', '1500', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Caplino Lavender Essential Oil 10mlCaplino Lavender Essential Oil is a premium-quality, 100% pure and natural essential oil extracted from carefully selected lavender flowers. Known for its calming and therapeutic aroma, this multipurpose oil supports relaxation, stress relief, skincare, and hair care. Available at the best price in Bangladesh from Arogga, ensuring guaranteed authenticity and quality.\nKey Features:• 100% Pure & Natural – Free from additives, fillers, and synthetic fragrances.• Therapeutic Grade Quality – Suitable for aromatherapy, massage, skincare, and hair care.• Calming Lavender Aroma – Warm, herbaceous, and slightly sweet scent for deep relaxation.• Multipurpose Use – Ideal for diffusers, vaporizers, home care, beauty, and wellness routines.• Premium Extraction Process – Ensures maximum purity, potency, and effectiveness.\nBenefits:• Promotes relaxation and supports better sleep quality.• Helps reduce stress, anxiety, and mental fatigue.• Relieves headaches, migraines, and tension when properly diluted.• Supports skin health by soothing irritation and reducing redness.• Nourishes hair and scalp, supporting healthy hair growth.• Helps ease muscle soreness and joint discomfort during massage.• Supports respiratory comfort when inhaled through aromatherapy.• Acts as a natural home freshener and cleaning enhancer.\nIngredients:100% Pure Lavender Essential Oil\nUsage Direction:For aromatherapy, add a few drops to a diffuser or vaporizer. For massage or skincare, dilute with a suitable carrier oil before applying to skin. For hair care, mix a few drops with shampoo or carrier oil and massage into the scalp. For relaxation and sleep support, diffuse before bedtime or apply a diluted drop to pulse points. For home use, add to DIY natural cleaning solutions.\nCaution:For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. Consult a physician before use if pregnant or nursing.Made in PRC', 255.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '10ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 145.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Caplino Lavender Essential Oil 10mlPrice in BD', 'Caplino Lavender Essential Oil 10ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'caplino-lavender-essential-oil-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1501, 'Skin Doctor Saffron Moisturizing & Whitening Concentrated Essence', '1', 0, 40, 263, '1501', '1501', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Doctor Saffron Moisturizing & Whitening Concentrated Essence: A potent blend of saffron extract and moisturizing agents to deeply hydrate while brightening the complexion. This essence revitalizes skin, leaving it supple, radiant, and even-toned. Unlock luminous, youthful skin with each application.', 450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 475.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Doctor Saffron Moisturizing & Whitening Concentrated EssencePrice in BD', 'Skin Doctor Saffron Moisturizing & Whitening Concentrated Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-doctor-saffron-moisturizing-whitening-concentrated-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1502, 'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Essence Water', '1', 0, 40, 34, '1502', '1502', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ginseng has been a cherished herb in Korean history, renowned for its benefits to our overall health and particularly our skin. Our Ginseng Essence Water, made with 80% ginseng water, harnesses the natural power of ginseng, nourishing and hydrating the skin deeply. This essence not only supplies your skin with ample moisture and nutrients but also ensures long-lasting hydration.\n\nFeatures:\nKey Ingredients:Ginseng root water 80% + Ginseng complexIn Donguibogam, a Korean herbal medicine book, ginseng was used as an important oriental medicine and recorded as \'Shincho\', meaning herb from the gods. Hwang Jini, known as the most beautiful woman in the Joseon Dynasty, used a ginseng decoction as a bath water.The rich saponin contained in ginseng helps to quickly supply moisture to the skin and maintain it deep inside the skin for a long time to help create healthy skin.Niacinamide 2%Niacinamide is helpful in controlling sebum secretion and maintaining the oil and moisture balance of the skin.\n\nIngredients:\nPanax Ginseng Root Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Propanediol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Water, Hydroxyacetophenone, Glyceryl Glucoside, Xanthna Gum, Panthenol, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Allantoin, Adenosine, Panax Ginseng Callus Culture Extract, Theobroma Cacao(Cocoa) Extract, Dextrin, Glucose, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Panax Ginseng Berry Extract, Lactobacillus/Panax Ginseng Root Ferment Filtrate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Ethylhexyglycerin, Disodium EDTA\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, pour a few drops into your hands and pat gently onto the face\n\n\nMade in Korea', 1650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Essence WaterPrice in BD', 'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Essence Water Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-of-joseon-ginseng-essence-water', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1503, 'Dr.C Tuna Aqua Revaitalizing Eye Cream 20ml', '1', 0, 41, 272, '1503', '1503', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dr. C. Tuna\'s Aqua Revitalizing Eye Cream is a moisture-rich formula designed to hydrate the delicate skin around the eyes, reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles for a smoother, more youthful look.\nKey Features:\nIntense Hydration: Provides immediate and long-lasting moisturization for up to 48 hours in just one application.\nAnti-Aging Benefits: Helps diminish the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, promoting a youthful appearance.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle formulation appropriate for all skin types.\nConsiderations:\nApplication: In the morning and evening, apply a small amount to the ring finger and gently pat around the eye area until fully absorbed.\nPatch Test: Before full application, perform a patch test to ensure compatibility with your skin.\nConsultation: If you have specific skin conditions or concerns, consult with a dermatologist before use.\nIncorporating Dr. C. Tuna Aqua Revitalizing Eye Cream into your skincare routine can provide essential hydration and contribute to a more youthful and refreshed eye area.\nMade in Turkey', 410.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 290.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr.C Tuna Aqua Revaitalizing Eye Cream 20mlPrice in BD', 'Dr.C Tuna Aqua Revaitalizing Eye Cream 20ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'drc-tuna-aqua-revaitalizing-eye-cream-20ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1504, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Probio Cica Bakuchol Eye Cream', '1', 0, 41, 16, '1504', '1504', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Introducing the SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Bakuchiol Eye Cream, a powerful yet gentle solution for the delicate eye area. This 20ml (0.68 fl.oz) eye cream harnesses the potent benefits of centella asiatica, a plant renowned for its soothing and healing properties. Enriched with bakuchiol, a plant-based alternative to retinol, it helps diminish the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles while promoting a smoother, more youthful-looking complexion. The probiotics in this formula aid in strengthening the skin\'s natural barrier, while the cica (centella) extract soothes and calms irritation. Lightweight and easily absorbed, this eye cream hydrates and nourishes the sensitive eye area, leaving it refreshed and revitalised. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin, this eye cream is a must-have for anyone seeking a comprehensive solution to target signs of ageing and fatigue around the eyes.\nMade in Korea', 1100.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Probio Cica Bakuchol Eye CreamPrice in BD', 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Probio Cica Bakuchol Eye Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-probio-cica-bakuchol-eye-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
