(1509, 'Mamaearth Bye Bye Dark Circles Eye Cream with Cucumber & Peptide', '1', 0, 41, 3, '1509', '1509', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mamaearth Bye Bye Dark Circles Eye Cream with Cucumber & Peptide\nTiring days and sleepless nights can harm your beautiful eyes and make you look dull and tired with those stubborn dark circles. Whatever the reason for your dark circles may be - melanin deposit, iron deposit, stress, pollution or sleepless nights, Mamaearth Bye Bye Dark Circles Eye Cream is here to help you rejuvenate your eyes with the goodness of natural ingredients. Cucumber soothes under-eye skin and reduces dark circles, Hawkweed Extract, Peptides & Daisy Flower Extract reduce melanin deposition in the skin to a great extent, which ultimately reduces the visibility of dark circles. This dark circle cream by Mamaearth is dermatologically tested, and has no harmful chemicals and is free of toxins like Parabens and Mineral Oil.\n\n\n\n\n\nIt is rich in vitamin C and has high water and antioxidant content. Cucumber helps neutralizing the harmful radicals produced by Sun’s UV rays. It helps enhance collagen while keeping the skin hydrated and tightened.\nDaisy Flower extract helps in naturally exfoliating the skin & thus reducing dark circles caused due to daily sun exposure.\nThis skin repairing agent enhances collagen in the skin and helps to make it look young and wrinkle-free. It reduces visible skin damage and strengthens the skin\'s underlying supportive elements.\nThis skin conditioning and masking agent helps to fight dark circles. It regenerates the skin; hence, reducing the appearance of dark circles.\n\n\n\nSkin tightening properties of Cucumber & Peptides in this eye cream helps reduce dark circles caused due to work & pollution.\nThe soothing and nourishing effects of Hawkweed and Daisy extracts help target the appearance of dark shadows, for youthful under eye skin that look well-rested.\nThis cream comes in a sleek tube with a fine nozzle, making it easy to apply and to carry in small bags, purses, pockets, etc.\n\n\n\nOur Bye Bye Dark Circles is enriched with the goodness of Cucumber extract, Peptides, and Daisy Flower and Hawkweed Extract.\nAll Mamaearth products go through strict testing to ensure they are safe for use.\nAll our products have no Paraben and Silicones that may cause changes in the body.', 490.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '20g', 0.00, 1, NULL, -490.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Bye Bye Dark Circles Eye Cream with Cucumber & PeptidePrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Bye Bye Dark Circles Eye Cream with Cucumber & Peptide Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-bye-bye-dark-circles-eye-cream-with-cucumber-peptide', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
