(1520, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Under Eye Cream Vitamin C & Turmeric 20 g', '1', 0, 41, 3, '1520', '1520', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten and refresh your under-eye area with Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Under Eye Cream. Enriched with Vitamin C and Turmeric, this gentle cream helps reduce dark circles, puffiness, and tired-looking eyes, giving you a radiant, well-rested appearance every day.\n✨ Reduces Dark Circles – Vitamin C brightens and evens out skin tone under the eyes.\n🌿 Soothes & Reduces Puffiness – Turmeric’s natural anti-inflammatory properties calm and refresh tired eyes.\n💧 Hydrates & Nourishes – Lightweight, non-greasy formula keeps delicate under-eye skin soft and smooth.\n🛡️ Safe & Gentle – Dermatologically tested, free from parabens, sulfates, and harmful chemicals.\nTake a small amount on your ring finger.\nGently dab and massage around the under-eye area.\nUse daily, morning and night, for best results.\nVitamin C – Brightens and combats dark circles.\nTurmeric – Reduces inflammation and soothes skin.\nAloe Vera & Glycerin – Hydrate and nourish the delicate under-eye area.\nNet Weight: 20 gMade by: Mamaearth, India', 792.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 198.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Under Eye Cream Vitamin C & Turmeric 20 gPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Under Eye Cream Vitamin C & Turmeric 20 g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-vitamin-c-daily-glow-under-eye-cream-vitamin-c-turmeric-20-g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
