(1522, 'Isme Eye Gel with Grape Extract – 10g ,Nourishing Eye Care & Dark Circle Reducer', '1', 0, 41, 169, '1522', '1522', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Isme Eye Gel with Grape Extract is a lightweight, nourishing gel designed to care for the delicate skin around the eyes. Enriched with Grape Seed Extract, this eye gel helps reduce dark circles, minimize fine lines, and improve skin elasticity while providing deep hydration. Its antioxidant-rich formula revitalizes tired-looking eyes, leaving the under-eye area smoother, fresher, and naturally radiant.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces dark circles and puffiness\nHydrates and nourishes delicate eye skin\nHelps smooth fine lines and signs of aging\nRevitalizes tired, dull-looking eyes\nLightweight, non-greasy formula suitable for daily use\nHow to Use:\nApply a small amount of eye gel to the skin around the eyes.\nGently smooth in using fingertips until fully absorbed.\nUse every morning and night for best results.\nIngredients:Water (Aqua), Propanediol, Methylsilanol Mannuronate, Butylene Glycol, Carbomer, Propylene Glycol, Castor Oil, Witch Hazel Water, Grape (Vitis Vinifera) Seed Extract, Salicylic Acid, Sodium Aspartate, Metabisulfite, Mica, Sodium Methylparaben, Sorbic Acid, Propylparaben, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 33 (CI 17200), Blue 1 (CI 42090), Alcohol.\nManufacturer: S&J International Enterprise Co., Ltd., Chonburi, ThailandDistributor: T.P.4 International Co., Ltd., Bangkok, ThailandNet Weight: 10g', 432.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Isme Eye Gel with Grape Extract – 10g ,Nourishing Eye Care & Dark Circle ReducerPrice in BD', 'Isme Eye Gel with Grape Extract – 10g ,Nourishing Eye Care & Dark Circle Reducer Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isme-eye-gel-with-grape-extract-10g-nourishing-eye-care-dark-circle-reducer', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1523, 'Sebamed Anti Aging Lifting Eye Cream', '1', 0, 41, 325, '1523', '1523', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Sebamed Anti-Ageing Q10 Lifting Eye Cream (15ml) is formulated to reduce wrinkles, fine lines, and puffiness around the delicate eye area. It contains Coenzyme Q10, which activates energy production in skin cells, helping to maintain smoothness and elasticity. Regular use can lead to a noticeable reduction in the depth of wrinkles.\nKey Features:\nCoenzyme Q10: Activates energy production in skin cells, aiding in maintaining skin\'s smoothness and elasticity.\nMoisturizing Complex: Includes ingredients like Glycerin and Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter) to provide hydration.\npH 5.5: Supports the skin\'s natural protective barrier.\nSuitable for Sensitive Skin: Free from parabens, paraffin, and colorants.\nHow to Use:\nMade in Germany', 1289.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '15ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 661.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sebamed Anti Aging Lifting Eye CreamPrice in BD', 'Sebamed Anti Aging Lifting Eye Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sebamed-anti-aging-lifting-eye-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
