(1526, 'Benton Snail Bee Ultimate Eye Cream 10g – Dark Circle & Wrinkle Care', '1', 0, 41, 19, '1526', '1526', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Benton Snail Bee Ultimate Eye Cream is a concentrated Korean eye treatment formulated to brighten dark circles, smooth fine lines, and deeply hydrate delicate under-eye skin. Its lightweight texture absorbs quickly without stickiness, leaving eyes refreshed and youthful.\nDark Circle Brightening – Niacinamide, bee venom, and botanical extracts help reduce discoloration and improve skin tone.\nWrinkle & Fine Line Care – Multiple peptides, collagen, and adenosine support skin elasticity for a firmer, smoother look.\nIntense Hydration – Multi-molecular hyaluronic acid complex locks in moisture for long-lasting suppleness.\nSkin Barrier Support – Ceramide NP, beta-glucan, and panthenol strengthen the skin’s protective barrier and soothe irritation.\nSoothing & Revitalizing – Aloe vera, willow bark, and herbal extracts calm puffiness and refresh tired eyes.\nSnail Secretion Filtrate Ferment – Repairs and revitalizes for a smoother, radiant eye area.\nBee Venom – Boosts circulation and supports natural collagen production.\nMulti-Peptide Complex – Includes Copper Tripeptide-1, Hexapeptide-11, and Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4 for firming and anti-aging.\nHyaluronic Acid Complex – Multiple forms (Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed HA, etc.) deliver deep, layered hydration.\nPlant Extracts – Aloe Barbadensis Leaf, Laminaria Digitata, and Salix Alba Bark provide antioxidant and calming effects.\nAfter cleansing and toning, gently pat a small amount around the eye area with your ring finger, morning and night.\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.', 520.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 130.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Benton Snail Bee Ultimate Eye Cream 10g – Dark Circle & Wrinkle CarePrice in BD', 'Benton Snail Bee Ultimate Eye Cream 10g – Dark Circle & Wrinkle Care Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'benton-snail-bee-ultimate-eye-cream-10g-dark-circle-wrinkle-care', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:27'),
(1527, 'OSUFI Collagen Eye Cream Improves Dark Circles Fades Fine Lines Moisturizing 20gm', '1', 0, 41, 35, '1527', '1527', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Osufi Collagen Eye Cream - 20gm\nRevitalize your eyes with Osufi Collagen Eye Cream, specially formulated to target dark circles, fine lines, and dehydration around the delicate eye area. This moisturizing cream is enriched with collagen and other nourishing ingredients, providing a refreshed and youthful look.\nTransform your under-eye area with Osufi Collagen Eye Cream, and enjoy smoother, brighter, and more youthful-looking skin. Perfect for adding to your daily skincare routine!', 451.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 99.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'OSUFI Collagen Eye Cream Improves Dark Circles Fades Fine Lines Moisturizing 20gmPrice in BD', 'OSUFI Collagen Eye Cream Improves Dark Circles Fades Fine Lines Moisturizing 20gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'osufi-collagen-eye-cream-improves-dark-circles-fades-fine-lines-moisturizing-20gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:27', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1528, 'Bioderma Sensibio Eye+ Anti-Fatigue Eye Care 15ml', '1', 0, 41, 227, '1528', '1528', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Active Ingredients: 8-MOLECULES HYALURONIC ACID (HYA), VITAMIN C, PEPTIDE, ORGANIC ROSE WATER\nInactive Ingredients: WATER, ROSA DAMASCENA FLOWER WATER, XANTHAN GUM, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, GLUCOSE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, CHONDRUS CRISPUS EXTRACT, HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM HYALURONATE, HYDROLYZED HYALURONIC ACID, SODIUM ACETYLATED HYALURONATE, HYALURONIC ACID, SODIUM HYALURONATE CROSSPOLYMER, HYDROLYZED SODIUM HYALURONATE, POTASSIUM HYALURONATE, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, PALMITOYL PENTAPEPTIDE-4, HEXAPEPTIDE-9, GLYCERETH-26, PHENOXYETHANOL, CHLORPHENESIN, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, DIPOTASSIUM GLYCYRRHIZATE, HYDROLYZED COLLAGEN, CELLULOSE GUM, DISODIUM EDTA, SODIUM HYDROXIDE\nThis gel contains 8-Molecules HYA, Vitamin C, Peptide, and Organic Rose Water as active ingredients. Please be advised that initial usage may cause irritation if allergic to active ingredients. Don’t use it on broken skin. It is recommended to avoid using eye contour gel during eye conditions like Dry eye, Glaucoma, and Conjunctivitis.', 1919.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 81.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Sensibio Eye+ Anti-Fatigue Eye Care 15mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Sensibio Eye+ Anti-Fatigue Eye Care 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-sensibio-eye-anti-fatigue-eye-care-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1529, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Eye Bags Away Eye Cream 15ml', '1', 0, 41, 104, '1529', '1529', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BioMD Eye Bags Away Eye Cream is a medical-grade eye care solution specially developed to reduce puffiness and visible bags under the eyes. Its advanced, dermatologically tested formula helps soothe swollen eye areas, revitalize tired-looking skin, and restore a fresh, well-rested appearance.\nBioMD Fresh Eyes Eye Cream is designed to help reduce puffiness around the eyes and visibly minimize under-eye bags, making it ideal for daily eye care.\nThis eye cream features an effective anti-edema formula that helps significantly reduce the volume of under-eye bags. It provides antioxidant and revitalizing benefits, supporting skin cell renewal and strengthening the delicate under-eye area. With regular use, the skin appears smoother, firmer, and more refreshed.\nHelps reduce under-eye bags and puffiness\nAnti-edema action for swollen eye areas\nRevitalizes and refreshes tired-looking eyes\nAntioxidant protection against environmental stress\nSupports skin renewal and strengthening\nGentle, medical-grade formulation\nAcetyl Tetrapeptide-5: Helps reduce fluid accumulation and puffiness\nCaffeine: Stimulates circulation and reduces swelling\nGreen Tea Extract: Provides antioxidant protection\nAloe Vera: Soothes and hydrates the delicate eye area\nMango Seed Butter & Jojoba Oil: Nourish and soften the skin\nAqua, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerine, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Seed Butter, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Gossypium Herbaceum (Cotton) Seed Oil, Glyceryl Oleate Citrate, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Oil, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-5, Caffeine, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Glyceryl Caprylate, Tocopherol, Menthyl Lactate, Potassium Sorbate, Citric Acid, Parfum.\nApply twice daily to the cleansed under-eye area. Gently apply from the inner corner of the eye outward and softly massage until absorbed.\nDo not use if you are hypersensitive or allergic to any of the listed ingredients.\nFree from parabens, mineral oils, and phenoxyethanol\nDermatologically tested\nMedical personal care product designed to support natural skin functions\nHerba Anima GmbHRubert-Mayer-Straße 44, Building 6415, 1st Floor\n15 ml', 1993.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 105.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Eye Bags Away Eye Cream 15mlPrice in BD', 'Biomd Organic Medical Skin Care Eye Bags Away Eye Cream 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biomd-organic-medical-skin-care-eye-bags-away-eye-cream-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1530, 'Primaderm XPERT Expression Contour 15ml', '1', 0, 41, 144, '1530', '1530', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Highly concentrated gel for the integral care of the eye contour. Its innovative formula combines two peptides (Acetyl-Hexapeptide-8 and Munapsys™) capable of attenuating expression wrinkles. Scelleye™ Natural Growth Factor helps remove damaged proteins, in synergy with Meiview™ to reduce bags and dark circles. The biotechnological extract Arctalis™ helps reverse the effects produced by blue light.\nClinical studies\n-66% wrinkles expression in 7 DAYS*\n-22% bags in 14 DAYS**\n*In vivo test performed at vol. 20 (59 years) after application of cream with 2% Arctalis™ twice a day for 28 days. Determined with AEVA. **In vivo test performed at vol 9 (49 years) after applying cream with 3% Meiview™ twice a day for 28 days (half of the face). Determined with PRIMOS.', 2950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2950.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Primaderm XPERT Expression Contour 15mlPrice in BD', 'Primaderm XPERT Expression Contour 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'primaderm-xpert-expression-contour-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1531, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Eye Cream 30ml', '1', 0, 41, 96, '1531', '1531', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Eye Cream is a Korean skincare product formulated to target common concerns of the delicate under-eye area, such as fine lines, dark circles, and puffiness. It contains powerful ingredients like PDRN, retinol, and peptides to improve the skin\'s firmness, elasticity, and radiance. The product is a 30ml eye cream with a lightweight, non-sticky texture that is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.', 1867.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 208.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Eye Cream 30mlPrice in BD', 'Medicube PDRN Pink Peptide Eye Cream 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-pdrn-pink-peptide-eye-cream-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
