(1533, 'Truderma i-Luxe Under Eye Gel 15ml', '1', 0, 41, 354, '1533', '1533', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Truderma i-Luxe is a lightweight, fast-absorbing under-eye treatment that targets multiple concerns such as dark circles, puffiness, fine lines, and loss of firmness. Its advanced peptide and vitamin complex hydrates and revitalizes delicate under-eye skin, leaving it brighter, smoother, and refreshed.\nDark Circle & Puffiness Reduction: Haloxyl, Vitamin K2, and Caffeine help diminish under-eye discoloration and fluid retention for a well-rested look.\nAnti-Ageing Support: Matrixyl 3000 peptides (Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1 & Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide) visibly reduce fine lines and deep wrinkles.\nSkin Brightening & Barrier Care: Niacinamide, Lumiskin, and a Ceramide complex improve skin tone, strengthen the moisture barrier, and enhance texture.\nHydration & Firmness: Lightweight gel texture provides lasting hydration without greasiness, helping the skin appear firmer and more supple.\nAfter cleansing and drying, gently press the pump nozzle to dispense a small amount.\nApply under the eyes and along the brow bone.\nMassage with the applicator or pat with fingertips until fully absorbed.\nUse twice daily, morning and night, for best results.\nStore below 30 °C in a cool, dry place away from sunlight.\nFor external use only. Keep out of reach of children.', 2025.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 225.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Truderma i-Luxe Under Eye Gel 15mlPrice in BD', 'Truderma i-Luxe Under Eye Gel 15ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'truderma-i-luxe-under-eye-gel-15ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1534, 'TOCOBO Collagen Brightening Eye Gel Cream', '1', 0, 41, 355, '1534', '1534', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lavender aroma care helps relieve stress and calms skin trouble\nTight net for active ingredients is filled with rich in nutrition and hydration.\nSpread it around your eyes, gently tap and massage until fully absorbed\nVital glowing care comes from a full of Iron, Magnesium, and Kalium\nHydrating skin barrier of tight net activates absorption and hold not to dry out\nThis cream can also be used on other areas like stubborn fine lines and wrinkles\nUses of safe plant-derived collagen and retinol give moist-lifting care\nApply a generous amount on eye area as your last skincare step to revive\n\nMade in Korea', 1280.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 995.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'TOCOBO Collagen Brightening Eye Gel CreamPrice in BD', 'TOCOBO Collagen Brightening Eye Gel Cream Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'tocobo-collagen-brightening-eye-gel-cream', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1535, 'Cerave Eye Repair Cream for Dark Circles and Puffiness 14ml (Made in France)', '1', 0, 41, 153, '1535', '1535', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CeraVe Eye Repair Cream is a dermatologist-developed formula designed to visibly reduce dark circles, puffiness, fine lines, and tired-looking eyes. Enriched with 3 essential ceramides, hyaluronic acid, niacinamide, and a Marine & Botanical Complex, it strengthens the skin barrier, hydrates deeply, and brightens the delicate under-eye area. Lightweight, non-greasy, and fast-absorbing—perfect for daily use and suitable even for sensitive or eczema-prone skin.\nTargets dark circles & puffinessReduces visible under-eye pigmentation, swelling, and tiredness.\nAnti-aging supportHelps improve appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nDeep hydration & elasticityContains collagen, hyaluronic acid, and ceramides for long-lasting moisture and improved firmness.\nBrightening effectNiacinamide + Marine & Botanical Complex helps brighten the entire eye contour.\nBarrier repair formula3 Essential Ceramides restore the natural skin barrier for smoother, healthier skin.\nGentle & safeDermatologist-developed, ophthalmologist-tested, fragrance-free, non-comedogenic, and suitable for eczema-prone skin.\nLightweight & refreshingProvides an energizing cooling sensation for revitalized, awake-looking eyes.\nSafe for contact lens wearersGentle enough for sensitive eyes.\nPerfect for:', 1845.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '14ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 655.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Eye Repair Cream for Dark Circles and Puffiness 14ml (Made in France)Price in BD', 'Cerave Eye Repair Cream for Dark Circles and Puffiness 14ml (Made in France) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-eye-repair-cream-for-dark-circles-and-puffiness-14ml-made-in-france', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1536, 'Ralycos Eyecos Under Eye Creamy Gel 15gm', '1', 0, 41, 142, '1536', '1536', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ralycos Eyecos Under Eye Creamy Gel is an advanced under-eye care formula designed to help reduce dark circles, puffiness, fine lines, and wrinkles for a refreshed and youthful appearance. Its unique roll-on applicator ensures smooth application and better absorption while gently massaging the delicate under-eye area.\nFormulated with a powerful blend of peptides, anti-ageing botanical extracts, and antioxidants, Eyecos works to help dissolve pigments responsible for under-eye darkening, improve skin tone, and support cell regeneration. Ingredients like Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, N-Hydroxysuccinimide, Chrysin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Aloe Vera, Green Tea, Cucumber, and Carrot Extracts help hydrate, soothe, and strengthen the delicate under-eye skin, making it look smoother, brighter, and more even-toned.\nKey Benefits\nHelps reduce dark circles & puffiness\nDiminishes the appearance of fine lines & wrinkles\nEvens under-eye skin tone\nBoosts skin hydration and regeneration\nRoll-on applicator for gentle massage and better absorption\nIngredientsAqua, Isopropyl Myristate, Propanediol, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Stearic Acid, Nannochloropsis Oculata Extract, Pullulan, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Glycerin, Steareth-20, N-Hydroxysuccinimide, Chrysin, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, C12-20 Acid PEG-8 Ester, Hydrolyzed Elastin, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil, Cocos Nucifera Oil, Daucus Carota Sativa Root Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Cucumis Sativus Fruit Extract, Acacia Senegal Gum, Xanthan Gum, Polyacrylate-13, Polyisobutene, Polysorbate 20, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Triethanolamine, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Sodium Hyaluronate, Disodium EDTA.\nDirections for UseClean the under-eye area. Press the pump once to dispense cream onto the roller. Gently roll over the under-eye area until fully absorbed. Use twice daily for best results.\nPrecautionsAvoid direct contact with eyes. Discontinue use if irritation or rash occurs. Keep out of reach of children. Patch test recommended before use.\nStorageStore in a cool, dry place below 30°C. Do not freeze.', 2158.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 92.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Ralycos Eyecos Under Eye Creamy Gel 15gmPrice in BD', 'Ralycos Eyecos Under Eye Creamy Gel 15gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ralycos-eyecos-under-eye-creamy-gel-15gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
