(1538, 'Care:Nel Peptide Max Rescue Eye Cream 25ml', '1', 0, 41, 216, '1538', '1538', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Care:Nel Peptide Max Rescue Eye Cream 25ml (Made in Korea)Care:Nel Peptide Max Rescue Eye Cream is a targeted eye care solution formulated to address fine lines, wrinkles, and dryness around the delicate eye area. Enriched with advanced peptides, adenosine, and a Moist-7-Complex of multiple hyaluronic acids, this eye cream delivers deep hydration, improves skin elasticity, and supports a youthful, refreshed look. Available at the best price in Bangladesh from Arogga with 100% authentic assurance.\nKey Features:• Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5 – Helps improve skin elasticity and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.• Adenosine Powered Formula – Supports anti-aging care by smoothing visible signs of aging.• Moist-7-Complex with Hyaluronic Acids – Provides multi-layer hydration to the delicate eye area.• Ceramide NP Infused – Helps strengthen the skin barrier and retain moisture.• Lightweight Yet Nourishing Texture – Absorbs easily without heaviness or greasiness.\nBenefits:• Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles around the eyes.• Deeply moisturizes and prevents dryness in the eye area.• Improves skin firmness and elasticity for a youthful look.• Soothes and comforts tired, stressed eye skin.\nIngredients:Water, Glycerin, Propanediol, Betaine, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, 1,2-Hexanediol, Butylene Glycol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Hyaluronic Acid, Potassium Hyaluronate, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-5, Ceramide NP, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Niacinamide, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Cetearyl Alcohol, Polyglyceryl-4 Caprate, Allantoin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Adenosine, Chlorphenesin, Ethylhexylglycerin, T-Butyl Alcohol, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia (Bergamot) Fruit Oil, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil.\nUsage Direction:After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount around the eye area. Gently pat with fingertips until fully absorbed. Use daily in the morning and evening for best results.', 990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '25ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 310.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Care:Nel Peptide Max Rescue Eye Cream 25mlPrice in BD', 'Care:Nel Peptide Max Rescue Eye Cream 25ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'carenel-peptide-max-rescue-eye-cream-25ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
