(1541, 'Dabo 3 in 1 Collagen Lifting Eye Cream for Face', '1', 0, 41, 207, '1541', '1541', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Benefits:\nReduces Signs of Aging: Enriched with collagen and peptides, this cream aims to improve skin elasticity, diminishing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\nDeep Hydration: The inclusion of hyaluronic acid provides intense moisture, keeping the skin plump and hydrated.\nBrightens Skin Tone: Niacinamide works to lighten dark circles and even out skin tone, resulting in a more radiant complexion.\nLightweight and Non-Greasy: Its quick-absorbing formula ensures it layers well under makeup or can be used as part of a nighttime routine without leaving a greasy residue.\nHow to Use:\nCleansing: Begin with a clean face, ensuring all makeup and impurities are removed.\nApplication: Apply a small amount of the cream to the under-eye area and other facial regions showing signs of aging.\nGentle Patting: Using your ring finger, gently tap the product into the skin until fully absorbed.\nFrequency: Use twice daily, morning and night, for optimal results.\nIngredients:\nCollagen: Enhances skin elasticity and firmness.\nHyaluronic Acid: Provides deep hydration, maintaining skin moisture.\nNiacinamide: Brightens skin tone and reduces dark circles.\nPeptides: Strengthen skin structure and promote elasticity.', 1041.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 484.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo 3 in 1 Collagen Lifting Eye Cream for FacePrice in BD', 'Dabo 3 in 1 Collagen Lifting Eye Cream for Face Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-3-in-1-collagen-lifting-eye-cream-for-face', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
