(1549, 'Cerave Eye Repair Cream 14.2g (made in USA)', '1', 0, 41, 153, '1549', '1549', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Developed with dermatologists, CeraVe Eye Repair Cream visibly reduces the look of dark circles and puffiness. It contains 3 essential ceramides to repair and restore the protective skin barrier. For optimal results, apply in small dots around the eye area and gently smooth until thoroughly absorbed. Can be used once or twice daily in the AM and/or PM.\n•Fragrance-free•Non-comedogenic•Ideal for all skin types•Ophthalmologist-tested•Allergy-tested•Accepted by the National Eczema Association\n\n\n\n\nCeraVe Eye Repair Cream is a moisturizing eye cream that absorbs quickly into skin and leaves a non-greasy finish.\nMoisturizing eye cream can help to reduce the appearance of dark circles and eye puffiness.\nApply CeraVe Eye Repair Cream in small dots around the eye area and gently smooth until thoroughly absorbed. Use alone or under makeup once or twice a day in the AM and/or PM.\nWhen layering products like facial moisturizing lotion with spf or facial serums, apply a thin layer of CeraVe Eye Repair Cream & allow product to be absorbed fully before applying the rest of your products.\nAll CeraVe products are developed with dermatologists.\nEye Repair Cream is formulated without fragrance and oil and is non-comedogenic & ophthalmologist-tested. Suitable for all skin types.\nThe National Eczema Association Seal of Acceptance only accepts products that have satisfied the criteria for use for those with eczema or sensitive skin conditions.\nFormulated with Hyaluronic Acid to help retain skin’s natural moisture, Niacinamide to help calm the skin, and 3 Essential Ceramides to help restore & maintain the skin’s natural moisture barrier.\n\nKey Ingredients:•Ceramides: Essential for healthy skin, ceramides help restore and maintain the skin’s natural barrier•Hyaluronic Acid: This ingredient attracts hydration to the skin’s surface and helps the skin retain moisture•Niacinamide: Helps calm the skin\n•MVE Technology: This patented delivery system continually releases moisturizing ingredients for 24-hour hydration\n•Marine & Botanical complex: Helps reduce the look of dark circles and puffiness\n\nMade in USA', 2341.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 989.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Eye Repair Cream 14.2g (made in USA)Price in BD', 'Cerave Eye Repair Cream 14.2g (made in USA) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-eye-repair-cream-142g-made-in-usa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
