(1551, 'Laikou Sakura Mud Mask 5g', '1', 0, 43, 8, '1551', '1551', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nThe Sakura Mud Mask - 5g is a compact yet powerful skincare treatment designed to offer deep cleansing and intense hydration. This mud mask acts as a makeup remover and pores cleanser, infused with natural plant ingredients that are gentle and non-irritating. It effectively controls oil, reduces spots, and balances the skin’s secretion of water and oil for a smooth and delicate complexion.\n\nExperience the transformative power of the Laikou Sakura Mud Mask. This luxurious formula harnesses the purifying properties of volcanic mud to deeply cleanse and unclog pores, while the hydrating essence of sakura extract replenishes essential moisture. Enjoy a visibly clearer, smoother, and more radiant complexion as this mask effectively controls oil, minimizes pore appearance, and brightens your skin. Say goodbye to impurities and hello to a revitalized, glowing you.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCustomers have praised the Sakura Mud Mask - 5g for its deep-cleansing and hydrating properties. Users report noticeable improvements in skin clarity and texture, with many highlighting its ability to control oil and reduce spots. The natural ingredients and gentle formula make it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\n\n\n\nLaikou is renowned for its high-quality skincare products that incorporate natural ingredients and advanced formulations. The Sakura Mud Mask is part of Laikou\'s commitment to providing effective skincare solutions inspired by traditional beauty rituals.', 35.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 15.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Sakura Mud Mask 5gPrice in BD', 'Laikou Sakura Mud Mask 5g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-sakura-mud-mask-5g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1552, 'LAIKOU Matcha Mud Mask 85g', '1', 0, 43, 8, '1552', '1552', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Matcha Mud Mask\nThe penetration of this mask is very stronger, it can absorb pore blackheads and dirt, convergence pores, effectively improve the rough skin quality, regulating oil secretion, maintain the damaged skin.\nCool and refreshing and comfortable, helps to reduce acne and prevent acne, makes the skin more luster. Lets you peel away impurities for a fresh, silky-feeling facial complexion without over-drying.\nFeatures:\nBlackhead RemovalOil Control, Shrink PoresSmooth SkinSkin Care Mask\nHow to use:\nClean your face first, evenly spread suitable amount on the face avoiding eyes and lip.The thickness of the mask about 2-3mm.Let it sit 15-20 minutes before washing it off.Use 2-3 times a week is better.', 510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '85g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 230.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Matcha Mud Mask 85gPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU Matcha Mud Mask 85g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-matcha-mud-mask-85g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1553, 'Laikou Tea Tree Mini Mud Mask', '1', 0, 43, 8, '1553', '1553', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Selected from Italian Tea Tree’s Melaleuca Alternifolia Leaf Oil, LAIKOU TEA TREE MUD MASK can balance oil secretion, soothe skin and reduce acne.\nWith the ingredients of Centella Asiatica Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Extract and Nanotailored Hyaluronic Acid, the texture is smooth and easy to apply. It can clean skin deeply and replenish moisture. The cleansing formula of Kaolin and Bentonite can absorb excess oil and dirt, leaving the skin smooth and delicate.\n\nHow to Use:Apply a layer of mud mask to clean skin (Avoid touching the eyes and lips areas).Leave it for 10-15 minutes and wash your face with water, then follow with the moisturizer.\n\nMade in PRC', 28.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Satche', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Tea Tree Mini Mud MaskPrice in BD', 'Laikou Tea Tree Mini Mud Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-tea-tree-mini-mud-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28');
