(1554, '24K Gold Caviar Pell Off Mask 120ml', '1', 0, 43, 249, '1554', '1554', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nBenefit: 24K GOLD SNAIL TEARING MASK HELPS TO CLEAN BLACKHEADS, DIRT IN PORES AND COSMETIC RESIDUES. IT ALSO IMPROVES SKIN ROUGHNESS AND BALANCE SKIN SECRECTION OF WATER AND OIL, LEAVING YOUR SKIN SOFT AND MOISTURIZED.\nUSAGE:AFTER CLEANSING SKIN, APPLY A PROPER AMOUNT OF CREAM TO THE FACE.GENTLY SPREAD WITH YOUR FINGERS TO COVER THE SKIN EVENLY.AFTER 20 MINUTES, SLOWLY PEEL IT OFF, THEN RINSE WITH WATER.RECOMMENDED TO USE 1-2 TIMES PER WEEK', 318.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 32.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '24K Gold Caviar Pell Off Mask 120mlPrice in BD', '24K Gold Caviar Pell Off Mask 120ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '24k-gold-caviar-pell-off-mask-120ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1555, 'Laikou Eggplant Mud Mask', '1', 0, 43, 8, '1555', '1555', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skin with Eggplant Mud Mask. Fight acne, remove blackheads, and achieve firm, healthy skin.\nMain Ingredients: KAOLIN, MINERAL OIL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, BENTONITE, BETAINE, CI 77891, CI 77491, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, CETEARYL GLUCOSIDE, GLUCOSE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, PEG-100 STEARATE, GLYCERIN, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, ALLANTOIN, SOLANUM MELONGENA (EGGPLANT) FRUIT EXTRACT, CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT\nHow to Use: Apply a layer of mud mask to clean skin (Avoid touching the eyes and lips areas). Leave it for 10-15 minutes and wash your face with water, then follow with the moisturizer.', 27.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 8.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Eggplant Mud MaskPrice in BD', 'Laikou Eggplant Mud Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-eggplant-mud-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1556, 'ISNTREE Mugwort Calming Clay Mask', '1', 0, 43, 238, '1556', '1556', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Isntree Real Mugwort Clay Mask powerhouse clay mask works to reduce sebum, clear waste from pores, and remove dead skin cells. Featuring 6 different types of clay (including Bentonite, Kaolin, French Green Clay and Colloidal Clay) which make up 25% of this purifying mask, it will help clarify and treat oily and acne-prone skin by drawing the gunk to the surface to be washed away. Isntree Real Mugwort Clay Mask has calming and cooling Mugwort and Oat Extract work to eliminate inflammation and irritation. Also features Mugwort powder and Red Bean powder for a mild exfoliation.Isntree Real Mugwort Clay Mask is suitable for all skin types, especially oily and acne-prone skin.\nIngredients:\nWater, Kaolin, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Bentonite, Artemisia Princeps Extract, Stearic Acid, Panthenol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Illite,Artemisia Princeps Leaf Powder, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Water, Castanea Crenata Shell Extract, Origanum Vulgare Leaf Extract, Chamaecyparis Obtusa Leaf Extract, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Extract, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Extract, Cynara Scolymus (Artichoke) Leaf Extract, Lactobacillus/Soybean Ferment Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Cinnamomum Cassia Bark Extract, Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract, Montmorillonite, Calcite, Phaseolus Angularis Seed Powder, Canadian Colloidal Clay, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Beta-Glucan, Methylpropanediol, Algin, Magnesium Aluminum Silicate, Cetyl Alcohol, Butylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Allantoin, Tromethamine, Polyquaternium-51, Ethylhexylglycerin.\nHow to Use: After cleansing, apply onto a dry face avoiding the eye and mouth areas. Leave on for 10-15 minutes and wash off with lukewarm water.', 1650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '100ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ISNTREE Mugwort Calming Clay MaskPrice in BD', 'ISNTREE Mugwort Calming Clay Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isntree-mugwort-calming-clay-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1557, 'Face Facts Refreshing Seaweed Mud Mask 60ml', '1', 0, 43, 357, '1557', '1557', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Face Facts Seaweed Mud Mask Refreshing Smooth 60ml\nIts a super cool detox for your skin!\nOur cleansing mud mask smells of freshwater Seaweed, so if you enjoy the fun of applying a mask, you will love this skin treat. We use Kaolin as its the perfect cleanser, helping to remove impurities + dirt from the skin.\nCleansing detox ,removing impurities + excess sebumKaolin Mineral ClayCleansing non-drying mudVegan Friendly + made with 53% less plastic packaging\nHow To Use:On freshly cleansed skin, apply a thin layer with fingertips or a mask brush (avoiding eye, lips & eyebrows) allow 10 minutes for the mask to take effect. Wash off using a hot cloth and dry. Use as a weekly treatment alongside our Face Facts serums & moisturisers to complete your skincare routine.', 357.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 113.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Face Facts Refreshing Seaweed Mud Mask 60mlPrice in BD', 'Face Facts Refreshing Seaweed Mud Mask 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'face-facts-refreshing-seaweed-mud-mask-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1558, 'Gongskin Vitamin Melasma Ampoule Mask 20g – Stem Cell Power for Bright, Radiant Skin', '1', 0, 43, 358, '1558', '1558', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Gongskin Vitamin Melasma Ampoule Mask combines human umbilical mesenchymal stem cell conditioned media extract with a vitamin complex and tranexamic acid to brighten and even skin tone. Designed as a whitening functional cosmetic, this mask helps reduce the appearance of melasma and dark spots while delivering deep hydration and nourishment. Suitable for all skin types, it leaves skin glowing, healthy, and revitalized.\nKey Benefits:\nBrightens and evens skin tone with Niacinamide and Tranexamic Acid\nProvides intensive hydration with Sodium Hyaluronate\nSupports skin repair and regeneration with stem cell extract\nSmooths and nourishes skin with vitamins (Retinol, Biotin, Ascorbic Acid)\nConvenient single-use ampoule mask for 10–20 minutes\nHow to Use:\nCleanse and tone your face thoroughly.\nApply the mask evenly on the face.\nLeave on for 10–20 minutes.\nRemove the mask and gently pat the remaining essence into the skin until fully absorbed.\nKey Ingredients:Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate, Human Umbilical Mesenchymal Stem Cell Conditioned Media Extract (5ppm), Retinol, Biotin, Ascorbic Acid\nPrecautions:\nDiscontinue use if irritation or adverse reactions occur\nAvoid applying to wounded or broken skin\nAvoid direct contact with eyes\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight\nVolume: 20g / 0.7 ozManufacturer & Distributor: Yeolin Bio, Gimpo-si, Gyeonggi-do, KoreaOrigin: Made in Korea', 121.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 229.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gongskin Vitamin Melasma Ampoule Mask 20g – Stem Cell Power for Bright, Radiant SkinPrice in BD', 'Gongskin Vitamin Melasma Ampoule Mask 20g – Stem Cell Power for Bright, Radiant Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gongskin-vitamin-melasma-ampoule-mask-20g-stem-cell-power-for-bright-radiant-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1559, 'Returnity Yulmu Skinclean Mask 120g', '1', 0, 43, 359, '1559', '1559', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Transform your skin with the Yulmu-In-Cream Mask, designed to provide instant transparent glow, improved circulation, and reduced puffiness. Its nutrient-rich cream texture delivers deep hydration while gently exfoliating old sebum and stubborn keratin with uniform Yulmu granules, leaving skin smooth, moisturized, and refreshed. Ideal for enhancing elasticity, brightening the complexion, and soothing irritation across all skin types.\n\nAll skin types – gentle yet effective for exfoliation, hydration, and soothing.\n\nMade in Korea', 2459.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2459.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Returnity Yulmu Skinclean Mask 120gPrice in BD', 'Returnity Yulmu Skinclean Mask 120g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'returnity-yulmu-skinclean-mask-120g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1560, 'Fenyi Green Tea Mud Mask', '1', 0, 43, 28, '1560', '1560', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LAIKOU FENYI Green Tea Mud Mask Gentle Cleansing Oil Control Skin Rejuvenation Mud Mask 5g x 20pcs\nDescription:1. Fenyi Green Tea Mud Mask is a deep makeup remover and pore cleanser at the same time!2. Not only cleans, smoothes and tightens pores but also helps control excessive sebum which usually causes clogged pores.\nSpecifications:Net Weight: 5g x 20pcsSkin Types: All Skin Types\nHow to Use:Step 1: Spoon the right amount of mud mask and apply evenly over dry face.Step 2: Wait 5-20 minutes, then rinse with warm water.Step 3: After Cleansing, Take proper amount of serum and apply evenly on the face.Step 4: Gently massage all over the face to help the skin absorb.\nPackage includes: 1x 100g Green Tea Mud Mask', 30.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Sachet', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fenyi Green Tea Mud MaskPrice in BD', 'Fenyi Green Tea Mud Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fenyi-green-tea-mud-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1561, 'LAIKOU Matcha Mini Mud Mask', '1', 0, 43, 8, '1561', '1561', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Laikou Matcha Mud Mask is a skincare product designed to cleanse, detoxify, and refresh the skin. Infused with matcha, this mask helps eliminate toxins, tighten pores, and brighten the complexion, leaving your skin feeling smooth and revitalized.\n\nThe Laikou Matcha Mud Mask stands out for its ability to detoxify and nourish your skin, all at an affordable price. Whether you have oily, dry, or combination skin, this mask is designed to suit all skin types and give you a refreshed look with regular use.\n\n\n\nDeep Hydration with Green Tea Moisture: Formulated with freshly squeezed green tea, this mask provides deep hydration, replenishing water into your skin to keep it moisturized and healthy.\nNatural and Gentle Ingredients: Enriched with a blend of natural plant extracts, it is mild and non-irritating, making it suitable for all skin types, even sensitive skin.\nOil Control & Spot Reduction: Controls excess oil production while reducing the appearance of spots and blemishes, leaving your face smoother and more refined.\nDeep Cleansing and Pore Shrinking: The mask penetrates deep into the skin, effectively removing dirt, impurities, and excess oils, while shrinking enlarged pores for a more even complexion.\nRepair Dryness and Fine Lines: By replenishing moisture, this mask helps repair dry lines caused by dehydration, giving your skin a softer and smoother texture.\nNourishes and Replenishes: Infused with essential nutrients, it nourishes the skin while locking in moisture, keeping your face hydrated and refreshed throughout the day.\nEnhances Skin Elasticity: Regular use of this mask helps restore skin elasticity, reducing the appearance of fine lines and leaving your skin firmer and more youthful.\nSmooth and Delicate Skin: With its deep moisturizing and cleansing properties, this mask leaves your skin feeling soft, supple, and revitalized.\n\n\n\nThis Matcha Green Tea Clay Mask deeply detoxifies your skin, drawing out toxins, impurities, and excess oils, leaving your face looking flawless and hydrated. Matcha\'s natural minerals not only cleanse but also tone and moisturize, making your skin feel silky smooth. Regular use delivers powerful antioxidant benefits, helping to delay signs of aging such as wrinkles and fine lines.\n\n\nMade with a blend of organic Matcha, aloe vera, volcanic mud, and tea tree oil, this mask contains no synthetic chemicals, fragrances, or parabens. It’s cruelty-free, ensuring that you treat your skin with nature’s best ingredients, perfect for supporting brighter, smoother, and younger-looking skin.\n\n\nIf you have acne-prone or oily skin, this green tea mask is perfect for you. The natural clay and tea tree oil help to unclog pores, reduce redness, and calm acne flare-ups, giving you clearer and healthier skin with consistent use.\n\n\nThis Matcha Green Tea Face Mask is crafted to suit all skin types, especially acne-prone and sensitive skin. Whether you’re battling breakouts or looking to nourish and detoxify, this mask provides a natural solution free from harmful chemicals.\n\n\nWe stand behind the quality of our product. If you’re not satisfied with your purchase, our 24/7 customer support is always available to assist you. We’re committed to ensuring your skin looks and feels its best.\n\n\n\nFor best results, use 2-3 times a week for glowing, smooth, and refreshed skin।\nMatcha Mud Mask এর প্রধান উপকারিতা হল ত্বকের গভীর পরিচ্ছন্নতা, ছিদ্র সংকোচন এবং ত্বকের উজ্জ্বলতা বৃদ্ধি। এই মাচা মাস্কটি মৃত কোষ দূর করে ত্বককে কোমল করে তোলে এবং অ্যান্টিঅক্সিডেন্টের কারণে বার্ধক্যর লক্ষণ কমায়।', 25.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Satche', 0.00, 1, NULL, 15.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Matcha Mini Mud MaskPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU Matcha Mini Mud Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-matcha-mini-mud-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0,