(1562, 'numbuzin No.1 Dewy Glow Spa Sheet Mask 27ml – Deep Hydration & Soothing Moisture Care', '1', 0, 43, 94, '1562', '1562', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'numbuzin No.1 Dewy Glow Spa Sheet Mask is a deeply hydrating and soothing sheet mask formulated with Jeju Cypress Water (82,948 ppm) to deliver intense moisture and calming care to tired, irritated skin. Inspired by the refreshing feeling of a forest spa, this mask provides long-lasting hydration that leaves the skin plump, smooth, and dewy even the next day.\nInfused with phytoncide-rich cypress water and Houttuynia Cordata extract, it helps soothe sensitive and stressed skin while restoring moisture balance. The seaweed-derived gel sheet adheres smoothly to the skin, delivering essence evenly for a spa-like glow at home.\nDermatologically tested for low irritation, making it suitable for daily soothing care.\nProvides deep, long-lasting hydration\nSoothes irritated and sensitive skin\nHelps calm redness and skin stress\nLeaves skin smooth, plump, and dewy\nSpa-like moisture glow effect\nLow-irritation formula, skin test completed\nSuitable for all skin types\nThe smooth, moisture-rich seaweed sheet holds a high concentration of essence, gently hugging the skin to deeply hydrate dry areas and create a fresh, radiant complexion—just like after a spa treatment.\nAfter cleansing, prep skin with toner.\nRemove the mask and apply evenly, starting from the eye area.\nLeave on for 10–20 minutes.\nRemove the mask and gently pat the remaining essence into the skin until fully absorbed.\nJeju Cypress Water (Chamaecyparis Obtusa Water)\nHouttuynia Cordata Extract\nSodium Hyaluronate\nChlorella Vulgaris Extract\nAllantoin & Betaine\nBotanical Oils & Plant Extracts\n(Full ingredient list included as provided by manufacturer.)\nProduct Name: numbuzin No.1 Dewy Glow Spa Sheet Mask\nVolume: 27 ml / 0.91 fl. oz.\nSkin Type: All Skin Types\nTest: Low-Irritation Test Completed\nCountry of Origin: Made in Korea\nFor external use only\nAvoid