(1563, 'Eshumi Collagen Repair Cica Mask 23ml – Soothing & Skin-Rejuvenating Care”', '1', 0, 43, 360, '1563', '1563', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Eshumi Collagen Repair Cica Mask 23ml – Soothing & Rejuvenating Sheet Mask\nDescription:Eshumi Collagen Repair Cica Mask combines hydrolyzed collagen with centella asiatica (cica) to deliver deep hydration and nourishment to tired, stressed skin. The mask adheres closely to the face, revitalizing skin and leaving it soft, supple, and radiant. Ideal for soothing and rejuvenating dull, fatigued skin.\nKey Benefits:\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes with hydrolyzed collagen and cica\nSoothes irritated or sensitive skin for a calm, healthy complexion\nRejuvenates tired, stressed skin to restore vitality and elasticity\nSheet mask adheres snugly to ensure maximum absorption\nLightweight and refreshing for all skin types\nHow to Use:\nCleanse your face and prep with toner.\nOpen the pouch and evenly place the mask on your face, avoiding eyes and mouth.\nRelax for 15–20 minutes, then remove the mask.\nGently pat remaining essence into skin for full absorption.\nKey Ingredients:Hydrolyzed Collagen (100ppm), Centella Asiatica Extract (110ppm), Sodium Hyaluronate, Dipropylene Glycol, Trehalose, Asiaticoside, Madecassoside, Asiatic Acid, Madecassic Acid\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only\nAvoid using on open wounds or broken skin\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs and consult a physician\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore away from direct sunlight\nVolume: 23ml / 0.77 fl.ozManufacturer & Distributor: Eshumi, KoreaOrigin: Made in Korea', 121.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 229.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Eshumi Collagen Repair Cica Mask 23ml – Soothing & Skin-Rejuvenating Care”Price in BD', 'Eshumi Collagen Repair Cica Mask 23ml – Soothing & Skin-Rejuvenating Care” Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'eshumi-collagen-repair-cica-mask-23ml-soothing-