(1567, 'Cosmed Skinologist No.5 Salicylic Sulfur Mask 75ml', '1', 0, 43, 132, '1567', '1567', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A high-performance exfoliating clay mask formulated for oily, combination, and acne-prone skin. This mask helps reduce skin discoloration, unclog pores, control excess sebum, and refine skin texture, promoting a clear, smooth, and balanced complexion. Dermatologically tested for safety and efficacy.\nKey Benefits:\nTargets blemishes, roughness, and uneven skin tone\nControls oil and minimizes the appearance of pores\nSoothes and purifies the skin\nDermatologically tested, vegan, and cruelty-free\nActive Ingredients:\nColloidal Sulfur: Helps reduce acne and purify skin\nSalicylic Acid (BHA): Exfoliates dead skin cells and unclogs pores\nKaolin & Bentonite: Absorb excess oil and impurities\nRosa Canina Seed Oil & Crocus Chrysanthus Extract: Nourish and support skin regeneration\nWitch Hazel Extract & Squalane: Soothe and hydrate\nFull Ingredient List:Aqua, Kaolin, Bentonite, Colloidal Sulfur, Magnesium Aluminum Silicate, Glycerin, PEG-7 Glyceryl Cocoate, Methyl Methacrylate Crosspolymer, Silica, Salicylic Acid, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Squalane, Rosa Canina Seed Oil, Acacia Senegal Gum, Hamamelis Virginiana Extract, Potassium Sorbate, Crocus Chrysanthus Bulb Extract\nDirections for Use:Apply to clean face and neck, avoiding the eye and lip area. Leave on for 10 minutes, then rinse thoroughly with water. Use 1-2 times per week. For daytime use, pair with SPF 30 or higher sunscreen.\nPrecautions:For external use only. Avoid use on irritated or broken skin. Test on a small patch before first use. Avoid eye contact; rinse thoroughly if contact occurs. Tingling may occur during application.', 1684.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 36.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmed Skinologist No.5 Salicylic Sulfur Mask 75mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmed Skinologist No.5 Salicylic Sul