(1569, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick Mask', '1', 0, 43, 16, '1569', '1569', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick Mask (27g) is a convenient, vegan clay mask designed to purify pores, control excess sebum, and gently exfoliate the skin. Its stick format allows for easy, mess-free application, making it suitable for targeted treatment areas.\nKey Features:\nFive Types of Clay: Contains 18% Kaolin along with Bentonite, Illite, Montmorillonite, and Calamine to effectively absorb excess sebum and impurities, promoting a clearer complexion.\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Known for its soothing properties, it helps calm irritated skin and supports skin healing.\nRed Bean Powder: Provides gentle exfoliation to remove dead skin cells, enhancing skin texture and radiance.\n30% Moisturizing Essence: Infused with Aloe and Centella Asiatica extracts to maintain skin hydration during and after use.\nBenefits:\nPore Cleansing: Effectively unclogs pores, reducing the appearance of blackheads and whiteheads.\nSebum Control: Absorbs excess oil, making it ideal for oily and combination skin types.\nSoothing and Hydrating: Calms the skin while ensuring it remains moisturized, preventing the dryness often associated with clay masks.\nEasy Application: The stick format allows for precise application without the mess, making it convenient for targeted areas or full-face use.\nHow to Use:\nAfter Cleansing: Gently glide the stick over dry skin, focusing on areas with enlarged pores or excess sebum.\nLeave On: Allow the mask to sit for 3 to 5 minutes.\nRinse Off: Thoroughly rinse with lukewarm water and follow up with your regular skincare routine.\nSuitable For:\nOily, combination, and normal skin types.\nIndividuals seeking a quick and mess-free pore-cleansing solution.\nThose looking to control excess sebum and minimize pore appearance.\nMade in Korea', 1320.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '27g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 830.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick MaskPrice in BD', 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-poremizing-quick-clay-stick-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1570, 'Innisfree Super Volcanic Pore Clay Mask', '1', 0, 43, 120, '1570', '1570', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Innisfree Super Volcanic Pore Clay Mask 2X is a face mask that is formulated with Jeju volcanic cluster and AHA, which work together to help remove impurities and exfoliate dead skin cells. The volcanic clusters, found in Jeju Island, are known for their ability to absorb excess sebum and help reduce the appearance of pores. The AHA (alpha hydroxy acids) helps to gently exfoliate the skin and brighten the complexion. The mask is recommended for those with oily or combination skin types, and it can be used once or twice a week for best results. The product comes in a 100ml tube.\nKey Benefits :\nKey Ingredients:\nHow to use:\nIt’s recommended to use the mask 2-3 times a week, applying a thin layer to a clean, dry face, leaving it on for 10-15 minutes and then rinsing off with lukewarm water. It’s also recommended to patch test the product before use, especially if you have sensitive skin.', 1485.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 675.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innisfree Super Volcanic Pore Clay MaskPrice in BD', 'Innisfree Super Volcanic Pore Clay Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innisfree-super-volcanic-pore-clay-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1571, 'Anua Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack', '1', 0, 43, 21, '1571', '1571', NULL, NULL, NULL, '– A pore-care mild clay mask formulated with Bentonite and Kaolin to offer deep cleansing and exfoliating effects, help reduce acne and absorb excess oil, refining pores.– Enriched with Houttuynia Cordata Extract and Quercetin to offer anti-oxidizing and anti-inflammatory effects, while reducing redness and restoring skin barrier.– Further contains Hyaluronic Acid, Soluble Collagen and Protease to facilitate keratin softening while offering plumping and firming effects.– A cream-like texture with a refreshing Eucalyptus scent.\n1. After washing your face, apply the content to the entire face except eye and mouth areas.2. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water after 3-5 minutes.3. Use 1-2 times a week depending on your skin condition.\nWater, Kaolin(20%), Houttuynia Cordata Extract(10.1%), Glycerin, Propanediol, Butylene Glycol, Bentonite(35,000ppm), Hexylene Glycol, Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glyceryl Glucoside, Betaine, Decyl Glucoside, Centella Asiatica Extract, Ficus Carica (Fig) Fruit Extract, Laminaria Japonica Extract, Eclipta Prostrata Leaf Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Soluble Collagen, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Calamine, Houttuynia Cordata Powder(3,060ppm), Xanthan Gum, Dipropylene Glycol, Chlorella Vulgaris Powder, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polyisobutene, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Allantoin, Sorbitan Oleate, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Fructooligosaccharides, Protease, Beta-Glucan, Panthenol, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide NP, Quercetin(100ppb), Palmitoyl Tripeptide-5, Fragrance, Hydroxyacetophenone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Pentylene Glycol, Iron Oxide Yellow\nMade in Korea', 1669.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1006.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Heartleaf Pore Clay PackPrice in BD', 'Anua Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-heartleaf-pore-clay-pack', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1572, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Mud Mask Tube', '1', 0, 43, 8, '1572', '1572', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Net: 80gType: Sleeping mask/Facial cream/MoisturizerSkin type: Oily/Combination/Dry/Common\nRich in sakura extracts, seaweed essence, hyaluronic acid and other nourishing ingredients to repair and protect the skin intensively, LAIKOU Sakura Sleeping Face Mask can restore the lost moisture for your skin when you are sleeping, making your skin moisturized, well-rested and dynamic when wake up!\n1. Rich in sakura extracts, repairs and moisturizes the skin intensively.2. Restores the lost moisture for your skin when you are sleeping, and lets your skin moisturized and dynamic.3. Adjusts water and oil balance, and shrinks pores.4. Nourishes and moisturizes dry skin, brightens and whitens skin, making your skin smooth and elastic.\nAfter basic skin care, apply an appropriate amount of this mask on the face evenly, then waiting for the absorption of the mask. Wash with water in the next morning.', 198.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 352.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Mud Mask TubePrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Mud Mask Tube Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-mud-mask-tube', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
