(1574, 'Medibeau Pearl One Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20ml', '1', 0, 43, 358, '1574', '1574', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Benefits:\nBrightens and revitalizes dull, tired skin with pearl extract\nHelps improve fine lines and wrinkles for a smoother complexion\nSoothes and calms skin with centella asiatica and witch hazel\nDeeply hydrates and nourishes for soft, supple skin\nSingle-use, easy-to-apply sheet mask\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, apply toner to prepare your skin.\nUnfold the sheet mask and place it evenly on your face, aligning with eyes and mouth.\nLeave on for 10–20 minutes.\nRemove the mask and gently pat remaining essence into the skin.\nFollow with your favorite cream if needed.\nKey Ingredients:Pearl Extract, Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract, Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Extract, Adenosine, Glycerin\nPrecautions:\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nAvoid applying to broken or wounded skin\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight\nAvoid contact with eyes\nVolume: 20ml / 0.67 fl.ozManufacturer: Juno Cosmetics Co., Ltd., Incheon, KoreaOrigin: Made in Korea', 121.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 229.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medibeau Pearl One Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20mlPrice in BD', 'Medibeau Pearl One Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medibeau-pearl-one-day-essential-skin-care-mask-pack-20ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1575, 'numbuzin No.3 Tingle-Pore Softening Serum Sheet Mask 27ml – Texture Smoothing & Pore Care', '1', 0, 43, 94, '1575', '1575', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'numbuzin No.3 Tingle-Pore Softening Serum Sheet Mask 27ml – Texture Smoothing & Pore Care\nnumbuzin No.3 Tingle-Pore Softening Sheet Mask is a high-performance serum-infused sheet mask designed to visibly improve skin texture and refine pores overnight. Formulated with premium fermented ingredients and a specialized Tingle-Pore Complex, this mask delivers intensive texture care, leaving skin noticeably smoother, softer, and more refined by the next day.\nInspired by numbuzin’s bestselling No.3 Serum, this mask concentrates its key active ingredients into a single sheet for one-step intensive home care. It helps tighten pores, smooth uneven skin texture, and enhance overall skin clarity while remaining gentle on sensitive skin.\nClinically tested for low irritation, sensitive skin suitability, and pore improvement, with added brightening and wrinkle-improving functional benefits.\nVisibly smooths rough and uneven skin texture\nHelps tighten and refine the appearance of pores\nProvides intensive overnight texture care\nEnhances skin softness and elasticity\nSupports brighter, healthier-looking skin\nContains fermented ingredients for improved absorption\nSuitable for sensitive skin\nDual functional cosmetic: Brightening & Wrinkle Care\nBifida Ferment Lysate\nGalactomyces Ferment Filtrate\nNiacinamide\nAllantoin & Panthenol\nSodium Hyaluronate\nSilk Extract & Goat Milk Extract\nBotanical Extracts & Essential Oils\n(Full ingredient list as provided by the manufacturer.)\nAfter cleansing, prep skin with toner.\nApply the mask evenly over the face.\nLeave on for 10–20 minutes.\nRemove the mask and gently pat the remaining essence into the skin until fully absorbed.\nProduct Name: numbuzin No.3 Tingle-Pore Softening Sheet Mask\nVolume: 27 ml / 0.91 fl. oz.\nSkin Type: All Skin Types (including sensitive skin)\nFunctions: Brightening & Wrinkle Improvement\nTests Completed:\nLow-Irritation Test\nSensitive Skin Test\nPore Improvement Test\nCountry of Origin: Made in Korea\nFor external use only\nAvoid use on damaged or irritated skin\nStop use if redness, swelling, or irritation occurs\nAvoid contact with eyes\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore away from direct sunlight', 220.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'numbuzin No.3 Tingle-Pore Softening Serum Sheet Mask 27ml – Texture Smoothing & Pore CarePrice in BD', 'numbuzin No.3 Tingle-Pore Softening Serum Sheet Mask 27ml – Texture Smoothing & Pore Care Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'numbuzin-no3-tingle-pore-softening-serum-sheet-mask-27ml-texture-smoothing-pore-care', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1576, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Mud Mask', '1', 0, 43, 28, '1576', '1576', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Mud Mask was selected from Kaolin, Sea Silt and Volcanic Soil, which with strong adsorption function and can deeply clean the grease and makeup residue in the pores, soothe and repair skin. With smooth texture and a variety of plant extracts, it also replenish skin moisture and tighten pores, making your skin smooth and clean.\n\nKaolin+Sea Silt+Volcanic Soil：Absorb grease and balance oil secretionButyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter: Moisturize skinPrunus Lannesiana Flower Extract: Brighten skin toneVitamin C(Ascorbic Acid): Reduce oxidationChamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Extract: Soothe and repair skin\n\nINGREDIENTS :\n\nAQUA, KAOLIN, GLYCERIN, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, MINERAL OIL, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCERYL STEARATE, SEA SILT, DIMETHICONE, OZOKERITE, BEESWAX, ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, PEG-100 STEARATE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, PRUNUS LANNESIANA FLOWER EXTRACT, ASCORBIC ACID, MALIC ACID, PRUNUS MUME FRUIT EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, POTASSIUM HYDROXIDE,ETC.', 393.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 257.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Mud MaskPrice in BD', 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Mud Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fenyi-japan-cherry-blossom-mud-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1577, 'Face Facts Brightening Cucumber Clay Mask 60ml', '1', 0, 43, 357, '1577', '1577', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Face Facts Brightening Cucumber Clay Face Mask 60ML\nCool as a cucumber! Our clay mud Mask has been whipped up to give you the creamiest texture and infused with Cucumber Fruit Extract, it packs a punch of Vitamin C + antioxidant Caffeic Acid. This mask will help soothe + deeply hydrate your skin, whilst enhancing your natural radiance', 357.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 113.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Face Facts Brightening Cucumber Clay Mask 60mlPrice in BD', 'Face Facts Brightening Cucumber Clay Mask 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'face-facts-brightening-cucumber-clay-mask-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1578, 'Medibeau Apple & Cucumber One Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20ml', '1', 0, 43, 358, '1578', '1578', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Medibeau Apple & Cucumber One Day Essential Mask Pack delivers gentle hydration and soothing care for tired, dull skin. Enriched with apple and cucumber extracts, this sheet mask calms irritation while providing essential nutrients, helping to restore a healthy, refreshed, and radiant complexion. Centella asiatica and witch hazel extract further soothe the skin, while adenosine works to improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Lightweight and easy to use, this mask is ideal for daily skin care.\nKey Benefits:\nSoothes and calms irritated or sensitive skin\nBrightens and revitalizes dull skin with apple extract\nHydrates and refreshes with cucumber extract\nHelps improve fine lines and wrinkles\nSingle-use, convenient sheet mask\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, apply toner to prepare your skin.\nUnfold the mask and place it evenly on your face, aligning with eyes and mouth.\nLeave on for 10–20 minutes.\nRemove the mask and gently pat remaining essence into the skin.\nFollow with your regular cream if desired.\nKey Ingredients:Apple Extract, Cucumber Extract, Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract, Witch Hazel Extract, Adenosine, Glycerin\nPrecautions:\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nAvoid applying to broken or wounded skin\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight\nAvoid contact with eyes\nVolume: 20ml / 0.67 fl.ozManufacturer: JUNO Cosmetics Co., Ltd., Incheon, KoreaOrigin: Made in Korea', 121.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 229.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medibeau Apple & Cucumber One Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20mlPrice in BD', 'Medibeau Apple & Cucumber One Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medibeau-apple-cucumber-one-day-essential-skin-care-mask-pack-20ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28');
