(1579, 'Medibeau Green Tea One-Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20ml', '1', 0, 43, 358, '1579', '1579', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Medibeau Green Tea One-Day Essential Mask Pack 20ml\nDescription:Medibeau Green Tea One-Day Essential Mask Pack is enriched with green tea extract, centella asiatica, and witch hazel to calm and soothe sensitive or irritated skin. This single-use sheet mask deeply hydrates, revitalizes dull skin, and helps improve skin tone while providing gentle anti-aging benefits. Ideal for daily use, it leaves your skin smooth, refreshed, and healthy-looking.\nKey Benefits:\nSoothes and calms irritated or sensitive skin\nProvides hydration and revitalization\nHelps brighten and improve skin tone\nSupports wrinkle improvement\nConvenient single-use sheet mask\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, apply toner to prepare your skin.\nOpen the mask and place it on your face, aligning with eyes and lips.\nLeave on for 10–20 minutes.\nRemove the mask and gently pat remaining essence into the skin.\nFollow with cream if desired.\nKey Ingredients:Green Tea Extract, Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract, Witch Hazel Extract, Niacinamide, Adenosine, Glycerin\nPrecautions:\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nAvoid applying to broken or wounded skin\nAvoid eye area\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight\nVolume: 20ml / 0.67 fl.ozManufacturer & Distributor: JUNO Cosmetics Co., Ltd., Incheon, KoreaOrigin: Made in Korea', 121.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 229.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medibeau Green Tea One-Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20mlPrice in BD', 'Medibeau Green Tea One-Day Essential Skin Care Mask Pack 20ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medibeau-green-tea-one-day-essential-skin-care-mask-pack-20ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1580, 'Health & Beauty Aztec Secret Indian Healing Clay Mask', '1', 0, 43, 361, '1580', '1580', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Aztec Secret Indian Healing Clay Deep Pore Cleansing Acne, Spots Facial Mask\nLooking to achieve healthy-looking and clear skin? and don\'t want any visits to the salon? Here is introducing Aztec Secret Indian Healing Clay Uk that is a facial care that can be done at home. The usage of This clay gives the same results as any expensive salon service.No added additives or fragrances in Aztec Secret Indian Healing Clay Uk. Suitable for ultra-sensitive skin as well. Order it now for yourself and experience drastic changes in your skin with just one application.Directions for use: Mix Aztec Secret Indian Healing Clay Uk with equal parts of raw apple cider vinegar and/or water. Use a non-metal bowl or utensil to mix it in. Mix the mixture well until you achieve a smooth paste. If needed, add more clay or liquid to it. Apply a 1/4 to 1/2 inch layer on your face or any other areas. Allow it to dry for 5-10 minutes for delicate skin and 15-20 mins for normal skin. A pulling and tightening sensation will happen. Remove the clay off with warm water. A bit of redness on the skin is normal and will go off in 30 minutes.', 2399.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1701.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Health & Beauty Aztec Secret Indian Healing Clay MaskPrice in BD', 'Health & Beauty Aztec Secret Indian Healing Clay Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'health-beauty-aztec-secret-indian-healing-clay-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1581, 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Mud Mask', '1', 0, 43, 8, '1581', '1581', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'LAIKOU JAPAN SAKURA MUD MASK is rich in sakura extract and various moisturizing ingredients, which can effectively replenish moisture and nutritions, making the skin rosy and shiny. With volcanic mud minerals, it can balance oil secretion, clean pores and remove aged keratin. With sufficient nutritions, it will make the skin clean, soft, and smooth.\nWhat it is?Laikou Sakura Mud Mask is rich in sakura extract and various moisturizing ingredients, which can effectively replenish moisture and nutrition, making the skin rosy and shiny.\nWhat is does?LAIKOU JAPAN SAKURA MUD MASK is rich in sakura extract and various moisturizing ingredients, which can effectively replenish moisture and nutrition, making the skin rosy and shiny. With volcanic mud minerals, it can balance oil secretion, clean pores and remove aged keratin. With sufficient nutrition, it will make the skin clean, soft, and smooth.\nCategories: Pore Care, Face, Acne Treatment, Masks & Peels, Masks & Peels, Oil Control, Dull Skin Treatment, Shop By Concern, Skin, Natural\nSuitable: all skin types.\nEffects:Skin Whitening, Skin Nourishing, Deep Cleansing, Shrink pores\nHow to use:\n', 498.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 252.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Mud MaskPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU Japan Sakura Mud Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-mud-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
