(1591, 'HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Peptamin Hydro Collagen Mask Pack Sheet – 4 Sheets', '1', 0, 44, 13, '1591', '1591', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Peptamin Hydro Collagen Mask is a pore-firming hydrogel sheet mask made with Collagen Water (100,940ppm), Red Bean Powder (2,000ppm), Calamine (1,000ppm), Betaine (3,000ppm) and a multi-peptide complex. The ampoule is solidified into a hydrogel sheet for deeper hydration, improved pore elasticity, and smoother skin density. Dermatologically tested for sensitive skin and certified for whitening & wrinkle improvement.\nImproves pore elasticity & tightness\nEnhances skin density and smoothness\nBrightening & anti-wrinkle dual functional\nCalms irritation with Calamine\nDeep hydration with Collagen & Betaine\nMulti-peptide complex for firm, energized skin\nOpen the pouch and remove the film from the lower mask. Apply it around the mouth area.\nRemove the film from the upper mask and align it with the eyes.\nWhen the mask turns transparent and starts drying, remove it and gently pat the remaining essence into the skin.For intensive care, use as a sleeping mask or keep on for at least 3 hours.\nWater (Aqua), Glycerin, Collagen Water (100,940ppm), Dipropylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ceratonia Siliqua (Carob) Gum, Chondrus Crispus, PEG-100 Stearate, Glyceryl Stearate, Betaine (3,000ppm), Panthenol, Phaseolus Angularis Seed Powder (2,000ppm), Potassium Chloride, Sodium Polyacrylate, Xanthan Gum, Matricaria Recutita Flower Extract, Dextrin, Glyceryl Caprylate, Saccharomyces Ferment, Vigna Angularis Seed Extract (1,000ppm), Calamine (1,000ppm), Polysorbate 20, Butylene Glycol, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Adenosine, Maltooligosyl Glucoside, Gardenia Florida Fruit Extract, Hydrolyzed Gardenia Florida Extract, C11-13 Isoalkane, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Hexapeptide-11, Copper Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Tetrapeptide-2, Disodium EDTA, Ascorbic Acid.\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.', 2440.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1050.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Peptamin Hydro Collagen Mask Pack Sheet – 4 SheetsPrice in BD', 'HEVEBLUE Pot Pore Peptamin Hydro Collagen Mask Pack Sheet – 4 Sheets Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heveblue-pot-pore-peptamin-hydro-collagen-mask-pack-sheet-4-sheets', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1592, 'Laneige Cica Sleeping Mask for Night Barrier Solution 10ml', '1', 0, 44, 317, '1592', '1592', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nSpecially formulated for sensitive skin, the overnight Cica Sleeping Mask derived from Forest Yeast delivers intense moisture to soothe stressed skin and visibly strengthen the skin’s moisture barrier.\n\nSkin Type: All, Normal, Dry\n\nBenefits:\nCica Sleeping Mask is formulated with Laneige\'s proprietary Forest Yeast extract that is more effective than madecassoside from tiger grass. Strongly recommended for sensitive and dry skin that needs soothing moisture overnight.\n\nIngredients:\nWATER / AQUA / EAU, PROPANEDIOL, CETYL ETHYLHEXANOATE, SQUALANE, HYDROGENATED POLY(C6-14 OLEFIN), GLYCERIN, PANTHENOL, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, GLYCERYL STEARATE CITRATE, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, POLYGLYCERYL-3 METHYLGLUCOSE DISTEARATE, POLYGLYCERYL-10 STEARATE, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, DISODIUM EDTA, ASIATICOSIDE, MADECASSIC ACID, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, ASIATIC ACID, MELALEUCA ALTERNIFOLIA (TEA TREE) LEAF OIL, AUREOBASIDIUM PULLULANS FERMENT, CHAMAECYPARIS OBTUSA LEAF EXTRACT, CYMBOPOGON MARTINI OIL, TOCOPHEROL.\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter moisturizer, apply evenly to face as the last step in your nighttime routine. Leave on overnight and rinse off in the morning. Use one to two times per week.\n\nPrecaution:\nStop using the product immediately and consult a dermatologist when redness, swelling, or other skin irritations occur.\nAvoid applying the product on open wounds or skin inflammation.\nKeep away from direct sunlight and out of reach of infants and children.\n1. If the following symptoms occur after product use, stop using the product immediately and consult a dermatologist(continuous use can exacerbate the symptoms):a) Red spots, swelling, itchiness, and other skin irritationb) If the symptoms above occur after the application area is exposed to direct sunlight\n2. Do not use on open wounds, eczema, and other skin irritations.\n3. Storing and handlinga) Close the lid after every use.b) Keep out of reach of infants and children.c) Do not store at extreme temperatures or in an area exposed to direct sunlight.\"\nAvoid applying the product on open wounds or skin inflammation.\nKeep away from direct sunlight and out of reach of infants and children.', 325.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '10ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laneige Cica Sleeping Mask for Night Barrier Solution 10mlPrice in BD', 'Laneige Cica Sleeping Mask for Night Barrier Solution 10ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laneige-cica-sleeping-mask-for-night-barrier-solution-10ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
