(1594, 'Purito Seoul Luminous Ceramide Sleeping Pack 100ml', '1', 0, 44, 83, '1594', '1594', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Overnight Barrier Repair • Deep Hydration • Soothing Care\n\nPurito Seoul Luminous Ceramide Sleeping Pack is a nourishing overnight treatment designed to repair, soothe, and deeply hydrate skin stressed by UV rays, pollution, and daily environmental aggressors.\nFormulated with skin-identical ingredients like Ceramide NP, Hyaluronic Acid, and Centella Asiatica (CICA), this sleeping pack strengthens the skin barrier while preventing moisture loss throughout the night. Wake up to soft, calm, and healthy-looking skin by morning.\nWhile you sleep, your skin enters repair mode. This sleeping pack forms a protective moisture barrier, locking in hydration and supporting overnight skin recovery for visibly improved texture and radiance.\nOvernight Barrier Repair: Strengthens damaged skin barrier with Ceramide NP\nDeep Hydration: Prevents water loss and keeps skin moisturized all night\nSoothes Irritation: CICA calms inflammation and stressed skin\nImproves Skin Texture: Leaves skin soft, smooth, and replenished by morning\nGentle & Non-Irritating: Suitable for sensitive and compromised skin\nKnown for wound-healing and soothing properties\nReduces redness, irritation, and inflammation\nPrevents moisture evaporation\nSmoothens skin texture without clogging pores\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\nSkin-identical lipid that strengthens the moisture barrier\nSeals in hydration and maintains oil-water balance\nProtects skin from external stressors\nDeep hydration and moisture retention\nKeeps skin plump and supple\nAqua, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Squalane, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Cetearyl Alcohol, Centella Asiatica Extract, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Butylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Panthenol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Sodium Carbomer, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Ceramide NP, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Disodium Phosphate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Phosphate, Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid.\nUse as the final step of your nighttime skincare routine\nTake a moderate amount and gently spread over face\nLeave on overnight and rinse off in the morning\nProduct Type: Sleeping Pack / Overnight Mask\nSize: 100 ml\nBrand: Purito Seoul\nSkin Type: All skin types, especially sensitive & damaged skin\nDry, dehydrated, irritated, barrier-damaged, or sleep-deprived skin needing overnight repair and long-lasting hydration.', 1962.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '100ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 218.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Seoul Luminous Ceramide Sleeping Pack 100mlPrice in BD', 'Purito Seoul Luminous Ceramide Sleeping Pack 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-seoul-luminous-ceramide-sleeping-pack-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1595, 'Cosrx Ultimate Moisturizing Honey Overnight Mask', '1', 0, 44, 31, '1595', '1595', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosrx Ultimate Misturizing Honey Overnight Mask\nAlways at the cutting-edge of beauty innovation, where South Korea leads, the rest of the industry eventually follows. Renowned for their high-maintenance, multi-step skin care rituals that result in flawless, glass-like skin, K-beauty fans leave no stone (or silk worm) unturned on the quest for perfection, and COSRX is a favourite amongst discerning beauty addicts worldwide. Toot-toot! We\'ve arrived at the hydration station with the Ultimate Moisturising Honey Overnight Mask front and centre. Basque your skin in this 3-in-1 moisturising mask that\'ll elevate your skin care regimen in ways you didn\'t know were possible.\nPut down the overly-thick, pore-clogging creams which overpromise and underdeliver and up the ante with the Ultimate Moisturising Honey Overnight Mask that\'s here to rescue your skin in more ways than one...\nEnriched with propolis extract, a natural antibacterial and anti-inflammatory ingredient that helps to soothe stressed out skin, and natural beeswax, this masking-miracle feeds your skin with long-lasting hydration like never before. Of course no bees were harmed to give you the sweetest honey-infused gel-like mask. Formulated with a satisfyingly cooling sensation which relieves your skin right before you sleep, its ultra-lightweight formula is instantly absorbed into your pores to help them exhale. Experiment in your bathroom and use this mask in three different ways to find what your skin likes best: either an overnight mask, a wash-off mask or as a light morning moisturiser. With so many options to choose from, this is a sure-fire sign that this skin care must-have is bound to be one of the hardest working products in your kit and bathroom cabinet staple!\nPropolis Extract, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Betaine, 1,2-Hexanediol, PEG-60 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Arginine, Cassia Obtusifolia Seed Extract, Dimethicone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Carbomer, Sodium Hyaluronate, Beeswax, Allantoin, Panthenol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Adenosine.\nFor the latest information, it is recommended to review the ingredient list printed on the packaging of the product prior to usage or consumption.\nAs an overnight mask - Apply a thick layer onto the skin as the last step in your night-time skincare routine.\nAs a wash-off mask - Apply a generous amount to the skin and leave for 15 minutes. Rinse and dry.\nAs a morning moisturiser - Apply a thin layer like a moisturiser.', 1379.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '60ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 621.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Ultimate Moisturizing Honey Overnight MaskPrice in BD', 'Cosrx Ultimate Moisturizing Honey Overnight Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-ultimate-moisturizing-honey-overnight-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1596, 'Alike 8K Diamond Sleeping Mask Brightening With Extra Hydrating Agent 60g', '1', 0, 44, 244, '1596', '1596', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brightening with Extra Hydrating AgentBOOST LUSTER | AILKE® Skincare\n🌙 Key Benefits:\n💧 Deep Moisturization Overnight\n✨ Brightens Dull, Tired Skin\n🧬 Nourishes & Repairs Skin While You Sleep\n🔄 Improves Skin Texture & Smoothness\n🌿 Gel-Based Formula – Lightweight, Refreshing & Non-Sticky\n🌞 Wake Up with Radiant, Supple, and Healthy-Looking Skin\n💧 Star Ingredients:Water, Mineral Oil, Propylene Glycol, Trehalose, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, C14-22 Alcohol, C12-20 Alkyl Glucoside, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Squalane, Polysorbate-60, Xanthan Gum, Methylparaben, Bis(hydroxymethyl) Imidazolidinyl Urea, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Fragrance, CI 42053, CI 42051\n🛏️ How to Use:After cleansing and toning, apply an even layer of the mask on your face.Do not rinse. Go to bed as usual and wash your face in the morning.✅ Use 2–3 times per week for best results.🌟 For intensive hydration, apply a thicker layer.\n📦 Product Details:\nNet Weight: 60g\nManufacturer: Taiwan (AILKE) Beauty Cosmetics International Group Co., Ltd.\nPacking Company: GZ CaiLi Daily Chemical Co., Ltd.\nManufacturing License: XK16-108 9303\nHygienic License: (2000) WZZZ No.29-XK-2021\nStandard Executed: QB/T 1857\nTrademark Registered: 18530101\nStorage: Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\nExpiration: Use before the expiration date.', 805.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Alike 8K Diamond Sleeping Mask Brightening With Extra Hydrating Agent 60gPrice in BD', 'Alike 8K Diamond Sleeping Mask Brightening With Extra Hydrating Agent 60g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'alike-8k-diamond-sleeping-mask-brightening-with-extra-hydrating-agent-60g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026