(1597, 'Constanta Bee Venom Sleeping Mask 50gm CT-175', '1', 0, 44, 137, '1597', '1597', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Whitening & Moisturizing Leave-On Overnight MaskWith Bee Venom & Royal Jelly\nConstanta Bee Venom Sleeping Mask is an intensive overnight leave-on treatment formulated to target skin whitening, rejuvenation, and long-lasting hydration. Enriched with Bee Venom, Royal Jelly, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Hyaluronic Acid, and nourishing botanical extracts, this mask works throughout the night to restore radiance, firmness, and a youthful glow.\nThe advanced formula helps lighten skin tone, reduce the appearance of age spots, improve elasticity, and smooth the complexion. With its anti-oxidant and skin-revitalizing properties, the mask promotes collagen and elastin production, leaving the skin soft, supple, and visibly brighter by morning.\nSupports skin-lightening and brightening activity\nHelps rejuvenate skin overnight\nEvens out skin tone and reduces dark spots\nImproves firmness, elasticity, and radiance\nProvides deep, long-lasting moisture\nContains Bee Venom and Royal Jelly for enhanced anti-aging benefits\nLeaves the skin velvety, smooth, and refreshed\nGentle and mild formula suitable for regular use\nApply an even layer of Constanta Bee Venom Sleeping Mask over the face and neck at night.Leave on overnight while sleeping.Rinse thoroughly with warm water the following morning.\nFor best results, use regularly.\nPurified Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Triethanolamine, Carbomer, Phenoxyethanol, Xanthan Gum, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Polyacrylate-13, Polyisobutene, Polysorbate 20, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Illicium Verum Fruit Extract, Allantoin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Bee Venom, Fragrance, Disodium EDTA, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ascorbic Acid, Lactic Acid, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Leontopodium Alpinum Extract, Saccharide Isomerate, Royal Jelly Extract.\nOvernight whitening & rejuvenation mask\nAnti-oxidant & skin-firming formula\nReduces visible signs of aging\nEnhances moisture retention\nProvides smoother, brighter, younger-looking skin\nManufactured under license of Constanta Germany', 2680.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2680.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Constanta Bee Venom Sleeping Mask 50gm CT-175Price in BD', 'Constanta Bee Venom Sleeping Mask 50gm CT-175 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'constanta-bee-venom-sleeping-mask-50gm-ct-175', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1598, 'Laikou Snail Sleeping Mask', '1', 0, 44, 8, '1598', '1598', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy  Laikou Snail Sleeping Face Mask 3g Pack in Bangladesh from Arogga. This hydrating and anti-aging night mask restores skin elasticity, fights wrinkles, and promotes a radiant complexion.\nThe Laikou Snail Sleeping Mask is a powerful skincare solution designed to rejuvenate your skin while you sleep. Infused with snail secretion, this mask effectively prevents skin aging, reduces fine lines, and eliminates spots, scars, and acne. Its hydrating properties deeply nourish the skin, restoring elasticity and promoting a youthful glow. Perfect for those looking to combat signs of aging, this mask works overnight to ensure your skin feels refreshed, firm, and hydrated by morning.\n\n\n● Hydration: Deeply moisturizes, leaving the skin soft and supple.● Anti-aging: Reduces wrinkles and fine lines, restoring skin firmness.● Skin Renewal: Helps in the reduction of acne scars, spots, and blemishes.● Whitening Effect: Evens out the complexion for a brighter, radiant look.\n\nLaikou is known for its innovative skincare products, focusing on effective ingredients that deliver real results. Their snail-based skincare line is highly regarded for promoting healthy, youthful-looking skin.\n\n', 29.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Sachet', 0.00, 1, NULL, 21.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Snail Sleeping MaskPrice in BD', 'Laikou Snail Sleeping Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-snail-sleeping-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:28', '2026-02-11 13:41:28'),
(1599, 'Garnier Night Sakura Glow Hyaluron Sleeping Mask', '1', 0, 44, 37, '1599', '1599', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Garnier Night Sakura Glow Hyaluron Sleeping Mask is a rejuvenating overnight skincare treatment designed to hydrate, brighten, and smooth your skin while you sleep. Infused with Sakura extract and Hyaluronic Acid, it leaves your skin glowing, plump, and refreshed by morning.\nDeep Hydration:\nBrightening Effect:\nOvernight Repair:\nNon-Sticky Formula:\nSoothing & Refreshing:\nHyaluronic Acid:\nSakura Extract:\nGlycerin:\nNiacinamide:\nCleanse:\nApply Generously:\nLeave Overnight:\nWake Up to Glow:\nSkin Types:\nConcerns:\nTransform your nighttime skincare routine with the Garnier Night Sakura Glow Hyaluron Sleeping Mask for beautifully glowing and hydrated skin every morning\nMade in Indonesia', 1075.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '50ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 750.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Night Sakura Glow Hyaluron Sleeping MaskPrice in BD', 'Garnier Night Sakura Glow Hyaluron Sleeping Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-night-sakura-glow-hyaluron-sleeping-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
