(1602, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Sleeping Mask', '1', 0, 44, 28, '1602', '1602', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Net: 3g\nShelf life: 5 Years\nMoisturizing/Brighten dull skin/ Firming\nMain ingredients\nPrunus Lannesiana Flower Extract: Prevent glycation and brighten skin tone\nVitamin C(Ascorbic Acid): Reduce fine lines and firm skin\nHyaluronic Acid(Sodium Hyaluronate): Hydrate the skin and retain moisture\nRice Ferment Filtrate (Sake): Reduce the appearance of melanin\nHow does sleeping mask work for our skin?\n1.Apply a thick layer of the mask to block the evaporation of skin moisture and soften the keratin.\n2.Skin cells are active during night and nutrients are more easier to be absorbed.\n3.After the skin temperature rised, the blood circulation was accelerated, so that the nutrients can penetrate into the skin deeply and make your skin bright.\nInstructions\nStep 1: Take the sleeping mask and apply it to the entire face\nStep 2: Avoid the eye areas, gently apply the mask until it is absorbed\nStep 3: Wash your face in the next morning', 28.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Sachet', 0.00, 1, NULL, 52.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Sleeping MaskPrice in BD', 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Sleeping Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fenyi-japan-cherry-blossom-sleeping-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
