(1613, 'COSMO Vitamin C Soothing Gel – Hydrating & Rejuvenates Dull Skin, Evens Skin Tone (200 ml) (Made in Dubai)', '1', 0, 45, 248, '1613', '1613', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Revitalize dull, dry, and sun-parched skin with COSMO Vitamin C Soothing Gel. Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, this gel moisturizes, protects, and brightens the skin, revealing a healthy, radiant complexion. Suitable for all skin types, including oily skin, it provides refreshing and astringent benefits while soothing irritation.\nKey Benefits:\nHydrating & Soothing: Moisturizes dry and sensitive skin, leaving it soft and supple.\nBrightens Skin: Rich in antioxidants and vitamin C, helps reveal a radiant complexion.\nMulti-Purpose Use: Can be used as a daily moisturizer, face mask, or massage gel.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Refreshing for oily skin, gentle on sensitive skin.\nUsage Instructions:\nAs Moisturizer: Apply generously to face and neck, massage until fully absorbed.\nAs Face Mask: Apply a thick layer to face and neck, leave for 20–30 minutes, then rinse off.\nAs Massage Gel: Apply to face, neck, and hands; massage in circular motions for a few minutes until absorbed, then rinse or wipe off.\nAvoid contact with eyes. For external use only. Keep out of reach of children.\nKey Ingredients:\nGlyceryl Ascorbate & Ethyl Ascorbic Acid – stabilized vitamin C for brightening and antioxidant protection.\nGlycerin – deeply hydrates skin.\nTurmeric Extract (Curcuma Longa) – soothes and revitalizes skin.\nSodium PCA & Zinc PCA – maintain moisture balance and skin health.\nPlant Extracts & Natural Moisturizers – nourish and protect skin.\nVolume: 200 ml\nOrigin: Made in Dubai', 803.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 487.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSMO Vitamin C Soothing Gel – Hydrating & Rejuvenates Dull Skin, Evens Skin Tone (200 ml) (Made in Dubai)Price in BD', 'COSMO Vitamin C Soothing Gel – Hydrating & Rejuvenates Dull Skin, Evens Skin Tone (200 ml) (Made in Dubai) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-vitamin-c-soothing-gel-hydrating-rejuvenates-dull-skin-evens-skin-tone-200-ml-made-in-dubai', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
