(1627, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Peel Off Mask', '1', 0, 46, 8, '1627', '1627', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Features:Deep Cleansing/Tighten Pores/Even Skin Tone\nEffects:LAIKOU JAPAN SAKURA PEEL-OFF MASK is enriched with Japan Sakura extract, which can improve skin roughness, smooth fine lines and even skin tone. It also contains multiple moisturizing ingredients such as Sodium Hyaluronate, Niacinamide and Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract to keep the skin hydrated and supple. It is easy to apply and can deeply cleanse dirt from pores and remove cosmetic residues, leaving your skin clean and delicate.\nUsage:1. After cleansing skin, apply a proper amount of mask to your face (Be careful to avoid the eyes and lips).2. Spread it evenly with your fingers to cover the skin.3. After about 20 minutes, slowly peel it off, then rinse with water.4. It’s recommended to use 1-2 times per week.\nCautions:Sensitive skin should be tested behind the ear before using. Discontinue use if signs of irritation appear.Keep it in a cool place and out of reach of children.', 176.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 274.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Japan Sakura Peel Off MaskPrice in BD', 'Laikou Japan Sakura Peel Off Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-japan-sakura-peel-off-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
