and improving the absorption of other ingredients.\n\n', 2719.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1131.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube Collagen Night Wrapping MaskPrice in BD', 'Medicube Collagen Night Wrapping Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-collagen-night-wrapping-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
