(1639, 'COSMO Skin Naturals Facial Soothing & Moisture Peel-Off Mask With Aloe Vera', '1', 0, 46, 248, '1639', '1639', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FEATURES:\nThe Aloe Vera Peel-Off Mask offers a range of benefits for your skin. Aloe Vera is well-known for its soothing and healing properties, making it ideal for sensitive or irritated skin. The mask helps to replenish and moisturize your skin, leaving it feeling refreshed and revitalized. It also helps to improve the overall appearance of your skin, promoting a healthy and radiant complexion.Experience the soothing and hydrating properties of our Aloe Vera Peel-Off Mask. Formulated with the goodness of Aloe Vera, this mask is designed to address your health concerns while providing multiple benefits for your skin.To apply the mask, ensure your face is clean and dry. Apply an even layer of the mask, avoiding the sensitive areas around the eyes and lips. Allow it to dry for approximately 15-20 minutes until it forms a solid, peelable layer. Gently peel off the mask from the bottom upwards and rinse off any residue. Follow up with your regular skincare routine.For optimal results, use the Aloe Vera Peel-Off Mask 1-2 times a week. By incorporating this mask into your skincare routine, you can effectively address your health concerns while maintaining the health and well-being of your skin.Size: 150 ml. Treat your skin to the nourishing and rejuvenating effects of our Aloe Vera Peel-Off Mask. Embrace the natural power of Aloe Vera and unlock a revitalizing skincare experience. Don\'t wait—order your Aloe Vera Peel-Off Mask today and indulge in the benefits of Aloe Vera for healthy and glowing skin.\nKEY BENEFITS:\n\nRemoves dead skin cells, unclogs pores, and removes dark spots and whiteheads. Help soothe while moisturizing, ensuring skin feels soft and silky-smooth.\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\nAloe Vera Extract: Helps retain skin\'s natural moisture balance, soothes the skin and leaves the skin feeling revitalized & refreshed.\nHOW TO USE:\n\nApply an even layer to clean, dry skin, avoiding the eye area, eyebrows, hairline and lips. Once completely dry, gently peel off the mask starting at the outer edges. Wash off any residue with water.\n\nMade in UAE', 462.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 388.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSMO Skin Naturals Facial Soothing & Moisture Peel-Off Mask With Aloe VeraPrice in BD', 'COSMO Skin Naturals Facial Soothing & Moisture Peel-Off Mask With Aloe Vera Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-skin-naturals-facial-soothing-moisture-peel-off-mask-with-aloe-vera', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29');
