(1640, 'COSMO Skin Naturals Facial Refreshing Peel-Off Mask With Cucumber', '1', 0, 46, 248, '1640', '1640', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FEATURES:\nThe Cucumber Peel-Off Mask offers a range of benefits for your skin. Cucumbers are known for their cooling and hydrating properties, helping to soothe and rejuvenate your skin. The mask helps to tighten pores, leaving your skin looking refreshed and revitalized. It also helps to remove impurities and excess oil, promoting a clearer complexion and smoother skin texture.Indulge in the soothing and hydrating properties of our Cucumber Peel-Off Mask. Formulated with the essence of fresh cucumbers, this mask is designed to address your health concerns while providing numerous benefits for your skin.To apply the mask, ensure your face is clean and dry. Apply a thin, even layer of the mask, avoiding the delicate eye and lip areas. Allow it to dry for approximately 15-20 minutes until it forms a solid, peelable layer. Gently peel off the mask from the bottom upwards and rinse off any residual residue. Follow up with your regular skincare routine.For optimal results, use the Cucumber Peel-Off Mask 1-2 times a week. By incorporating this mask into your skincare routine, you can effectively address your health concerns while maintaining the health and well-being of your skin.Size: 150 ml. Treat your skin to the refreshing and nourishing effects of our Cucumber Peel-Off Mask. Experience the natural goodness of cucumbers and unlock a revitalizing skincare experience. Don\'t wait—embrace the power of cucumbers and order your Cucumber Peel-Off Mask today for radiant and healthy-looking skin.\nKEY BENEFITS:\n\nRemoves dead skin cells, unclogs pores, and removes dark spots and whiteheads. Help soothe while moisturizing, ensuring skin feels soft and silky-smooth.\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\nCucumber Extract: Cooling properties of cucumber hydrate and soothe the skin, making skin soft, and supple.\nHOW TO USE:\n\nApply an even layer to clean, dry skin, avoiding the eye area, eyebrows, hairline and lips. Once completely dry, gently peel off the mask starting at the outer edges. Wash off any residue with water.\n\nMade in UAE', 462.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 388.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSMO Skin Naturals Facial Refreshing Peel-Off Mask With CucumberPrice in BD', 'COSMO Skin Naturals Facial Refreshing Peel-Off Mask With Cucumber Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-skin-naturals-facial-refreshing-peel-off-mask-with-cucumber', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
