(1644, 'Face Facts Brightening Watermelon Peel Off Mask 60ml', '1', 0, 46, 357, '1644', '1644', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Face Facts Brightening Watermelon Peel Off Mask is a revitalizing skincare treatment designed to nourish, condition, and brighten your complexion. Infused with watermelon fruit extract, radish root ferment filtrate, and glycerin, this vegan-friendly mask delivers essential vitamins, antioxidants, and anti-inflammatory properties to the skin. Suitable for all genders, it helps revive dull skin, leaving it refreshed, smooth, and radiant.\n\nKey Features & Benefits\n\nHow to Use\n\nIngredients', 399.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '60ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 201.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Face Facts Brightening Watermelon Peel Off Mask 60mlPrice in BD', 'Face Facts Brightening Watermelon Peel Off Mask 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'face-facts-brightening-watermelon-peel-off-mask-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1645, 'Beauty Formulas Deep Cleansing Nose Pore Strips 6 Pcs with Avocado Extract', '1', 0, 46, 89, '1645', '1645', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Strips with witch hazel and Avocado extracts deeply cleanse pores in the nose area. They help unclog pores and remove impurities.\nRecommended use is 1-2 times a week, and do not use more than 3 times a week.\nPackage contents: 6 pieces.\nNote: Use the strip immediately after peeling it from the backing. Do not use on extremely dry or inflamed skin.\nUsage:\nIngredients:Aqua, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Alcohol, Propylene Glycol, Hamamelis Virginiana Water (Witch Hazel), Glycerin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Parfum, Niacinamide, Phenoxyethanol, Citrullus Lanatus Fruit Extract (Avocado), Dipropylene Glycol, Sodium Benzoate, Citric Acid, CI 77891.', 259.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 101.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty Formulas Deep Cleansing Nose Pore Strips 6 Pcs with Avocado ExtractPrice in BD', 'Beauty Formulas Deep Cleansing Nose Pore Strips 6 Pcs with Avocado Extract Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-formulas-deep-cleansing-nose-pore-strips-6-pcs-with-avocado-extract', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1646, 'Dabo Sheet Mask White Pearl 23g', '1', 0, 46, 207, '1646', '1646', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The DABO First Solution Sheet Mask in White Pearl is a skincare product designed to provide nourishment and hydration to the skin. Here\'s a description of its features and benefits:\nWhite Pearl Extract: This sheet mask contains white pearl extract, which is known for its brightening properties. It helps to even out skin tone, reduce dark spots, and impart a radiant glow to the complexion.\nMoisturizing Formula: The mask is infused with hydrating ingredients that help to replenish moisture levels in the skin, leaving it feeling soft, smooth, and supple.\nSheet Mask Design: The mask comes in the form of a sheet that is saturated with the essence. This makes it easy to apply and ensures maximum absorption of the beneficial ingredients into the skin.\nBrightening Effect: Regular use of this sheet mask can help to improve the overall brightness and clarity of the skin, giving it a more youthful and radiant appearance.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: The DABO First Solution Sheet Mask in White Pearl is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. However, it\'s always recommended to do a patch test before using any new skincare product, especially if you have sensitive skin or are prone to allergies.\nConvenient Usage: This sheet mask is perfect for use as part of your regular skincare routine or as a quick pick-me-up whenever your skin needs a boost of hydration and radiance.\nOverall, the DABO First Solution Sheet Mask in White Pearl offers a convenient and effective way to achieve brighter, more hydrated skin with regular use.', 77.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 53.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo Sheet Mask White Pearl 23gPrice in BD', 'Dabo Sheet Mask White Pearl 23g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-sheet-mask-white-pearl-23g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1647, 'LANBENA Aloe Deep Cleansing Nose Strips', '1', 0, 46, 85, '1647', '1647', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lanbena nose strips for remove blackheads and clean shrink pores. Its design to remove dirt, blackhead ,oil and other clogging debris from the nose areas. Lanbena Blackhead remover nose strips are using Aloe extracts that can easily remove pore-clogging dirt and extra oils, effectively preventing blackheads and tightening skin for cleaner, clearer and more youthful appearance!\nDeep Cleansing, Blackhead Removal, Blemish Remover, Pore Minimizer. It Retains Moisture Leaving Skin Silky, Smooth and Radiant Every Day!\nBrand: LANBENAProduct:Nose StripsProduct Size:6.6*11.9cmOrigin: Made in China\nAloe, Dipotassium glycyrrhizinate, Sodium lactate, Portulaca oleracea extract, Hyaluronic acid.\n3 years\nWashing your face fistly, and clean up.\nApply thin layer on T-zone, not too much.\nCover the sticker and pressing everywhere.\nWaiting for 5-10 minutes for dry, then peel it off.', 30.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Sachet', 0.00, 1, NULL, 30.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LANBENA Aloe Deep Cleansing Nose StripsPrice in BD', 'LANBENA Aloe Deep Cleansing Nose Strips Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'lanbena-aloe-deep-cleansing-nose-strips', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1648, 'Bioaqua Blackhead Remover Mask', '1', 0, 46, 69, '1648', '1648', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Easy removal of black spots for your beauty! Removes black spots. Deeply cleanses skin. Cleans pores. Affects gently. Effective removal of black spots. Use the correct method to use. Effective removal of black spots. Get rid of the imperfections on your beautiful face! Get rid of black spots on your skin. Can also help to get rid of blackheads. Use different approach for different degrees of impurity of skin pores. Easy level of imperfections. Before using the mask, apply a hot towel for 2-3 minutes to face to help pores to open up. It is recommended to use serum for pores reducing after the procedure.\nMedium level of imperfections. Use the mask 2 times a week, before applying the mask apply a hot towel for 2-3 minutes to skin to help the pores to open up. High level of imperfections. For difficult dirt, use the mask 2-3 times a week, each time apply a hot towel for 2-3 minutes on face, then apply the mask.\nMethod of use:\nTips: If the applied layer of the mask is too thin, it will be not easy to remove film from skin and the efficiency of the mask will be low. If you apply a thick mask layer, the waiting time of drying is will be long. It is recommended to use the mask evenly to fully cover skin area.\n\nKey Features:', 328.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '60g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 122.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Blackhead Remover MaskPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Blackhead Remover Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-blackhead-remover-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1649, 'Groome Tea Tree Purifying & Deep Cleansing Nose Strips (Monthly Pack) 6Pcs', '1', 0, 46, 44, '1649', '1649', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Groome Acne Clear & Pore Minimizing Treatment (15ml) is a skincare product designed to help reduce acne and minimize the appearance of pores. It is formulated to be effective for all skin types and provides targeted treatment for those experiencing breakouts, oily skin, or enlarged pores.\nCleanse Your Face:\nApply the Treatment:\nLet It Absorb:\nUse Twice Daily:\nFollow Up with Moisturizer:\nApply Sunscreen (Morning Routine):\nAcne Reduction:\nPore Minimization:\nOil Control:\nImproved Skin Texture:\nSoothing Properties:\nSuitable for All Skin Types:\nGroome Acne Clear & Pore Minimizing Treatment (15ml) is a targeted skincare solution designed to help reduce acne, minimize pores, and improve skin texture. Suitable for all skin types, it offers benefits such as acne reduction, oil control, and smoother skin. The product is formulated for use by both men and women, making it a versatile addition to any skincare routine aimed at achieving clearer, healthier-looking skin.', 160.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 35.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Groome Tea Tree Purifying & Deep Cleansing Nose Strips (Monthly Pack) 6PcsPrice in BD', 'Groome Tea Tree Purifying & Deep Cleansing Nose Strips (Monthly Pack) 6Pcs Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'groome-tea-tree-purifying-deep-cleansing-nose-strips-monthly-pack-6pcs', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1650, 'Laikou Matcha Peeling Gel', '1', 0, 46, 8, '1650', '1650', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Matcha Exfoliating Peeling Gel – 60gm\nFeatures:100% brand new and high quality!Nourish the skin,clean & nourish skin,make skin tender Balance water according to skin state,keep the best skin state all day Item\n\n\nType Usage:\nStep 1:After cleansing face,take appropriate products smear on the faceStep 2:Along the skin texture and gently massage in circular motions for 1-2 minutes,until the dead skin off the dirtStep 3:Then rinse with water\n\n\nEffect:\n1.Gentle exfoliation adding matcha ingredients to clean the “dirty things” on the skin through the stratum corneum2.Clean and brighten skinCleans pores and allows skin to better absorb skin care products.3.Moisturizing nourishes to improve dry lines, large pores, moisturizes the skin and is not tight', 297.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 53.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Matcha Peeling GelPrice in BD', 'Laikou Matcha Peeling Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-matcha-peeling-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1651, 'COSMO Black Purifying & Tightening Face Mask – Clay-Based with Charcoal & Hyaluronic Acid, 125g', '1', 0, 46, 248, '1651', '1651', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Discover the secret to clear, refined, and radiant skin with COSMO Black Purifying & Tightening Face Mask.This powerful clay-based mask, enriched with Activated Charcoal and Hyaluronic Acid, helps draw out impurities, pollution, and excess oil while minimizing the appearance of pores.It refines your skin’s texture, leaving it smoother, softer, and naturally polished.\nInfused with Aloe Vera, Papaya, Pineapple, and Licorice Extracts, the mask not only purifies but also nourishes and revitalizes your complexion for a healthy, youthful glow.\nDeep Cleansing: Removes impurities, pollution, and blackheads.\nTightens Pores: Clay and charcoal work together to refine skin texture.\nHydrating Formula: Hyaluronic Acid keeps the skin soft and moisturized.\nSkin-Nourishing: Enriched with natural botanical extracts.\nBright, Smooth Finish: Leaves the skin clear, supple, and radiant.\nApply an even layer over clean skin, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\nLeave on for 15–20 minutes until the mask is dry.\nRinse thoroughly with water and gently pat dry.\nUse 2–3 times a week for best results.\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes and lips.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStore in a cool, dry place.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs.\nAqua, Kaolin, Glycerin, Bentonite, Activated Charcoal, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl Stearate, Palmitic Acid, Cetyl Ester, Isopropyl Myristate, Black Iron Oxide, Niacinamide, Parfum, Sodium Hydroxide, Diazolidinyl Urea, Aloe Barbadensis Extract, Carica Papaya Fruit Extract, Ananas Sativus (Pineapple) Fruit Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Hyaluronic Acid, Retinyl Palmitate, Panthenol, Zinc PCA, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Hexyl Cinnamal, Amyl Salicylate, Citronellol, Geraniol, Benzyl Coumarin, Linalool, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone.', 528.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 322.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSMO Black Purifying & Tightening Face Mask – Clay-Based with Charcoal & Hyaluronic Acid, 125gPrice in BD', 'COSMO Black Purifying & Tightening Face Mask – Clay-Based with Charcoal & Hyaluronic Acid, 125g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-black-purifying-tightening-face-mask-clay-based-with-charcoal-hyaluronic-acid-125g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
(1652, 'COSMO Gold Refining & Smoothing Face Mask 125g Clay-Based with Gold & Collagen', '1', 0, 46, 248, '1652', '1652', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COSMO Gold Refining & Smoothing Face Mask 125g Clay-Based with Gold & Collagen\nRefines and smooths skin texture\nReduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\nDeeply nourishes and plumps skin\nInfused with colloidal gold and hydrolyzed collagen for radiant, youthful skin\nClay-based formula detoxifies and purifies pores\nSuitable for all skin types\nThe COSMO Gold Refining & Smoothing Face Mask combines the detoxifying power of clay with luxurious gold and collagen extracts to help protect, nourish, and rejuvenate your skin. This mask smooths fine lines, firms the skin, and promotes a radiant, youthful glow. Perfect for at-home spa treatments or regular skincare routines.\nApply an even layer over cleansed skin, avoiding eyes and lips.\nLeave on for 15–20 minutes.\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\nUse 1–2 times per week for optimal results.\nFor external use only\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore in a cool, dry place\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nAqua, Bentonite, Kaolin, Glycerin, Mica, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl Stearate, Palmitic Acid, Cetyl Ester, Isopropyl Myristate, Colloidal Gold, Niacinamide, Perfume, Sodium Hydroxide, Diazolidinyl Urea, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Carica Papaya Fruit Extract, Ananas Sativus Fruit Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Retinyl Palmitate, Panthenol, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Maltodextrin, Acetyl Heptapeptide-9, Titanium Dioxide, Iron Oxides, Silica, Tin Oxide, Disodium EDTA, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Benzyl Salicylate, Citronellol, Limonene\nMade in Dubai, UAE 🇦🇪', 580.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 270.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSMO Gold Refining & Smoothing Face Mask 125g Clay-Based with Gold & CollagenPrice in BD', 'COSMO Gold Refining & Smoothing Face Mask 125g Clay-Based with