(1662, 'Quinsia Salicylic Acid Sheet Mask 30g', '1', 0, 47, 368, '1662', '1662', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Quinsia Salicylic Acid Sheet Mask 30g is a specialized facial treatment formulated to address common skin concerns such as acne, excess oil, and inflammation. Infused with 2% salicylic acid, this sheet mask penetrates deep into pores to remove impurities while delivering hydration and calming effects. Manufactured in Korea, it is suitable for both men and women over the age of 20.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage Instructions\n\nWhy Choose This ProductQuinsia’s sheet mask stands out for its targeted acne-fighting ingredients combined with hydrating and soothing properties. It’s ideal for individuals seeking a convenient, at-home treatment that balances oil control with skin nourishment. The formula is dermatologically safe and easy to incorporate into any skincare routine.\n\nBenefits', 150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Quinsia Salicylic Acid Sheet Mask 30gPrice in BD', 'Quinsia Salicylic Acid Sheet Mask 30g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'quinsia-salicylic-acid-sheet-mask-30g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
