(1664, '3W Clinic Essential Up Snail Sheet Mask', '1', 0, 47, 114, '1664', '1664', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This hypoallergenic mask sheet stays attached to the face along with the natural skin texture, and will provide a soothing comfort for your skin.\nSnail mucus at the same time has a good effect both on deep skin problems associated with photo-aging and age-related changes, and on surface problems associated with acne, bacteria, viruses and other aggressive external factors. Snail mucus protects the skin from damage by ultraviolet radiation, helps to avoid keloid scars and scars when healing various skin lesions, prevents the appearance of post-acne.\nHyaluronic acid creates a thinnest film on the surface of the skin, which prevents evaporation of water, but does not clog the pores of the skin, and also contributes to a deeper penetration of other components of the product. Acid actively moisturizes the skin, as well as accelerates the synthesis of collagen and elastin.\nArginine is an amino acid that affects the microcirculation and protective function of the skin. It penetrates deep into the skin layers, cleans from the breakdown products of proteins, thereby improving the complexion. Regenerates, restores, eliminates microdamages, fights wrinkles, smoothing the skin. Eliminates pigmentation, quickly heals burns.\nAllantoin perfectly cares for dry and very sensitive skin. It speeds up the healing of irritations, eliminates dryness and peeling, in addition, has a moisturizing and softening effect, enhances the protective ability of the skin.\nHow to use:Apply to clean skin and leave for 20-30 minutes, then remove the mask, and distribute the remnants of the product with light tapping movements until completely absorbed. The mask is recommended to use 1-3 times a week. Do not flush.\n\nMade in Korea', 115.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Packet', 0.00, 1, NULL, 15.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Essential Up Snail Sheet MaskPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Essential Up Snail Sheet Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-essential-up-snail-sheet-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
