(1666, 'Dabo First Solution Sheet Mask Pack - Aloevera', '1', 0, 47, 207, '1666', '1666', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dabo First Solution Aloevera Mask Pack 23gDABO First Solution Mask Pack Aloe Vera is a fabric face mask with aloe extract that has the ability to moisturize and soothe the skin, so this mask is perfect for tired skin damaged by stress due to a busy schedule or poor diet. aloe vera extract is suitable for regular gentle care of facial skin of all types. A mask with aloe vera has a powerful restorative, moisturizing and healing effect, therefore it will have a positive effect on the condition of both young and mature skin that has undergone age-related changes. The extract of the juicy green plant aloe vera, which is part of the liquid essence of the mask, normalizes metabolic processes in all layers of the epidermis and deeply moisturizes the cells. This component also intensively heals mechanical skin damage and removes traces of inflammation, irritation and peeling of the skin. The rejuvenating effect on the skin is achieved by triggering the synthesis of its own collagen and elastin, which ensure the elasticity and tone of the skin. A fabric mask with aloe extract is recommended to be used both in the morning to tone, give freshness and vigor to the skin, and in the evening to relieve fatigue, stress and prepare the skin for bed. After using the mask, the skin becomes smooth and even, oily shine disappears and a velvety matte texture appears. The hydrobalance in the cells of the epidermis is restored, causing the feeling of tightness, itching and dryness to disappear. Skin looks healthy, toned and radiates a natural glow. The fabric base of the mask is made of natural cotton, adjacent to the skin of the face.\nINGREDIENTS: Water, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Sodium Hyaluronate. PEG-60 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Xanthan Gum, Phenoxyethanol, Aloe Vera Extract, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Potassium Alginate, 1.2-Hexanediol, Fragrance. Sodium Citrate, Disodium EDTA, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate.\nMODE OF APPLICATION: On pre-cleansed, dry skin, apply a fabric mask tightly to your face and leave it on for 20-30 minutes. After removing the mask, gently spread the remaining essence over the skin until completely absorbed.', 105.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo First Solution Sheet Mask Pack - AloeveraPrice in BD', 'Dabo First Solution Sheet Mask Pack - Aloevera Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-first-solution-sheet-mask-pack-aloevera', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:29', '2026-02-11 13:41:29'),
