(1673, 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Acne Care Mask', '1', 0, 47, 224, '1673', '1673', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This Acne Care Mask is highly effective, yet gentle treatment that targets blemishes with concentrated & pure antibacterial ingredients such as Neem, Wild Turmeric & Orange Peel, all revered for their magical effect on their pimple & blemishes. Use as directed for a clear, Blemish-free, blanced skin.Ingredients:Fuller\'s Earth, Neem Powder, Wild Turmeric, Orange Peel Poder, Kaolin Clay.Usage Directions:Mix 1 tablespoon of the mask with water until if forms a smooth paste. Clean your face & neck gently, avoidong the eye & neck areas. Let the mask sit for atleast 15-20mins., then rinse it off with plain water. Use this routine 1-2 times per week for the best result. Made in Bangladesh', 226.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 54.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Acne Care MaskPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Acne Care Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-100-natural-acne-care-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1674, '3W Clinic Essential Up Pearl Sheet Mask', '1', 0, 47, 114, '1674', '1674', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic Essential Up Pearl Sheet Mask\nRevitalize and brighten your skin with the 3W Clinic Essential Up Pearl Sheet Mask, infused with Pearl Extract and nourishing botanical ingredients. This luxurious mask works to enhance skin radiance, improve elasticity, and deeply hydrate, leaving your skin looking refreshed and luminous.\n✔ Brightening Effect – Pearl extract helps to even out skin tone and boost radiance.✔ Hydrating & Moisturizing – Keeps skin soft, supple, and nourished.✔ Skin Soothing & Refreshing – Helps calm tired and stressed skin.✔ Enhances Skin Elasticity – Promotes a firm and youthful appearance.✔ Lightweight & Gentle – Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nGet radiant, hydrated, and glowing skin with the 3W Clinic Essential Up Pearl Sheet Mask!', 93.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 47.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Essential Up Pearl Sheet MaskPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Essential Up Pearl Sheet Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-essential-up-pearl-sheet-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
