(1676, 'BIOAQUA Avocado Moisturizing Mask 25g', '1', 0, 47, 69, '1676', '1676', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BIOAQUA Avocado Moisturizing Mask 25g replenishes your skin with quality avocado essence. It transforms dull and tired skin into healthy and glowing skin\nMask for the face, with avocado extract, a distinctive extract of a fruit rich in vitamins, sugars and amino acids, so the mask is an integrated solution to the problems of nutrition and hydration\nThe mask will nourish the skin cells thanks to the properties of avocado and its vitamins, and will support these cells with enough moisture to restore the health, luster and vitality of your dry skin\nHow to use:\nClean the face well and wet it with a little water, then put the mask on the face, leave the mask for a 15-20 minutes, then remove, and then distribute the liquid that was on the mask on the face, with a light pat and patting for five minutes, until the ingredients are absorbed properly\nWarnings:\nDue to the different skin characteristics of each person, the adaptability to different skin care products is also different; before using any new product, it is recommended that you try it on the skin behind the ear, and if there is discomfort or abnormal skin reaction, please stop using it\nAvoid contact with eyes, if it gets into eyes, rinse with water, for external use only; Do not use for children under three years old; Please keep in a cool place and avoid high temperature and direct sunlight.\n', 70.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Mask', 0.00, 1, NULL, 80.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BIOAQUA Avocado Moisturizing Mask 25gPrice in BD', 'BIOAQUA Avocado Moisturizing Mask 25g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-avocado-moisturizing-mask-25g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
