(1678, 'Dabo First Solution Sheet Mask Pack - Collagen', '1', 0, 47, 207, '1678', '1678', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'In the realm of skincare, sheet masks have gained significant popularity for their convenience and effectiveness. One standout product in this category is the Dabo First Solution Mask Pack. Known for its innovative formulation and skin-loving ingredients, this mask aims to provide a quick yet profound boost to your skincare routine.\nDabo, a renowned South Korean brand, specializes in harnessing the power of nature to deliver effective skincare solutions. The First Solution Mask Pack is designed as an intensive treatment to address various skin concerns, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Each pack contains a sheet mask infused with a concentrated essence that helps rejuvenate, hydrate, and enhance the skin’s overall texture.\nThe effectiveness of the Dabo First Solution Mask Pack can be attributed to its carefully selected ingredients:\nUsing the Dabo First Solution Mask Pack offers a plethora of benefits:\nUsing the Dabo First Solution Mask Pack is simple and can be easily integrated into your existing skincare routine:', 82.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 48.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo First Solution Sheet Mask Pack - CollagenPrice in BD', 'Dabo First Solution Sheet Mask Pack - Collagen Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-first-solution-sheet-mask-pack-collagen', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
