(1681, 'Pax Moly Real Arbutin Mask Pack for Hydration & Crystal Clear Tone', '1', 0, 47, 82, '1681', '1681', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Arbutin interferes with the production of pigment in melanin and preventing and enhancing the breakdown of melanin, brightening the skin and eliminating dark spots.\n\nStep-1: After cleansing, soothe your face. Step-2: Take the mask out of its package, place the mask on face, positioning it carefully. Step-3: Rest for between 10 and 20 minutes and remove the mask. Step-4: Let the skin absorb the remaining essence by gently patting the skin.\n\nWater, Glycerin, Arbutin(5%), Carbomer, Triethanolamine, Disodium EDTA, Adeno- sine, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Betaine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Polysorbate 20, Tocoph- eryl Acetate, Hippophae Rhamnoides Extract, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract, Morus Alba Fruit Extract, Ficus Carica (Fig) Fruit Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance\n\n', 125.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 65.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pax Moly Real Arbutin Mask Pack for Hydration & Crystal Clear TonePrice in BD', 'Pax Moly Real Arbutin Mask Pack for Hydration & Crystal Clear Tone Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'pax-moly-real-arbutin-mask-pack-for-hydration-crystal-clear-tone', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1682, 'Swiss Beauty Oxygen Bubble  Mask 30ml', '1', 0, 47, 318, '1682', '1682', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Swiss Beauty Oxygen Bubble Mask 30ml (P.R.C)Swiss Beauty Oxygen Bubble Mask is a revitalizing sheet mask that gives your skin a “bubble bath” experience, removing excess oil while nourishing and rejuvenating the skin. Enriched with hyaluronic acid and botanical extracts, this mask leaves skin feeling soft, fresh, and balanced after use. Available at the best price in Bangladesh from Arogga with guaranteed authenticity.\n\nKey Features:• Bubble Technology – Generates dense oxygen bubbles that gently cleanse and refresh the skin.• Nutrient-Rich Formula – Packed with plant extracts and hyaluronic acid to nourish and hydrate.• Skin Rejuvenation – Helps restore skin balance and leaves a soft, revitalized feel.• Sheet Mask Convenience – Easy to apply and conforms to the face for optimal absorption.• Suitable for All Skin Types – Gentle formula suitable for daily skin care routines.\n\nBenefits:• Removes excess oil and impurities effectively.• Deeply hydrates and nourishes for a soft, smooth complexion.• Promotes skin balance and refreshes tired skin.• Leaves skin feeling revitalized and healthy.\n\nIngredients:Aqua, Cyclomethicone, Propylene Glycol, Glycerin, Cocoyl Hydroxyethyl Imidazoline, Butylene Glycol, Opuntia Dillenii Extract, Avena Sativa (Oat) Bran Extract, Ophiopogon Japonicus Root Extract, Paeonia Albiflora Root Extract, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Methylparaben, Methylisothiazolinone, Parfum\n\nUsage Direction:\n\nCaution:For external use only. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.', 120.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 80.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Swiss Beauty Oxygen Bubble  Mask 30mlPrice in BD', 'Swiss Beauty Oxygen Bubble  Mask 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'swiss-beauty-oxygen-bubble-mask-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1683, 'Buy 2 Quinsia Anti-Melasma Sheet Mask Get 101tk Off', '1', 0, 47, 368, '1683', '1683', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy 2 Quinsia Anti-Melasma Sheet Mask & Get 101 TK Off\nTransform your skincare routine with the Quinsia Anti-Melasma Sheet Mask, a lightweight, moisture-rich mask infused with Calendula Flower Extract and Niacinamide. Specially designed to target dark spots and uneven skin tone, it helps deliver instant hydration, calming care, and a healthy glow without any greasy residue. Enjoy refreshed, radiant, and soothed skin after every use.\n\nKey Details:\n\nBenefits:\n\nHow to Use:\n\nCaution: Perform a patch test before use. For external use only. Keep out of reach of children.Storage: Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\nManufactured by: Korea.', 299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 101.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Buy 2 Quinsia Anti-Melasma Sheet Mask Get 101tk OffPrice in BD', 'Buy 2 Quinsia Anti-Melasma Sheet Mask Get 101tk Off Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'buy-2-quinsia-anti-melasma-sheet-mask-get-101tk-off', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
