(1704, 'Beauty of Joseon Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask', '1', 0, 47, 34, '1704', '1704', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Beauty of Joseon Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask is a gentle exfoliant for clearing clogged pores and reducing excess oil. Kaolin clay controls sebum production and lifts away debris. Red bean extract and powder help to gently exfoliate and smooth out skin texture.\n\nThe Scents – Subtle and fruity\nThe Texture – Creamy with texture\nMakes Skin Look & Feel – Cleansed, soft and calm\n\nKey ingredientsHaenam red bean extract 30%Red bean has been an important herbal ingredient throughout Korean history as well as a beloved skin care ingredient. Women of Joseon, who emphasized skin care that creates clear and clean skin, used mung beans and red beans ground together to wash their faces. The rich saponin in red beans helps with the adsorption of sebum and acts as a natural exfoliant.\n\nIngredients:\nPhaseolus angularis seed extract, glycerin, kaolin, caprylic/capric triglyceride, 1,2-hexanediol, phaseolus angularis seed powder, hectorite, cetyl alcohol, glyceryl stearate se, sorbitan olivate, cetearyl olivate, ultramarines, pyrus communis (pear) fruit extract, ethylhexylglycerin, sodium acrylate/sodium acryloyldimethyl taurate copolymer, hedera helix (ivy) leaf/stem extract, water, polyisobutene, pyrus malus (apple) leaf extract, fragaria chiloensis (strawberry) fruit extract, ci 77491, caprylyl/capryl glucoside, sorbitan oleate, triethoxycaprylylsilane\n\nHow to Use:\n\nMade in Korea', 2166.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 734.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty of Joseon Red Bean Refreshing Pore MaskPrice in BD', 'Beauty of Joseon Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-of-joseon-red-bean-refreshing-pore-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
