(1719, '3W Clinic Essential Up Aloe Sheet Mask', '1', 0, 47, 114, '1719', '1719', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3W Clinic Essential Up Aloe Sheet Mask\nSoothe and hydrate your skin with the 3W Clinic Essential Up Aloe Sheet Mask, infused with Aloe Vera extract and a blend of botanical ingredients. This mask helps to calm tired skin, restore moisture, and enhance skin elasticity, leaving it soft, supple, and refreshed.\n✔ Deep Hydration – Aloe Vera extract replenishes moisture and prevents dryness.✔ Soothing & Calming – Reduces redness, irritation, and inflammation.✔ Enhances Skin Elasticity – Helps maintain a smooth and youthful complexion.✔ Brightens & Refreshes – Leaves skin looking radiant and revitalized.✔ Lightweight & Gentle – Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nGive your skin an instant boost of hydration and nourishment with the 3W Clinic Essential Up Aloe Sheet Mask!', 93.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Sachet', 0.00, 1, NULL, 47.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Essential Up Aloe Sheet MaskPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Essential Up Aloe Sheet Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-essential-up-aloe-sheet-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30');
