(1721, 'Bioaqua Grape Seed Antioxidant Hydrating Facial Sheet Mask', '1', 0, 47, 69, '1721', '1721', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BIOAQUA Grape Seed Antioxidant Hydrating Facial Mask 25g is a refreshing sheet mask infused with grape seed extract, known for its powerful antioxidant and anti-aging benefits. This hydrating mask helps restore moisture, improve elasticity, and revitalize tired, dull skin—leaving it smooth, soft, and glowing.\nIdeal for all skin types, this lightweight sheet mask adheres closely to the skin, delivering nutrients deep into the pores while protecting against environmental stressors and early signs of aging.\nDeeply hydrates and softens the skin\nAntioxidant protection against free radicals\nHelps improve skin texture and elasticity\nReduces appearance of fine lines and dryness\nBrightens dull skin for a radiant, youthful glow', 50.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Grape Seed Antioxidant Hydrating Facial Sheet MaskPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Grape Seed Antioxidant Hydrating Facial Sheet Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-grape-seed-antioxidant-hydrating-facial-sheet-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1722, 'Bioaqua Cavier Fullence Sheet Musk 25g', '1', 0, 47, 69, '1722', '1722', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The BIOAQUA Caviar Fullerene Bouncing Nourishing Mask (25g) is a luxurious facial treatment that combines the richness of caviar extract with the advanced antioxidant properties of fullerene. This sheet mask is formulated to deeply hydrate, improve elasticity, and restore a youthful glow. Suitable for all skin types, it offers a convenient and effective way to revitalize tired or stressed skin.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage Instructions\n\nBenefits', 50.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '25g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Cavier Fullence Sheet Musk 25gPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Cavier Fullence Sheet Musk 25g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-cavier-fullence-sheet-musk-25g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1723, '3W Clinic Fresh White Sheet Mask', '1', 0, 47, 114, '1723', '1723', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This is a sheet-type mask containing a variety of aesthetic ingredients, which will moisturize your skin. Its excellent cleaning and astringent effects will leave your looking clear and transparent. This hypoallergenic mask sheet stays attached to the face along with the natural skin texture, and will provide a soothing comfort for your skin.', 110.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '23g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 40.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Fresh White Sheet MaskPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Fresh White Sheet Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-fresh-white-sheet-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1724, 'Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Sheet Mask - 25g', '1', 0, 47, 69, '1724', '1724', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fight acne while nourishing your skin with the Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Sheet Mask. Formulated with acne-fighting salicylic acid, this mask helps to unclog pores, reduce breakouts, and balance oily skin, while delivering hydration for a clearer, smoother complexion. Ideal for acne-prone skin, this sheet mask offers a targeted treatment that’s easy to use, leaving your skin refreshed and rejuvenated after every use.\n\n\nBioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Sheet Mask delivers powerful acne treatment while keeping your skin hydrated and soothed, perfect for clear and refreshed skin.', 82.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '25g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 18.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Sheet Mask - 25gPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Salicylic Acid Acne Removal Sheet Mask - 25g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-salicylic-acid-acne-removal-sheet-mask-25g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1725, 'AILKE Boost Luster Skin Rescue Mask with Avocado – Organic Herbal Extracts, Anti-Wrinkle & Hydrating, (10 x 25ml)', '1', 0, 48, 244, '1725', '1725', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fresh Avocado Mask | 100% Natural Herbal Extracts | Anti-Wrinkle & Hydrating\nDescription:AILKE Boost Luster Avocado Face Mask is enriched with avocado essence, vitamin E, plant oils, and honey to deeply moisturize, nourish, and rejuvenate the skin. This mask replenishes lost nutrients, helps fade fine lines, and restores a soft, smooth, and radiant complexion. Its natural herbal extracts provide anti-wrinkle benefits while maintaining lasting hydration.\nDeeply hydrates and moisturizes the skin\nReduces fine lines and smoothens skin texture\nNourishes and restores skin vitality\nLeaves skin soft, supple, and radiant\nMade from 100% natural herbal extracts\nAvocado, Vitamin E, Vegetable Oil, Honey, Water, Glycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Fermented Yeast Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate (Cross-linked, Acetylated, Hydrolyzed), Hydroxyethyl Cellulose, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, EDTA Disodium, Phenoxyethanol, Iodopropynol Butyl Carbamate, Methylisothiazolinone, Methylparaben, Propylene Glycol, Nonylphenol Polyether-14, PEG-50 Hydrogenated Castor Oil\nReplenishes moisture and nutrients for dehydrated skin\nProvides long-lasting hydration\nSmooths fine lines for youthful-looking skin\nNourishes and softens the skin, leaving it glowing and supple\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\nApply the mask evenly over the face, avoiding eyes and lips.\nLeave on for 15–20 minutes.\nRemove mask and gently massage remaining essence into the skin.\nUse immediately after opening; do not reuse mask sheets.\nFor external use only\nAvoid contact with eyes\nKeep out of reach of children\nDiscontinue use if irritation or rash occurs\nUse immediately after opening to prevent drying out\n10 x 25ml', 660.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 90.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'AILKE Boost Luster Skin Rescue Mask with Avocado – Organic Herbal Extracts, Anti-Wrinkle & Hydrating, (10 x 25ml)Price in BD', 'AILKE Boost Luster Skin Rescue Mask with Avocado – Organic Herbal Extracts, Anti-Wrinkle & Hydrating, (10 x 25ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ailke-boost-luster-skin-rescue-mask-with-avocado-organic-herbal-extracts-anti-wrinkle-hydrating-10-x-25ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
(1726, 'Mamaearth Rice Dewy Bright Face Pack with Rice Water & Niacinamide For Glass Skin 200g', '1', 0, 48, 3, '1726', '1726', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elevate your skincare routine with the Mamaearth Rice Dewy Bright Face Pack — a gentle, effective formula crafted to give you that coveted glass-like glow. Enriched with potent botanicals and skin-friendly actives, this face pack delivers hydration, brightness, and a radiant finish in one treat.\nHydrates Deeply & Locks Moisture – Rice water infused formula ensures skin stays supple and soft.\nBrightens & Evens Skin Tone – Niacinamide works to reduce dullness and pigmentation for a luminous complexion.\nGlassy Dewy Finish – Creamy texture with delicate white beads mimics a freshly prepared rice pack to instantly refresh and brighten.\nGentle & Safe – pH balanced and free from parabens, sulfates, silicones, and mineral oil, making it suitable even for sensitive skin.\nApply an even layer to clean, dry skin (avoid eyes).\nLeave on for 10–15 minutes.\nMassage with water to activate the beads, then rinse.Use 2–3 times per week for best results.\nRice Water – Hydrates and naturally brightens.\nNiacinamide – Improves tone, texture, and reduces dark spots.\nAloe Vera & Glycerin – Soothes and nourishes.\nNet Weight: 200 gMade by: Mamaearth, India', 1295.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 555.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Rice Dewy Bright Face Pack with Rice Water & Niacinamide For Glass Skin 200gPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Rice Dewy Bright Face Pack with Rice Water & Niacinamide For Glass Skin 200g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-rice-dewy-bright-face-pack-with-rice-water-niacinamide-for-glass-skin-200g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
