lukewarm water.Follow with toner and moisturizer to keep your skin hydrated.', 212.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '60g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 138.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Sadoer Bamboo Charcoal Black Mask - 60gPrice in BD', 'Sadoer Bamboo Charcoal Black Mask - 60g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'sadoer-bamboo-charcoal-black-mask-60g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:30', '2026-02-11 13:41:30'),
