(1755, 'Mamaearth Multani Mitti Oil Balance Face Pack with Multani Mitti 200g', '1', 0, 50, 3, '1755', '1755', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mamaearth Multani Mitti Oil Balance Face Pack is specially formulated to control excess oil, hydrate, and refresh the skin. Enriched with Multani Mitti and Rose, it helps reduce shine, cleanse pores, and leave skin smooth and balanced.\nControls excess oil and reduces shine\nHydrates and refreshes skin\nDeeply cleanses and unclogs pores\nSuitable for normal to oily skin\nMultani Mitti (Fuller’s Earth)\nRose Extract\nKaolin Clay\nGlycerin\nGlyceryl Stearate\nPanthenol\nTitanium Dioxide\nApply a generous layer on clean face and neck. Leave it on for 15 minutes. Rinse off with water. Use twice a week for best results. Avoid direct contact with eyes.\nContains natural ingredients; slight variation in color or fragrance may occur without affecting effectiveness\nProvides a light tingling sensation during use\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight\nFor external use only', 1100.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 650.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Multani Mitti Oil Balance Face Pack with Multani Mitti 200gPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Multani Mitti Oil Balance Face Pack with Multani Mitti 200g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-multani-mitti-oil-balance-face-pack-with-multani-mitti-200g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
(1756, 'Mumtaz Sandal Fairness Face Pack for Fair, Soft & Glowing Skin (20gm × 3 Sachets)', '1', 0, 50, 182, '1756', '1756', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mumtaz Sandal Fairness Face Pack is a natural herbal formulation enriched with the goodness of Multani Mitti, Sandalwood, Tulsi, Neem, and 16 additional skin-benefiting herbs. This powerful blend helps purify the skin, reduce acne and scars, and reveal a brighter and more radiant complexion.\nPure Multani Mitti\nSandalwood\nTulsi\nNeem\nBlend of 16 natural herbs\nThese ingredients work together to absorb excess oil, clear impurities, soothe the skin, and enhance natural fairness.\nHelps brighten and even out skin tone\nReduces acne, pimples, and blemishes\nFades acne marks and scars\nKeeps skin oil-free, fresh, and glowing\nLeaves skin soft, smooth, and healthy\nSuitable for all skin types\nTake 1 spoonful of Mumtaz Sandal Face Pack powder.\nAdd a small amount of water and mix to form a smooth paste.\nApply evenly on the face.\nLeave it on for 5–10 minutes.\nOnce dry, rinse thoroughly with plenty of water.\nFor best results, use 2–3 times weekly.', 88.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mumtaz Sandal Fairness Face Pack for Fair, Soft & Glowing Skin (20gm × 3 Sachets)Price in BD', 'Mumtaz Sandal Fairness Face Pack for Fair, Soft & Glowing Skin (20gm × 3 Sachets) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mumtaz-sandal-fairness-face-pack-for-fair-soft-glowing-skin-20gm-3-sachets', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
