(1765, 'Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder', '1', 0, 50, 181, '1765', '1765', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'রংধনু অ্যাক্টিভেটেড চারকোল পাউডার হল একটি প্রাকৃতিক উপাদান যা ত্বকের জন্য অত্যন্ত উপকারী।\nIntroducing Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder, a revolutionary skincare product designed to unlock the secrets of detoxification and rejuvenation. With its powerful absorption capacity and remarkable ability to cleanse the skin, this activated charcoal powder is your gateway to a fresh, blemish-free complexion. Let\'s explore the transformative benefits of Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder and discover how it can enhance your skincare routine:\nExperience the exceptional cleansing power of Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder as it penetrates deep into the hair follicles, effectively removing harmful dust and toxins from the skin. Thanks to its unique absorption capacity, activated charcoal acts as a magnet, drawing out impurities and leaving your skin refreshed and revitalized. Incorporate this powder into your skincare routine to unveil a supple, toxin-free complexion.\nBid farewell to pesky blackheads and whiteheads with Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder. This potent ingredient works wonders in removing these stubborn blemishes from deep within the skin. By absorbing excess oil, impurities, and dead skin cells, it unclogs pores and helps prevent future breakouts. Say hello to smoother, clearer skin as you embrace the benefits of activated charcoal.\nRevel in the natural brightness and softness of your skin with Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder. This remarkable product not only detoxifies and deep cleanses but also helps remove the tiredness accumulated throughout the day. By eliminating impurities and enhancing blood circulation, activated charcoal promotes a healthy glow, restoring a youthful and vibrant appearance. Embrace the softness and radiance that come hand in hand with this skincare gem.\nExperience the wonders of Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder as it effectively removes dark spots from underarms and acts as a natural deodorant. The absorbent properties of activated charcoal help in reducing discoloration and even out skin tone, revealing a more even complexion. Additionally, its natural deodorizing properties help combat odor-causing bacteria, keeping you fresh and confident throughout the day.\nUnleash the power of Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder as it plays a remarkable role in combating blemishes and acne problems. By drawing out impurities and excess oil, activated charcoal helps unclog pores and reduces the occurrence of breakouts. Incorporate this powder into your skincare routine and enjoy the soothing and clarifying effects it has on your skin.\nElevate Your Skincare Routine with Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder\nDiscover the transformative benefits of Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder and unlock the potential of a revitalized and radiant complexion. From its deep-cleansing properties to its ability to banish blackheads, this versatile product is a must-have addition to your skincare arsenal. Embrace the natural goodness of activated charcoal and experience the difference it can make in your pursuit of flawless, healthy skin.\n', 250.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 100.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) PowderPrice in BD', 'Rongdhonu Activated Charcoal (Charcol) Powder Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'rongdhonu-activated-charcoal-charcol-powder', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
