(1770, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Face Pack With Vitamin C & Turmeric (200 g)', '1', 0, 50, 3, '1770', '1770', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With Vitamin C & Turmeric | Brightening & Even Skin Tone\nReveal naturally glowing skin with the Mamaearth Vitamin C Daily Glow Face Pack, a gentle yet effective facial mask enriched with Vitamin C and Turmeric. This glow-boosting face pack helps reduce dullness, fade dark spots, and promote an even-toned complexion with regular use.\nVitamin C works to brighten the skin and improve overall radiance, while Turmeric, known for its antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties, helps fight pigmentation and revive tired-looking skin. The formula is powered by Kaolin and Bentonite clay, which detoxify the skin by drawing out impurities, while Glycerin and Panthenol provide deep hydration to keep skin soft and nourished.\nIts creamy, bead-infused texture offers a luxurious and satisfying skincare experience without being harsh on the skin. Free from harmful chemicals, this face pack is safe for daily glow care and suitable for all skin types.\nBrightens skin and boosts natural glow\nHelps fade dark spots and pigmentation\nDetoxifies pores and removes impurities\nHydrates and nourishes the skin\nImproves skin tone and texture\nNon-drying, creamy formula\nVitamin C (Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate): Brightens skin and fights dullness\nTurmeric Extract: Helps reduce pigmentation and evens skin tone\nKaolin & Bentonite Clay: Detoxify and absorb excess oil\nGlycerin & Panthenol: Deeply moisturize and soothe skin\nDull and uneven skin tone\nDark spots and pigmentation\nAll skin types\nApply a generous amount evenly on cleansed face\nAvoid the eye and lip area\nLeave on for 10–15 minutes until dry\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water\nUse 2–3 times a week for best results\nProduct Type: Face Pack / Face Mask\nNet Weight: 200 g\nFree From: Silicones, Parabens, SLS/SLES, Mineral Oils\nCertification: Made Safe Certified\nCategory: Skin Care → Face Mask',