(1775, 'Bio Active Charcoal White Spa Gluta Scrub 100g(Thailand)', '1', 0, 50, 271, '1775', '1775', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Deep Cleansing & Skin Renewal with Premium Thai Formula\nBio Active Charcoal White Spa Gluta Scrub is a professional-grade exfoliator that combines activated charcoal and glutathione to purify pores, remove dead skin cells, and reveal brighter, smoother skin. Dermatologically tested in Thailand, this scrub is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nDeep Cleansing: Activated charcoal draws out impurities and excess oil\nSkin Brightening: Glutathione helps even skin tone and reduce dark spots\nGentle Exfoliation: Removes dead skin cells without irritation\nImproved Texture: Leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed\nOil Control: Helps minimize pores and reduce shine\nApply to damp skin and gently massage in circular motions\nFocus on T-zone and areas with congestion\nRinse thoroughly with warm water\nUse 2-3 times weekly for best results\nSize: 50g | Dermatologically Tested | Made in Thailand\nContains natural active ingredients\nFree from harsh chemicals and parabens\nSuitable for daily skincare routines\nClinically proven gentle formula\nFor Optimal Results: Follow with your favorite moisturizer to maintain hydration.\nExperience Professional Skincare at Home – Try Bio Active Charcoal White Spa Gluta Scrub Today!', 666.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 74.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bio Active Charcoal White Spa Gluta Scrub 100g(Thailand)Price in BD', 'Bio Active Charcoal White Spa Gluta Scrub 100g(Thailand) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bio-active-charcoal-white-spa-gluta-scrub-100gthailand', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
(1776, 'Green Harvest Chandan Powder', '1', 0, 50, 372, '1776', '1776', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rakta Chandana or the red sandalwood is one of the finest ingredients for your skin. It is primarily used for skin care and beauty purposes. It is very effective in treating blemishes, rashes and acne.It also helps in the removal of tan and dullness because of its cooling properties.8 Ways to Use Red Sandalwood for Glowing, Acne-Free & Beautiful SkinRakta Chandana or the red sandalwood is one of the finest ingredients for your skin. It is primarily used for skin care and beauty purposes. It is very effective in treating blemishes, rashes and acne.It also helps in the removal of tan and dullness because of its cooling properties.\n### USES of Sandalwood powder1.  Add few drops of coconut oil to red sandalwood powder and make a paste with it. This can be applied on dry areas for moisturizing them. Wash off after 10-15 minutes. Red sandalwood powder is known to provide nourishment to the skin cells.\n2.  Mix red sandalwood powder with lemon juice to prepare a mask for oily skin. Apply this paste all over your face and let it dry out. Once it does, wash it off with lukewarm water. It helps in regulating the secretion of sebum and makes the pores tight.\n3. Acne and pimples happen to be common skin problems faced by most people. A rose water and red sandalwood face pack helps in the reduction of acne and acne scars and also the irritation caused by acne due to its cooling properties. You can even add a teaspoon of honey and a pinch of turmeric to the pack for better results.\n4.  A pack made with 1 tablespoon of red sandalwood and 2 tablespoons of mashed ripe papaya can help in exfoliation (removal of dead skin). This face pack helps you shed the dead skin and leaves your skin feeling fresh and rejuvenated.\n5. Use red sandalwood powder along with curd and milk to improve uneven skin tone. Mix 1 tablespoon of red sandalwood powder, half tablespoon of turmeric, 2 tablespoon of curd and milk each to make a face pack. Apply this all over and let it dry. Later wash it off with lukewarm water and enjoy radiant complexion.\n6.  It helps in removal of dark spots and reduces pigmentation. Prepare a simple pack with 2 tablespoons of red sandalwood and 2 tablespoon of milk and apply it everyday\n7.  A pack with cucumber juice or curd with red sandalwood powder helps in removing sun tan. Mix 2 tablespoon of curd or cucumber juice with an equal amount of red sandalwood powder and apply it on the affected area. Let it dry and then wash off. You will see instant results.\n8.  Prepare a mask with 2 teaspoons of almond oil, 4 teaspoons of coconut oil and 4 teaspoons of red sandalwood powder. Use this regularly for soft and glowing skin.\n###Benifits of Sandalwood powder1.Removes blemishes and warts.2.Prevents and cures pimples.3.Removes sun tan.4.Reduces wrinkles and signs of aging.5.Heals dry skin.6.Enhances skin brightness.7.Exfoliates the skin.', 163.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 17.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Green Harvest Chandan PowderPrice in BD', 'Green Harvest Chandan Powder Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'green-harvest-chandan-powder', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
