(1779, 'COSMO Purifying Face Pack with Neem, Turmeric & Tea Tree – 125 g', '1', 0, 50, 248, '1779', '1779', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Deeply cleanses and purifies skin\nRemoves excess oil and impurities\nReduces blackheads and whiteheads\nImproves overall skin tone and texture\nSuitable for all skin types\nCOSMO Purifying Face Pack is enriched with Neem, Turmeric, and Tea Tree extracts. This gentle yet effective formula helps your skin eliminate excess oil, unclog pores, and reduce blackheads and whiteheads. Regular use promotes smoother, clearer, and healthier-looking skin.\nApply evenly to clean skin, avoiding eyes and lips.\nLeave on for 15–20 minutes.\nRinse thoroughly with water.\nUse 1–2 times per week for best results.\nFor external use only\nKeep out of reach of children\nStore in a cool, dry place\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs\nAqua, Kaolin, Bentonite, Cetyl Esters, Cetyl Phosphate, Stearic Acid, Squalane, Niacinamide, Isopropyl Palmitate, Triethanolamine, Butylene Glycol, Lactic Acid, Carica Papaya (Papaya) Fruit Extract, Ananas Sativus (Pineapple) Fruit Extract, Mella Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Disodium EDTA, Butylated Hydroxy Toluene, Phenoxyethanol, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Sodium Biosaccharide Gum, Xanthan Gum, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Tocopherol, Perfume, Hydrolyzed Protein, Sodium Hyaluronate, Methyl Paraben, Propyl Paraben\nMade in UAE 🇦🇪', 760.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 190.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSMO Purifying Face Pack with Neem, Turmeric & Tea Tree – 125 gPrice in BD', 'COSMO Purifying Face Pack with Neem, Turmeric & Tea Tree – 125 g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-purifying-face-pack-with-neem-turmeric-tea-tree-125-g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
