(1788, 'Fenyi Green Tea Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 28, '1788', '1788', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fenyi Exfoliating Green Tea Scrub – 100g\nFenyi Green Tea Scrub can deeply clean pores, exfoliate skin, balance oil secretion and reduce acne. It can replenish moisture while cleansing your skin, making your skin smooth and bright.\nNet: 100gShelf life: 3 YearsSkin type: Normal/Oily/Acne/CombinationHow does it work?The selected “T+X” formula for Fenyi Green Tea Exfoliating Scrub contains Korean Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Extract, Chrysanthellum Indicum Extract and Ascorbic Acid, which can deeply clean pores, exfoliate skin, balance oil secretion and reduce acne. It can replenish moisture while cleansing your skin, making your skin smooth and bright.\nBenefits :\n-Deep cleansing-Clear Acne-Clean pores-Remove blackheads-For face and body\nIngredients:AQUA, MINERAL OIL, GLYCERIN, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, DIMETHICONE, ETHYLHEXYL PALMITATE, PETROLATUM, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, GLYCERYL STEARATE, HYDRATED SILICA, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, TREHALOSE, PEG-100 STEARATE, POLYACRYLAMIDE, C13-14 ISOPARAFFIN, C9-11 PARETH-6, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, CAMELLIA SINENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, CHRYSANTHELLUM INDICUM EXTRACT, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, ASCORBIC ACID, JOJOBA ESTERS, XANTHAN GUM, METHYLPARABEN, PROPYLPARABEN, DIAZOLIDINYL UREA, PARFUM, CI 77289, CI 42090, CI 19140\nHow to use:Apply proper amount of the scrub on the skin and massage your skin in circular motions for 3-5 minutes, then wash it with water.', 360.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '100g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 290.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fenyi Green Tea ScrubPrice in BD', 'Fenyi Green Tea Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fenyi-green-tea-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
