(1801, 'Neutrogena Visibly Clear Spot Stress Control Daily Scrub 150ml', '1', 0, 52, 151, '1801', '1801', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neutrogena Visibly Clear Spot Stress Control Daily Scrub is a powerful yet gentle creamy exfoliating scrub designed to help clear spots before they appear. Formulated with MicroClear® technology, salicylic acid, green tea, and cucumber extracts, it deeply cleanses pores, removes excess oil, and soothes stressed skin without over-drying.\nHelps clear spots before they appear\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells\nRemoves oil, dirt, and impurities\nUnclogs pores for clearer skin\nSoothes stressed skin\nSuitable for daily use without over-drying\nPromotes clearer, healthier-looking skin\nMicroClear® Technology for deep pore cleansing\nContains Salicylic Acid to fight breakouts\nEnriched with Green Tea & Cucumber Extracts\nGentle exfoliating scrub particles\nDermatologically tested\nCreamy, non-harsh formula\nPenetrates deep into pores to help prevent spots\nGently exfoliates while cleansing oil and dirt\nHelps unclog pores for improved skin clarity\nCalms and refreshes skin stressed by daily pollution\nSupports a clearer, healthier complexion\nOily Combination Acne-prone Spot-prone skin\nWet your face with water.\nApply a small amount of scrub to your fingertips.\nGently massage onto face, avoiding the eye area.\nRinse thoroughly with water.\nUse daily for best results.\nAqua, Cetyl Alcohol, PPG-15 Stearyl Ether, Glycerin, Glycolic Acid, Jojoba Esters, Polysorbate 60, Salicylic Acid, Steareth-21, C12-15 Alkyl Lactate, Sodium Hydroxide, Benzalkonium Chloride, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Lactic Acid, Menthyl Lactate, Cetyl Lactate, Cocamidopropyl PG-Dimonium Chloride Phosphate, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Cera Microcristallina, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Benzotriazolyl Butylphenol Sulfonate, Citric Acid, BHT, Parfum, CI 77289, CI 42090, CI 19140.\nNet Volume: 150ml\nBrand: Neutrogena\nProduct Type