(1803, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Face Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 3, '1803', '1803', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Glowing skin for the win! Crafted with the power of Vitamin C and the goodness of Walnut, Mamaearth Vitamin C Face Scrub is your answer to clear and radiant skin. It scrubs away dirt and impurities while exfoliating gently. Vitamin C helps fight free-radical damage while reducing pigmentation to give you glowing skin. Walnut Shell Powder, meanwhile, exfoliates gently and scrubs away dead skin cells that make your skin look dull. And because of our no toxins and harmful chemicals philosophy, you won’t find any Silicones, Parabens, Mineral Oil & Dyes in our Vitamin C Face Scrub.\nWho can Use\nKey Ingredients\nVitamin C : It has excellent antioxidant properties which combat dark spots, control melanin production, and fight free radical damage leading to radiant skin.\nWalnut Shell Powder : It gently exfoliates removing dead skin cells from the surface, reducing dullness, thus making skin soft & smooth.\nSaffron : It protects the skin from UV radiation and prevents aging. Its antioxidant properties also reduce inflammation.\nTurmeric Root Oil : It works as a skin rejuvenator and makes your skin glow. It also reduces blemishes, promoting even skin tone.', 560.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -560.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Face ScrubPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Face Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-vitamin-c-face-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
(1804, 'St. Ives Gentle Smoothing Oatmeal Face Scrub & Mask', '1', 0, 52, 377, '1804', '1804', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our Gentle Smoothing Oatmeal Scrub & Mask is a 2-in-1! Enter the multi‐tasker: it works double time to smooth away dryness & even out your skin texture. Make the move to smooth! From America\'s #1 scrub brand, this smooth operator contains 100% natural exfoliants and works as a mask or scrub, leaving skin looking and feeling soft and supple. Good ol’ wholesome oatmeal has all sorts of good stuff going on. Our oatmeal comes from the US of A. A cool and moist climate suits those oats down to the ground. The whole oat kernel is ground into a fine powder. It’s then extracted with water, filtered and distilled. We love oatmeal! Known for its soothing properties, creamy oatmeal helps you keep the peace with your mind, body, and soul. And not forgetting our honey… The golden nectar is known to be a natural moisturizer and can help soothe dry itchy skin. Our honey comes from bees buzzing around the states of North and South Dakota in the USA. It goes through a careful process of extraction but rest assured no bees come to any harm under our watch. Natural Ingredients: Oatmeal extract Honey extract Walnut Shell Powder Hydrated Silica Tell me more! This scrub and mask is oil free, paraben free, dermatologist tested, and non-comedogenic (won’t clog pores). It is made with 100% natural exfoliants. Be sure to recycle upon disposal. Directions: Dispense product onto fingertips and massage over damp skin. Scrub: Spread in small circular motions then rinse off and glow! Mask: Leave on for 5-7 minutes, then gently massage and rinse off. For best results, use 3-4 times a week.From the UK’s iconic scrub brand, this dual purpose formula made with creamy oatmeal extract and 100% Natural Exfoliants can be used as a mask to nourish skin or as a scrub to smooth away dullness. The results is soft, healthy and radiant skin. Enter the multi‐tasker: a scrub and mask in one! Infused with the soothing scent of oatmeal, this gentle face scrub is made with 100% natural exfoliants like walnut shell powder. Use as a gentle exfoliating scrub to smooth away dull skin or apply as a mask for a nourishing treatment. This scrub and mask can be used 3‐4 times a week for fresh, glowing skin.\n', 680.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 120.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'St. Ives Gentle Smoothing Oatmeal Face Scrub & MaskPrice in BD', 'St. Ives Gentle Smoothing Oatmeal Face Scrub & Mask Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'st-ives-gentle-smoothing-oatmeal-face-scrub-mask', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
