(1806, 'St. Ives Blemish Care Apricot Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 377, '1806', '1806', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'St. Ives Blemish Care Apricot Scrub\nReveal your skin’s natural glow with the St. Ives Blemish Care Apricot Scrub, a trusted skincare essential that deeply exfoliates to combat blemishes and promote clear, radiant skin.\nAchieve soft, glowing skin and a flawless complexion with the exfoliating power of St. Ives Blemish Care Apricot Scrub. Your ultimate solution for clear, smooth, and refreshed skin!', 780.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 420.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'St. Ives Blemish Care Apricot ScrubPrice in BD', 'St. Ives Blemish Care Apricot Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'st-ives-blemish-care-apricot-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31'),
(1807, 'Simple Clear Pore Scrub Daily Skin Detox for Smoother, Clearer Skin', '1', 0, 52, 24, '1807', '1807', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refresh & renew your skin with new Simple Daily Skin Detox Clear Pore Scrub, our exfoliating scrub specially designed for oily skin. Blended with thyme, zinc & witch hazel, this facial scrub cleanses deep down to help eliminate pore-clogging dirt, oil & make-up to leave skin purified. While added bamboo exfoliators gently refine pores & rough, uneven patches to leave skin clear & smooth.When skin is exposed to external aggressors such as heat, pollution or products containing harsh chemicals, it can cause skin to become sensitized & triggers an overproduction of oil & sebum, clogging pores & causing spots. Removing excess oil is key to preventing new blemishes from forming. But using a harsh face cleanser or face scrub can weaken skin’s defence against harmful bacteria, leaving it prone to spots & blemishes. If you’re wondering how to get rid of oily skin in a gentle way, Simple Daily Skin Detox Clear Pore Scrub is the perfect combination of efficacy & kindness thanks to its unique formula with 5% active witch hazel & ultra fine bamboo exfoliators:\n1. Lather a small amount in your hands2. Using light pressure, massage onto wet skin3. Rinse thoroughly. Designed to resolve oily skin in the gentlest way, we recommend using 2-3 times per week!\nWarning: External use only. Avoid getting in eyes\nMade in Poland', 725.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 225.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple Clear Pore Scrub Daily Skin Detox for Smoother, Clearer SkinPrice in BD', 'Simple Clear Pore Scrub Daily Skin Detox for Smoother, Clearer Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-clear-pore-scrub-daily-skin-detox-for-smoother-clearer-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:31', '2026-02-11 13:41:31');
