(1809, 'Groome Apricot Scrub With Walnut Shell Powder Fresh & Radiant (All Skin Type) -100ml', '1', 0, 52, 44, '1809', '1809', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Groome Apricot Scrub is formed with a perfect combination of Apricot and Walnut Shell Powder, which leave your skin clean and healthy by gently removing dead skin cells and impurities. It also tightens large pores and reduces early signs of aging. Your skin looks brighter with regular use.', 585.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 65.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Groome Apricot Scrub With Walnut Shell Powder Fresh & Radiant (All Skin Type) -100mlPrice in BD', 'Groome Apricot Scrub With Walnut Shell Powder Fresh & Radiant (All Skin Type) -100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'groome-apricot-scrub-with-walnut-shell-powder-fresh-radiant-all-skin-type-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1810, 'Face Facts Hydrating Coconut Facial Scrub - 60ml', '1', 0, 52, 357, '1810', '1810', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Face Facts Coconut Facial Scrub 60ML\nOur jelly based exfoliator uses a gentle, 100% natural Walnut Shell Powder to lightly exfoliate your skin, sweeping away dead skin cells + removing unwanted dirt + impurities. Plus we have added moisturisers, Coconut Oil + Glycerin a real skincare super hero.\nHow To Use:\nUse before cleansing & toning the skin. Wet your face with warm water. Apply a small amount of jelly scrub and use circular movements to gently massage the scrub around your face. Rinse off with warm water and dry. The cleanser & tone with your favourite products.\nIngredients:\nWater (Aqua), Glycerin, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Juglans Regia (Walnut) Shell Powder, Polyacrylic Acid, Triethanolamine, Phenoxyethanol, Disodium EDTA, Caprylyl Glycol, Fragrance (Parfum), Chlorphenesin.', 357.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 113.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Face Facts Hydrating Coconut Facial Scrub - 60mlPrice in BD', 'Face Facts Hydrating Coconut Facial Scrub - 60ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'face-facts-hydrating-coconut-facial-scrub-60ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
