(1815, 'Gold Apricot Facial Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 249, '1815', '1815', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nBenefit: Apricot scrub is a cream-based exfoliator that contains specially treated granules. Formulated using apricot kernel oil, almond oil and wheat germ oil along with walnut shell powder, This scrub exfoliates the skin and helps get rid of dead epithelial cells. It improves the quality of cells, giving the skin a youthful and fresh look\nHOW TO USE: Apply a sufficient quantity all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes in circular strokes. Wash off with plain water.\nINGREDIENTS: Apricot Kernel Oil, Almond Oil, Wheat Germ Oil, Walnut Shell Powder, Phenoxyethanol, Papaya Seeds, Honey, Fenugreek, Margosa, Purified Water Q.S.', 280.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gold Apricot Facial ScrubPrice in BD', 'Gold Apricot Facial Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gold-apricot-facial-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
