(1817, 'St. Ives Radiant Skin Pink Lemon & Mandarin Orange Scrub (Made in Poland)', '1', 0, 52, 377, '1817', '1817', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Polish away dullness and dryness with 100% natural walnut shell powder and lemon peel powder. Infused with pink lemon and mandarin peel extracts, this citrusy face scrub smoothes away rough skin and evens out skin tone for positively glowing skin.\nProduct Details:\nMade in Poland\nMADE WITH 100% NATURAL EXFOLIANTS AND EXTRACTS • OIL-FREE • PARABEN-FREE • DERMATOLOGIST-TESTED • NON-COMEDOGENIC • GLOBALLY, ST. IVES DOES NOT TEST ON ANIMALS AND IS CERTIFIED CRUELTY-FREE BY PETA\n\nHow to Use:\n1. Squeeze a dime sized amount of Radiant Skin Pink Lemon & Mandarin Orange Scrub onto your fingertips and massage onto damp skin.2. Spread in small circular motions, applying gentle pressure to wake your skin’s natural circulation.3. Work all over, right up to your hairline and onto the sides of your nose.4. When you’re done, rinse and pat dry with a clean towel.5. Use 3 to 4 times a week (depending on skin) for best results.\nIngredients:\nWater (Aqua), Juglans Regia (Walnut) Shell Powder, Glycerin, Sodium Methyl 2-Sulfolaurate, Decyl Glucoside, Acrylates Copolymer, Acrylates/Palmeth-25 Acrylate Copolymer, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Disodium 2-Sulfolaurate, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Peel Powder, Cocamidopropyl PG-Dimonium Chloride Phosphate, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance (Parfum), Disodium EDTA, Polyacrylamide, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Citrus Nobilis (Mandarin Orange) Peel Extract, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Fruit Extract, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 33 (CI 17200).\n', 671.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 449.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'St. Ives Radiant Skin Pink Lemon & Mandarin Orange Scrub (Made in Poland)Price in BD', 'St. Ives Radiant Skin Pink Lemon & Mandarin Orange Scrub (Made in Poland) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'st-ives-radiant-skin-pink-lemon-mandarin-orange-scrub-made-in-poland', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1818, 'YC Whitening Facial Scrub with Cucumber Extract', '1', 0, 52, 76, '1818', '1818', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'YC Cucumber Scrub is enriched with natural scrubs and Cucumber extract to gently clean and fresh your skin. Its cucumber properties restore the skin from sun damage.\nMaintain hydration under the skin. Remove dirt and dead skin cells gently, leaving skin whitening smooth and bright.\nPRODUCT FEATURES:\n-Whitening & Fairness-Oil Control-Moisturizing Skin-Dark Spots Reduce-Anti Acne & Pimple\nHOW TO USE:\nSqueeze on the palm. Scrub and leave for a moment. Then rinse with clean water. Can be used on the body.\nCOUNTRY OF ORIGIN: Thailand\nINGREDIENTS:Aqua, Stearic Acid, Glyceryl S massage gently (carefu Ceteareth-25, C9-15 Alkyl Phosphate, Triethanolamine, Prunus Armeniaca (Apricot) Seed Powder, CatyPhenoxyethanol & 4-Hydroxybenzolo Acid, Mothy, Ethyl Ester & 4-Hydroxybenzolo Acid, Propyl Ester, Shall Powder, Xanthan Gum, Parfum, Dimethicons, Niacinamide, CI 19140, CI 42090, Cucumis Sativa, Mannitol, Sodium Gluconate, Citric Acid, Sodium CWaltheria Indica Leaf Extract, Dextrin, Ferulio', 715.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 80.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'YC Whitening Facial Scrub with Cucumber ExtractPrice in BD', 'YC Whitening Facial Scrub with Cucumber Extract Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yc-whitening-facial-scrub-with-cucumber-extract', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
