(1821, 'Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Pore Clear Clay-BHA Facial Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 193, '1821', '1821', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This facial scrub brightens and cleanses skin, reducing blackheads and acne problems. Unleash the power of clay and BHA with Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Pore Clear Clay-BHA Facial Scrub. Designed to cleanse deeply and target clogged pores, this facial scrub combines the purifying properties of clay with the exfoliating action of BHA. It effectively removes excess oil, dead skin cells, and impurities, leaving your skin feeling refreshed, smooth, and visibly clearer. With regular use, it helps reduce the appearance of pores and blackheads, giving you a brighter, more radiant complexion. Suitable for oily and combination skin types, this scrub is your go-to solution for balanced, healthy-looking skin.Benefits:\nBest for:Pore controlUsage: Wet your face, create lather, gently massage onto face and neck, then rinse off. Use daily.Country of Origin: Indonesia', 475.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 175.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Pore Clear Clay-BHA Facial ScrubPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s Bright Miracle Ultimate Pore Clear Clay-BHA Facial Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-bright-miracle-ultimate-pore-clear-clay-bha-facial-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1822, 'Beauty Formulas Facial Scrub with Activate Charcoal', '1', 0, 52, 89, '1822', '1822', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Beauty Formulas Facial Scrub is perfect for a smoother, softer and more radiant skin. It gently exfoliates the skin to make it clean and clear. This helps remove dead skin cells and also unclog blocked pores that lead to acne and blemishes. It’s a deep cleansing formula that gently exfoliates removing dull and dead skin cells for smoother and softer radiant skin. Made in the U.K.', 565.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 235.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty Formulas Facial Scrub with Activate CharcoalPrice in BD', 'Beauty Formulas Facial Scrub with Activate Charcoal Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-formulas-facial-scrub-with-activate-charcoal', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1823, 'Neutrogena Deep Clean Invigorating Daily Scrub 150ml', '1', 0, 52, 151, '1823', '1823', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The exhilarating way to cleanse deep. Dermatologist-tested, gentle formula lathers into a bubbly foam. Permeating into the skin as it washes away surface oil. Energizing micro pearls exfoliate away dead skin cells. A surge of invigoration leaves behind thoroughly cool, cleansed and energized skin.\nBenefits:\nProduct Features:\nHow to use:\nWarning:\nAvoid contact with eyes. If eye contact occurs, rinse well with water. For external use only. Keep out of reach of children. Keep away from direct sunlight.\nInfredints:\nWater, Methyl Gluceth-20, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Lauryl Glucoside, Disodium Lauroamphodiacetate, Polyethylene, PEG-80 Sorbitan Laurate, Panthenol, Dimethicone PEG-8 Meadowfoamate, Polyquaternium-7, Sodium Benzotriazolyl Butylphenol Sulfonate, Menthol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate, Crosspolymer, Disodium EDTA, DMDM Hydantoin, Sodium Hydroxide, Synthetic Wax , Ultramarines, Blue 1, Fragrance.\n', 1056.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 144.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Deep Clean Invigorating Daily Scrub 150mlPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Deep Clean Invigorating Daily Scrub 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-deep-clean-invigorating-daily-scrub-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1824, 'Olay Detoxifying Pore Scrub With Pro-Vitamin B5 for All Skin Types – 150ml', '1', 0, 52, 58, '1824', '1824', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Benefits\nDeep Pore Purification: Draws out impurities to reduce the look of enlarged pores.\nGentle Daily Exfoliation: Smooths rough patches without stripping skin’s natural moisture.\nPro-Vitamin B5 & Glycerin: Support the skin’s moisture barrier for a soft, healthy feel.\nClean Formula: Free from phthalates, mineral oil, and synthetic dyes for a skin-friendly experience.\nHow to UseWet face with warm water. Massage a small amount in gentle circular motions, avoiding the eye area. Rinse thoroughly and follow with your preferred Olay moisturizer.\nDermatologist-Tested | Suitable for all skin types, including combination and oily skin.', 2793.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1197.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Olay Detoxifying Pore Scrub With Pro-Vitamin B5 for All Skin Types – 150mlPrice in BD', 'Olay Detoxifying Pore Scrub With Pro-Vitamin B5 for All Skin Types – 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'olay-detoxifying-pore-scrub-with-pro-vitamin-b5-for-all-skin-types-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1825, 'Cerave Skin Renewing Nightly Exfoliating Treatment', '1', 0, 52, 153, '1825', '1825', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'As the skin ages, its natural cellular turnover and renewal process may begin to slow down, making it more challenging to keep fresh, healthy-looking cells on the skin’s surface1. A targeted skin treatment such as an AHA serum formulated with glycolic acid to promote the skin’s natural exfoliation can provide improvement in visible signs of aging.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Skin Renewing Nightly Exfoliating Treatment is an AHA serum with a 5% blend of glycolic acid and lactic acid for gentle exfoliation to help smooth fine lines, accelerate skin\'s surface cell renewal and clear away dead skin cells, without causing flaking or redness. With continued use, skin looks healthier, radiance is improved, and signs of aging such as the appearance of wrinkles, dullness, dark spots and enlarged pores are reduced. Potent, yet gentle and lightweight, this multi-tasking, overnight AHA serum is formulated with 3 essential ceramides that work together to lock in skins moisture and help restore your skin’s protective barrier, hyaluronic acid and licorice root extract to help maintain the protective skin barrier, immediately boost skin hydration and help visibly brighten and even skin tone after 8 weeks of use.* MVE technology encapsulates ceramides to ensure efficient delivery within the skin’s barrier and slow release over time. Supporting your protective skin barrier, long after you’ve finish applying. The creamy, hydrating skin treatment is non-comedogenic, fragrance-free and suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nIngredients:\nAqua / Water / Eau, Glycerin, Cetearyl Ethylhexanoate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Dimethicone Lycolic Acid, Lactic Acid, Sodium Hydroxide, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6 , Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Carbomer, Cetearyl Glucoside, Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Triethyl Citrate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Cholesterol, Phenoxyethanol, Phenylethyl Resorcinol, Isopropyl Myristate, Caprylyl Glycol, Citric Acid, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Xanthan Gum, Phytosphingosine, Benzoic Acid\nBenefits:\nHow to use:\nDirections: Apply evenly to face nightly, after cleansing.\n\n\n\n\nWith Lactic and Glycolic Acids to help minimize the appearance of fine lines, dark spots and pores.\nContains Licorice Root Extract to help visibly brighten skin and Hyaluronic Acid to help retain skin\'s natural moisture.\nFor the first usage, press the pump down completely 5-6 times.\nApply in the evening to clean skin.\nApply a thin layer and allow to dry before applying CeraVe Night Cream.\nTo protect skin from sun exposure, use CeraVe Face Lotion with SPF 30 during the day.\nAll CeraVe products are developed with dermatologists.\nAs fragrance in skincare products can irritate sensitive skin, all CeraVe products are formulated to be fragrance-free.', 2868.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1017.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Skin Renewing Nightly Exfoliating TreatmentPrice in BD', 'Cerave Skin Renewing Nightly Exfoliating Treatment Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-skin-renewing-nightly-exfoliating-treatment', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
