(1835, 'Neutrogena Oil Free Acne Wash Daily Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 151, '1835', '1835', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our breakthrough exfoliating scrub features MicroClear®, a powerful technology scientifically shown to boost the delivery of acne medicine to the source of breakouts and speed treatment deep to the source. The MicroClear® Technology and gentle exfoliators work together to cut through oil and dissolve dirt and impurities, so your skin is left clear and smooth.\n\nIngredients:\n\nDirections:\n\nWarnings:\nFor external use only.\nWhen using this product skin irritation and dryness is more likely to occur if you use another topical medication at the same time. If irritation occurs, only use one topical medication at a time. avoid contact with the eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.Keep out of reach of children. If swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away.', 2040.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 920.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Oil Free Acne Wash Daily ScrubPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Oil Free Acne Wash Daily Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-oil-free-acne-wash-daily-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1836, 'Cosrx Full Fit Honey Sugar Lip Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 31, '1836', '1836', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Features:\nBenefits:\nHow to use:\nIngredients:\nSucrose, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Water, Stearalkonium Hectorite, 1,2-Hexanediol, Propylene Carbonate, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Extract, Ethylhexylglycerin, Butylene Glycol, Saccharum Officinarum (Sugarcane) Extract, Dextrin, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Fruit Extract, Honey\n', 1215.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1285.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Full Fit Honey Sugar Lip ScrubPrice in BD', 'Cosrx Full Fit Honey Sugar Lip Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-full-fit-honey-sugar-lip-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1837, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Facial Scrub 100ml', '1', 0, 52, 11, '1837', '1837', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Facial Scrub 100mlA brightening facial scrub formulated with 2x Vitamin C and refreshing Yuzu extract to exfoliate deeply, remove impurities, and instantly boost skin radiance. This scrub gently polishes away dull, dead skin cells, leaving the skin smoother, clearer, and brighter. Suitable for all skin types and ideal for those looking to improve uneven tone and revive tired-looking skin.\n\nKey Features\n\nBenefits\n\nBenefits of Key Ingredients\n\nUsageGently massage into cleansed, wet skin, avoiding the eye area. Rinse thoroughly with warm water. Gentle enough for daily use. Keep away from heat and direct sunlight.\n\nIngredients / CompositionAqua (Water), Glycerin, Propylene glycol, stearate, Stearic acid, Hydrated silica, Palmitic acid, Cetearyl alcohol, Cetea Polysorbate 40, Polysorbate 60, Phenoxyethanol, Lauryl glucoside, PEG-7 cocoate, Xanthan gum, Chlorphenesin, Coco-glucoside, Glyceryl oleate, Fragrance), 3-O-ethyl ascorbic acid, Citrus junos fruit extract, Ascorbyl tetrais PEG-40 hydrogenated castor oil, Potassium hydroxide, Myristic acid, Butylen Disodium EDTA, Dipropylene glycol, Benzotriazolyl dodecyl p-cresol, Limonene, Citric acid, Lauric acid, Agar, Polyquaternium-39, Denatonium benzoate, Tocopherol, Hydrogenated palm\n\nCountry of Origin: Thailand', 750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 40.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Facial Scrub 100mlPrice in BD', 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Facial Scrub 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-vitamin-c-brightening-facial-scrub-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1838, 'Gold Apricot Facial Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 249, '1838', '1838', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nBenefit: Apricot scrub is a cream-based exfoliator that contains specially treated granules. Formulated using apricot kernel oil, almond oil and wheat germ oil along with walnut shell powder, This scrub exfoliates the skin and helps get rid of dead epithelial cells. It improves the quality of cells, giving the skin a youthful and fresh look\nHOW TO USE: Apply a sufficient quantity all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes in circular strokes. Wash off with plain water.\nINGREDIENTS: Apricot Kernel Oil, Almond Oil, Wheat Germ Oil, Walnut Shell Powder, Phenoxyethanol, Papaya Seeds, Honey, Fenugreek, Margosa, Purified Water Q.S.', 193.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 27.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Gold Apricot Facial ScrubPrice in BD', 'Gold Apricot Facial Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gold-apricot-facial-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1839, 'Mango Apricot Facial Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 249, '1839', '1839', NULL, NULL, NULL, '1.Rich sugar body exfoliator2. Perfect for dry skin3. Leave skin feeling softer and nourished with moisture4. Smell deli cutely juicy5. Made with 90% ingredients of natural origin6. Mango Facial Scrub 99% works like magic for face and body. 7. Exfoliates the skin. Removes blackheads, white heads.8. Removes dirt.9. Cleans pores.10. Makes your skin healthy and bright with a crystal glass finish.\nHOW TO USE: Apply a sufficient quantity all over the face and neck. Massage gently for 2-3 minutes in circular strokes. Wash off with plain water\n', 199.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 21.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mango Apricot Facial ScrubPrice in BD', 'Mango Apricot Facial Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mango-apricot-facial-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1840, 'Good Lord Apple Facial Scrub 200gm', '1', 0, 52, 298, '1840', '1840', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Good Lord Apple Facial Scrub (200gm) is designed to gently exfoliate and refresh your skin, leaving it feeling smooth and revitalized. This facial scrub combines the benefits of natural ingredients with the invigorating scent of apple, making it a delightful addition to your skincare routine.\nFor more details on Good Lord Apple Facial Scrub, including user reviews and application tips, you can check beauty product sites that specialize in skincare', 107.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 3.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Good Lord Apple Facial Scrub 200gmPrice in BD', 'Good Lord Apple Facial Scrub 200gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'good-lord-apple-facial-scrub-200gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1841, 'Face Facts Cleansing Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 357, '1841', '1841', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Face Facts Cleansing Scrub is designed to cleanse and exfoliate the skin simultaneously, removing dead skin cells, dirt, and impurities while leaving the skin feeling refreshed and smooth. This scrub helps to improve skin texture, making it ideal for those looking for a clearer and more radiant complexion. It is suitable for most skin types, providing deep cleansing without stripping the skin of its natural oils.\nThe Face Facts Cleansing Scrub is a great addition to any skincare routine, offering deep cleansing and exfoliation for a refreshed and glowing complexion.\nMade in PRC', 440.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '75ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 360.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Face Facts Cleansing ScrubPrice in BD', 'Face Facts Cleansing Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'face-facts-cleansing-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1842, 'Nature Beauty Appricot Face Scrub for All Skin Type 130ml', '1', 0, 52, 78, '1842', '1842', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nature Beauty Apricot Face Scrub is specially formulated to gently exfoliate dead skin cells and impurities, revealing a brighter and healthier complexion. Enriched with natural apricot seed powder and vitamins A and C, this scrub nourishes and revitalizes your skin, promoting a smooth texture and an even tone.\n\nNature Beauty Apricot Face Scrub combines gentle exfoliation with nourishing care to leave your skin looking bright, smooth, and healthy.', 210.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 70.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nature Beauty Appricot Face Scrub for All Skin Type 130mlPrice in BD', 'Nature Beauty Appricot Face Scrub for All Skin Type 130ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nature-beauty-appricot-face-scrub-for-all-skin-type-130ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1843, 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Facial Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 11, '1843', '1843', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'We\'ve formulated our vegan skin care range enriched with cooling cucumber and vitamins to gently care for your skin. Our facial scrub is light and creamy to help revive and brighten the appearance of your skin, by gently buffing away dry patches and those nasty dead skin cells. Your skin will be left feeling thoroughly cleansed, refreshed and beautifully soft. This bottle contains a minimum of 35% post-consumer recycled content (PCR)\nHow to use\nSqueeze a small amount of facial scrub into your hands and massage in circular movements on your clean but dampened skin, splash with warm water to rinse and simply pat dry.\n\nAvoid contact with eyes. If product gets into eyes rinse well with water immediately. This is not a food. Keep out of reach of children.\n\n\nAqua (Water), Paraffinum liquidum (Mineral oil), Cetearyl alcohol, Hydrated silica, Glycerin, Steareth-21, Phenoxyethanol, Steareth-2, Xanthan gum, Caprylyl glycol, Tocopheryl acetate, Carbomer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Propylene glycol, Dipropylene glycol, Tetrasodium EDTA, Potassium hydroxide, Retinyl palmitate, Parfum (Fragrance), Hexyl cinnamal, Sorbitol, Hydroxycitronellal, Citronellol, Cucumis sativus (Cucumber) fruit extract, Denatonium benzoate, Tocopherol, Benzoic acid, CI 19140 (Yellow 5), CI 42090 (Blue 1)\n\nMade in UK', 620.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 290.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Facial ScrubPrice in BD', 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Facial Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-everyday-cucumber-facial-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32');
