(1844, 'Clean & Clear Blackhead Daily Scrub with Natural Exfoliators & Salicylic Acid', '1', 0, 52, 380, '1844', '1844', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Clean & Clear Blackhead Clearing Daily Face Scrub 150ml\nWhy Clean & Clear Blackhead Clearing Daily Scrub:Clean & Clear Blackhead Clearing Daily Scrub contains a unique active Quick Break-up Complex to help fight blackheads from day 1. The special exfoliating micro-beads immediately peel away dead cells to unclog pores. The blackhead fighting ingredient penetrates the pores to help clear them from impurities and prevent blackheads from forming. With soothing actives, this scrub is gentle enough to use everyday to help keep your skin Clean & Clearer of blackheads, without irritating or over-drying. See fewer blackheads after 1 wash.  With (purifying) salicylic acid.\nPack size: 150ML\nIngredientsAqua, Cetyl Alcohol, PPG-15 Stearyl Ether, Polyethylene, Cera Microcristallina, Steareth-21, Salicylic Acid, Polysorbate 60, Panthenol, Chamomilla Recutita Flower Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Gel, Bisabolol, Jojoba Esters, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Propylene Glycol, Glucose, Butylene Glycol, Xanthan Gum, Menthyl Lactate, BHT, Parfum, CI77510\nNet Contents150ml ℮', 825.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 575.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Clean & Clear Blackhead Daily Scrub with Natural Exfoliators & Salicylic AcidPrice in BD', 'Clean & Clear Blackhead Daily Scrub with Natural Exfoliators & Salicylic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'clean-clear-blackhead-daily-scrub-with-natural-exfoliators-salicylic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1845, 'St. Ives Gentle Smoothing Scrub with Rose Water & Aloe Vera', '1', 0, 52, 377, '1845', '1845', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our gentlest scrub yet! Made with 100% natural walnut shell powder and crushed rose petals, this scrub gently exfoliates to leave skin smooth\n\nHow to Use:\nIngredients:\nWater (Eau), Glyceryl Stearate SE, Glycerin, Juglans Regia (Walnut) Shell Powder, Cetearyl Alcohol, Cetyl Alcohol, Sodium Lauryl Sulfoacetate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Cetyl Acetate, Fragrance (Parfum), Benzyl Alcohol, Rosa Gallica Flower Powder, Ceteareth-20, Sodium Triethanolamine, Carbomer, Polysorbate 60, Disodium EDTA, Benzoic Acid, Acetylated Lanolin Alcohol, Sorbic acid, Rosa Damascena Flower Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Benzyl Alcohol, Cinnamyl Alcohol, Citral, Citronellol, Geraniol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Linalool, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).', 715.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 385.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'St. Ives Gentle Smoothing Scrub with Rose Water & Aloe VeraPrice in BD', 'St. Ives Gentle Smoothing Scrub with Rose Water & Aloe Vera Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'st-ives-gentle-smoothing-scrub-with-rose-water-aloe-vera', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1846, 'Neutrogena All-in-1 Acne Control Daily Scrub', '1', 0, 52, 151, '1846', '1846', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Finally, a multi-tasking daily exfoliating scrub that gets acne\'s past, present and future under control for consistently clearer, healthier looking skin.\nThis daily face scrub contains a powerful combination of ingredients for acne-prone skin that work together to clear up the three phases of a breakout, without over-drying. Formulated with gentle exfoliators, this scrub smooths away rough skin, and reduces the look of past acne marks. Maximum-strength salicylic acid acne-fighting medicine powerfully clears present breakouts and fights future budding acne before it emerges.\nCleanses away dirt, oil, grime, impurities, and bacteria\nSalicylic Acid acne treatment\nFormula doesn’t over-dry skin\nDoesn’t contain plastic microbeads\n\nIngredients:\nWater, Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate, Glycerin, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Sodium Chloride, Acrylates Copolymer, Cellulose, Polysorbate 20, Fragrance, C12-15 Alkyl Lactate, Sodium Hydroxide, Disodium Edta, Benzalkonium Chloride, Polyquaternium-7, Cocamidopropyl Pg-Dimonium Chloride Phosphate, Sodium Benzotriazolyl Butylphenol Sulfonate, Propylene Glycol, Citrus Grandis (Grapefruit) Fruit Extract, Carrageenan, Agar, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Mica, Titanium Dioxide, Red 30, Red 40, Violet 2.\n\nDirections:\nCleanse twice a day.\nWet face.\nApply to hands, add water and work into a lather.\nMassage face gently.\nRinse thoroughly.\nWarnings:\nFor external use only.\nWhen using this product\nskin irritation and dryness is more likely to occur if you use another topical acne medication at the same time. If irritation occurs, only use one topical acne medication at a time.\navoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, flush thoroughly with water.\nKeep out of reach of children. If swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center right away.', 1573.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '124ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1027.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena All-in-1 Acne Control Daily ScrubPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena All-in-1 Acne Control Daily Scrub Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-all-in-1-acne-control-daily-scrub', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1847, 'Bio Active Apricot Scrub + Gluta for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 52, 271, '1847', '1847', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Face & body scrub helps to cleanse and remove dead skin cells gently. Apricot(Apricot Extract) helps to nourishing and relax.', 521.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 219.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bio Active Apricot Scrub + Gluta for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Bio Active Apricot Scrub + Gluta for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bio-active-apricot-scrub-gluta-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1848, 'St. Ives Fresh Skin Apricot Scrub for Glowing Skin', '1', 0, 52, 377, '1848', '1848', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The icon. The cult classic. The beauty editor favorite. Our deep cleaning apricot face scrub with 100% natural walnut shell powder works to give you soft, smooth, positively glowing skin.\nMADE WITH 100% NATURAL EXFOLIANTS AND EXTRACTS • OIL-FREE • PARABEN-FREE • DERMATOLOGIST-TESTED • NON-COMEDOGENIC • GLOBALLY, ST. IVES DOES NOT TEST ON ANIMALS AND IS CERTIFIED CRUELTY-FREE BY PETA\nHow to use:\n1. Squeeze a dime sized amount of Fresh Skin Apricot Scrub onto your fingertips and massage onto damp skin.2. Spread in small circular motions, applying gentle pressure to wake your skin’s natural circulation.3. Work all over, right up to your hairline and onto the sides of your nose.4. When you’re done, rinse and pat dry with a clean towel.5. Use 3 to 4 times a week (depending on skin) for best results.\nIngredients:\nCrushed walnut shell powder is the gentle-yet-effective secret behind many of our scrubs. We take pride in ensuring the walnut shell powder in our scrubs is finely milled and polished so that each particle has a smooth surface. This ensures our scrubs only provide exfoliation to the outer layers of dead skin cells and do not damage your skin.\nWater (Aqua), Juglans Regia (Walnut) Shell Powder, Glyceryl Stearate SE, Glycerin, Cetearyl Alcohol, Zea Mays (Corn) Kernel Meal, Cetyl Alcohol, Sodium Lauryl Sulfoacetate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Glyceryl stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Cetyl Acetate, Benzyl alcohol, Ceteareth-20, Acetylated Lanolin Alcohol, Carbomer, Polysorbate 60, Triethanolamine, Fragrance (Parfum), Disodium EDTA, Benzoic Acid, Sorbic Acid, Prunus Armeniaca (Apricot) Fruit Extract, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).\nMade in USA', 850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'St. Ives Fresh Skin Apricot Scrub for Glowing SkinPrice i