(1864, 'The Ordinary Lactic Acid 10% + HA', '1', 0, 53, 25, '1864', '1864', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Benefits:\nTypes of Skin:All skin types, however is particularly beneficial for sensitive to dry skin\nIngredients:\nAqua (Water), Lactic Acid, Glycerin, Pentylene Glycol, Arginine, Potassium Citrate, Triethanolamine, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Tasmannia Lanceolata Fruit/Leaf Extract, Acacia Senegal Gum, Xanthan Gum, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, PPG-26-Buteth-26, Ethyl 2,2-Dimethylhydrocinnamal, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol.\nHow to Use:\nAfter Cleaning the face properly use 2 to 3 drops onto your face. Use a moisturizer after 30 mins while using it. Allow a few minutes for it to absorb. Avoid eyes area. If irritation occurs, this product can be diluted to reduce its strength.\nDirections:\nSunburn Alert:\nThis product contains an alpha hydroxy acid (AHA) that may increase your skin’s sensitivity to the sun & particularly the possibility of sunburn. Use a sunscreen, wear protective clothing, & limit sun exposure while using this product & for a week afterwards.\nContraindications:\nLactic Acid should not be used on sensitive, peeling or compromised skin. Please refer to additional sun protection note & other warnings in provided Directions.\nDo not use withCopper PeptidesDirect AcidsDirect Vitamin CEUKNiacinamide PowderPeptidesRetinoids\nWhat it is: A high-strength lactic acid peeling formula for smoother, healthier-looking skin.Skin Type: Normal, Dry, Combination, and OilySkincare Concerns: Fine Lines/Wrinkles, Dullness, and Uneven TextureIngredient Callouts: Free of parabens, formaldehydes, phthalates, mineral oil, oxybenzone, coal tar, and sulfates SLS & SLES. It is also vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.What Else You Need to Know: This product is vegan, cruelty-free, and formulated without oil, alcohol, silicone, nuts, gluten, and fragrance.\nMade in Canada', 1650.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 850.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Lactic Acid 10% + HAPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Lactic Acid 10% + HA Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-lactic-acid-10-ha', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1865, 'Dr Rashel Apple Aha Skin Polish Exfoloating Gel', '1', 0, 53, 55, '1865', '1865', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Achieve glowing, smooth skin with Dr.Rashel Apple Aha Exfloating Gel 220G. Formulated with a powerful combination of apple extract and Aha, this gel gently exfoliates and removes dead skin cells, revealing a rejuvenated complexion. With regular use, expect a 220% increase in skin radiance.', 450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 475.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr Rashel Apple Aha Skin Polish Exfoloating GelPrice in BD', 'Dr Rashel Apple Aha Skin Polish Exfoloating Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-rashel-apple-aha-skin-polish-exfoloating-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1866, 'The Ordinary Glycolic Acid 7% Exfoliating Toner (Previously Glycolic Acid 7% Toning Solution) 240ml', '1', 0, 53, 25, '1866', '1866', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Glycolic Acid is an alpha hydroxy acid that exfoliates the skin. The ordinary glycolic acid 7% toning solution offers mild exfoliation for improved skin radiance and visible clarity. The formula also improves the appearance of skin texture with continued use. This formula contains a studied Tasmanian Pepperberry derivative. This derivative is of plant origin and varies in colour seasonally and this colour variation may be apparent in the formula from time to time. The formula is further supported with the inclusion of ginseng root and aloe vera for both visible radiance and skin-soothing benefits. Contraindications: This formula should not be used on sensitive, peeling or compromised skin. Please refer to the additional sun protection notes and other warnings in the provided Directions. The pH of this formula is approximately 3.6. Glycolic Acid has a pKa of 3.6 and pKa is the most important aspect to consider in formulating with acids. pKa implies acid availability. When pKa is close to pH, there is an ideal balance between salt and acidity, maximizing the effectiveness of the acid and reducing irritation. Higher pH numbers in such a case would increase salt which counter-intuitively would make the formula even more irritating than if the formula was more acidic. Note: While exfoliating acids can result in quick visible benefits, we generally suggest indirect forms of skin exfoliation in favour of direct forms such as this formula due to potential inflammation and sensitivity associated with acids. Please refer to NIOD’s Non-Acid Acid Precursor for such a reference. Sunburn Alert: This product contains an alpha hydroxy acid (AHA) that may increase your skin’s sensitivity to the sun and particularly the possibility of sunburn. Use sunscreen, wear protective clothing, and limit sun exposure while using this product and for a week afterwards.\nFollow the skin care 5-Step Regimen\nStep 1: Cleanse – Wash your face with a gentle Cleanser/Facewash according to your skin type.\nStep 2: Tone- The Ordinary Glycolic Acid 7% Toning SolutionSoak a cotton pad with purifying toner and sweep along the skin. If preferred pat into the skin with your hands.\nStep 3: Treat – Serum/Facial Oil/Essence contains useful nutrients — for your skin.\nStep 4: Moisturize – Moisturizer/Day & Night Cream maintain your skin’s moisture barrier and to prevent environmental damage to your skin\nStep 5: Sun Care – Apply Sunscreen to protect skin from UV Ray (Day time only)\n\nSuited to: All Skin Types\nFormat: Water-based Toner', 3548.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 627.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Ordinary Glycolic Acid 7% Exfoliating Toner (Previously Glycolic Acid 7% Toning Solution) 240mlPrice in BD', 'The Ordinary Glycolic Acid 7% Exfoliating Toner (Previously Glycolic Acid 7% Toning Solution) 240ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-ordinary-glycolic-acid-7-exfoliating-toner-previously-glycolic-acid-7-toning-solution-240ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1867, 'Medicube Red Acne Body Peeling Shot with AHA+BHA+PHA+LHA 110g', '1', 0, 53, 96, '1867', '1867', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Water(Aqua), Lactic Acid, Alcohol, Gluconolactone, Dipropylene Glycol, Citric Acid, Sodium Hydroxide, Niacinamide, Methylpropanediol, C12-14 Alketh-12, Glucose, Gardenia Florida Fruit Extract, 1,2-Hexanediol, Salicylic Acid, Dextrin, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Succinic Acid, Ethylhexylglycerin, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate, Lavandula Hybrida Oil, Mentha Arvensis Extract, Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Extract, Brassica Oleracea Capitata (Cabbage) Leaf Extract, Juniperus Mexicana Oil, Panthenol, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Allantoin, Limonene, Glycolic Acid, Linalool, Coumarin, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Capryloyl Salicylic Acid, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Water, Butylene Glycol, Geraniol, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Extract, Cladosiphon Okamuranus Extract, Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Decyl Glucoside, Eugenol, Coffea Arabica (Coffee) Seed Extract, Citral, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia (Bergamot) Leaf Extract, Pinus Densiflora Leaf Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Extract, Cynanchum Atratum ExtractIngredients are subject to change at the discretion of the manufacturer. A list of ingredients that is as complete and up-to-date as possible can be found on the product packaging.', 2565.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 285.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube Red Acne Body Peeling Shot with AHA+BHA+PHA+LHA 110gPrice in BD', 'Medicube Red Acne Body Peeling Shot with AHA+BHA+PHA+LHA 110g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-red-acne-body-peeling-shot-with-ahabhaphalha-110g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1868, 'Cosrx AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 53, 31, '1868', '1868', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This treatment toner makes daily exfoliation possible with its mild AHA/BHA formulation. It mainly contains white willow extract and apple water which are abundant in nutrients beneficial to the skin. The gentle peeling process this clarifying toner offers makes it possible for the nutrients to effectively and fully penetrate the skin for optimum results. Over continuous usage, your skin will reveal a newer, healthier skin with a much smoother texture and brighter complexion.\nProduct Features:\nBenefits:\nTargets:\nIngredients:\n• Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Water + Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water :Offers gentle exfoliation & helps reduce breakouts and marks from spots\n• Glycolic Acid :Exfoliates the surface of the skin & smooths and softens skin\n• Betaine Salicylate :Clears congested pores & balances oil production\nWater, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Water, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Lactate, Glycolic Acid, Betaine Salicylate, Allantoin, Panthenol, Ethyl Hexanediol\nHow to use:\nAfter cleansing, spray the toner onto a cotton pad and gently wipe onto face, avoiding the eye and mouth area. For use during the daytime, follow with a broad-spectrum sunscreen rated SPF 30 or greater.\nWarnings:\n\nMade in Korea\n\n\n\n\n10% of Pyrus malus (apple) fruit water and salix alba (willow) bark water enhance skin vitality and radiance\nCare for your blackheads and whiteheads daily and gently before they get bigger and worse. It is mild enough to be used every day.\nThe toner creates a clean base as an extension of your cleansing step and restores the ideal pH of the skin for any skincare products that follow.', 1430.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottol', 0.00, 1, NULL, 820.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'Cosrx AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-ahabha-clarifying-treatment-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1869, 'Heimish RX AHA + BHA Facial Exfoliator', '1', 0, 53, 95, '1869', '1869', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Heimish RX AHA BHA Enzyme Scrub (130ml) is a gentle exfoliating scrub designed to remove dead skin cells, unclog pores, and promote a smoother, more radiant complexion. Inspired by the French \"gommage\" technique, this scrub combines Alpha Hydroxy Acids (AHA), Beta Hydroxy Acids (BHA), and natural enzymes to effectively exfoliate the skin without causing irritation.\nKey Features:\nDual Exfoliation: Combines AHA and BHA to exfoliate the skin\'s surface and penetrate pores, effectively removing dead skin cells and excess oil.\nEnzyme-Powered: Enriched with natural enzymes, such as Bromelain, to enhance exfoliation and promote skin renewal.\nHydrating Formula: Contains Panthenol and Allantoin to soothe and hydrate the skin, maintaining moisture balance.\nGentle on Skin: Formulated to be gentle, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nBenefits:\nSmooths and Brightens: Regular use helps achieve a smoother texture and a brighter complexion.\nUnclogs Pores: Helps clear clogged pores, reducing the risk of acne and blackheads.\nHydrates and Soothes: Maintains skin hydration and calms irritation, leaving the skin soft and comfortable.\nHow to Use:\nApply a generous amount to clean, wet skin.\nGently massage in circular motions to exfoliate.\nRinse thoroughly with water.\nMade in Korea', 1547.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 853.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish RX AHA + BHA Facial ExfoliatorPrice in BD', 'Heimish RX AHA + BHA Facial Exfoliator Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-rx-aha-bha-facial-exfoliator', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1870, 'Paula\'s Choice Skin Perfecting 2% BHA Liquid Exfoliant with Salicylic Acid', '1', 0, 53, 382, '1870', '1870', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Glow at home or on the go with a travel size 2% BHA Liquid Exfoliant, the #1 global best seller with salicylic acid that quickly unclogs pores, smooths wrinkles, brightens and evens out skin tone.\nA unique leave-on formula that’s gentle enough for daily use on all skin types. Exfoliates dead skin cells while clearing pores for a more even, radiant tone, plus visibly reduces fine lines and wrinkles to reveal remarkably smoother, younger-looking skin. This exfoliant has an optimal pH range of 3.2–3.8.\n\nWhat Does it Do:\nSkin becomes dull, dry and congested when dead skin cells build up on its surface. Beta hydroxy acid (BHA, also known as salicylic acid) mimics the natural exfoliation process of younger skin by helping it shed extra layers while unclogging and clearing pores. Clinically proven to brighten, hydrate, reduce the appearance of fine lines & improve skin barrier in 4 weeks.\n\nHow to Use:\nGently apply using fingers or a cotton pad over entire face and neck, including the eye area (avoid lash line and eyelids) after cleansing and toning. Do not rinse.\nStart Slowly: Apply every other day and note skin\'s response. Then use up to twice daily. For daytime, always finish with SPF 30+. For nighttime, follow with the rest of your routine.\nIf you have a salicylate allergy, check with your physician before using any products that contain salicylic acid\n\n\nMade in USA', 2399.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 601.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Paula\'s Choice Skin Perfecting 2% BHA Liquid Exfoliant with Salicylic AcidPrice in BD', 'Paula\'s Choice Skin Perfecting 2% BHA Liquid Exfoliant with Salicylic Acid Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'paulas-choice-skin-perfecting-2-bha-liquid-exfoliant-with-salicylic-acid', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
