(1872, 'L’Oréal Bright Reveal Dark Spot Exfoliant Peel – 25ml', '1', 0, 53, 110, '1872', '1872', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Achieve brighter, smoother, and more even-toned skin with L’Oréal Bright Reveal Dark Spot Exfoliant Peel. This powerful 25% multi-acid peel combines AHA, BHA, and PHA to target dark spots, post-acne marks, and uneven texture while resurfacing skin for a radiant glow.\nKey Benefits:\nReduces dark spots & post-acne marks with Glycolic, Lactic, and Mandelic acids (AHA)\nMinimizes pores & imperfections with Salicylic Acid (BHA)\nGently resurfaces skin for brighter, smoother texture (PHA)\nVisible results: Brighter skin after 1 use; faded marks and improved texture after 2–3 weeks\nDirections for Use:\nShake the bottle side to side.\nTurn upside down and dispense product into hand.\nApply evenly to clean, dry face, avoiding eyes and lips.\nLeave for 15 minutes.\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\nFollow with a moisturizer. Use 4 times per week at night. Always apply SPF 30+ during the day.\nCaution: Flammable until dry. Avoid contact with eyes, nostrils, lips, broken or irritated skin. Do not use with other peels or exfoliating products. For external use only.\nKey Ingredients:Aqua (Water), Alcohol Denat, Lactic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Gluconolactone, Salicylic Acid, Mandelic Acid, Niacinamide, Propanediol, Glycerin, Silica, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Mica, Fragrance, Titanium Dioxide', 3430.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1470.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'L’Oréal Bright Reveal Dark Spot Exfoliant Peel – 25mlPrice in BD', 'L’Oréal Bright Reveal Dark Spot Exfoliant Peel – 25ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-bright-reveal-dark-spot-exfoliant-peel-25ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
