(1875, 'The YEON Vita 7 Energy Peeling Gel 100ml – Multivitamin + AHA & BHA - Exfoliate', '1', 0, 53, 383, '1875', '1875', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gentle Exfoliation · Multivitamin Care · Brightening · Made in Korea\nThe YEON Vita7 Energy Peeling Gel is a vitamin-rich, hypoallergenic peeling gel designed for gentle keratin care and exfoliation. Formulated with AHA, BHA, and natural cellulose, it removes dead skin cells, impurities, and dullness while replenishing essential vitamins and nutrients for smooth, radiant, and healthy-looking skin.\nGentle Exfoliation: AHA and BHA remove dead skin cells and unclog pores.\nVitamin Boost: Contains 7 essential vitamins (C, E, B3, B5, F, H, HA) to nourish and revitalize skin.\nBrightening & Smooth Skin: Improves skin texture, leaving it soft, glowing, and healthy.\nHypoallergenic & Safe: Suitable for sensitive skin, dermatologist-tested.\nApply an appropriate amount to dry, clean skin, avoiding the eyes and mouth.\nWait 1–2 minutes, then gently massage in circular motions.\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\nUse 1–2 times per week depending on skin sensitivity.\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes.\nDo not use on damaged or broken skin.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs.\nKeep out of reach of children and store away from direct sunlight.\nAHA & BHA: Exfoliate dead skin cells and clear pores.\nNatural Cellulose: Helps gently remove impurities.\nMultivitamins (C, E, B3, B5, F, H, HA): Hydrate, nourish, and brighten skin.\nBotanical Extracts: Camellia, Lotus, Honeysuckle, Licorice, Centella Asiatica – soothing and revitalizing.\nHyaluronic Acid & Panthenol: Provide deep hydration and skin barrier support.\nVolume: 100ml / 3.38 fl. oz\nOrigin: Made in Korea\nBrand: The YEON\nSuitable For: All skin types, especially for dull or uneven-textured s', 1562.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 428.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The YEON Vita 7 Energy Peeling Gel 100ml – Multivitamin + AHA & BHA - ExfoliatePrice in BD', 'The YEON Vita 7 Energy Peeling Gel 100ml – Multivitamin + AHA & BHA - Exfoliate Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-yeon-vita-7-energy-peeling-gel-100ml-multivitamin-aha-bha-exfoliate', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1876, 'Garnier Pure Active 3in1 Anti Blackhead Scrub with BHA+Charcoal 150ml', '1', 0, 53, 37, '1876', '1876', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fight stubborn blackheads and excess oil with Garnier Pure Active 3in1 Charcoal Anti-Blackhead Cleanser—a multi-use formula powered by BHA (Salicylic Acid) and natural origin Charcoal. Designed for oily, congested skin, this 3-in-1 product works as a daily wash, daily scrub, and weekly mask to deeply cleanse pores, remove impurities, and help prevent blackheads from coming back.\nThis versatile cleanser helps purify the skin, reduce shine, and improve visible texture in a simple routine. With consistent use, skin looks clearer, pores feel cleaner, and blackheads appear less noticeable—making it an ideal all-in-one solution for blackhead-prone areas like the nose, forehead, and chin.\n1) WASH (Daily):Use every day to cleanse and purify, helping remove dirt, oil, and impurities.\n2) SCRUB (Daily):Gently exfoliates to help unclog pores and reduce stubborn blackheads.\n3) MASK (1–2x Weekly):Apply to absorb excess sebum and reduce shine for a more matte look.\nIn 7 days, skin looks visibly improved with fewer blackheads and blemishes\nWash: 97% agree impurities are eliminated**\nScrub: 78% agree blackheads look less visible and pores feel unclogged**\nMask: 83% agree skin looks mattified****Self-assessment / study results as mentioned on pack.\nWash: Apply daily on a wet face and rinse thoroughly.\nScrub: Every day, gently massage to exfoliate, then rinse.\nMask: Up to 2 times per week, apply on face, leave for 5 minutes, then rinse off.\nAvoid eye and lip area. If product gets into eyes, rinse immediately.\nSize: 150ml\nMade in: Germany\nTube made of 27% recycled plastic (as stated)\nAqua/Water, Kaolin, Glycerin, Zea Mays (Corn)…, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, CI 77499 (Mineral pigments), …, Charcoal Powder, Microcrystalline Cellulose, …, Sodium Hydroxide, Xanthan Gum, Parfum/Fragrance, Polyglycerin-10 (and other ingredients as listed on the pack).', 968.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 422.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Pure Active 3in1 Anti Blackhead Scrub with BHA+Charcoal 150mlPrice in BD', 'Garnier Pure Active 3in1 Anti Blackhead Scrub with BHA+Charcoal 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-pure-active-3in1-anti-blackhead-scrub-with-bhacharcoal-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32');
