(1877, 'Melao Glycolic Deep Acid Peel 70% Brightening Exfoliate 30ml', '1', 0, 53, 30, '1877', '1877', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Melao Glycolic Acid Peel 70%-30ml\nFeatures:whitening, shrinking pores, anti-acne, lifting and firming, moisturizing, deep cleansing, sun protection, after-sun repair, blackhead removal, anti-wrinkle, exfoliating, brighten skin tone, revitalize skin, control oil.Net Wt: 30mlIngredients: 70% glycolic acid peelInstructions:1. Wash your face with a mild facial cleanser.2. Apply a thin layer of stock solution3. Maintain the required peeling time (1-5 minutes)4. After applying the neutralizer to the skin, wash with baking soda and water5. Face wash6. Pat dry with sunscreen and apply moisturizer.Shelf life: 3 years', 380.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 170.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Melao Glycolic Deep Acid Peel 70% Brightening Exfoliate 30mlPrice in BD', 'Melao Glycolic Deep Acid Peel 70% Brightening Exfoliate 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'melao-glycolic-deep-acid-peel-70-brightening-exfoliate-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
(1878, 'Ralycos NIACOS Niacinamide Serum 30ml – Skin Radiance & Lightening', '1', 0, 53, 140, '1878', '1878', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:The Ralycos NIACOS Niacinamide Serum is a potent skincare formulation designed to enhance skin radiance and promote an even complexion. Enriched with 10% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), this serum effectively addresses various skin concerns, including uneven skin tone, dark spots, and blemishes. Its lightweight, non-greasy texture ensures deep penetration, providing hydration and improving skin resilience without clogging pores.\nKey Benefits:\nEvens Skin Tone: Reduces blotchiness and promotes a uniform complexion.\nFades Dark Spots: Diminishes the appearance of hyperpigmentation and blemishes.\nDeep Hydration: Infused with Hyaluronic Acid, it provides moisture without an oily residue.\nEnhances Skin Resilience: Strengthens the skin\'s barrier, improving elasticity and overall health.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle formulation ideal for daily use.\nKey Ingredients:\nNiacinamide (10%): A form of Vitamin B3 that brightens skin tone and reduces inflammation.\nHyaluronic Acid: Attracts moisture to the skin, ensuring hydration and plumpness.\nAzadirachta Indica (Neem) Leaf Extract: Offers antimicrobial properties, promoting clear skin.\nCinnamomum Zeylanicum (Cinnamon) Bark Extract: Provides antioxidant benefits, protecting the skin from environmental stressors.\nAllantoin: Soothes and protects the skin, aiding in the healing process.\nArctium Lappa (Burdock) Root Extract: Detoxifies and purifies the skin, reducing blemishes.\nUsage Instructions:\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\nApply 2-3 drops of the serum to your face and neck.\nGently massage in upward circular motions until fully absorbed.\nFor optimal results, use twice daily—morning and evening.\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes; in case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs and consult a dermatologist.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nPackaging: Comes in a 30ml glass dropper bottle, ensuring precise application and maintaining product integrity.', 4446.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 234.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Ralycos NIACOS Niacinamide Serum 30ml – Skin Radiance & LighteningPrice in BD', 'Ralycos NIACOS Niacinamide Serum 30ml – Skin Radiance & Lightening Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ralycos-niacos-niacinamide-serum-30ml-skin-radiance-lightening', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:32', '2026-02-11 13:41:32'),
