(1880, 'Cosrx AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid', '1', 0, 53, 31, '1880', '1880', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Get clear, glowing, whitehead-free skinFormulated with 7% Glycolic Acid (AHA), the toner gently exfoliates skin and helps reveal a radiant, even-toned complexion.\nProduct Benefits:\n• Exfoliating & brightening• Clear whiteheads• Promote skin cell turnover• Remove dead skin cell\nTargets:\n• Dull, rough skin in need of a glow up\n• Uneven skin texture\n• Tiny, white bumps & whiteheads\n• Dry, combination skin\nBest for experienced users\nIngredients:\n• Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water +Glycol, Glycolic Acid :\nRefines uneven skin texture & clears whiteheads & diminishes fine lines\n• Niacinamide :\nReduces marks from spots & boosts radiancePyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycolic Acid, Niacinamide, Sodium Hydroxide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Xanthan Gum, Ethyl HexanediolHow to use:After cleansing, soak a cotton pad and swipe a thin layer of the liquid over the skin, avoiding the eye and mouth area. For use during the daytime, follow with a broad-spectrum sunscreen rated SPF 30 or greater\nAbout this item:\nMildly Exfoliating: Say goodbye to whiteheads with continued use and reveal clear skin.\nDry to Combination Skin: Formulated with hyaluronic acid, the AHA 7 exfoliant is perfect for all skin types.\nKey Ingredients: Just 10 simple ingredients in a bottle. Clean and simple with results that follow.\nGentle and Effective: Don\'t be daunted by chemical exfoliants. This easy-to-use product guarantees the natural radiance you deserve.\nCOSRX Standards: All COSRX products are formulated with skin-friendly ingredients that alleviate irritated skin. Hypoallergenic, Dermatologist tested, Animal Testing-FREE, Parabens-FREE, Sulfates-FREE, Phthalates-FREE\nProduct Description\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 1599.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 601.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00,