(1883, 'Absolute New York Blemish Repair Skin Serum – AHA, BHA, Tea Tree Oil, Panthenol & Biotin, 50ml', '1', 0, 53, 86, '1883', '1883', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Say goodbye to blemishes and uneven skin with the Absolute New York Blemish Repair Skin Serum. Formulated with AHA, BHA, Tea Tree Oil, Panthenol, and Biotin, this lightweight serum helps exfoliate dead skin cells, unclog pores, reduce breakouts, and soothe irritated skin. Ideal for oily, acne-prone, or blemish-prone skin, it promotes a clearer, healthier-looking complexion with consistent use.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nAHA (Lactic & Glycolic Acid): Gently exfoliates dead skin cells, revealing smoother and brighter skin\nBHA (Salicylic Acid): Penetrates deep into pores to control blackheads and breakouts\nTea Tree Oil: Natural antibacterial agent that combats acne-causing bacteria\nPanthenol: Hydrates, soothes, and repairs irritated skin\nBiotin: Supports overall skin health and strengthens the skin barrier\nSweet Almond Oil: Nourishes and softens the skin\nHow to Use:\nStart with clean, damp skin.\nDispense 1–2 pumps of serum and gently pat into the skin until fully absorbed.\nApply before cream or moisturizer.\nUse morning and night for best results.\nIf applied during the day, finish with sunscreen to protect against sun exposure.\nTexture & Feel:\nLightweight, fast-absorbing serum suitable for daily use on blemish-prone skin\nPackaging:\n50ml hygienic pump bottle for controlled and convenient application\nBenefits:\nReduces blemishes, breakouts, and blackheads\nImproves skin texture and clarity\nHydrates and soothes irritation\nPromotes a healthier, balanced complexion\nSafety & Notes:\nDermatologically tested\nSuitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin\nUse sunscreen during the day to prevent sun sensitivity\nIngredients:Water, Dipropylene Glycol, Glycerin, Glycereth-26, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Betaine, Salicylic Acid, Lactic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Panthenol, Biotin, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Dimethicone, Polyacrylate-13, Methylpropanediol, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Polyisobutene, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Tromethamine, Polysorbate 20, Allantoin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Steareth-30, Disodium EDTA, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Citric Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin', 1590.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 700.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Absolute New York Blemish Repair Skin Serum – AHA, BHA, Tea Tree Oil, Panthenol & Biotin, 50mlPrice in BD', 'Absolute New York Blemish Repair Skin Serum – AHA, BHA, Tea Tree Oil, Panthenol & Biotin, 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'absolute-new-york-blemish-repair-skin-serum-aha-bha-tea-tree-oil-panthenol-biotin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1884, 'Minimalist AHA PHA BHA 32 Percent 30ml', '1', 0, 53, 32, '1884', '1884', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Exfoliate. Brighten. Renew.\nMinimalist AHA PHA BHA 32% is an advanced chemical exfoliant formulated to deeply cleanse pores, smooth skin texture, and promote an even, radiant complexion. This peeling solution combines a powerful blend of 25% AHA, 5% PHA, and 2% BHA to gently yet effectively exfoliate dead skin cells and clear congestion without over-drying the skin.\nAHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid) – 25%: Glycolic, Lactic, Malic, and Tartaric acids exfoliate the skin’s surface to reduce dullness and fine lines.\nPHA (Polyhydroxy Acid) – 5%: Gluconolactone hydrates and gently exfoliates, suitable for sensitive skin.\nBHA (Beta Hydroxy Acid) – 2%: Salicylic acid penetrates deep into pores to clear blackheads, whiteheads, and acne.\nTasmanian Pepperberry Extract: Soothes irritation often associated with acid use.\nAloe Vera & Hyaluronic Acid: Moisturize and calm the skin post-exfoliation.\n✔ Removes dead skin & unclogs pores✔ Brightens dull, uneven skin tone✔ Helps reduce acne, blackheads & whiteheads✔ Improves skin texture & radiance✔ Supports skin cell renewal\nApply once a week on clean, dry skin.\nLeave on for no more than 10 minutes.\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\nFollow with a gentle moisturizer and sunscreen (daytime use).For external use only.\nPatch test recommended before full use.\nAvoid contact with eyes and broken skin.\nNot recommended for sensitive or compromised skin.\nAlways follow with broad-spectrum SPF 30+ sunscreen in the daytime.\nNormal to oily & acne-prone skin\nNot ideal for very sensitive skin\nFragrance, Parabens, Sulfates, Silicones, Essential Oils\nMade in IndiaDermatologically Tested | pH: 3.6 ± 0.5', 1600.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Minimalist AHA PHA BHA 32 Percent 30mlPrice in BD', 'Minimalist AHA PHA BHA 32 Percent 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'minimalist-aha-pha-bha-32-percent-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
