(1895, 'Dr. C. Tuna Face Toner', '1', 0, 55, 272, '1895', '1895', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience the ultimate skin-refreshing solution with Dr. C. Tuna Face Toner, a premium skincare range from the renowned Farmasi brand, proudly made in Turkey. Designed to cater to diverse skin needs, these toners come in three powerful variants: Tea Tree, Charcoal, and Calendula. Each variant is enriched with carefully chosen ingredients to ensure targeted results, leaving your skin refreshed, balanced, and radiant.\nIdeal for oily and acne-prone skin, this toner harnesses the antibacterial and clarifying properties of Tea Tree Extract to:\nPerfect for deep cleansing and detoxifying, this toner is infused with Activated Charcoal to:\nSpecially formulated for sensitive and dry skin, this gentle toner contains Calendula Extract, known for its calming and hydrating properties. It helps to:\nRediscover the beauty of balanced, clear, and hydrated skin with Dr. C. Tuna Face Toner. Choose the variant that matches your unique needs and take the first step toward a more radiant you!\n\nMade in Turkey', 895.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 355.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dr. C. Tuna Face TonerPrice in BD', 'Dr. C. Tuna Face Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dr-c-tuna-face-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1896, 'Cetaphil Bright Healthy Radiance Brightness Refresh Toner', '1', 0, 55, 63, '1896', '1896', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A refreshing toner that instantly illuminates skin complexion for softer and smoother skin. Leaves the skin with a non-sticky, refreshing after-feel.\n•Contains Niacinamide and White Sea Daffodil•Fragrance-free and Non-Comedogenic•Clinically tested to respect sensitive skin\n\nComplete the cleansing process with this skin-perfecting, refreshing toner. Instantly revitalising, it lessens dullness by promoting hydrated, softer, smoother, brighter looking skin. The Gentle Bright Technology, powered by Niacinamide and natural Sea Daffodil extract, is designed to respect sensitive skin. These gentle, yet effective ingredients in the Healthy Radiance range, work in combination to reveal brighter, more even, radiant looking skin, whilst defending against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness and a weakened skin barrier.\nAqua, Butylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Glycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Anhydroxylitol, Citric Acid,Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydrolyzed Cicer Seed Extract, Pancratium Maritimum Extract, Rhododendron Chrysanthum Leaf Extract, Sodium Citrate, Tocopherol, Tricholoma Matsutake Extract, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Xylitol, Xylitylglucoside. FIL.1718,V00\nRestore even, radiant skin tone and help protect your skin against the damaging effects of the sun to help prevent dark spots. Day after day, this creamy moisturiser works to gradually correct dark spots, while keeping skin hydrated for 24 hours.', 2199.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1001.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Bright Healthy Radiance Brightness Refresh TonerPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Bright Healthy Radiance Brightness Refresh Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-bright-healthy-radiance-brightness-refresh-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1897, 'THE FACE SHOP Rice Ceramide Moisturizing Toner', '1', 0, 55, 194, '1897', '1897', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Face Shop Rice & Ceramide Moisturizing Facial Toner cleanses skin of any remaining residues and impurities left behind by your cleanser. This toner finely tightens enlarged pores and mildly replenishes skin with long-lasting moisture. With rice extract, it brightens skin and corrects skin texture to reduce the appearance of dark spots, freckles, and even out skin tone.\nIngredients: Water/Eau, Glycerine, Dipropylene Glycol, Caprylic/capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Betane, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Cyclopentasiloxane, Panthenol, Oryza Sativa(rice) Extract, Di-c12-13 Alkyl Malate, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Cetearyl Alcohol\nHow to Use: After cleansing, apply a few drops onto a cotton pad or in the palm of your hand. Gently pat all across the face and chin area. Pat till fully absorbed into the skin.\nMade in korea', 1248.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 312.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'THE FACE SHOP Rice Ceramide Moisturizing TonerPrice in BD', 'THE FACE SHOP Rice Ceramide Moisturizing Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-face-shop-rice-ceramide-moisturizing-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1898, 'Guerniss Vitamin C Daily Facial Toner', '1', 0, 55, 162, '1898', '1898', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Guerniss Vitamin C Daily Facial Toner is a water-based glycerin containing skin care formulation which is wonderful for almost all types of skin except acne prone skin. It provides antioxidants to the skin which helps to fight early signs of aging and also hydrate your skin, fade hyper-pigmentation, stimulate the collagen synthesis. Regular usage can make your skin smooth and supple. Besides, Guerniss Toner gives you more radiant complexion and also protects your skin from harmful effects of pollution and ultra violet rays of sun.Usage: To obtain optimum result use Guerniss Vitamin C Daily Facial Toner on your skin twice a day. After waking up in the morning cleanse your face with a Cleanser or Face Wash. Let your skin dry. Use a cotton pad and add a generous amount of toner in it. Wipe gently in upward movement over the skin. Avoid the eye area. Allow to dry. That is it! This is how easy it is to use. Follow with Guerniss Serum & Moisturizer. Guerniss Toner is tested and certified by Dermatologist.Ingredients: Double Distilled True Witch Hazel Extract (Hamamelis Virginiana Water),Deep Ocean Mineral Complex (Sea Water Extract), Deionized Aqua (Water), Organic Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Organic Jojoba Oil(Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil), Cucumis Sativus Water (Hydrosol),Vitamin C ( Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate), Msm Dimethyl Sulfone),Glycolic Acid, Colloidal Silver Sodium Pca Sodium Lactate, Arginine,Aspartic Acid, Glycine, Alanine, Serine, Valine, Proline, Threonine,Soleucne, Phenylalanine, Histidine Palmitoyl Oligopeptide, Palmitoyl Tetapeptide7, Organic Ginseng (Panax Quinquefolius Root Extract ) Ginkgo Biloba Leaf Extract (Ginkgo)C Liconce (Glycyrrhiza Glabra Root Extract), Chamomilla Recutita Extract (Chamomile), Organic Marshmallow Althaea Officinalis Extract), Echinacea Purpurea Extract (Super Echinacea), Calendula Officinalis Extract (Organic Calendula, Violet Extract, Spilanthes) Acmella Extract Chickweed Extract, Elderflower Extract, Berry Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin .Made in Hongkong', 1329.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 541.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Guerniss Vitamin C Daily Facial TonerPrice in BD', 'Guerniss Vitamin C Daily Facial Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guerniss-vitamin-c-daily-facial-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1899, 'COSRX AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 100ml', '1', 0, 55, 31, '1899', '1899', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This treatment toner makes daily exfoliation possible with its mild AHA/BHA formulation. It mainly contains white willow extract and apple water which are abundant in nutrients beneficial to the skin. The gentle peeling process this clarifying toner offers makes it possible for the nutrients to effectively and fully penetrate the skin for optimum results. Over continuous usage, your skin will reveal a newer, healthier skin with a much smoother texture and brighter complexion.\n\nProduct Features:\n\nBenefits:\n\nTargets:\n\nIngredients:\n• Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Water + Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water :Offers gentle exfoliation & helps reduce breakouts and marks from spots\n• Glycolic Acid :Exfoliates the surface of the skin & smooths and softens skin\n• Betaine Salicylate :Clears congested pores & balances oil production\nWater, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Water, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Lactate, Glycolic Acid, Betaine Salicylate, Allantoin, Panthenol, Ethyl Hexanediol\n\nHow to use:\nAfter cleansing, spray the toner onto a cotton pad and gently wipe onto face, avoiding the eye and mouth area. For use during the daytime, follow with a broad-spectrum sunscreen rated SPF 30 or greater.\n\nWarnings:\n\nMade in Korea', 2200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'COSRX AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 100mlPrice in BD', 'COSRX AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-ahabha-clarifying-treatment-toner-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1900, 'Anua Birch 70% Moisture Boosting Toner 250ml', '1', 0, 55, 21, '1900', '1900', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anua Birch 70 Moisture Boosting Toner is a refreshing toner formulated with 70% Japanese white birch water to maintain your skin\'s pH balance and lock in essential moisture. Enriched with panthenol and ten types of hyaluronic acid, it intensely hydrates your skin while strengthening its natural barrier. The unique ABC complex, composed of allantoin, betaine, and cucumber extract, instantly soothes and calms sensitive skin, while helping regulate the balance between oil and moisture for a calm and comfortable complexion. Its watery texture absorbs quickly, making it ideal for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nMain benefits of Anua Birch 70 Moisture Boosting Toner:\nskin type:\nconcern:  dehydration, sensitivity\nVegan & Cruelty-free\nHow to use it\nWhen to apply : morning and/or evening\n1. After cleansing, apply a moderate amount to the face and pat lightly for better absorption\nIngredients\nBetula Platyphylla Japonica Juice (70%), Dipropylene Glycol, Vegetable Glycerin, 1,2-Hexanediol, Methylpropanediol, Betaine, Allantoin, Cucumis Sativus (​Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Gluconic Acid, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Hyaluronic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Hydrolyzed Glycosaminoglycans, Butylene Glycol, Gardenia Florida Fruit Extract, Isopentyldiol, Acrylates/​C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tromethamine, Citric Acid, Propanediol, Benzyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Raspberry Ketone', 2412.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 268.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Birch 70% Moisture Boosting Toner 250mlPrice in BD', 'Anua Birch 70% Moisture Boosting Toner 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-birch-70-moisture-boosting-toner-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1901, 'Meril Glycerine 120gm and Get 25 Taka Off', '1', 0, 55, 177, '1901', '1901', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MERIL Glycerin has been used for many years. It is used for medical, food, personal and various other purposes. Leaving other areas aside, glycerin is used by people with sensitive, easily irritated skin because it prevents skin dryness with its moisturizing properties. MERIL Glycerin is used to maintain the moisture balance of your skin which you tend to lose during the winter. Since its 100% glycerin, mix with water to avoid gumminess.\nGlycerine\nMix 60% Meril Glycerine with 40% water and Apply it on your skin (face, hand, lips, feet). For best result apply it on its own directly after a shower while your skin is still wet.Do Not is on sensetive part of your body. External Use Only.', 110.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 5.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Meril Glycerine 120gm and Get 25 Taka OffPrice in BD', 'Meril Glycerine 120gm and Get 25 Taka Off Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'meril-glycerine-120gm-and-get-25-taka-off', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1902, 'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Probiotics Barrier Essence 120ml (a.k.a. Makgeolli Essence)', '1', 0, 55, 155, '1902', '1902', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Strengthen and soothe your skin barrier with Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Probiotics Barrier Essence, also known as Makgeolli Essence. This lightweight, milky essence is formulated to deeply hydrate, support barrier health, and help improve the look of dull, tired skin for a smoother, healthier-looking complexion. Powered with rice extract and probiotic/ferment ingredients like Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate and Bifida Ferment Filtrate, plus Panthenol and Ceramides, it helps skin feel comfortable, moisturized, and resilient—perfect for daily use.\nHelps support a stronger skin barrier and long-lasting hydration\nFerment + probiotic ingredients help promote a healthy glow\nContains Panthenol for soothing moisture support\nEnriched with Ceramides, Cholesterol & Phytosphingosine to reinforce barrier care\nLightweight essence texture—great for layering in any routine\nSuitable for daily use on most skin types\nAfter cleansing (and toner if used), apply an appropriate amount to the face and neck. Gently pat until absorbed. Use morning and night. Follow with moisturizer.\nWater, Butylene Glycol, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Butylene Glycol Dicaprylate/Dicaprate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Glycerin, Glyceryl Stearate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract (2,000ppm), Phyllostachys Pubescens Shoot Bark Extract (2,000ppm), Hydrogenated Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Xanthan Gum, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate (1,000ppm), Panthenol, Bifida Ferment Filtrate (1,000ppm), Aspergillus Ferment, Ethylhexylglycerin, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Ceramide NP, Disodium EDTA, Pentylene Glycol, Tromethamine, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Phytosterols, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Lees Extract (100ppm), Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Stearic Acid, Palmitic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Squalane, Hydrolyzed Wheat Protein, Cyclodextrin, Arachidic Acid, Myristic Acid, Oleic Acid, Ceramide NS, Phytosphingosine, Cholesterol, Ceramide AS, Ceramide AP, Ceramide EOP.\nFor external use only. Do not use on damaged/broken skin. Stop using and consult a doctor if rash occurs. Keep out of reach of children. Keep away from direct sunlight.\nSize: 120ml\nMade in: Korea', 2200.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1190.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Probiotics Barrier Essence 120ml (a.k.a. Makgeolli Essence)Price in BD', 'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Probiotics Barrier Essence 120ml (a.k.a. Makgeolli Essence) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'haruharu-wonder-black-rice-probiotics-barrier-essence-120ml-aka-makgeolli-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
