(1904, 'Buy YUSERA Rosy Glycerin 100ml & Get YUSERA Rosy Glycerin 50ml Free', '1', 0, 55, 232, '1904', '1904', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yusera Rosy Glycerin is a nourishing and softening skincare product enriched with the essence of rose petal extracts. This exquisite formula delicately soothes and revitalizes your skin, providing deep hydration that leaves your skin feeling replenished and beautifully moisturized. Enjoy the luxurious experience where the calming touch of rose petal extracts meets the transformative power of intense hydration.\n\nExperience the perfect blend of natural gentleness and effective hydration with Yusera Rosy Glycerin — your skin’s daily dose of softness and care.\nThis special combo offer provides double the benefits, helping you maintain deeply nourished, healthy, and radiant skin.', 140.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Buy YUSERA Rosy Glycerin 100ml & Get YUSERA Rosy Glycerin 50ml FreePrice in BD', 'Buy YUSERA Rosy Glycerin 100ml & Get YUSERA Rosy Glycerin 50ml Free Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'buy-yusera-rosy-glycerin-100ml-get-yusera-rosy-glycerin-50ml-free', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1905, 'Cos De BAHA M.A. Peptide PT Facial Toner', '1', 0, 55, 36, '1905', '1905', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Our Matrixyl + Argireline formulation is the only peptide toner on the market that combines a professional peptide complex with pure concentrated chamomile extract, a natural ingredient that soothes the skin and reduces inflammation. In addition, our serum contains hyaluronic acid, the strongest moisturiser for the skin to give your skin a youthful look.\n-Long-term and short-term effective solution for fine lines-Efficiency Real Peptide Matrixyl 3000 + Argireline Peptide Complex Serum-Hyaluronic acid base-Organic 86%: KFDA registration-Intense hydration and fine lines and wrinkles\nOur peptide complex cream toner is a thicker texture than the general watery facial toner. It is moisturising like a cream and can be applied to the entire skin without irritation.\nPromotes smooth, youthful skin with Matrixyl Synthhe\'7 and 1. Argireline helps relax facial muscles and prevents the formation of new lines. Let this nutrient-rich toner nourish your skin from the inside out to keep your skin looking vibrantly hydrated and healthy. Renew your skin at the cellular level and help your skin maintain moisture for a more radiant, youthful lookOur peptide cream toner with antioxidants balances greasy, blemished skin and blemished skin. Use day and night after your favorite cleanser to remove the last traces of makeup, clean pores and renew the skin before moisturizing the skin.Brilliant balancing – This soothing cream toner for the face is a complex peptide and hyaluronic and is an important step to soothe, brighten and refresh the skin. Perfect together with your other skin care products, enjoy a clear and fresh look with your favorite cleanser, moisturizer, creams or mask.The best Korean skin care at the lowest price – you will find it hard to find the high-quality ingredients in our products that even match our price. We believe fantastic skincare should be available to everyone, and it is our mission to ensure you receive both first-class quality products and the best customer care. Contact us at any time via Amazon.\nSpecifications:\nBrand: Cos De BAHAVolume: 200 ml / 6.76 fl oz.PH level: low pH balance level 5.8.Product name - M.A peptide toner.Main ingredients - Argireline, Matrixyl 3000Country of Manufacture: Made in South KoreaPackage: with paper box package, reinforced container for cosmetics (no glass bottle).Free from 6 harmful (parabens, gluten, formaldehyde, fragrance, sulphate, artificial colour).If for any reason you later decide that it is not for you, let Cos De BAHA know this within 30 days of purchase, and the amount will be 100% refunded.\nTEST USE:\nAfter cleaning, apply an appropriate amount to the skin and absorb it. or\nAfter cleaning, take a suitable amount on a cotton pad and wipe it according to the skin structure.\nDirectionsAfter cleansing and toning your face. Apply 1~2 drops of serum at night. Do not wash or wipe after applying the serum. After applying this serum, we recommend using a skin moisturiser. Massage a small amount of cleanser to wet skin, avoiding eye area. Rinse w lukewarm water. Directions Gently massage a small amount of the cleanser to moistened skin on your face and neck, carefully avoiding the eye area. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water and gently pat dry. For oily or acne prone skin', 1470.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '200ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 630.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA M.A. Peptide PT Facial TonerPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA M.A. Peptide PT Facial Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-ma-peptide-pt-facial-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33');
