(1906, 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Toner Unscented', '1', 0, 55, 83, '1906', '1906', NULL, NULL, NULL, '⏱️ 10-Second Rapid Soothing – Instantly calms irritation and redness with just one application. Specially formulated for sensitive skin, this fast-acting toner provides immediate relief.\n🍀 Infused with Calming Korean Centella – Powered by Centella Asiatica, a legendary Korean herb known for its potent soothing properties. Grown in Korea’s diverse climates, this resilient botanical effectively reduces redness and skin discomfort.\n💦 Balancing Hydration – Helps maintain the skin’s oil-water balance while delivering deep hydration, leaving skin refreshed, energized, and plump.\n✔️ Made for Sensitive Skin – Dermatologist-tested, hypoallergenic, and free from fragrance and alcohol, this toner is gentle yet effective, making it ideal for even the most delicate skin.\n✨ Best Redness Relief Toner – Clinically proven to soothe and reduce irritation, this must-have toner is your secret to a healthy, dewy, and radiant complexion.\nAchieve calm, balanced, and hydrated skin with the PURITO Wonder Releaf Centella Toner Unscented – the ultimate essential for sensitive skin care! 💚', 540.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 260.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Toner UnscentedPrice in BD', 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Toner Unscented Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-seoul-wonder-releaf-centella-toner-unscented', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1907, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Boosting Toner', '1', 0, 55, 16, '1907', '1907', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Boosting Toner (210ml) is a hydrating and brightening toner designed to soothe sensitive skin, improve skin tone, and enhance the effectiveness of subsequent skincare products.\nKey Features:\nCentella Asiatica Extract (90%): Sourced from Madagascar, this extract is renowned for its soothing and healing properties, aiding in collagen synthesis and skin regeneration.\nMadeWhite™ (Madecassoside): A patented ingredient derived from Centella Asiatica, it helps brighten the skin and improve uneven skin tone\nNatural Exfoliants: Contains extracts from papaya and apple that gently remove dead skin cells, promoting a smoother and more radiant complexion.\nNiacinamide and Vitamin C Derivative: These ingredients work together to enhance skin brightness and clarity.\n\nBenefits:\nHydration: Provides deep moisture, leaving the skin soft and supple.\nBrightening: Helps improve uneven skin tone and enhances skin radiance.\nSoothing: Calms irritated and sensitive skin, reducing redness and discomfort.\nExfoliation: Gently removes dead skin cells, improving skin texture and allowing better absorption of subsequent skincare products.\nHow to Use:\nAfter Cleansing: Apply an appropriate amount to a cotton pad or directly to the palms.\nApplication: Gently pat onto the skin, avoiding the eye area.\nFollow-Up: Proceed with your regular skincare routine.\nSuitable For:\nAll skin types, including sensitive skin.\nIndividuals seeking hydration, brightening, and soothing care.\nMade in Korea', 1705.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '210ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 795.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Boosting TonerPrice in BD', 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Boosting Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-tone-brightening-boosting-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
