(1915, 'I\'m From Rice Toner 77.78% Rice Extract', '1', 0, 55, 129, '1915', '1915', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I\'m From Rice Toner for hydrated and radiant skin. It forms a protective barrier over the skin to prevent water loss, eliminates dead skin cells, and rebalances dry and tired barriers.\n77.78% rice extract helps with collagen production and has high water retention, both effectively plumping skin. Its antioxidants also protect skin from free radicals, helping to slow down the appearance of aging. Rich in vitamin E, this ingredient nourishes and keeps skin soft. And of course, rice extract is well-loved for its brightening properties, helping to lighten pigmentation and even out dull skin.\npH of 6.9±1.0. Vegan and cruelty free and formulated without artificial fragrances and colors, parabens, sulfates, animal products, alcohol, mineral oils, essential oils, and silicone.\n\nI\'m From harnesses time-tested natural ingredients and extracts to provide clean yet efficacious skin care to leave your complexion revived.\n\nMade in Korea', 2299.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 701.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'I\'m From Rice Toner 77.78% Rice ExtractPrice in BD', 'I\'m From Rice Toner 77.78% Rice Extract Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'im-from-rice-toner-7778-rice-extract', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1916, 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner With Pure Centella', '1', 0, 55, 16, '1916', '1916', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner\nFacial toner formulated with Centella Asiatica extract from Madagascar, PHA and Hyaluronic Acid that helps unify skin tone and has an anti-wrinkle effect. Gently exfoliates the face thanks to its PHA ingredient. Helps improve skin texture. Ideal for sensitive skin.\nBenefits-Tonic benefits Madagascar Centella Toning Toner Skin1004It improves skin textureUnifies the toneAnti-wrinkle\nHow to use Madagascar Centella Toning Toner Skin1004After facial cleansing, apply the appropriate amount of product on a cotton pad or your hands and apply to the face.\ningredients-Water, Dipropylene Glycol, Centella Asiatica Extract, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Sodium Citrate, Gluconolactone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Betaine, Hyaluronic Acid, Carbomer, Tromethamine', 583.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 417.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner With Pure CentellaPrice in BD', 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner With Pure Centella Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-toning-toner-with-pure-centella', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1917, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Hydrosol', '1', 0, 55, 28, '1917', '1917', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Hydrosol Toner – 100ml\nMain Ingredients: PRUNUS SPECIOSA FLOWER EXTRACT, BUTYLENE GLYCOL\nFeatures1. Carefully selected from fresh flowers2.No preservative/Fragrance-free/No pigment/No Alcohol3. Shrink pores, moisturize skin, brighten skin tone, revitalize skin4. Relieve skin dryness, quick absorption\nHow to useAfter cleansing, apply the hydrosol on the face and pat it slightly until it is absorbed. It can also be applied to the face for 5-10 minutes after soaking with the cotton pad or compressed mask.\n\n', 291.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 559.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom HydrosolPrice in BD', 'Fenyi Japan Cherry Blossom Hydrosol Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'fenyi-japan-cherry-blossom-hydrosol', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
