(1919, 'Pax Moly Dr.Jk Vitamin Collagen 97 Essence 100ml', '1', 0, 55, 82, '1919', '1919', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pax Moly Dr.Jk Vitamin Collagen 97 Essence is a premium Korean skincare product formulated to deliver deep hydration and visible skin renewal. With a high concentration of collagen and vitamins, this essence helps combat dryness, dullness, and signs of aging. Its non-greasy texture makes it suitable for daily use, leaving the skin feeling refreshed and revitalized.\nKey Features\nUsage\nApply a small amount to clean, dry skin after toner and before moisturizer. Gently pat into the skin until fully absorbed. Use twice daily, morning and night, for best results.\n\nINGREDIENTS:\nWater, Panthenol (50.000ppm), Glycerin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, 1.2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Cetearyl Olivate, Dimethicone, Sorbitan Olivate, Arginine, Carbomer, Polyacrylamide, Al lantoin, Fragrance, C13-14 Isoparaffin, Ad enosine, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Poly acrylate, Laureth-7, Butylene Glycol. Hy drolyzed Collagen(10ppm), Citrus Aura ntium Dulcis (Orange) Fruit Extrac, Citrus Paradisi (Grapefruit) Fruit Extract, Citrus Junos Fruit Extrac Citrus Limon (Lemon) Fruit Extrac, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extr act. Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extr act[@ppm), Vaccinium Angustifolium (B) ueberryl Fruit Extract Prunus Persica (P each) Fruit Extract, Actinidia Chinensis (Kiwi) Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract. Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Fruit Extract, Punica Granatum Fruit Extract Citronellol, Benzyl Salicylate. Eugenol, Ceraniol, Linalool', 1127.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 563.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pax Moly Dr.Jk Vitamin Collagen 97 Essence 100mlPrice in BD', 'Pax Moly Dr.Jk Vitamin Collagen 97 Essence 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'pax-moly-drjk-vitamin-collagen-97-essence-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1920, 'Beaute Melasma 3D Whitening Clinic Daily Toner', '1', 0, 55, 87, '1920', '1920', NULL, NULL, NULL, '3D Whitening Clinic Daily Toner 150ml\nContains niacinamide,Beoussonetia kazinoki Root Extract and morus alba root extract,whiteningingreduents to improve blemishes on your face which are functional skin whitening ingredients.\nIt contains adenosine, collagen, and hyaluronic acid, a moisturizing ingredients to makes your skin elastic and moisturized.This Toner is a premium whitening toner from Korea, featuring an advanced formula and nutrient-rich ingredients. The product contains Niacinamide, known as the \"queen\" of the beauty industry, which helps to fade dark spots, freckles and tighten pores. Combined with Glutathione - a powerful antioxidant, the toner helps protect the skin from environmental damage, prevents aging and brings bright, smooth, even-toned skin.\nBenefits:\n-Whitening\n-Moisturizing\n-Wrinkle care\n-Melasma Care\n-Blemishes care\n\nBrand: Beaute Cosmetic\n\nMade in Korea', 1040.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '150ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 835.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beaute Melasma 3D Whitening Clinic Daily TonerPrice in BD', 'Beaute Melasma 3D Whitening Clinic Daily Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beaute-melasma-3d-whitening-clinic-daily-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1921, 'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Hyaluronic Toner Ultra Deep Technology 150ml', '1', 0, 55, 155, '1921', '1921', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ultra Deep Technology | Korean Skincare | Deep Hydration + Anti-Aging\nHaruharu Wonder Black Rice Hyaluronic Toner is a premium Korean facial toner formulated with black rice extract and hyaluronic acid to deliver intense hydration, anti-aging benefits, and skin barrier support. Designed for all skin types, especially sensitive and dehydrated skin, this unscented toner enhances elasticity, smoothness, and radiance—naturally.\nEnriched with fermented black rice extract—rich in flavonoids and polyphenols—this toner helps protect the skin against environmental damage and premature aging. It improves skin tone and strengthens the barrier with essential nutrients.\nContains multiple types of hyaluronic acid to deeply moisturize and retain hydration throughout the day, leaving the skin plump, smooth, and dewy.\nThis toner absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a sticky residue. Its lightweight formula is perfect for layering in your skincare routine.\nFree from artificial fragrance, alcohol, and harsh chemicals—ideal for sensitive skin. It soothes and tones without causing irritation.\nBlack rice antioxidants help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, while hyaluronic acid enhances firmness and elasticity for a more youthful complexion.\nWhether your skin is oily, dry, combination, or acne-prone—this toner balances moisture levels and helps restore natural glow and smoothness.\nApply with your hands or a cotton pad—no need to rinse. Perfect for use in both morning and night routines.', 1800.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Hyaluronic Toner Ultra Deep Technology 150mlPrice in BD', 'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Hyaluronic Toner Ultra Deep Technology 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'haruharu-wonder-black-rice-hyaluronic-toner-ultra-deep-technology-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1922, 'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Essence Water 40ml', '1', 0, 55, 34, '1922', '1922', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Barrier-Boosting • Hydrating • Glow-Enhancing Essence\n\nBeauty of Joseon Ginseng Essence Water is a deeply nourishing, lightweight essence formulated with 80% Ginseng Root Water and Niacinamide to deliver long-lasting hydration, antioxidant protection, and a healthy glow.\nInspired by traditional Korean herbal skincare, this essence replenishes moisture, smooths skin texture, and helps even out skin tone. It strengthens the skin’s moisture barrier while calming the skin surface, making it suitable for daily use on all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nGinseng has been valued for centuries in Korean history for its revitalizing and antioxidant properties. Rich in nutrients, it helps improve skin vitality, resilience, and overall radiance.\nDeep & Long-Lasting Hydration: Keeps skin plump and moisturized throughout the day\nSmooth + Glow: Improves texture and promotes brighter, more even-toned skin\nBarrier Support: Strengthens the skin’s moisture barrier against external stressors\nOil-Moisture Balance: Niacinamide helps regulate excess sebum without drying\nSoothing & Non-Irritating: Clinically proven suitable for sensitive skin\nClinically proven non-irritating**Based on a 24-hour sensitive skin patch test conducted by Korea Dermatology Research Institute on 33 subjects.\nGinseng Root Water (80%) – Deep hydration and skin nourishment\nGinseng Complex – Antioxidant benefits & moisture barrier support\nNiacinamide – Balances oil-moisture levels and refines skin texture\nPanthenol & Allantoin – Calm and soothe irritated skin\nSodium Hyaluronate – Helps retain moisture for lasting hydration\nPanax Ginseng Root Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Propanediol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Water, Hydroxyacetophenone, Glyceryl Glucoside, Xanthan Gum, Panthenol, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Allantoin, Adenosine, Panax Ginseng Callus Culture Extract, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Extract, Dextrin, Glucose, Panax Ginseng Root Extract, Panax Ginseng Berry Extract, Lactobacillus/Panax Ginseng Root Ferment Filtrate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA.\nAfter cleansing, pour a few drops into your hands\nGently pat onto the face until absorbed\nUse morning and night\nCan be applied with hands or a cotton pad like a toner\nProduct Type: Essence / Hydrating Toner\nSize: 40 ml\nBrand: Beauty of Joseon\nSkin Type: All skin types, including sensitive\nDull, dehydrated, uneven-textured skin looking for lasting hydration, barrier care, and natural glow.', 990.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '40ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Essence Water 40mlPrice in BD', 'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Essence Water 40ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-of-joseon-ginseng-essence-water-40ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1923, 'Bioderma Sensibio H2O Make-Up Removing Micelle Solution 250ml', '1', 0, 55, 200, '1923', '1923', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'All BIODERMA products are crafted with ecobiology principles, central to the NAOS approach, to respect your skin’s natural ecosystem and maintain its health over time.\nSensibio H2O is a gentle cleansing and makeup-removing micellar water specially formulated for sensitive skin.\nThanks to its micellar technology—developed by the pioneers at Laboratoire BIODERMA and inspired by the skin’s own cellular lipids—Sensibio H2O cleanses the face and eyes effectively without disturbing the skin’s natural protective barrier.\nCleanses and removes makeup gently from face and eyes\nProtects against pollutants that can worsen skin sensitivity\nMaintains the skin’s natural biological balance with a physiological pH of ~5.5\nContains highly purified pharmaceutical-grade water\nNo rinsing needed\nFace & Eyes – Morning and/or Evening (7 days a week):\nSoak a cotton pad with Sensibio H2O.\nGently cleanse and/or remove makeup from your face and eyes.\nFor long-lasting or heavy makeup, leave the cotton pad on your eyelids for a few seconds before wiping.\nDon’t forget to cleanse your neck area.\nNo rinsing required.\nFollow up with Sensibio Lotion for extra care.\nInstant cleansing and soothing\nSkin feels fresh, balanced, and comfortable\nHelps maintain healthy, sensitive skin', 1727.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 73.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Sensibio H2O Make-Up Removing Micelle Solution 250mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Sensibio H2O Make-Up Removing Micelle Solution 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-sensibio-h2o-make-up-removing-micelle-solution-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1924, 'I\'m from Black Rice Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 55, 129, '1924', '1924', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I’m From Black Rice Toner 150ml – Glowy, Not Oily\nDiscover the upgraded I’m From Black Rice Toner, now specially formulated for oily and acne-prone skin. Inspired by the beloved original, this next-gen toner balances oil and hydration to give your skin a smooth, dewy glow—without the greasy finish. Infused with naturally fermented black rice from Jindo, Korea, it delivers lightweight nourishment, sebum control, and antioxidant protection in every drop.\nKey Benefits:\nPowered by 100-Day Fermented Black Rice\nLightweight Dual-Layer FormulaWith a refined oil + water blend, this toner absorbs quickly with a breathable finish. The reduced oil layer and increased water phase make it ideal for oily and sensitive skin types.\nHow to Use:\nHero Ingredient:\nBlack Rice Extract (100-day fermented, Jindo, Korea): Delivers deep hydration, sebum control, and antioxidant care.\nOther Key Ingredients:Niacinamide, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Glycolic Acid, Rice Bran Oil, Cocoa Extract, Tocopherol (Vitamin E)\nPerfect for:\nMade in Korea', 2150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'I\'m from Black Rice Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'I\'m from Black Rice Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'im-from-black-rice-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1925, 'APLB 19.8% Collagen EGF Peptide Facial Toner 160ml', '1', 0, 55, 4, '1925', '1925', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'APLB 19.8% Collagen EGF Peptide Facial Toner 160ml\nCentella 3x Complex, patented ingredients, and COLLAGEN PEPT CEN 19.8% (Hydrolyzed Collagen 2,000 ppm EGF Peptide 1,000 ppt and Centella Asiatica extract 19.6%) combine to create a high-end facial toner that tightens enlarged pores, revitalizes dull skin, and provides rich nutrition to the skin.  To soothe inflammation, Centella 3x Complex contains Asiatic acid, Asiaticoside, and madecassic acid.  The following ingredients are patented: Saccharomyces fermentation, Artemisia Annua extract, Nelumbo Nucifera extract, and Oryza Sativa (rice) extract.\nComponents: Hydroxyethyl Urea, Allantoin, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Collagen (2,000 ppm), sh-Oligopeptide-1 (1,000 ppt), Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (rice) Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract (19.6%), Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Hydroxyethyl Urea,  Fruit extract from Solanum melongena (eggplant), leaf extract from Melaleuca alternifolia (tea tree), hydrolyzed collagen, squalane, beta-glucan, and fruit from Hippophae rhamnoides\nHow to Apply:\nFor optimal absorption, apply a reasonable amount of product to the face and gently pat it in.\nDisclaimer: Skinnora.com cannot guarantee that the information and/or photographs on this website are correct, comprehensive, and/or up-to-date because product packaging, information, and/or formulation changes may happen suddenly.  Although we make every effort to update our website, the final product may differ.  Prices are subject to change.  Price changes for earlier orders are not something we can accommodate.', 1099.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 701.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB 19.8% Collagen EGF Peptide Facial Toner 160mlPrice in BD', 'APLB 19.8% Collagen