(1935, 'Amiwash Face Wash', '1', 0, 55, 386, '1935', '1935', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Amiwash is a well-known premium quality face wash.\nIf you want to keep your trust in a single face wash, then select this one\nAmiwash is a well-known premium quality whitening face wash. You can put your trust in this brightening face wash to whiten your face. It is gel-based. It suits all skin types. It is applied for fairness & radiance. It cleans your face from deep. It contains, D-panthenol, Allantoin, Vitamin- E, Aloe Vera, Glycerine, and other essential natural ingredients.\nA good face wash can reduce excess oil, maintain a healthy skin pH, remove dirt, and provide a healthy dose of good-for-you ingredients to hydrate, detoxify, and brighten. It\'s important to pick the right one for your skin type, but even in the acne-prone and oily skin category, you may have different needs and preferences.\nIf we want to maintain a life with a minimalist way then at least we need a face wash. Because facewash is a cleanser. We must need to clean our face. When we go out, our faces got affected by bacteria and others harmful things. So a face wash is a must need\nBut have you ever thought about the effect that even a small mistake in using this face wash can have on your skin? Actually yes, there are certain rules for using a face wash. You need to use face wash on your skin according to your skin type. Even with the amount of facewash to be taken, there is a need to be careful. So what to look for while using face wash, I will discuss today. So first remove the skin makeup with a makeup remover and then wash your face with a face wash.\nDo you know your skin type? That is, is your skin dry or oily, or normal skin? The oil-cleansing face wash is great for those with oily skin. If your face feels tight after using a face wash, then you know that face wash is not suitable for your skin. This is the right way to choose a facewash for your skin.\nDue to this, there is a possibility of an age impression on the face. Problems like dry skin and premature wrinkles may develop. You can use face wash twice a day. But not more than that.\nNever wash your face with too cold or too hot water. Washing your face with hot water is not good. Do not confuse face steaming with hot water face wash. Wash your face with plain water.\nProduct highlights:\n For men & women.\n Gel-based.\n All skin types.\n Applied for fairness & radiance.\n Clean from deep.\n Feelings of refreshment.\n Sheds old skin cells and creates new ones.\n Prevents ageing & wrinkling.', 1184.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 36.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Amiwash Face WashPrice in BD', 'Amiwash Face Wash Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'amiwash-face-wash', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1936, 'Meril Rose Water Glycerine 120ml', '1', 0, 55, 177, '1936', '1936', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'REMOVE 5 SIGNS OF DRYNESS MERIL Rose Water Glycerin contains natural rose water and “hygroscopic,” meaning it absorbs water from the air. That makes it an excellent culinary humectant because it will draw moisture to itself from inside your muffins. MERIL Rose water glycerin removes 5 types of skin conditions and by regular usage it ensures bright, fulgent, smooth and soft skin. IMPROVE SKIN CONDITIONS There are several types of skin inflammations that cause itching, burning, redness or pus. If you have atopic dermatitis (a type of eczema) or psoriasis, for example, you might try switching to glycerin. In studies, some participants have shown significant improvement to their skin condition by making the switch.\nRosewater, Glycerine\nNo need use water while applyin to your skin. Spray on your face, hand and feet or wherever needed. External Use Only.', 180.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Meril Rose Water Glycerine 120mlPrice in BD', 'Meril Rose Water Glycerine 120ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'meril-rose-water-glycerine-120ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1937, 'Skino Niacinamide Ultra Light Glow Toner 100ml and Skino Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) 110ml Combo', '1', 0, 55, 15, '1937', '1937', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skino Niacinamide Ultra Light Glow Toner 100ml & Skino Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) 110ml Combo\nAchieve radiant, clear, and healthy-looking skin with this Skino skincare combo. Designed for all skin types, this set combines the brightening and pore-tightening effects of the Niacinamide Ultra Light Glow Toner with the refreshing, oil-controlling power of the Vitamin C Lemon Facewash. Perfect for daily use, it helps cleanse, purify, and revitalize your skin.\nFeatures:\nKey Ingredients: Aqua, EDTA, Niacinamide, Allantoin, Rose Hydrosol, D-Panthenol, Hyaluronic Acid, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Fragrance Oil, Phenoxyethanol\nHow to Use: After cleansing, apply a small amount on a cotton pad and sweep over the face. Press gently with palms to absorb.\nOrigin: Bangladesh\nFeatures:\nHow to Use: Apply a small amount on wet face, gently massage to cleanse, and rinse thoroughly.Benefits of the Combo:', 362.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '100ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 178.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skino Niacinamide Ultra Light Glow Toner 100ml and Skino Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) 110ml ComboPrice in BD', 'Skino Niacinamide Ultra Light Glow Toner 100ml and Skino Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) 110ml Combo Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-niacinamide-ultra-light-glow-toner-100ml-and-skino-vitamin-c-oil-control-facewash-lemon-110ml-combo', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1938, 'Skino Tea Tree Toner with (LIGHT AHA,BHA,PHA) 100ml and Skino Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30ml and Skino Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) 110ml', '1', 0, 55, 15, '1938', '1938', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Attain clear, balanced skin with skin\'O Acne + Spot Treatment Serum.\nskin’O Tea Tree Toner With (Light AHA,BHA,PHA) Introducing our Tea Tree Toner infused with gentle exfoliating AHAs, BHAs, and PHAs! This toner clarifies and balances skin, fights acne, and removes impurities. Its gentle exfoliation leaves skin smoother and clearer, for a refreshed, revitalized look.\nskin\'O Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) It is a facial care product designed to remove dead skin cells, oil, grime, and other impurities from the skin of the face. This provides an instant glow, aids in the unclogging of pores, and serves as a preventative skincare plan.', 783.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Combo', 0.00, 1, NULL, 247.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skino Tea Tree Toner with (LIGHT AHA,BHA,PHA) 100ml and Skino Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30ml and Skino Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) 110mlPrice in BD', 'Skino Tea Tree Toner with (LIGHT AHA,BHA,PHA) 100ml and Skino Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30ml and Skino Vitamin C Oil Control Facewash (Lemon) 110ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-tea-tree-toner-with-light-ahabhapha-100ml-and-skino-acne-spot-treatment-serum-30ml-and-skino-vitamin-c-oil-control-facewash-lemon-110ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1939, 'Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Milky Toner Essence with 5 Ceramides & Hyaluronic Acid 150ml', '1', 0, 55, 91, '1939', '1939', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize and strengthen your skin with Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Milky Toner Essence, enriched with 5 Ceramides, Hyaluronic Acid, and antioxidant-rich blueberry extract. This lightweight, milky essence provides deep hydration, repairs and reinforces the skin barrier, and soothes irritation for a balanced, healthy complexion. Perfect for daily use, it preps your skin for better absorption of serums and moisturizers while leaving your skin soft, plump, and visibly refreshed.\nProduct Details:\nHero Ingredients:\nFull Ingredients:Aqua, Lactic Acid, Propanediol, Sodium Hydroxide, Glycerine, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Silanetriol (and) Hyaluronic Acid (and) Methylpropanediol (and) Citric Acid (and) Water (Aqua), PPG-26-Buteth-26 (and) PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil (and) Water, Polysorbate 20, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Allantoin, Lactobacillus (and) Maltodextrin, Saccharomyces/Xylinum/Black Tea Ferment, Laminaria Digitata Extract (and) Hydrogenated Lecithin (and) Cetyl-PG Hydroxyethyl Palmitamide (and) Ceramide 1, 2,3,4,6II (and) Cholesterol (and) 1,2-hexanediol, Aqua (and) Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract (and) Saccharomyces ferment lysate filtrate (and) Citric acid (and) Sodium Benzoate (and) Potassium sorbate, Glycerin (and) Aqua (and) Vaccinium Angustifolium (Blueberry) Fruit Extract, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Phenoxyethanol (and) Ethylhexylglycerin.\nBenefits:\nUsage:\nMade in India', 995.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 235.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Milky Toner Essence with 5 Ceramides & Hyaluronic Acid 150mlPrice in BD', 'Dot & Key Blueberry Hydrate Barrier Repair Milky Toner Essence with 5 Ceramides & Hyaluronic Acid 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dot-key-blueberry-hydrate-barrier-repair-milky-toner-essence-with-5-ceramides-hyaluronic-acid-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1940, 'Anua Peach 77% Niacin Essence Toner', '1', 0, 55, 21, '1940', '1940', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This multi-purpose hydrator is a toner and essence in one, both strengthening and nourishing the skin’s moisture barrier. The Peach 77 Niacin Essence Toner also removes dead skin cells & brightens, revealing a glowing complexion.\nSkin Types – All Skin Types, including Dry, Dehydrated & Sensitive\nSkin Concerns – Irritation, Redness, Fine Lines, Dryness, Rough texture, Flakiness, Hyperpigmentation\nAnua’s Peach 77 Niacin Essence Toner is a combination of strength and hydration with an array of barrier-boosting ingredients. Moisturizing ingredients like panthenol and ceramides strenghten the skin’s barrier, while skin brighteners like niacinamide, alpha-arbutin, and vitamin C even out the skin tone and leave the skin radiant. The Peach Melting Peel™ technology also gently removes dead skins cells without harshness, and hyaluronic acid boosts hydration, ensuring this to be a non-irritating product, suitable for all skin types.\n\nThe Scents – Subtle and sweet\nThe Texture – Thicker-than-water Liquid\nMakes Skin Look & Feel – Hydrated, Smoother & Brighter\n\nHow to use:\n1. After cleansing, apply a moderate amount onto face and pat gently for absorption.2. Or moisten the cotton pads with toner and apply onto face as a moisture pack.\n\nPeach Fruit Extract, Niacinamide, Polyphenols, Ceramide, Ascorbic Acid\nPrunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract (77%), 2,3-Butanediol, Water, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Lactobacillus Ferment, Methylpropanediol, Streptococcus Thermophilus Ferment, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Juice, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Bacillus Ferment, Phellinus Linteus Extract, Xylose, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Alpha-Arbutin, Prunus Persica (Peach) Flower Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Vegetable Protein, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Propanediol, Squalane, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Diphenyl Dimethicone, Triethylhexanoin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Polyglyceryl-10 Stearate, Adenosine, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Tromethamine, Sodium Polyacrylate, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Ceramide NP, Allantoin, Cyanocobalamin, Polyglutamic Acid, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Tocopherol, Ascorbyl Glucoside, Betaine Salicylate, Ascorbic Acid, Maltodextrin, Glycine, Serine, Glutamic Acid, Aspartic Acid, Leucine, Alanine, Lysine, Arginine, Tyrosine, Phenylalanine, Proline, Threonine, Valine, Isoleucine, Histidine, Cysteine, Methionine, Xanthan Gum, Fragrance', 2099.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '250ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1601.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Peach 77% Niacin Essence TonerPrice in BD', 'Anua Peach 77% Niacin Essence Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-peach-77-niacin-essence-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1941, 'Organic Vegetables Glycerin for Dryness, Breakage & Splitness 150g', '1', 0, 55, 387, '1941', '1941', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Organic Vegetables Glycerin 150gA natural vegetable glycerin formulated to nourish both skin and hair. Ideal for combating dryness, breakage, and split ends, it delivers deep hydration while supporting overall scalp and skin health. Organic Vegetables Glycerin is a natural solution for dry, brittle hair and skin. Rich in moisturizing properties, it helps maintain hydration, strengthens strands, and keeps skin soft and elastic. Suitable for daily use on both hair and body to enhance health, shine, and resilience.\n\nBenefits• Protects skin and scalp from harmful bacteria• Regulates oil production for balanced skin and scalp• Soothes itching, dryness, and irritation• Cleanses and eliminates pore congestion• Nourishes dull and unhealthy skin and hair• Maintains elasticity of skin and hair strands• Provides natural sun-protective properties\n\nHow to UseApply a small amount to dry areas of skin or hair. Massage gently until absorbed. Can be mixed with oils, creams, or hair masks for enhanced hydration.\n\nKey Ingredients• Pure Vegetable Glycerin', 455.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '150g', 0.00, 1, NULL, 45.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Organic Vegetables Glycerin for Dryness, Breakage & Splitness 150gPrice in BD', 'Organic Vegetables Glycerin for Dryness, Breakage & Splitness 150g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'organic-vegetables-glycerin-for-dryness-breakage-splitness-150g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1942, 'ISNTREE Hyaluronic Acid Toner 200ml', '1', 0, 55, 238, '1942', '1942', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ISNTREE Hyaluronic Acid Toner\nBenefits:Contains 50% of Hyaluronic aqueous solution that provides lasting fresh hydration to dry skin.Adheres to skin without stickiness and allows skin to absorb quickly.Prevents loss of moisture with Phyto-oligo and NMF and build up moisture barrier with 3 kinds of Hyaluronic Acid.\nHow to use:1. Soak a cotton pad with the product and gently wipe across the entire face.2. For special care, place the toner-soaked cotton pads onto your skin for a while.Other InformationTranslation reference for Korean beauty product packaging:\nAbout brand: IsntreeIsntree fuses \"island\", \"natural\" and \"tree\" together to inspire its brand name and guiding philosophy. Showing honesty in its choice of ingredients, the brand uses only the safest and purest from nature. Isntree produces effective skin, body and hair care products such as its popular Aloe Soothing Gel, Hyaluronic Acid Aqua Gel Cream, Sensitive Balancing Sun Protection Plus SPF50+ PA++++ and Sensitive Balancing Cleansing Foam. All the brand\'s products are 100% made-in-Korea and free from animal-testing. YesStyle is an authorized retailer of Isntree and features all of the brand\'s product lines.\n', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 650.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ISNTREE Hyaluronic Acid Toner 200mlPrice in BD', 'ISNTREE Hyaluronic Acid Toner 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isntree-hyaluronic-acid-toner-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1943, 'Guerniss Anti Melasma Facial Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 55, 162, '1943', '1943', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Melasma is such a skin condition which is extremely tough and frustrating to deal with. It appears as discoloration and dark spots on the skin especially on the face just above the lips or brown, black, or gray patches of discoloration across the cheeks and forehead. Guerniss Anti Melasma Foaming Cleanser is ideal, highly effective for the treatment of the people suffering from melasma and a favorite among dermatologists due to its low pH, which gives you extra exfoliating benefits and removes impurities from your skin and developes your skin tone and texture. For the desired results you should follow with Guerniss melasma Toner and Serum and a complete personalized skin care practice for melasma.\nHow to Use:Dampen your face and hands with warm water. Pump the cleanser into your hands and make a lather. Massage it onto the skin with a gentle and circular motion. Rinse with lukewarm water. Pat to dry with a soft towel. Avoid direct contact with the eyes, if contact occurs, rinse with sufficient water carefully. Proper precautions at right time can fade Melasma from the skin. Our product is Dermatologically tested.\nIngredients:Aqua/water, sodium, cocoyl glycinate, coco-betaine, glycerine, vitamin C, Acrylates Copolymer, Sodium Chloride, Phenoxyethanol, Citrus Lemon Peel Oil/ Lemon Peel Oil, Limonene, Sodium Hydroxide, Tetrasodium Edta, Propylene Glycol, Geranium Maculatum Oil, Chamomilla Recutita Flower Oil, Citral, Calendula Officinalis Flower Extract, Cymbopogon Schoenanthus Oil, Artemisia Absinthium Extract, Citric Acid.Made in Hong Kong\n', 1313.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 557.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Guerniss Anti Melasma Facial Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'Guerniss Anti Melasma Facial Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'guerniss-anti-melasma-facial-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1944, 'Anua Peach 77 Niacin Enriched Cream', '1', 0, 55, 21, '1944', '1944', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Types – All Skin Types, including Dry, Dehydrated & Sensitive\nSkin Concerns – Irritation, Redness, Fine Lines, Dryness, Rough texture, Flakiness, Hyperpigmentation\n\nThe rich combination of fermented ingredients make Anua’s Peach 77 Niacin Enriched Cream a lifesaver for dry and dehydrated skin. Using the power of collagen, panthenol, ceramides, and probiotics, this moisture-rich cream hydrates and soothes rough patches and irritation while strengthening the skin’s barrier and healing any damages. It is also sensitive-skin approved, making it a great moisturizer for all skin types.\n\nThe Scents – Subtle and sweet\nThe Texture – Pudding-like gel cream, Non-sticky, Non-greasy\nMakes Skin Look & Feel – Refreshed, plump & hydrated\n\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, toning, and any serum or ampoule, apply a thin, even layer to the face and gently pat to absorb. For added moisture, apply a generous amount and leave on overnight as a sleeping pack.\n\nPeach Fruit Extract, Collagen, Ceramide NP, Panthenol, Bifida fermentation lysate, and Galactomyces fermentation filtrate\nPrunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract (77%), Glycerin, Methylpropanediol, Niacinamide, Isododecane, Lactobacillus Ferment, 1,2-Hexanediol, Propanediol, Panthenol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Polymethylsilsesquioxane, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Jojoba Esters, Coptis Japonica Root Extract, Prunus Persica (Peach) Flower Extract, Soluble Collagen, Sodium Hyaluronate, Vinyl Dimethicone, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Water, Dimethiconol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tromethamine, Butylene Glycol, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Cyanocobalamin, Saccharomyces Ferment Filtrate, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Ceramide NP, Pectin, Maltodextrin, Hydrolyzed Vegetable Protein, Fragrance, Hydroxyacetophenone, Ethylhexylglycerin', 2837.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', 