(1949, 'Meril Glycerine (5 Layer Skin Protection) 60gm and Get 15 Taka Off', '1', 0, 55, 177, '1949', '1949', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MERIL Glycerin has been used for many years. It is used for medical, food, personal and various other purposes. Leaving other areas aside, glycerin is used by people with sensitive, easily irritated skin because it prevents skin dryness with its moisturizing properties. MERIL Glycerin is used to maintain the moisture balance of your skin which you tend to lose during the winter. Since its 100% glycerin, mix with water to avoid gumminess.\nGlycerine\nMix 60% Meril Glycerine with 40% water and Apply it on your skin (face, hand, lips, feet). For best result apply it on its own directly after a shower while your skin is still wet.Do Not is on sensetive part of your body. External Use Only.', 58.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 7.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Meril Glycerine (5 Layer Skin Protection) 60gm and Get 15 Taka OffPrice in BD', 'Meril Glycerine (5 Layer Skin Protection) 60gm and Get 15 Taka Off Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'meril-glycerine-5-layer-skin-protection-60gm-and-get-15-taka-off', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
(1950, 'Isntree Green Tea Fresh Face Toner', '1', 0, 55, 238, '1950', '1950', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The ISNTREE Green Tea Fresh Toner contains Jeju green tea extract and anti-sebum ingredients that soothe the skin and regulate the skin\'s sebum production. The slightly brownish colour owes the toner to the high proportion of green tea extract of 80%. The tea used grows on the Korean island of Jeju, whose soil is particularly rich in minerals due to the volcanic rock. The liquid consistency absorbs particularly quickly into the skin without leaving a sticky feeling. In this way, the active ingredients penetrate particularly deep into the skin.\nDirections:After washing your face, take an appropriate amount of product on a cotton pad, gently wipe over the skin and then tap lightly with your fingertips to optimise absorption.\nFeatures:\nCountry of Origin: Korea', 1540.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 660.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Isntree Green Tea Fresh Face TonerPrice in BD', 'Isntree Green Tea Fresh Face Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'isntree-green-tea-fresh-face-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:33', '2026-02-11 13:41:33'),
