(1955, 'Skin Cafe Floral Hydrating Toner', '1', 0, 55, 224, '1955', '1955', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purify your skin with the soothing and refreshing hydrating toner composed of rose, hibiscus, and tuberose extracts, powered with the versatile niacinamide, to redeem the pH balance and provide hydration to your skin. This Floral Hydrating Toner cleanses makeup residue, tones up the skin, helps minimize pores to make it reinvigorated, healthy-looking, and more beautiful.\nWho can use this Floral Hydrating Toner?Women and men over the age of 18 can use this product. Why is Skin Cafe Floral Hydrating Toner better than any other toner?', 266.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 29.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe Floral Hydrating TonerPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe Floral Hydrating Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-floral-hydrating-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1956, 'Beauty of Joseon Glow Replenishing Rice Milk', '1', 0, 55, 34, '1956', '1956', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Inspired by Tradition, Perfected for Modern Skincare\nRooted in Joseon Dynasty beauty secrets, Glow Replenishing Rice Milk revitalizes the ancient tradition of migamsu (rice bran water) to deeply hydrate, nourish, and smooth the skin. Infused with rice extract and rice amino acids, this toner helps replenish moisture while refining skin texture for a radiant, healthy glow.\n✔ Deep Hydration & Antioxidant Protection – Rice extract and rice amino acids lock in moisture, preventing dryness.✔ Unique Dual-Layer Formula – Hydrating moisture layer + sebum-control powder layer for a balanced, fresh finish.✔ Sebum & Pore Care – Absorbs excess oil, making it ideal for acne-prone and sensitive skin.✔ Versatile for All Seasons – Provides long-lasting hydration without feeling heavy, perfect for year-round use.✔ Smooths & Brightens Skin – Helps refine texture and restore the skin’s natural radiance.\n🌾 Rice Extract – Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants to enhance skin clarity and glow.💧 Rice Amino Acids – Improves moisture retention and supports the skin barrier.🧴 Sebum Control Powder – Absorbs oil, minimizes pores, and soothes redness.\nAchieve smooth, hydrated, and radiant skin with Beauty of Joseon Glow Replenishing Rice Milk – where heritage meets innovation for your ultimate glow! ✨', 1738.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1562.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Beauty of Joseon Glow Replenishing Rice MilkPrice in BD', 'Beauty of Joseon Glow Replenishing Rice Milk Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'beauty-of-joseon-glow-replenishing-rice-milk', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
