(1961, 'Rajkonna All Purpose Toner', '1', 0, 56, 214, '1961', '1961', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Introducing Rajkonna All Purpose Toner, your everyday solution for refreshed and balanced skin. Infused with natural extracts and carefully selected ingredients, this versatile toner is designed to rejuvenate your skin, leaving it feeling hydrated, toned, and revitalized.\nKey Features:\nMulti-Purpose Formula: Rajkonna All Purpose Toner is designed to serve multiple skincare needs. Whether you want to hydrate, cleanse, or refresh your skin, this toner is your all-in-one solution.\nBalancing and Clarifying: With its gentle yet effective formula, this toner helps balance your skin\'s pH levels and clarifies pores, reducing the appearance of blemishes and promoting a clearer complexion.\nHydration Boost: Infused with hydrating ingredients, such as hyaluronic acid and botanical extracts, this toner provides an instant moisture boost, leaving your skin feeling soft, supple, and plump.\nRefreshing Sensation: Experience a refreshing sensation as you apply this lightweight toner to your skin. Its non-greasy formula absorbs quickly, leaving behind a cooling sensation that invigorates your senses.\nAntioxidant Protection: Packed with antioxidants, including vitamins and plant extracts, this toner helps protect your skin from environmental stressors, such as pollution and UV damage, keeping your skin looking youthful and radiant.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Whether you have dry, oily, or sensitive skin, Rajkonna All Purpose Toner is gentle enough for daily use and suitable for all skin types.\nDirections for Use:', 198.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 42.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Rajkonna All Purpose TonerPrice in BD', 'Rajkonna All Purpose Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'rajkonna-all-purpose-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1962, 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Essence toner', '1', 0, 56, 16, '1962', '1962', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Essence toner featuring patented and vegan ingredient ProBio-Cica (made of fermented centella asiatica) calms redness and irritated skin. It also fortifies the skin barrier for smooth and supple skin. Trehalose, panthenol, ceramide NP and sodium hyaluronate in the mix provides additional moisturizing effects for healthy skin. Free of artificial fragrances and colorants. Suitable for various skin types including sensitive skin.\nIngredients:\nCentella Asiatica Extract, Water, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Polypropanediol, Lactobacillus/Centella Asiatica Extract Ferment Filtrate, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Potassium Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Trehalose, Panthenol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Citrate, Xanthan Gum, Tromethamine, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Sodium Phytate, Citric Acid, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-10 Myristate, Ceramide NP, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Sucrose Distearate, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Hydrolyzed Glycosaminoglycans, Lauric Acid, Asiatic Acid, Phytosterols, Sodium Hyaluronate, Betaine, Hydroxystearic Acid, Benzyl Glycol, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Hyaluronic Acid, Raspberry Ketone, Phytosphingosine', 2045.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 755.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Essence tonerPrice in BD', 'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Essence toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin1004-madagascar-centella-probio-cica-essence-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1963, 'Cos De BAHA NT Niacinamide Facial Toner', '1', 0, 56, 36, '1963', '1963', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Cos De BAHA NT Niacinamide Facial Toner (200ml) is a popular skincare product designed to improve skin texture, tone, and clarity, thanks to its high concentration of niacinamide (Vitamin B3). This toner helps in addressing various skin concerns, such as hyperpigmentation, enlarged pores, and uneven skin tone.\nAlcohol-Free: Suitable for sensitive skin types, minimizing irritation.\npH Balanced (pH: 5.5): Maintains the skin\'s natural acidity, supporting a healthy skin barrier.\nMade in Korea', 1499.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 401.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cos De BAHA NT Niacinamide Facial TonerPrice in BD', 'Cos De BAHA NT Niacinamide Facial Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cos-de-baha-nt-niacinamide-facial-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1964, 'Nineless MELA-PRO Rice & TXA Toner for Targeted Melanin Rich Skin', '1', 0, 56, 47, '1964', '1964', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nineless MELA-PRO Rice & TXA Toner is a brightening solution designed to target dark spots and hyperpigmentation, promoting a more even and radiant complexion.\nAfter cleansing, shake the bottle well. Apply a moderate amount of toner to the face and neck using a cotton pad or your hands. Gently pat the skin to enhance absorption.\nAll skin types, including sensitive skin.\nAs product formulations may change, it\'s advisable to check the packaging for the most up-to-date ingredient list. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.', 1893.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1007.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nineless MELA-PRO Rice & TXA Toner for Targeted Melanin Rich SkinPrice in BD', 'Nineless MELA-PRO Rice & TXA Toner for Targeted Melanin Rich Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nineless-mela-pro-rice-txa-toner-for-targeted-melanin-rich-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1965, 'La Roche Posay Cicaplast B5 Soothing Repairing Concentrated Spray', '1', 0, 57, 62, '1965', '1965', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'La Roche-Posay Cicaplast B5 Soothing Repairing Concentrated Spray is a versatile skincare product designed to soothe, repair, and protect irritated or damaged skin. It’s part of La Roche-Posay’s Cicaplast range, which focuses on skin barrier repair and healing.\nCleanse the Skin:\nShake Well:\nSpray Evenly:\nAllow to Absorb:\nReapply as Needed:\nSoothes Irritated Skin:\nPromotes Skin Repair:\nAnti-Inflammatory Properties:\nHydrates and Protects:\nNon-Greasy, Quick Absorbing:\nVersatile Use:\nLa Roche-Posay Cicaplast B5 Soothing Repairing Concentrated Spray is a powerful, yet gentle, skincare product designed to soothe, repair, and protect irritated or damaged skin. With its formulation of Vitamin B5 and Madecassoside, it promotes skin healing, reduces inflammation, and provides hydration without a greasy feel. Suitable for all genders and all skin types, it’s an excellent choice for anyone looking for a versatile product to address various skin concerns, from everyday irritations to post-procedure care.', 2900.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 460.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche Posay Cicaplast B5 Soothing Repairing Concentrated SprayPrice in BD', 'La Roche Posay Cicaplast B5 Soothing Repairing Concentrated Spray Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-cicaplast-b5-soothing-repairing-concentrated-spray', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34');
