(1966, 'VT Cosmetics Reedle Shot 100 50ml', '1', 0, 57, 388, '1966', '1966', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'VT Cosmetics Reedle Shot 100 is a Korean skincare booster designed to be used as the first step in your nighttime routine. Inspired by microneedling technology, it gently exfoliates the skin, improves texture, and enhances the absorption of subsequent skincare products. This formula is particularly effective for skin exposed to pollution and prone to melanin-related concerns, making it suitable for climates like Bangladesh.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsageApply Reedle Shot 100 after cleansing as the first step in your evening skincare routine. Dispense two to three pumps and spread evenly across the face. Massage gently until fully absorbed. Follow with toner, serum, and moisturizer. A mild tingling sensation may occur, which is normal. Do not use this product in combination with Reedle Shot 300 or 700 in the same routine.\n\nWhy Choose This ProductThis booster offers a unique approach to exfoliation and skin renewal without the need for physical microneedling. Its gentle yet effective formula is ideal for textured, congested, or post-acne skin. VT Cosmetics is known for combining innovative skincare technology with soothing botanical ingredients, making this product a reliable choice for sensitive and reactive skin types.\n\nBenefits\n\nCautions', 3203.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 356.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'VT Cosmetics Reedle Shot 100 50mlPrice in BD', 'VT Cosmetics Reedle Shot 100 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'vt-cosmetics-reedle-shot-100-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1967, 'SOME BY MI Yuja Niacin 30 Days Miracle Brightening  Toner', '1', 0, 57, 2, '1967', '1967', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Some by mi Yuja Niacin 30 Days Miracle Brightening Toner is a toner that claims to brighten and even out the skin tone while also providing deep hydration. It is part of the brand’s 30 Days Miracle series, which is designed to improve the appearance of the skin in just 30 days of regular use.The toner contains a high concentration of yuja extract, which is rich in vitamin C and helps to brighten the skin and fade dark spots and hyperpigmentation. It also contains niacinamide, a form of vitamin B3 that helps to improve skin texture and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Other key ingredients include glutathione, arbutin, and 12 types of vitamins to provide further brightening benefits.The formula is also free from harmful ingredients such as parabens, mineral oil, and artificial fragrances, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nKey Benefits:\n\nKey Ingredients:\nHow to use:\nMade in Korea', 1815.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 735.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SOME BY MI Yuja Niacin 30 Days Miracle Brightening  TonerPrice in BD', 'SOME BY MI Yuja Niacin 30 Days Miracle Brightening  Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1968, 'Some By Mi Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Toner 150ml – Snail Mucin Brightening & Repair Toner', '1', 0, 57, 81, '1968', '1968', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Some By Mi Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Toner (150ml) is a gentle yet powerful toner formulated with 90% Snail Truecica™ and Niacinamide to restore, repair, and brighten your skin. This toner helps strengthen the skin barrier, soothe irritation, and reduce signs of damage, leaving your skin soft, radiant, and refreshed. Infused with Centella Asiatica, Tea Tree, Lavender, and Chamomile extracts, it calms sensitive skin while delivering deep hydration.\nPerfect for dull, damaged, or stressed skin, this toner revives and balances your complexion, preparing it for better absorption of your skincare routine.\nSkin Barrier Repair: Strengthens and restores damaged, sensitive skin with Snail Truecica™.\nBrightening Effect: Niacinamide and Arbutin improve dullness and promote an even skin tone.\nSoothes & Calms: Centella Asiatica, Tea Tree, and botanical extracts help reduce redness and irritation.\nDeep Hydration: Glycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, and Hydrolyzed Glycosaminoglycans provide lasting moisture.\nAnti-Aging & Revitalizing: Contains Glutathione, Adenosine, and antioxidants to improve elasticity and reduce fine lines.\nAfter cleansing, pour an appropriate amount onto a cotton pad or palms.\nGently apply and pat evenly over the face and neck.\nFollow with serum and moisturizer for best results.\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with the eyes; rinse thoroughly if it occurs.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\nSnail Secretion Filtrate (90%) – Skin repair, soothing & regeneration\nNiacinamide – Brightening & oil control\nCentella Asiatica Extracts – Calming & strengthening\nTea Tree Leaf Water – Reduces irritation & acne-prone skin issues\nBotanical Extracts (Lavender, Chamomile, Rosemary, Jasmine, etc.) – Antioxidant & soothing benefits\nHyaluronic Acid & Glycerin – Hydration & moisture retention\nGlutathione & Arbutin – Brightening & anti-aging care\n✅ Suitable for all skin types, especially sensitive, damaged, or dull skin.✅ Dermatologically tested and free from harsh chemicals.', 1960.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 490.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Some By Mi Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Toner 150ml – Snail Mucin Brightening & Repair TonerPrice in BD', 'Some By Mi Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Toner 150ml – Snail Mucin Brightening & Repair Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'some-by-mi-snail-truecica-miracle-repair-toner-150ml-snail-mucin-brightening-repair-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1969, 'MediCube AGE-R Glutathione Glow Toner 140ml – Brightening & Anti-Aging Care', '1', 0, 57, 96, '1969', '1969', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Give your skin a healthy glow with MediCube AGE-R Glutathione Glow Toner, a dual-layer toner designed to brighten, hydrate, and fight signs of aging. Enriched with Glutathione, Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin, and Peptides, it works to reduce fine lines, improve elasticity, and even out skin tone. Natural extracts like Sea Buckthorn Oil, Lavender, Chamomile, Parsley, and Turmeric deeply nourish while soothing sensitive skin.\n✨ Key Benefits:\nBrightens dull & uneven skin tone\nFirms & reduces wrinkles and fine lines\nDeep hydration & antioxidant protection\nSoothes skin with natural plant extracts\nPrepares skin for better absorption of skincare\nHow to Use:Shake well after cleansing to mix cream and essence layers. Apply gently along skin texture and pat for absorption.\nIngredients:Water, Triethylhexanoin, Hydrogenated Poly(C6-14 Olefin), Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Methylpropanediol, Niacinamide, Phenyl Trimethicone, Polyglyceryl-10 Myristate, Sea Buckthorn Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Allantoin, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Hibiscus Esculentus Fruit Extract, Corchorus Olitorius Leaf Extract, Parsley Extract, Glutathione, Adenosine, Chamomile Extract, Lavender Flower Water, Hyacinth Extract, Centaurea Cyanus Flower Extract, Turmeric Root Extract, Borage Extract, Clary Extract, Alpha-Arbutin, Holy Basil Extract, Red Algae Extract, Lipoic Acid, Biotin, Biotinoyl Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Tripeptide-1, Tripeptide-3, Myristoyl Pentapeptide-17, Hexapeptide-9, and more.\nCaution: For external use only. Discontinue if irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.\nMade in Korea 🇰🇷', 1955.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 345.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'MediCube AGE-R Glutathione Glow Toner 140ml – Brightening & Anti-Aging CarePrice in BD', 'MediCube AGE-R Glutathione Glow Toner 140ml – Brightening & Anti-Aging Care Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-age-r-glutathione-glow-toner-140ml-brightening-anti-aging-care', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1970, 'Garnier SkinActive Rose Soothing Toner with Rose Water for Dry & Sensitive Skin 200ml', '1', 0, 57, 37, '1970', '1970', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'About The Product:', 925.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 395.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier SkinActive Rose Soothing Toner with Rose Water for Dry & Sensitive Skin 200mlPrice in BD', 'Garnier SkinActive Rose Soothing Toner with Rose Water for Dry & Sensitive Skin 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-skinactive-rose-soothing-toner-with-rose-water-for-dry-sensitive-skin-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1971, 'April Skin Pink Aloe Vita Toner 250ml – Brightening & Hydrating Daily Facial Toner with Niacinamide 2%, Vitamin C & Panthenol', '1', 0, 57, 135, '1971', '1971', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skincare routine with the APRILSKIN Pink Aloe Vita Toner, a premium, dermatologist-tested formula designed to deeply hydrate, calm, and brighten all skin types—even sensitive skin. Infused with a powerful 80% Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water, this non-comedogenic toner instantly soothes irritation, replenishes moisture, and gently refines rough skin texture, leaving your complexion soft, plump, and refreshed after every cleanse.\nIntense Hydration & Soothing Care: Aloe Vera delivers long-lasting moisture while calming redness and dryness.\nVisible Brightening: Niacinamide 2% and dual Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid & 3-O Ethyl Ascorbic Acid) help fade dark spots, even skin tone, and boost radiance.\nBarrier Support & Repair: Panthenol, Allantoin, and Centella Asiatica Extract strengthen the skin barrier and promote healing.\nGentle Exfoliation & Texture Refinement: Lightly smooths rough patches for a clearer, more refined complexion.\nNon-Comedogenic & Lightweight: Absorbs quickly without clogging pores, perfect for oily, dry, combination, or sensitive skin.\nAfter cleansing, replace the rounded cap with the enclosed pointed cap.\nTwist the top to open, dispense an appropriate amount onto a cotton pad or palms.\nGently sweep or pat over the face and neck, following skin texture.\nPat lightly for better absorption, then twist the cap back to close for storage.Tip: Use morning and night before serum or moisturizer for best results.\nAloe Barbadensis Leaf Water (80%) – Deeply hydrates and soothes.\nNiacinamide 2% – Brightens and minimizes pores.\nVitamin C Complex – Antioxidant protection, glow enhancement.\nPanthenol & Allantoin – Barrier-repairing, calming.\nCentella Asiatica & Tea Tree Water – Natural skin-strengthening botanicals.\nSodium Hyaluronate – Locks in essential moisture.\n✔ Paraben-Free • Alcohol-Free • Dermatologist Tested✔ Ideal for dull, irritated, or dehydrated skin✔ Lightweight, refreshing texture with a natural herbal aroma\nApril Skin Pink Aloe Vita Toner, Niacinamide toner, Vitamin C toner, aloe vera face toner, hydrating brightening toner, soothing facial toner, Korean skincare, non-comedogenic toner.\nBring home the April Skin Pink Aloe Vita Toner 250ml for a glowing, hydrated, and beautifully balanced complexion—your must-have step for radiant Korean skincare.', 1804.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 496.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'April Skin Pink Aloe Vita Toner 250ml – Brightening & Hydrating Daily Facial Toner with Niacinamide 2%, Vitamin C & PanthenolPrice in BD', 'April Skin Pink Aloe Vita Toner 250ml – Brightening & Hydrating Daily Facial Toner with Niacinamide 2%, Vitamin C & Panthenol Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'april-skin-pink-aloe-vita-toner-250ml-brightening-hydrating-daily-facial-toner-with-niacinamide-2-vitamin-c-panthenol', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
