(1973, 'Coxir Black Snail Collagen Cream 50ml –Wrinkel Care ,Firming & Hydrating', '1', 0, 57, 156, '1973', '1973', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Coxir Black Snail Collagen Cream (50ml) is a nourishing anti-aging moisturizer formulated with snail secretion filtrate, hydrolyzed collagen, and black soybean extract to deliver powerful wrinkle care and deep hydration. This rich cream works to minimize fine lines, improve skin elasticity, and restore vitality, leaving skin firmer, smoother, and more radiant.\nEnhanced with black sesame, black rice, and ginseng extracts, it provides antioxidant protection and strengthens the skin barrier for a youthful, healthy glow. Suitable for daily AM and PM use, this cream absorbs smoothly without greasiness, making it ideal for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nWrinkle Care & Firming: Snail mucin and collagen reduce fine lines while improving skin elasticity.\nDeep Hydration: Aloe vera, hyaluronic ingredients, and natural oils deliver long-lasting moisture.\nBrightening & Revitalizing: Black bean, black sesame, and black rice extracts nourish and improve dullness.\nSkin Barrier Strengthening: Ginseng, licorice, and herbal extracts protect and restore the skin’s natural defenses.\nAntioxidant Power: Botanical and peptide-rich formula helps fight free radical damage for youthful-looking skin.\nAfter cleansing and applying toner/serum, take an appropriate amount of cream.\nGently massage onto the face and neck in circular motions until fully absorbed.\nUse daily, AM and PM, as the final step in your skincare routine.\nSnail Secretion Filtrate – Skin repair, regeneration, and hydration\nHydrolyzed Collagen – Improves firmness and elasticity\nBlack Soybean, Black Rice, Black Sesame Extracts – Antioxidants & nourishment\nAloe Vera & Glycerin – Soothing and moisturizing\nGinseng Root Extract & Green Tea – Revitalizing and protective\nCopper Tripeptide-1 & Peptides – Anti-aging and skin barrier support\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs.\n✅ Best for wrinkle care, hydration, and firming.✅ Suitable for all skin types, especially dry, aging, or dull skin.', 1360.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 240.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Coxir Black Snail Collagen Cream 50ml –Wrinkel Care ,Firming & HydratingPrice in BD', 'Coxir Black Snail Collagen Cream 50ml –Wrinkel Care ,Firming & Hydrating Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'coxir-black-snail-collagen-cream-50ml-wrinkel-care-firming-hydrating', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1974, 'Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner', '1', 0, 57, 21, '1974', '1974', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heartleaf 77% soothing toner is perfectly formulated to soothe, tone, hydrate, and balance the PH level of skin.  Anua presents 77% soothing toner with mild ingredients for those tired of harsh products.\nCountry of Origin: Korea\n\nAnua\'s Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner is crafted for those who seek gentle yet effective skincare. With 77% Korean-grown heartleaf extract, this toner hydrates and soothes your skin while maintaining its natural pH balance. Ideal for all skin types, especially sensitive skin, it provides lightweight hydration, clarifies your complexion, and evens out your skin tone without any harsh or irritating ingredients.\nThis toner is made to calm, tone, and hydrate your skin while keeping its pH balanced. With 77% heartleaf extract, it helps soothe sensitive or irritated skin.\n\nAfter thoroughly washing and cleaning the face, apply an appropriate amount of the product to the face and simply allow it to be absorbed.\n\n\n\nAvoid Contact with Eyes, in case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Keep in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.\n\nBring balance and calm to your skincare routine with our soothing, hydrating toner. Perfect for sensitive skin and those tired of harsh products. Order now and give your skin the gentle care it deserves!', 750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 150.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing TonerPrice in BD', 'Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-heartleaf-77-soothing-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1975, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Papaya Whitening Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – (Made in Dubai)', '1', 0, 57, 248, '1975', '1975', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Papaya Whitening Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – Made in Dubai\nCategory: Whitening Cleansing Toner\nKey Ingredient: Papaya\nDescription:Cosmo Skin Naturals Papaya Whitening Facial Cleansing Toner is a gentle yet effective formula that combines the benefits of a cleanser and toner in a single step. Enriched with natural papaya extract, it helps to exfoliate dead skin cells, brighten the complexion, and improve skin tone and texture. Its unique formulation also hydrates, soothes, and refreshes the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and radiant.\nThis toner is ideal for daily use and suitable for all skin types. It works to gently remove impurities, dirt, and excess oil, while promoting a healthy, glowing skin appearance.\nDirections for Use:\nMoisten a cotton pad with the toner.\nGently apply over the face and neck after cleansing.\nAvoid direct contact with eyes.\nWarnings:\nFor external use only.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nAvoid contact with eyes; in case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water.\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.\nIngredients:Aqua, Propylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Gly Glucanide, Sodium PCA, Carica Papaya (Papaya) Root Extract, PEG-8, Allantoin, Panthenol, DL-α Tocopheryl Acetate, CI 15985, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Ethanol.\nVolume: 250ml / 8.45 fl.oz', 970.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 420.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Papaya Whitening Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – (Made in Dubai)Price in BD', 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Papaya Whitening Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – (Made in Dubai) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-skin-naturals-papaya-whitening-facial-cleansing-toner-250ml-made-in-dubai', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now',