(1976, 'Tonymoly Wonder Tea Tree Pore Fresh Toner - 500ml', '1', 0, 57, 389, '1976', '1976', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Multi-moisturizing toner for soft, smooth-looking skin\nHelps improve the feel of dryness and rough texture\nContains Rice Ferment Filtrate (100,000 ppb)\nLarge 500ml size—great for daily use\nCan be used as wipe toner / 7-skin / toner pack\nDry & rough-feeling skin\nDehydrated skin needing lightweight hydration\nDaily toner layering routines\nWiping Toner: After cleansing, apply to a cotton pad and gently sweep to remove remaining residue. Pat to absorb.\n7-Skin Method: Apply toner with hands and pat in. Repeat up to 7 layers for deeper hydration.\nToner Pack: Soak cotton pads, apply to dry areas for ~10 minutes, then remove.\nTip: Shake lightly before use so the ferment ingredients mix well.\nWater, Glycerin, Isopentyldiol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Rice Ferment Filtrate, Butylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-4 Caprate, Phenyl Trimethicone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Rosewood Oil, Orange Peel Oil, Bergamot Oil, Mandarin Orange Peel Oil, Sugarcane Extract, Grape Extract, Apple Extract, Disodium EDTA, Linalool, Limonene.(Linalool & Limonene may occur naturally from essential oils.)\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Stop use if irritation/rash occurs. Keep out of reach of children. Store away from direct sunlight.', 1815.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Tonymoly Wonder Tea Tree Pore Fresh Toner - 500mlPrice in BD', 'Tonymoly Wonder Tea Tree Pore Fresh Toner - 500ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'tonymoly-wonder-tea-tree-pore-fresh-toner-500ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
