(1978, 'La Roche- Posay Thermal Spring Water For Sensitive Skin 150ml', '1', 0, 57, 62, '1978', '1978', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Soothe, refresh, and protect sensitive skin anytime, anywhere with La Roche-Posay Thermal Spring Water—a dermatologist-recommended facial and body mist known for its naturally calming and antioxidant benefits. Sourced in La Roche-Posay, France, this mineral-rich thermal water has been used in dermatological care for over a century and is suitable for the whole family, including adults, children, and babies.\nNaturally enriched with minerals and trace elements (including Selenium), this gentle mist helps reduce visible signs of irritation, dryness discomfort, and redness caused by daily aggressors such as heat, pollution, shaving, cosmetic procedures, or sun exposure. With a neutral pH and a lightweight, ultra-fine spray, it instantly cools the skin and leaves it feeling soft, comfortable, and refreshed—without fragrance or residue.\nPerfect as a daily skincare step or an on-the-go skin rescue, it can be used before moisturizer, after cleansing, to set makeup, or whenever skin needs quick comfort.\nInstantly soothes and calms sensitive skin\nNaturally antioxidant support with trace element Selenium\nHelps reduce discomfort from dryness, irritation, redness & heat\nGentle enough for adults, children & babies\nFine mist spray for an even, refreshing application\nIdeal after sun exposure, shaving, cleansing, or dermatological treatments\nSpray a fine mist onto face or body from a short distance. Leave on for a few moments, then gently pat dry if needed. Use anytime throughout the day.\nSkin Type: Sensitive / irritated / reactive skin\nSize: 150ml\nOrigin: France (thermal source)', 3410.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1580.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche- Posay Thermal Spring Water For Sensitive Skin 150mlPrice in BD', 'La Roche- Posay Thermal Spring Water For Sensitive Skin 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-thermal-spring-water-for-sensitive-skin-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1979, 'Celimax The Real Noni Refresh Clay Mask 120g', '1', 0, 57, 102, '1979', '1979', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Celimax The Real Noni Refresh Clay Mask is a gentle yet effective treatment designed to purify and hydrate your skin. Infused with 30% Noni Fruit Extract and 13,000 ppm of ground Noni Fruit Powder, this mask deeply cleanses pores, removes impurities, and provides essential nutrients, leaving your skin refreshed and radiant.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\n30% Noni Fruit Extract: Rich in vitamins and minerals, it nourishes and revitalizes the skin, promoting a healthy glow.\n13,000 ppm Ground Noni Fruit Powder: Acts as a gentle exfoliant, removing dead skin cells and unclogging pores for smoother skin texture.\nKaolin & Bentonite Clays: Highly absorbent clays that effectively remove impurities and excess sebum, helping to minimize pores and control oil production.\nAllantoin & Glycerin: Provide soothing and moisturizing effects, ensuring the skin remains hydrated and comfortable after use.\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, apply a thick, even layer of the mask to your face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\nLeave on for 5–10 minutes, allowing the mask to dry without completely hardening.\nRinse off gently with lukewarm water.\nUse 1–2 times a week for optimal results.\nWhy You\'ll Love It:\nDeeply cleanses and purifies pores.\nProvides essential nutrients and hydration.\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nDermatologist-tested and hypoallergenic.\nIngredients: Water, Kaolin, Bentonite, Glycerin, Propanediol, Alcohol Denat., 1,2-Hexanediol, Dipropylene Glycol, Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Morinda Citrifolia Fruit Extract, Iron Oxides (CI 77499), Citric Acid, Xanthan Gum, Butylene Glycol, Betula Platyphylla Japonica Juice, Ethylhexylglycerin, Morinda Citrifolia Extract, Fragrance, Allantoin, Saponaria Officinalis Extract, Kigelia Africana Fruit Extract.\nExperience the rejuvenating effects of Celimax The Real Noni Refresh Clay Mask and unveil smoother, clearer, and more radiant skin.Made in Korea | Celimax US', 1673.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 717.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Celimax The Real Noni Refresh Clay Mask 120gPrice in BD', 'Celimax The Real Noni Refresh Clay Mask 120g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'celimax-the-real-noni-refresh-clay-mask-120g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
