ronic Acid, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Madecassoside, Copper Tripeptide-1, Oligopeptide-32, Oligopeptide-29, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Betaine, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Arginine, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Benzotriazolyl Dodecyl p-Cresol, Alcohol, Tris(Tetramethylhydroxypiperidinol) Citrate, Polysorbate 20, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Linalool, Fragrance.', 1045.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 555.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Grace Day 30% Marine Collagen Cream (50ml)Price in BD', 'Grace Day 30% Marine Collagen Cream (50ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'grace-day-30-marine-collagen-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
