(1986, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Lemon oil control Facial  Cleansing Toner 250ml (Made in Dubai)', '1', 0, 57, 248, '1986', '1986', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Lemon Oil Control Cleansing Toner is a refreshing, dual-action formula that works as both a cleanser and toner in one simple step. Enriched with natural Lemon Extract, it helps to unclog pores, reduce excess oil, and brighten the complexion, leaving your skin clean, balanced, and shine-free.\nThis mild yet effective toner removes impurities and traces of makeup while maintaining the skin’s natural pH balance. Ideal for oily and combination skin, it tones, refreshes, and prepares your skin for moisturizers or serums — promoting a smooth and radiant look every day.\nControls oil and shine for a matte, fresh look\nHelps unclog and tighten pores\nBrightens and refreshes the complexion\nGently removes impurities and makeup residue\nAlcohol-free and suitable for daily use\nIdeal for oily and combination skin\nMoisten a cotton pad with the cleansing toner.\nSweep gently over the face and neck after cleansing.\nAvoid the eye area.\nDo not rinse.\nStore in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nAqua, Propylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, PEG-8, Allantoin, Panthenol, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Zinc PCA, Citrus Medica Limonum (Lemon) Extract, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Phenoxyethanol, DMDM Hydantoin, Isopropyl Acetate, CI 19140, Perfume.\nNet Content: 250ml / 8.45 fl. ozMade in Dubai, UAEManufactured by: Premier Cosmetics (Sterling Perfumes Group Company)', 970.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 420.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Lemon oil control Facial  Cleansing Toner 250ml (Made in Dubai)Price in BD', 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Lemon oil control Facial  Cleansing Toner 250ml (Made 