(1987, 'April Skin TXA Niacinamide Toning Shot 99 Milky Toner 150ml – Brightening & Hydrating Toner with 5% Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin & Ceramide NP for Even-Toned, Smooth, and Radiant Skin', '1', 0, 57, 135, '1987', '1987', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'প্রোডাক্ট বর্ণনা (Product Description):April Skin TXA Niacinamide 99 Milky Toner হলো একটি মিল্কি টোনার, যা 99% বিশুদ্ধ TXA ও 5% Niacinamide দিয়ে তৈরি। এটি অসম ত্বক, ডার্ক স্পট এবং অসম টোনকে হালকা করে এবং ত্বককে মসৃণ, উজ্জ্বল ও হাইড্রেটেড রাখে।\nটোনারে রয়েছে Alpha-Arbutin, Ceramide NP এবং Hyaluronic Acid Complex, যা ত্বককে দীর্ঘস্থায়ী আর্দ্রতা দেয়, টোন সমান রাখে এবং ত্বককে সতেজ ও স্বাস্থ্যকর রাখে। নিয়মিত ব্যবহারে ত্বক হয়ে ওঠে উজ্জ্বল, সমান টোন ও কোমল।\nপ্রধান উপকারিতা (Key Benefits):\nTXA ও Niacinamide অসম টোন হালকা করে এবং উজ্জ্বলতা আনে\nAlpha-Arbutin ডার্ক স্পট হ্রাসে সহায়ক\nCeramide NP ও Hyaluronic Acid ত্বককে গভীরভাবে হাইড্রেট করে\nমিল্কি ফর্মুলা হালকা ও দ্রুত শোষিত\nত্বককে মসৃণ ও কোমল রাখে\nNon-Comedogenic – ব্রণপ্রবণ ত্বকের জন্য নিরাপদ\nপ্রতিদিনের ব্যবহার উপযোগী\nব্যবহারবিধি (Directions):\nমুখ ধোয়ার পর উপযুক্ত পরিমাণ টোনার নিন।\nত্বকের দিকে আলতোভাবে লাগান এবং হালকা চাপ দিয়ে প্যাট করুন যাতে সম্পূর্ণ শোষিত হয়।\nপ্রতিদিন সকাল ও রাতে ব্যবহার করা যায়।\nপ্রধান উপাদানসমূহ (Key Ingredients):\nTXA (Tranexamic Acid) – অসম টোন হালকা করে\nNiacinamide (5%) – ত্বককে উজ্জ্বল ও সমান টোন করে\nAlpha-Arbutin – ডার্ক স্পট হ্রাসে সহায়ক\nCeramide NP, Ceramide NS, Ceramide AP, Ceramide EOP – ত্বকের ব্যারিয়ার মেরামত ও হাইড্রেশন প্রদান করে\nHyaluronic Acid Complex (Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid ইত্যাদি) – গভীর হাইড্রেশন\nপ্রাকৃতিক এক্সট্র্যাক্ট (Green Tea, Apple Leaf, Jasmine Flower Water, Vanilla Fruit Extract, Bitter Almond Oil, Trehalose ইত্যাদি) – ত্বককে শান্ত, সতেজ ও পুনর্গঠন করে\nGlutathione & Panthenol – অ্যান্টিঅক্সিডেন্ট সুরক্ষা ও ত্বক পুনর্গঠন\nসতর্কতা (Caution):\nশুধুমাত্র বাহ্যিক ব্যবহারের জন্য।\nকোনো অ্যালার্জি বা জ্বালা দেখা দিলে ব্যবহার বন্ধ করুন।\nশিশুদের নাগালের বাইরে রাখুন।\nMADE IN KOREA', 1752.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 438.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'April Skin TXA Niacinamide Toning Shot 99 Milky Toner 150ml – Brightening & Hydrating Toner with 5% Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin & Ceramide NP for Even-Toned, Smooth, and Radiant SkinPrice in BD', 'April Skin TXA Niacinamide Toning Shot 99 Milky Toner 150ml – Brightening & Hydrating Toner with 5% Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin & Ceramide NP for Even-Toned, Smooth, and Radiant Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'april-skin-txa-niacinamide-toning-shot-99-milky-toner-150ml-brightening-hydrating-toner-with-5-niacinamide-alpha-arbutin-ceramide-np-for-even-toned-smooth-and-radiant-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1988, 'Mamaearth Niacin Toner for Face with Niacinamide & Witch Hazel – 200 ml  For Acne & Open Pores', '1', 0, 57, 3, '1988', '1988', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reduces Acne Marks | Tightens Open Pores | Repairs Damaged Skin\nAchieve clearer, smoother, and healthier skin with the Mamaearth Niacin Toner, formulated with Niacinamide and Witch Hazel. This gentle toner helps reduce acne marks, tighten open pores, and repair damaged skin while keeping it hydrated and refreshed. Perfect for daily use, it complements your skincare routine by preparing the skin for moisturizers or serums.\nSuitable for all skin types, especially oily and acne-prone skin, this toner is MadeSafe Certified, free from harmful chemicals, and safe for everyday use.\nReduces Acne Marks: Niacinamide helps fade blemishes and acne scars\nTightens Pores: Witch Hazel tones skin and minimizes pore appearance\nRepairs & Refreshes Skin: Soothes irritation and promotes healthier skin\nHydrating & Gentle: Aloe Vera juice keeps skin soft and nourished\nSafe & Natural: Free from sulfates, parabens, silicones, and harmful chemicals\nNiacinamide: Reduces acne marks, evens skin tone, and strengthens skin barrier\nWitch Hazel Extract: Tones and tightens pores while soothing irritation\nAloe Vera Juice: Hydrates and calms the skin\nSodium Hyaluronate: Retains moisture for smooth and plump skin\nWash your face with a gentle cleanser like Mamaearth Sulfate-Free Face Wash\nPour toner onto a cotton pad and gently dab on face and neck\nFollow with a silicone-free moisturizer\nUse daily for best results\nNet Volume: 200 ml\nSkin Type: All skin types, especially oily and acne-prone skin\nCategory: Skincare → Toner\nFree From: Sulfates, parabens, silicones, and harmful chemicals', 1155.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 495.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Niacin Toner for Face with Niacinamide & Witch Hazel – 200 ml  For Acne & Open PoresPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Niacin Toner for Face with Niacinamide & Witch Hazel – 200 ml  For Acne & Open Pores Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-niacin-toner-for-face-with-niacinamide-witch-hazel-200-ml-for-acne-open-pores', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1989, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Niacinamide Milky Toner 150ml – (Made in Korea)', '1', 0, 57, 96, '1989', '1989', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Niacinamide Milky Toner is a rich, hydrating toner designed to brighten, soothe, and strengthen the skin barrier. Enriched with Niacinamide 50,000ppm, PDRN, Pink Vitamin Complex, and Centella Extracts, this toner delivers deep nourishment while improving overall skin tone and texture.\nIts soft, milky texture absorbs smoothly, leaving the skin moisturized, plump, and radiant. Suitable for all skin types—especially dull, dry, uneven, and sensitive skin.\nBrightens & Evens Skin ToneHigh-dose Niacinamide helps reduce dullness, discoloration, and dark spots.\nDeep Hydration & Skin Barrier SupportMilky texture enriched with glycerin, hyaluronic acid, and ceramides leaves skin soft and moisturized.\nSoothes Irritation & RednessCentella Asiatica extracts and Madecassoside help calm sensitive or stressed skin.\nAnti-Aging & RepairPDRN, peptides, and plant extracts improve elasticity and support healthy skin regeneration.\nNutrient-Rich FormulaContains botanical extracts like Green Tea, Bitter Almond, Jasmine Flower Water, Apple Leaf, and Red Clover for added nourishment.\nSuitable for Daily UseGentle, hypoallergenic, and perfect for AM & PM routines.\nAfter cleansing, apply an appropriate amount onto your hands or a cotton pad.\nGently wipe or pat along the skin texture.\nPress lightly until fully absorbed.\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\nFor external use only.\nDiscontinue use if irritation or rash occurs.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStore away from direct sunlight.\nRead all instructions before use.\nWater (Aqua), Glycerin, Niacinamide (50,000ppm), Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Pentaerythrityl Tetraethylhexanoate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Polyglyceryl-3 Distearate, Octyldodecanol, Diisostearyl Malate, C12-14 Alketh-12, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Tromethamine, Glyceryl Stearate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Trehalose, Glyceryl Stearate Citrate, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Cyanocobalamin, Saccharide Hydrolysate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Oil, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Water, Butylene Glycol, Bitter Almond Kernel Oil, Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Leaf Extract, Apple Leaf Extract, Sorbitol, Panthenol, Propanediol, Vanilla Fruit Extract, Jasmine Flower Water, Xylitylglucoside, Anhydroxylitol, Sunflower Seed Oil, Dipropylene Glycol, Sucrose Stearate, Xylitol, Beta-Carotene, Sodium DNA (PDRN), Polyglyceryl-10 Oleate, Bilberry Fruit Extract, Centella Asiatica Root Extract, Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Tocopherol, Pueraria Lobata Root Extract, Pentylene Glycol, Madecassoside, Milk Protein Extract, Lycopodium Extract, Horsetail Extract, Phragmites Extract, Sweet Almond Fruit Extract, Lecithin, Tremella (Mushroom) Extract, Tabebuia Impetiginosa Bark Extract, Red Clover Extract, Acetyl Glutamine, Asiatic Acid, Bacillus/Soybean Ferment Extract, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Hydrolyzed Wheat Protein, Hydrolyzed Soy Protein, Hydrolyzed Rice Protein, Hydrolyzed Rice Bran Protein, Hydrolyzed Corn Protein, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Folic Acid, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Ceramide NS, Ceramide NP, Ceramide EOS, Ceramide AP, Oligopeptide-3, Oligopeptide-2, Oligopeptide-1, Hexapeptide-11.\nLot Number & Expiry Date: Indicated separately\nMade in Korea\nSuitable for all skin types', 1850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 870.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Niacinamide Milky Toner 150ml – (Made in Korea)Price in BD', 'Medicube PDRN Pink Niacinamide Milky Toner 150ml – (Made in Korea) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-pdrn-pink-niacinamide-milky-toner-150ml-made-in-korea', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1990, 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Toner', '1', 0, 57, 83, '1990', '1990', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Toner\nRevitalize your skin with the Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Toner, a gentle yet powerful formulation designed to soothe, hydrate, and repair. Enriched with Centella Asiatica Extract, it works to calm redness, promote healing, and fortify your skin\'s natural barrier.\nThis toner is further enhanced with Panthenol, which provides deep hydration and locks in moisture for a plump, refreshed complexion. Its lightweight, non-sticky texture ensures rapid absorption, making it ideal for layering or as a quick skin refresher throughout the day.\nFree from artificial fragrances, essential oils, and harsh chemicals, it’s suitable for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin. Achieve balanced, radiant, and healthier-looking skin with every application.\nKey Benefits:\nHow to Use:\nMade in Korea', 1510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1740.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella TonerPrice in BD', 'Purito Seoul Wonder Releaf Centella Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-seoul-wonder-releaf-centella-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34');
