(1991, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Rose Revitalizing Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – (Made in Dubai)', '1', 0, 57, 248, '1991', '1991', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Name:Cosmo Skin Naturals Rose Revitalizing Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – Made in Dubai\nCategory: Revitalizing Cleansing Toner\nKey Ingredient: Rose\nDescription:Cosmo Skin Naturals Rose Revitalizing Facial Cleansing Toner is specially formulated to moisturize, soothe, and refresh the skin while improving its suppleness. Enriched with natural rose extract, it helps make the skin appear firmer, youthful, and rejuvenated. This dual-action toner combines the benefits of a cleanser and toner in a single, easy step, leaving your skin soft, smooth, and radiant. Ideal for daily use on all skin types.\nDirections for Use:\nMoisten a cotton pad with the toner.\nGently apply over the face and neck after cleansing.\nAvoid direct contact with eyes.\nWarnings:\nFor external use only.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nAvoid contact with eyes; if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.\nIngredients:Aqua, Propylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Glycymhica Caproyl Methyl Glucanide, Sodium PCA, Rosa Canina Root Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, PEG-8, Glycerin, Allantoin, Panthenol, Phenoxyethanol, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, DMDM Hydantoin, Perfume, Tocopheryl Acetate\nVolume: 250ml / 8.45 fl.ozMade in: Dubai, UAE', 970.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 420.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Rose Revitalizing Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – (Made in Dubai)Price in BD', 'Cosmo Skin Naturals Rose Revitalizing Facial Cleansing Toner 250ml – (Made in Dubai) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-skin-naturals-rose-revitalizing-facial-cleansing-toner-250ml-made-in-dubai', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-0