(1992, 'MediPeel Bio Intense Glutathione White Silky Toner 180ml-Revives Dull Skin, Fades Dark Spots, Restores Hydration', '1', 0, 57, 247, '1992', '1992', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The MediPeel Bio Intense Glutathione White Silky Toner (180ml) is a powerful brightening and hydrating skincare toner formulated with the Glutathione Whitening Complex to target dullness, uneven skin tone, and dark spots. This silky-textured toner instantly refreshes and nourishes the skin, helping to restore a radiant, healthy glow while reinforcing the skin’s natural barrier.\nInfused with Niacinamide, Glutathione, Hyaluronic Acid, and Madecassoside, this toner delivers deep hydration, improves elasticity, and soothes irritation, making it ideal for daily use. With continuous use, it helps reveal a brighter, smoother, and more luminous complexion.\nBrightens & Evens Skin Tone: Glutathione and Niacinamide reduce dullness and fade dark spots.\nHydration Boost: Multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid and Panthenol lock in long-lasting moisture.\nSkin Barrier Support: Ceramides and peptides strengthen and protect the skin barrier.\nAnti-Aging Care: Peptides, Retinol, and antioxidants improve skin texture and elasticity.\nSoothing & Calming: Madecassoside and botanical extracts reduce redness and irritation.\nAfter cleansing, soak a cotton pad with toner.\nGently sweep from the center of the face outward, avoiding the eye area.\nFollow with essence, serum, and moisturizer.\nGlutathione & Niacinamide – Brightening, fading dark spots, and evening skin tone\nMultiple Hyaluronic Acids – Deep hydration and moisture retention\nMadecassoside & Centella Extracts – Soothing and calming care\nPeptides & Retinol – Anti-aging and skin-firming benefits\nBotanical Oils & Extracts (Olive, Shea Butter, Sea Buckthorn, etc.) – Nourishment and antioxidant protection', 1870.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 330.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'MediPeel Bio Intense Glutathione White Silky Toner 180ml-Revives Dull Skin, Fades Dark Spots, Restores HydrationPrice in BD', 'MediPeel Bio Intense Glutathione White Silky Toner 180ml-Revives Dull Skin, Fades Dark Spots, Restores Hydration Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medipeel-bio-intense-glutathione-white-silky-toner-180ml-revives-dull-skin-fades-dark-spots-restores-hydration', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1993, 'Celimax The Real Noni Moisture Balancing Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 57, 102, '1993', '1993', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Benefits:\n80.1% Noni Fruit Extract: Packed with over 150 vitamins and 200 phytochemical antioxidants, Noni Extract soothes irritation, nourishes the skin, and promotes a healthy, glowing complexion.\nHydrovance™: A patented moisturizing ingredient that deeply penetrates the skin to provide lasting hydration, leaving the skin plump and supple.\n5% Amino Acid Complex: Contains 17 types of amino acids that gently exfoliate, improve skin texture, enhance elasticity, and support the skin’s natural barrier.\nLow pH Formula: Maintains optimal skin pH to protect the skin barrier, promote healthy balance, and prevent dryness or irritation.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Gentle yet effective, ideal for sensitive, dry, or combination skin.\nTexture & Application:This toner features a watery, lightweight texture that absorbs quickly without leaving any sticky residue. Use after cleansing to prep the skin for serum and moisturizer. Apply an appropriate amount onto a cotton pad or directly onto your palms and gently pat onto your face and neck. For best results, use both morning and night.\nWhy You’ll Love It:\nRevitalizes and nourishes tired, dull skin.\nProvides deep hydration while soothing irritation.\nImproves texture and elasticity for a smoother, firmer complexion.\nHelps maintain healthy skin pH and barrier function.\nIngredients:Water, Morinda Citrifolia (Noni) Fruit Extract (80.1%), Butylene Glycol, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrovance™, Panthenol, Allantoin, Amino Acid Complex, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA, Glycerin, Fragrance.\nMade in Korea | Celimax US', 2380.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1020.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Celimax The Real Noni Moisture Balancing Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'Celimax The Real Noni 