(1994, 'Mamaearth Rice Water Dewy Face Toner with Rice Water & 4% Niacinamide for Glass Skin 150ml', '1', 0, 57, 3, '1994', '1994', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Achieve that coveted glass-skin glow with the Mamaearth Rice Water Dewy Face Toner. Enriched with hydrating Rice Water and 4% Niacinamide, this toner gently refreshes, brightens, and balances your skin, leaving it soft, radiant, and dewy. Perfect for daily skincare routines and suitable for all skin types.\n🌾 Hydrates & Refreshes – Rice Water deeply nourishes and maintains skin moisture.\n✨ Brightens & Evens Skin Tone – 4% Niacinamide reduces dullness, dark spots, and uneven texture.\n💧 Dewy, Glass-Skin Finish – Lightweight formula leaves skin soft, supple, and radiant.\n🌿 Gentle & Safe – Alcohol-free, dermatologically tested, and free from parabens, sulfates, and harmful chemicals.\nAfter cleansing, pour a small amount onto a cotton pad or your palms.\nGently sweep across face and neck.\nFollow with serum or moisturizer.Use daily, morning and night, for best results.\nRice Water – Hydrates and naturally brightens.\n4% Niacinamide – Improves skin tone, texture, and reduces pigmentation.\nAloe Vera & Glycerin – Soothes and nourishes the skin.\nNet Volume: 150 mlMade by: Mamaearth, India', 1295.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 555.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Rice Water Dewy Face Toner with Rice Water & 4% Niacinamide for Glass Skin 150mlPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Rice Water Dewy Face Toner with Rice Water & 4% Niacinamide for Glass Skin 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-rice-water-dewy-face-toner-with-rice-water-4-niacinamide-for-glass-skin-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(1995, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Toner For Face, with Vitamin C & Cucumber-200 ml', '1', 0, 57, 3, '1995', '1995', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Purifies Skin | Cleanses Pores | Restores Skin’s pH Balance\nRefresh and rejuvenate your skin with the Mamaearth Vitamin C Toner, enriched with Vitamin C and Cucumber Extract. This gentle toner helps purify skin, tighten pores, and restore your skin’s natural pH balance, leaving it fresh, radiant, and healthy.\nIdeal for normal to oily skin types, this lightweight formula can be incorporated into your daily skincare routine to enhance hydration, soothe the skin, and prepare it for moisturization. MadeSafe Certified, it’s free from harmful chemicals and safe for regular use.\nPurifies & Refreshes Skin: Removes impurities and excess oil\nCleanses Pores: Tightens and minimizes the appearance of pores\nRestores pH Balance: Helps maintain skin’s natural protective barrier\nHydrates & Soothes: Cucumber extract nourishes and cools the skin\nSafe & Gentle: Dermatologically tested and free from harmful chemicals\nVitamin C: Brightens skin, reduces dullness, and protects against free radicals\nCucumber Extract: Soothes, hydrates, and refreshes skin\nGlycerin & Sodium PCA: Retains moisture for a soft and smooth complexion\nWitch Hazel Extract: Cleanses and tones skin naturally\nWash your face with Mamaearth Vitamin C Face Wash\nPour toner onto a cotton pad and gently dab over the face and neck\nFollow with Mamaearth Vitamin C Oil-Free Moisturizer\nUse daily for best results\nNet Volume: 200 ml\nSkin Type: Normal to oily skin\nFree From: Parabens, sulfates, silicones, and harmful chemicals\nCategory: Skincare → Toner\nThe second step in a skincare routine, toning helps clean leftover impurities and excess oil from the face. Regular application of toner helps tighten and cleanse pores from within while protecting the skin from acne and breakouts. Mamaearth Vitamin C toner has a unique alcohol-free formula and comes loaded with the goodness of Aloe Vera, Cucumber, Witch Hazel, and many other hardworking ingredients. Vitamin C in this toner supports the production of healthy collagen that brightens the complexion and boosts skin’s firmness. Witch Hazel reduces inflammation, tightens skin pores, and soothes acne-prone sensitive skin. The alcohol-free formula of this toner helps balance the pH level of your skin. Cucumber, a trusted skincare ingredient, offers hydration, reduces inflammation, and calms irritated skin. Mamaearth Vitamin C Face Toner is suitable for all skin types & free of alcohol & harmful toxins such as Parabens, Mineral Oil, Silicones, etc.\n', 836.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 484.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Toner For Face, with Vitamin C & Cucumber-200 mlPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Vitamin C Toner For Face, with Vitamin C & Cucumber-200 ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-vitamin-c-toner-for-face-with-vitamin-c-cucumber-200-ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
