(2004, 'I’m From Mugwort Essence 150ml', '1', 0, 57, 129, '2004', '2004', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I\'m From Mugwort Essence is a Korean face essence that harnesses the incredible power of 100% mugwort extract sourced from Ganghwa County in Korea. Packed with natural detoxifying properties, this essence is your ticket to a clear, glowing complexion in just minutes.Mugwort, a revered herb in Korea and known for its detoxifying prowess, takes center stage in this exceptional essence. Bursting with antioxidants, vitamins, and minerals, mugwort works tirelessly to restore, soothe, and detoxify your skin, giving you the healthy and radiant complexion you\'ve always desired.\nSuitable for all skin types, the I\'m From Mugwort Essence is a must-have addition to your skincare routine. Whether you\'re dealing with dryness, oiliness, or sensitivity, this essence has got you covered. It\'s a versatile powerhouse that adapts to your skin\'s needs, providing the nourishment and care it craves.\nExperience the wonder of this watery yet slightly viscous essence, which is perfect for the popular 7-skin method. With its lightweight texture, it effortlessly absorbs into your skin, leaving it smooth, hydrated, and refreshed. Say goodbye to irritation and hello to a complexion that looks and feels revitalized.\nWe adore this essence for its simplicity and effectiveness. It\'s the ideal choice for irritated skin, offering a calming and soothing effect that is truly remarkable. Incorporating this essence into your routine is a breeze, and you\'ll quickly see the transformative results it brings to your complexion.\nUnlock the secret to clear, healthy, and radiant skin with the I\'m From Mugwort Essence. Embrace the natural goodness of mugwort and let its detoxifying and nourishing properties work their magic. Experience the joy of a complexion that is revitalized, balanced, and positively glowing. Try the I\'m From Mugwort Essence today and witness the incredible transformation of your skin.\nHow to Use1) After cleansing, prep the skin with the toner.\n2) Dispense an appropriate amount of the essence and gently pat over the face to promote absorption, starting with the most sensitive areas.\n\nIngredientsArtemisia Princeps Extract 100%\nIngredients are subject to change at the manufacturer\'s discretion. For the most complete and up-to-date list of ingredients, refer to the product packaging.\n\n', 3080.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '150ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2345.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'I’m From Mugwort Essence 150mlPrice in BD', 'I’m From Mugwort Essence 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'im-from-mugwort-essence-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2005, 'Tonymoly Wonder Rice Smoothing Toner-500ml', '1', 0, 57, 389, '2005', '2005', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Helps smooth rough texture and soften skin feel\nProvides lightweight hydration for dry/dehydrated skin\nContains Rice Ferment Filtrate (100,000 ppb)\nMulti-use toner: wipe toner, 7-skin layering, or toner pack\nLarge-size 500ml (great value for daily routines)\nWiping Toner: After cleansing, soak a cotton pad and gently sweep across the face. Pat to absorb.\n7-Skin Method: Apply toner with hands and pat in. Repeat up to 7 times for extra hydration.\nToner Pack: Soak cotton pads with toner, place on dry areas for ~10 minutes, then remove.\nTip: Shake lightly before use so the ferment ingredients mix well.\nWater, Glycerin, Isopentyldiol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Rice Ferment Filtrate (100,000 ppb), C12-14 Alketh-12, Butylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-4 Caprate, Phenyl Trimethicone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Aniba Rosodora (Rosewood) Oil, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Peel Oil, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia (Bergamot) Oil, Citrus Nobilis (Mandarin Orange) Peel Oil, Methylpropanediol, Saccharum Officinarum (Sugarcane) Extract, Vitis (Grape) Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract, Disodium EDTA, Linalool, Limonene.\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children. Discontinue use if irritation or rash occurs. Store away from direct sunlight.', 1815.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 875.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Tonymoly Wonder Rice Smoothing Toner-500mlPrice in BD', 'Tonymoly Wonder Rice Smoothing Toner-500ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'tonymoly-wonder-rice-smoothing-toner-500ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2006, 'Cosmo Glow White Skin Perfector Whitening Cleansing Toner Max Tone 250ml – With Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid – (Made in Dubai)', '1', 0, 57, 248, '2006', '2006', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosmo Glow White Skin Perfector Whitening Cleansing Toner Max Tone 250ml – With Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid – Made in Dubai\nCategory: Whitening Cleansing Toner / Toner Nettoyant Blanchissant\nDescription:COSMO Glow White Skin Perfector Whitening Cleansing Toner is specially formulated to gently cleanse, brighten, and refine the skin. Enriched with Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid, it removes dead skin cells, dirt, oil, and makeup residues while reducing the appearance of pores and balancing sebum production. Its unique formulation also helps protect the skin against signs of aging and promotes a smoother, more radiant complexion. Ideal for daily use on all skin types.\nDirections for Use:\nApply to the cleansed face and neck using a cotton pad.\nUse daily for best results.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nCautions:\nFor external use only.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStore in a cool, dry place.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nNiacinamide: Brightens skin and improves uneven tone\nHyaluronic Acid: Hydrates and plumps the skin\nLicorice Root Extract: Reduces pigmentation and evens skin tone\nTurmeric Root Extract: Soothes and revitalizes the skin\nAlpha Arbutin & Potassium Azeloyl Diglycinate: Reduce dark spots and improve clarity\nZinc PCA: Controls oil and minimizes pores\nFull Ingredients:Aqua (Water), Propanediol, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Niacinamide, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Capryloyl/Caproyl Methyl Glucamide (and) Lauroyl/Myristoyl Methyl Glucamide, Polysorbate 20, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Alpha Arbutin, Potassium Azeloyl Diglycinate, Phenoxyethanol, Zinc PCA, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hyaluronic Acid, Perfume, Lactic Acid, Sodium Sulfite\nVolume: 250ml\nMade in: Dubai, UAE', 970.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 420.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmo Glow White Skin Perfector Whitening Cleansing Toner Max Tone 250ml – With Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid – (Made in Dubai)Price in BD', 'Cosmo Glow White Skin Perfector Whitening Cleansing Toner Max Tone 250ml – With Niacinamide & Hyaluronic Acid – (Made in Dubai) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmo-glow-white-skin-perfector-whitening-cleansing-toner-max-tone-250ml-with-niacinamide-hyaluronic-acid-made-in-dubai', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2007, 'Simple Kind to Skin Soothing Facial Toner with Vitamin B5 & Witch Hazel', '1', 0, 57, 24, '2007', '2007', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A great skincare routine is as easy as 1,2,3 - with the middle step being a toner, of course! Our Simple Kind to Skin Soothing Facial Toner features a special blend of Simple skin toning goodness to help keep skin toned and refreshed; this blend includes ingredients like Pro-Vitamin B5, Chamomile, Witch Hazel and Allantoin.\nThis facial toner is ideal for using after your cleanser and before your moisturiser morning and night to help remove those last traces of dirt and make-up from your skin.\nThe Soothing Facial Toner is a great way to finish any cleansing routine, not just if you\'re experiencing breakouts or blemishes. In fact, a toner is a skincare treatment in its own right and helps to prepare skin for your moisturiser.\nDermatologically Tested and Approved.\n\nIngredients:\nAqua, Hydrogenated Starch Hydrolysate, Hamamelis Virginiana Water, Allantoin, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Chamomilla Recutita Flower Extract, Sodium PCA, Glycerin, Pantolactone, Disodium Laureth Sulfosuccinate, Citric acid, Methylparaben, 2-Bromo-2-Nitropropane-1,3-Diol, Potassium sorbate\n\nMade in Poland', 630.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple Kind to Skin Soothing Facial Toner with Vitamin B5 & Witch HazelPrice in BD', 'Simple Kind to Skin Soothing Facial Toner with Vitamin B5 & Witch Hazel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-kind-to-skin-soothing-facial-toner-with-vitamin-b5-witch-hazel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
