(2012, 'Nineless B Boost 1% Kojic Acid Toner for Dark spot and Pigmentation', '1', 0, 58, 47, '2012', '2012', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The NINELESS B-Boost 1% Kojic Acid Toner (200ml) is a skincare product formulated to address dark spots and hyperpigmentation, promoting a clearer and more luminous complexion.\nKey Ingredients and Benefits:\nKojic Acid (1%): Known for its ability to inhibit melanin production, kojic acid helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and uneven skin tone.\nNiacinamide (2%): Also known as Vitamin B3, niacinamide aids in reducing pigmentation, strengthening the skin barrier, and providing anti-inflammatory benefits.\nAdenosine: Contributes to skin barrier repair and offers anti-inflammatory properties, promoting healthier skin.\nBotanical Extracts: Ingredients like Houttuynia Cordata Extract and Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract provide soothing hydration and antioxidant protection, shielding the skin from environmental damage.\nProduct Features:\nLightweight and Fast-Absorbing: The toner has a thin, watery consistency that absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a sticky residue, making it suitable for layering with other skincare products.\nSuitable for All Skin Types: Including sensitive and acne-prone skin, due to its gentle formulation.\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, apply a moderate amount of the toner to the face using a cotton pad or your hands.\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\nFollow with your regular serum and moisturizer.\nMade in Korea', 1518.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1257.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Nineless B Boost 1% Kojic Acid Toner for Dark spot and PigmentationPrice in BD', 'Nineless B Boost 1% Kojic Acid Toner for Dark spot and Pigmentation Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nineless-b-boost-1-kojic-acid-toner-for-dark-spot-and-pigmentation', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34'