(2013, 'APLB Glutathione 22.6% Niacinamide Mist Essence', '1', 0, 58, 4, '2013', '2013', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'BASIC SUMMARY: LIPO GLUTA NIAC CEN 22.6% (Glutathione 1,000ppm, Niacinamide 20,000ppm, Centella Asiatica Extract 20.5%), combined with Centella 3x Complex\nCENTELLA 3X COMPLEX: The following components of Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, and Asiatic Acid come from a leaf called “Centella asiatica”.\nPRESERVE THE MOISTURE: Infused with Hyaluronic Acid and Beta Glucan.\nSHINE AND GLOW: Infused with Vitamin C, Niacinamide (Vitamin B3 and Nicotinamide)\nALLEVIATE FOR SENSITIVE SKIN: Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) extract.\n\nBenefits :\n-Tightening-Moisturizing-Brightening-Soothing-Calming-Mild Ingredients With the Best Results-Microfluidizer Glutathione, Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica Extract are included\nLIPO GLUTA NIAC CEN™ 22.6% (Glutathione 1,000ppm, Niacinamide 20,000ppm, Centella Asiatica Extract 20.5%), combined with Centella 3x Complex™ and patented ingredients make it a premium mist essence that provides rich nutrition and deep moisture to the skin, making it vibrant and hydrated.\nCentella 3x Complex™ : Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid\nSuggested useHow to use : Close your eyes, spray 2-3 times 20cm away from your face, and tap gently with your hands to absorb. To keep your self moisturized, spray it several times a day.\nOther ingredientsWater, centella asiatica extract (20.5%), butylene glycol, glycerin, dipropylene glycol, niacinamide (20,000ppm), hydroxyethyl urea, sodium hyaluronate, allantoin, panthenol, glutathione (1,000ppm ), nelumbo nucifera extract, artemisia annua extract, oryza sativa (rice) extract, saccharomyces ferment, solanum melongena (eggplant) fruit extract, melaleuca alternifolia (tea tree) leaf extract, hydrolyzed collagen, beta-glucan, hippophae rhamnoides fruit extract, adenosine, madecassic acid, asiaticoside, asiatic acid, squalane, caprylic/capric triglyceride, hydrogenated lecithin, glyceryl tearate, cholesterol, xanthan gum, propanediol, hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-hexanediol, ethylhexylglycerin, dipotassium glycyrrhizate, styrene/acrylates copolymer, citric acid, sodium citrate.\nWarningsKeep out of reach of children. For external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. Immediately discontinue use if irritation or rash occurs.\n\n\n\nMade in Korea', 902.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '105ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 848.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Glutathione 22.6% Niacinamide Mist EssencePrice in BD', 'APLB Glutathione 22.6% Niacinamide Mist Essence Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-glutathione-226-niacinamide-mist-essence', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2014, 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Ocean Aqua (100ml)', '1', 0, 58, 391, '2014', '2014', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lock in your look and refresh your skin with the BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Ocean Aqua. This ultra-lightweight, multi-functional mist is more than just a setting spray—it’s a skin hydration boost in a bottle. Enriched with deep-sea minerals and marine botanical extracts, it replenishes moisture, soothes tired skin, and gives your makeup a fresh, dewy finish that lasts all day.\nWhether you use it as a primer, makeup setting spray, or a midday refresh mist, the Ocean Aqua formula leaves your skin feeling soft, supple, and glowing—like a gentle splash of ocean breeze for your face.\nHydrating Ocean MineralsInfused with minerals derived from ocean water to help restore skin balance, prevent dryness, and give your face a healthy, hydrated glow.\nMulti-Use Formula: Prime, Set, RefreshUse before makeup to prep and hydrate the skin, after makeup to lock it in place, or throughout the day to refresh and revive your look without caking or cracking.\nDewy, Radiant FinishGives skin a naturally luminous finish without looking oily—perfect for that fresh, glowing complexion.\nLightweight & Non-StickyThe fine mist applies evenly and absorbs quickly without leaving behind residue, stickiness, or shine.\nSoothing & Cooling EffectHelps calm tired or irritated skin while revitalizing your overall appearance—ideal for use in hot or dry climates.\nAll skin types, especially dry, dull, or dehydrated skin\nSetting makeup for long-lasting wear\nDaily skin hydration or midday pick-me-up\nSensitive skin needing a gentle, non-irritating mist\nProduct Name: BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Ocean Aqua\nNet Volume: 100 ml\nTexture: Ultra-fine mist\nFragrance: Mild aquatic freshness (non-overpowering)\nFinish: Natural dewy glow\nPackaging: Spray bottle with fine mist nozzle', 495.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 455.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Ocean Aqua (100ml)Price in BD', 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Ocean Aqua (100ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bob-glow-mist-hydrating-setting-spray-ocean-aqua-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34');
