(2015, 'BOB Camellia Refreshing & Moisturizing Setting Spray 90ml', '1', 0, 58, 391, '2015', '2015', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience the perfect finishing touch to your makeup routine with the BOB Camellia Refreshing & Moisturizing Setting Spray. Specially formulated to lock in your makeup while delivering a burst of hydration, this lightweight mist revitalizes your skin and keeps your look fresh all day long. Whether you\'re preparing for a busy day or a night out, this setting spray is your secret weapon for a flawless, long-lasting finish.\nEnriched with the nourishing and soothing properties of camellia extract, renowned for its antioxidant benefits and skin-conditioning effects, this setting spray not only sets your makeup but also pampers your skin with gentle moisture. The fine mist sprays evenly and absorbs quickly, leaving no sticky or heavy residue, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nKey Benefits:\nLong-lasting makeup hold: Helps keep your makeup intact and fresh, preventing smudging, fading, and settling into fine lines.\nIntense hydration: Camellia extract deeply moisturizes and soothes the skin, reducing dryness and promoting a radiant complexion.\nRefreshing boost anytime: Use throughout the day to refresh your makeup and revitalize tired or dull skin.\nLightweight & breathable: The ultra-fine mist feels weightless and comfortable, allowing your skin to breathe.\nVersatile usage: Ideal for use after makeup application, as a midday refresher, or even as a hydrating facial mist.\nHow to Use:\nShake the bottle gently to activate the ingredients.\nHold the spray about 20-25cm (8-10 inches) from your face with eyes closed.\nMist evenly over your face to set makeup or refresh skin anytime during the day.\nFor best results, use after makeup application or whenever your skin feels dry or needs a quick hydration boost.', 660.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 590.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BOB Camellia Refreshing & Moisturizing Setting Spray 90mlPrice in BD', 'BOB Camellia Refreshing & Moisturizing Setting Spray 90ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bob-camellia-refreshing-moisturizing-setting-spray-90ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2016, 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Vitamin C (100ml)', '1', 0, 58, 392, '2016', '2016', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Give your skin a daily dose of brightness and hydration with the BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Vitamin C. This multitasking mist is enriched with powerful Vitamin C and skin-loving antioxidants to help awaken dull, tired skin while locking in your makeup for long-lasting freshness. With each spray, your complexion is instantly refreshed, more radiant, and perfectly set—ready to face the day with confidence.\nIdeal as a primer, setting spray, or skin refresher, this glow mist energizes the skin and adds a natural, healthy-looking glow without making your face feel greasy or heavy.\nBrightening Power of Vitamin CPacked with stabilized Vitamin C, this mist helps to even out skin tone, reduce dullness, and boost radiance with continued use.\nAntioxidant-Rich FormulaProtects your skin against environmental stressors like pollution and free radicals, making it a perfect choice for daily city wear.\nLong-Lasting Makeup HoldLocks your foundation and makeup in place with a dewy, glowing finish that lasts—no melting, cracking, or fading throughout the day.\nHydrating & RevitalizingInstantly refreshes your face with lightweight moisture, making it perfect for dry or combination skin.\nNon-Sticky, Ultra-Fine MistApplies evenly in a light veil—no dripping, no clumping, and no heavy feeling. Makeup stays intact and skin stays fresh.\nDull or uneven skin tone\nDry or combination skin\nEveryday makeup setting and refreshing\nMakeup prep, mid-day hydration, or no-makeup skin brightening\nPeople living in urban or polluted environments\nProduct Name: BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Vitamin C\nNet Volume: 100 ml', 495.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 455.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Vitamin C (100ml)Price in BD', 'BOB G