(2017, 'Purito Centella Unscented Toner', '1', 0, 58, 83, '2017', '2017', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1700.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 940.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Centella Unscented TonerPrice in BD', 'Purito Centella Unscented Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-centella-unscented-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2018, 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Flower Extracts (100ml)', '1', 0, 58, 391, '2018', '2018', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refresh, hydrate, and finish your makeup routine with the gentle power of BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Flower Extracts. Specially formulated with a soothing blend of natural flower extracts, this ultra-fine mist delivers lasting hydration, a soft glow-enhancing finish, and a calming effect on the skin. It’s the perfect multitasking spray to prime, set, or refresh your look anytime, anywhere.\nInfused with floral essences like rose, chamomile, and lavender, this spray not only locks your makeup in place but also nourishes and comforts your skin, making it ideal for sensitive or easily irritated complexions.\n🌺 Floral Hydration ComplexEnriched with natural flower extracts known for their hydrating, soothing, and antioxidant properties. Helps calm skin, reduce redness, and maintain moisture levels throughout the day.\n💧 All-Day Hydration & RadianceDelivers a refreshing burst of moisture that leaves the skin looking naturally glowing and revitalized—without feeling greasy or sticky.\n💨 Fine Mist, Even ApplicationUltra-light mist disperses evenly across the face for a smooth, breathable finish that doesn’t disturb your makeup.\n🔐 Locks in MakeupWorks as an effective setting spray that extends the wear of your foundation, concealer, and powders while giving your face a soft, luminous finish.\n🍃 Gentle & Non-IrritatingFormulated without harsh alcohols or artificial fragrances—perfect for those with sensitive or dry skin types.\nSensitive, dry, or normal skin\nDaily use as a skincare and makeup hybrid\nThose who prefer gentle, plant-based formulas\nMakeup setting without heavy hold or cakiness\nMidday refresh for tired, dehydrated skin\nProduct Name: BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Flower Extracts\nNet Volume: 100 ml', 495.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 455.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Flower Extracts (100ml)Price in BD', 'BOB Glow Mist Hydrating Setting Spray – Flower Extracts (100ml) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bob-glow-mist-hydrating-setting-spray-flower-extracts-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2019, 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Rose Water Face And Body Mist', '1', 0, 59, 224, '2019', '2019', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Experience the hydrating and rejuvenating power of Skin Cafe 100% Natural Rose Water. Available in Bangladesh at Arogga, this rose water tones, refreshes, and balances your skin, ensuring a radiant complexion.\n\nSkin Cafe 100% Natural Rose Water is crafted to provide essential hydration and toning benefits to all skin types. Made from the finest roses, this product not only moisturizes the skin but also helps in cleaning the pores, controlling oil production, and maintaining the pH balance of the skin. It\'s an ideal addition to your daily skincare routine, providing a refreshing and revitalizing experience.\n\nThis is the purest rose water and body mist you can get. We source our rose from the famous golap gram of Savar, Dhaka. The steam distillation process is used with maximum hygiene to ensure the purity and flavor of rose in the yielded water. The rose water works as a natural astringent toner that deep cleanses and brightens your skin, and also tightens your pores. Use it alone or with any powder face mask of your choice to form a smooth paste.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nApply to a clean face using a soft cotton ball or pad. Gently dab all over the face. No need to rinse. Use morning and evening for best results.\n\n\n\nSkin Cafe is dedicated to providing high-quality, natural skincare products. Their 100% Natural Rose Water is a testament to their commitment to purity and effectiveness, helping users achieve a healthy and radiant complexion naturally.', 264.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 56.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Rose Water Face And Body MistPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe 100% Natural Rose Water Face And Body Mist Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-100-natural-rose-water-face-and-body-mist', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2020, '3W Clinic Premium Vegan Intensive Water Glow Mist', '1', 0, 59, 114, '2020', '2020', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elevate your skincare routine with the 3W Clinic Premium Vegan Intensive Water Glow Mist, a luxurious and hydrating facial mist designed to refresh and rejuvenate your skin throughout the day. Formulated with a blend of plant-based ingredients, this mist provides an instant boost of moisture, leaving your skin with a radiant, dewy glow. Perfect for all skin types, it is especially beneficial for those seeking hydration and a natural, luminous finish. This vegan-friendly mist is free from harsh chemicals, making it a gentle and effective addition to your skincare arsenal.\nKey Features:\nHow to Use:\nBenefits:', 715.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 485.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, '3W Clinic Premium Vegan Intensive Water Glow MistPrice in BD', '3W Clinic Premium Vegan Intensive Water Glow Mist Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, '3w-clinic-premium-vegan-intensive-water-glow-mist', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2021, 'Primaderm Glow Up Mist 50ml', '1', 0, 59, 57, '2021', '2021', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tagline: Instant Radiance, On The Go. Your Dewy, Hydrated Glow in a Spritz.\nA multi-purpose hydrating face mist that instantly refreshes, brightens, and sets makeup. Infused with illuminating and skin-loving ingredients, it delivers a burst of moisture for a dewy, radiant finish anytime, anywhere.\nUnlock an Instant, Lit-From-Within Radiance\nMeet the Primaderm Glow Up Mist – your secret weapon for a continuous, camera-ready glow. This isn\'t just a setting spray; it\'s a skincare-infused treat that revitalizes your complexion in a single, fine spritz. Whether you\'re prepping your skin, setting your makeup, or needing a midday pick-me-up, this mist delivers an instant surge of hydration and a luminous, non-glittery finish.\nFormulated with light-reflecting particles and nourishing botanicals, the Glow Up Mist seamlessly blends with your skin to erase the look of fatigue and give you that coveted \"glass skin\" effect. It’s the perfect final touch to lock in your look and the quickest refresh to revive it.\nKey Benefits & Features:\n💦 Instant Hydration Boost: Provides an immediate surge of moisture to refresh and plump dehydrated skin, relieving tightness and dryness.\n✨ Luminous Finish: Features subtle, light-reflecting pearls that catch the light to give your skin a natural, dewy, and lit-from-within glow—without any chunky glitter.\n🔒 Makeup Setting & Blending: Gently sets your makeup for longer wear while melting powders into the skin for a seamless, airbrushed finish that never looks cakey.\n🌿 Skin-Loving Ingredients: Enriched with soothing and brightening agents like Niacinamide or Botanical Extracts (e.g., Aloe, Green Tea) to calm the skin and promote an even tone.\n🌞 Anytime, Anywhere Refresh: The perfect compact size for your desk, gym bag, or purse to combat dryness, reduce shine, and revitalize your look throughout the day.\n** Fine Mist Technology:** Delivers an even, lightweight, and gentle mist that won\'t disrupt makeup or feel sticky on the skin.\nWho Is It For?\nThe Primaderm Glow Up Mist is ideal for:\nAll skin types, especially dry, combination, and dull-looking skin.\nMakeup wearers looking for a hydrating setting spray that adds radiance.\nAnyone seeking an instant refresh to rehydrate and revitalize their skin during the day.\nSkincare enthusiasts wanting to add a step of luminosity to their routine.\nHow To Use:\nFor a Skincare Boost: After cleansing, or anytime skin feels dry, hold the bottle 20-30 cm from your face. Close your eyes and mist generously. Gently pat into the skin until absorbed.\nAs a Makeup Primer: Spritz over a clean face before applying foundation to create a hydrated, glowing base.\nTo Set & Melt Makeup: After completing your makeup, lightly mist over your face to set everything in place and blend powders for a natural finish.\nFor a Midday Refresh: Throughout the day, spray over or under makeup to rejuvenate your glow and add hydration.', 2290.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 160.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Primaderm Glow Up Mist 50mlPrice in BD', 'Primaderm Glow Up Mist 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'primaderm-glow-up-mist-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2022, 'NanoWhite Fresh Miracle Mist', '1', 0, 59, 393, '2022', '2022', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The multi-active mist is scientifically crafted to tone, hydrate and prep skin for acne treatment while controlling excess oil production\nSuitability: For All Skin Types\nBenefits\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, spray evenly to face and neck with eyes closed.Use after cleansing or anytime as a hydrating mist', 949.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 811.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'NanoWhite Fresh Miracle MistPrice in BD', 'NanoWhite Fresh Miracle Mist Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'nanowhite-fresh-miracle-mist', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:34', '2026-02-11 13:41:34'),
(2023, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Glutathione Serum Mist 100ml', '1', 0, 59, 96, '2023', '2023', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Medicube PDRN Pink Glutathione Serum Mist is a lightweight, multi-functional facial mist that combines the hydration of a toner with the potency of a serum. Designed to refresh and revitalize tired skin, it works to combat dullness and the early signs of aging. The spray delivers a fine mist that absorbs quickly, providing an instant boost of moisture and leaving the skin with a radiant, dewy finish.', 2070.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Spray', 0.00, 1, NULL, 230.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube PDRN Pink Glutathione Serum Mist 100mlPrice in BD', 'Medicube PDRN Pink Glutathione Serum Mist 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-pdrn-pink-glutathione-serum-mist-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2024, 'Bionnex Glycolic Acid 8% + Aloe Vera +Birch Toner 100ml', '1', 0, 60, 107, '2024', '2024', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Revitalize your skin with Arogga!\nThe Bionnex Glycolic Acid 8% + Aloe Vera + Birch Toner is a powerful yet gentle exfoliating toner designed to rejuvenate and refresh your skin. Infused with 8% Glycolic Acid, Aloe Vera, and Birch Extract, this toner helps to remove dead skin cells, unclog pores, and promote a brighter, smoother complexion. Perfect for all skin types, it’s your go-to solution for achieving radiant and healthy-looking skin.\n8% Glycolic Acid:\nGently exfoliates the skin, removing dead skin cells and promoting cell turnover.\nHelps to reduce the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and uneven skin texture.\nAloe Vera:\nSoothes and hydrates the skin, reducing irritation and redness caused by exfoliation.\nBirch Extract:\nRich in antioxidants, it helps to tone and tighten the skin while improving elasticity.\nDeep Cleansing:\nEffectively unclogs pores, reducing the risk of acne and blackheads.\nBrightening Effect:\nPromotes a brighter, more even skin tone by reducing dark spots and hyperpigmentation.\nLightweight and Non-Greasy:\nAbsorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy residue.\nSuitable for All Skin Types:\nGentle enough for daily use and suitable for sensitive skin.\nCleanse your face thoroughly before application.\nApply a small amount of toner to a cotton pad.\nGently swipe the cotton pad across your face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\nUse once daily, preferably in the evening, and follow up with a moisturizer.\nAlways use sunscreen during the day, as Glycolic Acid can increase sun sensitivity.\nExfoliates: Removes dead skin cells for a smoother complexion.\nHydrates: Aloe Vera soothes and moisturizes the skin.\nBrightens: Reduces dark spots and evens out skin tone.\nTightens: Birch Extract improves skin elasticity and firmness.\nPrevents Acne: Keeps pores clean and reduces breakouts.\nEffective Formula: Combines the power of Glycolic Acid with soothing Aloe Vera and Birch Extract.\nGentle Exfoliation: Perfect for daily use without over-drying the skin.\nSkin Rejuvenation: Promotes a youthful, radiant glow.\nVersatile: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n1 x Bionnex Glycolic Acid 8% + Aloe Vera + Birch Toner 100ml\nThe Bionnex Glycolic Acid 8% + Aloe Vera + Birch Toner is your ultimate skincare solution for achieving a refreshed, glowing complexion. Whether you\'re targeting dullness, uneven texture, or acne-prone skin, this toner delivers visible results with regular use.\nOrder now from Arogga and give your skin the care it deserves! ✨\n🔗 Order Now: https://www.arogga.com', 2641.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 4.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionnex Glycolic Acid 8% + Aloe Vera +Birch Toner 100mlPrice in BD', 'Bionnex Glycolic Acid 8% + Aloe Vera +Birch Toner 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionnex-glycolic-acid-8-aloe-vera-birch-toner-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2025, 'Dabo 30 Days Green Tea Avocado Nourishing Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 60, 207, '2025', '2025', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dabo 30 Days Green Tea Avocado Nourishing Toner is a revitalizing skincare solution designed to hydrate, calm, and balance the skin. Infused with antioxidant-rich green tea and nourishing avocado extract, this toner helps soothe irritation, replenish moisture, and prepare the skin for the next steps in your routine. Ideal for all skin types, especially dry, sensitive, or troubled skin.\nKey Features\nUsageAfter cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to a cotton pad or directly to the palms. Gently sweep or pat onto the face and neck. Use morning and evening for best results.\nWhy Choose This Product\nBenefits', 899.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 401.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dabo 30 Days Green Tea Avocado Nourishing Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'Dabo 30 Days Green Tea Avocado Nourishing Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dabo-30-days-green-tea-avocado-nourishing-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2026, 'APLB Glutathione 15.2% Niacinamide Facial Toner 160ml', '1', 0, 60, 4, '2026', '2026', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'APLB Glutathione Niacinamide Facial Toner 160ml\nWater, Centella Asiatica Extract (13.1%), Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Niacinamide (20,000ppm), Hydroxyethyl Urea, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Panthenol, Glutathione (1,000ppm), Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Beta-Glucan, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extract, Adenosine, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Squalane, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Glyceryl Stearate, Cholesterol, Xanthan Gum, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Styrene/Acrylates Copolymer, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate\nMore Ingridients:\nPour a small amount onto a cotton pad and swipe it across the face after cleansing and before applying serum or moisturizer.\nStatements regarding dietary supplements have not been evaluated by the FDA and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or health condition.', 1250.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 550.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Glutathione 15.2% Niacinamide Facial Toner 160mlPrice in BD', 'APLB Glutathione 15.2% Niacinamide Facial Toner 160ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-glutathione-152-niacinamide-facial-toner-160ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2027, 'LAIKOU Vitamin C Brightening Toner', '1', 0, 60, 8, '2027', '2027', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'With the ingredient selected from high grade Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate in France, pure Vitamin C and Citrus Tangerina (Tangerine) Extract, it can effectively whiten skin and lighten blemishes and acne marks. With the refreshing texture, it can delay skin aging and make your skin bright and young！\nWhat benefits for vitamin c?Vitamin c can inhibit the oxidation of melanocytes, prevent pigmentation and lighten the spots.With strong antioxidant function, it can help promote collagen. Skin care products contain good quality vitamin c can effectively fade blemishes, smooth wrinkles and brighten the complexion.\nHow to useTake a few drops of the toner on the plam, apply evenly on the whole face and pat gently until it is absorbed.\n\n', 253.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 297.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'LAIKOU Vitamin C Brightening TonerPrice in BD', 'LAIKOU Vitamin C Brightening Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-vitamin-c-brightening-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
