(2031, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner', '1', 0, 61, 16, '2031', '2031', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner (210ml) is a gentle exfoliating toner formulated to soothe, hydrate, and brighten the skin. Enriched with 84% Centella Asiatica extract from Madagascar, it is suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\nKey Features:\nCentella Asiatica Extract (84%): Known for its soothing and healing properties, it calms irritated skin and provides deep hydration.\nPHA (Gluconolactone): A mild exfoliant that gently removes dead skin cells, promoting a smoother and brighter complexion without irritating sensitive skin.\nNiacinamide: A form of Vitamin B3 that brightens skin tone and reduces the appearance of pores.\nHyaluronic Acid: Provides intense hydration, leaving the skin plump and moisturized.\nBetaine: Maintains the skin\'s moisture balance and enhances elasticity.\nBenefits:\nSoothing and Calming: Ideal for sensitive skin, it alleviates redness and irritation.\nGentle Exfoliation: Removes dead skin cells, enhancing skin texture and radiance.\nHydration: Deeply moisturizes, preventing dryness and maintaining skin elasticity.\nBrightening: Improves uneven skin tone, giving a luminous complexion.\nHow to Use:\nAfter Cleansing: Apply an appropriate amount to a cotton pad or your palms.\nApplication: Gently pat onto the face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\nAbsorption: Allow the toner to fully absorb before proceeding with your skincare routine.\nMade in Korea', 1628.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '210ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1072.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Toning TonerPrice in BD', 'Skin 1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-toning-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2032, 'Medicube Zero Pore Pads 2.0', '1', 0, 62, 96, '2032', '2032', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Medicube Zero Pore Pads 2.0 – Refine & Refresh Your Skin\nMedicube Zero Pore Pads 2.0 are dermatologist-tested, dual-textured toner pads designed to minimize the appearance of pores, exfoliate dead skin cells, and control excess sebum. Infused with AHA, BHA, and Centella Asiatica extract, these pads gently cleanse and refine skin for a smoother, clearer complexion.\nMinimizes Pores – Deeply cleanses and tightens enlarged pores for a refined look.Gentle Exfoliation – AHA and BHA remove dead skin cells and impurities without irritation.Sebum Control – Helps balance oil production to prevent clogged pores and breakouts.Soothing & Hydrating – Enriched with Centella Asiatica and plant extracts to calm and nourish skin.Hypoallergenic Formula – Suitable for sensitive skin, tested for safety and effectiveness.\nAchieve smooth, poreless skin effortlessly with Medicube Zero Pore Pads 2.0!', 2601.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1449.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Medicube Zero Pore Pads 2.0Price in BD', 'Medicube Zero Pore Pads 2.0 Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'medicube-zero-pore-pads-20', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2033, 'Laikou Rice Milky Toner 100ml', '1', 0, 62, 8, '2033', '2033', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Laikou Rice Milky Toner 100mlLaikou Rice Milky Toner is a nourishing and hydrating toner enriched with 94.4% fermented rice extract to improve skin texture, balance tone, and enhance natural radiance. This lightweight milky formula delivers essential vitamins and amino acids to the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and refreshed. Available at the best price in Bangladesh from Arogga with assured product authenticity.\nKey Features:• 94.4% Fermented Rice Extract – Deeply nourishes skin and improves softness and suppleness.• Korean Rice Ferment – Rich in amino acids to support radiant and healthy-looking skin.• Niacinamide Infused – Helps balance uneven skin tone and enhance clarity.• Witch Hazel Water – Assists in oil control and refines skin texture.• Milky Hydrating Texture – Absorbs easily without heaviness or stickiness.\nBenefits:• Deeply hydrates and nourishes dull, tired skin.• Improves skin texture for a smoother, softer feel.• Helps brighten complexion and promote an even skin tone.• Maintains oil-moisture balance for fresh, healthy-looking skin.\nIngredients:Water (Aqua), Glycerin, Cyclopentasiloxane, Butylene Glycol, Isopropyl Palmitate, C20-22 Alkyl Phosphate, C20-22 Alcohols, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polysorbate 60, Sorbitan Isostearate, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Saccharomyces/Rice Ferment Filtrate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Pentylene Glycol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Ethylhexylglycerin, Rice Extract, Niacinamide & More.\nUsage Direction:Apply an appropriate amount of toner onto a cotton pad or fingertips and gently sweep across the face and neck. Pat lightly until fully absorbed. Use daily as part of your skincare routine.Made in PRC', 350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '100ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laikou Rice Milky Toner 100mlPrice in BD', 'Laikou Rice Milky Toner 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laikou-rice-milky-toner-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
