(2039, 'Bioaqua Rice Raw Pulp Toner with Added Rice Extract', '1', 0, 62, 69, '2039', '2039', NULL, NULL, NULL, '​Bioaqua Rice Raw Pulp Toner is a facial toner formulated to hydrate, brighten, and improve skin texture. Enriched with rice extract and other botanical ingredients, it aims to provide a comprehensive skincare solution.​\nRice Extract (Oryza Sativa): Deeply hydrates and softens the skin, evens out skin tone, and helps reduce pigmentation. It also stimulates tissue regeneration, smooths wrinkles, and rejuvenates the skin, leaving it smooth and matte. ​\nGrape Seed Extract (Vitis Vinifera): Offers antioxidant and anti-inflammatory effects, normalizing the skin\'s hydro-lipid balance. ​\nPomegranate Extract: Rich in vitamins and microelements, it contributes to intensive nourishment, regeneration, and skin rejuvenation. ​\nAllantoin: Soothes and protects the skin, promoting healing.​\nLicorice Root Extract (Glycyrrhiza Glabra): Known for its skin-brightening and anti-inflammatory properties.​\nVolume: 120 ml​\nSkin Types: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.​\nFunctions: Hydration, toning, brightening, anti-aging, and improving skin elasticity.​\nTexture: Lightweight, absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky residue.​\nAfter cleansing your face, apply a small amount of toner to a cotton pad.​\nGently wipe the cotton pad over your face, avoiding the eye area.​\nFollow up with your regular serum or moisturizer.​\nFor best results, use twice daily—morning and evening.​', 434.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 216.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioaqua Rice Raw Pulp Toner with Added Rice ExtractPrice in BD', 'Bioaqua Rice Raw Pulp Toner with Added Rice Extract Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioaqua-rice-raw-pulp-toner-with-added-rice-extract', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
