(2042, 'YC Retinol Pore Refining Anti Aging Facial Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 62, 76, '2042', '2042', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'YC Facial Toner contains Retinol and pure mineral water to helps refine skin texture in the first step of skincare, ensuring a smooth base for makeup application. This Toner is particularly effective due to its inclusion of Retinol (Vitamin A), helps to neutralize free radicals, Reduce the appearance of wrinkles and enlarged pores. Its anti-aging, skin exfoliation, collagen-stimulant. Make your skin brighten and healthy. Additionally, the high concentration of tea tree extract and hyaluronic acid in this pore refining and provides continuous hydration to the skin. It keeps the skin refresh and healthy.\nYC Retinol Facial Toner is a specially formulated liquid toner enriched with active retinol and nourishing botanical extracts. Designed to refine pores, reduce the appearance of fine lines, and promote a smoother, healthier complexion, this toner is suitable for daily skincare routines aimed at anti-aging and skin rejuvenation. Packaged in a sleek 150ml bottle, it offers an easy and effective way to enhance your skincare regimen.', 787.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 108.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'YC Retinol Pore Refining Anti Aging Facial Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'YC Retinol Pore Refining Anti Aging Facial Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yc-retinol-pore-refining-anti-aging-facial-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2043, 'Axis-Y Daily Purifying Treatment Toner', '1', 0, 62, 12, '2043', '2043', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The AXIS-Y Daily Purifying Treatment Toner is a gentle yet effective solution for maintaining clear, calm, and healthy skin. Designed to remove bacteria, pollution, and impurities from deep within the pores, this toner purifies while soothing irritation and preventing acne. With an enhanced formula featuring increased AHA, PHA, and Centella Asiatica, it delivers gentle exfoliation and soothing care for all skin types.\nGive your skin the care it deserves with AXIS-Y Daily Purifying Treatment Toner—your go-to solution for purified, balanced, and radiant skin!', 1110.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 540.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Axis-Y Daily Purifying Treatment TonerPrice in BD', 'Axis-Y Daily Purifying Treatment Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'axis-y-daily-purifying-treatment-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2044, 'YC AHA Facial Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 62, 76, '2044', '2044', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'YC AHA Facial Toner 150ml\nProduct Description:YC AHA Facial Toner is a refreshing and skin-renewing toner formulated with AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid) and pure mineral water to refine skin texture and promote a smoother, more radiant complexion. It gently exfoliates dead skin cells, clears impurities, and helps tighten pores for a refined look. Enriched with Tea Tree Extract and Hyaluronic Acid, this toner not only clarifies the skin but also delivers lasting hydration, leaving your skin refreshed, soft, and healthy.\n\nKey Benefits:\nGently Exfoliates: AHA removes dead skin cells and impurities, improving skin texture and clarity.\nHydrates & Refreshes: Hyaluronic acid provides continuous moisture for a supple, hydrated complexion.\nPore Refining: Helps tighten and minimize pores for smoother-looking skin.\nBalances Oil & Moisture: Tea tree extract helps balance sebum production and prevent breakouts.\nPrepares Skin for Skincare: Creates a smooth, clean base for better absorption of skincare products or makeup.\nBrightens Complexion: Promotes a radiant and even skin tone with regular use.\n\nHow to Use:After cleansing, apply a small amount of toner to a cotton pad or your hands and gently pat onto the face and neck. Use daily, morning and night, before applying serum or moisturizer.\nSuitable For: All skin types, especially dull or uneven skin.\nCountry of Origin: Thailand.', 787.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 108.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'YC AHA Facial Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'YC AHA Facial Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yc-aha-facial-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2045, 'Neutrogena Blackhead Eliminating 0.5% Salicylic Acid Cleansing Toner', '1', 0, 62, 151, '2045', '2045', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NEUTROGENA Blackhead Eliminating Cleansing Toner is clinically proven to help eliminate and prevent blackheads. Developed with dermatologists, it is a targeted cleansing toner formulated with powerful blackhead-fighting ingredients. By reaching deep down to remove dirt and oil trapped in your pores, the impurities that can lead to blackheads, this face toner leaves the complexion looking visibly refined.', 899.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 501.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Blackhead Eliminating 0.5% Salicylic Acid Cleansing TonerPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Blackhead Eliminating 0.5% Salicylic Acid Cleansing Toner Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-blackhead-eliminating-05-salicylic-acid-cleansing-toner', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35');
