(2046, 'Skin Cafe Rose Water Face and Body Mist', '1', 0, 62, 224, '2046', '2046', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nRose water is well known for its hydrating, revitalizing and moisturizing attributes. It deeply nourishes your skin and keeps your skin moisturized.\nSkin Cafe 100% Natural Rose Water helps clean the pore and tone the skin. It brings a natural glow on the face at the same time.\nThis rose water helps control excess sebum production and improves the appearance of pores. Those who face the problem of excess oil production in the skin will get benefitted by this product.\nSkin Cafe 100% Natural Rose helps maintain skin’s pH level and gives skin a fresh and healthy look.\nWho can use Skin Cafe 100% Natural Rose Water\nDisclaimer\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n', 264.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 56.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe Rose Water Face and Body MistPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe Rose Water Face and Body Mist Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-rose-water-face-and-body-mist', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2047, 'YC Niacinamide Facial Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 62, 76, '2047', '2047', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'YC Niacinamide Facial Toner 150ml\nProduct Description:YC Niacinamide Facial Toner is a skin-perfecting toner enriched with Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) and pure mineral water to refine skin texture, even out skin tone, and create a smooth base for makeup. This advanced formula works to brighten dull skin, reduce dark spots, and minimize the appearance of fine lines and pores. With Tea Tree Extract and Hyaluronic Acid, it delivers lasting hydration while balancing oil levels, leaving your skin refreshed, radiant, and healthy.\n\nKey Benefits:\nBrightens & Evens Skin Tone: Niacinamide helps reduce pigmentation, discoloration, and redness for a more luminous complexion.\nMinimizes Fine Lines & Wrinkles: Stimulates collagen production, improving elasticity and smoothness.\nPore Refining: Helps tighten pores and control excess oil for clearer skin.\nDeeply Hydrating: Hyaluronic acid locks in moisture, keeping skin plump and soft.\nBalances & Calms Skin: Tea tree extract soothes irritation and helps maintain a healthy skin barrier.\nPrepares Skin for Skincare: Creates the perfect base for better absorption of subsequent skincare products or makeup.\n\nHow to Use:After cleansing, apply a small amount of toner to a cotton pad or your palms and gently pat onto the face and neck. Use daily, morning and night, before serum or moisturizer.\nSuitable For: All skin types, especially dull, uneven, or aging skin.\nCountry of Origin: Thailand.', 895.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -895.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'YC Niacinamide Facial Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'YC Niacinamide Facial Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'yc-niacinamide-facial-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2048, 'Good Molecules Niacinamide Brightening Toner 120ml', '1', 0, 62, 395, '2048', '2048', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brighten, Balance & Refine Your Skin\nReveal a radiant, even complexion with Good Molecules Niacinamide Brightening Toner. This alcohol-free, skin-loving formula is packed with powerful brightening and pore-refining ingredients to improve dullness, uneven skin tone, and enlarged pores.\n✔ Evens Skin Tone & Reduces Dullness – Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) brightens and strengthens the skin barrier.✔ Minimizes Enlarged Pores – Helps refine skin texture for a smooth, flawless look.✔ Targets Hyperpigmentation – Arbutin and Licorice Root Extract work to fade dark spots and reduce excess melanin production.✔ Antioxidant Protection – Vitamin C defends against free radicals and boosts collagen production for firmer skin.✔ Gentle & Effective – Vegan, alcohol-free, and cruelty-free, making it perfect for all skin types, even sensitive skin.\n💦 Apply onto a cotton pad or dispense into palms and gently pat onto freshly cleansed skin until fully absorbed.🌞 Use daily for brighter, smoother, and more even skin.\n📏 Size: 120ml | 🧴 pH: 6.2 | 🌱 Vegan & Cruelty-Free\nAchieve a refreshed, brighter complexion with Good Molecules Niacinamide Brightening Toner – your skin’s daily dose of glow! ✨', 2705.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1670.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Good Molecules Niacinamide Brightening Toner 120mlPrice in BD', 'Good Molecules Niacinamide Brightening Toner 120ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'good-molecules-niacinamide-brightening-toner-120ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2049, 'Anua Azelaic Acid 3+ Cica Skin Clarifying Toner 250ml', '1', 0, 63, 21, '2049', '2049', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Anua Azelaic Acid 3+ Cica Skin Clarifying Toner (250ml) is a lightweight, non-comedogenic toner specially formulated to soothe irritated, blemish-prone skin. Designed to reduce redness, refine skin texture, and support a healthy barrier, it combines powerful actives with gentle hydration for clearer, calmer skin.\n\nKey Features\n\nUsage\n\nIngredients\nWater, Azelaic Acid 3%, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Hydroxide, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Cynanchum Atratum Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Oil, Epilobium Angustifolium Flower/Leaf/Stem Extract, Althaea Rosea Flower Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Protein, Centella Asiatica Leaf Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Centella Asiatica Root Extract, Xylose, Chlorella Vulgaris Extract, Propylene Glycol, Salicylic Acid, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Propanediol, PPG-13-Decyltetradeceth-24, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Ethylhexylglycerin, Docosahexaenoic Acid, Citric Acid, Tocopherol, Madecassoside, Panthenol, Asiaticoside, Allantoin, Ectoin, Glycyrrhizic Acid, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Succinic Acid, Zinc PCA, Glycolic Acid, Potassium Azeloyl Diglycinate, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Polygutamic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Madecassic Acid, Totoral, Squalane, Ceramide NP, Disodium EDTA, o-Cymen-5-ol\n\nBenefits', 2600.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '250ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Azelaic Acid 3+ Cica Skin Clarifying Toner 250mlPrice in BD', 'Anua Azelaic Acid 3+ Cica Skin Clarifying Toner 250ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-azelaic-acid-3-cica-skin-clarifying-toner-250ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2050, 'Pixi Glow Tonic', '1', 0, 63, 396, '2050', '2050', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Pixi Glow Tonic is a highly concentrated, invigorating facial toner that deeply cleans pores by sweeping away excess oil and impurities.\n• Formulated with 5% Glycolic Acid.• Exfoliates, brightens and smooths skin.• Aloe Vera, Ginseng and Botanical extracts work together to nourish and treat.• Instant glow enhancer.• Alcohol-free• Suitable for all skin types• Paraben-free• Not tested on animals• Volume: 100 ml / 3.4 fl oz\nRemove excess oils and impurities with Pixi Glow Tonic in its 100ml size from Pixi Beauty. This award-winning, invigorating toner deeply cleanses and gently exfoliates all skin types in one lovely step. Our unique formula is enriched with 5% Glycolic Acid that gently wipes away impurities from your pores, while Aloe Vera soothes and hydrates your skin. Infused with red Ginseng, this Skintreats essential helps to protect and energize your skin. Use it in the AM or PM for a healthier, balanced complexion that\'s ready to glow. With Pixi Glow Tonic, your skin will be balanced, soothed, radiant and prepped for makeup application.\nHow to Use:\nUse: Either in the AM and PM or when needed.• Step 1: Cleanse your face.• Step 2: Saturate a cotton pad with the Glow Tonic and sweep across face, neck and décolletage (avoiding the eye area).• Step 3: Follow with a serum or moisturizer.\nIngredients:\n• Glycolic Acid (5%) exfoliates• Ginseng improves circulation & energizes• Aloe Vera soothes & hydrates• Fructose & Sucrose brightenThis alcohol-free tonic is never tested on animals.\n\nMade in England', 1900.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 950.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pixi Glow TonicPrice in BD', 'Pixi Glow Tonic Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'pixi-glow-tonic', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2051, 'Anua BHA 2+ Ceramides Gentle Exfoliating Toner 150ml', '1', 0, 63, 21, '2051', '2051', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gentle Yet Powerful Exfoliation for Clearer, Smoother Skin\nAnua BHA 2% Gentle Exfoliating Toner is a leave-on exfoliator formulated with 2% BHA (Salicylic Acid) to unclog pores, remove dead skin cells, and refine skin texture. This non-abrasive, non-irritating formula helps combat excess sebum, oiliness, and breakouts, making it a must-have for clear, healthy skin.\n✔ Unclogs Pores & Prevents Breakouts – 2% BHA exfoliates deep within pores to dissolve excess oil and prevent acne.✔ Smooths & Brightens Skin – Gently removes dead skin cells for a radiant, even complexion.✔ Hydrates & Protects – Panthenol & 6 Ceramides strengthen the skin barrier and prevent moisture loss.✔ Soothes & Calms Irritated Skin – Tea Tree Leaf Extract & Hyaluronic Acid reduce redness and sensitivity.✔ Fragrance-Free & Cruelty-Free – No unnecessary additives, just effective skincare.\n🔹 Apply onto a cotton pad or hands and gently pat onto cleansed skin.🔹 Use 2-3 times a week, gradually increasing frequency if tolerated.🔹 Follow with moisturizer & SPF (daytime use) to protect your skin.\nAchieve clearer, smoother, and healthier skin with Anua BHA 2% Gentle Exfoliating Toner – your ultimate pore-refining and breakout-fighting solution! ✨', 2167.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1983.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua BHA 2+ Ceramides Gentle Exfoliating Toner 150mlPrice in BD', 'Anua BHA 2+ Ceramides Gentle Exfoliating Toner 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-bha-2-ceramides-gentle-exfoliating-toner-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2052, 'Healthy Shop Essential Toner with White Tea & Peach  Extract for Dry Skin – 150ml (HP-113-C)', '1', 0, 63, 43, '2052', '2052', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Healthy Shop Essential Toner with White Tea & Peach Extract for Dry Skin – 150ml (HP-113-C)\nProduct Overview:The Healthy Shop Essential Toner HP-113-C is specifically formulated for dry skin. Enriched with natural White Tea and Peach extracts, it hydrates, soothes, and revitalizes the skin, leaving it feeling refreshed, soft, and nourished.\nKey Features:\nWhite Tea Extract: Provides antioxidant protection and helps maintain a clear complexion.\nPeach Extract: Moisturizes and revitalizes skin, promoting softness and smoothness.\nHydration: Deeply hydrates dry skin for a refreshed feeling.\nSoothing: Calms irritation and reduces redness or discomfort.\nRefreshing Sensation: Leaves skin feeling cool, clean, and invigorated.\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Start with a gentle cleanser for dry skin.\nApply Toner: Pour a small amount onto a cotton pad.\nGently Swipe: Apply across the face and neck, focusing on dry areas.\nFollow Up: Allow absorption before applying serum or moisturizer.\nIngredients:Purified Water, Alcohol Denat, Propylene Glycol, Panthenol, Methylsilanol Mannuronate, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Disodium EDTA, Methylparaben, Lavender Essential Oil, Sodium Methylparaben, Sorbic Acid, Propylparaben, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract (White Tea), Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract, CI 42090.\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs and consult a dermatologist.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStorage:Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.', 1383.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 97.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Healthy Shop Essential Toner with White Tea & Peach  Extract for Dry Skin – 150ml (HP-113-C)Price in BD', 'Healthy Shop Essential Toner with White Tea & Peach  Extract for Dry Skin – 150ml (HP-113-C) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'healthy-shop-essential-toner-with-white-tea-peach-extract-for-dry-skin-150ml-hp-113-c', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2053, 'Healthy Shop Essential Toner with White Tea & Grape Seed Extract for Oily Skin – 150ml (HP-113-B)', '1', 0, 63, 43, '2053', '2053', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Overview:The Healthy Shop Essential Toner HP-113-B is specially formulated for oily and combination skin. Infused with White Tea and Grape Seed extracts, this toner helps cleanse, tighten pores, and balance oil production, leaving skin refreshed, revitalized, and naturally radiant.\nKey Features:\nWhite Tea Extract: Rich in antioxidants, protects skin from environmental stressors and promotes a clear complexion.\nGrape Seed Extract: Helps tighten pores, control excess sebum, and prevent blemishes.\nOil Control: Reduces shine and balances oil levels for a matte, fresh finish.\nPore Tightening: Minimizes the appearance of pores for smoother, refined skin.\nRefreshing Sensation: Provides a cooling and invigorating effect, leaving skin feeling clean and revitalized.\nHow to Use:\nCleanse: Start with a gentle cleanser suitable for oily skin.\nApply Toner: Pour a small amount onto a cotton pad.\nGentle Application: Swipe across the face and neck, focusing on oily areas and enlarged pores.\nFollow Up: Allow toner to absorb before applying serum or moisturizer.\nIngredients:Purified Water, Alcohol Denat, Propylene Glycol, Methylsilanol Mannuronate, Panthenol, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Disodium EDTA, Methylparaben, Lavender Essential Oil, Sodium Methylparaben, Sorbic Acid, Propylparaben, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract (White Tea), Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Extract, CI 42090.\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs and consult a dermatologist.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStorage:Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight to maintain effectiveness.', 1383.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 97.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Healthy Shop Essential Toner with White Tea & Grape Seed Extract for Oily Skin – 150ml (HP-113-B)Price in BD', 'Healthy Shop Essential Toner with White Tea & Grape Seed Extract for Oily Skin – 150ml (HP-113-B) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'healthy-shop-essential-toner-with-white-tea-grape-seed-extract-for-oily-skin-150ml-hp-113-b', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
