(2066, 'Neutrogena Clear & Defend+ 7% AHA & Panthenol Liquid Exfoliant for Spot Prone Skin', '1', 0, 63, 151, '2066', '2066', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NEUTROGENA® Clear & Defend+ Liquid Exfoliant with AHA + Panthenol supports skin cell renewal for visibly smoother skin in one week, helping remove the dead skin and excess oil that can lead to blemishes. Loaded with a blend of Glycolic & Citric acids (AHAs), it promotes skin cell turnover to fade marks, and refine skin texture; and Panthenol to help support your skin’s vital protective barrier. Formulated with an optimal pH to maximise the efficacy.\npH 3.6\nFragrance-free\nAlcohol-free\n7% AHA [5% Glycolic acid + 2% Citric Acid] increases surface skin cell renewal to fade acne marks & refine skin texture.\n0.5% Panthenol helps to soothe skin & maintain skin\'s moisture barrier.\nNEUTROGENA® Clear & Defend+ Liquid Exfoliant is suitable for spot-prone skin\nThis Liquid Exfoliant is packed with Alpha Hydroxy Acids (AHA): Glycolic & Citric Acids to promote your skin cell turnover, reducing imperfections.\nImproves skin texture in 1 week.\n7 out of 10 users saw skin look smoother and brighter after just one use. (Self-assessment, 110 women)\nAqua, Glycerin, Glycolic Acid, Butylene Glycol, Polysorbate 20, Sodium Hydroxide, Citric Acid, Sodium Benzoate, Panthenol, C12-15 Alkyl Lactate, Cocamidopropyl PG-Dimonium Chloride Phosphate, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Chloride. [PR-0004773]\n\nApply our AHA exfoliant weekly increasing up to daily (if needed) using a cotton pad over dry face and neck. Allow to fully absorb into the skin. Do not rinse.\nImportant: Avoid contact with eyes. In case of contact with eyes, rinse thoroughly with water. Do not use on irritated skin. Discontinue use if irritation occurs. This product contains an alpha hydroxy acid (AHA) that may increase your skin sensitivity to the sun. Avoid sun exposure and protect your skin from sun.', 850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '125ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 675.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Neutrogena Clear & Defend+ 7% AHA & Panthenol Liquid Exfoliant for Spot Prone SkinPrice in BD', 'Neutrogena Clear & Defend+ 7% AHA & Panthenol Liquid Exfoliant for Spot Prone Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'neutrogena-clear-defend-7-aha-panthenol-liquid-exfoliant-for-spot-prone-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
