(2069, 'L\'Oreal Paris Sublime Bronze Tanning Drops & Self-Tanning Towelettes 30ml (USA)', '1', 0, 64, 110, '2069', '2069', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Achieve a radiant, sun-kissed glow with the L\'Oréal Paris Sublime Bronze Tanning Drops & Self-Tanning Towelettes. This duo offers a customizable, streak-free tan for both face and body, suitable for all skin types.\nCustomizable Glow: Mix 5–7 drops with your favorite moisturizer for a subtle tan, or 8–10 drops for a deeper bronze.\nFragrance-Free & Lightweight: Designed specifically for the face, these clear, non-greasy drops blend seamlessly into your skincare routine.\nHydrating Formula: Enriched with hyaluronic acid to keep skin moisturized and smooth.\nStreak-Free Finish: Develops into a natural-looking tan without orange undertones.\nUsage: Apply daily until desired tan is achieved; reapply as needed to maintain color.\nOn-the-Go Application: Pre-moistened towelettes provide a mess-free, quick-drying tanning solution.\nEven Coverage: Each towelette is saturated enough to cover the entire body, delivering a streak-free, natural-looking tan.\nEnhanced Skin Appearance: Formulated with AHAs and Vitamin E to help smooth the look of skin.\nCustomizable Shade: Achieve a tan that ranges from subtle warmth to a bronzed glow.\nUsage: Apply 1–2 times per week to maintain your tan; use more frequently for a deeper color.\nTailored Tanning: Customize your tan with the facial drops and maintain it with the body towelettes.\nConvenient & Travel-Friendly: The towelettes are individually wrapped, making them perfect for on-the-go tanning.\nTrusted Brand: L\'Oréal Paris is renowned for its innovative and high-quality beauty products.\nAchieve a flawless, sun-kissed glow with the L\'Oréal Paris Sublime Bronze Tanning Drops & Self-Tanning Towelettes 30ml—your go-to solution for a radiant complexion year-round.', 3850.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1830.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'L\'Oreal Paris Sublime Bronze Tanning Drops & Self-Tanning Towelettes 30ml (USA)Price in BD', 'L\'Oreal Paris Sublime Bronze Tanning Drops & Self-Tanning Towelettes 30ml (USA) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'loreal-paris-sublime-bronze-tanning-drops-self-tanning-towelettes-30ml-usa', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2070, 'APLB 28.7% Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 Mist Essence 105ml', '1', 0, 64, 4, '2070', '2070', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Formulated with 28.7% Hyaluronic HA B5 CEN, this mist delivers a refreshing burst of moisture to dry skin while maintaining optimal pH balance. Enriched with Centella Asiatica Extract (20.8%) and a Centella 3x Complex, it calms and hydrates sensitive skin exposed to environmental stressors.\nKey Benefits\nHow to UseDispense a moderate amount onto clean skin and gently pat for optimal absorption.\nMajor Ingredients', 950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB 28.7% Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 Mist Essence 105mlPrice in BD', 'APLB 28.7% Hyaluronic Acid Ceramide HA B5 Mist Essence 105ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-287-hyaluronic-acid-ceramide-ha-b5-mist-essence-105ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2071, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Facial Essence – Hyaluronic Acid & Vitamin C, 100ml', '1', 0, 64, 86, '2071', '2071', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Enhance your skincare routine with the Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Facial Essence, a lightweight and fast-absorbing formula infused with 10% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Hyaluronic Acid, and Vitamin C. This essence works to brighten dull skin, refine texture, and hydrate deeply, giving your complexion a smooth, radiant, and balanced appearance.\nKey Ingredients & Benefits:\nNiacinamide (10%): Reduces dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone\nHyaluronic Acid: Provides deep hydration, locks in moisture, and plumps the skin\nVitamin C: Antioxidant protection and promotes collagen production for a youthful glow\nHow to Use:\nAfter cleansing, dispense 1–2 pumps into your palm.\nGently pat onto face and neck until fully absorbed.\nFollow with your serum and moisturizer.\nUse morning and night for best results.\nTexture & Feel:\nLightweight, fast-absorbing essence suitable for daily use\nBenefits:\nBrightens and evens skin tone\nRefines skin texture and minimizes pores\nHydrates and plumps the skin\nProtects and rejuvenates the skin\nSuitable For:\nAll skin types, including sensitive skin\nThose looking to brighten dull skin, minimize pores, and achieve a balanced complexion\nPackaging:\n100ml hygienic pump or dropper bottle\nNotes:\nUse sunscreen during the day to protect skin from UV damage\nCan be used alone or layered with other skincare products', 1673.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 717.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Facial Essence – Hyaluronic Acid & Vitamin C, 100mlPrice in BD', 'Absolute New York Niacinamide 10% Facial Essence – Hyaluronic Acid & Vitamin C, 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'absolute-new-york-niacinamide-10-facial-essence-hyaluronic-acid-vitamin-c-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2072, 'Earth Beauty & You Rose Water With Vitamin C Mist Toner 120ml', '1', 0, 65, 73, '2072', '2072', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Earth Beauty & You Rose Water With Vitamin C Mist Toner 120ml\nOur rose water is made from rose petals with no added extra fragrances. It is a hydrating formula that helps restore moisture, making the skin look fresh. Rose water helps to get the dirt out of the pores and helps maintain the skin’s pH balance. This body toner has an active cleansing agent that penetrates deep into pores to cleanse them, locking in hydration to increase elasticity. Vitamin C is loaded with antioxidants that are known to make your skin radiant and youthful. It helps to destroy the free radicles and enhance the tissue repairment and collagen synthesis for healthy skin.\n\n', 261.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 14.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Earth Beauty & You Rose Water With Vitamin C Mist Toner 120mlPrice in BD', 'Earth Beauty & You Rose Water With Vitamin C Mist Toner 120ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'earth-beauty-you-rose-water-with-vitamin-c-mist-toner-120ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
