(2074, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Gentle Exfoliating Facewash 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 119, '2074', '2074', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mild Scrub • Deep Cleansing • Skin-Calming FormulaMade in Korea | Dermatologically Tested | No Alcohol | Suitable for Sensitive & Acne-Prone Skin\nThe Remedist Gentle Exfoliating Facewash is a mild scrub cleanser specially designed for sensitive and acne-prone skin. Enriched with fine Walnut Powder, it gently exfoliates to remove dead skin cells, unclog pores, and control excess oil, leaving your skin soft, smooth, and refreshed.\nIts advanced formulation contains natural soothing actives that help reduce irritation, redness, and inflammation—making it ideal for daily use.\nA powerful blend of natural anti-inflammatory actives that helps:\n(Korean Patent No: 10-1560526)\n\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.', 1765.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Gentle Exfoliating Facewash 100mlPrice in BD', 'The Remedist by Dr Rhazes Gentle Exfoliating Facewash 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-remedist-by-dr-rhazes-gentle-exfoliating-facewash-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
