(2076, 'Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser for Dry to Normal, Sensitive Skin 125ml', '1', 0, 68, 63, '2076', '2076', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nAbout Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser is a non-soap cleanser that softens the skin as it gently cleanses. While cleansing your skin, Cetaphil leaves your skin\'s natural protective oils intact. It cleanses without harmful foaming or lathering. Developed by Dermatologists Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser was originally developed by dermatologists for patients whose skin was so sensitive they could not even use water without a reaction. Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser has been shown in independent clinical tests using undiluted products (i.e. without water) to be the gentlest non-soap cleanser. Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser - softens as it gently cleanses, can be used with or without water, won\'t sting eyes, is pH balanced, is lanolin and fragrance-free. Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser is suitable for gentle, all-over body cleansing of dry, sensitive, or normal skin. Use Cetaphil with or without water for gentle and convenient cleansing.\nThis leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and healthy. It soothes skin as it cleans, removing dirt and impurities without stripping skin.\nFormulated with Micellar Technology to gently yet effectively remove dirt, makeup, and impurities, plus a dermatologist-backed blend of niacinamide (vitamin B3), panthenol (vitamin B5), and hydrating glycerin to reinforce the skin’s natural moisture barrier. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness, and a weakened skin barrier.\nDirections for use without water: Apply a liberal amount of Cetaphil Gentle Skin cleanser to the skin and rub gently. Remove excess with a soft cloth, leaving a thin film on the skin.\nDirections for use with water: Apply cleanser to the skin and rub gently. Rinse.\n\nFor those who prefer a larger option,  Cetaphil Gentle Skin cleanser is also available in a 250ml Bottle to ensure you have more of your favorite cleanser whenever you need it.', 1239.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 311.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser for Dry to Normal, Sensitive Skin 125mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser for Dry to Normal, Sensitive Skin 125ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-gentle-skin-cleanser-for-dry-to-normal-sensitive-skin-125ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2077, 'Skin Cafe Soothing Aloevera Face Wash with Salicylic Acid for Oily & Acne Prone Skin - 140ml', '1', 0, 68, 224, '2077', '2077', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Skin Cafe Aloe Vera Face Wash contains a powerful blend of antibacterial components such as Aloe Vera, Mint, and Salicylic Acid that work together to effectively remove dirt, excess sebum, and bacteria responsible for acne while preserving the skin’s natural moisture balance and overall health.', 325.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '140ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 70.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe Soothing Aloevera Face Wash with Salicylic Acid for Oily & Acne Prone Skin - 140mlPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe Soothing Aloevera Face Wash with Salicylic Acid for Oily & Acne Prone Skin - 140ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-soothing-aloevera-face-wash-with-salicylic-acid-for-oily-acne-prone-skin-140ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2078, 'Cerave Hydrating Facial Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 87ml', '1', 0, 68, 153, '2078', '2078', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'CeraVe Hydrating Facial Cleanser for Balanced to Dry Skin cleanses and provides 24-hour hydration. Sensitive and dry skin feels soft and comfortable.\n\nStep 1.) Wet skin with lukewarm water​\nStep 2.) Massage cleanser into skin in a gentle, circular motion​\nStep 3.) Rinse.​\n\nPurified Water, Glycerin, Behentrimonium Methosulfate and Cetearyl Alcohol, Ceramide 3, Ceramide 6-11, Ceramide 1, Hyaluronic Acid, Cholesterol, Polyoxyl 40 Stearate, Glyceryl Monostearate, Stearyl Alcohol, Polysorbate 20, Potassium Phosphate, Dipotassium Phosphate, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Cetyl Alcohol, Disodium EDTA, Phytosphingosine, Methylparaben, Propylparaben, Carbomer, Xanthan Gum.CeraVe  Face Cleanser is available in a variety of sizes to suit your skincare needs.', 1175.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 275.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Hydrating Facial Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 87mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Hydrating Facial Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 87ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-hydrating-facial-cleanser-for-normal-to-dry-skin-87ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2079, 'Acefer ZC Face Wash 75ml', '1', 0, 68, 345, '2079', '2079', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anti-Acne • Skin Rejuvenating Gel CleanserWith Salicylic Acid, Glycolic Acid & Aloe Vera\nAcefer ZC Face Wash is an anti-acne gel cleanser specially formulated to cleanse pores, reduce excess oil, and promote clearer, healthier-looking skin. Enriched with Salicylic Acid and Glycolic Acid, it exfoliates gently to remove dead skin cells, unclog pores, and help prevent breakouts.\nThe soothing and refreshing properties of Aloe Vera Extract help calm irritation, while Vitamin E beads nourish and protect the skin from environmental stress. The lightweight gel formula purifies, rejuvenates, and refreshes the skin, making it ideal for oily, acne-prone, or dull skin types.\nHelps reduce acne and prevent future breakouts\nDeeply cleanses and purifies pores\nControls excess oil without overdrying\nSupports skin rejuvenation and improved texture\nContains exfoliating acids for clearer, smoother skin\nAloe Vera helps soothe and refresh the skin\nSuitable for daily use\nWet face thoroughly with water.\nApply a small amount of Acefer ZC Face Wash.\nGently massage over the face for 20–30 seconds, avoiding the eyes and surrounding areas.\nRinse well with water and pat dry.\nFor external use only.\nSodium Laureth Sulfate, Cocamide MEA, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Aloe Vera Extract, Salicylic Acid, Glycolic Acid, Acrylates Crosspolymer-4, Phenoxyethanol, Vitamin E Beads, Perfume, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Chloride, Purified Water.\nKeep out of reach of children\nDo not use in children below 3 years\nStore below 30°C\nProtect from light\nFor external use only', 1161.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 129.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Acefer ZC Face Wash 75mlPrice in BD', 'Acefer ZC Face Wash 75ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acefer-zc-face-wash-75ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2080, 'Care:Nel Cicavita B5 Salicylic Acid Gentle Cleanser 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 216, '2080', '2080', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Details:\n1. Cica & Tea Tree Soothing Solution : Effective for skin soothing and trouble care Centella asiatica extract and tea tree prescription quickly soothe sensitive skin and make it moist and healthy. Skin that has become sensitive due to harmful external stimuli cannot be soothed with water. Cicavita B5 Salicylic Acid Gentle Cleanser quickly soothes sensitive skin caused by constant skin irritation caused by bad air, masks, and stress.2. Trouble Care & skin Soothing with Tea Tree Extract : Tea tree which is sensitive to external stimuli. Effectively soothes irritated skin.3. Clear skin tone without blemishes: Tranexamic Acid smoothes uneven skin and dull skin tone, adds a healthy glow, and fills up from the inside. Helps to clear skin tone and manage blemishes.4. Hypoallergenic Pore & Dead Skin Care : Contains salicylic acid, which is stable on the skin, and removes dead skin cells on the surface of the skin and wastes in pores without irritation, maintaining damaged skin and skin tone in a healthy way.5. Strengthen skin barrier : Vitamin B5 Panthenol has high penetration into sensitive and weakened skin.Absorbed to supply nutrients and moisture, and strengthen the skin barrier. Helps make you stronger. Mothers Day Gifts From Daughter Unique.\nBenefits:\n\nHow to use:\nIngredients:\nWater, Glycerin, Palmitic Acid, Myristic Acid, Stearic Acid, Lauric Acid, Potassium Hydroxide, Glyceryl Stearate, Sodium Cocoyl Alaninate, Centella Asiatica Extract (1%), Beeswax, Potassium Benzoate, Fragrance, Tranexamic Acid, Panthenol (0.1%), Gluconolactone, Polyquaternium-7, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract (0.1%), Disodium EDTA, Salicylic Acid (0.1%), Capric Acid, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethylhexylglycerin\n\nMade in Korea\n', 1487.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 263.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Care:Nel Cicavita B5 Salicylic Acid Gentle Cleanser 150mlPrice in BD', 'Care:Nel Cicavita B5 Salicylic Acid Gentle Cleanser 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'carenel-cicavita-b5-salicylic-acid-gentle-cleanser-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2081, 'Reju Face Wash 100gm', '1', 0, 68, 150, '2081', '2081', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Features:\nProduct Description:\nExperience the power of deep cleansing and pore refinement with Reju Face Wash. This invigorating face wash effectively removes dirt, oil, and impurities, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and revitalized.\nReju Face Wash is formulated with a unique blend of ingredients that work together to cleanse, exfoliate, and hydrate your skin. The deep-cleaning action helps to remove dirt, oil, and impurities from deep within your pores, preventing clogged pores and breakouts. The gentle exfoliating action helps to remove dead skin cells, revealing a brighter, more radiant complexion.\nReju Face Wash also contains moisturizing agents that help to prevent over-drying and maintain your skin\'s natural moisture balance. This helps to keep your skin feeling soft, smooth, and hydrated.\nBenefits:\nOrder Reju Face Wash today and experience the power of deep cleansing and pore refinement.', 1350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1350.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Reju Face Wash 100gmPrice in BD', 'Reju Face Wash 100gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'reju-face-wash-100gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
(2082, 'BREYLEE Acne Treatment  Facial Cleanser', '1', 0, 68, 212, '2082', '2082', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ingredients:\nAQUA, GLYCERIN, MYRISTIC ACID, STEARIC ACID, POTASSIUM HYDROXIDE, LAURIC ACID, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, POTASSIUM COCOYL GLYCINATE, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, GLYCERYL STEARATE SE, COCAMIDE MEA, HYDROXYPROPYL METHYLCELLULOSE, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, SALICYLIC ACID, GLYCOLIC ACID, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE, LACTOBACILLUS/PEAR JUICE FERMENT FILTRATE, OUBAKU EKISU, SALIX ALBA (WILLOW) BARK EXTRACT, REHMANNIA CHINENSIS ROOT EXTRACT, MELIA AZADIRACHTA LEAF EXTRACT, SCUTELLARIA BAICALENSIS ROOT EXTRACT, HOUTTUYNIA CORDATA EXTRACT, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) PROTEIN, MELALEUCA ALTERNIFOLIA (TEA TREE) LEAF OIL.\nHow to use\nWet face. Apply a small amount to wet hands and create a lather. Gently massage into skin in a gentle, circular motion, concentrating on troubled areas such as the t-zone. Rinse thoroughly and pat dry. Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse well with water. Be sure to follow with an appropriate toner/serum and moisturizer. Recommend using twice a day for day and night.\nCaution\n1. In case of sensitive skin, please test the face wash on the inside of the arm first. If discomfort arises, please immediately stop using the product and seek the assistance of a dermatologist.\n2. If the product splashes into your eyes, flush them with fresh water immediately.\n3. Keep out of reach of children.\n\n\nMade in PRC', 483.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 367.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'BREYLEE Acne Treatment  Facial CleanserPrice in BD', 'BREYLEE Acne Treatment  Facial Cleanser Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'breylee-acne-treatment-facial-cleanser', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:35', '2026-02-11 13:41:35'),
