(2101, 'Biozia Face Wash 60gm', '1', 0, 68, 327, '2101', '2101', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Biozia Skin Glowing & Whitening Face Wash is a specially formulated cleanser designed to provide gentle and effective cleansing while promoting a glowing and whitening effect. With its deep cleansing action and hydrating ingredients, it ensures your skin feels refreshed and clear without any dryness or irritation.\n\nEnriched with Oxyresveratrol, Liquorice Extract, Turmeric Extract, Basil Extract, and Squalene, this face wash promotes a glowing and whitening effect, enhancing your natural complexion.\n\n\n\nWet your face with water. Apply a small amount of Biozia Skin Face Wash to your palms and work into a lather. Gently massage onto your face in circular motions, avoiding the eye area. Rinse thoroughly with water and pat dry. Use twice daily for best results.\n\n\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water. If irritation develops, discontinue use and consult a healthcare professional.\n\n\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.\n', 914.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 21.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biozia Face Wash 60gmPrice in BD', 'Biozia Face Wash 60gm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biozia-face-wash-60gm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
