(2103, 'SKYA Anti Acne Oil Control Facewash For Rejuvenating Skin 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 57, '2103', '2103', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Skya Accutane Anti-Acne Oil Control Face Wash is a 100ml skin-rejuvenating face wash for all skin types. It is free from chemicals harmful to the skin such as SLS, paraben, and cruelty. It consists of Mandelic acid, Glycolic acid, Salicylic acid, Niacinamide, and Licorice extract, thus, helping in preventing acne, and post-acne scars, and lightens and brightens the skin tone. With its innovative approach to sebum and excess oil control, Skya’s Accutane Anti-Acne Oil Control Face Wash is perfect for rejuvenating your skin. It minimizes ageing, removes post-acne scars and controls excess oil to give you a bright and undamaged skin texture', 1590.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1590.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKYA Anti Acne Oil Control Facewash For Rejuvenating Skin 100mlPrice in BD', 'SKYA Anti Acne Oil Control Facewash For Rejuvenating Skin 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skya-anti-acne-oil-control-facewash-for-rejuvenating-skin-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2104, 'Mamaearth Tea Tree Facewash 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 3, '2104', '2104', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mamaearth Tea Tree Neem Facewash for Acne & Pimples :Mamaearth tea tree FaceWash for Acne & Pimples is a natural blend of neem and tea tree oil. It helps prevent acne by deep cleaning impurities, fighting bacteria, and controlling excess oil secretion. All this, without stripping the skin off its natural oils. Aloe Vera in the face wash helps reduce redness and inflammation. Dermatologically tested and pH balanced, it takes gentle care of your skin while making it look healthy and glowing. It is absolutely safe since it contains no harmful chemicals like SLES, Sulfates, Phthalates, and Artificial Fragrances.\n\nControls Acne & Pimples:It helps to reduce and prevent the development of acne and pimples by controlling excess oil secretion.\n\nRemoves Excess Oil:Removes excess oil from your face, leaving thoroughly clean and oil-free skin without making it dry or stretchy.\n\nPurifies Skin:Neem extract helps purify the skin and improves its resilience. It gently removes dirt, oil, and impurities from the clogged skin pores, making it clean and healthy.\n\nAntibacterial:Natural anti-bacterial and cleansing properties of Neem and Tea Tree Oil prevent regular breakouts of acne and pimples.\n\n\n\nHow to Use:\nStep 1 : Apply a coin-sized amount of face wash on damp faces.Step 2 : Work up a mild lather and massage your face in gentle, anti-clockwise circular movements.Step 3 : Rinse with lukewarm or tap water. Pat dry your face with a clean towel.\n\n\n\nFAQ:\nHow Often Should I Use It?Use it regularly, twice a day for best results.\n\nHow Long Will It Take for The Face Wash To Show Results?As the face wash is made of natural ingredients; hence, it will depend on your problem area. However, visible results should be seen within 8 weeks of regular use.\n\nCan Teenagers Use It?Absolutely, it can be used by anyone above 15 years of age as it is made with the best natural and toxin-free ingredients, which are ideal for young skin.\n\nWill It Make My Skin Dry?You should always moisturize your skin after cleansing with a face wash.', 503.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 27.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Mamaearth Tea Tree Facewash 100mlPrice in BD', 'Mamaearth Tea Tree Facewash 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'mamaearth-tea-tree-facewash-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2105, 'Pond\'s Face Wash Daily 100g', '1', 0, 68, 193, '2105', '2105', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'New Pond\'s Daily Face Wash is designed to give your skin fresh feel everyday. This face wash is designed for all skin types. Active cleansing system cleanses thoroughly &amp; gently. Cares for your skin as it cleans more gently than a soap can. Menthol &amp; Peppermint fusion helps to leave your skin fresh and renewed. This Ultra-mild face wash is perfect for every day exfoliation. Get fresh skin everyday with new Pond\'s Daily Face Wash. Buy Now!', 170.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -170.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Face Wash Daily 100gPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s Face Wash Daily 100g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-face-wash-daily-100g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2106, 'Pond\'s Face Wash Bright Beauty 50g', '1', 0, 68, 193, '2106', '2106', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pond’s White Beauty Face Wash with advanced vitamin B3+ formula will cleanse your skin and give you a spotless glow. This powerful formula, infused with advanced vitamin B3+, deeply cleanses your skin and removes dead skin cells, revealing millions of new, glowing cells beneath.\n\n\nPond\'s Bright Beauty Face Wash is your solution to achieving a spot-less, radiant complexion. Unlock your hidden glow and embrace a brighter, more confident you. Order today and experience the transformation.\n', 93.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 27.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Pond\'s Face Wash Bright Beauty 50gPrice in BD', 'Pond\'s Face Wash Bright Beauty 50g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-face-wash-bright-beauty-50g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2107, 'Skin Cafe Face Wash Hydrating Hyaluronic Acid (Dry & Sensitive Skin)- 140ml', '1', 0, 68, 224, '2107', '2107', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skin Cafe Face Wash Hydrating Hyaluronic Acid (Dry & Sensitive Skin) – 140ml (Made in Bangladesh)Skin Cafe Hydrating Hyaluronic Acid Face Wash is a gentle, nourishing cleanser specially formulated for dry and sensitive skin. Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid and Seaweed Extract, it effectively cleanses, calms, and moisturizes the skin while maintaining its natural balance. Available at the best price in Bangladesh from Arogga with guaranteed authenticity.\n\nKey Features:• Soap-Free & pH Balanced – Gentle on dry and sensitive skin.• Paraben-Free – Safe and dermatologically tested formula.• Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid – Retains moisture and improves skin elasticity.• Contains Seaweed Extract – Soothes, softens, and protects the skin.• Suitable for Men & Women – Ideal for daily use on sensitive skin.\n\nBenefits:• Removes dirt, oil, and makeup without stripping skin.• Maintains natural moisture balance for soft, hydrated skin.• Reduces skin sensitivity and irritation.• Leaves skin smooth, calm, and refreshed.\n\nIngredients:Aqua, Disodium EDTA, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Decyl Glucoside, PEG-150 Distearate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Alaria Esculenta Extract, Phenoxyethanol, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Parfum\n\nUsage Direction:Dampen your face slightly, apply a small amount of face wash, and gently massage to create a lather. Rinse thoroughly with water. Use daily for best results.\n\nCaution:For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes and mouth. If contact occurs, rinse immediately. Conduct a patch test before use and discontinue if irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children and store in a cool, dry place away from sunlight.', 325.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 70.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skin Cafe Face Wash Hydrating Hyaluronic Acid (Dry & Sensitive Skin)- 140mlPrice in BD', 'Skin Cafe Face Wash Hydrating Hyaluronic Acid (Dry & Sensitive Skin)- 140ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-cafe-face-wash-hydrating-hyaluronic-acid-dry-sensitive-skin-140ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2108, 'Cerave Acne Control Cleanser with 2% Salicylic Acid Acne Treatment 237ml', '1', 0, 68, 153, '2108', '2108', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Acne can affect teenagers and adults alike, and an effective acne cleanser is an essential step in any anti-acne skincare regimen. Ideal for daily use to gently exfoliate the dead skin cells that can clog pores and contribute to acne, a cleanser with salicylic acid offers acne-controlling benefits and may complement other over-the-counter and prescription-based acne treatments to help maintain clear, healthy skin just be sure to check with your dermatologist.\nCeraVe is the #1 dermatologist-recommended cleanser brand for acne*, and our new Acne Control Cleanser with 2% salicylic acid is formulated to clear acne, reduce blackheads and improve the appearance of pores, while purifying clay helps absorb excess oil. Featuring Oil-Absorbing Technology to minimize visible shine, this refreshing, gel-to-foam salicylic acid cleanser effectively removes dirt and excess oil, gently exfoliates and penetrates clogged pores to help prevent new acne breakouts. Acne Control Cleanser also maintains the skin’s protective barrier with 3 essential ceramides, calms the skin with niacinamide and reduces acne while leaving the skin soft, smooth and hydrated.\n\nInactive Ingredients: Water, Sodium Lauroyl Sarcosinate, Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Gluconolactone, Sodium Methyl Cocoyl Taurate, Peg-150 Pentaerythrityl Tetrastearate, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Carbomer, Calcium Gluconate, Triethyl Citrate, Sodium Benzoate, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Cholesterol, Tetrasodium Edta, Caprylyl Glycol, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Xanthan Gum, Hectorite, Phytosphingosine, Benzoic Acid\n\nBenefits:\n\nHow to Use:', 2675.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1025.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Acne Control Cleanser with 2% Salicylic Acid Acne Treatment 237mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Acne Control Cleanser with 2% Salicylic Acid Acne Treatment 237ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-acne-control-cleanser-with-2-salicylic-acid-acne-treatment-237ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2109, 'Dermamate Face Wash For Acne Prone Skin 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 22, '2109', '2109', NULL, NULL, NULL, '“Darmamate Face Wash for Acne Prone Skin 100ml” enriched with salicylic acid that helps to eliminate the acne breakout and prevent future breakouts. It leaves skin feeling residue-free with reduction of excessive sebum production. This face wash helps to control excess oil and acne-causing bacteria and leaving skin feeling fresh and clean.\nBenefits:\n•       It helps to control excess oil and pimple-causing bacteria\n•       It is exceptionally gentle on the skin and doesn\'t bring about any sort of dryness or irritation\n•       Helps to improve skin irritation and redness from skin\n•       Provide smooth and supple skin.\n•       Brightens skin tone.\nIngredients:\nAqua, Allantoin, Salicylic Acid, Sodium laureth sulfate, Cocodiethanolamide, Cocamidopropyl betaine, Acrylates Copolymer, Azadirachta indica extract, Ocimum tenuiflorum extract, PEG-40, Hydrogenated castor oil, Potassium Cocoate, Mentha Spicata Extract, DMDM Hydantoin, Trideceth-9, Triclosan, Disodium EDTA, Potassium Hydroxide & Fragrance Oil.\nHow To Use:\n•       Apply face wash on moist face and massage\n•       Massage it on to the skin with and gentle circular motion for 1-2 minutes\n•       Use sunscreen after washing face at day time\n\nCautions:\n•       For external use only\n•       Keep out of reach of children\n•       Avoid contact with eyes; If contact occurs rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue usage and consult with a doctor.\n\nAdditional Claims:\n•       Soap Free\n•       Paraben free\n•       Alcohol free\n•       Sulphate Free\n•       Cruelty free\nStorage Conditions:\n•       Avoid direct sunlight\n•       Store in a cool and dry place\n•       Do not freeze', 275.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 25.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermamate Face Wash For Acne Prone Skin 100mlPrice in BD', 'Dermamate Face Wash For Acne Prone Skin 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermamate-face-wash-for-acne-prone-skin-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36');
