(2113, 'SkinO Gel Cleanser Daily Refresh For All Skin Types 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 15, '2113', '2113', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SkinO Gel Cleanser Daily Refresh is a gentle, effective face wash designed to cleanse and revitalize your skin without stripping its natural moisture. Formulated for all skin types—including sensitive, oily, and combination—it offers a refreshing start and finish to your day. Its lightweight gel texture glides smoothly across the skin, removing dirt, excess oil, and impurities while maintaining balance and hydration.\nKey Features\nUsageApply a small amount to damp skin. Gently massage in circular motions, then rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. Use morning and evening for best results.\nWhy Choose This Product\nBenefits\n', 234.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 26.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SkinO Gel Cleanser Daily Refresh For All Skin Types 100mlPrice in BD', 'SkinO Gel Cleanser Daily Refresh For All Skin Types 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skino-gel-cleanser-daily-refresh-for-all-skin-types-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2114, 'POND\'S Oil Control Face Wash With Silica Beads 100g', '1', 0, 68, 193, '2114', '2114', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For skin that faces a constant problem of oil secretion making you look dull, Pond’s oil control is an effective way to start the morning and go through the day. It helps remove oil and grime off your face. Women with oily or combination skin tend to look dull due to the oil secretion - Pond’s oil control is tough on the oil but gentle on the skin. The silica gel bead technology helps giving you an oil free glow. Feel the freshness with Pond’s oil control. Get rid of oil and avoid dull and tired looking skin. Let your skin feel energized from deep within with Pond’s oil control. Pond’s oil control comes with the promise of no wash-up no touch required. Pond’s oil control facewash is created by Pond’s - the experts in skincare products. It’s gel based formula with silica bead technology is created keeping in mind the modern millennial with her busy schedule. If you want the perfect no wash-up no touch-up - all day fresh look - grab your pack of Pond’s oil control facewash today, recommended to use twice a day (morning and night) for best results.Features:\nCountry of Origin: Bangladesh.', 167.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 43.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'POND\'S Oil Control Face Wash With Silica Beads 100gPrice in BD', 'POND\'S Oil Control Face Wash With Silica Beads 100g Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'ponds-oil-control-face-wash-with-silica-beads-100g', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
