(2117, 'Innsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Solution Cleansing Foam 150ml and Innsaei Lightweight UV Sunscreen 50ml', '1', 0, 68, 6, '2117', '2117', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Here’s a complete skincare duo from Innsaei that’s designed to fight acne, control oil, and protect your skin from sun damage—ideal for oily, acne-prone, and combination skin types.\nInnsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Solution Cleansing Foam (150ml)This foam cleanser is formulated with salicylic acid to deeply cleanse pores, remove excess oil, and reduce breakouts. It’s gentle enough for daily use and effective at tackling blackheads and acne without irritating the skin.\nKey Features\nHow to UseWet your face and hands, dispense a small amount of foam, and gently massage onto the skin. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. Use morning and night for best results.\nInnsaei Lightweight UV Sunscreen (50ml)This sunscreen offers broad-spectrum protection with a breathable, non-greasy formula that’s perfect for daily wear. It shields your skin from harmful UVA and UVB rays while maintaining hydration and comfort throughout the day.\nKey Features\nHow to UseApply generously to clean skin as the final step in your morning routine. Reapply every two hours when exposed to sunlight.\nWhy Choose This ComboThis skincare pair is ideal for anyone looking to manage acne while maintaining daily sun protection. The cleansing foam clears and purifies the skin, while the sunscreen defends against UV damage without clogging pores. Together, they offer a simple, effective routine for clearer, healthier skin.', 820.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '150ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 230.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Solution Cleansing Foam 150ml and Innsaei Lightweight UV Sunscreen 50mlPrice in BD', 'Innsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Solution Cleansing Foam 150ml and Innsaei Lightweight UV Sunscreen 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innsaei-salicylic-acid-acne-solution-cleansing-foam-150ml-and-innsaei-lightweight-uv-sunscreen-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
