(2134, 'Dermamate Melasma Solution Face Wash 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 22, '2134', '2134', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description: Dermamate\'s Melasma Solution Face Wash is likely formulated to target melasma, a skin condition characterized by dark patches on the skin. The face wash may contain ingredients that help to lighten and even out skin tone.\nKey Features:\nUsage: Wet your face and hands with lukewarm water. Apply a small amount of the face wash to your hands and work into a lather. Gently massage the lather onto your face in a circular motion, avoiding the eye area. Rinse thoroughly with water and pat dry. Use twice daily for best results.\nBenefits:\nAlways remember to do a patch test before using any new skincare product, especially if you have sensitive skin or are prone to reactions. These products are formulated to target specific skin concerns and can be beneficial when used as part of a regular skincare routine.', 334.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 16.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Dermamate Melasma Solution Face Wash 100mlPrice in BD', 'Dermamate Melasma Solution Face Wash 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'dermamate-melasma-solution-face-wash-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
