(2136, 'Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml and skinO Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 68, 6, '2136', '2136', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Start your skincare routine with Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5, a gentle yet effective cleanser that maintains your skin’s natural pH balance. Infused with natural BHA ingredients, this cleanser works from within, removing impurities, excess oil, and dirt without disrupting your skin barrier. Ideal for all skin types, it leaves your skin feeling clean, refreshed, and perfectly prepped for the next steps in your routine.\nBenefit:\nHow to use:Use morning and night, begin with wet hands and face, squeeze a proper amount onto your hand and foam up. Gently massage the face.Rinse with warm water.\nIngredients:Aqua, Salicylic acid, Galaxy LES 70, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Carbomer, Potassium Hydroxide, CDEA, CAPB, DMDM Hydantoin, Triclosan, Fragrance Oil.\nThen, Follow up with the skin\'O Acne + Spot Treatment Serum, a potent solution designed to target acne and blemishes at their source. This fast-absorbing serum soothes inflamed skin while combating breakouts, reducing redness, and fading stubborn spots. With its targeted treatment formula, it helps to visibly improve skin texture and tone, giving you a clearer, more even complexion.\nBenefits:\nHow to Use:Apply a few drops of serum to your face in the morning and night and before using any heavier cream. Gently tap it into the skin for better absorptionCaution:\nIngredients:Aqua, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Niacinamide, Carbomer, Glycerine, Hyaluronic Acid, Salicylic Acid, Propylene Glycol, phenoxyethanol.\nTogether, this duo offers a complete solution for maintaining balanced, blemish-free skin, leaving you with a fresh, radiant look.Country of Origin: Bangladesh', 631.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 219.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml and skinO Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30mlPrice in BD', 'Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml and skinO Acne + Spot Treatment Serum 30ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innsaei-low-ph-daily-gel-cleanser-55-150ml-and-skino-acne-spot-treatment-serum-30ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2137, 'Simple Purifying Cleansing Lotion 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 24, '2137', '2137', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Love the feeling of smooth, softened skin? The Simple Kind to Skin Purifying Cleansing Lotion is ideal for gently cleansing drier skin; with its creamy no-rinse formula, this cleansing lotion makes the first step in your skincare routine quick and easy. Just apply the product to cotton wool and sweep over your skin using upwards and outwards movements; this helps to avoid pulling your skin downwards as you cleanse. These little skincare tips can all contribute to skin feeling happier and healthier!Our Purifying Cleansing Lotion is also ideal for taking with you on-the-go as there\'s no need to rinse it away, which is why you\'ll find it in both our bathroom cabinet and travel beauty bag.Cleansing your skin daily is essential for helping to clear away dirt and bacteria, but it\'s important to not overdo it – overusing skincare products can actually trigger skin sensitivity. Cleansing twice a day with a gentle cleanser like the Purifying Cleansing Lotion is ideal, and the perfect way to start your morning and evening beauty routines. After we\'ve cleansed we love to apply our favourite Simple moisturiser, like the Kind to Skin Replenishing Rich Moisturiser, to nourish and replenish skin for up to 12 hours. Like our Purifying Cleansing Lotion it is great for dry complexions, and perfect even for sensitive skin.', 731.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 169.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple Purifying Cleansing Lotion 200mlPrice in BD', 'Simple Purifying Cleansing Lotion 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-purifying-cleansing-lotion-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
