(2139, 'Laxzin All Purpose Cleansing Oil-100ml', '1', 0, 68, 54, '2139', '2139', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For All Skin Types\nA mild and complete cleansing oil made from skin-friendly plant oils that effectively remove heavy makeup and impurities. Leaves skin feeling fresh and moisturized after cleansing.\nShake the bottle well before use.\nTake 3-5 drops on dry hands.\nGently massage over a dry face in circular motions to dissolve makeup and impurities.\nAdd a little water to emulsify the oil and continue massaging for about 1 minute.\nRinse thoroughly with warm water.\nFollow with your regular face wash.\nPat dry with a towel and apply moisturizer.\nDimethicone, Sunflower Oil, Argan Oil, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Vitamin E, Vitamin B5, EDTA, DMDMH, Isopropyl Myristate.\nStore in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight and heat.\nFor external use only.\nRetina Health Care, Gazipur, Dhaka, Bangladesh\nBeauty World Brand Ltd., KAH-200/C, Hazi Solim Uddin Lane, Middle Badda, Dhaka', 675.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 75.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Laxzin All Purpose Cleansing Oil-100mlPrice in BD', 'Laxzin All Purpose Cleansing Oil-100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'laxzin-all-purpose-cleansing-oil-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
