(2141, 'Cetaphil Gentle Foaming Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 237ml', '1', 0, 68, 63, '2141', '2141', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'An instant foaming facial cleanser that effortlessly removes dirt, oil and makeup. Infused with skin conditioners and a vitamin complex, it softens as it cleans without stripping skin of its natural moisture balance. The result is soft, clean skin that feels fresh and healthy.', 1893.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 607.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Gentle Foaming Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 237mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Gentle Foaming Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 237ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-gentle-foaming-cleanser-for-normal-to-dry-skin-237ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2142, 'Kose Softymo Speedy Cleansing Oil (10ml Extra)', '1', 0, 68, 398, '2142', '2142', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Kose Softymo Deep Cleansing Oil is another popular Japanese skincare product, similar to the Speedy version but formulated for deeper cleansing. Here\'s what you can expect from it:\nKose Softymo Deep Cleansing Oil is often favored by those with combination or oily skin types, as well as those who wear heavy makeup or sunscreen regularly. It\'s important to follow up with a water-based cleanser as part of a double cleansing routine to ensure thorough removal of any remaining impurities and to maintain the skin\'s balance. As always, it\'s a good idea to patch test first, especially if you have sensitive skin or if you\'re trying a new product for the first time.\nIngredients:Mineral Oil (Paraffinum Liquidum), Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Oil, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Cyclomethicone, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Seed Oil, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Oil, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Sesamum Indicum (Sesame) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Tocopherol, BHT, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol Dicaprate, Trilaureth-4 Phosphate, Water(Aqua), Phenoxyethanol.\nCountry of Origin: Japan.', 2340.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '230ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 260.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Kose Softymo Speedy Cleansing Oil (10ml Extra)Price in BD', 'Kose Softymo Speedy Cleansing Oil (10ml Extra) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'kose-softymo-speedy-cleansing-oil-10ml-extra', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2143, 'Noreva Exfoliac Foaming Gel 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 130, '2143', '2143', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Noreva Exofoliac Foaming Gel has active ingredients Zinc and Ammonium lactate. It is  refreshes the skin and cleans the pores without stimulating sebum production again. Promoting the exfoliation of the corneous cells & promotes the penetration of zinc into the hair follicles. It contains no parabens. Zinc has a slightly dehydrating, anti-inflammatory and healing effect, which has a positive effect on irritated & inflamed skin. Ammonium lactate and free AHA reduce adhesion of horny cells on the skin & support their detachment. The skin becomes finer, smoother and more even.', 2030.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Noreva Exfoliac Foaming Gel 100mlPrice in BD', 'Noreva Exfoliac Foaming Gel 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'noreva-exfoliac-foaming-gel-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
