(2146, 'Softymo Deep Cleansing Oil Kose Cosmeport 240ml', '1', 0, 68, 398, '2146', '2146', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Deep yet gentle cleansing for clear, radiant skin.\nExperience the powerful yet skin-loving cleansing of Japan’s trusted skincare brand – Kose Cosmeport. The Softymo Deep Cleansing Oil is formulated to thoroughly dissolve and remove even the most stubborn makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, and impurities deep within your pores.\n🌿 Deep Pore Cleansing: Effectively dissolves waterproof makeup, mascara, and dirt without leaving residue.\n💧 Hydrating Formula: Contains natural moisturizing ingredients such as rice bran oil and jojoba oil that nourish and protect the skin’s natural moisture balance.\n✨ Smooth, Non-Greasy Finish: Rinses off easily with water, leaving skin fresh, clean, and soft—no greasy film or tightness.\n🌸 Mild on Skin: Free from colorants and mineral oil. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n🇯🇵 Made in Japan: Trusted quality and performance from Kose Cosmeport’s innovative skincare line.\nTake 2–3 pumps into dry hands.\nGently massage onto dry face, focusing on areas with makeup or clogged pores.\nAdd a small amount of water to emulsify the oil.\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.', 1600.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '200ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 400.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Softymo Deep Cleansing Oil Kose Cosmeport 240mlPrice in BD', 'Softymo Deep Cleansing Oil Kose Cosmeport 240ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'softymo-deep-cleansing-oil-kose-cosmeport-240ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36');
