(2147, 'Cerave Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser for Normal to Very Dry Skin 473ml', '1', 0, 68, 153, '2147', '2147', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Features:\n[ DAILY CLEANSER ] Daily wash with hyaluronic acid, ceramides, squalane & triglycerides cleanses without stripping moisture. Provides lasting hydration and leaves soothed and comfortable, non-greasy feel.\n[ONE STEP OIL CLEANSER ] Transforms from an oil into a soft lathering foam to cleanse, to help hydrate, and leave skin feeling comforted/comfortable without a tight, dry skin feeling. Removes face makeup, dirt, and excess oil\n[SUITABLE FOR FACE & BODY] Suitable to use as facial cleanser & body wash. Fragrance-free and non-comedogenic. Suitable for dry to very dry skin. Suitable for sensitive skin, atopic-prone skin and baby skin.\n[ 3 ESSENTIAL CERAMIDES ] Ceramides are found naturally in the skin and make up 50% of the lipids in the skin barrier. All CeraVe products are formulated with three essential ceramides (1, 3, 6-II)to help maintain the skin’s natural barrier.\n[ DEVELOPED WITH DERMATOLOGISTS ] CeraVe Skincare is developed with dermatologists and has products suitable for dry skin, sensitive skin, oily skin, acne-prone, and more.\nCountry of Origin France\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCeraVe Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser gently cleanses and removes makeup, dirt & excess oil without leaving skin feeling tight or dry.​\nIt helps skin keep hydrating and maintains skin’s natural barrier.​\nThis foaming oil cleanser transforms from an oil into a soft lathering foam.​\n​\n​\nWet skin with lukewarm water. Massage a dime-size amount of Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser into skin in a gentle circular motion. Rinse.​\n​Follow by your favorite CeraVe’s moisturizer.​\nSuitable for use on the face, body, even hands.​\nAvoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs rinse thoroughly with water.\nAll CeraVe products are developed with dermatologists.​\nHydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser is formulated without fragrance. It is non-comedogenic and suitable for dry to very dry skin including sensitive skin, atopic-prone skin, and baby skin (3+ months).\nSqualane Oil is known to help retain moisture – the formula maintains the skin barrier and keeps skin comfortable without feeling greasy.​\nHyaluronic Acid helps retain skin’s natural moisture.​\nCeramides are naturally found in your skin and play a vital role in helping your skin protect you. They help fill in the gaps between your skin cells so your skin can seal in moisture and seal out impurities.\n\n\n\n', 2860.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '473ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 2590.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser for Normal to Very Dry Skin 473mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser for Normal to Very Dry Skin 473ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-hydrating-foaming-oil-cleanser-for-normal-to-very-dry-skin-473ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2148, 'Celimax Derma Nature Fresh Blackhead Jojoba Cleansing Oil', '1', 0, 68, 102, '2148', '2148', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Light and non-greasy cleansing oil for all skin type\n\n\nCore ingredients: 6 plant oil – Bergamot fruit oil, Meadowfoam seed oil, Jojoba seed oil, Sunflower seed oil, Sweet almond oil, Olive fruit oil\nEthylhexyl Palmitate, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Aqua, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia (Bergamot) Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Prunus Armeniaca (Apricot) Kernel Oil, Zanthoxylum Piperitum Fruit Extract, Pulsatilla Koreana Extract, Usnea Barbata (Lichen) Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Alcohol, Limonene, Linalool\n\n', 384.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 191.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Celimax Derma Nature Fresh Blackhead Jojoba Cleansing OilPrice in BD', 'Celimax Derma Nature Fresh Blackhead Jojoba Cleansing Oil Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'celimax-derma-nature-fresh-blackhead-jojoba-cleansing-oil', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2149, 'Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser for Nattoyant Doux Pour La Peau Sensitive Skin 500ml', '1', 0, 68, 63, '2149', '2149', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser (Made in Canada) 500ml is a mild, non-irritating soap free formulation that cleanses without stripping the skin of its natural protective oils or emollients. Dermatologically tested and designed specifically to work for all skin types, it is a simple, yet highly effective way to care for your skin.\n\nIngretients:Water, Cetyl Alcohol, Propylene Glycol, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Stearyl Alcohol, Methylparaben, Propylparaben, Butylparaben\n', 3292.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1508.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser for Nattoyant Doux Pour La Peau Sensitive Skin 500mlPrice in BD', 'Cetaphil Gentle Skin Cleanser for Nattoyant Doux Pour La Peau Sensitive Skin 500ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cetaphil-gentle-skin-cleanser-for-nattoyant-doux-pour-la-peau-sensitive-skin-500ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2150, 'ACM Sebionex Nettoyant Cleansing Gel 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 284, '2150', '2150', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cleansing Gel – 200ml\nA gentle yet effective cleansing gel specially formulated for oily and acne-prone skin. This purifying gel removes impurities, excess oil, and makeup without drying out the skin, helping to prevent imperfections and maintain a clear complexion.\n\nKey Benefits:\nDeeply cleanses and purifies pores\nControls sebum production to reduce shine\nSoothes and refreshes the skin\nSuitable for daily use on combination to oily skin types\nDermatologically tested\n\nUsage: Apply to damp skin, gently massage, then rinse thoroughly. Use morning and evening for best results.', 1439.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 61.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ACM Sebionex Nettoyant Cleansing Gel 200mlPrice in BD', 'ACM Sebionex Nettoyant Cleansing Gel 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acm-sebionex-nettoyant-cleansing-gel-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2151, 'Constanta Cleansing Foam 75gm (CT-106)', '1', 0, 68, 137, '2151', '2151', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Collagen • Ginkgo • Charcoal • ArbutinEssential Face Cleansing Foam\nConstanta Cleansing Foam is an intensive detoxifying and firming facial cleanser formulated with a powerful blend of Collagen, Ginkgo Biloba, Charcoal, and Arbutin. This advanced formula helps strengthen skin elasticity, brighten the complexion, and deeply cleanse pores for a clearer and more refined appearance.\nArbutin supports skin whitening and helps reduce pigmentation, while Charcoal provides strong detoxifying and pore-clearing benefits. Collagen and Ginkgo nourish and firm the skin, helping maintain smoothness and freshness after every wash. Suitable for everyday use, this gentle and mild foam cleanser leaves the skin clean, balanced, and revitalized.\nDeep-cleansing formula that removes impurities and excess oil\nHelps tighten pores and keep them clean\nArbutin helps reduce pigmentation and promotes skin whitening\nCharcoal effectively detoxifies for clear, blemish-free skin\nCollagen and Ginkgo Biloba help support firmness and elasticity\nLeaves skin feeling clean, fresh, and smooth\nGentle and mild formula suitable for daily use\nGently massage the foam onto wet skin.Rinse thoroughly with water.Use twice daily—morning and night.\nAqua, Stearic Acid, Myristic Acid, Potassium Hydroxide, Glycerin, Lauric Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance, Niacinamide, Butylated Hydroxytoluene, Disodium EDTA, Propylene Glycol, Soluble Collagen, Ginkgo Biloba Leaf Extract, Charcoal Powder, Butylene Glycol, Saccharide Isomerate, Morinda Citrifolia Fruit Juice, Benzyl Alcohol, Dehydroacetic Acid, Sorbic Acid, Benzoic Acid, Alcohol, Lecithin, Sparassis Crispa Extract, Arbutin, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Glutathione, Linolenic Acid, Linoleic Acid, Ascorbyl Palmitate.\nDeep cleansing and detoxifying\nBrightening and pigment-correcting\nFirming and elasticity-boosting\nSuitable for daily use\nManufactured under license of Constanta Germany', 1480.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1480.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Constanta Cleansing Foam 75gm (CT-106)Price in BD', 'Constanta Cleansing Foam 75gm (CT-106) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'constanta-cleansing-foam-75gm-ct-106', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
