(2159, 'Cerave Hydrating Facial Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 355ml', '1', 0, 68, 153, '2159', '2159', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nBuy CeraVe Hydrating Facial Cleanser in Bangladesh from Arogga, your trusted online store. Buy this moisturizing face wash for normal to dry skin with hyaluronic acid, ceramides, and glycerin at the lowest cost.\n\nCeraVe Hydrating Cleanser was designed to cleanse and refresh the skin without over-stripping it or leaving it feeling tight and dry. Featuring hyaluronic acid to hydrate the skin and 3 essential ceramides that work together to lock in skin moisture and help restore your skin’s protective barrier. MVE Delivery Technology encapsulates ceramides to ensure efficient delivery within the skin’s barrier and slow release over time. Supporting your protective skin barrier, long after you’ve finished applying. This non-comedogenic face wash is an effective yet non-irritating way to start any skincare regimen. Best for normal to dry skin.\n\nThe CeraVe Hydrating Facial Cleanser is an essential part of a skincare routine for those with normal to dry skin. Developed with dermatologists, this gentle face wash is formulated with key ingredients such as ceramides and hyaluronic acid to help restore and maintain the skin\'s natural barrier while retaining its natural moisture.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAqua / Water / Eau, Glycerin, Cetearyl Alcohol, Peg-40 Stearate, Stearyl Alcohol, Potassium Phosphate, Ceramide Np, Ceramide Ap, Ceramide Eop, Carbomer, Glyceryl Stearate, Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Cholesterol, Phenoxyethanol, Disodium Edta, Dipotassium Phosphate, Tocopherol, Phytosphingosine, Xanthan Gum, Cetyl Alcohol, Polysorbate 20, Ethylhexylglycerin\n\n\n\nCeraVe is renowned for its commitment to developing skincare solutions that are both effective and gentle. Created with dermatologists, CeraVe products include essential ceramides to help restore and maintain the skin’s natural barrier. Their product range is suitable for various skin types and concerns, ensuring optimal skincare for everyone.\n', 2800.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1450.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Hydrating Facial Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 355mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Hydrating Facial Cleanser for Normal to Dry Skin 355ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-hydrating-facial-cleanser-for-normal-to-dry-skin-355ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2160, 'Cosmed Day-To-Day Gentle Cleansing Gel 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 132, '2160', '2160', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cosmed Day-To-Day Gentle Cleansing Gel is a mild, vegan facial cleanser designed for normal, combination, and sensitive skin. Formulated to remove impurities, excess sebum, and light makeup, it preserves the skin’s natural protective barrier while providing hydration and soothing effects. Its gentle formula combines hemp seed oil, panthenol, sodium PCA, and Crocus Chrysanthus Bulb Extract to nourish, regenerate, and protect the skin for a refreshed and balanced appearance.\nKey Benefits:\nGentle Daily Cleansing: Effectively removes impurities without irritating or stripping the skin.\nMoisturizing & Soothing: Sodium PCA and panthenol help maintain hydration, prevent water loss, and calm sensitive skin.\nSkin Regeneration & Firmness: Crocus Chrysanthus Bulb Extract stimulates collagen and elastin production, supporting skin firmness, elasticity, and anti-aging effects.\nAnti-Inflammatory Properties: Hemp seed oil nourishes and soothes inflammation-prone skin.\nVegan & Dermatologically Tested: Suitable for sensitive skin with physiological pH.\nHow to Use:\nApply a small amount to damp face and neck.\nGently massage in circular motions and rinse thoroughly with water.\nUse morning and evening for optimal results.\nMain Ingredients & Actions:\nHemp Seed Oil (Cannabis Sativa): Moisturizes, nourishes, and has anti-inflammatory properties.\nSodium PCA: Natural moisturizing factor that prevents water loss from the epidermis.\nPanthenol (Provitamin B5): Regenerates, hydrates, and soothes skin irritations.\nCrocus Chrysanthus Bulb Extract: Stimulates collagen and elastin production, enhances skin regeneration, firmness, and elasticity, helping reduce fine lines and signs of aging.\nIngredients:Aqua, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Sodium Cocoyl Alaninate, Coco-Glucoside, Sodium Cocoyl Glutamate, Disodium Cocoamphodiacetate, Disodium Laureth Sulfosuccinate, Decyl Glucoside, Sodium PCA, PEG-120 Methyl Glucose Dioleate, PEG-7 Glyceryl Cocoate, PEG-6 Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Cannabis Sativa Seed Extract, Panthenol, Citric Acid, Parfum, Acacia Senegal Gum, Potassium Sorbate, Crocus Chrysanthus Bulb Extract.\nWarnings:\nFor external use only. Avoid contact with eyes.\nIn case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water.\nDiscontinue use if irritation occurs and consult a healthcare professional.\nRecommended to perform an allergy test before first use.\nSummary:Cosmed Day-To-Day Gentle Cleansing Gel is a perfect solution for daily facial cleansing, combining gentle cleansing, hydration, and anti-aging benefits. Its innovative formula protects sensitive skin, nourishes, and supports skin regeneration, leaving it clean, refreshed, and healthy.', 2240.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2240.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosmed Day-To-Day Gentle Cleansing Gel 200mlPrice in BD', 'Cosmed Day-To-Day Gentle Cleansing Gel 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosmed-day-to-day-gentle-cleansing-gel-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
