(2164, 'Bionnex Cleansing & Foaming Gel 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 107, '2164', '2164', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Refresh and rejuvenate your skin with Arogga!\nThe Bionnex Cleansing & Foaming Gel is a gentle yet effective cleanser designed to remove dirt, oil, and impurities while maintaining your skin\'s natural moisture balance. Enriched with nourishing ingredients, this foaming gel cleanser leaves your skin feeling clean, soft, and refreshed. Perfect for all skin types, it’s your go-to product for a daily skincare routine that promotes a healthy, radiant complexion.\nDeep Cleansing Action:\nEffectively removes dirt, oil, makeup, and impurities from the skin.\nUnclogs pores, preventing breakouts and blackheads.\nGentle Foaming Formula:\nCreates a rich, luxurious lather that cleanses without stripping the skin of its natural oils.\nHydrating and Nourishing:\nInfused with moisturizing agents to keep your skin soft, smooth, and hydrated.\npH-Balanced:\nMaintains the skin\'s natural pH balance, ensuring a healthy skin barrier.\nSuitable for All Skin Types:\nGentle enough for daily use and effective for sensitive skin.\nRefreshing Fragrance:\nLeaves your skin feeling fresh and revitalized.\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\nApply a small amount of the foaming gel to your hands and work into a rich lather.\nGently massage the lather onto your face in circular motions.\nRinse thoroughly with water and pat dry.\nUse morning and night as part of your daily skincare routine.\nDeep Cleansing: Removes dirt, oil, and impurities for a clean complexion.\nHydrates: Keeps your skin soft, smooth, and moisturized.\nGentle Formula: Safe for daily use and suitable for all skin types.\npH-Balanced: Maintains the skin\'s natural balance.\nRefreshing: Leaves your skin feeling fresh and revitalized.\nEffective Cleansing: Thoroughly cleanses without over-drying the skin.\nGentle and Safe: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nHydrating: Keeps your skin nourished and smooth.\nRefreshing Experience: Leaves your skin feeling clean and revitalized.\n1 x Bionnex Cleansing & Foaming Gel 200ml\nThe Bionnex Cleansing & Foaming Gel is your ultimate solution for achieving a clean, refreshed complexion. Whether you\'re removing makeup, dirt, or excess oil, this cleanser delivers a gentle yet effective cleansing experience.\nOrder now from Arogga and embrace clean, radiant skin every day! ✨\n🔗 Order Now: https://www.arogga.com', 2158.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 22.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bionnex Cleansing & Foaming Gel 200mlPrice in BD', 'Bionnex Cleansing & Foaming Gel 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bionnex-cleansing-foaming-gel-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
