(2168, 'Cosrx Low pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser 50ml', '1', 0, 68, 31, '2168', '2168', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'While refining the skin texture, the cleanser will help cleanse with no stripping. Great for all skin types, wake up to firmer-looking skin while letting it rest clean during the night.\nLow pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser: Cleanse daily with this gentle and effective gel-type cleanser day and night, removing impurities while strengthening your skin barrier.\nCleanse for a Luminous Day and Silky Night: While refining the skin texture, the cleanser will help cleanse with no stripping. Great for all skin types, wake up to firmer-looking skin while letting it rest clean during the night.\nKey Ingredients: pH balanced, tea-tree oil, and BHA to soothe and strengthen for luminous and clear skin.\nInspired by Skin\'s Natural pH level: Following your skin\'s slightly acidic natural pH level, this cleanser helps balance your skin and protect it from trouble-causing irritants.\nCOSRX Standards: All COSRX products are formulated with skin-friendly ingredients that alleviate irritated skin. Hypoallergenic, Dermatologist tested, Animal Testing-FREE, Parabens-FREE, Sulfates-FREE, Phthalates-FREE\n\nThis cleanser is infused with naturally driven plant extracts including BHA and tea-tree. Detoxify and remove impurities while filling your skin with nourishing vitamins.\nBased on a Primary Skin Irritation Test on 34 men and women, the Low pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser did not cause any skin reactions in all subjects 24 hours, 48 hours, and 72 hours after the test.\n\nFor those who prefer a larger option, COSRX Low PH Good Morning Gel Cleanser is also available in a 150ml size to ensure you have more of your favorite cleanser whenever you need it.\n\n', 575.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 275.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cosrx Low pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser 50mlPrice in BD', 'Cosrx Low pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-low-ph-good-morning-gel-cleanser-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2169, 'Innsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Cleansing Foam 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 6, '2169', '2169', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Innsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Cleansing Foam (150ml) is a targeted facial cleanser designed to combat acne, blackheads, and excess oil while remaining gentle enough for daily use. With its balanced formula and deep-cleansing action, it’s ideal for oily, combination, and sensitive skin types.\nProduct Overview\n\nKey Benefits\n\nHow to Use\n\nWhy Choose This Cleanser\nInnsaei’s Acne Cleansing Foam is crafted for those who struggle with breakouts but want a gentle, non-drying solution. Its salicylic acid formula targets acne at the source while maintaining skin comfort and hydration. Whether you\'re dealing with occasional blemishes or persistent acne, this cleanser fits seamlessly into any skincare routine.', 315.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 45.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Cleansing Foam 150mlPrice in BD', 'Innsaei Salicylic Acid Acne Cleansing Foam 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innsaei-salicylic-acid-acne-cleansing-foam-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:36'),
(2170, 'Anua 8+ Hyaluronic Acid Panthenol Hydrating Gentle Foaming Cleanser', '1', 0, 68, 21, '2170', '2170', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Formulated with eight types of hyaluronic acid to moisturize skin as well as panthenol to strengthen the skin barrier, this foaming cleanser delivers superb cleansing power while producing a well-hydrated finish. It contains hydrolyzed vegetable protein to boost skin elasticity and zinc PCA to regulate sebum production. The cream formula transforms easily to foam upon contact with water to leave skin clear and refreshed. The product is sensitive skin-friendly.', 1656.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '150ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 694.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua 8+ Hyaluronic Acid Panthenol Hydrating Gentle Foaming CleanserPrice in BD', 'Anua 8+ Hyaluronic Acid Panthenol Hydrating Gentle Foaming Cleanser Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-8-hyaluronic-acid-panthenol-hydrating-gentle-foaming-cleanser', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:36', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2171, 'Cathy Doll Acne Oil Control Cleansing Foam 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 100, '2171', '2171', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Finding the right cleanser when you have oily or acne-prone skin can be a challenge. Some gentle cleansers are too mild, while other foaming cleansers are too harsh. The Cathy Doll Acne Oil Control Cleansing Foam strikes balance with its SLS-free formula that still cleans the face, removing oil and dirt buildup effectively. BENEFITS Remove impurities, dirt, and pollutants that clog your pores with the Cathy Doll Acne Oil Control Cleansing Foam. SLS and paraben-free, the mild formula focuses on zapping away dirt and oil without damaging your skin\'s natural barrier. It contains coconut oil, tea tree extract, and Centella Asiatica that work together to keep the skin smooth, bright, and free of uneven dark spots, as well as remove wrinkles', 583.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 342.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cathy Doll Acne Oil Control Cleansing Foam 150mlPrice in BD', 'Cathy Doll Acne Oil Control Cleansing Foam 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cathy-doll-acne-oil-control-cleansing-foam-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
