(2173, 'Cerave Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser for Dry to Very Dry Skin', '1', 0, 68, 153, '2173', '2173', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lightweight cleansing oil for face and body\nTraditional oil cleansers use oils and other nourishing ingredients to help hydrate and thoroughly remove impurities, dirt, and excess oil that can build up on your skin. We recommend choosing a formula that combines oil-based ingredients and surfactants, like our Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser, which cleanses without disrupting the skin barrier or stripping the skin of essential moisture.\nDeveloped with dermatologists, CeraVe Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser transforms from an oil into a soft lathering foam. It gently yet effectively cleanses the skin’s surface and removes excess oil without leaving your skin feeling tight or dry. This oil cleanser with three essential ceramides helps to lock in moisture and helps maintain the skin’s protective barrier. It also features beneficial ingredients for healthy-looking skin, such as squalane oil, triglyceride, and hyaluronic acid.\nCeraVe Hydrating Foaming Oil is ideal for dry to very dry skin but is also suitable for sensitive skin, eczema-prone skin, and baby skin (3+ months). It’s also non-comedogenic, fragrance-free, and residue-free. Using our foaming oil cleanser as part of your daily routine can help support comfortable, hydrated skin on your face and body.\nCountry of Origin: USA\nIngredients:\nAQUA/WATER, GLYCERIN, PEG-200 HYDROGENATED GLYCERYL PALMATE, COCO-BETAINE, DISODIUM COCOYL GLUTAMATE, PEG-120 METHYL GLUCOSE DIOLEATE, POLYSORBATE 20, PEG-7 GLYCERYL COCOATE, SQUALANE, CERAMIDE NP, CERAMIDE AP, CERAMIDE EOP, CARBOMER, TRIETHYL CITRATE, SODIUM CHLORIDE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SODIUM COCOYL GLUTAMATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, SODIUM LAUROYL LACTYLATE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, CHOLESTEROL, CITRIC ACID, CAPRYLOYL GLYCINE, HYDROXYACETOPHENONE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, CAPRYLIC/ CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, TRISODIUM ETHYLENEDIAMINE DISUCCINATE, PHYTOSPHINGOSINE, XANTHAN GUM, BENZOIC ACID, PEG-150 PENTAERYTHRITYL TETRASTEARATE, PPG-5-CETETH-20, PEG-6 CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC GLYCERIDE\nBenefits:\nHow to use:\n\n\n\n\nCeraVe Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser gently cleanses and removes makeup, dirt & excess oil without leaving skin feeling tight or dry.​\nIt helps skin keep hydrating and maintains skin’s natural barrier.​\nThis foaming oil cleanser transforms from an oil into a soft lathering foam.​\n​\n​\nWet skin with lukewarm water. Massage a dime-size amount of Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser into skin in a gentle circular motion. Rinse.​\n​Follow by your favorite CeraVe’s moisturizer.​\nSuitable for use on the face, body, even hands.​\nAvoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs rinse thoroughly with water.\nAll CeraVe products are developed with dermatologists.​\nHydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser is formulated without fragrance. It is non-comedogenic and suitable for dry to very dry skin including sensitive skin, atopic-prone skin, and baby skin (3+ months).\nSqualane Oil is known to help retain moisture – the formula maintains the skin barrier and keeps skin comfortable without feeling greasy.​\nHyaluronic Acid helps retain skin’s natural moisture.​\nCeramides are naturally found in your skin and play a vital role in helping your skin protect you. They help fill in the gaps between your skin cells so your skin can seal in moisture and seal out impurities.', 2700.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser for Dry to Very Dry SkinPrice in BD', 'Cerave Hydrating Foaming Oil Cleanser for Dry to Very Dry Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-hydrating-foaming-oil-cleanser-for-dry-to-very-dry-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2174, 'Anua Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil', '1', 0, 68, 21, '2174', '2174', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Product Details:\nGENTLE YET POTENT CLEANSING OIL: Effective in eliminating makeup residue, blackheads and sebum, whilst preventing pore congestion. Essential step for double cleansing, with glowy glass skin results.MILD INGREDIENTS ONLY: Formulated with Heartleaf extract for soothing effects on the skinFOR ALL SKIN TYPES: Hypoallergenic & Non-Irritation Test completed, making it suitable for all skin types and especially Sensitive, Acne-Prone Skin.GENTLE ON THE EYES: No eye stinging experiences when used around eyes, Eye Irritation Test (Cruelty Free HET-CAM Test) completedion test completedHOW TO DOUBLE CLEANSE: Apply the cleansing oil to dry skin and gently massage for 1-2 minutes. Emulsify with water to effectively remove sebum. Wash off all oil residues by using a water based cleanser.\n\nHow It Works:\nHow to Use:\n\nIngredients:\nEthylhexyl Palmitate, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Butyl Avocadate, Fragrance, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Tocopherol, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Melia Azadirachta Bark Extract, Moringa Oleifera Seed Oil, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract\n\nMade in Korea', 510.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 240.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Anua Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing OilPrice in BD', 'Anua Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'anua-heartleaf-pore-control-cleansing-oil', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2175, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Cleansing Gel for All Skin Types', '1', 0, 68, 11, '2175', '2175', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Cleansing Gel for All Skin Types is a revitalizing facial cleanser that gently removes impurities, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and radiant. Enriched with Vitamin C, it helps brighten and even out your complexion, while its lightweight gel formula is suitable for all skin types. Perfect for daily use, this cleansing gel promotes a healthy glow and a clearer, more luminous skin tone.\nCountry Of Origin: Thailand', 979.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '200ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 821.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Cleansing Gel for All Skin TypesPrice in BD', 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Cleansing Gel for All Skin Types Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-vitamin-c-brightening-cleansing-gel-for-all-skin-types', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2176, 'Cathy Doll Whitamin C Brightening Cleansing Gel', '1', 0, 68, 100, '2176', '2176', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This skin brightening vitamin C cleansing gel aids in providing deep cleansing without over drying the skin with the value of 99% pure 3-o-ethyl ascorbic acid, a vitamin C derivative that is more stable than natural vitamin C to offer its consistent benefits for bright and spot-free results. Citrus Nobilis (Mandarin Orange) Peel extract infused in this cleansing gel also helps keep the skin balanced and smooth while delivering hydration with vitamin E and Coconut Oil extract, along with Propolis extract to protect the skin from bacteria which allow you to unveil perfectly clean, luminous and moisturized complexion.', 530.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '120ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 270.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cathy Doll Whitamin C Brightening Cleansing GelPrice in BD', 'Cathy Doll Whitamin C Brightening Cleansing Gel Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cathy-doll-whitamin-c-brightening-cleansing-gel', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2177, 'Skinpro Acne Clearing Gel Cleanser with Salicylic Acid For Acne Prone Skin 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 338, '2177', '2177', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skinpro Acne Clearing Gel cleanser has pimple-clearing properties helps to control excess oil and pimple-causing bacteria has a gel-like consistency that foams quickly is exceptionally gentle on the skin and doesn’t bring about any sort of dryness or irritation Helps to improve skin irritation and redness skin helps to keep the skin smooth and supple skinpro acne clearing gel cleanser with maximum-strength 2% salicylic acid helps eliminate the breakout cycle and prevent future breakouts. It leaves skin feeling clean and residue-free.\nSkinpro acne-clearing gel cleanser with maximum-strength 2% salicylic acid helps eliminate the breakout cycle and prevent future breakouts. It leaves skin feeling clean and residue-free.\n\n\nSalicylic Acid, Aqua, Carbomer, Allantoin, Tri Ethanol Amine, DMDM Hydantoin', 177.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 13.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Skinpro Acne Clearing Gel Cleanser with Salicylic Acid For Acne Prone Skin 100mlPrice in BD', 'Skinpro Acne Clearing Gel Cleanser with Salicylic Acid For Acne Prone Skin 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skinpro-acne-clearing-gel-cleanser-with-salicylic-acid-for-acne-prone-skin-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37');
