(2178, 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Cleansing Lotion', '1', 0, 68, 11, '2178', '2178', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Boots - Cucumber Cleansing Lotion - 150 ML\nBoots formulated their skin care range enriched with cooling cucumber and vitamins to gently care for your skin. This lotion will remove your makeup, as well as those unwanted excess oils and impurities. Your skin will be left feeling thoroughly cleansed, refreshed and beautifully soft.\nFor All Skin Types.\nEnriched with cooling cucumber and vitaminc to gently care for your skin.\nDermatologically Tested.\n\nHow To Use : Squeeze a small amount of cleansing lotion onto a cotton pad and massage in circular movements on your dampened skin, splash with warm water to rinse and simply pat dry.\n\nAvoid contact with eyes. If product gets into eyes rinse well with water immediately. This is not a food. Keep out of reach of children.\n\nAqua (Water), Paraffinum liquidum (Mineral oil), Glycerin, Cetearyl alcohol, Phenoxyethanol, Potassium cetyl phosphate, Methlparaben, Carbomer, Ethylparaben, Tocopheryl acetate, Potassium hydroxide, Propylene glycol, Dipropylene glycol, Simethicone, Retinyl palmitate, Tetrasodium EDTA, Parfum (Fragrance), Sorbitol, Cucumis sativus (Cucumber) fruit extract, Denatonium benzoate, Tocopherol, Benzoic acid, CI19140 (Yellow 5), CI 42090 (Blue 1)\n\nMade In UK', 638.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 287.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Cleansing LotionPrice in BD', 'Boots Everyday Cucumber Cleansing Lotion Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-everyday-cucumber-cleansing-lotion', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2179, 'Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml and Innsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen 50ml', '1', 0, 68, 6, '2179', '2179', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Here’s a complete skincare duo from Innsaei that’s designed to cleanse, hydrate, and protect—ideal for daily use and suitable for all skin types, especially sensitive and dehydrated skin.\nInnsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 (150ml)This gentle gel cleanser is formulated to maintain your skin’s natural pH balance, helping to cleanse without stripping moisture. It’s enriched with natural BHA ingredients like salicylic acid to help unclog pores and reduce acne, while allantoin soothes irritation and promotes a healthier complexion.\nKey Benefits\nHow to UseWet your face and hands, apply a small amount of cleanser, lather gently, and massage onto the skin. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. Use morning and night for best results.\nInnsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen (50ml)This sunscreen offers broad-spectrum protection while delivering deep hydration through hyaluronic acid. Its lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs quickly and layers well under makeup, making it perfect for daily wear.\nKey Benefits\nHow to UseApply generously to clean skin as the final step in your morning routine. Reapply every two hours when exposed to sunlight.\nWhy Choose This ComboThis pairing is ideal for anyone seeking a simple, effective skincare routine. The cleanser gently purifies and balances the skin, while the sunscreen hydrates and protects. Together, they support clear, healthy, and resilient skin—perfect for everyday use in any climate.', 820.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '150ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 230.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml and Innsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen 50mlPrice in BD', 'Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml and Innsaei Hyaluronic Sunscreen 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innsaei-low-ph-daily-gel-cleanser-55-150ml-and-innsaei-hyaluronic-sunscreen-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2180, 'Acne Combo: Skinpro Acne Clearing Cleanser 100ml + Ultimate Acne Gel 15ml + Freyias Moisturizing Cream 50ml', '1', 0, 68, 338, '2180', '2180', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Get clear, healthy, and balanced skin with the SkinPro Complete Acne Care Combo, a powerful 3-step daily skincare solution specially designed for acne-prone and oily skin. This combo targets breakouts at the source while keeping your skin hydrated, calm, and nourished—without dryness or irritation.\nThe SkinPro Acne Clearing Gel Cleanser is formulated with 2% Salicylic Acid to remove excess oil, unclog pores, and fight acne-causing bacteria. Its gentle foaming gel cleanses deeply without stripping moisture, helping reduce redness and irritation.\nThe SkinPro Ultimate Acne Gel delivers maximum-strength 2% Salicylic Acid directly to pimples and breakouts. It helps shrink active acne, prevent future breakouts, and improve overall skin texture.\nThe Freyias Moisturizing Skin Cream replenishes lost moisture and soothes the skin after acne treatment. Enriched with glycerin, jojoba oil, vitamin E, and panthenol, it keeps skin soft, smooth, and comfortable all day—without feeling greasy.', 590.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Acne Combo: Skinpro Acne Clearing Cleanser 100ml + Ultimate Acne Gel 15ml + Freyias Moisturizing Cream 50mlPrice in BD', 'Acne Combo: Skinpro Acne Clearing Cleanser 100ml + Ultimate Acne Gel 15ml + Freyias Moisturizing Cream 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acne-combo-skinpro-acne-clearing-cleanser-100ml-ultimate-acne-gel-15ml-freyias-moisturizing-cream-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2181, 'ACM Sensitelial Gel Nettoyant Surgras Ultra Rich 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 284, '2181', '2181', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ultra-Rich Cleansing Gel – 200ml\nA gentle, ultra-rich cleansing gel designed for very dry and sensitive skin. This nourishing formula cleanses without stripping, protects the skin’s natural barrier, and leaves the skin feeling soft, comfortable, and hydrated.\nKey Benefits:\nDeeply cleanses while preserving skin moisture\nUltra-rich texture suitable for dry and sensitive skin\nSoothes irritation and reduces tightness\nHelps restore and protect the skin barrier\nDermatologically tested\nUsage: Apply to damp skin, gently massage, then rinse thoroughly. Suitable for daily use on face and body.\nPresentation: 200ml bottle', 1439.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 61.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'ACM Sensitelial Gel Nettoyant Surgras Ultra Rich 200mlPrice in BD', 'ACM Sensitelial Gel Nettoyant Surgras Ultra Rich 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'acm-sensitelial-gel-nettoyant-surgras-ultra-rich-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2182, 'Singuladerm Hydrantial Cleanser 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 144, '2182', '2182', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gentle gel that transforms into a pleasant cleansing foam on contact with water. Gently removes impurities, excess sebum and makeup. Its formula incorporates Biomafense, an innovative technology that helps to reinforce hydration, balance the skin\'s microbiome and protect it from oxidative stress. As a complement, niacinamide (vitamin B3) helps to reduce irritation and soothe redness. The result is a clean, comfortable and balanced skin.', 2550.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2550.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Singuladerm Hydrantial Cleanser 200mlPrice in BD', 'Singuladerm Hydrantial Cleanser 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'singuladerm-hydrantial-cleanser-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2183, 'Babe Purifying Cleansing Gel 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 99, '2183', '2183', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nPurifying Cleanser is a refreshing and foaming gel with rinsing that removes impurities and helps control excess oil and facial glows without irritating the skin.\nSeborrregula and mattifying\nBenefits\nThe skin is mattified. Its daily use prevents the rebounding effect. It unclogs pores preventing the possible appearance of acne. It helps to reduce inflammation of the granites. Non-comedogenic.\nActive Ingredients\nCytobiol Burdock 2% Salicylic Acid 1 0.20% Zinc PCA 0.02%\n\nDaily wear, morning and night.\nApply to damp face, massage carefully and warm with plenty of water.\nAvoid the periocular area.\n\n\nHelps control excess oil and facial shine without irritating the skin.\n\n\n\n3 in 1: Exfoliating, desynrusting and absorbent.\nFrequency of use:\n1-2 times per week\nDaily hydration of oily or acneic tendency skin.\nFrequency of use:\nDaily wear, morning and night\nSpot dry intensive action.\nFrequency of use:\nUse daily, reapply 2-3 times a day on the area to be treated', 2600.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, -2600.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Babe Purifying Cleansing Gel 200mlPrice in BD', 'Babe Purifying Cleansing Gel 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'babe-purifying-cleansing-gel-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2184, 'Neutrogena Silicone & Oil Free Deep Clean Gel Wash 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 151, '2184', '2184', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash is a good skincare product. It is enriched with an oil-free formula to deeply clean your skin. It is generally used for women and is now widely available in Bangladesh. This gel wash removes unclogged pores and dark spots. It relieves dryness and refreshes the new skin’s surface by providing glycerin. It also helps to remove makeup and excess oil. It provides a fresh and glowing complexion. The mild fragrance formula leaves you feeling energized and fresh. It also contains aqua, the main ingredient that makes your skin moist and smooth. It helps to hydrate your skin and improves its appearance. Aqua also helps to remove toxins from the skin. The scrub restores & improves skin texture and gives you soothe skin.\nAqua, Glycerin, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Lauryl Glucoside, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Disodium Edta, Citric Acid, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Benzoate, Parfum, Ci 19140, Ci 17200.\n\nOverall, Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash is a good skincare product for deeply cleansing your skin and making your skin more radiant and healthier.   Is Neutrogena Deep Clean\n\nGel Wash good for the skin?Yes, Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash is enriched with an oil-free formula to deeply cleanse your skin and promote a fresh and glowing complexion. It also removes dirt and excess oil.\n\nHow many times should you use Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash? Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash can deeply clean your skin and reduce excess oil, and makeup with ease. So Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash will be gently used twice a day.\n\nHow often to use Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash?Neutrogena Deep Clean Gel Wash cleans deep into the pores but is gentle enough to use every day.', 770.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Pack', 0.00, 1, NULL, 500.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0,