(2190, 'Iunik Calendula Complete Cleansing Oil 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 17, '2190', '2190', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Iunik Calendula Complete Cleansing Oil\nA mini version of the IUNIK Calendula Complete Cleansing Oil deeply cleanses the skin and pores, effectively removing heavy makeup and impurities without causing dryness. The nutrient-rich formula features Calendula Flower Extract, providing moisture and a soothing effect on the skin. It also contains Jojoba Seed Oil, which approaches whiteheads and blackheads inside the pores, assisting in maintaining clear, smooth skin, while Sunflower Seed Oil keeps the skin hydrated during cleansing.\nThe lightweight, smooth texture is easy to spread and massage into the skin, effortlessly breaking down impurities. Formulated with EWG Green-graded, non-comedogenic ingredients, it is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nIngredients\nStar Ingredients - Calendula Flower Extract (anti-inflammatory, moisturising, antioxidant-rich, stimulates collagen production, anti-acne), Jojoba Seed Oil (protects skin from environmental stressors, controls excess sebum, breaks down whiteheads and blackheads inside the pores), Sunflower Seed Oil (antioxidant-rich, helps with premature ageing, retains moisture)\nHelianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Canola Oil, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Calendula Officinalis Flower Extract, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Cananga Odorata Flower Oil, Sorbitan Sesquioleate\nHow To Use\n1. Wet your face and apply the cleansing oil\n2. Massage it in circular motions to cleanse and dissolve makeup\n3. Rinse with warm water\n\nMade in Korea', 1750.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '200ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1550.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Iunik Calendula Complete Cleansing Oil 200mlPrice in BD', 'Iunik Calendula Complete Cleansing Oil 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'iunik-calendula-complete-cleansing-oil-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2191, 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil', '1', 0, 68, 16, '2191', '2191', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lightweight, multifunctional cleanser thoroughly removes makeup and impurities from skin while offering some extra nourishment. Coconut-derived MCT oil combined with cica extract as well as six kinds of botanical oils deliver a refreshing, skin-soothing and pore-tightening finish.\n1) ALL IN ONE CLEANSER: With this cleansing oil, you can remove everything from base makeup like sunscreen and foundationto color makeup\nlike lipstick and mascara. No need for multiple cleansing. Finish off washing your face quickly and simple with this product.\n2) OIL TYPE CENTELLA EXTRACT: To put Centella Asiatica into oil, we used MCT oil, which consists merely 7% of coconut, as a solvent and succeeded\nin extracting oil type Centella Asiatica. Unlike other liquid type of it, you can experience deep and pure nature of it.3) SAFE AND OPTIMAL FORMULA: Instead of harmful and irritating ingredients, we put only mild and safe ingredients including plant derived oils.\nIt’s a hypoallergenic oil that won’t cause any soar eyes or thick oil layers while using it.4) FRESH AND LIGHT TEXTURE: Light and thin oil cleanse deep inside pores and provides fresh feelings after washing.\nIt’d be a great starter for people who haven’t used oil for cleansing their face.5) MICELLAR CLEANSING: We’ve come up with our own micellar method to provide unique cleansing oil.\nIt’s a transparent water type at the beginning, but it goes milky as soon as it meets water. This allows thorough cleansing and moist finish.\n\nIngredients: Ethylhexyl Stearate, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Centella Asiatica Extract(10,000Ppm), Helianthus Annuus(Sunflower) Seed Oil, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia(Bergamot) Fruit Oil, Olea Europaea(Olive) Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis(Jojoba) Seed Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Pelargonium Graveolens Flower Oil, Rosa Damascena Flower Oil\n\nHow to use::\nDispense a moderate amount onto dry hands.\nMassage over dry face to dissolve surface oil and dirt.\nWet hands and continue massaging to create a light, milky emulsion.\nRinse with lukewarm water.', 1950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1050.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing OilPrice in BD', 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-light-cleansing-oil', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
