(2194, 'Simple Kind To Skin Hydrating Cleansing Oil with Pure Grape Seed Oil & Vitamin E + A', '1', 0, 68, 24, '2194', '2194', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Simple Kind to Skin Hydrating Cleansing Oil - our finest cleanser for thoroughly clean and touchably soft skin.Made with 100% natural grape-seed oil, our new face oil is enriched with vitamin A & E to dissolve impurities and remove make up, leaving your skin deeply clean and well hydrated.Our facial oil is a gentle, hydrating, soothing and effective way to cleanse and lift away even waterproof makeup without stripping or irritating the skin.So, how does it work?Oil attracts oil, so when a few drops of the Simple ® Hydrating Cleansing Oil are massaged onto dry skin, the formula efficiently attracts grease and makeup and then cleverly rinses away once the oil is mixed with a little water. It won\'t leave your skin dry or greasy, just completely clean, soft and fresh, making it suitable for even oily skin.Caring cleansing that is unforgiving on make-up. A deep clean without residue - for perfectly clean, nourished and smooth skin.And as per all Simple ® products, Simple ® Kind to Skin Hydrating Cleansing Oil contains no artificial perfume or colour and no harsh chemicals, so it won\'t upset your skin.\n\nKey Features:\n\n\nVitis Vinifera Seed Oil, Isopropyl Palmitate, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Phenoxyethanol, BHT, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Isopropyl Myristate, Retinyl Palmitate, Tocopheryl Acetate.\n\nMade in Hungary', 1149.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 331.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple Kind To Skin Hydrating Cleansing Oil with Pure Grape Seed Oil & Vitamin E + APrice in BD', 'Simple Kind To Skin Hydrating Cleansing Oil with Pure Grape Seed Oil & Vitamin E + A Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-kind-to-skin-hydrating-cleansing-oil-with-pure-grape-seed-oil-vitamin-e-a', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy