(2196, 'The Derma Co 2% Niacinamide Gentle Skin Cleanser 125ml', '1', 0, 68, 33, '2196', '2196', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Derma Co 2% Niacinamide Gentle Skin Cleanser (125ml)\nThe Derma Co 2% Niacinamide Gentle Skin Cleanser is a mild yet effective formula designed to cleanse, soothe, and hydrate the skin without causing irritation. Infused with 2% Niacinamide to strengthen the skin’s barrier and Cica Extract for its anti-inflammatory properties, this soap-free cleanser ensures a deep cleanse while maintaining the skin’s natural moisture balance.\nKeep your skin clean, calm, and hydrated with The Derma Co 2% Niacinamide Gentle Skin Cleanser.', 1050.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 110.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Derma Co 2% Niacinamide Gentle Skin Cleanser 125mlPrice in BD', 'The Derma Co 2% Niacinamide Gentle Skin Cleanser 125ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-derma-co-2-niacinamide-gentle-skin-cleanser-125ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
