(2198, 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil With Pure Centella', '1', 0, 68, 16, '2198', '2198', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A lightweight, multifunctional cleanser that works to cleanse without drying or upsetting the skin\'s natural pH balance.\nA lightweight, multifunctional cleanser that works to cleanse without drying or upsetting the skin\'s natural pH balance.The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil is a hypoallergenic facial cleanser designed with the gentle properties of Centella Asiatica extract and natural plant-derived oils. These components work harmoniously to delicately dissolve makeup and eliminate impurities lodged within pores. Its velvety texture smoothly glides across the skin\'s surface, transitioning into a milky emulsion when met with water, leaving behind a refreshed, hydrated, and soothing sensation.\nThis cleansing oil is designed to deliver a smooth and gentle cleansing experience. Get rid of makeup, impurities, and dirt without stripping skin of essential nutrients and oils. This cleanser dissolves makeup and other contaminants as it nourishes and moisturizes the skin.\nIngredientsCentella Asiatica Extract, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia (Bergamot) Fruit Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil\nDirectionsApply a few pumps of cleansing oil onto dry face with dry hands. Gently massage in circular motions to dissolve makeup and debris. Add a little water and continue massaging to create a light and milky emulsion. Rinse off completely with lukewarm water.\nHow to Use1. Dispense a small amount and softly massage in circular movements onto dry skin.2. Add a few drops of water to transform it into a milky texture before rinsing thoroughly.\n\n', 720.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '30ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 280.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil With Pure CentellaPrice in BD', 'SKIN 1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil With Pure Centella Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'skin-1004-madagascar-centella-light-cleansing-oil-with-pure-centella', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2199, 'Buy 1 Skinpro Acne Cleansing Gel with Salicylic Acid for Acne Prone Skin 100ml and Get 1 Blackhead Removal Silicone Nose Brush Free', '1', 0, 68, 338, '2199', '2199', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Skinpro Acne Cleansing Gel with Salicylic Acid (100ml) - Buy 1 Get 1 Free Offer\nThe Skinpro Acne Cleansing Gel with Salicylic Acid is a powerful skincare solution specifically designed for acne-prone skin. It helps clear breakouts, unclog pores, and control excess oil while being gentle enough for regular use. Salicylic acid is known for its ability to penetrate the pores deeply, exfoliating from within and preventing future breakouts.\n\nFree Product: Blackhead Removal Silicone Nose Brush\n\nMade in Bangladesh', 170.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '100ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 20.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Buy 1 Skinpro Acne Cleansing Gel with Salicylic Acid for Acne Prone Skin 100ml and Get 1 Blackhead Removal Silicone Nose Brush FreePrice in BD', 'Buy 1 Skinpro Acne Cleansing Gel with Salicylic Acid for Acne Prone Skin 100ml and Get 1 Blackhead Removal Silicone Nose Brush Free Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'buy-1-skinpro-acne-cleansing-gel-with-salicylic-acid-for-acne-prone-skin-100ml-and-get-1-blackhead-removal-silicone-nose-brush-free', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
