(2201, 'Daiso Cleansing Water 140ml', '1', 0, 68, 401, '2201', '2201', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Key Features:\nGentle Cleansing: Effectively removes makeup and impurities without harsh rubbing.\nMinimal Ingredients: Formulated with a simple ingredient list to minimize potential irritation.\nFragrance-Free: Ideal for sensitive skin, as it contains no added fragrances.\nNo Residue: Leaves the skin feeling clean and fresh without any sticky residue.\nHow to Use:\nApplication: Soak an appropriate amount of the cleansing water onto a cotton pad.\nCleansing: Gently wipe the cotton pad over your face to remove makeup and impurities.\nNo Rinsing Required: There\'s no need to rinse your face after use, making it convenient for on-the-go cleansing.\n\nIngredients:\nMinimal  ingredients,\nFragrance free\nGentle around the eyes\nNo tacky residue\nThe Daiso Cleansing Water comes in a 140ml bottle and is Made in Vietnam. It\'s an affordable option for those seeking a gentle and effective cleansing solution.', 780.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 370.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Daiso Cleansing Water 140mlPrice in BD', 'Daiso Cleansing Water 140ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'daiso-cleansing-water-140ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2202, 'Garnier SkinActive Vitamin C Micellar Water 400ml', '1', 0, 68, 37, '2202', '2202', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier SkinActive Vitamin C Micellar Water is a refreshing, lightweight cleanser designed to brighten and purify the skin while effectively removing makeup, dirt, and impurities. Enriched with Vitamin C, it helps revitalize dull, tired-looking skin, leaving it soft, clean, and radiant. Its gentle, no-rinse formula is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nBrightens Skin: Vitamin C helps reduce dullness for a luminous complexion.\nEffective Cleansing: Removes makeup, dirt, and impurities in one simple step.\nGentle & Refreshing: Safe for sensitive areas, including eyes and lips.\nNon-Greasy Finish: Leaves skin feeling clean, soft, and comfortable.\nDermatologically Tested: Clinically approved for sensitive skin.\nFull INCI List:Aqua / Water, Glycerin, Hexylene Glycol, Poloxamer 184, Sodium Chloride, Citric Acid, Ascorbyl Glucoside (Vitamin C), Coco-Glucoside, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Hydroxide, Linalool, Limonene, Parfum / Fragrance, CI 19140, CI 42090\nIngredient Highlights:\nVitamin C (Ascorbyl Glucoside): Brightens skin and reduces dullness.\nGlycerin: Maintains hydration and softness.\nCoco-Glucoside & Poloxamer 184: Gentle surfactants that cleanse effectively without irritation.\nCitric Acid & Sodium Hydroxide: Maintain pH balance for healthy, comfortable skin.\nSoak a cotton pad with the micellar water.\nGently wipe over face, eyes, and lips.\nNo rinsing required.\nRepeat if necessary to remove all makeup or impurities.\nVolume: 400 mL\nForm: Liquid micellar water\nSkin Type: All skin types; suitable for sensitive skin and eyes\nFinish: Fresh, soft, and non-greasy\nDermatologically Tested', 1848.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1102.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier SkinActive Vitamin C Micellar Water 400mlPrice in BD', 'Garnier SkinActive Vitamin C Micellar Water 400ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-skinactive-vitamin-c-micellar-water-400ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2203, 'Cerave Micellar Cleansing Water 295ml', '1', 0, 68, 153, '2203', '2203', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cleansing your skin isn’t a one-size-fits-all procedure – all manner of formats, textures and methods are now available for washing the day off. Micellar water is one of the latest formulas to join the skincare universe, with this iteration from CeraVe capable of removing dirt, pollution and make-up in a one-swipe, no-rinse motion. Extremely gentle on both the skin and eyes, this particular product is boosted with hyaluronic acid and ceramides.\n\nBenefits\n\nIngredients:\nAqua/ Water, Glycerine, Hexylene, Glycol, Poloxamer184, Disodium Cocoamphoacetate, Disodium EDTA, Niacinamide, Polyaminopropyl Biguanide, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, BHT, Ceramide NP, Phenoxyethanol, Ceramide AP, Phytosphingosine, Cholesterol, Xanthan Gum, Carbomer, Ethylhexylglycerin, Ceramide EOP.\nCountry of Origin: USA', 1500.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1300.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cerave Micellar Cleansing Water 295mlPrice in BD', 'Cerave Micellar Cleansing Water 295ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cerave-micellar-cleansing-water-295ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2204, 'Garnier SkinActive All in 1 Micellar Cleansing Water for Sensitive Skin 400ml', '1', 0, 68, 37, '2204', '2204', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This All-in-1 cleanser is surprisingly powerful yet gentle to skin. It is specially formulated to effectively cleanse, remove makeup, and refresh skin. Like a magnet, micelles capture and lift away dirt, oil and makeup without harsh rubbing, leaving skin perfectly clean, and refreshed without over-drying.\n\nInstruction of Use:\nTO REMOVE EYE MAKEUP:Hold pad over closed eyes for a few seconds, then gently wipe without harsh rubbing.TO CLEAN SKIN & REMOVE FACE MAKEUP:Gently wipe all over until skin is completely clean from makeup and impurities. Use daily, AM/PM. No need to rinse.\n\nIngredients:\nAQUA / WATER, HEXYLENE GLYCOL, GLYCERIN, DISODIUM COCOAMPHODIACETATE, DISODIUM EDTA, POLOXAMER 184, POLYAMINOPROPYL BIGUANIDE, FIL B162919/3\n\nMade in Poland', 1345.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1055.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier SkinActive All in 1 Micellar Cleansing Water for Sensitive Skin 400mlPrice in BD', 'Garnier SkinActive All in 1 Micellar Cleansing Water for Sensitive Skin 400ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-skinactive-all-in-1-micellar-cleansing-water-for-sensitive-skin-400ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2205, 'Bioderma Sebium H2O Purifying Micellar Water for Combination & Oily Skin 500ml', '1', 0, 68, 200, '2205', '2205', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sebium H2O Micellar Water is a make-up removing micellar water spcifically created for combination to oily skin, with micelles that mimics the natural composition of the skin for perfect make-up removal and total respect for even the most sensitive skin. Enriched with purifying agents, zinc gluconate and copper sulphate, Sébium H2O leaves skin feeling refreshed. The D.A.F. patented natural complex contributes to raise the skin\'s tolerance threshold.Soak cotton pad with Sensibio H2O, cleanse and/or remove makeup from your face and eyes. Repeat until cotton pad is clean then gently pat skin and eyes dry.\nMade in France\n\nKey Features:', 2495.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '500ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1205.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Sebium H2O Purifying Micellar Water for Combination & Oily Skin 500mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Sebium H2O Purifying Micellar Water for Combination & Oily Skin 500ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-sebium-h2o-purifying-micellar-water-for-combination-oily-skin-500ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2206, 'Bioderma Sensibio H2O Original Micellar Water 500ml', '1', 0, 68, 200, '2206', '2206', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\nBuy Bioderma Sensibio H2O Original Micellar Water 500ML in Bangladesh at Arogga. This unscented, high-tolerance cleanser removes makeup and pollutants while soothing sensitive skin.\n\nThis micellar water with physiological pH that guarantees a cleaning and make-up removal carefully of the face and the eyes and supports the elimination of the residues of pollution and pollen. Inspired by the biological structure of the skin lipids, its micelles eliminate impurities while respecting the skin balance. The soothing dermatological active ingredients help prevent feelings of irritation. The patented D.A.F. complex increases the tolerance threshold of the most sensitive skin.\n\n\nIntroduction: Bioderma Sensibio H2O, also known as Créaline H2O, is the original micellar water that has revolutionized the skincare routine for sensitive skin. This gentle, no-rinse cleanser uses micellar technology to effectively remove makeup, pollutants, and even heavy metals from the skin while maintaining its natural balance. With a physiological pH and the patented D.A.F. complex, Sensibio H2O respects the most sensitive skin, providing high tolerance and reducing irritation.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIndications: Suitable for sensitive skin, including the delicate areas around the eyes and lips. Tested under dermatological and ophthalmological control for high skin and eye tolerance.\n\nHow to Use: Use morning and/or evening, 7 days a week. Soak a cotton pad with Sensibio H2O and gently cleanse or remove makeup from your face and eyes. No rinsing required.\n\nSafety Guide: For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. If irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.\n\nBioderma is a leading skincare brand known for its commitment to developing dermatologically tested products that cater to sensitive skin. The Sensibio line, featuring the iconic Sensibio H2O, is trusted by millions worldwide for its gentle yet effective skincare solutions.\n\nI', 2559.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 640.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Sensibio H2O Original Micellar Water 500mlPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Sensibio H2O Original Micellar Water 500ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-sensibio-h2o-original-micellar-water-500ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2207, 'Bioderma Créaline H2O TS Micellar Water 500ml – Makeup Remover for Very Dry & Sensitive Skin', '1', 0, 68, 200, '2207', '2207', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Bioderma Créaline H2O TS (also known as Sensibio H2O TS) is a dermatologically tested micellar cleansing water specially formulated for very dry and sensitive skin. It gently removes makeup and impurities from the face and eyes while maintaining the skin’s natural balance.\nInspired by the biological structure of skin lipids, its micelles effectively capture dirt, pollution particles, and pollen residues without irritation. Enriched with hydrating and soothing active ingredients, it helps prevent skin dehydration and feelings of discomfort.\nThe patented D.A.F™ (Dermatological Advanced Formulation) complex increases the skin’s tolerance threshold, making it suitable even for the most sensitive skin types.\nResults:\nGently cleanses and removes makeup without leaving residue\nSoothes and hydrates dry, sensitive skin\nLeaves skin soft, clean, and refreshed\nKey Features:\nFor very dry and sensitive skin\nNo rinse required\nFragrance-free and hypoallergenic\nTested under dermatological and ophthalmological control\nHow to Use:Soak a cotton pad with Créaline H2O TS. Gently cleanse and/or remove makeup from your face and eyes. Repeat until the cotton pad is clean. No rinsing needed.\nVolume: 500 ml', 2360.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 839.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Bioderma Créaline H2O TS Micellar Water 500ml – Makeup Remover for Very Dry & Sensitive SkinPrice in BD', 'Bioderma Créaline H2O TS Micellar Water 500ml – Makeup Remover for Very Dry & Sensitive Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'bioderma-crealine-h2o-ts-micellar-water-500ml-makeup-remover-for-very-dry-sensitive-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2208, 'Biore Makeup Remover Cleansing Water for Normal to Dry Skin', '1', 0, 68, 402, '2208', '2208', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vietnam\nSoak an appropriate amount onto cotton pad and gently wipe off with no excessive rubbing. Change cotton & repeat untill cotton remains clean after wiping. No need to rinse off or double cleanse.\nWater (Aqua), Dipropylene Glycol, PEG-12 Laurate, Butylene Glycol, PEG/PPG/Polybutylene Glycol-8/5/3 Glycerin, PEG-8, PEG-6 Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Sodium Citrate, Sodium Methyl Stearoyl Taurate, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA, Phenoxyethanol, Methylparaben, o-Cymen-5-ol\nNormal', 660.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 460.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Biore Makeup Remover Cleansing Water for Normal to Dry SkinPrice in BD', 'Biore Makeup Remover Cleansing Water for Normal to Dry Skin Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'biore-makeup-remover-cleansing-water-for-normal-to-dry-skin', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
(2209, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Micellar Water for All Skin Type', '1', 0, 68, 11, '2209', '2209', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Begin your brightening skincare journey with Boots Vitamin C Brightening Micellar Water, the first step in a powerful 3-step cleansing routine. Enriched with 2X Vitamin C and Yuzu extract, this micellar water effectively removes makeup, excess oil, and daily impurities to reveal a refreshed and visibly brighter complexion.\nDesigned to be gentle yet effective, its alcohol-free and fragrance-free formula is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. With regular use, skin looks brighter and more radiant within 7 to 14 days.\nWarnings\nMade in Thailand', 549.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 151.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Micellar Water for All Skin TypePrice in BD', 'Boots Vitamin C Brightening Micellar Water for All Skin Type Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'boots-vitamin-c-brightening-micellar-water-for-all-skin-type', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
