(2211, 'Garnier Vitamin C Micellar Cleansing Water for Dull & Sensitive Skin 125ml', '1', 0, 68, 37, '2211', '2211', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Brightening Action: Enriched with Vitamin Cg, this micellar water helps to brighten dull skin and even out skin tone. ,\nGentle Cleansing: Utilizes micellar technology to lift away dirt, oil, and makeup without harsh rubbing, leaving skin clean and refreshed. ,\nSuitable for Sensitive Skin: Formulated to be gentle and is safe for use on all skin types, including sensitive skin. ,\nNo Rinsing Required: Designed for convenience, there\'s no need to rinse after use. ,\nSaturate a Cotton Pad: Pour the micellar water onto a cotton pad until it\'s fully moistened.\nGently Wipe: Gently wipe the cotton pad over your face, starting from the center and moving outward.\nNo Rinsing Needed: There\'s no need to rinse your face after use.\nSize: 125ml\nPackaging: Plastic bottle with a flip-top cap for easy dispensing.\nSkin Type: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nScent: Fragrance-free.', 450.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 480.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Vitamin C Micellar Cleansing Water for Dull & Sensitive Skin 125mlPrice in BD', 'Garnier Vitamin C Micellar Cleansing Water for Dull & Sensitive Skin 125ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-vitamin-c-micellar-cleansing-water-for-dull-sensitive-skin-125ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
