(2213, 'Garnier Acqua Micellare Bifase con Fiordaliso 400ml', '1', 0, 68, 37, '2213', '2213', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier Acqua Micellare Bifase con Fiordaliso is a gentle, two-phase micellar water designed for sensitive and delicate skin. It effectively removes makeup, including waterproof formulas, from the face, eyes, and lips. Enriched with cornflower (fiordaliso) extract, it soothes and calms skin while cleansing, leaving it feeling fresh, soft, and comfortable. No rubbing required, making it ideal for daily use, even for sensitive eye areas.\nDeep Cleansing: Removes dirt, impurities, and waterproof makeup in one step.\nSoothing & Calming: Cornflower extract helps reduce irritation and refresh the skin.\nGentle on Eyes: Safe for sensitive eye areas and contact lens wearers.\nNon-Greasy Finish: Leaves skin clean without any oily residue.\nDermatologically & Ophthalmologically Tested: Clinically proven for sensitive skin.\nFull INCI List:Water (Aqua), Cyclopentasiloxane, Isohexadecane, Centaurea Cyanus Flower Water, Potassium Phosphate, Sodium Chloride, Arginine, Coco-Betaine, Poloxamer 184, Dipotassium Phosphate, Disodium EDTA, Propanediol, Citric Acid, Hexylene Glycol, Myrtrimonium Bromide, Mica, Titanium Dioxide, Sodium Hydroxide, Linalool, Geraniol, Limonene, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Salicylate, Parfum / Fragrance, CI 60725, CI 61565\nIngredient Highlights:\nCornflower (Centaurea Cyanus) Extract: Soothes and calms sensitive skin.\nCyclopentasiloxane & Isohexadecane: Gentle oil phase that removes waterproof makeup effortlessly.\nCoco-Betaine & Poloxamer 184: Mild surfactants that cleanse without irritation.\nPanthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5): Supports skin hydration and barrier recovery.\nCitric Acid & Sodium Hydroxide: Maintain skin’s pH balance for comfort.\nShake well to mix the two phases.\nSoak a cotton pad with the micellar water.\nGently wipe over face, eyes, and lips — no rubbing needed.\nNo rinsing required.\nRepeat if necessary to remove all makeup.\nVolume: 400 mL\nForm: Bifase (two-phase) micellar water\nSkin Type: Sensitive skin; suitable for eyes, lips, and contact lens wearers\nTests: Dermatologically and ophthalmologically tested\nFinish: Light, fresh, and non-greasy', 1980.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 980.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Acqua Micellare Bifase con Fiordaliso 400mlPrice in BD', 'Garnier Acqua Micellare Bifase con Fiordaliso 400ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-acqua-micellare-bifase-con-fiordaliso-400ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
