(2221, 'Garnier Skin Active Hyaluronic Aloe Toner – Refreshes & Hydrates All Skin Types 200ml (Made in Poland)', '1', 0, 68, 37, '2221', '2221', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier SkinActive Hyaluronic Aloe Toner is a refreshing facial toner designed to hydrate, soothe, and balance all skin types, including sensitive skin. Infused with the natural goodness of aloe vera and the hydrating power of hyaluronic acid, this vegan-friendly formula effectively removes impurities and prepares the skin for subsequent skincare steps.\nKey Features:\nHydrating & Soothing: Enriched with aloe vera and hyaluronic acid to replenish moisture and calm the skin.\nGentle Formula: Dermatologically tested and suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\nVegan-Friendly: Contains 96% ingredients of natural origin and is free from animal-derived ingredients.\nAlcohol-Free: Designed to cleanse without drying or irritating the skin.\nRefreshing Sensation: Leaves the skin feeling clean, refreshed, and balanced.\nUsage Instructions:\nApply to a cotton pad.\nGently sweep over the face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\nUse daily, morning and evening, after cleansing.\nPrecautions:\nFor external use only.\nAvoid contact with eyes.\nIf irritation occurs, discontinue use and consult a dermatologist.', 1225.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 525.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier Skin Active Hyaluronic Aloe Toner – Refreshes & Hydrates All Skin Types 200ml (Made in Poland)Price in BD', 'Garnier Skin Active Hyaluronic Aloe Toner – Refreshes & Hydrates All Skin Types 200ml (Made in Poland) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-skin-active-hyaluronic-aloe-toner-refreshes-hydrates-all-skin-types-200ml-made-in-poland', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:37', '2026-02-11 13:41:37'),
