(2226, 'Neutrogena Clear & Radiant Vitamin C Face Scrub with 0.5% Salicylic Acid 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 151, '2226', '2226', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Neutrogena Clear & Radiant Vitamin C Face Scrub is a refreshing daily facial cleanser developed with dermatologists to promote clearer, smoother, and more radiant skin. Infused with Vitamin C, pink grapefruit extract, and 0.5% salicylic acid, this oil-free scrub gently exfoliates, unclogs pores, and removes impurities without over-drying, making it suitable for everyday use.\nGently exfoliates to remove dead skin cells\nHelps unclog pores and prevent blemishes\nBrightens dull skin for a radiant complexion\nSupports clearer, smoother-looking skin\nOil-free formula cleanses without over-drying\nDeveloped with dermatologists\nContains Vitamin C for skin radiance\n0.5% Salicylic Acid helps fight blemishes\nEnriched with pink grapefruit extract\nGentle natural exfoliators\nSuitable for daily use\nOil-free cleanser\nBlemish-prone Oily Combination\nWet your face with water.\nMassage a small amount onto wet skin once daily, avoiding the eye area.\nRinse thoroughly with water.\nPat dry and follow with Neutrogena Clear & Radiant Moisturiser.\nFor external use only. Do not ingest.\nAvoid contact with eyes. If contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water.\nDiscontinue use if irritation develops. If symptoms persist, consult a healthcare professional.\nKeep out of reach of children.\nStore away from direct sunlight.\nA patch test is recommended before first use.Apply a small amount to the skin, allow it to dry, and rinse off.If no redness, itching, burning, or swelling occurs after 24 hours, the product is safe to use.\nActive Ingredients:Aqua (Water), Glycerin, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Cellulose, Lauryl Glucoside, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Sodium Benzoate, Salicylic Acid (0.5%), Parfum, Citric Acid, Disodium EDTA, Sodium Hydroxide, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate (Vitamin C), Propylene Glycol, Citrus Grandis (Grapefruit) Fruit 