(2235, 'SkinO Refreshing Micellar Cleansing Water 100ml and  SkinO Advanced Brightening Serum 30ml', '1', 0, 68, 15, '2235', '2235', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'skinO Refreshing Micellar Cleansing Water:Effortlessly cleanse and refresh your skin with skinO Refreshing Micellar Cleansing Water. This gentle, yet powerful formula removes makeup, dirt, and impurities without the need for rinsing. Infused with hydrating ingredients, it leaves your skin feeling fresh, clean, and revitalized while maintaining its natural moisture balance. Perfect for all skin types, this micellar water is your go-to for a quick, effective, and soothing cleanse.\nBenefit:\n\nHow to use:Take an appropriate amount of micellar water on a cotton pad and gently wipe all over the face until skin is completely cleaned from makeup. To clean eye makeup, hold a pad over closed eyes for a few seconds, then gently wipe without harsh rubbing.\n\nIngredients:Aqua, Allantoin, Glycerine, Non ionic Surfactant, Disodium EDTA, Sorbitol, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance Oil.skinO Advanced Brightening Serum:Reveal a more radiant complexion with skinO Advanced Brightening Serum. This potent formula targets dark spots, uneven skin tone, and dullness, delivering a brighter and more luminous glow. Infused with powerful brightening agents and skin-loving ingredients, it penetrates deeply to improve skin texture and clarity. Use it daily for visibly brighter, smoother, and more youthful-looking skin.\nBenefits:\n\nHow to UseApply a few drops of serum to your face in the morning and night and before using any heavier cream. Gently tap it into the skin for better absorption\nCaution:\n1. Please do a patch test on the skin before use.\n2. Store in a cool & dry place.\n3. For external use only.\n4. Keep out of reach of children.\n5. Use only as directed on unbroken skin.\n\nIngredients:Aqua, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Carbomer, Hyaluronic Acid, Glycerine, Niacinamide, Alpha Arbutin, Propylene Glycol, PEG- 40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Pheno