(2243, 'Innsaei Low pH Micellar Cleansing Water 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 6, '2243', '2243', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Innsaei Low pH Micellar Water cleanses, hydrates, and refreshes the skin without disrupting its natural balance. It effectively removes dirt, oil, and makeup while helping to maintain moisture, leaving the skin soft, smooth, and revitalized. The lightweight, non-greasy formula ensures a fresh finish, making it perfect for daily use on all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\nSkin Type: All types of skin\nMade In: Bangladesh\n\nBenefits:\n1. Gently removes makeup and impurities\n2. Hydrates and moisturizes skin\n3. Maintains natural pH balance\n4. Leaves skin soft and refreshed\n\nIngredients:\nAqua, Alkyl Glucoside, Propylene Glycol, Glycerin, Phenoxyethanol, PEG Methyl Ether\n\nUser guideline: Soak a cotton pad with innsaei Low pH Micellar Water and gently wipe it over your face, eyes, and lips to remove makeup and impurities. Your skin will feel clean and refreshed, ready for the next step in your skincare routine.\n\nCaution: For external use only. Avoid direct contact with the eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Perform a patch test before first use. Discontinue use if signs of irritation or rash occur. Keep out of reach of children.\n\nStorage: Store in a cool and dry place.\n\nDo\'s:\nUse daily to cleanse and remove makeup gently.\nApply with a cotton pad—no harsh rubbing needed.\nStore in a cool, dry place.\nPerform a patch test before first use.\nDon’ts:\n\nAvoid direct contact with the eyes.\nDon’t use on broken or irritated skin.\nDon’t tug or rub the skin harshly.\nAvoid storing in hot or humid places.', 310.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 50.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innsaei Low pH Micellar Cleansing Water 150mlPrice in BD', 'Innsaei Low pH Micellar Cleansing Water 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innsaei-low-ph-micellar-cleansing-water-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2244, 'Garnier SkinActive All-in-1 Micellar Cleansing Water for Sensitive Skin 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 37, '2244', '2244', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Garnier SkinActive All-in-1 Micellar Cleansing Water is a gentle, no-rinse cleanser designed to remove makeup and daily impurities while soothing sensitive skin. The micellar formula cleanses effectively without leaving residue, helping skin feel fresh, comfortable, and hydrated.\nMicellar cleansing water\nSuitable for face, eyes, and lips\nGently removes dirt, oil, SPF, pollution, and dead skin cells\nRemoves up to 100% of makeup*\nHelps soothe and hydrate sensitive skin for up to 24 hours\nLeaves skin feeling clean and refreshed without residue\nSensitive skin\nSuitable for all skin types\nMicellar technology to lift impurities without harsh rubbing\nPerfume-free formula\nDermatologically tested\nApply to a cotton or reusable pad\nGently wipe over face, eyes, and lips\nNo rinsing required\nAqua / Water\nGlycerin\nHexylene Glycol\nPoloxamer 184\nDisodium Cocoamphodiacetate\nDisodium EDTA\nMyrtrimonium Bromide\nNo specific precautions required under normal use\nFor external use only', 1590.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '200ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, -1590.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Garnier SkinActive All-in-1 Micellar Cleansing Water for Sensitive Skin 200mlPrice in BD', 'Garnier SkinActive All-in-1 Micellar Cleansing Water for Sensitive Skin 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'garnier-skinactive-all-in-1-micellar-cleansing-water-for-sensitive-skin-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2245, 'Quinsia Micellar Water (Makeup Remover) 100ml', '1', 0, 68, 368, '2245', '2245', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Contains potent form of micelles that helps to remove makeup, oil & draws out impurities from pores avoiding any harsh rubbing. Quinsia All Swipe Miceller Water – a must have skin care for single swipe cleansing solution for your beautiful skin.\n\nItem Barcode:784196633678\n\nIngredient List:Water, Sodium Cocoamphoacetate, Peg-8 Caprylic/Capric Glyceride, Glycerin, Sodium Chloride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Disodium Edta, Propylene Glycol, Butylene Glycol, Methylisothiazolinone, Astragalus Membranaceus Root Extract, Saposhnikovia Divaricata Root Extract, Calendula Officinalis Flower Extract, Albizia Julibrissin Flower Extract, Gastrodia Elata Root Extract.\n\nDirection for Use:• Soak a cotton pad with micellar water.• Hold gently on eyelids/lips for 2-3 seconds to dissolve makeup.• Wipe outwards in soft motion—no harsh rubbing.• Repeat with a fresh pad until clean.• For double cleansing, use a gentle face wash afterward.\n\nMade In Korea', 338.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 112.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Quinsia Micellar Water (Makeup Remover) 100mlPrice in BD', 'Quinsia Micellar Water (Makeup Remover) 100ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'quinsia-micellar-water-makeup-remover-100ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38');
