(2252, 'Menow Gently Off Eye & Lip Makeup Remover', '1', 0, 68, 405, '2252', '2252', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The product is more likely to allow the skin to absorb, to achieve the role of the second skin cleansing, deep purification of the skin, add enough water.Reduce the common water in the micro-organisms, pesticide residues on the skin hazards. After multiple water treatment of deionized water, deep purification of the skin, easier to absorb nutrients.Busy morning skin care only need to gently spray a spray, moisturizing water all day, before the makeup gently spray a spray, balance oil, make makeup fresh, dry season, gently spray a spray, so that the skin drink full water!As long as you are willing, 75ml specifications can carry, convenient, lightweight, is your quick replenishment choice.\nOil and water do mix, for twice the impact - just shake. A dual-phase, easy-does-it formula that sweeps off even tenacious waterproof mascara and lip colour. Absolutely gentle, suitable for all. Cucumber extract soothes and refreshes. Rinse with cool water.\nBenefits:\nIngredients:\nRecmmended Usage:\nAfter cleansing, take an appropriate amount (approx. the size of a tiny coin) onto the palm and spread across the face.\n\nPat lightly until it is fully absorbed into skin. (Cotton pad need not be used.)', 275.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 275.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Menow Gently Off Eye & Lip Makeup RemoverPrice in BD', 'Menow Gently Off Eye & Lip Makeup Remover Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'menow-gently-off-eye-lip-makeup-remover', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2253, 'APLB Glutathione Niacinamide 79.7% Cleansing Balm', '1', 0, 68, 4, '2253', '2253', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Melt away heavy makeup and excess oil without stripping skin of moisture with this gentle cleansing balm. It’s formulated with glutathione, niacinamide and soybean oil to tighten pores and boost skin radiance. Hypoallergenic and fragrance-free formula is suitable for sensitive skin.\nKey Features:\nBenefits:-This cleansing balm consists of 79.7% Lipo Gluta Niac Oil and offers gentle and non-irritating cleansing with a moisturizing effect even after washing.-Removes Waste and Supplies Moisture with mild and clear ingredients.-Offers tight pore care, elastic skin care, and revitalizes dull skin to protect dry and sensitive skin.\n-Clear and clean, fragrance-free for the sensitive skin.\nHow To Use:1. Take a moderate amount with dry hands and gently massage on a dry face in a circular motion.2. Massage to dissolve blackheads and makeup while adding water to emulsify the process.3. Rinse off thoroughly with lukewarm water.\nAbout brand: APLBUpholding the motto “two is greater than one,” Korean beauty brand APLB (A plus B) offers skin care, hair care, body care and makeup formulated with naturally derived ingredients for various benefits without causing irritation. The brand applies strict quality control during the manufacturing process to ensure its products are efficacious and safe to use. Bestsellers include the Glutathione Ampoule Serum, Propolis Collagen Eye Cream and EGF Collagen Moisture Cream. All APLB products are 100% made in Korea YesStyle is an authorized retailer of APLB.\n\nMade in Korea', 1150.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '80ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 550.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'APLB Glutathione Niacinamide 79.7% Cleansing BalmPrice in BD', 'APLB Glutathione Niacinamide 79.7% Cleansing Balm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'aplb-glutathione-niacinamide-797-cleansing-balm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2254, 'La Roche-Posay Lipikar AP+ Gentle Foaming Cleansing Oil – For Dry to Extra-Dry Skin (400 ml, Face & Body)', '1', 0, 68, 62, '2254', '2254', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Description:Nourish and cleanse even the most sensitive skin with La Roche-Posay Lipikar AP+ Gentle Foaming Cleansing Oil. Formulated with prebiotic thermal water and Shea Butter, this gentle cleansing oil removes dirt and impurities without stripping skin of its natural moisture. Suitable for babies, children, and adults, it helps maintain hydration while leaving a protective barrier on the skin.\nKey Benefits:\nUltra-Gentle Cleansing: Removes dirt, oil, and makeup without harsh effects.\nHydration & Soothing: Shea Butter and prebiotic thermal water leave skin soft and moisturized.\nSafe for Sensitive Skin: Fragrance-free, allergy-tested, suitable for dry, extra-dry, and compromised skin (including under chemotherapy).\nVersatile Use: Ideal for face, body, and scalp. Safe for daily use for all ages.\nEco-Friendly Packaging: Bottle made from 98% recycled plastic.\nUsage Instructions:\nMassage gently onto wet skin or hair.\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\nPat dry without rubbing.\nFor extra hydration, follow with Lipikar AP+ Moisturizing Cream.\nAvoid contact with eyes. Keep out of reach of children.\nMain Ingredients:\nAqua / Water / Eau – base ingredient.\nSucrose – gentle exfoliating and cleansing agent.\nSodium Laureth Sulfate & Betaine – mild surfactants.\nShea Butter (Glyceryl Stearate / Glyceryl Stearate SE) – deeply nourishes and protects.\nPentylene Glycol & Polysorbate 20 – moisturizing and skin-softening agents.\nPrebiotic Thermal Water – soothes and supports skin barrier.\nVolume: 400 ml\nOrigin: La Roche-Posay, France', 3520.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1470.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'La Roche-Posay Lipikar AP+ Gentle Foaming Cleansing Oil – For Dry to Extra-Dry Skin (400 ml, Face & Body)Price in BD', 'La Roche-Posay Lipikar AP+ Gentle Foaming Cleansing Oil – For Dry to Extra-Dry Skin (400 ml, Face & Body) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'la-roche-posay-lipikar-ap-gentle-foaming-cleansing-oil-for-dry-to-extra-dry-skin-400-ml-face-body', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
