(2256, 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Tea Tree-Ex Pore Clarifying Balm 7ml', '1', 0, 68, 406, '2256', '2256', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Tea Tree-Ex is a pore-clarifying cleansing balm formulated to target oily and acne-prone skin. Infused with tea tree oil and other botanical extracts, this balm gently removes makeup, excess sebum, and impurities while helping to minimize the appearance of pores. The 7ml mini size is perfect for travel, sampling, or daily use on-the-go.\nKey Features:\nUsage:\nWhy Choose This Product:\nBenefits:\nCautions:\n', 245.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, '7ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 105.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Tea Tree-Ex Pore Clarifying Balm 7mlPrice in BD', 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Tea Tree-Ex Pore Clarifying Balm 7ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'banila-co-clean-it-zero-tea-tree-ex-pore-clarifying-balm-7ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2257, 'Heimish All Clean Balm Mandarin 50ml', '1', 0, 68, 95, '2257', '2257', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heimish All Clean Balm Mandarin is a refreshing and gentle cleansing balm designed to melt away makeup, sunscreen, and daily impurities. With a zesty mandarin fragrance and a skin-loving formula, this balm offers a luxurious cleansing experience while nourishing and revitalizing the skin. Ideal for all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin, it’s a compact yet powerful addition to any skincare routine.\nKey Features\nUsage\nScoop a small amount using the included spatula and apply to dry skin. Massage gently in circular motions to dissolve makeup and impurities. Add water to emulsify into a milky texture, then rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. Follow with your regular cleanser if double cleansing is preferred.\nWhy Choose This Product\nHeimish All Clean Balm Mandarin stands out for its gentle yet effective cleansing power. Unlike traditional makeup removers, it nourishes the skin while removing even waterproof products. The refreshing mandarin scent adds a spa-like touch to your routine, and its low-irritation formula makes it suitable for all skin types.\nBenefits\nCautions', 999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 301.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish All Clean Balm Mandarin 50mlPrice in BD', 'Heimish All Clean Balm Mandarin 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-all-clean-balm-mandarin-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2258, 'House Of Hur Purifying Cleansing Balm 50ml', '1', 0, 68, 407, '2258', '2258', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Purifying Cleansing Balm is a transformative skincare product designed to deliver deep cleansing and a radiant complexion. Its unique sherbet-to-oil-to-milk texture activates upon contact with the skin, effectively dissolving makeup, sunscreen, and daily impurities. Packaged in a hygienic grinder-style dispenser, it ensures freshness and precise application with every use.\n\nKey FeaturesThis balm is enriched with wild strawberry, cherry fruit, and vitamin tree fruit extracts, which help regulate oil production and minimize excess sebum. The formula is suitable for all skin types and maintains optimal moisture levels, leaving the skin feeling soft, clean, and revitalized without any greasy residue. Its sherbet-like consistency melts into a gentle oil that transitions into a milky emulsion, reducing friction and enhancing comfort during cleansing.\n\nUsageTo use, rotate the grinder packaging to release a small amount of balm onto dry hands. Apply to a dry face and massage in circular motions, allowing the balm to melt and break down makeup and impurities. Rinse thoroughly with water. Follow with your regular skincare routine.\n\nBenefits\n\nCautions\n', 2564.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 285.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'House Of Hur Purifying Cleansing Balm 50mlPrice in BD', 'House Of Hur Purifying Cleansing Balm 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'house-of-hur-purifying-cleansing-balm-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
