(2267, 'Heimish All Clean Balm', '1', 0, 68, 95, '2267', '2267', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Easily and quickly removes waterproof makeup, impurities, and other residue that pile up throughout your day. No need to double cleanse! No more eye irritation with this gentle cleanser!\nMulti-Purpose Cleanser for waterproof makeup, dirt, and blackheads - Quickly dissolves into oil when in contact with skin and cleans all residue.No Eye Irritation - No pain when accidentally getting some product in your eyes while cleansing. Low-Irritation and Vegan - For those who are pregnant and/or have sensitive, acne-prone skin. Scoop Out for Your Face - Convenient mini spatula included in the product.A Spa-like Experience - Contains a mild herbal fragrance that does not linger on the skin.\n\nWHO IS THIS FOR?\nFor all skin typesAnyone who wants perfect cleansing without having to double cleanseAnyone who prefers solid-type prodects\n\nHOW TO USE\nUse the spatula to scoop a moderate amount of balm on to your dried face. The balm will start to melt at this point. Gently massage the product, spreading it to areas you want to cleanse and wash off with warm water.\n\nMade in Korea', 1882.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 718.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish All Clean BalmPrice in BD', 'Heimish All Clean Balm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-all-clean-balm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2268, 'Heimish Matcha Biome Intensive Repair Cream with Probiotics 50ml', '1', 0, 68, 95, '2268', '2268', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Heimish Matcha Biome Intensive Repair Cream is a deeply nourishing moisturizer formulated to strengthen the skin barrier and restore hydration. Infused with 50% fermented matcha water and probiotics, this cream is ideal for sensitive, dry, or compromised skin. Its rich yet non-greasy texture makes it suitable for both day and night use, offering a soothing experience with every application.\nKey Features\nIngredients\nSkin-Loving Ingredients: Water, Propanediol, Butylene Glycol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Diisostearyl Malate, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Cetearyl Alcohol, Niacinamide, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Glyceryl Stearate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Hydrogenated Poly(C6-14 Olefin), Hydrogenated Polydecene, Dipropylene Glycol, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Lactobacillus Ferment, Saccharomyces Ferment, Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Flower Extract, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Centella Asiatica Extract, Polygonum Cuspidatum Root Extract, Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Extract, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Leaf Extract, Jasminum Officinale (Jasmine) Flower Water, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Adenosine, Polyacrylate-13, PEG-100 Stearate, Palmitic Acid, Tocopheryl Acetate, Stearic Acid,Polyisobutene, Hydroxyacetophenone, Cetyl Palmitate, Sorbitan Palmitate, Sorbitan Olivate, Polysorbate 20,Carbomer, Sorbitan Isostearate, Tromethamine, Citrus Aurantium Amara (Bitter Orange) Leaf/Twig Oil, Artemisia Vulgaris Oil, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract,Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil, Litsea Cubeba Fruit Oil, Dextrin, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Extract, Laurus Nobilis Leaf Extract, Lauric Acid, Myristic Acid, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Disodium EDTA\nUsage\nApply a moderate amount to clean skin as the final step in your skincare routine. Gently massage until fully absorbed. For enhanced hydration, layer the cream twice at night. Suitable for use under makeup or after serums and toners.\nWhy Choose This Product\nThis cream is designed for those who struggle with skin sensitivity, dryness, or barrier damage. Its unique Matcha Biome™ blend combines fermented matcha and probiotics to deliver high absorption and deep hydration. The minimalist, irritation-free formula makes it a safe and effective choice for daily use.\nBenefits\nCautions', 1999.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 201.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Heimish Matcha Biome Intensive Repair Cream with Probiotics 50mlPrice in BD', 'Heimish Matcha Biome Intensive Repair Cream with Probiotics 50ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'heimish-matcha-biome-intensive-repair-cream-with-probiotics-50ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2269, 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Ginseng-Glow Claming Cleansing Balm 7ml', '1', 0, 68, 406, '2269', '2269', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Ginseng-Glow is a nourishing mini cleansing balm designed to gently remove makeup and impurities while deeply hydrating the skin. Infused with ginseng root and berry extracts, this balm-to-oil formula is ideal for dry and sensitive skin types. Its compact 7ml size makes it perfect for travel or trial use.\nKey Features:\nUsage:\nWhy Choose This Product:\nBenefits:\nCautions:\n', 231.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 119.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Ginseng-Glow Claming Cleansing Balm 7mlPrice in BD', 'Banila Co Clean It Zero Ginseng-Glow Claming Cleansing Balm 7ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'banila-co-clean-it-zero-ginseng-glow-claming-cleansing-balm-7ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-14 12:43:37'),
(2270, 'Siodil Ato Intensive Balm 200ml', '1', 0, 68, 75, '2270', '2270', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Siodil Ato Intensive Balm presents a restorative solution tailored for severely dry skin, delivering immediate nourishment and soothing comfort. Formulated with an advanced combination of Glycerin, Sunflower Oil, Vitamin E, and Ceramide, this balm restores moisture and fortifies the protective skin barrier, offering specialized care for intensely dry skin concerns.\nActive Ingredients: Glycerin, Sunflower Oil, Vitamin E, Ceramide.\nInactive Ingredients: Demineralised Water, Disodium EDTA, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Themax N1, Xanthan Gum (Transparent), Glycerine, 1,2 Hexanediol, BO-800, Lipomulse Luxe MB, Olivem VS Feel, Mineral Oil LLP, Witarix MCT C8, Imwitor GMIS, Miglyol 829 ECO, Xylishine™/Aquaxyl™, Sunflower Oil, Lipex Shea™, BEG-800, Pentylene Glycol, Vitamin E, Phenoxyethanol (Extra Pure), and Ceramide NP.\n● Apply the balm once or twice a day for optimal benefits● Ensure the skin is cleansed before applying the balm', 1731.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 119.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Siodil Ato Intensive Balm 200mlPrice in BD', 'Siodil Ato Intensive Balm 200ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'siodil-ato-intensive-balm-200ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2271, 'Purito Melt + Refresh From Green Avocado Cleansing Balm', '1', 0, 68, 83, '2271', '2271', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Transform your cleansing routine into a luxurious ritual with Purito Melt + Refresh From Green Avocado Cleansing Balm. This rich, buttery balm harnesses the power of greens and Avocado Oil to gently yet effectively cleanse the skin, leaving it refreshed, hydrated, and glowing.\nReveal soft, radiant, and hydrated skin with Purito Melt + Refresh From Green Avocado Cleansing Balm—where nature meets luxury in your skincare routine. 🌿💛', 1890.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Jar', 0.00, 1, NULL, 1560.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Purito Melt + Refresh From Green Avocado Cleansing BalmPrice in BD', 'Purito Melt + Refresh From Green Avocado Cleansing Balm Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'purito-melt-refresh-from-green-avocado-cleansing-balm', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2272, 'Himalaya Purifying Neem Face Wash 300ml', '1', 0, 68, 10, '2272', '2272', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Himalaya\'s purifying neem face wash is a soap-free, herbal formulation that cleans impurities and helps clear pimples. A natural blend of neem and turmeric brings together their antibacterial and antifungal properties to prevent the recurrence of acne over time. Neem is an excellent skin care ingredient known for its antibacterial properties. It improves general skin health and immunity, combating bacterial infections such as acne, boils and ulcers. Neem tackles bacteria from the root and prevents the recurrence of pimples and blemishes. Turmeric has been used as an antiseptic for centuries and it is regarded as one of nature\'s most powerful healers. The herb helps to even out your skin tone and color, making it an excellent ingredient in a face wash. It also helps to retain the skin\'s elasticity, making it supple. Turmeric has strong anti-inflammatory properties, which soothe your skin.\nMade in Bangladesh\n', 250.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 250.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Himalaya Purifying Neem Face Wash 300mlPrice in BD', 'Himalaya Purifying Neem Face Wash 300ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'himalaya-purifying-neem-face-wash-300ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2273, 'The Face Shop Rice Water Bright Foaming Cleanser Nettoyant Moussant 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 194, '2273', '2273', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Looking for a rice water bright cleansing foam? The Face Shop Rice Water Bright Foaming Cleanser! This popular K-beauty product is enriched with rice water, a natural ingredient known for its brightening and nourishing properties.\nThis Rice Water Bright Cleansing Foam enriched with rice extracts offers your skin a clear and even complexion. Enriched with a natural rice water solution with brightening properties, it cleanses skin with its whipped cream-like texture. The Face Shop is a South Korean skincare company renowned for its natural ingredients and innovative beauty solutions. The brand advocates for nature-inspired skincare that appeals to individuals seeking gentle and effective products.\nUse daily. For best results, moisturize after with suitable Daily Moisturiser.\nRice Water Extracts, Soapwort & Moringa Oil', 950.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 450.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'The Face Shop Rice Water Bright Foaming Cleanser Nettoyant Moussant 150mlPrice in BD', 'The Face Shop Rice Water Bright Foaming Cleanser Nettoyant Moussant 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'the-face-shop-rice-water-bright-foaming-cleanser-nettoyant-moussant-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2274, 'Simple Kind to Skin Moisturising Facial Wash 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 24, '2274', '2274', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'This moisturizing, 100% soap-free, vegan face wash gently washes away makeup and impurities, leaving skin feeling hydrated, soft, and replenished. No colors, no perfume, no harsh chemicals that can upset your skin. Perfect for even the most sensitive skin.\nMeet Simple Kind to Skin Moisturising Facial Wash. Supercharged with a vitamin-rich formula – this is the same gentle care you know and love from Simple – made even more effective for stronger, healthy-looking, and smoother skin.\nWith 2X pro vitamin B5, together with vitamin E, this deep cleansing, foaming gel cream helps the skin become more resilient against damage with every wash. Its Pro Amino Acid Technology boosts the levels of strengthening amino acids naturally present in the skin, for a hydrated and healthy skin barrier against drying elements like pollution.\nBut it doesn’t stop there. This skin cleanser is also proven to boost skin moisture by 40% in just one week. You’ll love the non-stripping, pH-neutral lather which leaves skin gratifyingly clean and satisfyingly moisturized. And you can count on this facial wash to remove every last trace of make-up, dirt, and grime – minus that tight, dry skin feeling.\n100% soap-free and packed with ultra-nourishing ingredients, this daily cleanser is suitable for all skin types and is super gentle – even on sensitive skin. Like all Simple products, our Moisturising Facial Wash is dermatologically tested, non-comedogenic, contains no harsh chemicals, and is free from alcohol, mineral oils, artificial colors, and perfume\n', 645.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'Bottle', 0.00, 1, NULL, 205.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Simple Kind to Skin Moisturising Facial Wash 150mlPrice in BD', 'Simple Kind to Skin Moisturising Facial Wash 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'simple-kind-to-skin-moisturising-facial-wash-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2275, 'Cutishine Face Wash', '1', 0, 68, 40, '2275', '2275', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 874.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 0, 0, 100, 'tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 46.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Cutishine Face WashPrice in BD', 'Cutishine Face Wash Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cutishine-face-wash', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-11 13:41:38'),
(2276, 'GM 60 Face Wash', '1', 0, 68, 27, '2276', '2276', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Deep Cleansing, Skin Rejuvenating, Smooth & Refreshed Skin.\nGM-60 Face Wash is a skin-rejuvenating facial cleanser enriched with Aloe Vera and Liquorice Extract, designed to deeply cleanse and revitalize your skin. This gentle yet effective formula helps remove dirt, excess oil, and impurities while promoting the natural shedding of dead skin cells, improving skin texture, tone, and clarity. Ideal for oily and acne-prone skin, it leaves your face feeling refreshed, smooth, and rejuvenated.\nDeeply cleanses and unblocks pores\nPromotes skin rejuvenation by removing dead skin cells\nReduces superficial wrinkles and fine lines\nImproves skin texture and tone\nRefreshes and revitalizes oily and acne-prone skin\nAloe Vera Extract – soothes and moisturizes skin\nVitamin E Acetate – antioxidant protection\nGlycolic Acid – promotes skin renewal\nSalicylic Acid – helps prevent acne and unclogs pores\nLactic Acid – gently exfoliates and smooths skin\nLiquorice Extract – brightens and evens skin tone\nD.M. Aqua, Carbomer, Methyl Paraben Sodium, Propyl Paraben Sodium, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Triethanolamine, Cocoamidopropyl Betaine, Sodium Lauryl Ether Sulphate, 2-Phenoxyethanol, Disodium EDTA, Perfume\nSqueeze a small amount of GM-60 onto your palm.\nWork into a lather and massage gently on a wet face and neck using upward circular motions.\nRinse thoroughly with clean water and pat dry.\nFollow with a moisturizer if your skin feels dry.\nNote: Sensitive skin may experience temporary tingling or slight irritation. Flush thoroughly with water if needed.\nOily, acne-prone, and normal skin types.\nGM-60 Face Wash – Deep Cleansing, Skin Rejuvenating, Smooth & Refreshed Skin.', 1226.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'bot', 0.00, 1, NULL, 44.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'GM 60 Face WashPrice in BD', 'GM 60 Face Wash Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'gm-60-face-wash', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-14 12:43:34');
