(2277, 'COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser 150ml', '1', 0, 68, 31, '2277', '2277', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser is crafted to provide an effective yet gentle cleansing solution for acne-prone skin. Featuring salicylic acid, this cleanser helps to reduce blemishes and prevent future breakouts by deeply cleansing the pores and removing excess oil and dirt.  COSRX is a globally recognized brand known for its effective and gentle skincare products, recommended by dermatologists and loved by users.\n\nFind COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser 150ml in Bangladesh from Arogga, your trusted online store. Buy this daily gentle cleanser for clearer, healthier skin.\nBoth packaging are available here!\nCleanse Your Way to Clearer Skin\nUnveil a fresh, clean, and clear complexion with COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser. This powerful yet gentle formula is designed to cleanse deeply, fight acne, and maintain your skin’s natural balance. Perfect for everyday use, it targets breakouts, unclogs pores, and leaves your skin feeling refreshed and revitalized.\n\nProven Acne Treatment\n\nWith the power of salicylic acid, this cleanser is highly effective in treating and preventing acne. Regular use results in visibly clearer skin.\n\nGentle and Non-Drying\n\nUnlike many acne treatments, this cleanser is formulated to be gentle on the skin, ensuring it doesn\'t strip away essential moisture.\n\nNatural Ingredients\n\nEnriched with natural ingredients like Tea Tree Oil and Willow Bark Water, it provides a holistic approach to skincare.\n\nDermatologist Recommended\n\nCOSRX is a trusted brand recommended by dermatologists worldwide for its efficacy and gentle formulations.\n\nPositive Customer Feedback\n\nLoved by users for its ability to clear up skin without irritating. Many have noticed significant improvements in their skin’s texture and clarity.\n\n\n\n\nA Salicylic Acid Exfoliating Cleanser that reduces acne breakouts and promotes clearer skin; Salicylic Acid removes dead skin cells and makes room for new skin cells; It also contains Tea Tree Leaf Oil which has an anti-inflammatory effect and sterilization action; Micro Creamy Soap System makes perfect cleansing! BHA cleanser eradicates difficult-to-remove dead skin cells and skin trouble. Korean K Beauty pure soft gentle basic daily facial face cleanser cosmetic.\n\n\nMade in Korea\n\nA: Yes! The CosRx Salicylic Acid Cleanser is safe for daily use, especially if you have acne-prone skin. Consistent use helps keep your pores clean and prevents future breakouts.\n\nA:  Absolutely. The CosRx Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser is ideal for acne-prone and oily skin. Its non-drying formula helps fight acne and blemishes by gently removing dirt, bacteria, and excess sebum.\n\nA:  If you experience severe skin irritation or peeling, stop using the product and consult a doctor. Mild irritation is normal, but severe reactions require medical advice.\n\nA:  Yes. The combination of salicylic acid and tea tree oil in the cleanser helps to combat blemishes, remove excess oil, and exfoliate dead skin cells, blackheads, and whiteheads.\n\nA: Using the salicylic acid wash at night is generally recommended, especially after an oil or balm to remove makeup or sunscreen. If your skin feels oily in the morning, you can use a mild cleanser.\n\nA:  No. Salicylic acid cleansers should not be left on overnight. They are designed to be rinsed off after application to avoid over-exfoliation and irritation. If you need a leave-on treatment, use a product specifically designed for that purpose and consult a skincare expert.\nA: Yes, it is formulated to be gentle enough for sensitive skin, but it’s always a good idea to do a patch test before full use.\nA: For best results, use it twice daily, in the morning and at night.\nA: Yes, it is suitable for all skin types, especially beneficial for oily and acne-prone skin.\n', 1145.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, 'Tube', 0.00, 1, NULL, 355.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 1, 'COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser 150mlPrice in BD', 'COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser 150ml Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'cosrx-salicylic-acid-daily-gentle-cleanser-150ml', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-14 12:43:33'),
(2278, 'Innsaei low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml (Buy 1 Get 1 Free)', '1', 0, 68, 6, '2278', '2278', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser (150ml) - Buy 1 Get 1 Free\nThe Innsaei Low pH Daily Gel Cleanser is a gentle yet effective cleanser formulated to maintain the skin\'s natural balance while providing a thorough cleanse. With a low pH of 5.5, this gel cleanser is designed for daily use, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\nKey Features:\n\nHow to Use:\n\nBenefits:\n\nIngredients: Aqua, Salicylic acid, Galaxy LES 70, Disodium EDTA, Allantoin, Carbomer, Potassium Hydroxide, CDEA, CAPB, DMDM Hydantoin, Triclosan, Fragrance Oil.\nMade in Bangladesh', 350.00, NULL, 0, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 1, 1, '0', 0, 1, 0, 100, '150ml', 0.00, 1, NULL, 10.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'flat_rate', 0.00, 0, NULL, 0, 'Innsaei low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml (Buy 1 Get 1 Free)Price in BD', 'Innsaei low pH Daily Gel Cleanser 5.5 150ml (Buy 1 Get 1 Free) Price in Bangladesh', NULL, NULL, 'innsaei-low-ph-daily-gel-cleanser-55-150ml-buy-1-get-1-free', 0.00, 0, 0.00, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Buy Now', 0, '2026-02-11 13:41:38', '2026-02-14 12:43:33'),
